#. Occurrence 8_EX:2507:11516: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8_EX_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:2507
msgctxt "text_id=11516 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……ったく。まあ、映画なら考えない事もない。"
msgstr "\"Well, I suppose I could manage a movie or something."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:2513:11517: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8_EX_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:2513
msgctxt "text_id=11517 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　ちょうど見たい映画あんだよ。映画の内容より、見終わった後に文句言い合う方が楽しい部類のＢ級でな。"
