#. Occurrence 8_EX:2990:11552: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8_EX_0014; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:2990
msgctxt "text_id=11552 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「あったりめえだ。テメエみたいな色ボケと草十郎を一緒にするな」"
msgstr "\"Of course he's not! Soujyuro isn't some kind of creepy pervert like you!\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3024:11553: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3024
msgctxt "text_id=11553 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや。興味はある。"
msgstr "\"No. I'm interested, actually."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3030:11554: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3030
msgctxt "text_id=11554 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　可愛い女の子は可愛いと思うし、たまに薄着なところに出くわすと目のやり場に困るだろ。ああいう時、自分が男だって事を実感するよな」"
msgstr "  I see girls who I think are cute, and when they're wearing something revealing I find it hard to control where my eyes go, just like anyone else.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3079:11555: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3079
msgctxt "text_id=11555 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　せいてん　の　へきれき　だった。"
msgstr "  His words shot through the air like a bolt of lightning."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3085:11556: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3085
msgctxt "text_id=11556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　部屋に飾ってあった愛らしいテディベアが、口をあけたら中の人がフィリップ・マーロゥぐらいの衝撃だった。"
msgstr "  It was as shocking as when a kid sees the head of a character at an amusement park fall off, revealing the person inside."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3122:11557: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8_EX_0033; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3122
msgctxt "text_id=11557 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「―――は！？"
msgstr "\"...Yeah!"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3128:11558: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8_EX_0034; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3128
msgctxt "text_id=11558 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　そ、そりゃそうだよな！　すまん、見くびっていた。つまり静希も、オレたちの同士ってコトでいいんだな？」"
msgstr "  I-I guess you're right! Sorry for thinking otherwise! So you're one of us then, eh Sizuki?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3139:11559: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3139
msgctxt "text_id=11559 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「同士？」"
msgstr "\"What do you mean by 'one of us?'\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3165:11560: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8_EX_0035; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3165
msgctxt "text_id=11560 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「そうだ。たとえばこう―――夏場の女子のうなじにひかる汗とか、テニス部の女子の肩からワキにかけての清涼感とか、ぶっちゃけ水泳部の競泳水着の後ろ姿だよ！」"
msgstr "\"You get excited when you see sweat rolling down the nape of a girl's neck in the summer heat, or the cute outfits the girls in the tennis club wear, or when you see a girl in a swimsuit from behind!\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3191:11561: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3191
msgctxt "text_id=11561 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「？？」"
msgstr "\"...?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3196:11562: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3196
msgctxt "text_id=11562 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はてな？　と目をしばたたかせる草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's eyes were filled with question marks."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3201:11563: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3201
msgctxt "text_id=11563 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　木乃美の説明がいまいち実感できていない。"
msgstr "  Apparently he hadn't quite understood Kinomi's explanation."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3236:11564: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8_EX_0036; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3236
msgctxt "text_id=11564 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「いや、だから普段は同い年のガキにしか見えない女どもでも、たまに見せる無防備な仕草とか、ぐっとくるよな？」"
msgstr "\"Come on, you know! Don't you get worked up when you see a girl our own age do something that makes her look all inviting?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3260:11565: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3260
msgctxt "text_id=11565 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「うん。無防備なのは、ちょっと考えてほしい」"
msgstr "\"Sure, but I'd urge you to reconsider that choice of words.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3277:11566: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3277
msgctxt "text_id=11566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無防備な誰かにか、"
msgstr "  Whether it was because Soujyuro was unsure if Kinomi was referring to someone in particular..."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3282:11567: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3282
msgctxt "text_id=11567 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それとも、それに気を取られてしまう自分に対してか、草十郎は居づらそうに顔を曇らせた。"
msgstr "  ...or whether he was just concerned about how this related to himself, a troubled look washed over his face."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3315:11568: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8_EX_0037; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3315
msgctxt "text_id=11568 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「いいんだって、それでいいんだって！　なぜなら、高校生男子の六割は性欲で出来ていますからね！"
msgstr "\"Don't overthink the details! It's fine, guys our age are made up of sixty percent sex drive anyway!"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3321:11569: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8_EX_0038; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3321
msgctxt "text_id=11569 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　よし、そうと決まればさっそくナンパに行こうぜ！　面子が変われば<釣果|ちょうか>も変わるってもんだ！」"
msgstr "  So that decides it! We're going to pick up girls! Besides, a new face might increase our luck!\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3341:11570: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3341
msgctxt "text_id=11570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何が嬉しいのか、木乃美は草十郎の肩を抱いて、共に駅前方面へと歩きだす。"
msgstr "  And with that, he happily put his arm around Soujyuro's shoulders and headed off towards the train station."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3374:11571: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8_EX_0015; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3374
msgctxt "text_id=11571 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ちょっと待て。あまりのコトに絶句しちまったが、テメエは根本的に間違ってる。"
msgstr "\"Wait just a second. This isn't right. I don't think you two are even talking about the same thing."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3380:11572: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8_EX_0016; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3380
msgctxt "text_id=11572 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　草十郎。そもそもナンパって言葉がなんなのか、知ってるか？」"
msgstr "  Soujyuro, do you even know what he means when he's talking about 'picking up' girls?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3386:11573: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3386
msgctxt "text_id=11573 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「？？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3418:11574: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3418
msgctxt "text_id=11574 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "【軟派】"
msgstr "Q: Define \"pickup.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3424:11575: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3424
msgctxt "text_id=11575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　①軟弱な意見の党派。「―議員」"
msgstr "  (1) to answer a telephone call"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3429:11576: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3429
msgctxt "text_id=11576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　②文芸上エロチシズムを主とするもの。「江戸―」"
msgstr "  (2) to recite a Shakespearean work"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3434:11577: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3434
msgctxt "text_id=11577 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　③社会面や文学における艶物の担当。「―記者」"
msgstr "  (3) to transport someone from one place to another"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3439:11578: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3439
msgctxt "text_id=11578 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　④軟弱な風潮に同調する人々。"
msgstr "  (4) to pay someone's bill"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:3444:11579: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3444
msgctxt "text_id=11579 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　⑤転じて、女性などを誘惑すること。硬派"
