#. Occurrence 8_EX:3986:11614: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:3986
msgctxt "text_id=11614 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「そうね。そう暮らせるのなら、理想的ね」"
