#. Occurrence 8_EX:4162:11625: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0031; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4162
msgctxt "text_id=11625 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　うちの生徒会なんて黙ってお茶飲んでるだけよ？　いちいち鍋からお湯沸かして、ポット使って、たっぷり蒸らすなんて、三時のおやつと夕食後だけで十分でしょう。"
msgstr "  Our student council just sits and sips tea quietly. Considering you have to boil water, get a teapot, and steep the tea, drinking it in the afternoon and after dinner is plenty."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4168:11626: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0032; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4168
msgctxt "text_id=11626 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　有珠は手間をかけすぎ。私、贅沢は好きだけど、贅沢に慣れるのはご免だから」"
msgstr "  You just always do too much. Look, I like the fancy lifestyle, but I'm never going to get used to it.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4174:11627: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4174
msgctxt "text_id=11627 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠に反論しつつも、これまた上機嫌な青子がいる。"
msgstr "  Even though Aoko was arguing, she still seemed to be in a good mood."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4210:11628: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4210
msgctxt "text_id=11628 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「贅沢なのは青子たちの方よ。日本の水道水はこんなにも美味しいのに。どうして貴方たちは、この<軟水|おうごん>の価値に気付かないのかしら？」"
msgstr "\"Well, I'm not the one who's too fancy to drink the tap water here. I can't believe you haven't figured out how delicious Japanese tap water is yet.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4227:11629: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0033; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4227
msgctxt "text_id=11629 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「一日七回もお茶会開く国民性じゃないからでしょ。"
msgstr "\"I guess we're just not as *cultured* as you. After all, we're not the type to want to have tea seven times a day."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4233:11630: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0034; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4233
msgctxt "text_id=11630 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　気をつけなさいね草十郎。美味しい紅茶を淹れようとしてペットボトルの水なんて買ってきたら、有珠に一時間近くお説教されるから。知識も心構えもなってない、って」"
msgstr "  Be careful, Soujyuro. If you go and buy bottled water to make a nice cup of tea, she'll lecture you for an hour about how dumb and barbaric you are.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4263:11631: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4263
msgctxt "text_id=11631 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　水が美味しければ紅茶も美味しくなるはずだ。"
msgstr "  It was true that better water should make a better cup of tea."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4268:11632: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4268
msgctxt "text_id=11632 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺邸に引っ越してすぐの頃、青子はそう考えてペットボトルの自然水を買ってきた。"
msgstr "  That was why Aoko went out and bought bottles of natural spring water as soon as she moved into the Kuonji Estate."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4273:11633: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4273
msgctxt "text_id=11633 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これでどうよ、と自信満々の青子だったが、結果は同居人とのはじめての“人間らしい”口論だった。"
msgstr "  Her proud show-and-tell to Alice had led to their first petty argument."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4278:11634: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4278
msgctxt "text_id=11634 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術以外のコトであんなに<罵|ののし>りあい、終わった時は二人とも疲れきって、"
msgstr "  The two were exhausted after quarreling about something one would think wasn't nearly as significant as magecraft."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4309:11635: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4309
msgctxt "text_id=11635 | speaker=alice"
msgid "『……蒼崎さん。夕食を作る気力、残ってる？』"
msgstr "\"Do you have enough energy left to cook dinner, Miss Aozaki?\" Alice asked."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4315:11636: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0035; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4315
msgctxt "text_id=11636 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "『……パス。主義に反するけど、<店屋物|てんやもの>を頼んでみよう』"
msgstr "\"...Nah. It goes against my better nature, but let's just order takeout.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4321:11637: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4321
msgctxt "text_id=11637 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これまたはじめて、蕎麦屋に電話で注文する経験をした。"
msgstr "  And that had been her first time ordering from a soba noodle shop by phone."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4326:11638: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4326
msgctxt "text_id=11638 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　以来、二人の<自堕落|じだらく>っぷりは加速の<一途|いっと>を辿ったのである。"
msgstr "  Their slovenly attitude toward household chores had only accelerated since then."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4369:11639: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0036; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4369
msgctxt "text_id=11639 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いやー、あの後は悔しくってお茶について調べまくったもんだわ。有珠に質問したり競い合ってたら、いつのまにか私も紅茶党の仲間入りよ。"
msgstr "\"After that, I looked up everything I could about tea. I asked Alice a lot of questions, and had many heated debates which led to me becoming more of a black tea person."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4375:11640: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0037; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4375
msgctxt "text_id=11640 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私、姉貴の影響で中学までコーヒー党だったのに」"
msgstr "  Up until middle school, I was more into coffee because of my older sister.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4405:11641: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4405
msgctxt "text_id=11641 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……そこには感謝しているわ。"
msgstr "\"...Well, I'm glad you changed your mind."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4411:11642: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4411
msgctxt "text_id=11642 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　青子が連れ出してくれなかったら、コープランドのアンティークカップに出会えなかったもの」"
msgstr "  If you hadn't taken me out shopping that one time, I never would have found that antique Copeland teacup.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4417:11643: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0038; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4417
msgctxt "text_id=11643 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あはは。気が付いたら骨董品回りしてたものね、去年の私たち」"
msgstr "\"Ahahaha! You're right. Last year we were all about antique shopping, weren't we?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4437:11644: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4437
msgctxt "text_id=11644 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間とサンルーム。"
msgstr "  The drawing room and the sunroom."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4442:11645: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4442
msgctxt "text_id=11645 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　離れてはいるものの二人は楽しげに会話をしている。"
msgstr "  Though they were not even in the same room, the two were enjoying a fun and lively conversation nonetheless."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4461:11646: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4461
msgctxt "text_id=11646 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　せっかく仲が良いんだから、居間で向き合って話をすればいいのに、と草十郎は首をかしげる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro wondered why they didn't just sit together and chat in the drawing room since they got along so well."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4466:11647: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4466
msgctxt "text_id=11647 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　離れているからこそ思い出話には興が乗ることを、彼はまだ知らないのだ。"
msgstr "  He didn't yet understand how the physical distance between them made those stories of old memories more meaningful."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4492:11648: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0023; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4492
msgctxt "text_id=11648 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ふうん。有珠は外に出ない子だったんだ」"
msgstr "\"Huh. So you weren't the type to go out much, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4511:11649: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0039; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4511
msgctxt "text_id=11649 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ええ、この子ったらほーんと屋内派で、外に出るのは学校だけだったんだから。"
msgstr "\"That's right. She was a total indoor type. She only went out to go to school, and that's about it."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4511:11650: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0039; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4511
msgctxt "text_id=11650 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　今日だってずっと洋館にいたんでしょう、有珠？」"
msgstr "  I mean, just look at today. You've been inside the mansion all day, haven't you, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4544:11651: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4544
msgctxt "text_id=11651 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――違うわ。外に用がないだけよ。"
msgstr "\"It's not that I'm an indoor type. I simply have no reason to go outside."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4544:11652: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4544
msgctxt "text_id=11652 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　今日はプロイの補充に忙しかっただけだし」"
msgstr "  Today I was busy replenishing the Ploys, anyway.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4562:11653: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0024; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4562
msgctxt "text_id=11653 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それだ。プロイの補充ってコトは、遊園地の時みたいなのはここで生まれてるのか？」"
msgstr "\"About that... Do you make those things here? Like the ones at the amusement park?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4613:11654: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4613
msgctxt "text_id=11654 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　遊園地で酷い目にあって以来、草十郎はプロイと聞くと過敏に反応する。あの時は逃げるのに手一杯だったが、時間が経つにつれ、"
msgstr "  Ever since that terrible incident, Soujyuro had been sensitive whenever Ploys came up. He'd only been worried about escaping with his life at the time, but as time passed..."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4618:11655: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4618
msgctxt "text_id=11655 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“あの不思議なものはなんだったのか？”"
msgstr "'What were those mysterious things?'"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4623:11656: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4623
msgctxt "text_id=11656 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　と気になって仕方がなかったらしい。"
msgstr "  He became filled with curiosity."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4644:11657: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0040; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4644
msgctxt "text_id=11657 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なに、知りたい草十郎？」"
msgstr "\"Oh, you wanna know?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4662:11658: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0025; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4662
msgctxt "text_id=11658 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「教えてくれるなら知りたいけど……いや、よく考えると聞かない方がいいような、やっぱり知りたいような―――」"
msgstr "\"I do, if you are willing to tell me. Uh, should I not have asked? But I am curious...\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4698:11659: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0041; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4698
msgctxt "text_id=11659 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「よし、そういう事なら話してあげましょう！"
msgstr "\"Fine, I'll tell you then!"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4704:11660: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0042; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4704
msgctxt "text_id=11660 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ちょっとした触りだけなら怒らないわよね、有珠？」"
msgstr "  You don't mind if I give a brief rundown, do you, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4709:11661: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4709
msgctxt "text_id=11661 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　勢いよく脚を組み替える青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko quickly recrossed her legs in anticipation."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4715:11662: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4715
msgctxt "text_id=11662 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……別に。"
msgstr "\"...Doesn't matter to me."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4715:11663: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4715
msgctxt "text_id=11663 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　わたしと貴女の違いを話すぐらいなら、いいけど」"
msgstr "  As long as you talk about the difference between me and you, that's perfectly fine.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4749:11664: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0043; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4749
msgctxt "text_id=11664 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「よし決まった！"
msgstr "\"All right, it's settled then!"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4756:11665: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0044; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4756
msgctxt "text_id=11665 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……ってなによアンタ、妙な顔して。自分から言っておいて尻尾まくの？」"
msgstr "  ...Now what's with that look on your face? You're the one who brought it up.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4772:11666: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0026; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4772
msgctxt "text_id=11666 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――いや、そうではなく」"
msgstr "\"Ah, no, it's just that... Umm...\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4778:11667: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4778
msgctxt "text_id=11667 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子に正面から見つめられて、草十郎はつい視線を泳がす。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro diverted his eyes at Aoko's direct stare."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4808:11668: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4808
msgctxt "text_id=11668 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　現状、青子との接点は食後のひとときだけなので<接触事故|ニアミス>はないのだが、たまに、こういう無防備な仕草を目にしてしまい、対応に困る草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro and Aoko currently only spent time together after dinner. Every once in a while, however, he would catch a glimpse of some innocent gesture of hers and wouldn't know how to respond."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4829:11669: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0027; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4829
msgctxt "text_id=11669 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いいんだ、続けてくれ。興味はある」"
msgstr "\"It's nothing. Keep going. I'm interested.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4845:11670: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0045; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4845
msgctxt "text_id=11670 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「よし。じゃあ<駒鳥|コマドリ>呼ばないとね。"
msgstr "\"Great. Let's get started then. For this, I'll need to call in my robin!"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4851:11671: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0046; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4851
msgctxt "text_id=11671 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それでは特別授業、なぜなにプロイキッシャー、はじまりはじまり～」"
msgstr "  Today in this special class you're going to learn all about Ploy Kickshaws!\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4873:11672: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4873
msgctxt "text_id=11672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はパチンと指を鳴らす。"
msgstr "  Aoko snapped her fingers."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4878:11673: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4878
msgctxt "text_id=11673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　テレビのスイッチを入れる真似ごとらしい。"
msgstr "  Apparently she was trying to mimic turning on the switch to a TV."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4884:11674: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4884
msgctxt "text_id=11674 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……<一時|いっとき>の番外編。"
msgstr "  It was a veritable TV special."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4889:11675: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4889
msgctxt "text_id=11675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺有珠監修、久遠寺有珠出演による、ある魔術系統のレクチャーはこうして始まった。"
msgstr "  That's how a lecture about a certain brand of magecraft, performed and directed by Alice Kuonji, first aired."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4937:11676: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4937
msgctxt "text_id=11676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が。"
msgstr "  Unfortunately..."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4942:11677: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4942
msgctxt "text_id=11677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　せっかくの特番は三十分ほどで打ち切りと相成った。"
msgstr "  The special production was cancelled only thirty minutes after it began."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4947:11678: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4947
msgctxt "text_id=11678 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　聞き手である草十郎をおいてけぼりにした、あまりにマニアックな内容だったからである。"
msgstr "  Apparently, the content had been a little too esoteric for Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4987:11679: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4987
msgctxt "text_id=11679 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……分かってはいたけど。"
msgstr "\"...I knew this would happen."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4993:11680: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4993
msgctxt "text_id=11680 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　静希君の覚えの悪さは、三千世界に響き渡るわね」"
msgstr "  Sizuki probably has the worst memory in the universe.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:4999:11681: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:4999
msgctxt "text_id=11681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　死ねばいいのに、と言葉にならないため息をつく有珠。"
msgstr "  She almost said he was better off dead, but took a deep breath to avoid being hurtful."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5024:11682: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0047; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5024
msgctxt "text_id=11682 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「可哀想な有珠。さすがに今回は同情するわ。"
msgstr "\"I'm sorry, Alice. I feel for you on this one."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5030:11683: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0048; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5030
msgctxt "text_id=11683 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ソイツにとっちゃ私の魔術も有珠の魔術も“すごく便利”でくくられちゃうものだなんて。他の魔術師が聞いたら失神ものの屈辱よ」"
msgstr "  I've no idea how he can reduce our magecraft down to 'amazingly convenient.' If any other mage heard that, they'd faint from the pure insult of it.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5050:11684: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5050
msgctxt "text_id=11684 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子も本格的に呆れている。"
msgstr "  Aoko was exasperated;"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5055:11685: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5055
msgctxt "text_id=11685 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もっとも、彼女の場合は反省も混じっていた。"
msgstr "  she also felt some measure of regret."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5060:11686: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5060
msgctxt "text_id=11686 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　考えてみればこの結果は見えていたからだ。"
msgstr "  She should've realized this would be the outcome."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5095:11687: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0028; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5095
msgctxt "text_id=11687 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そんな事はない。ちゃんと区別はつく。"
msgstr "\"That's not true at all. I can tell the difference between your magecraft."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5101:11688: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0029; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5101
msgctxt "text_id=11688 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　蒼崎は壊すだけで、有珠はいろんなものを作って、それで壊すんだろ。有珠の方がやや生産的だ」"
msgstr "  Aozaki just breaks stuff. Alice makes things to break stuff with. Therefore, Alice is a little more productive.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5145:11689: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5145
msgctxt "text_id=11689 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「怖いわ青子。わたし、どうしてか胸が苦しい。こういうコトって本当にあるのね。"
msgstr "\"This is scary, Aoko. It hurts. There's a pain in my chest and I don't know what to do with it."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5151:11690: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5151
msgctxt "text_id=11690 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　まるで、お気に入りのカップを割ってしまった時、通りかかったキリンに“でもトロルよりマシですよ”と<慰|なぐさ>められた気分だわ」"
msgstr "  This feels like when someone breaks your favorite teacup and tries to cheer you up by saying that at least there wasn't a troll in the kitchen.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5173:11691: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0049; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5173
msgctxt "text_id=11691 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どういう意味よそれ」"
msgstr "\"What's *that* supposed to mean?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5193:11692: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5193
msgctxt "text_id=11692 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　むっと対面に座った相方を睨む青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko glared at Alice sitting across from her."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5198:11693: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5198
msgctxt "text_id=11693 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　トロルとは童話で言うところの、少々おつむの足りない暴れん坊の巨人の名だ。"
msgstr "  Alice had alluded to a fairy tale about a less-than-intelligent giant who lived under a bridge."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5224:11694: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0050; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5224
msgctxt "text_id=11694 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ふん。今の草十郎の指摘、けっこうあってると思うけど。"
msgstr "\"...Hmph. I think Soujyuro's observation was pretty accurate though, to be honest."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5231:11695: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0051; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5231
msgctxt "text_id=11695 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "私、有珠のプロイが生活の役に立つトコ見たことないし。駒鳥も双子も最後はドジって終わりじゃない」"
msgstr "I've never seen your Ploys doing anything to help around here. The robin and the twins both only mess things up.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5249:11696: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5249
msgctxt "text_id=11696 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「それは結果論よ。役立とうという初志は尊重するべきだわ。……だいたい。<駒鳥|アレ>や<双子|ソレ>が最後にぜんぶ台無しにするのは、わたしの責任じゃないのだし」"
msgstr "\"You're only looking at the final outcomes. They are at least *trying* to help. It's not my responsibility that they only end up ruining things.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5269:11697: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5269
msgctxt "text_id=11697 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　両者は互いのダメだしに余念がない。"
msgstr "  Both girls were now just intent on calling the other out."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5274:11698: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5274
msgctxt "text_id=11698 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こと魔術の技量に関して、両者とも譲れない一線があるようだ。"
msgstr "  It seemed neither wanted to admit their own shortcomings when it came to magecraft."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5279:11699: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5279
msgctxt "text_id=11699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どちらがより厄介な壊し屋なのかを押しつける、<底辺|ていへん>の争いにしても。"
msgstr "  Even when it came down to a silly argument about who was the worst at breaking things."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5313:11700: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0030; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5313
msgctxt "text_id=11700 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、でも有珠の使い魔は役に立ってるぞ。"
msgstr "\"But wait, Alice's familiar does help out sometimes."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5319:11701: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0031; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5319
msgctxt "text_id=11701 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　前に森で落ち葉を集めているブタを見かけた。あれは有珠の使い魔なのに、なんで蒼崎に言ってやらないんだ。"
msgstr "  I saw a pig in the woods picking up leaves before. If that's your familiar, then why don't you tell Aozaki?"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5325:11702: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0032; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5325
msgctxt "text_id=11702 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……まあ、いいことをしたのに黙っているのは美徳だって、山城先生は言ってたけど」"
msgstr "  Though I guess Mr. Yamasiro did try to teach us that it's good to be humble and not brag...\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5354:11703: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0052; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5354
msgctxt "text_id=11703 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5374:11704: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5374
msgctxt "text_id=11704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠にしてみれば慣らし運転、ただの準備運動で“お喋り双子”を森に派遣したのだが、草十郎から見れば立派な善行だったらしい。"
msgstr "  Alice had simply sent the Chatty Twins out into the forest to break them in, as it were. To Soujyuro, this had seemed like a good deed."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5379:11705: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5379
msgctxt "text_id=11705 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の勝ち、と納得する草十郎に、青子はますます面白くない。"
msgstr "  Aoko was visibly getting more fed up with this conversation since Soujyuro had decided Alice was the victor here."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5406:11706: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0053; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5406
msgctxt "text_id=11706 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ハン。掃除をしているから生産的とか、ずいぶん小さな判断ですこと。もっとこう、大きな視点で評価できないのかしらね、このお掃除マシーンは」"
msgstr "\"Hmph. You think cleaning is productive? I guess you can't see the bigger picture.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5428:11707: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0033; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5428
msgctxt "text_id=11707 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「大きな視点―――"
msgstr "\"The bigger picture?"

msgctxt "text_id=11708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "たとえば、お金<儲|もう>けとか？」"
msgstr " Like making money or something?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5467:11709: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0054; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5467
msgctxt "text_id=11709 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「！？」"
msgstr "\"?!\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5485:11710: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5485
msgctxt "text_id=11710 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ご」"
msgstr "\"Urgh...\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5521:11711: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5521
msgctxt "text_id=11711 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりに直球な質問に、少女たちは平静を装いつつ顔を見合わせる。"
msgstr "  The two girls both tried to remain calm in face of such a direct question."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5526:11712: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5526
msgctxt "text_id=11712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時に、愚者の思いつきは会議を新たなステージに押し上げるのだった。"
msgstr "  Even a fool could think of a good idea sometimes."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5554:11713: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0055; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5554
msgctxt "text_id=11713 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……呆れた。我ながらその発想はなかったわ。"
msgstr "\"...You know, I've never thought about that."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5560:11714: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0056; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5560
msgctxt "text_id=11714 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　盲点すぎたっていうか、基本、魔術って損失しか産まないものだから」"
msgstr "  Magecraft has always been something that only brings loss.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5572:11715: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5572
msgctxt "text_id=11715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の意見に、うんうん、と頷く有珠。"
msgstr "  Alice nodded affirmatively."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5608:11716: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0057; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5608
msgctxt "text_id=11716 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それで、たとえば？"
msgstr "\"So... What are you thinking?"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5614:11717: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0058; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5614
msgctxt "text_id=11717 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　貴方から見て、私の魔術はどんな金策ができると思う？」"
msgstr "  How do you think my magecraft can make us money?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5620:11718: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0034; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5620
msgctxt "text_id=11718 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「蒼崎なら……そうだな、マグロを捕まえるのはどうだろう」"
msgstr "\"Hmm, let's see... For you, maybe you could use it to catch tuna or something?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5626:11719: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0059; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5626
msgctxt "text_id=11719 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5631:11720: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5631
msgctxt "text_id=11720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しばし沈黙。"
msgstr "  Silence."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5664:11721: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5664
msgctxt "text_id=11721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は静かに足を組み直して、"
msgstr "  Aoko adjusted the position of her crossed legs."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5673:11722: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0060; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5673
msgctxt "text_id=11722 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なんでマグロ？」"
msgstr "\"Why tuna, exactly?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5679:11723: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5679
msgctxt "text_id=11723 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わりと真剣に聞き返した。"
msgstr "  She asked this question seriously."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5712:11724: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0035; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5712
msgctxt "text_id=11724 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや。<朝市|あさいち>でたいへん高価だと聞いた。"
msgstr "\"Ah, I just heard they fetch a really high price at the morning fish market."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5718:11725: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0036; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5718
msgctxt "text_id=11725 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　でも捕まえるのは難しいって。あんな巨大なものが、水の中では車より速く泳ぐと」"
msgstr "  But they're hard to catch. They're huge, but they can swim at high speeds.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5724:11726: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0061; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5724
msgctxt "text_id=11726 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そりゃ地球が誇る大型肉食魚だからね。お寿司屋さんでも最強だし。平均時速60キロ、マックススピードは時速180キロに迫ると聞くわ」"
msgstr "\"Well, they are one of Earth's greatest predator fish, and one of the most popular types of sushi. I heard they travel at an average speed of 38 miles per hour and can reach a max speed of 112 miles per hour if need be.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5730:11727: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0037; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5730
msgctxt "text_id=11727 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「部長いわく、蒼崎は泳ぎがうまいって。泳いで捕まえられないか？」"
msgstr "\"You're good at swimming, aren't you, Aozaki? Couldn't you swim and catch one?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5751:11728: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0062; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5751
msgctxt "text_id=11728 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「もう魔術関係ないわねそれ。"
msgstr "\"What does that have to do with magecraft?"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5757:11729: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0063; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5757
msgctxt "text_id=11729 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　仮に魔弾で迎撃できたとしても、保存できないわ。私、回転を速めるのが専門で止めるのはちょっと。有珠は？」"
msgstr "  Even if I could hit one with a magic bullet, it would be too damaging. I'm only good at speeding things up, not stopping things. What about you, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5763:11730: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5763
msgctxt "text_id=11730 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「魚は苦手」"
msgstr "\"I rather hate fish.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5768:11731: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5768
msgctxt "text_id=11731 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たまに妙に気を引くのがいるから、と小さく付け足す有珠だった。"
msgstr "  Alice quietly added that some of them were oddly interesting to her, so she wouldn't feel comfortable harming them."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5797:11732: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5797
msgctxt "text_id=11732 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう、じゃあ無理ね、と青子は両肩を落とす。"
msgstr "  Aoko shrugged her shoulders, throwing that idea to the side."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5823:11733: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0064; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5823
msgctxt "text_id=11733 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ところでケンカ売ってる、静希君？」"
msgstr "\"Anyway, are you trying to start a fight or something, Sizuki?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5843:11734: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0038; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5843
msgctxt "text_id=11734 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「す、すまない。実は、ちょっとからかっ、てみた」"
msgstr "\"S-Sorry... I may have been m-mocking you... just a little...\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5855:11735: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5855
msgctxt "text_id=11735 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　首輪の圧迫は五秒ほどで止まった。"
msgstr "  The collar around his neck tightened for a good five seconds."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5860:11736: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5860
msgctxt "text_id=11736 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　微妙にシャレにならない<締め時間|チョークスリーパー>だ。"
msgstr "  It was as tight as a sleeper hold."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5886:11737: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0039; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5886
msgctxt "text_id=11737 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「とまあ、蒼崎には乱暴なことしか期待できないとして、有珠はどうなんだ？　"
msgstr "\"So I guess we can only count on Aozaki to do violent things... How about you, Alice?  "

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5898:11738: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0040; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5898
msgctxt "text_id=11738 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "何も言わないということは、魔術でお金儲けは気に入らない？」"
msgstr "You haven't said anything, so I guess you're opposed to using magecraft for profit?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5916:11739: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5916
msgctxt "text_id=11739 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……そうね。好き嫌いはともかく、お金があるのはいいことだわ。協会の目をくぐりぬける事ができるなら、青子には頑張ってほしい」"
msgstr "\"...It's not really about liking it or not. Having money is always a good thing. If there's something Aoko can do while also evading the watching eyes of the Association, I'm all for it.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5953:11740: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0065; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5953
msgctxt "text_id=11740 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「危ない目に<遭|あ>うのは私だけかッ！？"
msgstr "\"So I'm the only one sticking my neck out?!"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5959:11741: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0066; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5959
msgctxt "text_id=11741 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　有珠のプロイにはなんかないの？　<土|つち>食べたら<金|きん>に変換するようなカバとか!?"
msgstr "  Isn't there something your Ploys can do? Like, I don't know, a hippo that eats dirt and turns it into gold or something?!"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:5965:11742: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0067; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:5965
msgctxt "text_id=11742 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ほら、中世の貴族はお抱えの錬金術師で、日夜<金|きん>を作り出す研究をしてたっていうじゃない!?」"
msgstr "  You know, like alchemists who spent day and night researching how to make gold in the middle ages!\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6004:11743: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6004
msgctxt "text_id=11743 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「<錬金術師|アレ>はただの金食い虫。"
msgstr "\"Alchemists were a waste of time and money."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6010:11744: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6010
msgctxt "text_id=11744 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……まあ、騙した貴族たちの貯蓄を食いつぶして新しい技術を生み出したから、無意味ではなかったけど。"
msgstr "  ...Granted, in some cases they used the wealth of the rich to discover new technologies, so it wasn't all bad."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6016:11745: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6016
msgctxt "text_id=11745 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　このマイセンも、元々は<金|きん>を作ると豪語した錬金術師が苦し紛れに産んだ磁器なワケだし」"
msgstr "  For example, this Meissen porcelain was the product of a desperate alchemist who boasted the ability to create gold.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6021:11746: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6021
msgctxt "text_id=11746 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は手元のティーカップの縁を指でなぞる。"
msgstr "  Alice ran a finger along the edge of the teacup in her hand."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6059:11747: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0068; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6059
msgctxt "text_id=11747 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……はあ。錬金術師ほどアテにならない奴はいないってワケか。今じゃプラハの錬金術師は証券魔術師、エジプトの方は兵器作ってるって話だしね……」"
msgstr "\"I guess there's nobody more unreliable than an alchemist then, huh? I hear the alchemists in Prague deal in securities, and the ones in Egypt make weapons now.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6089:11748: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6089
msgctxt "text_id=11748 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ええ。ちょっと期待してしまったけど、もともとわたしたちは現実社会と折り合いが悪いのよ。神秘に特化しすぎているから」"
msgstr "\"Right? I got my hopes up a little, but our kind should honestly never deal with the real world. We're too specialized in Mystics.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6115:11749: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6115
msgctxt "text_id=11749 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ロンドンの名門になると、家訓と事業は別物と割り切っていて、金融専門の弟子をとっているわ。"
msgstr "\"I've heard that a noble mage family in London has abandoned their traditions and is only taking in disciples for finance now."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6121:11750: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6121
msgctxt "text_id=11750 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……噂だけど、ある財閥の総帥は社員全員の血を吸って、情報を共有するネットワークを作っているとか。"
msgstr "  It's only a rumor, but apparently the leader of this big financial group drank the blood of all their employees to create a shared information network."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6127:11751: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6127
msgctxt "text_id=11751 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　なんでも吸血鬼になった理由が“精神的に繋がった、決して内部闘争しない商会を作りたいから”だったとか」"
msgstr "  Supposedly he became a vampire so that his employees would all be mentally linked, creating the world's only financial group without internal conflict.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6171:11752: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0069; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6171
msgctxt "text_id=11752 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――極まってるなあ。要は、そこまで徹底しないと魔術でお金儲けは難しいってコトかぁ。"
msgstr "\"...Sounds extreme. But I guess that's the lengths you have to go to if you want to make money from magecraft."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6182:11753: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0070; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6182
msgctxt "text_id=11753 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あ、有珠のプロイで遊園地をやるのはどう？」"
msgstr "  Hey, what if your Ploys started their own amusement park?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6201:11754: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6201
msgctxt "text_id=11754 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ポン、と手を叩く草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro clapped his hands together in excitement."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6207:11755: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0041; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6207
msgctxt "text_id=11755 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それはいい。襲われるのはもうこりごりだけど、あの遊園地なら連日連夜大盛況だ」"
msgstr "\"That's a great idea! I've had enough of getting attacked, but in an amusement park that would be a huge hit for sure!\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6235:11756: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6235
msgctxt "text_id=11756 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「わたしのプロイを見せ物にする気？」"
msgstr "\"You mean you want my Ploys to be some kind of show or exhibit?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6258:11757: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0071; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6258
msgctxt "text_id=11757 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でも大ウケよ、絶対。ロボットって言い張ればみんな騙されるし」"
msgstr "\"I bet it would actually be popular. You could just tell everyone they're robots, and they would definitely believe you.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6297:11758: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6297
msgctxt "text_id=11758 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「却下よ青子。この話、もう一度したら絶交だから」"
msgstr "\"No way, Aoko. Bring this up again and we're through.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6308:11759: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0072; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6308
msgctxt "text_id=11759 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「う、本気で怒らせたか。だってさ草十郎、遊園地はあきらめましょ。今度こそ友情を失っちゃうし」"
msgstr "\"Oof, you're actually mad. All right, Soujyuro. That's it for the amusement park idea. No point losing a friendship over it.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6341:11760: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6341
msgctxt "text_id=11760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冷たく拒絶する有珠と、やれやれと引き下がる青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko backed down after Alice's cold rejection of the idea."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6346:11761: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6346
msgctxt "text_id=11761 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雑談をしつつも、少女たちは互いの距離感、踏みこんではいけない線を心得ていた。"
msgstr "  The small talk continued, but the girls grew more distant as they tried to avoid further conflict."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6363:11762: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6363
msgctxt "text_id=11762 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はそんなふたりを不思議そうに見つめている。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro looked at the two with a perplexed expression."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6389:11763: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0042; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6389
msgctxt "text_id=11763 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ちょっといいかな。いま、猛烈に気になったんだが」"
msgstr "\"Hold on, there's something I really have to ask about now.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6406:11764: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0073; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6406
msgctxt "text_id=11764 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なに？」"
msgstr "\"What is it?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6424:11765: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0043; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6424
msgctxt "text_id=11765 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや。蒼崎も有珠も、遊園地で本気で殺し合っただろ。"
msgstr "\"It's just, you guys were both trying to seriously kill each other at that amusement park, weren't you?"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6430:11766: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0044; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6430
msgctxt "text_id=11766 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　それなのに、まだ友達だったのか？」"
msgstr "  How were you able to stay friends after that?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6491:11767: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6491
msgctxt "text_id=11767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　失礼と言えば失礼、"
msgstr "  It was certainly a rude question to ask."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6496:11768: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6496
msgctxt "text_id=11768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　当然と言えば当然の疑問に、青子たちは顔を見合わせる。"
msgstr "  But it was also an obvious thing to ask. Aoko and Alice looked at each other as they thought of the answer."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6501:11769: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6501
msgctxt "text_id=11769 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりは二秒ほど見つめ合ったあと、"
msgstr "  The stared at each other for about two seconds."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6552:11770: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0074; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6552
msgctxt "text_id=11770 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「んー、ギリギリあり？」"
msgstr "\"Hmm... It happens, I guess?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6563:11771: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0028; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6563
msgctxt "text_id=11771 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「まあ、ギリギリ」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, these things happen.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6583:11772: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0045; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6583
msgctxt "text_id=11772 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ありなんだ！」"
msgstr "\"They do?!\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6589:11773: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6589
msgctxt "text_id=11773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりに軽く、"
msgstr "  Though their friendship was surprisingly lighthearted..."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6594:11774: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6594
msgctxt "text_id=11774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　また鉄より堅い、驚愕の友情なのだった。"
msgstr "  ...it also seemed to be forged from bonds harder than steel."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6662:11775: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6662
msgctxt "text_id=11775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おもいのほか長く続いたお茶会は、草十郎の退席でお開きとなった。"
msgstr "  Their long and extended tea party had just started to get going when Soujyuro had to leave."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6667:11776: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6667
msgctxt "text_id=11776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎としても名残惜しいが、アルバイトは休めない。"
msgstr "  He didn't really want to since he was enjoying himself, but he couldn't miss his part-time job."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6691:11777: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0075; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6691
msgctxt "text_id=11777 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「二時間も話してたなんて珍しいわね。"
msgstr "\"It's rare for us to talk for two hours like this."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6691:11778: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0075; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6691
msgctxt "text_id=11778 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　有珠もいつになく<饒舌|じょうぜつ>だったし」"
msgstr "  You were unusually chatty today, Alice.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6700:11779: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6700
msgctxt "text_id=11779 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「成り行きよ。静希君があれこれ青子に質問して、貴女がそれをわたしにも向けてきただけ。"
msgstr "\"I had to be. Sizuki kept asking you questions, and you kept putting them off onto me."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6706:11780: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0030; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6706
msgctxt "text_id=11780 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……本当。わたしたちが一日なにをしているのかなんて、聞いても仕方がないのに」"
msgstr "  I don't even understand why he's so concerned with what we do all day anyway.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6742:11781: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0046; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6742
msgctxt "text_id=11781 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、それがそうでもない。たいへん役に立ちました」"
msgstr "\"I don't know, I think it was actually a helpful conversation.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6760:11782: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0076; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6760
msgctxt "text_id=11782 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「はい？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6780:11783: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6780
msgctxt "text_id=11783 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　驚く青子をよそに、草十郎は廊下から何やら運んでくる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was carrying something down the hallway, ignoring Aoko's surprise."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6798:11784: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6798
msgctxt "text_id=11784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生徒会室にあるタイプの、大型のホワイトボード。"
msgstr "  It was a large whiteboard, much like the one in the student council room."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6803:11785: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6803
msgctxt "text_id=11785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　真新しいボードには油性ペンで、以下の内容が書かれていた。"
msgstr "  On the shiny new board was written,"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6823:11786: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6823
msgctxt "text_id=11786 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　～これからの役割分担表～"
msgstr "  Chores List"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6829:11787: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6829
msgctxt "text_id=11787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　・館内清掃（一階東館にかぎる）"
msgstr "        - Mansion cleaning (1F east wing only)"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6829:11788: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6829
msgctxt "text_id=11788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　・朝食当番"
msgstr "        - Breakfast"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6829:11789: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6829
msgctxt "text_id=11789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　・夕食当番"
msgstr "        - Dinner"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6829:11790: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6829
msgctxt "text_id=11790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　・風呂当番"
msgstr "        - Cleaning the bath"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6860:11791: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0077; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6860
msgctxt "text_id=11791 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「な―――なんか色々と詮索してくると思ったら、そういう裏があったワケ……!?」"
msgstr "\"I knew there had to be some reason you were asking so many questions!\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6884:11792: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0047; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6884
msgctxt "text_id=11792 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「うん。歪みを正したかったら、まずどこがおかしいのか知らないといけないからね。"
msgstr "\"Right. If you want to correct something, you need to first find out what's broken, right?"

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6890:11793: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0048; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6890
msgctxt "text_id=11793 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　今夜の話じゃ、ふたりとも一日に一時間ぐらいは使える時間があるみたいだし。三人で一つの台所を使っているんだから、ローテーションを組んだ方がいいだろ。協力できるところは協力しないと」"
msgstr "  Well, based on tonight's conversation, you both have at least one hour of free time a day. Since all three of us share the kitchen, I think it's best if we assign a rotation. You both need to help out where you can.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6896:11794: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6896
msgctxt "text_id=11794 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たいしつかいぜんだ、と胸を張る草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was clearly proud of his attempt at making things better around here."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6937:11795: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0031; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6937
msgctxt "text_id=11795 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「待って。わたしは貴方を住まわせているだけで、協力なんてする気はないって言ったでしょう」"
msgstr "\"Wait just a second. Didn't I make it clear that I'm just letting you live here and don't have any intention to help with things like this?\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6961:11796: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0049; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6961
msgctxt "text_id=11796 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「うん、言ったね。"
msgstr "\"You did, yes."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6961:11797: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0049; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6961
msgctxt "text_id=11797 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　でも“夕食を用意するならわたしの分もお願い”と言いたいのなら、<相互扶助|そうごふじょ>は当然の義務だと思うんだ。"
msgstr "  But if you can ask me to make dinner for you while I'm cooking for myself, then it's only fair that you reciprocate."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:6973:11798: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0050; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:6973
msgctxt "text_id=11798 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　あと、三人で食費を集めれば、その分美味しいものが食べられるよ」"
msgstr "  Plus, if all three of us pitch in, I think we can eat better food in general.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7012:11799: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0032; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7012
msgctxt "text_id=11799 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「こ」"
msgstr "\"Urgh.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7018:11800: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7018
msgctxt "text_id=11800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今まで何度か“わたしの分もお願い”をやってしまった有珠にとって、草十郎の言葉はまさに神の鉄槌。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's words pierced Alice's heart. She knew she had asked him to make dinner for her on many occasions."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7023:11801: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7023
msgctxt "text_id=11801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神罰に等しい、汝の罪を悔い改めよ系の攻撃だった。"
msgstr "  It was a carefully planned attack designed to make her repent for her sins, and she knew it."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7061:11802: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0078; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7061
msgctxt "text_id=11802 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「で、でもホワイトボードを用意するコトはないんじゃない？　当番なんて、今まで口約束で決めてきたんだし……」"
msgstr "\"Even so, do we really need an entire whiteboard? We always managed without writing any chores down before...\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7085:11803: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7085
msgctxt "text_id=11803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うんうん、と頷く有珠。"
msgstr "  Alice nodded her agreement."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7090:11804: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7090
msgctxt "text_id=11804 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　口約束ほどアテに出来ないものはない。"
msgstr "  There was nothing less reliable in this world than a verbal promise."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7095:11805: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7095
msgctxt "text_id=11805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりとも口にはしないものの、イザとなったらさぼる気満々の顔である。"
msgstr "  Even if they didn't say so, Soujyuro could tell by the look on their faces that they intended to skip out on whatever task they were assigned to do."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7133:11806: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0051; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7133
msgctxt "text_id=11806 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ダメだ。正しい生活を送るには、正しい役割を把握しないと。こういう風に書いておけば、後になっても忘れないだろ？」"
msgstr "\"No way. If you want things to be done right, then everyone needs to know their responsibilities. If we write it down like this, then nobody will have an excuse to forget.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7156:11807: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0079; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7156
msgctxt "text_id=11807 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「うっ―――」"
msgstr "\"Urrrggghhh...\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7176:11808: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7176
msgctxt "text_id=11808 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　底の見えない笑顔にたじろぐ青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko recoiled at this new development."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7181:11809: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7181
msgctxt "text_id=11809 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　親切心で言っているのか、今から“サボらせないぞ”と<釘|くぎ>をさしているのか、まったく読めない。"
msgstr "  She couldn't tell if Soujyuro was just being nice, or if he was saying he wouldn't tolerate any slackers."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7220:11810: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0033; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7220
msgctxt "text_id=11810 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……なんてこと。証明文を書かせて、責任の所在を明らかにしようだなんて……」"
msgstr "\"...I can't believe you're making us sign off on these specific responsibilities like this.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7226:11811: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7226
msgctxt "text_id=11811 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は有珠で、これから日常になるっぽい当番制に<戦慄|せんりつ>していた。"
msgstr "  Alice was absolutely terrified at the prospect of daily chores."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7259:11812: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8_EX_0052; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7259
msgctxt "text_id=11812 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「決まりだな。誰がどこを担当するかは、また明日話しあおう。今のふたりがたいへんなのは分かってるから、しばらくの間はこっちが多目に受け持つよ」"
msgstr "\"So that settles it. Tomorrow we'll figure out who to assign to which tasks. I know this is going to be difficult for you two, so I'll take on the majority of tasks myself for the time being.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7271:11813: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7271
msgctxt "text_id=11813 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それじゃ、と草十郎は去っていった。"
msgstr "  And with that, Soujyuro left."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7276:11814: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7276
msgctxt "text_id=11814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残されたふたりはやるせなく、新品のホワイトボードを見つめている。"
msgstr "  The two girls left behind could only sit and stare, stunned at the shiny new whiteboard."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7316:11815: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0034; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7316
msgctxt "text_id=11815 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……こういうのを、飼い犬に手を噛まれる、というのかしら。わりと<小癪|こしゃく>な性格をしていたのね、彼」"
msgstr "\"This is like a dog biting the hand that feeds it. I never knew he was so brazen.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7327:11816: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0080; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7327
msgctxt "text_id=11816 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「知ってた。私、アイツがそういうヤツって知ってたわ」"
msgstr "\"I knew. I knew it from the moment I met him.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7347:11817: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7347
msgctxt "text_id=11817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<罠|わな>にかかったと気付いても後の祭り。"
msgstr "  But now it was too late. They'd already been caught in the trap."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7352:11818: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7352
msgctxt "text_id=11818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも今日の青子の朝食も、草十郎が調理したサラダを分けて貰ったものである。"
msgstr "  Just this morning, Aoko had received a portion of the salad Soujyuro prepared."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7357:11819: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7357
msgctxt "text_id=11819 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今から“じゃあこれから助け合いはなし”と言うには、助け合いの味をしめてしまった。"
msgstr "  She knew it would be wrong for her to veto the idea of them all helping each other out."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7377:11820: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7377
msgctxt "text_id=11820 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも当番制は青子の合理性に合っている。"
msgstr "  The concept of dividing up specific chores made perfect sense to Aoko, after all."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7382:11821: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7382
msgctxt "text_id=11821 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ、できれば作業の割合を、たまにでいいから誤魔化したかっただけなのだ。"
msgstr "  Even so, she wanted to be able to tip the ratio of chores in her favor, at least sometimes."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7408:11822: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0035; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7408
msgctxt "text_id=11822 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……青子。貴女、なにを考えているか丸わかりよ」"
msgstr "\"...Aoko, I already know what you're thinking.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7419:11823: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0081; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7419
msgctxt "text_id=11823 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうでしょうとも。"
msgstr "\"I'm sure you do."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7419:11824: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8_EX_0081; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7419
msgctxt "text_id=11824 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　間違いなく同じコトを考えてたからね、私たち」"
msgstr "  Because I'm pretty sure we're both thinking the same thing.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7439:11825: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7439
msgctxt "text_id=11825 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ため息まじりの返答をして、青子はホワイトボードを手に取った。全員共通の持ち物として、台所の壁に立てかける気らしい。"
msgstr "  Aoko sighed as she grabbed the whiteboard. She was going to hang it up in the kitchen so that they could all see it."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7469:11826: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7469
msgctxt "text_id=11826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はじっとホワイトボードを見ながら、"
msgstr "  Alice was still staring at the whiteboard blankly."

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7481:11827: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8_EX_0036; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7481
msgctxt "text_id=11827 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……せめて、新しい項目が増えなければいいけど」"
msgstr "\"...I just hope he doesn't add any new chores to the list.\""

#. Occurrence 8_EX:7487:11828: scene=8_EX
#: 8_EX:7487
msgctxt "text_id=11828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんて、世にも不吉な言葉を口にした。"
msgstr "  She would come to regret ever saying those words."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:38:11829: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:38
msgctxt "text_id=11829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いかに多忙と言え、人間として暮らしている以上、ある程度の余分は生まれてくる。"
msgstr "  No matter how busy one is, any person living within human means is certain to have at least some free time."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:56:11830: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:56
msgctxt "text_id=11830 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たとえば食事の前後。"
msgstr "  Before or after eating, for example."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:61:11831: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:61
msgctxt "text_id=11831 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　調理の手間と食後の<一服|ひととき>は無くす方が難しい。"
msgstr "  It's difficult to eliminate the time required to prepare a meal and the time after one finishes eating."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:66:11832: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:66
msgctxt "text_id=11832 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　頭脳労働者の場合、特に顕著である。"
msgstr "  This is particularly the case for those who do a lot of thinking."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:71:11833: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:71
msgctxt "text_id=11833 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　食後、体は消化にエネルギーを使うため、肝心の頭にまで血が回らない。なので、"
msgstr "  Since the body needs to use energy to digest after eating, there's less available for the brain to use..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:105:11834: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:105
msgctxt "text_id=11834 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ナイキはあれでしょ、ニケーのもじりでしょ？"
msgstr "\"That brand was named after the Greek goddess Nike, right?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:105:11835: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:105
msgctxt "text_id=11835 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　アテナの持ってる、盾じゃなくて小さな勝利の女神の方。陸上競技に勝つってイメージじゃない？」"
msgstr "  I guess it represents winning in sports, since she was the goddess of victory.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:112:11836: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:112
msgctxt "text_id=11836 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『さすがブランド品とか大好きな青子さん、どうでもいい知識だけはそれなりッスね！』"
msgstr "\"You've got a lot fillin' your head about these brands, Miss Aoko. Don't know where ya put it all!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:118:11837: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:118
msgctxt "text_id=11837 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館における頭脳労働者は、だらけきった姿勢でソファーに体を<預|あず>けているのだった。"
msgstr "  The studious resident of the mansion was now taking refuge on the sofa, looking exhausted."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:155:11838: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:155
msgctxt "text_id=11838 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の話し相手はテーブルの上にいる駒鳥だ。"
msgstr "  Aoko was talking to the robin perched on the table."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:160:11839: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:160
msgctxt "text_id=11839 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青い鳥はパタパタと羽を鳴らしながら、食後の団らんの真似事なぞ<勤|いそ>しんでいる。"
msgstr "  The blue bird flapped its wings, doing its best to join in on the after dinner conversation."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:199:11840: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:199
msgctxt "text_id=11840 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はサンルームで読書中。"
msgstr "  Alice was reading in the sunroom."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:204:11841: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:204
msgctxt "text_id=11841 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外部からやってきた敵魔術師への対策は、あと三十分ほど休んでからの話となる。"
msgstr "  Discussion of how to deal with the encroaching enemy mage wouldn't start for at least another thirty minutes."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:247:11842: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:247
msgctxt "text_id=11842 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『んじゃアディダスは？"
msgstr "\"So you fink"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:247:11843: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:247
msgctxt "text_id=11843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もしかしてアディオスのもじりっスか？』"
msgstr "  that other one is sum play on adios?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:267:11844: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:267
msgctxt "text_id=11844 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あれは普通に名前じゃなかったっけ？"
msgstr "\"It's just a name, isn't it?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:273:11845: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:273
msgctxt "text_id=11845 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ほら、グリム童話みたいに、作った兄弟の名前がそのままブランド名になっちゃったのよ」"
msgstr "  It's like the Grimm Fairy Tales where they just used the name of the brothers who came up with it for the brand name.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:309:11846: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:309
msgctxt "text_id=11846 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ブラザーグリムは童話を作った訳じゃないわ。"
msgstr "\"The brothers Grimm didn't make up those fairy tales."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:315:11847: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:315
msgctxt "text_id=11847 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　埋もれていた口伝を<蒐集|しゅうしゅう>して、物語に仕立て直して、丁寧に<編纂|へんさん>した人たちよ。職人というより学者の<類|たぐい>ね。"
msgstr "  They're a collection of folk tales passed down by oral tradition. The brothers rewrote and carefully compiled them into proper stories. They're more like scholars than craftsmen in that sense."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:321:11848: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:321
msgctxt "text_id=11848 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……まあ、多少は詐欺師めいたところもあるけれど」"
msgstr "  ...And in some sense, kind of like con men.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:356:11849: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:356
msgctxt "text_id=11849 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「へー。じゃあアンデルセンは？　人魚姫とか親指姫とか超メジャーだけど。ああ、あとみにくいアヒルの子」"
msgstr "\"Huh. Well what about Andersen? The Little Mermaid and Thumbelina are super famous. Oh, and The Ugly Duckling!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:362:11850: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:362
msgctxt "text_id=11850 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『ジブン、裸の王様とかたまんないッス。シンパシー感じるッスよ、あの<透けてる|クリスタル>キングに』"
msgstr "\"I personally like The Emperor's New Clothes. Me 'n 'im got a lot in common.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:396:11851: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:396
msgctxt "text_id=11851 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「アンデルセンは学者というより作家でしょうね。"
msgstr "\"Andersen was more of a writer than a scholar."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:402:11852: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:402
msgctxt "text_id=11852 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　彼の創作意欲は裕福層や大衆、平凡な幸福を得ている人々、はては女性像への<憤|いきどお>りから生まれたものだと言われているし。知的好奇心から筆をとったのではなく、感情を訴えるために筆をとった人」"
msgstr "  His creativity is said to have been inspired by everything from the elite and wealthy, to the common people and what makes them happy, to a resentment of the female image. He didn't write from intellectual curiosity, but rather from his own emotions.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:428:11853: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:428
msgctxt "text_id=11853 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……あまり、こういう説明はしたくないのだけれど。"
msgstr "\"I hate to explain it this way, but..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:434:11854: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:434
msgctxt "text_id=11854 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　それぞれ分けて説明するなら、マザーグースは歌、ブラザーグリムは物語。アンデルセンは寓話ね」"
msgstr "  If Mother Goose is a song, the brothers Grimm tell a story. Andersen is more like a fable or an allegory.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:464:11855: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0003_A; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:464
msgctxt "text_id=11855 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『みつばちマッチはアニメっすね。"
msgstr "\"Some of their stories are now cartoons!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:470:11856: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0004_A; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:470
msgctxt "text_id=11856 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ところで青子さん、アシックスの由来はなんスか』"
msgstr "  Anyway, Aoko, you know the dicky bird behind that Japanese sportswear name?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:506:11857: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:506
msgctxt "text_id=11857 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え？　うーん、これは私も小学校の頃、友達に聞いたものなんで真偽は分からないんだけど。"
msgstr "\"Hmm, I heard this once from a friend of mine in elementary school, so I don't know if it's true or not."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:512:11858: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:512
msgctxt "text_id=11858 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　アシックスって、もともと三つの会社が合併して出来た会社なのよ。で、三社の社長があつまると足が六本になるじゃない？　だから<足|アシ>、シックス　あくまで俗説だけどね」"
msgstr "  They were formed from a merger of three separate companies. So the name comes from the Japanese word for foot, ashi, and the number six, since the three CEOs would have six feet when together. It's probably just a myth.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:547:11859: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:547
msgctxt "text_id=11859 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「っ―――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:552:11860: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:552
msgctxt "text_id=11860 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　サンルームでは本を床に落とし、きゅっと唇を噛んでいる有珠の姿。"
msgstr "  Alice had dropped her book on the floor of the sunroom and was biting her lip."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:557:11861: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:557
msgctxt "text_id=11861 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は努めて冷静に、何事もなかったように呼吸を整えている。"
msgstr "  She was clearly trying to feign calm and to breathe as if nothing had happened."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:562:11862: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:562
msgctxt "text_id=11862 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少なくとも、本人はそう演じきれていると信じている。"
msgstr "  She thought she was doing a convincing job of it."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:593:11863: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:593
msgctxt "text_id=11863 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……あの子の笑いのツボも分かんないわね……」"
msgstr "\"...I really don't understand her sense of humor or why she thinks that was so funny.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:636:11864: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_9000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:636
msgctxt "text_id=11864 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『それはどうっスかね。あんまりにもつまんなかったから怒ってるのかもしれないっス。"
msgstr "\"Hmm, maybe it wasn't funny at all, and she's all marbles and conkers 'bout how unfunny it was?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:658:11865: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_9001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:658
msgctxt "text_id=11865 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "だってアリスさん、怒り心頭しても笑顔になるんスよ。ジブンたまに見るッス。アリスさんの日記を盗み見てると、後ろでそういう顔してるッス。"
msgstr "I mean, Alice usually smiles even when she's angry. I've seen it. Whenever I half inch her diary to have a look at it, that's always the look she's givin'."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:668:11866: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_9002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:668
msgctxt "text_id=11866 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "それ以上見ると死ぬわよって。でもカンベンしてほしいッス、見ちゃうものは見ちゃうっスよー！　ジブンから素行調査をとったら、もう帰巣本能しか残らない気もするッス』"
msgstr "She's like, 'Look at that again, and I'll kill you!' But I can't help it! I wanna read it! If you take my curiosity away from me, I've got nofink left!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:702:11867: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:702
msgctxt "text_id=11867 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぱたぱたと異論をはさむ駒鳥。"
msgstr "  The robin felt compelled to give a counter-argument for some reason."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:707:11868: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:707
msgctxt "text_id=11868 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はため息をつきながら、有珠も厄介な使い魔を押しつけられたもんね、と同情した。"
msgstr "  Aoko let out a sigh. Even Alice sympathized with her over the difficult familiar."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:734:11869: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:734
msgctxt "text_id=11869 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ただいま。お、今日はふたりともいるんだな」"
msgstr "\"I'm home! Oh, you're both here today.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:740:11870: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:740
msgctxt "text_id=11870 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな中、草十郎が顔を見せた。"
msgstr "  It was at this time that Soujyuro returned."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:745:11871: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:745
msgctxt "text_id=11871 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アルバイトから帰ってきたところらしい。"
msgstr "  He must have just gotten home from his part-time job."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:779:11872: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:779
msgctxt "text_id=11872 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「おかえりー。お疲れさまー」"
msgstr "\"Welcome back!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:785:11873: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:785
msgctxt "text_id=11873 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:791:11874: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:791
msgctxt "text_id=11874 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駒鳥の話し相手で<緩|ゆる>みきった青子の出迎えと、サンルームからのかすかな反応。"
msgstr "  Aoko's warm welcome was quite the opposite from the faint response from the sunroom."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:820:11875: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:820
msgctxt "text_id=11875 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「夕食は済ませてきたから要らないよ。"
msgstr "\"I already ate dinner, so I don't need anything to eat tonight."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:826:11876: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:826
msgctxt "text_id=11876 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　じゃ、夜のバイトにそなえてちょっと寝てくる」"
msgstr "  I'm gonna go take a nap before my night job.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:836:11877: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:836
msgctxt "text_id=11877 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はサンルームの有珠にも手を振って立ち去った。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro still gave Alice a wave as he left."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:842:11878: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:842
msgctxt "text_id=11878 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下に消える直前、不審な物音を立てながら。"
msgstr "  The dull thud of something dropping was heard as he entered the hallway."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:876:11879: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:876
msgctxt "text_id=11879 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「おーい、なんか落ちたわよー」"
msgstr "\"Hey! You dropped something!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:882:11880: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:882
msgctxt "text_id=11880 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はソファーから顔だけ出して草十郎を呼び止めた。"
msgstr "  Aoko peeked out from the sofa to yell for Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:920:11881: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:920
msgctxt "text_id=11881 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ああ、ポケットに入れっぱなしだった」"
msgstr "\"Ah, it's been in my pocket this whole time.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:926:11882: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:926
msgctxt "text_id=11882 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は慌てた風もなく、ごく自然に戻ってきて、床に落ちた何か―――封筒のようなもの―――に手を伸ばす。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro calmly and naturally walked back to pick up what looked to be some kind of envelope."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:943:11883: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:943
msgctxt "text_id=11883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人間の<性|さが>だろう。"
msgstr "  Perhaps it was instinct, but..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:948:11884: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:948
msgctxt "text_id=11884 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　興味はなくとも動くものは<野次馬|やじうま>根性で追ってしまう。"
msgstr "  The human eye was drawn to motion, even if it was something one had no personal interest in."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:953:11885: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:953
msgctxt "text_id=11885 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はどれどれ、と草十郎の手を目で追って―――"
msgstr "  Aoko keenly followed Soujyuro's hand with her eyes..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1001:11886: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1001
msgctxt "text_id=11886 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「さ―――！」"
msgstr "\"Aha!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1007:11887: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1007
msgctxt "text_id=11887 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“札束、だっ！”"
msgstr "(A wad of cash!)"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1012:11888: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1012
msgctxt "text_id=11888 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　などと、はしたない心の叫びを抑えつつ、青子はソファーから跳ね上がった。"
msgstr "  She had to restrain herself from shouting her thoughts out loud as she leaped up from the sofa."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1043:11889: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1043
msgctxt "text_id=11889 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「？　どうした蒼崎？」"
msgstr "\"Huh? What's wrong, Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1061:11890: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1061
msgctxt "text_id=11890 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え、どうしたって、その……」"
msgstr "\"Eh, umm, that's err...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1067:11891: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1067
msgctxt "text_id=11891 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<汚|けが>れのない純朴な目で見つめられては、さすがの青子も言い返せない。"
msgstr "  Aoko found it difficult to come up with a proper response to the pure, innocent eyes staring back at her."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1072:11892: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1072
msgctxt "text_id=11892 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　相乗効果的に、お金を見て飛び上がった自分のがめつさに頭を抱えたくなるほどだ。"
msgstr "  She was ashamed at how she had jumped up at the enticing sight of so much money."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1098:11893: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1098
msgctxt "text_id=11893 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「な、なんでもないっ！"
msgstr "\"I-It's nothing!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1104:11894: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1104
msgctxt "text_id=11894 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　そうよね、フツーにアルバイトの給料日よね。……にしても、けっこうもらってんのね、アンタ」"
msgstr "  I just forgot that today was pay day... You're earning a lot more than I thought.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1145:11895: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1145
msgctxt "text_id=11895 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　納得する青子に妙な間で笑顔を返して、草十郎は自室へ戻っていった。"
msgstr "  There was an awkward pause before Soujyuro smiled and returned back to his room."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1176:11896: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1176
msgctxt "text_id=11896 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「？」"
msgstr "\"?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1187:11897: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1187
msgctxt "text_id=11897 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　微妙に引っかかるものを感じながら、青子もソファーに腰を下ろす。"
msgstr "  Aoko sat back down on the sofa, still feeling a bit awkward."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1205:11898: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1205
msgctxt "text_id=11898 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――以上が事の発端。"
msgstr "  ...This was what set it all off."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1211:11899: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1211
msgctxt "text_id=11899 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　のちにカーモネーギー事件と駒鳥が名付けた、ありふれた<騒動|いちにち>の始まりだった。"
msgstr "  It began a series of events that the robin would later name \"The Dosh Affair.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1298:11900: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1298
msgctxt "text_id=11900 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　翌日、昨日の一件とほぼ同じ時間。"
msgstr "  It was the next day, and around the same time as the previous day's incident."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1314:11901: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1314
msgctxt "text_id=11901 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子が息抜きをかねて紅茶を淹れに来ると、居間では草十郎と駒鳥が何やら議論を交わしていた。"
msgstr "  Aoko was coming to pour some tea and relax when she heard Soujyuro and the robin engaged in some kind of debate in the drawing room."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1348:11902: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1348
msgctxt "text_id=11902 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「その人が言うには、人と会うたびに小さな親切を尽くしてあげるべきだ、と。そうして一日が終わったら、その親切が何をもたらしたか、よくかみしめなさいって。"
msgstr "\"What they mean is that you should try to be kind in some way every time you meet someone. Then, when that day ends, you need to take time to reflect on what that kindness has brought you."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1359:11903: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1359
msgctxt "text_id=11903 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　たった一回の言葉だけの親切でも、相手にとっては大きな意味があるんだそうだ。それが思いも寄らない幸福を運んでくる」"
msgstr "  Even if it's just a kind word, it might mean a lot to someone and could bring great and unexpected happiness your way.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1404:11904: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1404
msgctxt "text_id=11904 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『うはっ、だからジブンにビーフジャーキーくれたっスか！"
msgstr "\"Ah, so that's why you gave me some beef jerky?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1410:11905: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1410
msgctxt "text_id=11905 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　でもそれ、親切じゃなくてソデノシタって言う伝統芸能じゃないっスかね？　アンダーハート見え見えッス』"
msgstr "  Are you sure that wasn't just a bribe? I can see right through you, lad!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1430:11906: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1430
msgctxt "text_id=11906 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の真剣さは、雑談というより相談・勧誘の<類|たぐい>に見える。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's serious demeanor was more like a consultation or a proposal than it was idle chatter."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1452:11907: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1452
msgctxt "text_id=11907 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……まあ、アイツが妙なのはいつものコトか……」"
msgstr "\"Well, I guess he's just being a weirdo like normal...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1457:11908: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1457
msgctxt "text_id=11908 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は居間の様子をスルーしてサンルームに入る。"
msgstr "  Aoko decided to ignore what was going on in the drawing room and head straight for the sunroom."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1462:11909: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1462
msgctxt "text_id=11909 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と、椅子には草十郎のコートがかけられていた。"
msgstr "  There, she saw Soujyuro's coat on the chair."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1486:11910: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1486
msgctxt "text_id=11910 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ちょっと草十郎、コート置きっぱなしじゃない。"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro, you've just left your coat here!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1492:11911: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1492
msgctxt "text_id=11911 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　居間のコート掛けか、自分の部屋に持っていって―――」"
msgstr "  Take this to the coat rack in the drawing room or back to your...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1498:11912: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1498
msgctxt "text_id=11912 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いいかけて、言葉を飲む。"
msgstr "  She stopped herself mid-sentence."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1549:11913: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1549
msgctxt "text_id=11913 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎のコートのポケットから、昨日と同じような封筒が顔を覗かせていた。"
msgstr "  She could see the same kind of envelope that Soujyuro had dropped on the ground yesterday inside his coat pocket."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1554:11914: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1554
msgctxt "text_id=11914 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それも昨日よりいくぶん厚く、あまりにも無造作に。"
msgstr "  And it was even thicker than the one she saw the day before."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1580:11915: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1580
msgctxt "text_id=11915 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ふ、ふーん」"
msgstr "\"H-Hmm.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1585:11916: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1585
msgctxt "text_id=11916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　昨日のような、大金に目を輝かす愚は犯せない。"
msgstr "  She wouldn't allow herself to make a spectacle about it like she did yesterday."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1590:11917: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1590
msgctxt "text_id=11917 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子とて学園の模範生たる生徒会長の自覚はあるのだ。"
msgstr "  She reminded herself that she was a model student and student council president."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1616:11918: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1616
msgctxt "text_id=11918 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「さ、さーて、紅茶紅茶っと」"
msgstr "\"A-Anyway, it's time for some tea.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1622:11919: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1622
msgctxt "text_id=11919 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無関心を装いつつ、居間の会話に聞き耳を立てる。"
msgstr "  Feigning disinterest, she listened in on the conversation going on in the drawing room."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1627:11920: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1627
msgctxt "text_id=11920 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の呼びかけが聞こえなかったのか、草十郎は駒鳥との雑談に夢中だった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was still in deep conversation with the robin. Perhaps he hadn't heard her calls."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1660:11921: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1660
msgctxt "text_id=11921 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「都会の孤独は万人に平等だ。"
msgstr "\"Everyone feels lonely in a city."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1666:11922: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1666
msgctxt "text_id=11922 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　一見して身勝手な、暴力じみたお仕着せの善意も、長い目で見ればその人のためになる」"
msgstr "  Acts of kindness, even if they look like they are done for selfish reasons at first, can do real good in the long run.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1685:11923: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1685
msgctxt "text_id=11923 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『なるほどー。親切の押しつけには<一銭|いっせん>もかからないッスからね！　ジャンジャン人助けするッスよ』"
msgstr "\"I see... And it don't cost a thing to be kind to people! I'm tryin' to help people as much as I can now!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1706:11924: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1706
msgctxt "text_id=11924 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「うん。タダより高いものはないって言うけどね」"
msgstr "\"True, though they say nothing in life is truly free.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1727:11925: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1727
msgctxt "text_id=11925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『ハハハどっちっスかこのシャバ僧！』"
msgstr "\"Hahaha! So which is it then, o wise one?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1763:11926: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1763
msgctxt "text_id=11926 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1769:11927: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1769
msgctxt "text_id=11927 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の用事……紅茶を淹れに来た……も忘れて、青子は居間からの声に耳をすませる。"
msgstr "  Aoko was so intent on eavesdropping, she'd completely forgotten that she'd come to pour a cup of tea."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1774:11928: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1774
msgctxt "text_id=11928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これはもう、無視できる<怪|あや>しさではない。"
msgstr "  There was no way she could ignore such a suspicious conversation."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1809:11929: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1809
msgctxt "text_id=11929 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「こうも言うんだ。幸福になりたければ、はじめは恨まれてもいいと。"
msgstr "\"Well, let me put it this way. If you want to be happy, you must first be hated."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1815:11930: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1815
msgctxt "text_id=11930 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　やれ金を返せだの詐欺師だのと言われても、いずれその人のためになると分かっていれば心を鬼にできる。"
msgstr "  People shouldn't care if they're called a scam artist, for example. They just need to realize that what they're doing is for the good of others."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1822:11931: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1822
msgctxt "text_id=11931 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "人に尽くしている喜びが、後ろめたさとか帳消しにするらしい」"
msgstr "The joy you give to others will cancel out the sense of guilt you might feel.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1841:11932: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0010; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1841
msgctxt "text_id=11932 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『それ知ってるッス。でも、微妙に違うような』"
msgstr "\"I've heard somefink like that, but what you're saying's different.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1876:11933: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1876
msgctxt "text_id=11933 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不本意ではあるが、青子は駒鳥に同意する。"
msgstr "  Aoko agreed with the robin in this case."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1881:11934: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1881
msgctxt "text_id=11934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今のは有名な事業家の言葉で、正しくは"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was referring to the words of a famous entrepreneur,"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1887:11935: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1887
msgctxt "text_id=11935 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“幸せになりたければ、誰が恩を返した、誰が恩を返さないなどと考えるのはやめて、人に貢献できる喜びを大切にしよう”"
msgstr "\"If we want to find happiness, let's stop thinking about gratitude or ingratitude and give for the inner joy of giving.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1893:11936: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1893
msgctxt "text_id=11936 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だったはずだ。"
msgstr "  That was the actual quote."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1928:11937: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1928
msgctxt "text_id=11937 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あるいはこうとも。"
msgstr "\"In other words..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1934:11938: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1934
msgctxt "text_id=11938 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　貯金のある人は、その富を温存するよりも、会社がより豊かになるために使うべきだと」"
msgstr "  People should not save up their wealth. Instead, they are bound to administer it to help their company prosper.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1941:11939: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1941
msgctxt "text_id=11939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『それも知ってるッス。でも、もう完全に違うような』"
msgstr "\"I know that one, too. But you've got it all dodgy this time.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1973:11940: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1973
msgctxt "text_id=11940 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<甚|はなは>だ不本意ではあるが、またも青子は同意する。"
msgstr "  Aoko was becoming upset with how much she was agreeing with the robin at this point."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1980:11941: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1980
msgctxt "text_id=11941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今のはより有名な実業家の言葉で、正しくは"
msgstr "  This was a quote from an even more famous entrepreneur,"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1986:11942: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1986
msgctxt "text_id=11942 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“富める者は、その富を社会の改善のために使うべきである”"
msgstr "\"Surplus wealth is a sacred trust which its possessor is bound to administer in his lifetime for the good of the community.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:1992:11943: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:1992
msgctxt "text_id=11943 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だったはず。"
msgstr "  This was how that one was supposed to go."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2027:11944: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2027
msgctxt "text_id=11944 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「信じられるのはお金だけなのかもしれない。"
msgstr "\"The only thing you can trust in life is money."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2033:11945: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0016; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2033
msgctxt "text_id=11945 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　だって奥さんも子供も、ずっと一緒にいてくれるわけじゃない。不幸な事故で先立たれるコトだってある。"
msgstr "  Even if you're married with children, it's not like they're always going to be by your side. They could die in an unfortunate accident and leave you behind."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2039:11946: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0017; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2039
msgctxt "text_id=11946 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　でもお金は別だった。お金で幸福は買えないけど、幸福はお金になる。いまは人の親切と、温かい布団があればそれでいいと、その人は言った」"
msgstr "  Money is different. You can't buy happiness, but happiness can bring you wealth. They said that as long as you have the kindness of others and a warm bed to sleep in, you don't need anything else.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2073:11947: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2073
msgctxt "text_id=11947 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なんか……無性にらしくないコト言ってるわね、アイツ」"
msgstr "\"Whatever he's talking about is not like him at all...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2081:11948: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2081
msgctxt "text_id=11948 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<一抹|いちまつ>の不安を覚えるものの、草十郎の発言を気にしていては日が暮れる。"
msgstr "  Though his words were a bit strange and worrisome, Aoko couldn't spend much time worrying about it."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2086:11949: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2086
msgctxt "text_id=11949 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　第一、今の青子には<他人|ひと>に神経をさく余裕はない。"
msgstr "  She didn't have the capacity to worry about anyone else right now."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2091:11950: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2091
msgctxt "text_id=11950 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　敵魔術師との戦いは目下、水面下で進行中なのだ。"
msgstr "  Her battle with the enemy mage was always lurking just beneath the surface."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2124:11951: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2124
msgctxt "text_id=11951 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どっちにしろ私には関係ないか」"
msgstr "\"This isn't any of my business anyway.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2130:11952: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2130
msgctxt "text_id=11952 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やれやれと肩をすくめて、青子は居間から意識を逸らした。"
msgstr "  Aoko shrugged it off and turned her attention away from the drawing room."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2135:11953: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2135
msgctxt "text_id=11953 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんな騒ぎも明日になれば忘れるだろう、と楽観して。"
msgstr "  She told herself that she would forget about all this commotion by tomorrow anyway."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2228:11954: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0018; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2228
msgctxt "text_id=11954 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ただいまー」"
msgstr "\"I'm hooooome!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2271:11955: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2271
msgctxt "text_id=11955 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今日も今日とて笑顔で帰ってくる勤労少年。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was back from his job with a smile on his face again today."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2276:11956: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2276
msgctxt "text_id=11956 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何であれ労働は美しい。"
msgstr "  Work truly was its own reward."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2281:11957: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2281
msgctxt "text_id=11957 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なので、ソファーでくつろぐ青子の返答も自然、微笑ましいものになる。"
msgstr "  His mood was infectious, and Aoko smiled back while relaxing on the sofa."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2312:11958: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2312
msgctxt "text_id=11958 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「はい、おつかれさま。"
msgstr "\"Hey, welcome home."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2318:11959: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0023; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2318
msgctxt "text_id=11959 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　休んでていいわよ。今日は昼からずっとバイトだったんでしょ。"
msgstr "  Take a load off. You've been working since noon today, haven't you?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2326:11960: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0024; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2326
msgctxt "text_id=11960 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "夕飯ならこれから作ってあ―――"
msgstr "I'll go start making something for di―"

msgctxt "text_id=11961 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "なにぃ？」"
msgstr " What...?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2339:11962: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2339
msgctxt "text_id=11962 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が。その笑顔も、唐突に凍りついた。"
msgstr "  Her smile suddenly turned frigid."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2372:11963: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0019; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2372
msgctxt "text_id=11963 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ん？　どうした蒼崎、木乃美の冗談を聞いた時みたいな顔して」"
msgstr "\"Hm? What's wrong, Aozaki? You look like you just heard one of Kinomi's jokes.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2383:11964: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0025; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2383
msgctxt "text_id=11964 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どうしたじゃない、いいかげん黙っていられなくなった！"
msgstr "\"Don't play dumb with me! I can't keep quiet about this any longer!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2383:11965: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0025; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2383
msgctxt "text_id=11965 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　いいから、そのポケットの<物|もん>だしなさい！」"
msgstr "  Empty your pockets. Right now!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2403:11966: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0020; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2403
msgctxt "text_id=11966 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「む」"
msgstr "\"Err...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2423:11967: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2423
msgctxt "text_id=11967 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜ<叱|しか>られるのか納得いかないまま、草十郎はポケットの中の物を取り出した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro reached in and pulled out the contents of his pockets without knowing why he was being scolded."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2457:11968: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2457
msgctxt "text_id=11968 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　テーブルに置かれる、お馴染みの茶封筒。"
msgstr "  He placed the now all too familiar brown envelope on the table."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2463:11969: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2463
msgctxt "text_id=11969 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、それは普通の封筒と言うにはぶ厚すぎた。"
msgstr "  It was far too thick to be any normal envelope."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2469:11970: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2469
msgctxt "text_id=11970 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<眩|まぶ>しく、<荘厳|そうごん>で、人を惑わす魔力がありすぎた。"
msgstr "  Bright and enticing, it was imbued with a enchanting aura all its own..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2476:11971: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2476
msgctxt "text_id=11971 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんていうか、それはまさしく札束だった。"
msgstr "  There was nothing else it could be than a stack of cash."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2511:11972: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2511
msgctxt "text_id=11972 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――まあ。これはどうしたの、静希君」"
msgstr "\"Well. What do we have here?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2517:11973: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2517
msgctxt "text_id=11973 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あどけない有珠の声。"
msgstr "  Alice innocently asked Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2522:11974: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2522
msgctxt "text_id=11974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心なしか目が輝いているように見えるが、間違いなく錯覚ではない。"
msgstr "  She was a bit dazzled at the sight, but there was no mistaking it for an illusion."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2560:11975: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0021; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2560
msgctxt "text_id=11975 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「バイト代だよ」"
msgstr "\"It's my pay from my part-time job.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2578:11976: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2578
msgctxt "text_id=11976 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「そう。それはいいコトだわ。明日はご馳走ね」"
msgstr "\"Well isn't that nice? Looks like dinner is on you tomorrow, then.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2584:11977: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2584
msgctxt "text_id=11977 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　札束を前にしても淡々としたふたりである。"
msgstr "  The two remained calm, despite the abnormally large wad of cash before them."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2589:11978: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2589
msgctxt "text_id=11978 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、この<館|いえ>唯一の常識人はと言うと、"
msgstr "  That being said, the one with the most common sense in the house finally had to speak up."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2625:11979: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0026; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2625
msgctxt "text_id=11979 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「んなワケないでしょう！？　ちょっと草十郎、そこに正座！　どういうコトか説明なさい！」"
msgstr "\"I know you're lying! Soujyuro, you kneel right here and explain to me what is going on!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2631:11980: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2631
msgctxt "text_id=11980 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この通り、コトの重大さを当事者より理解していた。"
msgstr "  She knew more than anyone how serious this was."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2657:11981: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0022; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2657
msgctxt "text_id=11981 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「？　説明って、なにをだ？」"
msgstr "\"Huh? Explain what?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2668:11982: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0027; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2668
msgctxt "text_id=11982 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「決まってるでしょ、この札束の正体よ！"
msgstr "\"Explain where you got this money!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2674:11983: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0028; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2674
msgctxt "text_id=11983 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　アンタいま何やってんの！？　どう考えてもまっとうな職種とは思えないんですけど！？」"
msgstr "  What the hell are you doing to earn this kind of cash? There's no way it's anything legal!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2700:11984: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0023; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2700
msgctxt "text_id=11984 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「まっとうだぞ。"
msgstr "\"It really is fine!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2706:11985: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0024; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2706
msgctxt "text_id=11985 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　この新しいバイトは、少なくとも法には触れていないと聞いた。ちゃんとやれば危ない目にも遭わない。"
msgstr "  This new job I got is at least not illegal. And if I do it properly, it's not dangerous at all."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2712:11986: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0025; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2712
msgctxt "text_id=11986 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　コンビニエンスストアより割がいいし、俺でも簡単にできると言う」"
msgstr "  It pays better than the convenience store, and it's easy enough that even I can handle it without a problem.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2752:11987: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2752
msgctxt "text_id=11987 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　クラッと。"
msgstr "  Unbelievable."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2757:11988: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2757
msgctxt "text_id=11988 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は失意を通り越した苛立ちのあまり、目眩を起こしかけた。"
msgstr "  Aoko was just about dizzy with rage by this point."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2762:11989: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2762
msgctxt "text_id=11989 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“少なくとも法には触れていない”"
msgstr "(At least not illegal.)"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2767:11990: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2767
msgctxt "text_id=11990 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　泥酔した酔っぱらいが“酔っていない”と言い張るのと何が違おう。"
msgstr "  That's like when an obviously drunk person tries to contend that they are indeed quite the contrary."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2802:11991: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0029; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2802
msgctxt "text_id=11991 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「正気に戻れ！　日ごとお金が倍々に増えていくバイトなんてあるワケないでしょう？"
msgstr "\"Use your brain! What kind of part-time job pays out more and more money exponentially every day?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2808:11992: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0030; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2808
msgctxt "text_id=11992 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　いいから仕事の内容を言いなさい、内容を！　アンタ、どう考えても騙されてるから！」"
msgstr "  Tell us exactly what you're doing! You are being scammed! You have to be!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2826:11993: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2826
msgctxt "text_id=11993 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　む、と草十郎は口を閉ざす。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro kept his mouth shut."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2831:11994: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2831
msgctxt "text_id=11994 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の剣幕を前にして一歩も引かない構えだ。"
msgstr "  He didn't seem to be too threatened by Aoko's reprimands."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2865:11995: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0026; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2865
msgctxt "text_id=11995 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「だめだ。いくら蒼崎でも教えられない。あんまり<他人|ひと>に話すことでもない。"
msgstr "\"Sorry, I can't. Not even to you. It's not really something I'm supposed to talk about."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2871:11996: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0027; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2871
msgctxt "text_id=11996 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　でも安心してくれ。分類的には、ちょっとした人助けと言えるだろう。あと紹介してくれた人とは一度しか会ってないし、支払いは常に現金だ」"
msgstr "  But please, don't worry. It's honestly something that helps people. I've only met the person who recommended me for the job once, and I'm always paid in cash.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2877:11997: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0031; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2877
msgctxt "text_id=11997 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「この田舎バカ、その文脈からして怪しすぎるんだっていうのーーー！」"
msgstr "\"You bumpkin! All of that sounds suspicious as hell!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2910:11998: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2910
msgctxt "text_id=11998 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ああもう、と地団駄を踏む青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko stamped her foot in frustration."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2915:11999: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2915
msgctxt "text_id=11999 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『新しいバイト』『割がいい、誰でもできる』『だが内容公開は断る』なんて禁句を連発されて、冷静でいられるはずがない。"
msgstr "  But who could blame her after hearing the standard lines for a scam: \"it's a new job,\" \"the pay is good and anyone can do it,\" and \"I'm not supposed to talk about it.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2935:12000: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2935
msgctxt "text_id=12000 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が、"
msgstr "  Despite all that..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2954:12001: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2954
msgctxt "text_id=12001 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はかたくなに口を閉ざしている。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was still refusing to spill the beans."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2959:12002: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2959
msgctxt "text_id=12002 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　付き合いは短いが、青子はこの少年の性格をそれなりに思い知っている。"
msgstr "  They hadn't known each other for that long, but Aoko was well aware of Soujyuro's personality."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2964:12003: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2964
msgctxt "text_id=12003 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　義理堅いというか、自分の中でこれと決めた事はちょっとやそっとでは<覆|くつがえ>らないのだ。"
msgstr "  *Steadfast* explained him well. Once he made a decision, nothing could make him change his mind about it."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:2969:12004: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:2969
msgctxt "text_id=12004 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こういう時の草十郎はとんでもなく口が堅い。"
msgstr "  At times like this, it was near impossible to get him to talk."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3004:12005: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0032; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3004
msgctxt "text_id=12005 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……くぅ、厄介な……」"
msgstr "\"Argh... You really are making this difficult...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3010:12006: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3010
msgctxt "text_id=12006 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無理やり<喋|しゃべ>らせるのは困難か、と青子は引き下がる。"
msgstr "  Aoko backed off, realizing it would be a challenge to get him to say anything at this point."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3030:12007: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3030
msgctxt "text_id=12007 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな彼女の内心をまったく分かっていないらしく、草十郎は不思議そうに、"
msgstr "  Soujyuro couldn't figure out what was upsetting her."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3053:12008: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0028; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3053
msgctxt "text_id=12008 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「なんで蒼崎は怒ってるんだ？」"
msgstr "\"Why are you so mad?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3077:12009: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3077
msgctxt "text_id=12009 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うん、こいつは役に立たない、と諦める青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko decided to give up on getting anything useful out of him."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3116:12010: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0033; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3116
msgctxt "text_id=12010 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そんなうまい話はないからよ。有珠もそう思うでしょう？」"
msgstr "\"There's just no job in the world like that. It's too good to be true. You agree, right, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3140:12011: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3140
msgctxt "text_id=12011 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「そうね。青子の言いたいコトは分からないけど、静希君はもっとやるべきだと思う」"
msgstr "\"Hmm, I suppose. I'm not sure what Aoko is trying to say, but I think you can do more, Sizuki.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3164:12012: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3164
msgctxt "text_id=12012 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして有珠は、はじめから役に立たない。"
msgstr "  And so, Alice contributed absolutely nothing useful."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3199:12013: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0034; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3199
msgctxt "text_id=12013 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「…………はあ」"
msgstr "\"...Ugh.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3205:12014: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3205
msgctxt "text_id=12014 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はソファーに腰を落とす。"
msgstr "  Aoko collapsed onto the sofa."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3226:12015: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0029; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3226
msgctxt "text_id=12015 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「蒼崎」"
msgstr "\"Aozaki...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3232:12016: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0035; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3232
msgctxt "text_id=12016 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いいわよ、もう。よく分かんない理由で話す気ないんでしょ、草十郎は。"
msgstr "\"It's fine. I know you don't want to talk about it."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3238:12017: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0036; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3238
msgctxt "text_id=12017 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　考えてみればアンタなんてただの同居人なワケだし、私があれこれ文句いう筋合いはなかったわ」"
msgstr "  And when it comes down to it, you're just a roommate. There's no point in me trying to tell you what to do with your life.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3267:12018: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3267
msgctxt "text_id=12018 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しっしっ、と手を振って草十郎を追っ払う。"
msgstr "  Aoko shooed Soujyuro away with her hand."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3272:12019: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3272
msgctxt "text_id=12019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それっきり不機嫌に押し黙る青子だが、もちろん、このまま済ませる気はない。"
msgstr "  Unfortunately, she wasn't going to be able to sit there and stew like she wanted to."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3277:12020: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3277
msgctxt "text_id=12020 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の見解はともかく、草十郎を放っておく事はできないからだ。"
msgstr "  She couldn't just ignore this problem like Alice."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3303:12021: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0037; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3303
msgctxt "text_id=12021 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……アイツはどう見ても騙されてるし……最終的にとばっちりくらうのは私だし……」"
msgstr "\"He's clearly being scammed. In the end, it's going to affect me too if I don't do something about it...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3309:12022: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3309
msgctxt "text_id=12022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここは心を鬼にして、今すぐにでも新しいバイトとやらを辞めさせるべきである。"
msgstr "  She needed to be bold and make him quit this new job of his immediately."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3314:12023: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3314
msgctxt "text_id=12023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが友人としての思いやりであり、"
msgstr "  It was what a true friend would do,"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3319:12024: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3319
msgctxt "text_id=12024 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生徒会長としての義務だろう。"
msgstr "  and it was also her duty as the student council president."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3345:12025: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0038; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3345
msgctxt "text_id=12025 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3351:12026: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3351
msgctxt "text_id=12026 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし。"
msgstr "  However..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3356:12027: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3356
msgctxt "text_id=12027 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかしだ、と青子は自分に言い聞かせる。"
msgstr "  Aoko started to think otherwise."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3361:12028: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3361
msgctxt "text_id=12028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　道徳も良心も大切だが、正直なところ、仕送りだけで生きている学生として、あのお金は捨てがたい……！"
msgstr "  Morals and a clear conscience were important, sure, but for a student living solely off of their parents' generosity, that kind of money was hard to pass up!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3392:12029: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0039; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3392
msgctxt "text_id=12029 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……そうね。最終的に辞めさせるのは絶対にしても、これまで稼いだお金を捨てるのは勿体ないし……"
msgstr "\"...Right. So, even if I do get him to quit the job, it would be a total waste for him to just give all that money up..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3399:12030: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0040; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3399
msgctxt "text_id=12030 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "仕方ない、ここは<搦|から>め手でいくか」"
msgstr "Guess I'll have to approach this from a different angle...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3405:12031: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3405
msgctxt "text_id=12031 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　などと画策しながら、ソファーにずぶずぶと沈む悪の生徒会長。"
msgstr "  The wicked, scheming student council president sank deeper into the sofa."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3410:12032: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3410
msgctxt "text_id=12032 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いちいち覚悟を決めずともデフォルトで心が<守銭奴|お　に>なのが彼女の長所であり、短所である。"
msgstr "  Her ability to play things by ear and her miserly nature were both her strongest and weakest points."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3456:12033: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3456
msgctxt "text_id=12033 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　翌日、正午。"
msgstr "  The next day, noon."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3496:12034: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3496
msgctxt "text_id=12034 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は同居人たちが出かけたのを<見計|みはか>らって、ロビーの電話を手に取った。"
msgstr "  Aoko waited until her roommates were gone, then picked up the phone in the foyer."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3503:12035: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0041; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3503
msgctxt "text_id=12035 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「もしもし、鳶丸？　草十郎がこんなコトになってるんだけど、アンタ、心当たりない？」"
msgstr "\"Hey, Tobimaru? Soujyuro's gotten himself into something recently. Does anything ring a bell?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3550:12036: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3550
msgctxt "text_id=12036 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　始発電車の音が遠い。"
msgstr "  The sound of the first train leaving the station could be heard far off in the distance."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3555:12037: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3555
msgctxt "text_id=12037 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　町が目を覚ますか覚まさないか、どちらつかずの時間帯。"
msgstr "  This was that time of morning when the town was deciding if it felt like waking up or not."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3560:12038: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3560
msgctxt "text_id=12038 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<槻司|つきじ><鳶丸|とびまる>は日が<昇|のぼ>ったばかりの繁華街をそぞろ歩きながら、早朝の雑多にして清浄な空気に感心していた。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru Tsukiji was having a walk down the city streets at sunrise, enjoying the fresh, crisp morning air."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3590:12039: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3590
msgctxt "text_id=12039 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「本当、町ってのは人間がいないだけでキレイなもんだ」"
msgstr "\"This town really is beautiful when it isn't swarming with people.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3596:12040: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3596
msgctxt "text_id=12040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸にとっては通例化しているぼやきである。"
msgstr "  The crowds had become a common complaint of Tobimaru's."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3628:12041: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3628
msgctxt "text_id=12041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　派手派手しく<飾|かざ>られた<町角|まちかど>は、人間の欲望の具現だ。"
msgstr "  To him, the tacky, over-decorated street corners were the embodiments of human desire."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3633:12042: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3633
msgctxt "text_id=12042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見せ物小屋と何ら変わりのない連なりだが、この時間帯だけはまったく違うものになる。"
msgstr "  At this time of day, the streets were nothing like the circus tent of activity they usually were."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3638:12043: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3638
msgctxt "text_id=12043 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人のいない大通り。"
msgstr "  The main street was completely empty."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3643:12044: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3643
msgctxt "text_id=12044 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静まりかえった朝の町は、祭りの後のような寂しさに染まっている。"
msgstr "  It was like a lonely, tranquil morning after a festival."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3676:12045: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3676
msgctxt "text_id=12045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふと目に入った<酒場|バー>の入り口には、けだるそうに昨夜の後始末をする黒服。"
msgstr "  Weary men in black were busy cleaning up and restoring order in the bars after the previous night's revelry."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3681:12046: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3681
msgctxt "text_id=12046 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あるいは、飲食店の裏口ではあくびをかみ殺しながら今日の仕込みをはじめる<料理人|コックコート>。"
msgstr "  Around the back entrance of the local restaurants, the kitchen crew were busy bringing in their daily ingredients while stifling back tired yawns."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3686:12047: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3686
msgctxt "text_id=12047 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳥は無防備に道を歩き、"
msgstr "  Birds carelessly wandered the streets."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3691:12048: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3691
msgctxt "text_id=12048 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自動車のエンジン音も途絶えている。"
msgstr "  There wasn't even the sound of a single car engine to be heard."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3724:12049: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3724
msgctxt "text_id=12049 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この独特の清涼感は都市の朝にしかないものだ。"
msgstr "  This was a uniquely refreshing sensation that could only be felt from a city morning."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3729:12050: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3729
msgctxt "text_id=12050 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生活と娯楽の狭間。"
msgstr "  It existed somewhere between daily life and exciting entertainment."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3734:12051: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3734
msgctxt "text_id=12051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　忙しい<人間社会|ダイヤル>の中で、この時間だけは昔ながらのスピードで回っている。"
msgstr "  This was the only time of day when the bustling modern world stepped aside for a slower, more nostalgic pace."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3772:12052: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3772
msgctxt "text_id=12052 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「―――チッ。そうか」"
msgstr "\"...Tch. 'Kay.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3778:12053: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3778
msgctxt "text_id=12053 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　口元に<寂|さみ>しさを感じてコートのポケットをあさったが、中にあるのはレシートばかりだ。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru searched through his coat pockets, but only found some old receipts."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3783:12054: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3783
msgctxt "text_id=12054 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸はマフラーを巻き直して、冷えきった風をやり過ごした。"
msgstr "  He rearranged the scarf around his neck to keep the cold wind at bay."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3817:12055: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3817
msgctxt "text_id=12055 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸は繁華街を適当にぶらついて、朝の魔力がきれる頃に中央公園に流れていく。"
msgstr "  Meandering through the city streets, he'd ended up at Central Park just as the morning magic began to fade."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3822:12056: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3822
msgctxt "text_id=12056 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　散策に目的はない。"
msgstr "  His stroll had no particular purpose."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3827:12057: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3827
msgctxt "text_id=12057 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　健康のための散歩でもジョギングでもない。"
msgstr "  It wasn't for his health or anything like that."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3832:12058: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3832
msgctxt "text_id=12058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これは単に、夜通し遊んだ後の<自堕落|じだらく>な朝帰りだ。"
msgstr "  He was merely making his way home after a night out on the town."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3865:12059: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3865
msgctxt "text_id=12059 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「馬鹿らしい。なにやってんだか」"
msgstr "\"What the hell am I even doing?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3871:12060: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3871
msgctxt "text_id=12060 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自動販売機で買った缶コーヒーを飲みながら、臆面もなく自虐する。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru had a moment of unabashed self-reflection as he drank a can of vending machine coffee."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3876:12061: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3876
msgctxt "text_id=12061 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜通し遊ぶのは嫌いではないが、まだ酒も飲めないのでは退屈極まりない。"
msgstr "  He didn't particularly hate partying all night long, but it was pretty boring since he still wasn't old enough to drink alcohol."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3882:12062: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3882
msgctxt "text_id=12062 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも家に居るよりはマシだろう、とここ数日は朝帰りだが、いい加減、それも飽きてきたところだった。"
msgstr "  He'd been at it for a few days now, thinking it was at least better than being at home, but he was quickly growing bored of it."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3916:12063: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3916
msgctxt "text_id=12063 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……ま、年末に親戚筋が集まるのは仕方がねえし」"
msgstr "\"I suppose it's only natural for relatives to get together at New Year's, though.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3922:12064: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3922
msgctxt "text_id=12064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言い訳がましい呟きに、いっそう苦笑いを強めてしまう。"
msgstr "  He grinned wryly at his own lame excuse."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3927:12065: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3927
msgctxt "text_id=12065 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼がこうして時間を潰しているのは、ある意味、帰る場所がないからだ。"
msgstr "  It was true that he was out wasting time like this because he didn't really have a place to go home to at the moment."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3947:12066: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3947
msgctxt "text_id=12066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司家では祖父の方針で、毎年元旦に親戚会議が行われる。"
msgstr "  The Tsukiji family always had a congregation of relatives over on New Year's Day, as per his grandfather's orders."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3952:12067: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3952
msgctxt "text_id=12067 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　必然、数日前からちりぢりになっていた<兄姉|きょうだい>、親族筋が槻司の家に宿泊する事になる。"
msgstr "  This was why his siblings and other relatives had been staying over at the Tsukiji home for a few days now."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3972:12068: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3972
msgctxt "text_id=12068 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな場で<鳶丸|じぶん>がいては火種になる。"
msgstr "  If Tobimaru was there, he'd just provide fuel for the fire."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:3977:12069: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:3977
msgctxt "text_id=12069 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　降りかかる火の粉を払うのはやぶさかではないが、争いごとは極力避けるため、鳶丸は家に帰らない選択をした。"
msgstr "  He'd decided to avoid the family drama and not go home while everyone was there."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4012:12070: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4012
msgctxt "text_id=12070 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　家にいては何であろうと攻撃される。"
msgstr "  They'd just greet him with insults, anyway."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4017:12071: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4017
msgctxt "text_id=12071 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ケンカを売られては買ってしまうのが彼の性分だ。"
msgstr "  And if someone tried to start a fight, he knew he wouldn't be able to resist the bait."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4022:12072: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4022
msgctxt "text_id=12072 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その都度に相手を打ち負かしていては憎しみはつのるばかりだし、父にも面倒が及ぶ。"
msgstr "  It would only cause even more resentment and trouble for his father."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4027:12073: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4027
msgctxt "text_id=12073 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そしてなにより、兄姉たちのように血眼になって相続争いをするのは、この上なく面倒で、どうでもいい話だった。"
msgstr "  So, for Tobimaru, there was nothing more pointless or less enticing than getting involved in his siblings' squabbles over the inheritance."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4078:12074: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4078
msgctxt "text_id=12074 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司鳶丸は三咲市でも有数の地主、槻司家の五男として生まれた。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru Tsukiji was the fifthborn son to the Tsukiji family, which owned multiple plots of land in Misaki City."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4083:12075: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4083
msgctxt "text_id=12075 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今では大地主として君臨する槻司家だが、その大部分は戦後に財を成したもので、それ以前は小さな、没落を前にした華族にすぎなかった。"
msgstr "  However, most of that land had been acquired after the war. Before that, they had been a minor noble family on the brink of ruin."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4088:12076: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4088
msgctxt "text_id=12076 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その槻司家を立て直したのが婿養子として迎えられた槻司<喜実國|きみくに>―――現槻司家の家長にして、鳶丸の祖父にあたる人物だ。"
msgstr "  The man who built the Tsukiji family into its current glory was Kimikuni Tsukiji, Tobimaru's grandfather and the current patriarch."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4108:12077: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4108
msgctxt "text_id=12077 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　戦時中に力を失い、やせ細った槻司家を救ったのは、この男、喜実國の豪腕によるものである。"
msgstr "  Kimikuni married into the struggling Tsukiji family and saved them after they lost all their power during the war."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4113:12078: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4113
msgctxt "text_id=12078 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<檀家|だんけ><総代|そうだい>、神職として地域を取り仕切っていた槻司家は喜実國の資産を、"
msgstr "  The Tsukiji clan were local Shinto clergy and relied upon Kimikuni's financial assets."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4118:12079: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4118
msgctxt "text_id=12079 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　喜実國は三咲市に根を下ろすために槻司家の人脈を必要とした。"
msgstr "  Kimikuni, on the other hand, had leveraged clan connections to establish himself in Misaki City."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4171:12080: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4171
msgctxt "text_id=12080 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　利益目的で結びついた両者だが、槻司家の誤算は、一時だけと甘んじて迎え入れた喜実國の経営手腕が並々ならぬものだった事だろう。"
msgstr "  While both parties came together for mutual gain, the Tsukiji family failed to recognize just how ambitious Kimikuni was when they accepted him into their family."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4176:12081: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4176
msgctxt "text_id=12081 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　婿養子として下に置くはずだった喜実國は三咲の産業を発展させ、それを基盤として町の外に多くの会社を興していった。"
msgstr "  He wasn't the obedient son-in-law they had imagined. He had grand plans of his own, growing and developing industries within Misaki City and many other areas as well."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4196:12082: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4196
msgctxt "text_id=12082 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は三咲市の内を支配しながら、その周りを槻司の親族たちとは関わりのない、自分だけの勢力で制圧した。"
msgstr "  Kimikuni controlled all of these areas not as a member of the Tsukiji family, but under his own name."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4201:12083: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4201
msgctxt "text_id=12083 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　内側より先に外堀を。"
msgstr "  A castle's greatest defense was its moat, not the walls. And Kimikuni bridged the moat."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4206:12084: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4206
msgctxt "text_id=12084 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言ってしまえば経済的な兵糧攻めである。"
msgstr "  It was the economic equivalent of starving out the enemy."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4211:12085: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4211
msgctxt "text_id=12085 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　喜実國は経済の力で槻司家の“由緒正しい血筋”を押さえつけたのだ。"
msgstr "  Kimikuni's financial might subdued the noble Tsukiji family completely."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4246:12086: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4246
msgctxt "text_id=12086 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　十年を待たずして、槻司家では喜実國に対抗できる者は一人としていなくなった。"
msgstr "  In less than ten years, there was no one in the family who could stand up against him."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4251:12087: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4251
msgctxt "text_id=12087 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　婿養子として招かれた商人は、名実ともに槻司家の<家督|かとく>を手にしたのである。"
msgstr "  This businessman, accepted into the family as a mere son-in-law, had seized the Tsukiji name and the entirety of the family fortune."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4287:12088: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4287
msgctxt "text_id=12088 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、喜実國は多くの子供を儲けていた。"
msgstr "  However, Kimikuni had fathered many children."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4292:12089: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4292
msgctxt "text_id=12089 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司の血を絶やさないこと。それが家督を継ぐ条件でもあったからだ。"
msgstr "  He would not allow the Tsukiji bloodline to die out. That was also the only way to maintain the family fortune."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4297:12090: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4297
msgctxt "text_id=12090 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の三人の息子とひとり娘は槻司家縁の親戚と結婚し、喜実國によって弱体化した槻司家の<絆|きずな>をなんとか持ち直そうとした。"
msgstr "  His three sons and one daughter all married relatives of the Tsukiji family, thus strengthening the familial bonds that Kimikuni had weakened."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4307:12091: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4307
msgctxt "text_id=12091 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その長男にあたる槻司<一義|ひとよし>の、五人目の子供が鳶丸である。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru was the fifth son of Hitoyoshi Tsukiji, Kimikuni's eldest son."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4359:12092: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4359
msgctxt "text_id=12092 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　……だが、彼の母親は槻司家には存在しない。"
msgstr "  However, his mother was not a member of the family."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4365:12093: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4365
msgctxt "text_id=12093 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　父、一義が<戯|たわむ>れに関係し生まれた<妾|めかけ>の子。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru was the result of a fling with a mistress."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4371:12094: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4371
msgctxt "text_id=12094 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが槻司鳶丸の、槻司家における身分だった。"
msgstr "  That ignoble birth defined his place in the family."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4391:12095: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4391
msgctxt "text_id=12095 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸は父と愛人との間に生まれた子供である。"
msgstr "  He was his father's love child."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4396:12096: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4396
msgctxt "text_id=12096 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　長男である一義の子という事で最低限の威厳は守られたが、立場の弱い鳶丸が親戚、兄姉たちにどんな迫害を受けたかは想像に難くない。"
msgstr "  Although the family's dignity was somehow maintained since he was the son of Hitoyoshi, it wasn't difficult to imagine the level of mistreatment Tobimaru faced from his siblings and other relatives."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4416:12097: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4416
msgctxt "text_id=12097 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな幼年期の環境が、鳶丸の人となりをいち早く成長させた。"
msgstr "  Being raised in such a hostile environment made Tobimaru grow up far faster than he should have."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4421:12098: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4421
msgctxt "text_id=12098 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　独特の理解の早さ、自分の役回りを演じる客観性は、槻司家で生きる上で自然に<磨|みが>かれたものだろう。"
msgstr "  His ability to think quickly and objectively was honed naturally within this challenging environment."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4471:12099: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4471
msgctxt "text_id=12099 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、その<如才|じょさい>のなさが鳶丸により大きな問題を運んでしまった。"
msgstr "  However, those exact traits also brought Tobimaru a great deal of trouble."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4476:12100: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4476
msgctxt "text_id=12100 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司喜実國。"
msgstr "  Kimikuni Tsukiji."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4481:12101: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4481
msgctxt "text_id=12101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　困った事にこの大人物は今<以|もっ>て現役であり、多くの息子たちより―――鳶丸の父親である一義より、どこの女の子供とも知れない<鳶|ま><丸|ご>を気に入ってしまったのだ。"
msgstr "  Unfortunately, against all odds, this great leader of the Tsukiji family favored Tobimaru over everyone else, including his own eldest son."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4501:12102: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4501
msgctxt "text_id=12102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もともと庶民の出であった喜実國は、血縁による相続を良しとしない節がある。"
msgstr "  Since Kimikuni had been a commoner himself, he did not believe in blood inheritance alone."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4506:12103: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4506
msgctxt "text_id=12103 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　加えて、この人物はいまだ息子たちに、自身の財産をこれっぽっちも譲り渡していなかった。"
msgstr "  To make matters worse, not a single coin from his great fortune had been given to any of his sons yet."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4557:12104: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4557
msgctxt "text_id=12104 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“この世でもっとも忌まわしいのは槻司の血だ。"
msgstr "\"The most loathsome thing in this world is the blood of the Tsukiji family."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4562:12105: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4562
msgctxt "text_id=12105 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　儂は貴様らなぞ作りたくもなかったわ”"
msgstr "  I never would have had any of you if I could have helped it.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4568:12106: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4568
msgctxt "text_id=12106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　親族一同が集まるたびに出るその言葉は、嘘偽りのない本音だった。"
msgstr "  Those words were spoken at every family gathering, and they were the absolute truth."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4573:12107: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4573
msgctxt "text_id=12107 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　恒例の親戚会議のおり、喜実國はたまたま話し相手になった鳶丸を気に入り、以後、仕事の合間に帰ってきては孫と囲碁などに興じる間柄になっていた。"
msgstr "  He'd taken a liking to Tobimaru after speaking with him at these annual family gatherings and enjoyed playing chess with him in his spare time ever since."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4593:12108: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4593
msgctxt "text_id=12108 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その喜実國がいつ鳶丸を後継者にと言いだすか、親戚一同は気が気でない。"
msgstr "  Everyone in the family was worried Kimikuni would name Tobimaru his successor."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4598:12109: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4598
msgctxt "text_id=12109 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　喜実國の息子たちにとって鳶丸は『居る価値のない』ものから、『居てもらっては困るもの』に格上げされたワケである。"
msgstr "  In this way, Tobimaru had gone from being worthless to a threat in the eyes of Kimikuni's sons."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4633:12110: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4633
msgctxt "text_id=12110 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その危機感がもはや恐怖、嫌悪の域にまで達しているのは他でもない、本来なら無条件で喜実國の跡を継ぐはずだった長男であり、鳶丸の父親である、槻司一義その人だった。"
msgstr "  The son who felt the most fear and hatred was Tobimaru's own father, Hitoyoshi, who would have been the unquestionable heir as the eldest son."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4665:12111: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4665
msgctxt "text_id=12111 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こうして、鳶丸は実の父親にまで疎まれる立場になった。"
msgstr "  And this was how Tobimaru became estranged from his father."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4671:12112: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4671
msgctxt "text_id=12112 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　現在、鳶丸は父である一義と同じ家には住んでいない。"
msgstr "  They no longer even lived in the same house."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4676:12113: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4676
msgctxt "text_id=12113 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一義は喜実國の手前、<鳶丸|むすこ>とは良好な親子関係だとアピールしているが、それも喜実國が床に臥せるか、喜実國が本格的に鳶丸を跡継ぎにすると言いだすまでだ。"
msgstr "  Hitoyoshi always acted like they had a great father-son relationship in front of Kimikuni, but that would only last until his father was no longer around or until Tobimaru was officially named the heir."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4681:12114: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4681
msgctxt "text_id=12114 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その後は戦争である。"
msgstr "  When that happened, it would be all-out war."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4686:12115: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4686
msgctxt "text_id=12115 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どちらにせよろくな話にはならないだろう。"
msgstr "  In any case, it would not be a pleasant story."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4710:12116: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4710
msgctxt "text_id=12116 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……<祖|じ><父|い>さんも空気読めねぇからなあ、ホント」"
msgstr "\"Grandpa really has a hard time reading between the lines sometimes...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4716:12117: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4716
msgctxt "text_id=12117 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呆れながらバリバリと頭を掻く。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru scratched his head in frustration."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4721:12118: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4721
msgctxt "text_id=12118 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　といっても、鳶丸はさして苦には思っていなかった。"
msgstr "  He really wasn't all that worried, though."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4755:12119: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4755
msgctxt "text_id=12119 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　表向きは仲の良い親子関係。"
msgstr "  In public, it looked like they had a good father-son relationship."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4760:12120: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4760
msgctxt "text_id=12120 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　裏では怨念うずまく相続争い。"
msgstr "  In private, they were in the midst of a bitter inheritance dispute."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4765:12121: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4765
msgctxt "text_id=12121 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなもの、別に喜実國と出会う前と変わらない。"
msgstr "  Things had always been that way, even before he met Kimikuni."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4785:12122: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4785
msgctxt "text_id=12122 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今まで唯一の<擁護者|ようごしゃ>だった父親が最大の敵にまわっただけだ。"
msgstr "  The only difference was that his sole protector, his father, was now his mortal enemy."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4790:12123: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4790
msgctxt "text_id=12123 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　家族と良質な関係を結ばなかった鳶丸にとって、いまさら敵がひとり増えたところで何をかいわんや、という境地である。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru had always been at odds with his family. His father was just one more enemy to add to that pile."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4822:12124: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4822
msgctxt "text_id=12124 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸がこうして朝帰りを繰り返すのは、親戚一同との顔合わせを避けるためだ。"
msgstr "  Staying out all night like this was Tobimaru's way of avoiding his family."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4827:12125: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4827
msgctxt "text_id=12125 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今ではあちらが鳶丸の顔色を<窺|うかが>っている。"
msgstr "  If he was home, he knew they would try to gauge his feelings."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4847:12126: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4847
msgctxt "text_id=12126 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見下していた親戚たちも、"
msgstr "  However, they wouldn't openly attack him now."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4852:12127: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4852
msgctxt "text_id=12127 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<戯|たわむ>れに暴力をふるってきた兄姉たちも、今では表だっての攻撃はしてこない。"
msgstr "  Even the relatives who looked down on him and his siblings who had bullied him as a child."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4857:12128: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4857
msgctxt "text_id=12128 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　せいぜい嫌味を言う程度だ。"
msgstr "  The worst they would do was make snide remarks."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4885:12129: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4885
msgctxt "text_id=12129 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸は基本、平和主義者である。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru was, at his core, a peaceful person,"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4890:12130: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4890
msgctxt "text_id=12130 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　面倒ごとは避けて通るのが信条だ。"
msgstr "  who preferred to avoid trouble whenever possible."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4895:12131: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4895
msgctxt "text_id=12131 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なので、今までの意趣返しをする気も、喜実國の期待に応えるつもりもない。"
msgstr "  Petty revenge or even stepping up to Kimikuni's expectations weren't on his to-do list."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4900:12132: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4900
msgctxt "text_id=12132 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<一義|ちち>の不安は杞憂であり、親戚たちは勝手に踊っているだけであり、鳶丸は放蕩息子の域から出るつもりは毛頭無い。"
msgstr "  His father's worries were unfounded, his relatives were getting riled up for no reason, and Tobimaru had no intention of stepping out of his role as the prodigal son."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4920:12133: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4920
msgctxt "text_id=12133 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし。その一方で、歳の近い兄弟たちは、父親たちとは違う憎しみを帯びていた。"
msgstr "  However, his siblings who were around the same age as him held a different kind of resentment."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4925:12134: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4925
msgctxt "text_id=12134 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今まで迫害してきた負い目、あるいは立場の逆転からくる反動だろう。"
msgstr "  Perhaps they felt guilty for tormenting him all those years. Perhaps it was the result of their roles being reversed."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4930:12135: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4930
msgctxt "text_id=12135 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『きっと、いつかやり返される』"
msgstr "\"He's going to get back at us one day.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4935:12136: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4935
msgctxt "text_id=12136 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう怯える彼らには、もう、鳶丸を無視する事はできないらしい。"
msgstr "  They lived in such fear of this that they didn't dare ignore Tobimaru."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4977:12137: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4977
msgctxt "text_id=12137 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……そのクセ根回しはうまくねえときた。"
msgstr "\"I'm not good at dealing with all that talking behind my back."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:4983:12138: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:4983
msgctxt "text_id=12138 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　蒼崎ぐらいの大胆さでつっこんでくるんなら、まだスリルがあるってもんだがな」"
msgstr "  If they'd just confront me like Aozaki, it might at least be interesting.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5003:12139: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5003
msgctxt "text_id=12139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸にとって、家庭の問題はただ面倒なだけで、あれこれ悩むものではない。"
msgstr "  His family problems were simply a chore. They never really worried him much."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5008:12140: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5008
msgctxt "text_id=12140 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう人間の悪意には慣れている。"
msgstr "  He was used to human malice,"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5013:12141: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5013
msgctxt "text_id=12141 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いきすぎた<兄姉|きょうだい>の暴力で死にかけた事も、"
msgstr "  although he'd nearly died from the physical abuse of his siblings."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5018:12142: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5018
msgctxt "text_id=12142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　明確な意志のもと、殺されかけた事もある。"
msgstr "  Even though someone had once tried to kill him with true murderous intent."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5023:12143: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5023
msgctxt "text_id=12143 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　特権階級、選民思想にこりかたまった長兄の顕示欲から、他人の命を扱う現場を見せつけられた事もある。"
msgstr "  Even though he had been exposed to how the elite, untouchable class of society treated others by his eldest brother."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5056:12144: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5056
msgctxt "text_id=12144 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……まったく面倒くさい。"
msgstr "  It was all such a pain in the ass."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5061:12145: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5061
msgctxt "text_id=12145 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どれも人生観を変える衝撃だったが、心の底はいつも冷めていた。"
msgstr "  These were all events that would change a person's outlook on life, but he always remained coolheaded."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5066:12146: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5066
msgctxt "text_id=12146 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなものか、と。"
msgstr "  That was just how things were for Tobimaru."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5071:12147: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5071
msgctxt "text_id=12147 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなことのためにこの連中は躍起になっているのかと、鳶丸は白けてしまったのだ。"
msgstr "  He had grown bored of his relatives getting worked up over everything."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5100:12148: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5100
msgctxt "text_id=12148 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……ま、そのあたりは人それぞれか。"
msgstr "\"...Eh, I guess everyone is different."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5106:12149: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5106
msgctxt "text_id=12149 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　親父殿には同情するけどな。あの<祖|じ><父|い>さんの息子なんて並の根性じゃつとまらねえ」"
msgstr "  I do sympathize with my dad. You'd have to be tough to be the son of that old man.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5139:12150: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5139
msgctxt "text_id=12150 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　後継者問題なぞ鳶丸にはどうでもいい。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru honestly could not care less about who would be the next heir."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5144:12151: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5144
msgctxt "text_id=12151 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼にはまだ、明確な将来への展望はない。"
msgstr "  He had no clear plans for the future yet."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5149:12152: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5149
msgctxt "text_id=12152 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あるとしたら、二十歳になった時に彼らが信じる価値観をキレイサッパリ捨てて、あっさり自由になる事ぐらいだ。"
msgstr "  His only real goal was to wash his hands of his family and start fresh when he became an adult."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5169:12153: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5169
msgctxt "text_id=12153 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それまでは何事も人生経験。"
msgstr "  Until then, everything that happened was a life experience."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5174:12154: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5174
msgctxt "text_id=12154 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　くだらない夜遊びも今のうちにちゃっかり楽しんでおこう、と自虐気味に朝の遊歩道をそぞろ歩くのだった。"
msgstr "  He continued his morning walk, thinking it was better to enjoy the nightlife now while he was still young."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5206:12155: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5206
msgctxt "text_id=12155 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「お？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5212:12156: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5212
msgctxt "text_id=12156 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　遊歩道から広場に出ると、ベンチには先客の姿があった。"
msgstr "  Someone was already sitting on the bench when Tobimaru entered the plaza."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5218:12157: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5218
msgctxt "text_id=12157 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　広場にたむろしていた、<鴉|からす>に似た黒鳥が舞い散っていく。"
msgstr "  The crows gathered there flew off at his approach."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5223:12158: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5223
msgctxt "text_id=12158 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベンチに座っているのは黒い服の少女と、"
msgstr "  On the bench sat a girl dressed in black."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5228:12159: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5228
msgctxt "text_id=12159 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　杖を手にうなだれている、身なりのいい老人だ。"
msgstr "  A well-dressed old man with a cane sat with her."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5255:12160: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0010; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5255
msgctxt "text_id=12160 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5261:12161: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5261
msgctxt "text_id=12161 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　知らぬ顔でもなし、出くわしたからには挨拶をしなくてはなるまい、と鳶丸はベンチへと足を向けた。"
msgstr "  These were familiar faces, so he approached the bench to say hello."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5296:12162: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5296
msgctxt "text_id=12162 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女と老人は、傍から見れば祖父と孫のようだった。"
msgstr "  The old man and girl looked as if they were grandfather and granddaughter."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5301:12163: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5301
msgctxt "text_id=12163 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　パッと見は孫の相手をしている心優しい老人。"
msgstr "  He seemed like a kind old man spending time with his grandchild."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5306:12164: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5306
msgctxt "text_id=12164 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、その実態は、"
msgstr "  However, the truth was..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5342:12165: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5342
msgctxt "text_id=12165 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「アリス、ボクは今でも思うんだ。いったい何がいけなかったのかって。"
msgstr "\"Alice, I still don't understand what went wrong."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5348:12166: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0001; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5348
msgctxt "text_id=12166 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　考えられるサービスはすべて実現させた。従業員への感謝も、来園者への笑顔も忘れたコトはない。"
msgstr "  We provided every service we could think of. We always thanked our employees and greeted visitors with a smile."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5354:12167: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0002; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5354
msgctxt "text_id=12167 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　なのに時代はボクを選ばなかった。それどころか、ボクの内なる芸術性を否定した」"
msgstr "  But the times haven't favored me. What's worse, my art was outright rejected!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5389:12168: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0003; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5389
msgctxt "text_id=12168 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「無念だ、死ぬがいい腐った魚のようなマスコミどもめ！"
msgstr "\"I'll never forgive them! Those media vultures can die, for all I care!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5395:12169: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0004; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5395
msgctxt "text_id=12169 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　何が悪夢のクリーチャーか、あんな、夢にまで見そうなマスコットが他にあるだろうか？　いやあるまい。"
msgstr "  How dare they call them nightmarish creatures! Why, they only wish they could dream up such mascots!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5402:12170: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0005; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5402
msgctxt "text_id=12170 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "なのに連中ときたら、ネズミを二足歩行させれば満足ときた！"
msgstr "But give them a mouse that walks on two legs, and they fawn over it!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5413:12171: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0006; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5413
msgctxt "text_id=12171 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　そもそも犬をペットにする<齧歯|げっし>類とか、冷静に考えたら怖いぞ。動物が動物をペットにするなんて、モラルが低いにも程がある。あそこはやはり、人間をペットにするべきじゃないんだろうか？」"
msgstr "  If you really think about it, a rodent that owns a dog as a pet? That's a nightmare! How can an animal keep another animal as a pet? If anything, an animal should keep a human as a pet! Don't you think?!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5447:12172: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5447
msgctxt "text_id=12172 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかして、その実態は。"
msgstr "  Actually..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5452:12173: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5452
msgctxt "text_id=12173 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かくも厄介な老人にからまれている、悲劇の少女の図なのだった。"
msgstr "  This poor young woman was getting an earful from this old man."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5458:12174: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5458
msgctxt "text_id=12174 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "老人は激した後、"
msgstr "After his outburst, he paused for a moment."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5470:12175: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0007; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5470
msgctxt "text_id=12175 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「いや、これは失礼。<由里彦|ゆりひこ>よ、紳士たれ」"
msgstr "\"I'm sorry. I forgot myself.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5476:12176: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5476
msgctxt "text_id=12176 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　と自らに言い聞かせて、力なくうなだれる。"
msgstr "  He scolded himself and hung his head."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5511:12177: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0008; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5511
msgctxt "text_id=12177 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「答えてくれアリス。いったい、ボクのキッツィーちゃんは何がいけなかったんだ？」"
msgstr "\"Just answer me this, Alice. What was so wrong with my Kitsy?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5533:12178: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5533
msgctxt "text_id=12178 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「角よ。角をつけるべきだったのよ」"
msgstr "\"Horns. You should have given it horns.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5539:12179: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5539
msgctxt "text_id=12179 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うなだれる老人の顔を覗きこみながら、黒衣の少女は真剣に返答する。"
msgstr "  The girl in black returned the old man's solemn bow with a grim answer of her own."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5574:12180: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0009; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5574
msgctxt "text_id=12180 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「いや、角はいけない。子供たちが怪我をしてしまうからね。ボクは、傷をつけるなら体ではなく心にしたい」"
msgstr "\"No, no, no! Horns won't do! A kid could get injured by something like that. I don't want to harm them physically, just mentally!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5580:12181: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5580
msgctxt "text_id=12181 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<含蓄|がんちく>のある言葉ね、と更に真剣に頷く少女。"
msgstr "  The girl nodded deeply, thinking over the implications of what this old man had just said."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5613:12182: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0011; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5613
msgctxt "text_id=12182 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「…………さて」"
msgstr "\"...Anyway.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5619:12183: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5619
msgctxt "text_id=12183 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの組み合わせには関わりたくない鳶丸だが、もう完全に射程圏内だ。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru didn't really want to get involved, but he was already too close."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5624:12184: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5624
msgctxt "text_id=12184 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このまま無視して通り過ぎれば、少女はともかく老人の方がうるさく文句を言ってくるだろう。"
msgstr "  If he passed by without saying anything, the old man would certainly make a fuss."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5663:12185: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0012; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5663
msgctxt "text_id=12185 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「こんちは。こんな朝っぱらからジクジク後悔中かい、<土桔|ときつ>の爺さん。いつまでも引きずってると死に損なうぜ。さっさと<往生|おうじょう>して、息子たちを安心させてやんな」"
msgstr "\"Good morning. Isn't it a bit early for so much regret, Mr. Tokitsu? Seems it's about time you passed on to a better place and stopped worrying your kids.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5672:12186: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0010; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5672
msgctxt "text_id=12186 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「おや、どこの悪ガキかと思えば<夜鷹|よたか>の子供か。"
msgstr "\"Well, well, well! If it isn't the Tsukiji's bratty black sheep."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5678:12187: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0011; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5678
msgctxt "text_id=12187 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　おはようトビー。君も、あいかわらず早起きだね」"
msgstr "  Morning, Toby. You're up early, as usual.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5705:12188: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0013; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5705
msgctxt "text_id=12188 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「俺は朝帰りですよ。お二人みたいに健康的じゃあない。"
msgstr "\"I'm just heading home after being out all night. I don't live a healthy lifestyle like you two."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5711:12189: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0014; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5711
msgctxt "text_id=12189 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　そら、久遠寺のお嬢さんもおはようさん」"
msgstr "  And good morning to you too, Miss Kuonji.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5717:12190: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5717
msgctxt "text_id=12190 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸の挨拶を聞いて、少女は静かに顔を上げる。"
msgstr "  The girl looked up calmly at Tobimaru's greeting."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5736:12191: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5736
msgctxt "text_id=12191 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベンチに座っていたのは丘の上の魔女、久遠寺有珠その人だ。"
msgstr "  It was none other than the witch on the hill, Alice Kuonji."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5769:12192: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0015; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5769
msgctxt "text_id=12192 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ん？　こうしてまともに挨拶するのは二年前のパーティー以来か？　なんにせよ珍しいな。アンタがお付きなしで町に下りて来てるなんてよ」"
msgstr "\"Hm. How long has it been since we really talked? Maybe it was at that party two years ago? Well, it's rare to see you out like this.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5790:12193: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5790
msgctxt "text_id=12193 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……そうでもないわ。この時間の公園は鳥を入れ替えるのにちょうどいいから。ひとりで、散歩によく使うの」"
msgstr "\"That's not true. I walk through the park at this time of morning quite often, actually.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5817:12194: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0016; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5817
msgctxt "text_id=12194 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ほう、そりゃ驚いた。箱入り娘じゃなかったのか、アンタ」"
msgstr "\"Huh, that's kind of surprising. I always thought of you as kind of a shut-in.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5829:12195: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5829
msgctxt "text_id=12195 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ええ。その証拠に、貴方がひどい顔で歩いているのを何度か見かけたわ。"
msgstr "\"As proof, I can say I've seen you walking around here looking like a mess on many an occasion."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5836:12196: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5836
msgctxt "text_id=12196 | speaker=alice"
msgid "……遊び歩くのは結構だけど、青子に迷惑かけないよう気をつけなさい」"
msgstr "Whatever you do is your business, just try not to cause any trouble for Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5863:12197: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0017; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5863
msgctxt "text_id=12197 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ご忠告どうも。肝に<銘|めい>じておくよ」"
msgstr "\"Thank you for the words of caution. I will do my best.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5896:12198: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5896
msgctxt "text_id=12198 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気軽に挨拶を交わしたものの、鳶丸は久遠寺有珠とそこまでの面識はない。父親たちに交友があるだけだ。"
msgstr "  Despite their casual greeting, Tobimaru and Alice rarely interacted, though their fathers were acquainted."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5901:12199: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5901
msgctxt "text_id=12199 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　と言っても、"
msgstr "  Even so..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5901:12200: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5901
msgctxt "text_id=12200 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あくまで三咲市限定の有力者である槻司と、"
msgstr "  The histories and spheres of influence of the two families were very different."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5901:12201: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5901
msgctxt "text_id=12201 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　日本全国に広がる久遠寺では規模も歴史も違う。"
msgstr "  Though the Tsukijis held sway in Misaki City, the Kuonjis influenced the whole of Japan."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5921:12202: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5921
msgctxt "text_id=12202 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本来なら久遠寺有珠は槻司鳶丸をしても身分違いの相手である。"
msgstr "  Normally, someone like Tobimaru would not be in the same social circles as Alice."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5926:12203: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5926
msgctxt "text_id=12203 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その有珠とこうして話せるのも、蒼崎青子という共通の友人がいるおかげだろう。"
msgstr "  The only reason they could interact like this at all was because they were both friends with Aoko Aozaki."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5966:12204: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0012; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5966
msgctxt "text_id=12204 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「バカな。トビー、君はアリスと友人関係だったのか。"
msgstr "\"Huh, I didn't realize you and Alice were friends, Toby."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5979:12205: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0013; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5979
msgctxt "text_id=12205 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　は!?　も、ももも、ももももしかして、二人はステディな関係だとか言うまいな？"
msgstr "  W-Wait a second. You're not *dating*, are you?!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:5991:12206: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0014; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:5991
msgctxt "text_id=12206 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　やめたまえ。言ったら大事になるぞトビー。ボクは心臓麻痺で急死しかねない。犯人は君であり、凶器はアリスだ。"
msgstr "  Don't tell me. If that's true, I'll die of a heart attack right here and now. You'd be the murderer, and Alice would be your weapon."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6002:12207: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0015; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6002
msgctxt "text_id=12207 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　無論、死因はこう書いてくれ。"
msgstr "  Be sure to write that down as my cause of death."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6002:12208: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0015; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6002
msgctxt "text_id=12208 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　そう、聞くも無情な、恋の、<病|やまい>と―――」"
msgstr "  O, say it isn't so! This heartless love shall be the cause of my demise...!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6029:12209: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0018; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6029
msgctxt "text_id=12209 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「久遠寺のお嬢さんはどうしてこんなダメ老人と？"
msgstr "\"So tell me again why a girl like you hangs around with this pathetic old man?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6035:12210: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0019; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6035
msgctxt "text_id=12210 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　俺と同じ、親父関係の付き合いか？」"
msgstr "  Is it the same reason I do? Because of your father?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6047:12211: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6047
msgctxt "text_id=12211 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「この人とはペンフレンド。"
msgstr "\"He's my pen pal."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6053:12212: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6053
msgctxt "text_id=12212 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　分不相応にいいアンティークを持っているから、青子と二人で少しずつとりあげているの」"
msgstr "  He has more antiques than he can handle, so Aoko and I are taking some off his hands.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6059:12213: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6059
msgctxt "text_id=12213 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ほぼ初対面でありながら、鳶丸と有珠は抜群のコンビネーションで老人をスルーする。"
msgstr "  Despite this being one of the only times they'd really talked, Tobimaru and Alice both manage to completely ignore the old man."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6096:12214: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0016; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6096
msgctxt "text_id=12214 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「はは、まいったな、アリスは照れ隠しもチャーミングだ。"
msgstr "\"Hahaha! Oh, Alice, even the way you hide your embarrassment is charming."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6102:12215: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0017; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6102
msgctxt "text_id=12215 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　ところで、ボクのことはユーリッヒと呼んでくれていいんだよ」"
msgstr "  By the way, you can call me Julich.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6107:12216: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6107
msgctxt "text_id=12216 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そっと有珠の手を握る土桔老人。"
msgstr "  Mr. Tokitsu gently took Alice's hand."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6127:12217: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6127
msgctxt "text_id=12217 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は人形のような仕草で、"
msgstr "  Alice face remained neutral, like a doll's."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6146:12218: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6146
msgctxt "text_id=12218 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「トッキィー。わたし、いい絵付けのティーカップを探しているの。1900年代の、ラム工房のものとか、どうかしら」"
msgstr "\"Tokie, I'm looking for a nice painted teacup. Something from the 1900s, maybe from Dresden?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6152:12219: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0018; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6152
msgctxt "text_id=12219 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「あるとも。もちろんあるとも。今度、あのおっかないお友達と遊びにくる時までに用意しておこう」"
msgstr "\"I have just the thing! I'll be sure to bring it out for you next time you come by with that terrifying friend of yours.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6158:12220: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6158
msgctxt "text_id=12220 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このように、老人の下心を華麗に誘導するのだった。"
msgstr "  He responded to her request like an obedient marionette."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6190:12221: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0020; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6190
msgctxt "text_id=12221 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「老いらくの恋って柄かよ。よくもまあ<身代|しんだい>潰さなかったもんだ、トッパンは」"
msgstr "\"You know, I'm surprised you haven't ruined yourself looking for love in all the wrong places, old man.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6208:12222: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6208
msgctxt "text_id=12222 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう。"
msgstr "  You see..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6223:12223: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6223
msgctxt "text_id=12223 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この老人こそ<社木|やしろぎ>の名士であり、全国に多くの工場をかまえる土桔製パン株式会社の<元|もと>総帥にして、<現|げん>相談役の<土桔|ときつ><由|ゆ><里彦|りひこ>翁その人なのである。"
msgstr "  This old man was none other than Yurihiko Tokitsu. He was famous in Yashirogi as the former head of the Tokitsu Baking Company with factories all across Japan. He still served as an adviser."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6258:12224: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0019; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6258
msgctxt "text_id=12224 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「老人とはなんだ。芸術家にとっての老いとは感性の凍結であり、しかるに我が心の火は絶えていない。"
msgstr "\"Who are you calling old? An artist is only old when he's lost his sensibility. My fire hasn't burned out yet."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6270:12225: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0020; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6270
msgctxt "text_id=12225 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "ボクはまだ暑苦しいくらいに若いんだ。<蕾|つぼみ>のような少女と恋を語らう楽しみは残っているさ。"
msgstr "I'm so young, it's almost stifling! I still look forward to passionate chats with a young woman."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6281:12226: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0021; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6281
msgctxt "text_id=12226 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　ははは、この歳になるともう世間体とかどうでもよくてね。女の子と話すことだけが人生の意味になるんだぞう」"
msgstr "  Hahaha! Once you get my age, you stop giving a damn about keeping up appearances. Talking to girls is what gives meaning to life.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6299:12227: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0021; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6299
msgctxt "text_id=12227 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「若いのか爺さんなのか、どっちなんだよ」"
msgstr "\"So wait, are you young or old?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6333:12228: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0022; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6333
msgctxt "text_id=12228 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「おっと失言失言、最後の方のは聞き流してくれ。"
msgstr "\"Oh, a slip of the tongue. Forget that last bit."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6345:12229: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0023; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6345
msgctxt "text_id=12229 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　ボクが言いたいのは、女の子と穏やかな時間を過ごすのは最高ってコトさ。"
msgstr "  What I'm trying to say here is that there's nothing quite like having a nice time with a young woman."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6358:12230: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0024; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6358
msgctxt "text_id=12230 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "トビー。そういうの、君も好きだろ？」"
msgstr "I'm sure we can at least agree on that, can't we, Toby?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6393:12231: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0022; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6393
msgctxt "text_id=12231 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「一緒にしないでください、あいにく俺は年上好みですよ。"
msgstr "\"Don't lump me in with you. I like older women."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6399:12232: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0023; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6399
msgctxt "text_id=12232 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　おまけに言うなら、二回り以上も年下の女に欲情する趣味もねえワケで」"
msgstr "  I definitely don't have a thing for girls who are less than half my age, I can tell you that much.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6411:12233: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0025; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6411
msgctxt "text_id=12233 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「うん、それはそうだろう。君がやったら犯罪だ。"
msgstr "\"I should hope not. That'd be quite the crime."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6417:12234: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0026; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6417
msgctxt "text_id=12234 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　トビーは十七歳。その二回り下が何歳になるとか、口にだしたらいけないよ」"
msgstr "  You're only seventeen. I don't even want to think about what age you'd be talking about.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6437:12235: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6437
msgctxt "text_id=12235 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うむ、と頷く土桔老人。"
msgstr "  Mr. Tokitsu nodded his head in self-affirmation."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6442:12236: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6442
msgctxt "text_id=12236 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸の無礼な発言もまったく気にしていない。"
msgstr "  He chose to ignore Tobimaru's off-color remarks."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6452:12237: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6452
msgctxt "text_id=12237 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これはこれで大人物なんだよなあ、とつい感心してしまう鳶丸だった。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru was reluctantly impressed with the man's magnanimity, in the end."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6488:12238: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0024; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6488
msgctxt "text_id=12238 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ともかく挨拶はしましたから。邪魔者はこれで消えますよ。あとは仲良し同士、気兼ねなくどうぞ」"
msgstr "\"At any rate, I just wanted to say good morning. I'll get out of your hair now. Sorry to interrupt your fun.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6499:12239: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0027; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6499
msgctxt "text_id=12239 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「なんだトビー。これも縁だ、ゆっくりしていけばいい。"
msgstr "\"Oh, don't be like that, Toby. Fate has led you here. Relax and spend some time with us."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6499:12240: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0027; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6499
msgctxt "text_id=12240 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "　なんなら、今からボクの別荘に来るかね？　ヘリコ呼ぶよ？楽しいぞ？」"
msgstr "  Why don't you come and stay at my villa for a bit? We could take a helicopter. It'd be fun.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6526:12241: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0025; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6526
msgctxt "text_id=12241 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いや、お気持ちは嬉しいんですけどね。知る人が見ればとんでもなくブルジョワな面子でしょ、コレ。今は避けたい気分なんですよ、そういうの」"
msgstr "\"Ah, I'll pass, but thanks for the invitation. If anyone I know sees me, they'll think I'm even more of a spoiled rich kid. I feel like avoiding that right now.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6546:12242: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6546
msgctxt "text_id=12242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸の言い回しで事情を察したのか、それは残念だ、と土桔老人は引き下がった。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru's choice of words made his present situation clear to Mr. Tokitsu, and he reluctantly backed off."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6551:12243: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6551
msgctxt "text_id=12243 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　引退したとはいえ、こんなんでもトッパンを全国規模にまで発展させた偉人である。"
msgstr "  Such intuitive understanding made it obvious how this man had expanded the Tokitsu Baking Company nationwide."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6556:12244: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6556
msgctxt "text_id=12244 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸の複雑な家庭環境を瞬時に察したのだろう。"
msgstr "  He had divined Tobimaru's complicated family situation in an instant."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6591:12245: speaker=yurihiko; speaker_ja=由里彦; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B90_8DOT5_0028; voice_prefix=B90; voice_category=14; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6591
msgctxt "text_id=12245 | speaker=yurihiko"
msgid "「ミックによろしく。そろそろ引退して子供たちと仲直りするよう、ボクが言っていたと伝えてくれ」"
msgstr "\"Tell Mick I said hello, and that he should retire and make up with his kids soon, will ya?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6609:12246: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0026; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6609
msgctxt "text_id=12246 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「はいはい、<糠|ぬか>に釘だろうけど伝えておきますよ。"
msgstr "\"I'm sure it'll fall on deaf ears, but okay."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6620:12247: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0027; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6620
msgctxt "text_id=12247 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　じゃあな久遠寺さん。また朝に出会うことがあったら、その時は改めて挨拶させてくれ」"
msgstr "  See you around, Miss Kuonji. I'll be sure to say hello next time I see you around in the morning.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6653:12248: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6653
msgctxt "text_id=12248 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　同意とも拒絶ともつかない無言の返答。"
msgstr "  Alice's silence neither encouraged nor discouraged this."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6658:12249: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6658
msgctxt "text_id=12249 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それにやれやれと肩をすくめて、鳶丸は広場を後にした。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru shrugged and left the plaza."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6737:12250: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6737
msgctxt "text_id=12250 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　公園を出て気ままに歩いていると、いつのまにか再開発地区にやってきていた。"
msgstr "  He walked leisurely away from the park and came to an area of the city that was under redevelopment."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6742:12251: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6742
msgctxt "text_id=12251 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これは建設途中の電波塔で、この開発には槻司家も噛んでいるが、大部分の資金は外資企業からのものだった。"
msgstr "  There was a radio tower under construction there that the Tsukiji family had a hand in, but most of the capital for that project was funded by foreign firms."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6775:12252: voice_id=D40_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=D40; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6775
msgctxt "text_id=12252 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“この電波塔は十年先を見越しての物です。"
msgstr "\"We're looking ten years into the future with this radio tower."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6781:12253: voice_id=D40_8DOT5_0001; voice_prefix=D40; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6781
msgctxt "text_id=12253 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いずれ携帯通信は目まぐるしい進歩をとげるでしょう。"
msgstr "  Many advancements will be made in the field of mobile communications."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6787:12254: voice_id=D40_8DOT5_0002; voice_prefix=D40; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6787
msgctxt "text_id=12254 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まずはそのモデルケースとして、私どもの技術をミサキ市に普及させたいのです―――”"
msgstr "  We want to bring our technology into Misaki City ahead of the rest.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6807:12255: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6807
msgctxt "text_id=12255 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外資企業から派遣された男は、そんなうたい文句で父、一義と握手を交わしていた。"
msgstr "  The man from the foreign firm shook on the deal with Tobimaru's father, Hitoyoshi."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6839:12256: voice_id=D40_8DOT5_0003; voice_prefix=D40; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6839
msgctxt "text_id=12256 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“いずれは娘もミサキ市に住まわせようと思っています。"
msgstr "\"Eventually I want my daughter to live here in Misaki City."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6845:12257: voice_id=D40_8DOT5_0004; voice_prefix=D40; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6845
msgctxt "text_id=12257 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その時は貴方の息子さんとも、ぜひ交友を深めて―――”"
msgstr "  I hope that she and your son can get to know each other better when that day comes.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6865:12258: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6865
msgctxt "text_id=12258 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　白人特有の、穏やかな威圧感を持つ優男だった。"
msgstr "  He was a handsome man who had the calm command of a leader."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6870:12259: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6870
msgctxt "text_id=12259 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の娘を鳶丸にあてがおうとするあたり、槻司家の相続問題も調査済みなのだろう。"
msgstr "  The fact that he had offered up his daughter to Tobimaru showed that he had researched the Tsukiji family's inheritance issues well."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6891:12260: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0028; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6891
msgctxt "text_id=12260 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「親父も舐められてるって気付けよな。親父より先に俺に色目使いやがってクソヤンキーが。"
msgstr "\"When are you gonna realize you're getting played, Dad? It's so obvious."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6897:12261: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0029; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6897
msgctxt "text_id=12261 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　そもそも金髪女の相手なんざ願い下げだぜ。向こうで海兵相手に<尻|ケツ>振ってろってんだ」"
msgstr "  And I'm not interested in blondes, anyway. She can take her skanky, money-grubbing hands elsewhere. I'll pass.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6928:12262: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6928
msgctxt "text_id=12262 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう愚痴をこぼすと鳶丸は足を止めた。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru stopped in his tracks after these muttered complaints."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6933:12263: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6933
msgctxt "text_id=12263 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本気の悪態が口から出るようではおしまいである。"
msgstr "  He decided to stop himself before he said anything worse."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6938:12264: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6938
msgctxt "text_id=12264 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　じゅうぶんに歩いたし、日も完全に昇ってしまった。"
msgstr "  He'd walked far enough already anyway. The sun was completely up now."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6943:12265: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6943
msgctxt "text_id=12265 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これ以上の放浪は何ら得るものがない。"
msgstr "  There was nothing more to gain from wandering mindlessly."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6964:12266: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0030; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6964
msgctxt "text_id=12266 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「―――戻るか」"
msgstr "\"...Guess I should head back.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:6971:12267: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:6971
msgctxt "text_id=12267 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　建設途中の電波塔に背を向けて、鳶丸は家路につく。"
msgstr "  He turned his back to the radio tower and began heading home."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7005:12268: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7005
msgctxt "text_id=12268 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一時間後。"
msgstr "  One hour later..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7011:12269: voice_id=G40_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=G40; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7011
msgctxt "text_id=12269 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「坊ちゃん、お電話です」"
msgstr "\"Young master, you have a phone call.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7016:12270: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7016
msgctxt "text_id=12270 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司の本邸に帰った鳶丸は、家政婦から受話器を受け取った。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru had returned to the Tsukiji residence. He took the phone from the housemaid."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7037:12271: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0042; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7037
msgctxt "text_id=12271 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "『もしもし、鳶丸？　草十郎がこんなコトになってるんだけど、アンタ、心当たりない？』"
msgstr "\"Hey, Tobimaru? Soujyuro's gotten himself into something recently. Does anything ring a bell?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7043:12272: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7043
msgctxt "text_id=12272 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　風雲急を告げる、蒼崎青子からの電話である。"
msgstr "  Aoko Aozaki was on the line. That was never a good sign."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7107:12273: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0043; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7107
msgctxt "text_id=12273 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「とまあ、こういう<事情|ワケ>なのよ」"
msgstr "\"So yeah, that's as much as I know about it.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7116:12274: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0031; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7116
msgctxt "text_id=12274 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「すげえな。安心できる要素がひとつもねえ」"
msgstr "\"Geez. Everything about that is as suspicious as it gets.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7150:12275: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7150
msgctxt "text_id=12275 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“草十郎がおかしな<仕事|バイト>に<嵌|はま>っている模様。"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro seems caught up in a strange part-time job."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7150:12276: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7150
msgctxt "text_id=12276 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　急遽相談に乗られたし。中央公園で待つ”"
msgstr "  I'll wait for you in Central Park to talk about it.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7182:12277: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7182
msgctxt "text_id=12277 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな電話を受け、公園にとんぼ返りしてからはや十分。"
msgstr "  Ten minutes had passed since he had received this call from Aoko and returned to the park."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7187:12278: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7187
msgctxt "text_id=12278 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ある意味、いつかは起こるだろう、と危惧していた状況を聞かされ、槻司鳶丸は軽い<偏頭痛|へんずつう>に襲われた。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru felt a light migraine coming on after hearing about the situation."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7192:12279: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7192
msgctxt "text_id=12279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ちなみに、ベンチに少女と老人の姿はない。"
msgstr "  The young girl and the old man from before were nowhere to be seen."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7223:12280: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0044; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7223
msgctxt "text_id=12280 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そんなコト言われるまでもなく分かってるわよ。"
msgstr "\"Well, you don't have to tell me that."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7229:12281: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0045; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7229
msgctxt "text_id=12281 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私だって人のアルバイトにケチつけたくないけど、どう考えても普通じゃないでしょ？"
msgstr "  I'm not trying to be judgmental about what someone does for work, but this just doesn't seem right."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7240:12282: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0046; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7240
msgctxt "text_id=12282 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　アンタ、アイツから何か聞いてない？」"
msgstr "  He hasn't told you anything about this?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7258:12283: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0032; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7258
msgctxt "text_id=12283 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「悪いな、期待には応えられん。草十郎はバイトに関しちゃ秘密主義だ。任されているからには他言はできない、とかなんとかな」"
msgstr "\"Sorry, but I haven't heard anything. He's super secretive about his job. He said he can't talk to anyone about it, or something.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7291:12284: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0047; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7291
msgctxt "text_id=12284 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……そうなのよね。アイツ、他人の事情に関しちゃ缶詰みたいに義理堅いから。ガキガキにされないかぎり口割らないのよ」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, he's always so tight-lipped about anything that involves other people. He's not going to talk easily.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7309:12285: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0033; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7309
msgctxt "text_id=12285 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ほう、それはそれは。蒼崎にそこまで言わせるとはね。草十郎も信頼されたもんだ」"
msgstr "\"Hm, I guess he must be pretty loyal if even you think that about him.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7344:12286: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0048; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7344
msgctxt "text_id=12286 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どういう意味よそれ」"
msgstr "\"What is that supposed to mean?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7355:12287: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0034; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7355
msgctxt "text_id=12287 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「他意はねえ、言葉通りに受け取ってくれ。"
msgstr "\"I'm not implying anything. I'm just saying."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7361:12288: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0035; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7361
msgctxt "text_id=12288 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　おまえ、基本的に何にだって怒るだろ。そんな女が学校外で世話をやくなんて、よっぽど気に入ったのかと思ってな」"
msgstr "  You get mad about pretty much everything. If you're watching his back outside of school, you must really like him.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7396:12289: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0049; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7396
msgctxt "text_id=12289 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「違うわよ。アイツが問題を起こしたら<生徒会|わたしたち>にまで飛び火するじゃない。"
msgstr "\"Not really. It's just that if he causes any problems, we're going to take the heat for it in the student council."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7402:12290: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0050; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7402
msgctxt "text_id=12290 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　こんなの、誰がどう見ても、ただのリスク回避でしょう」"
msgstr "  This is just risk aversion, plain and simple.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7408:12291: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0036; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7408
msgctxt "text_id=12291 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「なるほど、公務として見過ごせないってワケか」"
msgstr "\"Ah okay, so you're just doing your duty.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7429:12292: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0051; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7429
msgctxt "text_id=12292 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうよ。悪い？」"
msgstr "\"That's right. Any problem with that?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7435:12293: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0037; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7435
msgctxt "text_id=12293 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いやぁ、悪かねえさ。むしろ尊敬するよ。"
msgstr "\"No, none. I respect it, actually."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7441:12294: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0038; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7441
msgctxt "text_id=12294 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　ほんと、鉄の生徒会長だぜ。休日だっていうのに学校の評判を守るため<だ|・><け|・>に働けるとは」"
msgstr "  You're the perfect student council president. I mean, it's not even a school day, and you're out here just to make sure our school's reputation is upheld.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7472:12295: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0052; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7472
msgctxt "text_id=12295 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「だけ、ってところを妙に強調するじゃない。"
msgstr "\"You really don't have to say it like that."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7478:12296: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0053; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7478
msgctxt "text_id=12296 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……まあ、事実その通りだけど」"
msgstr "  ...Though, I suppose you're right.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7486:12297: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7486
msgctxt "text_id=12297 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は何か文句でも？　と睨みを利かせた。"
msgstr "  Aoko's glare seemed to suggest she wasn't interested in hearing any objections."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7491:12298: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7491
msgctxt "text_id=12298 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　すでに草十郎と青子の雑居を知っている鳶丸からすると、その虚勢はたいへん微笑ましい。"
msgstr "  This little bluff was rather charming to Tobimaru, who was well aware of Soujyuro and Aoko's current living situation."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7524:12299: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0039; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7524
msgctxt "text_id=12299 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「べっつにぃー。しかしま、そういうコトなら副会長として付き合わなくっちゃな。"
msgstr "\"At any rate, I guess it's my duty as vice-president to tag along with this investigation then."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7530:12300: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0040; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7530
msgctxt "text_id=12300 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　会長は学校のために草十郎を調査する。"
msgstr "  You continue investigating Soujyuro. For the reputation of our school, of course."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7537:12301: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0041; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7537
msgctxt "text_id=12301 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "俺はそのサポートをしつつ、友人として草十郎を気に掛けるってコトで」"
msgstr "I'll provide support however I can, and will watch out for Soujyuro as his friend.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7555:12302: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0054; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7555
msgctxt "text_id=12302 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7561:12303: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7561
msgctxt "text_id=12303 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸の発言は<注文|オーダー>通りなのだが、なんとなく納得のいかない青子だった。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru said he would do as Aoko asked, but for some reason she did not seem satisfied."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7597:12304: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0042; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7597
msgctxt "text_id=12304 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「んじゃ、そうと決まればさっそく始めますか。"
msgstr "\"Now that it's all settled, let's get started."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7603:12305: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0043; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7603
msgctxt "text_id=12305 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　蒼崎のコトだから草十郎の<勤|つと>め先ぐらい突き止めてんだろ？住所どこだよ」"
msgstr "  You should at least know where he's working, right? What's the address?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7630:12306: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0055; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7630
msgctxt "text_id=12306 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それが……尾行したんだけど、うまくまかれちゃって。"
msgstr "\"I tried to tail him and find that out, actually... but I got nowhere."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7636:12307: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0056; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7636
msgctxt "text_id=12307 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　駅前から二丁目方面に曲がっていったのまでは確実なんだけど」"
msgstr "  All I know is that he turned and walked towards 2nd Street from the train station.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7647:12308: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7647
msgctxt "text_id=12308 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さすが副会長、慣れたものである。"
msgstr "  The vice-president was used to this."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7652:12309: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7652
msgctxt "text_id=12309 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『尾行したのかよ』なんて<批難|ツッコミ>は当然スルー。"
msgstr "  He didn't bother saying anything about her going so far as to tail Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7686:12310: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0044; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7686
msgctxt "text_id=12310 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「二丁目か……あのあたりだとパチンコとゲームセンターぐらいしか思い当たらねえな。一日に何万も稼げる店なんざねえぞ？」"
msgstr "\"2nd Street, huh... There's just a bunch of pachinko parlors and arcades around there. I can't think of anywhere that'd be paying him tens of thousands of yen a day.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7692:12311: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0057; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7692
msgctxt "text_id=12311 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうなのよ。というか、知ってたら私が試したい気分だわ。"
msgstr "\"I know, right? I mean, if I knew a place like that, I'd be inclined to work there myself."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7711:12312: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0058; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7711
msgctxt "text_id=12312 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　鳶丸。念のために訊くけど、三咲町にある“お金の稼げる遊び場”ってパチンコだけよね？」"
msgstr "  I just want to make sure, but the only place you can gamble in Misaki is the pachinko parlor, right?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7741:12313: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0045; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7741
msgctxt "text_id=12313 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ああ。親父の話じゃ風営法にひっかかる<賭|と><場|ば>はねえとさ。"
msgstr "\"According to my dad, there are no gambling spots that violate the Entertainment Business Act in town."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7747:12314: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0046; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7747
msgctxt "text_id=12314 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　三咲町の顔役は話の分かるおっさんで、クリーンな<極道|ごくどう>を目指してるらしい。パチンコ経営だけで満足してるって話だ」"
msgstr "  He said the owner of the pachinko parlor is an agreeable sort who seems happy sticking to his current business.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7758:12315: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0059; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7758
msgctxt "text_id=12315 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「うん、それは知ってる。一応確認しただけ」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, I know. I just wanted to make sure.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7810:12316: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0060; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7810
msgctxt "text_id=12316 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でも、そうなるとますます謎ね。"
msgstr "\"That just makes this whole thing even more mysterious."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7816:12317: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0061; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7816
msgctxt "text_id=12317 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ギャンブル以外でお金を倍々にしていく仕事なんて、ちょっと思い当たらないんだけど」"
msgstr "  I can't think of any way other than gambling that you can make money that quickly.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7828:12318: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0047; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7828
msgctxt "text_id=12318 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ああ、体でも売ってるとしか思えない羽振りの良さだ。一晩いくら、みたいな」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, nothing except maybe selling his body. Maybe people are paying him for a night.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7849:12319: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0062; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7849
msgctxt "text_id=12319 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――へ？」"
msgstr "\"...Huh?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7869:12320: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7869
msgctxt "text_id=12320 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　間の抜けた声がもれる。"
msgstr "  There was a slight delay in Aoko's reaction."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7874:12321: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7874
msgctxt "text_id=12321 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　理解するのに数瞬を必要としたのか、青子はぽかんと口を開けた。"
msgstr "  It took her a few seconds to register what he was saying, but then her jaw dropped."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7901:12322: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0063; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7901
msgctxt "text_id=12322 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ちょっ、か、体って、あ、アンタ！」"
msgstr "\"W-Wait, s-selling his body?! Are you serious?!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7907:12323: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0048; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7907
msgctxt "text_id=12323 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ほら、絵画のモデルとか。バイト代は高いときくぜ」"
msgstr "\"Oh, chill out! I meant as a model or something. I heard they make pretty good money.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7933:12324: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0064; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7933
msgctxt "text_id=12324 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あ―――うん、割はいいって言うわね。美大生ってお金持ちだし。そうよね、それぐらいなら別に」"
msgstr "\"Ahh... Yeah, I've heard that too. And art school kids are usually pretty rich. Maybe that's all it is. That's not so bad.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7939:12325: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0049; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7939
msgctxt "text_id=12325 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「まあ、ヌードなのは当然だが」"
msgstr "\"I mean, he would be nude, of course.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7950:12326: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0065; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7950
msgctxt "text_id=12326 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「結局はだかじゃない！」"
msgstr "\"So he *is* getting naked for money!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7983:12327: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7983
msgctxt "text_id=12327 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　決定的な情報を欠くため、話せば話すほど核心から遠ざかっていくようだ。"
msgstr "  Without any real information to go on, the conversation was quickly diverging further from the topic at hand."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7988:12328: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7988
msgctxt "text_id=12328 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アルバイトの種類も、"
msgstr "  Without knowing the location or type of work..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:7993:12329: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:7993
msgctxt "text_id=12329 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アルバイトの現場も分からないのでは話にならない。"
msgstr "  There really wasn't much to talk about."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8024:12330: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0066; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8024
msgctxt "text_id=12330 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「明日、もう一度草十郎を尾行するしかないわね。二人がかりなら見失うコトもないだろうし」"
msgstr "\"Let's try to tail him again tomorrow. It'll be harder to lose him if there's two of us.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8042:12331: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0050; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8042
msgctxt "text_id=12331 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そうだな。他に手がかりもねえし、明日にするか。"
msgstr "\"Yeah, you're right. We don't have any other clues at the moment, so let's just pick this up tomorrow."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8049:12332: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0051_0; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8049
msgctxt "text_id=12332 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "“草十郎の羽振りがいい”だけじゃどうしようも―――"
msgstr "  All we know is he's making lots of money, and that's not really..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8062:12333: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0051_1; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8062
msgctxt "text_id=12333 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "あん？　羽振りがいい？」"
msgstr " Hmm...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8082:12334: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8082
msgctxt "text_id=12334 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　む、と眉を寄せて思案する鳶丸。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru furrowed his brow. It seemed he had thought of something."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8092:12335: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8092
msgctxt "text_id=12335 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　考えれば考えるほどイヤな予感が満ちていくのか、その<表|か><情|お>は苦虫をかみ潰したように険しくなっていく。"
msgstr "  His expression turned more dire by the second."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8128:12336: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0067; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8128
msgctxt "text_id=12336 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どうしたの鳶丸。何か思い出した？」"
msgstr "\"What's wrong, Tobimaru? Did you remember something?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8139:12337: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0052; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8139
msgctxt "text_id=12337 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……あー、ちょっとな。そういえば、最近妙に羽振りのいいバカがひとりいたなって。"
msgstr "\"Hmm, kind of. I just remembered one other idiot who's been making a lot of cash recently."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8145:12338: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0053; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8145
msgctxt "text_id=12338 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　そいつ、三日ぐらい前から金にあかして合コンし放題って話なんだが……頭の痛いコトに、草十郎と同じクラスのバカなんだよ、これが」"
msgstr "  Since about three days ago, he's been flaunting a lot of money and going to all these expensive mixer parties. And he's in the same class as Soujyuro.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8179:12339: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8179
msgctxt "text_id=12339 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　数秒、沈黙。"
msgstr "  There were a few seconds of silence."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8184:12340: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8184
msgctxt "text_id=12340 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はなるほど、と心底<合点|がてん>がいったように頷いて、"
msgstr "  Aoko nodded. She had put two and two together."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8196:12341: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0068; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8196
msgctxt "text_id=12341 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――アイツね」"
msgstr "\"...I know who you're talking about.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8202:12342: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8202
msgctxt "text_id=12342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さっそく捕まえに行きましょう、と公園を後にした。"
msgstr "  The two immediately left the park to go and find the suspect."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8253:12343: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8253
msgctxt "text_id=12343 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「ちゃりーす！"
msgstr "\"What's happenin'?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8259:12344: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8259
msgctxt "text_id=12344 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　およびとあらば補習だろうと即サボり、遊びのお誘いだけは断らない<木|き><乃|の><美|み>クンでーす！」"
msgstr "  You know I can't turn down an invite even if I'm in the middle of studying. I'm here to party, guys!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8291:12345: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8291
msgctxt "text_id=12345 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　容疑者Ａはたやすく捕獲できた。"
msgstr "  Suspect A was apprehended with ease."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8296:12346: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8296
msgctxt "text_id=12346 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ターゲットが赤点の補習で学校にいる事は、生徒会であるふたりには既知の事実だったからだ。"
msgstr "  Aoko and Tobimaru were both on the student council, so they knew their target would be at school for remedial lessons."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8301:12347: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8301
msgctxt "text_id=12347 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸が女生徒に「ちょっといい話があるから出てきてくれ」と伝言を伝えてから約十分。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru got a girl in Kinomi's class to tell him he had some good news to share outside."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8306:12348: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8306
msgctxt "text_id=12348 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　木乃美<芳助|ほうすけ>は神速の早足で正門前にやってきた。"
msgstr "  Kinomi took the bait and came running out the school's front gate as fast as he could."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8346:12349: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0054; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8346
msgctxt "text_id=12349 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「おう。補習中呼び出して悪かったな」"
msgstr "\"Hey, sorry to call you out when you're trying to study.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8358:12350: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8358
msgctxt "text_id=12350 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「別に悪くないぜー？　補習を口実にバイトをさぼってみたものの、やっぱり補習もかったるかったんで、出席だけとって保健室で寝てただけだし」"
msgstr "\"No worries! I was actually just using school as an excuse to skip my job, but then that was boring too, so I was just having a nap in the nurse's office.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8384:12351: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8384
msgctxt "text_id=12351 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「んで、ちょうど暇してたところに殿下からコールだろ。"
msgstr "\"Then that's when I got the call from you!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8384:12352: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8384
msgctxt "text_id=12352 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　豪遊できると飛んできたワケさ！」"
msgstr "  So I'm all ready to party. What's going on?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8390:12353: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8390
msgctxt "text_id=12353 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　バチィ！とサムズアップでやる気をアピール。"
msgstr "  Kinomi gave a double thumbs up to show he was really ready to have some fun."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8416:12354: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0055; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8416
msgctxt "text_id=12354 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そうか。てっきり外で遊び歩いてるかと思ったが、助かったぜ。おまえ、連日ゲームセンターに入り浸りだって聞いてたからよ」"
msgstr "\"I thought you'd be out and about, so I'm glad I caught you. I heard you've been holed up in the arcade for the past few days.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8458:12355: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0004; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8458
msgctxt "text_id=12355 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「あー、あれね。ちょうど昨日ですっからかんよ。ゲーセンでおごりまくるのは気持ちいいけど、後に残るのは空しさばかりだよなあ。"
msgstr "\"Ah, yeah. I was there giving out free games and stuff, which is fun, but not so much once you run out of cash."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8464:12356: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0005; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8464
msgctxt "text_id=12356 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　他校のヤンキーどもと仲良くなっても嬉しくねえっつうか、女っ気カイムというか。なんで女の子はゲーセンいやがるかねぇ」"
msgstr "  Plus, I'm not really interested in becoming friends with punks from other schools, and it's all guys in there. Why don't girls like hanging out in arcades?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8491:12357: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0006; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8491
msgctxt "text_id=12357 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「ま、それも過去の話だけどな。しょせんポッと湧いたあぶく銭、使っちまった金の話をしてもしょうがねえ。"
msgstr "\"Anyway, that's all in the past. No point in talking about dough that's already spent. Easy come, easy go."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8497:12358: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0007; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8497
msgctxt "text_id=12358 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　オレたちは明るく今の話をしよう。そうだろう、リッチな鳶丸クン。そのありあまる財力で、今日はボクを何処に連れて行ってくれるんだい？」"
msgstr "  Let's focus on the now! You're rich, right? You feel like taking a broke guy like me out on the town today, or what?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8509:12359: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0056; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8509
msgctxt "text_id=12359 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ああ。その前に、こちらの<御仁|ごじん>がおまえに話があるってよ」"
msgstr "\"Sure, but first this bigwig here has a few questions for you.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8515:12360: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0008; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8515
msgctxt "text_id=12360 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「へ？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8550:12361: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0069; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8550
msgctxt "text_id=12361 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「こんにちは木乃美君。"
msgstr "\"Hello there, Kinomi."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8556:12362: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0070; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8556
msgctxt "text_id=12362 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　その、あぶく銭の話を聞かせてもらえるかしら」"
msgstr "  Do you mind telling me a little about all this money you came into recently?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8574:12363: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8574
msgctxt "text_id=12363 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　木乃美の表情が停止する。"
msgstr "  Kinomi's expression went blank."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8579:12364: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8579
msgctxt "text_id=12364 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　危険に敏感な彼は、この時点で自らの終わりを察したらしい。"
msgstr "  If anyone could sniff out danger, it was him. And it stank like his impending doom."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8605:12365: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0009; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8605
msgctxt "text_id=12365 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「アノー。ボク、勉強シタインデ、戻ッテイイデショウカ？」"
msgstr "\"Umm, well, you see, I... I really need to get back to studying, so... Is it okay if I head back?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8626:12366: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0071; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8626
msgctxt "text_id=12366 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「もちろん。洗いざらい質問に答え終わったら戻っていいわよ。こっちも時間が惜しいから、スムーズな自白を期待するわ」"
msgstr "\"Of course. Once you answer all of my questions. We don't have much time either, so I hope you'll confess quickly.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8652:12367: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0072; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8652
msgctxt "text_id=12367 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それで、あぶく銭って何の話？"
msgstr "\"So again, tell me about this money you recently came into."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8658:12368: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0073; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8658
msgctxt "text_id=12368 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　貴方の月々のバイト料は二万円前後よね。その金額で三日近くも王様の真似事は難しいと思うのだけど」"
msgstr "  I know you make around 20,000 yen a month from your part-time job. I don't think that's quite enough to live like a king for three days.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8664:12369: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8664
msgctxt "text_id=12369 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　犯罪にでも手を染めた？　と続きそうな<質問|こえ>である。"
msgstr "  It seemed the next logical question would be to ask if he had begun a life of crime."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8703:12370: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0010; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8703
msgctxt "text_id=12370 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「な、なんだよ、会長には関係ないだろー！"
msgstr "\"W-Why is this even any of your business?!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8709:12371: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0011; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8709
msgctxt "text_id=12371 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　そもそも自白って何デスカ。いきなり犯人扱いとか、いくらなんでも横暴じゃねえの？　つーか何の事件、これ？」"
msgstr "  You're treating me like a criminal! I don't have anything to confess! This isn't fair! What's going on?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8744:12372: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0074; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8744
msgctxt "text_id=12372 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「まだ事件かどうかは何とも。最近お金の回りがいい生徒がいると聞いて、調べはじめたばかりだから。"
msgstr "\"Nothing, yet. We just heard about some students who recently came into a significant amount of money, and we're looking into it."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8750:12373: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0075; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8750
msgctxt "text_id=12373 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　毎日何万円ももらえる仕事なんて学生には目の毒だし、そういったアルバイトは学校側に報告されてないしね。"
msgstr "  A job that pays tens of thousands of yen a day is very tempting to a broke student, but we haven't heard of any such jobs reported to the school."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8756:12374: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0076; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8756
msgctxt "text_id=12374 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　生徒会として、危ない仕事だったら注意してあげないと」"
msgstr "  It's our job as the student council to be on the look out for any dangers to our students. That's all.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8792:12375: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8792
msgctxt "text_id=12375 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は微笑みをキープしたまま、じりじりと木乃美に近づいていく。"
msgstr "  Aoko was still smiling as she inched closer to Kinomi."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8797:12376: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8797
msgctxt "text_id=12376 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　木乃美にしてみれば、入学からこっち、青子にこれほど愛想良く話しかけられた事はなく、なんというか、もうそれだけで自らの死期を悟らざるを得ない状況だった。"
msgstr "  She had never spoken to him this nicely after what he had done at the entrance ceremony. That alone was enough to make him think he was in big trouble."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8836:12377: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0012; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8836
msgctxt "text_id=12377 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「へ、へえ、それは初耳だなあ。最近金回りがいい生徒ねえ。"
msgstr "\"R-Really? I haven't heard about anything like that..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8842:12378: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0013; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8842
msgctxt "text_id=12378 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　あ、オレのは違うよ。今まで貯めた貯金をなんとなく使っただけ。クリスマス前だから、こう派手に<浄財|じょうざい>しとこうかなって。<厄|やく>落とし的に？」"
msgstr "  Ah, umm, my case is different. I was just using money I'd saved up. It's just before Christmas, so I thought I'd go a bit wild with my spending. Sort of a cleansing of the spirit, you know?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8870:12379: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0057; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8870
msgctxt "text_id=12379 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「普通、クリスマス前は貯金するもんだけどな」"
msgstr "\"Isn't this time of year usually when people are trying to save money?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8904:12380: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0077; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8904
msgctxt "text_id=12380 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ダメよ槻司君、デリカシーが足りないわ。"
msgstr "\"Now, now, Tsukiji. Let's be more sensitive."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8910:12381: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0078; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8910
msgctxt "text_id=12381 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　残酷な事実は口にしたくはないけど、木乃美君にはイヴを過ごす相手がいないって事でしょう。学友として、そこを追及したら可哀想よ」"
msgstr "  That being said, I hate to point this out, but it's obvious that Kinomi here has no date for Christmas Eve. It would be a shame if word of that got around school.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8956:12382: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0014; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8956
msgctxt "text_id=12382 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「い、いるわい本命ぐらい！　真剣に同情する方がデリカシーに欠けると思うよオレは！」"
msgstr "\"I-I totally have a date! Seriously! Also, you're the one being insensitive here!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:8976:12383: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0079; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:8976
msgctxt "text_id=12383 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あら。じゃあ、イヴ用の資金はとってあるの？」"
msgstr "\"Oh, really? Then I guess you have some money saved up for your big Christmas Eve date then?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9010:12384: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0015; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9010
msgctxt "text_id=12384 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「あったりめえさ。臨時収入と貯金は別。"
msgstr "\"Of course I do! Extra income and savings are two separate things."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9016:12385: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0016; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9016
msgctxt "text_id=12385 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　オレ、通帳オヤジに握られてるからさー、予定外の入金とかすぐバレて怒られるんだよ。どこで悪さしてきやがったって。部屋も妹がチェックするしさー、隠し場所とかないんだよー。天井裏に隠したエロ本すら見付けられるんだぜ、万札入った封筒とか見つかった日にゃ警察につれていかれる。だからソッコー使うしかなくってさー」"
msgstr "  Look, my dad is super strict about watching my bank statements. He'd yell at me the moment he saw anything odd, thinking I was doing something bad. And my sister searches my room, so I can't hide anything there. They even found the porn mags I hid up in the ceiling. If they found an envelope full of cash, they'd take me down to the police station! So I used the money right away...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9036:12386: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9036
msgctxt "text_id=12386 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何が恥ずかしいのか、ははは、と照れ隠しに笑う木乃美。"
msgstr "  Kinomi laughed awkwardly, as if he was ashamed."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9041:12387: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9041
msgctxt "text_id=12387 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　基本おしゃべりで感情だだもれな性格を、本人だけは気付いていない悲劇だった。"
msgstr "  He wasn't even aware of just how much he had let slip."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9079:12388: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0080; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9079
msgctxt "text_id=12388 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「へえ、臨時収入？　さっきと話、違うみたい」"
msgstr "\"Oh, extra income? That's not what you said earlier.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9093:12389: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0017; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9093
msgctxt "text_id=12389 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「―――あ。いや、それはほら、バイト先のボーナスみたいな。五千円ぐらい上乗せしてもらったの！　ほんのちょっと、ちょっとだけだって！　事件性とかないって！」"
msgstr "\"...Ah, no, I mean... It was a bonus from my part-time job. They just gave me an extra 5,000 yen! Just a little! It's nothing crazy!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9124:12390: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0081; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9124
msgctxt "text_id=12390 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「万札入った封筒について詳しく」"
msgstr "\"So why were you talking about an envelope full of cash?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9150:12391: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0018; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9150
msgctxt "text_id=12391 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「うおお、話せば話すほど食い違っていくぜ！　なんだこれ孔明のワナか？"
msgstr "\"Urgh, I'm talking myself into a hole here! Are you trying to entrap me or something?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9159:12392: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0019; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9159
msgctxt "text_id=12392 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　ちょっ、会長近い、オーラすごい、なんか寒い！　しかもローファーじゃなくてブーツですか!?　この間合い、封じられたオレの記憶が蘇りそうなんですけどー！」"
msgstr "  Y-You're getting a little close... You're kinda scaring me! Also, are you wearing boots?! You know, this feels oddly familiar!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9179:12393: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9179
msgctxt "text_id=12393 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　じりじりと後退する木乃美と、"
msgstr "  Kinomi backed away slowly."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9202:12394: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0082; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9202
msgctxt "text_id=12394 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「木乃美君？　時間がないって言ったの、もう一度アピールするべきかしら？」"
msgstr "\"Kinomi? Do I have to remind you that we're running short on time here?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9215:12395: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0083; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9215
msgctxt "text_id=12395 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "“直接、体に。”"
msgstr "\"I don't want to have to get physical with you.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9221:12396: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9221
msgctxt "text_id=12396 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう、ぼそっと付け足すハイキックの鬼。"
msgstr "  The threat of a kick to the face from Aoko was enough to show him that she was serious."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9254:12397: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0020; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9254
msgctxt "text_id=12397 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「わかった、話す！　話すってばもー！"
msgstr "\"Okay, okay. I'll talk! I'll talk!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9260:12398: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0021; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9260
msgctxt "text_id=12398 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　臨時収入ってのはホントだよ！　新しいバイトがあってさ、そこに静希を紹介したら先輩にボーナスもらったんだよ！」"
msgstr "  Yes, I am making extra income from a new part-time job. I got a bonus for introducing Sizuki to them, that's all!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9278:12399: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0084; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9278
msgctxt "text_id=12399 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――なんですって？」"
msgstr "\"...What did you just say?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9298:12400: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9298
msgctxt "text_id=12400 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　仮に、木乃美が草十郎と同じバイトをしているのなら情報を引きずりだそう。"
msgstr "  If Kinomi really was working at the same part-time job as Soujyuro, she wanted to get as much information from him as she could."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9303:12401: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9303
msgctxt "text_id=12401 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう考えていた青子にとって、木乃美の返答は期待通りであり、ちょっとばかり想像を超えていた。"
msgstr "  This was the exact response she had wanted from Kinomi, if not better."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9347:12402: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9347
msgctxt "text_id=12402 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悪い予感に目眩を覚える。"
msgstr "  But she felt dizzy from the implications."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9355:12403: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0085; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9355
msgctxt "text_id=12403 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「紹介したらボーナスをもらえるって、それ―――」"
msgstr "\"So you get a bonus for getting other people to join? That sounds like...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9361:12404: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9361
msgctxt "text_id=12404 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悪徳商法と名高い、ネズミ講のうたい文句そのものだ。"
msgstr "  It was the oldest trick in the book for pyramid schemes and other unscrupulous business practices."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9397:12405: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0022; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9397
msgctxt "text_id=12405 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「いや、それがさー。"
msgstr "\"It's not what you think."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9403:12406: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0023; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9403
msgctxt "text_id=12406 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　静希が稼ぎを増やしたいっていうんで、ちょい怪しいバイトを紹介したんだよね」"
msgstr "  Sizuki said he was looking to make some extra money, so I told him about this kinda shady job.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9435:12407: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9435
msgctxt "text_id=12407 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　事は期末試験前にさかのぼる。"
msgstr "  This went back all the way to before final exams."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9440:12408: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9440
msgctxt "text_id=12408 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とある理由から先立つものがない、と相談してきたクラスメイトに、木乃美は先輩経由で回ってきたアルバイトを紹介した。"
msgstr "  Kinomi told Soujyuro about a job he'd heard of from an older student."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9445:12409: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9445
msgctxt "text_id=12409 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先方が求めた人材が「心優しい、素直な青年」だったため、木乃美は泣く泣く出馬をあきらめ、代わりに条件の合う友人を送り出した―――という訳である。"
msgstr "  Since the job required a \"kind, honest young man,\" Kinomi reluctantly gave up on it for himself and instead passed it on to a friend he thought fit that description."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9474:12410: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0086; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9474
msgctxt "text_id=12410 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「信じられない。そんな怪しい話にクラスメイトを放り出しておいて、まだ友人顔するとか。"
msgstr "\"I can't believe you did that to someone you consider a friend. You yourself knew it sounded shady."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9480:12411: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0087; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9480
msgctxt "text_id=12411 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　木乃美君、普段なに考えて生きてるの？」"
msgstr "  What were you thinking?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9486:12412: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0024; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9486
msgctxt "text_id=12412 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「えー。トモダチでも紹介するでしょ、こういうの。"
msgstr "\"Huh? Why wouldn't I pass something like this on to a friend?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9492:12413: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0025; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9492
msgctxt "text_id=12413 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　むしろ本当の友情ってこういうものよ？　静希も助かってオレも<潤|うるお>うんだからさー。無償の友情とかもうはやんないですよ？」"
msgstr "  Dude needed help, so I tried to help him out. Plus, we both profited.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9523:12414: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0088; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9523
msgctxt "text_id=12414 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そりゃそうだけど、そういうのはちゃんと<責任|ケツ>持つ覚悟がある時だけ口にするものじゃないの？」"
msgstr "\"Well yeah, but then you also have to do your due diligence first before you tell them about something like that.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9529:12415: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0026; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9529
msgctxt "text_id=12415 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「なにそれメンドくさーい。会長、男同士の友情に幻想持ちすぎだってば。基本、オレたちみんなバカよ？」"
msgstr "\"That's way too much effort for a guy like me. I don't think you understand how friendship between guys works. You realize we're all dumb, right?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9535:12416: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0089; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9535
msgctxt "text_id=12416 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「貴方を見てると本気でそう思えてくるから不思議ね。"
msgstr "\"I do start to believe that the more I look at you, honestly."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9541:12417: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0090; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9541
msgctxt "text_id=12417 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　鳶丸。アンタ、よくこんなのと<連|つる>んでるわね」"
msgstr "  How do you hang out with him, Tobimaru?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9572:12418: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0058; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9572
msgctxt "text_id=12418 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「はいはいそこまで。説教するならまた後でな蒼崎。"
msgstr "\"Okay, that's enough. You can lecture him later."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9578:12419: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0059; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9578
msgctxt "text_id=12419 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　そいつ素で<最低|バカ>だから、本気で更生させたかったら一日使うぞ」"
msgstr "  It'll take at least a full day to reform someone as dense as him.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9587:12420: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0027; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9587
msgctxt "text_id=12420 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「いや、足りますよ。ちゃんと一日で更生できますボク。"
msgstr "\"Hey, come on. Give me a little credit at least. I can reform in a day!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9599:12421: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0028; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9599
msgctxt "text_id=12421 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　ただ、寝ると忘れちゃうだけで」"
msgstr "  I'll probably forget everything once I sleep on it, though.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9612:12422: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0091; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9612
msgctxt "text_id=12422 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9633:12423: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0060; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9633
msgctxt "text_id=12423 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ほらな。まあ、<手前|テメエ>がバカだって自覚している分、気付いてない奴よりは付き合いやすい。"
msgstr "\"Hey, at least you're self-aware. It's easier than talking to someone who doesn't realize they're an idiot."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9640:12424: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0061; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9640
msgctxt "text_id=12424 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "この若さで情けは人のためならず、を<実践|じっせん>してる野郎はそうはいねえし」"
msgstr "There's not many people who realize that compassion is not for other people's benefit at such a young age.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9651:12425: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0092; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9651
msgctxt "text_id=12425 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……納得。たしかに、アンタと気が合いそうな性格ね」"
msgstr "\"That makes sense. I guess I can see how you two would get along then.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9684:12426: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0029; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9684
msgctxt "text_id=12426 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「え？　いやまいったなぁ！"
msgstr "\"Wait, huh?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9690:12427: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0030; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9690
msgctxt "text_id=12427 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　なんだよ二人とも、いくらオレでも照れるじゃんか。いま、オレのこと褒めてなかった？」"
msgstr "  Are you both trying to pick on me? I thought you were praising me just now!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9696:12428: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0062; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9696
msgctxt "text_id=12428 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「褒めてねえ」"
msgstr "\"We're not praising you.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9702:12429: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0093; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9702
msgctxt "text_id=12429 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「褒めてないわよ」"
msgstr "\"Definitely not.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9708:12430: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0031; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9708
msgctxt "text_id=12430 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「うん、ですよね」"
msgstr "\"Hmph, thought so.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9768:12431: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9768
msgctxt "text_id=12431 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　木乃美を先頭に、青子たちは問題のアルバイト先へと到着した。"
msgstr "  With Kinomi leading the way, Aoko and Tobimaru arrived at the part-time job in question."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9773:12432: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9773
msgctxt "text_id=12432 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駅前の新繁華街から奥に移動し、気持ち、いかがわしい空気ただよう二丁目。"
msgstr "  They moved past the new entertainment district in front of the station and into the seedy part of 2nd Street."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9778:12433: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9778
msgctxt "text_id=12433 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子が草十郎を見失った場所とぴったり符合する。"
msgstr "  Aoko pointed to where she had lost Soujyuro when she was following him."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9800:12434: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0094; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9800
msgctxt "text_id=12434 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「このあたりね。木乃美君、そのバイト先ってどこ？」"
msgstr "\"It was right around here. So Kinomi, where is this place?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9806:12435: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0032; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9806
msgctxt "text_id=12435 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「えーと、あのへん」"
msgstr "\"Umm, just over there.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9823:12436: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9823
msgctxt "text_id=12436 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　木乃美が指さしたのは四階建てのオフィスビルだ。"
msgstr "  Kinomi pointed at a four-story office building."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9828:12437: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9828
msgctxt "text_id=12437 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　入り口は一階の端にあり、パッと見はマンションに見える。"
msgstr "  The entrance was on one side of the first floor. At first glance, it looked no different from an apartment complex."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9848:12438: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9848
msgctxt "text_id=12438 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一階の通路はビルの裏側まで続いている。"
msgstr "  The hallway on the first floor continued around to the back of the building."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9853:12439: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9853
msgctxt "text_id=12439 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　階段はその通路のはじめ、入り口から入ってすぐ正面に造られていた。"
msgstr "  The stairs were located at the beginning of that hallway and were the first thing you saw after entering."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9874:12440: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0095; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9874
msgctxt "text_id=12440 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ちょっと、そこの路地裏に入りましょう」"
msgstr "\"Let's go into that back alley.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9896:12441: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9896
msgctxt "text_id=12441 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ササッと人目につかない路地裏に移動する青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko hurried off into the back alley where they were not likely to be seen."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9901:12442: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9901
msgctxt "text_id=12442 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　風俗店の多い界隈で学生三人は目立つからだ。"
msgstr "  Three students stuck out like a sore thumb in an entertainment district like this."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9932:12443: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0096; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9932
msgctxt "text_id=12443 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「で、中はどうなってんの？"
msgstr "\"So what goes on in here?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9938:12444: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0097; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9938
msgctxt "text_id=12444 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　事務所って言ってたけど、どんな仕事？」"
msgstr "  You said it was an office, but what's the work like?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9951:12445: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0033; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9951
msgctxt "text_id=12445 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「？　オレに訊いてんの？　やだなあ、オレが知ってるのはここまでだぜ？　オレだって先輩に言われただけで、中のコトなんて知らないし。草十郎をここまで連れてきたら、先輩が紹介料くれただけだし」"
msgstr "\"Huh? You're asking me? That's literally all I know. I just heard about the job from that student. I don't know the details. I brought Soujyuro here, they gave me the money, and that was it.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9989:12446: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9989
msgctxt "text_id=12446 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最有力容疑者はここにきて無知をさらけ出した。"
msgstr "  Their top suspect just admitted he knew no further details."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:9994:12447: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:9994
msgctxt "text_id=12447 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　共犯者、もしくは主犯と思われた木乃美芳助は、その実、はた迷惑なだけの通行人Ａにすぎなかったのである。"
msgstr "  Housuke Kinomi, co-defendant, or perhaps who they thought may have been the main culprit, was really no more than an annoying witness."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10020:12448: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0098; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10020
msgctxt "text_id=12448 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……まいった。ここまで無責任だといっそ<清々|すがすが>しい。"
msgstr "\"...Well, this is no good. I still can't believe you're this irresponsible, Kinomi."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10031:12449: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0099; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10031
msgctxt "text_id=12449 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ところで木乃美君、西部劇とか見たコトある？"
msgstr "  Have you ever seen any westerns?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10031:12450: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0099; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10031
msgctxt "text_id=12450 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　役にたたない情報提供者の末路とか、ご存じかしら？」"
msgstr "  Do you know what they do with informants who are no longer useful?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10054:12451: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0034; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10054
msgctxt "text_id=12451 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「い、いやあ、オレ映画って苦手なんだよ。"
msgstr "\"I-I don't really watch many movies, honestly."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10054:12452: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0034; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10054
msgctxt "text_id=12452 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　でも『セーラー服と機関銃』なら見た。主演目当てで」"
msgstr "  I have seen \"Sailor Suit and Machine Gun\" though. Mostly because I think the lead actress is hot.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10082:12453: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0100; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10082
msgctxt "text_id=12453 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そ、残念ね。『夕陽のガンマン』ぐらいは見とけば良かったのに。ま、どうあれ情報提供者は悲惨な死をとげるんだけど」"
msgstr "\"Ah, that's too bad. You should at least watch For a Few Dollars More sometime. The informant in that film meets an untimely demise, by the way.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10091:12454: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0035; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10091
msgctxt "text_id=12454 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「ちょっ、やる気満々だぜこの女！　殿下、こんな<凶獣|きょうじゅう>ほったらかしにしちゃまずいって、首輪とかつけないとさあ！」"
msgstr "\"A-Are you serious? Your Highness! You need to put a collar on this girl! She's like a wild dog over here!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10117:12455: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0036; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10117
msgctxt "text_id=12455 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「……って槻司？　なんだよしけた顔しちゃって。"
msgstr "\"...Tsukiji? Why are you making that face?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10123:12456: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0037; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10123
msgctxt "text_id=12456 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　あのビルがなにか知ってんの？」"
msgstr "  Do you know something about that building?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10150:12457: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0063; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10150
msgctxt "text_id=12457 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……まずいな。"
msgstr "\"...This is bad."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10156:12458: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0064; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10156
msgctxt "text_id=12458 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　知ってるも何も、ありゃあ最近やってきた詐欺まがいのセールス屋だ。英会話セットの販売と何ら変わらねえ」"
msgstr "  I know all about it. They're a fraudulent sales company that just came into town. They're a complete racket.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10191:12459: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10191
msgctxt "text_id=12459 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やはりそうか、と憂鬱になる青子と、"
msgstr "  Aoko was sad to hear that the truth was as bad as she thought."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10196:12460: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10196
msgctxt "text_id=12460 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　英会話セット？　と首をかしげる木乃美。"
msgstr "  Kinomi seemed confused as usual."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10231:12461: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0101; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10231
msgctxt "text_id=12461 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それ、確かなの鳶丸？」"
msgstr "\"Are you sure about that?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10237:12462: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0065; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10237
msgctxt "text_id=12462 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ああ。親父の秘書さんから聞いた話だ、間違いない。"
msgstr "\"Definitely. My dad heard it from his secretary, and she wouldn't lie."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10243:12463: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0066; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10243
msgctxt "text_id=12463 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　表向きは新興宗教なんだが、やってるコトは<羽毛布団|うもうぶとん>の販売だとさ。じいさまばあさま相手に質の低い羽毛布団を高額で売りつけているらしい」"
msgstr "  They front as a kind of new religion, but they're actually selling down quilts. They target the elderly and sell them these super low quality quilts at extremely marked up prices.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10264:12464: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0067; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10264
msgctxt "text_id=12464 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「あの事務所も貸事務所だ。一ヶ月もこの街で稼いだらあっさりドロンするつもりだろう。"
msgstr "\"That's a leased office, so after they make their money here for a month or so, they're probably planning on skipping town."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10270:12465: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0068; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10270
msgctxt "text_id=12465 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　……間違いなく草十郎は騙されてるな。最高のカモだろ、詐欺師にとっちゃ」"
msgstr "  Soujyuro is most certainly being scammed. He's the perfect target for a group like that.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10289:12466: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10289
msgctxt "text_id=12466 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ガックリと肩を落とす鳶丸。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru slumped his shoulders in defeat."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10294:12467: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10294
msgctxt "text_id=12467 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、青子はもう完全に戦闘状態に移行していた。"
msgstr "  Aoko, however, was already in full on battle mode."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10319:12468: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0102; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10319
msgctxt "text_id=12468 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「よし潰す。そのあと木乃美は学校の旗のところに<吊|つる>す」"
msgstr "\"I'll put a stop to this. And then I'm going to string you up on the school's flagpole, Kinomi!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10333:12469: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0038; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10333
msgctxt "text_id=12469 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「え、<直|じか>？　今の台詞だと<縄|なわ>じゃなくて首？　<脊髄|せきずい>にぐっさり？　殺人？」"
msgstr "\"What?! You mean you're going to hang me?! That's murder, you know!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10346:12470: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0069; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10346
msgctxt "text_id=12470 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「あ、いや待て蒼崎。それだと辻褄が合わん。"
msgstr "\"Wait a second, Aozaki. Something's not right here."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10352:12471: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0070; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10352
msgctxt "text_id=12471 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　草十郎は大金を持ってたんだよな？　それじゃカモとは呼べねえぞ」"
msgstr "  Soujyuro had wads of cash, right? Then how is he being scammed?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10391:12472: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0103; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10391
msgctxt "text_id=12472 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……そう言えばそうだった。木乃美君の発言に気を取られすぎて、あの大金のコトを忘れてた。"
msgstr "\"Hmm... You're right. I got so caught up with Kinomi that I forgot about all the money."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10402:12473: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0104; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10402
msgctxt "text_id=12473 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あれ、ってコトは、まさか―――」"
msgstr "  So does that mean...?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10413:12474: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0071; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10413
msgctxt "text_id=12474 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ああ。騙されている側だったら金は減っていく。"
msgstr "\"Right. If he was being scammed, he'd be the one losing money."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10419:12475: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0072; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10419
msgctxt "text_id=12475 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　……だが増えてるなら話は別だ。考えたくねえが、草十郎のヤツはセールス側に回ってるんじゃないか？」"
msgstr "  But he's making money. I hope it isn't true, but maybe Soujyuro's the one doing the scamming.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10460:12476: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0105; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10460
msgctxt "text_id=12476 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……信じられない。草十郎が、詐欺グループの一員になっている、ですって―――？」"
msgstr "\"...I can't believe it. Do you really think he'd join a group of scammers?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10473:12477: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0039; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10473
msgctxt "text_id=12477 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「はあ？　まっさかあ。静希に騙されるようなヤツはいねーよぉ。だいたい嘘つけないじゃんアイツ。羽毛布団を売りさばくとか、ぜったい無理だって」"
msgstr "\"Pfft, are you kidding me? Who in their right mind would be duped by Sizuki? He couldn't lie his way outta a paper bag! There's no way he's out here scheming.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10498:12478: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0073; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10498
msgctxt "text_id=12478 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「だから、草十郎自身それが悪質なサギだと気づいてないんじゃないか？　アイツはアイツで、心からいいものだと思って売ってるんだよ。真心の固まりで」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, but maybe he doesn't realize what he's doing is scamming people. He probably really believes he's selling a good product.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10510:12479: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0040_0; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10510
msgctxt "text_id=12479 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「おお！　なるほど、そりゃ納得だ！　あの純真さがお年寄りに大人気ってワケだな！　やるじゃん静希、今度あったらオレもお<裾|すそ>分けしてもら、"
msgstr "\"That makes sense! His pure innocence is probably just the thing old folks like to see in a salesman! Maybe he'll give me a cut of his profits next time I see him―"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10528:12480: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0040_1; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10528
msgctxt "text_id=12480 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "あいたぁ!?」"
msgstr " Owwwww?!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10573:12481: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0106; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10573
msgctxt "text_id=12481 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……木乃美君の更生は今後の課題として。"
msgstr "\"Looks like I'll have to teach you a lesson later after all."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10579:12482: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0107; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10579
msgctxt "text_id=12482 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　どうしよう鳶丸？　もう少し様子を見た方がいいと思う？仮に静希君が関わってたら、彼にも詐欺罪が適用される？　まだ未成年だけど」"
msgstr "  So what do we do, Tobimaru? Do we wait it out and gather more information? If he's really involved, he could be arrested for fraud. Though he is still a minor at least.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10590:12483: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0074; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10590
msgctxt "text_id=12483 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「あくまで従業員だから実刑はかからねえとは思うが、敵さんはアレで食ってる連中だからな。草十郎が雇われた時の、契約書の内容次第だ」"
msgstr "\"If he's just an employee, he probably won't get any kind of real sentence. I guess it all depends on what his contract said when they hired him.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10629:12484: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0108; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10629
msgctxt "text_id=12484 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そう。そうよね。下手したら草十郎自身、もう入会してるかもしれない」"
msgstr "\"Yeah that's true. He might already be a member of their group by now.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10635:12485: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10635
msgctxt "text_id=12485 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気が付けば、青子の顔つきは冷徹なものに変わっていた。"
msgstr "  Aoko looked a lot more cool-headed now."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10647:12486: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10647
msgctxt "text_id=12486 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生徒会役員として一年以上付き合ってきた鳶丸だ。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru had been serving with her on the student council for over a year."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10652:12487: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10652
msgctxt "text_id=12487 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こういう時の彼女が何を考えているか、言われずとも分かっている。"
msgstr "  He knew exactly what she was thinking at a time like this."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10685:12488: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0075; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10685
msgctxt "text_id=12488 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「入会していたら脱会は難しいな。アイツ本人にその気がなくとも、<判子|はんこ>の力は絶大だ。"
msgstr "\"If he's signed a contract, it's going to be hard to get him out of it. Even if he wants to leave, it's legally binding."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10691:12489: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0076; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10691
msgctxt "text_id=12489 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　……それで蒼崎、どこまでやる気だ？」"
msgstr "  ...How far do you wanna go with this?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10697:12490: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0109; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10697
msgctxt "text_id=12490 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「営業停止は最低ライン。信仰は自由だっていうなら、よその土地でやってもらうまでよ」"
msgstr "\"We have to at least stop their business. If they want to say they're free to practice their beliefs, they'll have to go worship elsewhere.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10718:12491: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0077; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10718
msgctxt "text_id=12491 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「だろうなあ、そんな顔してるぜおまえさん。"
msgstr "\"I could tell by the look on your face you weren't messing around."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10724:12492: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0078; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10724
msgctxt "text_id=12492 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　で、草十郎はどうする？　とりあえず辞めさせるか？」"
msgstr "  What do we do about Soujyuro, then? Get him to quit first?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10730:12493: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0110; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10730
msgctxt "text_id=12493 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「当然。けど、もう彼だけの問題じゃないわ。そもそもうちの生徒を雇おうとした時点で私たちの問題よ。"
msgstr "\"Of course. This isn't only his problem anymore. The fact that they're trying to recruit our students makes it our problem too."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10736:12494: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0111; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10736
msgctxt "text_id=12494 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　静希君とは関係なしで、あの事務所<潰|つぶ>すから」"
msgstr "  We have to take them down, regardless of Sizuki's involvement.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10784:12495: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0079; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10784
msgctxt "text_id=12495 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……いいけどな。厄介だぞあの手の連中は。サラ金と同じで法律上は何の問題もねえ。"
msgstr "\"Fine, but you know they won't go down without a fight. They're technically a legal business, just like predatory loan services."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10791:12496: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0080; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10791
msgctxt "text_id=12496 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "警察じゃせいぜい厳重注意レベル、下手に商売の邪魔をすれば<損害|そんがい><賠償|ばいしょう>と言いだしかねん。急いては事をなんとやらだ」"
msgstr "The police can only give them a warning, and if we disrupt their business, they'll try and sue us for damages. We shouldn't rush into this.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10803:12497: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0112_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10803
msgctxt "text_id=12497 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「分かってる。まずは会社の概要と社長の素性、構成員の数を調べながら被害者の洗い出し、"
msgstr "\"I know. First we need to find out more about the company, who their president is, and how many employees they have. We also need to look for possible victims, "

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10815:12498: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0112_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10815
msgctxt "text_id=12498 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "を―――」"
msgstr "then we can...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10836:12499: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10836
msgctxt "text_id=12499 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静かに、しかし大胆に密談していた青子の口が止まる。"
msgstr "  Aoko suddenly stopped talking in the middle of her detailed plans."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10848:12500: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0081_0; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10848
msgctxt "text_id=12500 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「どうした蒼崎―――って、"
msgstr "\"What's wrong?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10860:12501: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0081_1; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10860
msgctxt "text_id=12501 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "げ」"
msgstr " Ah...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10865:12502: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10865
msgctxt "text_id=12502 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　物陰からオフィスビルを覗いていた鳶丸もその変化に気付いたようだ。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru noticed right away what Aoko had spotted."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10900:12503: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10900
msgctxt "text_id=12503 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の視線は通りの雑踏に向けられている。"
msgstr "  Aoko was looking at the crowd on the street."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10910:12504: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10910
msgctxt "text_id=12504 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見慣れたコート姿の少年がいかがわしい二丁目を歩いている。"
msgstr "  A familiar young man wearing a coat was walking through the lively 2nd Street."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10947:12505: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10947
msgctxt "text_id=12505 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年はわずかな迷いもなくオフィスビルまでやってくると、トコトコと足音をたてて入り口に消えていった。"
msgstr "  He walked confidently up to the office building and disappeared inside."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10957:12506: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10957
msgctxt "text_id=12506 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　物陰に隠れている青子たちの気苦労もどこ吹く風。"
msgstr "  He hadn't seemed to notice the worried trio watching from the shadows."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10962:12507: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10962
msgctxt "text_id=12507 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年……静希草十郎は軽い足取りで、自分が騙されている事にも気付かず、今日も一日、まじめに働きに来たらしい。"
msgstr "  The young man, clearly Soujyuro Sizuki, had just started his shift, still oblivious to the severity of the situation he was in."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:10995:12508: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0113; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:10995
msgctxt "text_id=12508 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あ、あ、あの―――」"
msgstr "\"That... that... little...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11001:12509: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11001
msgctxt "text_id=12509 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は肩を震わせながら、<懸命|けんめい>に怒りを<堪|こら>えている。"
msgstr "  Aoko was shaking with rage."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11022:12510: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0082; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11022
msgctxt "text_id=12510 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「待て、落ち着け蒼崎。"
msgstr "\"Calm down."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11022:12511: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0082; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11022
msgctxt "text_id=12511 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　気持ちは分かるが、あいつに悪気はだな」"
msgstr "  I know how you feel, but he doesn't realize what he's doing.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11043:12512: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0114; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11043
msgctxt "text_id=12512 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ああもう、なんか無性にあったまきたー！」"
msgstr "\"Ahhhhh! I just can't stand this!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11063:12513: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11063
msgctxt "text_id=12513 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　がばり、と俯いていた顔をあげ、拳を握る。"
msgstr "  Aoko raised her head up in a fury and clenched her fists."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11069:12514: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11069
msgctxt "text_id=12514 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこにあるのはいつもの冷淡な彼女ではなく、"
msgstr "  She was no longer her usual calm and collected self."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11074:12515: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11074
msgctxt "text_id=12515 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正義と<義憤|ぎふん>と個人的な感情で燃え上がる、鉄の生徒会長の姿だった。"
msgstr "  This was the student council president who ruled with an iron fist, fueled by her own righteous indignation."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11129:12516: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0115; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11129
msgctxt "text_id=12516 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「鳶丸、応援団の<美濃|みの>先輩に連絡とって、いますぐ強面の団員二十人ほど集めてきて！"
msgstr "\"Tobimaru, call up Mino and tell him we need twenty of the most intimidating guys from his team here immediately!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11136:12517: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0116; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11136
msgctxt "text_id=12517 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ケンカになるかもしれないから、それなりの装備こみでって！」"
msgstr "  Tell them to gear up because we might have a fight on our hands!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11142:12518: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11142
msgctxt "text_id=12518 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言いつつ、青子は表通りに飛びだした。"
msgstr "  Aoko darted out into the main street as she barked her orders."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11147:12519: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11147
msgctxt "text_id=12519 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その姿は<敵陣突入|カチコミ>にいく番長そのものである。"
msgstr "  She looked like an esteemed general charging into battle against an enemy squadron."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11173:12520: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0083; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11173
msgctxt "text_id=12520 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「美濃って応援団の団長のか!?"
msgstr "\"Mino? You mean the captain of the cheer squad?!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11173:12521: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0083; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11173
msgctxt "text_id=12521 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　しかも二十人って、おまえいったい何する気だ!?」"
msgstr "  Also, twenty guys?! What the hell are you planning on doing?!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11199:12522: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0117; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11199
msgctxt "text_id=12522 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「決まってるでしょ、殴り込みよ！"
msgstr "\"What do you think?! We're gonna crack some skulls!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11206:12523: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0118_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11206
msgctxt "text_id=12523 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　まずは法律面での制裁から、なんて考えが甘かった！"
msgstr "  We won't get anywhere trying to make this into a legal battle!"

msgctxt "text_id=12524 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　学生だまして私腹を肥やすような悪党には物理的な制裁で十分よ！　そもそもスケールが小さいっての！　"
msgstr "  Any organization that's grooming students into committing crimes on their behalf will only answer to physical force!  "

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11221:12525: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0118_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11221
msgctxt "text_id=12525 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "なによ『ほんものの光』って、こんなしけた町で羽毛布団とか売ってんなー！」"
msgstr "I mean, what is this 'Light of Truth' garbage on their sign?! They can't just come into our town and sell their dingy down quilts to our unsuspecting citizens!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11248:12526: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0084; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11248
msgctxt "text_id=12526 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「待て落ち着け、さっきまでの平和的な<対処法|プラン>はどこにいった!?　悪党を暴力で押さえつけていいのは警察だけだ！　いいから戻りやがれ！」"
msgstr "\"Okay, just calm down! What happened to our peaceful plan just a minute ago? Only the police are allowed to use violence against criminals! Come back here!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11271:12527: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0119; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11271
msgctxt "text_id=12527 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ちょっ！"
msgstr "\"Hey!"

msgctxt "text_id=12528 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "」"
msgstr "\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11327:12529: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0120; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11327
msgctxt "text_id=12529 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なによ！　その警察が使えないから私たちが出張るんじゃない！　文句あるなら代案だせ！」"
msgstr "\"What was that for?! We're doing this precisely because you said the police can't do much! If you have a problem with it, then come up with a better plan!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11354:12530: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0085; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11354
msgctxt "text_id=12530 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「文句はねえ、まず落ち着けって話だ！"
msgstr "\"I don't necessarily have a problem with it, I'm just telling you to calm down for a minute!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11360:12531: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0086; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11360
msgctxt "text_id=12531 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　そもそも代案なんざ立てるまでもねえ。おまえさん、さっきはどんな手を考えてたか口にしてみろ。まずは法律面での制裁を、とか言ってただろう」"
msgstr "  I haven't had time to think of an alternative plan, even if I wanted to. What were you thinking of earlier? You said something about going through the legal system.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11386:12532: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0121; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11386
msgctxt "text_id=12532 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そんなのアンタだって分かってるでしょ。"
msgstr "\"You know what I was getting at."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11392:12533: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0122; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11392
msgctxt "text_id=12533 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あの会社の調査と並行して、詐欺の被害にあった人たちを探して、私たちが間に入って連盟を作る。"
msgstr "  While we investigate the company, we should also help victims of the scam come together."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11398:12534: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0123; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11398
msgctxt "text_id=12534 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ご老人ばかりを標的にしてるのは、お爺さんたちは世間の事情に<疎|うと>いとみくびってるからだろうし。"
msgstr "  The reason why this company is targeting the elderly is likely because they're out of touch with the times."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11404:12535: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0124; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11404
msgctxt "text_id=12535 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　なんで、お爺さんたちだけじゃ分からない問題を私たちでフォローしてあげれば、被害者の会ぐらいは作れるわ」"
msgstr "  If we can help them understand this issue, they'll be able to work together.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11425:12536: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0087; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11425
msgctxt "text_id=12536 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「よし、その調子だ。"
msgstr "\"That sounds great."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11432:12537: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0088; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11432
msgctxt "text_id=12537 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "たしかにひとりひとりでかけ合っても連中にとっちゃ痛くもかゆくもねえ。横の繋がりを作るのは大事だからな。"
msgstr "The victims will be able to do more if they work together as a group, rather than as individuals."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11438:12538: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0089; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11438
msgctxt "text_id=12538 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　それで？　契約をなかった事にして、とられた金を取り戻すか？」"
msgstr "  Then what? If we assume there was no kind of contract involved, we just try and get their money back?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11465:12539: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0125; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11465
msgctxt "text_id=12539 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……それは無理でしょうね。"
msgstr "\"...Yeah, but that's probably going to be impossible."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11471:12540: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0126; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11471
msgctxt "text_id=12540 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　契約書は絶対よ。あったまくるけど、書かれた事はくつがえらない。今から出来るのはこれ以上の被害を抑えるコトだけ。ローンの解約、入会の破棄、それと―――」"
msgstr "  They almost definitely will have a contract. It's annoying, but if they signed something, we can't overturn that. All we can do now is try and stop the damages from getting worse. Cancel loans, cancel memberships, and...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11477:12541: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0090; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11477
msgctxt "text_id=12541 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「それと？」"
msgstr "\"And?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11518:12542: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0127; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11518
msgctxt "text_id=12542 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「可能なかぎり、金銭を回収する。"
msgstr "\"Get as much money back as we can."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11524:12543: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0128; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11524
msgctxt "text_id=12543 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　羽毛布団ならクーリングオフが適用されるはず。全ての返品は無理でも、やるにこしたことはないわ」"
msgstr "  There should be a cooling-off period for the down quilts, so some might be able to get a refund.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11575:12544: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0091; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11575
msgctxt "text_id=12544 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「上出来だ。それで行こうぜ蒼崎。"
msgstr "\"That sounds like a plan. Let's go with that."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11581:12545: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0092; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11581
msgctxt "text_id=12545 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　何もおまえさんが悪役になる必要はねえ。せっかくの法治国家だ、平和的に解決しよう」"
msgstr "  There's no need for you to become the bad guy here. Let's try to solve this peacefully and within the law.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11592:12546: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0129; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11592
msgctxt "text_id=12546 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それはそうだけど……こんなの部外者だから言えることよ。詐欺にあった人たちからすれば、<奪|と>られたものは奪られたままなんだし……」"
msgstr "\"That's true, but it's easy for you to say that since you weren't one of the victims. For those that were scammed, that money is lost forever.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11637:12547: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0093; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11637
msgctxt "text_id=12547 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「それを気に病むのは、それこそおまえの仕事じゃねえ。"
msgstr "\"Yeah, but it's not your job to worry about that."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11643:12548: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0094; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11643
msgctxt "text_id=12548 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　まずは<久|く><万|ま><梨|り>に連絡しよう。あいつ、商店街の娘だからな。被害者の調査に向いているだろ」"
msgstr "  We should get in touch with Kumari. She was raised in the shopping district and should know the best way to go about things.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11669:12549: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0130; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11669
msgctxt "text_id=12549 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「<金鹿|こじか>に？"
msgstr "\"Kojika?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11676:12550: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0131; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11676
msgctxt "text_id=12550 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……あんまり<荒事|あらごと>に巻きこみたくないけど、仕方ないか。"
msgstr "  ...I hate to get her involved in this, but we don't have much of a choice."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11683:12551: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0132; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11683
msgctxt "text_id=12551 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "ＯＫ、私の方から連絡する。鳶丸は<美|み><濃|の>先輩への電話、お願い」"
msgstr "Okay, I'll get in touch with her. I still need you to call up Mino.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11709:12552: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0095; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11709
msgctxt "text_id=12552 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「あ？　こっちの話なら応援団、必要ねえだろ？」"
msgstr "\"Huh? Why do we still need the cheer squad with this plan?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11735:12553: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0133; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11735
msgctxt "text_id=12553 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「必要だってば。脅し要員だけじゃなく、お爺さん<間|かん>の連携に走ってもらわなくっちゃ。"
msgstr "\"They're good for more than just intimidation. They can help support the victims when we find them."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11741:12554: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0134; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11741
msgctxt "text_id=12554 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　先輩たち、いかつい顔して優しいでしょ？　クーリングオフは書面に起こす事が大前提。書類に弱いお爺さんたちの代わりに、先輩たちに代筆してもらうのよ」"
msgstr "  I know Mino's team looks scary, but they're all good at heart, right? Once we've made sure there's a cooling-off period for those contracts, they can take care of the paperwork for them.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11777:12555: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0096; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11777
msgctxt "text_id=12555 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「なるほど、そりゃあいい！　数の暴力だな、連中も二十人からの返品は夢にも思ってねえだろうさ！」"
msgstr "\"That's not a bad idea! I bet those idiots won't know what to do when twenty big strong guys come in demanding refunds!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11783:12556: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11783
msgctxt "text_id=12556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うんうんと頷きあう青子と鳶丸。"
msgstr "  Aoko and Tobimaru both nodded in agreement."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11788:12557: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11788
msgctxt "text_id=12557 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　端で見ている木乃美は完全に置いてけぼりだ。"
msgstr "  Kinomi had been completely left to the wayside in this whole discussion."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11824:12558: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0041; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11824
msgctxt "text_id=12558 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「なー。クーリングオフってなんだよー？"
msgstr "\"Hey, so... What's a cooling-off period?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11830:12559: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0042; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11830
msgctxt "text_id=12559 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　オレ、聞いたことねぇんだけど」"
msgstr "  I've never heard of it.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11843:12560: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0135; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11843
msgctxt "text_id=12560 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「買った商品を返品して、購入時の金額を返して貰うコトよ。日本じゃ十年ぐらい前から正式に採用されてるけど、木乃美君、聞いたことない？」"
msgstr "\"It's a clause that allows you to return an item you purchased and get a refund for the full amount paid at the time of purchase. It was officially put into practice in Japan about ten years ago. You really haven't heard of it?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11869:12561: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0043; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11869
msgctxt "text_id=12561 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「いやまったく。ただの返品と違うの？」"
msgstr "\"No, never. How is that any different from a normal return?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11880:12562: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0136; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11880
msgctxt "text_id=12562 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「同じだけど、こっちは国が後ろ盾になってくれるわ。ほんものの光が法を盾にするなら、こっちも法で突き破るだけよ。"
msgstr "\"Well, it's the same, but it's just legally protected. If the Light of Truth wants to use the law to their advantage, then we can do the same."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11886:12563: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0137; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11886
msgctxt "text_id=12563 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　お爺さんたちには馴染みのない話だろうから、そこは私たちが代わりにやるってワケ」"
msgstr "  The elderly victims probably won't know a thing about it either, so that's why we're going to fight for them.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11921:12564: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11921
msgctxt "text_id=12564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　実際のところ、クーリングオフの選定商品には細かい指定があり、ほんものの光が扱っている商品がその規定内かは現状<定|さだ>かではない。"
msgstr "  In reality, only a very narrow range of products were applicable for the satisfaction period law, and it was currently unclear if those handled by the Light of Truth fell under that umbrella."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11926:12565: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11926
msgctxt "text_id=12565 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もし規定外であるならクーリングオフ制度による金銭回収はできず、青子は別の手段を講じる必要がある。"
msgstr "  If it was not applicable under this law, Aoko would have to think of another plan."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11946:12566: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11946
msgctxt "text_id=12566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……もっとも。"
msgstr "  However..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11951:12567: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11951
msgctxt "text_id=12567 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三十分後、実際に売られた羽毛布団を調べた時点で、その不安材料は霧散することになるのだが。"
msgstr "  Not thirty minutes later, that worry would vanish when they got the chance to examine an actual quilt sold by the Light of Truth."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11987:12568: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11987
msgctxt "text_id=12568 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　方針さえ決めてしまえば青子に迷いはない。"
msgstr "  Once Aoko has an established plan, she will not waver from it."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11992:12569: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11992
msgctxt "text_id=12569 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　オフィスビルを見渡せる喫茶店を司令室に、"
msgstr "  They had made a cafe with a view of the office building their command center."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:11997:12570: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:11997
msgctxt "text_id=12570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生徒会の人材を手足にし、"
msgstr "  And, after they got together others from the student council for backup..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12002:12571: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12002
msgctxt "text_id=12571 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一日かぎりの電撃作戦がはじまった。"
msgstr "  Their one-day blitz tactic plan began."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12037:12572: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0138; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12037
msgctxt "text_id=12572 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうと決まれば迅速にね。"
msgstr "\"I want this over with quickly."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12045:12573: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0139; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12045
msgctxt "text_id=12573 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　二人とも連絡係よろしく。サクッと、今日中に決着をつけましょ」"
msgstr "  You two, take care of all the communications. Let's get this done today.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12079:12574: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12079
msgctxt "text_id=12574 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一日で終わらせる気かよ、と呆れる副会長と、"
msgstr "  Tobimaru sighed at the thought of trying to complete everything in a day's time."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12084:12575: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12084
msgctxt "text_id=12575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんでオレまで数に入ってんの？　と嫌がる事件の発端を使いに出して、青子はクーリングオフ以外の手はないかと資料を読み<耽|ふけ>っている。"
msgstr "  Kinomi, on the other hand, wondered why he had been dragged in to help."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12090:12576: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12090
msgctxt "text_id=12576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸にはタンカを切ったものの、青子自身、クーリングオフ作戦は難しいと理解していたからだ。"
msgstr "  Although Tobimaru had gotten Aoko to abandon the idea of a physical fight, Aoko knew that the contact plan would be difficult to pull off and continued to research other options."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12123:12577: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12123
msgctxt "text_id=12577 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　クーリングオフを成立させるには様々な条件がある。"
msgstr "  There were many conditions that needed to be met for this plan to actually work."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12128:12578: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12128
msgctxt "text_id=12578 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その中で最大のネックになるのが購買してからの経過時間だ。"
msgstr "  The major issue was the amount of time elapsed from the time of purchase."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12133:12579: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12133
msgctxt "text_id=12579 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　消耗品なら八日以内の返却でなければならない。"
msgstr "  For consumable goods, the time limit for a legal return was eight days."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12138:12580: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12138
msgctxt "text_id=12580 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　被害者が三十人いるとしても、該当するのは一人か二人だろう。"
msgstr "  If there were thirty or so victims, this would probably only be applicable to one or two of them."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12143:12581: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12143
msgctxt "text_id=12581 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　となると、クーリングオフ以外での、消費者の保護を扱った抜け道を探すしかない。"
msgstr "  If that was the case, they needed to look for some other consumer protection besides the satisfaction clause."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12174:12582: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0140; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12174
msgctxt "text_id=12582 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……なになに……安価なものを不当な金額で売りつけた場合、暴利行為として公序良俗違反で契約が無効となる場合がある……ただし公序良俗を根拠とする……って、なによこれ、ほとんど売る側の勝ちじゃない。"
msgstr "\"Wait, really...? If items of low value are sold at an unfair price, the contract may be invalidated as profiteering. However, this must be founded in public order and morality... Doesn't this generally always favor the seller?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12180:12583: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0141; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12180
msgctxt "text_id=12583 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　疑わしきは罰せずが法廷の基本だし。水掛け論じゃこっちが不利だ」"
msgstr "  The courts can't punish solely on the basis of suspicion. We'd be at the disadvantage if it came to an extended argument.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12212:12584: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12212
msgctxt "text_id=12584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが状況は<厳|きび>しい。"
msgstr "  It was a difficult situation."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12217:12585: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12217
msgctxt "text_id=12585 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　相手が<百戦錬磨|ひゃくせんれんま>の詐欺集団なら、素人の知識では太刀打ちできまい。"
msgstr "  They wouldn't be able to stand up to an experienced group of scam artists with their limited knowledge of the law."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12222:12586: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12222
msgctxt "text_id=12586 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最終的には同じ土俵での戦い―――詐欺には詐欺でまるめこむ事になる。"
msgstr "  They'd need to fight fire with fire. Or in this case, a scam with a scam."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12243:12587: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0142; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12243
msgctxt "text_id=12587 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……だまし取られた金額分だけ、美味しい話でだましとるって<寸法|はなし>か……」"
msgstr "\"...So basically we scam them out of the same amount of money they scammed out of the victims.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12249:12588: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12249
msgctxt "text_id=12588 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その場合であっても情報は必要だ。"
msgstr "  To do that, they'd need more intel."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12254:12589: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12254
msgctxt "text_id=12589 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は期末の一夜漬けもかくやという集中力で、かき集めた資料を頭に叩きこんでいく。"
msgstr "  Aoko was studying the materials they'd collected for something they could use."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12312:12590: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12312
msgctxt "text_id=12590 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「お待たせ。とりあえず追加候補十人分の住所と、布団の現物、持ってきたわよ」"
msgstr "\"Thanks for waiting, everyone. I've got the addresses of ten additional candidates and one of the actual quilts sold.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12318:12591: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_9000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12318
msgctxt "text_id=12591 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「サンキュー。さっすが久万梨、本気だせば仕事の速いこと速いこと」"
msgstr "\"Thank you. You really get things done fast when you put your mind to it!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12353:12592: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12353
msgctxt "text_id=12592 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生徒会書記・久万梨金鹿から被害者のリストを受け取って、すぐさま鳶丸の小型無線機に連絡をいれる。"
msgstr "  Aoko took the list of victims from the student council secretary, Kojika Kumari, and immediately contacted Tobimaru on his pager."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12358:12593: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12358
msgctxt "text_id=12593 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小<型無線|ポケベル>機は“連絡求む”程度の短いメッセージしか送信できないが、連絡手段を公衆電話に頼っている昨今では強力な通信装置だ。"
msgstr "  Although pagers could only receive short messages like 'Call me,' they were a powerful means of communication in an age where people relied on public telephones."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12363:12594: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12363
msgctxt "text_id=12594 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は折り返しで喫茶店に連絡を入れてきた鳶丸に新しい被害者たちを伝え、鳶丸たちの現状も報告してもらう。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru called the cafe to give Aoko an update and hear about the list of newly discovered victims."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12393:12595: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0143; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12393
msgctxt "text_id=12595 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「被害者の会はできたのね？　仕切りは青山クンにやらせて。一応、相手への牽制として名刺も作ってくれると助かる。"
msgstr "\"You've got all the victims together? Let Aoyama handle the proceedings. If you could get some business cards made up to throw them off, that'd be helpful too."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12402:12596: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0144; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12402
msgctxt "text_id=12596 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　事務局はほら、文化祭の時に作ったニセ団体あるじゃない。あそこの電話番号にしておいて。電話番は山城センセに頼みこむわ」"
msgstr "  Remember that fake organization we made up for the school festival? Use that and put that phone number on the cards. We can have Mr. Yamasiro field the calls.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12438:12597: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12438
msgctxt "text_id=12597 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　被害者友の会は現状で十人強。"
msgstr "  The victims' advocacy group was currently at just over ten members."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12443:12598: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12443
msgctxt "text_id=12598 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　返品、脱会を望む人々の力になるのが会の趣旨である。"
msgstr "  The group's aim was to help the victims of the scam get their money back and remove themselves from the Light of Truth."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12448:12599: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12448
msgctxt "text_id=12599 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも騙されていた事すら分かっていなかった人もおり、きちんと説明すれば二十人はたやすく超えるとの事だった。"
msgstr "  Some of the victims had not even realized they'd been scammed. So with some explanation, about ten more members were added."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12453:12600: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12453
msgctxt "text_id=12600 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　礼儀正しい学生服の好漢が説得にあたっているのも大きい。"
msgstr "  It helped that it was polite, young, well-dressed students who were giving them this information."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12458:12601: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12458
msgctxt "text_id=12601 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おじいさんおばあさんは基本、孫に対して<寛大|かんだい>なものである。"
msgstr "  The elderly generally seemed more accepting of anyone who was around the age of their grandchildren."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12493:12602: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0145; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12493
msgctxt "text_id=12602 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「にしてもよくここまで調べたもんだわ。規定の二十人なんてあっという間だったわね」"
msgstr "\"We've done a good job getting this far. We got our goal of twenty people in no time.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12526:12603: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_8DOT5_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12526
msgctxt "text_id=12603 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「アンタの言う条件が分かりやすかったから。"
msgstr "\"You laid out all the conditions clearly, which made it easy for us."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12532:12604: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_8DOT5_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12532
msgctxt "text_id=12604 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　六十歳過ぎのご老人で、ひとり暮らしで、町内会に入っていない人を探せば良かったんだし。やってる事はほんものの光の販売員と一緒。"
msgstr "  We looked for anyone over the age of sixty who lived alone and was not a member of their local neighborhood association. We just did exactly what the salespeople from the Light of Truth did."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12543:12605: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_8DOT5_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12543
msgctxt "text_id=12605 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　でも、こんなんでなんとかなる話じゃないと思うけど。"
msgstr "  Our work is just getting started though."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12550:12606: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_8DOT5_0005_0; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12550
msgctxt "text_id=12606 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　結局のところ、抗議するのが関の山じゃ―――"
msgstr "  It's still going to be all we can do to make a complaint against their..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12562:12607: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_8DOT5_0005_1; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12562
msgctxt "text_id=12607 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "蒼崎？"
msgstr "Aozaki?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12562:12608: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_8DOT5_0005_1; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12562
msgctxt "text_id=12608 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　ちょっと、なに薄気味悪い顔で笑ってるのよ」"
msgstr "  What's with the weird smile all of a sudden?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12582:12609: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12582
msgctxt "text_id=12609 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　友人に指摘され、青子は俯いていた顔をあげる。"
msgstr "  Aoko looked up after being called out by her friend."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12600:12610: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0146; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12600
msgctxt "text_id=12610 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いやあ、面白いもん見付けちゃって。"
msgstr "\"Oh, I just found something very interesting is all."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12606:12611: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0147; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12606
msgctxt "text_id=12611 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　成果の乏しい戦いになると思ってたけど、風向きが変わったわ。ほら、見てクマ。この羽毛布団のマーク」"
msgstr "  We may be fighting an uphill battle, but this might change the tides in our favor. Look here at this tag.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12612:12612: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_8DOT5_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12612
msgctxt "text_id=12612 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「？」"
msgstr "\"Hm?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12643:12613: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12643
msgctxt "text_id=12613 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は羽毛布団に縫いつけられた商品タグを久万梨に見せつけた。"
msgstr "  Aoko showed her the product label sewn into the down quilt."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12648:12614: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12648
msgctxt "text_id=12614 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　タグにはお馴染みのＪＩＳのマーク。"
msgstr "  There on the tag was what looked like the Japanese Industrial Standards logo."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12653:12615: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12653
msgctxt "text_id=12615 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　工業製品の品質を表すもので、ＪＩＳのマークがある商品は国が定めた工業標準化法に基づいている、のだが……"
msgstr "  The Japanese Industrial Standards helped maintain the quality of industrial products in Japan. Products with this mark were required to be produced in accordance with the Industrial Standardization Law."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12674:12616: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_8DOT5_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12674
msgctxt "text_id=12616 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あれ？　じぇい……える……えす？」"
msgstr "\"Huh? Jay... El... Ess?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12693:12617: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0148; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12693
msgctxt "text_id=12617 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そ。こうなると契約書が逆に武器になる。百戦錬磨かと思ったけど、実際は兎しか相手にしない素人ってコト。"
msgstr "\"Yep. This actually makes the contracts work in our favor. I thought we were dealing with professionals, but it turns out they're actually a group of amateurs."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12699:12618: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0149; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12699
msgctxt "text_id=12618 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……ええ、うまく話をもっていけば全額返済も夢じゃないわ。勝利の勝ちどきは、さぞ気持ちのいいものになるでしょうねぇ」"
msgstr "  If we do this right, we could get all the money back to the victims. It's going to feel so good to put these scammers in their place!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12723:12619: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12723
msgctxt "text_id=12619 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　にやりと笑って青子は席を立った。"
msgstr "  Aoko took a seat, still grinning from ear to ear."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12745:12620: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12745
msgctxt "text_id=12620 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸へのポケベルは鳴らさず、赤電話を鼻歌まじりにダイヤルする。"
msgstr "  She didn't ring Tobimaru's pager. Instead, she dialed a different number on the red phone while humming to herself."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12750:12621: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12750
msgctxt "text_id=12621 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　受話器からはお馴染みのコールの音がリピート中。"
msgstr "  Aoko heard the familiar ringing tone through the receiver."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12785:12622: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_8DOT5_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12785
msgctxt "text_id=12622 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「蒼崎？　槻司に連絡入れるんじゃないの？　作戦が変わったって」"
msgstr "\"Aozaki? I thought you were calling Tsukiji? You need to tell him about our change of plans.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12791:12623: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0150; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12791
msgctxt "text_id=12623 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それは後。いま大事なのは交渉役を誰にするかよ。私や鳶丸じゃさすがに貫禄不足だしね。"
msgstr "\"I will after this. Right now I have to figure out who to put in charge of the negotiations. I don't think Tobimaru or myself could do such an important role justice."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12797:12624: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0151; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12797
msgctxt "text_id=12624 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　こっちが有利になったとしても、まだ状況は五分だし。"
msgstr "  Even if we have the advantage for now, we're still in an evenly matched battle."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12803:12625: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0152; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12803
msgctxt "text_id=12625 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　会話次第じゃひっくり返されるだろうから、被害者の会の代表は、それはもう、性根のひん曲がった悪魔でないと」"
msgstr "  They could completely turn the tables on us in the discussions, so we need someone ruthless to represent us.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12829:12626: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_8DOT5_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12829
msgctxt "text_id=12626 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「それアンタの事だと思うんだけど。違うの？」"
msgstr "\"I thought that was going to be you.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12835:12627: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0153; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12835
msgctxt "text_id=12627 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いえいえ、こういうのは社会的立場のある大人じゃないと務まりません。"
msgstr "\"No, no, no. For this we need an adult with some kind of social standing."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12841:12628: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0154; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12841
msgctxt "text_id=12628 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　安心して久万梨、ぴったりのヤツを知ってるから」"
msgstr "  Don't worry. I actually know the perfect person for the job.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12875:12629: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0155; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12875
msgctxt "text_id=12629 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ま、詐欺師には詐欺師ってね。"
msgstr "\"Let's just say you need a scammer to fight a scammer."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12881:12630: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0156; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12881
msgctxt "text_id=12630 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　この町には人を言い負かすのだけが仕事のヤツっていちゃったりするのよ。今日もやることなくて暇してるだろうし、たまには働いてもらわないと。"
msgstr "  I know someone whose sole job is to win arguments against people in town. I doubt she has anything going on today, so I thought we might put her to work."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12887:12631: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0157; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12887
msgctxt "text_id=12631 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　彼女にかかっちゃサラ金だろうが教祖だろうが一時間で精神崩壊、<裸足|はだし>で山に逃げこむわ」"
msgstr "  Anyone who goes up against her is guaranteed to have a mental breakdown in an hour, no matter what kind of scam they're running.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12907:12632: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12907
msgctxt "text_id=12632 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これ以上ない嫌味を言いながら、青子は受話器に耳を当てる。"
msgstr "  Aoko kept the phone receiver at her ear as she delivered these cutting remarks."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12912:12633: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12912
msgctxt "text_id=12633 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ちなみに、受話器から漏れていたコール音はとっくに消えていた。"
msgstr "  The ringing tone had long since gone silent."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12945:12634: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12945
msgctxt "text_id=12634 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "『―――もしもし。まさかとは思いますが、今の話は私の事でしょうか、青子さん？』"
msgstr "\"...Hello? I don't want to assume anything, but were you talking about me this whole time Aoko?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12951:12635: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12951
msgctxt "text_id=12635 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　受話器から<流暢|りゅうちょう>な女性の声が響く。"
msgstr "  An eloquent woman's voice could be heard from the phone's earpiece."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:12956:12636: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:12956
msgctxt "text_id=12636 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は白々しく挨拶しながら、獲物が挑発にのってくれたとほくそ笑んだ。"
msgstr "  Aoko innocently said her greetings and smiled like a hunter who had just gotten their prey to take the bait."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13017:12637: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_8DOT5_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13017
msgctxt "text_id=12637 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「つねづね思っていましたが。"
msgstr "\"You know, I've always thought this about you..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13023:12638: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_8DOT5_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13023
msgctxt "text_id=12638 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　貴女には年長者への敬意が足りていないようですね、青子さん」"
msgstr "  But you really don't have enough respect for your elders, Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13047:12639: voice_id=X70_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=X70; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13047
msgctxt "text_id=12639 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「「へ？」」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13067:12640: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13067
msgctxt "text_id=12640 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　役割を終えて集結していた鳶丸たちが目を見張る。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru and Kinomi had returned from their tasks and stood there wide-eyed."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13072:12641: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13072
msgctxt "text_id=12641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の呼び出しでやってきた人物は、この場にはあまりにも不釣り合いで、予想外だったからだ。"
msgstr "  The person Aoko had invited to the cafe looked so out of place that it was a shock to everyone."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13113:12642: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0158; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13113
msgctxt "text_id=12642 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「はあい、<唯架|ゆいか>さん。わざわざ来てもらって助かるわ。"
msgstr "\"Thank you so much for coming, Yuika."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13119:12643: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0159; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13119
msgctxt "text_id=12643 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　事情は電話で説明したけど、もう少し詳しく説明する？」"
msgstr "  I pretty much told you all the details over the phone, but is there anything else you want me to go over?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13130:12644: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_8DOT5_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13130
msgctxt "text_id=12644 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「結構です。ほんものの光の事は、先ほど<律架|りつか>から報告を受けましたから。貴女に教授していただく事柄は一つもありません」"
msgstr "\"That's okay. I received a full report about the Light of Truth from Ritsuka. I do not require any lectures from you on that matter.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13156:12645: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0160; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13156
msgctxt "text_id=12645 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ありゃまご機嫌ななめ。良かった、そのテンションのままカチコミお願いね。一般人のひとりやふたり、唯架さんが本性をだせば睨むだけで<卒倒|そっとう>させられるでしょ？」"
msgstr "\"Well aren't we in a mood? That's perfect, though. Take that attitude to them. When you're in the zone, your glare alone is enough to make someone faint!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13174:12646: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0044; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13174
msgctxt "text_id=12646 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「うえ、そうなの!?　このお姉さん、合田教会のシスターさんだよね!?　オレ、ひそかに<憧|あこが>れてたんですけど！"
msgstr "\"Whoa, seriously?! Isn't this lady a nun at Aida Church? I actually really look up to her!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13180:12647: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0045; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13180
msgctxt "text_id=12647 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　あ、いや、そんな場合じゃねえ、どうも木乃美芳助ッス！　蒼崎サンとはあんまり仲良くありません！」"
msgstr "  Oh, crap, now is not the time. Umm, hi, my name's Housuke Kinomi! Aozaki and I aren't really friends!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13200:12648: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13200
msgctxt "text_id=12648 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　咄嗟に青子とシスターの仲が悪いと察し、さりげなくポイントアップを図る木乃美。"
msgstr "  Kinomi was clearly trying to earn points by showing that he also was not that friendly with Aoko."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13213:12649: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13213
msgctxt "text_id=12649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなやんちゃな青少年に、シスターは天使のような微笑みを投げるのだった。"
msgstr "  Sister Yuika gave him an angelic smile back."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13234:12650: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_8DOT5_0004; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13234
msgctxt "text_id=12650 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「これはご丁寧に。合田教会で僧職を勤める、<周|す><瀬|せ><唯架|ゆいか>です。はじめまして、芳助さん」"
msgstr "\"Well, hello there. I am indeed a sister at Aida Church. My name is Yuika Suse. It's a pleasure to meet you, Mr. Housuke.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13246:12651: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0046; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13246
msgctxt "text_id=12651 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「ひゃー！　すげえ、ホントにシスターだよシスター！"
msgstr "\"Ahhhhh! This is crazy! She's really a nun!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13246:12652: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0046; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13246
msgctxt "text_id=12652 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　会長とんでもない隠し球つれてきたな！"
msgstr "  I can't believe you had something this amazing up your sleeve the whole time, Aoko!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13258:12653: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0047; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13258
msgctxt "text_id=12653 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　……あれ？　でも、唯架さんに何してもらうの？　いや、オレはいてくれるだけで嬉しいけど」"
msgstr "  ...Wait, but what are you going to have her do? I mean, I'm fine with just having her around in general.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13296:12654: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0097; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13296
msgctxt "text_id=12654 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……まあ、だいたい想像できるが。"
msgstr "\"I think we can all imagine..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13307:12655: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0098; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13307
msgctxt "text_id=12655 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　はじめまして、シスター唯架。三咲高校生徒会副会長、槻司鳶丸です」"
msgstr "  It's a pleasure to meet you, Sister Yuika. My name is Tobimaru Tsukiji, student council vice-president.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13336:12656: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13336
msgctxt "text_id=12656 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、事の成り行きが読めたのか、鳶丸は元気がない。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru didn't look so well. Perhaps he had figured out where this course of events was headed."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13341:12657: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13341
msgctxt "text_id=12657 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ＪＬＳマークが違法であること。"
msgstr "  The JLS label was indeed illegal."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13346:12658: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13346
msgctxt "text_id=12658 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　羽毛布団が<偽物|バッタ>ものである事が判った時点で、青子は被害者たちの支払金の全額回収と、ほんものの光を町から追い出す算段を立てた。"
msgstr "  This discovery made Aoko realize how they could get the victims' money back and run the Light of Truth out of town completely."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13351:12659: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13351
msgctxt "text_id=12659 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その結論が、目の前のシスターだと察したからだ。"
msgstr "  Sister Yuika was her solution."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13384:12660: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0099; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13384
msgctxt "text_id=12660 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……てっきり証拠にものをいわせて、訴えられたくなければ示談ですませろ、全額返して出て行けー、って話かと思ったが。"
msgstr "\"...I thought the plan was to let the evidence do the talking, and if they don't want to be sued, get them to settle out of court. They'd pay back the money and get out of town."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13391:12661: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0100; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13391
msgctxt "text_id=12661 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "……恐ろしい女だぜ。追い出すだけじゃなく、<素寒貧|すかんぴん>にして放りだそうってハラか」"
msgstr "But this is something else. She doesn't want to just kick them out of town. She wants to fleece them for all they've got!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13409:12662: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0048; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13409
msgctxt "text_id=12662 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「は？　なんでそうなるの？　なに、美人なだけじゃなく、シスターさんってそんな権利持ってるの？」"
msgstr "\"Huh? How can she even do that? I mean, I know she's beautiful, but does a nun really have that kind of power?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13442:12663: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0161; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13442
msgctxt "text_id=12663 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「シスターさんが、じゃなくて唯架さんの人間力と言うべきね。はい、これ被害者の会からの連名書。一応、うちの応援団の先輩たちも待機してるけど、何人か連れていく？」"
msgstr "\"It's not because she's a nun. That's just the kind of pull Yuika has around here. Anyway, here's the signatures of everyone in the advocacy group. The cheer team is also helping. Do you want to take some of them?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13485:12664: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_8DOT5_0005; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13485
msgctxt "text_id=12664 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「……そうですね。<逆上|ぎゃくじょう>して手を上げられては後片づけが面倒ですので、抑止力として五人ほど。"
msgstr "\"...Hmm. If things get too heated, it's going to be a pain to resolve later. Let's just bring five to keep the peace."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13491:12665: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_8DOT5_0006; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13491
msgctxt "text_id=12665 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　あとは青子さんが同行してくれるのでしたら、私としては不満はありません」"
msgstr "  You are also welcome to accompany me if you'd like, Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13538:12666: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0049; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13538
msgctxt "text_id=12666 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「え？　どゆこと？　もしかしてシスターさんが話つけにいくの？　会長のがよくね？」"
msgstr "\"Huh? Wait, is Yuika going to go talk to them? I thought you were going to do that, prez.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13549:12667: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0162; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13549
msgctxt "text_id=12667 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いいのいいの。唯架さんはこう見えて荒事の専門家なんだから。ねー、唯架さん？」"
msgstr "\"No, no, it's fine. She may not look it, but she's actually a specialist in these kinds of situations. Isn't that right, Yuika?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13598:12668: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_8DOT5_0007; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13598
msgctxt "text_id=12668 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「貴女ほどではありませんが。"
msgstr "\"Not as much as you, but yes, you could say that."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13604:12669: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_8DOT5_0008; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13604
msgctxt "text_id=12669 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　……いいでしょう、今回は利益が一致します。あの事務所の方々が違法を働いているのは事実ですから。"
msgstr "  Since that office is indeed operating an illegal business, I'm willing to help. We both will benefit, after all."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13610:12670: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_8DOT5_0009; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13610
msgctxt "text_id=12670 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　罪には罰を。善良な人々を、とくに私たちの同胞を苦しめた手合いには、相応の痛みが必要です」"
msgstr "  Sins must not go unpunished. They must feel the pain that they inflicted upon the good people of this town.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13649:12671: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0163; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13649
msgctxt "text_id=12671 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「さっすが泣く子も黙る鬼のシスター。"
msgstr "\"You certainly live up to your reputation, Sister."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13655:12672: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0164; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13655
msgctxt "text_id=12672 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　期待してるわ。昔っから、商売<敵|がたき>を潰すのは得意だものね、貴女たち」"
msgstr "  I'm sure you'll win. You've been crushing the competition for a long time, now.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13673:12673: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_8DOT5_0010; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13673
msgctxt "text_id=12673 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「言われるまでもありません。"
msgstr "\"Yes, well."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13679:12674: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_8DOT5_0011; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13679
msgctxt "text_id=12674 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　一つの土地に、二つの教えがあっては迷惑です」"
msgstr "  There's simply no need for two schools of thought in a single place.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13748:12675: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13748
msgctxt "text_id=12675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりは反目の火花を散らしながらも、肩を並べてオフィスビルへと入っていった。"
msgstr "  Though the two continued to antagonize each other, they entered the office building fighting for the same team."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13753:12676: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13753
msgctxt "text_id=12676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　五人のむくつけき応援団員ものっしのっしと後に続く。"
msgstr "  The five burly members of the cheer team filed in behind them."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13758:12677: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13758
msgctxt "text_id=12677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残されたのは肩をすくめる鳶丸と、事情をいっさい把握できない木乃美だけ。"
msgstr "  They had left behind a glum Tobimaru and a completely clueless Kinomi."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13797:12678: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0050; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13797
msgctxt "text_id=12678 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「……わっかんねー。"
msgstr "\"...I really don't know what's going on."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13797:12679: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0050; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13797
msgctxt "text_id=12679 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　蒼崎、あの美人さんに何やらせる気なんだよ？」"
msgstr "  What is Aozaki trying to get that poor woman to do for her?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13821:12680: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0101; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13821
msgctxt "text_id=12680 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そりゃおまえ、口にはできない残虐行為だろ。相手の弱みをにぎったらとことん叩きのめすのが蒼崎だからな。"
msgstr "\"Oh, you do not even want to know what kind of cruelty Aozaki is capable of inflicting upon her enemies."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13827:12681: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0102; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13827
msgctxt "text_id=12681 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　違法販売をネタにして、契約解除をさせた後に告訴するって流れ。訴えるのはシスターの役目だな。"
msgstr "  Once they get the company to terminate everyone's contracts based on the illegal sales, the two will take legal action against them. That's where Sister Yuika comes in."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13834:12682: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0103; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13834
msgctxt "text_id=12682 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "立場上、学生である蒼崎よりシスターのほうがお題目が立つ。"
msgstr "She's far more qualified than Aozaki, who's just a student."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13845:12683: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0104; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13845
msgctxt "text_id=12683 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　……なによりあの教会、たまにイヤな噂を聞くしなあ。連中、貯めた財産根こそぎ奪られるだけで済めばいいが」"
msgstr "  I've heard some less than savory rumors about that church, too. This company will be lucky if losing all their funds is the worst that happens.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13870:12684: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13870
msgctxt "text_id=12684 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さて、と一息ついてから、鳶丸もオフィスビルへと足を向けた。"
msgstr "  After taking a few deep breaths, Tobimaru also headed towards the office building."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13881:12685: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0051; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13881
msgctxt "text_id=12685 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「え、殿下も事務所に行くの？　怖くない？」"
msgstr "\"You're going in there too? Isn't it a little scary?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13899:12686: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0105; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13899
msgctxt "text_id=12686 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いかねえよ、おっかねえ。俺のはちょっとした野暮用だ。"
msgstr "\"I'm not going. Are you crazy? I just have some business to attend to."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13905:12687: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0106; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13905
msgctxt "text_id=12687 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　テメエも補習に戻れよ。今日の礼は、また改めてくれてやるから」"
msgstr "  You need to get back to school. I'll compensate you for all this later, don't worry.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13938:12688: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0052; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13938
msgctxt "text_id=12688 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「ばっか、補習なんてもう終わってるじゃんか。気が付けばもうすぐ夕方だぜ、夕方。楽しかったからいいけどな！」"
msgstr "\"Man, you know school's done by now, right? It's almost night. Hey, it was fun though!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13956:12689: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0107; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13956
msgctxt "text_id=12689 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「違いない。あっというまの半日だった」"
msgstr "\"Wow, you're right. Half the day's gone.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13966:12690: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13966
msgctxt "text_id=12690 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それじゃあ、と手を振って、鳶丸はオフィスビルの入り口に消えていった。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru waved goodbye and disappeared into the office building."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:13997:12691: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_8DOT5_0053; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:13997
msgctxt "text_id=12691 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「？」"
msgstr "\"Wait, what?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14002:12692: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14002
msgctxt "text_id=12692 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを疑問に思いながらも、"
msgstr "  Kinomi thought it was strange since Tobimaru had just said he wasn't going in there."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14014:12693: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14014
msgctxt "text_id=12693 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　オフィスビルの三階から響いた、どうみても窓ガラスの割れる音を聴いて、木乃美も現場を後にした。"
msgstr "  However, he left as well after hearing a noise that sounded like glass breaking on the third floor of the office building."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14023:12694: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14023
msgctxt "text_id=12694 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　君子危うきに近寄らず、である。"
msgstr "  A wise man never courts danger, as they say."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14064:12695: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14064
msgctxt "text_id=12695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何事もなく話し合いは終了した。"
msgstr "  The discussion ended without any major issues."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14069:12696: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14069
msgctxt "text_id=12696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　事務所の内部はモーゼの十戒よろしく、シスターの一蹴りによって真ん中の机の列がきれいさっぱり吹っ飛んでいるだけで、ひとりの流血もない、実に平和的な解決だった。"
msgstr "  The inside of the office was mostly untouched. Only the center line of desks had been pulverized by Sister Yuika. Things had been resolved peacefully without any bloodshed."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14075:12697: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14075
msgctxt "text_id=12697 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなわけで、およそ半刻ほどで事務所の制圧を終えた蒼崎青子は、きょろきょろとあたりを見渡している。"
msgstr "  The office had been conquered in about an hour, and Aoko was now surveying it."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14095:12698: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14095
msgctxt "text_id=12698 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シスターの、鶴を思わせる手の一振りで宙に舞ったまま窓ガラスにつきささった大型デスク。"
msgstr "  A large desk had gone right through the window, flung through the air with a single swing of Sister Yuika's hand."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14100:12699: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14100
msgctxt "text_id=12699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悪魔でも見たかのように部屋の隅でガクガクと震える販売員たち。"
msgstr "  The sales staff were shaking in the corner like they'd just seen the devil incarnate."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14105:12700: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14105
msgctxt "text_id=12700 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　五人の応援団員をひきつれ、事務所の利権証明書等を押さえていくシスター。"
msgstr "  Sister Yuika brought in the five members of the cheer team to seize the office's permits and other important documents."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14130:12701: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0165; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14130
msgctxt "text_id=12701 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あれ？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14136:12702: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14136
msgctxt "text_id=12702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、青子の探しものは影も形も見あたらない。"
msgstr "  Unfortunately, the one thing Aoko was looking for was nowhere to be found."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14141:12703: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14141
msgctxt "text_id=12703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　首をかしげながら、部屋の隅の販売員に声をかける。"
msgstr "  She went to ask the sales staff still quivering in the corner of the room."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14168:12704: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0166; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14168
msgctxt "text_id=12704 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ちょっと。三時間ぐらい前、ここに人畜無害そうなのこなかった？　ビルから出てきてないから、まだ中にいると思うんだけど」"
msgstr "\"About three hours ago, did you see a harmless looking teenage boy come in here? I know he hasn't left the building, so he must still be in here somewhere.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14174:12705: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14174
msgctxt "text_id=12705 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　販売員たちはブンブンと首をふる。"
msgstr "  Everyone shook their heads no."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14179:12706: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14179
msgctxt "text_id=12706 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　事務所には純朴そうな学生の姿など何処にもない。"
msgstr "  Nobody had seen a student who fit that description in the office."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14205:12707: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14205
msgctxt "text_id=12707 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どういう事？　とさらに首をかしげるも、"
msgstr "  Aoko was looking even more confused at this point."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14218:12708: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0167; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14218
msgctxt "text_id=12708 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でもまあ」"
msgstr "\"Ah, well...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14224:12709: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14224
msgctxt "text_id=12709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　イイコトしたからいっか、と満足する生徒会長なのだった。"
msgstr "  She was still happy that she'd done a good deed here today."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14260:12710: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14260
msgctxt "text_id=12710 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸はオフィスビルに足を踏み入れると、そのまま通路を直進した。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru entered the office building and headed straight down the hallway."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14265:12711: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14265
msgctxt "text_id=12711 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　入って正面にある上層への階段には視線を投げただけで、いくつかの<貸部屋|テナント>を通り過ぎ、ビルの裏手に出る非常口まで歩いていく。"
msgstr "  He glanced at the stairs in front of him as he walked by, passing several tenants and heading towards the emergency exit at the back of the building."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14285:12712: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14285
msgctxt "text_id=12712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸はここ二丁目の地理に明るい。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru knew the geography of 2nd Street well."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14290:12713: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14290
msgctxt "text_id=12713 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の記憶によると、このビルの裏手には開発の手がかかっていない、昔ながらの平屋が並んでいる。"
msgstr "  If his memory served correctly, there were some old one-story houses behind this building that had been around forever."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14295:12714: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14295
msgctxt "text_id=12714 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時代の波に取り残されたトタンの貸し屋。"
msgstr "  They were old tin-roofed rental houses that stood against the tides of time."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14300:12715: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14300
msgctxt "text_id=12715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　近代的な二階建てアパートの影に飲まれてはいるが、まだ十分に<活|い>きている一角だ。"
msgstr "  Though overshadowed by the recent trend of two-story apartments, they were still there, alive and kicking."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14352:12716: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14352
msgctxt "text_id=12716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　裏口から出ると、正面には下水を処理するための川があった。"
msgstr "  At the back of the office building there was a river for processing waste water."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14357:12717: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14357
msgctxt "text_id=12717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　川とフェンスの向こうには平屋住宅が並んでいる。"
msgstr "  Beyond the river and a fence, there were many one-story houses."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14362:12718: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14362
msgctxt "text_id=12718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ビルのすぐ横には向こう岸に渡る橋がある。"
msgstr "  Next to the building there was a bridge that crossed over to the other side."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14367:12719: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14367
msgctxt "text_id=12719 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この界隈の人間しか知り得ない、ちょっとした近道のようだ。"
msgstr "  It was a shortcut only neighborhood locals would know about."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14399:12720: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0108; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14399
msgctxt "text_id=12720 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……なるほど、大したショートカットだ。地図なんてアテになんねえな」"
msgstr "\"...This is a pretty intense shortcut. Maps can't help you here, that's for sure.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14405:12721: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14405
msgctxt "text_id=12721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸が橋に向かって足を進めると、平屋から見慣れた少年が出てくるところだった。"
msgstr "  As Tobimaru walked towards the bridge, he saw a familiar face exit one of the old tin-roof houses."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14414:12722: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14414
msgctxt "text_id=12722 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　コートに着られている姿は、間違いなく静希草十郎である。"
msgstr "  The young man was wearing a coat and was without a doubt Soujyuro Sizuki."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14448:12723: voice_id=E60_8DOT5_0000; voice_prefix=E60; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14448
msgctxt "text_id=12723 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「明日もまた来ておくれね」"
msgstr "\"See you tomorrow!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14454:12724: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14454
msgctxt "text_id=12724 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　平屋の主人であろう、年老いた老婆に見送られて、草十郎は橋を渡る。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro crossed the bridge while the old woman who resided there saw him off."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14489:12725: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0030; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14489
msgctxt "text_id=12725 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あれ、副会長？」"
msgstr "\"Huh? Is that you, Tobimaru?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14497:12726: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0109; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14497
msgctxt "text_id=12726 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「よ。奇遇だな色男」"
msgstr "\"Yo! Fancy meeting you here, slick.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14517:12727: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14517
msgctxt "text_id=12727 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　必然、二人は橋の上で顔を合わせた。"
msgstr "  The two exchanged glances as they crossed paths on the bridge."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14522:12728: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14522
msgctxt "text_id=12728 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の顔は心なしか元気がない。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro looked fairly spent."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14527:12729: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14527
msgctxt "text_id=12729 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その様子を見て鳶丸は納得した。"
msgstr "  That was all Tobimaru needed to see."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14532:12730: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14532
msgctxt "text_id=12730 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この男の新しいバイトとやらは、詐欺の片棒を担ぐより、何倍も気難しい話だったのだと。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's new job was a lot harder than working for any scam artists."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14582:12731: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14582
msgctxt "text_id=12731 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんとなしにふたりは帰り道を同じにし、歩道橋の上で立ち止まった。"
msgstr "  They both stopped to talk on the footbridge."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14597:12732: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0110; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14597
msgctxt "text_id=12732 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「あのあたりに親戚でもいんのか？」"
msgstr "\"You have relatives around there or something?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14603:12733: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0031; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14603
msgctxt "text_id=12733 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、いない。人づてに紹介されて、おばあさんの話し相手をしていただけだ」"
msgstr "\"Ah, no. I was just keeping the old woman who lives there company. Someone told me about it, and it sounded like something I could do.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14608:12734: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14608
msgctxt "text_id=12734 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子に問いつめられても話さなかった事を、草十郎はあっさり口にした。"
msgstr "  For some reason, Soujyuro readily revealed what he had refused to tell Aoko."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14629:12735: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0111; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14629
msgctxt "text_id=12735 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そんなに気軽に話していいのか？　守秘義務とかありそうだが」"
msgstr "\"Is it okay to be talking about it? Sounds like something they might want to be kept secret.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14635:12736: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0032; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14635
msgctxt "text_id=12736 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、秘密にしなくちゃいけない話でもないんだ。"
msgstr "\"Oh, no it's fine. It's not really anything I need to keep quiet about."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14635:12737: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0032; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14635
msgctxt "text_id=12737 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　ただ話しちゃいけない気がしただけで。"
msgstr "  I just thought maybe I shouldn't before."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14641:12738: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0033; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14641
msgctxt "text_id=12738 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　鳶丸には出てくるところを見られたし、正直、誰かに言いたい気持ちはあった。弱音みたいなものだから、副会長が聞いてくれるならちょうどいい」"
msgstr "  You saw me coming out of there, and I actually have been wanting to tell someone about it. I didn't want to complain, but since you asked...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14661:12739: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14661
msgctxt "text_id=12739 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　歩道橋の<欄干|らんかん>に寄りかかりながら、鳶丸は先を<促|うなが>した。"
msgstr "  Leaning on the rail of the footbridge, Tobimaru urged him to go on."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14666:12740: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14666
msgctxt "text_id=12740 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の話は、フタを開けてみれば平凡なものだった。"
msgstr "  It turned out that Soujyuro's story was nothing out of the ordinary."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14672:12741: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14672
msgctxt "text_id=12741 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の新しいアルバイトは、あの平屋住宅の、とある家のホームヘルパーだった。"
msgstr "  His new part-time job was to be a home helper in that old one-story house."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14677:12742: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14677
msgctxt "text_id=12742 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ少し風向きが違うのは、その家の老婆は夫に先立たれ、息子も都会に出たまま便りをよこさなくなった事だ。"
msgstr "  This resident was a widow who had been left alone after her son moved off to the city."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14712:12743: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0034; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14712
msgctxt "text_id=12743 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「はじめは、ただのお手伝いだったんだけどね」"
msgstr "\"At first, I was just helping around the house.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14718:12744: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14718
msgctxt "text_id=12744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　困ったような、悔いるような笑顔で彼は言った。"
msgstr "  He spoke with a troubled, slightly regretful smile."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14723:12745: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14723
msgctxt "text_id=12745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あるいは、不当な行為への嫌悪か。"
msgstr "  Maybe he was ashamed of something he'd done?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14728:12746: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14728
msgctxt "text_id=12746 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自虐的にすら見える苦笑いは、暗い<翳|かげ>りを帯びている。"
msgstr "  There was a tinge of darkness behind the wry, tormented smile on his face."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14761:12747: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0112; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14761
msgctxt "text_id=12747 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14772:12748: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14772
msgctxt "text_id=12748 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸はかすかに驚いて、すぐに自分の頬を叩いた。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru found himself surprised at his own thoughts and slapped himself lightly on the cheek."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14777:12749: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14777
msgctxt "text_id=12749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この少年が、その手の感情を見せるとは夢にも思っていなかった―――そんな身勝手な思いこみを恥じ入って、自分自身を罰したのだ。"
msgstr "  This was his way of punishing himself. He wasn't sure why his imagination was running so wild now."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14798:12750: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0113; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14798
msgctxt "text_id=12750 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「珍しくうかない顔だが。あれか、出ていった息子さんとやらに文句があるのか？　<介護|かいご>が必要なお<袋|ふくろ>さんを放って、好きかってに暮らしていることに？」"
msgstr "\"You seem oddly glum, though. Oh, I get it. You have a problem with the son who left his mom like that, even though she clearly needs help around the house, huh?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14816:12751: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0035; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14816
msgctxt "text_id=12751 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……どうだろう。確かにおかしな話だとは思う。"
msgstr "\"...I wonder. It is an odd story, I think."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14822:12752: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0036; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14822
msgctxt "text_id=12752 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　けど、俺はその息子さんを責める気にはなれない。だって、それは」"
msgstr "  But I don't really mean to blame him. I mean, that's...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14847:12753: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14847
msgctxt "text_id=12753 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言いかけて口を<噤|つぐ>む。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro stopped himself mid-sentence."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14852:12754: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14852
msgctxt "text_id=12754 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おそらく、その息子は母を嫌ったのではなく、この町を嫌ったのだ。"
msgstr "  He didn't think the son hated his mother so much as he did the town;"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14857:12755: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14857
msgctxt "text_id=12755 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　単に、ここより好きな場所があったら、この町から出ていっただけの話。"
msgstr "  he had probably just found somewhere better to live, and moved away."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14862:12756: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14862
msgctxt "text_id=12756 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はそれを<苦々|にがにが>しげに、声にせず飲みこんだ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro swallowed those bitter words."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14898:12757: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0037; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14898
msgctxt "text_id=12757 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「お手伝いの料金は初めに全部もらってたんだ。"
msgstr "\"At first, I took the full amount as payment."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14898:12758: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0037; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14898
msgctxt "text_id=12758 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　今月だけという話なのに、十万円は高すぎると思う」"
msgstr "  But I thought 100,000 yen was way too much for a job that'll only last the month.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14904:12759: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14904
msgctxt "text_id=12759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本気で、こんなにお金はいらないのに、と呟く。"
msgstr "  He trailed off, muttering that he really didn't need that much money."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14909:12760: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14909
msgctxt "text_id=12760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな少年に老婆は感謝をした。"
msgstr "  The old woman had thanked him for his honesty."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14914:12761: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14914
msgctxt "text_id=12761 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の頼りないところも微笑ましかったのだろう。"
msgstr "  That was part of Soujyuro's appeal, most likely."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14919:12762: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14919
msgctxt "text_id=12762 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　老婆はすぐに心を許し、数日を待たずして草十郎を孫と同一視するようになったらしい。"
msgstr "  In a matter of days, the old woman put all her trust into Soujyuro and treated him like her own grandson."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14940:12763: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0038; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14940
msgctxt "text_id=12763 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……ああ。それは素直に嬉しいんだけど、問題は」"
msgstr "\"I was honestly happy about that. The problem is...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14946:12764: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14946
msgctxt "text_id=12764 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　問題は、明日も来ておくれ、と。"
msgstr "  She always saw him off with a smile, and asked him to return tomorrow."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14951:12765: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14951
msgctxt "text_id=12765 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしを忘れないでおくれと、別れ際に草十郎に大金を手渡した事だ。"
msgstr "  Every time he left, she gave him a stack of cash in the hope that he wouldn't forget her."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14986:12766: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0114; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14986
msgctxt "text_id=12766 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ああ？　それだけで大金もらってたのか？」"
msgstr "\"Whoa, really? That's what you're getting all that money for?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14992:12767: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0039; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14992
msgctxt "text_id=12767 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「うん。お孫さんの代わりをしてほしい、と言われた。"
msgstr "\"Yeah. She says she wants me to be her grandson."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:14999:12768: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0040; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:14999
msgctxt "text_id=12768 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "貴方は信じられるから、これで孫のようにふるまってくれって」"
msgstr "She says she can trust me, so she wants me to act like I'm her grandson.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15026:12769: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0115; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15026
msgctxt "text_id=12769 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……なんだそりゃ。少しも信じてねえよそれ。金で動く孫がいるか。そりゃあヘルパーと変わらねえ」"
msgstr "\"Wow, that's crazy! It's hard to believe, but I guess a grandson-for-hire isn't much different from a house helper...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15037:12770: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0041; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15037
msgctxt "text_id=12770 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや。おばあさんはヘルパーさんにはお金は払わないと言った。信頼できないから。あのおばあさんが信じられるのはお金だけなんだ」"
msgstr "\"No, it's different. She said she doesn't pay helpers because she can't trust them. She says she can only trust money.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15079:12771: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15079
msgctxt "text_id=12771 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　長くひとりきりで暮らしてきたからか、それとも生来の偏屈さからひとりになったのか。"
msgstr "  She seemed to have some quirks about her, probably because she'd been living alone for so long."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15084:12772: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15084
msgctxt "text_id=12772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　老婆は「人間の善意」をまるっきり信じられないようになっていた。"
msgstr "  By this point she'd lost all faith in the goodwill of humankind."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15089:12773: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15089
msgctxt "text_id=12773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女にとって、家族の絆は絵空事にすぎない。"
msgstr "  To her, the bonds of a family were nothing but fantasy."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15094:12774: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15094
msgctxt "text_id=12774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　長年そういったものに見捨てられてきた彼女にとって、確かなものは手元に残った貯金だけ。"
msgstr "  After being cast aside by her own family for so many years, the only thing that remained faithful to her was the money she'd saved."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15114:12775: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15114
msgctxt "text_id=12775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……だから、逆に。"
msgstr "  Over time, this led to her developing a strange complex."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15119:12776: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15119
msgctxt "text_id=12776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　偏屈に、<無駄遣|むだづか>いせず、最後の心の拠り所として貯めに貯めた<金|ソレ>だけが、彼女にとって、人をつなぎ止める絆になっていたのだろう。"
msgstr "  For her, the money she'd scrimped and saved, the last thing she could rely on, was the only way she could conceive of keeping someone in her life."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15154:12777: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0116; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15154
msgctxt "text_id=12777 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……バカらしい。"
msgstr "\"That's crazy."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15160:12778: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0117; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15160
msgctxt "text_id=12778 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　それって結局、金で雇った他人じゃねえか。孫の代わりとは言えねえな」"
msgstr "  She's just hiring help. It's not like she can just buy a grandson.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15181:12779: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0042; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15181
msgctxt "text_id=12779 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それはおばあさんが誰よりも分かってるよ。"
msgstr "\"I think she knows that more than anyone."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15187:12780: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0043; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15187
msgctxt "text_id=12780 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　でも、偽者だと分かっていても、それぐらいしか信じられるモノはなかったんだ。"
msgstr "  Even if she knows it isn't real, that's just how hard it is for her to trust anyone."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15193:12781: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0044; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15193
msgctxt "text_id=12781 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　おばあさんにとって、家によりつかなくなったお孫さんはいま一番欲しいものだから、その代償として、彼女が一番信用できるものを真心として渡してくれたんだ」"
msgstr "  What she wants most in this world is for her grandchildren to visit her, but since that's not happening, she turned to the one thing she could trust to make that a reality.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15214:12782: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0118; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15214
msgctxt "text_id=12782 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15220:12783: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15220
msgctxt "text_id=12783 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　買収ではない。"
msgstr "  She wasn't buying him, though."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15225:12784: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15225
msgctxt "text_id=12784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　老婆は心の底から草十郎を信頼したから、一番確かなもので感謝の気持ちを表した。"
msgstr "  She just trusted Soujyuro from the bottom of her heart and was thanking him the only way she knew how."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15231:12785: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15231
msgctxt "text_id=12785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それが、<傍目|はため>には<醜|みにく>い行為だと気づく事もできずに。"
msgstr "  She didn't realize how that looked from other people's perspectives."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15275:12786: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0119; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15275
msgctxt "text_id=12786 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……また厄介な事情に首つっこんだもんだ。"
msgstr "\"...Well, looks like you've gotten yourself into a real sticky situation again."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15281:12787: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0120; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15281
msgctxt "text_id=12787 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　まあ、あんまり深く思い詰めるな。"
msgstr "  But hey, try not to worry about it too much."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15287:12788: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0121; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15287
msgctxt "text_id=12788 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　いい話じゃねえか。命より金が大事だった婆さんが、今になって思い出の方に転んだワケだ。まっとうな話だよ」"
msgstr "  I mean, it's a nice story. She's found something in her life that's even more important than money. It's something to be proud of.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15293:12789: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0045; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15293
msgctxt "text_id=12789 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうかな。そうだといいけど」"
msgstr "\"Really? I hope so.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15298:12790: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15298
msgctxt "text_id=12790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うなずく草十郎の顔には、まだ重苦しい翳りが残っている。"
msgstr "  It was obvious from Soujyuro's expression that all this still weighed heavily on him."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15340:12791: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0122; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15340
msgctxt "text_id=12791 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「なんだよ煮えきらねえな。どうせおまえさんの事だ、もらった金は一銭も使ってねえんだろ？"
msgstr "\"Come on, cheer up. Knowing you, I bet you haven't spent any of the money she's given you."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15346:12792: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0123; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15346
msgctxt "text_id=12792 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　んな事してりゃいずれ年金も底をつく。そうなった時にまるまる返すつもりだから蒼崎にも黙ってたんじゃないのか？」"
msgstr "  Are you saving it all up to give back to her when she inevitably runs out? Is that why you didn't tell Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15363:12793: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0046; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15363
msgctxt "text_id=12793 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「？　なんで鳶丸がそんなコト知ってるんだ？」"
msgstr "\"Huh? How did you know?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15375:12794: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0124; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15375
msgctxt "text_id=12794 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「あー、いや、なんとなく。そんな気がした」"
msgstr "\"It was just a guess. But I know how you are.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15409:12795: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15409
msgctxt "text_id=12795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今日一日、草十郎の為に<奔走|ほんそう>した事は黙っておくが吉だ。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru decided it was best not to tell Soujyuro about all the trouble they went through for him today."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15414:12796: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15414
msgctxt "text_id=12796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　後々、なんで喋ったのか、と鉄の生徒会長に<祟|たた>られるのが目に見えている。"
msgstr "  He knew Aoko would only make him regret it later if he did."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15435:12797: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0047; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15435
msgctxt "text_id=12797 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そっか。でもこの話の一番難しいところはね、鳶丸。"
msgstr "\"So, let me tell you the worst thing about all this."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15441:12798: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0048; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15441
msgctxt "text_id=12798 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　その人には、お孫さんはいなかったんだ」"
msgstr "  The truth is, this old lady doesn't have any grandchildren.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15457:12799: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0125; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15457
msgctxt "text_id=12799 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「あ―――？」"
msgstr "\"Huh...?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15468:12800: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15468
msgctxt "text_id=12800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぼんやりと口をあけて、ああ、と鳶丸は息を吐いた。"
msgstr "  After a few moments of surprise, Tobimaru let out a sigh."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15473:12801: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15473
msgctxt "text_id=12801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そういう事か、と。"
msgstr "  He understood."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15504:12802: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15504
msgctxt "text_id=12802 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夫に先立たれ、息子は町を出て、孫は寄りつきもしない。"
msgstr "  Being widowed with a son who's moved into the city and grandchildren who never visit..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15509:12803: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15509
msgctxt "text_id=12803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんて恵まれた、スタンダードな一生だろう。"
msgstr "  That was a normal, full and rich life."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15514:12804: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15514
msgctxt "text_id=12804 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　世の中には、そんな“もしも”を信じる事でしか、立ちゆかない人生もある。"
msgstr "  Sometimes, however, a person's dreams were all that kept them going."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15519:12805: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15519
msgctxt "text_id=12805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　底はない。悲惨な人生の下には、より悲惨な底が待っているだけの話。"
msgstr "  The bottom is limitless. For every tragic life there is another even more tragic than that."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15540:12806: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0049; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15540
msgctxt "text_id=12806 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「時々、油断すると思うんだ。この町について。"
msgstr "\"You know, sometimes this town catches me off guard."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15546:12807: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0050; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15546
msgctxt "text_id=12807 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　みんな幸福そうに見えるのに、裏を覗くとそうでもないのはなんでだろうって。なんか、町全体に騙されてるみたいだ」"
msgstr "  Everyone looks so happy and blessed, but if you look hard enough you start to see that's not always the case. It's like the entire town is fooling me.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15552:12808: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0126; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15552
msgctxt "text_id=12808 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15557:12809: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15557
msgctxt "text_id=12809 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸は<欄干|らんかん>によりかかって、賑わう町並みを見下ろしている。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru leaned over the railing and looked down at the bustling town below."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15591:12810: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15591
msgctxt "text_id=12810 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の悩みは、つまるところ環境への戸惑いだ。"
msgstr "  In the end, Soujyuro's worries stemmed from his feeling lost in this environment."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15596:12811: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15596
msgctxt "text_id=12811 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　年老いるまで独りだった老婆の人生も、"
msgstr "  The woman who walked through life alone into old age..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15601:12812: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15601
msgctxt "text_id=12812 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　親戚一同に敵視されている鳶丸の生い立ちも、"
msgstr "  Tobimaru's struggle with being antagonized by his entire family..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15606:12813: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15606
msgctxt "text_id=12813 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　所詮は個人の事情でしかない。"
msgstr "  Those were both personal matters."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15611:12814: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15611
msgctxt "text_id=12814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年の相手は、この得体の知れない町そのものらしい。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's problems stemmed from the nebulous entity of the town itself."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15631:12815: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15631
msgctxt "text_id=12815 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　近代化して豊かになった分、豊かになれなかった人間の悲惨さは増している。"
msgstr "  For every bit of progress made through modernization, there were also people left in growing misfortune."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15636:12816: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15636
msgctxt "text_id=12816 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは富の差であれ、心の差であれ同じ事だ。"
msgstr "  It didn't matter whether they were unequal in wealth or compassion. It was all the same."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15641:12817: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15641
msgctxt "text_id=12817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大きくなった町は弱者に<厳|きび>しい。"
msgstr "  The larger a town grows, the harder it becomes for the weak to thrive."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15646:12818: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15646
msgctxt "text_id=12818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　すべてが相互扶助でなりたっていた田舎育ちの少年にとっては、その在り方は耐え難い“なぜ”なのだろう。"
msgstr "  For a young man who spent his life in the countryside where everyone helped each other, this was hard to understand."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15681:12819: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0127; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15681
msgctxt "text_id=12819 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「草十郎。おまえ、この町は好きか？」"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro... Do you really like it in this town?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15687:12820: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0051; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15687
msgctxt "text_id=12820 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……まだ分からない。そういう鳶丸は？」"
msgstr "\"I honestly don't know yet. What about you?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15708:12821: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0128; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15708
msgctxt "text_id=12821 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ま、似たようなもんだ。好き嫌いも半々で、たまに何もかもどうでもよくなる時はある。"
msgstr "\"Eh, similar. Sometimes I like it, sometimes I don't. Sometimes I feel like it doesn't matter either way."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15714:12822: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0129; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15714
msgctxt "text_id=12822 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　だがまあ、おまえさんとは真逆だな。"
msgstr "  Then again, I'm kind of the total opposite of you."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15720:12823: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0130; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15720
msgctxt "text_id=12823 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　俺はこの町のおかげで<手前|テメエ>の悩みなんざ無視できる。ここに比べりゃマシだってな。空虚であろうと、この忙しさ、節操のなさは捨てたもんじゃねえってな」"
msgstr "  In town, I can ignore my problems if I want. It's better than a place like this, anyway. There's something to this bustle and chaos that you can't discount. Even if it does feel hollow at times.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15741:12824: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0052; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15741
msgctxt "text_id=12824 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ここに比べたらマシ？」"
msgstr "\"It's better than here?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15747:12825: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0131; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15747
msgctxt "text_id=12825 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……あー、違うな。マシというよりはアリって感じか。"
msgstr "\"Ah, not exactly. I just mean that I'd have more options."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15753:12826: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0132; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15753
msgctxt "text_id=12826 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　バイトしてればたまに思うだろ？　町ってのは隙間を作らないように回ってるんだ。欠席にしろ空席にしろ、空きが出来たらすぐに埋められるように出来ている」"
msgstr "  I'm sure you've thought this at your part-time jobs, but a town like this never leaves any gaps. Wherever there's an opening, that opening is going to be filled.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15785:12827: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0133; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15785
msgctxt "text_id=12827 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「当たり前のようで、コイツはよく出来た共同体なんだよ。"
msgstr "\"A city is a really well-constructed community when you think about it."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15791:12828: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0134; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15791
msgctxt "text_id=12828 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　昨日までは誰でもなかった他人が、明日には必要な隣人になってるかもしれない。"
msgstr "  Someone you never knew the day before, might be a neighbor you need to call on the very next day."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15797:12829: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0135; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15797
msgctxt "text_id=12829 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　昨日まではなかった町角に、新しい建物ができている事もある」"
msgstr "  A street corner that had nothing on it yesterday, might have a new building on it today.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15818:12830: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0136; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15818
msgctxt "text_id=12830 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「まるで毎日が切った<縫|ぬ>ったの大手術だ。それでもうまく回ってる事に、真剣に感心する。"
msgstr "\"Every single day in the city is like living through a major surgery in progress. It's seriously impressive that it works as well as it does."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15824:12831: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0137; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15824
msgctxt "text_id=12831 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　本当に、何かのはずみで思うんだよ。"
msgstr "  Something always makes me think that."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15831:12832: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0138; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15831
msgctxt "text_id=12832 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "俺はテメエだけで生きてるんじゃなくて、どうでもいい誰かのどうでもいい頑張りのおかげで、こうしてクダまけてるんだってな。"
msgstr "I'm not just living on my own. I'm able to survive thanks to the accomplishments of people I'll never know about."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15837:12833: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0139; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15837
msgctxt "text_id=12833 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　持ちつ持たれつだ。そういう巡り合わせを成立させているだけでも、どんなバランスなんだって呆れるわけだ」"
msgstr "  It's all a bunch of give-and-take. The fact that it works at all is a feat in and of itself.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15870:12834: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0053; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15870
msgctxt "text_id=12834 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15876:12835: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15876
msgctxt "text_id=12835 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山が生き物であるように、町もまた生き物だ。"
msgstr "  Just as the mountains are alive, so is the city."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15881:12836: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15881
msgctxt "text_id=12836 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸はその生き物のカタチをいまいち気に入っていないらしい。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru didn't seem to like the way that living creature had manifested itself."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15886:12837: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15886
msgctxt "text_id=12837 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただそれでも、"
msgstr "  But even still..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15912:12838: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0054; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15912
msgctxt "text_id=12838 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうか。敬意を払ってるんだな、鳶丸は」"
msgstr "\"I see. You really respect it, huh?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15930:12839: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0140; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15930
msgctxt "text_id=12839 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……まあ。照れくさいが、そういうこった」"
msgstr "\"I mean, it's a little embarrassing, but yeah.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15936:12840: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15936
msgctxt "text_id=12840 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　町に生まれた人間として、顔も知らない人間が、顔も知らないクセに助け合っている事実に、感謝している。"
msgstr "  As someone who was born and raised in the city, Tobimaru was thankful that complete strangers were able to help each other out."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15962:12841: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0141; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15962
msgctxt "text_id=12841 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「つーか、おまえさんは贅沢すぎる！"
msgstr "\"Honestly, you're just asking for too much!"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:15968:12842: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0142; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:15968
msgctxt "text_id=12842 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　はじめから好きなところに住めるヤツなんていねえだろ。生まれる場所は選べねえしな。単純な話、自分が住むって決めたところを好きになるしかねえってことだ！」"
msgstr "  Nobody likes where they live in the beginning. You can't choose where you were born, after all. You have to learn to like wherever it is you've decided to live, not the other way around!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16004:12843: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0055; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16004
msgctxt "text_id=12843 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「っ！」"
msgstr "\"Gah!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16010:12844: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16010
msgctxt "text_id=12844 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸の手が草十郎の背中を叩く。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru gave Soujyuro's back a hard slap."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16015:12845: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16015
msgctxt "text_id=12845 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　丸まりかけた背を叩かれて、草十郎は目を点にして跳ね起きた。"
msgstr "  It made Soujyuro straighten up his posture and snap him out of his slump a bit."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16062:12846: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0056; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16062
msgctxt "text_id=12846 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……でも鳶丸。そこに住むって決めても、好きになれなかったらどうするんだ？」"
msgstr "\"Okay, but what if you decide to live somewhere and you just can't like it no matter how hard you try?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16068:12847: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0143; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16068
msgctxt "text_id=12847 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「どうしても好きになれないヤツは違う土地に行けばいい。イヤなら逃げてもいいんだよ。放浪するのも人生だぜ」"
msgstr "\"If you really don't like it, you can just move somewhere else. Don't be scared to run away from a bad place. You're meant to wander a bit in life.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16089:12848: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0057; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16089
msgctxt "text_id=12848 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16094:12849: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16094
msgctxt "text_id=12849 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸の発言は目から鱗だったのか、草十郎は感心して息を呑んでいる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was so impressed with Tobimaru's words he couldn't speak. They gave him a new perspective."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16099:12850: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16099
msgctxt "text_id=12850 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　イヤなら逃げていい、という言葉にではなく、"
msgstr "  It wasn't just the words, \"don't be scared to run away from a bad place.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16104:12851: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16104
msgctxt "text_id=12851 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう言い切れる槻司鳶丸に、強い<感銘|かんめい>を受けたのだ。"
msgstr "  What had really left a strong impression was Tobimaru's confidence."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16109:12852: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16109
msgctxt "text_id=12852 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この町に生まれながら、この町をあっさり捨てられると言った彼の自由さに。"
msgstr "  Although he had been born in this town, he spoke freely of abandoning it."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16153:12853: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0058; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16153
msgctxt "text_id=12853 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「鳶丸から、逃げるなんて言葉がでるとは思わなかった」"
msgstr "\"I never thought I'd hear you talk about running away.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16179:12854: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0144; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16179
msgctxt "text_id=12854 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「逃げる先があるなら逃げてもいいだろって話。"
msgstr "\"There's nothing wrong with running away if you have somewhere to run to."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16185:12855: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0145; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16185
msgctxt "text_id=12855 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　……そりゃ勝ちとか成功とか、そういう言葉に固執するのも悪くはねえさ。富と名声はいいもんだしな。"
msgstr "  That's not to say you shouldn't hold on to words like victory and success, or fortune and fame."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16191:12856: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0146; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16191
msgctxt "text_id=12856 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　だが、俺にはどうも、勝ち続けるっていうのは固まるってコトに見える。息苦しくてしょうがない。蒼崎みたいにがんじがらめになっても突き進むパワーもねえしな。身上は軽い方がいいだろうよ」"
msgstr "  I just think it's easy to feel stifled if you're always trying to win. I don't have the willpower of someone like Aozaki who can just power through things. I like to keep life... light.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16218:12857: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0059; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16218
msgctxt "text_id=12857 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「？　人生は軽い方がいいのか？」"
msgstr "\"You think life is better when it's light?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16229:12858: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0147; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16229
msgctxt "text_id=12858 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いや、軽いとか手堅いとか、そういうんじゃなくて、オレはもっと、こう、<浪漫|ろまん>あふれるっつーか……」"
msgstr "\"I don't really mean lightweight or secure, or anything like that. I just want more adventure or, you know...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16264:12859: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16264
msgctxt "text_id=12859 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言いかけて、それも違うな、と鳶丸は眉をひそめる。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru furrowed his brow at his inability to find the proper words."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16269:12860: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16269
msgctxt "text_id=12860 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　欲しいものは単純なものだ。"
msgstr "  What he wanted was simple."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16276:12861: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0148; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16276
msgctxt "text_id=12861 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そうだな。俺はきっと、笑える人生が送りたいんだ」"
msgstr "\"Look, I just want to live a life that I can laugh about.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16282:12862: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16282
msgctxt "text_id=12862 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こういうものだろ、と。"
msgstr "  That was how he saw life."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16287:12863: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16287
msgctxt "text_id=12863 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸は自分が良しとするものが、いま目の前で悩む友人の指針になればいいと願って口にした。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru tried his best to put into words his thoughts, hoping his friend would find them useful."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16331:12864: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0060; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16331
msgctxt "text_id=12864 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「………………漫才師か？」"
msgstr "\"...Like... a comedian?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16337:12865: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0149; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16337
msgctxt "text_id=12865 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16342:12866: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16342
msgctxt "text_id=12866 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ガックリと肩を落とす。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru's shoulders slumped in disappointment."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16347:12867: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16347
msgctxt "text_id=12867 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　落としたものの、"
msgstr "  But even so..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16353:12868: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0150; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16353
msgctxt "text_id=12868 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いや、そんなもんか、実際」"
msgstr "\"Actually, yeah. Sure.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16358:12869: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16358
msgctxt "text_id=12869 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　よくよく考えると的はずれでもない、と納得する鳶丸だった。"
msgstr "  The more he thought about it, the more he realized that Soujyuro wasn't really wrong."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16378:12870: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16378
msgctxt "text_id=12870 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人間、望めば望むほど果てがない。"
msgstr "  There was no end to human desire."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16383:12871: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16383
msgctxt "text_id=12871 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最高の人生なんてものは誰であろうと迎えられない。"
msgstr "  The perfect life was an unattainable dream."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16388:12872: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16388
msgctxt "text_id=12872 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なら、いまわの際で「俺の人生は愉快だった」とニヤつけるなら、最後の最後で勝ち組だろうと。"
msgstr "  The only way to really win was to be able to say with your dying breath that you had truly enjoyed living."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16427:12873: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0151; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16427
msgctxt "text_id=12873 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……ったく、蒼崎の影響かねえ。考えなしの<博徒|ばくと>かっていうの。あいつ、ボニー＆クライドとか大好きなんだろうなあ」"
msgstr "\"...Man, I wonder if this is Aozaki's influence. She's the type to take a gamble on anything. I bet she loves Bonnie and Clyde.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16433:12874: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16433
msgctxt "text_id=12874 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やれやれと鳶丸は頭を掻いた。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru tiredly scratched his head."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16438:12875: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16438
msgctxt "text_id=12875 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一年前までは厭世的だった自分が、よくもまあここまで偉そうに語れるものだと。"
msgstr "  He never would have said something like this last year, considering how pessimistic he had been then."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16473:12876: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0152; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16473
msgctxt "text_id=12876 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ともかくだ。他人の事情にいちいち落ちこんでるようじゃ日が暮れるぜ。"
msgstr "\"Anyway, there's no end to it if you worry about everyone else's business."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16479:12877: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0153; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16479
msgctxt "text_id=12877 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　いや、実際もう暮れかけてるけどな。とんだ道草だ」"
msgstr "  Look, the sun's already going down. We've been out here forever.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16485:12878: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0061; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16485
msgctxt "text_id=12878 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうか。引き留めてすまなかった。鳶丸は他に用事が？」"
msgstr "\"Sorry to keep you. Do you have something else you need to be doing?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16506:12879: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0154; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16506
msgctxt "text_id=12879 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……俺も大人しく家に帰るとするか。"
msgstr "\"...Nah, maybe I'll just be good and head home."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16512:12880: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0155; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16512
msgctxt "text_id=12880 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　そっちも日が落ちる前に帰れよ。何をしていたか聞かれたら、隠さず事情は説明しとけ。その話、おまえが思ってるほどひでえ話じゃねえから」"
msgstr "  You should get home before it gets totally dark, too. If they ask you what you were doing, just be honest. It's not as bad as you think it sounds.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16543:12881: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0062; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16543
msgctxt "text_id=12881 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「む」"
msgstr "\"Hm...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16549:12882: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16549
msgctxt "text_id=12882 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸の言葉に、眉を八の字にして黙りこむ草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro frowned and fell silent."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16554:12883: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16554
msgctxt "text_id=12883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の中では、あの老婆にしてしまった行為の折り合いが付いていない。"
msgstr "  He still hadn't come to terms with his arrangement with that old woman yet."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16574:12884: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16574
msgctxt "text_id=12884 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも草十郎があの家を訪れなければ、彼女が自分の人生に絶望する事はなかったはずだ。"
msgstr "  If he hadn't gone there in the first place, she might not have felt like anything was missing from her life."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16579:12885: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16579
msgctxt "text_id=12885 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう悔いているからこそ、草十郎は誰かに話したかったのだ。"
msgstr "  That feeling of regret was exactly why he wanted to talk to someone."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16614:12886: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0156; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16614
msgctxt "text_id=12886 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「おまえ、残酷なことをしたと思ってんだろ。"
msgstr "\"I bet you think you've done something cruel to her, don't you?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16620:12887: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0157; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16620
msgctxt "text_id=12887 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　婆さんの人生に、今からじゃ取り戻せないモノを見せつけた、とかな」"
msgstr "  Like you showed her something that she can never have. Am I right?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16639:12888: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0063; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16639
msgctxt "text_id=12888 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16644:12889: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16644
msgctxt "text_id=12889 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　核心をつかれて黙りこむ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was stunned into silence."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16649:12890: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16649
msgctxt "text_id=12890 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その後悔を、鳶丸ははっきりと切り捨てた。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru knew exactly what Soujyuro regretted."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16655:12891: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0158; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16655
msgctxt "text_id=12891 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そりゃ違う。思い上がりだぜ草十郎」"
msgstr "\"You shouldn't think that you have that much power over someone, Soujyuro.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16689:12892: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0159; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16689
msgctxt "text_id=12892 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いいか。その婆さんも、自分は人生に失敗した、なんて思ってんなら、今の自分に出来ることをさせればいい。"
msgstr "\"Listen. If she thinks she messed up her life, then you should do whatever you can to help her."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16695:12893: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0160; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16695
msgctxt "text_id=12893 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　幸い、金は腐るほどあるんだろ？"
msgstr "  She's stinking rich, right?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16701:12894: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0161; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16701
msgctxt "text_id=12894 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　なら、思いっきり人助けをさせてみろ。金で救える不幸なんざ山ほどあるだろ。"
msgstr "  Then get her to help people with it. There are so many problems in this world she can fix with her money."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16707:12895: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0162; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16707
msgctxt "text_id=12895 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　んで、婆さんがどんなもんだと胸を張れたんなら、そりゃ間違いなくいい仕事だ。少なくとも俺は気持ちがいい」"
msgstr "  If you can get her to be proud of herself, then you'll have done a good job. It would make me happy at least.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16733:12896: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0064; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16733
msgctxt "text_id=12896 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……む。それは、おばあさんの苦しみを解決していない」"
msgstr "\"Hm... But that still doesn't get rid of her suffering.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16753:12897: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0163; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16753
msgctxt "text_id=12897 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「解決できねえ問題は放っておけ。"
msgstr "\"Don't worry about problems you can't solve."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16759:12898: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0164; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16759
msgctxt "text_id=12898 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　その婆さんには今、他に解決できる問題があるんだからそれでいいじゃねえか。んで、"
msgstr "  Focus on the problems you can help with."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16765:12899: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0165; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16765
msgctxt "text_id=12899 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "『悪いけどお金はこれから世のため人のため自分のために使うから返しておくれ』となったらば婆さんの勝ち。"
msgstr "  If you can convince her to let you give that money back so she can use it to help others and herself, then she's won."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16771:12900: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0166; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16771
msgctxt "text_id=12900 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　偽者の孫なんざより、よっぽどいい生き甲斐に目覚めたわけだな」"
msgstr "  That will give more meaning to her life than a fake grandson ever could.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16792:12901: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0167; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16792
msgctxt "text_id=12901 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「しかし、"
msgstr "\"But..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16792:12902: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0167; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16792
msgctxt "text_id=12902 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "『これで満足したから残りはやっぱり貰っておくれ』"
msgstr "  If she says she's done enough, and she wants you to have the rest of her money..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16798:12903: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0168; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16798
msgctxt "text_id=12903 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　と言えばおまえさんの勝ち。"
msgstr "  That means you've won."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16804:12904: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0169; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16804
msgctxt "text_id=12904 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　婆さんにとってはやっぱり孫の方がいいって事で、そん時は大手を振って大金もって帰りやがれ」"
msgstr "  She'd prefer to think of you as her grandson. If that's the case, then there's no shame in taking that money from her.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16835:12905: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0065; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16835
msgctxt "text_id=12905 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――なるほど」"
msgstr "\"...I see now.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16840:12906: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16840
msgctxt "text_id=12906 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鮮やかな大岡裁きに、ポン、と手を打つ草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro clapped his hands together. He was finally able to accept these conditions as fair."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16853:12907: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0066; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16853
msgctxt "text_id=12907 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「すまない。ありがとう鳶丸」"
msgstr "\"Hey, thanks for the talk, Tobimaru.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16858:12908: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16858
msgctxt "text_id=12908 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　苦笑いは既にない。"
msgstr "  His smile was no longer bitter."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16863:12909: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16863
msgctxt "text_id=12909 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の一言で、彼は老婆の選択が前者になるよう、努力しようと決めたのだ。"
msgstr "  He would do whatever he could to help that old woman choose to assist others in need."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16896:12910: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0170; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16896
msgctxt "text_id=12910 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16901:12911: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16901
msgctxt "text_id=12911 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸に言わせれば、その迷いのなさこそ、よっぽど自由に眩しく見える。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru thought that such unwavering confidence was the sign of true freedom."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16912:12912: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0171; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16912
msgctxt "text_id=12912 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「気にするな、礼を言うならお互いさまだ。"
msgstr "\"Don't worry about it. I needed it just as much as you."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16918:12913: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_8DOT5_0172; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16918
msgctxt "text_id=12913 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　じゃあな草十郎。休み明けに、また学校で」"
msgstr "  See you after the break.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16951:12914: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16951
msgctxt "text_id=12914 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　愛想のない捨て台詞だったが、そんな鳶丸の態度も気にせず、草十郎は満面の笑みで手を挙げて走っていった。"
msgstr "  His goodbye wasn't the friendliest, but Soujyuro didn't mind. He ran home with a big smile on his face."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16956:12915: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16956
msgctxt "text_id=12915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに心底から困った笑みを浮かべて、鳶丸も歩道橋を後にする。"
msgstr "  Tobimaru's smile was a bit less carefree as he left the footbridge."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16963:12916: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16963
msgctxt "text_id=12916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時刻は午後四時半。"
msgstr "  The time was four-thirty in the evening."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:16968:12917: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:16968
msgctxt "text_id=12917 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　真冬の町並みはほどなくして、夜の<帳|とばり>を降ろしていった。"
msgstr "  Night would soon fall over the midwinter landscape."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17055:12918: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0067; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17055
msgctxt "text_id=12918 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ただいま。今夜はまた、一段と冷えるね」"
msgstr "\"I'm home! Looks like it's going to be a cold one tonight again.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17071:12919: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17071
msgctxt "text_id=12919 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎が戻ると、居間には青子と有珠の姿があった。"
msgstr "  Aoko and Alice were both in the drawing room when he returned."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17076:12920: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17076
msgctxt "text_id=12920 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりともまだ夕食前らしい。"
msgstr "  Neither of them had eaten dinner yet."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17081:12921: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17081
msgctxt "text_id=12921 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はむすっとした顔で、"
msgstr "  Aoko looked displeased."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17098:12922: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17098
msgctxt "text_id=12922 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はどことなく落ち着かない様子でソファーに座っている。"
msgstr "  Alice sat uncomfortably on the sofa."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17129:12923: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0068; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17129
msgctxt "text_id=12923 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あれ。もしかして、こっちの帰りを待っていたのか？」"
msgstr "\"Huh, were you two waiting for me to get home?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17147:12924: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17147
msgctxt "text_id=12924 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かすかに肯定する有珠と、"
msgstr "  Alice quietly affirmed his assumption."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17162:12925: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17162
msgctxt "text_id=12925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あからさまに否定する青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko vehemently denied it."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17195:12926: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0069; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17195
msgctxt "text_id=12926 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「蒼崎。俺の気のせいならいいんだけど、なんだか昨夜以上にどうかしてないか？」"
msgstr "\"Aozaki, I might just be imagining things, but you seem even more worked up than you were last night.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17201:12927: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17201
msgctxt "text_id=12927 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　多少は空気が読めるようになった草十郎だが、言葉遣いはまだまだお粗末である。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro had gotten slightly better at reading the room, but he still had difficulty choosing the right words."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17233:12928: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17233
msgctxt "text_id=12928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうかしてるかっ！"
msgstr "  (I'll show you worked up!)"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17239:12929: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17239
msgctxt "text_id=12929 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と切り返したい青子ではあるが、ぐっと堪える。"
msgstr "  ...Was what she wanted to say, but she stopped herself."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17244:12930: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17244
msgctxt "text_id=12930 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は別に、草十郎が気にしているほど怒ってはいないからだ。"
msgstr "  She wasn't actually all that angry with Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17249:12931: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17249
msgctxt "text_id=12931 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が。"
msgstr "  But..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17282:12932: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17282
msgctxt "text_id=12932 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「どうかしてるの、青子？」"
msgstr "\"Wait, what are you worked up about Aoko?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17302:12933: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0168; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17302
msgctxt "text_id=12933 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「してないわよ！　してるのは草十郎の方だっていうの！」"
msgstr "\"I'm not worked up about anything! If anybody's worked up about something, it's Soujyuro!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17308:12934: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17308
msgctxt "text_id=12934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠からの波状攻撃によって、むなしくも決壊してしまった。"
msgstr "  Alice's additional remark seemed to have been the tipping point."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17338:12935: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17338
msgctxt "text_id=12935 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ほら、どうかしてるじゃないか、と草十郎は無言で指摘する。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro thought this showed she was indeed worked up about something."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17370:12936: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17370
msgctxt "text_id=12936 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「静希君がどうかしたの？　彼、今夜は比較的まともだけど」"
msgstr "\"You think so? I thought he seemed more normal than usual tonight.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17380:12937: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17380
msgctxt "text_id=12937 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その言葉もどうかと思う草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro felt like that was pretty offensive too, but let it slide."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17415:12938: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0169; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17415
msgctxt "text_id=12938 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ああもう、分かったわよ。そっちから切りだすまで黙っていようと思ったけど、私の方から訊いてあげる。"
msgstr "\"Fine, if that's how you want to play it. I was going to wait for you to say something, but I'll just go ahead and ask."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17421:12939: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0170; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17421
msgctxt "text_id=12939 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　草十郎。アンタ、ほんものの光って名前に聞き覚えはない？」"
msgstr "  Soujyuro, have you ever heard of an organization called the Light of Truth?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17439:12940: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0070; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17439
msgctxt "text_id=12940 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いやまったく。はじめて聞いた」"
msgstr "\"No, not before now.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17470:12941: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0171; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17470
msgctxt "text_id=12941 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でしょうね。名簿にアンタの名前はなかったもの。なんだってあんな勘違いしちゃったんだろ。"
msgstr "\"I didn't think so. Your name wasn't in their records anywhere. How could we have messed that up so badly..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17476:12942: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0172; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17476
msgctxt "text_id=12942 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　骨折り損……とまではいかないけど、また良くない評判たてちゃった」"
msgstr "  It wasn't all for naught, but now I've set more bad rumors afloat.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17496:12943: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17496
msgctxt "text_id=12943 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は大げさにため息をついて、ソファーにぐったりとよりかかる。"
msgstr "  Aoko let out an exaggerated sigh and flopped down onto the sofa."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17501:12944: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17501
msgctxt "text_id=12944 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな青子の弱体化を好機と見たのか。"
msgstr "  Seeing Aoko in this weakened state as an opportunity..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17506:12945: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17506
msgctxt "text_id=12945 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　サンルームから<颯爽|さっそう>とテーブルに飛来する青い星が一つ。"
msgstr "  ...the blue robin flew jauntily down from the sunroom."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17557:12946: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17557
msgctxt "text_id=12946 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『ハハハ、見てたっス、ジブン見てたっス！　ご近所じゃもう尾ひれつきまくりッス！　蒼崎さんトコの娘さんがまた指一本で店潰したとかマジパネェ、指先一つでダウンとかどこまで都市伝説作る気っスかwwwwww』"
msgstr "\"Hahaha! I saw it with me own mince pies! The whole neighborhood is like, 'Oh that Aozaki girl has gone and done it again! She took down a whole business with the snap of her fingers!' You're an urban legend at this point! Hahahaha!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17577:12947: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17577
msgctxt "text_id=12947 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　チチチ、と青子の健闘をたたえる駒鳥。"
msgstr "  The robin continued to chatter praise for Aoko's deeds of valor."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17696:12948: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17696
msgctxt "text_id=12948 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを指先一つで弾き飛ばして、青子はのっそりと体を起こした。"
msgstr "  Aoko knocked it away with a flick of her finger, and picked herself up off the sofa."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17742:12949: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0173; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17742
msgctxt "text_id=12949 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……今日はお金、持ってないわね。例のアルバイトはもう終わったの？」"
msgstr "\"...I see you don't have an envelope of money today. Is your part-time job finished?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17748:12950: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0071; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17748
msgctxt "text_id=12950 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、まだ続いているよ。あのお金は預かりものだから、朝のうちに口座を作って預けておいた」"
msgstr "\"No, it's still going. I'm actually just holding that money. I made a separate bank account for it and deposited it this morning.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17768:12951: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0174; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17768
msgctxt "text_id=12951 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「預かりもの？」"
msgstr "\"You're holding it?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17785:12952: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0072; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17785
msgctxt "text_id=12952 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そう、預かりもの。きっと全額<返|かえ>すことになる」"
msgstr "\"Yep. I'll be giving it all back eventually.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17815:12953: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17815
msgctxt "text_id=12953 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして、草十郎はコートを脱ぎながらホームヘルパーのアルバイトを説明した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro took off his coat and began talking about his job as a home helper."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17820:12954: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17820
msgctxt "text_id=12954 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あくまで簡素に。事の発端と、さきほど友人と一緒にだした結論だけを口にする。"
msgstr "  He kept it simple, explaining how things began and the conclusion he'd come to with Tobimaru earlier."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17844:12955: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17844
msgctxt "text_id=12955 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はじめは突拍子のない内容に面食らった青子だったが、終わる頃には、"
msgstr "  Aoko seemed stunned by the outlandish circumstances, but in the end..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17857:12956: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0175; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17857
msgctxt "text_id=12956 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「はいはい、やっぱりね。安心したっていうか、ガッカリしたっていうか。そうよね、どう頑張っても悪事を働ける人間じゃないわよね、貴方」"
msgstr "\"Okay, okay, I should've known. I don't know if I'm relieved or disappointed. You really are incapable of doing any wrong, aren't you?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17863:12957: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17863
msgctxt "text_id=12957 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　などと、いつもの憎まれ口に戻っていた。"
msgstr "  She was back to her usual offensive self."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17905:12958: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17905
msgctxt "text_id=12958 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方。"
msgstr "  However..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17910:12959: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17910
msgctxt "text_id=12959 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ホッと一息ついた青子の対面で、ひっそり青ざめる少女がひとり。"
msgstr "  There was another girl in the room who had at this point gone pale."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17931:12960: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17931
msgctxt "text_id=12960 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「待って。という事は、それは静希君のお金ではないの？」"
msgstr "\"Wait. So you're saying that wasn't your money?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:17953:12961: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0073; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:17953
msgctxt "text_id=12961 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ああ。<他人様|ひとさま>のお金だよ」"
msgstr "\"That's right. I'm just holding it for someone else.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18000:12962: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0176; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18000
msgctxt "text_id=12962 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「有珠？"
msgstr "\"Alice?"

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18006:12963: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0177; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18006
msgctxt "text_id=12963 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　なんかとんでもない顔してるけど、どうかした？」"
msgstr "  The expression on your face right now is something else. Are you okay?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18025:12964: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18025
msgctxt "text_id=12964 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……それが。どうかはしてないけど、出前はしたわ」"
msgstr "\"...No, I'm fine. I just ordered takeout.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18031:12965: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0178; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18031
msgctxt "text_id=12965 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「はい？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18037:12966: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18037
msgctxt "text_id=12966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そっと、壊れ物を扱うように蕎麦屋と喫茶店のメニューを差しだす有珠。"
msgstr "  Alice handed out menus for the local soba noodle shop and a cafe."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18076:12967: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18076
msgctxt "text_id=12967 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それだけで事態を飲みこんでしまったのか、ざあ、と青子から血の気が引いていく。"
msgstr "  The blood drained from Aoko's face as she took everything in."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18086:12968: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18086
msgctxt "text_id=12968 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さらにそそっと、有珠から一枚のメモが差し出される。"
msgstr "  Alice quietly passed her a small note."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18091:12969: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18091
msgctxt "text_id=12969 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　走り書きとおぼしきメモには、三人分にしては余りある量の注文が―――"
msgstr "  On it was a hastily written order that was more than enough food for the three of them."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18119:12970: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0179; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18119
msgctxt "text_id=12970 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「な―――ままま、まさかもう注文を!?」"
msgstr "\"Wha- W-W-Wait, you already ordered?!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18131:12971: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18131
msgctxt "text_id=12971 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……だって。そろそろ、ご馳走のタイミングかと思って」"
msgstr "\"Well, yeah. I thought it was about time someone treated us...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18137:12972: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18137
msgctxt "text_id=12972 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うなだれる有珠の視線は、どことなく草十郎を非難していた。"
msgstr "  Alice's accusing gaze fell on Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18175:12973: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0074; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18175
msgctxt "text_id=12973 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「え？　俺？　なんで？」"
msgstr "\"Huh? Me? Why?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18197:12974: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0180; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18197
msgctxt "text_id=12974 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そりゃ、アンタがいらない期待を持たせたからでしょ。有珠、あんなに喜んでたじゃない。明日はご馳走ねって」"
msgstr "\"Because you got everyone's hopes up! Alice was looking forward to you treating us to dinner, you know!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18214:12975: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18214
msgctxt "text_id=12975 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ポン、と本日二度目の手打ち音が響く。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro clapped his hands together for the second time today."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18219:12976: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18219
msgctxt "text_id=12976 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう言えば昨日の夜、有珠はそんな事を言っていた。"
msgstr "  He remembered that Alice had said that yesterday."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18252:12977: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18252
msgctxt "text_id=12977 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ええ。あの夜、静希君は同意してくれたわ」"
msgstr "\"Yes, and you agreed!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18257:12978: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18257
msgctxt "text_id=12978 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なので自分は悪くない、と有珠は主張する。"
msgstr "  Alice was eager to emphasize that this was not her fault."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18274:12979: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0075; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18274
msgctxt "text_id=12979 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、それは」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, but...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18308:12980: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0181; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18308
msgctxt "text_id=12980 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうね。有珠のミスなのは確かだけど、悪いのはアンタもよ。大金を持ち歩くってのはそれだけで危険なんだから。"
msgstr "\"Alice may have messed up, but it's your fault! This is why you shouldn't walk around with so much money."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18314:12981: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0182; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18314
msgctxt "text_id=12981 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　いい教訓になったんじゃない？　観念して、二人で勘定を折半しなさいよ」"
msgstr "  I hope you've learned your lesson. You two are just going to have to split the bill.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18351:12982: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0076; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18351
msgctxt "text_id=12982 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、それはできない。あのお金は預けてきたし、そもそも五百円しか持ち合わせがない」"
msgstr "\"No way, I can't! That money is in the bank, and I only have five hundred yen on me.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18360:12983: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18360
msgctxt "text_id=12983 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……そう。合わせても足りないわね。……試した事はないけど、出前にキャンセルはきくのかしら……」"
msgstr "\"...He's right. Even if we pool our money together, we won't have enough. Can we cancel the order...?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18380:12984: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18380
msgctxt "text_id=12984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　絶望に包まれる久遠寺邸。"
msgstr "  An air of despair fell upon the Kuonji Estate."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18385:12985: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18385
msgctxt "text_id=12985 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを他人事のように眺めつつ、やれやれと青子はため息をついた。"
msgstr "  Aoko sighed as if none of this involved her."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18390:12986: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18390
msgctxt "text_id=12986 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……甘やかすのはよくないが、これも星の巡り合わせなのだろう、と。"
msgstr "  She hated to coddle them, but perhaps this was her fate."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18434:12987: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0183; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18434
msgctxt "text_id=12987 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――ま、そうなるか。"
msgstr "\"I should've known this would happen."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18440:12988: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0184; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18440
msgctxt "text_id=12988 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　いいわよ、私が出してあげる。今日は臨時収入があったから、パァーッと派手に使いましょう」"
msgstr "  It's fine. I'll pay for it. I got some unexpected income today, so I might as well use it.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18468:12989: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18468
msgctxt "text_id=12989 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　思いがけぬ青子の提案に、ふたりは何事かと顔を上げる。"
msgstr "  Aoko's sudden proposal made both Soujyuro and Alice perk up."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18489:12990: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_8DOT5_0077; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18489
msgctxt "text_id=12990 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「つまり、蒼崎のおごり？」"
msgstr "\"Wait, you're going to treat us, Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18495:12991: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_8DOT5_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18495
msgctxt "text_id=12991 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「そんな……信じられない。いいの青子……？」"
msgstr "\"I can't believe my ears. Are you sure, Aoko?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18532:12992: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0185; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18532
msgctxt "text_id=12992 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「呼んじゃったものは今さら止められないでしょ。"
msgstr "\"Well, you've already called in the order. We can't cancel now."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18538:12993: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0186; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18538
msgctxt "text_id=12993 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　さっき電話したんなら、今ごろはもう坂を登ってきてるだろうし。"
msgstr "  If you called them earlier, they're probably already on their way up the hill."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18544:12994: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0187; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18544
msgctxt "text_id=12994 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……まあ、そもそも。このお金も草十郎が発端だしね。人助けをしたら、被害者の会からお礼をもらっちゃったのよ」"
msgstr "  We got this money because of Soujyuro, anyway. It's a thank you present from the victim's advocacy group.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18570:12995: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0188; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18570
msgctxt "text_id=12995 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「だから気にしないで。なんか居心地悪かったし、浄財と思って商店街に還元する。……本音いうと、ちょっともったいないけどね」"
msgstr "\"It felt weird taking it from them, and this way it goes back into the shopping district anyway. So don't worry about it. I do think it's a bit of a waste, though, if I'm being honest.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18576:12996: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18576
msgctxt "text_id=12996 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おお、と<喝采|かっさい>をあげる同居人たち。"
msgstr "  Her roommates began celebrating."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18586:12997: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18586
msgctxt "text_id=12997 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その喜びようを見ながら、青子はぼすん、とソファーに沈みこんだ。"
msgstr "  Aoko sank back onto the sofa upon seeing the happiness her gesture brought."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18619:12998: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0189; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18619
msgctxt "text_id=12998 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……あーあ。悪銭身に付かずって言うけど、ホントその通り。臨時収入は泡と消えた、か」"
msgstr "\"Oh well... Easy come, easy go. All that extra money, gone just like that.\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18625:12999: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18625
msgctxt "text_id=12999 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……かくして。"
msgstr "  And thus..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18630:13000: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18630
msgctxt "text_id=13000 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　降って湧いた大金にまつわる、ちょっとした事件はこうして幕を下ろしたのである。"
msgstr "  The curtain closed on a little incident involving a lot of cash."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18650:13001: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18650
msgctxt "text_id=13001 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　テーブルには再度飛来する青い星。"
msgstr "  The blue robin flew down to the table again."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18668:13002: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18668
msgctxt "text_id=13002 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『……ああ。まったく、イヤな<事|ヤ><件|マ>だったぜ……』"
msgstr "\"...Whew! That one'd knock you right out of yer Goldilocks, eh?\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18674:13003: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18674
msgctxt "text_id=13003 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駒鳥はチチチと鳴き声をあげながら、煙草を吹かすジェスチャーなどに興じている。"
msgstr "  The robin chirped and mimicked puffing on a cigarette."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18714:13004: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0014; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18714
msgctxt "text_id=13004 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『まあ、それはそれとして。"
msgstr "\"Anyway, all 'er that aside..."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18720:13005: voice_id=BA0_8DOT5_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18720
msgctxt "text_id=13005 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子さんの空回りっぷりを忘れないよう、これをカーモネーギー事件として記録しとくッスね！』"
msgstr "  Let's always remember this as 'The Dosh Affair' so that we never forget the gravel and grit Miss Aoko dragged herself through!\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18726:13006: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18726
msgctxt "text_id=13006 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つぶらな瞳で、今日最大の功労者に笑いかける青い鳥。"
msgstr "  The blue robin continued to laugh at that day's hero."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18775:13007: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18775
msgctxt "text_id=13007 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを指先一つでバウンドさせた頃、玄関からのノックがあった。"
msgstr "  Aoko flicked the bird away just as someone knocked at the door."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18809:13008: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18809
msgctxt "text_id=13008 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠が頼んだメニューはお気に入りの洋食店のオムライスと、喫茶店からのケーキセット。"
msgstr "  Alice had ordered her favorite omelet dish and a set of cakes from the cafe."

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18816:13009: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_8DOT5_0190; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18816
msgctxt "text_id=13009 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「まあ、それなら―――」"
msgstr "\"Might as well enjoy...\""

#. Occurrence 8DOT5:18822:13010: scene=8DOT5
#: 8DOT5:18822
msgctxt "text_id=13010 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　労働の報酬にしては悪くない、と現代の魔女はこっそり気を取り直すのだった。"
msgstr "  Aoko was quietly satisfied with the spoils of an honest day's work."

#. Occurrence 9_0:47:13011: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:47
msgctxt "text_id=13011 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　師匠も走る十二月。"
msgstr "  December, the month when even monks were busy at work."

#. Occurrence 9_0:52:13012: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:52
msgctxt "text_id=13012 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一年の総決算。"
msgstr "  It was the culmination of the year."

#. Occurrence 9_0:57:13013: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:57
msgctxt "text_id=13013 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やり残しを溜めに溜めた<不始末|ふしまつ>故か、<師走|しわす>の月日は<瞬|またた>く間に過ぎ去っていく。"
msgstr "  Perhaps due to all the put-off tasks built up through the seasons, the month always seemed to pass by in the blink of an eye."

#. Occurrence 9_0:79:13014: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:79
msgctxt "text_id=13014 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時に十二月某日。"
msgstr "  It was a day^ like any other in December."

#. Occurrence 9_0:84:13015: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:84
msgctxt "text_id=13015 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何をやっているんだか互いに不明であるが、青子も有珠も草十郎も、忙しげな毎日を過ごしていた。"
msgstr "  Though none of them were any the wiser to what the others were doing, Aoko, Alice, and Soujyuro had spent the day attending to their own affairs."

#. Occurrence 9_0:137:13016: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:137
msgctxt "text_id=13016 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なに、コレ」"
msgstr "\"What...is this?\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:161:13017: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:161
msgctxt "text_id=13017 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　殺意を押し殺した、険悪<極|きわ>まりない声が響く。"
msgstr "  Aoko kept the urge to kill out of her voice, but her menacing tone still reverberated in the room."

#. Occurrence 9_0:194:13018: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:194
msgctxt "text_id=13018 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　サンルームは中庭を一望できるため、天気の良い日など食堂として使われる。"
msgstr "  The sunroom was often used to dine in when the weather was nice, since it overlooked the courtyard."

#. Occurrence 9_0:199:13019: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:199
msgctxt "text_id=13019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　歴史のある洋館に相応しい、家具も内装も一級品で纏められた空間である。"
msgstr "  It was a room decorated with high-quality furniture and upholstery befitting an historic western style mansion."

#. Occurrence 9_0:228:13020: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:228
msgctxt "text_id=13020 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　中国風の様式美を混ぜ合わせたチッペンデール式と、スマートながら英国の歴史を受け継ぐジョージアン式との融合は、庶民である青子ですら“ここでの非貴族的行為は自粛しよう”と誓わせる程だ。"
msgstr "  The fusion of Chinese Chippendale aesthetics and traditional English Georgian elegance caused even Aoko, a commoner, to think twice about doing anything \"unaristocratic\" on the grounds."

#. Occurrence 9_0:233:13021: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:233
msgctxt "text_id=13021 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正直なところ<無|む><駄|だ><遣|づか>い以外の何物でもないと呆れもしているが、自分の財布が痛んだ訳でもないのでいいぞもっとやれ、という心境でもある。"
msgstr "  Truthfully, she was sickened by the flagrant waste of money, but none of it was paid for out of her pocket, so she could have cared less what the purchaser spent their money on."

#. Occurrence 9_0:253:13022: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:253
msgctxt "text_id=13022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな高級感あふれるサンルームのテーブルに、目を疑う異物が三つ、鎮座していた。"
msgstr "  Three unbelievably out-of-place offerings sat atop the lavish sunroom's table, as if enshrined."

#. Occurrence 9_0:271:13023: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:271
msgctxt "text_id=13023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この部屋で見ると、得体の知れない宇宙食に見えなくもない。"
msgstr "  In stark contrast to the room, they appeared like meals prepared by aliens."

#. Occurrence 9_0:297:13024: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:297
msgctxt "text_id=13024 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎。これ、なんか新しい冗談？」"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro. Is this your idea of a practical joke?\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:303:13025: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:303
msgctxt "text_id=13025 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふるふると<片手|かたて><拳|こぶし>を震わせながら、青子は今日の食事当番に問いかける。"
msgstr "  Aoko's trembling fists clenched and unclenched, as she questioned the one responsible for today's menu."

#. Occurrence 9_0:308:13026: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:308
msgctxt "text_id=13026 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時刻は午後九時。"
msgstr "  The clock struck nine in the evening."

#. Occurrence 9_0:313:13027: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:313
msgctxt "text_id=13027 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夕食を用意したシェフはうん、と素直に頷いた。"
msgstr "  Tonight's executive chef nodded dutifully, eager to explain."

#. Occurrence 9_0:347:13028: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:347
msgctxt "text_id=13028 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「コレはうちの会社の新製品。"
msgstr "\"It's a new product from my workplace."

#. Occurrence 9_0:353:13029: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:353
msgctxt "text_id=13029 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　パチモンくさいが中身はほんとにパチモンだ、と木乃美が言ってた。でも俺は本物よりいいと思う。"
msgstr "  Kinomi said it looks and tastes fake, but honestly I think it's better than the real thing."

#. Occurrence 9_0:364:13030: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:364
msgctxt "text_id=13030 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　そんなコトより評価すべきは、社内販売なんで一個四十円をきる低価格だ。"
msgstr "  Besides, they're only forty yen each after the company discount."

#. Occurrence 9_0:371:13031: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:371
msgctxt "text_id=13031 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "すごいぞ、卵をつけても六十円とか」"
msgstr "A steal, right? Even with the egg on top it's still only sixty yen or so.\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:390:13032: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:390
msgctxt "text_id=13032 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　驚きだ、と感心する手抜きシェフ。"
msgstr "  The corner-cutting chef seemed pleased with himself."

#. Occurrence 9_0:405:13033: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:405
msgctxt "text_id=13033 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そりゃ誰だって驚くわ、とひとり吐き捨てる青子だった。"
msgstr "  Aoko wanted to grumble that the real steal was her appetite."

#. Occurrence 9_0:426:13034: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:426
msgctxt "text_id=13034 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そう、良かったわね。"
msgstr "\"Well, isn't that nice for you."

#. Occurrence 9_0:432:13035: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:432
msgctxt "text_id=13035 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ところで今日の夕飯はどこにあるの？」"
msgstr "  Now, where's tonight's dinner?\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:461:13036: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:461
msgctxt "text_id=13036 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シェフは二秒ほど考えこんで、ぽん、と両手を合わせた。"
msgstr "  Chef Soujyuro thought for a second or two, then clapped his hands together in realization."

#. Occurrence 9_0:472:13037: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:472
msgctxt "text_id=13037 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「蒼崎、そんなに食べると太るよ」"
msgstr "\"Aozaki, you know if you eat too much you'll get fat.\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:514:13038: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:514
msgctxt "text_id=13038 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「つまり、"
msgstr "\"So what you're telling me is..."

#. Occurrence 9_0:514:13039: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:514
msgctxt "text_id=13039 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　これが夕飯だって言い張る気なのねアンタはーっ！」"
msgstr "  This slop is what you call dinner!?\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:527:13040: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:527
msgctxt "text_id=13040 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「言い張るも何も、これ以外用意していない」"
msgstr "\"No complaints. I'm not making anything else.\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:561:13041: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:561
msgctxt "text_id=13041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりはそこで睨み合う。"
msgstr "  The two stood there, glaring at each other."

#. Occurrence 9_0:566:13042: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:566
msgctxt "text_id=13042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はこんなもの食べるものかと徹底抗戦の意を示し、"
msgstr "  Aoko gave off an air that said she would rather die than eat his \"food,\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:571:13043: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:571
msgctxt "text_id=13043 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は食べてもらえる事を大前提と信じており、"
msgstr "  while Soujyuro was convinced she would capitulate eventually."

#. Occurrence 9_0:576:13044: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:576
msgctxt "text_id=13044 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまつさえ、好き嫌いはいけないぞ、なんて教育理念まで持ち始めていた。"
msgstr "  He even considered chiding her for being a picky eater."

#. Occurrence 9_0:581:13045: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:581
msgctxt "text_id=13045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　相変わらず両者の思考は噛み合わない。"
msgstr "  As usual, the two could not see eye to eye."

#. Occurrence 9_0:613:13046: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:613
msgctxt "text_id=13046 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「イヤ。私は食べないからね、こんなの」"
msgstr "\"No way. There's no way I'm eating... whatever this is.\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:630:13047: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:630
msgctxt "text_id=13047 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「お姫さまみたいなこと言うんじゃない。大体、今日の夕食代はこれで三名さま二百円未満なんだぞ」"
msgstr "\"Don't be such a spoiled princess. Besides, tonight's dinner only cost two hundred yen for the three of us.\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:636:13048: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:636
msgctxt "text_id=13048 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けいざい的だ、と胸を張る草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro puffed his chest out at his penny-pinching prowess."

#. Occurrence 9_0:698:13049: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:698
msgctxt "text_id=13049 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はふたりの言い合いと、目前に置かれた未知の食器……実物を見るのは初めてらしい……を交互に眺めていた。もはや完全に傍観者である。"
msgstr "  Alice alternated her gaze between the two quarreling roommates and the strange food before her, which she had also never seen before. She remained a mere bystander in all this."

#. Occurrence 9_0:735:13050: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:735
msgctxt "text_id=13050 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「し、信じられない……ひとり六十円の食事って、アンタ一体いつの生まれよ!?"
msgstr "\"U-unbelievable... a sixty-yen meal for one person? What year is it!?"

#. Occurrence 9_0:742:13051: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:742
msgctxt "text_id=13051 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　このご時世、新しくできた牛丼屋ですら贅沢に原価あげてるわよ、ばか！」"
msgstr "  These days, even cheap beef bowl places spend more on ingredients!\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:755:13052: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:755
msgctxt "text_id=13052 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「…………蒼崎。一ヶ月の食費が三万円だけで、あんな好き勝手な食生活をしていたら、俺が君たちに殺される前に全員が飢え死ぬと思うんだ」"
msgstr "\"...Aozaki. If we ate the way you wanted with only thirty thousand yen for food each month, I'm pretty sure we would all starve to death before you two could kill me.\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:814:13053: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:814
msgctxt "text_id=13053 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「たしかに昨日の有珠の肉料理は素晴らしかった。"
msgstr "\"I mean, sure, the meat Alice cooked yesterday was really something."

#. Occurrence 9_0:820:13054: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:820
msgctxt "text_id=13054 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　グラム七百円から肉は種類が変わるんだって感動した。"
msgstr "  I was impressed at the difference in quality at seven hundred yen per ounce."

#. Occurrence 9_0:826:13055: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:826
msgctxt "text_id=13055 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　生協の果汁百パーセントジュースだって、ちょっと本気で馬鹿にできるもんじゃないと反省したよ。"
msgstr "  Even the 100% juice from the co-op made me rethink the idea of fresh food."

#. Occurrence 9_0:836:13056: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:836
msgctxt "text_id=13056 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　けど、あれが三日続いたらこの家はどうなってしまうんだい？」"
msgstr "  But, if we keep eating like we have for the last three days, we'll go broke.\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:856:13057: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:856
msgctxt "text_id=13057 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　珍しく常識的な事を口にする草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was making perfect sense, for once."

#. Occurrence 9_0:861:13058: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:861
msgctxt "text_id=13058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ひっそりと抗議の眼差しを向ける有珠だが、幸い、青子も草十郎も気付かなかった。"
msgstr "  Fortunately, neither Aoko nor Soujyuro noticed the silent stare of disapproval coming from Alice."

#. Occurrence 9_0:901:13059: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:901
msgctxt "text_id=13059 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「その時はその時よ。"
msgstr "\"We'll cross that bridge when we come to it."

#. Occurrence 9_0:907:13060: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:907
msgctxt "text_id=13060 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それにね、昨日みたいなのは滅多にないの。有珠はアンタの料理に触発されて柄にもなく頑張ったみたいだけど！」"
msgstr "  And I should note, a meal like yesterday's was a rarity. But maybe I should thank you, since your meals have inspired Alice to put some effort into hers for a change!\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:925:13061: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:925
msgctxt "text_id=13061 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の言葉に、有珠は静かに瞳を閉じる。"
msgstr "  With Aoko's words, Alice closed her eyes."

#. Occurrence 9_0:930:13062: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:930
msgctxt "text_id=13062 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……もしかすると、ああして怒りを抑えているのかもしれない。"
msgstr "  ...She might have been trying to quell her anger."

#. Occurrence 9_0:963:13063: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:963
msgctxt "text_id=13063 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……信じられない。じゃあ、今までどんな生活してたんだ、蒼崎たちは」"
msgstr "\"You astonish me, you know. How did you even get by before me?\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:982:13064: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:982
msgctxt "text_id=13064 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「その時は、それぞれでなんとかやってたわ。飢え死に一歩手前ぐらい、いい精神修行じゃない」"
msgstr "\"We made it work, thank you very much. Besides, living life one step from starvation keeps you on your toes.\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:988:13065: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:988
msgctxt "text_id=13065 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:993:13066: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:993
msgctxt "text_id=13066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりの潔さに絶句する。"
msgstr "  Her brazen response left him speechless."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1031:13067: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1031
msgctxt "text_id=13067 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……また、これは後の話ではあるが、月の終わりになると頻繁に某会長が昼食をおごらせにやってくる、と某副会長は告発するのだった。"
msgstr "  Though a story for another time, Soujyuro remembered a warning from a certain vice president who had complained about a certain president incessantly bugging him to take her to lunch at the end of the month."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1037:13068: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1037
msgctxt "text_id=13068 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはともかくとして。"
msgstr "  But that was neither here nor there."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1071:13069: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1071
msgctxt "text_id=13069 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そんな昔のコトより今のコト！"
msgstr "\"That was then, and this is now!"

#. Occurrence 9_0:1077:13070: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1077
msgctxt "text_id=13070 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　前に見せたあの腕はどこにいったのよ草十郎!?　あれを見こんで今日の夕飯を任せたっていうのに！」"
msgstr "  Where are those cooking skills you displayed before, Soujyuro!? That's the only reason I trusted you with today's meal!\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:1083:13071: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1083
msgctxt "text_id=13071 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……なんだかんだと、青子はそれが一番悔しいらしい。"
msgstr "  Out of everything, that seemed to be what ate at Aoko the most."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1088:13072: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1088
msgctxt "text_id=13072 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの時の焼きうどんはいたく好評で、起きたばかりの青子の不機嫌っぷりは一口で解消してしまったほどだ。"
msgstr "  The stir-fried yaki-udon he had prepared previously had been very well received. It had even melted away Aoko's morning grumpiness with just one bite."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1108:13073: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1108
msgctxt "text_id=13073 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし草十郎は、あれが数少ないレパートリーの一つだという事を語っていない。"
msgstr "  However, Soujyuro had not seen fit to tell them that it was one of the only dishes in his limited repertoire."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1113:13074: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1113
msgctxt "text_id=13074 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　男料理とは、基本的に<独身|ひとり>に<唯一|ひとつ>の<異能力|レシピ>なのだ。"
msgstr "  For a bachelor, the ability to cook is as close to a superpower as one could get."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1118:13075: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1118
msgctxt "text_id=13075 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あと十五年ぐらいしたら流行りそうな特殊能力みたいなもんである。"
msgstr "  Fifteen years into the future, it would likely become a highly desirable trait."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1153:13076: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1153
msgctxt "text_id=13076 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　以上の誤解から、有珠と青子は草十郎の料理技術を過大評価していたりする。"
msgstr "  Regardless, that misunderstanding had led Aoko and Alice to overestimate Soujyuro's culinary talents."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1158:13077: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1158
msgctxt "text_id=13077 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこに原因があったのか、と納得する草十郎。"
msgstr "  Her ire finally made sense to Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1193:13078: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1193
msgctxt "text_id=13078 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……分かった、自腹を切るから出前をとろう。作るにしても材料がないからな。"
msgstr "\"...All right. Fine. We can order in. There's nothing here to cook anyway."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1204:13079: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_0_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1204
msgctxt "text_id=13079 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　そのかわり、それは回収する」"
msgstr "  But only if you clear up.\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:1230:13080: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1230
msgctxt "text_id=13080 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うむ、と自らの勝利を喜ぶ青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko basked in her victory."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1266:13081: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1266
msgctxt "text_id=13081 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が。出前の献立を取りに行く草十郎の顔を見て、青子は自分の勘違いに気付いてしまった。"
msgstr "  It was then, after seeing Soujyuro's face as he went to fetch the delivery menu, Aoko realized her misreading of him."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1271:13082: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1271
msgctxt "text_id=13082 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子がカチンときたのは、夕食に手を抜くとは何事か、という点が大きい。"
msgstr "  What annoyed Aoko most was the fact that such little effort was put into dinner."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1276:13083: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1276
msgctxt "text_id=13083 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど草十郎にとって、この夕食は手抜きでもなんでもなく、本気で食べてみたかったのだろう。"
msgstr "  But to Soujyuro, this dinner had not been about cutting corners, but rather about a meal he had legitimately wanted to try."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1309:13084: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1309
msgctxt "text_id=13084 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山育ちはこういう物でも喜ぶのか、と青子はつくづく感心する。"
msgstr "  Aoko ruminated on how it could probably pass as food for someone raised in the mountains."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1314:13085: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1314
msgctxt "text_id=13085 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と。"
msgstr "  ...And then."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1341:13086: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1341
msgctxt "text_id=13086 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……？　有珠、何してるの？」"
msgstr "\"...? Alice, what are you doing?\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:1347:13087: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1347
msgctxt "text_id=13087 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はようやく、有珠がテーブルに近寄り、しっかりとどんぶりを持っている事に気がついた。"
msgstr "  Aoko noticed Alice standing near the table, holding one of the bowls tightly."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1378:13088: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0014_A; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1378
msgctxt "text_id=13088 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「もうそれはいいんだってば。"
msgstr "\"Would you put that down already?"

#. Occurrence 9_0:1384:13089: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_0_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1384
msgctxt "text_id=13089 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　草十郎に返して、きちんとした出前にしましょ」"
msgstr "  I need to give those back to Soujyuro so we can eat a proper meal.\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:1404:13090: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1404
msgctxt "text_id=13090 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子に言われても、有珠はどんぶりから手を離さない。"
msgstr "  Despite Aoko's words, Alice stood her ground, firmly clutching the bowl."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1409:13091: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1409
msgctxt "text_id=13091 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　むしろ抱くように持ちあげ、"
msgstr "  In fact, she seemed to be embracing it."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1420:13092: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_0_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1420
msgctxt "text_id=13092 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「これ、わたしのだから」"
msgstr "\"This one is mine.\""

#. Occurrence 9_0:1442:13093: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1442
msgctxt "text_id=13093 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静かな有珠の声が、閑散としたサンルームに響きわたる。"
msgstr "  Alice's faint voice drifted across the sunroom."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1465:13094: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1465
msgctxt "text_id=13094 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうやら多数決によって、今夜の献立は決定したらしい。"
msgstr "  And just like that, the night's menu had been decided by majority rule."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1470:13095: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1470
msgctxt "text_id=13095 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まさかそんな、と青子は力なく肩を落とす。"
msgstr "  Aoko's shoulders sank in disappointment at her lot that evening."

#. Occurrence 9_0:1475:13096: scene=9_0
#: 9_0:1475
msgctxt "text_id=13096 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そういえば、有珠の『自分の物』に対する執着心は異常なものがあったなぁ、と思い返しながら。"
msgstr "  Come to think of it, Alice was always peculiar about things she deemed \"hers.\""

#. Occurrence 9_1:50:13097: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:50
msgctxt "text_id=13097 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　十二月も残すところ十日をきった朝。"
msgstr "  It was morning, and there were ten days left in December."

#. Occurrence 9_1:67:13098: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:67
msgctxt "text_id=13098 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もうじきクリスマスと浮かれる町並みに逆行するように、草十郎はアルバイトに向かっていた。"
msgstr "  While the rest of the city was preparing for Christmas festivities, Soujyuro headed to his part-time job."

#. Occurrence 9_1:72:13099: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:72
msgctxt "text_id=13099 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今にも雪が降ってきそうな空の下、並木道は鮮やかに賑わっている。"
msgstr "  Though it looked like it could snow at any minute, the tree-lined streets were busy with foot traffic."

#. Occurrence 9_1:77:13100: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:77
msgctxt "text_id=13100 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここ数日は特に華やかだ。"
msgstr "  These days were particularly merry."

#. Occurrence 9_1:82:13101: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:82
msgctxt "text_id=13101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冬休みの学生たちは日々親しい友人と顔を合わせ、間近に迫ったイベントを指折り数えて待っている。"
msgstr "  Students on winter break spent their days hanging out with friends while they counted down the days until the holidays."

#. Occurrence 9_1:110:13102: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:110
msgctxt "text_id=13102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔よけのお札のように乱立する特製ケーキの見出し。"
msgstr "  Colorful Christmas cakes lined storefronts, placed like charms to ward off evil."

#. Occurrence 9_1:115:13103: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:115
msgctxt "text_id=13103 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ビルの壁一面に貼られた巨大広告。"
msgstr "  Huge advertisements adorned the sides of buildings."

#. Occurrence 9_1:120:13104: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:120
msgctxt "text_id=13104 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駅前広場に集まった数々の露店。"
msgstr "  The station plaza bustled with pop-up stalls."

#. Occurrence 9_1:149:13105: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:149
msgctxt "text_id=13105 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そういった都会の町の賑わいを横目に、草十郎は電話ボックスに入る。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro stepped out of the milling crowd and into a phone booth."

#. Occurrence 9_1:154:13106: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:154
msgctxt "text_id=13106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　中も冷えきっていたが、冬の風が入らないだけ暖かい。"
msgstr "  Safe from the winter wind, the inside seemed warm by comparison."

#. Occurrence 9_1:172:13107: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:172
msgctxt "text_id=13107 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雪山にこういうのを置いたら便利なんじゃないか、などと思いつつ、"
msgstr "  The thought that it would actually be nice to have one in the mountains "

msgctxt "text_id=13108 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "草十郎は電話に十円玉を投入する。"
msgstr "crossed his mind as he inserted a coin into the phone."

#. Occurrence 9_1:195:13109: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:195
msgctxt "text_id=13109 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それなりに慣れた手つきで、暗記したナンバーをプッシュする。"
msgstr "  He dialed a number from memory, his fingers punching the keys with a somewhat practiced motion."

#. Occurrence 9_1:200:13110: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:200
msgctxt "text_id=13110 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　コールが鳴るまで約五秒。"
msgstr "  After about five seconds, the phone began to ring."

#. Occurrence 9_1:206:13111: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:206
msgctxt "text_id=13111 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　コールが鳴ってから、またも五秒。"
msgstr "  Another five seconds, another ring..."

#. Occurrence 9_1:225:13112: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:225
msgctxt "text_id=13112 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　十秒間の待ち時間。"
msgstr "  Ten seconds had passed."

#. Occurrence 9_1:230:13113: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:230
msgctxt "text_id=13113 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　電話ボックスからビルの壁に飾られた広告を見上げて、今さらながら人々の多種多様さに感心したりする。"
msgstr "  He gazed through the window at the various signs on the surrounding buildings, and marveled at the sheer number of people out and about so early."

#. Occurrence 9_1:250:13114: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:250
msgctxt "text_id=13114 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　電話番号は槻司鳶丸のものである。"
msgstr "  The number he dialed was that of Tobimaru Tsukiji."

#. Occurrence 9_1:255:13115: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:255
msgctxt "text_id=13115 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司家は三咲市に深く関わりのある家―――古くからの地主、名家であるらしい。"
msgstr "  The Tsukiji name was well-known in Misaki as a distinguished landowning family going back generations."

#. Occurrence 9_1:260:13116: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:260
msgctxt "text_id=13116 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その豪邸は隣町である<社木|やしろぎ>にある。"
msgstr "  Incidentally, their residence was located in the neighboring town of Yashirogi."

#. Occurrence 9_1:278:13117: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:278
msgctxt "text_id=13117 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呼び出し音に取ってかわったのは、感じの良い初老の婦人の声だった。"
msgstr "  A kind, elderly female voice finally replaced the ringtone."

#. Occurrence 9_1:283:13118: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:283
msgctxt "text_id=13118 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　婦人は丁寧な挨拶の後、目的の人物に繋げてくれた。"
msgstr "  After her polite greeting, she handed over the phone to Soujyuro's target."

#. Occurrence 9_1:304:13119: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_1_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_1
#: 9_1:304
msgctxt "text_id=13119 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「おはよう、鳶丸」"
msgstr "\"Morning, Tobimaru.\""

#. Occurrence 9_1:310:13120: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_9_1_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=9_1
#: 9_1:310
msgctxt "text_id=13120 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "『……あい、おはよう』"
msgstr "\"'Ey. Mornin'.\""

#. Occurrence 9_1:315:13121: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:315
msgctxt "text_id=13121 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　寝惚けているのか、そんな返答が受話器ごしに返される。"
msgstr "  He was still half-asleep, or so it sounded to Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_1:321:13122: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_1_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_1
#: 9_1:321
msgctxt "text_id=13122 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ひとつ相談があるんだけど、いいか？」"
msgstr "\"I need to ask you something. Do you have a second?\""

#. Occurrence 9_1:327:13123: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_9_1_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=9_1
#: 9_1:327
msgctxt "text_id=13123 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "『うむ、よきにはからえ』"
msgstr "\"Mm. Speak.\""

#. Occurrence 9_1:357:13124: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:357
msgctxt "text_id=13124 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……大丈夫かなこの男、と不安に思いつつ、草十郎はまっすぐ本題を切りだした。"
msgstr "  His response did not exactly inspire confidence in Soujyuro, but he cut right to the chase."

#. Occurrence 9_1:363:13125: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_9_1_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=9_1
#: 9_1:363
msgctxt "text_id=13125 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "『………………』"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_1:368:13126: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:368
msgctxt "text_id=13126 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しばらく無音。"
msgstr "  There was a long pause."

#. Occurrence 9_1:373:13127: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:373
msgctxt "text_id=13127 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　受話器の向こうの副会長が、どんな呆れ顔をしているかは分からない。"
msgstr "  He was hard to read from this end of the receiver."

#. Occurrence 9_1:394:13128: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_9_1_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=9_1
#: 9_1:394
msgctxt "text_id=13128 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "『……あのな、んな単純なコトで俺を起こすな。"
msgstr "\"...This is what you wake me up for?"

#. Occurrence 9_1:400:13129: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_9_1_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=9_1
#: 9_1:400
msgctxt "text_id=13129 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　いいか草十郎。仲が悪けりゃ遊びに行け。機嫌をとりたきゃいいとこ見せろ。んで、それが合わなきゃ早めに手を切れ。俺ができるアドバイスはそんなもんだ』"
msgstr "  Listen here, Soujyuro. If she's mad at you, take her out somewhere. Try to butter her up, show her a good time. If that doesn't do the trick, then cut her loose. What do you want me to say?\""

#. Occurrence 9_1:421:13130: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:421
msgctxt "text_id=13130 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　以上、と鳶丸は電話を切った。"
msgstr "  And with a \"peace,\" Tobimaru hung up."

#. Occurrence 9_1:426:13131: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:426
msgctxt "text_id=13131 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう朝の十時だというのに、まるで朝の六時のような鳶丸の対応に、うむ、と草十郎は真剣に頷いた。"
msgstr "  It may have been ten in the morning to Soujyuro, but after dealing with what seemed like a six o'clock Tobimaru, all he could do nod earnestly."

#. Occurrence 9_1:443:13132: scene=9_1
#: 9_1:443
msgctxt "text_id=13132 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　適当にあしらわれた気はするが、たしかにそれは一番現実的な気がする、と感心しながら。"
msgstr "  He had a feeling his friend had just been trying to end the call, but deep down, he knew that the advice was sound."

#. Occurrence 9_2:52:13133: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:52
msgctxt "text_id=13133 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　電話ボックスの一件から買い物を済ませ、正午前。"
msgstr "  After the phone ordeal, Soujyuro finished up his shopping and returned to the mansion just before noon."

#. Occurrence 9_2:57:13134: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:57
msgctxt "text_id=13134 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎が洋館に戻ると、青子と有珠は暗い面持ちで黙りこんでいた。"
msgstr "  He was greeted by the sight of Aoko and Alice sitting in silent gloom."

#. Occurrence 9_2:77:13135: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:77
msgctxt "text_id=13135 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　事情を知らない第三者が見れば喧嘩の後にしか見えない。"
msgstr "  Though he was unsure of the circumstances, from the outside looking in, it seemed like the aftermath of an argument."

#. Occurrence 9_2:107:13136: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:107
msgctxt "text_id=13136 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは<吹雪|ふぶ>くような、チクチク痛いやらヒリヒリ寒いやらな、沈黙による暴力である。"
msgstr "  The silence was as deafening as a blizzard...or rather, the biting cold and stinging wind of it."

#. Occurrence 9_2:112:13137: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:112
msgctxt "text_id=13137 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間は巨大な冷蔵庫と化している。"
msgstr "  One might also compare the drawing room to an enormous walk-in freezer."

#. Occurrence 9_2:117:13138: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:117
msgctxt "text_id=13138 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ちょっと天井を見上げれば、<氷柱|つらら>が垂れていても不思議ではないぐらいだ。"
msgstr "  It would not have been surprising to look up and see icicles hanging from the ceiling."

#. Occurrence 9_2:157:13139: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:157
msgctxt "text_id=13139 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "“やっぱり、今日もか”"
msgstr "(They're at it again.)"

#. Occurrence 9_2:169:13140: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:169
msgctxt "text_id=13140 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アライグマとペンギンの仲違いに心痛める飼育員……"
msgstr "  He felt like a zookeeper pained to see the raccoon and penguin at each other's throats."

msgctxt "text_id=13141 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "つい先日、日雇いで動物園の清掃をしてきた草十郎である……"
msgstr " In fact, he had seen this literally happen the other day at his zoo janitor job,"

msgctxt "text_id=13142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "のような顔つきで、草十郎は青子たちを流し見る。"
msgstr " and now, he glanced between them like a zookeeper trying to gauge the animals' temper."

#. Occurrence 9_2:194:13143: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:194
msgctxt "text_id=13143 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言うまでもなく、ふたりは喧嘩などしていない。"
msgstr "  Needless to say, the silence meant they were not fighting at this moment."

#. Occurrence 9_2:199:13144: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:199
msgctxt "text_id=13144 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　食事以外では終始この調子なだけだ。"
msgstr "  Dinner served as a respite from the conflict."

#. Occurrence 9_2:204:13145: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:204
msgctxt "text_id=13145 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<草十郎|じぶん>の知らないところでの問題――他所からやってきた魔術師との戦いは、日に日に厳しいものになっているらしい。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was oblivious to the circumstances surrounding the quarrel, but their day-in day-out battles against the mysterious mage was clearly taking a toll."

#. Occurrence 9_2:225:13146: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:225
msgctxt "text_id=13146 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "“もっとも、有珠はいつも通りだけど”"
msgstr "(Not that Alice looks anything but grumpy.)"

#. Occurrence 9_2:246:13147: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:246
msgctxt "text_id=13147 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　瞑想っぽく口を閉ざしている青子に対して、有珠は古ぼけた本を両膝に置いて読む、いつものスタンスである。"
msgstr "  Across from the quiet and contemplative Aoko, Alice was reading an old book in her lap, as she was accustomed to."

#. Occurrence 9_2:251:13148: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:251
msgctxt "text_id=13148 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　違うところといえば、その本が今までの物より遥かに重そうな物であるコトぐらい。"
msgstr "  The book seemed somehow heavier than the other ones."

#. Occurrence 9_2:286:13149: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:286
msgctxt "text_id=13149 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ただいま。煮詰まってるな、ここんところ」"
msgstr "\"I'm home. Looks like I just missed the discussion.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:291:13150: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:291
msgctxt "text_id=13150 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　コートを脱ぎつつ青子たちに声をかける。"
msgstr "  He greeted them as he took off his coat."

#. Occurrence 9_2:307:13151: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_2_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:307
msgctxt "text_id=13151 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「煮詰まるぐらい事態が進んでるなら、まだ面白みもあるんでしょうけどね。"
msgstr "\"If only. 'Discussion' implies progress."

#. Occurrence 9_2:318:13152: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_2_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:318
msgctxt "text_id=13152 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　今の誤用よ、草十郎」"
msgstr "  You're way off, Soujyuro.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:351:13153: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:351
msgctxt "text_id=13153 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「？」"
msgstr "\"?\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:356:13154: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:356
msgctxt "text_id=13154 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の言わんとするところが分からず、草十郎は首をかしげる。"
msgstr "  Without quite knowing what Aoko was getting at, Soujyuro quizzically tilted his head."

#. Occurrence 9_2:361:13155: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:361
msgctxt "text_id=13155 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　考えすぎはよくないぞ、とリラックスさせるつもりが、逆に注意されてしまった。"
msgstr "  He told himself not to think too hard into it, but it only made him more curious."

#. Occurrence 9_2:400:13156: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_2_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:400
msgctxt "text_id=13156 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「煮詰まってるってコトはもうじき完成ってコトでしょ。"
msgstr "\"In fact, we're not even close to an agreement."

#. Occurrence 9_2:406:13157: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_2_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:406
msgctxt "text_id=13157 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　進展がないって意味合いなら、行き詰まってると言うべきね」"
msgstr "  If anything, I'd say we've debated ourselves into a corner.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:418:13158: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:418
msgctxt "text_id=13158 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎を叱る余裕もないのか、青子は邪険に手を振って“余所にいってて”とジェスチャーする。"
msgstr "  Seemingly too preoccupied to scold Soujyuro, Aoko waved her hand as though shooing off an insect."

#. Occurrence 9_2:423:13159: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:423
msgctxt "text_id=13159 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無論、"
msgstr "  But Soujyuro being Soujyuro..."

#. Occurrence 9_2:457:13160: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:457
msgctxt "text_id=13160 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「じゃあ言い直して。"
msgstr "\"Okay, let me start over."

#. Occurrence 9_2:463:13161: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:463
msgctxt "text_id=13161 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　やあ、あれから進展はあったかい？」"
msgstr "  Hey, you two. Any progress since last time?\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:469:13162: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:469
msgctxt "text_id=13162 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それぐらいでめげる草十郎ではないのだった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro held his ground."

#. Occurrence 9_2:502:13163: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_2_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:502
msgctxt "text_id=13163 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎には関係ないわ。"
msgstr "\"That's none of your business."

#. Occurrence 9_2:508:13164: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_2_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:508
msgctxt "text_id=13164 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　<魔術|こっち>の事情に関しては不可侵だって、言わなかった？」"
msgstr "  What did l tell you? Mage affairs are not for your ears.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:514:13165: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:514
msgctxt "text_id=13165 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静かではあるがトゲのある返答。"
msgstr "  Her response was calm, but pointed."

#. Occurrence 9_2:519:13166: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:519
msgctxt "text_id=13166 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ご機嫌斜めなのはいつものコトだが、今日は六割増しのようだ。"
msgstr "  Surliness was her weapon of choice, and today she seemed determined to swing it at will."

#. Occurrence 9_2:554:13167: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:554
msgctxt "text_id=13167 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「もちろん聞いてる。ところで、お昼はまだだろう？」"
msgstr "\"Yes, I remember. ...Did you two eat yet?\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:560:13168: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:560
msgctxt "text_id=13168 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな青子の不機嫌さも気にせず、草十郎は食い下がった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro chose to brush off Aoko's attitude."

#. Occurrence 9_2:566:13169: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:566
msgctxt "text_id=13169 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "青子が六割増しなら、彼の<暢気|のんき>さは二倍に増強というところ。"
msgstr "If Aoko's weapon was surliness, Soujyuro's was blitheness."

#. Occurrence 9_2:585:13170: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:585
msgctxt "text_id=13170 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その強引さに、さすがの青子もわずかに怯む。"
msgstr "  He wielded just enough of it to make Aoko flinch."

#. Occurrence 9_2:611:13171: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_2_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:611
msgctxt "text_id=13171 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どうしたの、今日は。なにかいい事でもあったわけ？」"
msgstr "\"What's with you today? Did something nice happen to you?\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:616:13172: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:616
msgctxt "text_id=13172 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　別に、と草十郎は首をふる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro shook his head."

#. Occurrence 9_2:640:13173: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:640
msgctxt "text_id=13173 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「まだなんだ。じゃあちょっと、提案がある」"
msgstr "\"Not yet. But I do have a proposal for you.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:660:13174: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:660
msgctxt "text_id=13174 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言って、ハンガーにかけたコートのポケットをあさる。"
msgstr "  He dug around in the pocket of his coat, which was now on a hanger."

#. Occurrence 9_2:665:13175: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:665
msgctxt "text_id=13175 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今日にかぎって積極的な草十郎の様子を、青子は訝しげに見据え、有珠は本を読みながら聞き耳をたてている。"
msgstr "  Aoko gave him a dubious stare, while Alice's ears perked up at his upbeat tone."

#. Occurrence 9_2:697:13176: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:697
msgctxt "text_id=13176 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「実は今日、給料日だったんだ。"
msgstr "\"Actually, today was payday."

#. Occurrence 9_2:697:13177: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:697
msgctxt "text_id=13177 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　お金も入った事だし、外に遊びにいこう」"
msgstr "  Which means I have money. We should go out and do something.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:715:13178: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:715
msgctxt "text_id=13178 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　コートから財布を取り出し、心温まる笑顔で言う。"
msgstr "  He spoke with a warm smile as he removed his wallet from his coat pocket."

#. Occurrence 9_2:746:13179: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:746
msgctxt "text_id=13179 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、ふたりは複雑な顔である。"
msgstr "  The other two did not know what to make of it."

#. Occurrence 9_2:786:13180: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_2_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:786
msgctxt "text_id=13180 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……草十郎」"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro...?\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:792:13181: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:792
msgctxt "text_id=13181 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何か文句を言ってやりたかったけど、それと同じぐらい青子は草十郎に同情した。"
msgstr "  She wanted to take exception to his bright mood, but found herself wrestling with the idea of reacting positively to it."

#. Occurrence 9_2:797:13182: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:797
msgctxt "text_id=13182 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼はいまだ不仲な有珠と融和するため、なけなしの給料をはたいて行動に出たのだろう。"
msgstr "  After all, he was making a gesture of good faith to try and make things better with what little funds he had."

#. Occurrence 9_2:829:13183: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:829
msgctxt "text_id=13183 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　考え自体は悪くない。"
msgstr "  The thought itself was not a bad one."

#. Occurrence 9_2:834:13184: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:834
msgctxt "text_id=13184 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな事じゃ有珠の“とりあえず今は黙っていてあげるけど、何か目障りな事をしたら消す”感は消えないと分かっていても、その健気な努力に応援ぐらいはしてあげたい。"
msgstr "  While there was always the chance that Alice would keep quiet until the slightest thing annoyed her―at which point she would ruin everything―Aoko wanted to accept his goodwill."

#. Occurrence 9_2:839:13185: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:839
msgctxt "text_id=13185 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、今は三人で街を歩いている気分じゃないし、状況でもないのだ。"
msgstr "  However, she was not in the mood to walk around town with either of the two, nor was the timing ideal."

#. Occurrence 9_2:865:13186: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_2_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:865
msgctxt "text_id=13186 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「悪いけど、いま忙しいの。暇になったら思い出してあげるから、しばらく我慢して」"
msgstr "\"Sorry, but I'm kinda busy. I'll take you up on it some other time though. Just remind me.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:883:13187: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:883
msgctxt "text_id=13187 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何も言わないが有珠も同意見らしい。"
msgstr "  Alice seemed to give the same response, though wordlessly."

#. Occurrence 9_2:888:13188: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:888
msgctxt "text_id=13188 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな重苦しい空気にもめげず、"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was not about to be held back by the sullen mood."

#. Occurrence 9_2:920:13189: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:920
msgctxt "text_id=13189 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「忙しいって、ここで黙りあってるだけじゃないか。"
msgstr "\"Busy doing what, sitting here in silence?"

#. Occurrence 9_2:926:13190: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:926
msgctxt "text_id=13190 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　徹夜漬けの時、気分転換は必要だって言ったのは蒼崎だろ。行き詰まったら回れ右して戻らないと、どこにも行けない」"
msgstr "  Wasn't it you, Aozaki, that said a change of pace was important when working overnight? Sometimes you need to take one step back to take two steps forward.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:957:13191: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:957
msgctxt "text_id=13191 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつになく強気に言って、草十郎は財布から二枚のチケットを取り出し、とん、とテーブルに置いた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro spoke with unusual confidence, as he drew two tickets from his wallet and slapped them on the table."

#. Occurrence 9_2:962:13192: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:962
msgctxt "text_id=13192 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは映画の前売券……なんてありきたりなものではなく、有名な水族館のチケットだった。"
msgstr "  At first glance, they looked like advance tickets to a movie...but not quite. They were tickets to a famous aquarium."

#. Occurrence 9_2:982:13193: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:982
msgctxt "text_id=13193 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　行き先は、快速と地下鉄を乗り継いだ先にある、三咲市より何倍も近代化の進んだ街。"
msgstr "  To get there, they would take the rapid train and subway to a city several times more modern than Misaki."

#. Occurrence 9_2:987:13194: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:987
msgctxt "text_id=13194 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　県内最大をうたうショッピングモールだけでなく、来年開場予定の、国際的な規模の演劇、講演を可能とする多目的ホールまで造られているという。"
msgstr "  It housed not only the biggest shopping mall in the prefecture, but also a multi-purpose auditorium―set to open next year―designed to host international conferences and stage productions."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1019:13195: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1019
msgctxt "text_id=13195 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それと、夜はメシアンでカレーでも食べてくれ」"
msgstr "\"Oh, and eat some curry at Messiaen, on me.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:1038:13196: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1038
msgctxt "text_id=13196 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さらに、見ようによっては黄金にも見えるお札を二枚ほどぽん、とテーブルにそえる。"
msgstr "  Saying that, he slapped two bills on the table, as if he had struck it rich."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1043:13197: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1043
msgctxt "text_id=13197 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そういえば、夕食の食事当番は草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  It was Soujyuro's turn to make dinner tonight, after all."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1111:13198: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1111
msgctxt "text_id=13198 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「じゃ、そういう事で」"
msgstr "\"Be seeing you.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:1118:13199: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1118
msgctxt "text_id=13199 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は用件だけ告げ、財布をコートに戻す。"
msgstr "  His business concluded, Soujyuro returned his wallet to his coat pocket."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1123:13200: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1123
msgctxt "text_id=13200 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それで、青子はようやく自分の間違いに気が付いた。"
msgstr "  It was then that Aoko realized what Soujyuro meant by \"be seeing you.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:1158:13201: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_2_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1158
msgctxt "text_id=13201 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ちょっと待った！　そういうアンタはどうするのよ」"
msgstr "\"Y-you mean you're not coming with us?\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:1164:13202: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_2_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1164
msgctxt "text_id=13202 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「今日はアルバイト」"
msgstr "\"I have to work tonight.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:1175:13203: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1175
msgctxt "text_id=13203 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さらっと答える草十郎に、そういうコト、と察する青子。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was almost too quick with his response, helping Aoko to see things for what they really were."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1200:13204: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1200
msgctxt "text_id=13204 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は自分の為でなく、ここのところギスギスしている青子と有珠の仲をほぐそうとしているのだ。"
msgstr "  Rather than for Soujyuro's benefit, his gesture was instead an attempt to ease the tension that had built up between Aoko and Alice."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1210:13205: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1210
msgctxt "text_id=13205 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなのは彼の勝手な勘違いで、言ってしまえば迷惑なお節介に分類される。"
msgstr "  Though if asked, both girls would tell you it was an unnecessary gesture."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1215:13206: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1215
msgctxt "text_id=13206 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……しかし。"
msgstr "  Still..."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1220:13207: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1220
msgctxt "text_id=13207 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな風に気を配ってくれた事と、なにより、そこまで気を遣わせてしまった自分の未熟さに反省する。"
msgstr "  For him to pay this much attention to the household, if anything, gave Aoko reason to reflect on her own immaturity."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1260:13208: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_2_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1260
msgctxt "text_id=13208 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:1266:13209: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1266
msgctxt "text_id=13209 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は対面に座る有珠を覗き見た。"
msgstr "  Aoko glanced over to the still-seated Alice."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1295:13210: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1295
msgctxt "text_id=13210 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　すると、ちょうど有珠も青子に視線を投げかけているところだった。"
msgstr "  At the same time, Alice peeked up at Aoko from behind her book."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1326:13211: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1326
msgctxt "text_id=13211 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりはしばし無言で見つめ合う。"
msgstr "  They kept still, staring at each other."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1366:13212: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_2_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1366
msgctxt "text_id=13212 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……わたしはかまわないけど。"
msgstr "\"...I'll go if you go."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1366:13213: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_2_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1366
msgctxt "text_id=13213 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　いまやれる事は全部やってあるし」"
msgstr "  I'm almost done with my book.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:1384:13214: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_2_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1384
msgctxt "text_id=13214 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうね。そういう事なら、せっかくだし」"
msgstr "\"Okay. It would be a waste not to.\""

#. Occurrence 9_2:1403:13215: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1403
msgctxt "text_id=13215 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　観念したように言って、青子はソファーから立ち上がる。"
msgstr "  Aoko stood up from the sofa, resigned to her decision."

#. Occurrence 9_2:1419:13216: scene=9_2
#: 9_2:1419
msgctxt "text_id=13216 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなふたりを、草十郎は満足げに眺めていた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro watched on, a satisfied smile on his face."

#. Occurrence 9_3:46:13217: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:46
msgctxt "text_id=13217 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それから二十分ほど後。"
msgstr "  Twenty minutes later."

#. Occurrence 9_3:51:13218: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:51
msgctxt "text_id=13218 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子と有珠は外出の支度を済ませ、居間にいる草十郎に声をかけた。"
msgstr "  As Aoko and Alice were done getting ready, Aoko called out to Soujyuro in the drawing room."

#. Occurrence 9_3:72:13219: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:72
msgctxt "text_id=13219 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それじゃ出かけてくるからアンタもバイト―――草十郎？」"
msgstr "\"All right, we're leaving now. ...Soujyuro?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:104:13220: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:104
msgctxt "text_id=13220 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　立ち寄ったふたりに気付かず、草十郎はなにやらテレビの前にしゃがみこんでいる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was crouched in front of the television, unaware that the two had entered the room."

#. Occurrence 9_3:111:13221: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:111
msgctxt "text_id=13221 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「もしかして、ビデオいじってるの？」"
msgstr "\"Are you fiddling with the VCR?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:144:13222: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:144
msgctxt "text_id=13222 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ああ、ちょうど良かった。蒼崎、これ―――」"
msgstr "\"Oh, hey. Good timing. How do I―\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:150:13223: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:150
msgctxt "text_id=13223 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　作業を中断し、青子たちに振り向く草十郎。"
msgstr "  Pausing his audiovisual struggles, Soujyuro turned around."

#. Occurrence 9_3:242:13224: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:242
msgctxt "text_id=13224 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:247:13225: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:247
msgctxt "text_id=13225 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　振り向いて、驚きのあまり言葉を失った。"
msgstr "  He froze in shock, forgetting what he was about to say."

#. Occurrence 9_3:289:13226: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:289
msgctxt "text_id=13226 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「？　私たち、お言葉に甘えて出かけてくるけど……どうしたのよ、一体。<棚|たな>の後ろに落とし物でもしたの？」"
msgstr "\"You okay? Listen, we're taking you up on your offer and going out. ...Did you drop something behind the TV?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:295:13227: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:295
msgctxt "text_id=13227 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　固まっている草十郎を青子は不思議そうに見る。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro appeared to have gone stiff. Aoko stared at him curiously."

#. Occurrence 9_3:305:13228: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:305
msgctxt "text_id=13228 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その挙動不審さに有珠もうんうん、と無言で同意した。"
msgstr "  Though Alice silently nodded along with his bizarre reaction,"

#. Occurrence 9_3:310:13229: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:310
msgctxt "text_id=13229 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……実際、頷いてはいなかったが。"
msgstr "  she kept her thoughts to herself."

#. Occurrence 9_3:349:13230: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:349
msgctxt "text_id=13230 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――いや。"
msgstr "\"...No."

#. Occurrence 9_3:371:13231: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:371
msgctxt "text_id=13231 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　なんか、"
msgstr "  ...It's just..."

msgctxt "text_id=13232 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "こう」"
msgstr " Um...\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:411:13233: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:411
msgctxt "text_id=13233 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　すごく驚いたんだ、と続くところを、草十郎は喉を絞めて押し伏せた。"
msgstr "  Still gawking, his voice stuck in his throat."

#. Occurrence 9_3:416:13234: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:416
msgctxt "text_id=13234 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その驚きが感動に由来するものである事を、彼はまだ知り得なかったからである。"
msgstr "  He was blissfully unaware that the shock he was experiencing was the direct result of his emotional state."

#. Occurrence 9_3:449:13235: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:449
msgctxt "text_id=13235 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それじゃ分からないってば。"
msgstr "\"Spit it out already."

#. Occurrence 9_3:460:13236: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:460
msgctxt "text_id=13236 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　まったく、落ち着いてるクセに妙に挙動不審なんだから。有珠に<煙|けむ>たがられても仕方ないって言うか―――」"
msgstr "  God, I wish your weird reactions made sense sometimes. Does Alice have something on her face, or...?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:485:13237: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:485
msgctxt "text_id=13237 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は無言で観察している。"
msgstr "  Alice looked on in silence."

#. Occurrence 9_3:490:13238: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:490
msgctxt "text_id=13238 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あわてるのでもなく、ぼんやりするのでもなく、こんな風に固まる草十郎を見るのは初めてだったからだ。"
msgstr "  He was not confused, or in a daydream. That much he could tell. But this frozen look was by all accounts a first for Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_3:526:13239: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:526
msgctxt "text_id=13239 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それで、何かあったの？」"
msgstr "\"So what is it then?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:543:13240: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:543
msgctxt "text_id=13240 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ああ、いや―――これなんだけど。"
msgstr "\"Oh, uhhh... This thing, here."

#. Occurrence 9_3:549:13241: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:549
msgctxt "text_id=13241 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　蒼崎、ビデオってどう使うんだ？」"
msgstr "  How exactly do I use it?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:554:13242: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:554
msgctxt "text_id=13242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　動揺が顔に出ないよう気を取り直し、草十郎はビデオデッキを指さした。"
msgstr "  Shaking his head to regain his composure, Soujyuro pointed to the VCR."

#. Occurrence 9_3:559:13243: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:559
msgctxt "text_id=13243 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　テレビの下にはＶＨＳ型のビデオデッキが置かれている。"
msgstr "  A VHS player sat on a shelf beneath the TV."

#. Occurrence 9_3:592:13244: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:592
msgctxt "text_id=13244 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なに、タイマー録画でもするの？」"
msgstr "\"What? You want to record something?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:598:13245: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:598
msgctxt "text_id=13245 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はテレビの前でしゃがんでいる草十郎のとなりへ歩いていく。"
msgstr "  Aoko walked over and crouched next to Soujyuro in front of the TV."

#. Occurrence 9_3:631:13246: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:631
msgctxt "text_id=13246 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、木乃美からビデオを借りたんだけど、映らない」"
msgstr "\"No, I just borrowed a video from Kinomi, but it won't play.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:643:13247: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:643
msgctxt "text_id=13247 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……まず、テレビの電源が入ってない」"
msgstr "\"Well... for starters, the TV isn't turned on.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:714:13248: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:714
msgctxt "text_id=13248 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぱちり、と音を立ててブラウン管に光がともる。"
msgstr "  With a click, the TV screen flickered alive."

#. Occurrence 9_3:742:13249: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:742
msgctxt "text_id=13249 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「次、チャンネルを外線に合わせて……"
msgstr "\"Next, you have to switch to the video input..."

#. Occurrence 9_3:764:13250: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:764
msgctxt "text_id=13250 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あら、意外にも真っ黒。木乃美くんの事だからテープ頭から録画してると思ったけど」"
msgstr "  That's weird, it's all dark. Knowing Kinomi, I'm surprised the recording doesn't start from the very beginning.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:781:13251: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:781
msgctxt "text_id=13251 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この時代、ビデオテープはそれなりに高価である。"
msgstr "  During this time period, video tapes were still rather expensive."

#. Occurrence 9_3:786:13252: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:786
msgctxt "text_id=13252 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　120分の記録容量をフルに使うため、せっかちな人間なら一秒も無駄にしたがらないのが常だった。"
msgstr "  Therefore, it was only natural for people to not want to waste a single second of the tape's one-hundred and twenty minute capacity."

#. Occurrence 9_3:819:13253: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:819
msgctxt "text_id=13253 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「わりと趣味には気を遣う性格なのね。じゃ、早送りっと」"
msgstr "\"Especially considering how serious he is about his hobbies. Oh well, we'll have to fast-forward.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:837:13254: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:837
msgctxt "text_id=13254 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小さなリモコンを手にとって、青子はささっと早送りボタンを押す。"
msgstr "  Aoko picked the small remote up, and quickly pushed the button marked FWD."

#. Occurrence 9_3:855:13255: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:855
msgctxt "text_id=13255 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ん？」"
msgstr "\"Hm?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:867:13256: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:867
msgctxt "text_id=13256 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ビデオデッキからの反応はない。"
msgstr "  The VCR beeped in protest."

#. Occurrence 9_3:872:13257: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:872
msgctxt "text_id=13257 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ガチャンガチャン、と内部でモーターの空回る音がする。"
msgstr "  With several clicks and thuds, there was an empty whirr from within the machine."

#. Occurrence 9_3:904:13258: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:904
msgctxt "text_id=13258 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……壊してないぞ、たぶん」"
msgstr "\"Don't look at me. I didn't break it. I think...\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:909:13259: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:909
msgctxt "text_id=13259 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そういう事を言う人間の多くが電気機器を破壊する特殊技能を有しているのだが、それは置いておいて。"
msgstr "  The vast majority of people who say this are actually very prone to destroying electrical equipment. But that is a separate matter."

#. Occurrence 9_3:943:13260: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:943
msgctxt "text_id=13260 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……おまけに、テープが入ってない」"
msgstr "\"Umm... There's no tape in here.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:948:13261: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:948
msgctxt "text_id=13261 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はトドメとばかりに言い捨てた。"
msgstr "  As soon as the words left her lips, it all made sense."

#. Occurrence 9_3:968:13262: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:968
msgctxt "text_id=13262 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「テープ？」"
msgstr "\"Tape?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:973:13263: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:973
msgctxt "text_id=13263 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　両面か？　などとベタな思案をする草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro imagined adhesive tape, clearly confused."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1006:13264: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1006
msgctxt "text_id=13264 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎。木乃美くんから、何か渡されなかった？」"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro. Did Kinomi give you something?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1023:13265: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1023
msgctxt "text_id=13265 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「渡されたけど。ほら、テーブルの上」"
msgstr "\"You mean the thing on the table?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1041:13266: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1041
msgctxt "text_id=13266 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1046:13267: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1046
msgctxt "text_id=13267 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　慣れたとはいえ、時々こいつわざとやってるんじゃないのか、と疑うほどのボケっぷりだった。"
msgstr "  Though she should have been used to it by now, she caught herself wondering if Soujyuro was being stupid deliberately."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1082:13268: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1082
msgctxt "text_id=13268 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「木乃美くんがなんて言ったか、覚えてる？」"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro. What exactly did Kinomi say? Do you remember?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1099:13269: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1099
msgctxt "text_id=13269 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「テープ貸してやるから、家に帰ったらビデオを見ろ、と……」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, he said, 'I'll totally lend you this tape. When you get home, ^just watch the TV.'\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1127:13270: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1127
msgctxt "text_id=13270 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「一番大事な言葉が抜けてたワケね。"
msgstr "\"Great. So he left out the most important part."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1140:13271: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1140
msgctxt "text_id=13271 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……はあ。失望を通り越して怖くなるわ。あっさり順応しているように見えてこれだものね。どんだけ<綱渡|つなわた>りな毎日送ってんのよ、アンタは」"
msgstr "  Honestly... This is so sad it's almost scary. Just when I thought you were finally adapting. How you make it through a day is a mystery to me.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1184:13272: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1184
msgctxt "text_id=13272 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ちょっと疲れて、青子は問題のテープを手に取った。"
msgstr "  Exasperated, Aoko fetched the tape in question."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1189:13273: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1189
msgctxt "text_id=13273 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ラベルにはサインペンで『GAKUGAKU動物ランド暗黒大陸編』と書かれている。"
msgstr "  It was labeled \"GAKUGAKU Animal Kingdom: African Adventure.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1227:13274: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1227
msgctxt "text_id=13274 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……生徒会における木乃美芳助の評価レベルをひとつ下げる青子だった。"
msgstr "  To Aoko, this knocked Housuke Kinomi down a level on the ratings file she kept with the student council."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1261:13275: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1261
msgctxt "text_id=13275 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……で、このテープをデッキに入れて、再生すればいいの。ツメは折ってないから、録画ボタンだけは押さないようにね」"
msgstr "\"Okay, you put the tape in the VCR, and push 'Play'. The tab isn't broken, so just be careful not to hit the record button.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1267:13276: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1267
msgctxt "text_id=13276 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ツメとは？」"
msgstr "\"What's a tab?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1288:13277: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1288
msgctxt "text_id=13277 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ここ。テープの側面にへこみがあるでしょ。これをカバーしているのがツメ。"
msgstr "\"Right here. See the indent on the side of the tape here? The 'tab' is this little plastic cover."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1295:13278: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1295
msgctxt "text_id=13278 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "これを切り取っておくと、もうそのテープは上書き録画できなくなるのよ。"
msgstr "If you snap this tab off, you can't record on this tape anymore."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1301:13279: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1301
msgctxt "text_id=13279 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　えーと……そうね、喩えるなら授業のノート。"
msgstr "  How can I explain this...? Think of it like a notebook for class."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1307:13280: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1307
msgctxt "text_id=13280 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　大事なものだから、消しゴムで消えないようにフィキサチーフをかけたっていうか。ヒューマンエラーを物理的に防止する、<力技|アナログ>な防御法ってワケ」"
msgstr "  It's like a sealant you spray over the page so it can't be erased. Think of it as a physical barrier against common human error.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1328:13281: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1328
msgctxt "text_id=13281 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　デッキにビデオを入れ、草十郎にリモコンを手渡す。"
msgstr "  She inserted the tape into the VCR, and handed the remote to Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1345:13282: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1345
msgctxt "text_id=13282 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たったこれだけの事でひどく精神力を消耗してしまった。"
msgstr "  Just this small interaction used up a fair bit of Aoko's patience."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1364:13283: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1364
msgctxt "text_id=13283 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな青子の気苦労も知らず、ピッと再生ボタンを押して喜ぶ草十郎。"
msgstr "  Completely ignorant of Aoko's feelings, Soujyuro gleefully pressed the play button."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1397:13284: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0023; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1397
msgctxt "text_id=13284 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……はあ。前から危なっかしいと思ってたけど、まさかここまでとはね。時代錯誤にも程がある。"
msgstr "\"Whew... I was afraid we weren't going to make it this far for a second there. That was a bit much, even for someone as out of place as you are."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1413:13285: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0024; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1413
msgctxt "text_id=13285 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　アンタ、山で何やってたの？　空手家じゃあるまいし、熊を倒す修業でもしてた、とか言わないでしょうね？」"
msgstr "  What were you doing up there in the mountains? Don't tell me you were some karate master, training against bears or something?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1430:13286: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1430
msgctxt "text_id=13286 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さすがにこれは嫌味だと分かったのか、草十郎は批難の目を青子に向けた。"
msgstr "  Even Soujyuro managed to pick up on Aoko's rude tone, and he frowned disapprovingly."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1456:13287: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1456
msgctxt "text_id=13287 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それは、もしかして俺を馬鹿にしてるのか？」"
msgstr "\"Was that an attempt to insult me?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1462:13288: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0025; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1462
msgctxt "text_id=13288 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「心外ね、事実馬鹿にしてるんだけど」"
msgstr "\"Umm... You mean just now, or all the other times?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1473:13289: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1473
msgctxt "text_id=13289 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　きっぱりと青子は答える。"
msgstr "  Aoko answered, unapologetically."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1478:13290: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1478
msgctxt "text_id=13290 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　テレビでは問題のワニがむはぁー、とあくびをしているところだった。"
msgstr "  On the TV, a crocodile's yawning mouth appeared."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1504:13291: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1504
msgctxt "text_id=13291 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そんな馬鹿な話があるもんか。なんで熊を倒すために修業しなくちゃいけないんだ？」"
msgstr "\"Don't be ridiculous. Why would anyone train against bears?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1514:13292: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1514
msgctxt "text_id=13292 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぷいっと顔をテレビに逸らす草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro turned toward the TV in a huff."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1531:13293: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1531
msgctxt "text_id=13293 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼にしては珍しく怒ったのだが、顔を背けた先で大口を開けるワニの映像と向き合い、びくっと後退したりする。"
msgstr "  Perhaps because of his rare outburst, as he turned face to face with the gaping maw of the crocodile on the TV, he fell backwards in surprise."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1568:13294: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1568
msgctxt "text_id=13294 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな光景を見て、青子は嬉しげに口元を緩めた。"
msgstr "  Aoko unpursed her lips upon seeing this, delighted."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1573:13295: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1573
msgctxt "text_id=13295 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この少年はやっぱりこうでなくてはいけない、と安心するように。"
msgstr "  It was relieving to see the boy disarmed."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1608:13296: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1608
msgctxt "text_id=13296 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「けど蒼崎。この機械、ずいぶんほこりがつもっているけど、掃除はしていないのか？」"
msgstr "\"Hey, Aozaki. These machines have gotten kinda dusty. Don't you clean them?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1641:13297: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0026; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1641
msgctxt "text_id=13297 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「私はあんまり使わないし、有珠は見ないから今までほっぽってただけよ。"
msgstr "\"Why bother? I hardly ever use them, and Alice doesn't watch TV."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1647:13298: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0027; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1647
msgctxt "text_id=13298 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ダメもとでトレーニング用に買ってもらったんだけど、飽きちゃった。イメージでどうにかできる問題じゃなかったっていうか」"
msgstr "  I bought some exercise videos to train with, but got bored of them. Who would have thought you actually need to do the exercises instead of just watching the damn thing?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1679:13299: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1679
msgctxt "text_id=13299 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　昔の自分の浅はかさを<嗤|わら>うように、青子は両肩をすくめる。"
msgstr "  Aoko shrugged at her past superficiality."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1699:13300: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1699
msgctxt "text_id=13300 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　またひとつ、ビデオデッキは飽きるもの、という間違った単語を覚える草十郎である。"
msgstr "  And Soujyuro was led to believe yet another falsehood about modern life-that VCRs would go out of fashion."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1735:13301: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0028; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1735
msgctxt "text_id=13301 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それじゃ、留守番お願いね。"
msgstr "\"Well then, we're off. Try not to burn the place to the ground."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1741:13302: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3_0029; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1741
msgctxt "text_id=13302 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　バイト、ほんとは無いんでしょう？」"
msgstr "  And in case you were wondering, I know you don't have work tonight.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1762:13303: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1762
msgctxt "text_id=13303 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　微笑みながら言って、青子は居間から立ち去っていった。"
msgstr "  Aoko walked out of the drawing room, smiling."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1793:13304: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_3_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1793
msgctxt "text_id=13304 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_3:1798:13305: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1798
msgctxt "text_id=13305 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の笑顔に虚を突かれて、言葉につまる草十郎。"
msgstr "  Her grin was the cheap shot that left Soujyuro speechless."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1803:13306: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1803
msgctxt "text_id=13306 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やっぱり、あんな嘘が通じる相手ではなかったのだ、と頬をかく。"
msgstr "  As he scratched his cheek, he was reminded that she was not someone to be trifled with."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1836:13307: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1836
msgctxt "text_id=13307 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなふたりのやりとりを最後まで傍観してから、有珠もロビーに向かっていった。"
msgstr "  After watching the end of the drama between her housemates, Alice made for the reception area as well."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1871:13308: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1871
msgctxt "text_id=13308 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ひとり居間に残され、さて、と草十郎はソファーに座る。"
msgstr "  Left alone in the room, Soujyuro took his seat on the sofa."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1876:13309: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1876
msgctxt "text_id=13309 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……まあ。"
msgstr "  ...Well."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1881:13310: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1881
msgctxt "text_id=13310 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とりあえず、やりたいコトはきちんと機能したのだし。"
msgstr "  It was certainly not easy making everything run smoothly around these parts."

#. Occurrence 9_3:1886:13311: scene=9_3
#: 9_3:1886
msgctxt "text_id=13311 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あとは彼女たちが帰ってくるまで、こうしてワニを観察していよう、と思いながら。"
msgstr "  Until they came back, he could enjoy his crocodile-watching in peace."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:89:13312: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:89
msgctxt "text_id=13312 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三咲町から地下鉄線で六駅分。"
msgstr "  They took the subway from Misaki for six stations."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:94:13313: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:94
msgctxt "text_id=13313 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこから更に快速で三駅分。"
msgstr "  From there, they rode another three stops by express train."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:100:13314: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:100
msgctxt "text_id=13314 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一時間ほどかけて、青子と有珠は<有坂|ありさか>駅に到着した。"
msgstr "  After about an hour, Aoko and Alice arrived at Arisaka Station."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:120:13315: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:120
msgctxt "text_id=13315 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有坂は政令指定によって一から開発された都市だ。"
msgstr "  While Misaki City was a mixture of old and new architecture, Arisaka was a brand-new town built in accordance with recent government ordinance."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:125:13316: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:125
msgctxt "text_id=13316 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三咲町は古きを残し、新しきを築く方針で生まれ変わった町だが、有坂は何もなかった土地に<高層建築|ビルディング>を築き上げた街である。"
msgstr "  It was as though an entire town full of tall buildings sprouted up in the middle of nowhere."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:184:13317: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:184
msgctxt "text_id=13317 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　十二月末、冬休みまっただ中。"
msgstr "  It was near the end of December, in the middle of winter break."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:189:13318: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:189
msgctxt "text_id=13318 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　午後を過ぎた有坂の街の賑わいは、三咲町とは比べものにならない。"
msgstr "  Even the bustling plaza in Misaki was quiet compared to Arisaka in the evening."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:194:13319: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:194
msgctxt "text_id=13319 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なにしろ大型デパートや各種専門店、多目的ホールで賑わう、県内有数の近代都市だ。"
msgstr "  Whether it was the huge mall full of countless specialty stores, or the crowded multi-purpose auditorium, there really was something for everyone here."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:199:13320: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:199
msgctxt "text_id=13320 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その結果、有坂駅前は地元の人々より、遠方からの来訪者が集まる歓楽地になっていた。"
msgstr "  For that reason, beyond its local residents, Arisaka's station was crowded with people from far and wide."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:257:13321: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:257
msgctxt "text_id=13321 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「へえ、あれが新しい演劇ホールかあ。"
msgstr "\"Cool. That must be their fancy new performance arts center."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:257:13322: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:257
msgctxt "text_id=13322 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　県内最大のコンサートホールらしいけど、中はどうなってんだろ。なんか周りのビルより背が高くない？」"
msgstr "  It's supposed to have the biggest concert hall in the prefecture. I wonder what it's like inside. Look how much grander it is than the buildings around it!\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:320:13323: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:320
msgctxt "text_id=13323 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目当ての水族館に向かう途中、多くの人々とすれ違う。"
msgstr "  They made their way to the aquarium, weaving through the crowds."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:325:13324: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:325
msgctxt "text_id=13324 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は雑踏に慣れたものだが、"
msgstr "  Aoko might have been used to city life,"

#. Occurrence 9_3C:330:13325: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:330
msgctxt "text_id=13325 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<傍|かたわ>らの有珠は終始無言だ。"
msgstr "  but Alice was silently anxious."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:364:13326: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:364
msgctxt "text_id=13326 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠自身も、有珠とすれ違う人々も、道を行く白い少女の姿に違和感を覚えている。"
msgstr "  The people passing by must have thought this pale girl out of place, which Alice happened to agree with."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:431:13327: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0001_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:431
msgctxt "text_id=13327 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「来年夏にはビッグアーティストも来日予定……"
msgstr "\"Oh! It says a big artist is coming summer of next year... "

#. Occurrence 9_3C:444:13328: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0001_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:444
msgctxt "text_id=13328 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "って、ピンクトゥルーデが入ってない！？"
msgstr "Oh my god, it's Pink Trudy!"

msgctxt "text_id=13329 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ちょっと、これ日本初ライブよ有珠！？」"
msgstr "  Alice, this says it'll be their first live appearance in Japan!\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:457:13330: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:457
msgctxt "text_id=13330 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　看板にある予定表に一喜一憂する青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko exclaimed, overcome by excitement."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:500:13331: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:500
msgctxt "text_id=13331 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子的に注目株のロックバンドらしいのだが、当然、有珠はあまり関心を持っていない。"
msgstr "  This kind of pop-rock band was right up Aoko's alley, but naturally, Alice did not seem very interested."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:532:13332: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:532
msgctxt "text_id=13332 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「それより、セレモニーに予定されてるポーランド楽団の方が驚きだと思うけど。"
msgstr "\"I'm more amazed by the Polish orchestra they've invited to open for them."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:538:13333: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:538
msgctxt "text_id=13333 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　随分とお金がかかっているようね。"
msgstr "  This must be costing them a fortune."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:545:13334: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:545
msgctxt "text_id=13334 | speaker=alice"
msgid "……本当、懲りない人」"
msgstr "How incorrigible...\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:600:13335: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:600
msgctxt "text_id=13335 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あ」"
msgstr "\"Ah.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:610:13336: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:610
msgctxt "text_id=13336 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しまった、と口を<塞|ふさ>いで青子は足を速めた。"
msgstr "  Aoko cursed under her breath before hurrying them along."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:655:13337: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:655
msgctxt "text_id=13337 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　建設予定図の下にはお馴染みの、久遠寺財閥ゆかりの企業名があったからだ。"
msgstr "  Underneath the construction map read, \"With the support of the Kuonji Group.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:721:13338: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:721
msgctxt "text_id=13338 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　お目当ての水族館は、高層ビルの最上階に造られていた。"
msgstr "  The aquarium they were looking for was on the top floor of a massive building."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:762:13339: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:762
msgctxt "text_id=13339 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう目新しさはないのか、"
msgstr "  Maybe it was because it was no longer a new attraction,"

#. Occurrence 9_3C:767:13340: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:767
msgctxt "text_id=13340 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　階下の映画館に客足をとられているのか。"
msgstr "  or perhaps it was because the first-floor cinema drew the crowds..."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:772:13341: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:772
msgctxt "text_id=13341 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　エントランスの人影はまばらで、館内の空気は落ち着いている。"
msgstr "  With only a few people scattered around the entrance, the atmosphere inside was very calm."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:792:13342: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:792
msgctxt "text_id=13342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無音というほど寂しくはなく、"
msgstr "  It wasn't quiet, but desolate,"

#. Occurrence 9_3C:797:13343: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:797
msgctxt "text_id=13343 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　町中ほど騒がしくはない。"
msgstr "  and far removed from the hustle and bustle outside."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:802:13344: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:802
msgctxt "text_id=13344 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな美術館さながらの<趣|おもむき>が気に入ったのか。"
msgstr "  Perhaps they were going for a museum-like mood."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:824:13345: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:824
msgctxt "text_id=13345 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:829:13346: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:829
msgctxt "text_id=13346 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は静かに、感じ入るように息を呑んでいた。"
msgstr "  Alice quietly caught her breath, staring in awe."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:849:13347: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:849
msgctxt "text_id=13347 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はじめてサーカスを見た子供のようだ。"
msgstr "  She was like a child seeing the circus for the first time,"

#. Occurrence 9_3C:854:13348: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:854
msgctxt "text_id=13348 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　驚きと期待に、知らず、目を見開かせている。"
msgstr "  her eyes wide in anticipation and wonder."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:883:13349: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:883
msgctxt "text_id=13349 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「お、気に入ったみたいね。良かった良かった。"
msgstr "\"It's to the lady's liking I see. Good, good."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:889:13350: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:889
msgctxt "text_id=13350 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　草十郎お薦めの物件は、気むずかしい有珠さんのお眼鏡にかないましたか」"
msgstr "  I guess Soujyuro's idea wasn't totally off the mark, then, huh?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:895:13351: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:895
msgctxt "text_id=13351 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子もつられて笑顔になる。"
msgstr "  Aoko found herself smiling as well."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:921:13352: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:921
msgctxt "text_id=13352 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の驚きはそれぐらい微笑ましいものだったのだ。"
msgstr "  There was a certain joy in seeing Alice's wonderment."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:965:13353: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:965
msgctxt "text_id=13353 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……別に。屋上にある水族館が珍しいだけ」"
msgstr "\"Not really. I just find rooftop aquariums to be kind of novel.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:971:13354: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:971
msgctxt "text_id=13354 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　水族館のエントランスは久遠寺邸のホールほどの大きさで、壁には館内の見取り図が展示されている。"
msgstr "  According to the guide on the wall, the entrance to the aquarium was nearly as big as the Kuonji mansion's foyer."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1006:13355: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1006
msgctxt "text_id=13355 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　野外のペンギンショウは休演中だった。ペンギンのペン太くんが怪我につき治療中らしい。"
msgstr "  The outdoor penguin show was apparently suspended due to the star penguin \"Flippy\" undergoing treatment for an injury."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1011:13356: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1011
msgctxt "text_id=13356 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少し残念だが、有珠は気にとめず館内案内を目で追う。彼女にとってペンギンはそう珍しいものではないらしい。"
msgstr "  It was an unfortunate state of affairs, but one that did not stop Alice from continuing to read over the guide. Apparently, she was quite familiar with penguin shows."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1021:13357: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1021
msgctxt "text_id=13357 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と。"
msgstr "  Then..."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1072:13358: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1072
msgctxt "text_id=13358 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――、え」"
msgstr "\"...Eh?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1078:13359: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1078
msgctxt "text_id=13359 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“そんな、嘘よ”……と。"
msgstr "\" I can't believe it,\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1083:13360: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1083
msgctxt "text_id=13360 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は悲鳴を飲みこむように喉を鳴らすのだった。"
msgstr "  Alice quietly whimpered, as if holding back a scream."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1104:13361: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1104
msgctxt "text_id=13361 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なになに、どうしたの？」"
msgstr "\"Hey hey, what's wrong?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1138:13362: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1138
msgctxt "text_id=13362 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　館内案内を見る青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko said, still looking at the floor plan."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1143:13363: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1143
msgctxt "text_id=13363 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　屋敷内ではたまに見られるが、外で有珠が取り乱すのはまずあり得ない。"
msgstr "  It was rare to see Alice getting this emotional outside of the mansion."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1148:13364: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1148
msgctxt "text_id=13364 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一体なにが有珠を<戦|おのの>かせたのか。"
msgstr "  For some reason, she was trembling."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1153:13365: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1153
msgctxt "text_id=13365 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　案内にはこれといって珍しい部分はないが……"
msgstr "  Nothing seemed terribly off about the aquarium's offerings."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1193:13366: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1193
msgctxt "text_id=13366 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ゾウガメがいない」"
msgstr "\"There's no giant tortoises.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1229:13367: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1229
msgctxt "text_id=13367 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え？」"
msgstr "\"No what?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1240:13368: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1240
msgctxt "text_id=13368 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「話が違うわ青子。"
msgstr "\"It's all wrong, Aoko."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1240:13369: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1240
msgctxt "text_id=13369 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　どうしてゾウガメの展示スペースがないの？」"
msgstr "  Why is there no giant tortoise exhibit?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1280:13370: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1280
msgctxt "text_id=13370 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どうしてって……そりゃあ、ゾウガメぐらいになったらもうほとんど陸上生物だからじゃない？　大きいし」"
msgstr "\"Why? I don't know. Are giant tortoises even aquatic? Maybe it's because they take up too much space.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1298:13371: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1298
msgctxt "text_id=13371 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「なんで。ペンギンはいるのに、不公平よ。"
msgstr "\"Why though? They have penguins. It's not fair."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1305:13372: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1305
msgctxt "text_id=13372 | speaker=alice"
msgid "イルカだって許せないわ」"
msgstr "Look, they even have a dolphin. This is absurd.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1311:13373: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1311
msgctxt "text_id=13373 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんだかぜんぜん納得できない。"
msgstr "  It was a bitter pill for Alice to swallow."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1316:13374: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1316
msgctxt "text_id=13374 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ゾウガメが不在ならイルカだって不在であるべきだ、と妙な公正さからメラメラ瞳を燃やす有珠だった。"
msgstr "  The idea that they did not have a giant tortoise, despite having a dolphin, had Alice's eyes hot with indignation."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1352:13375: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1352
msgctxt "text_id=13375 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あー……言われてみれば、確かに。"
msgstr "\"Ahhh... Now that you mention it..."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1358:13376: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1358
msgctxt "text_id=13376 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ペンギンとイルカは定番なのに、なぜゾウガメだけ外されるのか。ちょっとした日常の落とし穴ね」"
msgstr "  If penguins and dolphins are standard fare, you'd have thought they would at least have a giant tortoise. What were they thinking?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1364:13377: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1364
msgctxt "text_id=13377 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ま、単に不人気だからだろうけど。"
msgstr "  Aoko said, certain something like a giant tortoise would be boring and unpopular."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1369:13378: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1369
msgctxt "text_id=13378 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな感想を心の中だけに留める青子。彼女なりに空気を読んだ結果である。"
msgstr "  She was sensible enough to read the room, however, and kept her thought to herself."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1413:13379: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1413
msgctxt "text_id=13379 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「有珠、こっち。チケットはあるから、<販売機|そっち>に並ぶことはないわよ」"
msgstr "\"Let's go, Alice. We have tickets so we can skip the line.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1436:13380: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1436
msgctxt "text_id=13380 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ゾウガメ論争から一分後。"
msgstr "  A few moments after the giant tortoise fiasco..."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1441:13381: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1441
msgctxt "text_id=13381 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎から貰ったチケットを受付に渡して、<人気|ひとけ>の途絶えた入り口に向かう。"
msgstr "  Presenting the tickets they received from Soujyuro, they headed toward the once popular entrance."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1446:13382: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1446
msgctxt "text_id=13382 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青一色で染められたエントランスとは対照的に、ゲートから延びる通路は暗く細長い。"
msgstr "  From the entrance gate, the corridor stretched into a dark hallway completely illuminated in blue."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1489:13383: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1489
msgctxt "text_id=13383 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここから先は隣人の顔も見えない密閉空間。"
msgstr "  Figures and faces became mere silhouettes in the darkness."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1494:13384: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1494
msgctxt "text_id=13384 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術の手でもなく魔法の手でもない、文明の手によって現実と切り離された小宇宙だ。"
msgstr "  It was no darkness born from magecraft, but a man-made area of twilight..."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1556:13385: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1556
msgctxt "text_id=13385 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　水槽だけがライトアップされた、影と水色の世界。"
msgstr "  A world of shadow and blue, the only light being from the illuminated tanks."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1561:13386: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1561
msgctxt "text_id=13386 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ガラス一枚<隔|へだ>てた人工の海を眺めながら、ふたりの魔女は歩を進ませる。"
msgstr "  The two witches continued walking down the artificial ocean corridor."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1581:13387: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1581
msgctxt "text_id=13387 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　百の<異世界|コロニー>を<航|わた>る旅。"
msgstr "  Water tanks seemed like windows into hundreds of different worlds."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1587:13388: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1587
msgctxt "text_id=13388 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それぞれ温度も環境も違う水槽たち。"
msgstr "  Each had their own separate temperature and environment."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1592:13389: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1592
msgctxt "text_id=13389 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ひとつひとつが同じようで別の時間。"
msgstr "  It was as if they were snapshots of the same place at different times."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1597:13390: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1597
msgctxt "text_id=13390 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　光の屈折する<水底|みなそこ>では方角は不確かで、彼女たちの会話でさえ、断片的に消えていく。"
msgstr "  Mesmerized by the refracting images of the ocean floor, the housemates' conversation grew sparse."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1647:13391: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1647
msgctxt "text_id=13391 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そういえば、有珠の家ってあれだけ大きいのにプールとかないわよね。なんで？」"
msgstr "\"That reminds me, Alice. You have this huge mansion without a pool. What's up with that?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1671:13392: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1671
msgctxt "text_id=13392 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……呆れた。水槽を観て何を想像したのかは聞かないけど。"
msgstr "\"Figures. You come to an aquarium and that's what you think about."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1677:13393: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1677
msgctxt "text_id=13393 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　必要ないものを欲しがるのは貴女の悪い癖ね、青子」"
msgstr "  Wanting superfluous things is a bad habit of yours, Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1701:13394: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1701
msgctxt "text_id=13394 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「えー、必要ないってコトはないんじゃない？　水遊びは<日|こ><本|っち>より<英国|そっち>の方が馴染み深いでしょうに。"
msgstr "\"Aww, a pool isn't superfluous. Besides, aren't pools more common in England than Japan?"

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1707:13395: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1707
msgctxt "text_id=13395 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あ。もしかして有珠、泳げない？」"
msgstr "  Or... could it be that you can't swim?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1746:13396: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1746
msgctxt "text_id=13396 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「泳ぎの経験ぐらいあるわ。夏は湖で何度も遊んだもの。"
msgstr "\"I've spent enough time in a swimsuit. I often swam in the lake as a child."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1753:13397: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1753
msgctxt "text_id=13397 | speaker=alice"
msgid "わたし、大型のセントバーナードにだって負けなかったのよ」"
msgstr "And I never once lost a race to our big St. Bernard.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1777:13398: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1777
msgctxt "text_id=13398 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「セントバーナードって……有珠さんったら、もしかして<息|いき><継|つ>ぎとか苦手かしら？」"
msgstr "\"A St. Bernard...? Wait, don't tell me. You had trouble with your breathing, didn't you?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1796:13399: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1796
msgctxt "text_id=13399 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「この世でもっとも聞きたくない言葉のひとつね。"
msgstr "\"Ugh. Spare me the swimming lesson."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1802:13400: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1802
msgctxt "text_id=13400 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　クロールとかバタフライとか、発明した人は半魚人になればいいのに」"
msgstr "  'Crawl'? 'Butterfly'? The people who invented those were probably half-fish anyway.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1839:13401: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1839
msgctxt "text_id=13401 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かつ、かつ、かつ。"
msgstr "  Clack, clack, clack."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1845:13402: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1845
msgctxt "text_id=13402 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　海を巡る足取りは、普段のものよりおごそかに、繊細に。"
msgstr "  Their pace was more delicate and solemn than a stroll along the beach."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1850:13403: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1850
msgctxt "text_id=13403 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女たちの会話はうわのそら。"
msgstr "  It was the sort of absent-minded chat one might hear between girls anywhere in the world."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1855:13404: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1855
msgctxt "text_id=13404 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここでは、視線は青いスクリーンにのみ向けられるので。"
msgstr "  In here, the only thing to do was look at blue screens."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1885:13405: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1885
msgctxt "text_id=13405 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でも驚いた。あんなにあっさり館の留守を任せるなんて。アイツがこっそり西館に入るかも、とか考えなかった？」"
msgstr "\"I'm surprised you were willing to leave him alone in the house. You're not worried he'll go snooping in the west wing, are you?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1891:13406: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1891
msgctxt "text_id=13406 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……彼、そこまで考えなしじゃないでしょう。"
msgstr "\"He... can't possibly be that foolish."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1897:13407: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1897
msgctxt "text_id=13407 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　それに―――」"
msgstr "  Besides...\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1915:13408: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1915
msgctxt "text_id=13408 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それに、それならそれで手間が省けてせいせいした？」"
msgstr "\"It'd save us trouble if he did?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1940:13409: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1940
msgctxt "text_id=13409 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……そうじゃなくて。"
msgstr "\"...It's not that."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1960:13410: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1960
msgctxt "text_id=13410 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　一度交わした約束は、破らないんじゃないかって」"
msgstr "  I just don't think he's the type to break his word.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:1997:13411: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:1997
msgctxt "text_id=13411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なるほど、そういうコトもあるだろう。"
msgstr "  That he was not."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2002:13412: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2002
msgctxt "text_id=13412 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　長い髪の少女は感心したように頷いた。"
msgstr "  Aoko nodded, her long hair waving back and forth,"

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2007:13413: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2007
msgctxt "text_id=13413 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ちょっとだけ目が開いたところを見ると、驚きも何割か。"
msgstr "  a certain gleam of surprise in her eyes."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2013:13414: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2013
msgctxt "text_id=13414 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女たちは次の世界にふわふわと。"
msgstr "  Onward they meandered to the next aquatic world."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2019:13415: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2019
msgctxt "text_id=13415 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かつ、かつ、かつ。"
msgstr "  Clack, clack, clack."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2055:13416: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2055
msgctxt "text_id=13416 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ところで、水族館は初めて？」"
msgstr "\"By the way, is this your first time at an aquarium?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2061:13417: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2061
msgctxt "text_id=13417 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「これで二度目。昔、友達とふたりで行ったきりよ」"
msgstr "\"Second. I went with a friend long ago.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2085:13418: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2085
msgctxt "text_id=13418 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「うそ、ほんと？」"
msgstr "\"No way. Really?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2109:13419: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2109
msgctxt "text_id=13419 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「本当。六年以上も前。まだイギリスにいた頃」"
msgstr "\"Yes, really. More than six years ago, when I was still in England.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2115:13420: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2115
msgctxt "text_id=13420 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうじゃなくて友達の方。アンタ、友人はいないって言ったじゃない」"
msgstr "\"No, I mean the friend part. I thought you said you didn't have any friends.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2154:13421: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2154
msgctxt "text_id=13421 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……昔の話よ。わたしたち、同じ名前だったの。"
msgstr "\"That was... a long time ago. We even had the same name."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2160:13422: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2160
msgctxt "text_id=13422 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　それが縁でよく遊んでいたけれど、長続きはしなかったわ」"
msgstr "  We used to play all the time, but we fell out of touch.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2184:13423: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2184
msgctxt "text_id=13423 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そっか、あっちじゃそう珍しくない名前なのね、アリスって。こっちでいうところの良子とか、花子みたいなもの？」"
msgstr "\"That's right, Alice must be a pretty common name over there. Here it's all 'Ryoko' or 'Hanako' and such.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2203:13424: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2203
msgctxt "text_id=13424 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ええ。<青子|あおこ>とか<赤子|あかこ>とか、<黒子|くろこ>とか<白子|しらこ>みたいなものよ」"
msgstr "\"Indeed. Or names referencing colors, like 'Aoko,' 'Akako,' 'Kuroko,' or 'Shirako.'\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2221:13425: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2221
msgctxt "text_id=13425 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……後半はみんな普通名詞なんですけど」"
msgstr "\"They do all end with 'ko,' don't they...\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2258:13426: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2258
msgctxt "text_id=13426 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ひとつひとつに名前があるのが彼らの社会。"
msgstr "  To each their own, a society of names."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2263:13427: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2263
msgctxt "text_id=13427 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　水の中もくるくると目まぐるしいけれど、"
msgstr "  The swirling of the waters was dizzying,"

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2268:13428: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2268
msgctxt "text_id=13428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人間も人間で、いろいろどうでも忙しいよう。"
msgstr "  much like the hectic world of humans."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2274:13429: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2274
msgctxt "text_id=13429 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女たちは手を振りながら、次の世界にかつ、かつと。"
msgstr "  Their hands swung back and forth as they walked toward the next world."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2304:13430: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2304
msgctxt "text_id=13430 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「そう言う青子は、彼をどうするつもりなの？」"
msgstr "\"Incidentally, Aoko, what exactly is your plan for him?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2322:13431: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2322
msgctxt "text_id=13431 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どうって、今の一件を終わらせるまで大人しくしてもらって、落ち着いたら忘却のルーン探して、なかった事にするだけでしょ？　これ以上迷惑かけられないわよ」"
msgstr "\"Well, once our current issue is resolved and things calm down, I'll find the rune for erasing his memory, and he'll forget we ever existed. He won't be a bother for much longer.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2328:13432: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2328
msgctxt "text_id=13432 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……それは、わたしに？」"
msgstr "\"...A bother to whom? Me?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2362:13433: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0023_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2362
msgctxt "text_id=13433 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「へ……？　―――あ、うん、そう。そうに決まってるじゃない。"
msgstr "\"Hm...? O-oh, yeah. Obviously."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2381:13434: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0023_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2381
msgctxt "text_id=13434 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "ところでこの魚、キレイよね。なんか泳ぎたくなってくる。有珠、来年の夏は海にでも行ってみよっか？」"
msgstr "Wow, this fish is really pretty! It makes me want to swim. Hey, we should go to the beach next summer!\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2421:13435: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2421
msgctxt "text_id=13435 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「海って……あの、海？」"
msgstr "\"The beach... You mean...by the ocean?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2445:13436: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0024; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2445
msgctxt "text_id=13436 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「もちろん。夏の海っていったら灼熱の太陽と砂浜、水平線に沈む夕日ってね。"
msgstr "\"Of course. You know, fun under the hot summer sun, sand between your toes, watching the sun set on the horizon..."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2451:13437: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0025; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2451
msgctxt "text_id=13437 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　今年は行けなかったけど、来年は一緒に行かない？」"
msgstr "  We couldn't go this year, so why don't we go together next year?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2470:13438: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0028; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2470
msgctxt "text_id=13438 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「呆れた。本当、貴女って楽観的。"
msgstr "\"Your optimism is exhausting."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2476:13439: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2476
msgctxt "text_id=13439 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……でも、そうね。夏まで生きていられたのなら、そういう事もあるかもしれない」"
msgstr "  But... that does sound nice. If we manage to survive until next summer, that is.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2513:13440: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2513
msgctxt "text_id=13440 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かつ、かつ、かつ。"
msgstr "  Clack, clack, clack."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2519:13441: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2519
msgctxt "text_id=13441 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人間の少女たちは次の水場に跳んでいく。"
msgstr "  The two girls journeyed to the next oceanic wonderland,"

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2524:13442: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2524
msgctxt "text_id=13442 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　眺めていたのはお互いさま。"
msgstr "  mutually taking in the sights."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2529:13443: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2529
msgctxt "text_id=13443 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冬の海に訪れた客人は、涼しい顔で消えていった。"
msgstr "  The visitors to these winter waters had begun to leave, satisfied by their tour."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2535:13444: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2535
msgctxt "text_id=13444 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それではさよなら、かつ、かつ、ばたん。"
msgstr "  The sound of their footsteps heralded their farewell."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2624:13445: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2624
msgctxt "text_id=13445 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……徒歩による航海は一時間に及んだ。"
msgstr "  An hour into the wayfaring sea voyage..."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2641:13446: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2641
msgctxt "text_id=13446 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　展示物の多さもさることながら、入り組んだ通路は迷路のようで、気付かないうちに一フロア上の階層にあがっていたりもした。"
msgstr "  Losing themselves in the maze-like corridors of seemingly endless exhibits, they somehow found themselves on the next floor."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2646:13447: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2646
msgctxt "text_id=13447 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最上階と聞いていた事もあり、青子も二層構造と気付いた時は感心したものだ。"
msgstr "  Aoko had heard that the aquarium was situated on the top floor, and was shocked to find out there was yet another above it."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2690:13448: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2690
msgctxt "text_id=13448 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おそらく、本当の最上階には水族館からしか行けない作りになっているのだろう。"
msgstr "  It was likely by design that the actual top floor could only be accessed from within the aquarium."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2695:13449: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2695
msgctxt "text_id=13449 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どのようなアトラクションであれ、サプライズはあるに越したことはない。"
msgstr "  Moments of intrigue such as this are what attractions were made for."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2736:13450: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0026; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2736
msgctxt "text_id=13450 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「有珠？」"
msgstr "\"Alice?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2763:13451: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2763
msgctxt "text_id=13451 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふと振り返ると有珠の姿がない。"
msgstr "  Turning this way and that, she found Alice had disappeared."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2768:13452: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2768
msgctxt "text_id=13452 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さっきまで一緒にいたのに、と同居人の姿を探す。"
msgstr "  Her houesmate had just been there, however, and Aoko took to looking for her."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2791:13453: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2791
msgctxt "text_id=13453 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　探し人はすぐに見つかった。"
msgstr "  She soon found her nearby."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2796:13454: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2796
msgctxt "text_id=13454 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　闇に映える白い<外套|コート>が、ライトアップされた水槽の前に佇んでいる。"
msgstr "  Her white overcoat shone brightly in front of the dimly lit exhibit."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2836:13455: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2836
msgctxt "text_id=13455 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女はじっと青い水槽を見つめていた。"
msgstr "  She was staring motionless into the water tank."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2841:13456: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2841
msgctxt "text_id=13456 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　散漫と、ありきたりな風景を見つめるように。"
msgstr "  Alice almost looked to be staring through it, as though distracted by something."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2862:13457: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0027; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2862
msgctxt "text_id=13457 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どうしたの有珠？　気分でも悪くなった？」"
msgstr "\"What's wrong, Alice? Are you feeling okay?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2868:13458: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2868
msgctxt "text_id=13458 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　微妙な様子の変化を感じて声をかける。"
msgstr "  She spoke, hoping to snap her out of it."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2873:13459: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2873
msgctxt "text_id=13459 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の体にある、いつもの張りつめた空気がなくなっている気がしたからだ。"
msgstr "  Alice's typically cold aura seemed to have all but left her."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2940:13460: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0028; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2940
msgctxt "text_id=13460 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「珍しい魚でもいた？　それ、余り物を端においやりましたって感じの水槽だけど」"
msgstr "\"Is it a rare fish? ...This looks like the tank they use for all the fish that don't fit anywhere else.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2946:13461: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2946
msgctxt "text_id=13461 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はそうね、とだけ返答した。"
msgstr "  Alice gave a noncommittal response."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:2951:13462: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:2951
msgctxt "text_id=13462 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女の視線の先にあるのはひとつの影。"
msgstr "  Just ahead of her gaze was a single shadow."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3011:13463: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0029; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3011
msgctxt "text_id=13463 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ワォ、マンボウ」"
msgstr "\"Wow, an ocean sunfish.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3017:13464: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3017
msgctxt "text_id=13464 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　芝居がかった青子の声に、有珠は無言でうなずく。"
msgstr "  Alice remained motionless, unresponsive to Aoko's sarcasm."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3022:13465: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3022
msgctxt "text_id=13465 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この、端においやられた水槽のさらに端っこで、彼は静かに漂っていた。"
msgstr "  She stood in silence, watching the poor little fish, drifting listlessly in the tank where they put the fish that did not fit anywhere else, here at the end of the hall."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3078:13466: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3078
msgctxt "text_id=13466 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一般的に言って、マンボウはカタチのいい魚ではない。"
msgstr "  To put it lightly, sunfish were not especially pleasant to look at."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3083:13467: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3083
msgctxt "text_id=13467 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　海を泳ぐ生物として、なぜこんな進化を？　と聞きたくなる形状だ。"
msgstr "  When looking at one, it begged the question of what direction evolution wanted to take with it."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3088:13468: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3088
msgctxt "text_id=13468 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　平べったい魚身の上下にある舵びれで泳ぐらしいが、他の魚のようなスピードは期待できまい。"
msgstr "  It looked like it swam using rudder-like fins on its top and bottom, but lacked the grace of other fish."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3093:13469: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3093
msgctxt "text_id=13469 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子からすれば、体も目も、その在り方ものっぺりとした不思議生物である。"
msgstr "  To Aoko, its eyes, body, and strange movements made it an awkward creature."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3098:13470: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3098
msgctxt "text_id=13470 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が。"
msgstr "  But..."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3153:13471: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0030; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3153
msgctxt "text_id=13471 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ね。有珠、あっちの水槽みない？　ジンベエザメの回遊とか、<見|み><目|め><麗|うるわ>しいわよ？」"
msgstr "\"Hey, Alice, let's check out the whale shark exhibit over there. It sounds really exciting, don't you think?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3191:13472: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3191
msgctxt "text_id=13472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はこのように、マンボウに夢中である。"
msgstr "  Alice, unmoved, fixated on the sunfish."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3211:13473: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3211
msgctxt "text_id=13473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふらふらと漂う魚界の<金平糖|こんぺいとう>を見つめ、彼がうまく<転回|ターン>できずコツコツと水槽にぶつかる度に、"
msgstr "  It clumsily drifted around its tank, occasionally bumping into the glass as it turned."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3227:13474: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0030; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3227
msgctxt "text_id=13474 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「青子。この子、泳ぐのが下手だわ」"
msgstr "\"Aoko, this little one can't swim well.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3281:13475: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3281
msgctxt "text_id=13475 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　水槽に触れようと指を伸ばし、大人げないと引っ込めていた。"
msgstr "  Alice extended her finger toward the glass, then retracted it, feeling childish."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3310:13476: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0031; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3310
msgctxt "text_id=13476 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ま、いっか。<愛嬌|あいきょう>だけはあるしね、マンボウ」"
msgstr "\"Well, whatever. I suppose sunfish have their own charm.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3316:13477: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3316
msgctxt "text_id=13477 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こうなっては有珠はテコでも動かない。"
msgstr "  It did not seem like Alice was going to budge."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3329:13478: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3329
msgctxt "text_id=13478 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　仕方ないと観念して、青子は有珠に付き合い、<座布団|ざぶとん>のような硬骨魚を眺めるのだった。"
msgstr "  Resigning herself, Aoko stayed with Alice while she stared at the cushion-shaped fish."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3358:13479: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0032; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3358
msgctxt "text_id=13479 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「へー。マンボウってフグ目だったんだ。なになに、マンボウのメスは一度に三億個の卵を海中に放出する、地上でもっとも多くの卵を産む脊椎動物である……なるほどねー。"
msgstr "\"Huh. They have eyes like puffer fish. It also says here that the females can produce more eggs than any other known vertebrate, up to three hundred million at a time. Neat..."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3364:13480: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0033; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3364
msgctxt "text_id=13480 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　他の魚たちにとっちゃ格好のエサになるから、多く産むこと、それ自体が生存のための手段になるワケか」"
msgstr "  The babies become prey to other fish, so in a way giving birth to so many is a means of survival for them.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3424:13481: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3424
msgctxt "text_id=13481 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　興味深く解説を読む青子だが、有珠はマンボウの生態はどうでもいいらしい。"
msgstr "  Though Aoko seemed taken in by the biological details of the fish, Alice couldn't have cared less."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3429:13482: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3429
msgctxt "text_id=13482 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　平たい魚影がコツコツと水槽の壁に当たるたび、目を輝かせたり、落ちこんだりする。"
msgstr "  She was lost in the ebb and flow of emotions between wonder and woe with every clumsy bump of the fish into the glass."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3434:13483: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3434
msgctxt "text_id=13483 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな中、不意に少女は呟いた。"
msgstr "  Out of nowhere, she softly spoke."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3440:13484: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0031; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3440
msgctxt "text_id=13484 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「さっきの話だけど」"
msgstr "\"About before...\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3468:13485: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0034; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3468
msgctxt "text_id=13485 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「へ？　さっきの話って、なに？」"
msgstr "\"Huh? Before? When?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3491:13486: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0032; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3491
msgctxt "text_id=13486 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「彼について。留守を任せるとか、そういうの」"
msgstr "\"About him. About leaving the house in his care.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3511:13487: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3511
msgctxt "text_id=13487 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気が付けば、少女はいつもの姿に戻っていた。"
msgstr "  It seemed like Alice had returned to her normal self."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3516:13488: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3516
msgctxt "text_id=13488 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　張りつめた空気。"
msgstr "  There was that cold aura."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3521:13489: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3521
msgctxt "text_id=13489 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何処であろうと、あの洋館の中であろうと、<頑|かたく>なに人を拒む冷たさに。"
msgstr "  Whether inside the mansion or out, that stubborn chill that pushed people away was back."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3542:13490: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0033; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3542
msgctxt "text_id=13490 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「わたしの気が変わった訳じゃないわ。"
msgstr "\"I haven't changed my mind."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3548:13491: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0034; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3548
msgctxt "text_id=13491 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　依然として彼の事は分からないもの。分からない人を、どうやって信頼すればいいの？」"
msgstr "  He is still a complete unknown. How can I trust someone I know nothing about?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3573:13492: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0035; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3573
msgctxt "text_id=13492 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……まあね。でも、じゃあどうして？」"
msgstr "\"...I guess. But then why let him...?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3579:13493: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0035; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3579
msgctxt "text_id=13493 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「青子の事は分かるわ。貴女はいつも正しい選択をする。……だから、青子を信じる彼の人間性は、信じてもいい」"
msgstr "\"Because I know you, Aoko. You always make the right decision. So... I'm trusting your judgment on the matter.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3600:13494: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0036; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3600
msgctxt "text_id=13494 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3641:13495: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3641
msgctxt "text_id=13495 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の事は分からないし、理解する気もない。"
msgstr "  It was true. She did not know Soujyuro, nor had any intention to."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3646:13496: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3646
msgctxt "text_id=13496 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、<有珠|じぶん>の協力者である青子を信じているのなら、その選択に免じて許してもいい。"
msgstr "  But because of her trust in Aoko, she could trust in Aoko's decision to allow him to stay."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3652:13497: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3652
msgctxt "text_id=13497 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は今の自分の感情を、そう落としこんだらしい。"
msgstr "  It seemed Alice was challenging her own feelings."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3685:13498: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3685
msgctxt "text_id=13498 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　分からない人は信頼できない、と少女は言う。"
msgstr "  She said she could not trust someone she did not know."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3690:13499: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3690
msgctxt "text_id=13499 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど逆に言えば、それは―――誰かを信じたいから、深く理解したいと望んでいるようにもとれた。"
msgstr "  In other words, she wished to trust him, and in order to do so, she needed to know more about him."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3724:13500: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0037; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3724
msgctxt "text_id=13500 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ま、口にするのは何だからつっこまないけどね。"
msgstr "\"Well, I don't really know how to respond to that, Alice."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3766:13501: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_3C_0038; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3766
msgctxt "text_id=13501 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それより、なに？　そんなに私のこと信頼してくれてたの、有珠？」"
msgstr "  Also, I had no idea you trusted me that much.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3772:13502: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0036; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3772
msgctxt "text_id=13502 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……ええ。好意はともかく、信頼だけはしているわ。"
msgstr "\"I do trust you. I may not be fond of you, but I trust you."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3778:13503: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0037; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3778
msgctxt "text_id=13503 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　だって共犯者でしょう、わたしたち」"
msgstr "  Because we're partners in crime, aren't we?\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3863:13504: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3863
msgctxt "text_id=13504 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　白いコートが揺れる。"
msgstr "  Her white coat swayed to and fro."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3868:13505: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3868
msgctxt "text_id=13505 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……ひとときの旅は終わった。"
msgstr "  Just like that, their short excursion had come to an end."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3873:13506: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3873
msgctxt "text_id=13506 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　水の国の出口はすぐそこだ。"
msgstr "  Straight ahead was the exit back to the real world."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3878:13507: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3878
msgctxt "text_id=13507 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女は水槽から視線を逸らして、付き合いのいい同居人へと歩きだした。"
msgstr "  A step away from the exhibit was a step toward becoming better roommates."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3939:13508: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_3C_0038; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3939
msgctxt "text_id=13508 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……優しい顔をしているのに、傷だらけね」"
msgstr "\"...Such a kind face, but so clearly scarred.\""

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3951:13509: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3951
msgctxt "text_id=13509 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最後に小さく。"
msgstr "  One last, small whisper."

#. Occurrence 9_3C:3956:13510: scene=9_3C
#: 9_3C:3956
msgctxt "text_id=13510 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　水槽の孤影に別れを告げるよう、呟いて。"
msgstr "  And with that, she bid farewell to the lonely figure in the tank."

#. Occurrence 9_4:67:13511: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:67
msgctxt "text_id=13511 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冬の日没は早い。"
msgstr "  The sun set early during winter."

#. Occurrence 9_4:72:13512: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:72
msgctxt "text_id=13512 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　午後の斜陽が完全に失われた午後四時。"
msgstr "  By four in the afternoon, it had already fallen below the horizon."

#. Occurrence 9_4:77:13513: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:77
msgctxt "text_id=13513 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館は町中よりいくぶん早く夕暮れを迎えようとしている。"
msgstr "  Evening seemed to arrive at the mansion earlier than in the city."

#. Occurrence 9_4:107:13514: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:107
msgctxt "text_id=13514 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――なるほど。君の生態はよく解った」"
msgstr "\"I see. Now I know all about crocodiles.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:113:13515: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:113
msgctxt "text_id=13515 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冷えこんできた中、お茶だけを<暖|だん>にして草十郎はひとりうなずいた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro sat alone, sipping his warm tea in the chilly room."

#. Occurrence 9_4:129:13516: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:129
msgctxt "text_id=13516 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いいかげんワニは飽きたのか、ソファーに身を預けて、ぼんやりと窓の外を眺めている。"
msgstr "  He relaxed on the couch staring out the window, having had his fill of crocodiles."

#. Occurrence 9_4:160:13517: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:160
msgctxt "text_id=13517 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一度やってみたかったのか、ソファーに寝そべったまま草十郎は動かない。"
msgstr "  Once he sprawled out on the sofa, his body refused to move. Maybe he'd had always wanted to try it."

#. Occurrence 9_4:165:13518: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:165
msgctxt "text_id=13518 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三時間近くワニを観察していた影響か、あんなふうに日がな一日横になって暮らすのはどんな気持ちなのか、と真剣に悩んでいるようにも見える。"
msgstr "  After three straight hours of crocodile-watching, he intently pondered what it would be like to laze there for the remainder of the day like a reptile."

#. Occurrence 9_4:186:13519: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:186
msgctxt "text_id=13519 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:192:13520: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:192
msgctxt "text_id=13520 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いい機会だし、いっそ青子たちが帰ってくるまでソファーで眠ってみようか、などと草十郎が考えた矢先、洋館には不釣り合いな怪音が響いてきた。"
msgstr "  Just as he was considering the opportunity nap until Aoko and Alice returned, an unnatural noise echoed through the halls of the mansion."

#. Occurrence 9_4:225:13521: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:225
msgctxt "text_id=13521 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……？」"
msgstr "\"...?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:231:13522: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:231
msgctxt "text_id=13522 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<四足|ワニ>から<二足|ヒト>に進化するように、のっそりと起き上がる。"
msgstr "  Sluggishly, he rose from all fours to a bipedal state, as if undergoing an evolution of his own."

#. Occurrence 9_4:236:13523: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:236
msgctxt "text_id=13523 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ごんごん、という音は辛抱強く定期的に続いていた。"
msgstr "  It was a knocking sound that repeated itself regularly, with patient pauses in between."

#. Occurrence 9_4:241:13524: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:241
msgctxt "text_id=13524 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アパート暮らしの時に何度か経験した、玄関からの呼び音である。"
msgstr "  He recognized the cadence from something he'd experienced at his apartment before."

#. Occurrence 9_4:263:13525: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:263
msgctxt "text_id=13525 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……むう。新聞の勧誘か？」"
msgstr "\"...Hm? A newspaper salesman?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:269:13526: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:269
msgctxt "text_id=13526 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんな丘の上までたいしたもんだ、と感心しながら草十郎はロビーに向かった。"
msgstr "  Making for the foyer, Soujyuro was impressed that they had hiked all the way up the hill."

#. Occurrence 9_4:311:13527: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:311
msgctxt "text_id=13527 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　音は妙に響き渡る。"
msgstr "  The knocking resounded eerily."

#. Occurrence 9_4:316:13528: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:316
msgctxt "text_id=13528 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの玄関には呼び鈴らしきものはないし、来訪者はいかなる道具で扉を叩いているのか。"
msgstr "  Without a doorbell of any kind, visitors had no choice but to rap on the door using whatever they had in hand."

#. Occurrence 9_4:321:13529: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:321
msgctxt "text_id=13529 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手だとしたら、なんていうか、<畏|い><怖|ふ>すべき鉄拳勧誘である。"
msgstr "  It would take a literal iron fist to produce the din Soujyuro heard now."

#. Occurrence 9_4:368:13530: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:368
msgctxt "text_id=13530 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　館の入り口にあたる玄関は、草十郎から見れば要塞の如き堅固さ、豪華さだ。"
msgstr "  From his position in the hall, the front door looked like an ornately built fortification."

#. Occurrence 9_4:373:13531: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:373
msgctxt "text_id=13531 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　両開きの扉は頑丈で、<破城鎚|はじょうづち>でも持ってこないかぎり破られる事はないだろう。"
msgstr "  The sturdy double doors looked as though they could withstand any onslaught of blows."

#. Occurrence 9_4:385:13532: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:385
msgctxt "text_id=13532 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな扉が、何度目かのノックで悲鳴を上げるように軋んでいる。"
msgstr "  But now, they rattled in protest to the repeated knocking."

#. Occurrence 9_4:405:13533: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:405
msgctxt "text_id=13533 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうも相手は、このまま出てこないのなら城門突破も<辞|じ>さないかまえらしい。"
msgstr "  Whoever the visitor was, they seemed determined to breach the castle gate by force if its defender refused to sally forth."

#. Occurrence 9_4:410:13534: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:410
msgctxt "text_id=13534 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　新聞の勧誘バイトも経験済みの草十郎である。なので、"
msgstr "  Fortunately for them, Soujyuro was sympathetic, having experience selling newspapers himself."

#. Occurrence 9_4:430:13535: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:430
msgctxt "text_id=13535 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「はーい、いま開けまーす」"
msgstr "\"Just a second!\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:436:13536: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:436
msgctxt "text_id=13536 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼らは彼らなりに必死な事を知っているので、別段そこには驚かなかった。"
msgstr "  He knew what it was like to be in those shoes, so was unsurprised by their persistence."

#. Occurrence 9_4:537:13537: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:537
msgctxt "text_id=13537 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:543:13538: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:543
msgctxt "text_id=13538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは本日二度目の、正体不明の驚きだった。"
msgstr "  There stood the second surprise of the day."

#. Occurrence 9_4:548:13539: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:548
msgctxt "text_id=13539 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は言葉なく立ち尽くす。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was struck speechless."

#. Occurrence 9_4:582:13540: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:582
msgctxt "text_id=13540 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　新聞の勧誘にしては珍しく、若い女性だったから……ではない。"
msgstr "  He was greeted by a young woman who hardly looked the part of a newspaper hawker."

#. Occurrence 9_4:587:13541: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:587
msgctxt "text_id=13541 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　日没前の中庭を背景にした女性の姿は、自分なんかよりよほど、この洋館に相応しく思えたからだ。"
msgstr "  Standing in the courtyard against a dusk-lit horizon, she appeared more at home in the European mansion than Soujyuro did."

#. Occurrence 9_4:622:13542: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:622
msgctxt "text_id=13542 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　細いが、しかし、凛とした女性だった。"
msgstr "  She carried a dignified air, in spite of her dainty frame."

#. Occurrence 9_4:627:13543: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:627
msgctxt "text_id=13543 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背の程は草十郎よりやや低い。女性としては長身の部類だろう。"
msgstr "  While a tad shorter than Soujyuro, she was tall for her sex."

#. Occurrence 9_4:632:13544: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:632
msgctxt "text_id=13544 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　緑色の服は地味な色彩のクセに派手で、この国の文化とは系統が違っていた。"
msgstr "  Her green clothing was subtly colored yet flashy, and clearly inspired by foreign fashion."

#. Occurrence 9_4:652:13545: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:652
msgctxt "text_id=13545 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<清楚|せいそ>なのに堂々としている。"
msgstr "  She seemed prim and proper, yet bold―"

#. Occurrence 9_4:657:13546: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:657
msgctxt "text_id=13546 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　華やかなようで、その実、強い芯が通っている感じ。"
msgstr "  though vaguely garish, her appearance spoke of strength and confidence."

#. Occurrence 9_4:684:13547: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:684
msgctxt "text_id=13547 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな、本来ならあまり混ざらない要素を持つ女性を、草十郎はよく知っている。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro knew all too well that such a woman was not to be trifled with."

#. Occurrence 9_4:725:13548: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:725
msgctxt "text_id=13548 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ、草十郎の知っている彼女と違い、この女性は威圧より優しさの方が際だっていた。"
msgstr "  Only, unlike the one he knew, this stranger appeared more friendly than intimidating."

#. Occurrence 9_4:730:13549: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:730
msgctxt "text_id=13549 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　中性的に見えるのは短髪だからだろう。"
msgstr "  Perhaps it was her short hair that made her look approachable."

#. Occurrence 9_4:735:13550: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:735
msgctxt "text_id=13550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見るも鮮やかなブラウンの髪はうなじまでしかない。"
msgstr "  Bright and brown, it stopped just above the nape of her neck."

#. Occurrence 9_4:740:13551: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:740
msgctxt "text_id=13551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呆然と、もったいないな、と思う草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro silently thought that it was a shame she hadn't grown it out."

#. Occurrence 9_4:765:13552: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:765
msgctxt "text_id=13552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな草十郎を見て、女性は小さく微笑んだ。"
msgstr "  She looked at him and offered a smile."

#. Occurrence 9_4:770:13553: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:770
msgctxt "text_id=13553 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ずいぶん年上のように見えるのに、そんな仕草が悪戯っぽくて可愛いことこの上ない。"
msgstr "  Despite seeming visibly older than him, this made her appear impish and cute."

#. Occurrence 9_4:809:13554: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:809
msgctxt "text_id=13554 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:814:13555: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:814
msgctxt "text_id=13555 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分は惚れっぽい<性質|たち>ではないと信じていた草十郎だが、なんだかそれも怪しいな、とうなだれる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro reacted with suspicion, knowing better by now than to fall for a charming smile."

#. Occurrence 9_4:819:13556: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:819
msgctxt "text_id=13556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ともあれ、こうして黙りこんでいては失礼だ。"
msgstr "  At any rate, it was rude to stare."

#. Occurrence 9_4:855:13557: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:855
msgctxt "text_id=13557 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ええと、どちら様でしょうか」"
msgstr "\"Um, can I help you?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:861:13558: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:861
msgctxt "text_id=13558 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　微妙にドギマギしている心臓を落ち着けて問いかける。"
msgstr "  He tried not to look flustered as he greeted the visitor."

#. Occurrence 9_4:866:13559: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:866
msgctxt "text_id=13559 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに、"
msgstr "  To which she replied,"

#. Occurrence 9_4:905:13560: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:905
msgctxt "text_id=13560 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「こんばんは。青子います？」"
msgstr "\"Good evening. Is Aoko home?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:929:13561: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:929
msgctxt "text_id=13561 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　女性は青子という言葉に親しみをこめて、笑顔で返してきたのだった。"
msgstr "  She smiled as she used Aoko's first name with a familiar tone."

#. Occurrence 9_4:980:13562: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:980
msgctxt "text_id=13562 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「蒼崎はいないんです」"
msgstr "\"Aozaki isn't home right now.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1015:13563: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1015
msgctxt "text_id=13563 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の留守を告げる草十郎に、女性はあら、という意外そうな顔をした。"
msgstr "  She smiled again, this time deviously upon learning of Aoko's absence."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1042:13564: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1042
msgctxt "text_id=13564 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「それじゃあ久遠寺さんも留守なんだ」"
msgstr "\"Then I take it Miss Kuonji is away, too?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1048:13565: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1048
msgctxt "text_id=13565 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はしばし戸惑う。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro looked perplexed."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1053:13566: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1053
msgctxt "text_id=13566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠を『久遠寺』と呼ぶ人間は今までいなかった。それも親しげに、十年来の友人のようにだ。"
msgstr "  This was the first time he had heard Alice referred to by her last name only, and again, with the familiarity of an old friend."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1081:13567: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1081
msgctxt "text_id=13567 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そっかあ。夜ならともかく、日中から二人で出かけるとは感心感心。"
msgstr "\"I see. It's nice to hear that they can get out during the day, instead of only during the dead of night."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1088:13568: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1088
msgctxt "text_id=13568 | speaker=touko"
msgid "カタチだけの雑居だろうと思ったけど、ちゃんと上手くいってるのね」"
msgstr "I was under the impression that living together was merely a facade, but they really do get along.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1108:13569: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1108
msgctxt "text_id=13569 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　にこりと微笑まれて、つい頷く草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro found himself nodding in response to her smile."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1113:13570: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1113
msgctxt "text_id=13570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子たちと面識がありそうなのも驚きだが、この女性はそもそも印象がおかしい。"
msgstr "  It was strange enough that the visitor knew both Aoko and Alice, but Soujyuro found her odd as well."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1118:13571: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1118
msgctxt "text_id=13571 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　歳の頃は二十代前半だろうけれど、そう<草十郎|じぶん>と歳が離れている気がしない。"
msgstr "  Likely in her early twenties, she did not appear much older than he was."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1123:13572: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1123
msgctxt "text_id=13572 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　屈託のない口調と明るい表情が、本来の美貌を<曖昧|あいまい>にしているような。"
msgstr "  She was clearly hiding something behind her nonchalant manner and bright smile."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1151:13573: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1151
msgctxt "text_id=13573 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「それじゃあ、帰ってくるにしても夜？」"
msgstr "\"So they won't be home until the evening, then?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1169:13574: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1169
msgctxt "text_id=13574 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「はい。終電前には帰ってくると思いますけど」"
msgstr "\"That's correct, though I expect them back before the last train.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1175:13575: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1175
msgctxt "text_id=13575 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そう。ところで君、誰？」"
msgstr "\"I see. And who might you be?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1181:13576: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1181
msgctxt "text_id=13576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはこっちの台詞なんだけど、と心の中でちょっとだけ困る草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro, troubled by her forwardness, wanted to ask her the same."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1186:13577: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1186
msgctxt "text_id=13577 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰？　という問いへの返答は、草十郎には難しすぎる。"
msgstr "  Alas, \"who are you?\" was a question far too difficult for Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1207:13578: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1207
msgctxt "text_id=13578 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「すみません。誰か、と言われてもよく分からなくて。"
msgstr "\"I'm sorry. I don't really know how to answer that."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1213:13579: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1213
msgctxt "text_id=13579 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　とりあえず、今は留守番してますけど、実は蒼崎の友人なんです」"
msgstr "  For now, I'm the house-sitter. I'm a friend of Aozaki's, to tell the truth.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1219:13580: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1219
msgctxt "text_id=13580 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まったく頼り気のない返答。"
msgstr "  It was a response without an ounce of persuasion to it."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1224:13581: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1224
msgctxt "text_id=13581 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　馬鹿にしているとしか思えない少年に、女性はぱあ、と顔を明るくした。"
msgstr "  The young woman's face lit up at what she believed was the boy's attempt to tease her."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1258:13582: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1258
msgctxt "text_id=13582 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「へえ、面白いこと言うのね君。名前はなんて言うの？」"
msgstr "\"Aren't you a funny one? What's your name, dear?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1264:13583: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1264
msgctxt "text_id=13583 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あの……静希草十郎、と言うのですが」"
msgstr "\"It's... Soujyuro Sizuki.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1287:13584: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1287
msgctxt "text_id=13584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さらに自信なげな答えに、女性は笑いだしてしまった。"
msgstr "  His shy answer made her giggle."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1292:13585: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1292
msgctxt "text_id=13585 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎にはどのあたりが可笑しかったのか分からなかったが、そう気分の悪い笑い声ではない。そこには卑下するものはなく、包むような温かさがあったからだ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro had no idea what he'd said that was so funny, but her laugh did not offend him. It came across as warm and affable, rather than derogatory."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1312:13586: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1312
msgctxt "text_id=13586 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして。"
msgstr "  Then..."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1317:13587: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1317
msgctxt "text_id=13587 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　女性はひとしきり笑った後、やけに親しげな眼差しで草十郎を見つめ直した。"
msgstr "  After she finished giggling, the woman fixed him with rather a rather tender look."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1355:13588: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1355
msgctxt "text_id=13588 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「いや、気に入ったわ。えーと、草十郎くんだっけ？"
msgstr "\"I think I like you. Soujyuro, was it?"

#. Occurrence 9_4:1383:13589: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1383
msgctxt "text_id=13589 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　君には合わない名前だけど、それも暗示的で素敵だし。じゃ、そういうワケでお茶でも淹れてくれない？」"
msgstr "  A fine name for hypnosis, though it doesn't really suit you. Now then, pour me some tea, would you?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1389:13590: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1389
msgctxt "text_id=13590 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「？　あ、いや」"
msgstr "\"Huh? Uh, wait―\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1395:13591: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1395
msgctxt "text_id=13591 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　女性は草十郎を置き去りに、堂々と玄関を抜けていく。"
msgstr "  She slipped past him into the house, boldly striding through the entrance hall."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1431:13592: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1431
msgctxt "text_id=13592 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「うわ、呆れた。ほんと以前のまんまじゃない。"
msgstr "\"Wow, it's just as I remember it."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1437:13593: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1437
msgctxt "text_id=13593 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　せっかくこっちに持ってきたんだから、悪いところは<修復|リフォーム>したものと思ったけど。なにも柱の歪みまで再現しなくてもいいのにねー」"
msgstr "  I thought she would have repaired the damaged pieces, what with taking the trouble to bring them all the way here. I would have fixed up the warped columns, at least.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1473:13594: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1473
msgctxt "text_id=13594 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　女性は楽しげにロビーを観察する。"
msgstr "  The visitor cheerfully inspected the foyer."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1482:13595: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1482
msgctxt "text_id=13595 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は玄関に置き去り状態。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro still stood at the entrance."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1487:13596: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1487
msgctxt "text_id=13596 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<靴|ヒール>の音はロビーを横切って、居間に続く扉に向かっていく。"
msgstr "  The clicking of her heels on the wooden floor echoed as she moved toward the drawing room."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1520:13597: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1520
msgctxt "text_id=13597 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「どうしたの？　こっちでしょ、居間は」"
msgstr "\"Why are you standing there? The drawing room is this way, isn't it?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1530:13598: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1530
msgctxt "text_id=13598 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　勝手知ったる<他人|ひと>の家状態で、女性は迷いなく居間に続く廊下に消えていった。"
msgstr "  She disappeared from the foyer into the drawing room, oddly familiar with the layout of the house."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1563:13599: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1563
msgctxt "text_id=13599 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「蒼崎か有珠、どっちかの先輩……かな？」"
msgstr "\"Does she know Aozaki from school? Or maybe she knows Alice?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1568:13600: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1568
msgctxt "text_id=13600 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぽつりと呟いて、草十郎も居間に向かった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro muttered to himself, walking to the drawing room."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1614:13601: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1614
msgctxt "text_id=13601 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎が居間に入ると、女性は感心しきった顔で、居間中を<漫|すず>ろ歩いていた。"
msgstr "  He entered to see the woman walking around the room gleefully."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1625:13602: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1625
msgctxt "text_id=13602 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　公園の並木道を散策するような、"
msgstr "  Like someone strolling down a park boulevard,"

#. Occurrence 9_4:1630:13603: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1630
msgctxt "text_id=13603 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　懐かしい空気を吸って踊りだしそうな、"
msgstr "  she peered around, breathing in the nostalgia,"

#. Occurrence 9_4:1635:13604: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1635
msgctxt "text_id=13604 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　女性というより少女らしい軽やかさで。"
msgstr "  twirling with ladylike―or rather, girlish―glee."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1669:13605: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0012; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1669
msgctxt "text_id=13605 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ん？　よく見れば、このテレビって―――」"
msgstr "\"Hm? Wait a minute... This TV is...\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1678:13606: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1678
msgctxt "text_id=13606 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　３０インチのテレビが珍しいのか、女性は食い入るように居間に不釣り合いなテレビを見つめた。"
msgstr "  She stared at the television inquisitively. Perhaps she had never seen a thirty-inch television before."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1698:13607: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1698
msgctxt "text_id=13607 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……間の悪いことに、ブラウン管には流しっぱなしのがくがく動物ランドの映像。"
msgstr "  Awkwardly for Soujyuro, the cathode-ray tube was still displaying images of the animal kingdom."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1703:13608: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1703
msgctxt "text_id=13608 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ちゃんと停止ボタンを押しておけば良かった、と草十郎は悔やみつつ反省した。"
msgstr "  He wished he'd stopped the video before he answered the door."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1737:13609: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1737
msgctxt "text_id=13609 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あの、もし」"
msgstr "\"Er, may I...\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1742:13610: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1742
msgctxt "text_id=13610 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気を取り直して話しかける。"
msgstr "  He blurted half a question, attempting to regain his composure."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1747:13611: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1747
msgctxt "text_id=13611 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とりあえず色々問題はある気はするけど、まず<女性|あいて>の名前ぐらいは聞かなければ、と意を決したのだ。"
msgstr "  There were many questions to be answered, but he first resolved to ask her name, at least."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1752:13612: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1752
msgctxt "text_id=13612 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな草十郎に、女性は一転して冷たい視線を向けた。"
msgstr "  The woman turned a coldly observant gaze on him."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1757:13613: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1757
msgctxt "text_id=13613 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　細く長い眉と、相手を圧倒する瞳が、眼鏡ごしに草十郎を睨む。"
msgstr "  Her intimidating eyes and long, thin eyebrows bored into Soujyuro through her spectacles."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1789:13614: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1789
msgctxt "text_id=13614 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1800:13615: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1800
msgctxt "text_id=13615 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなつもりはなかったけど、自分に重大な落ち度があったらしい―――と思うしかない批難の眼差しだった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro had intended no offense, but now he felt like he had chosen his words very poorly."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1820:13616: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1820
msgctxt "text_id=13616 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は申し訳なさそうに言葉を失う。"
msgstr "  He apologetically clammed up."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1825:13617: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1825
msgctxt "text_id=13617 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこへ、"
msgstr "  Then..."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1852:13618: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0014; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1852
msgctxt "text_id=13618 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「やだなあ草十郎くん。もし、なんてかしこまって。"
msgstr "\"Come now, Soujyuro. 'May I'? Really?"

#. Occurrence 9_4:1858:13619: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0015; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1858
msgctxt "text_id=13619 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　私、そんなおばさんに見える？」"
msgstr "  Do I look like some old lady to you?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1863:13620: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1863
msgctxt "text_id=13620 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　くすりと。"
msgstr "  She snickered."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1868:13621: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1868
msgctxt "text_id=13621 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鋭い眼差しを崩して、からかうように女性は笑った。"
msgstr "  Her disapproving glare melted into a teasing smile."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1914:13622: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1914
msgctxt "text_id=13622 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もちろんそんな事は全然なくて、比喩するならお姉さんという単語がぴったりくる。"
msgstr "  Of course, that wasn't true at all. It would be more accurate to say she had the air of an older sister."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1919:13623: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1919
msgctxt "text_id=13623 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな気持ちを全身で表現する草十郎に、女性は満足気に微笑んだ。"
msgstr "  Or at least, that was what Soujyuro attempted to express with body language, to which she grinned smugly."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1948:13624: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0016; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1948
msgctxt "text_id=13624 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「よろしい。なら、そんな他人行儀な話し方はやめましょ。つまらないし、<柄|がら>じゃないわ」"
msgstr "\"Very well. Let's do away with the formalities, shall we? They're beginning to bore me, anyway.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:1967:13625: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1967
msgctxt "text_id=13625 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言って、彼女はソファーに腰を下ろした。"
msgstr "  Without making a sound, she took an effortless seat on the sofa,"

#. Occurrence 9_4:1972:13626: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1972
msgctxt "text_id=13626 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あくまで自然に、優雅に、物音ひとつ立てずに。"
msgstr "  as naturally as if she belonged there."

#. Occurrence 9_4:1979:13627: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1979
msgctxt "text_id=13627 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その、あまりにも洗練された動作と姿勢が、"
msgstr "  Her posture and movements exuded sophistication,"

#. Occurrence 9_4:1984:13628: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:1984
msgctxt "text_id=13628 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『さあ、早くお茶淹れてきて』と語っている。"
msgstr "and she required no words to instruct him to hurry along and make the tea."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2015:13629: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2015
msgctxt "text_id=13629 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　疑問は究明されないまま、仕方なく草十郎は台所に向かった。"
msgstr "  Without pressing her further, Soujyuro headed to the kitchen."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2021:13630: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2021
msgctxt "text_id=13630 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "とにかくお茶を淹れないと話は進まないらしい。"
msgstr "It seemed that the conversation would not proceed until tea had been served."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2042:13631: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2042
msgctxt "text_id=13631 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　葉は以前、無断使用の<咎|とが>で弁償させられたフォションを選んだ。"
msgstr "  He chose the Fauchon he was forced to replace once before, after using it without permission."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2047:13632: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2047
msgctxt "text_id=13632 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カップは青子を訪ねてきた人なので、青子の持ち物であるセーブルのカップで紅茶を淹れる事にする。"
msgstr "  Since she was here to see Aoko, he decided to serve her using Aoko's Sèvres tea cup."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2052:13633: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2052
msgctxt "text_id=13633 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　深海を思わせるカップにお茶をそそいで、草十郎は居間へとまい戻った。"
msgstr "  Into the cup as blue as the ocean depths, he carefully poured the tea before returning to the drawing room."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2083:13634: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2083
msgctxt "text_id=13634 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<恭|うやうや>しくティーカップをテーブルにおいて、草十郎は女性を見る。"
msgstr "  Gently, he placed the teacup on the table, and faced the woman."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2119:13635: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0016; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2119
msgctxt "text_id=13635 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あの。訊ねるのが遅れましたけど、蒼崎の知り合い……かな？」"
msgstr "\"Um. Forgive me for not asking earlier, but should I take it that you're an acquaintance of Aozaki's...or whatever?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:2125:13636: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2125
msgctxt "text_id=13636 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言われた事はすぐに直す草十郎だが、この女性にはつい丁寧語になってしまった。"
msgstr "  Despite being told otherwise, Soujyuro could not help but stand on ceremony."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2130:13637: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2130
msgctxt "text_id=13637 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ので、強引に語尾を砕けたものにする。"
msgstr "  His clumsy effort to make the question sound casual only jumbled it further."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2135:13638: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2135
msgctxt "text_id=13638 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが不満だったのか、女性はまたも眼差しを険しくした。"
msgstr "  The visitor's eyes narrowed again in displeasure."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2167:13639: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0017; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2167
msgctxt "text_id=13639 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「それ。その蒼崎って言うの、やめてくれない？　なんだかくすぐったくて。青子でいいでしょ、呼び方は」"
msgstr "\"That's what I mean. Would you stop calling her 'Aozaki'? It's beginning to grate on me. Just use 'Aoko.'\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:2205:13640: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2205
msgctxt "text_id=13640 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　女性はすました顔でカップを手にして、一口だけ口をつけた。"
msgstr "  The woman kept the rest of her expression indifferent as she slowly raised the cup to take a sip."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2210:13641: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2210
msgctxt "text_id=13641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子たちには下手、苦い、と不評なソレを、女性は笑顔ひとつで受け流す。"
msgstr "  Smiling, she tolerated the tea that Aoko and Alice regularly criticized as bitter and clumsily brewed."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2215:13642: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2215
msgctxt "text_id=13642 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<結果|あじ>はどうあれ頑張ったで賞、という温情が存在する事を、のちに知る草十郎なのだった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro had yet to learn that society thoughtfully awarded participation trophies to people merely for trying, regardless of the outcome."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2249:13643: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2249
msgctxt "text_id=13643 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ほら、立ってないで座って。"
msgstr "\"Come. Don't stand there. Sit."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2249:13644: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2249
msgctxt "text_id=13644 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　見下ろされるのは好きじゃないんだ、私」"
msgstr "  I don't like being looked down on.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:2266:13645: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0017; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2266
msgctxt "text_id=13645 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……？」"
msgstr "\"...?\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:2272:13646: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2272
msgctxt "text_id=13646 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　よく知る同居人に似た話し方に、ますます首をかしげる草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro tilted his head, noting a slight familiarity to her manner of speech."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2278:13647: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2278
msgctxt "text_id=13647 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "そう言えば―――唐突ではあるが、この光景にも見覚えのあるような―――"
msgstr "It was almost...as if they'd met somewhere before."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2316:13648: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0018; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2316
msgctxt "text_id=13648 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「…………あれ？」"
msgstr "\"Wait...\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:2322:13649: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2322
msgctxt "text_id=13649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソファーに座っている女性の姿から、忘れかけていた記憶が蘇る。"
msgstr "  The sight of her sitting on the sofa began to stir forgotten memories."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2340:13650: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2340
msgctxt "text_id=13650 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな彼を、女性は楽しげに見上げている。"
msgstr "  Noticing his reaction, the woman became visibly delighted."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2373:13651: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0019; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2373
msgctxt "text_id=13651 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「思い出した？　私もちょっと驚いたわ。"
msgstr "\"You remember me. I can tell you I was as surprised as you are."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2380:13652: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0020; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2380
msgctxt "text_id=13652 | speaker=touko"
msgid "青子を訪ねにきたら、いつか見た君が出迎えてくるんだから」"
msgstr "I came all the way here to see Aoko, and instead I find you standing there to greet me.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:2386:13653: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0019; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2386
msgctxt "text_id=13653 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――、あ」"
msgstr "\"...Oh!\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:2417:13654: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2417
msgctxt "text_id=13654 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　くすくすと笑う女性を見て、草十郎は完全に思い出した。"
msgstr "  Now that she was chuckling, Soujyuro remembered everything."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2436:13655: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2436
msgctxt "text_id=13655 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの時は一瞬しか見ていなかったが、間違いない。"
msgstr "  He had only glimpsed her for a moment, but there was no mistaking it."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2441:13656: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2441
msgctxt "text_id=13656 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この女性こそ、いつかのパチンコ屋でフィーバーを出していた長い煙草の<達人|ひと>……！"
msgstr "  It had to be her―the woman smoking the long cigarette who had cleaned out the pachinko parlor!"

#. Occurrence 9_4:2480:13657: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0021; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2480
msgctxt "text_id=13657 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「あの時は私もショックだったなぁ。"
msgstr "\"You gave me quite the fright that day, Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2486:13658: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0022; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2486
msgctxt "text_id=13658 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　草十郎くん、目が合うなりいきなり逃げ出したでしょ？"
msgstr "  You took one look at me and ran away."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2492:13659: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0023; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2492
msgctxt "text_id=13659 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　そんなに私ってこわもてなのかしらって、あの日の晩は真剣に悩んだんだから」"
msgstr "  How terrifying you must think I am, reacting like that. You hurt my feelings, you know.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:2512:13660: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2512
msgctxt "text_id=13660 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな思い出話を、女性は楽しそうに語る。"
msgstr "  In spite of her words, she clearly enjoyed the memory."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2517:13661: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2517
msgctxt "text_id=13661 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう。あの時は青子の秘密を知った翌日で、草十郎は公園にいた<青子|ひとかげ>を、この女性と勘違いして逃げだしたのだ。"
msgstr "  She was right. He'd mistaken her for the murderous shadow (Aoko) in the park from the previous night, and fled in mortal terror."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2523:13662: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2523
msgctxt "text_id=13662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　結局は人違いだったけど、あの時、なぜあんな事を思ったかと言うと―――"
msgstr "  Even though it was clearly a case of mistaken identity, he could now see why he had mixed them up."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2556:13663: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0020; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2556
msgctxt "text_id=13663 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "『……そうか。雰囲気が似てるんだ』"
msgstr "(...So that's why. They feel similar.)"

#. Occurrence 9_4:2569:13664: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2569
msgctxt "text_id=13664 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこまで思って、草十郎はやっと来客の正体に気が付いた。ちょっと考えればすぐに分かった事じゃないか、と自分を叱りながら。"
msgstr "  Finally, Soujyuro realized who the visitor was. He chided himself for not realizing it sooner."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2607:13665: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_4_0021; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2607
msgctxt "text_id=13665 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それじゃあ、あなたは」"
msgstr "\"You must be―\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:2613:13666: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2613
msgctxt "text_id=13666 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言い掛ける草十郎の口を塞ぐように、女性は片手を上げた。"
msgstr "  Just as he was about to say it, she held up her hand to interrupt him."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2624:13667: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2624
msgctxt "text_id=13667 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人差し指で草十郎の顔をばん、と射つように。"
msgstr "  She pointed at him like she was aiming a gun."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2657:13668: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0024; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2657
msgctxt "text_id=13668 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ごめんなさい。君の仕草がちょっと可愛くて、からかいがすぎちゃった。"
msgstr "\"Forgive me. Your reaction was just so cute, I got carried away teasing you."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2663:13669: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0025; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2663
msgctxt "text_id=13669 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　自己紹介が遅れたけど、私は蒼崎<橙子|とうこ>。"
msgstr "  It's a little late, but my name is Touko Aozaki."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2681:13670: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0026; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2681
msgctxt "text_id=13670 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　率直に言うと、青子の実の姉ってワケね」"
msgstr "  Surprise―I'm Aoko's big sister.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:2701:13671: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2701
msgctxt "text_id=13671 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なるほど、見惚れるはずだと納得する。"
msgstr "  That figured. No wonder he'd been charmed at first sight."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2706:13672: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2706
msgctxt "text_id=13672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見るものを勇気づける笑顔を持った女性は、確かに青子の未来の姿を映していたのだから。"
msgstr "  It wasn't hard to envision Touko as a not-too-distant future version of Aoko, with her smile that imparted courage to any who glimpsed it."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2737:13673: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2737
msgctxt "text_id=13673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……もっとも。"
msgstr "  Only..."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2742:13674: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2742
msgctxt "text_id=13674 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　常に前向きな青子と違って、この人物はななめ前あたりを面白がって眺めているタイプのようだけど。"
msgstr "  While Aoko was earnest and diligent, Touko seemed to be shrewd and playful."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2775:13675: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0027; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2775
msgctxt "text_id=13675 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「あの子が困ってるって聞いてね。"
msgstr "\"I heard my sister was in trouble."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2781:13676: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_4_0028; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2781
msgctxt "text_id=13676 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　いいかげん忠告してあげる気で、はるばるやってきたわけなのでした」"
msgstr "  So I came all the way over here to set her straight.\""

#. Occurrence 9_4:2799:13677: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2799
msgctxt "text_id=13677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふふ、と妖しい笑みを浮かべて、青子のお姉さんは紅茶を一口。"
msgstr "  Aoko's sister chuckled coyly while sipping her tea."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2805:13678: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2805
msgctxt "text_id=13678 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その仕草に釣られて、草十郎もソファーに腰を下ろした。急な来客に驚いてばかりだったが、そういうコトなら安心できる。"
msgstr "  Lured by her charm, Soujyuro sat on the sofa as well. He felt like he could relax a little, now that the initial shock of an unexpected guest had subsided."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2835:13679: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2835
msgctxt "text_id=13679 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして、時刻は午後五時前。"
msgstr "  Just like that, it was almost five in the afternoon."

#. Occurrence 9_4:2840:13680: scene=9_4
#: 9_4:2840
msgctxt "text_id=13680 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　遠出した青子たちも、そろそろ帰途につく頃だった。"
msgstr "  Aoko and Alice would be returning from their excursion soon."

#. Occurrence 9_5:57:13681: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:57
msgctxt "text_id=13681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三咲市唯一の地下鉄線。"
msgstr "  This was Misaki City's only subway line."

#. Occurrence 9_5:62:13682: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:62
msgctxt "text_id=13682 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　開通からまだ半年ほどしか経っていない真新しいホームの先端に、彼女たちは<佇|たたず>んでいた。"
msgstr "  Only half a year had passed since its opening, and at the end of the fairly new platform, there the two girls stood."

#. Occurrence 9_5:67:13683: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:67
msgctxt "text_id=13683 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時刻は午後六時半。"
msgstr "  The time was six-thirty in the evening."

#. Occurrence 9_5:73:13684: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:73
msgctxt "text_id=13684 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有坂から戻ってきた青子たちは地上には上がらず、既に二十分近い時間をここで浪費していた。"
msgstr "  They had been idling for around twenty minutes since returning from Arisaka and had yet to return to street level."

#. Occurrence 9_5:94:13685: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:94
msgctxt "text_id=13685 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「青子」"
msgstr "\"Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:111:13686: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:111
msgctxt "text_id=13686 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呆れ声で有珠は語りかける。"
msgstr "  There was a hint of irritation in Alice's voice."

#. Occurrence 9_5:121:13687: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:121
msgctxt "text_id=13687 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ちょっと待って。あともう一回だけ、ね？」"
msgstr "\"I'm not done yet. Just one more, okay?\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:141:13688: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:141
msgctxt "text_id=13688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　寒さに震えながら、両手を合わせて有珠にお願いする。"
msgstr "  Aoko begged Alice, hands together, trembling from the cold."

#. Occurrence 9_5:146:13689: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:146
msgctxt "text_id=13689 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女がここまで甘える事は珍しい。"
msgstr "  It was rare to see her act this childish."

#. Occurrence 9_5:151:13690: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:151
msgctxt "text_id=13690 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳶丸あたりが見たら可愛いというより不気味だと用心するに違いない。"
msgstr "  No doubt Tobimaru would consider this behavior more strange than cute if he were here."

#. Occurrence 9_5:184:13691: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:184
msgctxt "text_id=13691 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はホームの先端―――深い闇になっている、レールの先を見つめている。"
msgstr "  From the end of the platform, Aoko peered into the creeping darkness to where the tracks led."

#. Occurrence 9_5:201:13692: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:201
msgctxt "text_id=13692 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……貴女の趣味、変わってるわ」"
msgstr "\"You have the strangest taste.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:218:13693: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:218
msgctxt "text_id=13693 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呟いて、仕方なく有珠はベンチに座った。"
msgstr "  Alice muttered, sitting on the bench with forbearance."

#. Occurrence 9_5:238:13694: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:238
msgctxt "text_id=13694 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつもならひとりで先に帰るところだが、今日は気分がいいので付き合う事にしたらしい。"
msgstr "  Any other day and she would have been fine heading back by herself, but today she was in a good mood and decided to humor Aoko."

#. Occurrence 9_5:243:13695: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:243
msgctxt "text_id=13695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　できるのなら今日はこのまま、すぐに溶けてしまう雪のような手触りであっても、幸せな気分のまま帰りたい。"
msgstr "  Knowing full well that her rare spells of positivity were about as fragile as freshly fallen snow, she hoped to go home while she was still in high spirits."

#. Occurrence 9_5:248:13696: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:248
msgctxt "text_id=13696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……穏やかに閉じられた有珠の<目蓋|まぶた>は、そんな気持ちを代弁しているようだった。"
msgstr "  Eyes closed, her placid demeanor conveyed her feelings well enough."

#. Occurrence 9_5:277:13697: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:277
msgctxt "text_id=13697 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かくして、人影のない地下鉄のホームで、ふたりは乗る予定のない電車を待つ事となった。"
msgstr "  Thus, the two of them waited on the platform alone for a subway train they had no intention of riding."

#. Occurrence 9_5:297:13698: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:297
msgctxt "text_id=13698 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　開通したばかりの地下鉄。"
msgstr "  The subway had recently opened for service."

#. Occurrence 9_5:302:13699: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:302
msgctxt "text_id=13699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　高めの料金設定や、そもそも地下鉄に馴染みのない三咲市の人々の気質もあって、利用客はまだまだ少ない。"
msgstr "  The people of Misaki were humble folk, and for now, few passengers were drawn to the novelty and high prices of the new train."

#. Occurrence 9_5:307:13700: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:307
msgctxt "text_id=13700 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　活気がないのは問題だが、そのおかげでホームはいまだ新品同様だ。"
msgstr "  Thanks to the low foot traffic, the platform was still as good as new."

#. Occurrence 9_5:327:13701: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:327
msgctxt "text_id=13701 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　思えば、人のいない地下鉄はこの上なく原始的だ。"
msgstr "  There was something primeval about a subway devoid of people."

#. Occurrence 9_5:333:13702: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:333
msgctxt "text_id=13702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　此処はもともと人の住まぬ<安寧|あんねい>の地。"
msgstr "  It was a picture of tranquility, free of human interference―"

#. Occurrence 9_5:338:13703: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:338
msgctxt "text_id=13703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無音にして無生。"
msgstr "  not just silent, but lifeless."

#. Occurrence 9_5:343:13704: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:343
msgctxt "text_id=13704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　物言わぬ微生物たちが息づく、生者には辿り着けぬ<根|ね>の国である。"
msgstr "  This was a realm unmolested by living creatures, where only speechless organisms dwelt."

#. Occurrence 9_5:373:13705: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:373
msgctxt "text_id=13705 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　真白すぎる人工の明かりは生命を感じさせない。"
msgstr "  The harshly artificial fluorescent lighting underscored its soullessness."

#. Occurrence 9_5:378:13706: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:378
msgctxt "text_id=13706 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はっきりと光と影に分かれた空洞。"
msgstr "  It was a cave where light ended and shadows began,"

#. Occurrence 9_5:383:13707: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:383
msgctxt "text_id=13707 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<電車|ふね>は乗客のないまま闇に出航する。"
msgstr "  where riderless vessels disappeared into the dark."

#. Occurrence 9_5:388:13708: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:388
msgctxt "text_id=13708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　レールに挟まれたホームは、地底の海に造られた桟橋のようだ。"
msgstr "  The platform was wedged between two tracks, like a jetty built upon a subterranean sea."

#. Occurrence 9_5:393:13709: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:393
msgctxt "text_id=13709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな、地上の風景とはかけ離れた場所で、青子は目を<瞑|つむ>って<振動|ふなで>を待つ。"
msgstr "  In this place, far removed from the world above, Aoko waited with eyes closed for the familiar rumble."

#. Occurrence 9_5:428:13710: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:428
msgctxt "text_id=13710 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は帰宅を少し遅らせて、ホームで休もうと提案した。"
msgstr "  It was she who had proposed that they delay their return and rest at the platform."

#. Occurrence 9_5:433:13711: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:433
msgctxt "text_id=13711 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　理由は単純。"
msgstr "  The reason was simple:"

#. Occurrence 9_5:438:13712: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:438
msgctxt "text_id=13712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎青子は地下鉄の通過音に安らぎを覚える、奇妙な趣味を持っていたからだ。"
msgstr "  Aoko Aozaki enjoyed the soothing sound of passing subway trains."

#. Occurrence 9_5:470:13713: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:470
msgctxt "text_id=13713 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「今年はもうライブハウスに行けそうもないし、これぐらいのワガママはいいでしょ」"
msgstr "\"I probably won't get to see any more live bands this year, so at least let me have this,\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:476:13714: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:476
msgctxt "text_id=13714 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は目を閉じたまま有珠に語りかける。"
msgstr "  she had said to Alice, her eyes still closed."

#. Occurrence 9_5:493:13715: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:493
msgctxt "text_id=13715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　付き合いで三回ほど電車を見送っている有珠はうなずきもしない。"
msgstr "  Alice had neither nodded nor objected, and so they'd watched three trains come and go."

#. Occurrence 9_5:524:13716: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:524
msgctxt "text_id=13716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それきり静寂。"
msgstr "  Silence fell again."

#. Occurrence 9_5:529:13717: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:529
msgctxt "text_id=13717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はあと数分後の電車の到着を心待ちにしながら。"
msgstr "  Aoko waited for the next train with anticipation."

#. Occurrence 9_5:534:13718: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:534
msgctxt "text_id=13718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は、そんな青子に付き合いながらも地下鉄の壁を見つめながら。"
msgstr "  Alice sat and stared at the tunnel wall patiently."

#. Occurrence 9_5:554:13719: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:554
msgctxt "text_id=13719 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　掲示板によると、次の電車は五分後に到着予定。"
msgstr "  According to the display board, the next train was due to arrive in five minutes."

#. Occurrence 9_5:559:13720: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:559
msgctxt "text_id=13720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　暗い穴からは、カタカタと風の音が響いてくる。"
msgstr "  From the dark tunnel came wind and rumbling."

#. Occurrence 9_5:593:13721: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:593
msgctxt "text_id=13721 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:598:13722: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:598
msgctxt "text_id=13722 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地下鉄のホームは人工の結界だ。"
msgstr "  A purposefully placed Bounded Field now surrounded the platform."

#. Occurrence 9_5:606:13723: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:606
msgctxt "text_id=13723 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駅員の姿はなく、出入り口にあたる通路はあまりにも狭く、少ない。"
msgstr "  There was no sign of any station personnel, and entrances and exits were few and narrow."

#. Occurrence 9_5:614:13724: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:614
msgctxt "text_id=13724 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　結界を張るまでもなく<人避|ひとよ>けは成立している。"
msgstr "  The lack of bystanders made the field hardly necessary."

#. Occurrence 9_5:634:13725: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:634
msgctxt "text_id=13725 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地上に通じる階段の前には、いつのまにか六人ほどの人影が立っていた。"
msgstr "  Suddenly, six figures appeared in front of the stairs to the surface."

#. Occurrence 9_5:654:13726: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:654
msgctxt "text_id=13726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――ただし、全員同じ顔。"
msgstr "  ...They all shared the same face."

#. Occurrence 9_5:659:13727: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:659
msgctxt "text_id=13727 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一歩も動かず、三日月のような笑顔のまま、ホームにいる有珠たちを眺めている。"
msgstr "  Motionless and with smiles like the crescent moon, they stared at Aoko and Alice."

#. Occurrence 9_5:696:13728: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:696
msgctxt "text_id=13728 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……<鈍|にぶ>っているにも、程があるわね」"
msgstr "\"...I can't believe I missed that.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:702:13729: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:702
msgctxt "text_id=13729 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分への落胆から、静かに有珠はため息をついた。"
msgstr "  Alice let out a quiet, dejected sigh."

#. Occurrence 9_5:737:13730: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:737
msgctxt "text_id=13730 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「？　どうかした、有珠」"
msgstr "\"Alice? What's wrong?\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:757:13731: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:757
msgctxt "text_id=13731 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……どうもなにも。この駅で降りたのは貴女とわたしだけなの、気付いていた？」"
msgstr "\"...Must you ask? Didn't you notice that you and I were the only ones to get off at this station?\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:778:13732: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:778
msgctxt "text_id=13732 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そりゃあね。相変わらず、ここの地下鉄ってば利用客が少ないって…………」"
msgstr "\"I mean, this subway is usually pretty dead anyway, so...\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:783:13733: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:783
msgctxt "text_id=13733 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこまで言いかけて、青子はち、と舌を鳴らした。"
msgstr "  Aoko trailed off, tutting in annoyance."

#. Occurrence 9_5:810:13734: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:810
msgctxt "text_id=13734 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「で。そう言う有珠はいつ気が付いたの？」"
msgstr "\"So, what tipped you off?\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:826:13735: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:826
msgctxt "text_id=13735 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……憂鬱なコトにたった今よ。"
msgstr "\"The impending gloom I felt a moment ago."

#. Occurrence 9_5:832:13736: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:832
msgctxt "text_id=13736 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　青子ばかり責められないわね。貴女とわたしが一つなら、こんな事もなかったのに」"
msgstr "  I'm not entirely blaming you. This wouldn't have happened if we were a better team.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:844:13737: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:844
msgctxt "text_id=13737 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「つまらない喩え話は口にしない」"
msgstr "\"Enough sniveling.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:879:13738: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:879
msgctxt "text_id=13738 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　淡々と、視線も合わさず言葉を交わすふたり。"
msgstr "  They traded stoic and calm words, never moving or making eye contact."

#. Occurrence 9_5:884:13739: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:884
msgctxt "text_id=13739 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな彼女たちとは対照的に、階段を<塞|ふさ>いでいた人影が動きはじめた。"
msgstr "  In contrast, the figures near the stairs began to stir."

#. Occurrence 9_5:899:13740: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:899
msgctxt "text_id=13740 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼らは一律、二足歩行の生き物である事を忘れたように倒れこみ、四つんばいになって前進する。"
msgstr "  As though regressing from primates to wild beasts, they dropped prone in unison..."

#. Occurrence 9_5:919:13741: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:919
msgctxt "text_id=13741 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……その姿は巨大な<蟻|あり>そのものだ。"
msgstr "  ...and scrambled forth, like man-sized ants."

#. Occurrence 9_5:924:13742: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:924
msgctxt "text_id=13742 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぞろぞろと、次々と。"
msgstr "  They advanced as a stream, one after another."

#. Occurrence 9_5:929:13743: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:929
msgctxt "text_id=13743 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　階段のみならず、レールのある洞穴からもカタカタと音を響かせて大挙してくる。"
msgstr "  Soon, the clattering came not just from the platform entrances, but from the subway tunnel as well."

#. Occurrence 9_5:982:13744: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:982
msgctxt "text_id=13744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その数、目測で三十体以上。"
msgstr "  At a glance, they numbered at least thirty strong."

#. Occurrence 9_5:987:13745: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:987
msgctxt "text_id=13745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おぞましい事に、響いてくる足音は増していくばかりだ。"
msgstr "  The eerie skittering multiplied, echoing off the subway walls."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1031:13746: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1031
msgctxt "text_id=13746 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「信じられない。これだけの自動人形、集めたら<三咲|うち>どころか南<仏|フランス>の一等地も買えるんじゃない？」"
msgstr "\"This is ridiculous. Forget Misaki; with this many automata, you could take over all of southern France.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:1049:13747: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1049
msgctxt "text_id=13747 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……ええ。もっとも、こんな出来じゃ買手は見つからないでしょうけど」"
msgstr "\"...True, but I doubt there would be much demand for dolls of such poor quality.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:1075:13748: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1075
msgctxt "text_id=13748 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なんだ、ガラクタはガラクタか」"
msgstr "\"Junk is junk, after all.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:1095:13749: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1095
msgctxt "text_id=13749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の罵倒に応じて、人影の一体が飛び跳ねる。"
msgstr "  One of the horde leapt forward in response to Aoko's insult."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1151:13750: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1151
msgctxt "text_id=13750 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ダンプカーに<撥|は>ねられたような、唐突な突進。"
msgstr "  It was a sudden charge, like a hurtling dump truck."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1156:13751: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1156
msgctxt "text_id=13751 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は動かず。"
msgstr "  Alice remained still."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1181:13752: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1181
msgctxt "text_id=13752 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はそれを待っていたかのように、振り向きながら右腕を振るった。"
msgstr "  As though expecting the attack, Aoko swung her right arm in an arc."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1295:13753: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1295
msgctxt "text_id=13753 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青い光弾はたやすく外皮に防がれた。"
msgstr "  The blue missile of light was easily repelled."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1309:13754: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1309
msgctxt "text_id=13754 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔力を弾いただけの<魔弾|スナップ>では、この人形たちには通用しない。"
msgstr "  Her magic bullet, Snap, had little to no effect on the puppets."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1315:13755: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1315
msgctxt "text_id=13755 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人影はカエルのように地面に這い、首をくるりと一回転させて<獲物|あおこ>を探し求めている。"
msgstr "  They scrambled over each other like frogs, heads jerking and twisting in search of prey."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1336:13756: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1336
msgctxt "text_id=13756 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……全部で三十か。悪いけど一人でやらせてもらうわよ有珠。この前のを実力と思われたままじゃ不愉快だ」"
msgstr "\"I count...thirty total. Sorry Alice, but I'm gonna need you to hang back. I can't have you thinking last time was my best.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:1360:13757: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1360
msgctxt "text_id=13757 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ホームの端にまで移動して、青子はベンチに座ったままの少女に語りかけた。"
msgstr "  As she spoke to Alice, who was still sitting on a bench, Aoko stepped toward the edge of the platform."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1380:13758: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1380
msgctxt "text_id=13758 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの遊園地での反省は山ほどあるが、特に痛恨なのはミラーハウスでの一戦だ。"
msgstr "  Among the myriad regrets she still had from the amusement park, the house of mirrors stung the most."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1385:13759: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1385
msgctxt "text_id=13759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人形戦に関して言うと、青子はまったく戦闘準備をしていなかった。"
msgstr "  She had been caught off guard in her last battle against that puppet."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1405:13760: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1405
msgctxt "text_id=13760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど今日は万全の態勢で、フォロー役として有珠までいる。"
msgstr "  But today, she'd come prepared, and she had Alice as backup."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1461:13761: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1461
msgctxt "text_id=13761 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここで思う存分、雪辱を果たそうと青子は魔術刻印に火を灯し―――。"
msgstr "  Aoko ignited her Magic Crest. This time, she would restore her honor, and―"

#. Occurrence 9_5:1483:13762: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1483
msgctxt "text_id=13762 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「私の後ろまで下がって青子。そこにいたら、貴女まで食べてしまう」"
msgstr "\"Get behind me, Aoko. It'll eat you too if you stand there.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:1489:13763: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1489
msgctxt "text_id=13763 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はそれを、持ち上げた一指だけで停止させた。"
msgstr "  All it took to stop Aoko was one raised finger."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1564:13764: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1564
msgctxt "text_id=13764 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「待って―――有珠、それは」"
msgstr "\"Alice, wait, you can't―\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:1587:13765: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1587
msgctxt "text_id=13765 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地中の深海に、夜の鐘が響いていく。"
msgstr "  In the depths of the ocean black, the bells of night chimed out."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1610:13766: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1610
msgctxt "text_id=13766 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　桟橋は<海神|わだつみ>の腕に抱かれるように、"
msgstr "  The jetty, as if embraced by a sea god like Poseidon or Wadatsumi,"

#. Occurrence 9_5:1616:13767: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1616
msgctxt "text_id=13767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　白い、"
msgstr "  became awash with white..."

msgctxt "text_id=13768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　白い粒子に覆われていく。"
msgstr "  White motes, which seemed to engulf everything."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1639:13769: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1639
msgctxt "text_id=13769 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……青子のやり方じゃ<疵痕|あと>が残るでしょう。"
msgstr "\"You always leave a mess, Aoko."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1645:13770: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1645
msgctxt "text_id=13770 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　もうじき次の電車も来るし、それに―――」"
msgstr "  Not to mention the next train will be arriving soon, and...\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:1673:13771: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1673
msgctxt "text_id=13771 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　白いヴェールの向こうで、不確かに伸び上がる少女のカタチ。"
msgstr "  Behind the white veil, her form blurred and stretched upward."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1728:13772: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1728
msgctxt "text_id=13772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悲壮な<群舞|バレエ>のようだ。"
msgstr "  She was like a melancholy ballerina."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1733:13773: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1733
msgctxt "text_id=13773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<主役|プリマ>の周りを囲む人形たちは異常を察してざわめいている。"
msgstr "  The figures surrounding the prima ballerina bristled in response to the strange aura."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1738:13774: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1738
msgctxt "text_id=13774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼らとて人間外の、神秘に属する器物である。"
msgstr "  Though puppets were inhuman Mystical vessels,"

#. Occurrence 9_5:1743:13775: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1743
msgctxt "text_id=13775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの少女が恐れるに足りるモノだと、人間である青子より何倍も悟っている。"
msgstr "  they had far more reason to fear Alice than they did the human Aoko."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1802:13776: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1802
msgctxt "text_id=13776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なので逃げる。"
msgstr "  They began to flee."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1807:13777: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1807
msgctxt "text_id=13777 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人形たちの主人も、危険を感じたのなら撤退しろと言っていたのだ。"
msgstr "  Whoever their master was, they sensed enough danger to order a retreat."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1844:13778: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1844
msgctxt "text_id=13778 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、"
msgstr "  However... "

msgctxt "text_id=13779 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "もう動けない。<主役|プリマ>を見守るダンサーたちは、のきなみ、"
msgstr "it was too late. The dancers were captivated by their prima, transfixed in place,"

msgctxt "text_id=13780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "アキレス腱を外されてしまったらしい。"
msgstr " as if their Achilles tendons had been severed."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1872:13781: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1872
msgctxt "text_id=13781 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――それに。"
msgstr "\"Besides..."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1922:13782: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1922
msgctxt "text_id=13782 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　気分を台無しにされたのは、貴女だけじゃないわ」"
msgstr "  It wasn't just you who ruined my mood.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:1942:13783: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1942
msgctxt "text_id=13783 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外される黒い手袋。"
msgstr "  She removed her black glove."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1947:13784: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1947
msgctxt "text_id=13784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館の中とは一変して、外では異常な寒がりである彼女の防寒ぶりは凄まじい。"
msgstr "  Unlike her subdued demeanor at the mansion, Alice's aura away from home was a biting, frigid blizzard that none could approach."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1952:13785: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1952
msgctxt "text_id=13785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二枚重ねの手袋が、ぱさりとホームに落ちる。"
msgstr "  Her discarded gloves floated down, settling on the platform deck."

#. Occurrence 9_5:1986:13786: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:1986
msgctxt "text_id=13786 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　濃度を増していく白い闇。"
msgstr "  The pale haze grew even thicker."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2016:13787: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2016
msgctxt "text_id=13787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<見|ギ><逃|チ><し|ギ><て|チ><く|ギ><れ|チ>、と悲鳴をあげる影の集団。"
msgstr "  Terrified, the mass of shadows cried out for mercy."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2102:13788: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2102
msgctxt "text_id=13788 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　“さあ―――ごっこ遊びをしましょう”"
msgstr "        \"Now...let us play make-believe.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:2122:13789: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2122
msgctxt "text_id=13789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何もかも不確かな、濃霧に映し出される暗黒童話。"
msgstr "  Within the nebulous mist, a dark fairy tale came to life."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2127:13790: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2127
msgctxt "text_id=13790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その中で。"
msgstr "  Inside that fog,"

#. Occurrence 9_5:2134:13791: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2134
msgctxt "text_id=13791 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<凶歌|まがうた>のような彼女の声だけが、血のように<鮮明|リアル>だった。"
msgstr "  only the macabre melody of her voice felt real."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2226:13792: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2226
msgctxt "text_id=13792 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　がつがつ／ざりざり／ぎしゃむ。"
msgstr "  Feast / Grind / Crunch."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2236:13793: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2236
msgctxt "text_id=13793 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最後に残った人影が消失した。"
msgstr "  At last, the final puppet fell."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2251:13794: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2251
msgctxt "text_id=13794 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　壁には／床には／天井には／"
msgstr "  On the walls / On the floor / On the ceiling / "

#. Occurrence 9_5:2260:13795: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2260
msgctxt "text_id=13795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あえなく、異質な<擬音|オノマトペ>が染みついている。"
msgstr "  the grotesque, mechanical sounds of their demise filled the air."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2307:13796: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2307
msgctxt "text_id=13796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……彼らの悲鳴は、<拭|ぬぐ>っても消えない血の跡のようだ。"
msgstr "  Their twisted shrieks plastered the subway surfaces, like indelible bloodstains."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2312:13797: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2312
msgctxt "text_id=13797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三十体におよぶ人形たちは、速やかに、けれど味わうようにゆっくりと、得体の知れない怪物に<咀嚼|そしゃく>された。"
msgstr "  Some amorphous abomination had―hastily, yet just slowly enough to savor the taste―chewed and devoured all thirty puppets."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2317:13798: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2317
msgctxt "text_id=13798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わずか一体分……それも片腕一本だけが、淋しくホームに残されている。"
msgstr "  Only a lone, severed arm remained on the platform."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2354:13799: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2354
msgctxt "text_id=13799 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……持ってきてたの、アレ？」"
msgstr "\"You had that thing on you this whole time?\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:2360:13800: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2360
msgctxt "text_id=13800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は嫌悪を隠さずに、傍らの少女に語りかける。"
msgstr "  Aoko spoke sideways to Alice, making no attempt to hide her disgust."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2406:13801: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2406
msgctxt "text_id=13801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――濃霧の怪物。"
msgstr "  The brutal gluttony they'd just witnessed had a name."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2412:13802: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2412
msgctxt "text_id=13802 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三体の<貴重品|プロイキッシャー>の一つ、マインスターの薔薇の猟犬。"
msgstr "  It was the beast of the fog, one of her Three Great Ploys Kickshaw,"

#. Occurrence 9_5:2417:13803: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2417
msgctxt "text_id=13803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが、いま吹き荒れた暴力の名称だ。"
msgstr "  the Meinster's Rose Hound: Wandersnatch."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2429:13804: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2429
msgctxt "text_id=13804 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の言葉に刺があるのは、有珠が、その正体にあたる器物を持ち歩いていたからだ。"
msgstr "  Aoko's words stung, since Alice was the one harboring its true form."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2461:13805: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2461
msgctxt "text_id=13805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三大のプロイはそれだけで強力な呪力を放つ。"
msgstr "  The Great Three Ploys wielded terrifyingly powerful curses."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2466:13806: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2466
msgctxt "text_id=13806 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　防衛戦ならともかく、今日のようなプライベートで持ち歩かれては、相方である青子も面白くはない。"
msgstr "  While Wandersnatch had its uses in combat, Aoko was not at all amused to learn that her companion had been carrying it around town all day."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2472:13807: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2472
msgctxt "text_id=13807 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大げさな表現ではなく、外食の際、巨大な爆弾を忍ばせているようなものなのだから。"
msgstr "  Without hyperbole, it was akin to going out for dinner with a bunker buster bomb in one's pocket."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2508:13808: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2508
msgctxt "text_id=13808 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ま、次からは一言お願いね。"
msgstr "\"Just... tell me next time, okay?"

#. Occurrence 9_5:2514:13809: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2514
msgctxt "text_id=13809 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　他のプロイならいいけど、今の<玩具|ヤツ>だけは別よ。できれば洋館限定にしてほしいぐらい」"
msgstr "  Other Ploys are fine, but not that one. Try to leave it at home, would you?\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:2556:13810: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2556
msgctxt "text_id=13810 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「…………"
msgstr "\"..."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2569:13811: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2569
msgctxt "text_id=13811 | speaker=alice"
msgid "悪かったわ。でも、最近なにも食べさせてなかったから」"
msgstr "I apologize. It's just that I haven't let him feed lately, so...\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:2600:13812: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2600
msgctxt "text_id=13812 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はホームに転がった人形の腕へと歩いていく。"
msgstr "  Alice walked slowly toward the severed arm."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2605:13813: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2605
msgctxt "text_id=13813 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしかに、今のは食事以外の何物でもなかった。"
msgstr "  Indeed, all she'd done was feed her Ploy."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2628:13814: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2628
msgctxt "text_id=13814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　食べる者も見えなければ、食べられる物も血を流さないプラスチックな<情事|もの>だったけれど。"
msgstr "  No one had died, and no blood had been shed, since the meal was made of plastic."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2649:13815: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2649
msgctxt "text_id=13815 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「青子、ちょっと」"
msgstr "\"Aoko, over here.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:2669:13816: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2669
msgctxt "text_id=13816 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残された人形の右腕を拾い上げ、青子を呼びつける。"
msgstr "  Alice picked up the arm and beckoned Aoko over."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2708:13817: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2708
msgctxt "text_id=13817 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「これを見て。わたしたちは今まで、相手を人形<遣|つか>いと思っていたけど―――正確には違ったみたい。"
msgstr "\"Look at this. Until now, we were thinking our opponent was a puppet master. But... I think we were wrong."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2720:13818: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2720
msgctxt "text_id=13818 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　分かる？　この人形たちは新しすぎる。"
msgstr "  Can you see it? These puppets are too new."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2732:13819: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2732
msgctxt "text_id=13819 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　この子たちが造られたのは十七世紀以後よ。……それはそれで、信じがたいコトだけど」"
msgstr "  They must have been made no earlier than the seventeenth century. Even that seems hard to believe.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:2744:13820: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2744
msgctxt "text_id=13820 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なんですって？」"
msgstr "\"What did you just say?\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:2791:13821: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2791
msgctxt "text_id=13821 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……矛盾した話ではあるが、<自動人形|オートマタ>は古いものほど性能が良い。"
msgstr "  Although it sounded counterintuitive, automata typically performed better with age."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2796:13822: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2796
msgctxt "text_id=13822 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　十七世紀以後、人形・人体模造の魔術概念が衰退した結果、魔術戦に堪えうる<自動人形|オートマタ>の製造は困難になったからだ。"
msgstr "  Since the seventeenth century, the magical concept of using puppets and mannequins had declined. Consequently, it became much harder to produce combat-effective automata."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2820:13823: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2820
msgctxt "text_id=13823 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　近年ではオートマタを一体造るのなら、たとえ低級でも使い魔を錬成した方が遥かにコストが安く、優秀な出来になる。"
msgstr "  If one wanted to build an automaton these days, it was far more cost-effective to train even a low-class familiar, and it would be better constructed, too."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2825:13824: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2825
msgctxt "text_id=13824 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　故に、この時代の人形遣いは十七世紀以前に造られた作品を蒐集し、手足とするのが常になっていた。"
msgstr "  Therefore, it was common for modern puppet masters to collect parts made before the seventeenth century and use them in their creations."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2830:13825: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2830
msgctxt "text_id=13825 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自動人形に高値がつくのは、戦闘品としては時代遅れだが、稀少品としての価値がある為である。"
msgstr "  The high price of automata often came not from their antiquated combat abilities, but from the rarity of the parts used to make them."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2863:13826: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2863
msgctxt "text_id=13826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が。"
msgstr "  Despite that,"

#. Occurrence 9_5:2870:13827: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2870
msgctxt "text_id=13827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "その稀少品を、敵魔術師は湯水のように、それこそ使い捨てのコマのように扱ってきた。"
msgstr " the enemy mage controlling these puppets used them as fodder, as if they grew on trees."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2875:13828: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2875
msgctxt "text_id=13828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その事実から、今回の敵は“莫大な資金とコレクションを持ちながら、管理地を与えられていない成り上がり者の魔術師である”"
msgstr "  The only conclusion to be drawn was that their current opponent was a spoiled upstart with wealth, but no territory."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2880:13829: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2880
msgctxt "text_id=13829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう有珠たちは予想していたのだが―――"
msgstr "  Or so Alice and Aoko imagined, anyway."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2901:13830: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2901
msgctxt "text_id=13830 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「それともう一つ。"
msgstr "\"There's something else."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2927:13831: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2927
msgctxt "text_id=13831 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　この内部<術式|こうぞう>は三咲市の結界に似ているわ。"
msgstr "  The internal formulae remind me of Misaki's Bounded Field."

#. Occurrence 9_5:2939:13832: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2939
msgctxt "text_id=13832 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……まるで自分たちこそが、この街を守る兵士だって主張するぐらい」"
msgstr "  It's as if their maker is asserting that these are the rightful defenders of our city.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:2959:13833: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:2959
msgctxt "text_id=13833 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　霧を払いながらやってきた青子へ、有珠は証拠品を差しだした。"
msgstr "  Alice presented the evidence to Aoko, who was still waving fog out of her face."

#. Occurrence 9_5:3012:13834: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3012
msgctxt "text_id=13834 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心底からの驚きと、瞬間の理解。"
msgstr "  The revelations stirred profound surprise, and then rapid realization."

#. Occurrence 9_5:3052:13835: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3052
msgctxt "text_id=13835 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……そう。"
msgstr "\"I see..."

msgctxt "text_id=13836 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "そういう事なのね」"
msgstr "now I get it,\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:3082:13837: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3082
msgctxt "text_id=13837 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はいまいましげに呟くと、人形の腕をホームに叩きつけた。"
msgstr "  Aoko growled, violently smashing the arm on the ground."

#. Occurrence 9_5:3087:13838: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3087
msgctxt "text_id=13838 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女の顔には怒りと、かすかな恐れが混ざっている。"
msgstr "  Her face twisted with anger and a hint of fear."

#. Occurrence 9_5:3108:13839: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3108
msgctxt "text_id=13839 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「惜し気もなく骨董品を出してくると思ったら、そもそも出し惜しむ程のものじゃなかったワケか。"
msgstr "\"She didn't bother holding back any of her knickknacks because they weren't worth keeping in reserve, to begin with."

#. Occurrence 9_5:3141:13840: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3141
msgctxt "text_id=13840 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……チッ。たしかにあの女なら<祖父|まち>の結界にも反応しないし、私の欠点も知ってて当然。支点の退去だって簡単にやってのけるわよね。"
msgstr "  ...Tch. That's why the town's barrier didn't have any effect on her, and how she knew my weaknesses. No wonder she found and removed the sigils so easily."

#. Occurrence 9_5:3147:13841: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3147
msgctxt "text_id=13841 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　だって―――」"
msgstr "  I should've known.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:3187:13842: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3187
msgctxt "text_id=13842 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狂気を含んだ独白に、有珠は静かに瞳を曇らせる。"
msgstr "  Alice quietly listened to Aoko's furious rambling, bemused."

#. Occurrence 9_5:3199:13843: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_5_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3199
msgctxt "text_id=13843 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「青子。これを造ったのは、そうなの？」"
msgstr "\"Aoko. So you're saying the one who made these is none other than...\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:3220:13844: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3220
msgctxt "text_id=13844 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ええ。昔から物を造る事に関しちゃズバ抜けていたからね、あの人は」"
msgstr "\"That's right. When it came to making things, she always had me beat.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:3243:13845: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3243
msgctxt "text_id=13845 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は人形の腕を睨みつける。"
msgstr "  Aoko glared at the severed arm."

#. Occurrence 9_5:3248:13846: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3248
msgctxt "text_id=13846 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人形の持ち主と、今までそれに気が付かなかった自分自身を責めるように。"
msgstr "  She was furious at its creator, and herself for taking so long to figure it out."

#. Occurrence 9_5:3277:13847: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3277
msgctxt "text_id=13847 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……でも、ようやく合点がいった。"
msgstr "\"But it all adds up, now."

#. Occurrence 9_5:3283:13848: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3283
msgctxt "text_id=13848 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　認めたくないけど、今回の敵は間違いなく私の<姉貴|あねき>。"
msgstr "  As much as I hate to admit it, our current enemy is my big sister, no doubt about it."

#. Occurrence 9_5:3289:13849: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_5_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3289
msgctxt "text_id=13849 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　この土地の<元|もと>継承者、蒼崎<橙子|とうこ>その人よ、有珠」"
msgstr "  She's the one who was meant to inherit our land, Alice.\""

#. Occurrence 9_5:3347:13850: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3347
msgctxt "text_id=13850 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人気の絶えた地下の歩廊で。"
msgstr "  The desolate subway platform returned to silence,"

#. Occurrence 9_5:3352:13851: scene=9_5
#: 9_5:3352
msgctxt "text_id=13851 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　負の念を噛むように、青子はそう言い切った。"
msgstr "  Aoko's words lingering uncomfortably in the air."

#. Occurrence 9_6:97:13852: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:97
msgctxt "text_id=13852 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少しだけ時間を巻き戻して、久遠寺邸。"
msgstr "  A short time ago, at the Kuonji Estate..."

#. Occurrence 9_6:102:13853: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:102
msgctxt "text_id=13853 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　再生していたビデオが終わる。"
msgstr "  The videotape finished playing."

#. Occurrence 9_6:107:13854: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:107
msgctxt "text_id=13854 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　耳障りなノイズは停止ボタンを押すまでもなく、自動的に停止した。"
msgstr "  The VCR had automatically stopped playback, forgoing the need to hit the stop button to avoid the static storm."

#. Occurrence 9_6:132:13855: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:132
msgctxt "text_id=13855 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ブラウン管に映るのは、テーブルをはさんで談話する草十郎と、蒼崎橙子の姿だけ。"
msgstr "  What remained on-screen was the reflection of Soujyuro and Touko Aozaki, sitting opposite each other in conversation."

#. Occurrence 9_6:162:13856: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:162
msgctxt "text_id=13856 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……秘密を知られたから宣誓なしの直接攻撃、ね……懐柔策を考えもしないのは青子らしいけど」"
msgstr "\"A direct attack without warning because her secret was exposed... Aoko never did play well with others.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:182:13857: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:182
msgctxt "text_id=13857 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呆れているのか、どうでもいいのか。"
msgstr "  It was hard to tell if she was being patronizing or indifferent."

#. Occurrence 9_6:200:13858: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:200
msgctxt "text_id=13858 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子は紅茶を口にしながら、草十郎の体験談を聞いている。"
msgstr "  Touko Aozaki took a sip from her cup as she listened to Soujyuro's story."

#. Occurrence 9_6:205:13859: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:205
msgctxt "text_id=13859 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　失敗だらけだった遊園地での逸話を、不出来な紅茶で飲み下すように。"
msgstr "  She would have savored the anecdote about the amusement park kerfuffle, were it not for the poor excuse for a cup of tea in her hands."

#. Occurrence 9_6:239:13860: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:239
msgctxt "text_id=13860 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ありがとう、参考になったわ。"
msgstr "\"Thank you for that. I feel so informed."

#. Occurrence 9_6:245:13861: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:245
msgctxt "text_id=13861 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ここしばらく青子とは顔を合わせていなかったから、あの子がどんな風に成長したかなんて、想像するしかなかったし」"
msgstr "  I haven't seen Aoko in ages, so I can only imagine the kind of woman she's grown into.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:277:13862: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:277
msgctxt "text_id=13862 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「それと、いちおう肉親としてあやまっておかないとね。"
msgstr "\"And, as her sister, the least I can do is apologize."

#. Occurrence 9_6:283:13863: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:283
msgctxt "text_id=13863 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　災難に付き合わせて悪かったわ草十郎くん。"
msgstr "  I'm sorry you had to experience such a tragic event, Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_6:290:13864: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:290
msgctxt "text_id=13864 | speaker=touko"
msgid "ほんと、あの子ったら昔っから迷いってものがなかったから」"
msgstr "That girl does have a tendency to be rather... headstrong.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:309:13865: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:309
msgctxt "text_id=13865 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「なさすぎると思います」"
msgstr "\"You said it.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:329:13866: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:329
msgctxt "text_id=13866 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は憮然とした顔で抗議するも、会話そのものは楽しいものだった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was enjoying the conversation, despite having to relive those events."

#. Occurrence 9_6:346:13867: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:346
msgctxt "text_id=13867 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりきりになってもう一時間近く経過するが、話題には事欠かない。"
msgstr "  About an hour passed by while the two of them sat in conversation, neither short on topics to discuss."

#. Occurrence 9_6:351:13868: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:351
msgctxt "text_id=13868 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　話にのぼるのは青子の事だけだったが、その青子が何かと話題になりやすかったのだ。"
msgstr "  Aoko was an easy topic for both of them, so the conversation centered mostly around her."

#. Occurrence 9_6:385:13869: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:385
msgctxt "text_id=13869 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ところで、さっきから気になってる事があるんだけど。"
msgstr "\"By the way, I've been curious about something."

#. Occurrence 9_6:385:13870: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:385
msgctxt "text_id=13870 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　訊いていいかな？」"
msgstr "  And I hope you don't mind me asking...\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:391:13871: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:391
msgctxt "text_id=13871 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　礼儀正しい姿勢のまま、目だけが好奇心に輝いている。"
msgstr "  While she kept her posture dignified, Touko's eyes shone with eager curiosity."

#. Occurrence 9_6:396:13872: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:396
msgctxt "text_id=13872 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その人あたりの良さに、やっぱりドギマギしてしまう草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  Her elegance caused Soujyuro's heart to beat a little faster."

#. Occurrence 9_6:431:13873: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:431
msgctxt "text_id=13873 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「気になってる事……ですか？」"
msgstr "\"Curious? About what?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:437:13874: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:437
msgctxt "text_id=13874 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　結果、気をつけても敬語調になってしまう。"
msgstr "  Despite his caution, he found himself speaking politely."

#. Occurrence 9_6:442:13875: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:442
msgctxt "text_id=13875 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな草十郎が微笑ましいのか、橙子は親しみをこめて頷いた。"
msgstr "  She smiled affectionately, as if she found him pleasing."

#. Occurrence 9_6:474:13876: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:474
msgctxt "text_id=13876 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ええ。一度目はダッシュで逃げられて驚いたけど、今日は違った意味で驚かされた。"
msgstr "\"Well, you see, you surprised me the last time when you ran away, but today I'm surprised by something new."

#. Occurrence 9_6:493:13877: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:493
msgctxt "text_id=13877 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ね、そういうのが若い子たちの<流行|はやり>なの？」"
msgstr "  Is that some kind of in-vogue fashion accessory?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:517:13878: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:517
msgctxt "text_id=13878 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「はい？」"
msgstr "\"Come again?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:539:13879: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:539
msgctxt "text_id=13879 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の視線は草十郎の首……青子から貰った首輪に向けられている。"
msgstr "  Touko tilted her head, her eyes fixated on the collar that Aoko had snugly secured around his neck."

#. Occurrence 9_6:569:13880: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:569
msgctxt "text_id=13880 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「新手のチョーカー？　でも、どこから見ても、ほら」"
msgstr "\"Is that a new style of choker? You know, I could swear it was a...\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:575:13881: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:575
msgctxt "text_id=13881 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言いにくそうに言葉をにごす眼鏡の美女。"
msgstr "  The bespectacled woman made a show of holding her tongue."

#. Occurrence 9_6:580:13882: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:580
msgctxt "text_id=13882 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　年頃の少年がこういった<装飾|アクセ>をするのはあと十年……<Ｖ系|ヴィジュアル　 　>の台頭を待たねばならないのだが、それは置いておくとして。"
msgstr "  On a completely unrelated note, in another decade, similar accessories would become a standard part of any visual kei artist's wardrobe."

#. Occurrence 9_6:617:13883: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:617
msgctxt "text_id=13883 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「まさか。どこから見ても首輪ですよ。犬用の」"
msgstr "\"Oh, not at all. It's obviously a collar. For dogs.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:636:13884: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:636
msgctxt "text_id=13884 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「やっぱり？　けどその首輪、すごく可愛いわ。よく似合ってるけど、自分でつけたの？」"
msgstr "\"I knew it! It's rather charming, and very much suits you, I might add. Did you put it on yourself?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:664:13885: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:664
msgctxt "text_id=13885 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まじまじとベルトを観察する橙子。"
msgstr "  Touko stared intently, examining the strap."

#. Occurrence 9_6:669:13886: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:669
msgctxt "text_id=13886 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今までは何も感じなかったクセに、草十郎は少しだけ照れている。"
msgstr "  While he had never been very conscious of the collar till now, for some reason, Soujyuro found himself blushing."

#. Occurrence 9_6:690:13887: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:690
msgctxt "text_id=13887 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「はい。つけたのは、自分ですけど」"
msgstr "\"Yes. I put it on... by myself.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:702:13888: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:702
msgctxt "text_id=13888 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そうじゃなくて、誰から貰ったの？　青子？　それとも久遠寺さん？」"
msgstr "\"No, silly. I mean, who gave it to you? Was it Aoko? Or perhaps Miss Kuonji?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:722:13889: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:722
msgctxt "text_id=13889 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「くれたのは青子ですね」"
msgstr "\"Aoko gave it to me.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:727:13890: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:727
msgctxt "text_id=13890 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　きっぱりと答える草十郎に、橙子はそう、と満足げに呟いた。"
msgstr "  Touko nodded in satisfaction at Soujyuro's candid response."

#. Occurrence 9_6:769:13891: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0012; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:769
msgctxt "text_id=13891 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……つまり、君は青子の持ち物な訳か」"
msgstr "\"...That makes you Aoko's property.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:775:13892: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:775
msgctxt "text_id=13892 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呟いた声は冷たい。それこそ、ここまで打ち解けた雰囲気を一変させるような。"
msgstr "  She coldly muttered. With this, the cordial atmosphere began to turn."

#. Occurrence 9_6:794:13893: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:794
msgctxt "text_id=13893 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな橙子の鋭さに気づきもしないで、草十郎は頷いた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded, naturally oblivious to the edge in her words."

#. Occurrence 9_6:805:13894: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:805
msgctxt "text_id=13894 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「なんでも所有されてるそうです」"
msgstr "\"She does like to own things.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:848:13895: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:848
msgctxt "text_id=13895 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他人事のように言う草十郎に、橙子はまた笑いだした。"
msgstr "  The blunt observation made Touko burst out laughing."

#. Occurrence 9_6:867:13896: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:867
msgctxt "text_id=13896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　些細な事に笑いだす奇癖を、この人物は持っているらしい。"
msgstr "  Apparently, Touko was the quirky type of person to laugh when least appropriate."

#. Occurrence 9_6:872:13897: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:872
msgctxt "text_id=13897 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ひとしきり笑い終わった後、橙子は<空|から>になったティーカップを手に取った。"
msgstr "  As her laugh tapered off into a giggle, she picked up her now empty teacup."

#. Occurrence 9_6:904:13898: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:904
msgctxt "text_id=13898 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「じゃ、これも青子のでしょ？　青っていう名前にコンプレックスがある癖に、青い物がわりと好きだから」"
msgstr "\"So, this must belong to Aoko as well? How funny, considering she hates blue things on account of the 'blue' character in her name.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:910:13899: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:910
msgctxt "text_id=13899 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうですけど。……おかわりしますか？"
msgstr "\"Yeah, that's right. ...Would you like another cup?"

#. Occurrence 9_6:916:13900: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:916
msgctxt "text_id=13900 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　ふたりとも、まだ帰ってきそうにありませんから」"
msgstr "  I'm not sure when they'll be back.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:933:13901: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0014; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:933
msgctxt "text_id=13901 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「いいえ、そろそろ帰ってくる頃よ。そういう風に仕向けたから」"
msgstr "\"No, thank you. Actually, they'll be returning shortly, as I calculated.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:954:13902: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:954
msgctxt "text_id=13902 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あ、そうなんですか、と草十郎は相づちを打つ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded along heedlessly."

#. Occurrence 9_6:959:13903: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:959
msgctxt "text_id=13903 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……打って、今の言葉のおかしさに首を傾げた。"
msgstr "  Finally, the strangeness of her phrasing dawned on him, and he tilted his head in confusion."

#. Occurrence 9_6:990:13904: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:990
msgctxt "text_id=13904 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「橙子さん？」"
msgstr "\"Miss Touko?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:995:13905: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:995
msgctxt "text_id=13905 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　聞き返す草十郎に、橙子は一度だけ嘆息する。"
msgstr "  Touko sighed once."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1029:13906: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0015; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1029
msgctxt "text_id=13906 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ごめんね、草十郎くん。眼鏡、外してもいいかしら？」"
msgstr "\"Forgive me, Soujyuro, but would you allow me to take off my glasses?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:1035:13907: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1035
msgctxt "text_id=13907 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんでそんな事を謝るんだろう、と思いつつ、草十郎はどうぞ、と促す。"
msgstr "  He wondered why she would need to ask his permission, but nodded anyway."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1047:13908: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0016; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1047
msgctxt "text_id=13908 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「それじゃあ、お言葉に甘えて。"
msgstr "\"That's very kind of you."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1053:13909: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0017; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1053
msgctxt "text_id=13909 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　もう少しぐらいは、君の反応を見ていたかったけど」"
msgstr "  Though, I do wish I could have enjoyed more of your hospitality.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:1088:13910: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1088
msgctxt "text_id=13910 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の指が眼鏡の<蔓|つる>に触れる。"
msgstr "  Touko touched the temples of her glasses."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1093:13911: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1093
msgctxt "text_id=13911 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女の長い指は、よく見ると傷があった。"
msgstr "  If one were to look closely enough, one might have noticed the scars on her slender fingers."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1098:13912: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1098
msgctxt "text_id=13912 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　細かな、年月を積み重ねた切り傷だ。"
msgstr "  They were small, fine scars, from years of repeated cuts."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1125:13913: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1125
msgctxt "text_id=13913 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その指が眼鏡を外すより早く、彼女の眼鏡はひとりでに壊れて落ちた。"
msgstr "  Before her fingers even left the eyeglass frames, the spectacles crumbled."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1130:13914: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1130
msgctxt "text_id=13914 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　驚く暇もない。"
msgstr "  It happened so fast that Soujyuro barely registered it."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1135:13915: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1135
msgctxt "text_id=13915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　フレームは粉々に砕けて、眼鏡は彼女の顔を滑り落ちて、その<両股|あし>に不時着する。"
msgstr "  The frame cracked into pieces, sliding down her face and into her lap."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1203:13916: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1203
msgctxt "text_id=13916 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……やるもんだ。三十体を一瞬とはね」"
msgstr "\"...Kudos to you, sister. Thirty in one go. Not bad.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:1209:13917: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1209
msgctxt "text_id=13917 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう呟いた橙子は、今までの彼女ではなかった。"
msgstr "  The low voice belonged to someone entirely different."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1217:13918: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1217
msgctxt "text_id=13918 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　眼鏡が外れただけ。それだけなのに、今までの彼女の趣は完全に消え去っていた。"
msgstr "  All she had done was take off her glasses, but her elegant grace had completely faded."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1237:13919: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1237
msgctxt "text_id=13919 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先ほどまでの温かな印象は何処にもない。"
msgstr "  Any semblance of warmth and kindness had disappeared."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1242:13920: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1242
msgctxt "text_id=13920 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこにいるのは、<在|い>るだけで空気を黒く<淀|よど>ませる、ひとりの醜悪な魔術師だった。"
msgstr "  Sitting upon on the sofa was a deplorable mage, her very presence darkening the room."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1294:13921: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1294
msgctxt "text_id=13921 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:1299:13922: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1299
msgctxt "text_id=13922 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はソファーに座ったままで、言葉もない。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro sat speechless."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1314:13923: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1314
msgctxt "text_id=13923 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もはや別人になった橙子は、そんな草十郎を性悪そうに眺めている。"
msgstr "  Across from him was a completely changed Touko, glaring back at him menacingly."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1334:13924: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1334
msgctxt "text_id=13924 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子が彼を殺そうとした時以上の敵意と魔力を、これみよがしに立ち<昇|のぼ>らせる。"
msgstr "  More malice and magical energy was now emanating from Touko than when Aoko had tried to kill Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1354:13925: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1354
msgctxt "text_id=13925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この少年が自分の変化にどんな反応を示すのか、その怯えや豹変を楽しむように。"
msgstr "  She seemed titillated at the prospect of the boy's shock at her transformation."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1371:13926: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1371
msgctxt "text_id=13926 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし。そんなまっとうな<愉悦|かんがえ>は、彼にはまったく適用されなかった。"
msgstr "  Such expectations, however, were often left unfulfilled when it came to Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1407:13927: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1407
msgctxt "text_id=13927 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「眼鏡、壊れましたね」"
msgstr "\"You broke your glasses.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:1412:13928: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1412
msgctxt "text_id=13928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いやぁ驚いた、とばかりに口走る草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro blurted out in surprise."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1431:13929: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0019; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1431
msgctxt "text_id=13929 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:1436:13930: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1436
msgctxt "text_id=13930 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<予想|テンポ>を崩したのか、<煙草|シガレット>を取りだそうとした橙子の手が止まってしまう。"
msgstr "  Her hand stopped as she reached for a cigarette, the wind taken out of her sails."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1470:13931: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1470
msgctxt "text_id=13931 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「もったいない。大丈夫ですか、それ」"
msgstr "\"That was unfortunate. Do you have another pair?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:1477:13932: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0020; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1477
msgctxt "text_id=13932 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……いや、そんな物はいいんだ。多少、視力が落ちたところで大事にはならないし。"
msgstr "\"No, forget them. It's not as if I actually need them to see correctly."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1492:13933: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0021; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1492
msgctxt "text_id=13933 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　そもそも<我欲|わたし>があるかぎり、五感による情報にすら主観が入る。全てこの世は霧の中だ。もともと目に見える<だ|・><け|・>のものは信じていない<質|たち>でね」"
msgstr "  As long as my self exists, data is received subjectively by my five senses. The entire world is in a fog. You shouldn't trust what you can only see with your eyes.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:1522:13934: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1522
msgctxt "text_id=13934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は口調まで中性的なものに変わっている。"
msgstr "  Her speech had taken on a clinical tone."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1527:13935: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1527
msgctxt "text_id=13935 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それすらも草十郎は気にしてはいないようだ。"
msgstr "  This, too, did not seem to shake Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1561:13936: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1561
msgctxt "text_id=13936 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうですか。それで、さっきの言葉の意味ですけど」"
msgstr "\"Right... So what you're saying is...\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:1577:13937: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1577
msgctxt "text_id=13937 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　変わらずに訊ねてくる草十郎と、"
msgstr "  Soujyuro began forming another question, unflinchingly."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1594:13938: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1594
msgctxt "text_id=13938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　苦虫をかむように沈黙する橙子。"
msgstr "  Touko scowled, as if she'd found a bug in her food."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1599:13939: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1599
msgctxt "text_id=13939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少しの思案の末、橙子はこの少年にははっきり言わないと駄目なんだな、という真理に到達した。"
msgstr "  After some consideration, she came to the conclusion she needed to be blunt with the boy."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1615:13940: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1615
msgctxt "text_id=13940 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何の因果か、おかしな頭痛に悩まされる姉妹である。"
msgstr "  By some twist of fate, it was a headache she now unknowingly shared with her sister."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1649:13941: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0022; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1649
msgctxt "text_id=13941 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「意味も何もない。青子たちの帰り道に、多少の障害を置いただけだ。私がここにいる間は、外で足止めをするように。"
msgstr "\"It's like this, Soujyuro. I placed some obstacles in Aoko's way. I'm only here now because she's still dealing with them."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1665:13942: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0023_0; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1665
msgctxt "text_id=13942 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　君は青子の持ち物だと言ったな。"
msgstr "  As I mentioned, you are are merely her property."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1675:13943: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0023_1; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1675
msgctxt "text_id=13943 | speaker=touko"
msgid "なら、<殊更|ことさら>丁寧に教えてやる必要もない。"
msgstr "So, I won't worry that pretty little head of yours."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1696:13944: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0023_2; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1696
msgctxt "text_id=13944 | speaker=touko"
msgid "告白してしまうとね、草十郎くん。私が君たちの敵なんだ」"
msgstr "I must confess, dear Soujyuro―I am your enemy.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:1778:13945: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1778
msgctxt "text_id=13945 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎が橙子の発言を理解するのに、たっぷり秒針二周分の時間がかかった。"
msgstr "  Though he understood her words, the clock's second hand would rotate fully twice over before anyone next spoke."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1783:13946: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1783
msgctxt "text_id=13946 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソファーに座ったまま、ふたりは互いに見つめ合う。"
msgstr "  They sat across from each other, eyes locked."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1788:13947: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1788
msgctxt "text_id=13947 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の両肩に緊張らしき力みが入る。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's shoulders tightened nervously."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1793:13948: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1793
msgctxt "text_id=13948 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼にもようやく、この場がどれほど危険なのか理解できたらしい。"
msgstr "  He had finally understood the true danger of the situation."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1837:13949: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0024; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1837
msgctxt "text_id=13949 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「驚いた？」"
msgstr "\"Surprised?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:1843:13950: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1843
msgctxt "text_id=13950 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　楽しげに微笑む橙子。"
msgstr "  Touko asked with a grin."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1860:13951: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1860
msgctxt "text_id=13951 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カタチは同じなのに、眼鏡がないだけで冷たい微笑に変わっている。"
msgstr "  She was still the same woman, but without her glasses, Touko's smile was rather sinister."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1881:13952: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1881
msgctxt "text_id=13952 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あなたは、蒼崎の姉なのに……？」"
msgstr "\"Even though... you're Aozaki's sister?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:1901:13953: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1901
msgctxt "text_id=13953 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の微笑に圧されながら、草十郎はそんな、当然の疑問を口にした。"
msgstr "  Her smile pierced him as he asked the obvious."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1906:13954: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1906
msgctxt "text_id=13954 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この状況で自身の安全ではなく<他人事|ひとごと>の質問をする草十郎に、しかし橙子は驚かない。"
msgstr "  Touko was no longer surprised that Soujyuro would be more concerned about the safety of others than his own."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1911:13955: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1911
msgctxt "text_id=13955 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は彼以上に、この一時間で静希草十郎という人間を把握していた。"
msgstr "  In just one short hour, she had come to understand Soujyuro Sizuki better than he knew himself."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1940:13956: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0025; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1940
msgctxt "text_id=13956 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「逆だよ。姉だから敵なんだ。私には青子からあらゆる権利を奪う義務がある。"
msgstr "\"On the contrary. It's *because* I'm her sister. I'm obligated to take away what is hers."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1947:13957: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0026; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1947
msgctxt "text_id=13957 | speaker=touko"
msgid "物質的な物も、精神的な物も、その全てを踏みにじらなければ気が済まない。"
msgstr "I won't stop until I crush every last thing she holds physically and emotionally dear."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1963:13958: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0027; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1963
msgctxt "text_id=13958 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　尺度として言うなら、もし青子がこの街に頼っていたのなら、まず街から壊していたぐらい。"
msgstr "  For instance, if she has come to rely on this city, then I will happily go so far as to destroy it."

#. Occurrence 9_6:1974:13959: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0028; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:1974
msgctxt "text_id=13959 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　―――けど、君の事は予想外だった」"
msgstr "  But you... I wasn't expecting you.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2007:13960: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2007
msgctxt "text_id=13960 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は<悼|いた>むように瞳を閉じる。"
msgstr "  Touko, her eyes closed, felt sorrow."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2012:13961: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2012
msgctxt "text_id=13961 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その顔は静かな葛藤に満ちている。"
msgstr "  Behind her troubled expression, there was a silent conflict."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2042:13962: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0029; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2042
msgctxt "text_id=13962 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……世の平等に怒るべきか、<幸運|ぐうぜん>の出会いとやらに嘆くべきか。これも抑止力というヤツかな。"
msgstr "\"I don't know if I should rage at the impartiality of the world, or lament the serendipity of life. I suppose it's all part of the Counter Force."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2048:13963: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0030; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2048
msgctxt "text_id=13963 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　無垢な部外者を手に掛けるのは世の常だが、この手合いに会ったのは初めてだ。"
msgstr "  Innocent outsiders get killed all the time in this world of ours, but I've never met anyone quite like you."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2054:13964: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0031; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2054
msgctxt "text_id=13964 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　いや。そもそも居るなどと、考えた事すらなかったな」"
msgstr "  Or rather, never imagined a guy like you could exist.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2077:13965: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2077
msgctxt "text_id=13965 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まったく、と空に向かってグチをこぼし、橙子は体を起こす。"
msgstr "  Touko sighed at the ceiling, and stirred in her seat."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2082:13966: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2082
msgctxt "text_id=13966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女が予想もしていなかった類の迷いは、それで断ち切れたらしい。"
msgstr "  She seemed to have overcome an unexpected moment of uncertainty."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2117:13967: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0032; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2117
msgctxt "text_id=13967 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「君は青子の切札には見えない。"
msgstr "\"You don't look like Aoko's ace in the hole."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2123:13968: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0033; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2123
msgctxt "text_id=13968 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　排除しておくまでもない、善良かつ無能な部外者だ。"
msgstr "  You're just a dim-but-nice stranger, too pitiful to put out of his misery."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2134:13969: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0034; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2134
msgctxt "text_id=13969 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　だから放っておきたいのだけど、私の六感がこう告げているんだ。君を逃すな、いいからさっさと済ませてしまえ、と」"
msgstr "  But as much as I want to leave you be, my sixth sense is screaming that I should erase you now and be done with it.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2166:13970: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2166
msgctxt "text_id=13970 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　分かりやすく言うと『よし、いま殺そう』という意味らしい。"
msgstr "  More plainly put, she had made up her mind to kill him."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2171:13971: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2171
msgctxt "text_id=13971 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　過大評価をしてくれる分には嬉しいけれどいきすぎるのも問題で、それより何より、なんだかんだと<青子|いもうと>と同じ結論になるあたり姉妹の<業|ごう>を感じる草十郎である。"
msgstr "  Though Soujyuro was somewhat flattered at how grossly she inflated his importance, he was struck more by the karmic irony―Touko had arrived at the same conclusion as her sister."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2217:13972: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2217
msgctxt "text_id=13972 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2223:13973: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2223
msgctxt "text_id=13973 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、悠長に感想を述べている場合でもない。"
msgstr "  However, this was no time for idle thoughts."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2229:13974: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2229
msgctxt "text_id=13974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はできるだけさりげなく―――具体的には逃げだそうとしているのが見え見えな慎重さで―――ソファーから腰をあげようと努力する。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro readied himself to stand up from the sofa in such a way as to not draw attention to the plan so clearly written all over his face―to make a run for it."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2256:13975: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0035; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2256
msgctxt "text_id=13975 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「バカもの、こういう時は半端に動くな。逃げるならサッサと逃げる、交渉するならテコでも動くな。"
msgstr "\"Silly boy. Don't give yourself away like that. If you're going to run, then run. But if you value your life, then don't move a muscle."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2268:13976: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0036; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2268
msgctxt "text_id=13976 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　……なんというか、そんな風に動かれるとその気がなくともつい反応してしまうだろう。ほら、命が惜しいのなら大人しく固まっていなさい」"
msgstr "  In other words, you won't make it halfway to the door before I get you. Now, be a good boy and sit still.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2304:13977: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0016; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2304
msgctxt "text_id=13977 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「えっと……殺さない、んですか？」"
msgstr "\"So you're... not going to kill me?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2323:13978: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0037; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2323
msgctxt "text_id=13978 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「今のところはね。私は君が気に入ったし。"
msgstr "\"For the time being. I like you, kid."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2329:13979: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0038; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2329
msgctxt "text_id=13979 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　いや、違うな、正しくはこう。私ぐらいしか、君を救ってあげられないのかも、かな」"
msgstr "  Well, not exactly. The truth is, I might be the only one who can save you.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2335:13980: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0017; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2335
msgctxt "text_id=13980 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――はい？」"
msgstr "\"...What?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2374:13981: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2374
msgctxt "text_id=13981 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　当惑する草十郎を、正面から見据える橙子。"
msgstr "  She looked the perplexed Soujyuro straight in the eyes."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2379:13982: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2379
msgctxt "text_id=13982 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　赤くさえ見える茶色の瞳は、剣のような鋭さで目前の少年を捕らえている。"
msgstr "  Though actually brown, her eyes gleamed a piercing red, like the edge of blade."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2438:13983: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2438
msgctxt "text_id=13983 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一瞬、草十郎は軽い<眩暈|めまい>に襲われた。"
msgstr "  It was at this moment an overwhelming sense of dizziness overcame Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2443:13984: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2443
msgctxt "text_id=13984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正体のつかめない浮遊感と、脳の痺れ。"
msgstr "  His mind went numb, like he couldn't tell who he was."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2448:13985: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2448
msgctxt "text_id=13985 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔物のような眠気、というのがもっとも近いイメージだった。"
msgstr "  It was like drifting into a sinister sleep from which he'd never wake."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2473:13986: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0018; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2473
msgctxt "text_id=13986 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――、――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2479:13987: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2479
msgctxt "text_id=13987 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は歯を食いしばって意識を保つ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro clenched his jaw, desperate to maintain consciousness."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2503:13988: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2503
msgctxt "text_id=13988 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目前にはあまりにも深い、底なし沼のような橙子の瞳。"
msgstr "  Touko's eyes devoured him like a bottomless pit of quicksand."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2523:13989: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2523
msgctxt "text_id=13989 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それで、草十郎は漠然と理解した。"
msgstr "  In that moment, it all became clear to him."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2529:13990: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2529
msgctxt "text_id=13990 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アレは青子の姉とかそういったモノでなく、"
msgstr "  It no longer mattered that she was Aoko's sister,"

#. Occurrence 9_6:2534:13991: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2534
msgctxt "text_id=13991 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠たちの敵というモノでもない。"
msgstr "  or that she was Alice's sworn enemy."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2539:13992: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2539
msgctxt "text_id=13992 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女たちの事情とは別の次元で、蒼崎橙子という人物は自分にとって<危|あや>うい生き物なのだと。"
msgstr "  Touko Aozaki's deadly battle with the girls, had become his battle."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2572:13993: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2572
msgctxt "text_id=13993 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何故なら―――"
msgstr "  Which is why..."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2577:13994: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2577
msgctxt "text_id=13994 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たった一時間足らずの会話で、理由もないのに他人に心底から共感してしまうのは、良くないことだ。"
msgstr "  When you find yourself feeling a special spark for a stranger met mere moments ago, that feeling is not to be trusted."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2582:13995: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2582
msgctxt "text_id=13995 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはただ、同じ<金型|カタチ>のものが、空洞を埋める為だけに、同じものを求めているにすぎない。"
msgstr "  You may simply be attempting to fill a void shaped like yourself, with more emptiness."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2616:13996: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2616
msgctxt "text_id=13996 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これまで感じた事のない危機感に身を引く草十郎だが、体はまったく言う事をきかない。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro tried to drag his body away from this heretofore unencountered sense of danger, but found that it would not respond."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2621:13997: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2621
msgctxt "text_id=13997 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな草十郎を見つめて、橙子は微かにうなずいた。"
msgstr "  Touko tilted her head forward at him, eyes fixated on his."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2655:13998: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0039; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2655
msgctxt "text_id=13998 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「君の思う通り、私は君と似たところがある。それとも君が私に近いのかな。なに、食べ物の好き嫌い程度の類似だが、軽視する事でもない。"
msgstr "\"Your instincts weren't wrong; you do have something in common with me. Or maybe you're just close to me. Maybe we're picky about all the same foods. It's something to consider."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2673:13999: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0040; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2673
msgctxt "text_id=13999 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　問題は、君が私より<偏|かたよ>っている、という事でね」"
msgstr "  The problem is, you're more... biased than I am.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2693:14000: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2693
msgctxt "text_id=14000 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　偏っている。"
msgstr "  Biased."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2709:14001: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2709
msgctxt "text_id=14001 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その言葉を、草十郎は違う意味にしかとれなかった。"
msgstr "  She clearly used a different definition of the word than the one Soujyuro knew."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2732:14002: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2732
msgctxt "text_id=14002 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　偏っている。"
msgstr "  \"Biased.\""

msgctxt "text_id=14003 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "傍には誰もいない。"
msgstr " It meant that he was alone―"

msgctxt "text_id=14004 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "おまえはこの町では、仲間外れの異邦人だと。"
msgstr "that he was an outsider who didn't belong in this town."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2742:14005: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2742
msgctxt "text_id=14005 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　急激な反感が、温厚な彼の<性格|こころ>を沸騰させる。"
msgstr "  A sudden and seething anger eclipsed his gentle heart."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2782:14006: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0019; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2782
msgctxt "text_id=14006 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「俺、ひとりじゃないですけど」"
msgstr "\"But... I'm not alone.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2790:14007: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2790
msgctxt "text_id=14007 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心底からの嫌悪をこめて、草十郎は言い返す。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro shot back with all the enmity he could muster,"

#. Occurrence 9_6:2795:14008: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2795
msgctxt "text_id=14008 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子と名乗る目前の魔女に。"
msgstr "  as he faced this witch named Touko Aozaki."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2800:14009: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2800
msgctxt "text_id=14009 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう言い返さなければ、彼女の目から逃れられなくなりそうで恐ろしかった。"
msgstr "  If he had not, he feared he would never escape her gaze."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2837:14010: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0041; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2837
msgctxt "text_id=14010 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「だろうな。だからこそ君は偏っているんだ。早くそれに気付きなさい。一番てっとり早い解決は、それでいいんだと認める事だ。"
msgstr "\"See. That's precisely what makes you biased. And the sooner you realize that, the better. It's the fastest way out of your predicament."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2844:14011: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0042; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2844
msgctxt "text_id=14011 | speaker=touko"
msgid "人間なんて逞しいもんでね。別に、何もかも放り投げても上手くいくものなのさ。"
msgstr "Humans are hardy creatures. No matter what life throws at them, they find a way to survive."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2850:14012: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0043; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2850
msgctxt "text_id=14012 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　けれど―――青子にはそれは許せない。アレは他人であれ、あらゆる事を許さない人間だからな」"
msgstr "  But... Aoko can't tolerate them, because she's the sort of stranger who can't stand anything.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2881:14013: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2881
msgctxt "text_id=14013 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言って、橙子はテーブルに身を乗り出した。"
msgstr "  Touko leaned over the table."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2887:14014: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2887
msgctxt "text_id=14014 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　片手を伸ばして草十郎の首輪を掴むと、力任せに自分へと引き寄せる。"
msgstr "  She reached out, grabbed Soujyuro's collar, and roughly pulled him toward her."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2919:14015: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0044; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2919
msgctxt "text_id=14015 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「いや、そんな事はいいんだ。ただ純粋に、私は君が欲しいと思った。君が、自分の名前すら定かではないと名乗った時にね」"
msgstr "\"But enough about her. All I care about is getting to have you. In fact, I wanted you from the moment you mumbled your name like it's not even yours.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2940:14016: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0045; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2940
msgctxt "text_id=14016 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「自分の認識が不明で、自分自身が不能と感じる。"
msgstr "\"I want you with your lack of self-awareness, and your sense of powerlessness."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2946:14017: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0046; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2946
msgctxt "text_id=14017 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　未来というものが、とても自分に関わりのある事とは思えない。となれば必然、心情は過去への逆行を試みる。"
msgstr "  The future must seem like such a foreign concept to someone like you. Your mind inevitably looks to the past."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2955:14018: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0047; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2955
msgctxt "text_id=14018 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　しかし、所詮<大我|ソア>の前の<小我|モア>のように、正常な流れの前には時間旅行は押し戻されてしまう。"
msgstr "  But just as moi―the lesser self―comes before soi― the greater self―the normal flow of time will always reject time travel."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2961:14019: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0048; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2961
msgctxt "text_id=14019 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　それも私にあって君にある物だ。"
msgstr "  It's the same for me as it is for you."

#. Occurrence 9_6:2972:14020: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0049; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2972
msgctxt "text_id=14020 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ああ、なんて無様な私。なんて哀れな―――」"
msgstr "  Argh, I've done it again, haven't I? How could you possibly even begin to...\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:2997:14021: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:2997
msgctxt "text_id=14021 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言いかけて、橙子は口を塞ぐ。"
msgstr "  Touko trailed off mid-sentence."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3006:14022: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3006
msgctxt "text_id=14022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　引き寄せられた草十郎の目に映るのは、橙子の目に映った、憐れみの表情をうかべた自分だけだった。"
msgstr "  As she pulled Soujyuro closer, her own eyes reflected in his, she noticed the merciful expression on her face."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3026:14023: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3026
msgctxt "text_id=14023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は思う。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro got to thinking."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3031:14024: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3031
msgctxt "text_id=14024 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この女性に敵意はない。"
msgstr "  He held no hostility toward this woman."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3036:14025: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3036
msgctxt "text_id=14025 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　殺意も、失意もない。"
msgstr "  He bore her no grudge, harbored no desire to kill her."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3041:14026: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3041
msgctxt "text_id=14026 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あるのは怒りと、行く当てのない<憐憫|れんびん>だけだ。"
msgstr "  He was aware only of his anger and aimless compassion."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3046:14027: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3046
msgctxt "text_id=14027 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　出来れば彼女の望む答えを口にしてやりたい。"
msgstr "  He wished that he could give her the answers she wanted."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3051:14028: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3051
msgctxt "text_id=14028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど―――"
msgstr "  But..."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3087:14029: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0020; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3087
msgctxt "text_id=14029 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あなたの言っている事は、よく分からない」"
msgstr "\"I don't really know what you're talking about.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3104:14030: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3104
msgctxt "text_id=14030 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　申し訳ないように草十郎は返答した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro replied apologetically."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3109:14031: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3109
msgctxt "text_id=14031 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　視線で問われた事を、はっきりと言葉にして。"
msgstr "  A verbal reply to the visible question he perceived in her eyes."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3114:14032: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3114
msgctxt "text_id=14032 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子に落胆の色はない。"
msgstr "  Touko showed no sign of disappointment."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3119:14033: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3119
msgctxt "text_id=14033 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　むしろ楽しげに、かすかに唇をつり上げた。"
msgstr "  Instead, the corners of her lips turned upward in delight."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3157:14034: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0050; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3157
msgctxt "text_id=14034 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そうか。君には言葉の<魔術|あんじ>は通じないんだな。"
msgstr "\"Of course, you wouldn't comprehend the language of magecraft."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3163:14035: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0051; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3163
msgctxt "text_id=14035 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　意味深な台詞回しで丸飲みにしてやろうとも思ったが、いや、失敗失敗。<小奇麗|こぎれい>な建前は逆効果だった。君には剥き出しの、原始的な語りの方が良かったんだな。"
msgstr "  And here I am trying to wax philosophical to you. How foolish of me. Small courtesies can have the opposite effect, after all. I should have put it in plainer, more primitive terms."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3179:14036: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0052; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3179
msgctxt "text_id=14036 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　―――いいよ、ますます気に入った」"
msgstr "  Oh, I *do* like you, Soujyuro.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3213:14037: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3213
msgctxt "text_id=14037 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　首輪を掴む指が、革を引き裂くように喉元に食いこむ。"
msgstr "  Her fingers dug into his throat as if she were tearing at the leather."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3218:14038: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3218
msgctxt "text_id=14038 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを裂いてしまえば、この少年は自分の物になると言うかのように。"
msgstr "  Perhaps he could be hers if only she could rip it off."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3255:14039: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0053; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3255
msgctxt "text_id=14039 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「―――少年。青子なぞより私のもとにこい。"
msgstr "\"Sweet boy. Leave Aoko and be with me."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3261:14040: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0054; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3261
msgctxt "text_id=14040 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　使い道はないが保護ぐらいはしてやろう。手が空いた時なら、気晴らしに愛してやってもいい」"
msgstr "  I may not have a use for you, but at least I can protect you. Or maybe if I'm bored, you could be my plaything.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3281:14041: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3281
msgctxt "text_id=14041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　色々回り道はしたが、それが彼女の結論らしい。"
msgstr "  It had taken many approaches, but she seemed to have decided on this one."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3286:14042: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3286
msgctxt "text_id=14042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誘われている草十郎は、そこまで買われている事が不思議でしようがない。嬉しくないというのも嘘になる。"
msgstr "  The lengths to which she went to seduce him were not lost on Soujyuro, and truth be told, they were not wholly unwelcome."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3291:14043: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3291
msgctxt "text_id=14043 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、それはそれとして、"
msgstr "  But back to the matter at hand..."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3298:14044: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0021; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3298
msgctxt "text_id=14044 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それは、お断りします」"
msgstr "\"I respectfully decline.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3304:14045: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3304
msgctxt "text_id=14045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　またもきっぱりと、草十郎は即答した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro chose the direct response, as he did."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3332:14046: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0055; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3332
msgctxt "text_id=14046 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「―――なぜ？」"
msgstr "\"...Why?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3338:14047: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0022; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3338
msgctxt "text_id=14047 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「だって、貴方のためにならない」"
msgstr "\"Because it wouldn't be good for you.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3357:14048: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3357
msgctxt "text_id=14048 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それだけは胸を張って断言できる。"
msgstr "  He had confidence in that, at least."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3362:14049: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3362
msgctxt "text_id=14049 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の過大評価はともかく、草十郎は、自分がこの人物をどうにかしてはいけない、と強く感じていた。"
msgstr "  Touko's overestimation of him aside, Soujyuro knew for a fact that he had to escape this woman's clutches."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3367:14050: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3367
msgctxt "text_id=14050 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　結論を出すのは彼女本人か、彼女が<拘|こだわ>っている相手の手でなければ間違っている、と。"
msgstr "  This tête-à-tête could only be concluded by one of its two participants: Touko, or the individual she was currently infatuated with."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3407:14051: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0056; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3407
msgctxt "text_id=14051 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3413:14052: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3413
msgctxt "text_id=14052 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　直感を通り越した、信念めいた少年の断言。"
msgstr "  On a hunch, the boy mustered all the conviction he could feign."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3428:14053: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3428
msgctxt "text_id=14053 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子はそっと首輪から指をぬいて、とん、と近寄っていた草十郎をソファーへと押し戻した。"
msgstr "  She gently removed her hand from his collar and jabbed him in the chest, causing him to topple back onto the sofa."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3460:14054: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0057; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3460
msgctxt "text_id=14054 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そうか。なら仕方がない。"
msgstr "\"Very well. If that's the way it must be."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3466:14055: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0058; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3466
msgctxt "text_id=14055 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　君も、青子の大切な持ち物として考える事にしよう」"
msgstr "  I'll just have to think of you as Aoko's personal property then.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3486:14056: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3486
msgctxt "text_id=14056 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙色の魔術師は静かに立ち上がる。"
msgstr "  The Scarred Red mage quietly stood up."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3510:14057: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0059; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3510
msgctxt "text_id=14057 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「青子が帰ってくる頃だから、私は行くよ。"
msgstr "\"Well, Aoko will be here any moment. I'd best be on my way."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3517:14058: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0060; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3517
msgctxt "text_id=14058 | speaker=touko"
msgid "青子では私には勝てない、とだけ伝えておいてくれればいい」"
msgstr "She has no chance of defeating me. Tell her that for me, won't you?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3523:14059: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0023; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3523
msgctxt "text_id=14059 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それはいいんですけど」"
msgstr "\"Sure, but...\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3555:14060: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3555
msgctxt "text_id=14060 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソファーに座ったまま、草十郎は立ち去ろうとする橙子を呼び止めた。"
msgstr "  Before she left the room, Touko paused to let Soujyuro continue."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3560:14061: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3560
msgctxt "text_id=14061 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして、師匠に質問する弟子のように控え目に、橙子が持っている物を指差す。"
msgstr "  Like a student humbly inquiring of a teacher, Soujyuro pointed to the object in Touko's hand and asked,"

#. Occurrence 9_6:3586:14062: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_6_0024; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3586
msgctxt "text_id=14062 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……あの。そのカップ、どうするんです？」"
msgstr "\"...Um. What are you going to do with that cup?\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3592:14063: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3592
msgctxt "text_id=14063 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　頼りのない弟子の指摘に、ああ、と橙子は右手に持ったティーカップに視線を落とした。"
msgstr "  Surprised, she looked down at the teacup in her right hand that she had forgotten she was holding."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3597:14064: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3597
msgctxt "text_id=14064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子本人、自分がカップを持っていた事実を意識していなかったとしか思えない。"
msgstr "  She hadn't even realized that she had been holding the cup the entire time."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3630:14065: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0061; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3630
msgctxt "text_id=14065 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「これ？　うん、せっかくだから貰っていく」"
msgstr "\"Oh, this? I might as well take it with me.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3636:14066: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3636
msgctxt "text_id=14066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……持ち主の許しもなく持っていくのは『貰う』ではなく『奪う』という。"
msgstr "  The act of taking something without the owner's permission is commonly referred to as \"theft.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3641:14067: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3641
msgctxt "text_id=14067 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、青子と橙子の間ではそれぐらいの交流は普通なのかも知れない。あの妹にしてこの姉あり、みたいな。"
msgstr "  However, this was more likely the typical relationship between Aoko and Touko. Share and share alike, and so forth."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3674:14068: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3674
msgctxt "text_id=14068 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なるほど、と草十郎は頷く。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded to show that he understood."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3679:14069: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3679
msgctxt "text_id=14069 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな、真面目なんだか不真面目なんだか分からない草十郎の仕草に、橙子は眼鏡を外してから二度目の、楽しげな笑みをこぼすのだった。"
msgstr "  Unsure if his nod was sincere or not, Touko smiled that gleeful grin for the second time since taking her glasses off."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3715:14070: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_9_6_0062; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3715
msgctxt "text_id=14070 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「やはり変わり種だね、君は。逸材かどうかは別の話だが」"
msgstr "\"You certainly are an odd one, the question of your worth aside.\""

#. Occurrence 9_6:3736:14071: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3736
msgctxt "text_id=14071 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一瞬だけ、彼女は眼鏡をはずす前の、穏和な蒼崎橙子に戻っていた。"
msgstr "  For just a moment, she had returned to the affable Touko Aozaki he met before the glasses came off."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3741:14072: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3741
msgctxt "text_id=14072 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その微笑みを最後にして、橙子は洋館から去っていった。"
msgstr "  Leaving him with the image of her smile, she departed the mansion."

#. Occurrence 9_6:3760:14073: scene=9_6
#: 9_6:3760
msgctxt "text_id=14073 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間のテーブルに、壊れた眼鏡を残したままで。"
msgstr "  Her broken glasses remained on the drawing-room table."

#. Occurrence 9_7:89:14074: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:89
msgctxt "text_id=14074 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ただいまー！」"
msgstr "\"We're hooome!\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:96:14075: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:96
msgctxt "text_id=14075 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不意の来客と入れ替わるように、青子たちは帰ってきた。"
msgstr "  No sooner had the eerie visitor left, did Aoko and Alice return home."

#. Occurrence 9_7:101:14076: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:101
msgctxt "text_id=14076 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の表情は不機嫌ながらも活き活きとしている。"
msgstr "  Despite Aoko's sour mood, she seemed as merry as ever."

#. Occurrence 9_7:106:14077: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:106
msgctxt "text_id=14077 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とりあえず問題は山積みだけど目的が決まってスッキリした、と言いたげなハイテンションさだ。"
msgstr "  Despite everything that had happened and their trip having its fair share of problems, she still had fun."

#. Occurrence 9_7:126:14078: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:126
msgctxt "text_id=14078 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、傍らの有珠はいつも通り。"
msgstr "  Whereas Alice was her usual stoic self,"

#. Occurrence 9_7:131:14079: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:131
msgctxt "text_id=14079 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　相棒の暴走っぷりをフォローできるよう裏方に徹している……と見えなくもない。"
msgstr "  her manner not unlike a parent following behind a rampaging toddler, cleaning up their mess."

#. Occurrence 9_7:136:14080: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:136
msgctxt "text_id=14080 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりの颯爽とした登場はテレビの映像のように思えて、草十郎はお帰りと言うのも忘れてしまった。"
msgstr "  The scene of their return was like something out of a TV sitcom, and lost in thought, Soujyuro forgot to greet them."

#. Occurrence 9_7:170:14081: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:170
msgctxt "text_id=14081 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎、留守中なにかあった？」"
msgstr "\"Did anything happen while we were out, Soujyuro?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:176:14082: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:176
msgctxt "text_id=14082 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は上着を脱ぎながら、社交辞令じみた質問をした。"
msgstr "  Aoko asked, more so out of etiquette than curiosity, while removing her coat."

#. Occurrence 9_7:181:14083: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:181
msgctxt "text_id=14083 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それには答えず、草十郎はソファーから立ち上がる。"
msgstr "  Without answering, he stood up from the sofa."

#. Occurrence 9_7:205:14084: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:205
msgctxt "text_id=14084 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そりゃあ半日分の出来事はあったけど。"
msgstr "\"Yeah, it took up half of my day, actually."

#. Occurrence 9_7:211:14085: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:211
msgctxt "text_id=14085 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　それより寒かっただろう。お茶を淹れようか？」"
msgstr "  Other than that, it was just cold. Want me to make some tea?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:222:14086: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:222
msgctxt "text_id=14086 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あ、お願い。"
msgstr "\"Yes, please."

#. Occurrence 9_7:222:14087: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:222
msgctxt "text_id=14087 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　こっちも一から作戦練り上げようってトコだから」"
msgstr "  You can't plan anything without a hot cup of tea in your hands.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:264:14088: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:264
msgctxt "text_id=14088 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　上機嫌な青子の台詞を聞き流して、草十郎は台所に向かい、二人分の紅茶を淹れはじめる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was on his way to the kitchen to prepare tea even before Aoko had finished her upbeat response."

#. Occurrence 9_7:271:14089: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:271
msgctxt "text_id=14089 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……なんだろう。どこか、変だ」"
msgstr "\"...Wait a minute. Something feels off.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:276:14090: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:276
msgctxt "text_id=14090 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつもの手順で紅茶を淹れているのに、作っている実感が湧かない。"
msgstr "  He was following his same tea-brewing routine as always, but somehow something did not feel the same."

#. Occurrence 9_7:282:14091: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:282
msgctxt "text_id=14091 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<夢現|ゆめうつつ>な気分で、草十郎は青子たちがくつろいでいる居間に戻り、テーブルにティーカップを置く。"
msgstr "  As though in a trance, Soujyuro returned to the drawing room where they were settling down, and placed the tea on the table."

#. Occurrence 9_7:316:14092: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_7_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:316
msgctxt "text_id=14092 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「これからどうするつもりなの、青子」"
msgstr "\"What do you intend to do now, Aoko?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:322:14093: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:322
msgctxt "text_id=14093 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「とりあえず足で探すしかないわね。あいつ相手に守りに入るのは良くない。こっちが城壁を作ってる間に、一個師団の人形をこさえかねないわ」"
msgstr "\"We'll have to search for her on foot. We can't play this one defensively. If we spend time fortifying defenses here, she'll just have more time to create more puppets.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:342:14094: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:342
msgctxt "text_id=14094 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりは草十郎を無視して話をしている。"
msgstr "  They conversed with each other while ignoring Soujyuro's presence."

#. Occurrence 9_7:347:14095: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:347
msgctxt "text_id=14095 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それをつっ立ったまま聞きながら、ぽつりと草十郎は話しかけた。"
msgstr "  Upon hearing what they said, he stood up and spoke abruptly."

#. Occurrence 9_7:380:14096: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:380
msgctxt "text_id=14096 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「探すって、橙子さんを？」"
msgstr "\"Are you going to look for Miss Touko?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:398:14097: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:398
msgctxt "text_id=14097 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それ以外誰を探すって―――"
msgstr "\"Yeah, who else would we―"

#. Occurrence 9_7:410:14098: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:410
msgctxt "text_id=14098 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ちょっと。アンタ、今なんて言ったの？」"
msgstr "  Wait. What did you just say?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:416:14099: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:416
msgctxt "text_id=14099 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「橙子さんなんだろ、蒼崎たちの敵は。さっきまでここにいたよ」"
msgstr "\"Touko. She's your enemy, right? You just missed her.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:436:14100: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:436
msgctxt "text_id=14100 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呆然とする青子に、平然と答える草十郎。"
msgstr "  He answered so casually, Aoko standing there dumbfounded."

#. Occurrence 9_7:452:14101: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:452
msgctxt "text_id=14101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな間の抜けたふたりを余所に、有珠はソファーから立ち上がった。"
msgstr "  Alice stood up from the sofa and went to where the two of them were standing."

#. Occurrence 9_7:457:14102: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:457
msgctxt "text_id=14102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　可憐な顔立ちを、厳しい叱責の<貌|かたち>に変えて。"
msgstr "  Her typically kind and somber features turned reproachable."

#. Occurrence 9_7:491:14103: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_7_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:491
msgctxt "text_id=14103 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「静希君。その人、何かしていった？」"
msgstr "\"Sizuki. Tell me exactly what she did when she was here.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:512:14104: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0005_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:512
msgctxt "text_id=14104 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「お茶を飲んで、眼鏡を外して帰っていっただけだけど。"
msgstr "\"We drank some tea, then she took off her glasses..."

#. Occurrence 9_7:524:14105: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0005_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:524
msgctxt "text_id=14105 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "あれ……よく、思い出せないな……」"
msgstr " Huh... I can't remember anything after that.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:530:14106: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:530
msgctxt "text_id=14106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さっきまで確かだった記憶が、消しゴムにかけられるように消えていく。"
msgstr "  What was once a clear memory seemed to have been scrubbed clean from his mind."

#. Occurrence 9_7:535:14107: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:535
msgctxt "text_id=14107 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は、つい先ほど感じた、眠気のような目眩に襲われて、"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was overcome by the same dizziness he had felt earlier."

#. Occurrence 9_7:580:14108: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:580
msgctxt "text_id=14108 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぱん、と乾いた音が居間に響く。"
msgstr "  A sharp dry smack echoed through the room."

#. Occurrence 9_7:585:14109: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:585
msgctxt "text_id=14109 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の目眩を止めたのは、彼が思ってもいなかった有珠の平手打ちだった。"
msgstr "  What snapped him out of his haze was an unexpected slap from Alice."

#. Occurrence 9_7:613:14110: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_7_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:613
msgctxt "text_id=14110 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――二度は言わないわ。"
msgstr "\"I won't warn you again."

#. Occurrence 9_7:613:14111: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_7_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:613
msgctxt "text_id=14111 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　他人を、わたしの家に立ち入らせないで」"
msgstr "  *Never* let anyone else into my house.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:642:14112: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:642
msgctxt "text_id=14112 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の目には、<潜|ひそ>めた、けれど激情が灯っている。"
msgstr "  Deep within her eyes, beyond the normal cool indifference, was an intense fury."

#. Occurrence 9_7:647:14113: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:647
msgctxt "text_id=14113 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが怒りだけのものではないと気付いて、草十郎はようやく、自分の軽率さを悔いた。"
msgstr "  Realizing, however, that it was no ordinary anger, Soujyuro understood how careless he had been."

#. Occurrence 9_7:668:14114: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:668
msgctxt "text_id=14114 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……すまない。有珠にとってここが大事な場所なのは、分かってたのに」"
msgstr "\"...I'm sorry. This place is very important to you. I should have known better.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:689:14115: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:689
msgctxt "text_id=14115 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　重い沈黙。"
msgstr "  A heavy silence followed."

#. Occurrence 9_7:707:14116: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:707
msgctxt "text_id=14116 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠も草十郎も、自分への後悔に縛られて動けない。"
msgstr "  Both Soujyuro and Alice stood there, chained to the spot by their own regret."

#. Occurrence 9_7:738:14117: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:738
msgctxt "text_id=14117 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　放っておけば一晩中そうやっていそうなふたりを、青子は呆れて眺めている。"
msgstr "  Aoko looked on in amazement, wondering if they would stay this way all night if left alone."

#. Occurrence 9_7:766:14118: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:766
msgctxt "text_id=14118 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あのね。姉貴を通した草十郎も悪いけど、言ってなかった有珠も悪いでしょ。"
msgstr "\"So, hey. I know Soujyuro screwed up by letting my sister in, but Alice, you never told him he shouldn't."

#. Occurrence 9_7:772:14119: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:772
msgctxt "text_id=14119 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　子供じゃないんだからいつまでも反省してないで、もっと前向きに話をしない？」"
msgstr "  We're not children anymore, so how about we put this behind us, and focus on the problem at hand, okay?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:799:14120: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_7_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:799
msgctxt "text_id=14120 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:824:14121: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:824
msgctxt "text_id=14121 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子に促され、有珠はうつむきがちにソファーに座った。"
msgstr "  Alice hung her head and sat back down at Aoko's insistence."

#. Occurrence 9_7:829:14122: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:829
msgctxt "text_id=14122 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は立ったままで、有珠に叩かれた右頬に手を当てた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro stood where he was, nursing his stinging right cheek."

#. Occurrence 9_7:834:14123: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:834
msgctxt "text_id=14123 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　痛む事は痛むけど、体の痛みには慣れている。"
msgstr "  Pain was pain, but he knew how to take a knock."

#. Occurrence 9_7:850:14124: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:850
msgctxt "text_id=14124 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それよりいま重要なのは、有珠の平手で記憶が鮮明になったという事だ。"
msgstr "  More to the point, the crisp strike from Alice snapped him out of his fog, jogging his memory."

#. Occurrence 9_7:871:14125: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:871
msgctxt "text_id=14125 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「思い出した。青子じゃ私には勝てないって、伝えておいてほしいって」"
msgstr "\"I remember... She told me to tell you that you have no chance of defeating her, Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:887:14126: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:887
msgctxt "text_id=14126 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ふーん、大した自信ね。他には？」"
msgstr "\"Hmmm... Pretty full of herself. Anything else?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:928:14127: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:928
msgctxt "text_id=14127 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「他は……基本的に世間話だったというか……ああ、そあとかもあとか、よく分からないコトを口にしてたな」"
msgstr "\"She also said... Well, most of it was small talk... To be honest, she said a lot of other stuff I didn't really understand.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:950:14128: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:950
msgctxt "text_id=14128 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはともかく、世間話の大半が青子の失敗談だった事は墓まで持っていこう、と誓う草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  Considering the small talk was mostly about Aoko and her flaws, Soujyuro decided it would be better to take that part to his grave."

#. Occurrence 9_7:971:14129: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:971
msgctxt "text_id=14129 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「大我と小我？　あの人、インドにでも行ってたのかしら。"
msgstr "\"She mentioned the greater and lesser self? I wonder if she's been to India."

#. Occurrence 9_7:977:14130: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:977
msgctxt "text_id=14130 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ところで草十郎。アンタ、姉貴に何かされたわね」"
msgstr "  In case you didn't catch on, Soujyuro, she must have done something to you.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:995:14131: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:995
msgctxt "text_id=14131 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　じろり、と鋭い視線を青子は向ける。"
msgstr "  Aoko turned to him, glaring sharply."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1000:14132: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1000
msgctxt "text_id=14132 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　後ろめたい事は何もないのに、草十郎はそれについ顔を背けてしまった。"
msgstr "  He had nothing to be ashamed of, but he looked away guiltily anyway."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1021:14133: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1021
msgctxt "text_id=14133 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「何かって、何さ」"
msgstr "\"She did? What did she do...exactly?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1033:14134: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0011_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1033
msgctxt "text_id=14134 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「思い出せない、とか言ってたでしょ。さっきまでの態度もふわふわしてたし。"
msgstr "\"You said you couldn't remember what she said, right? And up until a second ago you looked like a zombie."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1045:14135: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0011_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1045
msgctxt "text_id=14135 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "……そうか、眼鏡を外したまでは覚えてたって事は、魔眼にでも魅入られたか」"
msgstr "I see. You remember right up to when she took her glasses off, which means you must have been entranced by her Mystic Eyes.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1065:14136: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1065
msgctxt "text_id=14136 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうやって勝手に結論に辿り着くと、青子はもう興味なし、とばかりに黙りこむ。"
msgstr "  As quickly as she had jumped to that conclusion, Aoko went quiet again, as if the information was of little importance."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1070:14137: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1070
msgctxt "text_id=14137 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しっくりいかないのは草十郎である。"
msgstr "  But it was not enough to detract Soujyuro from bringing it up again."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1111:14138: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1111
msgctxt "text_id=14138 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「蒼崎、まがんって何だ？」"
msgstr "\"Aozaki, what are 'Mystic Eyes'?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1139:14139: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1139
msgctxt "text_id=14139 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……魔力を帯びた目の事よ。簡単な物は一時的な混乱を、上級な物は睨んだだけで相手を殺す、とかね。"
msgstr "\"Eyes infused with magical energy. Simple forms of Mystic Eyes can cause temporary confusion, while more advanced ones can kill with just a glance. Stuff like that."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1145:14140: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1145
msgctxt "text_id=14140 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……ま、バロールみたいな魔眼の持ち主なんて伝説だけだろうし、そもそもそんな魔眼持ちが生まれてくるなら私たちの悩みもあっさり終わるってものだけど」"
msgstr "  Eh, eyes like Balor's are really just the stuff of legends. If there were eyes like that, we could really use them right about now.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1182:14141: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1182
msgctxt "text_id=14141 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……？」"
msgstr "\"...?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1188:14142: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1188
msgctxt "text_id=14142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の説明は事情を知らない<草十郎|いちげんさん>にはさっぱりである。"
msgstr "  Without further context, Aoko knew her explanation was completely lost on Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1221:14143: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1221
msgctxt "text_id=14143 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……んー、そうね。"
msgstr "\"So... yeah."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1228:14144: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1228
msgctxt "text_id=14144 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "分かりやすく言うと、私の魔弾みたいなのを目から照射するようなもんよ」"
msgstr "To put it simply, it's like my magic bullet, only you use your eyes to shoot it.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1248:14145: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1248
msgctxt "text_id=14145 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「目から……蒼崎……が？」"
msgstr "\"You can shoot... bullets from your eyes?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1254:14146: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1254
msgctxt "text_id=14146 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　退屈そうな青子とは反対に、草十郎の混乱はより深くなっていく。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's confusion deepened along with Aoko's frustration."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1296:14147: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1296
msgctxt "text_id=14147 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「だから！　貴方、一度目を閉じた後の橙子の目を見たんでしょ？　その一瞬で姉貴の魔眼に捕まったってコト！"
msgstr "\"Anyway! You looked into Touko's eyes after she blinked once, right? That's the moment she put the whammy on you with her Mystic Eyes!"

#. Occurrence 9_7:1302:14148: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1302
msgctxt "text_id=14148 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　目を猫目石に入れ替える魔術師もいるけど、姉貴はそんな事する必要はないから。"
msgstr "  Some mages even replace their eyes with cat's-eye stones, but my sister doesn't need to bother with that."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1308:14149: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1308
msgctxt "text_id=14149 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あの人、生まれながらの魔眼持ちだしね。さしたる準備も詠唱もなしで、<閉塞|シャッター>するだけで切り替え自由なの」"
msgstr "  She was born with hers. She doesn't even need to say anything to use them; she can just blink, like a camera shutter.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1348:14150: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1348
msgctxt "text_id=14150 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぽん、と手を叩く草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro pounded his fist in understanding."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1353:14151: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1353
msgctxt "text_id=14151 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしかに、橙子はそんな仕草をしていた気がする。"
msgstr "  Now he thought about it, he vaguely remembered her doing something exactly like that."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1358:14152: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1358
msgctxt "text_id=14152 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの直後から心が惑わされたのは、魔眼とやらの力が大きいらしい。"
msgstr "  Everything after was foggy and muddled, and her Mystic Eyes seemed the only logical cause."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1385:14153: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1385
msgctxt "text_id=14153 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……その話は分かったけど。"
msgstr "\"...That's one mystery solved."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1412:14154: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1412
msgctxt "text_id=14154 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　橙子さんは蒼崎のお姉さんなんだろう？　なんで<姉妹|しまい>で殺し合いをしてるんだ」"
msgstr "  But Aozaki, isn't she your sister? Why would sisters try to kill each other?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1424:14155: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1424
msgctxt "text_id=14155 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　聞くべきではない事と分かっていても、あえて草十郎は問いただした。"
msgstr "  He knew it was not something he should ask, but he did it anyway."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1444:14156: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1444
msgctxt "text_id=14156 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　条約違反である質問。"
msgstr "  The question was against the rules."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1471:14157: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1471
msgctxt "text_id=14157 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼には関係のない、関わらせてはいけない争い。"
msgstr "  He had no business being involved in this dispute."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1487:14158: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1487
msgctxt "text_id=14158 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はしばし瞳を閉じて状況を整理し―――"
msgstr "  Aoko closed her eyes to collect her thoughts."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1492:14159: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1492
msgctxt "text_id=14159 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここでつっぱねるより、概要だけ話して黙らせる方がお互いの為と判断した。"
msgstr "  She decided it was best for all involved to at least share some background information, if only to head off further questions."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1513:14160: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1513
msgctxt "text_id=14160 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いいわ、話してあげる。姉貴に関わった以上、事情を説明しておかないと危ないし。"
msgstr "\"Fine, here's what you need to know now that you've met her. Besides, keeping you in the dark would be more dangerous."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1519:14161: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1519
msgctxt "text_id=14161 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　けど、なんであれ聞き返すのはナシね。この件に関しては、私は私の事情を話すだけだから」"
msgstr "  But no more questions. This is my story to tell, got it?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1551:14162: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1551
msgctxt "text_id=14162 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　物わかり良さげに頷く草十郎に、どうだか、と青子は疑いの視線を向けた。"
msgstr "  She stared down Soujyuro until he nodded slowly in recognition."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1556:14163: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1556
msgctxt "text_id=14163 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の性格は、それなりに把握できている。"
msgstr "  Knowing him, she knew this was confirmation enough."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1566:14164: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1566
msgctxt "text_id=14164 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　またヘンに親身になったりするのは目に見えているが、話すと言ったからには話そう、と青子は姿勢を切り替えた。"
msgstr "  The conversation was becoming oddly friendly again, but Aoko sat up a little straighter as she prepared to tell the tale."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1593:14165: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1593
msgctxt "text_id=14165 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……姉貴の話をするってコトは、私と蒼崎の家の話と、なにより魔術と魔法の話をしないといけない。"
msgstr "\"Before we talk about my sister, I have to explain the Aozaki family, and more importantly, magecraft versus Magic."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1599:14166: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1599
msgctxt "text_id=14166 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　少し遠回りになるし他言無用な内容だけど、いずれアンタの記憶は消えるから問題ないってコトで」"
msgstr "  We're going to cover a lot of ground and it'll include stuff you can't tell anyone, but we can always wipe your memories later, so it's fine.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1621:14167: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1621
msgctxt "text_id=14167 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰に対しての断りか、そういう前提付きだから話してあげるのよ、と青子は念を押す。"
msgstr "  Aoko made sure to add that disclaimer as a condition for telling him the information in the first place."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1657:14168: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0023; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1657
msgctxt "text_id=14168 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「魔術っていうのはね、草十郎。いわば共通のルールなのよ。"
msgstr "\"You see, Soujyuro, magecraft follows a set of common rules."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1664:14169: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0024; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1664
msgctxt "text_id=14169 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "ルーンやカバラといった魔術系統はそれぞれの科目……世界共通の<教科書|マニュアル>だと思えばいい。"
msgstr "There are different schools of magecraft, such as runes or Kabbalah. Think of them as different textbooks or manuals that the whole world uses."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1670:14170: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0025; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1670
msgctxt "text_id=14170 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　教科書さえきちんと持っているのなら、あとは血脈次第で誰でも魔術師にはなれるわ。"
msgstr "  Anyone that has a proper textbook, and a suitable bloodline, can become a mage."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1676:14171: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0026; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1676
msgctxt "text_id=14171 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　けど魔法を使うのは別。"
msgstr "  But using Magic is something else entirely."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1682:14172: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0027; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1682
msgctxt "text_id=14172 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　魔法は魔術みたいに『根源の渦』から派生した写本じゃなくて、根源の渦に直接つながる物だから」"
msgstr "  Magic, *True Magic*, isn't just some manuscript derived from the Swirl of the Root like magecraft is, but something that comes directly from the Root itself.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1714:14173: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0028_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1714
msgctxt "text_id=14173 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「この根源の渦っていうのは……"
msgstr "\"As for the Swirl of the Root, well..."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1727:14174: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0028_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1727
msgctxt "text_id=14174 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "あー、草十郎の分かるレベルに落としこむと……ま、太陽みたいなものと考えて。"
msgstr " The simplest way I can describe it so you'll understand is to compare it to the sun."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1739:14175: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0029; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1739
msgctxt "text_id=14175 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　遠くにあって、なにより初めにあるもので、それなくしては私たちは生活できない、といった」"
msgstr "  The Sun is really far away, and has been there from the beginning as far as we're concerned. Without it, you and I wouldn't be able to live.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1797:14176: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0030; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1797
msgctxt "text_id=14176 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「魔術っていうのは、この太陽からの恩恵を利用しただけのものよ。"
msgstr "\"Magecraft merely lets us take advantage of the Sun's benefits, so to speak."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1803:14177: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0031; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1803
msgctxt "text_id=14177 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　自然現象の模倣、ないし代償が魔術の本質だから。神秘を学び、実践し、再現するけど、神秘そのものを作る事はできない。"
msgstr "  Magecraft is all about imitating or paying for natural phenomena. We can use it to study, practice, and recreate Mystics―mysteries―but we can never truly create them."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1814:14178: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0032; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1814
msgctxt "text_id=14178 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　いえ、研究の末にたどり着くんでしょうけど、そこには大きな壁がある。人知では超えられない、リミッターみたいな壁がね」"
msgstr "  Actually, no matter how much you learn, you eventually hit a wall. It's like a limiter that human knowledge can never overcome.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1841:14179: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0033; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1841
msgctxt "text_id=14179 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「で、魔法っていうのは太陽そのものを扱うコト。"
msgstr "\"And beyond that wall is where Magic, the Sun itself, exists."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1859:14180: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0034; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1859
msgctxt "text_id=14180 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　誰にも到達できない場所に行って、"
msgstr "  To attain it means to go where no one can go,"

#. Occurrence 9_7:1865:14181: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0035; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1865
msgctxt "text_id=14181 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　何者にも<再現|マネ>できない奇跡を起こす。"
msgstr "  and awaken miracles no one could possibly reproduce."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1871:14182: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0036; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1871
msgctxt "text_id=14182 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　お金をかけようが時間をかけようが、今の人類には到達できない技術―――それが魔法」"
msgstr "  A technique to make things happen that humanity could never hope to accomplish with any amount of time or resources... that's *True* Magic.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1894:14183: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0037; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1894
msgctxt "text_id=14183 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「次元の壁を越えるっていうか。最後まで走ってみたら、まったく違うルールで出来た世界があって、そのルールを学んじゃった……ってとこかしら」"
msgstr "\"It's about overcoming that dimensional wall―like, running until you reach the end where you'll find a world with completely different rules from ours. That's the only way you can, well, learn it.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1915:14184: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0038; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1915
msgctxt "text_id=14184 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「前に、魔術に限界はないって言ったでしょ。あれは人知の及ぶ範囲なら限界はない、って意味ね。"
msgstr "\"I told you before that magecraft has no limits, right? Well, I meant that it has no limits within the scope of human knowledge."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1921:14185: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0039; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1921
msgctxt "text_id=14185 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　対して、魔法は限界だらけ―――っていうか、ひとつの事しかできないけど、それも当然なの。だってこの宇宙の<概念|しくみ>から仲間はずれの、ひとつっきりの光点なんだから」"
msgstr "  Meanwhile, Magic has lots of limits; actually, it can only do one thing, and one thing alone. Makes sense, right? I mean, we're talking about unique, rule-breaking concepts and mechanisms that exist outside the boundaries of the very universe.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:1967:14186: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1967
msgctxt "text_id=14186 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……魔術より魔法の方が凄い……というのは、流れ的に分かるんだけど。"
msgstr "\"So... Magic is more amazing than magecraft. I think I get the general idea, but..."

#. Occurrence 9_7:1974:14187: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0016; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:1974
msgctxt "text_id=14187 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "限界だらけ、なんだよな？」"
msgstr "It's really limited?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2001:14188: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0040; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2001
msgctxt "text_id=14188 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「限界っていうか特例、特権、越権の類ね。"
msgstr "\"Kinda. It's more like an exception, a special privilege, or an abuse of power."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2007:14189: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0041; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2007
msgctxt "text_id=14189 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　汎用性はないけど、誰にも出来ない事を可能とする時点で、魔術世界にとっては万能とされる」"
msgstr "  It's not versatile, but in making the impossible possible, it's all-powerful as far as magecraft is concerned.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2034:14190: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0042; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2034
msgctxt "text_id=14190 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そもそも魔法は『根源の渦』にたどり着いた魔術師へのご褒美みたいなもので、たとえその術者に魔法を使うだけの肉体性能がなくても、根源への<路|パス>ができただけで魔術的にはやりたい放題ってわけ。"
msgstr "\"Magic is like a reward a mage gets when reaching the Swirl of the Root, and that even goes for mages who don't possess the mettle to wield it. Just making a path to the Root gives them free reign to use it, in magecraft terms."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2046:14191: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0043; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2046
msgctxt "text_id=14191 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　要は、地球で一番のお金持ちになるってコト」"
msgstr "  In short, it's like becoming the richest person in the world.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2086:14192: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2086
msgctxt "text_id=14192 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　力強い発言に、おお、と感動する草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro made an appreciative sound, impressed."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2111:14193: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2111
msgctxt "text_id=14193 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、青子の暴論を色々改めたくて仕方のない有珠。"
msgstr "  On the other hand, Alice looked as though she wished to make many revisions to Aoko's account."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2144:14194: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0017; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2144
msgctxt "text_id=14194 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「一番の大金持ちか……じゃあ、どんなにお金持ちでも、一番目でない以上は魔法は貰えないんだな？」"
msgstr "\"The richest person in the world... In which case, does it mean that no matter how rich you are, only the richest person gets to have Magic?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2184:14195: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0044; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2184
msgctxt "text_id=14195 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――まあ、そういう事。"
msgstr "\"...I guess so, sure."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2196:14196: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0045; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2196
msgctxt "text_id=14196 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……時々とんでもない角度で核心をつくわね、コイツ……アンタの言う通り、同じ<理論|ルート>、同じ方法で根源に辿り着いても、一番目じゃないと魔法にはたどり着けない。"
msgstr "  ...Sometimes you sure get to the right conclusion from the weirdest of places. It's like you said―there are many routes and theories to reach the Root, but unless you're first to the post, Magic will elude you."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2202:14197: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0046; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2202
msgctxt "text_id=14197 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　どんなに優れていても二番目以降には意味がないのよ」"
msgstr "  No matter how good you are, if you're not the first, you're everyone else.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2233:14198: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0047; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2233
msgctxt "text_id=14198 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「魔法使いが五人……いえ、四人か。"
msgstr "\"There are only five... no, four Magicians."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2239:14199: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0048; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2239
msgctxt "text_id=14199 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　現存する魔法使いが四人しかいないのは、一度使われた<未|ル><知|ート>は<確定|とざ>されてしまうから。"
msgstr "  And there are only four because once that path to the Root has been taken by one Magician, it's closed off to all others."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2245:14200: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0049; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2245
msgctxt "text_id=14200 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　大昔はそうでもなかったって話だけどね。"
msgstr "  But it wasn't always like that, in ancient times."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2251:14201: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0050; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2251
msgctxt "text_id=14201 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　根源への路……真理への到達に壁を作ったのは、皮肉なことに人間自身だった」"
msgstr "  Ironically, mankind is responsible for closing off the paths to the Root; we've built walls that stand between us and the 'truth.'\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2276:14202: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0051; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2276
msgctxt "text_id=14202 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「未知を解明すればするほどルートが閉じていくなんて、昔の魔術師たちは思いもしなかったんでしょう。"
msgstr "\"The mages of old could never have imagined that the more we explored the unknown, the more paths we would seal off."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2282:14203: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0052; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2282
msgctxt "text_id=14203 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　でも結果はこの通り、気が付いた時には後の祭りっていうか。多くの研鑽の末、この世から魔法は消えていっちゃったワケ」"
msgstr "  But the result was exactly that, and by the time they realized it, it was too late. After all that studying, True Magic had all but disappeared from the world.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2327:14204: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0018; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2327
msgctxt "text_id=14204 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……ふーん。それは、山と町の関係に似てる……と思っていいのかな」"
msgstr "\"...Huh. So it's kind of like how the city has dwarfed the countryside, then?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2360:14205: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0053; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2360
msgctxt "text_id=14205 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ミクロな視点で言うなら、似たようなものよ。"
msgstr "\"In a microscopic sense, that example works."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2372:14206: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0054; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2372
msgctxt "text_id=14206 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　で―――つい最近まで、現代の魔術師たちは残された最後の席を求めていたけど、それもちょっと前にどこぞの田舎者が横取りしちゃって、イス取りゲームはあえなく終了。"
msgstr "  So... up until recently, modern mages have been vying for that final seat in a game of magical musical chairs, but some country bumpkin snagged it a while ago, so their little race is over."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2378:14207: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0055; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2378
msgctxt "text_id=14207 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あとは魔法抜きで根源にたどり着くため、地味で無意味な魔術の研究を続ける事になった」"
msgstr "  After that, all further research into the Root was limited to mundane and meaningless magecraft.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2405:14208: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0056; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2405
msgctxt "text_id=14208 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ま、もともと魔法なんてのを優先してたのは一部の魔術師だけで、他のまっとうな連中はとっくに見切りをつけてたんだけどね。"
msgstr "\"Though, only a small fraction of mages were chasing Magic anyway, while the rest had already thrown in the towel."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2417:14209: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0057; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2417
msgctxt "text_id=14209 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　だって、魔術師にとって最終目的は根源の渦への到達であって魔法じゃないし。"
msgstr "  Magic gained from reaching the Swirl of the Root isn't necessarily a mage's only goal."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2423:14210: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0058; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2423
msgctxt "text_id=14210 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　そのあたりいつのまにかごっちゃになっちゃったんでしょ。卵が先か鶏が先かって話」"
msgstr "  But that's a whole other convoluted mess in itself. The chicken or the egg dilemma, if you will.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2466:14211: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0019; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2466
msgctxt "text_id=14211 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……よし。まったく分からないってコトは分かったんで、そろそろ本題に入ってくれ。"
msgstr "\"...Okay. Well, I at least understand that I understand absolutely nothing. Do you mind if we get to the point?"

#. Occurrence 9_7:2478:14212: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0020; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2478
msgctxt "text_id=14212 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　あ。けど、一番目の人間しか魔法使いになれないのに、魔法使いは何人もいるのか？」"
msgstr "  Oh, right. How can there be multiple wielders of True Magic if only the first one there can learn it?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2524:14213: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0059; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2524
msgctxt "text_id=14213 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「五人いたわ。最終的に、人間に残される最後の課題は五つだろうって一番初めの―――」"
msgstr "\"Well, there were five at one time. There were five final tasks left to humanity, so the first―\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2552:14214: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_7_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2552
msgctxt "text_id=14214 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「青子」"
msgstr "\"Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2598:14215: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0060; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2598
msgctxt "text_id=14215 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――じゃ、本題ね。"
msgstr "\"...Right, to the point."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2604:14216: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0061; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2604
msgctxt "text_id=14216 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　魔法と魔術の関係が分かったところで、ようやくうちの話になるんだけど」"
msgstr "  Now that I've explained the relationship between magecraft and Magic, I can finally talk about my family.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2631:14217: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0062; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2631
msgctxt "text_id=14217 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「蒼崎の家が代々魔術師だったのは前に言ったでしょ？"
msgstr "\"Remember when I mentioned that the Aozaki family has been mages for generations?"

#. Occurrence 9_7:2637:14218: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0063; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2637
msgctxt "text_id=14218 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　歴史的には浅いけど、運と才能には恵まれていたのね。"
msgstr "  Our history isn't ancient, but we've been blessed with good luck and talent,"

#. Occurrence 9_7:2643:14219: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0064; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2643
msgctxt "text_id=14219 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　蒼崎は、なんだかんだって魔法にまで辿り着いたんだから」"
msgstr "  because somehow or another, an Aozaki finally attained True Magic.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2678:14220: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0021; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2678
msgctxt "text_id=14220 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――ちょっと待った。じゃあ、蒼崎が、その、」"
msgstr "\"Hold on just a second. Aozaki, so you mean―\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2705:14221: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0065; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2705
msgctxt "text_id=14221 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「私はあくまで魔術師見習い。"
msgstr "\"I'm an apprentice mage, nothing more."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2711:14222: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0066; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2711
msgctxt "text_id=14222 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　使えないし、使う気もないわよ、魔法なんて。私はただ、蒼崎の家を継いだだけだもの」"
msgstr "  I can't wield Magic, nor do I want to. I'm just the successor to the Aozaki family.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2741:14223: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2741
msgctxt "text_id=14223 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は簡潔に、感情のない声で言い切った。"
msgstr "  Aoko asserted obtusely, her voice devoid of emotion."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2746:14224: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2746
msgctxt "text_id=14224 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法使いになるために魔術師になったのではなく、"
msgstr "  She became a mage not to wield Magic,"

#. Occurrence 9_7:2751:14225: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2751
msgctxt "text_id=14225 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎の家を継ぐコトになったから、魔術師として生きていく道を選んだのだと。"
msgstr "  but simply because the succession of her family's magecraft was forced on her."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2786:14226: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0067; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2786
msgctxt "text_id=14226 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ま、とにかく。"
msgstr "\"Anyway..."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2825:14227: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0068; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2825
msgctxt "text_id=14227 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　根源の渦に辿り着くには、何代も何代も魔術を研究しなくちゃいけない。自分独自の川を造るようなものなんだから、もちろんその過程は果てがない。"
msgstr "  in order to reach the Swirl of the Root, generations upon generations of mages have to dedicate their lives to research. Since every special snowflake is trying a unique approach and doesn't want to share, it obviously takes forever."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2837:14228: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0069; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2837
msgctxt "text_id=14228 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　よほどの天賦か天啓でもないかぎり魔法を創るなんてできないしね」"
msgstr "  At any rate, you can't create Magic unless you have the innate ability to, or through some sort of divine intervention.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2873:14229: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0070; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2873
msgctxt "text_id=14229 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そしてもし根源に辿り着いても、相応しい後継者がいなければ一代かぎりの奇跡で終わってしまう。"
msgstr "\"Just making it to the Root isn't enough. If you lack a worthy heir to pass it on to, the miracle stops there. So much for your lineage."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2879:14230: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0071; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2879
msgctxt "text_id=14230 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　だから魔術師は血脈を重ねて、代々の魔力を次代に積み重ねていく。自分より勝れた後継者を生むために」"
msgstr "  That's why mages cultivate their bloodlines, to pass magical energy from one generation to the next, and to create an heir more powerful than oneself.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2899:14231: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2899
msgctxt "text_id=14231 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　要するにサラブレッドを作っているのよ、と青子は一度話を切った。"
msgstr "  Aoko wrapped up the explanation by remarking that it was like producing a thoroughbred."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2904:14232: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2904
msgctxt "text_id=14232 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もともと草十郎に理解させる気はこれっぽっちもないので、サラブレッド？　と首をひねる草十郎を華麗にスルーする。"
msgstr "  Not that Soujyuro knew what a thoroughbred was to begin with, leaving him as perplexed at the end of the story as he was at the beginning."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2933:14233: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0072; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2933
msgctxt "text_id=14233 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうやって代を重ねて、魔術師は作り上げた独自の神秘、守り続けた魔術を次の世代に伝えていくの。"
msgstr "\"So mages pass along their uniquely created Mystics to later generations, protecting their legacy in the process."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2939:14234: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0073; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2939
msgctxt "text_id=14234 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　きっと最後の最後に、全ての疑問を打ち消すに足る答えがある筈だって」"
msgstr "  And at the very end, they say that there should be an answer sufficient enough to satisfy all our questions.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:2967:14235: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0074; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2967
msgctxt "text_id=14235 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でも魔術師―――いえ、魔法使いだって、みんな悟ってるのよ。"
msgstr "\"But, you see, mages―no, Magicians too―all understand one very important thing:"

#. Occurrence 9_7:2973:14236: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0075; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2973
msgctxt "text_id=14236 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　自分の代でも、その次の代でも、きっと最後の最後の最後まで、誰もゴールには辿り着けないって結末を。"
msgstr "  their own generation, and every single one thereafter, will all die before they ever reach their ultimate goal."

#. Occurrence 9_7:2999:14237: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0076; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:2999
msgctxt "text_id=14237 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それを解っていながら魔術を研究していくのが神秘学に取り憑かれた者の宿命だって、祖父はよく口にしてた。"
msgstr "  My grandfather always used to say that it was the destiny of those who obsess over Mystics to end up learning only magecraft."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3005:14238: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0077; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3005
msgctxt "text_id=14238 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　けど、私の姉はそうじゃなかったみたい」"
msgstr "  Funny how my sister didn't turn out like that...\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3045:14239: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3045
msgctxt "text_id=14239 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その気持ちも分かるけどね、と青子はひとり呟く。"
msgstr "  She left \"I can see why\" hanging in the air."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3064:14240: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3064
msgctxt "text_id=14240 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はそれには無反応だ。"
msgstr "  Alice had no response."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3079:14241: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3079
msgctxt "text_id=14241 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法を伝える蒼崎の家。"
msgstr "  The Aozaki family, passing down True Magic..."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3088:14242: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3088
msgctxt "text_id=14242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その後継者となった青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko, the reluctant successor."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3102:14243: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3102
msgctxt "text_id=14243 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして―――青子の姉である蒼崎橙子。"
msgstr "  And Touko Aozaki, her elder sister."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3123:14244: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0078; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3123
msgctxt "text_id=14244 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ほんとは、蒼崎の後継者は姉貴だった。"
msgstr "\"Actually, my sister was the Aozaki heir."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3129:14245: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0079; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3129
msgctxt "text_id=14245 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私もうちの家業がなんであるかは教えられてきたけど、実践する事はなかったのよ。"
msgstr "  They told me about the family legacy, but I never had to learn any of it."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3135:14246: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0080; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3135
msgctxt "text_id=14246 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　魔術師の家系はよっぽど裕福でもないかぎり、基本的に一子相伝だからね。うち、ホント財力的には一般家庭レベルだし」"
msgstr "  For mage lineages, unless they're super rich, they usually only raise one heir. I guess that wasn't the case for an average income household like ours...\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3183:14247: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0081; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3183
msgctxt "text_id=14247 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「で、後継者にはより魔術に適した者が選ばれるワケだけど……姉貴はたしかに天才だった。"
msgstr "\"Successors are supposed to be chosen based on their affinity for magecraft... and in that sense, my sister was definitely a prodigy."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3189:14248: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0082; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3189
msgctxt "text_id=14248 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　けどそれは、蒼崎の後継者にはいらない才能だった」"
msgstr "  But, her talent just wasn't fit for an heir, for whatever reason.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3216:14249: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0083; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3216
msgctxt "text_id=14249 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そのかわり、私は心底蒼崎の後継者として相応しかったみたい。"
msgstr "\"Instead, I turned out to be more suited to succeed it."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3222:14250: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0084; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3222
msgctxt "text_id=14250 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……まあ、それはそれでどうも思わないけど、祖父がはっきりと私に鞍替えしたのが十五歳の冬の頃でさ。"
msgstr "  And... while I don't really agree with him, my grandfather seemed dead set on switching it over to me during the winter when I was fifteen."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3228:14251: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0085; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3228
msgctxt "text_id=14251 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　姉貴はいきなり、四つ年下で、今まで魔術に関わってなかった妹に魔法の相続権利を奪われたってワケよ」"
msgstr "  To my sister, I suddenly stole her entire birthright, while not only being four years younger, but also lacking any magical knowledge.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3263:14252: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0022; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3263
msgctxt "text_id=14252 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「…………そうか、それで」"
msgstr "\"I see. So that's why.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3281:14253: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3281
msgctxt "text_id=14253 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……私にはその<義|・><務|・>がある、と。"
msgstr "  Touko had said that she was \"obligated\" to take what was Aoko's."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3300:14254: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3300
msgctxt "text_id=14254 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子は、憎しみに満ちた声で言い切ったのだ。"
msgstr "  He recalled how resentful her voice had been when she said it."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3341:14255: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0086; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3341
msgctxt "text_id=14255 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「<姉貴|あのひと>がどんな思いをしたか、私は本人じゃないから知らないけど。"
msgstr "\"I'm not her, so I don't know how she feels about the whole thing."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3347:14256: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0087; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3347
msgctxt "text_id=14256 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　祖父と言い争って、今まで愛用してた眼鏡を叩き壊して家を出ていったのが三年と半年前。"
msgstr "  It's been three and a half years since she fought with grandfather, smashed her glasses, and left our home."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3353:14257: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0088; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3353
msgctxt "text_id=14257 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それからまったく消息なしで、私は姉の代わりになったの。これが、私と姉貴の争う原因でしょうね」"
msgstr "  No one has heard from her since then, and I became her replacement. I guess this is why we're squabbling.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3391:14258: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3391
msgctxt "text_id=14258 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かなり重い話だと草十郎は思うのだけど、青子の声はさっぱりしている。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro thought the story was tragic, but Aoko's voice had a tone of relief in it."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3396:14259: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3396
msgctxt "text_id=14259 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが幼い頃から植え付けられた魔術師の思考だとしたら、同情すべきはどちらにあるのだろうか。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro did not know exactly who he should feel bad for anymore."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3433:14260: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0023; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3433
msgctxt "text_id=14260 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……眼鏡を壊した、か」"
msgstr "\"She...broke her glasses?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3452:14261: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0089; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3452
msgctxt "text_id=14261 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そう。あの人、昔はすっごく目が良かった。生まれながら魔眼を持ってたって化物だからね。"
msgstr "\"Correct. Her eyesight has always been perfect. The bitch was even born with Mystic Eyes."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3458:14262: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0090; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3458
msgctxt "text_id=14262 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　けど祖父の期待に応えようとして、無理して頑張ったあげく視力が下がっちゃったみたい」"
msgstr "  But in trying to live up to our grandfather's expectations, she probably overdid it and her eyes suffered as a result.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3496:14263: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3496
msgctxt "text_id=14263 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんだかねー、と呆れる青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko wrestled with the memory, not sure if she had everything down exactly right."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3517:14264: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3517
msgctxt "text_id=14264 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の冷徹さを知っている草十郎だが、さすがに今のは見ていて気持ちのいいものではない。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro knew how well Aoko could hide her emotions, and this was not one of those moments."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3549:14265: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0091; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3549
msgctxt "text_id=14265 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「けど、あれに何の意味があったんだろう。"
msgstr "\"You know, now that I think of it, was Touko trying to give him a message?"

#. Occurrence 9_7:3555:14266: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0092; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3555
msgctxt "text_id=14266 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　眼鏡を<祖父|じじい>に叩きつけるぐらいなら、フィンの一撃でも叩きこめば良かったのに。"
msgstr "  Why did she throw her glasses at my grandfather, when she could have smoked him with a single Finn Shot?"

#. Occurrence 9_7:3561:14267: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0093; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3561
msgctxt "text_id=14267 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あの人、あの頃が才能のピークだったんだし、<耄碌|もうろく>した<祖|じ><父|じい>なんてそれこそ一撃だったと思うんだけど……」"
msgstr "  She was in her prime back then, so she could have wiped a senile old man out in an instant if she had wanted to.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3602:14268: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3602
msgctxt "text_id=14268 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はて、と今更ながら考えこむ青子に、草十郎はうつむいて批難する。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro shook his head, disappointed at Aoko's misjudgment of the situation."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3630:14269: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0024; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3630
msgctxt "text_id=14269 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「恨み辛みの話じゃない。"
msgstr "\"This isn't about any grudge."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3642:14270: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0025; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3642
msgctxt "text_id=14270 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……その眼鏡は、大事な物だったんだ。だってそれは、誰にだって分かる努力の証なんだから。"
msgstr "  Those glasses... They were important to her. It was a symbol of all of her efforts that everyone could see."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3648:14271: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0026; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3648
msgctxt "text_id=14271 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　それを叩きつけたんだ。痛かったんだろうな、橙子さんは。思い出を、自分で壊さなくちゃいけないぐらいに」"
msgstr "  To break them like that... it must have been painful. Painful enough for her to feel like she had to break them.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3688:14272: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3688
msgctxt "text_id=14272 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう語る草十郎自身、痛みをかみ殺している事に青子も有珠も気付かない。"
msgstr "  As Soujyuro spoke, neither Aoko nor Alice noticed the grief he was fighting to hold in."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3693:14273: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3693
msgctxt "text_id=14273 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　というより、二人には草十郎の心情が理解できない。"
msgstr "  Or more accurately, they could not understand his point of view."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3698:14274: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3698
msgctxt "text_id=14274 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術師として育てられ、戦うべき敵として認識しあう彼女たちには、そういった感傷は必要ないからだ。"
msgstr "  After all, in a world where mages are raised to fight other mages, empathy was in short supply."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3735:14275: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_9_7_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3735
msgctxt "text_id=14275 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……けど、どうして今ごろになって戻ってきたのかしら。青子の言う通り、橙子さんならもっと早く三咲市を奪えたのに」"
msgstr "\"I wonder why she chose to come back now. Like Aoko said, Touko could have taken Misaki City any time she wanted to.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3755:14276: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0094; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3755
msgctxt "text_id=14276 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうね。そんなに土地が欲しかったのなら、三年前に私を殺せば後継者に戻れたのに。"
msgstr "\"That's right. If she wanted this land so badly, she should have come back three years ago, killed me, and reclaimed her rights."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3767:14277: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0095; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3767
msgctxt "text_id=14277 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……世間の荒波にもまれて気が変わったとか……？」"
msgstr "  ...Maybe she had a change of heart after seeing the world, I dunno.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3788:14278: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0027; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3788
msgctxt "text_id=14278 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「違う。蒼崎は本当に分からないのか」"
msgstr "\"You really don't get it, do you, Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3808:14279: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3808
msgctxt "text_id=14279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　微かな<憤|いきどお>りが草十郎を揺り動かす。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro shook with a faint anger."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3813:14280: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3813
msgctxt "text_id=14280 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その声は、二人の知っている少年とは少しだけ違っていた。"
msgstr "  His voice changed from the boy they thought they knew."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3855:14281: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0096; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3855
msgctxt "text_id=14281 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「な、なによ。アンタなら分かるっていうの？」"
msgstr "\"Oh, and you do?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3861:14282: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0028; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3861
msgctxt "text_id=14282 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「誰だって分かる。"
msgstr "\"Yes, like anyone would."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3887:14283: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0029; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3887
msgctxt "text_id=14283 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　橙子さんは、蒼崎が一人前になるまで待っていたんだ。自分が失った物と同じぐらい、大切な物を無くさせるために。そうしないとどうにもならない。そこまでしなくちゃいけないほど、あの人の怒りは深かったんだ」"
msgstr "  Touko was waiting for you to become a fully-fledged mage so that you would lose the same thing that was stolen from her. That's how deep her hurt and hatred goes.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:3966:14284: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3966
msgctxt "text_id=14284 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんでそれが分からない、と草十郎は二人を見据える。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro gazed at them, wondering why they could not see what he could."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3971:14285: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3971
msgctxt "text_id=14285 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、分かっていないのは彼の方だ。"
msgstr "  Only, he was the one that did not understand."

#. Occurrence 9_7:3976:14286: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:3976
msgctxt "text_id=14286 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そういった人間らしい関係を、彼女たちは、何より蒼崎橙子は、一番初めに断っているのだから。"
msgstr "  The two girls, and above all Touko Aozaki, deny themselves the type of relationships that other normal people are allowed to experience."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4008:14287: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4008
msgctxt "text_id=14287 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子を動かしているのは憎しみではない。"
msgstr "  Touko's actions were not fueled by hatred."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4013:14288: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4013
msgctxt "text_id=14288 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしかにそれもあるにはあるが、彼女を突き動かす最大の理由は魔法に至ること一点。"
msgstr "  While there certainly was hatred behind them, the real reason was and always has been Touko's pursuit of True Magic."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4018:14289: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4018
msgctxt "text_id=14289 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は貪欲で優秀な魔術師であり、憎しみなど後付の<外皮|りゆう>でしかない。"
msgstr "  She was an ambitious and talented mage; her hatred was only her veneer."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4023:14290: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4023
msgctxt "text_id=14290 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを間違えては、なにより、魔術に己を捧げた姉を侮辱する事になる。"
msgstr "  Thinking of her in any other way would be an insult to the elder sister who devoted her life to the study of magecraft."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4056:14291: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4056
msgctxt "text_id=14291 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう口にしようとして、青子は止めた。"
msgstr "  All of this Aoko wanted to tell Soujyuro, but instead stopped herself."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4061:14292: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4061
msgctxt "text_id=14292 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術師でもない草十郎に言っても意味がないし、彼にその事実を突きつけるのは面白くない。"
msgstr "  Even if she had, Soujyuro was not a mage and could never understand, and besides, arguing with him any further would not have brought her any joy."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4066:14293: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4066
msgctxt "text_id=14293 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言語化できないが、それはしたくないと思ってしまった。"
msgstr "  She could not have put it into words even if she had tried."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4071:14294: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4071
msgctxt "text_id=14294 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なので―――"
msgstr "  And so..."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4105:14295: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0097; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4105
msgctxt "text_id=14295 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ふーん。やけに姉貴の肩を持つじゃない、草十郎。"
msgstr "\"Hmmm... You sure are taking her side a lot, Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4111:14296: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0098; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4111
msgctxt "text_id=14296 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　もしかして、一目惚れでもした？」"
msgstr "  Could it be... love at first sight?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:4136:14297: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4136
msgctxt "text_id=14297 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分でも卑怯と思う方法で、青子は逃げた。"
msgstr "  In her own cowardly way, Aoko dodged the subject."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4141:14298: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4141
msgctxt "text_id=14298 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　にやっと笑う青子。"
msgstr "  She smirked childishly."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4182:14299: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0030; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4182
msgctxt "text_id=14299 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「肩ぐらい持つ。あの人は、可哀相な人だからな」"
msgstr "\"I get how she feels, a little. I pity her.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:4236:14300: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4236
msgctxt "text_id=14300 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、草十郎はまったく動じていなかった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro did not take the bait."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4241:14301: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4241
msgctxt "text_id=14301 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこまで言われては青子もカチンとくる。"
msgstr "  Aoko was frustrated at his reply."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4253:14302: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0099; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4253
msgctxt "text_id=14302 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なぜ？」"
msgstr "\"And why, might I ask?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:4258:14303: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4258
msgctxt "text_id=14303 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　作り笑いを消して、真剣な眼差しで青子は問いかけた。"
msgstr "  An icy glare replaced her smile."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4278:14304: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4278
msgctxt "text_id=14304 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎に<躊躇|ためら>いはない。"
msgstr "  He did not falter,"

#. Occurrence 9_7:4283:14305: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4283
msgctxt "text_id=14305 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は当然のように、"
msgstr "  only plainly stating,"

#. Occurrence 9_7:4310:14306: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0031; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4310
msgctxt "text_id=14306 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「だって実の妹と争わなくちゃいけないんだろ。"
msgstr "\"Because she has to fight her only sister."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4336:14307: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_7_0032; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4336
msgctxt "text_id=14307 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　それは可哀相な事じゃないのか？」"
msgstr "  That's sad, isn't it?\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:4359:14308: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4359
msgctxt "text_id=14308 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何に対して怒っているのかを明言した。"
msgstr "  This was the source of his frustration."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4387:14309: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0100; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4387
msgctxt "text_id=14309 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「…………たしかに、ね」"
msgstr "\"...It's sad, all right.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:4393:14310: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4393
msgctxt "text_id=14310 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　知らず、青子は目を細めた。"
msgstr "  Aoko's eyes narrowed unconsciously,"

#. Occurrence 9_7:4398:14311: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4398
msgctxt "text_id=14311 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　胸を衝かれた事実を隠すように。"
msgstr "  as if hiding from a painful truth."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4403:14312: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4403
msgctxt "text_id=14312 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　コイツは毒だな、と思いながら。"
msgstr "  \"This guy is a poison,\" she thought to herself."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4408:14313: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4408
msgctxt "text_id=14313 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　薬にもなりはしない。この男の言葉は、知らず知らずのうちに自分の弱い部分を浮き彫りにする、と。"
msgstr "  A poison with no antidote; with his words, he was unwittingly bringing her weakness to light."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4441:14314: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0101; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4441
msgctxt "text_id=14314 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「だけど私も姉貴も、それをなんとも思ってないのよ。"
msgstr "\"My sister and I... We don't think of it in that way, though."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4447:14315: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_7_0102; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4447
msgctxt "text_id=14315 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　だって、それ以外に解決策はないんだから」"
msgstr "  To us, this was always the way it would turn out.\""

#. Occurrence 9_7:4453:14316: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4453
msgctxt "text_id=14316 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の答えに、草十郎はそうか、と表情を曇らせる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro looked down and frowned in defeat."

#. Occurrence 9_7:4458:14317: scene=9_7
#: 9_7:4458
msgctxt "text_id=14317 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「それも、悲しい話だね」と呟いて。"
msgstr "\"And that's sad too,\" he muttered."

#. Occurrence 9_8:81:14318: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:81
msgctxt "text_id=14318 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜の<帳|とばり>はとっくに落ちている。"
msgstr "  The curtain of night had already fallen."

#. Occurrence 9_8:101:14319: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:101
msgctxt "text_id=14319 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子が去ってからまだ一時間も経っていないのに、草十郎には彼女の顔がひどく遠いものに感じられた。"
msgstr "  Not even an hour had passed since Touko left the estate, and Soujyuro was feeling the distance between him and the girls."

#. Occurrence 9_8:106:14320: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:106
msgctxt "text_id=14320 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子と有珠にしてみれば、現在の蒼崎橙子の姿は幻よりさらに遠いに違いない。"
msgstr "  Aoko and Alice felt much the same way about Touko Aozaki, who seemed more elusive than a phantom."

#. Occurrence 9_8:138:14321: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_8_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:138
msgctxt "text_id=14321 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「とにかく！　姉貴が敵だって事は草十郎にも分かったでしょう？　ならつべこべ言わず、君子危うきに近寄らずよ！"
msgstr "\"Anyway! Soujyuro, you at least understand that she's our enemy, right? If so, stop arguing with me, and let sleeping bears lie!"

#. Occurrence 9_8:144:14322: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_8_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:144
msgctxt "text_id=14322 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……ま、姉貴もアンタと会って、私たちとはまったくの無関係だって分かっただろうから、そっちには手を出してこないでしょうけど」"
msgstr "  Although, after meeting you, she must have realized that you have nothing to do with us, so I doubt we need to worry about her going after you.\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:177:14323: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:177
msgctxt "text_id=14323 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから安全、気にするな、と青子は胸を張る。"
msgstr "  Aoko seemed absolutely certain in her assessment, as if to proclaim that Soujyuro had dodged a bullet."

#. Occurrence 9_8:182:14324: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:182
msgctxt "text_id=14324 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おかしな話だが、たとえ敵であっても橙子の合理性を青子は信頼しきっていた。"
msgstr "  Strangely, she was placing her trust in her enemy's sense of reason."

#. Occurrence 9_8:224:14325: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_8_0000_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:224
msgctxt "text_id=14325 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……そうかな。……そうなのかな。"
msgstr "\"...Really? ...Are you sure about that?"

#. Occurrence 9_8:251:14326: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_8_0000_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:251
msgctxt "text_id=14326 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "……そうだといいんだけどな」"
msgstr "I hope you're right...\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:257:14327: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_8_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:257
msgctxt "text_id=14327 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうだから安心なさい。昔から要らない物には手を出さないんだから、あの人は」"
msgstr "\"Really. So relax; she never paid any attention to things that were of no use to her anyway.\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:283:14328: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_8_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:283
msgctxt "text_id=14328 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そっか。蒼崎がそこまで言うなら安心する。"
msgstr "\"Okay. If you say so, Aozaki, then that's good enough for me."

#. Occurrence 9_8:294:14329: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_8_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:294
msgctxt "text_id=14329 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　あ、要らない物っていえば、橙子さんが蒼崎のティーカップを貰うって。セーブルのやつ」"
msgstr "  Oh, right. Speaking of things she has no use for, Touko took your teacup. The nice Sèvres one.\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:326:14330: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_8_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:326
msgctxt "text_id=14330 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え……ちょ、ちょっと待って！"
msgstr "\"She did WHAT!?"

#. Occurrence 9_8:332:14331: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_8_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:332
msgctxt "text_id=14331 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　アンタ、それを黙って見てたっていうの!?」"
msgstr "  And you just stood by and let her!?\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:338:14332: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_8_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:338
msgctxt "text_id=14332 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうだけど。……む。やっぱりあれは奪っていったのか」"
msgstr "\"I did. ...So she really was stealing it after all, huh.\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:379:14333: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:379
msgctxt "text_id=14333 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　怒る青子に、草十郎はなるほど、と納得する。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded sagely, while Aoko fumed."

#. Occurrence 9_8:384:14334: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:384
msgctxt "text_id=14334 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さっきまでの深刻な顔つきと口調はどこへいったのか。"
msgstr "  She wondered where his serious manner and tone had gone."

#. Occurrence 9_8:389:14335: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:389
msgctxt "text_id=14335 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今ここにいやがるのは、いつものぼんやりとした草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's frustrating absentmindedness had returned."

#. Occurrence 9_8:439:14336: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_8_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:439
msgctxt "text_id=14336 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「しかもセーブルのカップって、私の一番のお気に入り……」"
msgstr "\"It had to be the Sèvres cup too... my favorite one.\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:445:14337: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:445
msgctxt "text_id=14337 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぬぬぬ、と拳を震わす青子だが、草十郎の<暢気顔|のんきがお>を殴りつけるワケにもいかない。"
msgstr "  Aoko's fist trembled violently, but as much as she wanted to, she knew better than to plant it into Soujyuro's carefree face."

#. Occurrence 9_8:450:14338: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:450
msgctxt "text_id=14338 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もし草十郎が橙子を止めていたら大惨事だったろうし、なにより草十郎に、あの姉を止められた筈もないのである。"
msgstr "  Not that he was even capable, but even if Soujyuro did try to stop Touko, it would have gone tragically for him."

#. Occurrence 9_8:496:14339: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_8_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:496
msgctxt "text_id=14339 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……仕方ないか。そういえばあの人、よく私の持ち物を奪っていったっけ。"
msgstr "\"...Nothing to do now, I guess. She always did have a habit of stealing my things."

#. Occurrence 9_8:503:14340: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_8_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:503
msgctxt "text_id=14340 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "他人の物を欲しがるクセ、まだ治ってないんだ」"
msgstr "Always wanting what others have... I guess old habits die hard.\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:509:14341: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_8_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:509
msgctxt "text_id=14341 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「？　子供の頃は、みんなそうなんじゃないのか？」"
msgstr "\"Isn't everybody like that, as children?\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:530:14342: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:530
msgctxt "text_id=14342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つい聞き返してしまう草十郎。"
msgstr "  He wondered aloud, curiously."

#. Occurrence 9_8:569:14343: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_8_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:569
msgctxt "text_id=14343 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうかな。私のクレヨンとか人形とかとっても仕方ないと思うけど。どうせ粉々にしちゃうんだし」"
msgstr "\"Maybe. So many of my crayons and dolls, she took as she pleased... And broke them, too.\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:575:14344: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:575
msgctxt "text_id=14344 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その言葉に草十郎は息を呑んだ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro felt his heart jump into his mouth."

#. Occurrence 9_8:580:14345: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:580
msgctxt "text_id=14345 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なにかいま、不吉な意味が含まれていた気がする。"
msgstr "  The ominous foreshadowing was not lost on him."

#. Occurrence 9_8:601:14346: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_8_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:601
msgctxt "text_id=14346 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「………それは、どういう？」"
msgstr "\"Why... do you think that was?\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:622:14347: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_8_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:622
msgctxt "text_id=14347 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「だから、あの人って私の持ち物を横取りしてはぶっ壊すのが趣味なのよ。苦節十四年、姉貴に目をつけられて無事だった物なんてひとつも無いもの」"
msgstr "\"Because she made a hobby out of taking my property and smashing it to pieces, obviously! Once she had her eye on something, I had to kiss it goodbye.\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:644:14348: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_8_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:644
msgctxt "text_id=14348 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「…………………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:664:14349: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:664
msgctxt "text_id=14349 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の独白を聞いて、草十郎は橙子との会話を思い出す。"
msgstr "  Listening to Aoko, Soujyuro recalled his conversation with Touko."

#. Occurrence 9_8:669:14350: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:669
msgctxt "text_id=14350 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……気のせいだといいのだけど、彼女はしきりに静希草十郎を、誰かさんの持ち物だと決め付けていたような……。"
msgstr "  He hoped he was imagining it, but he vaguely recalled her declaring Soujyuro Sizuki as someone's property..."

#. Occurrence 9_8:695:14351: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_8_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:695
msgctxt "text_id=14351 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……それは……ちょっと、難儀だな」"
msgstr "\"That... is troubling.\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:701:14352: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:701
msgctxt "text_id=14352 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手強い難問に出会った刑事よろしく、顔をしかめて呟く草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's face turned grim, not unlike a detective at the scene of a crime―"

#. Occurrence 9_8:706:14353: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:706
msgctxt "text_id=14353 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　解決策がまったく見つからないあたりまで、ホントよく似ている。"
msgstr "  a scene which left no traces of evidence or clues as to how the case could be solved."

#. Occurrence 9_8:738:14354: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_8_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:738
msgctxt "text_id=14354 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でしょ？　ひどい姉貴なのよ、あの人って」"
msgstr "\"Right? She was a terrible sister. The worst.\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:744:14355: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:744
msgctxt "text_id=14355 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の気持ちも知らず、青子は気楽に答えて紅茶を飲んだ。"
msgstr "  Unaware of Soujyuro's turmoil, Aoko calmly sipped her tea."

#. Occurrence 9_8:749:14356: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:749
msgctxt "text_id=14356 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　肩をすくめる青子を半眼で見つめながら、草十郎は居間の時計に目をやった。気分がどんなに<陰欝|いんうつ>でも、時間だけはきっちりと回っている。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro watched as Aoko shrugged her shoulders before looking over to the drawing room clock. No matter how heavy the mood, time kept on ticking."

#. Occurrence 9_8:781:14357: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_8_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:781
msgctxt "text_id=14357 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……明日から、大変になるね」"
msgstr "\"...Gloomy days ahead, I guess,\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:787:14358: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:787
msgctxt "text_id=14358 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぽつりと呟く本日最大の被害者。"
msgstr "  muttered the undeniable victim of today's injustices."

#. Occurrence 9_8:792:14359: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:792
msgctxt "text_id=14359 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこに、青子はからっとした趣で付け足した。"
msgstr "  Aoko looked ready to move on from the incident, adding,"

#. Occurrence 9_8:834:14360: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_9_8_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:834
msgctxt "text_id=14360 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうね。でも今は、そんな事より今日の夕飯のが楽しみなんだ、私」"
msgstr "\"Probably. But right now, I'm just looking forward to tonight's dinner.\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:874:14361: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:874
msgctxt "text_id=14361 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の意見に、有珠も賛同するように黙りこんでいる。"
msgstr "  Alice seemed to second that opinion with her silence."

#. Occurrence 9_8:879:14362: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:879
msgctxt "text_id=14362 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ゆったりくつろぐふたりは、夕飯が用意されるまでソファーから動く意志が、見事なまでに皆無だった。"
msgstr "  Comfortable and relaxed, neither of them seemed to have any intention of leaving the sofa to prepare food."

#. Occurrence 9_8:914:14363: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_8_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:914
msgctxt "text_id=14363 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence 9_8:920:14364: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:920
msgctxt "text_id=14364 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしかに夜のアルバイトはない。"
msgstr "  Tonight was supposed to be his night off from work..."

#. Occurrence 9_8:925:14365: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:925
msgctxt "text_id=14365 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど深夜となると話は別だ。"
msgstr "  ...at least, until midnight."

#. Occurrence 9_8:930:14366: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:930
msgctxt "text_id=14366 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これから本当にアルバイトが待っている草十郎にとって、ふたりの期待は苛酷な命令以外の何物でもない。"
msgstr "  But Soujyuro knew that until the clock struck midnight, he would be serving on hand and foot the two ladies of the house."

#. Occurrence 9_8:950:14367: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:950
msgctxt "text_id=14367 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも、今から調理したら食べるのは一時間後になってしまう。"
msgstr "  For one, it would take at least another hour to prepare something to eat."

#. Occurrence 9_8:955:14368: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:955
msgctxt "text_id=14368 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなコトを何やら疲れきったふたりが容認するはずもなく、となると結局、残された手段は出前のみ。"
msgstr "  And there was no way the exhausted Aoko and Alice would stand for that, so the only other option, in the end, was to have something delivered."

#. Occurrence 9_8:988:14369: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_9_8_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=9_8
#: 9_8:988
msgctxt "text_id=14369 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "“……なんと。橙子さんに付いていけば良かったかもしれないな、俺”"
msgstr "(Maybe I should have taken Touko up on her offer after all.)"

#. Occurrence 9_8:995:14370: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:995
msgctxt "text_id=14370 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　グチをこぼしつつ、草十郎はお財布の中身を確かめた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro opened his wallet as he second-guessed his situation."

#. Occurrence 9_8:1000:14371: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:1000
msgctxt "text_id=14371 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　慎ましげに残っている三枚目の諭吉は、別れを惜しむようにしかめっ面をしている。"
msgstr "  His eyes settled on the third and final ten-thousand yen bill in his wallet. It stared back at him forlornly, reluctant to leave its home."

#. Occurrence 9_8:1005:14372: scene=9_8
#: 9_8:1005
msgctxt "text_id=14372 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが、草十郎にはちょこっとだけ痛かった。"
msgstr "  With a heavy heart, he bid it farewell."

#. Occurrence A_0:44:14373: scene=A_0
#: A_0:44
msgctxt "text_id=14373 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とりあえずは、そんな日常の話から。"
msgstr "  This everyday tale started like any other."

#. Occurrence A_0:129:14374: scene=A_0
#: A_0:129
msgctxt "text_id=14374 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　星の運びは、今日一日を労働に<捧|ささ>げるべしと告げていた。"
msgstr "  The morning sun alerted Soujyuro that a day of work lay ahead."

#. Occurrence A_0:134:14375: scene=A_0
#: A_0:134
msgctxt "text_id=14375 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　具体的に言うと庭の清掃。"
msgstr "  Specifically, the gardens needed tending to,"

#. Occurrence A_0:139:14376: scene=A_0
#: A_0:139
msgctxt "text_id=14376 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎にとって、これ以上アレを放置しておくのは精神衛生上よろしくない。"
msgstr "  and an unkempt garden made for an unhappy Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence A_0:144:14377: scene=A_0
#: A_0:144
msgctxt "text_id=14377 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　幸い、アルバイトの<当番|シフト>は丸一日オフ。"
msgstr "  Luckily, today was his day off from all his part-time jobs."

#. Occurrence A_0:149:14378: scene=A_0
#: A_0:149
msgctxt "text_id=14378 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼にとって今日はまたとない好機だった。"
msgstr "  It was the perfect opportunity to get his hands dirty."

#. Occurrence A_0:194:14379: scene=A_0
#: A_0:194
msgctxt "text_id=14379 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――しかし。洋館の<園|にわ>は本気で広い。"
msgstr "  There was one problem, however: the mansion's grounds were vast."

#. Occurrence A_0:200:14380: scene=A_0
#: A_0:200
msgctxt "text_id=14380 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　荒れ放題なのは中庭だけでなく、館の正面玄関まわりですら手入れが行き届いていなかった。"
msgstr "  Not only had the courtyard been left to run wild, but the area around the front door had been neglected, too."

#. Occurrence A_0:205:14381: scene=A_0
#: A_0:205
msgctxt "text_id=14381 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本気で掃除をするのなら、一週間単位で計画を組まなくてはいけない広さである。"
msgstr "  To tend to these problems thoroughly, he would have to work on them week in, week out."

#. Occurrence A_0:227:14382: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:227
msgctxt "text_id=14382 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「よし。まずは地ならしだな」"
msgstr "\"All right. First, let's level things out.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:233:14383: scene=A_0
#: A_0:233
msgctxt "text_id=14383 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　理想は一日で成し遂げられるものではない。"
msgstr "  In an ideal world, his task would only take a day, but for its enormity."

#. Occurrence A_0:238:14384: scene=A_0
#: A_0:238
msgctxt "text_id=14384 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今日は雑草の除去だけに専念しよう、と草十郎は決意を新たに荒れ野に踏み出した。"
msgstr "  For the moment, Soujyuro decided to set foot into the mansion's wilderness and evict the weeds."

#. Occurrence A_0:274:14385: scene=A_0
#: A_0:274
msgctxt "text_id=14385 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　朝も早くから館の周りの雑草を引き抜いていく。"
msgstr "  Wasting none of the early light, he started tackling the ones around the mansion."

#. Occurrence A_0:280:14386: scene=A_0
#: A_0:280
msgctxt "text_id=14386 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　計算によれば、午後までには玄関付近、中庭、裏庭をぐるりと一回りし、一休みできる予定になっていた。"
msgstr "  By his estimation, he could clear the forecourt, courtyard, and backyard, then take a small rest."

#. Occurrence A_0:496:14387: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_0_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_0
#: A_0:496
msgctxt "text_id=14387 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「どうしたの、彼」"
msgstr "\"What's gotten into him?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:536:14388: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:536
msgctxt "text_id=14388 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「さあ。草摘みが趣味ってワケじゃなさそうだけど」"
msgstr "\"Beats me. I doubt he's out there for fun.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:542:14389: scene=A_0
#: A_0:542
msgctxt "text_id=14389 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正午前のサンルーム。"
msgstr "  It was just before noon in the sunroom."

#. Occurrence A_0:554:14390: scene=A_0
#: A_0:554
msgctxt "text_id=14390 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠が本を片手にやってきた時、先客である青子は優雅に紅茶を飲みつつ、ファッション誌を読んでいた。"
msgstr "  Alice had come down, book in hand, to find Aoko sitting down with a fashion magazine and elegantly sipping tea."

#. Occurrence A_0:598:14391: scene=A_0
#: A_0:598
msgctxt "text_id=14391 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　窓ガラスの向こうには、しゃがみこんだまま後退していく人影がひとつ。"
msgstr "  Through the window she could see the crouched figure of Soujyuro shuffling by."

#. Occurrence A_0:627:14392: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:627
msgctxt "text_id=14392 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「朝からやってるみたいよ。"
msgstr "\"He's been at it all morning."

#. Occurrence A_0:633:14393: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:633
msgctxt "text_id=14393 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　起きてカーテンを開けたら、もうあの格好でスパスパやってたから。ついでに焼却炉の掃除も言いつけといたけど、いいでしょ？」"
msgstr "  Hunched over since I saw him first thing from my bedroom window. I told him to clean the incinerator, too. Any objections?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:647:14394: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_0_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_0
#: A_0:647
msgctxt "text_id=14394 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「いいけど。……頑張るのね、彼。外はあんなにも寒いのに」"
msgstr "\"Not really. He always works so hard. Even in the cold.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:701:14395: scene=A_0
#: A_0:701
msgctxt "text_id=14395 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は静かに腰を下ろした。"
msgstr "  Alice quietly sat down."

#. Occurrence A_0:707:14396: scene=A_0
#: A_0:707
msgctxt "text_id=14396 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　テーブルには彼女の分のティーカップも用意されていた。"
msgstr "  Her teacup had been placed on the table for her."

#. Occurrence A_0:712:14397: scene=A_0
#: A_0:712
msgctxt "text_id=14397 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はポットからカップに紅茶を注いで、持ちこんだ本を開く。"
msgstr "  She poured herself some tea and proceeded to open her book."

#. Occurrence A_0:758:14398: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:758
msgctxt "text_id=14398 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_0:773:14399: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_0_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_0
#: A_0:773
msgctxt "text_id=14399 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_0:781:14400: scene=A_0
#: A_0:781
msgctxt "text_id=14400 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二人は無言で時間を過ごす。"
msgstr "  The two sat passing the time in silence."

#. Occurrence A_0:786:14401: scene=A_0
#: A_0:786
msgctxt "text_id=14401 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子も有珠も気まぐれに、部屋で休むのだったらサンルームでお茶にしよう、とやって来ただけだった。"
msgstr "  Having happened to have the same idea: a nice, relaxing cup of tea in the sunroom."

#. Occurrence A_0:791:14402: scene=A_0
#: A_0:791
msgctxt "text_id=14402 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　談話のネタもなく、夜にそなえての役割分担も既に済んでいる。"
msgstr "  With their evening roles decided, there was no need for idle chatter."

#. Occurrence A_0:820:14403: scene=A_0
#: A_0:820
msgctxt "text_id=14403 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は雑誌をパラ読みしながら、基本的には窓の外の風景を眺め、"
msgstr "  Aoko stared out the window, intermittently turning her gaze to her magazine."

#. Occurrence A_0:825:14404: scene=A_0
#: A_0:825
msgctxt "text_id=14404 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はルーン魔術に関する書物に没頭しながら、時折、思い出したように顔をあげる。"
msgstr "  Alice was immersed in a book on rune magecraft, occasionally tilting her head up as if to recall something."

#. Occurrence A_0:897:14405: scene=A_0
#: A_0:897
msgctxt "text_id=14405 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ティーカップに口をつけ、二人は申し合わせたように窓の外に視線を送った。"
msgstr "  As if by unspoken agreement, in unison they pressed their teacups to their lips and glanced outside."

#. Occurrence A_0:902:14406: scene=A_0
#: A_0:902
msgctxt "text_id=14406 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手伝う気など爪の先ほどもないのか、少女たちは他人事のように庭職人（駆け出し）の動きを観察する。"
msgstr "  To the two girls, Soujyuro appeared as if he were an animal in a zoo. Neither was interested in lending a hand."

#. Occurrence A_0:907:14407: scene=A_0
#: A_0:907
msgctxt "text_id=14407 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の動きは緩慢ではあるけれど、なぜか作業は<迅速|じんそく>にこなされていった。"
msgstr "  Despite his sluggish movement, he was making good progress."

#. Occurrence A_0:952:14408: scene=A_0
#: A_0:952
msgctxt "text_id=14408 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……ふと青子が視線を逸らすと、対面の相方と目が合った。"
msgstr "  As Aoko's attention turned back to the sunroom, her eyes met Alice's."

#. Occurrence A_0:1024:14409: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1024
msgctxt "text_id=14409 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は取り<繕|つくろ>うように書物に視線を戻し、"
msgstr "  Alice returned her gaze to her book."

#. Occurrence A_0:1024:14410: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1024
msgctxt "text_id=14410 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しばらくした後、もう一度顔をあげて、"
msgstr "  Though moments later, she raised her head again."

#. Occurrence A_0:1279:14411: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1279
msgctxt "text_id=14411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「―――、"
msgstr "\""

#. Occurrence A_0:1287:14412: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_0_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1287
msgctxt "text_id=14412 | speaker=alice"
msgid "ぽこ」"
msgstr "Ahem...\""

#. Occurrence A_0:1357:14413: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1357
msgctxt "text_id=14413 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　コホンと咳払いをして、読書に集中しようと目を伏せる。"
msgstr "  Clearing her throat, she attempted to focus on reading."

#. Occurrence A_0:1377:14414: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1377
msgctxt "text_id=14414 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……有珠が驚くのも無理はない。"
msgstr "  It was no surprise that Alice admired Soujyuro's diligence."

#. Occurrence A_0:1390:14415: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1390
msgctxt "text_id=14415 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は三十分も経たないうちに中庭を横断して、あれほど見苦しかった雑草を綺麗に片付けてしまったのだ。"
msgstr "  Not even thirty minutes had passed before he had cleared the courtyard of its unsightly weeds."

#. Occurrence A_0:1395:14416: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1395
msgctxt "text_id=14416 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　謎の庭師は休憩も入れず、白い息を吐きながら、中庭から退場していった。"
msgstr "  Without stopping once, the mysterious gardener left the courtyard, puffing clouds of white breath."

#. Occurrence A_0:1400:14417: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1400
msgctxt "text_id=14417 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　立つ鳥跡を<濁|にご>さず、どころの話ではない。"
msgstr "  The area he left behind was spotless."

#. Occurrence A_0:1421:14418: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1421
msgctxt "text_id=14418 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……プロかしらね、あいつ」"
msgstr "\"Has he done this before?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:1448:14419: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1448
msgctxt "text_id=14419 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はその一部始終を見届けて、ぽつりと呟く。"
msgstr "  Aoko muttered after scanning over his work."

#. Occurrence A_0:1453:14420: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1453
msgctxt "text_id=14420 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりにも迷いのない、鉄人の作業だった。"
msgstr "  A stalwart, Soujyuro worked confidently and ceaselessly."

#. Occurrence A_0:1458:14421: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1458
msgctxt "text_id=14421 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　良くできた映画を見た気分にすらなって、青子は感心……を通り越して、草十郎の無駄な芸達者ぶりに呆れている。"
msgstr "  She was impressed, like she was watching a scene from a great movie, but before long she grew irked. Why would he waste his energy like that, she thought."

#. Occurrence A_0:1463:14422: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1463
msgctxt "text_id=14422 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、有珠は顔をあげて時計を確認していた。"
msgstr "  Alice looked at the clock."

#. Occurrence A_0:1504:14423: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_0_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1504
msgctxt "text_id=14423 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……焼却炉、今から手入れをしたら夕方ね」"
msgstr "\"If he starts now, it'll be evening before he's done with the incinerator.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:1524:14424: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1524
msgctxt "text_id=14424 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そっちはもう終わってるわ。朝、上から見てたもの。"
msgstr "\"Actually, he already took care of it. I watched him do it from upstairs."

#. Occurrence A_0:1524:14425: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1524
msgctxt "text_id=14425 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　壊されちゃいけないからあれこれ指示だしてね。"
msgstr "  I didn't want him breaking it, so I gave him some pointers."

#. Occurrence A_0:1535:14426: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1535
msgctxt "text_id=14426 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　いやあ、窓開けてさんざん怒鳴ったから部屋が冷えるコト冷えるコト」"
msgstr "  Y'know, I yelled at him for so long from my window my room almost froze over.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:1577:14427: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1577
msgctxt "text_id=14427 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子が居間にやって来た理由は、自分の部屋が冷えきってしまったから、と推測される。"
msgstr "  It was safe to assume Aoko had come to the sunroom to escape her cold room."

#. Occurrence A_0:1582:14428: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1582
msgctxt "text_id=14428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……部屋から指図をするのと外で掃除をするのとでは、どちらが<極寒|ハード>か言うまでもない。"
msgstr "  Between barking orders from a window and cleaning in the cold, it was clear who had the harder job."

#. Occurrence A_0:1609:14429: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_0_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1609
msgctxt "text_id=14429 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「静希君、何か言ってこなかった？」"
msgstr "\"Did Sizuki have anything to say?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:1631:14430: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1631
msgctxt "text_id=14430 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「言ってたけど、よく聞こえなかったわ」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, a lot, but I couldn't really hear him.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:1658:14431: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1658
msgctxt "text_id=14431 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つまり、草十郎の文句は一切<効|き>かなかったという事か。"
msgstr "  In other words, his complaints fell on deaf ears."

#. Occurrence A_0:1703:14432: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1703
msgctxt "text_id=14432 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　共通の話題もなくなって、二人は読書を再開する。"
msgstr "  With nothing else to discuss, the two resumed their reading."

#. Occurrence A_0:1749:14433: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1749
msgctxt "text_id=14433 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな、少しだけ張りつめた沈黙を破るように、掃除を終えた草十郎がやってきた。"
msgstr "  The ever-so tense silence was broken by Soujyuro, entering the house after finishing his cleaning."

#. Occurrence A_0:1800:14434: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1800
msgctxt "text_id=14434 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_0:1805:14435: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1805
msgctxt "text_id=14435 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気に食わない事があったのか、草十郎は険しい目で青子たちを一瞥する。"
msgstr "  He stared at the two of them, displeased."

#. Occurrence A_0:1851:14436: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1851
msgctxt "text_id=14436 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あったかそうだね、蒼崎」"
msgstr "\"Warm enough in here, Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:1874:14437: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1874
msgctxt "text_id=14437 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「外よりは幾分ね。廊下の気温は外とあまり変わらないけど。"
msgstr "\"Warmer than outside. Unless you're walking the halls."

#. Occurrence A_0:1880:14438: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1880
msgctxt "text_id=14438 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それで、どうして庭の掃除なんてはじめたのよ、草十郎」"
msgstr "  What made you decide to take care of the gardens, anyway?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:1912:14439: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1912
msgctxt "text_id=14439 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の嫌味なんてこれっぽっちも効いていない。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's subtle jibe had failed to find its target."

#. Occurrence A_0:1917:14440: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1917
msgctxt "text_id=14440 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<青子|てき>の丈夫さに、草十郎は今更ながらガッカリと肩を落とした。"
msgstr "  He had no chance of winning, and so just hung his shoulders in defeat."

#. Occurrence A_0:1955:14441: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1955
msgctxt "text_id=14441 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「今日は本当に寒い。明日あたり雪でも降ってくるだろうから、外の掃除は早くに済ませたかったのに。"
msgstr "\"It's so cold out today. Snow's probably going to fall tomorrow, so I thought I should tidy up while I could."

#. Occurrence A_0:1961:14442: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:1961
msgctxt "text_id=14442 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……焼却炉は予定外だったぞ」"
msgstr "  I didn't think I'd have to work on the incinerator, too...\""

#. Occurrence A_0:1990:14443: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1990
msgctxt "text_id=14443 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　恨みがましく言うが、草十郎にとって焼却炉の掃除などお菓子のおまけみたいな物だった。"
msgstr "  He sounded resentful, but his problem was not with the additional work. If anything, he was glad to do it."

#. Occurrence A_0:1995:14444: scene=A_0
#: A_0:1995
msgctxt "text_id=14444 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼が不満に思っているのは、誰も手伝いにこなかった、お寒い事実だけである。"
msgstr "  What he did not care for was how nobody had even bothered to lend a hand."

#. Occurrence A_0:2016:14445: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2016
msgctxt "text_id=14445 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いいじゃない、焼却炉はみんな使うんだから。"
msgstr "\"So what? We all need to use it."

#. Occurrence A_0:2039:14446: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2039
msgctxt "text_id=14446 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　じゃ、その殊勝な心がけついでに、二階の廊下に掃除機かけといてね。"
msgstr "  Hey, seeing as you're in a generous mood, vacuum the upstairs corridor, will you?"

#. Occurrence A_0:2045:14447: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2045
msgctxt "text_id=14447 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それと裏庭のブナの添え木、壊れかけてたでしょ。工具箱はアンタの<屋根裏|へや>に置きっぱなしだから、それを使うこと」"
msgstr "  Oh, and that brace for the beech tree out back is on its last legs. Put that toolbox in your room in the attic to good use.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2071:14448: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2071
msgctxt "text_id=14448 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「で、ぜんぶ終わったら私の部屋に来てくれる？"
msgstr "\"And once you're done with that, come to my room."

#. Occurrence A_0:2071:14449: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2071
msgctxt "text_id=14449 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　いらない物まとめておくから、焼却炉で焼いておいて」"
msgstr "  I have a bunch of things I'd like you to throw in the incinerator.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2103:14450: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2103
msgctxt "text_id=14450 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2109:14451: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2109
msgctxt "text_id=14451 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そのために焼却炉の手入れをさせたらしい。"
msgstr "  Hence why she made him clean the incinerator."

#. Occurrence A_0:2114:14452: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2114
msgctxt "text_id=14452 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　憎らしいぐらいの段取りの良さである。"
msgstr "  Cruel, but clever."

#. Occurrence A_0:2151:14453: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2151
msgctxt "text_id=14453 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それで蒼崎、君は何をするんだ？」"
msgstr "\"And what're you going to do while I'm doing all that?\" "

#. Occurrence A_0:2157:14454: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2157
msgctxt "text_id=14454 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうね、やる事もないしギターにでも触ってようかしら」"
msgstr "\"Hmm. No plans, really. Maybe I'll play a little guitar.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2181:14455: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2181
msgctxt "text_id=14455 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うーん、と有意義な午後の過ごし方を模索する青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko thought hard about how to spend her afternoon."

#. Occurrence A_0:2186:14456: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2186
msgctxt "text_id=14456 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　嫌味に対して嫌味で返しているワケではない。"
msgstr "  Yet the thought of cleaning did not cross her mind, as had always been the case."

#. Occurrence A_0:2191:14457: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2191
msgctxt "text_id=14457 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　きっと、彼女の予定には『掃除』という単語が存在しないのだ。"
msgstr "  No, it was not out of spite that she did not think to help clean, it was because the word \"cleaning\" was not in her vocabulary."

#. Occurrence A_0:2227:14458: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2227
msgctxt "text_id=14458 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この洋館はなぜ荒れ果てているのか。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro knew exactly why the mansion"

#. Occurrence A_0:2232:14459: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2232
msgctxt "text_id=14459 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その理由を、はっきりと草十郎は思い知った。"
msgstr "  was in the state it was in."

#. Occurrence A_0:2261:14460: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2261
msgctxt "text_id=14460 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それにしても二階の廊下は長い。"
msgstr "  Still, that did not change the fact the corridor upstairs was very long."

#. Occurrence A_0:2266:14461: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2266
msgctxt "text_id=14461 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おまけに青子の言う通り、廊下の気温は外とそう変わりはない極寒だ。"
msgstr "  And Aoko was not lying about how cold it was-inside was not much different than outside."

#. Occurrence A_0:2297:14462: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2297
msgctxt "text_id=14462 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……そうか、あくまで掃除をする気はないんだな蒼崎。"
msgstr "\"You really have no intention of helping me, do you? "

#. Occurrence A_0:2303:14463: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2303
msgctxt "text_id=14463 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　まあ、掃除はしたいからするけど、こう、なんだろう。"
msgstr "  I mean, I do enjoy cleaning, but...I don't know..."

#. Occurrence A_0:2331:14464: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2331
msgctxt "text_id=14464 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　一緒に住んでる人間をそこまでこき使って良心は痛まないか？　それとも、わりと気付いてはいたけど、良心そのものがないのか？」"
msgstr "  Don't you even feel a little bit guilty using a roommate like this? Or do you just not feel guilt at all?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2390:14465: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2390
msgctxt "text_id=14465 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　相変わらず、一言多い男である。"
msgstr "  As usual, he might have gone too far."

#. Occurrence A_0:2409:14466: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2409
msgctxt "text_id=14466 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の的確すぎる指摘に、青子はファッション誌を置いて向き直る。"
msgstr "  His remarks had hit too close to home. Aoko closed her magazine and turned to face him."

#. Occurrence A_0:2425:14467: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2425
msgctxt "text_id=14467 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　透き通る青い目が、苛立ちをこめて草十郎を直視する。"
msgstr "  Infuriated, she glared, her sharp, blue eyes piercing into him."

#. Occurrence A_0:2457:14468: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2457
msgctxt "text_id=14468 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その目力に、正義は１００パーセント自分側にありながら、つい気合い負けをする草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro knew he had not said anything unjust, but he always backed down first."

#. Occurrence A_0:2479:14469: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2479
msgctxt "text_id=14469 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎。"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro."

msgctxt "text_id=14470 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "何度も言うようだけど」"
msgstr " Let me explain it. One. More. Time.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2493:14471: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2493
msgctxt "text_id=14471 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「はい」"
msgstr "\"Okay...\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2498:14472: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2498
msgctxt "text_id=14472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　落ち着いた青子の声に、反射的に背中を伸ばす草十郎。"
msgstr "  He replied automatically, straightening his back in response to Aoko's cold, calm tone."

#. Occurrence A_0:2535:14473: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2535
msgctxt "text_id=14473 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「勘違いはしないで。私たちはアンタを同居させてあげてるんじゃない。"
msgstr "\"Don't be mistaken. We're not letting you stay here out of kindness."

#. Occurrence A_0:2541:14474: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2541
msgctxt "text_id=14474 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　これ以上ないって譲歩の末、仕方なく飼ってあげてるだけなんだからね」"
msgstr "  We're putting up with you, because we have to.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2557:14475: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2557
msgctxt "text_id=14475 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　きっぱりと青子は言う。"
msgstr "  Aoko did not mince her words."

#. Occurrence A_0:2562:14476: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2562
msgctxt "text_id=14476 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はなるほど、と頷いた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded in defeat."

#. Occurrence A_0:2604:14477: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2604
msgctxt "text_id=14477 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうか、飼ってもらってるのか」"
msgstr "\"So, I'm basically a pet.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2626:14478: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2626
msgctxt "text_id=14478 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そ。番犬にもならないだろうけど」"
msgstr "\"Exactly. And not a very useful one at that.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2632:14479: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2632
msgctxt "text_id=14479 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の呟きに、青子はつまらなそうに言い返す。"
msgstr "  Aoko responded, already tired of the conversation."

#. Occurrence A_0:2637:14480: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2637
msgctxt "text_id=14480 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはそれで事実なのだが、草十郎にも一つや二つ反論もあるというもの。"
msgstr "  While Soujyuro had little room to counter, he still tried."

#. Occurrence A_0:2674:14481: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2674
msgctxt "text_id=14481 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「しかし一方、番犬は間違っても自分の食い<扶持|ぶち>を入れたり、あまつさえ家賃を払ったりしないのも事実であった」"
msgstr "\"Last time I checked, most pets don't have to buy food or pay rent.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2691:14482: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2691
msgctxt "text_id=14482 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「何か言った？」"
msgstr "\"Did you say something?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2741:14483: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2741
msgctxt "text_id=14483 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや。負け犬の遠吠えを、少しばかり」"
msgstr "\"Nothing. I'm just a dumb mutt barking up the wrong tree.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2747:14484: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2747
msgctxt "text_id=14484 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　参りました、とばかりに手をあげる草十郎。"
msgstr "  He raised his hand dismissively, knowing he could not win."

#. Occurrence A_0:2752:14485: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2752
msgctxt "text_id=14485 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自虐的なセリフは、彼が言うと間の抜けた冗談にしか聞こえない。"
msgstr "  To Aoko's ears, his attempt at self-deprecation sounded facetious."

#. Occurrence A_0:2797:14486: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2797
msgctxt "text_id=14486 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……草十郎。アンタ、ほんとに分かってる？」"
msgstr "\"You do understand the position you're in, right?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2803:14487: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2803
msgctxt "text_id=14487 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうだな。君たちがどうあっても掃除をする気がないぐらいは、なんとか」"
msgstr "\"Yeah. One where I do all the work.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2815:14488: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2815
msgctxt "text_id=14488 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それだけ理解していれば上等である。"
msgstr "  Aoko grinned at her pet's obedience."

#. Occurrence A_0:2826:14489: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2826
msgctxt "text_id=14489 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな草十郎の態度に、青子はにっこりと笑みをうかべた。"
msgstr "  As long as he knew his place, that was all that mattered to her."

#. Occurrence A_0:2831:14490: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2831
msgctxt "text_id=14490 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうも、今の返答がたいへんお気に召した模様。"
msgstr "  She seemed to be extremely satisfied with his response."

#. Occurrence A_0:2853:14491: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2853
msgctxt "text_id=14491 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ふーん。余裕あるんだ、静希くんってば」"
msgstr "\"Heh. You don't have a care in the world, do you?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2887:14492: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2887
msgctxt "text_id=14492 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　楽しげな青子の笑みと同時に、草十郎の顔が<曇|くも>る。"
msgstr "  Her playful smile darkened, as did Soujyuro's expression."

#. Occurrence A_0:2927:14493: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2927
msgctxt "text_id=14493 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……蒼崎。なんだか、息ができないんだけど」"
msgstr "\"Aozaki, I...I can't breathe.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2933:14494: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2933
msgctxt "text_id=14494 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「このまま放っておくとそんなコトも言ってられなくなるんだけど、試してみる？」"
msgstr "\"You know, if I keep this up you'll never be able to complain again. Shall we give it a try?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:2938:14495: scene=A_0
#: A_0:2938
msgctxt "text_id=14495 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は顔をますます曇らせながら、いや、と首を横に振って答えた。"
msgstr "  He shook his head, his expression growing more and more grim."

#. Occurrence A_0:2988:14496: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0023; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:2988
msgctxt "text_id=14496 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「賢明ね。私も窒息死体なんて見たくないもの」"
msgstr "\"Smart choice. I don't want to see you suffocate. If I can help it.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:3025:14497: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3025
msgctxt "text_id=14497 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　耳障りな音が途絶える。"
msgstr "  The grating sound subsided."

#. Occurrence A_0:3030:14498: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3030
msgctxt "text_id=14498 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はそろりと首に手を当てる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro gingerly touched his throat."

#. Occurrence A_0:3035:14499: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3035
msgctxt "text_id=14499 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さっきまで独りでに絞まってきた首輪は、今ではもとのサイズに戻っていた。"
msgstr "  The collar that had suddenly tightened around his neck returned to its normal size."

#. Occurrence A_0:3075:14500: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0016; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:3075
msgctxt "text_id=14500 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……気管が<塞|ふさ>がれた時の苦しさを知らないんだろ、蒼崎は。本当に抵抗できなくなるんだぞ、あれは」"
msgstr "\"Do you have any idea how painful it is to suffocate? It's excruciating.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:3097:14501: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0024; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:3097
msgctxt "text_id=14501 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「だから、そのための首輪だって言ったでしょ。"
msgstr "\"I told you that's what your collar was for."

#. Occurrence A_0:3103:14502: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0025; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:3103
msgctxt "text_id=14502 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　今まで実践したコトなかったし、アンタはあいかわらず危機感ないし。ここらで一度<躾|しつ>けておいたの。"
msgstr "  You're always so naive, so I took the opportunity to give it a test run... Now you know your place."

#. Occurrence A_0:3130:14503: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0026; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:3130
msgctxt "text_id=14503 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　―――それより掃除。急がないと日が暮れるんじゃないの？」"
msgstr "  Anyway. Chores. You're wasting daylight.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:3163:14504: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0017; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:3163
msgctxt "text_id=14504 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……はあ。わかったよ。"
msgstr "\"Okay..."

#. Occurrence A_0:3169:14505: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_0_0018; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_0
#: A_0:3169
msgctxt "text_id=14505 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　結局、今日はこうなる星の運びだったんだ」"
msgstr "  So that's what the sun was trying to tell me this morning...\""

#. Occurrence A_0:3211:14506: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3211
msgctxt "text_id=14506 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　負け犬よろしく肩を落として、草十郎はサンルームから立ち去っていった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro left the sunroom, his shoulders slumped and his tail between his legs."

#. Occurrence A_0:3224:14507: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3224
msgctxt "text_id=14507 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを見送った後、何事もなかったように青子は雑誌に視線を戻す。"
msgstr "  Aoko watched him leave before turning to her magazine as if nothing had happened."

#. Occurrence A_0:3258:14508: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3258
msgctxt "text_id=14508 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　以上のやりとりを、有珠は我関せずと聞き流していた。"
msgstr "  Alice paid no attention. None of that had anything to do with her."

#. Occurrence A_0:3263:14509: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3263
msgctxt "text_id=14509 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何度目かの沈黙。"
msgstr "  With Soujyuro gone, the room once again fell silent."

#. Occurrence A_0:3268:14510: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3268
msgctxt "text_id=14510 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　刻々と時計の針が回る中、不意に、ページをめくる有珠の手が止まった。"
msgstr "  As the clock ticked on, Alice suddenly stopped flipping through her book."

#. Occurrence A_0:3289:14511: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_0_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_0
#: A_0:3289
msgctxt "text_id=14511 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ねえ。どうして彼を酷使するの？」"
msgstr "\"Any reason why you push him so hard?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:3295:14512: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3295
msgctxt "text_id=14512 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　独り言のような問い。"
msgstr "  She asked as though talking to herself."

#. Occurrence A_0:3300:14513: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3300
msgctxt "text_id=14513 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は雑誌をめくる手を止めず、"
msgstr "  Aoko replied without so much as looking up."

#. Occurrence A_0:3335:14514: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_0_0027; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_0
#: A_0:3335
msgctxt "text_id=14514 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「別に。最後には記憶を消させてもらうんだから、楽しかったら困るじゃない」"
msgstr "\"Nope. We're just going to erase his memories in the end anyway. Why get his hopes up?\""

#. Occurrence A_0:3341:14515: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3341
msgctxt "text_id=14515 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　極めて分かりにくい、彼女らしい誠実さを口にした。"
msgstr "  Obscure as ever, but sincere in her own way."

#. Occurrence A_0:3374:14516: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_0_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_0
#: A_0:3374
msgctxt "text_id=14516 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「…………そう。言われてみれば、そうだったわね」"
msgstr "\"When you put it like that...I suppose you are right.\""

#. Occurrence A_0:3380:14517: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3380
msgctxt "text_id=14517 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……そんなコトを、忘れていた自分に驚いてしまう。"
msgstr "  Alice could not believe she had forgotten about the situation."

#. Occurrence A_0:3385:14518: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3385
msgctxt "text_id=14518 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は静かに顔を上げ、硝子ごしの風景を眺めた。"
msgstr "  Silently, she looked up from her book and gazed outside once again."

#. Occurrence A_0:3430:14519: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3430
msgctxt "text_id=14519 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　窓から見える彼女の中庭は、十年前の故郷を思わせる。"
msgstr "  The courtyard through the window reminded her of where she lived a decade ago."

#. Occurrence A_0:3435:14520: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3435
msgctxt "text_id=14520 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの頃に比べれば何もかも<見窄|みすぼ>らしい、荒れ野とさえ言える庭。"
msgstr "  Nothing could compare to the beauty of those gardens."

#. Occurrence A_0:3440:14521: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3440
msgctxt "text_id=14521 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なのに、どうして面影が重なるのか。"
msgstr "  But if that was the case, why did the scenery make her feel nostalgic?"

#. Occurrence A_0:3479:14522: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3479
msgctxt "text_id=14522 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ大切に、真心だけで手入れをされた彼女の庭。"
msgstr "  All Soujyuro had done was take care of the gardens with the goodness of his own heart."

#. Occurrence A_0:3485:14523: scene=A_0
#: A_0:3485
msgctxt "text_id=14523 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが今日半日の、草十郎の成果だった。"
msgstr "  In only half a day, he had achieved so much."

#. Occurrence A_1:42:14524: scene=A_1
#: A_1:42
msgctxt "text_id=14524 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　イヴの日に、雪はしんしんと降りはじめた。"
msgstr "  It was Christmas Eve, and snow had started to fall."

#. Occurrence A_1:83:14525: scene=A_1
#: A_1:83
msgctxt "text_id=14525 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自らの価値を知っていたのか、今年の初雪は誰もが喜ぶ記念日に顔を見せた。"
msgstr "  Its timing was too good, as though it had waited for that day specifically."

#. Occurrence A_1:88:14526: scene=A_1
#: A_1:88
msgctxt "text_id=14526 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大通りでの<賑|にぎ>わいは白く寒く、それでいて明るいものになっているだろう。"
msgstr "  The cold, bustling main street seemed bright and vibrant under the layer of frosty white."

#. Occurrence A_1:108:14527: scene=A_1
#: A_1:108
msgctxt "text_id=14527 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　トナカイを<象|かたど>るイルミネーション。"
msgstr "  Reindeer statues illuminated the surroundings..."

#. Occurrence A_1:113:14528: scene=A_1
#: A_1:113
msgctxt "text_id=14528 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　子供たちの足を弾ませるジングルベル。"
msgstr "  Children danced merrily to \"Jingle Bells\"..."

#. Occurrence A_1:118:14529: scene=A_1
#: A_1:118
msgctxt "text_id=14529 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　レンガの道を行く人々は、一様に満ち足りた微笑みをうかべている。"
msgstr "  People walked along the brick road, smiling broadly..."

#. Occurrence A_1:162:14530: scene=A_1
#: A_1:162
msgctxt "text_id=14530 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし。"
msgstr "  These festivities, however,"

#. Occurrence A_1:167:14531: scene=A_1
#: A_1:167
msgctxt "text_id=14531 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな街の<彩|いろど>りも、丘の上の洋館には届かない。"
msgstr "  had not reached the mansion on the hill."

#. Occurrence A_1:172:14532: scene=A_1
#: A_1:172
msgctxt "text_id=14532 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人里から離れた館は静かに。"
msgstr "  Silence enveloped the isolated building."

#. Occurrence A_1:177:14533: scene=A_1
#: A_1:177
msgctxt "text_id=14533 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　森は白い粉雪に覆われ、いっそう影を濃くしていた。"
msgstr "  The shadow of the snow-covered woodland grew longer,"

#. Occurrence A_1:183:14534: scene=A_1
#: A_1:183
msgctxt "text_id=14534 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いずれ来るであろう<黄昏時|たそがれどき>。"
msgstr "  beckoning in the darkness."

#. Occurrence A_1:188:14535: scene=A_1
#: A_1:188
msgctxt "text_id=14535 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人々が<家路|いえじ>に就き、街頭から<人気|ひとけ>の絶える静夜を、じっと待ち続けるように。"
msgstr "  People returned to the warmth of their homes, knowing a bitter night lay ahead."

#. Occurrence A_1:260:14536: scene=A_1
#: A_1:260
msgctxt "text_id=14536 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その日の洋館は、朝から空気が違っていた。"
msgstr "  Something had been amiss in the mansion all day."

#. Occurrence A_1:265:14537: scene=A_1
#: A_1:265
msgctxt "text_id=14537 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　嵐の前の静けさである。"
msgstr "  Perhaps it was the calm before the storm."

#. Occurrence A_1:290:14538: scene=A_1
#: A_1:290
msgctxt "text_id=14538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　敵の正体―――蒼崎橙子の存在が明らかになってから二日。"
msgstr "  Two days had passed since Touko Aozaki had revealed herself."

#. Occurrence A_1:295:14539: scene=A_1
#: A_1:295
msgctxt "text_id=14539 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子も有珠も自室に閉じこもる事が多くなり、食事<時|どき>の談話も目に見えて少なくなった。"
msgstr "  Aoko and Alice spent more and more time locked in their rooms; mealtimes had grown noticeably quieter."

#. Occurrence A_1:300:14540: scene=A_1
#: A_1:300
msgctxt "text_id=14540 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　役割分担を終えた少女たちは、それぞれの仕事を<全|まっと>うするため、自分の事だけで手一杯なのだ。"
msgstr "  With their roles decided, they were too busy with their own jobs to worry about each other."

#. Occurrence A_1:359:14541: scene=A_1
#: A_1:359
msgctxt "text_id=14541 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな二人が、今日は朝から居間でくつろいでいる。"
msgstr "  On this day, the two had been relaxing in the drawing room since morning."

#. Occurrence A_1:364:14542: scene=A_1
#: A_1:364
msgctxt "text_id=14542 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　張りつめた様子もない。"
msgstr "  The mood was calm."

#. Occurrence A_1:369:14543: scene=A_1
#: A_1:369
msgctxt "text_id=14543 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから逆に今夜がそうなのだと、草十郎は悟ってしまった。"
msgstr "  Well, mostly at least―Soujyuro was fretting that tonight would be the same."

#. Occurrence A_1:403:14544: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_1_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_1
#: A_1:403
msgctxt "text_id=14544 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「雪が明日なら良かったのに」"
msgstr "\"The snow just couldn't wait till tomorrow, could it?\""

#. Occurrence A_1:410:14545: scene=A_1
#: A_1:410
msgctxt "text_id=14545 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はソファーに座った二人に話しかける。"
msgstr "  He aimed his words towards the girls on the sofa,"

#. Occurrence A_1:415:14546: scene=A_1
#: A_1:415
msgctxt "text_id=14546 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　返事は期待していない。"
msgstr "  despite knowing they would be ignored."

#. Occurrence A_1:420:14547: scene=A_1
#: A_1:420
msgctxt "text_id=14547 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大体、雪が明日になったところで彼女たちに変化があるわけでもない。"
msgstr "  Whether the snow fell today, tomorrow, or not at all, it did not affect them."

#. Occurrence A_1:425:14548: scene=A_1
#: A_1:425
msgctxt "text_id=14548 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　クリスマスが、ホワイトクリスマスになるだけの話である。"
msgstr "  The snow just meant a white Christmas."

#. Occurrence A_1:457:14549: scene=A_1
#: A_1:457
msgctxt "text_id=14549 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子から言葉はなかった。"
msgstr "  Aoko remained silent."

#. Occurrence A_1:462:14550: scene=A_1
#: A_1:462
msgctxt "text_id=14550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無視しているのではなく、単純に、そこまでの余裕がないだけだ。"
msgstr "  She wasn't ignoring him per se; she just had other things on her mind."

#. Occurrence A_1:467:14551: scene=A_1
#: A_1:467
msgctxt "text_id=14551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　分かり切った事とはいえ少し淋しいな、と草十郎はサンルームに視線を投げる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro knew this, but still cast a lonely glance around the sunroom."

#. Occurrence A_1:502:14552: scene=A_1
#: A_1:502
msgctxt "text_id=14552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何日か前に手入れをした中庭は、白一色に染まっている。"
msgstr "  The courtyard he had cleaned only a few days ago was hidden by a layer of white."

#. Occurrence A_1:507:14553: scene=A_1
#: A_1:507
msgctxt "text_id=14553 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　粉雪は降ったり止んだりと気まぐれだが、この分ではかなりの厚さで地面に残るに違いない。"
msgstr "  The falling snow would stop every so often, but then resume again as if teasing Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence A_1:512:14554: scene=A_1
#: A_1:512
msgctxt "text_id=14554 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜には一面の銀世界になるだろう。"
msgstr "  By the next morning, the courtyard would be a winter wonderland."

#. Occurrence A_1:517:14555: scene=A_1
#: A_1:517
msgctxt "text_id=14555 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　伝わる寒気から身を暖めるように、青子たちは紅茶を口に運んでいる。"
msgstr "  Aoko and Alice sipped tea in an effort to fight the cold."

#. Occurrence A_1:522:14556: scene=A_1
#: A_1:522
msgctxt "text_id=14556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　思えばそれだけが、今の彼女たちの行動だった。"
msgstr "  In fact, that was all they were doing."

#. Occurrence A_1:555:14557: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_1_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_1
#: A_1:555
msgctxt "text_id=14557 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そういえば、橙子さんの髪の色は蒼崎より濃かったね。"
msgstr "\"You know, Touko's hair was darker than yours, Aozaki."

#. Occurrence A_1:555:14558: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_1_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_1
#: A_1:555
msgctxt "text_id=14558 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　あんな綺麗な赤毛は初めて見た。短くしてるのはもったいなかったな」"
msgstr "  I've never seen such beautiful red hair. Shame it was so short.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:560:14559: scene=A_1
#: A_1:560
msgctxt "text_id=14559 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これも返事は期待せず、ぼんやりと呟く草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro rambled on, not expecting a response."

#. Occurrence A_1:565:14560: scene=A_1
#: A_1:565
msgctxt "text_id=14560 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし。"
msgstr "  However..."

#. Occurrence A_1:592:14561: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:592
msgctxt "text_id=14561 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……短かったって、姉貴の髪が……？」"
msgstr "\"Her hair was cut short...?\""

#. Occurrence A_1:598:14562: scene=A_1
#: A_1:598
msgctxt "text_id=14562 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心ここにあらずだった青子の表情が、普段の鋭さを取り戻した。"
msgstr "  Aoko's expression went from nonchalant to its usual sharpness."

#. Occurrence A_1:633:14563: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:633
msgctxt "text_id=14563 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それどういうこと？　短くしてるって、髪の毛の事よね？」"
msgstr "\"What do you mean short? You are talking about her hair, right?\""

#. Occurrence A_1:652:14564: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_1_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_1
#: A_1:652
msgctxt "text_id=14564 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ああ。有珠より短かったけど、それがどうしたんだ？」"
msgstr "\"Yeah. Even shorter than Alice's. Is that a big deal?\""

#. Occurrence A_1:658:14565: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:658
msgctxt "text_id=14565 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「別に。あの人、前は私より長かったってだけ。"
msgstr "\"No. She just used to have longer hair than mine."

#. Occurrence A_1:678:14566: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:678
msgctxt "text_id=14566 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　―――そう。あの髪を切ったのね、姉貴は」"
msgstr "  Hm... So she really cut it all off.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:684:14567: scene=A_1
#: A_1:684
msgctxt "text_id=14567 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　深刻な独白。"
msgstr "  Aoko spoke in a grave tone."

#. Occurrence A_1:689:14568: scene=A_1
#: A_1:689
msgctxt "text_id=14568 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠も関心があるのか、黒い瞳を草十郎に向けていた。"
msgstr "  Showing slight interest, Alice turned to Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence A_1:748:14569: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_1_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_1
#: A_1:748
msgctxt "text_id=14569 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……普通じゃないな。髪を切ったぐらいでどうしたんだ、一体。橙子さんの髪が短いと蒼崎が困るのか？」"
msgstr "\"What's so bad about her getting a haircut? Does it affect you in any way, Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence A_1:767:14570: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:767
msgctxt "text_id=14570 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「…………まあ、その通りだけど。"
msgstr "\"Well, yeah, it does."

#. Occurrence A_1:779:14571: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:779
msgctxt "text_id=14571 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　いいわ、どうせ夜まで暇だし、説明ぐらいはしてあげる。"
msgstr "  As we have nothing to do until nightfall, I suppose I'll explain."

#. Occurrence A_1:785:14572: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:785
msgctxt "text_id=14572 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　アンタがそんなコト言わなければ、未知数のまま橙子と戦うはめになっただろうし」"
msgstr "  You're lucky. If you hadn't said anything, we'd have been oblivious when fighting her.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:817:14573: scene=A_1
#: A_1:817
msgctxt "text_id=14573 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ま、ご褒美ね、と青子は有珠を一瞥した。"
msgstr "  Aoko knowingly glanced at Alice, her expression suggesting she was treating her."

#. Occurrence A_1:822:14574: scene=A_1
#: A_1:822
msgctxt "text_id=14574 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おそらく有珠に同意を求めているのだろう。"
msgstr "  She was also likely seeking approval."

#. Occurrence A_1:827:14575: scene=A_1
#: A_1:827
msgctxt "text_id=14575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はやっぱり無表情で、青子の視線に肯定も否定もしない。"
msgstr "  Alice remained stoic as ever, her expression showing neither approval nor disapproval."

#. Occurrence A_1:859:14576: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:859
msgctxt "text_id=14576 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「簡単に言うと、魔術師にとっては髪の毛も武器ってコトよ。"
msgstr "\"How can I put this... Mages can use their hair as a weapon."

#. Occurrence A_1:865:14577: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:865
msgctxt "text_id=14577 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　昔っから人間の髪や目は魔術の材料になりやすいの。女の場合は<殊更|ことさら>にね。"
msgstr "  For the longest time, hair and eyes have been vital to magecraft. Especially in my sister's case."

#. Occurrence A_1:871:14578: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:871
msgctxt "text_id=14578 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　瞳の色は<多彩|おおい>ほどいいし、髪も長いほど質がいい。"
msgstr "  The more colorful the eyes, the better. The longer the hair, the higher the quality."

#. Occurrence A_1:877:14579: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:877
msgctxt "text_id=14579 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　髪の毛は自身と同一視しやすいし、長い年月をかけて育てられる、原始的で強力な“原料”と思ってくれていいわ。"
msgstr "  Hair has the same qualities as the body, and when grown over many years it becomes a strong base component."

#. Occurrence A_1:896:14580: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:896
msgctxt "text_id=14580 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私が髪を伸ばしてるのはまあ、そういうこと。手入れが大変なんだけど、そこは女だから半分趣味みたいなもんよね」"
msgstr "  That's why I'm growing mine out. Looking after it is a pain sometimes, but I like styling it.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:916:14581: scene=A_1
#: A_1:916
msgctxt "text_id=14581 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……はて。そうなると有珠はどうなのだろうか、と草十郎は有珠の横顔を盗み見る。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro glanced furtively at Alice, wondering if the same held true for her."

#. Occurrence A_1:934:14582: scene=A_1
#: A_1:934
msgctxt "text_id=14582 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の言う通り、手入れが面倒なので切ってしまったのか。"
msgstr "  Maybe Alice had cut it because it was a hassle to maintain."

#. Occurrence A_1:939:14583: scene=A_1
#: A_1:939
msgctxt "text_id=14583 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　バカらしい考えだが、有珠ならありうるな、と草十郎は内心うなずいた。"
msgstr "  It sounded stupid, but then again this was Alice. Soujyuro nodded to himself."

#. Occurrence A_1:977:14584: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_1_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_1
#: A_1:977
msgctxt "text_id=14584 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ん？　じゃあ蒼崎としてはいい事じゃないか。"
msgstr "\"So that's good for you then, right, Aozaki?"

#. Occurrence A_1:983:14585: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_1_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_1
#: A_1:983
msgctxt "text_id=14585 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　橙子さんの髪、短いんだから」"
msgstr "  I mean that Touko's got short hair.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1017:14586: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1017
msgctxt "text_id=14586 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それが<三咲町|ここ>に来る前に使い切ったものならいいんだけど。"
msgstr "\"If she's used all her hair before coming here, then yes."

#. Occurrence A_1:1023:14587: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1023
msgctxt "text_id=14587 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　伸ばした髪には色々と使い道があるのよ。"
msgstr "  Long hair can be used in tons of ways."

#. Occurrence A_1:1029:14588: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1029
msgctxt "text_id=14588 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私は瞬間的な術の強化にしか使えないけど、姉貴だったら恒久的な術の補佐に使うはず。"
msgstr "  I can only use it to temporarily reinforce magecraft, but my sister can use it to complement longer-lasting spells."

#. Occurrence A_1:1047:14589: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1047
msgctxt "text_id=14589 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　年月と想念を蓄えた髪は魔術師の分身とも言える。"
msgstr "  With all those thoughts and memories in that hair, it's like having a mage clone."

#. Occurrence A_1:1053:14590: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1053
msgctxt "text_id=14590 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　そういった物をね、死んじゃった犬だの猫だのを反魂させる時に与えると、術者に<服従|ふくじゅう>する使い魔が出来上がるの」"
msgstr "  You can even use it on a dead dog or cat, reviving them and making them the mage's familiar.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1086:14591: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1086
msgctxt "text_id=14591 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「生前魔力のなかった使い魔……例えば猫とか、犬ね。これらは術者の髪を取りこんで独自の魔術回路を得る。"
msgstr "\"Familiars with no previous magical energy, like said dog or cat, can acquire Magic Circuits. All thanks to the hair."

#. Occurrence A_1:1092:14592: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1092
msgctxt "text_id=14592 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　新生する事でまったく違う生き物―――<猫|・><の|・><魔|・><術|・><師|・>になるってコト。たとえば人語を解したり、人間に化けてみたりって。"
msgstr "  The reanimated creature becomes something entirely different. They can even speak and take human form."

#. Occurrence A_1:1098:14593: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1098
msgctxt "text_id=14593 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　行動原理も変わってしまって、たいていは術者に似通った性格になるわ。そうよね、有珠？」"
msgstr "  Their behavior changes, too, to something resembling a regular mage. Right, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1128:14594: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1128
msgctxt "text_id=14594 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の最後の言葉は、どこか意地の悪い笑みが含まれていた。"
msgstr "  Her last words came with a mocking smile."

#. Occurrence A_1:1133:14595: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1133
msgctxt "text_id=14595 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はそれを無言で受け流す。"
msgstr "  Alice silently ignored it."

#. Occurrence A_1:1166:14596: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_1_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1166
msgctxt "text_id=14596 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「じゃあ、橙子さんには有珠のみたいな使い魔がいると……？」"
msgstr "\"So, Touko has familiars like Alice?\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1172:14597: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1172
msgctxt "text_id=14597 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そう見るのが妥当でしょうね。"
msgstr "\"I think that's a safe bet."

#. Occurrence A_1:1178:14598: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1178
msgctxt "text_id=14598 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　姉貴は二十年以上伸ばし続けた髪と引き替えに、強力な使い魔を用意したってことよ」"
msgstr "  She must have been growing her hair for over twenty years. She could have an army of powerful familiars.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1199:14599: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_1_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1199
msgctxt "text_id=14599 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1219:14600: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1219
msgctxt "text_id=14600 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　遊園地での戦い。"
msgstr "  The fight at the amusement park..."

#. Occurrence A_1:1239:14601: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1239
msgctxt "text_id=14601 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺有珠が解放したフラットスナークを思い出して、草十郎は息を呑む。"
msgstr "  Just the thought of Alice Kuonji releasing Flat Snark sent a shiver down Soujyuro's spine."

#. Occurrence A_1:1244:14602: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1244
msgctxt "text_id=14602 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの月の油は特注も特注で、あれだけの使い魔は世界に二つとないという話だが―――"
msgstr "  The Oil of the Moon had been a unique familiar, out of this world..."

#. Occurrence A_1:1290:14603: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1290
msgctxt "text_id=14603 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ほら、そこ心配しない、三咲町をぶっ壊す規模の使い魔なんてありっこないから。"
msgstr "\"Hey, don't worry about it. She couldn't create a familiar that could destroy Misaki or anything."

#. Occurrence A_1:1296:14604: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0023; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1296
msgctxt "text_id=14604 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　たしかに長く歴史のある髪を使用するほど、強力な使い魔が出来上がる」"
msgstr "  Still, a familiar created with hair that long would be incredibly powerful.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1323:14605: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0024; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1323
msgctxt "text_id=14605 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「けど、髪を使った魔術師はそれまで溜めこんできた三柱のうちの一つを、初めからやり直さないといけない。"
msgstr "\"Mages that use their hair though, they need to reset one of the three pillars from the beginning."

#. Occurrence A_1:1329:14606: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0025; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1329
msgctxt "text_id=14606 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　切った髪はまた伸ばさないといけないでしょ？　使い魔を造るのは簡単だけど、そう多く従えないのはそういう事なの」"
msgstr "  They have to grow their hair again. Making familiars is easy, but not leading them.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1364:14607: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1364
msgctxt "text_id=14607 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　話しているうちに何かふっきれたのか、青子は上機嫌になりつつある。"
msgstr "  As Aoko spoke, her mood visibly improved, as though she had made a breakthrough."

#. Occurrence A_1:1376:14608: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_1_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1376
msgctxt "text_id=14608 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "『……犬とか猫、か……』"
msgstr "\"...Dogs and cats...\" "

#. Occurrence A_1:1381:14609: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1381
msgctxt "text_id=14609 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、青子の話を聞いて首を傾げる草十郎。"
msgstr "  tilting his head to the side."

#. Occurrence A_1:1386:14610: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1386
msgctxt "text_id=14610 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の想像力では、どう考えても、犬と猫から強そうなイメージは生まれないようだ。"
msgstr "  He could not imagine a world where dogs and cats were so powerful."

#. Occurrence A_1:1419:14611: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1419
msgctxt "text_id=14611 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……変ね。"
msgstr "\"It's strange..."

#. Occurrence A_1:1425:14612: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1425
msgctxt "text_id=14612 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　橙子さんは人形師よ。使い魔を造って自分のレベルを下げるのは、どうなのかしら」"
msgstr "  Touko is a puppet master. I wonder why she would lower herself to make familiars?\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1450:14613: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0026; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1450
msgctxt "text_id=14613 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「協力者がいないだけでしょ。蒼崎のお家騒動に<他人|ひと>の手を借りたくないから、自分だけで全部やるつもりなのよ」"
msgstr "\"She probably has nobody to help her. And she wouldn't ask for assistance with a personal matter concerning the family.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1477:14614: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0027; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1477
msgctxt "text_id=14614 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あ……もしかして、遊園地の人形って姉貴の髪で造られたんじゃないだろうな……」"
msgstr "\"Actually... maybe the puppet at the amusement park wasn't made from her hair.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1501:14615: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1501
msgctxt "text_id=14615 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……たしかに、話に聞いたかぎりだと特注品ね。"
msgstr "\"...Now that you mention it, you did say that it seemed highly customized."

#. Occurrence A_1:1507:14616: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1507
msgctxt "text_id=14616 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　呪いによる永久機関、両手のギミック、フィンの一撃、執念深さ。橙子さんでもゼロから造るのは難しいでしょうけど……」"
msgstr "  Its curse-based perpetual-motion, coiled arms, Finn Shot, the depths of its obsession... It's unlikely Touko created the puppet from scratch.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1528:14617: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0028; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1528
msgctxt "text_id=14617 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「けど、なによ有珠？」"
msgstr "\"Meaning...?\" "

#. Occurrence A_1:1561:14618: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1561
msgctxt "text_id=14618 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……あの人は、人形に自己を投影するような人じゃないわ。"
msgstr "\"Touko's not the type to put herself into her creations."

#. Occurrence A_1:1567:14619: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1567
msgctxt "text_id=14619 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　完璧な偽物なら許すけど、偽物にすぎない偽物は容赦なく壊してきた。"
msgstr "  She might consider doing it for a perfect replica, but the ones we destroyed weren't even faint copies of her."

#. Occurrence A_1:1574:14620: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1574
msgctxt "text_id=14620 | speaker=alice"
msgid "青子から見て、その特注人形は橙子さんと同じ力量を持っていた？」"
msgstr "Aoko, did that puppet have the same power as Touko?\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1580:14621: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0029; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1580
msgctxt "text_id=14621 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……まさか。遠く及ばないわよ、あんなの」"
msgstr "\"No way. Not even close.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1607:14622: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1607
msgctxt "text_id=14622 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「なら橙子さんの髪と、あの人形は別件よ。"
msgstr "\"Then it would not have been made using her hair."

#. Occurrence A_1:1613:14623: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1613
msgctxt "text_id=14623 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　あの人が自分の魔力を分け与えたほどの使い魔が、あと一体はいると見るべきね」"
msgstr "  Meaning we have to keep our eyes open for a familiar fused with her magical energy.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1647:14624: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0030; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1647
msgctxt "text_id=14624 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……専門家としての意見？"
msgstr "\"So in your expert opinion..."

#. Occurrence A_1:1653:14625: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0031; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1653
msgctxt "text_id=14625 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　つまり、その使い魔は<姉|・><貴|・><よ|・><り|・><強|・><い|・>？」"
msgstr "  ...you think that her familiar could be stronger than my sister herself?\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1671:14626: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1671
msgctxt "text_id=14626 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「そうでないと意味がないわ。"
msgstr "\"If it's not, then what's the point of creating one?"

#. Occurrence A_1:1677:14627: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1677
msgctxt "text_id=14627 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……人手が足りないというのもあるでしょうけど。だってわたしたちは二人、彼女は一人だもの」"
msgstr "  She needs help. It's two of us versus one of her.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1709:14628: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0032; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1709
msgctxt "text_id=14628 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――同時制圧も想定済みってワケ。"
msgstr "\"So she's going to attack with the familiar at the same time."

#. Occurrence A_1:1715:14629: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0033; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1715
msgctxt "text_id=14629 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　なるほどね。その場合、どっちが強い方を引き当てても恨みっこなしよ有珠。"
msgstr "  That makes sense. It would at least be a fair fight."

#. Occurrence A_1:1727:14630: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0034; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1727
msgctxt "text_id=14630 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ま、こと使い魔でアンタが後れを取るとは思えないけど」"
msgstr "  Well, *fairer.* When it comes to familiars, I think you have the upper hand.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1757:14631: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1757
msgctxt "text_id=14631 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　使い魔同士の戦いなら久遠寺有珠に敗北はない。"
msgstr "  Alice had never been defeated by a familiar."

#. Occurrence A_1:1762:14632: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1762
msgctxt "text_id=14632 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう楽観する青子に、有珠はため息まじりに忠告する。"
msgstr "  She sighed at Aoko's overconfidence."

#. Occurrence A_1:1783:14633: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1783
msgctxt "text_id=14633 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「青子。たとえ二十年間の蓄えを付与したとしても、その器が小動物では限度があるわ。"
msgstr "\"Aoko, even if she utilizes her twenty-year stockpile, she can only use small animals as vessels."

#. Occurrence A_1:1789:14634: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1789
msgctxt "text_id=14634 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　あの橙子さんが切札になる使い魔を用意したのなら、それは」"
msgstr "  If Touko was to prepare a familiar as her trump card...\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1827:14635: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0035; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1827
msgctxt "text_id=14635 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……よしてよ。"
msgstr "\"...Don't you say it."

#. Occurrence A_1:1833:14636: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0036; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1833
msgctxt "text_id=14636 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　いくらなんでも、姉貴はそこまで悪趣味じゃないわ」"
msgstr "  No sister of mine would stoop that low.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1866:14637: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1866
msgctxt "text_id=14637 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　意味ありげに見つめ合うふたり。"
msgstr "  Aoko and Alice stared at each other."

#. Occurrence A_1:1888:14638: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1888
msgctxt "text_id=14638 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間に会話が戻ってきた事は嬉しいが、不穏すぎるのも困りものだ。"
msgstr "  The conversation had returned to the drawing room, but the subject matter was not for the faint of heart."

#. Occurrence A_1:1929:14639: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1929
msgctxt "text_id=14639 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……そうね。けれど、人間を追いつめるのに最も効果的な相手は、やっぱり人間なのよ。"
msgstr "\"I suppose. Still, nothing hunts down a human better than a human."

#. Occurrence A_1:1935:14640: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_1_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1935
msgctxt "text_id=14640 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　橙子さんが死者を亡者にしていなくても、それと同格の相手がいる、ぐらいは覚悟しておいて」"
msgstr "  Touko may not have raised the dead, but she probably has something just as powerful up her sleeve.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1958:14641: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0037; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:1958
msgctxt "text_id=14641 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……はいはい、分かったわよ。たしかに天才ってヤツは空気読めないから。どんな生き物の死体を用意してきても驚かないわ」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, yeah, okay. I admit geniuses can get stuck in their own world sometimes. Whatever corpse she throws at me, I'll be ready.\""

#. Occurrence A_1:1984:14642: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1984
msgctxt "text_id=14642 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の冷たい言葉に、青子は不本意そうに頷いた。"
msgstr "  Aoko nodded reluctantly at Alice's directness."

#. Occurrence A_1:1989:14643: scene=A_1
#: A_1:1989
msgctxt "text_id=14643 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言うまでもなく、草十郎にはちんぷんかんぷんである。"
msgstr "  Needless to say, Soujyuro was completely lost."

#. Occurrence A_1:2026:14644: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_1_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_1
#: A_1:2026
msgctxt "text_id=14644 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……その、よく分からないけど。"
msgstr "\"Um... I don't quite follow."

#. Occurrence A_1:2032:14645: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_1_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_1
#: A_1:2032
msgctxt "text_id=14645 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　なんで蒼崎たちは死んでるって事に固執するんだ？　生きてる物じゃ駄目なのか？」"
msgstr "  Why're you both convinced the familiar is dead?\""

#. Occurrence A_1:2062:14646: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0038; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:2062
msgctxt "text_id=14646 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それは使い魔じゃなくて協力者でしょ。使い魔は基本、術者なくしては生きられないものにしないと。"
msgstr "\"Because living partners aren't familiars; they're co-conspirators. Familiars can't live with a mage to sustain them."

#. Occurrence A_1:2068:14647: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0039; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:2068
msgctxt "text_id=14647 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それでいて優れた<人格|いし>を持ち、術者の死角や盲点を補える知性もある―――それが一流の使い魔の条件よ。"
msgstr "  Still, they're the perfect foil: strong-willed, and smart enough to compensate for their mage's shortcomings. Everything you'd want from a great familiar."

#. Occurrence A_1:2074:14648: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0040; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:2074
msgctxt "text_id=14648 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　正直な話、それだけ都合のいいヤツは死から作り直すしかないってワケ」"
msgstr "  Let's be real. Who wouldn't want to bring that kind of partner back to life?\""

#. Occurrence A_1:2107:14649: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2107
msgctxt "text_id=14649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　絶対服従でありながら、術者の死角……勘違いやドジをフォローする役回り。"
msgstr "  Completely obedient, and capable of compensating for their mage's weaknesses..."

#. Occurrence A_1:2112:14650: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2112
msgctxt "text_id=14650 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つまるところ、使い魔というのは今の自分とあんまり変わらない連中なのか、と草十郎は納得した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro felt that a familiar was little different than himself."

#. Occurrence A_1:2139:14651: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0041; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:2139
msgctxt "text_id=14651 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……さて。"
msgstr "\"Now then..."

#. Occurrence A_1:2145:14652: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0042; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:2145
msgctxt "text_id=14652 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　姉貴は昔からルーン使いだったから戦術は予測できる。"
msgstr "  My sister has always been a rune user, so we can somewhat predict her tactics."

#. Occurrence A_1:2151:14653: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0043; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:2151
msgctxt "text_id=14653 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　問題の切札もどうやら使い魔らしい。"
msgstr "  Her trump card, which we need to be worried about, is probably a familiar."

#. Occurrence A_1:2163:14654: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0044; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:2163
msgctxt "text_id=14654 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　自動人形もさすがにこの前で使いきっただろうし……」"
msgstr "  And it's likely she used up all of her automata already...\""

#. Occurrence A_1:2169:14655: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2169
msgctxt "text_id=14655 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　確認するように言いながら、青子は有珠と視線を合わせた。"
msgstr "  Aoko spoke directly to Alice, looking for confirmation."

#. Occurrence A_1:2174:14656: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2174
msgctxt "text_id=14656 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は頷きだけで同意する。"
msgstr "  Alice nodded in agreement."

#. Occurrence A_1:2201:14657: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0045; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:2201
msgctxt "text_id=14657 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「じゃあ予定通り、今日で終わりにしよう。"
msgstr "\"So we stick to the plan. Let's call it a night."

#. Occurrence A_1:2230:14658: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_1_0046; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_1
#: A_1:2230
msgctxt "text_id=14658 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　この一ヶ月、好き放題やられた借り―――ぎったんぎったんにして、あのバカ姉貴に返してやる……！」"
msgstr "  I'm gonna make her pay for all the crap she's put us through for the last month!\""

#. Occurrence A_1:2236:14659: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2236
msgctxt "text_id=14659 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぐっと握りこぶしを作る青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko clenched teeth and balled her fists."

#. Occurrence A_1:2241:14660: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2241
msgctxt "text_id=14660 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こうして見るとごく一般的な姉妹ゲンカにしか見えないのは、おそらく、本当に姉妹ゲンカにすぎないからだろう。"
msgstr "  It all seemed like nothing more than sibling rivalry. In fact, that's probably all it was."

#. Occurrence A_1:2280:14661: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2280
msgctxt "text_id=14661 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな青子の様子に、草十郎はそっと安堵の息をついた。"
msgstr "  Looking at Aoko, Soujyuro let out a sigh of relief."

#. Occurrence A_1:2285:14662: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2285
msgctxt "text_id=14662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先日やってきた橙子と、その後の青子たちの緊張感は、本気で殺し合うような空気だった。"
msgstr "  With what happened with Touko, and how they reacted to her visit, the atmosphere had been deathly tense."

#. Occurrence A_1:2290:14663: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2290
msgctxt "text_id=14663 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が、今の青子には、そんな凄惨さはまったくない。"
msgstr "  For now though, Aoko seemed much calmer."

#. Occurrence A_1:2318:14664: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2318
msgctxt "text_id=14664 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　結局、刀はもとの鞘に戻るのだろうな、とぼんやりと考えて、草十郎は安心したのだ。"
msgstr "  He took comfort in the thought that perhaps the sisters would just bury the hatchet."

#. Occurrence A_1:2323:14665: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2323
msgctxt "text_id=14665 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子と橙子。たとえ両者が赤の他人であったとしても、彼は彼女たちの争う姿は見たくはなかった。"
msgstr "  Even if Aoko and Touko were not sisters, he would not want to see what would happen if they fought."

#. Occurrence A_1:2329:14666: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2329
msgctxt "text_id=14666 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……時間は緩やかに過ぎていく。"
msgstr "  The hands of the clock turned gently."

#. Occurrence A_1:2334:14667: scene=A_1
#: A_1:2334
msgctxt "text_id=14667 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の言う決着の夜―――彼の浅はかな間違いを正す、無慈悲な夜の静寂へと。"
msgstr "  approaching Judgment night, a merciless silence would soon come to mock Soujyuro's complacency."

#. Occurrence A_2:51:14668: scene=A_2
#: A_2:51
msgctxt "text_id=14668 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜の訪れと共に、二つのものが消え去った。"
msgstr "  As night appeared, two things vanished."

#. Occurrence A_2:57:14669: scene=A_2
#: A_2:57
msgctxt "text_id=14669 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一つは気まぐれな<白雪|しらゆき>。"
msgstr "  The first was the whimsical snowfall."

#. Occurrence A_2:62:14670: scene=A_2
#: A_2:62
msgctxt "text_id=14670 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一つは、丘の上の洋館の明かりである。"
msgstr "  The second was the lights of the mansion on the top of the hill."

#. Occurrence A_2:108:14671: scene=A_2
#: A_2:108
msgctxt "text_id=14671 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館に青子と有珠の姿はない。"
msgstr "  Aoko and Alice were nowhere to be seen inside."

#. Occurrence A_2:113:14672: scene=A_2
#: A_2:113
msgctxt "text_id=14672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残っているのは草十郎だけだ。"
msgstr "  Only Soujyuro remained."

#. Occurrence A_2:119:14673: scene=A_2
#: A_2:119
msgctxt "text_id=14673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　クリスマスイヴの夜。"
msgstr "  It was the night of Christmas Eve."

#. Occurrence A_2:124:14674: scene=A_2
#: A_2:124
msgctxt "text_id=14674 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いまだ橙子の隠れ家を見つけてはいないものの、彼女たちには今日と明日が決着の日だと判っていた。"
msgstr "  Though Aoko and Alice had yet to find Touko, they knew everything would be concluded over the course of this day and the next."

#. Occurrence A_2:170:14675: scene=A_2
#: A_2:170
msgctxt "text_id=14675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　祭りとは日常の中の非日常だ。"
msgstr "  Christmas comes but once a year."

#. Occurrence A_2:175:14676: scene=A_2
#: A_2:175
msgctxt "text_id=14676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　終わり、蘇り、やり直しを象徴する特異点である。"
msgstr "  It was a singular time for endings and new beginnings."

#. Occurrence A_2:180:14677: scene=A_2
#: A_2:180
msgctxt "text_id=14677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<聖誕祭|クリスマス>など百年程度の歴史しかなく、形骸的な記念日にすぎないとしても、営みの<環|わ>に組みこまれているのなら偽物も本物もない。"
msgstr "  In Japan, the modern holiday dated back only about a hundred years, and celebrated Christ's birth only in name-with all its latter-day trappings, it was neither a pure homage nor corruption of the festival that inspired it."

#. Occurrence A_2:185:14678: scene=A_2
#: A_2:185
msgctxt "text_id=14678 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　祭りにおいて、土地の<魔|マ><力|ナ>の増大は<著|いちじる>しい。"
msgstr "  Regardless, there was a significant increase in the land's mana during festivals."

#. Occurrence A_2:190:14679: scene=A_2
#: A_2:190
msgctxt "text_id=14679 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　造るにしろ壊すにしろ、蓄えられてきた歪みは術者の魔術行使を助けるだろう。"
msgstr "  Such charged distortions were a boon to a mage's craft, be it creative or destructive."

#. Occurrence A_2:237:14680: scene=A_2
#: A_2:237
msgctxt "text_id=14680 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子はこの土地に造られた支点……土地、人々からの魔力を集め、正しく循環させている……を壊そうとしている。"
msgstr "  Touko Aozaki sought to destroy the local sigils, which gathered and properly cycled the magical energy of the land and its people."

#. Occurrence A_2:243:14681: scene=A_2
#: A_2:243
msgctxt "text_id=14681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎もそれぐらいは青子たちの会話から聞き取っていた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was able to gather that much from Aoko and Alice's conversation."

#. Occurrence A_2:248:14682: scene=A_2
#: A_2:248
msgctxt "text_id=14682 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　五ヶ所にある支点のうち三つは既に破壊され、橙子の手に渡っている。"
msgstr "  Touko had already claimed three sigils."

#. Occurrence A_2:294:14683: scene=A_2
#: A_2:294
msgctxt "text_id=14683 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残るは二ヶ所。"
msgstr "  Only two remained."

#. Occurrence A_2:299:14684: scene=A_2
#: A_2:299
msgctxt "text_id=14684 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これ以上の破壊は青子たちの敗北を意味する。"
msgstr "  Any further loss would signal Aoko and Alice's defeat."

#. Occurrence A_2:304:14685: scene=A_2
#: A_2:304
msgctxt "text_id=14685 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子と有珠は残った支点を守るため、別行動を取らざるをえない。"
msgstr "  In order to protect the remaining ones, they had to split up."

#. Occurrence A_2:309:14686: scene=A_2
#: A_2:309
msgctxt "text_id=14686 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　力量的に劣る青子は、有珠の<使い魔|プロイ>を一体借り受け、最高の<魔力提供|バックアップ>を誇る陶川の支点に。"
msgstr "  Aoko lacked power, so she would need to borrow a Ploy from Alice and head to the Toukawa sigil, which boasted the greatest local energy supply."

#. Occurrence A_2:314:14687: scene=A_2
#: A_2:314
msgctxt "text_id=14687 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は万全の装備で<社木|やしろぎ>の支点へ。"
msgstr "  Alice would go fully equipped to the sigil in Yashirogi."

#. Occurrence A_2:360:14688: scene=A_2
#: A_2:360
msgctxt "text_id=14688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　文明社会のくびきから逃れ、"
msgstr "  Free from the constraints of civilized society,"

#. Occurrence A_2:365:14689: scene=A_2
#: A_2:365
msgctxt "text_id=14689 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術が最大限の威力を発揮する深夜。"
msgstr "  magecraft is most powerful at midnight."

#. Occurrence A_2:371:14690: scene=A_2
#: A_2:371
msgctxt "text_id=14690 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　幼い魔女と魔法使い見習いは、互いの健闘を祈って洋館を後にした。"
msgstr "  The young witch and the apprentice mage wished each other luck, before leaving the mansion."

#. Occurrence A_2:405:14691: scene=A_2
#: A_2:405
msgctxt "text_id=14691 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時刻はじき午後十時になろうとしている。"
msgstr "  It was almost ten at night."

#. Occurrence A_2:410:14692: scene=A_2
#: A_2:410
msgctxt "text_id=14692 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女たちが出立してから、早い事に二時間は経っていた。"
msgstr "  After the girls set out, the first two hours passed quickly."

#. Occurrence A_2:461:14693: scene=A_2
#: A_2:461
msgctxt "text_id=14693 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子が陶川の支点に向かう時、草十郎はロビーまで見送った。"
msgstr "  When Aoko was ready to head off, Soujyuro walked with her to the foyer."

#. Occurrence A_2:466:14694: scene=A_2
#: A_2:466
msgctxt "text_id=14694 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎に話はなかったし、青子にだって話はなかった。"
msgstr "  Neither had spoken a word to each other."

#. Occurrence A_2:471:14695: scene=A_2
#: A_2:471
msgctxt "text_id=14695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<悲壮|ひそう>な空気もなく、青子は<颯爽|さっそう>と出ていった。"
msgstr "  She had departed without showing any sign of fear."

#. Occurrence A_2:476:14696: scene=A_2
#: A_2:476
msgctxt "text_id=14696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　宣言した通り、青子は草十郎を関わらせる気はないのか、それとも戦力と見ていないのか。"
msgstr "  It was difficult to tell whether she did not want to get him involved, or whether she did not see him a worthy ally in combat."

#. Occurrence A_2:489:14697: scene=A_2
#: A_2:489
msgctxt "text_id=14697 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうしてか、それが少しだけ胸に残った。"
msgstr "  The thought stuck with him."

#. Occurrence A_2:535:14698: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_2_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_2
#: A_2:535
msgctxt "text_id=14698 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_2:541:14699: scene=A_2
#: A_2:541
msgctxt "text_id=14699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大きく息を吐く。"
msgstr "  He let out a long sigh."

#. Occurrence A_2:546:14700: scene=A_2
#: A_2:546
msgctxt "text_id=14700 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<落胆|らくたん>でも<焦燥|しょうそう>でもない。"
msgstr "  Not out of dejection or frustration."

#. Occurrence A_2:551:14701: scene=A_2
#: A_2:551
msgctxt "text_id=14701 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　機械的な、これといった<感|い><情|み>のない息継ぎだ。"
msgstr "  It was a mechanical, emotionless breath."

#. Occurrence A_2:583:14702: scene=A_2
#: A_2:583
msgctxt "text_id=14702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　張りつくような冷たさの床に座りこんで、草十郎はぼんやりと天窓を見上げる。"
msgstr "  He sat on the near-frozen floor, staring vacantly up at the skylight."

#. Occurrence A_2:603:14703: scene=A_2
#: A_2:603
msgctxt "text_id=14703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　切り取られた空からは、雲間から覗く月の光。"
msgstr "  Moonlight peaked through the clouds."

#. Occurrence A_2:608:14704: scene=A_2
#: A_2:608
msgctxt "text_id=14704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　町に降り積もった雪は月光を照り返して、夜を真白に照らしているのだろう。"
msgstr "  He imagined the moonlight bouncing off the town's powdery blanket and illuminating the night."

#. Occurrence A_2:613:14705: scene=A_2
#: A_2:613
msgctxt "text_id=14705 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その町中に、彼が立つ事はない。"
msgstr "  But he would not find himself downtown."

#. Occurrence A_2:618:14706: scene=A_2
#: A_2:618
msgctxt "text_id=14706 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　当然のように、初めから関わる事はない。"
msgstr "  Watching from the sidelines was his role to begin with."

#. Occurrence A_2:638:14707: scene=A_2
#: A_2:638
msgctxt "text_id=14707 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女たちの世界と彼の世界は違っている。"
msgstr "  His roommates and he lived worlds apart."

#. Occurrence A_2:643:14708: scene=A_2
#: A_2:643
msgctxt "text_id=14708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ついていく事はできないし、彼にその意志も意義も思いつかないのなら、あとは<傍観|ぼうかん>するだけだ。"
msgstr "  He could not keep up with them, and if he did not show the same kind of will, he would remain on the sidelines."

#. Occurrence A_2:648:14709: scene=A_2
#: A_2:648
msgctxt "text_id=14709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ、"
msgstr "  However..."

#. Occurrence A_2:666:14710: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_2_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_2
#: A_2:666
msgctxt "text_id=14710 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――そうか。"
msgstr "\"I get it."

#. Occurrence A_2:673:14711: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_2_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_2
#: A_2:673
msgctxt "text_id=14711 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "この手が必要な時は、もうないのか」"
msgstr "I'm not needed anymore.\""

#. Occurrence A_2:678:14712: scene=A_2
#: A_2:678
msgctxt "text_id=14712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　独白して月を見上げる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro looked up at the moon."

#. Occurrence A_2:731:14713: scene=A_2
#: A_2:731
msgctxt "text_id=14713 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから、それが少しだけ、悲しかった。"
msgstr "  Somewhere deep inside, he felt a trickle of sadness."

#. Occurrence A_3:72:14714: scene=A_3
#: A_3:72
msgctxt "text_id=14714 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その公園は、人々の記憶から忘却されたかのように、白い闇に沈んでいた。"
msgstr "  Veiled in white and cloaked in darkness, the park seemed like a forgotten memory."

#. Occurrence A_3:77:14715: scene=A_3
#: A_3:77
msgctxt "text_id=14715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人の気配は完全に絶えている。"
msgstr "  Not a soul was in sight."

#. Occurrence A_3:82:14716: scene=A_3
#: A_3:82
msgctxt "text_id=14716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜は普段より何倍も深く得体が知れないが、同時に、息を呑むほど清潔だ。"
msgstr "  The night felt far more enigmatic than usual, yet the air was clean enough to drink."

#. Occurrence A_3:88:14717: scene=A_3
#: A_3:88
msgctxt "text_id=14717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雲間から届くかすかな月光だけで、世界のすべてを見渡せるほどに。"
msgstr "  Though only a sliver of moonlight peered through the clouds, it lit up the entire world."

#. Occurrence A_3:121:14718: scene=A_3
#: A_3:121
msgctxt "text_id=14718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな束の間の永遠に、少女の足音が響いていく。"
msgstr "  In those moments, a young girl's footsteps echoed,"

#. Occurrence A_3:134:14719: scene=A_3
#: A_3:134
msgctxt "text_id=14719 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<無|む><垢|く>の<白野|ビャクヤ>に、<静寂|シジマ>を踏む靴がひとつ。"
msgstr "  trampling the still white silence under a midnight sun."

#. Occurrence A_3:139:14720: scene=A_3
#: A_3:139
msgctxt "text_id=14720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜空には蒼い闇夜と<薄墨|うすずみ>の月。"
msgstr "  The pale moon illuminated the inky blue sky."

#. Occurrence A_3:144:14721: scene=A_3
#: A_3:144
msgctxt "text_id=14721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少しばかりの街灯と、場違いな電話ボックスだけが、いまは文明の名残だった。"
msgstr "  Only a few streetlights and an incongruous phone booth betrayed signs of civilization."

#. Occurrence A_3:187:14722: scene=A_3
#: A_3:187
msgctxt "text_id=14722 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　現れたのは黒衣の少女。"
msgstr "  A girl appeared, dressed in black."

#. Occurrence A_3:198:14723: scene=A_3
#: A_3:198
msgctxt "text_id=14723 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雪原で浮き彫りになる姿は、紛れもなく久遠寺有珠だ。"
msgstr "  Against the snowy landscape, the figure of Alice Kuonji was unmistakable."

#. Occurrence A_3:203:14724: scene=A_3
#: A_3:203
msgctxt "text_id=14724 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<外套|がいとう>、帽子、手袋。"
msgstr "  Pure black, deeper than even the night,"

#. Occurrence A_3:208:14725: scene=A_3
#: A_3:208
msgctxt "text_id=14725 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その全てが黒く、瞳と髪すら、闇より深い<藍色|やみいろ>に染められている。"
msgstr "  were her overcoat, gloves, and hat-even her hair and eyes."

#. Occurrence A_3:228:14726: scene=A_3
#: A_3:228
msgctxt "text_id=14726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　変化は長く訪れなかった。"
msgstr "  Nothing stirred, for a time..."

#. Occurrence A_3:233:14727: scene=A_3
#: A_3:233
msgctxt "text_id=14727 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠にも、その白い風景にも。"
msgstr "  Not Alice, nor the white scenery."

#. Occurrence A_3:238:14728: scene=A_3
#: A_3:238
msgctxt "text_id=14728 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雪原にたたずむ姿は一枚の絵画のように。"
msgstr "  The world was a still painting of a snowy field."

#. Occurrence A_3:243:14729: scene=A_3
#: A_3:243
msgctxt "text_id=14729 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時間だけが過ぎ、公園の周囲から、かろうじてあった家々の明かりが消えていく。"
msgstr "  Only time moved, gradually darkening the lights in the park, and eventually the nearby homes as well."

#. Occurrence A_3:289:14730: scene=A_3
#: A_3:289
msgctxt "text_id=14730 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここ<社木|やしろぎ>は三咲町より近代化の進んだ街だ。"
msgstr "  Yashirogi was a more modern and developed town than Misaki."

#. Occurrence A_3:296:14731: scene=A_3
#: A_3:296
msgctxt "text_id=14731 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　公園はそんな街のただ中にありながら、街の死角になっていた。"
msgstr "  Though the park was located in the center of town, it had become a blind spot."

#. Occurrence A_3:303:14732: scene=A_3
#: A_3:303
msgctxt "text_id=14732 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　開発につまはじきにされた、利用価値のない土地。"
msgstr "  It had been overlooked by developers, and carried no commercial value."

#. Occurrence A_3:310:14733: scene=A_3
#: A_3:310
msgctxt "text_id=14733 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　周囲に住宅は少なく、道を照らす街灯も、深夜になれば明かりを落とす。"
msgstr "  A few houses encircled the park. The street lights turned off at midnight."

#. Occurrence A_3:330:14734: scene=A_3
#: A_3:330
msgctxt "text_id=14734 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな、人々だけでなく機械すら眠りについた白い夜。"
msgstr "  It was a white night. People-even machines-were fast asleep."

#. Occurrence A_3:356:14735: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_3_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_3
#: A_3:356
msgctxt "text_id=14735 | speaker=alice"
msgid "『……わたしが、先なのね』"
msgstr "\"It looks like I got here early.\""

#. Occurrence A_3:367:14736: scene=A_3
#: A_3:367
msgctxt "text_id=14736 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　消えていく灯を見つめながら、有珠は静かに呟いた。"
msgstr "  Alice whispered, watching the streetlights slowly fade."

#. Occurrence A_3:388:14737: scene=A_3
#: A_3:388
msgctxt "text_id=14737 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どこか遠くで、犬の遠吠えが聞こえた気がする。"
msgstr "  She thought she heard a dog howling in the distance."

#. Occurrence A_3:417:14738: scene=A_3
#: A_3:417
msgctxt "text_id=14738 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　月にでも吠えたのだろうか。"
msgstr "  Perhaps it was howling at the moon."

#. Occurrence A_3:422:14739: scene=A_3
#: A_3:422
msgctxt "text_id=14739 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは犬というより狼めいた強さで、長く長く、夜空に立ち上っていった。"
msgstr "  The howl reached deeper into the night than expected. A wolf, maybe?"

#. Occurrence A_3:464:14740: scene=A_3
#: A_3:464
msgctxt "text_id=14740 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　電話が鳴った。"
msgstr "  The phone rang."

#. Occurrence A_3:469:14741: scene=A_3
#: A_3:469
msgctxt "text_id=14741 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎が洋館に住みだして、おそらく初めてになる電話の音は、深夜のホールに寒々しく響き渡った。"
msgstr "  It was perhaps the first time it had hung since Soujyuro moved into the mansion."

#. Occurrence A_3:501:14742: scene=A_3
#: A_3:501
msgctxt "text_id=14742 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はためらいがちに受話器をとる。"
msgstr "  Hesitantly, he picked up the receiver and brought it to his ear."

#. Occurrence A_3:506:14743: scene=A_3
#: A_3:506
msgctxt "text_id=14743 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　受話器からの<音|こえ>はない。"
msgstr "  He heard nothing."

#. Occurrence A_3:511:14744: scene=A_3
#: A_3:511
msgctxt "text_id=14744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　仕方なく何か言おうとして、ハタ、と草十郎は考えこんだ。"
msgstr "  He felt he had to say something, but could not think what."

#. Occurrence A_3:516:14745: scene=A_3
#: A_3:516
msgctxt "text_id=14745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『もしもし、久遠寺ですが』と言えばいいのか、"
msgstr "  Maybe something like, \"Hello? Kuonji residence!\""

#. Occurrence A_3:521:14746: scene=A_3
#: A_3:521
msgctxt "text_id=14746 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それとも『はい、蒼崎ですが』と言えばいいのか。"
msgstr "  Or maybe, \"You've reached the Aozaki residence\"?"

#. Occurrence A_3:526:14747: scene=A_3
#: A_3:526
msgctxt "text_id=14747 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな事を真剣に悩んでいると、受話器ごしに、消えそうなほど細い声が届けられた。"
msgstr "  While he was deep in thought, a voice as light as air came through the receiver."

#. Occurrence A_3:559:14748: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_3_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_3
#: A_3:559
msgctxt "text_id=14748 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……静希……君？」"
msgstr "\"Sizuki...?\""

#. Occurrence A_3:565:14749: scene=A_3
#: A_3:565
msgctxt "text_id=14749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かすれてはいるが、間違いなく久遠寺有珠の声だ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro could barely hear the voice, but it was definitely Alice's."

#. Occurrence A_3:597:14750: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_3_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_3
#: A_3:597
msgctxt "text_id=14750 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうだけど、有珠？」"
msgstr "\"Yes. Is that you, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence A_3:603:14751: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_3_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_3
#: A_3:603
msgctxt "text_id=14751 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「………………………………………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_3:608:14752: scene=A_3
#: A_3:608
msgctxt "text_id=14752 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の声に、有珠は<応|こた>えない。"
msgstr "  No response."

#. Occurrence A_3:613:14753: scene=A_3
#: A_3:613
msgctxt "text_id=14753 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……深い闇のような沈黙。"
msgstr "  The silence was as profound as the night,"

#. Occurrence A_3:618:14754: scene=A_3
#: A_3:618
msgctxt "text_id=14754 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ、受話器の向こうは騒がしく、雑踏めいたノイズに満ちている。"
msgstr "  but for the sound of static from the receiver."

#. Occurrence A_3:624:14755: scene=A_3
#: A_3:624
msgctxt "text_id=14755 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　長い沈黙の後、ようやく有珠は声を出した。"
msgstr "  After a long pause, Alice finally spoke."

#. Occurrence A_3:645:14756: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_3_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_3
#: A_3:645
msgctxt "text_id=14756 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「青子は、いる……？」"
msgstr "\"Is Aoko there...?\""

#. Occurrence A_3:662:14757: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_3_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_3
#: A_3:662
msgctxt "text_id=14757 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、まだ帰ってないけど」"
msgstr "\"No, she hasn't come back yet.\""

#. Occurrence A_3:668:14758: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_3_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_3
#: A_3:668
msgctxt "text_id=14758 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――そう」"
msgstr "\"I see.\""

#. Occurrence A_3:675:14759: scene=A_3
#: A_3:675
msgctxt "text_id=14759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　がしゃり、と電話は切れてしまった。"
msgstr "  With a click, the call ended."

#. Occurrence A_3:680:14760: scene=A_3
#: A_3:680
msgctxt "text_id=14760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何が言いたかったんだろう、と草十郎はひとり考えこんだが、答えはついにでなかった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro wondered if she had had something to say, but could not respond in time."

#. Occurrence A_4:75:14761: scene=A_4
#: A_4:75
msgctxt "text_id=14761 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　降り積もった雪を汚すように、"
msgstr "  Slowly they advanced,"

msgctxt "text_id=14762 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<彼|・><ら|・>はゆっくりと、その包囲の輪を狭めていく。"
msgstr "  carving through the fresh snow."

#. Occurrence A_4:98:14763: scene=A_4
#: A_4:98
msgctxt "text_id=14763 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつの間にこれほどの数が集まったのか。"
msgstr "  There were so many. Where had they all come from?"

#. Occurrence A_4:103:14764: scene=A_4
#: A_4:103
msgctxt "text_id=14764 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　公園には何十匹もの野犬が<群|むら>がり、<荒|あら>い呼吸で有珠を凝視していた。"
msgstr "  Dozens of feral dogs snarled at Alice, their eyes trained on her."

#. Occurrence A_4:124:14765: scene=A_4
#: A_4:124
msgctxt "text_id=14765 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　野犬たちの体は寒さに凍えて、どれもみすぼらしい。"
msgstr "  The snow clung to the beasts' mangy fur."

#. Occurrence A_4:129:14766: scene=A_4
#: A_4:129
msgctxt "text_id=14766 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　反して、かちかちと鳴る牙と血走った眼は、今にも稲妻のように走りだしそうだ。"
msgstr "  Their clenched fangs and bloodshot eyes hid a barely-reined hunger that might burst forth like lightning at any moment."

#. Occurrence A_4:134:14767: scene=A_4
#: A_4:134
msgctxt "text_id=14767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その飢えた腹を満たすために、目前のか弱い少女の、あまりにも食欲をそそる温かな腹の肉へ。"
msgstr "  They yearned to taste her warm flesh, and satiate their empty bellies."

#. Occurrence A_4:139:14768: scene=A_4
#: A_4:139
msgctxt "text_id=14768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼らにとって、黒衣の少女は暗い海に立つ<灯台|きぼう>にさえ見えている。"
msgstr "  To them, the girl in black stood like a lighthouse in a stormy sea."

#. Occurrence A_4:206:14769: scene=A_4
#: A_4:206
msgctxt "text_id=14769 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな光景を、有珠は遠い目で眺めていた。"
msgstr "  She watched them, disinterested."

#. Occurrence A_4:211:14770: scene=A_4
#: A_4:211
msgctxt "text_id=14770 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子が行った陶川ではなく、ここ社木が今夜の本命であるらしい。"
msgstr "  It appeared that the Yashirogi sigil was the key target tonight, not Toukawa where Aoko had gone."

#. Occurrence A_4:216:14771: scene=A_4
#: A_4:216
msgctxt "text_id=14771 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに動じるような心構えは初めからしていないし、この程度の脅しでは予想外どころか子供<騙|だま>しにもならない。"
msgstr "  Alice had always been unflappable, and the child's play before her was hardly about to change that."

#. Occurrence A_4:221:14772: scene=A_4
#: A_4:221
msgctxt "text_id=14772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠が見すえるべき敵は包囲する野犬ではなく、その後方の闇に<控|ひか>える魔術師―――蒼崎橙子に他ならないのだから。"
msgstr "  Her main enemy was not the dogs surrounding her, but the lone mage behind them: Touko Aozaki."

#. Occurrence A_4:265:14773: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:265
msgctxt "text_id=14773 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「酷い趣味。ここ数年で品が落ちたの？"
msgstr "\"What hideous taste. Is this what you've fallen to, after these last several years?"

#. Occurrence A_4:272:14774: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:272
msgctxt "text_id=14774 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……まあ、それならそれで嬉しいけど。コレが<地金|じがね>なら、蒼崎との付き合いもいよいよ白紙に戻せるわ」"
msgstr "  Not that I'm complaining. If this is who you really are, then Aozaki and I have nothing to worry about.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:277:14775: scene=A_4
#: A_4:277
msgctxt "text_id=14775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<辛辣|しんらつ>な言葉に、くぐもった笑いが応える。"
msgstr "  Touko laughed at the acerbic taunt."

#. Occurrence A_4:283:14776: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:283
msgctxt "text_id=14776 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「いやいや、コレは不可抗力でね。"
msgstr "\"My, my. Such immovable spirit."

#. Occurrence A_4:290:14777: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:290
msgctxt "text_id=14777 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　安心しろ有珠、間違っても私の趣味じゃあない」"
msgstr "  Rest assured, Alice. I'm not doing this for fun.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:322:14778: scene=A_4
#: A_4:322
msgctxt "text_id=14778 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ざくり、と積もった雪を踏みしめて、彼女はゆっくりと現れた。"
msgstr "  Crunching through the fallen snow, Touko slowly came into view."

#. Occurrence A_4:341:14779: scene=A_4
#: A_4:341
msgctxt "text_id=14779 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠とは対照的なモスグリーンのコート。"
msgstr "  She wore a moss-green coat that contrasted sharply with Alice's garb."

#. Occurrence A_4:346:14780: scene=A_4
#: A_4:346
msgctxt "text_id=14780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　首もとを結ぶ<絹|シルク>のスカーフ。"
msgstr "  A silk scarf warmed her neck."

#. Occurrence A_4:351:14781: scene=A_4
#: A_4:351
msgctxt "text_id=14781 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　長身と短い髪、そして<凛|りん>とした背筋が、男性より遥かに彼女を<雄|おす>らしく見せている。"
msgstr "  She stood tall, her hair short, striking a more valiant posture than any young man."

#. Occurrence A_4:371:14782: scene=A_4
#: A_4:371
msgctxt "text_id=14782 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――そう。"
msgstr "  After all..."

#. Occurrence A_4:413:14783: scene=A_4
#: A_4:413
msgctxt "text_id=14783 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この雪原に立つ者は、白い夜気より深い闇を纏っていなくてはならない。"
msgstr "  The two standing here needed to be less like the shining moon,"

#. Occurrence A_4:449:14784: scene=A_4
#: A_4:449
msgctxt "text_id=14784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠がそうであるように、その敵である橙子もまた。"
msgstr "  and more like the darkness surrounding it."

#. Occurrence A_4:470:14785: scene=A_4
#: A_4:470
msgctxt "text_id=14785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　野犬たちの呼吸が弱まる。"
msgstr "  The barking abated."

#. Occurrence A_4:475:14786: scene=A_4
#: A_4:475
msgctxt "text_id=14786 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<端役|はやく>にすぎない彼らは、登場した主役の威光から目を逸らす。"
msgstr "  Like servants in a royal court, they averted their eyes from their ruler,"

#. Occurrence A_4:482:14787: scene=A_4
#: A_4:482
msgctxt "text_id=14787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうしなければ、眼球ばかりか心臓まで<潰|つぶ>されるからだ。"
msgstr "  lest their eyes and hearts be plucked out."

#. Occurrence A_4:521:14788: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:521
msgctxt "text_id=14788 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「久しぶりだね、有珠」"
msgstr "\"It's been too long, Alice.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:527:14789: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:527
msgctxt "text_id=14789 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「橙子さんも、お元気そうで」"
msgstr "\"It has. You look well, Touko.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:546:14790: scene=A_4
#: A_4:546
msgctxt "text_id=14790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　六メートルほどの距離を隔てた挨拶。"
msgstr "  They stood about twelve feet apart."

#. Occurrence A_4:551:14791: scene=A_4
#: A_4:551
msgctxt "text_id=14791 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　親愛の情はない。"
msgstr "  No love had been lost between them."

#. Occurrence A_4:556:14792: scene=A_4
#: A_4:556
msgctxt "text_id=14792 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あるのは倒す者と倒される者、その区分だけである。"
msgstr "  Just two enemies―one who was to be victorious, and one who was to fall."

#. Occurrence A_4:577:14793: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:577
msgctxt "text_id=14793 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「さて。どうしようか有珠？"
msgstr "\"So, how shall we do this, Alice?"

#. Occurrence A_4:603:14794: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:603
msgctxt "text_id=14794 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　積もる話もある。君の近況にも興味がある。そもそも今回の件について、色々と説明したくてたまらない。"
msgstr "  We have so much to catch up on. How have you been? There's so much I've been dying to tell you."

#. Occurrence A_4:617:14795: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:617
msgctxt "text_id=14795 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　五分ほど時間を割いても構わないか？」"
msgstr "  You can spare five minutes to chat, can't you?\""

#. Occurrence A_4:630:14796: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:630
msgctxt "text_id=14796 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「お断りよ。貴女と五分も話をしていたら、その隙に内臓まで売却されそう」"
msgstr "\"I'm afraid not. If I give you even the slightest quarter, you will steal it all.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:678:14797: scene=A_4
#: A_4:678
msgctxt "text_id=14797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは一瞬の出来事。"
msgstr "  The following events unfolded quickly."

#. Occurrence A_4:693:14798: scene=A_4
#: A_4:693
msgctxt "text_id=14798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりにも自然に、目を奪うほど大胆に、"
msgstr "  Boldly and without a second's thought,"

#. Occurrence A_4:698:14799: scene=A_4
#: A_4:698
msgctxt "text_id=14799 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は猫の鈴をケープの裾から取り出した。"
msgstr "  Alice pulled out a cat's bell from the seam of her mantle and dropped it."

#. Occurrence A_4:729:14800: scene=A_4
#: A_4:729
msgctxt "text_id=14800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　落下する鐘をディドルディドル。"
msgstr "  Diddle Diddle."

#. Occurrence A_4:734:14801: scene=A_4
#: A_4:734
msgctxt "text_id=14801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　童話の夜を助長する、久遠寺有珠の魔術の始まりである。"
msgstr "  The beginning of Alice Kuonji's magecraft. The start to a night of fairy tales."

#. Occurrence A_4:754:14802: scene=A_4
#: A_4:754
msgctxt "text_id=14802 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の魔術行使が西部劇の<早撃ち|クイックドロウ>なら、"
msgstr "  Aoko favored a quick-draw approach, like something from a western."

#. Occurrence A_4:759:14803: scene=A_4
#: A_4:759
msgctxt "text_id=14803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の魔術行使は手品師の<指芸|カット>のようだ。"
msgstr "  However, Alice preferred sleight of hand."

#. Occurrence A_4:764:14804: scene=A_4
#: A_4:764
msgctxt "text_id=14804 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見る者の意識の隙をついて、鮮やかに大胆に、何より気づかれる事なく、目的を終えている。"
msgstr "  She used her target's blind spots against them, ending the game before they knew it had begun."

#. Occurrence A_4:769:14805: scene=A_4
#: A_4:769
msgctxt "text_id=14805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鈴は泉に没する<金貨|コイン>のように落下し、そして―――"
msgstr "  The bell fell, like a coin into a fountain."

#. Occurrence A_4:817:14806: scene=A_4
#: A_4:817
msgctxt "text_id=14806 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　跡形もなく、地中に沈む前に砕け散った。"
msgstr "  Then, as it was about to strike the ground, it shattered, disappearing without a trace."

#. Occurrence A_4:858:14807: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:858
msgctxt "text_id=14807 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ルーン―――」"
msgstr "\"Runes...\""

#. Occurrence A_4:867:14808: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:867
msgctxt "text_id=14808 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ああ。一日かけて公園中に<刻|きざ>ませてもらった。"
msgstr "\"Correct. I spent the day carving characters into the park."

#. Occurrence A_4:873:14809: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:873
msgctxt "text_id=14809 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　この公園の道はレンガだからね。手間こそかかったが簡単な仕事だった。"
msgstr "  The brick path meant it was easy work, if a little time consuming."

#. Occurrence A_4:889:14810: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:889
msgctxt "text_id=14810 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　まわりの森まで見て、ざっと四百<平米|ヘーベー>のキャンバスだ。"
msgstr "  Look at the woods around here. Roughly a twelve hundred square foot blank canvas."

#. Occurrence A_4:895:14811: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:895
msgctxt "text_id=14811 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　面白いだろう？"
msgstr "  Impressive, isn't it?"

#. Occurrence A_4:901:14812: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:901
msgctxt "text_id=14812 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　いま私たちは、三十万字以上の<太陽|ルーン>の上にいる」"
msgstr "  Right now, you and I are right on top of three-hundred thousand characters' worth of runes.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:998:14813: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:998
msgctxt "text_id=14813 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_4:1003:14814: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1003
msgctxt "text_id=14814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　息を呑みながら一歩だけ後じさる有珠。"
msgstr "  Swallowing hard, Alice took a step back."

#. Occurrence A_4:1008:14815: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1008
msgctxt "text_id=14815 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地表すべてにルーンを刻んでいる？"
msgstr "  Touko had carved runes all over the ground."

#. Occurrence A_4:1013:14816: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1013
msgctxt "text_id=14816 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いま一瞬だけディドルに反応した箇所だけでも気が滅入る数のルーンを、公園すべてに？"
msgstr "  Even in the area Diddle reacted to alone, there was a depressing amount of them. Had she truly carved them into the whole park?"

#. Occurrence A_4:1018:14817: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1018
msgctxt "text_id=14817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　驚きより、強い疑問に有珠は目を細めた。"
msgstr "  Alice did not react with surprise; she simply narrowed her eyes."

#. Occurrence A_4:1064:14818: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1064
msgctxt "text_id=14818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしかに、それは完全な“日中”だ。"
msgstr "  She could see how it would have taken the whole day."

#. Occurrence A_4:1069:14819: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1069
msgctxt "text_id=14819 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜を呼ぶディドルディドルは、この太陽の膜に破壊されて当然だろう。"
msgstr "  It was no wonder Diddle Diddle, Banquet of the Night, was destroyed by the skin of sun."

#. Occurrence A_4:1074:14820: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1074
msgctxt "text_id=14820 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが―――"
msgstr "  Still, something bothered Alice."

#. Occurrence A_4:1095:14821: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:1095
msgctxt "text_id=14821 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……一体、どうやって隠していたの？」"
msgstr "\"How in the world did you hide them all?\""

#. Occurrence A_4:1101:14822: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1101
msgctxt "text_id=14822 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それだけのルーン文字。"
msgstr "  There were just so many."

#. Occurrence A_4:1106:14823: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1106
msgctxt "text_id=14823 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それだけの魔術行使の痕跡を、どうやって隠し通したのか。"
msgstr "  What kind of magecraft could do that?"

#. Occurrence A_4:1146:14824: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:1146
msgctxt "text_id=14824 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ああ、ちょっと特別製。"
msgstr "\"Oh, these are special."

#. Occurrence A_4:1153:14825: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0012; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:1153
msgctxt "text_id=14825 | speaker=touko"
msgid "このルーンね、普段は確定していないんだ。こうしている今も変形している。パッと見はただの<疵痕|きずあと>。それが強い魔力に触れると、もとのカタチに立ち戻る。形状記憶ルーンとでも言おうかな。"
msgstr "These runes shift location-they're doing it even now. They look like simple scratches, but they return to their original form when they touch strong magical energy. You could call them 'memory runes.'"

#. Occurrence A_4:1164:14826: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:1164
msgctxt "text_id=14826 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　そんな訳で、いかなる夜の深さをもってしても、この太陽は没しない。この通り、雪が降ってくれたおかげで視覚的な誤魔化しも万全だったしね」"
msgstr "  No matter how deep the night, these little suns won't set. And the snow hid them beautifully.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:1186:14827: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1186
msgctxt "text_id=14827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さらりと言ってのけるが、それがどれほどの執念、技術、才能を必要とするものか、有珠ですら正確に判断できない。"
msgstr "  She spoke modestly, but Alice could not imagine the amount of persistence, technique, and skill it must have taken."

#. Occurrence A_4:1208:14828: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1208
msgctxt "text_id=14828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一日作業だと言うなら、熟練したルーン使いが十人がかりでも可能かどうか。"
msgstr "  And it only took a day. Even ten mages would have trouble producing so many sophisticated runes in that time."

#. Occurrence A_4:1213:14829: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1213
msgctxt "text_id=14829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　加えて、使われているルーンは協会に特許も出されていない未知の技術だ。"
msgstr "  Moreover, these runes were made using unknown techniques the Association had not approved."

#. Occurrence A_4:1239:14830: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:1239
msgctxt "text_id=14830 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……負け惜しみだけど。"
msgstr "\"It pains me to admit it, Touko..."

#. Occurrence A_4:1245:14831: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:1245
msgctxt "text_id=14831 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　わたしみたいな小娘ひとりに大人げないわね、橙子さん」"
msgstr "  but that's a lot of power to use on one poor, little girl.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:1251:14832: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0014; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:1251
msgctxt "text_id=14832 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「馬鹿を言うな。君を小娘だなんて、一度も思った事はないよ。"
msgstr "\"Oh, please. I've never thought that about you."

#. Occurrence A_4:1277:14833: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0015; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:1277
msgctxt "text_id=14833 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　まあ―――私<好|ごの>みの体だと、<睨|ね>め付ける事はあったがね」"
msgstr "  Though, there were times when I admired that body of yours. To have one like that...\""

#. Occurrence A_4:1441:14834: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1441
msgctxt "text_id=14834 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　変化は一瞬だった。"
msgstr "  It happened in the blink of an eye."

#. Occurrence A_4:1446:14835: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1446
msgctxt "text_id=14835 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の<戯言|たわごと>を、有珠は視線だけで斬って捨てた。"
msgstr "  Alice cut off Touko's snide remark with a deadly stare."

#. Occurrence A_4:1466:14836: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1466
msgctxt "text_id=14836 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　深い闇色をした少女の左目は、禍々しい<紅玉|ルビー>の色に変わっている。"
msgstr "  The left eye of the darkly clad girl changed in color to an ominous ruby."

#. Occurrence A_4:1486:14837: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1486
msgctxt "text_id=14837 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最速の<一工程|シングルアクション>、視線による術式投射。"
msgstr "  The speed of the incantation was phenomenal."

#. Occurrence A_4:1491:14838: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1491
msgctxt "text_id=14838 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔眼と呼ばれる“魅了の視線”が、蒼崎橙子の姿を眼球に捕らえている。"
msgstr "  Alice's Mystic Eyes of Enthralling snared Touko."

#. Occurrence A_4:1496:14839: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1496
msgctxt "text_id=14839 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　睨め付けていた、と語った女は、今や文字通り、少女の目によって<縫|・><い|・><付|・><け|・>られていた。"
msgstr "  She had been the one to, quite literally, be taken captive by the girl's stare."

#. Occurrence A_4:1535:14840: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0016; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:1535
msgctxt "text_id=14840 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「―――――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_4:1540:14841: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1540
msgctxt "text_id=14841 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は腕をあげようとしたが、体は指一本動かない。"
msgstr "  Touko tried to raise her arm, but could not even move a finger."

#. Occurrence A_4:1545:14842: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1545
msgctxt "text_id=14842 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<抵抗|レジスト>する間もない、問答無用の有珠の魔眼だった。"
msgstr "  Alice's Mystic Eyes commanded absolute control, with no room for resistance."

#. Occurrence A_4:1550:14843: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1550
msgctxt "text_id=14843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自由が許されているのは<内臓|なかみ>ぐらい。"
msgstr "  Only a person's internal organs were allowed the freedom to move."

#. Occurrence A_4:1555:14844: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1555
msgctxt "text_id=14844 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<内臓|なかみ>は問題なく機能している以上、<運|・><動|・>ではなく<行|・><動|・>を禁じる<魅了|まがん>であるらしい。"
msgstr "  Since their organs still functioned, it was more precise to say that her eyes forbid the target from acting."

#. Occurrence A_4:1600:14845: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1600
msgctxt "text_id=14845 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……に、しても惚れ惚れするタイミングだった。"
msgstr "  Alice had played her hand with exquisite timing."

#. Occurrence A_4:1605:14846: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1605
msgctxt "text_id=14846 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔眼の速度ではない。"
msgstr "  It wasn't the speed of her eyes that had given her an edge."

#. Occurrence A_4:1610:14847: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1610
msgctxt "text_id=14847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こちらの呼吸、次の手に入る前の<間隙|かんげき>をつく術の<巧|うま>さは、青子などとは地金が違う。"
msgstr "  The deftness with which she wove her spells to exploit the briefest vulnerability is what made Alice a different caliber to other mages like Aoko."

#. Occurrence A_4:1636:14848: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1636
msgctxt "text_id=14848 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　現代に隠れ住む魔女は、蒼崎橙子以上に、魔術戦のなんたるかを熟知していた。"
msgstr "  This witch, who lived hidden in the modern era, was more seasoned in magical battles than Touko Aozaki."

#. Occurrence A_4:1672:14849: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0017; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:1672
msgctxt "text_id=14849 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「―――だが残念。ディドルディドルが響かないのでは、魔眼のアクロスティック化はできないようだな。"
msgstr "\"Such a shame... Without Diddle Diddle, your eyes can't be made acrostic."

#. Occurrence A_4:1691:14850: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:1691
msgctxt "text_id=14850 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　惜しいね。あの月目のプロイキッシャーなら、これで<私|・>の方はお手上げだったろうが―――」"
msgstr "  You were close. With your moon Ploy Kickshaw, I might have been begging for mercy.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:1729:14851: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1729
msgctxt "text_id=14851 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子を拘束する陣形が歪んでいく。"
msgstr "  The formation holding Touko began to distort."

#. Occurrence A_4:1734:14852: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1734
msgctxt "text_id=14852 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手足はおろか指一本動かせない筈の魔術師は、"
msgstr "  In the blink of an eye, the mage"

#. Occurrence A_4:1775:14853: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1775
msgctxt "text_id=14853 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　瞬きだけで、有珠の魔眼を克服した。"
msgstr "  had bested Alice's Mystic Eyes."

#. Occurrence A_4:1857:14854: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:1857
msgctxt "text_id=14854 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_4:1862:14855: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1862
msgctxt "text_id=14855 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　黒衣が流れる。"
msgstr "  Alice's black outfit fluttered in the wind."

#. Occurrence A_4:1867:14856: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1867
msgctxt "text_id=14856 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の<克服|リカバー>が橙子の<魔|・><眼|・>によるものと看破し、有珠は相手の視界―――その正面に立たないように身を<翻|ひるがえ>す。"
msgstr "  She turned so she was not facing Touko head on-the mage had recovered through her own Mystic Eyes. "

#. Occurrence A_4:1904:14857: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1904
msgctxt "text_id=14857 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔眼と言えど、その根底にあるのは暗示だ。"
msgstr "  At the root of Touko's Mystic Eyes was a spell of Mesmerize."

#. Occurrence A_4:1909:14858: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1909
msgctxt "text_id=14858 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正面からの、相手の不意をつく<意識|マインド><制圧|ジャック>がもっとも効果的であり、<抵抗|レジスト>されにくい。"
msgstr "  Most effective when facing their prey, such eyes could mind-jack a target's awareness. It was difficult to resist head-on."

#. Occurrence A_4:1914:14859: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1914
msgctxt "text_id=14859 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　逆に言えば、たとえ魔眼の範囲に入っていようと、正面にさえいなければ効果は半減する。"
msgstr "  However, its effect was greatly diminished if the target was not facing the eyes directly, even if it was within range."

#. Occurrence A_4:1919:14860: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1919
msgctxt "text_id=14860 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ましてや、少女は数多の童話を従える最後の魔女。"
msgstr "  Moreover, the girl was the last witch of her lineage, who commanded a great number of fairy tales."

#. Occurrence A_4:1924:14861: scene=A_4
#: A_4:1924
msgctxt "text_id=14861 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　投写型の魔眼が相手なら、半身<逸|そ>らすだけであらゆる魔力をはじき返せる……！"
msgstr "  Against Mystic Eyes that projected their effects, simply turning one's body was enough to repel half of the magical energy!"

#. Occurrence A_4:2006:14862: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2006
msgctxt "text_id=14862 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の魔眼も有珠と同様、行動を封じる魅了だった。"
msgstr "  Like Alice's eyes, Touko's could also disable actions."

#. Occurrence A_4:2011:14863: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2011
msgctxt "text_id=14863 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は間一髪、正面からの視線を逸らした。"
msgstr "  Alice had escaped by the skin of her teeth."

#. Occurrence A_4:2016:14864: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2016
msgctxt "text_id=14864 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この程度の<戒|いまし>め、少女にとっては森の小枝ほどの重みもない。"
msgstr "  The damage she'd suffered was the weight of a twig to a forest."

#. Occurrence A_4:2021:14865: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2021
msgctxt "text_id=14865 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　指で払いのけるまでもなく、ただ通過するのみ―――"
msgstr "  She just had to let the energy pass throu-"

#. Occurrence A_4:2136:14866: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:2136
msgctxt "text_id=14866 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「っ―――!?」"
msgstr "\"Ngh...?!\""

#. Occurrence A_4:2141:14867: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2141
msgctxt "text_id=14867 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　瞬間、有珠は信じがたい寒気に襲われた。"
msgstr "  In an instant, a startling chill ran through Alice's body."

#. Occurrence A_4:2209:14868: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2209
msgctxt "text_id=14868 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これは、<詰|・><ん|・><だ|・>。"
msgstr "  This was a problem."

#. Occurrence A_4:2237:14869: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2237
msgctxt "text_id=14869 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　死の感触が背中を走る。"
msgstr "  The touch of death ran up her spine."

#. Occurrence A_4:2245:14870: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2245
msgctxt "text_id=14870 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外套の下から青いゴムマリを逃がしながら、有珠は敵魔術師を凝視する。"
msgstr "  She glared at the mage before her, as blue rubber balls flowed out from beneath her overcoat."

#. Occurrence A_4:2289:14871: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2289
msgctxt "text_id=14871 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　衝突する視線。"
msgstr "  The stare-off grew more intense."

#. Occurrence A_4:2294:14872: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2294
msgctxt "text_id=14872 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔眼を魔眼で押し返そうと、有珠は橙子を睨む。"
msgstr "  Alice glared harder, resisting Touko's Mystic Eyes with her own."

#. Occurrence A_4:2314:14873: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2314
msgctxt "text_id=14873 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――負ける筈がない。"
msgstr "  Losing was not an option."

#. Occurrence A_4:2332:14874: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2332
msgctxt "text_id=14874 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　純粋な魔力量でも、魔眼の質でも、久遠寺有珠は蒼崎橙子の上にいる。"
msgstr "  In terms of raw magical energy, Alice Kuonji's Mystic Eyes were more powerful and advanced than Touko's."

#. Occurrence A_4:2486:14875: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2486
msgctxt "text_id=14875 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　当然の帰結として、敵の<戒|いまし>めは有珠の前で霧散した。"
msgstr "  Surely nobody could beat her."

#. Occurrence A_4:2504:14876: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2504
msgctxt "text_id=14876 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが。"
msgstr "  And yet..."

#. Occurrence A_4:2509:14877: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2509
msgctxt "text_id=14877 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　血統だの魔力量だの、そんな時代遅れの価値観は、橙子の狂気の前に砕け散った。"
msgstr "  Her unfiltered stock of magical energy, stifled by old-fashioned values, was no match for Touko's madness."

#. Occurrence A_4:2562:14878: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2562
msgctxt "text_id=14878 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目蓋ではなくその中身―――"
msgstr "  Deeper within her eyes..."

msgctxt "text_id=14879 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　開く<機|コ><能|ト>のない<眼球|まがん>が開く。"
msgstr "  Somehow, the eyes revealed a sealed power."

#. Occurrence A_4:2742:14880: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2742
msgctxt "text_id=14880 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術師の左眼―――その水晶体の中に、<底なしの穴|クラインキューブ>がうがたれていく。"
msgstr "  Inside the crystalline lens of the mage's left iris was a bottomless pit, a Klein cube."

#. Occurrence A_4:2813:14881: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:2813
msgctxt "text_id=14881 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「、っ…………！」"
msgstr "\"Hng...!\""

#. Occurrence A_4:2818:14882: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2818
msgctxt "text_id=14882 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　苦痛に歪む吐息。"
msgstr "  Alice winced in pain."

#. Occurrence A_4:2823:14883: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2823
msgctxt "text_id=14883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もはや拘束は一つではない。"
msgstr "  The bindings grew in number."

#. Occurrence A_4:2870:14884: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2870
msgctxt "text_id=14884 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<夥|おびただ>しいまでの魔眼―――千を超える橙子の魔眼、その視線がすべて有珠に向けられている……！"
msgstr "  So many Mystic Eyes... Thousands perhaps, and all fixed on Alice."

#. Occurrence A_4:2922:14885: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:2922
msgctxt "text_id=14885 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「っ、っ……！」"
msgstr "\"Ngh... Hnh...!\""

#. Occurrence A_4:2927:14886: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2927
msgctxt "text_id=14886 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　視線の重圧はいまも増え続けている。"
msgstr "  Pressure. So much pressure."

#. Occurrence A_4:2932:14887: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2932
msgctxt "text_id=14887 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこに果てがない事を、有珠は認めた。"
msgstr "  Endless. And Alice knew it."

#. Occurrence A_4:2938:14888: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2938
msgctxt "text_id=14888 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アレは―――"
msgstr "  She saw..."

msgctxt "text_id=14889 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　信じがたい事に、魔眼の中に魔眼を造っている。"
msgstr "  Incredulously, she saw eyes growing within eyes..."

#. Occurrence A_4:2945:14890: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2945
msgctxt "text_id=14890 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は自らの魔眼の内部を合わせ鏡にする事で、その<視線|こうか>を無限にしたのだ。"
msgstr "  Touko had placed opposing mirrors inside her eyes, resulting in an infinite glare."

#. Occurrence A_4:2997:14891: scene=A_4
#: A_4:2997
msgctxt "text_id=14891 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔眼の中に魔眼を造るだけでも狂気の沙汰。"
msgstr "  It was the act of a madwoman. Creating Mystic Eyes within Mystic Eyes..."

#. Occurrence A_4:3002:14892: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3002
msgctxt "text_id=14892 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを反射させ、次々とコピーされていく魔力を制御し、カオス化した魔力を暴走させる事なく機能させる―――"
msgstr "  She could even control the resulting chaos caused by all the copies."

#. Occurrence A_4:3008:14893: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3008
msgctxt "text_id=14893 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "狂気なんて罵倒では飽き足らない。"
msgstr "Her insanity knew no bounds."

#. Occurrence A_4:3045:14894: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3045
msgctxt "text_id=14894 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術を―――人間に残された最後の逃げ道である神秘を、あんな、分別なく<大量生産|マスプロダクション>してしまうのなら、あの女は魔術師と名乗るのもおこがましい―――！"
msgstr "  No mage in their right mind would mass-produce so many Mystics-the last escape of humankind-so indiscriminately!"

#. Occurrence A_4:3093:14895: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0019; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:3093
msgctxt "text_id=14895 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……やれやれ、これもお気に召さないか。私なりにマインスターの真似事をしてみたつもりなんだが。"
msgstr "\"Oh dear... am I making you uncomfortable? Tell me, am I doing a good job of imitating a Meinster?"

#. Occurrence A_4:3114:14896: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0020; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:3114
msgctxt "text_id=14896 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　<巧|うま>く出来ているだろう？"
msgstr "  Aren't you impressed?"

#. Occurrence A_4:3120:14897: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0021; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:3120
msgctxt "text_id=14897 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　君のアクロのように稀少な神秘で現実をねじ曲げるのではなく、量産した神秘で現実をねじ伏せる。"
msgstr "  Instead of bending reality using a rare Mystic like you would, I mass produce a Mystic to bend reality to my will."

#. Occurrence A_4:3135:14898: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0022; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:3135
msgctxt "text_id=14898 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　もの自体はただの魔眼。だがその弾数には果てがない。"
msgstr "  On the surface they're regular Mystic Eyes, only their volume is infinite."

#. Occurrence A_4:3142:14899: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0023; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:3142
msgctxt "text_id=14899 | speaker=touko"
msgid "相手がどれほどの魔力抵抗を持っていようと、それ以上の魔力で拘束する<だ|・><け|・>のモノだ」"
msgstr "No matter how much magical energy an opponent uses to resist them, they will simply multiply the energy needed to bind them.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:3180:14900: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3180
msgctxt "text_id=14900 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　果てのない魔力で相手の動きを封じこめる。"
msgstr "  She wielded power without limit to disable an opponent."

#. Occurrence A_4:3185:14901: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3185
msgctxt "text_id=14901 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つまり、あの魔眼に囚われたが最後、無限という概念に縛られてしまうのだ。"
msgstr "  Once one was caught in them, one was chained to the concept of infinity."

#. Occurrence A_4:3255:14902: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3255
msgctxt "text_id=14902 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　投写型の魔眼の欠点―――所詮は短銃であり、大砲である詠唱術式には火力・術式で敵わないという定説を、橙子は力ずくで破壊した。"
msgstr "  Projection-type eyes had a fatal flaw: their firepower and formulae were insignificant compared to the great artillery of incanted spells. But Touko had torn down that conventional wisdom with brute strength."

#. Occurrence A_4:3283:14903: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3283
msgctxt "text_id=14903 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小銃が弱いのなら、数を用意する。"
msgstr "  If the gun was a pea-shooter, she simply needed to bring more guns."

#. Occurrence A_4:3329:14904: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3329
msgctxt "text_id=14904 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　９ミリの弾丸では要塞を壊せないのなら、壊せるだけの数を叩きつけてご覧にいれよう―――"
msgstr "  A 9-millimeter bullet could never destroy a fortress... unless one threw a fortress' mass of bullets at it."

#. Occurrence A_4:3334:14905: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3334
msgctxt "text_id=14905 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの<積重|せきじゅう>魔眼はそれだけの原理だが、概念が力を持つ魔術世界においては完璧な兵器だった。"
msgstr "  The principle was brutishly simple, but in the world of magecraft where concepts decided supremacy, Touko's Iterative Mystic Eyes were the perfect weapon."

#. Occurrence A_4:3354:14906: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3354
msgctxt "text_id=14906 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アレに囚われた者は、橙子が眼を閉じるまで動けない。"
msgstr "  The target would be bound until she closed her eyes."

#. Occurrence A_4:3359:14907: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3359
msgctxt "text_id=14907 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　机上の空論とはいえ、理屈の上では「無限」である。"
msgstr "  In theory at least, the effects were infinite."

#. Occurrence A_4:3364:14908: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3364
msgctxt "text_id=14908 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔力量では決して上回れない以上、魔力で抵抗する事は無意味なのだ。"
msgstr "  No amount of magical energy could ever overcome it, so it was utterly futile to resist using magical energy."

#. Occurrence A_4:3416:14909: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3416
msgctxt "text_id=14909 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　破る手段があるとしたら、まずは一つ、はじめから橙子の視界に入らないこと。"
msgstr "  Of course, one way to counter it would be to stay out of Touko's line of sight to begin with."

#. Occurrence A_4:3422:14910: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3422
msgctxt "text_id=14910 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "相手に気付かれる前に倒す、という対魔眼戦の基本にして最善手。"
msgstr "The standard tactic against Mystic Eyes was to defeat the user before they were aware of you."

#. Occurrence A_4:3439:14911: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3439
msgctxt "text_id=14911 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そしてもう一つ。"
msgstr "  There was, however, another way."

#. Occurrence A_4:3444:14912: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3444
msgctxt "text_id=14912 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　実に、単純かつ粗暴な話ではあるが―――"
msgstr "  It was simpler than one might think."

#. Occurrence A_4:3477:14913: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0024; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:3477
msgctxt "text_id=14913 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ともあれこれで詰みだ。何か言い残す事は？」"
msgstr "\"I'm afraid this is checkmate. Any last words?\""

#. Occurrence A_4:3509:14914: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:3509
msgctxt "text_id=14914 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_4:3514:14915: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3514
msgctxt "text_id=14915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう有珠には敵の姿も見えない。"
msgstr "  Alice could no longer see her enemy."

#. Occurrence A_4:3519:14916: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3519
msgctxt "text_id=14916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔眼の呪縛が視界を<覆|おお>い尽くしている。"
msgstr "  Touko's infinite eyes had bound her."

#. Occurrence A_4:3577:14917: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3577
msgctxt "text_id=14917 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かろうじて見えるのは空の月だけ。"
msgstr "  All she could make out was a sliver of moonlight,"

#. Occurrence A_4:3582:14918: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3582
msgctxt "text_id=14918 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それと、<階|きざはし>のような青い軌跡。"
msgstr "  and a blue streak, tracing its way towards her."

#. Occurrence A_4:3636:14919: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0025; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:3636
msgctxt "text_id=14919 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「結構。悔いのない人生で羨ましい」"
msgstr "\"Fine. I wish I could say I had no regrets like you.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:3683:14920: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3683
msgctxt "text_id=14920 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大気中に描かれた<呪刻|ルーン>から、肌を裂く衝撃が<弾|はじ>かれる。"
msgstr "  She drew a rune in the air, unleashing a shockwave to tear flesh asunder."

#. Occurrence A_4:3688:14921: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3688
msgctxt "text_id=14921 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　風は鋭利な刃物と化して、少女の外套と、その体を八つ裂きにし―――"
msgstr "  The gusts became blades of air that shredded Alice's overcoat, and minced- "

#. Occurrence A_4:3819:14922: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0026; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:3819
msgctxt "text_id=14922 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「―――！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence A_4:3874:14923: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3874
msgctxt "text_id=14923 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<千|ち><々|ぢ>に散る青い羽根。"
msgstr "  Blue feathers flitted all around."

#. Occurrence A_4:3879:14924: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3879
msgctxt "text_id=14924 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背後に気配を感じて振りかえる橙子。"
msgstr "  Touko felt something behind her, and turned."

#. Occurrence A_4:3884:14925: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3884
msgctxt "text_id=14925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その足下に、五体の猫鈴が投げつけられる。"
msgstr "  Five cat-shaped bells were thrown at her feet."

#. Occurrence A_4:3970:14926: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3970
msgctxt "text_id=14926 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無惨に砕け散る猫鈴。"
msgstr "  And just as quickly they shattered to pieces."

#. Occurrence A_4:3975:14927: scene=A_4
#: A_4:3975
msgctxt "text_id=14927 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子が振り向いた先には、変わらぬ久遠寺有珠の姿があった。"
msgstr "  Standing before her was a completely unharmed Alice Kuonji."

#. Occurrence A_4:3996:14928: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:3996
msgctxt "text_id=14928 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「…………そよ風みたいなルーンね。"
msgstr "\"...That rune was but a light breeze."

#. Occurrence A_4:3996:14929: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:3996
msgctxt "text_id=14929 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　橙子さん、本当に<鈍|にぶ>った？」"
msgstr "  Have you really lost your touch, Touko?\""

#. Occurrence A_4:4042:14930: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0027; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4042
msgctxt "text_id=14930 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……<空蝉|うつせみ>か。術者の身代わりになるプロイの話は、聞いてなかったな」"
msgstr "\"You used a double? I've never heard of a Ploy that can take the form of a mage.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:4076:14931: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4076
msgctxt "text_id=14931 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ええ。一年のうち３６５日は役立たずで、どうしてあんなのが古参なのかわたしも疑問だけど―――殺される事だけは得意なのよ、彼」"
msgstr "\"Well, you have now. He's useless every other day of the year, but comes in handy when someone's trying to kill you.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:4109:14932: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4109
msgctxt "text_id=14932 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女の言葉に応えるように、チチチ、とどこからか鳥の鳴き声がする。"
msgstr "  As if responding to Alice's words, a bird began chirping frantically."

#. Occurrence A_4:4114:14933: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4114
msgctxt "text_id=14933 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　犯人不明の<犠牲者|ブルーバード>。"
msgstr "  An anonymous sacrifice."

#. Occurrence A_4:4130:14934: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4130
msgctxt "text_id=14934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『誰<が駒鳥を殺した|Who killed COCK ROBIN.>か？』を、音程はずれで唄っている。"
msgstr "\"Who Killed Cock Robin?\" echoed into the night, sung out of tune."

#. Occurrence A_4:4182:14935: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0028; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4182
msgctxt "text_id=14935 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……ああ、そんな歌もあったな。"
msgstr "\"Ah... that old rhyme."

#. Occurrence A_4:4188:14936: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0029; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4188
msgctxt "text_id=14936 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　だがアレは一度に一回しか殺されない。"
msgstr "  But you can only kill it once."

#. Occurrence A_4:4194:14937: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0030; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4194
msgctxt "text_id=14937 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　二度目はないし、あったとしても―――」"
msgstr "  Not that it would matter if it was more than that.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:4220:14938: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4220
msgctxt "text_id=14938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぷぎゃ、と鳥である事を疑う断末魔が響く。"
msgstr "  The bird squawked a very un-birdlike death throe."

#. Occurrence A_4:4225:14939: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4225
msgctxt "text_id=14939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の背後の木に留まっていた駒鳥は、橙子の魔眼を受けただけで悶絶してしまった。"
msgstr "  From behind Alice, the blue robin fell from its tree, a victim of Touko's Mystic Eyes."

#. Occurrence A_4:4256:14940: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4256
msgctxt "text_id=14940 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「…………本当に、使えない」"
msgstr "\"...So useless.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:4280:14941: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0031; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4280
msgctxt "text_id=14941 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「さて、ではやり直しだ。"
msgstr "\"How about you and I start over?"

#. Occurrence A_4:4286:14942: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0032; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4286
msgctxt "text_id=14942 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　<後|あと>もつかえている、これで終わりにしよう有珠。どの道、この公園では手がないだろう？」"
msgstr "  Or rather, let's end this now. You're out of options in this park.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:4346:14943: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4346
msgctxt "text_id=14943 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――そうでもないわ。"
msgstr "\"I don't think so."

#. Occurrence A_4:4352:14944: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4352
msgctxt "text_id=14944 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　たしかに、今のわたしに貴女の魔眼は<破|やぶ>れない。"
msgstr "  Granted, I may not be able to break free of your eyes."

#. Occurrence A_4:4363:14945: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4363
msgctxt "text_id=14945 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　けれど―――」"
msgstr "  But...\""

#. Occurrence A_4:4403:14946: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4403
msgctxt "text_id=14946 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　『Build it up with wood and clay,"
msgstr "              \"Build it up with wood and clay,"

#. Occurrence A_4:4403:14947: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4403
msgctxt "text_id=14947 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　　Wood and clay,Wood and clay,"
msgstr "              wood and clay, wood and clay."

#. Occurrence A_4:4403:14948: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4403
msgctxt "text_id=14948 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　　Build it up with wood and clay,"
msgstr "              Build it up with wood and clay,"

#. Occurrence A_4:4403:14949: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4403
msgctxt "text_id=14949 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　　My fair lady.』"
msgstr "              My fair lady.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:4466:14950: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4466
msgctxt "text_id=14950 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その歌は地の底から。"
msgstr "  The song came from the depths of the earth,"

#. Occurrence A_4:4472:14951: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4472
msgctxt "text_id=14951 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地面を<震|ふる>わせて、"
msgstr "  stirring a mighty quake to mark"

msgctxt "text_id=14952 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何か、巨大なものが生まれつつある―――"
msgstr "  the birth of something gargantuan."

#. Occurrence A_4:4550:14953: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0033; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4550
msgctxt "text_id=14953 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「―――！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence A_4:4636:14954: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4636
msgctxt "text_id=14954 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　土くれの変化が完成する前に、橙子は黒衣を無限地獄に落としこむ。"
msgstr "  Touko needed to throw Alice into an infinite hell before whatever that was could be completed."

#. Occurrence A_4:4641:14955: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4641
msgctxt "text_id=14955 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だがもう、何もかもが遅い。"
msgstr "  But, she was far too late."

#. Occurrence A_4:4714:14956: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4714
msgctxt "text_id=14956 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　『Wood and clay will wash away,』"
msgstr "            \"Wood and clay will wash away,"

msgctxt "text_id=14957 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　Falling down,Falling down,"
msgstr "            falling down, falling down."

msgctxt "text_id=14958 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　Build it up with bricks and mortar,"
msgstr "            Build it up with bricks and mortar,"

msgctxt "text_id=14959 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　My fair lady.』"
msgstr "            My fair lady.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:4821:14960: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4821
msgctxt "text_id=14960 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　波打つ大地。"
msgstr "  The ground burst to life."

#. Occurrence A_4:4826:14961: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4826
msgctxt "text_id=14961 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　盛り上がる塔のような指。指。指。指。"
msgstr "  A finger. Then another. And another... All rising up like towers."

#. Occurrence A_4:4832:14962: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4832
msgctxt "text_id=14962 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　数多のレンガを呑みながら、石の巨人が<顕現|けんげん>する―――！"
msgstr "  Earth, snow, and brick knitted together, manifesting a giant stone golem!"

#. Occurrence A_4:4853:14963: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0034; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4853
msgctxt "text_id=14963 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そんなバカな話があるか……！"
msgstr "\"What the hell is this?!"

#. Occurrence A_4:4889:14964: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0035; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:4889
msgctxt "text_id=14964 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　なぜコイツが出てきやがる！？」"
msgstr "  What's this freak doing here?!\""

#. Occurrence A_4:4895:14965: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4895
msgctxt "text_id=14965 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　困惑と怒りが、魔術師を口汚く<罵|ののし>らせる。"
msgstr "  Touko was so angry and confused she could barely gather her thoughts."

#. Occurrence A_4:4900:14966: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4900
msgctxt "text_id=14966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橋の巨人。"
msgstr "  The Bridge Giant."

#. Occurrence A_4:4905:14967: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4905
msgctxt "text_id=14967 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子をして正面からの攻略を断念させた、マインスターの童話の怪物。"
msgstr "  The monster from the Meinster's fairy tales rose from the ground, ruining Touko's plan."

#. Occurrence A_4:4973:14968: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4973
msgctxt "text_id=14968 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その巨人は、強力であるが故に生成に条件が付く。"
msgstr "  The giant was extremely powerful, but could only be summoned under one condition:"

#. Occurrence A_4:4978:14969: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4978
msgctxt "text_id=14969 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どのような規模であれ、周囲に自然の川があること―――"
msgstr "  It must be in proximity to a natural river."

#. Occurrence A_4:4983:14970: scene=A_4
#: A_4:4983
msgctxt "text_id=14970 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが、この巨人を呼ぶ絶対条件だ。"
msgstr "  That was the monster's one and only condition."

#. Occurrence A_4:5026:14971: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5026
msgctxt "text_id=14971 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして、この公園の周囲に天然の川はない。"
msgstr "  But this park was nowhere near one."

#. Occurrence A_4:5044:14972: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5044
msgctxt "text_id=14972 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを踏まえた上で、橙子は有珠との直接対決に乗り出したというのに……！"
msgstr "  And on top of that, it was rising up directly between Touko and Alice, mid-battle."

#. Occurrence A_4:5078:14973: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:5078
msgctxt "text_id=14973 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――あら。"
msgstr "\"Oh,"

#. Occurrence A_4:5096:14974: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:5096
msgctxt "text_id=14974 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　あるでしょう、すぐ<そ|・><こ|・>に。"
msgstr "  there's a river all right."

#. Occurrence A_4:5102:14975: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:5102
msgctxt "text_id=14975 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　川と呼ぶには小さな、すぐに消えてしまうものだけど」"
msgstr "  Well, I suppose 'river' is a bit of an exaggeration. And it'll be gone soon.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:5183:14976: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5183
msgctxt "text_id=14976 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女の宣言に、魔術師は足下に視線を落とした。"
msgstr "  Touko lowered her gaze."

#. Occurrence A_4:5188:14977: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5188
msgctxt "text_id=14977 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぱしゃり、と革靴が水を弾く。"
msgstr "  She was standing in a puddle of water."

#. Occurrence A_4:5209:14978: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0036; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:5209
msgctxt "text_id=14978 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_4:5214:14979: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5214
msgctxt "text_id=14979 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　愕然とするオレンジ色の魔術師。"
msgstr "  The Scarred Red mage was dumbfounded."

#. Occurrence A_4:5219:14980: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5219
msgctxt "text_id=14980 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先ほどの、無意味と知った上でのディドルディドルの消費はこの為か。"
msgstr "  That was why Alice had used Diddle Diddle before."

#. Occurrence A_4:5272:14981: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5272
msgctxt "text_id=14981 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<猫鈴|ディドル>は量産できるとはいえ、少女にとっては貴重品だ。"
msgstr "  While the bells could be replenished, they were valuable to Alice."

#. Occurrence A_4:5279:14982: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5279
msgctxt "text_id=14982 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを意味もなく五回。"
msgstr "  And she had spent five,"

#. Occurrence A_4:5287:14983: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5287
msgctxt "text_id=14983 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　直線上に、道を描くよう放たれたディドルディドルは、太陽のルーンによって消滅した。"
msgstr "  throwing them in an intentional line for the sun runes to destroy."

#. Occurrence A_4:5401:14984: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5401
msgctxt "text_id=14984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その爪痕こそ―――"
msgstr "  From their "

#. Occurrence A_4:5446:14985: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0037; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:5446
msgctxt "text_id=14985 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「雪解けの流水か―――！」"
msgstr "\"A stream of melting snow!\""

#. Occurrence A_4:5811:14986: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5811
msgctxt "text_id=14986 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　石畳を食らいながら、<橋の巨人|テムズトロル>の巨腕が上がる。"
msgstr "  The arms of the Thames Troll rose up from the stone paving."

#. Occurrence A_4:5816:14987: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5816
msgctxt "text_id=14987 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　上半身だけで八メートルを超える怪物。"
msgstr "  The monster's torso alone surpassed eighty feet."

#. Occurrence A_4:5821:14988: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5821
msgctxt "text_id=14988 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その構成はすべて石。"
msgstr "  Its form was made entirely of stone."

#. Occurrence A_4:5826:14989: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5826
msgctxt "text_id=14989 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　以前、少女が森で使役した木々の巨人も怪物だった。"
msgstr "  Previously, she had created one using the trees of a forest."

#. Occurrence A_4:5831:14990: scene=A_4
#: A_4:5831
msgctxt "text_id=14990 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが―――目前のモノはそれを二回り上回る怪物だと、魔術師は瞬時に理解する。"
msgstr "  However, Touko knew instantly the monster before her was at least twice as powerful."

#. Occurrence A_4:5895:14991: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0038; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:5895
msgctxt "text_id=14991 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「「「「「止まれ―――！！！！」」」」」"
msgstr "\"\"\"\"\"HALT!!!\"\"\"\"\""

#. Occurrence A_4:6027:14992: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6027
msgctxt "text_id=14992 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たまらず解放される積重魔眼。"
msgstr "  She unleashed her stacked Mystic Eyes."

#. Occurrence A_4:6032:14993: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6032
msgctxt "text_id=14993 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが―――そんなものが、この巨大な一つの生命に、どれほどの意味があるのか。"
msgstr "  They were meaningless at this stage; they had no effect on the giant."

#. Occurrence A_4:6127:14994: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6127
msgctxt "text_id=14994 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　前述したが、魔眼への対応策は二つある。"
msgstr "  As said, Mystic Eyes can be countered in two ways."

#. Occurrence A_4:6132:14995: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6132
msgctxt "text_id=14995 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一つは身を隠し、術者の視界に入らない事。"
msgstr "  The first is to hide oneself from view of the mage."

#. Occurrence A_4:6137:14996: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6137
msgctxt "text_id=14996 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが定石ではあるが、もう一つ、単純かつ絶対の対応策がある。"
msgstr "  That was the standard response. The other way, however, was devilishly simple yet one-hundred percent effective."

#. Occurrence A_4:6142:14997: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6142
msgctxt "text_id=14997 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、策というよりどうしようもない現実だ。"
msgstr "  In fact, it's less of a way and more of a fact."

#. Occurrence A_4:6147:14998: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6147
msgctxt "text_id=14998 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔眼とは視界、焦点に収めた対象に呪いを行う魔術。"
msgstr "  Mystic Eyes curse a target by focusing on them."

#. Occurrence A_4:6152:14999: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6152
msgctxt "text_id=14999 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし。その対象が、<視|・><界|・><に|・><収|・><ま|・><り|・><き|・><ら|・><な|・><い|・><規格|サイズ>であったらどうなるのか？"
msgstr "  However, what if the target was too large to focus on entirely?"

#. Occurrence A_4:6282:15000: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6282
msgctxt "text_id=15000 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その答えが、これである。"
msgstr "  The answer was..."

#. Occurrence A_4:6287:15001: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6287
msgctxt "text_id=15001 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　片腕を止めたところで些末なこと。"
msgstr "  One could barely stop a single arm."

#. Occurrence A_4:6292:15002: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6292
msgctxt "text_id=15002 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　巨人は自由気ままな右腕を持ち上げ、三十万の<太陽|ルーン>に叩き付ける。"
msgstr "  The giant, unfazed, raised its right arm and swung it down onto the ground, destroying thousands of runes."

#. Occurrence A_4:6543:15003: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6543
msgctxt "text_id=15003 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　粉砕され、巨人の体として巻き込まれる石の欠片。"
msgstr "  The demolished stones were then absorbed into its arm, adding to its mass."

#. Occurrence A_4:6548:15004: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6548
msgctxt "text_id=15004 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術師はこう語った。"
msgstr "  As the mage had said before."

#. Occurrence A_4:6554:15005: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6554
msgctxt "text_id=15005 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“いかなる夜をもってしても、この太陽は没しない”"
msgstr "\"No matter how deep the night, these little suns won't set.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:6561:15006: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6561
msgctxt "text_id=15006 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さもありなん。"
msgstr "  While the suns might not set,"

#. Occurrence A_4:6566:15007: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6566
msgctxt "text_id=15007 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その言葉ごと、巨人は沈まぬ太陽を完膚無きまで<粉|・><砕|・><し|・><た|・>。"
msgstr "  ...they could be crushed under the bulk of a giant's hand."

#. Occurrence A_4:6656:15008: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6656
msgctxt "text_id=15008 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……勝敗は決した。"
msgstr "  The victor of the battle was decided."

#. Occurrence A_4:6662:15009: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6662
msgctxt "text_id=15009 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子は魔眼を閉じ、逃げ道を確保するように後退する。"
msgstr "  Touko Aozaki closed her eyes, and prepared to escape."

#. Occurrence A_4:6668:15010: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6668
msgctxt "text_id=15010 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　周囲からはくぐもった野犬の<呻|うめ>き。"
msgstr "  The stray dogs began to whine,"

#. Occurrence A_4:6673:15011: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6673
msgctxt "text_id=15011 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　集まった彼らも、そびえ立つ異形に怯えきっている。"
msgstr "  fearful of the hulking figure before them."

#. Occurrence A_4:6729:15012: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0040; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:6729
msgctxt "text_id=15012 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「まいったな。私ではマインスターには勝てなかったか。"
msgstr "\"You win this one, Alice. Looks like I'm no match for a Meinster after all."

#. Occurrence A_4:6735:15013: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0041; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:6735
msgctxt "text_id=15013 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　まあ、そのあたりは今後の課題としよう」"
msgstr "  Let's pick this up another time, shall we?\""

#. Occurrence A_4:6764:15014: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:6764
msgctxt "text_id=15014 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……呆れた。逃げられると思っているの、橙子さん？」"
msgstr "\"Do you really think you can escape, Touko?\""

#. Occurrence A_4:6770:15015: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0042; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:6770
msgctxt "text_id=15015 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「まさか。そこまで鈍ってはいないよ有珠。"
msgstr "\"Oh, please, Alice. Give me *some* credit."

#. Occurrence A_4:6776:15016: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0043; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:6776
msgctxt "text_id=15016 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　だいいち―――逃げるとしたら、それは私の方じゃないからね」"
msgstr "  I should mention- I don't think I'm the one who needs to escape.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:6805:15017: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:6805
msgctxt "text_id=15017 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……？」"
msgstr "\"...?\""

#. Occurrence A_4:6844:15018: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6844
msgctxt "text_id=15018 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術師の声に虚勢はない。"
msgstr "  There was no hint of bravado in Touko's tone."

#. Occurrence A_4:6861:15019: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6861
msgctxt "text_id=15019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分では傷一つ付けられない巨人を前にして、蒼崎橙子の余裕は崩れない。"
msgstr "  Even in the face of a titan she had no means of harming, her confidence was unshakable."

#. Occurrence A_4:6866:15020: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6866
msgctxt "text_id=15020 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜなら、"
msgstr "  The reason being..."

#. Occurrence A_4:6918:15021: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_4_0044; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_4
#: A_4:6918
msgctxt "text_id=15021 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ま、前座は終わりだ。―――来い、ベオ」"
msgstr "\"The opening act's over. Come out, Beo.\""

#. Occurrence A_4:6923:15022: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6923
msgctxt "text_id=15022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　技を競い合う戦いではなく、"
msgstr "  ...This was no longer a battle of skill."

#. Occurrence A_4:6928:15023: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6928
msgctxt "text_id=15023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　命を奪い合う戦いは、ここから始まるのだから。"
msgstr "  A fight for survival had begun."

#. Occurrence A_4:6977:15024: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6977
msgctxt "text_id=15024 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぱちん、と指を鳴らす橙子。"
msgstr "  Snap went Touko's fingers."

#. Occurrence A_4:6983:15025: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6983
msgctxt "text_id=15025 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その呼びかけに応じて、一際高く、美しい旋律が月に伸びた。"
msgstr "  In response, a beautiful, high-pitched melody floated up toward the moon."

#. Occurrence A_4:6988:15026: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6988
msgctxt "text_id=15026 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……どこまでも響く弦楽器。"
msgstr "  It echoed all around them."

#. Occurrence A_4:6993:15027: scene=A_4
#: A_4:6993
msgctxt "text_id=15027 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　太古の記憶を呼び覚ます<螺旋|らせん>の<咆哮|ほうこう>。"
msgstr "  The spiral howl dredged up ancient, primal memories."

#. Occurrence A_4:7000:15028: scene=A_4
#: A_4:7000
msgctxt "text_id=15028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その音の主は、闇の中から魔術師の真横に舞い降りた。"
msgstr "  Its source emerged from the shadows and landed next to the mage."

#. Occurrence A_4:7026:15029: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:7026
msgctxt "text_id=15029 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_4:7031:15030: scene=A_4
#: A_4:7031
msgctxt "text_id=15030 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<少女|アリス>の口が、かすかにわななく。"
msgstr "  Alice's lip trembled faintly."

#. Occurrence A_4:7036:15031: scene=A_4
#: A_4:7036
msgctxt "text_id=15031 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　恐怖によるものではない。"
msgstr "  Not from fear,"

#. Occurrence A_4:7069:15032: scene=A_4
#: A_4:7069
msgctxt "text_id=15032 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれがどのような生き物なのか一目で受け入れ、感動で唇を震わせたのだ。"
msgstr "  but with admiration, once she recognized the creature before her."

#. Occurrence A_4:7102:15033: scene=A_4
#: A_4:7102
msgctxt "text_id=15033 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりにも美しい<黄金|おうごん>の獣。"
msgstr "  It was a majestic golden beast,"

#. Occurrence A_4:7108:15034: scene=A_4
#: A_4:7108
msgctxt "text_id=15034 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔でもなく幻でもなく、聖なるものにも留まらない。"
msgstr "  beyond the domain of both magical and phantasmal-simply divine."

#. Occurrence A_4:7113:15035: scene=A_4
#: A_4:7113
msgctxt "text_id=15035 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは絶滅した<神代|しんだい>の<生命|いのち>。"
msgstr "  It was a life that should have passed from the world with the Age of Gods..."

#. Occurrence A_4:7118:15036: scene=A_4
#: A_4:7118
msgctxt "text_id=15036 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人智による神秘。積み重ねられた秘儀伝承。"
msgstr "  A Mystic derived from human wisdom, preserved by thousands of generations of hidden tradition."

#. Occurrence A_4:7124:15037: scene=A_4
#: A_4:7124
msgctxt "text_id=15037 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地に<遍|あまね>く在る奇跡の再現―――"
msgstr "  A recreation of a miracle that once freely walked the earth-"

msgctxt "text_id=15038 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その一切をかみ砕く、<本|・><当|・><の|・><魔|・><術|・><の|・><天|・><敵|・>。"
msgstr "  The *natural enemy* of magecraft, able to crush it with ease."

#. Occurrence A_4:7166:15039: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_4_0028; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_4
#: A_4:7166
msgctxt "text_id=15039 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_4:7171:15040: scene=A_4
#: A_4:7171
msgctxt "text_id=15040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女の眼が、静かな<諦|あきら>めに<翳|かげ>る。"
msgstr "  Quiet resignation settled over Alice's face."

#. Occurrence A_4:7177:15041: scene=A_4
#: A_4:7177
msgctxt "text_id=15041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　黄金の獣が駆ける。"
msgstr "  The golden beast charged."

#. Occurrence A_4:7185:15042: scene=A_4
#: A_4:7185
msgctxt "text_id=15042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――今度は詰んだとすら、思えなかった。"
msgstr "  This time, she didn't even have a chance to admit defeat."

#. Occurrence A_5:51:15043: scene=A_5
#: A_5:51
msgctxt "text_id=15043 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――すぐ<傍|そば>で、獣の息遣いが聞こえる。"
msgstr "  She could hear the beast's breathing in her ear."

#. Occurrence A_5:81:15044: scene=A_5
#: A_5:81
msgctxt "text_id=15044 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうやら、意識が数秒ほど途切れていたようだ。"
msgstr "  It seemed she had been unconscious for a short time."

#. Occurrence A_5:110:15045: scene=A_5
#: A_5:110
msgctxt "text_id=15045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は目を開けて、息を吸う。"
msgstr "  Alice opened her eyes, and took a deep breath."

#. Occurrence A_5:181:15046: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_5_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_5
#: A_5:181
msgctxt "text_id=15046 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――、―――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_5:186:15047: scene=A_5
#: A_5:186
msgctxt "text_id=15047 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　咳きこむように苦痛を漏らす。"
msgstr "  Each cough sent pain shooting through her body."

#. Occurrence A_5:195:15048: scene=A_5
#: A_5:195
msgctxt "text_id=15048 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　喉もとから逆流した血が、冷たい地面を濡らす。"
msgstr "  Blood rose from the pit of her stomach, and she spat it onto the cold ground."

#. Occurrence A_5:200:15049: scene=A_5
#: A_5:200
msgctxt "text_id=15049 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　焦点を取り戻した視覚が、高い空と、また降りだした雪と、黄金の狼を認めていた。"
msgstr "  When her vision returned, she was able to make out the distant sky, falling snow, and the golden wolf."

#. Occurrence A_5:235:15050: scene=A_5
#: A_5:235
msgctxt "text_id=15050 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狼の息遣いは荒々しい。"
msgstr "  The wolf panted."

#. Occurrence A_5:240:15051: scene=A_5
#: A_5:240
msgctxt "text_id=15051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<涎|よだれ>を舌からこぼしながら、有珠の顔を覗きこんでいる。"
msgstr "  It stared at Alice, saliva dripping from its mouth onto her cheek."

#. Occurrence A_5:262:15052: scene=A_5
#: A_5:262
msgctxt "text_id=15052 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ノコギリのような牙と口。"
msgstr "  Razor-sharp fangs lined its jaws."

#. Occurrence A_5:267:15053: scene=A_5
#: A_5:267
msgctxt "text_id=15053 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この世のどんな動物より柔らかく、艶やかな毛並み。"
msgstr "  Its fur was glossier than that of any animal she had ever seen."

#. Occurrence A_5:272:15054: scene=A_5
#: A_5:272
msgctxt "text_id=15054 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　血に染まった<前脚|あし>の爪は、まるで包丁を三本揃えたような凶悪さだ。"
msgstr "  Brutal, knife-like claws protruded from its massive blood-stained paws."

#. Occurrence A_5:277:15055: scene=A_5
#: A_5:277
msgctxt "text_id=15055 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも、粗野な臭いは微塵もない。"
msgstr "  And yet, it did not smell like a beast."

#. Occurrence A_5:282:15056: scene=A_5
#: A_5:282
msgctxt "text_id=15056 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この金狼の前では、人間の方が己が<獣性|じゅうせい>に恥じ入るだろう。"
msgstr "  Surely, the presence of such a noble creature, a human would feel like the lesser animal."

#. Occurrence A_5:302:15057: scene=A_5
#: A_5:302
msgctxt "text_id=15057 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……有珠と狼の戦いはあっけなく終わった。"
msgstr "  The battle between Alice and the wolf was over before it had begun."

#. Occurrence A_5:309:15058: scene=A_5
#: A_5:309
msgctxt "text_id=15058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橋の巨人は金狼の前に破れ、有珠は逃げる事もできず、その凶悪な前脚の洗礼を受けた。"
msgstr "  After destroying the troll, it baptized Alice with its wicked claws, giving her no chance to escape."

#. Occurrence A_5:314:15059: scene=A_5
#: A_5:314
msgctxt "text_id=15059 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　剣のような横殴りの衝撃が、有珠の腹を一閃したのだ。"
msgstr "  Its side-swipe had torn into her abdomen like a sword,"

#. Occurrence A_5:319:15060: scene=A_5
#: A_5:319
msgctxt "text_id=15060 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　服はもちろん、内臓まで吹き飛んだ。"
msgstr "  carving through her clothes and flesh, all the way to her heart."

#. Occurrence A_5:324:15061: scene=A_5
#: A_5:324
msgctxt "text_id=15061 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その決定的な瞬間でさえ、有珠は声をあげなかった。"
msgstr "  Even so, not once did Alice make a sound."

#. Occurrence A_5:358:15062: scene=A_5
#: A_5:358
msgctxt "text_id=15062 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狼は有珠を押し倒し、その顔を覗きこむ。"
msgstr "  The wolf had her pinned, and stared at her face."

#. Occurrence A_5:363:15063: scene=A_5
#: A_5:363
msgctxt "text_id=15063 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　触れれば折れかねない少女の四肢にのしかかる。"
msgstr "  Her limbs felt ready to break at any moment."

#. Occurrence A_5:368:15064: scene=A_5
#: A_5:368
msgctxt "text_id=15064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが<現在|いま>の状態だ。"
msgstr "  That was the situation she found herself in."

#. Occurrence A_5:373:15065: scene=A_5
#: A_5:373
msgctxt "text_id=15065 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　意識を取り戻した有珠は苦しげな瞳で敵を見据える。"
msgstr "  Now fully conscious, Alice stared at her enemy through pained eyes."

#. Occurrence A_5:378:15066: scene=A_5
#: A_5:378
msgctxt "text_id=15066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこに恐怖はない。"
msgstr "  She felt no fear,"

#. Occurrence A_5:383:15067: scene=A_5
#: A_5:383
msgctxt "text_id=15067 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あるのは、現実を受け入れる冷めた色だけだった。"
msgstr "  only cold reality sinking in."

#. Occurrence A_5:409:15068: scene=A_5
#: A_5:409
msgctxt "text_id=15068 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の覚悟に感じ入ったのか、狼は振り上げた前脚を停止させる。"
msgstr "  Sensing Alice's demeanor, the wolf suddenly paused, its paw still raised."

#. Occurrence A_5:414:15069: scene=A_5
#: A_5:414
msgctxt "text_id=15069 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女の黒い瞳と、狼の眼が交差した後―――"
msgstr "  They looked into each other's eyes."

#. Occurrence A_5:422:15070: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_A_5_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=A_5
#: A_5:422
msgctxt "text_id=15070 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“そんなに血が出てるのに、痛くないんだ”」"
msgstr "\"You're bleeding. Doesn't it hurt?\""

#. Occurrence A_5:428:15071: scene=A_5
#: A_5:428
msgctxt "text_id=15071 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　思いがけない声があった。"
msgstr "  The wolf's voice came as a surprise."

#. Occurrence A_5:433:15072: scene=A_5
#: A_5:433
msgctxt "text_id=15072 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは間違いなく、目前の狼が発した<言|も><葉|の>だ。"
msgstr "  But there was no doubt it had spoken."

#. Occurrence A_5:454:15073: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_A_5_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=A_5
#: A_5:454
msgctxt "text_id=15073 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“それとも、痛いのは平気なのかな”」"
msgstr "\"Or are you just fine with pain?\""

#. Occurrence A_5:459:15074: scene=A_5
#: A_5:459
msgctxt "text_id=15074 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　邪気のない、子供のようなイントネーション。"
msgstr "  The wolf's voice sounded innocent, almost childlike."

#. Occurrence A_5:464:15075: scene=A_5
#: A_5:464
msgctxt "text_id=15075 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狼は不釣り合いな、これまでの風格を台無しにする笑みを両眼に浮かべ、"
msgstr "  In complete contrast to what had happened up to that point, the wolf smiled."

#. Occurrence A_5:486:15076: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_A_5_0002; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=A_5
#: A_5:486
msgctxt "text_id=15076 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“どっちにしろ我慢強いんだね、お姉ちゃんは……！”」"
msgstr "\"Either way, you've got guts, lady!\""

#. Occurrence A_5:494:15077: scene=A_5
#: A_5:494
msgctxt "text_id=15077 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大口を開けて、少女の首にかぶりついた。"
msgstr "  The wolf opened its mouth wide and clamped its jaws around Alice's neck."

#. Occurrence A_5:545:15078: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:545
msgctxt "text_id=15078 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ベオ―――！」"
msgstr "\"Beo!\""

#. Occurrence A_5:550:15079: scene=A_5
#: A_5:550
msgctxt "text_id=15079 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　閉じられる狼の牙より、なお鋭い橙子の<叱責|しっせき>。"
msgstr "  Touko's tone was sharper than the wolf's fangs."

#. Occurrence A_5:555:15080: scene=A_5
#: A_5:555
msgctxt "text_id=15080 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに驚くような動作で、狼はびくりと停止した。"
msgstr "  The wolf froze."

#. Occurrence A_5:600:15081: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_A_5_0003; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=A_5
#: A_5:600
msgctxt "text_id=15081 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“……トーコさん”」"
msgstr "\"Miss Touko...\""

#. Occurrence A_5:605:15082: scene=A_5
#: A_5:605
msgctxt "text_id=15082 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狼はゆっくりと背後を振り返る。"
msgstr "  He let go and slowly turned his head towards the voice."

#. Occurrence A_5:621:15083: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:621
msgctxt "text_id=15083 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「トドメは刺すなと言ったろう。余計な仕事を増やす気か、バカモン」"
msgstr "\"Didn't I tell you not to finish her off? Are you trying to make extra work for me, you mutt?\""

#. Occurrence A_5:627:15084: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_A_5_0004; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=A_5
#: A_5:627
msgctxt "text_id=15084 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“ちぇっ。それはそれで楽しいのに。"
msgstr "\"Tch... But that's the best part."

#. Occurrence A_5:653:15085: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_A_5_0005; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=A_5
#: A_5:653
msgctxt "text_id=15085 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　あーあ、たいくつー。話に聞いた橋の巨人も、結局は他の生き物と一緒だったしー”」"
msgstr "  Well this was a washout. And that troll went down like everything else. Talk about a disappointment.\""

#. Occurrence A_5:685:15086: scene=A_5
#: A_5:685
msgctxt "text_id=15086 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の叱責を受け、狼は有珠からトボトボと離れていった。"
msgstr "  The wolf backed away from Alice,"

#. Occurrence A_5:690:15087: scene=A_5
#: A_5:690
msgctxt "text_id=15087 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう何の興味もないように。"
msgstr "  as if no longer interested in his prey."

#. Occurrence A_5:695:15088: scene=A_5
#: A_5:695
msgctxt "text_id=15088 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの黄金の獣にとって、有珠は道ばたの草ほどの価値もないらしい。"
msgstr "  To the golden beast, she was little more than an old chew toy."

#. Occurrence A_5:732:15089: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_5_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_5
#: A_5:732
msgctxt "text_id=15089 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――、っ―――」"
msgstr "\"...Ngh...\""

#. Occurrence A_5:755:15090: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:755
msgctxt "text_id=15090 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「なんだ、もう意識が戻ったのか。心もタフなら体もたいがいだな。骨まで砕いて、その程度の出血とは。マインスターの教育のたまものかい？」"
msgstr "\"Conscious again, even with all that blood loss and broken bones? You're tough. Do I have the Meinster training to thank?\""

#. Occurrence A_5:812:15091: scene=A_5
#: A_5:812
msgctxt "text_id=15091 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は死に<瀕|ひん>した体で、蒼崎橙子を凝視する。"
msgstr "  Barely clinging to life, Alice stared at Touko."

#. Occurrence A_5:817:15092: scene=A_5
#: A_5:817
msgctxt "text_id=15092 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<敗|やぶ>れた憎しみからではなく、なぜあんなものを連れているのか、という糾弾から。"
msgstr "  But not a stare of hatred in defeat, but one of disbelief. Alice simply wondered why Touko had brought such a beast."

#. Occurrence A_5:845:15093: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:845
msgctxt "text_id=15093 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ああ、紹介が遅れたな。"
msgstr "\"Ah, pardon me. I should have introduced you."

#. Occurrence A_5:851:15094: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:851
msgctxt "text_id=15094 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　彼はおそらく地上で現存している最後の<人狼|じんろう>だ。"
msgstr "  This is the last known werewolf on Earth."

#. Occurrence A_5:858:15095: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:858
msgctxt "text_id=15095 | speaker=touko"
msgid "北欧の奥地に生きる彼らの一族の中に現れた、生粋の原種だよ。"
msgstr "A pureblood, born to an indigenous tribe in the northern European tundra."

#. Occurrence A_5:864:15096: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:864
msgctxt "text_id=15096 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　見ての通り、先祖返りなんて言葉じゃ表せない黄金の神秘でね。名前がなかったんで、分かりやすくベオウルフと呼んでいる」"
msgstr "  As you can see, he's a golden Mystic, and it doesn't do him justice to say he merely resembles his ancestors. He didn't have a name, so I called him Beowulf. Pretty apt, right?\""

#. Occurrence A_5:905:15097: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_5_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_5
#: A_5:905
msgctxt "text_id=15097 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ベオ……ウルフ？」"
msgstr "\"Beo...wulf?\""

#. Occurrence A_5:911:15098: scene=A_5
#: A_5:911
msgctxt "text_id=15098 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　腹部を裂く爪にさえ乱れなかった有珠の<表|か><情|お>が、<怪訝|けげん>に<曇|くも>る。"
msgstr "  Alice's face was perplexed, even though she hadn't wavered when she was disemboweled."

#. Occurrence A_5:916:15099: scene=A_5
#: A_5:916
msgctxt "text_id=15099 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオウルフ。"
msgstr "  Beowulf."

#. Occurrence A_5:921:15100: scene=A_5
#: A_5:921
msgctxt "text_id=15100 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　デンマークに伝わる、巨人殺しの英雄の名前。"
msgstr "  The name of the heroic giant slayer from Danish legend."

#. Occurrence A_5:926:15101: scene=A_5
#: A_5:926
msgctxt "text_id=15101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その名は古英語でいうところのミツバチと野生の獣の組み合わせで、つまるところは熊を意味する。"
msgstr "  It came from old English; a combination of 'honeybee' and 'wild beast'-a 'bear,' in other words."

#. Occurrence A_5:965:15102: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_5_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_5
#: A_5:965
msgctxt "text_id=15102 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――なんで、そんな、ちぐはぐな名前、を」"
msgstr "\"...Kind of an... Incongruous... name...\""

#. Occurrence A_5:971:15103: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:971
msgctxt "text_id=15103 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「うん？　いや、可愛いからに決まってるだろ」"
msgstr "\"What do you mean? It's cute!\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1002:15104: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1002
msgctxt "text_id=15104 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはベオウルフという名前にかかったものか、金狼自体にかかったものか。"
msgstr "  Perhaps because of the name, or because of the golden beast itself,"

#. Occurrence A_5:1007:15105: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1007
msgctxt "text_id=15105 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この女の感性は青子より分かりづらい、と有珠は痛みをかみ殺した。"
msgstr "  Fighting the pain, Alice struggled to read Touko. In this respect, she was worse than Aoko."

#. Occurrence A_5:1062:15106: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1062
msgctxt "text_id=15106 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ついでに説明しておくと、周りの犬どもはベオが勝手に呼び寄せたものだ。私自身、マインスターの娘がただの畜生に傷つけられるとは思ってはいないよ。"
msgstr "\"Incidentally, Beo called these other mutts in. Naturally, I didn't think they'd have any effect on a Meinster's daughter."

#. Occurrence A_5:1068:15107: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1068
msgctxt "text_id=15107 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　―――今のところは、ね」"
msgstr "  For now, at least.\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1115:15108: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1115
msgctxt "text_id=15108 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それだけ言うと、橙子は小さく微笑んだ。"
msgstr "  Touko's mouth twisted into a grin."

#. Occurrence A_5:1120:15109: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1120
msgctxt "text_id=15109 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎に見せた温かなものではなく、勝者が敗者に見せる無慈悲な笑みを。"
msgstr "  Not the warm one Soujyuro saw, but the merciless smile a victor displays to a loser."

#. Occurrence A_5:1125:15110: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1125
msgctxt "text_id=15110 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の瞳にこもった批難は、今や怒りに変わっている。"
msgstr "  The disdain in Alice's eyes turned to anger."

#. Occurrence A_5:1164:15111: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1164
msgctxt "text_id=15111 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　黄金の神秘。"
msgstr "  The golden Mystic."

#. Occurrence A_5:1169:15112: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1169
msgctxt "text_id=15112 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう口にするのなら、なぜこんな人の世界に連れてきてしまったのかと。"
msgstr "  How could Touko have brought such a creature into the human world?"

#. Occurrence A_5:1190:15113: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1190
msgctxt "text_id=15113 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「なに、需要と供給だよ。"
msgstr "\"Come now, it's just supply and demand."

#. Occurrence A_5:1196:15114: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1196
msgctxt "text_id=15114 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　過疎化は人間だけの問題じゃあない。彼らもいい加減、昔ながらの生活には限界がきたらしくてね。話し合いの末、高額で私が買い取った。"
msgstr "  Depopulation is not just a human problem. Their old ways were unsustainable, and so I bought him for a high price."

#. Occurrence A_5:1202:15115: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0012; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1202
msgctxt "text_id=15115 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　といっても、あくまで<洞|さと>から出すだけの権利だがね。"
msgstr "  Well, more like I had to pay for the right to bring him out of his cave."

#. Occurrence A_5:1227:15116: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0013_0; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1227
msgctxt "text_id=15116 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　お察しの通り、私の髪はベオとの契約に使いきった。自分の髪を使って<使い魔|ぶんしん>を造るより、強大な怪物を縛り付けた方がよっぽど健全―――"
msgstr "  As you might've guessed, I used my hair for the contract with Beo. I like to think of it as creating an alliance with a beast instead of creating a famili-"

#. Occurrence A_5:1239:15117: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0013_1; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1239
msgctxt "text_id=15117 | speaker=touko"
msgid "む？」"
msgstr " Hmm?\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1260:15118: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1260
msgctxt "text_id=15118 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　喋りながら、橙子は眼下の異常を感知した。"
msgstr "  While she was talking, Touko noticed something strange."

#. Occurrence A_5:1315:15119: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1315
msgctxt "text_id=15119 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……形容しがたい怪音。"
msgstr "  An unusual sound."

#. Occurrence A_5:1320:15120: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1320
msgctxt "text_id=15120 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……聞く者の正気を削るような、この世には存在しない音。"
msgstr "  A preternatural sound that tore at the mind."

#. Occurrence A_5:1325:15121: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1325
msgctxt "text_id=15121 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、してはならない音。"
msgstr "  A sound that should not have existed."

#. Occurrence A_5:1359:15122: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1359
msgctxt "text_id=15122 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが、少女の裂かれた腹部から<零|こぼ>れている―――"
msgstr "  And it was coming from the girl's open abdomen."

#. Occurrence A_5:1380:15123: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0014; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1380
msgctxt "text_id=15123 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「もう復元が始まったか。いや、というより、これは―――」"
msgstr "\"Regenerating already? No...wait...\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1405:15124: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_A_5_0006; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1405
msgctxt "text_id=15124 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“ん？　ふんふんふんふん？　なにこの匂い。トーコさん、なんかワクワクするコト起きてない？”」"
msgstr "\"Hmmm? Hmm hmm hmm? What's that smell? Smells like something amazing is going to happen!\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1410:15125: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1410
msgctxt "text_id=15125 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なーにー？　と近寄ってくるベオウルフ。"
msgstr "  Curious, Beowulf moved closer,"

#. Occurrence A_5:1415:15126: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1415
msgctxt "text_id=15126 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<玩具|オモチャ>に興味を持った子犬さながらである。"
msgstr "  like a puppy examining a new toy."

#. Occurrence A_5:1459:15127: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0015; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1459
msgctxt "text_id=15127 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「見るな、あっちに行っていろベオ。正気を失ってもしらんぞ」"
msgstr "\"Don't look at it! Stay over there, Beo. Pull yourself together.\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1464:15128: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1464
msgctxt "text_id=15128 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しっし、と橙子は駄犬を手で追い払う。"
msgstr "  Touko shooed the mutt away with her hand."

#. Occurrence A_5:1474:15129: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1474
msgctxt "text_id=15129 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオウルフは残念そうに、大人しく引き下がった。"
msgstr "  Beowulf lowered his head meekly and withdrew."

#. Occurrence A_5:1513:15130: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0016; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1513
msgctxt "text_id=15130 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……教育方針を間違ったかな。まったく、乙女の<胎|はら>を見ようなんて恥を知れ、恥を」"
msgstr "\"I must have trained you wrong, going for a girl's belly like that. Shame on you.\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1538:15131: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_A_5_0007; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1538
msgctxt "text_id=15131 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“えー。トーコさんだって見てるじゃない”」"
msgstr "\"So? But how come you're allowed to look?!\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1574:15132: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0017; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1574
msgctxt "text_id=15132 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ばっか、私は乙女だからいいんだ！」"
msgstr "\"Idiot! I'm a girl, so it's fine!\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1602:15133: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_5_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1602
msgctxt "text_id=15133 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1608:15134: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1608
msgctxt "text_id=15134 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子がいたらフラットスナーク戦もかくや、という一撃を放ちかねない暴言だった。"
msgstr "  If Aoko had been here, she would have blasted them away for their impudence, just as she did against Flat Snark."

#. Occurrence A_5:1655:15135: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1655
msgctxt "text_id=15135 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……まあ、しかし惨いな。"
msgstr "\"Y'know, I feel sorry for you."

#. Occurrence A_5:1661:15136: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0019; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1661
msgctxt "text_id=15136 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　<こ|・><ん|・><な|・><に|・><な|・><る|・><ま|・><で|・>放っておくとは、マインスターは人の親とはいえまいよ」"
msgstr "  How could your Meinster mother call herself a parent when she's neglected you so much?\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1670:15137: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1670
msgctxt "text_id=15137 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は手袋をつけたまま、鮮血に染まる有珠の腹部に手を滑らせる。"
msgstr "  With her gloved hand, Touko ran her fingers along the wound on Alice's abdomen."

#. Occurrence A_5:1691:15138: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_5_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1691
msgctxt "text_id=15138 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「っ………」"
msgstr "\"Nng...\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1730:15139: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1730
msgctxt "text_id=15139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小さく<零|こぼ>れる苦悶。"
msgstr "  A flash of pain ran through Alice's body."

#. Occurrence A_5:1735:15140: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1735
msgctxt "text_id=15140 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悲鳴ひとつあげなかった有珠から吐息が漏れる。"
msgstr "  Alice had held in her screams, but she finally let out a long breath."

#. Occurrence A_5:1740:15141: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1740
msgctxt "text_id=15141 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　顔を<背|そむ>けたのは、恥じらいからか、痛みからか。"
msgstr "  She turned her face away, in pain or shame."

#. Occurrence A_5:1763:15142: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0020; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1763
msgctxt "text_id=15142 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ほら、もう肌も復元している。骨格、血管はおろか、内臓にまで施された、<夥|おびただ>しいまでの刻印だ。"
msgstr "\"The skin here's regenerating already. So many crests on the bones, veins, even the internal organs."

#. Occurrence A_5:1769:15143: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0021; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1769
msgctxt "text_id=15143 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　生後、肉体に魔術回路を付加する事は両刃の剣だ。"
msgstr "  Having Magic Circuits like that from birth is a double-edged sword."

#. Occurrence A_5:1775:15144: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0022; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1775
msgctxt "text_id=15144 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　呪文を自分と一体化させる事により、詠唱の手間を省き、術者に多大な利点をもたらす魔術刻印。"
msgstr "  They cut incantation time, which is a great boon for a mage."

#. Occurrence A_5:1781:15145: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0023; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1781
msgctxt "text_id=15145 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　しかし、それは多ければ多いほど苦痛をともなう。蒼崎の刻印は腕一本分。まあ、君に比べれば少ない方だな」"
msgstr "  But the more there are, the more pain they bring. Aozakis have crests in one arm. We've got nothing on you, do we?\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1831:15146: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1831
msgctxt "text_id=15146 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の語る魔術刻印とは、その家系の歴史を形にした遺産の事だ。"
msgstr "  The Magic Crests Touko referred to were the inheritance of the Aozaki family, passed down by their ancestors."

#. Occurrence A_5:1836:15147: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1836
msgctxt "text_id=15147 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　後継者にしか刻まれない一品もの。"
msgstr "  They can only be inherited."

#. Occurrence A_5:1841:15148: scene=A_5
#: A_5:1841
msgctxt "text_id=15148 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子が継承するはずだった刻印は、妹である青子の手に渡っている。"
msgstr "  Aoko had received the ones that were meant for Touko."

#. Occurrence A_5:1890:15149: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0024; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1890
msgctxt "text_id=15149 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「しかし、それも良し悪しだな。"
msgstr "\"However, ours has its own set of drawbacks."

#. Occurrence A_5:1896:15150: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0025; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1896
msgctxt "text_id=15150 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　右腕に刻印をした青子の痛みは、残る人間の体と神秘となった右腕とが反発する程度だ。"
msgstr "  The pain Aoko feels in her right arm is the remainder of her human body reacting to being changed into a Mystic."

#. Occurrence A_5:1902:15151: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0026; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1902
msgctxt "text_id=15151 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　通常の肉体が右腕を否定し、抹消にかかる痛み。"
msgstr "  Her mundane body rejects her right arm, and that pain is the cost of its deletion."

#. Occurrence A_5:1908:15152: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0027; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1908
msgctxt "text_id=15152 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　精神的にも肉体的にも生じる幻痛は、原罪にも似て<拭|ぬぐ>い去る事はできない」"
msgstr "  It causes both physical and mental phantom pain, like some original sin that can never be wiped away.\""

#. Occurrence A_5:1963:15153: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0028; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1963
msgctxt "text_id=15153 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……だが、ここまでくると痛みも何もあるまい。"
msgstr "\"Still, when you've come this far, pain becomes trivial."

#. Occurrence A_5:1969:15154: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0029; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1969
msgctxt "text_id=15154 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　そもそも生きている実感はあるのか？"
msgstr "  It makes it difficult to know if you're really alive."

#. Occurrence A_5:1975:15155: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0030; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1975
msgctxt "text_id=15155 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　自分が人間だとまだ信じている？"
msgstr "  Do you still believe you're human?"

#. Occurrence A_5:1999:15156: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0031_0; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:1999
msgctxt "text_id=15156 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ああ、本当に―――"
msgstr "  Honestly, I sympathize."

#. Occurrence A_5:2007:15157: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0031_1; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:2007
msgctxt "text_id=15157 | speaker=touko"
msgid "お互い、非凡な師を持つと苦労するね、有珠」"
msgstr "We've both had a hard time with such extraordinary teachers, haven't we, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence A_5:2055:15158: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2055
msgctxt "text_id=15158 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして、橙子は有珠の体を抱き起こした。"
msgstr "  Touko took Alice's body in her arms."

#. Occurrence A_5:2060:15159: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2060
msgctxt "text_id=15159 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオウルフに裂かれた腹部はもう大部分が<塞|ふさ>がっている。"
msgstr "  The wounds from Beowulf had mostly healed."

#. Occurrence A_5:2077:15160: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2077
msgctxt "text_id=15160 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも痛みは残っているのか、有珠の呼吸はあまりにもか細く、弱い。"
msgstr "  Even so, her breathing was shallow, likely due to the pain."

#. Occurrence A_5:2082:15161: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2082
msgctxt "text_id=15161 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな少女の顔を、橙子は優しく持ち上げる。"
msgstr "  Touko gently held the girl's face in her hand."

#. Occurrence A_5:2136:15162: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0032; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:2136
msgctxt "text_id=15162 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「マインスターには恩がある。それに、私の相手はあくまで青子ひとりだ」"
msgstr "\"I'm indebted to your Meinster mother. And my true opponent has only ever been Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence A_5:2171:15163: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2171
msgctxt "text_id=15163 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無惨に酸素を求める有珠の唇が、橙子の唇に塞がれる。"
msgstr "  Alice's lungs pined for oxygen; Touko pressed her lips to hers."

#. Occurrence A_5:2176:15164: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2176
msgctxt "text_id=15164 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　身をよじって逃れる少女の肩を、魔術師の腕が掴み縛る。"
msgstr "  The young girl wriggled, trying to escape, but Touko held her firmly."

#. Occurrence A_5:2196:15165: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2196
msgctxt "text_id=15165 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼い月の下、両者は凍り付いたように動かない。"
msgstr "  Beneath the blue moon, the two remained frozen."

#. Occurrence A_5:2202:15166: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2202
msgctxt "text_id=15166 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こくり、と嚥下する音。"
msgstr "  Then, the sound of swallowing."

#. Occurrence A_5:2231:15167: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2231
msgctxt "text_id=15167 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の喉に滑り落ちる固形物。それきり、少女は力を失って崩れ落ちた。"
msgstr "  Something solid slid down Alice's throat. With that, she went limp and her arm fell."

#. Occurrence A_5:2282:15168: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2282
msgctxt "text_id=15168 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　弱々しく横になった有珠を見届け、橙子は立ち上がる。"
msgstr "  After setting Alice down on her side, Touko stood up."

#. Occurrence A_5:2293:15169: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0033; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:2293
msgctxt "text_id=15169 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「今のはナナカマドに手を加えた私の特製品だ。そう簡単に解毒はできない。魔力を流せば体の中で暴発する仕組みになっているから気をつけなさい。"
msgstr "\"I've given you a dose of my own blend of rowan, not easily counteracted. If you use magical energy, it'll explode, so do be careful."

#. Occurrence A_5:2306:15170: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0034; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:2306
msgctxt "text_id=15170 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　―――ああ、口移しは私の趣味だから、特に気にする事はないよ」"
msgstr "  Oh, and... don't read too much into it. Passing things with y mouth is just something I like to do.\""

#. Occurrence A_5:2329:15171: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_5_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_5
#: A_5:2329
msgctxt "text_id=15171 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「…………………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_5:2349:15172: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2349
msgctxt "text_id=15172 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は地面に倒れたまま、必死に意識をたもって橙子を見上げる。"
msgstr "  As she desperately clung to consciousness, Alice looked up at Touko from the ground."

#. Occurrence A_5:2355:15173: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2355
msgctxt "text_id=15173 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "体の痛みより、今の口づけの方がよっぽどダメージが大きかったと睨むように。"
msgstr "The disgrace from the kiss was greater than the pain she felt in her body."

#. Occurrence A_5:2360:15174: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2360
msgctxt "text_id=15174 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　恨みがましい視線に振りかえる事もなく、橙子は黄金の狼を従えて歩きだす。"
msgstr "  Touko began walking away, her golden wolf in tow. Neither looked back to see Alice's hateful glare."

#. Occurrence A_5:2403:15175: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0035; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:2403
msgctxt "text_id=15175 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「と。そうそう、ひとつ言い忘れていた。"
msgstr "\"Ah! I almost forgot."

#. Occurrence A_5:2409:15176: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0036; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:2409
msgctxt "text_id=15176 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ベオが呼び寄せた野犬たちだけどね、公園の外にまだ山ほどいるんだが―――困ったコトに、彼らは本来<何|・><を|・><口|・><に|・><す|・><る|・><べ|・><き|・><か|・>を思い出している。"
msgstr "  Remember those mutts Beo called? There's a ton of them around the park, and unfortunately they're still hungry."

#. Occurrence A_5:2415:15177: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0037; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:2415
msgctxt "text_id=15177 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ベオの野性に刺激されたんだろう。獣は、より強い獣に従うものだからな」"
msgstr "  Beo's an alpha male. Seeing what Beo did to you must've really fired them up.\""

#. Occurrence A_5:2452:15178: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2452
msgctxt "text_id=15178 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　遠回しな死刑宣告。"
msgstr "  In a roundabout way, Touko had read Alice her last rites."

#. Occurrence A_5:2457:15179: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2457
msgctxt "text_id=15179 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自然界において、動かなくなった動物は、まだ動く動物に<肉|からだ>を捧げるのが習わしだ。"
msgstr "  In nature, it was common for the weak that could no longer move to offer their bodies up to feed the strong."

#. Occurrence A_5:2478:15180: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_5_0038; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_5
#: A_5:2478
msgctxt "text_id=15180 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「じゃあ私は行くよ。歩く事も満足にできないだろうが、無事に帰れるといいね、有珠」"
msgstr "\"Well, Alice, I think that's everything. It's a long walk back, but hopefully you make it safely.\""

#. Occurrence A_5:2513:15181: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2513
msgctxt "text_id=15181 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　口元をいびつに歪ませて、魔術師は退場した。"
msgstr "  With a twisted grin, the mage headed into the darkness."

#. Occurrence A_5:2547:15182: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2547
msgctxt "text_id=15182 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それと入れ替わるように、飢えた<彼|・><ら|・>の声が集まってくる。"
msgstr "  As her footsteps faded, the sound of growls grew louder."

#. Occurrence A_5:2568:15183: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_5_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_5
#: A_5:2568
msgctxt "text_id=15183 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「…………、――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_5:2574:15184: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2574
msgctxt "text_id=15184 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……有珠の視界はいまだ定まらない。"
msgstr "  Alice could still barely focus her eyes."

#. Occurrence A_5:2579:15185: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2579
msgctxt "text_id=15185 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　集まりだした野犬は、絵本に出てくるお化けのようだ。"
msgstr "  The hounds looked like monsters out of a picture book."

#. Occurrence A_5:2612:15186: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2612
msgctxt "text_id=15186 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　薄れゆく意識の中で、有珠は大きく息を吐いた。"
msgstr "  Alice took a deep breath, her consciousness slipping away."

#. Occurrence A_5:2617:15187: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2617
msgctxt "text_id=15187 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　空は青く、森は高く、広場に救いはない。"
msgstr "  The sky was blue... The trees were tall... The park was a graveyard..."

#. Occurrence A_5:2652:15188: scene=A_5
#: A_5:2652
msgctxt "text_id=15188 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うつろな視界の隅には、場違いな電話ボックスがひとつ。"
msgstr "  In the corner of her eye, though, Alice could just about make out a solitary phone booth."

#. Occurrence A_6:39:15189: scene=A_6
#: A_6:39
msgctxt "text_id=15189 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　電話が鳴った。"
msgstr "  The phone rang."

#. Occurrence A_6:55:15190: scene=A_6
#: A_6:55
msgctxt "text_id=15190 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎にとって二回目にあたる電話の音は、深夜のロビーに寒々しく響き渡った。"
msgstr "  It was the second time Soujyuro had heard its voice echo through the cold foyer."

#. Occurrence A_6:60:15191: scene=A_6
#: A_6:60
msgctxt "text_id=15191 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の電話から、まだ数分と経っていない。"
msgstr "  Only a few minutes had passed since Alice called."

#. Occurrence A_6:65:15192: scene=A_6
#: A_6:65
msgctxt "text_id=15192 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女の用件はなんだったのか。"
msgstr "  He wondered what she could want this time."

#. Occurrence A_6:81:15193: scene=A_6
#: A_6:81
msgctxt "text_id=15193 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ひとり考えこむ草十郎の目を覚ますように、コール音は鳴り響く。"
msgstr "  The call persisted, determined not to leave him to his thoughts."

#. Occurrence A_6:107:15194: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_6_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_6
#: A_6:107
msgctxt "text_id=15194 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「はい、久遠寺ですが」"
msgstr "\"Hello, Kuonji residence.\""

#. Occurrence A_6:113:15195: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:113
msgctxt "text_id=15195 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「あら、その声は草十郎くん？」"
msgstr "\"Oh, is that Soujyuro I hear?\""

#. Occurrence A_6:119:15196: scene=A_6
#: A_6:119
msgctxt "text_id=15196 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　また有珠からの電話では、という草十郎の予想を裏切る明るい声。"
msgstr "  A cheery voice? Soujyuro had been expecting Alice."

#. Occurrence A_6:124:15197: scene=A_6
#: A_6:124
msgctxt "text_id=15197 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　声の主は蒼崎橙子で、予想外の相手に草十郎はかすかに当惑……はしなかった。"
msgstr "  It was Touko Aozaki. Somehow, Soujyuro was not surprised."

#. Occurrence A_6:150:15198: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_6_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_6
#: A_6:150
msgctxt "text_id=15198 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうですけど。橙子さん、暇なんですか？」"
msgstr "\"Yes, it's me. How are you, Touko?\""

#. Occurrence A_6:156:15199: scene=A_6
#: A_6:156
msgctxt "text_id=15199 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしかもうじき午前零時になるな、と草十郎は時計を確認する。"
msgstr "  He checked the time; he thought it was about midnight by now."

#. Occurrence A_6:161:15200: scene=A_6
#: A_6:161
msgctxt "text_id=15200 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここ一番でも緊張感のない男である。"
msgstr "  No matter what the situation, Soujyuro always kept his cool."

#. Occurrence A_6:182:15201: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:182
msgctxt "text_id=15201 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「っ―――」"
msgstr "\"Pff...\""

#. Occurrence A_6:187:15202: scene=A_6
#: A_6:187
msgctxt "text_id=15202 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　受話器の向こうでは、笑いをこらえる息遣い。"
msgstr "  He could hear Touko trying to suppress a laugh."

#. Occurrence A_6:192:15203: scene=A_6
#: A_6:192
msgctxt "text_id=15203 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しばらくの呼吸困難の後、橙子はようやく落ち着いて会話を再開した。"
msgstr "  After taking a while to compose herself, she started talking again."

#. Occurrence A_6:213:15204: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:213
msgctxt "text_id=15204 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ごめんなさい、ちょっとツボはいっちゃったみたい。"
msgstr "\"My apologies. It seems you have a penchant for catching people off guard."

#. Occurrence A_6:219:15205: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:219
msgctxt "text_id=15205 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　で、質問の返しね。これがあんまり暇じゃないな。私も今日で終わらせる予定だから忙しいんだ」"
msgstr "  Anyway, to answer your question. I've been very busy today, trying to finish off every...thing.\""

#. Occurrence A_6:225:15206: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_6_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_6
#: A_6:225
msgctxt "text_id=15206 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「偶然ですね。蒼崎もそんな事を言ってました」"
msgstr "\"Huh. That's a coincidence. Aozaki was just talking about you.\""

#. Occurrence A_6:252:15207: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:252
msgctxt "text_id=15207 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「やっぱり？　そうね、こういう時は本当に姉妹だなって思うわ。昔からエンジンかけるタイミングだけは一緒だったから、あの子とは。"
msgstr "\"I thought she might. At times like this, you can tell we're sisters. In fact, that's the only thing we ever had in common―timing."

#. Occurrence A_6:258:15208: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:258
msgctxt "text_id=15208 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　……ところで、蒼崎はやめてって言ったでしょ。私も蒼崎だから、<擽|くすぐ>ったいのよね、そう言われるの」"
msgstr "  Oh, I bet you tried to get her to stop as well. As an Aozaki, I know she didn't take to that too kindly, I wouldn't.\""

#. Occurrence A_6:278:15209: scene=A_6
#: A_6:278
msgctxt "text_id=15209 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言われて、ああ、と草十郎は納得した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro realized she was probably right."

#. Occurrence A_6:283:15210: scene=A_6
#: A_6:283
msgctxt "text_id=15210 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの時の言葉はそういう意味だったのか、と。"
msgstr "  Aozaki's words made more sense now."

#. Occurrence A_6:304:15211: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:304
msgctxt "text_id=15211 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「まあそんな訳だから、長話をする気はないんだ。"
msgstr "\"Cutting to the chase, I don't have time to gossip."

#. Occurrence A_6:310:15212: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:310
msgctxt "text_id=15212 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　単刀直入に聞くけど、そっちに青子はいる？」"
msgstr "  Is Aoko there?\""

#. Occurrence A_6:316:15213: scene=A_6
#: A_6:316
msgctxt "text_id=15213 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは本当に、妹の行方を心配するような質問だった。"
msgstr "  It almost sounded like she was worried about her sister's whereabouts."

#. Occurrence A_6:321:15214: scene=A_6
#: A_6:321
msgctxt "text_id=15214 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、どんなに緊張感のない草十郎でも、橙子が青子たちの敵であるコトは実感している。"
msgstr "  But the cool-headed Soujyuro had not forgotten Touko was their enemy."

#. Occurrence A_6:326:15215: scene=A_6
#: A_6:326
msgctxt "text_id=15215 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子と有珠を思うのなら、この質問には答えられない。"
msgstr "  Keeping Aoko and Alice in mind, he decided to be evasive."

#. Occurrence A_6:347:15216: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_6_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_6
#: A_6:347
msgctxt "text_id=15216 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……さあ。なんて答えてほしいんですか、橙子さんとしては」"
msgstr "\"Who can say. I'm not sure what answer you expect, Miss Touko.\""

#. Occurrence A_6:352:15217: scene=A_6
#: A_6:352
msgctxt "text_id=15217 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今までの気軽な口調とは一変した質問。"
msgstr "  The question shifted the tone of the conversation drastically."

#. Occurrence A_6:357:15218: scene=A_6
#: A_6:357
msgctxt "text_id=15218 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の言葉に、受話器の向こうにいる橙子は、まいったなあ、と呟いた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro could hear Touko muttering to herself in annoyance."

#. Occurrence A_6:362:15219: scene=A_6
#: A_6:362
msgctxt "text_id=15219 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女が思っていた以上に、この少年は察しがいい。今は、その賢さがマイナスに働くというのにだ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was proving more quick-witted than she had anticipated. A change of tack was required."

#. Occurrence A_6:383:15220: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:383
msgctxt "text_id=15220 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そうね、君には何も答えてほしくないっていうのが正解かな。"
msgstr "\"I suppose not giving me an answer is probably the best course of action."

#. Occurrence A_6:389:15221: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:389
msgctxt "text_id=15221 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　第一印象で君を無視するのはよくない気がしてたけど、やっぱり私は、草十郎くんを手にかけたくはないみたい。"
msgstr "  On first impressions, I thought I'd be wise not to ignore you, but now I don't think I want to get you involved."

#. Occurrence A_6:395:15222: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:395
msgctxt "text_id=15222 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　君は、このまま無関係でいてちょうだいね」"
msgstr "  So for your sake, stay out of this, okay, Soujyuro?\""

#. Occurrence A_6:415:15223: scene=A_6
#: A_6:415
msgctxt "text_id=15223 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　嘘のない、親しみのこもった忠告。"
msgstr "  Her warning came from the heart."

#. Occurrence A_6:420:15224: scene=A_6
#: A_6:420
msgctxt "text_id=15224 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はそうですか、とだけ答えた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro responded flatly, once again not giving any sign either way."

#. Occurrence A_6:431:15225: scene=A_6
#: A_6:431
msgctxt "text_id=15225 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やっぱり彼女も無関係である事を望んでいる。"
msgstr "  It seems she wanted him to stay out of this, too."

#. Occurrence A_6:436:15226: scene=A_6
#: A_6:436
msgctxt "text_id=15226 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが彼女たちなりの誠意である事は、草十郎にも理解できる。"
msgstr "  Even Soujyuro could tell the girls were being kind in their own way."

#. Occurrence A_6:442:15227: scene=A_6
#: A_6:442
msgctxt "text_id=15227 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが。その誠意は、誰が望んだものなのか。"
msgstr "  But who asked for their kindness?"

#. Occurrence A_6:463:15228: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:463
msgctxt "text_id=15228 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「じゃ、さよならね。私は君が思ってるほど暇じゃないから。"
msgstr "\"I'll say goodbye then. I'm much busier than you think."

#. Occurrence A_6:469:15229: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0012; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:469
msgctxt "text_id=15229 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　……でも、最後にひとつだけ。君を試すようで悪いんだけど、伝えておかないと一生恨まれそうだし。"
msgstr "  Although, there is just one tiny thing. I know this is hardly fair, but I'd never forgive myself if I didn't tell you."

#. Occurrence A_6:475:15230: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:475
msgctxt "text_id=15230 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　なんで、そうならないように責任の半分を君に押しつけちゃおっかな」"
msgstr "  So, I'll just have to put half of the responsibility on your shoulders.\""

#. Occurrence A_6:495:15231: scene=A_6
#: A_6:495
msgctxt "text_id=15231 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　くす、と橙子は笑う。"
msgstr "  Touko giggled-"

#. Occurrence A_6:500:15232: scene=A_6
#: A_6:500
msgctxt "text_id=15232 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは、はじめから<そ|・><れ|・>を伝える事だけが目的だと示す笑みだった。"
msgstr "  a laugh to show she had him in the palm of her hand from the beginning."

#. Occurrence A_6:521:15233: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0014; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:521
msgctxt "text_id=15233 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「さっき久遠寺さんに会ってきたの。"
msgstr "\"I met Miss Kuonji a short while ago."

#. Occurrence A_6:527:15234: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0015; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:527
msgctxt "text_id=15234 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　彼女から電話があったでしょう？」"
msgstr "  She called you earlier, didn't she?\""

#. Occurrence A_6:533:15235: scene=A_6
#: A_6:533
msgctxt "text_id=15235 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の口調は変わらない。"
msgstr "  Her tone had not changed."

#. Occurrence A_6:538:15236: scene=A_6
#: A_6:538
msgctxt "text_id=15236 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の台詞にはどこにも嫌な気配はない。"
msgstr "  She sounded as cordial as before."

#. Occurrence A_6:543:15237: scene=A_6
#: A_6:543
msgctxt "text_id=15237 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なのに有珠の名前を聞いた瞬間、草十郎の背筋に冷たい物が走り抜けた。"
msgstr "  Even so, as soon as Soujyuro heard Alice's name, a chill ran up his spine."

#. Occurrence A_6:564:15238: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0016; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:564
msgctxt "text_id=15238 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「彼女、今ひどい状態なんだ。満足に歩けないどころか、体中の刻印が活性化して破裂寸前。草十郎くんが骨折の痛みを知ってるなら、うまい喩えようがあるんだけどね。"
msgstr "\"Well, right now, she's in bad shape. She can barely walk, in fact. And if she uses any crests, they'll tear her to pieces. Oh, and those broken bones... ouch."

#. Occurrence A_6:570:15239: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0017; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:570
msgctxt "text_id=15239 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ま、ともかくだ。いつ気を失ってもおかしくない状態なんだけど―――災難なことに、怖い野犬に囲まれてるみたいなの。"
msgstr "  At any rate, she could lose consciousness any time. Not great news with all those scary stray dogs around her."

#. Occurrence A_6:576:15240: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:576
msgctxt "text_id=15240 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　個人的な意見だけど、んー、十分もあれば骨しか残らない結末になるでしょうね」"
msgstr "  If you ask me, she has about ten minutes before she's nothing but a pile of bones.\""

#. Occurrence A_6:596:15241: scene=A_6
#: A_6:596
msgctxt "text_id=15241 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これっぽっちも信憑性のない、冗談のような話。"
msgstr "  She spoke as if she was telling a joke."

#. Occurrence A_6:601:15242: scene=A_6
#: A_6:601
msgctxt "text_id=15242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それもとびきり出来の悪い。"
msgstr "  If it was a joke, it was in bad taste."

#. Occurrence A_6:606:15243: scene=A_6
#: A_6:606
msgctxt "text_id=15243 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、草十郎はすべて現実だと受け入れた。"
msgstr "  However, Soujyuro knew this was anything but."

#. Occurrence A_6:611:15244: scene=A_6
#: A_6:611
msgctxt "text_id=15244 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の言葉に嘘はない。"
msgstr "  She was telling the truth."

#. Occurrence A_6:616:15245: scene=A_6
#: A_6:616
msgctxt "text_id=15245 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　都会の犬が人を襲うなんて話は聞かないけれど、先ほどの有珠の電話にあった違和感―――騒がしかった雑音の正体に、草十郎はようやく思い至った。"
msgstr "  He had not heard of dogs attacking anyone in town...but the noise he heard while on the phone with Alice suddenly made sense."

#. Occurrence A_6:627:15246: scene=A_6
#: A_6:627
msgctxt "text_id=15246 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれは間違いなく、群れをなして獲物を囲む、犬たちの唸り声だったのだ。"
msgstr "  Dogs. A pack of them. No doubt about it, they were surrounding their prey."

#. Occurrence A_6:648:15247: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_6_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_6
#: A_6:648
msgctxt "text_id=15247 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「っ………！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence A_6:653:15248: scene=A_6
#: A_6:653
msgctxt "text_id=15248 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜあの時に気付かなかったのか。"
msgstr "  Why had he not cottoned on sooner?"

#. Occurrence A_6:658:15249: scene=A_6
#: A_6:658
msgctxt "text_id=15249 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　受話器を強く握り締めて、草十郎は自分を呪う。"
msgstr "  Squeezing the receiver in his hand, Soujyuro cursed himself."

#. Occurrence A_6:663:15250: scene=A_6
#: A_6:663
msgctxt "text_id=15250 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つい数分前の有珠の言葉は、彼女にとって精一杯の、助けを呼ぶ声だった。"
msgstr "  Alice had been calling for help."

#. Occurrence A_6:683:15251: scene=A_6
#: A_6:683
msgctxt "text_id=15251 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子以上に草十郎を関わらせまいとする有珠は、絶望的な状況でも、彼に助けを求める事はしなかった。"
msgstr "  Even when backed into a corner, she had not wanted to involve Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence A_6:688:15252: scene=A_6
#: A_6:688
msgctxt "text_id=15252 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……けれど、それでも、最後の最後で助けを求めた。"
msgstr "  Still...she needed help."

#. Occurrence A_6:694:15253: scene=A_6
#: A_6:694
msgctxt "text_id=15253 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　か細い声で、彼女が彼の名前を呼んだあの時に。"
msgstr "  The way she said his name so lightly..."

#. Occurrence A_6:715:15254: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_6_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_6
#: A_6:715
msgctxt "text_id=15254 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「場所は」"
msgstr "\"Where is she?\""

#. Occurrence A_6:721:15255: scene=A_6
#: A_6:721
msgctxt "text_id=15255 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　簡潔に問いただす。"
msgstr "  He spoke abruptly."

#. Occurrence A_6:726:15256: scene=A_6
#: A_6:726
msgctxt "text_id=15256 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子が敵である事を思い知った草十郎だが、彼女なら場所を教えてくれるという確信がある。"
msgstr "  Even though he knew Touko was the enemy, he was confident she would answer him."

#. Occurrence A_6:731:15257: scene=A_6
#: A_6:731
msgctxt "text_id=15257 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そのために、橙子はここに電話をしたのだから。"
msgstr "  That was the reason she called."

#. Occurrence A_6:752:15258: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0019; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:752
msgctxt "text_id=15258 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「教えてあげてもいいけど、そうした瞬間に君は私の敵になるのよ。その覚悟はある？」"
msgstr "\"I can tell you, but just know that the moment I do, you become my enemy. Do we have a deal?\""

#. Occurrence A_6:758:15259: scene=A_6
#: A_6:758
msgctxt "text_id=15259 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そういう事か、と草十郎は納得した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro realized what was happening."

#. Occurrence A_6:763:15260: scene=A_6
#: A_6:763
msgctxt "text_id=15260 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしかに、これは試されている。"
msgstr "  He was being tested."

#. Occurrence A_6:768:15261: scene=A_6
#: A_6:768
msgctxt "text_id=15261 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここで有珠を無視すれば、自分は彼女たちと無関係だと証明できる。"
msgstr "  By ignoring Alice, he would be confirming that he did not want to get involved."

#. Occurrence A_6:773:15262: scene=A_6
#: A_6:773
msgctxt "text_id=15262 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど助けに行くのなら―――"
msgstr "  But if he decided to save her..."

#. Occurrence A_6:794:15263: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_6_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_6
#: A_6:794
msgctxt "text_id=15263 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それで、場所は？」"
msgstr "\"Tell me, where is she?\""

#. Occurrence A_6:806:15264: scene=A_6
#: A_6:806
msgctxt "text_id=15264 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の問いには答えず、草十郎はそれだけを聞き返した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro ignored Touko's question."

#. Occurrence A_6:811:15265: scene=A_6
#: A_6:811
msgctxt "text_id=15265 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　覚悟なんて一生できないし、後悔だって尽きる事はない。"
msgstr "  Of course he was not prepared to become her enemy, but he was even less prepared to let Alice die."

#. Occurrence A_6:816:15266: scene=A_6
#: A_6:816
msgctxt "text_id=15266 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だいたいはじめから、彼には明確な判断基準が失われている。"
msgstr "  He had lost his ability to think sensibly, not that he was particularly good about that to begin with."

#. Occurrence A_6:821:15267: scene=A_6
#: A_6:821
msgctxt "text_id=15267 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから、何であれ一番初めに感じた事を大事にしようと思ったのだ。"
msgstr "  Still, he would not waste any time in deliberation. He would simply go with his instincts."

#. Occurrence A_6:826:15268: scene=A_6
#: A_6:826
msgctxt "text_id=15268 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが山から下りてきてからの、彼の数少ない<矜持|きょうじ>だった。"
msgstr "  It was one of the few times he had felt pride since coming down from the mountains."

#. Occurrence A_6:847:15269: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0020; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:847
msgctxt "text_id=15269 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……そ。ちょっと残念だな、私はホントに君が気に入ってたのに。ま、こうなる事は分かってたけどね。"
msgstr "\"...Okay. I'm a little disappointed. I didn't want to have to kill you. Then again, I thought it might end up this way."

#. Occurrence A_6:853:15270: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0021; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:853
msgctxt "text_id=15270 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　場所は社木の森林公園。受話器の下に地図があるでしょ？この前、帰りがけに栞をはさんでおいたからそれを参考にすること。"
msgstr "  She's at Yashirogi Nature Park. Check the map under the phone. I bookmarked the page last time I was there."

#. Occurrence A_6:859:15271: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0022; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:859
msgctxt "text_id=15271 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　繰り返すようだけど、十分持てば幸運。その後は一分ごとに奇跡の価値があがるような状況よ、今の彼女は」"
msgstr "  I'll say it again: you'll be lucky if you have ten minutes. It'll be a miracle if she lasts a minute longer.\""

#. Occurrence A_6:879:15272: scene=A_6
#: A_6:879
msgctxt "text_id=15272 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の説明を聞きながら、ぎり、と草十郎は苛立ちで顔を歪めた。"
msgstr "  As he listened, Soujyuro's expression turned to one of irritation."

#. Occurrence A_6:884:15273: scene=A_6
#: A_6:884
msgctxt "text_id=15273 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここ三咲町から社木は一駅離れている。"
msgstr "  Misaki and Yashirogi were one station apart."

#. Occurrence A_6:889:15274: scene=A_6
#: A_6:889
msgctxt "text_id=15274 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今から洋館を出て駅に着くまで何分かかるだろう？"
msgstr "  How long would it take to get to the station from the mansion?"

#. Occurrence A_6:894:15275: scene=A_6
#: A_6:894
msgctxt "text_id=15275 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつもは二十分弱。"
msgstr "  Usually just under twelve minutes."

#. Occurrence A_6:899:15276: scene=A_6
#: A_6:899
msgctxt "text_id=15276 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこから電車に乗って社木に着いた頃には、もう三十分は経っている―――"
msgstr "  By the time he got off the train at Yashirogi, nearly thirty minutes would have passed."

#. Occurrence A_6:920:15277: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0023; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:920
msgctxt "text_id=15277 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「地図の上じゃ近いのに、区画整理された交通手段は不便よね。けど、急げば最終の電車には間に合うわ。ここで諦めた方が賢明だけど、君はもう私の敵だから。"
msgstr "\"It looks close on the map, but transport links around here are terrible. You might be able to catch the last train, but you should cut your losses. Either way, you're my enemy now."

#. Occurrence A_6:926:15278: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_A_6_0024; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=A_6
#: A_6:926
msgctxt "text_id=15278 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　―――どっちにしたって、後悔のないようにね」"
msgstr "  Just don't regret your choice.\""

#. Occurrence A_6:947:15279: scene=A_6
#: A_6:947
msgctxt "text_id=15279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　電話はそこで切れた。"
msgstr "  The line went dead."

#. Occurrence A_6:952:15280: scene=A_6
#: A_6:952
msgctxt "text_id=15280 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子が切ったのではなく、草十郎が切ったのだ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro, not Touko, had hung up the phone."

#. Occurrence A_6:959:15281: scene=A_6
#: A_6:959
msgctxt "text_id=15281 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地図を頭にいれて走りだす。"
msgstr "  He memorized the map and then made for the door."

#. Occurrence A_6:965:15282: scene=A_6
#: A_6:965
msgctxt "text_id=15282 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　上着を取りにいく時間も惜しい。草十郎は着の身着のままで、まだ雪の残る冬の夜へと駆け出していく。"
msgstr "  With no time to grab his coat, he ran out into the snowy winter night with the clothes he had on."

#. Occurrence A_6:985:15283: scene=A_6
#: A_6:985
msgctxt "text_id=15283 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ホールには放り出されたままの地図だけが残っていた。"
msgstr "  All that remained in the hall was the discarded map."

#. Occurrence A_6:990:15284: scene=A_6
#: A_6:990
msgctxt "text_id=15284 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　開かれたページには三咲市の地図がある。"
msgstr "  It showed Misaki City."

#. Occurrence A_6:995:15285: scene=A_6
#: A_6:995
msgctxt "text_id=15285 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この洋館から森林公園まで、距離にして約１５キロ。"
msgstr "  It was about ten miles from the mansion to the nature park;"

#. Occurrence A_6:1007:15286: scene=A_6
#: A_6:1007
msgctxt "text_id=15286 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　直線で結べばその三分の一もないというのに、都会の道は本当に不便だ。"
msgstr "  five if you went in a straight line, but the streets were not that forgiving."

#. Occurrence A_6:1012:15287: scene=A_6
#: A_6:1012
msgctxt "text_id=15287 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<都市|ここ>では十センチもない紙上の距離が何倍にもなってしまう事を、草十郎ははじめて呪いたくなった。"
msgstr "  Four inches on the map, but so much farther in reality. For the first time, Soujyuro cursed the town."

#. Occurrence A_7:79:15288: scene=A_7
#: A_7:79
msgctxt "text_id=15288 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠が裂かれたのは腹部だけではなかった。"
msgstr "  Alice's injuries were not limited to her abdomen."

#. Occurrence A_7:84:15289: scene=A_7
#: A_7:84
msgctxt "text_id=15289 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正確には腹を貫通して背中まで。"
msgstr "  The wolf had punched a hole straight through to her back,"

#. Occurrence A_7:90:15290: scene=A_7
#: A_7:90
msgctxt "text_id=15290 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "腰のやや上にある<脊椎|せきつい>まで砕かれた有珠の両足は、ぴくりとも動かなかった。"
msgstr " crushing her lower vertebrae and leaving both of her legs paralyzed."

#. Occurrence A_7:95:15291: scene=A_7
#: A_7:95
msgctxt "text_id=15291 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いずれ魔術刻印によって復元するにしろ、最短であと一時間。"
msgstr "  Though her Magic Crests were repairing the damage, it would likely take another hour before recovery."

#. Occurrence A_7:100:15292: scene=A_7
#: A_7:100
msgctxt "text_id=15292 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かろうじて動くのは心臓と、細い両手だけ。"
msgstr "  At the very least, her heart and slender arms still worked."

#. Occurrence A_7:141:15293: scene=A_7
#: A_7:141
msgctxt "text_id=15293 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その希望も、地を這って電話ボックスに入った時点で、もう満足に動かなかった。"
msgstr "  Although, after crawling along the ground to the phone booth, those too were failing her."

#. Occurrence A_7:146:15294: scene=A_7
#: A_7:146
msgctxt "text_id=15294 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　腹部の傷を癒すために起動した刻印は、凶悪な炉熱を放って、有珠の小さな体を押し潰そうとする。"
msgstr "  As the crests healed her wounds, a searing heat ran through her body that threatened to overwhelm her."

#. Occurrence A_7:152:15295: scene=A_7
#: A_7:152
msgctxt "text_id=15295 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――自分の体が自分の物でなく、何か得体の知れない、別の生き物に変わっていく感覚。"
msgstr "  It was as if her body was no longer her own, like she was transforming into another creature."

#. Occurrence A_7:172:15296: scene=A_7
#: A_7:172
msgctxt "text_id=15296 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　裂かれた腹部に渦巻く猛毒は、痛いというより辛い。"
msgstr "  The poison throbbing through her open wounds hurt emotionally more than physically."

#. Occurrence A_7:177:15297: scene=A_7
#: A_7:177
msgctxt "text_id=15297 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　痛みには慣れているが、この不快感だけは慣れようがない。"
msgstr "  She was used to pain, but she could not accept this disquieting feeling."

#. Occurrence A_7:182:15298: scene=A_7
#: A_7:182
msgctxt "text_id=15298 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　慣れた時には、彼女はもう彼女ではなくなっているのだから。"
msgstr "  Not that she had any intention to. The moment she did it would be her last."

#. Occurrence A_7:207:15299: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:207
msgctxt "text_id=15299 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……、―――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_7:213:15300: scene=A_7
#: A_7:213
msgctxt "text_id=15300 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　腹部の痛みと、魔術刻印による不快感。"
msgstr "  Alice wrestled with the discomfort from her abdomen and her Magic Crests,"

#. Occurrence A_7:218:15301: scene=A_7
#: A_7:218
msgctxt "text_id=15301 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつ消えてもおかしくない意識の中、有珠は受話器を手に取った。"
msgstr "  and with her consciousness holding on by a thread, she took the phone in her hand."

#. Occurrence A_7:269:15302: scene=A_7
#: A_7:269
msgctxt "text_id=15302 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子が帰還している可能性は低い。"
msgstr "  It was unlikely Aoko would be there to pick up."

#. Occurrence A_7:274:15303: scene=A_7
#: A_7:274
msgctxt "text_id=15303 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを知りながら洋館に電話をしたのは、電話ボックスに集まりだした野犬達の目つきに<圧|お>されての事かもしれない。"
msgstr "  Even so, with the stray dogs gathering around the booth, she had to try."

#. Occurrence A_7:279:15304: scene=A_7
#: A_7:279
msgctxt "text_id=15304 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、電話に出たのは草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  It was Soujyuro who picked up."

#. Occurrence A_7:286:15305: scene=A_7
#: A_7:286
msgctxt "text_id=15305 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　関係のない彼なら無言で切るべきだったのに、有珠は名前を呼んでしまった。"
msgstr "  Alice knew she was better off just hanging up, but his name slipped out of her mouth."

#. Occurrence A_7:306:15306: scene=A_7
#: A_7:306
msgctxt "text_id=15306 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……長い沈黙と葛藤の末、受話器ごしに凡庸な草十郎の顔が思い出されて、有珠はなんとか電話を切った。"
msgstr "  After pausing and fighting with herself for some time, an image of the innocent boy came to mind, and she hung up."

#. Occurrence A_7:311:15307: scene=A_7
#: A_7:311
msgctxt "text_id=15307 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうあっても彼を関わらせるのはいけない、そう本能が律したのだ。"
msgstr "  Her instincts had won out. She could not let him get involved."

#. Occurrence A_7:389:15308: scene=A_7
#: A_7:389
msgctxt "text_id=15308 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それは、一般人だからとか、そんな事とは関係なく。"
msgstr "  And not just because he was an innocent bystander. It was more than that."

#. Occurrence A_7:395:15309: scene=A_7
#: A_7:395
msgctxt "text_id=15309 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの日ささやかな秘密を共有した時から、少女にとって、静希草十郎はそういう風に映っていた。"
msgstr "  To Alice, Soujyuro appeared that day because he was merely in the wrong place at the wrong time."

#. Occurrence A_7:416:15310: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:416
msgctxt "text_id=15310 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「…………、―――――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_7:422:15311: scene=A_7
#: A_7:422
msgctxt "text_id=15311 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　喉からこぼれる息が、細い。"
msgstr "  Only the lightest of breaths passed her lips."

#. Occurrence A_7:461:15312: scene=A_7
#: A_7:461
msgctxt "text_id=15312 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　頭上の月が薄らいでいく。"
msgstr "  Above her, the moon began to blur."

#. Occurrence A_7:467:15313: scene=A_7
#: A_7:467
msgctxt "text_id=15313 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　降り始めた雪が遠くなっていく。"
msgstr "  Snow was falling again, so close yet so far."

#. Occurrence A_7:472:15314: scene=A_7
#: A_7:472
msgctxt "text_id=15314 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　周囲からは野犬たちの騒ぎ声。どん、と電話ボックスに体当たりをする音も聞こえだした。"
msgstr "  The dogs began hurling themselves at the phone booth to the chorus of hungry snarls. Thunk. Thunk."

#. Occurrence A_7:478:15315: scene=A_7
#: A_7:478
msgctxt "text_id=15315 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……少女は最後に大きく息をついて、目蓋を閉じる。"
msgstr "  She took one last deep breath and closed her eyes."

#. Occurrence A_7:505:15316: scene=A_7
#: A_7:505
msgctxt "text_id=15316 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　硝子の<棺|ひつぎ>の中で意識を手放す。"
msgstr "  Glass. An unusual material for a coffin."

#. Occurrence A_7:511:15317: scene=A_7
#: A_7:511
msgctxt "text_id=15317 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年に助けを乞わなかった事を最後まで正しく、そして不思議に思いながら。"
msgstr "  But the girl knew, in some corner of her mind, that she had made the right choice not to ask the boy for help."

#. Occurrence A_7:536:15318: scene=A_7
#: A_7:536
msgctxt "text_id=15318 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　―――合間。"
msgstr "          Some time passed."

msgctxt "text_id=15319 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "おかしな風景を見た。"
msgstr " A peculiar sight came into view."

#. Occurrence A_7:582:15320: scene=A_7
#: A_7:582
msgctxt "text_id=15320 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一面に花が咲き乱れた野原。"
msgstr "  A field of wild flowers."

#. Occurrence A_7:588:15321: scene=A_7
#: A_7:588
msgctxt "text_id=15321 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雲ひとつない空は青すぎて、"
msgstr "  The clear sky was too blue;"

#. Occurrence A_7:594:15322: scene=A_7
#: A_7:594
msgctxt "text_id=15322 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　野原いっぱいの花は白すぎて、"
msgstr "  the flowers, so numerous they made the field look barren."

#. Occurrence A_7:600:15323: scene=A_7
#: A_7:600
msgctxt "text_id=15323 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんなにも美しいのに、目を<背|そむ>けたくて仕方がない。"
msgstr "  The sight was so dazzlingly beautiful, she wished she could look away."

#. Occurrence A_7:620:15324: scene=A_7
#: A_7:620
msgctxt "text_id=15324 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それはたぶん、冬の出来事だった。"
msgstr "  ...This was probably all thanks to Father Winter."

#. Occurrence A_7:626:15325: scene=A_7
#: A_7:626
msgctxt "text_id=15325 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冷たい風は人里離れた<桃源|とうげん>の匂いがして、太陽すら人の<手|て><垢|あか>に汚れていない。"
msgstr "  The cold wind carried a scent of a paradise far removed, untainted by man or beast."

#. Occurrence A_7:632:15326: scene=A_7
#: A_7:632
msgctxt "text_id=15326 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　楽土と錯覚する<彼岸|ひがん>の原。"
msgstr "  It was a glimpse of the fields beyond winter. One could be forgiven for thinking they were the afterlife."

#. Occurrence A_7:637:15327: scene=A_7
#: A_7:637
msgctxt "text_id=15327 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう言えば、<弔|とむら>いは悲しいものなのに、いつも<華|はな>やかな事を思い出す。"
msgstr "  Come to think of it, she remembered how funerals were sad, yet always beautiful."

#. Occurrence A_7:658:15328: scene=A_7
#: A_7:658
msgctxt "text_id=15328 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……<嗚|あ><呼|あ>。"
msgstr "  She cried."

#. Occurrence A_7:663:15329: scene=A_7
#: A_7:663
msgctxt "text_id=15329 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なのに不釣り合いな呻き声と、<生命|いのち>の音がする。"
msgstr "  She made an incongruous whine, a sound of life."

#. Occurrence A_7:668:15330: scene=A_7
#: A_7:668
msgctxt "text_id=15330 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　断片的にこぼれる<吐|い><息|き>は<絞|しぼ>るように。"
msgstr "  Her breathing was strained and erratic."

#. Occurrence A_7:673:15331: scene=A_7
#: A_7:673
msgctxt "text_id=15331 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　痛みを訴えるはずの<感情|しんぞう>は、<虚|うつ>ろになって機能不全。"
msgstr "  Hollow and useless was the heart that she once used to fend off pain."

#. Occurrence A_7:678:15332: scene=A_7
#: A_7:678
msgctxt "text_id=15332 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　切断するかのような締め付けは胴と頭の中間に。"
msgstr "  It was as though she was in the space between disconnected body and mind."

#. Occurrence A_7:683:15333: scene=A_7
#: A_7:683
msgctxt "text_id=15333 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　女は泣きながら、鳴き声ひとつあげぬ幼子の―――"
msgstr "  A crying woman and a silent child..."

#. Occurrence A_7:704:15334: scene=A_7
#: A_7:704
msgctxt "text_id=15334 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　空は高く、森は深く、人は途絶え。"
msgstr "  High was the sky, deep was the forest, unmoving were the people."

#. Occurrence A_7:710:15335: scene=A_7
#: A_7:710
msgctxt "text_id=15335 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駆けつける足音も、助けを求める<意|こ><思|え>もない。"
msgstr "  No footsteps or voices of salvation came."

#. Occurrence A_7:716:15336: scene=A_7
#: A_7:716
msgctxt "text_id=15336 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな静けさの中で、無心で空を見上げていたのは、一体、誰だったのだろう―――"
msgstr "  Who was that looking innocently up at the sky in the stillness?"

#. Occurrence A_7:782:15337: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:782
msgctxt "text_id=15337 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_7:819:15338: scene=A_7
#: A_7:819
msgctxt "text_id=15338 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気が付くと、有珠は見慣れた坂を上っていた。"
msgstr "  When she came to, Alice was going up a familiar hill."

#. Occurrence A_7:824:15339: scene=A_7
#: A_7:824
msgctxt "text_id=15339 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜気は冷たく、手足は凍てついたように動かない。"
msgstr "  The cold, night air had all but frozen her hands or feet."

#. Occurrence A_7:829:15340: scene=A_7
#: A_7:829
msgctxt "text_id=15340 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　当然と言えば当然だが、金狼によって裂かれた腹部は剥きだしで、体はしきりに震えていた。"
msgstr "  She shook, as you would expect from someone whose abdomen had been torn apart."

#. Occurrence A_7:867:15341: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:867
msgctxt "text_id=15341 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……静希……君？」"
msgstr "\"Sizuki...?\""

#. Occurrence A_7:873:15342: scene=A_7
#: A_7:873
msgctxt "text_id=15342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分がその人物におぶられて白犬塚の坂を登っている事を、有珠はうつろな意識で認めた。"
msgstr "  She could barely comprehend that she was being carried slowly up Shiroinuzuka."

#. Occurrence A_7:905:15343: scene=A_7
#: A_7:905
msgctxt "text_id=15343 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は有珠を背中におぶったまま、無言で坂を上っていた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro had Alice on his back, and was silently ascending the slope."

#. Occurrence A_7:910:15344: scene=A_7
#: A_7:910
msgctxt "text_id=15344 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　落ち着いた瞳は、寒さのせいか辛そうな色をしている。"
msgstr "  His calm eyes seemed to be suffering from the bitter cold."

#. Occurrence A_7:915:15345: scene=A_7
#: A_7:915
msgctxt "text_id=15345 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見れば、この寒さの中で歩き回る服装ではなかった。"
msgstr "  He did not seem to be dressed for the time of year."

#. Occurrence A_7:920:15346: scene=A_7
#: A_7:920
msgctxt "text_id=15346 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は上着も着ておらず、首もとや手の平が哀れなほど冷えきっている。"
msgstr "  Not even a coat. His exposed neck and hands were ice-cold."

#. Occurrence A_7:941:15347: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:941
msgctxt "text_id=15347 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……どうして、ここにいるの……？」"
msgstr "\"Wh-What...are you...doing here?\""

#. Occurrence A_7:949:15348: scene=A_7
#: A_7:949
msgctxt "text_id=15348 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おぶられたまま有珠は問うた。"
msgstr "  Alice asked, still slumped over his frame."

#. Occurrence A_7:954:15349: scene=A_7
#: A_7:954
msgctxt "text_id=15349 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　体を起こしたくても力が入らない。"
msgstr "  She tried to move, but to no avail."

#. Occurrence A_7:959:15350: scene=A_7
#: A_7:959
msgctxt "text_id=15350 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の重さがすべて他人に預けられている事が、今はひどく気にかかる。"
msgstr "  The last thing she wanted was to rest her entire weight on someone else."

#. Occurrence A_7:993:15351: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:993
msgctxt "text_id=15351 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「橙子さんから電話があった。有珠が危ないって。"
msgstr "\"Touko called me. She said you were in trouble."

#. Occurrence A_7:999:15352: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:999
msgctxt "text_id=15352 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……蒼崎はともかく、有珠は意地を張りすぎだ。あの状況で助けを呼ばないのはどうかしてる。そりゃあ、自分が行っても何もできなかっただろうけど」"
msgstr "  You're more stubborn than Aozaki, you know. Why didn't you ask me for help? Not that I could be much help, but still.\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1019:15353: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1019
msgctxt "text_id=15353 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は前だけを見つめて、叱るように返答した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro spoke with a scolding tone, his eyes kept firmly ahead."

#. Occurrence A_7:1024:15354: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1024
msgctxt "text_id=15354 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その叱責は背中の少女に向けたものではなく、力になれなかった自分に対してのものだ。"
msgstr "  His words were directed at himself rather than the girl on his back."

#. Occurrence A_7:1071:15355: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1071
msgctxt "text_id=15355 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「…………静希君は、関係ないもの」"
msgstr "\"This... doesn't concern you...\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1077:15356: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1077
msgctxt "text_id=15356 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「だろうね。けど、これで関係はできた。館についたら話してもらうぞ」"
msgstr "\"Maybe you're right. But now it does. We'll talk more back at the house.\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1097:15357: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1097
msgctxt "text_id=15357 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はとにかく坂を登っていく。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro focused on climbing the hill."

#. Occurrence A_7:1102:15358: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1102
msgctxt "text_id=15358 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……考えてみれば、洋館までの坂は段々ときつくなっていく。"
msgstr "  The slope would get steeper from here to the mansion."

#. Occurrence A_7:1107:15359: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1107
msgctxt "text_id=15359 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その坂を、自分を背負ったまま登っていく草十郎に、有珠は意外なものを見た気がした。"
msgstr "  The thought of Soujyuro climbing this steep hill with her on his back surprised Alice."

#. Occurrence A_7:1141:15360: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1141
msgctxt "text_id=15360 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「降りるわ、もう大丈夫だから」"
msgstr "\"Let me down. I'm fine.\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1147:15361: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1147
msgctxt "text_id=15361 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「お腹をむきだしでかい。このほうが少しは暖かいよ。"
msgstr "\"Your whole stomach is exposed. My back will keep you warm."

#. Occurrence A_7:1153:15362: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1153
msgctxt "text_id=15362 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　それに、有珠は薪より軽い。山じゃこの程度は朝飯前だから気にしないでくれ。息があがっているのは公園まで急いだからだし。"
msgstr "  Don't worry. You're lighter than firewood, so this is a cinch. I'm only out of breath from rushing to the park."

#. Occurrence A_7:1160:15363: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1160
msgctxt "text_id=15363 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "……まあ、その意味はなかったんだが」"
msgstr "Not that I needed to hurry in the end.\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1177:15364: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1177
msgctxt "text_id=15364 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……なぜ？」"
msgstr "\"Why not...?\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1198:15365: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1198
msgctxt "text_id=15365 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「俺が着いたら、犬はさっさと散っていった。はじめから、橙子さんはそういうつもりだったんだ。"
msgstr "\"As soon as I got there, the dogs ran for the hills. I'm sure Touko knew that would happen all along."

#. Occurrence A_7:1214:15366: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1214
msgctxt "text_id=15366 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　有珠をどうにかするつもりもなければ、時間制限もなかった。喜ぶべき事なんだろうけど」"
msgstr "  She must not have meant to finish you off, which means I wasn't on a time limit. I suppose I should be thankful for small mercies.\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1234:15367: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1234
msgctxt "text_id=15367 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　憮然と言う草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro said dejectedly."

#. Occurrence A_7:1239:15368: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1239
msgctxt "text_id=15368 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、それは彼だけの勘違いだ。"
msgstr "  But he was wrong."

#. Occurrence A_7:1244:15369: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1244
msgctxt "text_id=15369 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子に殺意はなかったが、結果として有珠が死んでしまう事には何の罪悪感もなかっただろう。"
msgstr "  While Touko did not want to kill Alice per se, she would not have cared if she had died."

#. Occurrence A_7:1277:15370: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1277
msgctxt "text_id=15370 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……有珠は思う。"
msgstr "  At least that was the way Alice saw it."

#. Occurrence A_7:1282:15371: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1282
msgctxt "text_id=15371 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この少年がどれほどの速さで公園に着いたかは知らないけれど、彼が来なければ間違いなく電話ボックスは破られて、自分は生きてはいなかったと。"
msgstr "  She did not know how long it took Soujyuro to get to the park, but if he had not come, the phone booth would have collapsed and she would be dead."

#. Occurrence A_7:1322:15372: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1322
msgctxt "text_id=15372 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1328:15373: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1328
msgctxt "text_id=15373 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は様々な所感、感情をのど元で押し止める。"
msgstr "  Alice did her best to suppress her thoughts and feelings."

#. Occurrence A_7:1333:15374: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1333
msgctxt "text_id=15374 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言っても仕方のない事だし、草十郎の甘い勘違いを正すのも気が引けたからだ。"
msgstr "  She felt silly at the thought of correcting him, and it would matter little anyway."

#. Occurrence A_7:1338:15375: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1338
msgctxt "text_id=15375 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……ただ。言いかけた<感謝|ことば>を飲み込むのは、傷を堪える事より辛かっただけ。"
msgstr "  The thought of her trying to thank him was more painful than her open wounds."

#. Occurrence A_7:1386:15376: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1386
msgctxt "text_id=15376 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……もしかして、公園からずっと？」"
msgstr "\"...So you carried me all the way from the park?\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1416:15377: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1416
msgctxt "text_id=15377 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「仕方ないだろ。電車、終わってたんだから。タクシーを使えば良かったんだけど、あいにく持ち合わせがなくて。"
msgstr "\"Had to. The trains stopped running. I should've gotten a taxi, but didn't bring my wallet."

#. Occurrence A_7:1422:15378: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1422
msgctxt "text_id=15378 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……ほんと。今日ほどお金の不便さを思い知った日はない」"
msgstr "  ...Honestly, I've never felt how limiting money was until today.\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1442:15379: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1442
msgctxt "text_id=15379 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年はようやくため息らしきものをついた。"
msgstr "  For the first time today, Soujyuro let out a sigh."

#. Occurrence A_7:1447:15380: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1447
msgctxt "text_id=15380 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　休み休みとは言え、彼は実に十キロ近い距離をこうして踏破してきた。"
msgstr "  There was no point taking a break; he had already traveled close to six miles like this."

#. Occurrence A_7:1452:15381: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1452
msgctxt "text_id=15381 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　疲れきっているだろうに、草十郎はその困難さより、自分の頼りなさに呆れたらしい。"
msgstr "  Perhaps the fatigue was getting to him. Soujyuro was more upset with his own weakness than the difficulty of the trek."

#. Occurrence A_7:1490:15382: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1490
msgctxt "text_id=15382 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……でも。それを言うなら、お金の大切さ、じゃない？」"
msgstr "\"...Don't you mean how important money is?\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1496:15383: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1496
msgctxt "text_id=15383 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「使えるものがあるのにお金がないだけで使えないんだから、それって不便って言わないか？」"
msgstr "\"What I mean is, if there's something you can use only if you have money, isn't that incredibly limiting?\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1503:15384: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1503
msgctxt "text_id=15384 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1508:15385: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1508
msgctxt "text_id=15385 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　純粋な疑問に、有珠は一時、傷の痛みを忘れてしまった。"
msgstr "  The innocence of his question made Alice briefly forget her pain."

#. Occurrence A_7:1513:15386: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1513
msgctxt "text_id=15386 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分も、それなりに文明社会とは縁がないつもりだったけれど。"
msgstr "  She, too, felt distant from the real world,"

#. Occurrence A_7:1518:15387: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1518
msgctxt "text_id=15387 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この少年の素朴さに比べれば、ちゃんと文明人らしいのだ。"
msgstr "  but compared to the boy carrying her, she felt like a regular citizen."

#. Occurrence A_7:1554:15388: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_7_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1554
msgctxt "text_id=15388 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「なにか、貴方らしいわ」"
msgstr "\"That's just like you to say.\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1560:15389: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1560
msgctxt "text_id=15389 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気付かれない様に小さく笑う。"
msgstr "  Alice smiled to herself."

#. Occurrence A_7:1565:15390: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1565
msgctxt "text_id=15390 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠が顔をあずけると、こつん、と柔らかいものが頬に当たった。"
msgstr "  As Alice rested her head, something soft touched her cheek."

#. Occurrence A_7:1570:15391: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1570
msgctxt "text_id=15391 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年の首に巻かれた、青子からの首輪だった。"
msgstr "  The collar Aoko had given him."

#. Occurrence A_7:1603:15392: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1603
msgctxt "text_id=15392 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「館についたら着替えるんだ。お腹の血も拭って、落ち着いたら居間で話そう。"
msgstr "\"Once we get back, you should change and clean up. When you're ready, we can talk in the drawing room."

#. Occurrence A_7:1609:15393: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_7_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_7
#: A_7:1609
msgctxt "text_id=15393 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　橙子さんに言わせれば、俺もこれで敵らしいから」"
msgstr "  Touko sees me as her enemy now, too.\""

#. Occurrence A_7:1657:15394: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1657
msgctxt "text_id=15394 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その言葉を有珠が聞いた時、彼はもう坂を登りきっていた。"
msgstr "  With those words hanging in the air, they reached the top of the hill."

#. Occurrence A_7:1662:15395: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1662
msgctxt "text_id=15395 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　森の入り口にあたる正門。その奥には、月明かりの下に佇む彼女の洋館がある。"
msgstr "  The gate in the woods stood before them. Beyond it, illuminated by the pale moonlight, stood the mansion."

#. Occurrence A_7:1667:15396: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1667
msgctxt "text_id=15396 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを見上げて、少女は少しだけ残念に思った。"
msgstr "  Looking up at it, the girl felt a little disappointed."

#. Occurrence A_7:1719:15397: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1719
msgctxt "text_id=15397 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……もちろん。"
msgstr "  A natural reaction, yet..."

#. Occurrence A_7:1724:15398: scene=A_7
#: A_7:1724
msgctxt "text_id=15398 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何を残念に思ったのかは、気が付く事はなかったけれど。"
msgstr "  She could not place where her sadness was coming from."

#. Occurrence A_8:51:15399: scene=A_8
#: A_8:51
msgctxt "text_id=15399 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ロビーに着くと、有珠は草十郎の背中から降り、西館に向かって歩きだした。"
msgstr "  Once they entered the mansion, Alice slid off Soujyuro's back and walked toward the west wing."

#. Occurrence A_8:56:15400: scene=A_8
#: A_8:56
msgctxt "text_id=15400 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館の左翼、ロビーから西は彼女の管轄である。"
msgstr "  The west wing was her domain."

#. Occurrence A_8:65:15401: scene=A_8
#: A_8:65
msgctxt "text_id=15401 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が。有珠は数歩もしないうち、床に崩れ落ちてしまった。"
msgstr "  However, after only a few steps, she collapsed to the floor."

#. Occurrence A_8:88:15402: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_8_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_8
#: A_8:88
msgctxt "text_id=15402 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「有珠……！」"
msgstr "\"Alice!\""

#. Occurrence A_8:130:15403: scene=A_8
#: A_8:130
msgctxt "text_id=15403 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎が駆け寄ると、有珠は座りこんだまま片手を上げた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro rushed over to her, but she raised her hand."

#. Occurrence A_8:135:15404: scene=A_8
#: A_8:135
msgctxt "text_id=15404 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それ以上は近付かないで、と告げるように。"
msgstr "  Her gesture told him he was not to come closer."

#. Occurrence A_8:140:15405: scene=A_8
#: A_8:140
msgctxt "text_id=15405 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は苦い顔付きで足を止める。"
msgstr "  He stopped in his tracks, a concerned look on his face."

#. Occurrence A_8:145:15406: scene=A_8
#: A_8:145
msgctxt "text_id=15406 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……少女の白い肌には汗がにじんでいる。"
msgstr "  Her pale skin gleamed with sweat;"

#. Occurrence A_8:150:15407: scene=A_8
#: A_8:150
msgctxt "text_id=15407 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつも無表情の顔は、苦しそうに痛みに耐えていた。"
msgstr "  her expression uncharacteristically strained."

#. Occurrence A_8:190:15408: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:190
msgctxt "text_id=15408 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……平気。部屋に戻るぐらいの力は戻ったわ。服を<繕|つくろ>ってくるから、貴方はここにいて。"
msgstr "\"...I'm fine. I can make it to my room on my own. Stay here. I'm going to mend my clothes."

#. Occurrence A_8:196:15409: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:196
msgctxt "text_id=15409 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　すぐに戻ってくるから、そうしたら―――」"
msgstr "  I'll be back shortly, and then...\""

#. Occurrence A_8:202:15410: scene=A_8
#: A_8:202
msgctxt "text_id=15410 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　きちんと話をする、と苦しげな目が伝えてくる。"
msgstr "  The pained look in Alice's eyes told Soujyuro they would talk later."

#. Occurrence A_8:235:15411: scene=A_8
#: A_8:235
msgctxt "text_id=15411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう言われては止める事もできない。"
msgstr "  He knew he could not stop her."

#. Occurrence A_8:240:15412: scene=A_8
#: A_8:240
msgctxt "text_id=15412 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　辛いのは有珠の方で、断じて自分ではない、と草十郎は自分に言い聞かせる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro reminded himself that she was the one in pain, not him."

#. Occurrence A_8:260:15413: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_8_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_8
#: A_8:260
msgctxt "text_id=15413 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……それじゃあ、戻ってきたら話を聞かせてくれ」"
msgstr "\"...All right then. Tell me everything when you come back.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:284:15414: scene=A_8
#: A_8:284
msgctxt "text_id=15414 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は深呼吸をしてから、確かな足取りで洋館の西館へ消えていった。"
msgstr "  Alice took a deep breath, before slowly disappearing down the corridor."

#. Occurrence A_8:341:15415: scene=A_8
#: A_8:341
msgctxt "text_id=15415 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……時間にすれば五分もない空白。"
msgstr "  An uneventful five minutes passed."

#. Occurrence A_8:352:15416: scene=A_8
#: A_8:352
msgctxt "text_id=15416 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は代えの黒衣に着替えて戻ってきた。"
msgstr "  Alice returned wearing a fresh set of black clothes,"

#. Occurrence A_8:357:15417: scene=A_8
#: A_8:357
msgctxt "text_id=15417 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　顔色は一向に良くはならない。"
msgstr "  but her complexion remained pallid."

#. Occurrence A_8:367:15418: scene=A_8
#: A_8:367
msgctxt "text_id=15418 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小さく息をついて、いつかのように、ロビーの柱に背中を預けて座りこむ。"
msgstr "  With a small sigh, she carefully leaned against a pillar in the foyer, and slid down it until she was sitting."

#. Occurrence A_8:400:15419: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_8_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_8
#: A_8:400
msgctxt "text_id=15419 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「有珠。傷が痛むなら、無理せず横になったほうがいい」"
msgstr "\"Alice. If you're in pain, you should lie down.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:405:15420: scene=A_8
#: A_8:405
msgctxt "text_id=15420 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は有珠に合わせて、冷たい床に座りこむ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro sat across from her on the cold floor."

#. Occurrence A_8:423:15421: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:423
msgctxt "text_id=15421 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……傷はもう痛まないわ。横になる必要もない。"
msgstr "\"I'm not in pain anymore, so I don't need to lie down."

#. Occurrence A_8:429:15422: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:429
msgctxt "text_id=15422 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　この体の異常はナナカマドを飲まされたせいだから、どうあっても治らないもの」"
msgstr "  I was forced to swallow a rowan, so my body can't heal completely.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:450:15423: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_8_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_8
#: A_8:450
msgctxt "text_id=15423 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「じゃあ、せめて毛布とか」"
msgstr "\"At least let me get a blanket for you.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:456:15424: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:456
msgctxt "text_id=15424 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「…………いいから、気遣いはしないで。ここなら寒さも関係ないから」"
msgstr "\"No. If I stay here, the cold won't bother me.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:462:15425: scene=A_8
#: A_8:462
msgctxt "text_id=15425 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　寒さに関しては強がりではないらしい。"
msgstr "  She seemed to be telling the truth."

#. Occurrence A_8:467:15426: scene=A_8
#: A_8:467
msgctxt "text_id=15426 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつかの青子の『有珠は洋館の中にいれば適温』説を思い出して、草十郎はあっさり引き下がった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro remembered Aoko telling him that as long as Alice is inside the mansion, she would be comfortable."

#. Occurrence A_8:500:15427: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_8_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_8
#: A_8:500
msgctxt "text_id=15427 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……うん、あったかいのならいい。"
msgstr "\"Okay. As long as you're warm."

#. Occurrence A_8:506:15428: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_8_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_8
#: A_8:506
msgctxt "text_id=15428 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　それで、ナナカマドっていうのは？」"
msgstr "  So, what's this 'rowan' thing?\""

#. Occurrence A_8:512:15429: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:512
msgctxt "text_id=15429 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「薬草の一種よ。七回<竃|かまど>で焼いても燃え残る事から付けられた名前で、効用は魔除け。"
msgstr "\"It's a kind of medicinal herb. It gets its name from what's left in the cinders after it's burned seven times in a stove, and it's used as a ward against spirits."

#. Occurrence A_8:531:15430: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:531
msgctxt "text_id=15430 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……普通の人にはよくない程度だけど、わたしや青子には少し厄介ね。体内での魔力生成そのものに抵抗されてしまうから、手の打ちようがない」"
msgstr "  It's not good for regular people, but for me and Aoko it's worse. Once it's in our bodies, it reacts badly to the production of magical energy, and there's nothing we can do but wait it out.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:552:15431: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_8_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_8
#: A_8:552
msgctxt "text_id=15431 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……毒、と思っていいのか？」"
msgstr "\"So... it's a poison?\""

#. Occurrence A_8:589:15432: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:589
msgctxt "text_id=15432 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「いえ、本来は薬草よ。"
msgstr "\"No, like I said, it was originally used in medicine."

#. Occurrence A_8:595:15433: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:595
msgctxt "text_id=15433 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　今は傷を治すために魔力を使っているから苦しいけど、傷が完治すれば大人しくなるわ。魔術さえ使わなければナナカマドも反応しないから。"
msgstr "  I'm using magical energy to heal right now, so I'm having to fight it. But once I'm fully healed, I'll be fine, as long as I don't use magecraft."

#. Occurrence A_8:601:15434: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:601
msgctxt "text_id=15434 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　単純な話、ナナカマドを消化するまでわたしは役には立たないだけ」"
msgstr "  Basically, I won't be of any use until I fully digest it.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:634:15435: scene=A_8
#: A_8:634
msgctxt "text_id=15435 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ。"
msgstr "  Alice paused."

#. Occurrence A_8:639:15436: scene=A_8
#: A_8:639
msgctxt "text_id=15436 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが何日かかるかを、有珠は口にはしなかった。"
msgstr "  She decided not to say how many days that would take."

#. Occurrence A_8:672:15437: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:672
msgctxt "text_id=15437 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……別に、静希君が心配することじゃないわ。"
msgstr "\"Anyway, it's nothing you need worry about."

#. Occurrence A_8:678:15438: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:678
msgctxt "text_id=15438 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　こんなの、血が流れる程度の痛みだから」"
msgstr "  I can manage the pain. It's just a result of my circulation.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:710:15439: scene=A_8
#: A_8:710
msgctxt "text_id=15439 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の声は努めて静かだった。"
msgstr "  She worked hard to keep her tone calm."

#. Occurrence A_8:715:15440: scene=A_8
#: A_8:715
msgctxt "text_id=15440 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子も背中を強打されても平気な顔で走っていたし、魔術師という人種は痛みへの耐性が強いのかもしれない。"
msgstr "  Aoko had barely blinked when she was struck in the back, so mages must have an unusually high pain-threshold."

#. Occurrence A_8:715:15441: scene=A_8
#: A_8:715
msgctxt "text_id=15441 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに驚きつつ、草十郎は呆れたのだ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was surprised and bewildered by what she said."

#. Occurrence A_8:720:15442: scene=A_8
#: A_8:720
msgctxt "text_id=15442 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　耐えられる程度の痛みは傷じゃない、なんて考えでは、死に至る傷以外は痛みではなくなってしまう。"
msgstr "  If wounds didn't count as long as the pain wasn't too bad, then nothing would hurt except an injury that killed you."

#. Occurrence A_8:753:15443: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_8_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_8
#: A_8:753
msgctxt "text_id=15443 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……分かった。話をするのは明日にしよう。今日はとにかく体を休めてほしい」"
msgstr "\"Fine. Let's talk tomorrow. For now, I want you to rest.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:759:15444: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:759
msgctxt "text_id=15444 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「明日になっても、わたしの容態は変わらないけど……？」"
msgstr "\"I won't be any better then.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:765:15445: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_8_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_8
#: A_8:765
msgctxt "text_id=15445 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いいんだ、それでも。有珠はもっと体を大事にしてくれ」"
msgstr "\"It doesn't matter. You need to take better care of yourself.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:800:15446: scene=A_8
#: A_8:800
msgctxt "text_id=15446 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言って、草十郎は立ち上がった。"
msgstr "  He stood up."

#. Occurrence A_8:836:15447: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_8_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_8
#: A_8:836
msgctxt "text_id=15447 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「部屋まで送るよ。それとも居間で休むか？　西館には入った事はないから、有珠の部屋も分からないし」"
msgstr "\"I'll take you to your room. Or how about the drawing room? I've never been to the west wing, so I don't know where your room is.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:842:15448: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:842
msgctxt "text_id=15448 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……ここでいいわ。青子を待たなくちゃいけないから」"
msgstr "\"I'm fine here. I need to be here when Aoko comes back.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:880:15449: scene=A_8
#: A_8:880
msgctxt "text_id=15449 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は座りこんだまま、天窓を見上げている。"
msgstr "  Alice looked up at the skylight."

#. Occurrence A_8:885:15450: scene=A_8
#: A_8:885
msgctxt "text_id=15450 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　痛みに耐える顔が月光に照らされている。"
msgstr "  The moonlight illuminated her pained face."

#. Occurrence A_8:916:15451: scene=A_8
#: A_8:916
msgctxt "text_id=15451 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廃墟の古城を思わせるこのロビーで、月と有珠だけが現実より鮮明に映っている。"
msgstr "  The foyer looked like it belonged to a rundown castle. Only the moon and Alice seemed more vivid than reality."

#. Occurrence A_8:936:15452: scene=A_8
#: A_8:936
msgctxt "text_id=15452 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その張りつめた強さは、何処からくるものなのか。"
msgstr "  Where did her strength come from?"

#. Occurrence A_8:964:15453: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_A_8_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=A_8
#: A_8:964
msgctxt "text_id=15453 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence A_8:969:15454: scene=A_8
#: A_8:969
msgctxt "text_id=15454 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は立ったまま、少女の在り方を眺めている。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro stared at her."

#. Occurrence A_8:974:15455: scene=A_8
#: A_8:974
msgctxt "text_id=15455 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無力に夜空を見上げるしかない、有珠の視線の意味にも気付かないままで。"
msgstr "  Without understanding the significance of Alice's gaze, he turned his gaze to the night sky, powerless as it was."

#. Occurrence A_8:1063:15456: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1063
msgctxt "text_id=15456 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……そうして、ロビーの静寂を破るように三度目の<電話|コール>が鳴り響いた。"
msgstr "  For the third time that night, the silence was broken by the sound of the phone ringing."

#. Occurrence A_8:1068:15457: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1068
msgctxt "text_id=15457 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎が動くより早く、細い影がロビーを横切る。"
msgstr "  Before Soujyuro could move, a thin shadow bolted across the foyer."

#. Occurrence A_8:1085:15458: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1085
msgctxt "text_id=15458 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが衰弱した有珠だと草十郎が気付いた時、彼女はすでに受話器を手に取っていた。"
msgstr "  By the time he realized it was the weakened Alice, she had already taken the receiver in her hand."

#. Occurrence A_8:1106:15459: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_A_8_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=A_8
#: A_8:1106
msgctxt "text_id=15459 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「青子……？」"
msgstr "\"Aoko...?\""

#. Occurrence A_8:1112:15460: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1112
msgctxt "text_id=15460 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……不安を含んだ有珠の声を、草十郎は初めて聞いた。"
msgstr "  It was the first time Soujyuro had heard Alice sound concerned."

#. Occurrence A_8:1117:15461: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1117
msgctxt "text_id=15461 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　痛みに耐える声より、何倍も<悲愴|ひそう>な響き。"
msgstr "  Her tone was infinitely graver than when she was enduring her own pain."

#. Occurrence A_8:1122:15462: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1122
msgctxt "text_id=15462 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の問いに、受話器はただ一言だけを返す。"
msgstr "  Alice's question received only a short response from the voice on the other end."

#. Occurrence A_8:1127:15463: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1127
msgctxt "text_id=15463 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠以上に弱々しい、消え去る前の炎みたいな一言を。"
msgstr "  It was a voice more frail than Alice's, like a flickering flame about to turn to smoke."

#. Occurrence A_8:1175:15464: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_A_8_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=A_8
#: A_8:1175
msgctxt "text_id=15464 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ごめん、やられた」"
msgstr "\"...Sorry. They got me.\""

#. Occurrence A_8:1212:15465: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1212
msgctxt "text_id=15465 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　受話器から遠く離れた位置で、青子らしくない言葉が、草十郎の耳に響く。"
msgstr "  The phone was far from Soujyuro's ears, but the words he picked up were very unlike her."

#. Occurrence A_8:1217:15466: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1217
msgctxt "text_id=15466 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それだけの言葉なのに、いや、それだけの言葉だからこそ。"
msgstr "  Despite saying so little-no, because she had said so little,"

#. Occurrence A_8:1222:15467: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1222
msgctxt "text_id=15467 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎には青子の<敗北|けつまつ>が、堪え難いほど実感できた。"
msgstr "  the weight of Aoko's defeat struck Soujyuro hard."

#. Occurrence A_8:1264:15468: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1264
msgctxt "text_id=15468 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は静かに受話器を置く。"
msgstr "  Alice silently set the receiver down."

#. Occurrence A_8:1269:15469: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1269
msgctxt "text_id=15469 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今まで苦痛に耐えていた彼女の体は、一転してしなやかな強さを取り戻した。"
msgstr "  Only moments before, her body had been fighting the pain; now it felt stronger than ever."

#. Occurrence A_8:1274:15470: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1274
msgctxt "text_id=15470 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　針金の人形が、美しい彫像に変わるように。"
msgstr "  It was like a scarecrow transforming into a beautiful stone statue."

#. Occurrence A_8:1279:15471: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1279
msgctxt "text_id=15471 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを見て、草十郎はようやく気が付いた。"
msgstr "  Seeing this, Soujyuro finally understood."

#. Occurrence A_8:1309:15472: scene=A_8
#: A_8:1309
msgctxt "text_id=15472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の痛々しく月を見上げる瞳は、自分ではもう変えようのないこの結末を、静かに受け入れる為のものだったと。"
msgstr "  Alice's expression when she looked at the moon had come from her trying to accept an immutable reality."

#. Occurrence B_1:49:15473: scene=B_1
#: B_1:49
msgctxt "text_id=15473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子からの電話はつながったまま、もう語りかけてくる事はなかった。"
msgstr "  Aoko had not hung up, but the line remained silent."

#. Occurrence B_1:58:15474: scene=B_1
#: B_1:58
msgctxt "text_id=15474 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は電話を切ると、手早くケープを着て玄関へと歩きだす。重症の体を、気力だけで動かすようにぎこちなく。"
msgstr "  Alice set down the receiver, quickly put on her mantle, and made for the entrance, moving her injured body by sheer willpower alone."

#. Occurrence B_1:80:15475: scene=B_1
#: B_1:80
msgctxt "text_id=15475 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その途中、ぴたりと足を止め、何やら思案げに草十郎を凝視した。"
msgstr "  Along the way, she paused, turned to Soujyuro, and looked directly at him."

#. Occurrence B_1:135:15476: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:135
msgctxt "text_id=15476 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……青子に何かあったんだな？」"
msgstr "\"Aoko's in trouble, isn't she?\""

#. Occurrence B_1:160:15477: scene=B_1
#: B_1:160
msgctxt "text_id=15477 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は一瞬だけ思案し―――"
msgstr "  Alice hesitated for a moment..."

#. Occurrence B_1:194:15478: scene=B_1
#: B_1:194
msgctxt "text_id=15478 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　緊張をとくような思いきりの良さで、自分から少年の手をとった。"
msgstr "  ...before pushing aside her anxiety and grabbing his hand."

#. Occurrence B_1:201:15479: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:201
msgctxt "text_id=15479 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「静希君、一緒に来て」"
msgstr "\"Sizuki, come with me.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:250:15480: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:250
msgctxt "text_id=15480 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「待ってくれ。一緒にって、どこに？」"
msgstr "\"Wait, where are we going?\""

#. Occurrence B_1:264:15481: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:264
msgctxt "text_id=15481 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「<合田|あいだ>教会まで。青子の方は、<詠梨|えいり>神父にお願いするしかないから」"
msgstr "\"To Aida Church. We need to ask Father Eiri for help.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:277:15482: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:277
msgctxt "text_id=15482 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「合田教会って、病院の横にある？」"
msgstr "\"Aida Church... That's next to the hospital, isn't it?\""

#. Occurrence B_1:298:15483: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:298
msgctxt "text_id=15483 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……そう。知っているのなら問題ないわね。説明する手間も省けたわ」"
msgstr "\"Good. You know it. That'll save me time explaining.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:353:15484: scene=B_1
#: B_1:353
msgctxt "text_id=15484 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は玄関を出て、正面の並木道に向かっていく。"
msgstr "  Alice left the mansion and made her way down the tree-lined path."

#. Occurrence B_1:358:15485: scene=B_1
#: B_1:358
msgctxt "text_id=15485 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……気丈に振る舞ってはいるが、その瞳には苦痛の色が見え隠れしている。"
msgstr "  She was clearly determined, but the look in her eyes betrayed her pain."

#. Occurrence B_1:379:15486: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:379
msgctxt "text_id=15486 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ちょ、有珠！　連絡をするなら、電話は？」"
msgstr "\"A-Alice, wait! Shouldn't we call ahead?\""

#. Occurrence B_1:408:15487: scene=B_1
#: B_1:408
msgctxt "text_id=15487 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　弱い、けれど逆らえない有珠の手に引かれながら、草十郎は館を振り返った。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro asked Alice, whose grip on his hand was light but unyielding."

#. Occurrence B_1:459:15488: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:459
msgctxt "text_id=15488 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「教会の人になら、もう報せた。"
msgstr "\"The church already knows."

#. Occurrence B_1:465:15489: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:465
msgctxt "text_id=15489 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……もしかして病院のことを言っているなら、それこそ無駄よ。ハイヤーなんて言うけど空を飛ぶわけでもないし。今は助けを呼ぶより、助けに行かないと間に合わない」"
msgstr "  And if you're talking about the hospital, no need. It's quicker for us to go and help than call for a car. They can't fly.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:522:15490: scene=B_1
#: B_1:522
msgctxt "text_id=15490 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と。"
msgstr "  Alice had thought of everything."

#. Occurrence B_1:528:15491: scene=B_1
#: B_1:528
msgctxt "text_id=15491 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は洋館に視線を切り返し、小さく指を鳴らした。"
msgstr "  She turned to the mansion and lightly snapped her fingers."

#. Occurrence B_1:551:15492: scene=B_1
#: B_1:551
msgctxt "text_id=15492 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の合図に呼応するかのように、いずこかの窓が開き、無数の<椋鳥|ムクドリ>が飛び立っていく。"
msgstr "  In response, a window opened and countless starlings took flight."

#. Occurrence B_1:572:15493: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:572
msgctxt "text_id=15493 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「一番隊は索敵。二番隊と三番隊は現場に向かって応急処置を。在庫切れになってもいいわ。"
msgstr "\"Group One, search for the enemy. Groups Two and Three, proceed to the scene and administer first aid. Haste is paramount."

#. Occurrence B_1:579:15494: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:579
msgctxt "text_id=15494 | speaker=alice"
msgid "まだ生きているなら、青子の心臓を止めないで」"
msgstr "If Aoko is still alive, do not let her heart stop.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:584:15495: scene=B_1
#: B_1:584
msgctxt "text_id=15495 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の声は、飛び立っていく椋鳥たちにかけられたものだ。"
msgstr "  Alice commanded the birds firmly."

#. Occurrence B_1:605:15496: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:605
msgctxt "text_id=15496 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「静希君は、裏庭から青子の自転車を持ってきて」"
msgstr "\"Sizuki, fetch Aoko's bicycle from the rear courtyard.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:643:15497: scene=B_1
#: B_1:643
msgctxt "text_id=15497 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言われて、げっと草十郎は漏らした。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro let slip his discomfort at the thought of that thing."

#. Occurrence B_1:648:15498: scene=B_1
#: B_1:648
msgctxt "text_id=15498 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　裏庭にある赤い自転車はオーダーメイドの特注品だ。"
msgstr "  The custom-made red bicycle..."

#. Occurrence B_1:653:15499: scene=B_1
#: B_1:653
msgctxt "text_id=15499 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつぞやの焼却炉の掃除の際、うっかり傷つけそうになった草十郎に、青子は怒濤の<罵詈雑言|ばりぞうごん>をみまったのである。"
msgstr "  When he was cleaning the incinerator, Aoko had verbally assaulted him for nearly scratching it."

#. Occurrence B_1:681:15500: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:681
msgctxt "text_id=15500 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……いいけど。どうするつもりなんだ、有珠は？」"
msgstr "\"Okay... But what's the plan?\""

#. Occurrence B_1:709:15501: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0008_0; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:709
msgctxt "text_id=15501 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ここにいるより、教会にいたほうが静希君は安全よ。それに、わたしも急がないといけない。"
msgstr "\"You're much safer at the church than here. And I need to hurry."

#. Occurrence B_1:722:15502: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0008_1; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:722
msgctxt "text_id=15502 | speaker=alice"
msgid "……静希君、ふたり乗りできる？」"
msgstr " Can you can take us both, Sizuki?\""

#. Occurrence B_1:762:15503: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:762
msgctxt "text_id=15503 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――む」"
msgstr "\"...Hm.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:768:15504: scene=B_1
#: B_1:768
msgctxt "text_id=15504 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<見様見真似|み よ う み ま ね >でやれる自信はあるものの、いまいち自転車というものを信用できない草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  While Soujyuro had seen people riding tandem and was confident he could imitate them, he still wasn't quite certain he could trust a bicycle with his life."

#. Occurrence B_1:773:15505: scene=B_1
#: B_1:773
msgctxt "text_id=15505 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの細い<骨格|フレーム>の乗り物に、はたして二人分の体重を支えるだけの性能があるかどうか―――"
msgstr "  Moreover, its frame was so light, he was unsure it could support both their weights."

#. Occurrence B_1:800:15506: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:800
msgctxt "text_id=15506 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ん？　ふたり乗りってコトは有珠が後ろに乗るのか!?」"
msgstr "\"Wait, you mean you want to ride on the back!?\""

#. Occurrence B_1:825:15507: scene=B_1
#: B_1:825
msgctxt "text_id=15507 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「…………"
msgstr "\"..."

#. Occurrence B_1:837:15508: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:837
msgctxt "text_id=15508 | speaker=alice"
msgid "出来ないなら、いいわ」"
msgstr "If it's too much, then I don't need your help.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:848:15509: scene=B_1
#: B_1:848
msgctxt "text_id=15509 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぷい、と顔を背けて歩きだす有珠。"
msgstr "  Alice turned away as if to snub him, then began walking."

#. Occurrence B_1:853:15510: scene=B_1
#: B_1:853
msgctxt "text_id=15510 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　間の悪いコトに、草十郎の言葉をストレートに誤解したらしい。"
msgstr "  Unfortunately for Soujyuro, he was now on her bad side."

#. Occurrence B_1:891:15511: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:891
msgctxt "text_id=15511 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、そういう意味じゃないんだ。有珠とはイメージが合わなかったから」"
msgstr "\"Hey, don't get me wrong. It's just I never expected you to ask me to do something like that.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:897:15512: scene=B_1
#: B_1:897
msgctxt "text_id=15512 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の弁解にも耳を貸さず、有珠は一人でスタスタと森に向かう。"
msgstr "  Ignoring his pleas, she continued briskly toward the woods."

#. Occurrence B_1:902:15513: scene=B_1
#: B_1:902
msgctxt "text_id=15513 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうも、有珠は自転車に乗れないらしい。"
msgstr "  There was no way she was going to ride the bike now."

#. Occurrence B_1:907:15514: scene=B_1
#: B_1:907
msgctxt "text_id=15514 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目に見えて意地を張っている有珠を、草十郎は必死に呼び止めた。"
msgstr "  Sensing her stubborn streak, he desperately called out to her."

#. Occurrence B_1:949:15515: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:949
msgctxt "text_id=15515 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「待った、今のはこっちが悪かった。すぐに持ってくるから、怒るのはツケにしておいてくれ」"
msgstr "\"I take it back, I'm sorry, I'll go get it right now, you can take your anger out on me later!\""

#. Occurrence B_1:967:15516: scene=B_1
#: B_1:967
msgctxt "text_id=15516 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　聞いて、ぴたりと有珠の足が止まる。"
msgstr "  Alice stopped."

#. Occurrence B_1:1023:15517: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1023
msgctxt "text_id=15517 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の停止を確認して、草十郎は急いで裏庭に向かった。"
msgstr "  As soon as he saw her stop, he hurried to the rear courtyard,"

#. Occurrence B_1:1029:15518: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1029
msgctxt "text_id=15518 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　納屋の鍵置き場から自転車の鍵を取って、"
msgstr "  grabbed the key from where it was hanging,"

msgctxt "text_id=15519 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "青子愛用の自転車のロックを外す。"
msgstr " and used it to unlock Aoko's bicycle."

#. Occurrence B_1:1053:15520: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1053
msgctxt "text_id=15520 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自転車を引いて洋館の正面に戻ると、有珠はもう森に向かっていた。"
msgstr "  By the time Soujyuro brought it back to the front of the mansion, Alice was continuing toward the forest."

#. Occurrence B_1:1074:15521: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:1074
msgctxt "text_id=15521 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……有珠の性格、なんとなく掴めてきたな……」"
msgstr "\"...I think I finally have you figured out, Alice.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:1081:15522: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1081
msgctxt "text_id=15522 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呟いて、草十郎は自転車にまたがった。"
msgstr "  Muttering to himself, he straddled the bike."

#. Occurrence B_1:1086:15523: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1086
msgctxt "text_id=15523 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ペダルに足を置く。軽いが確かな感触。"
msgstr "  He rested his foot on a pedal. It felt light, but sturdy."

#. Occurrence B_1:1093:15524: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1093
msgctxt "text_id=15524 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これなら二人分の体重が乗っても問題ない、と自転車を走らせた。"
msgstr "  Confident the bike could support his weight and Alice's, he began pedaling."

#. Occurrence B_1:1127:15525: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:1127
msgctxt "text_id=15525 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「有珠！」"
msgstr "\"Alice!\""

#. Occurrence B_1:1175:15526: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1175
msgctxt "text_id=15526 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呼びかけに振りむく有珠。"
msgstr "  She turned as he called out to her,"

#. Occurrence B_1:1180:15527: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1180
msgctxt "text_id=15527 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あきらかに草十郎を非難している眼差しである。"
msgstr "  before shooting him a piercing glare."

#. Occurrence B_1:1243:15528: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:1243
msgctxt "text_id=15528 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「行こう、後ろの荷台に乗ってくれ。でもクッションがないから痛いと思う。辛かったら言ってくれ、止めるから」"
msgstr "\"Come on. Hop on the back. No cushion though, so it won't be a comfy ride. Let me know if it's too uncomfortable.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:1249:15529: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:1249
msgctxt "text_id=15529 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……わたしは大丈夫よ。静希君が、イヤじゃなければの話だけど」"
msgstr "\"...I'll be fine. Worry about yourself.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:1260:15530: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1260
msgctxt "text_id=15530 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……やはり、些細な事でも怒らせると根に持つ性格なんだな、と学習する草十郎なのだった。"
msgstr "  He had hit the nail on the head. Alice definitely held a grudge over the smallest things."

#. Occurrence B_1:1322:15531: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:1322
msgctxt "text_id=15531 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そういうコトなら問題ないよ。有珠が後ろにいてくれるのは嬉しい。それで、行き先は合田教会でいいんだな？」"
msgstr "\"If that's the issue then there is no issue. I'm happy to give you a ride. We're going to Aida Church, right?\""

#. Occurrence B_1:1356:15532: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1356
msgctxt "text_id=15532 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　臆面もない草十郎の返答。"
msgstr "  Unabashed and undaunted, he plowed on."

#. Occurrence B_1:1361:15533: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1361
msgctxt "text_id=15533 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに毒気が抜かれたのか、有珠はこくんとうなずいて、自転車の後部座席に腰を下ろした。"
msgstr "  His tone seemed to ease Alice's mood. She nodded calmly, and took a seat on the luggage rack above the rear tire."

#. Occurrence B_1:1442:15534: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:1442
msgctxt "text_id=15534 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「…………手を回すけど。わたしが触れても、平気？」"
msgstr "\"...I'm going to hold on to you, okay? You don't mind me touching you, do you?\""

#. Occurrence B_1:1474:15535: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:1474
msgctxt "text_id=15535 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「？　大丈夫だよ、体力があるのはさっき証明しただろ」"
msgstr "\"Why wouldn't I? I'm tougher than I look.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:1507:15536: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:1507
msgctxt "text_id=15536 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_1:1513:15537: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1513
msgctxt "text_id=15537 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は無言で草十郎の体に手を回す。"
msgstr "  Alice silently wrapped her arms around Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence B_1:1519:15538: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1519
msgctxt "text_id=15538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の手がしっかりと自分を掴んだのを確認して、よし、"
msgstr "  Once she had held on tightly enough,"

msgctxt "text_id=15539 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "と草十郎はハンドルを握った。"
msgstr " he gripped the handle bars."

#. Occurrence B_1:1565:15540: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:1565
msgctxt "text_id=15540 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「良かった」"
msgstr "\"Good,\""

#. Occurrence B_1:1570:15541: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1570
msgctxt "text_id=15541 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんて、小さな呟きと共に。"
msgstr "  he said quietly."

#. Occurrence B_1:1625:15542: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:1625
msgctxt "text_id=15542 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「何が良かったの……？」"
msgstr "\"What's 'good'...?\""

#. Occurrence B_1:1636:15543: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1636
msgctxt "text_id=15543 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠のささやきに、草十郎は曖昧な視線を返し、勢いよくペダルを踏み込んだ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro turned to her, an ambiguous expression on his face, and then began pedaling vigorously."

#. Occurrence B_1:1648:15544: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1648
msgctxt "text_id=15544 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自転車は白犬塚の急な坂道を、ノーブレーキで駆け下りていく。"
msgstr "  He let go of the brakes, and the bicycle hurtled down Shiroinuzuka's steep incline."

#. Occurrence B_1:1715:15545: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:1715
msgctxt "text_id=15545 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「っ……！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence B_1:1720:15546: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1720
msgctxt "text_id=15546 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分で言いだした事とはいえ、予想以上のスピードに有珠は息を呑んだ。"
msgstr "  Surprised by the sudden speed, Alice gasped,"

#. Occurrence B_1:1725:15547: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1725
msgctxt "text_id=15547 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりの急加速に、草十郎の両肩をぐっと掴んでしまったぐらいだ。"
msgstr "  and clutched Soujyuro tighter."

#. Occurrence B_1:1773:15548: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_1_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_1
#: B_1:1773
msgctxt "text_id=15548 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「し―――」"
msgstr "\"Si―\""

#. Occurrence B_1:1778:15549: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1778
msgctxt "text_id=15549 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　抗議の声をあげようと草十郎を見上げるが、草十郎は有珠以上に真剣な顔でハンドルを握っていた。"
msgstr "  She almost protested, but stopped when she saw the serious expression on Soujyuro's face."

#. Occurrence B_1:1783:15550: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1783
msgctxt "text_id=15550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はのど元まで出かかった声をおさえて、回した手を強く握る。"
msgstr "  Instead, she decided to tighten her grip."

#. Occurrence B_1:1788:15551: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1788
msgctxt "text_id=15551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜の坂道を下る、生真面目な操縦者を信頼するように。"
msgstr "  Under the night sky, a young girl had put her faith in a young boy."

#. Occurrence B_1:1931:15552: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1931
msgctxt "text_id=15552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自転車は最後までブレーキもかけず、ジェットコースター顔負けの速さで三咲町の駅前まで走っていく。"
msgstr "  Faster than a rollercoaster, the bicycle hurtled toward Misaki Station."

#. Occurrence B_1:1936:15553: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1936
msgctxt "text_id=15553 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　午前零時を過ぎた駅前には人の気配も車のヘッドライトもない。"
msgstr "  Around the station, there was no sight of cars or people."

#. Occurrence B_1:1956:15554: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1956
msgctxt "text_id=15554 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　完全に眠りについた町中、いまだ雪に埋もれた道の上を、風のように駆けていく。"
msgstr "  While the town slept under its snowy blanket, two people were racing like the wind."

#. Occurrence B_1:1961:15555: scene=B_1
#: B_1:1961
msgctxt "text_id=15555 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな中、"
msgstr "  While he pedaled, the boy said,"

#. Occurrence B_1:2001:15556: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_1_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_1
#: B_1:2001
msgctxt "text_id=15556 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……ほんとに良かった。ふたり乗りが思ったより簡単で」"
msgstr "\"Whew. Riding tandem is way easier than I thought.\""

#. Occurrence B_1:2006:15557: scene=B_1
#: B_1:2006
msgctxt "text_id=15557 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ホッと安堵する乗り手がひとり。"
msgstr "  But he was alone in his relief."

#. Occurrence B_1:2011:15558: scene=B_1
#: B_1:2011
msgctxt "text_id=15558 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　初めて自転車に乗る少年少女は、無人の国道を激走していく。"
msgstr "  It was their first bicycle ride together, and they spent it speeding down an empty highway."

#. Occurrence B_1:2016:15559: scene=B_1
#: B_1:2016
msgctxt "text_id=15559 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ゾッとする彼の呟きは、幸いにも風切り音にまぎれて、誰に届く事なく消えていった。"
msgstr "  The boy's words were lost to the howling wind, fortunately."

#. Occurrence B_2:55:15560: scene=B_2
#: B_2:55
msgctxt "text_id=15560 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　深夜にも拘わらず、教会には明かりが灯っていた。"
msgstr "  In spite of the late hour, there were still lights on in the church."

#. Occurrence B_2:60:15561: scene=B_2
#: B_2:60
msgctxt "text_id=15561 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本来、不慮の事故にそなえて眠らずの番である病院には、<仄暗|ほのぐら>い明かりが正面玄関に灯るのみ。"
msgstr "  Originally, the only light at this time of night came from the entrance to the sleepless hospital, ever vigilant and ready to receive patients."

#. Occurrence B_2:65:15562: scene=B_2
#: B_2:65
msgctxt "text_id=15562 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　娯楽の少ない田舎の町である。"
msgstr "  However, this was a quiet town with little night life."

#. Occurrence B_2:70:15563: scene=B_2
#: B_2:70
msgctxt "text_id=15563 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　深夜の急患はそれこそ一日に一人いるかいないかで、"
msgstr "  The hospital saw perhaps one emergency patient per night, however,"

#. Occurrence B_2:75:15564: scene=B_2
#: B_2:75
msgctxt "text_id=15564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今夜はただ、その一人が病院の手には負えない重傷者であっただけの話だ。"
msgstr "  and it was not equipped to handle tonight's sole patient."

#. Occurrence B_2:122:15565: scene=B_2
#: B_2:122
msgctxt "text_id=15565 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時刻は午前一時前。"
msgstr "  It was a little before one o'clock in the morning."

#. Occurrence B_2:127:15566: scene=B_2
#: B_2:127
msgctxt "text_id=15566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自転車を外に止めて、ふたりは教会に向かう。"
msgstr "  Leaving the bicycle outside, the two headed into the church."

#. Occurrence B_2:132:15567: scene=B_2
#: B_2:132
msgctxt "text_id=15567 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雪をかぶり、闇夜の中でもはっきりと浮かび上がる三角屋根の建物。"
msgstr "  With its snow-covered roof, the church looked like it was wearing a white hat that lit up the darkness."

#. Occurrence B_2:137:15568: scene=B_2
#: B_2:137
msgctxt "text_id=15568 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その入り口に、背の高い影が立っていた。"
msgstr "  In the entrance stood a tall shadow."

#. Occurrence B_2:173:15569: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_2_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_2
#: B_2:173
msgctxt "text_id=15569 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「久遠寺さん」"
msgstr "\"Miss Kuonji.\""

#. Occurrence B_2:190:15570: scene=B_2
#: B_2:190
msgctxt "text_id=15570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　落ち着いた男性の声。"
msgstr "  The man's voice was placid."

#. Occurrence B_2:195:15571: scene=B_2
#: B_2:195
msgctxt "text_id=15571 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　マントのような<外套|がいとう>を羽織った男は、入り口で有珠を待っていた。"
msgstr "  Dressed in a long coat, he had been waiting for Alice."

#. Occurrence B_2:227:15572: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_2_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_2
#: B_2:227
msgctxt "text_id=15572 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「<詠梨|えいり>神父。青子は―――」"
msgstr "\"Father Eiri. Is Aoko-\""

#. Occurrence B_2:251:15573: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_2_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_2
#: B_2:251
msgctxt "text_id=15573 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「<唯架|ゆいか>が診ています。私が駆け付けた時には手遅れでした。"
msgstr "\"Yuika is tending to her now. By the time I got to the scene, there were others already."

#. Occurrence B_2:257:15574: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_2_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_2
#: B_2:257
msgctxt "text_id=15574 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　蒼崎の家に伝令を願いたいのですが」"
msgstr "  I'd like to notify her family.\""

#. Occurrence B_2:278:15575: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_2_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_2
#: B_2:278
msgctxt "text_id=15575 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……青子はそれを望まないわ。それに、あちらも今は城に捕らわれているそうです。今夜の相手は、真っ先に青子の祖父の動きを封じたようですから」"
msgstr "\"...Aoko wouldn't want that. Besides, I believe they're trapped in the castle. Touko seems to have tied down their grandfather, too.\""

#. Occurrence B_2:298:15576: scene=B_2
#: B_2:298
msgctxt "text_id=15576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　断片的な言葉が交わされる。"
msgstr "  The two exchanged pleasantries."

#. Occurrence B_2:303:15577: scene=B_2
#: B_2:303
msgctxt "text_id=15577 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は階段の手前から動かない。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro did not move from the foot of the stairs."

#. Occurrence B_2:322:15578: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_2_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_2
#: B_2:322
msgctxt "text_id=15578 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「おや……そちらは？」"
msgstr "\"Oh? And who is this?\""

#. Occurrence B_2:327:15579: scene=B_2
#: B_2:327
msgctxt "text_id=15579 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　落ち着いていた男の声が、かすかに<険|けん>を含む。"
msgstr "  Though the father seemed calm, his words had an edge to them."

#. Occurrence B_2:353:15580: scene=B_2
#: B_2:353
msgctxt "text_id=15580 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その視線から草十郎を庇うように、有珠は男の前に歩みでた。"
msgstr "  As if to protect Soujyuro from his gaze, Alice stepped between them."

#. Occurrence B_2:401:15581: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_2_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_2
#: B_2:401
msgctxt "text_id=15581 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……彼は青子の使い魔。契約はまだ成されていないけれど」"
msgstr "\"...This is Aoko's familiar-though their contract hasn't been fulfilled yet.\""

#. Occurrence B_2:412:15582: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_2_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_2
#: B_2:412
msgctxt "text_id=15582 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「使い魔って、有珠」"
msgstr "\"'Familiar?' Ali-\""

#. Occurrence B_2:417:15583: scene=B_2
#: B_2:417
msgctxt "text_id=15583 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　文句を言いかける草十郎に、有珠は火のような視線を向ける。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was about to complain, but Alice shot him a fiery glare"

#. Occurrence B_2:444:15584: scene=B_2
#: B_2:444
msgctxt "text_id=15584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“いいから黙っていて”と。"
msgstr "that all but said, \"Just shut up and play along.\""

#. Occurrence B_2:465:15585: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_2_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_2
#: B_2:465
msgctxt "text_id=15585 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「そうですか。そのような申告はありませんでしたが、届けが遅れたのは不問としましょう。"
msgstr "\"I see. This is the first I've heard of it, but I'll let it slide."

#. Occurrence B_2:491:15586: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_2_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_2
#: B_2:491
msgctxt "text_id=15586 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　外部の魔術師と交戦中でしたからね。貴女たちはその撃退を最優先にした、という事で」"
msgstr "  I mean, you are both in conflict with an outside mage, after all. That should take priority.\""

#. Occurrence B_2:496:15587: scene=B_2
#: B_2:496
msgctxt "text_id=15587 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父の返答に、有珠は少しだけ頭を下げた。"
msgstr "  Alice nodded in thanks."

#. Occurrence B_2:532:15588: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_2_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_2
#: B_2:532
msgctxt "text_id=15588 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「では通ります。……彼の同行を許可しなさい」"
msgstr "\"I'll be going in now. ...Let him enter, too.\""

#. Occurrence B_2:551:15589: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_2_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_2
#: B_2:551
msgctxt "text_id=15589 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ご自由に。私はこれより調停に向かいます。管理者が替わるのなら、両<組織|きょうかい>への資料を用意しなければいけませんので。"
msgstr "\"He is most welcome. I will begin preparations for mediation. If a change of administrators is imminent, I have to prepare documents for both parties."

#. Occurrence B_2:563:15590: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_2_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_2
#: B_2:563
msgctxt "text_id=15590 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　ああ、留守中は<律架|りつか>に任せてありますから、必要なものがあれば彼女に」"
msgstr "  I'm leaving things to Ritsuka in my absence, so send any questions her way.\""

#. Occurrence B_2:589:15591: scene=B_2
#: B_2:589
msgctxt "text_id=15591 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　詠梨神父と呼ばれた人物は、ふたりと入れ替わるように教会の敷地から外に出た。"
msgstr "  As if passing the baton, Father Eiri exited the church."

#. Occurrence B_2:596:15592: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_2_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_2
#: B_2:596
msgctxt "text_id=15592 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_2:601:15593: scene=B_2
#: B_2:601
msgctxt "text_id=15593 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つられて、草十郎はきっかり<二間|にけん>ばかりの距離、おおげさに後退した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro took two full steps back to give him a wide berth."

#. Occurrence B_2:682:15594: scene=B_2
#: B_2:682
msgctxt "text_id=15594 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　通り過ぎていく間、神父の風貌が明確になる。"
msgstr "  The priest had a dignified air about him."

#. Occurrence B_2:687:15595: scene=B_2
#: B_2:687
msgctxt "text_id=15595 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一言、美しい男だった。"
msgstr "  To put it bluntly, he was strikingly beautiful."

#. Occurrence B_2:692:15596: scene=B_2
#: B_2:692
msgctxt "text_id=15596 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　すっと通った<鼻梁|びりょう>と、<艶|つや>を持った唇。"
msgstr "  Straight nose, glistening lips..."

#. Occurrence B_2:697:15597: scene=B_2
#: B_2:697
msgctxt "text_id=15597 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一点の歪みもない<面|おもて>は中性的ですらある。"
msgstr "  ...not a single imperfection on his mildly effeminate face."

#. Occurrence B_2:702:15598: scene=B_2
#: B_2:702
msgctxt "text_id=15598 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もっとも、それは外見だけの話で、神父の立ち振る舞いには女性らしい柔らかさは微塵もない。"
msgstr "  But that only went as far as his appearance. His manner lacked any hint of softness or grace."

#. Occurrence B_2:707:15599: scene=B_2
#: B_2:707
msgctxt "text_id=15599 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鍛えられた<鋼|はがね>を思わせる、頼りになるが近寄りがたい、そんな雰囲気を持っていた。"
msgstr "  Just by looking at him, you could tell he was dependable, like tempered steel, despite being somewhat unapproachable."

#. Occurrence B_2:739:15600: scene=B_2
#: B_2:739
msgctxt "text_id=15600 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父は足音もたてず、黒い外套で月光をはじくように闇夜に消えていく。"
msgstr "  The priest disappeared silently into the night, the darkness of his coat overpowering the moonlight."

#. Occurrence B_2:744:15601: scene=B_2
#: B_2:744
msgctxt "text_id=15601 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その後ろ姿を呆然と草十郎は見送った。"
msgstr "  In awe, Soujyuro watched him leave."

#. Occurrence B_2:783:15602: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_2_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_2
#: B_2:783
msgctxt "text_id=15602 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……なんか、仙人みたいな人だな」"
msgstr "\"He's like some kind of sage, from the folktales.\""

#. Occurrence B_2:789:15603: scene=B_2
#: B_2:789
msgctxt "text_id=15603 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呟きには草十郎なりの親しみがあった。"
msgstr "  In his own way, Soujyuro was expressing affection."

#. Occurrence B_2:794:15604: scene=B_2
#: B_2:794
msgctxt "text_id=15604 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他人を寄せ付けない雰囲気の詠梨神父に、どことなく懐かしいものを感じたらしい。"
msgstr "  For some reason, Father Eiri's distant tone made him feel nostalgic."

#. Occurrence B_2:818:15605: scene=B_2
#: B_2:818
msgctxt "text_id=15605 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方。そんな草十郎に、有珠は厳しい視線を向ける。"
msgstr "  Alice gave Soujyuro a deathly stare."

#. Occurrence B_2:854:15606: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_2_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_2
#: B_2:854
msgctxt "text_id=15606 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「気を許さないで。彼は教会の人間よ。"
msgstr "\"Don't let your guard down. He's with the Church."

#. Occurrence B_2:860:15607: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_2_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_2
#: B_2:860
msgctxt "text_id=15607 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　わたしたちを監視する側だけど、今回は彼の手を借りるしかなかっただけ。"
msgstr "  His job is to monitor us, but this time we had to ask for his help."

#. Occurrence B_2:866:15608: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_2_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_2
#: B_2:866
msgctxt "text_id=15608 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……許されるなら、真っ先に消えてほしい人間だから」"
msgstr "  If it were allowed, I'd make him disappear off the face of the Earth.\""

#. Occurrence B_2:907:15609: scene=B_2
#: B_2:907
msgctxt "text_id=15609 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<呪詛|じゅそ>とも取れる呟きを残して、有珠は礼拝堂の扉に手をかけた。"
msgstr "  Her curse ringing in the air, Alice placed her hand on the doors to the chapel."

#. Occurrence B_2:912:15610: scene=B_2
#: B_2:912
msgctxt "text_id=15610 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　扉は有珠より二倍ほど高く、重そうな両開きだ。"
msgstr "  They were twice her height and who knows how heavy."

#. Occurrence B_2:917:15611: scene=B_2
#: B_2:917
msgctxt "text_id=15611 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠ひとりでは開けられそうにない。"
msgstr "  It did not look like she could open them any time soon."

#. Occurrence B_2:923:15612: scene=B_2
#: B_2:923
msgctxt "text_id=15612 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は階段を三段飛ばしで通過して、有珠と共に扉を押した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro climbed the stairs three at a time, and helped Alice push the towering doors inward."

#. Occurrence B_3:56:15613: scene=B_3
#: B_3:56
msgctxt "text_id=15613 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　礼拝堂の明かりは、懐かしい油の匂いがした。"
msgstr "  The dim light of the chapel brought with it the familiar scent of burning oil."

#. Occurrence B_3:61:15614: scene=B_3
#: B_3:61
msgctxt "text_id=15614 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　高い天井。"
msgstr "  The ecclesiastical interior was breathtaking."

#. Occurrence B_3:66:15615: scene=B_3
#: B_3:66
msgctxt "text_id=15615 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　壁一面の装飾硝子。"
msgstr "  The tall ceiling... The stained-glass windows on every wall..."

#. Occurrence B_3:71:15616: scene=B_3
#: B_3:71
msgctxt "text_id=15616 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりにも<白々|しらじら>しく神々しい、聖霊の実在を証明する為の舞台装置。"
msgstr "  It all felt intended to illustrate the presence of the Holy Spirit within those chambers."

#. Occurrence B_3:76:15617: scene=B_3
#: B_3:76
msgctxt "text_id=15617 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺邸のホールと同じく、礼拝堂にも暖房器具のたぐいは一切ない。<軋|きし>むような寒さが、礼拝堂をより厳格な空間へと変えている。"
msgstr "  Like the foyer in the Kuonji Estate, there was not a single heater; the bitter cold made the chapel feel more severe."

#. Occurrence B_3:114:15618: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:114
msgctxt "text_id=15618 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「アッちゃん、こっちよ」"
msgstr "\"Allie, over here.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:132:15619: scene=B_3
#: B_3:132
msgctxt "text_id=15619 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな礼拝堂で、やや場違いな声が響いた。"
msgstr "  The gentle voice echoed through the chapel, incongruous to its surroundings."

#. Occurrence B_3:137:15620: scene=B_3
#: B_3:137
msgctxt "text_id=15620 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　柔らかな女性の声だ。"
msgstr "  It was the voice of a woman."

#. Occurrence B_3:172:15621: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_3_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_3
#: B_3:172
msgctxt "text_id=15621 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「<律架|りつか>さん？　奥？」"
msgstr "\"Ritsuka? Is that you?\""

#. Occurrence B_3:178:15622: scene=B_3
#: B_3:178
msgctxt "text_id=15622 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は奥の祭壇に向かって、長椅子の葬列を横断する。"
msgstr "  Alice made her way past the rows of pews toward the front altar."

#. Occurrence B_3:185:15623: scene=B_3
#: B_3:185
msgctxt "text_id=15623 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎も扉を閉めて、その背中を追いかけた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro closed the large doors and hurried after her."

#. Occurrence B_3:258:15624: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:258
msgctxt "text_id=15624 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「早かったわね。これから迎えに行こうと思ったのに」"
msgstr "\"You got here fast. I was just thinking of coming to see you.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:283:15625: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_3_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_3
#: B_3:283
msgctxt "text_id=15625 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……使える足があったから。後ろの彼」"
msgstr "\"...I had another pair of legs.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:316:15626: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:316
msgctxt "text_id=15626 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「足って……あれ、貴方？」"
msgstr "\"Legs...? Oh, you mean him?\""

#. Occurrence B_3:345:15627: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_3_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_3
#: B_3:345
msgctxt "text_id=15627 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あ」"
msgstr "\"Ah!\""

#. Occurrence B_3:365:15628: scene=B_3
#: B_3:365
msgctxt "text_id=15628 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の紹介を受けて顔をだす草十郎と、女性の驚きが重なる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro showed himself, surprising the woman."

#. Occurrence B_3:370:15629: scene=B_3
#: B_3:370
msgctxt "text_id=15629 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりはまじまじと、ここに居るはずのない顔を眺めるのだった。"
msgstr "  They stared intently at each other, wondering what the other was doing here."

#. Occurrence B_3:421:15630: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_3_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_3
#: B_3:421
msgctxt "text_id=15630 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……知り合い？」"
msgstr "\"...You two know each other?\""

#. Occurrence B_3:447:15631: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:447
msgctxt "text_id=15631 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「あ、うん、まずい事に知り合い。"
msgstr "\"Yes, although I didn't expect to see him here."

#. Occurrence B_3:458:15632: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:458
msgctxt "text_id=15632 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　草十郎さん、引っ越したって話だけど……もしかしてアッちゃんのところに下宿してるの？」"
msgstr "  Soujyuro, when you said you'd moved... you meant you were staying at Allie's?\""

#. Occurrence B_3:463:15633: scene=B_3
#: B_3:463
msgctxt "text_id=15633 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はい、とうなずく草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded."

#. Occurrence B_3:468:15634: scene=B_3
#: B_3:468
msgctxt "text_id=15634 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　予想外の展開に、有珠の機嫌は目に見えて悪くなる。"
msgstr "  Alice turned visibly sour at this unexpected development."

#. Occurrence B_3:501:15635: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_3_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_3
#: B_3:501
msgctxt "text_id=15635 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……どういう事？　静希君、律架さんとはどういう関係？」"
msgstr "\"...What're you talking about, Ritsuka? How do you know each other?\""

#. Occurrence B_3:513:15636: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:513
msgctxt "text_id=15636 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「関係って、そうね……。"
msgstr "\"Well..."

#. Occurrence B_3:525:15637: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:525
msgctxt "text_id=15637 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　お魚屋さんでしょっちゅう割引してもらったり、"
msgstr "  He always gave me a discount at the fish market,"

#. Occurrence B_3:531:15638: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:531
msgctxt "text_id=15638 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　荷物持ちを頼んでみたり、"
msgstr "  helped me with my bags, drank tea with me..."

#. Occurrence B_3:543:15639: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:543
msgctxt "text_id=15639 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　たまにお茶飲んだりする……主婦の友、みたいな？」"
msgstr "  He's like every housewife's best friend.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:555:15640: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_3_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_3
#: B_3:555
msgctxt "text_id=15640 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「意味が分かりません。律架さん、結婚していないでしょう」"
msgstr "\"That doesn't make any sense. You're not married, Ritsuka.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:581:15641: scene=B_3
#: B_3:581
msgctxt "text_id=15641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無論、草十郎も主婦ではないのだが、今は自分のコトより彼女の既婚問題の方が重要らしかった。"
msgstr "  Needless to say, Soujyuro was also not \"a housewife's best friend\" and all that suggested, but there were more urgent matters at hand."

#. Occurrence B_3:618:15642: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0009; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:618
msgctxt "text_id=15642 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「うわあ、そこをつっこむのかあ……アッちゃん、わたしにだけは一切妥協がないのはどうかと思うの」"
msgstr "\"Ouch. You had to go there, huh? I can't slip anything by you, can I, Allie.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:624:15643: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_3_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_3
#: B_3:624
msgctxt "text_id=15643 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「律架さんの場合、どこまで本気か分からないから。おかしなところは、ぜんぶ追及しておかないといけないだけよ」"
msgstr "\"Well, what do you expect? I never know when you're being serious, so I have to question every weird thing you say.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:651:15644: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0010; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:651
msgctxt "text_id=15644 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「あら素敵。仲の良い姉妹みたいね、わたしたち。"
msgstr "\"Just look at us! We must have been separated at birth."

#. Occurrence B_3:662:15645: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0011; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:662
msgctxt "text_id=15645 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　じゃ、その信頼に応えてホントのコト言うと、彼とは町内会の顔見知りよ。スパイ行為とかそういうんじゃないし、そもそもそんな器用な人じゃないでしょ、草十郎さんは」"
msgstr "  Okay, I'll tell you the truth. I know him from the neighborhood association. He's not a spy or anything-not that he could be. I mean, you know, just look at him.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:699:15646: scene=B_3
#: B_3:699
msgctxt "text_id=15646 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「…………"
msgstr "\"..."

#. Occurrence B_3:706:15647: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_3_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_3
#: B_3:706
msgctxt "text_id=15647 | speaker=alice"
msgid "本当？」"
msgstr "Is this true?\""

#. Occurrence B_3:711:15648: scene=B_3
#: B_3:711
msgctxt "text_id=15648 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ジトっとした目で草十郎を見据える有珠。"
msgstr "  Alice stared straight at Soujyuro"

#. Occurrence B_3:717:15649: scene=B_3
#: B_3:717
msgctxt "text_id=15649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "批難の目というより、隠し事をされて怒っているような目だ。"
msgstr " to let him know she was mad at him for hiding this from her."

#. Occurrence B_3:762:15650: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_3_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_3
#: B_3:762
msgctxt "text_id=15650 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「本当だ。魚屋でバイトしてる時に知り合った人だ。"
msgstr "\"Yes? I know her from my part-time job at the fish market."

#. Occurrence B_3:768:15651: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_3_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_3
#: B_3:768
msgctxt "text_id=15651 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　前に親切にしてもらったんで、お礼に鰯を一匹サービスしたら、それ以来ごひいきに」"
msgstr "  She was nice to me, so I gave her a free sardine to persuade her to come back.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:794:15652: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_3_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_3
#: B_3:794
msgctxt "text_id=15652 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_3:806:15653: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0012; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:806
msgctxt "text_id=15653 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「そうそう。商店街で買い物してればイヤでも草十郎さんとは顔見知りになるわ。"
msgstr "\"Exactly. Everybody who shops downtown knows Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence B_3:818:15654: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0013; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:818
msgctxt "text_id=15654 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　アッちゃんも怒るぐらいなら買い物に来ればいいのに。ひそかな商店街のアイドルです、彼」"
msgstr "  If it bothers you so much, Allie, go see for yourself. He's the secret stud of the shopping district.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:861:15655: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_3_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_3
#: B_3:861
msgctxt "text_id=15655 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……アイドルとは人気者という意味で、値切りやすいカモって意味じゃない、ような」"
msgstr "\"She means I'm popular, not that my prices are easy to hammer down like some nail on the wall.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:866:15656: scene=B_3
#: B_3:866
msgctxt "text_id=15656 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ある意味人気者なのだが、それは置いておいて。"
msgstr "  His apparent popularity would have to be questioned another time."

#. Occurrence B_3:902:15657: scene=B_3
#: B_3:902
msgctxt "text_id=15657 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気を取り直し、有珠は奥のドアに視線を向けた。"
msgstr "  Collecting herself, Alice focused on the door in the recesses of the church."

#. Occurrence B_3:923:15658: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_3_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_3
#: B_3:923
msgctxt "text_id=15658 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「律架さんの事情は知りませんが、彼は青子の連れです。"
msgstr "\"I don't know what's going on with you, Ritsuka, but he's with Aoko now."

#. Occurrence B_3:929:15659: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_3_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_3
#: B_3:929
msgctxt "text_id=15659 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　その他に説明は要りますか」"
msgstr "  That explanation will have to wait.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:953:15660: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0014; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:953
msgctxt "text_id=15660 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「あー、やっぱりそういうコトなのね……。ま、言いたい事は色々あるけど、今はそれどころじゃないし。"
msgstr "\"It all makes sense now. So much to say and so little time, but we can get to that later."

#. Occurrence B_3:965:15661: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0015; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:965
msgctxt "text_id=15661 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　ええ、了解したわ。他ならぬアッちゃんの頼みだし、特殊な例だけど、彼はこちらで保護しましょう！」"
msgstr "  Fine. For you, Allie, I'll make an exception, and offer him our protection!\""

#. Occurrence B_3:971:15662: scene=B_3
#: B_3:971
msgctxt "text_id=15662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架の答えにうなずいて、有珠は奥のドアへと歩きだした。"
msgstr "  Alice nodded, and began walking to the door."

#. Occurrence B_3:1046:15663: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_3_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1046
msgctxt "text_id=15663 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「有珠」"
msgstr "\"Alice...\""

#. Occurrence B_3:1052:15664: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0016; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1052
msgctxt "text_id=15664 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「だめよ、草十郎さん」"
msgstr "\"Stay, Soujyuro.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:1063:15665: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1063
msgctxt "text_id=15665 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の後を追う草十郎を、割り入って止める律架。"
msgstr "  As Soujyuro was about to follow Alice, Ritsuka stepped in his way."

#. Occurrence B_3:1084:15666: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0017; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1084
msgctxt "text_id=15666 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「貴方は行ってはいけません。彼女たちに任せなさい」"
msgstr "\"You need to stay here. Leave this to the girls.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:1113:15667: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1113
msgctxt "text_id=15667 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぴしゃりと律架は言い放つ。"
msgstr "  she asserted bluntly."

#. Occurrence B_3:1120:15668: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1120
msgctxt "text_id=15668 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　立ち止まっている草十郎をよそに、有珠はドアを開け、礼拝堂の奥に行ってしまった。"
msgstr "  Meanwhile, Alice had reached the door and entered further into the chapel."

#. Occurrence B_3:1149:15669: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_3_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1149
msgctxt "text_id=15669 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「行ってはいけないって、どうして」"
msgstr "\"But why?\""

#. Occurrence B_3:1155:15670: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0018; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1155
msgctxt "text_id=15670 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「貴方のためよ。青子の容態は普通の人が見ていいものじゃない。気分を悪くするだけ。"
msgstr "\"It's for your own good. No normal person should see Aoko in the state she's in. It'll be too much for you."

#. Occurrence B_3:1168:15671: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0019; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1168
msgctxt "text_id=15671 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　それとも……イヤな思いをしてもいいくらい、青子が心配なのかしら？」"
msgstr "  ...Unless, of course, you're so worried about her you don't care about that?\""

#. Occurrence B_3:1203:15672: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1203
msgctxt "text_id=15672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架の問いかけに、草十郎はすぐには答えられなかった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was not able to give an immediate answer;"

#. Occurrence B_3:1208:15673: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1208
msgctxt "text_id=15673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……青子が良くない状況である事は分かっている。"
msgstr "  it had finally hit him just how bad a state Aoko must be in."

#. Occurrence B_3:1213:15674: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1213
msgctxt "text_id=15674 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の様子から察して、有珠以上の傷を負っているのかもしれない。"
msgstr "  Based on Alice's condition when he found her, he intuited that Aoko's injuries might be even worse."

#. Occurrence B_3:1233:15675: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1233
msgctxt "text_id=15675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこまで承知していて、草十郎には青子のまいっている顔を想像できなかった。"
msgstr "  He tried to imagine her expression in that state, but could not."

#. Occurrence B_3:1266:15676: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_3_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1266
msgctxt "text_id=15676 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――蒼崎相手に心配なんかしません」"
msgstr "\"...I never worry about Aozaki.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:1272:15677: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1272
msgctxt "text_id=15677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから、本当の意味での心配を、彼はしていなかったのだ。"
msgstr "  Literally, he had never been worried about her before, not truly."

#. Occurrence B_3:1293:15678: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0020; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1293
msgctxt "text_id=15678 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「でも、会いにいくのね」"
msgstr "\"I can't stop you, can I?\""

#. Occurrence B_3:1299:15679: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_3_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1299
msgctxt "text_id=15679 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「はい」"
msgstr "\"No.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:1315:15680: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1315
msgctxt "text_id=15680 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架の言葉に、草十郎は反射的に答えた。"
msgstr "  He answered her reflexively."

#. Occurrence B_3:1321:15681: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1321
msgctxt "text_id=15681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年の未熟な勘違いにため息をつきながら、"
msgstr "  Ritsuka sighed at the boy's naivete,"

msgctxt "text_id=15682 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "仕方なく律架は道を譲る。"
msgstr " but nonetheless stepped aside."

#. Occurrence B_3:1364:15683: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0021; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1364
msgctxt "text_id=15683 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「どうぞ、いってらっしゃい。"
msgstr "\"Go on, then."

#. Occurrence B_3:1370:15684: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0022; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1370
msgctxt "text_id=15684 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　有珠さんが使ったドアから入って、四番目の部屋よ。"
msgstr "  Through the door Alice used. Fourth room in."

#. Occurrence B_3:1376:15685: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0023; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1376
msgctxt "text_id=15685 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　いま一番とりこんでる頃だから、ユイちゃんの邪魔だけはしないように」"
msgstr "  Things are critical right now, so stay out of Yui's way.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:1409:15686: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1409
msgctxt "text_id=15686 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架に礼を言って、草十郎は有珠の後を追った。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro thanked her and went after Alice."

#. Occurrence B_3:1414:15687: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1414
msgctxt "text_id=15687 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　礼拝堂には自称・近所のお姉さんである<周|す><瀬|せ>律架だけが残される。"
msgstr "  Leaving Ritsuka Suse, the self-proclaimed 'everybody's friendly neighbor,' alone."

#. Occurrence B_3:1459:15688: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0024; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1459
msgctxt "text_id=15688 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「……さて。唯架あたりなら止めるんでしょうけど、ま、わたしは草十郎さんの味方だし、傷つく男の子とか大好物だし。"
msgstr "\"Yuika'll probably stop him, but someone's got to be in Soujyuro's corner. I have a soft spot for broken boys."

#. Occurrence B_3:1470:15689: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_3_0025; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_3
#: B_3:1470
msgctxt "text_id=15689 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　少々スパルタと自覚しておりますが、これも親切な姉心と思って、草十郎さんには後悔していただきましょう！」"
msgstr "  I know I'm playing rough with him, but it's for his own good. I say let him learn to regret!\""

#. Occurrence B_3:1501:15690: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1501
msgctxt "text_id=15690 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　力強く断言するも、もちろん、礼拝堂には律架しかいない。"
msgstr "  She spoke with force, but her words echoed aimlessly around the chapel."

#. Occurrence B_3:1515:15691: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1515
msgctxt "text_id=15691 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やれやれと肩をすくめながら、律架は不信心に十字を切る。"
msgstr "  With a sigh, she shrugged her shoulders and made the sign of the cross in a rather unpious manner."

#. Occurrence B_3:1535:15692: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1535
msgctxt "text_id=15692 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……遠くなっていく足音。"
msgstr "  The sound of Soujyuro's footsteps grew fainter."

#. Occurrence B_3:1562:15693: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1562
msgctxt "text_id=15693 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その<躊躇|ためらい>のなさが、律架には痛ましい。"
msgstr "  His lack of hesitation had left a pain in her heart."

#. Occurrence B_3:1567:15694: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1567
msgctxt "text_id=15694 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜなら、少年が振り向かないのは迷いがないからではなく。"
msgstr "  And not because he did not look back at her,"

#. Occurrence B_3:1572:15695: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1572
msgctxt "text_id=15695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼本人が意識していない根本的な恐れから、ただ目を逸らしているだけなのだから。"
msgstr "  but because he was choosing to ignore the primal fear inside him."

#. Occurrence B_3:1621:15696: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1621
msgctxt "text_id=15696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　老人は語った。"
msgstr "                                      An elderly man once said..."

#. Occurrence B_3:1643:15697: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1643
msgctxt "text_id=15697 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生き物の死と、人間の死は違うもんだ。"
msgstr "  \"An animal's death and a human's are two different things."

#. Occurrence B_3:1648:15698: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1648
msgctxt "text_id=15698 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　同じように思えるかもしれないが、もう根本からぜんぜん違う。"
msgstr "  You may think they are the same, but they differ to their core."

#. Occurrence B_3:1653:15699: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1653
msgctxt "text_id=15699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　オレたちの<頭|ココ>は、はじめからそういう<区|・><別|・>をするように出来ている。"
msgstr "  Our heads have known the difference since the dawn of man."

#. Occurrence B_3:1675:15700: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1675
msgctxt "text_id=15700 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鹿だの豚だのの<死骸|しがい>と、<同|・><じ|・><生|・><き|・><物|・>の死骸は違う。"
msgstr "  An animal's corpse-be it a pig's or a deer's-is different."

#. Occurrence B_3:1681:15701: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1681
msgctxt "text_id=15701 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鉈だの斧だのを振るうのが暴力なら、"
msgstr "  If the swing of an axe or a machete is violent,"

msgctxt "text_id=15702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人間の死骸ってのも否応なしの暴力だ。"
msgstr "  then so must a human corpse be."

#. Occurrence B_3:1688:15703: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1688
msgctxt "text_id=15703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんで、そういうモンに出遭う前に、言葉でだけでも知っておけばいい。"
msgstr "  Therefore, before you see one with your own eyes, you should at least understand it with your ears."

#. Occurrence B_3:1712:15704: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1712
msgctxt "text_id=15704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いいかい草<十|ぼうず>郎。"
msgstr "  Listen closely, Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence B_3:1717:15705: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1717
msgctxt "text_id=15705 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人が死ぬ時はな、目を背けたくなるぐらい、赤い血が流れていくもんなんだ――――――"
msgstr "  When a person dies, blood flows like a crimson river... It's too much to bear.\""

#. Occurrence B_3:1745:15706: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1745
msgctxt "text_id=15706 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……慣れない、石造りの通路を歩いたせいか。"
msgstr "  Perhaps because he was not used to the stone path beneath his feet,"

#. Occurrence B_3:1750:15707: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1750
msgctxt "text_id=15707 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は幼い頃に聞いた、他愛のない話を思い出した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's mind wandered back to the words he'd heard as a child."

#. Occurrence B_3:1815:15708: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1815
msgctxt "text_id=15708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ドアを開けた瞬間、異様な、違う空気が流れている事を思い知った。"
msgstr "  The instant he opened the door, there was a palpable change in the air."

#. Occurrence B_3:1820:15709: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1820
msgctxt "text_id=15709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　部屋は小さな個室で、簡素なベッドと、小さな桐のタンスがあるだけだ。"
msgstr "  The room was small, with only a simple bed and a small wooden dresser."

#. Occurrence B_3:1825:15710: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1825
msgctxt "text_id=15710 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベッドには　　が横臥している。"
msgstr "  And there on the bed, ____ was lying on her side."

#. Occurrence B_3:1830:15711: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1830
msgctxt "text_id=15711 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　を看病しているのは、さっき礼拝堂にいた律架という女性だった。"
msgstr "      Tending to her was the woman he'd just seen in the chapel, Ritsuka."

#. Occurrence B_3:1891:15712: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1891
msgctxt "text_id=15712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……いや、それは律架によく似た女性にすぎない。"
msgstr "  ...No, she only looked a lot like her."

#. Occurrence B_3:1896:15713: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1896
msgctxt "text_id=15713 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　閉じられた目蓋と、血に濡れている修道服。"
msgstr "  Her eyes were closed, and her garments covered in blood."

#. Occurrence B_3:1901:15714: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1901
msgctxt "text_id=15714 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一度なり面識はある。"
msgstr "  He had met her maybe once before."

#. Occurrence B_3:1906:15715: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1906
msgctxt "text_id=15715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女はこの教会のシスター、<周|す><瀬|せ><唯架|ゆいか>だ。"
msgstr "  Yuika Suse, a nun at the church."

#. Occurrence B_3:1928:15716: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1928
msgctxt "text_id=15716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　唯架は横臥している　　に触れている。"
msgstr "  She was doing something to ____."

#. Occurrence B_3:1933:15717: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1933
msgctxt "text_id=15717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その手にはハサミと糸。"
msgstr "  Yuika held a pair of scissors and some thread."

#. Occurrence B_3:1938:15718: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1938
msgctxt "text_id=15718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シスターはオルガンを<弾|ひ>く静かさで、たおやかに、しかし<迅速|じんそく>に指を動かす。"
msgstr "  Her hands moved delicately yet quickly, as though playing an organ."

#. Occurrence B_3:1943:15719: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1943
msgctxt "text_id=15719 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<淀|よど>みのない手順は、そういう楽譜があるかのようだ。"
msgstr "  Her movements were precise, as if flawlessly reading sheet music."

#. Occurrence B_3:1948:15720: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1948
msgctxt "text_id=15720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　包帯は次から次へと消費される。"
msgstr "  One by one, the supply of bandages diminished."

#. Occurrence B_3:1953:15721: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1953
msgctxt "text_id=15721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さきほどまで使われていた包帯がはがされ、新しい包帯が、<潰|つぶ>れた人体部分を隠していく。"
msgstr "  Bandages recently applied to the wounds were quickly replaced with fresh ones."

#. Occurrence B_3:1973:15722: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1973
msgctxt "text_id=15722 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　血を拭うガーゼも、いいかげん使いすぎだ。"
msgstr "  Gauze was placed everywhere to try and cope with the amount of blood."

#. Occurrence B_3:1980:15723: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1980
msgctxt "text_id=15723 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　投げ捨てた布の色は白ではなく赤。"
msgstr "  Once white cloth was now dyed red and discarded."

#. Occurrence B_3:1985:15724: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1985
msgctxt "text_id=15724 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　床に積もった布切れは、汚れた薔薇を思わせる。"
msgstr "  The dressings scattered around the floor resembled roses."

#. Occurrence B_3:1991:15725: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1991
msgctxt "text_id=15725 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　腐った薔薇園でオルガンを演奏するシスター。"
msgstr "  In a wilted rose garden, the nun played her organ."

#. Occurrence B_3:1997:15726: scene=B_3
#: B_3:1997
msgctxt "text_id=15726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ますます、現実味というものがない。"
msgstr "  The scene looked unlike any reality Soujyuro knew."

#. Occurrence B_3:2017:15727: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2017
msgctxt "text_id=15727 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　空気が違う理由は明らかだ。"
msgstr "  It was clear why the air had changed."

#. Occurrence B_3:2050:15728: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2050
msgctxt "text_id=15728 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この部屋の空気には匂いがついている。"
msgstr "  There was a savage odor in the room."

#. Occurrence B_3:2055:15729: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2055
msgctxt "text_id=15729 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　初めて体験してもそれだと判ってしまう、胸の焼け付く、重い匂い。"
msgstr "  Even though he was experiencing it for the first time, he knew what it was. The smell burned his lungs."

#. Occurrence B_3:2091:15730: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2091
msgctxt "text_id=15730 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の視線は、どうにもベッドに定まらない。"
msgstr "  He could not bring himself to look at the bed."

#. Occurrence B_3:2096:15731: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2096
msgctxt "text_id=15731 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気持ちとは裏腹に、関係のない箇所ばかり見ようとする。"
msgstr "  Fighting his feelings, his eyes refused to move there."

#. Occurrence B_3:2116:15732: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2116
msgctxt "text_id=15732 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見れば、有珠はベッドの横に立っていた。"
msgstr "  He noticed Alice next to the bed."

#. Occurrence B_3:2159:15733: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2159
msgctxt "text_id=15733 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつもの無表情な立ち姿が、今は<卒塔婆|そとば>のように見える。"
msgstr "  Ever expressionless, she looked like a statue next to a grave,"

#. Occurrence B_3:2164:15734: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2164
msgctxt "text_id=15734 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は<微|かす>かに震えていた。"
msgstr "  except she was trembling ever so slightly."

#. Occurrence B_3:2169:15735: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2169
msgctxt "text_id=15735 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<怯|おび>えか不安、それとも憎しみによる憤怒かは、どうにも。"
msgstr "  It could have been from fear, anxiety, rage, or a combination of the three."

#. Occurrence B_3:2209:15736: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2209
msgctxt "text_id=15736 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その視線の先に、死に<瀕|ひん>する生き物が一つ。"
msgstr "  Before her lay a life on the verge of death."

#. Occurrence B_3:2257:15737: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2257
msgctxt "text_id=15737 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベッドに横たわるソレが何であるか、一見では頭に入らない。"
msgstr "  But whose life? It was difficult to tell with only a glance."

#. Occurrence B_3:2262:15738: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2262
msgctxt "text_id=15738 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ところどころ包帯に巻かれた人形。"
msgstr "  Some sort of puppet covered in bandages, perhaps."

#. Occurrence B_3:2282:15739: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2282
msgctxt "text_id=15739 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　美しかった髪は乱れて、呼吸は短く小さいクセに、胸はせわしなく上下している。"
msgstr "  Her hair should be beautiful, but it fell flat, disheveled; despite her short breaths, her chest convulsed. Up. Down. Up. Down."

#. Occurrence B_3:2287:15740: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2287
msgctxt "text_id=15740 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どことなく滑稽で、デパートの屋上で見た、ロデオマシーンを彷彿とさせる。"
msgstr "  Facetious though the thought was, Soujyuro recalled the rodeo machine on the roof of the department store."

#. Occurrence B_3:2293:15741: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2293
msgctxt "text_id=15741 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――ああ。"
msgstr "  Ah."

#. Occurrence B_3:2298:15742: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2298
msgctxt "text_id=15742 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　では、麻酔とか鎮痛剤とか、そういうものは効いていないのか。"
msgstr "  The painkillers and anesthesia could not have been working."

#. Occurrence B_3:2320:15743: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2320
msgctxt "text_id=15743 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　真新しい包帯は秒刻みで朱色に<滲|にじ>んでいく。"
msgstr "  New bandages were soaked crimson in seconds."

#. Occurrence B_3:2325:15744: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2325
msgctxt "text_id=15744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シーツに食いこむ五指の爪。"
msgstr "  Her fingernails bit into the sheets."

#. Occurrence B_3:2330:15745: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2330
msgctxt "text_id=15745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　苦しみに歪む顔。"
msgstr "  Her face twisted in agony."

#. Occurrence B_3:2335:15746: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2335
msgctxt "text_id=15746 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　麻酔は効かず、生きているのなら、意識だってあるだろう。"
msgstr "  Anesthesia would not be enough, so if she was still alive, she must be conscious too."

#. Occurrence B_3:2340:15747: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2340
msgctxt "text_id=15747 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰も不安に思わないのか、と不安になる。"
msgstr "  It worried him that no one seemed concerned about this."

#. Occurrence B_3:2345:15748: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2345
msgctxt "text_id=15748 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれでは体の傷より、痛みで心が先に死ぬ。"
msgstr "  In this state, she would surely lose her mind before her life."

#. Occurrence B_3:2418:15749: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2418
msgctxt "text_id=15749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　端的に言って。"
msgstr "  In short..."

#. Occurrence B_3:2423:15750: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2423
msgctxt "text_id=15750 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは少年にとって、二度と見たくない光景だった。"
msgstr "  The boy never wanted to see anything like this ever again."

#. Occurrence B_3:2492:15751: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2492
msgctxt "text_id=15751 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本来清潔であるべき白いベッドが、またたくまに赤く染まっていく。"
msgstr "  Bedsheets should be white, not red. With every blink, the color deepened."

#. Occurrence B_3:2497:15752: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2497
msgctxt "text_id=15752 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その中心で流血する人形が彼女なのだと認めて、"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was finally forced to accept that the bleeding mess in the center of it was... her."

#. Occurrence B_3:2502:15753: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2502
msgctxt "text_id=15753 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　体中の血管が膨張する。"
msgstr "  He felt the blood surge in his veins."

#. Occurrence B_3:2507:15754: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2507
msgctxt "text_id=15754 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベッドの<軋|きし>む音も、ハサミの刃がこすれる音も、彼女の苦悶も<彼岸|ひがん>の話。"
msgstr "  The squeaking of the bed; the snip of the scissors; the gasps of agony... it all faded."

#. Occurrence B_3:2528:15755: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2528
msgctxt "text_id=15755 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の鼓動だけが<耳朶|じだ>に響く。"
msgstr "  All he could hear was his own pounding heartbeat."

#. Occurrence B_3:2564:15756: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2564
msgctxt "text_id=15756 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　むせ返る血の匂いに、吐き気がする。"
msgstr "  The smell of the blood she choked up sent a wave of nausea through him."

#. Occurrence B_3:2569:15757: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2569
msgctxt "text_id=15757 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　膝から力が失われる感覚。"
msgstr "  His knees abandoned him."

#. Occurrence B_3:2618:15758: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2618
msgctxt "text_id=15758 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　でも、それは仕方のない事だ。"
msgstr "  And it was perfectly understandable."

#. Occurrence B_3:2641:15759: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2641
msgctxt "text_id=15759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　精神の安全装置が、断りもなく意識を遮断する。"
msgstr "  His brain had to shut his consciousness off to protect itself."

#. Occurrence B_3:2647:15760: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2647
msgctxt "text_id=15760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自明の理にも程がある。"
msgstr "  The mind could only take so much reality."

#. Occurrence B_3:2653:15761: scene=B_3
#: B_3:2653
msgctxt "text_id=15761 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――だってこんなモノ、何を引き替えにしても、彼は二度と見たくはなかったのだ。"
msgstr "  He would give anything to never see something like that again."

#. Occurrence B_4:58:15762: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_4_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_4
#: B_4:58
msgctxt "text_id=15762 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "“―――そうか。青子ちゃんは全部分かっているんだね。"
msgstr "\"...Silly me. You know everything, don't you, Aoko?"

#. Occurrence B_4:64:15763: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_4_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_4
#: B_4:64
msgctxt "text_id=15763 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　自分だけのコトじゃなくて、"
msgstr "  Not just about you,"

#. Occurrence B_4:70:15764: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_4_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_4
#: B_4:70
msgctxt "text_id=15764 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　このあとに起きるコトも、なにが残ってなにが残らないのかも、全部まっすぐに受けとめている。"
msgstr "  but what happens after this too; what survives, what won't. You can see it all."

#. Occurrence B_4:76:15765: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_B_4_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=B_4
#: B_4:76
msgctxt "text_id=15765 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　それでも自分であり続けられるという事は、"
msgstr "  And through it all, you never lose sight of who you are."

msgctxt "text_id=15766 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とても強いことなんだよ―――”"
msgstr "  You're so strong.\""

#. Occurrence B_4:118:15767: scene=B_4
#: B_4:118
msgctxt "text_id=15767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　などと。"
msgstr "  And on she went."

#. Occurrence B_4:123:15768: scene=B_4
#: B_4:123
msgctxt "text_id=15768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その人は、私がわりと好きだった笑顔で、いちばん言ってほしくない事を、誇らしげに口にした。"
msgstr "  I kind of liked her smile, but she just had to go and say the one thing I wished she hadn't."

#. Occurrence B_4:128:15769: scene=B_4
#: B_4:128
msgctxt "text_id=15769 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今では遠い昔のように思える中学の卒業式。"
msgstr "  The last day of middle school seems so long ago."

#. Occurrence B_4:133:15770: scene=B_4
#: B_4:133
msgctxt "text_id=15770 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　早咲きの桜が舞い散る中、私のささやかな夢は、木っ端微塵に砕け散ったのだ。"
msgstr "  As the ephemeral cherry blossom petals danced around, my little dream was crushed."

#. Occurrence B_4:185:15771: scene=B_4
#: B_4:185
msgctxt "text_id=15771 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だいたい、私は自分が強いなんて思った事はなかった。"
msgstr "  I'd never really considered myself strong."

#. Occurrence B_4:190:15772: scene=B_4
#: B_4:190
msgctxt "text_id=15772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少なくとも、この言葉を時折思い出すようになるまでは。"
msgstr "  At least, until I began remembering those words from time to time."

#. Occurrence B_4:197:15773: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_4_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_4
#: B_4:197
msgctxt "text_id=15773 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "“蒼崎は分かってると思ってた。"
msgstr "\"I thought you of all people would understand, Aozaki."

#. Occurrence B_4:203:15774: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_4_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_4
#: B_4:203
msgctxt "text_id=15774 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　いや、きっと分かってるんだな。だから、そこが強いんだろうね”"
msgstr "  I mean, of course you do. That's what makes you strong.\""

#. Occurrence B_4:223:15775: scene=B_4
#: B_4:223
msgctxt "text_id=15775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……なのに最近、そんな<戯|たわ>けたコトを言った奴がいる。"
msgstr "  ...And lately, an idiot who said things like that had appeared in my life."

#. Occurrence B_4:228:15776: scene=B_4
#: B_4:228
msgctxt "text_id=15776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の判断基準がまわりとズレている事は知っていたけど、知り合って何日も経たない相手に指摘されたのは、ちょっとしたショックだった。"
msgstr "  I knew I always judged people more harshly than those around me, but to have someone I'd only known for a few days point that out was like a stab in the chest."

#. Occurrence B_4:233:15777: scene=B_4
#: B_4:233
msgctxt "text_id=15777 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おまけに台詞までそっくりで、あの時は怒りのあまり我を忘れたほどである。"
msgstr "  Not only that, the words sounded so similar, they made me so angry I couldn't see straight."

#. Occurrence B_4:253:15778: scene=B_4
#: B_4:253
msgctxt "text_id=15778 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……今まで、私に対してそんなことを言ってきたのは彼を含めて二人だけ。"
msgstr "  Only him and one other person have ever said anything like that to me."

#. Occurrence B_4:258:15779: scene=B_4
#: B_4:258
msgctxt "text_id=15779 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けど、おそらくは姉貴も無言で言っていたのだ。"
msgstr "  Then again, I suppose my sister said the same without actually saying it."

#. Occurrence B_4:264:15780: scene=B_4
#: B_4:264
msgctxt "text_id=15780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おまえは、<自分|わたし>たちとは違う。"
msgstr "  \"You're different from us.\""

#. Occurrence B_4:270:15781: scene=B_4
#: B_4:270
msgctxt "text_id=15781 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　私にとって、それは賛美の声ではなく、呪いにしか聞こえなかった。"
msgstr "  But me being me, I took it as a curse rather than a compliment."

#. Occurrence B_4:292:15782: scene=B_4
#: B_4:292
msgctxt "text_id=15782 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の一挙一動、意志選択、善悪基準から<迫害|はくがい><博愛|はくあい>。"
msgstr "  My actions, my choices, my morals... all the good and bad I've done..."

#. Occurrence B_4:297:15783: scene=B_4
#: B_4:297
msgctxt "text_id=15783 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そのすべてを承知した上で、まだ自分が<大事|いちばん>なのか。"
msgstr "  When all's said and done, am I really any better than everyone else?"

#. Occurrence B_4:302:15784: scene=B_4
#: B_4:302
msgctxt "text_id=15784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もちろんだ。周りの為に自分を犠牲にするのなんて、どうあっても選べない。"
msgstr "  Of course I am. I'll never sacrifice myself for those around me."

#. Occurrence B_4:307:15785: scene=B_4
#: B_4:307
msgctxt "text_id=15785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その<孤|こだわ>り、その道化ぶりを分かっていながら、自分であり続けられる事を、彼らは強いといった。"
msgstr "  They just had to call me strong-true to myself, in spite of how alone, stubborn, and ridiculous I know I can be."

#. Occurrence B_4:327:15786: scene=B_4
#: B_4:327
msgctxt "text_id=15786 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　幼い私は首をかしげるしかない。"
msgstr "  When I was younger, it only confused me."

#. Occurrence B_4:332:15787: scene=B_4
#: B_4:332
msgctxt "text_id=15787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だって、私は違うやり方を見いだせないだけだ。"
msgstr "  I mean, I don't know any other way; I am who I am."

#. Occurrence B_4:337:15788: scene=B_4
#: B_4:337
msgctxt "text_id=15788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悔しいぐらい、『ただ諦める』勇気を持てないだけ。"
msgstr "  The frustrating fact is, I simply don't have the courage to give up."

#. Occurrence B_4:343:15789: scene=B_4
#: B_4:343
msgctxt "text_id=15789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なのにどうして―――"
msgstr "  So why...?"

#. Occurrence B_4:348:15790: scene=B_4
#: B_4:348
msgctxt "text_id=15790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな当たり前の事が、特別扱いされるんだろう―――？"
msgstr "  Why do I get treated special for doing what comes naturally?"

#. Occurrence B_4:393:15791: scene=B_4
#: B_4:393
msgctxt "text_id=15791 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……朝の光で目を覚ます。"
msgstr "  ...The sunlight stirred her."

#. Occurrence B_4:398:15792: scene=B_4
#: B_4:398
msgctxt "text_id=15792 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　全身を霊糸で<縫|ぬ>った痛みのせいか。"
msgstr "  Maybe it was the pain from having her whole body held together by arcane threads,"

#. Occurrence B_4:403:15793: scene=B_4
#: B_4:403
msgctxt "text_id=15793 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他愛のない夢を、見たようだ。"
msgstr "  but Aoko felt like she'd had a silly dream."

#. Occurrence B_4:434:15794: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_4_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_4
#: B_4:434
msgctxt "text_id=15794 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――、ぁ―――」"
msgstr "\"...Ah...\""

#. Occurrence B_4:440:15795: scene=B_4
#: B_4:440
msgctxt "text_id=15795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ガラガラに渇いて傷ついた喉が、大きく深呼吸をする。"
msgstr "  She gulped air through her painful, parched throat."

#. Occurrence B_4:445:15796: scene=B_4
#: B_4:445
msgctxt "text_id=15796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小さな窓から差しこむ灰色の日射しは、彼女の意識をゆっくりと覚醒させた。"
msgstr "  Gray rays of light shone through a small window, bringing her back to reality."

#. Occurrence B_4:466:15797: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_4_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_4
#: B_4:466
msgctxt "text_id=15797 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「うわ、体中、かゆ……」"
msgstr "\"Ugh... I feel... itchy.\""

#. Occurrence B_4:473:15798: scene=B_4
#: B_4:473
msgctxt "text_id=15798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　耐えきれず寝返りをうってみる。"
msgstr "  Unable to bear it, Aoko attempted to roll over."

#. Occurrence B_4:478:15799: scene=B_4
#: B_4:478
msgctxt "text_id=15799 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が、動かせたのは右腕だけ。"
msgstr "  Except, she could only move her right arm."

#. Occurrence B_4:483:15800: scene=B_4
#: B_4:483
msgctxt "text_id=15800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　肘から先を持ち上げてみても、嘘のように感覚がない。"
msgstr "  She tried lifting her arm, but couldn't feel anything past her elbow."

#. Occurrence B_4:489:15801: scene=B_4
#: B_4:489
msgctxt "text_id=15801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　腕に向けた集中をそらすと、"
msgstr "  Once she stopped concentrating on her bandaged arm,"

msgctxt "text_id=15802 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "包帯だらけの腕はぱたん、と力なくベッドに落ちた。"
msgstr " it fell to the bed like a stone."

#. Occurrence B_4:512:15803: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_4_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_4
#: B_4:512
msgctxt "text_id=15803 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――さて」"
msgstr "\"...Okay.\""

#. Occurrence B_4:532:15804: scene=B_4
#: B_4:532
msgctxt "text_id=15804 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は視線だけで状況を確認する。"
msgstr "  Aoko took in her surroundings, moving only her eyes."

#. Occurrence B_4:552:15805: scene=B_4
#: B_4:552
msgctxt "text_id=15805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……自分はベッドに眠っていたらしい。"
msgstr "  Evidently, she had been asleep in this bed."

#. Occurrence B_4:557:15806: scene=B_4
#: B_4:557
msgctxt "text_id=15806 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　体のあちこちの感覚がなくて、ロボットか何かになった気がする。"
msgstr "  Unable to feel certain parts of her body, she felt like a robot."

#. Occurrence B_4:562:15807: scene=B_4
#: B_4:562
msgctxt "text_id=15807 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　部屋は狭くて何の飾り気もない。"
msgstr "  The room was tiny and undecorated."

#. Occurrence B_4:584:15808: scene=B_4
#: B_4:584
msgctxt "text_id=15808 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まるで入居前のマンションだ。手入れは行き届いているところを見て、合田教会の一室だろう、とアタリをつける。"
msgstr "  It was like an apartment without a tenant. Judging by the good repair, she guessed that she was in Aida Church."

#. Occurrence B_4:604:15809: scene=B_4
#: B_4:604
msgctxt "text_id=15809 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外は朝というより昼に近い。"
msgstr "  Outside, it seemed closer to noon than morning."

#. Occurrence B_4:609:15810: scene=B_4
#: B_4:609
msgctxt "text_id=15810 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　空は相変わらず曇っていて、日射しは弱々しい。"
msgstr "  Clouds filled the sky as usual, dulling the sun's rays."

#. Occurrence B_4:614:15811: scene=B_4
#: B_4:614
msgctxt "text_id=15811 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この分では雪解けはもっと先になってしまうだろうな、と取りとめのない事が頭によぎる。"
msgstr "  Idly, she thought that it could be enough to melt the snow outside."

#. Occurrence B_4:623:15812: scene=B_4
#: B_4:623
msgctxt "text_id=15812 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして最後に、青子は彼女の姿を認めた。"
msgstr "  And then finally, she noticed the figure of a girl."

#. Occurrence B_4:628:15813: scene=B_4
#: B_4:628
msgctxt "text_id=15813 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の眠るベッドの横で、椅子に座ったまま動かない久遠寺有珠の姿を。"
msgstr "  Next to her bed, Alice Kuonji was sitting in a chair, unmoving."

#. Occurrence B_4:649:15814: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_4_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_4
#: B_4:649
msgctxt "text_id=15814 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……おはよ、有珠」"
msgstr "\"...Good morning, Alice.\""

#. Occurrence B_4:655:15815: scene=B_4
#: B_4:655
msgctxt "text_id=15815 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やあ、とばかりに青子は有珠に呼びかけた。"
msgstr "  She called out to her, all too casually."

#. Occurrence B_4:660:15816: scene=B_4
#: B_4:660
msgctxt "text_id=15816 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　口の中がやたら<鈍|にぶ>い。"
msgstr "  It was more difficult to talk than she thought."

#. Occurrence B_4:684:15817: scene=B_4
#: B_4:684
msgctxt "text_id=15817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はあいかわらずの無表情。"
msgstr "  Alice was her typical stoic self."

#. Occurrence B_4:689:15818: scene=B_4
#: B_4:689
msgctxt "text_id=15818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ、その瞳に同居人をいたわる<翳|かげ>りがあったのを、青子は見逃さなかった。"
msgstr "  Although Aoko did notice a glimpse of concern in her eyes."

#. Occurrence B_4:725:15819: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_4_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_4
#: B_4:725
msgctxt "text_id=15819 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「寝てないんでしょ。肌が荒れてる」"
msgstr "\"You haven't slept, Alice. I can tell from your poor complexion.\""

#. Occurrence B_4:751:15820: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_4_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_4
#: B_4:751
msgctxt "text_id=15820 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……努力はしたわ。けど、橙子さんに飲まされた物が解毒されるまで眠れそうにないの。"
msgstr "\"I tried. But I can't until the substance Touko made me swallow leaves my system."

#. Occurrence B_4:757:15821: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_4_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_4
#: B_4:757
msgctxt "text_id=15821 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　半端な痛みは、こういう時に<生温|なまぬる>いわね」"
msgstr "  I suppose my lukewarm discomfort is a fart in a windstorm compared to what you're going through.\""

#. Occurrence B_4:799:15822: scene=B_4
#: B_4:799
msgctxt "text_id=15822 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女らしからぬ相方の台詞を聞いて、青子はますます気持ちを生き返らせた。"
msgstr "  Alice's uncharacteristically vulgar comment helped Aoko feel a little more like her usual self."

#. Occurrence B_4:804:15823: scene=B_4
#: B_4:804
msgctxt "text_id=15823 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今は心配してくれる隣人より、ともに戦ってくれる友人の方が心強い。"
msgstr "  She felt reassured having a comrade-in-arms by her side instead of a concerned neighbor."

#. Occurrence B_4:852:15824: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_4_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_4
#: B_4:852
msgctxt "text_id=15824 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そ、有珠もやられたの。"
msgstr "\"So, she got you too."

#. Occurrence B_4:858:15825: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_4_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_4
#: B_4:858
msgctxt "text_id=15825 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……状況はだいたい予想してるけど、一応、細部を聞かせてくれない？」"
msgstr "  ...I can guess how it went, but fill me in on the details.\""

#. Occurrence B_4:863:15826: scene=B_4
#: B_4:863
msgctxt "text_id=15826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベッドに横になったまま、青子は凛とした口調で言う。"
msgstr "  Aoko remained horizontal as she spoke with a cool tone."

#. Occurrence B_4:903:15827: scene=B_4
#: B_4:903
msgctxt "text_id=15827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の無茶を、有珠は止めもせず聞き入れた。"
msgstr "  Despite Aoko's condition, Alice granted her request."

#. Occurrence B_4:908:15828: scene=B_4
#: B_4:908
msgctxt "text_id=15828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう二年近い付き合いだ。"
msgstr "  After all, they had known each other for two years."

#. Occurrence B_4:913:15829: scene=B_4
#: B_4:913
msgctxt "text_id=15829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こういう時、蒼崎青子という少女にとって何が一番の麻酔になるのか、有珠はよく理解していた。"
msgstr "  Alice knew exactly the kind of anesthesia Aoko Aozaki needed right now."

#. Occurrence B_5:51:15830: scene=B_5
#: B_5:51
msgctxt "text_id=15830 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺有珠と蒼崎橙子の戦いは、有珠の勝利で終わった。"
msgstr "  Alice Kuonji's battle with Touko Aozaki ended in the former's victory."

#. Occurrence B_5:103:15831: scene=B_5
#: B_5:103
msgctxt "text_id=15831 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橋の巨人は“童話の怪物”の中でも特別な使い魔だ。"
msgstr "  The Thames Troll was a special familiar even among fairy-tale monsters."

#. Occurrence B_5:108:15832: scene=B_5
#: B_5:108
msgctxt "text_id=15832 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　フラットスナークのような大異能はないが、その巨体、強度、出力、どれをとってもトップランクの性能を誇る。"
msgstr "  While lacking the incredible reality-warping abilities of Flat Snark, its sheer mass, durability, and strength were second to none."

#. Occurrence B_5:113:15833: scene=B_5
#: B_5:113
msgctxt "text_id=15833 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子のルーン魔術では表面の<石膚|せきふ>さえ破壊できまい。"
msgstr "  Touko's rune magecraft was rendered completely ineffective by its stone armor."

#. Occurrence B_5:119:15834: scene=B_5
#: B_5:119
msgctxt "text_id=15834 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは橙子に限った話ではない。現代の魔術師、その大部分は橋の巨人の前に敗れ去るだろう。"
msgstr "  In all fairness to Touko, most mages would not stand a chance against the Bridge Giant."

#. Occurrence B_5:139:15835: scene=B_5
#: B_5:139
msgctxt "text_id=15835 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　身にまとった神秘の違いだ。"
msgstr "  The reason lay in the Mystic's body."

#. Occurrence B_5:144:15836: scene=B_5
#: B_5:144
msgctxt "text_id=15836 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術の原則として、神秘はより強い神秘の前に敗北する。"
msgstr "  As a general law of magecraft, a Mystic will lose to a stronger, older Mystic."

#. Occurrence B_5:189:15837: scene=B_5
#: B_5:189
msgctxt "text_id=15837 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橋の巨人が持つ歴史は単体で千年<級|クラス>。"
msgstr "  The history of the Bridge Giant dated back well over a thousand years."

#. Occurrence B_5:194:15838: scene=B_5
#: B_5:194
msgctxt "text_id=15838 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その起源はイギリスがローマの支配下にあった一世紀にまで<遡|さかのぼ>る。"
msgstr "  Its origins could be traced to the 1st century when Britannia was conquered by the Romans."

#. Occurrence B_5:199:15839: scene=B_5
#: B_5:199
msgctxt "text_id=15839 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いかにルーンが神代の技術であったとしても、悲しいかな、歴史の影に埋もれた魔術。"
msgstr "  Conversely, despite having roots dating back to the Age of Gods, runes had unfortunately been lost to time."

#. Occurrence B_5:205:15840: scene=B_5
#: B_5:205
msgctxt "text_id=15840 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "一度死んだモノを、その都度、起こして利用しているにすぎない。"
msgstr "Rune magecraft was little more than an attempt to revive and use a dead art."

#. Occurrence B_5:264:15841: scene=B_5
#: B_5:264
msgctxt "text_id=15841 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、橋の巨人、童話の怪物たちは違う。"
msgstr "  However, monsters from fairy tales, like the troll, were different;"

#. Occurrence B_5:269:15842: scene=B_5
#: B_5:269
msgctxt "text_id=15842 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼等は今も、久遠寺有珠の手の中で生きている。"
msgstr "  they lived on in the hands of Alice Kuonji."

#. Occurrence B_5:274:15843: scene=B_5
#: B_5:274
msgctxt "text_id=15843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　千年以上も前に詠唱され、今も機能し続ける魔術は、世界広しと言えど有珠のプロイと他に二つあるかないか。"
msgstr "  The magical world was vast, but one could probably count on one hand the number of magecraft that still functioned after being chanted into existence a millennia ago, as Alice's Ploys did."

#. Occurrence B_5:294:15844: scene=B_5
#: B_5:294
msgctxt "text_id=15844 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、ルーン魔術を扱う橙子の年齢は二十年程度。"
msgstr "  In contrast, Touko the rune-user was only about two decades old."

#. Occurrence B_5:299:15845: scene=B_5
#: B_5:299
msgctxt "text_id=15845 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ルーンを<刻|きざ>む時間にいたっては一瞬だ。"
msgstr "  Carving a rune took only a moment."

#. Occurrence B_5:304:15846: scene=B_5
#: B_5:304
msgctxt "text_id=15846 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の故郷、その象徴の一つであるロンドン橋の擬人化を敗れる道理がない。"
msgstr "  There was no way a quick spell could defeat the personification of London Bridge in Alice's homeland."

#. Occurrence B_5:339:15847: scene=B_5
#: B_5:339
msgctxt "text_id=15847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが。"
msgstr "  That being said..."

#. Occurrence B_5:356:15848: scene=B_5
#: B_5:356
msgctxt "text_id=15848 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこに、“童話の怪物”を上回る怪物が現れた。"
msgstr "  A beast had appeared that surpassed even those from fairy tales:"

#. Occurrence B_5:361:15849: scene=B_5
#: B_5:361
msgctxt "text_id=15849 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　黄金の獣、ベオウルフ。"
msgstr "  Beowulf, the Golden Beast."

#. Occurrence B_5:366:15850: scene=B_5
#: B_5:366
msgctxt "text_id=15850 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橋の巨人とは比べるべくもない、小さく非力な狼は、<果敢|かかん>にも天を<覆|おお>う石くれに立ち向かった。"
msgstr "  It seemed absurd to compare a small and relatively powerless wolf to a towering stone giant."

#. Occurrence B_5:399:15851: scene=B_5
#: B_5:399
msgctxt "text_id=15851 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大地を揺るがす巨人の一撃。"
msgstr "  The Thames Troll's attacks were earth-quaking."

#. Occurrence B_5:404:15852: scene=B_5
#: B_5:404
msgctxt "text_id=15852 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　直撃すれば<ぺしゃんこ|ペースト>に、"
msgstr "  A direct hit from its 50-ton strikes would smash anything to paste,"

#. Occurrence B_5:409:15853: scene=B_5
#: B_5:409
msgctxt "text_id=15853 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かするだけでも<挽肉|ミンチ>になる50トンの衝撃。"
msgstr "  while a glancing blow would still create mincemeat."

#. Occurrence B_5:414:15854: scene=B_5
#: B_5:414
msgctxt "text_id=15854 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを狼は、真っ正面から<食|・><い|・><破|・><っ|・><た|・>。"
msgstr "  And yet, the beast had attacked head-on and torn right through it."

#. Occurrence B_5:513:15855: scene=B_5
#: B_5:513
msgctxt "text_id=15855 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　毛並みが逆立つ。"
msgstr "  The wolf's fur bristled,"

#. Occurrence B_5:518:15856: scene=B_5
#: B_5:518
msgctxt "text_id=15856 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その容姿が、流体のように変貌する。"
msgstr "  and the creature metamorphosed like liquid."

#. Occurrence B_5:523:15857: scene=B_5
#: B_5:523
msgctxt "text_id=15857 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりにも<荘厳|そうごん>な立ち振る舞い。"
msgstr "  It was a breathtaking display."

#. Occurrence B_5:528:15858: scene=B_5
#: B_5:528
msgctxt "text_id=15858 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　金狼は歓びを示すように月に吠え、文字通り、金色の光となって<爆|は>ぜ<走|ばし>る。"
msgstr "  The wolf howled at the moon, as if in joy, and streaked forth like a bolt of golden light."

#. Occurrence B_5:571:15859: scene=B_5
#: B_5:571
msgctxt "text_id=15859 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はたして、勝負は一撃で終わった。"
msgstr "  In an instant, the duel was decided."

#. Occurrence B_5:595:15860: scene=B_5
#: B_5:595
msgctxt "text_id=15860 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　光の槍と化した獣は巨人の胸板まで飛びかかり、その心臓に牙をたてながら<爆|・><発|・>したのだ。"
msgstr "  The radiant spear of a wolf flew straight through the giant's chest and sank its teeth into its heart. The troll exploded."

#. Occurrence B_5:643:15861: scene=B_5
#: B_5:643
msgctxt "text_id=15861 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はじけ飛ぶ石の筋肉。"
msgstr "  Chunks of stony muscle rained down."

#. Occurrence B_5:671:15862: scene=B_5
#: B_5:671
msgctxt "text_id=15862 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　拡散する光の毛並み。"
msgstr "  Luminous fur scattered in the wind."

#. Occurrence B_5:719:15863: scene=B_5
#: B_5:719
msgctxt "text_id=15863 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二つの神秘は<痕跡|こんせき>なく爆散し、収束した。"
msgstr "  Two Mystics dispersed without a trace, and returned from whence they came."

#. Occurrence B_5:725:15864: scene=B_5
#: B_5:725
msgctxt "text_id=15864 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……その、神話の再現のような<終|つい>に。"
msgstr "  The curtain fell on a battle straight out of mythology."

#. Occurrence B_5:730:15865: scene=B_5
#: B_5:730
msgctxt "text_id=15865 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　土塊となって崩れ落ちた“童話の怪物”の中心に、"
msgstr "  There among the rubble of the fairy-tale monster..."

#. Occurrence B_5:806:15866: scene=B_5
#: B_5:806
msgctxt "text_id=15866 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　燃え上がる炎のような、金狼の姿があった。"
msgstr "  was the Golden Wolf, standing like a flame."

#. Occurrence B_5:866:15867: scene=B_5
#: B_5:866
msgctxt "text_id=15867 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その後の出来事は、もはや戦いですらない。"
msgstr "  What came after could barely be described as a battle;"

#. Occurrence B_5:871:15868: scene=B_5
#: B_5:871
msgctxt "text_id=15868 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　単なる敗残兵の処理だ。"
msgstr "  it was more like the slaughter of defeated pawns."

#. Occurrence B_5:876:15869: scene=B_5
#: B_5:876
msgctxt "text_id=15869 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　金狼は有珠に飛びかかり、たやすく腹を引き裂いた。"
msgstr "  The wolf leapt on Alice, disemboweling her with ease."

#. Occurrence B_5:881:15870: scene=B_5
#: B_5:881
msgctxt "text_id=15870 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠のコートに<編|あ>まれた守りの呪文なぞ、金狼にとって蜘蛛の巣と変わらない。"
msgstr "  Its claws cut through the protective wards on Alice's coat like a hot knife through butter."

#. Occurrence B_5:915:15871: scene=B_5
#: B_5:915
msgctxt "text_id=15871 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　金の狼。"
msgstr "  The Golden Wolf-"

#. Occurrence B_5:920:15872: scene=B_5
#: B_5:920
msgctxt "text_id=15872 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人語を解するアレは、<人狼|ウェアウルフ>と呼ばれる魔獣に違いない。"
msgstr "  this wolf which understood human speech could only be the magical creature known as the werewolf."

#. Occurrence B_5:925:15873: scene=B_5
#: B_5:925
msgctxt "text_id=15873 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　捏造され流布された怪物の王、“吸血鬼”より遥かに古い起源を持つ、西欧の“森の人”。"
msgstr "  Werewolves were the forest people of western Europe, with origins far more ancient than the fabricated vampire legends of the continent."

#. Occurrence B_5:931:15874: scene=B_5
#: B_5:931
msgctxt "text_id=15874 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし―――彼らの基準に、黄金の毛並みは存在しない。"
msgstr "  However, none were known to have golden coats."

#. Occurrence B_5:961:15875: scene=B_5
#: B_5:961
msgctxt "text_id=15875 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼の社会において、最高位の血統は銀色と言われている。"
msgstr "  It was said that the most elite werewolf bloodlines boasted silver fur."

#. Occurrence B_5:966:15876: scene=B_5
#: B_5:966
msgctxt "text_id=15876 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　銀の人狼は一族の長であり、その階位は魔獣より上、幻獣の域とされる。"
msgstr "  Silver werewolves were pack leaders, and werewolves of that caliber were considered Phantasmal, rather than merely magical creatures."

#. Occurrence B_5:971:15877: scene=B_5
#: B_5:971
msgctxt "text_id=15877 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを上回る金色となると、もはや人智の及ぶものではない。"
msgstr "  But a golden werewolf was superior even to that, and so transcended human knowledge."

#. Occurrence B_5:1003:15878: scene=B_5
#: B_5:1003
msgctxt "text_id=15878 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺有珠の“童話の怪物”は、人の手によって作られた究極の神秘だ。"
msgstr "  Alice Kuonji's Ploys were among the ultimate Mystics to have been created by humankind."

#. Occurrence B_5:1008:15879: scene=B_5
#: B_5:1008
msgctxt "text_id=15879 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だがあの金狼は、星の手によって産み落とされた神秘。"
msgstr "  Therefore, the Golden Wolf could only have been a Mystic born of the planet."

#. Occurrence B_5:1013:15880: scene=B_5
#: B_5:1013
msgctxt "text_id=15880 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<生命|ほし>が何千年何万年と活動した末、<希|まれ>にこぼれ落ちる奇跡のような<一滴|ひとしずく>。"
msgstr "  When a celestial body has been active for millions, even billions of years, occasionally a miraculous droplet of Creation spills over into our current world."

#. Occurrence B_5:1062:15881: scene=B_5
#: B_5:1062
msgctxt "text_id=15881 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おそらく、身にまとった神秘は三千年以上。"
msgstr "  This Mystic had to be over three thousand years old."

#. Occurrence B_5:1067:15882: scene=B_5
#: B_5:1067
msgctxt "text_id=15882 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人間の魔術師―――"
msgstr "  A human mage-"

#. Occurrence B_5:1072:15883: scene=B_5
#: B_5:1072
msgctxt "text_id=15883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、現在の魔術基盤に生きる魔術師であるかぎり、あの金狼を倒す魔術は、理論上<編|あ>みだせない。"
msgstr "  no, any mage living in the current magical paradigm would be helpless against the Golden Wolf. Not even in theory would they stand a chance of defeating it."

#. Occurrence B_5:1078:15884: scene=B_5
#: B_5:1078
msgctxt "text_id=15884 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それは即ち、蒼崎青子と久遠寺有珠にとって、カレが最悪の敵である事を示していた。"
msgstr "  ...Which meant that this werewolf was Aoko and Alice's worst nightmare."

#. Occurrence B_6:53:15885: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:53
msgctxt "text_id=15885 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――そう。"
msgstr "\"...I see."

#. Occurrence B_6:60:15886: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:60
msgctxt "text_id=15886 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "有珠がお手上げの相手だものね、私がどうにかできる筈もなかったワケだ。"
msgstr "If it was too much even for you, Alice, I never would've stood a chance."

#. Occurrence B_6:77:15887: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:77
msgctxt "text_id=15887 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……でも、要は魔術でなければいいのよね？"
msgstr "  ...But that means non-magical attacks should work on it, right?"

#. Occurrence B_6:83:15888: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:83
msgctxt "text_id=15888 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　テムズの動力は魔力だけど、テムズの<攻撃|パンチ>は純粋な衝撃でしょ？　当たりさえすればペシャンコじゃないの？」"
msgstr "  Thames is powered by magical energy, but isn't its punch just raw force? One hit and it's game over.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:118:15889: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:118
msgctxt "text_id=15889 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……残念だけど。"
msgstr "\"It's not that simple, unfortunately."

#. Occurrence B_6:125:15890: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:125
msgctxt "text_id=15890 | speaker=alice"
msgid "アレ、基本は狼の姿なだけで、状況によってカタチを変えるわ。テムズの腕を受け止めた時は<大猿|おおざる>みたいになっていたし。"
msgstr "His base form was a wolf, but he can transform to adapt to the situation. He took Thames' punch by turning into a giant ape-like thing."

#. Occurrence B_6:136:15891: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:136
msgctxt "text_id=15891 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　機関銃やロケットで狙っても<躱|かわ>されるか、体の硬い生き物に変化して防ぐんじゃないかしら」"
msgstr "  Even if we used a machine gun or a rocket launcher, he could probably transform into something to defend himself.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:171:15892: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:171
msgctxt "text_id=15892 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……地球上の生き物なら、何にでも変われるってコトか。"
msgstr "\"...So he can turn into any living creature."

#. Occurrence B_6:188:15893: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:188
msgctxt "text_id=15893 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　でもまあ、質量までは無理かな？"
msgstr "  What about his mass? He can't change that, can he?"

#. Occurrence B_6:194:15894: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:194
msgctxt "text_id=15894 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　基本は二メートル大の生物の、いいトコどりってあたりで勘弁してほしいわね。"
msgstr "  Ugh. Why'd he have to be well over six feet tall on top of all his other strengths?"

#. Occurrence B_6:228:15895: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:228
msgctxt "text_id=15895 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ね。すごく関係ないけど、深海の生き物に変わられたら、ちょっと怖いと思わない？」"
msgstr "  Random question, but what if he could turn into a sea creature? That'd be just awful.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:248:15896: scene=B_6
#: B_6:248
msgctxt "text_id=15896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんというか視覚的に、とぼやく青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko narrowed her eyes as she bemoaned this creature's existence."

#. Occurrence B_6:266:15897: scene=B_6
#: B_6:266
msgctxt "text_id=15897 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　話しているうちに闘志が湧いたのか、<虚|うつ>ろだった思考も、焦点の定まっていなかった瞳も、完全に元の彼女に戻っている。"
msgstr "  The conversation appeared to have revived her fighting spirit. Once again, her eyes were focused and her thoughts clear; Aoko was back to her usual self."

#. Occurrence B_6:287:15898: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:287
msgctxt "text_id=15898 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「で、その後は？　有珠、うまく逃げられたの？」"
msgstr "\"So what happened next? Were you able to escape?\""

#. Occurrence B_6:313:15899: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:313
msgctxt "text_id=15899 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……いいえ。わたしもあの狼にやられたわ」"
msgstr "\"No. The wolf had its way with me next.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:319:15900: scene=B_6
#: B_6:319
msgctxt "text_id=15900 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は金狼に押し倒されてからの事を報告した。"
msgstr "  Alice explained how the wolf had pinned her to the ground."

#. Occurrence B_6:324:15901: scene=B_6
#: B_6:324
msgctxt "text_id=15901 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　余談ではあるが、草十郎に関するコトは大幅に短縮されていた。"
msgstr "  Incidentally, she kept the part about Soujyuro rather short."

#. Occurrence B_6:330:15902: scene=B_6
#: B_6:330
msgctxt "text_id=15902 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "彼との出来事を青子に語らなかった理由は、有珠自身、不思議に思うほど不明だった。"
msgstr "Alice herself was not entirely sure why she felt it necessary to leave most of that information out."

#. Occurrence B_6:362:15903: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:362
msgctxt "text_id=15903 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ふーん……有珠の相手をした後、休む間もなく私の所に来たワケか。"
msgstr "\"Hmm. So Touko came straight to me after fighting you."

#. Occurrence B_6:376:15904: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:376
msgctxt "text_id=15904 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　初めから昨日で決着をつけるつもりだったんだ、姉貴。"
msgstr "  That was your plan, sis-you wanted to end this all yesterday."

#. Occurrence B_6:382:15905: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:382
msgctxt "text_id=15905 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……姉妹かな、ここぞって時のタイミングは一緒だったの、忘れてた……」"
msgstr "  It was my mistake for forgetting... We always did have a habit of having the same thought at the same time.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:408:15906: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:408
msgctxt "text_id=15906 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「切札は、見せたからには敵を殲滅しなくちゃいけない。"
msgstr "\"Once you reveal your hand to the enemy, you have to take them out."

#. Occurrence B_6:414:15907: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:414
msgctxt "text_id=15907 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　姉貴は支点を残り二つにしておいて、自分の正体を告げて、こっちの戦力を分けさせた。"
msgstr "  She waited until she was down to the last two sigils to reveal herself and divide our strength."

#. Occurrence B_6:420:15908: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:420
msgctxt "text_id=15908 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……その時点で奥の手を投入してくるコトは覚悟してたけど、まさか人狼なんてキワモノとはね」"
msgstr "  I knew she'd do something like that, but I never imagined she'd have a freakin' werewolf with her.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:460:15909: scene=B_6
#: B_6:460
msgctxt "text_id=15909 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はあ、と重いため息をつく。"
msgstr "  Aoko let out a heavy sigh."

#. Occurrence B_6:465:15910: scene=B_6
#: B_6:465
msgctxt "text_id=15910 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこは有珠も同感らしく、小さく頷いていた。"
msgstr "  Alice nodded slightly in agreement."

#. Occurrence B_6:494:15911: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:494
msgctxt "text_id=15911 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……それはそれとして、草十郎が有珠を助けに行くなんてね。感謝しなくちゃいけないんだろうけど、莫迦な真似してくれたわ。"
msgstr "\"...Anyway, I can't believe Soujyuro came to your rescue. I know I should be grateful, but he's such an idiot."

#. Occurrence B_6:511:15912: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:511
msgctxt "text_id=15912 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私が橙子の立場なら、報復の可能性はひとつ残らず排除する。"
msgstr "  If I was in Touko's shoes, I'd be tying up any loose ends."

#. Occurrence B_6:518:15913: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:518
msgctxt "text_id=15913 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "私たちがどうにかなった後、猫の手首ひねるみたいに片付けられるわよ、あいつ」"
msgstr "After dealing with us, wiping him out should have been a piece of cake.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:550:15914: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:550
msgctxt "text_id=15914 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「静希君なら、こちらで保護してもらってるけど」"
msgstr "\"Sizuki is under this church's protection now.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:568:15915: scene=B_6
#: B_6:568
msgctxt "text_id=15915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の言葉に、青子はえっと目を驚かせた。"
msgstr "  Aoko's eyes widened."

#. Occurrence B_6:589:15916: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:589
msgctxt "text_id=15916 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「うわ、どういう風の吹き回し？"
msgstr "\"What? Am I hearing things?"

#. Occurrence B_6:606:15917: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:606
msgctxt "text_id=15917 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　有珠があいつの世話を焼くなんて」"
msgstr "  You actually went out of your way to protect him?\""

#. Occurrence B_6:612:15918: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:612
msgctxt "text_id=15918 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……だって。放っておいたら、青子が怒ると思って」"
msgstr "\"I was thinking of you. We wouldn't want you getting angry, now, would we?\""

#. Occurrence B_6:647:15919: scene=B_6
#: B_6:647
msgctxt "text_id=15919 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　瞳を閉じたまま有珠は答える。"
msgstr "  Alice responded with her eyes closed."

#. Occurrence B_6:652:15920: scene=B_6
#: B_6:652
msgctxt "text_id=15920 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに嫌そうな顔をして、青子は口を閉ざした。"
msgstr "  Aoko frowned in silent indignation,"

#. Occurrence B_6:657:15921: scene=B_6
#: B_6:657
msgctxt "text_id=15921 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんでそうなるのよ、と声にならない抗議をするように。"
msgstr "  as if she wanted to protest where Alice got *that* idea from."

#. Occurrence B_6:707:15922: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:707
msgctxt "text_id=15922 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ま、いいけど。それじゃ今ここにいるんだ、草十郎。姿が見えないけど、どうしたの？」"
msgstr "\"...Well, whatever. He's here now, I assume. But where?\""

#. Occurrence B_6:713:15923: scene=B_6
#: B_6:713
msgctxt "text_id=15923 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まだ首は動かせないのか、青子は視線だけで部屋を見回した。"
msgstr "  Still unable to move her neck, she looked around as best she could."

#. Occurrence B_6:748:15924: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:748
msgctxt "text_id=15924 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「彼なら気分を悪くして倒れたわ。今は詠梨神父の寝室を借りているけど」"
msgstr "\"He collapsed, so he's resting in Father Eiri's bedroom.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:787:15925: scene=B_6
#: B_6:787
msgctxt "text_id=15925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　倒れた、という言葉に青子は目を光らせる。"
msgstr "  Aoko furrowed her brow at \"collapsed.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:792:15926: scene=B_6
#: B_6:792
msgctxt "text_id=15926 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　では、ここに保護されたのはいいが、それでも橙子の行動が一歩早く、草十郎が始末されたのか―――？"
msgstr "  Sure, he was under the church's protection, but had Touko set the wheels in motion for his death?"

#. Occurrence B_6:799:15927: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:799
msgctxt "text_id=15927 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……何があったの、一体……？」"
msgstr "\"What exactly happened to him?\""

#. Occurrence B_6:832:15928: scene=B_6
#: B_6:832
msgctxt "text_id=15928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　真剣に問う青子に、有珠はしばし黙ってから、やや気を遣って、"
msgstr "  Alice paused for a moment before carefully answering the question."

#. Occurrence B_6:845:15929: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:845
msgctxt "text_id=15929 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「それが。"
msgstr "\"Well,"

#. Occurrence B_6:852:15930: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:852
msgctxt "text_id=15930 | speaker=alice"
msgid "彼、あなたを見て<嘔吐|おうと>したの」"
msgstr " when he saw you, he vomited.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:892:15931: scene=B_6
#: B_6:892
msgctxt "text_id=15931 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　きっぱりと、身も<蓋|ふた>もない真実を口にした。"
msgstr "  She had decided to be blunt."

#. Occurrence B_6:928:15932: scene=B_6
#: B_6:928
msgctxt "text_id=15932 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はちょっと、声もない。"
msgstr "  Aoko was taken aback."

#. Occurrence B_6:933:15933: scene=B_6
#: B_6:933
msgctxt "text_id=15933 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　窓から差しこむ日射しに照らされること数秒。"
msgstr "  For several seconds, dim sunlight leaked through the window."

#. Occurrence B_6:938:15934: scene=B_6
#: B_6:938
msgctxt "text_id=15934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はようやく言語中枢を回復させて呟いた。"
msgstr "  Once she had found her voice again, she muttered,"

#. Occurrence B_6:969:15935: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:969
msgctxt "text_id=15935 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……いいけど。ひどい侮辱よね、それって」"
msgstr "\"...Whatever. That's kind of rude, though.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:975:15936: scene=B_6
#: B_6:975
msgctxt "text_id=15936 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな青子の仕草がおかしかったのか、一晩かけての看病の緊張がほぐれたのか、有珠はクスリと小さく笑った。"
msgstr "  Perhaps amused, or perhaps exhausted from staying up all night, Alice cracked a tiny giggle."

#. Occurrence B_6:1001:15937: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0023; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1001
msgctxt "text_id=15937 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なによ。そんなにおかしい、有珠？」"
msgstr "\"Alice! What's so funny?!\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1034:15938: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1034
msgctxt "text_id=15938 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「さあ、どうかしらね。けど、静希君にも言い分はあるでしょう。今の貴女、とても見られたものじゃないわ」"
msgstr "\"Oh, nothing. Sizuki had his reasons, I'm sure. You were in a bad state, Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1071:15939: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1071
msgctxt "text_id=15939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言われて、青子は自分の体を観察した。"
msgstr "  Aoko appraised her physical state."

#. Occurrence B_6:1076:15940: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1076
msgctxt "text_id=15940 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一枚布の患者衣。"
msgstr "  She was dressed in a hospital gown."

#. Occurrence B_6:1081:15941: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1081
msgctxt "text_id=15941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　肌の露出より包帯の方が多いし、右足はギプスがあてられている。"
msgstr "  Bandages covered the majority of her body; her right leg was in a plaster cast."

#. Occurrence B_6:1087:15942: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1087
msgctxt "text_id=15942 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　右手は動くので、包帯に巻かれた指で青子は自分の喉元に触れてみた。"
msgstr "  Since she could move her right arm, she brought her bandaged fingers up to her throat."

#. Occurrence B_6:1110:15943: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0024; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1110
msgctxt "text_id=15943 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そっか……思い出した。あのガキ、まず私の首元に噛み付いたんだっけ。"
msgstr "\"Oh yeah... I remember now. That little shit bit my neck."

#. Occurrence B_6:1116:15944: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0025; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1116
msgctxt "text_id=15944 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　すごかったわよ、首が噛み砕かれるのって。ゴキンって音が頭の中に響いて、気持ち悪いったらなかったわ。"
msgstr "  It was crazy, being torn to pieces like that. I even heard my neck snapping. 'Gross' doesn't do the feeling justice."

#. Occurrence B_6:1122:15945: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0026; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1122
msgctxt "text_id=15945 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……ちっ。あそこから好き勝手やられたもんだから、つい忘れてた」"
msgstr "  ...Dammit. He played with me like some kind of chew toy. I almost wish I could forget.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1144:15946: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1144
msgctxt "text_id=15946 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　口調は明るいものの、青子の目は明るくはない。"
msgstr "  Aoko sounded upbeat, but the look in her eyes was anything but."

#. Occurrence B_6:1149:15947: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1149
msgctxt "text_id=15947 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……彼女の全身は、ご丁寧に“死なない”程度に壊されていた。"
msgstr "  She had been torn to pieces, but her life had been \"mercifully\" spared."

#. Occurrence B_6:1154:15948: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1154
msgctxt "text_id=15948 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　切断面は一切ない。"
msgstr "  At least she hadn't been dismembered."

#. Occurrence B_6:1159:15949: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1159
msgctxt "text_id=15949 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　基本的には噛みつかれてからの打撲、骨折だ。"
msgstr "  She had been bitten, beaten, and her bones broken."

#. Occurrence B_6:1179:15950: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1179
msgctxt "text_id=15950 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の体には蒼崎の秘術がつまった魔術刻印がある。"
msgstr "  Magic Crests containing the Aozakis' secret arts decorated her body."

#. Occurrence B_6:1184:15951: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1184
msgctxt "text_id=15951 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　仮に<脊椎|せきつい>を折られようが、青子自身がまだ生きているのなら、刻印が無理矢理にでも青子を生かす。"
msgstr "  Even if her spine was broken, as long as her body was alive, the crests would piece it back together."

#. Occurrence B_6:1189:15952: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1189
msgctxt "text_id=15952 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……少しは刻印からの麻酔が働いたにせよ、この痛みの恨みは金狼を百回殺しても余りある。"
msgstr "  Despite the crests easing the pain a little, she still hurt enough to want to kill that wolf a hundred times over."

#. Occurrence B_6:1236:15953: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0027; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1236
msgctxt "text_id=15953 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……支点は全部壊された。"
msgstr "\"...If all sigils have been broken,"

#. Occurrence B_6:1242:15954: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0028; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1242
msgctxt "text_id=15954 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　これで三咲市の霊脈はフリーってワケね。"
msgstr "  Misaki City's leylines are wide open."

#. Occurrence B_6:1248:15955: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0029; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1248
msgctxt "text_id=15955 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　全容を把握してるのはうちらだけの特権だったけど、橙子は昔から知ってる以上、解析の手間もいらない、と。"
msgstr "  We thought we had the edge of having the big picture of the area, but if Touko's known for awhile, then she's a step ahead of us."

#. Occurrence B_6:1281:15956: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0030; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1281
msgctxt "text_id=15956 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　―――真剣な話、所有権の書き換えまで何時間かかると思う？」"
msgstr "  Let's be real. How long do you think it'll take her to transfer dominion rights?\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1316:15957: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1316
msgctxt "text_id=15957 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「橙子さんなら二日かからないでしょうね。"
msgstr "\"For Touko, it won't even take her two days."

#. Occurrence B_6:1322:15958: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1322
msgctxt "text_id=15958 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　支点の修復は土地そのものに任せるしかない。"
msgstr "  She has no choice but to wait for the land itself to restore the sigils."

#. Occurrence B_6:1333:15959: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1333
msgctxt "text_id=15959 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　支点の<防護陣|プロテクト>が治る頃には、この町はもう彼女の物よ」"
msgstr "  By the time the defenses are in working order again, this town will be as good as hers.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1366:15960: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0031; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1366
msgctxt "text_id=15960 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「明日の夜明けと共に破産する我が身とはねぇ。"
msgstr "\"So come tomorrow morning, I lose everything."

#. Occurrence B_6:1377:15961: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0032; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1377
msgctxt "text_id=15961 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それで有珠の方はどうなの？　まだいける？」"
msgstr "  What about you, Alice? Any fight left in you?\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1396:15962: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1396
msgctxt "text_id=15962 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「思考魔術だけなら、少しは。"
msgstr "\"I can manage a little bit of mental magecraft."

#. Occurrence B_6:1402:15963: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1402
msgctxt "text_id=15963 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　あとは小道具に頼る事になるでしょうね」"
msgstr "  After that, I'd be relying on trinkets.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1438:15964: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0033; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1438
msgctxt "text_id=15964 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……はあ。お話にならない、か」"
msgstr "\"...Hah. That won't cut it.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1481:15965: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1481
msgctxt "text_id=15965 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言って、青子は口を閉ざした。"
msgstr "  Aoko went silent again,"

#. Occurrence B_6:1486:15966: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1486
msgctxt "text_id=15966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　瞳はまっすぐに天井を睨んでいる。"
msgstr "  staring straight at the ceiling."

#. Occurrence B_6:1491:15967: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1491
msgctxt "text_id=15967 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこにどんな決意がこめられているのか、有珠はよく分かっていた。"
msgstr "  Alice knew all too well what that look meant."

#. Occurrence B_6:1512:15968: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1512
msgctxt "text_id=15968 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「それでもやるんでしょう、青子は」"
msgstr "\"You're still planning on fighting, aren't you, Aoko?\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1518:15969: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0034; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1518
msgctxt "text_id=15969 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「まあね。私、<諦|あきら>めるのってできないから。"
msgstr "\"Can you blame me? It's not like I can give up."

#. Occurrence B_6:1524:15970: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0035; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1524
msgctxt "text_id=15970 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……で、そういう有珠はどうなのよ」"
msgstr "  ...What about you?\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1530:15971: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1530
msgctxt "text_id=15971 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「わたしは、一度自分の物になった物は、決して人には渡さない」"
msgstr "\"Once something is mine, it stays mine.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1563:15972: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1563
msgctxt "text_id=15972 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　短い返答に、青子はそうだった、と呟く。"
msgstr "  Aoko muttered in agreement to Alice's terse response."

#. Occurrence B_6:1568:15973: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1568
msgctxt "text_id=15973 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の、自分の物に対する執着心は青子でさえ薄ら寒くなるほどなのだ。"
msgstr "  Alice's intense attachment to her possessions was enough to make even Aoko shiver."

#. Occurrence B_6:1588:15974: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1588
msgctxt "text_id=15974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の物になったモノは手放さない―――それは転じて、裏切りは決して許さない、少女の潔癖さの証でもある。"
msgstr "  \"Once something is mine, it stays mine.\" To take it step further, betrayal was an unforgivable sin. This personal motto was further proof of her uncompromising nature."

#. Occurrence B_6:1609:15975: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0036; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1609
msgctxt "text_id=15975 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「オッケー、決まりね。"
msgstr "\"Okay. That settles it then."

#. Occurrence B_6:1628:15976: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0037; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1628
msgctxt "text_id=15976 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　じゃ、悪いけどもう少し休ませて。今晩までにはなんとか動けるようにするから」"
msgstr "  I'm going to get some rest. Come hell or high water, I'll be ready by tonight.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1648:15977: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1648
msgctxt "text_id=15977 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手術を担当したシスターが聞けば、その無謀さに卒倒するだろう。"
msgstr "  If the nun who stitched her back together had heard that, she would have fainted."

#. Occurrence B_6:1653:15978: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1653
msgctxt "text_id=15978 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の青子は食事すら満足にできない。"
msgstr "  Aoko could barely even eat in her current condition."

#. Occurrence B_6:1660:15979: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1660
msgctxt "text_id=15979 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "それを承知していながら、"
msgstr "Even so,"

msgctxt "text_id=15980 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "有珠は頷いて立ち上がった。"
msgstr " Alice nodded and stood up."

#. Occurrence B_6:1676:15981: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1676
msgctxt "text_id=15981 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子がそう言うのなら、相棒として、有珠は彼女を信じるだけである。"
msgstr "  As Aoko's partner, she knew that once her mind was made up, she had to trust her."

#. Occurrence B_6:1696:15982: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1696
msgctxt "text_id=15982 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　黒衣の少女は無言で病室を後にする。"
msgstr "  Silently, the girl in black began to take her leave."

#. Occurrence B_6:1703:15983: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1703
msgctxt "text_id=15983 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「あ」"
msgstr "\"Oh.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1709:15984: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1709
msgctxt "text_id=15984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　と。ドアの前で、片手を自分の口元に当てて、唐突に立ち止まった。"
msgstr "  She stopped in front of the door, her hand to her mouth."

#. Occurrence B_6:1740:15985: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0038; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1740
msgctxt "text_id=15985 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「有珠？」"
msgstr "\"Alice?\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1745:15986: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1745
msgctxt "text_id=15986 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　また何かどうでもいいコトを思いついたな、と青子は面白がって呼びかける。"
msgstr "  Aoko was curious, suspecting that Alice had something silly to say again."

#. Occurrence B_6:1750:15987: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1750
msgctxt "text_id=15987 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど。"
msgstr "  Quite the contrary."

#. Occurrence B_6:1755:15988: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1755
msgctxt "text_id=15988 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　恥ずかしげに頬を染めるはずの有珠は、深い謎に突き当たったように眉をひそめていた。"
msgstr "  Instead of blushing, Alice furrowed her brow, like she was thinking over a difficult riddle."

#. Occurrence B_6:1793:15989: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0039; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1793
msgctxt "text_id=15989 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「有珠ー？」"
msgstr "\"Alice...? Hello...?\" "

#. Occurrence B_6:1798:15990: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1798
msgctxt "text_id=15990 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もしもーし、と青子は呼びかける。"
msgstr "  Aoko called out,"

#. Occurrence B_6:1803:15991: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1803
msgctxt "text_id=15991 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は振り向かず、扉に向いたまま、"
msgstr "  but Alice remained with her back to her roommate."

#. Occurrence B_6:1816:15992: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1816
msgctxt "text_id=15992 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――なんで、間に合ったのかしら」"
msgstr "\"How did he make it to me in time...?\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1821:15993: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1821
msgctxt "text_id=15993 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな、自問めいた声を漏らしていた。"
msgstr "  She spoke as if the words had accidentally burst out from her thoughts."

#. Occurrence B_6:1845:15994: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1845
msgctxt "text_id=15994 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の疑問は青子の知らないところでの出来事なので、当然、青子に分かるはずもない。"
msgstr "  Alice's question was about something Aoko could not possibly have guessed."

#. Occurrence B_6:1873:15995: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1873
msgctxt "text_id=15995 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……あの時もそう。"
msgstr "\"...It happened before, too."

#. Occurrence B_6:1879:15996: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1879
msgctxt "text_id=15996 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　わたしたち、始発で帰ってきたのに」"
msgstr "  Even though we took the first train back...\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1885:15997: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1885
msgctxt "text_id=15997 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぶつぶつとドアに向かって語りかける。"
msgstr "  She carried on mumbling at the door."

#. Occurrence B_6:1902:15998: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1902
msgctxt "text_id=15998 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……結局答えは出なかったのか、有珠は物憂げに、ドアノブに手をかけた。"
msgstr "  Unable to find an answer, Alice gloomily put her hand on the doorknob."

#. Occurrence B_6:1936:15999: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0040; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1936
msgctxt "text_id=15999 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……言いたくないなら別にいいけど。"
msgstr "\"If you don't want to say, it's fine,"

#. Occurrence B_6:1942:16000: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0041; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1942
msgctxt "text_id=16000 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　何がどうしたって言うのよ、有珠」"
msgstr "  but if you do, then spit it out already.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:1948:16001: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1948
msgctxt "text_id=16001 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背中越しの問いに、有珠は答えない。"
msgstr "  Alice did not respond."

#. Occurrence B_6:1954:16002: scene=B_6
#: B_6:1954
msgctxt "text_id=16002 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はドアを開けて部屋から出ると、去り際に一言だけ青子に告げた。"
msgstr "  She opened the door to leave the room, and left a few words hanging in the air:"

#. Occurrence B_6:1989:16003: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1989
msgctxt "text_id=16003 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……どうでもいいコトだけど。"
msgstr "\"...It might be nothing."

#. Occurrence B_6:1996:16004: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_B_6_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=B_6
#: B_6:1996
msgctxt "text_id=16004 | speaker=alice"
msgid "唯架さんには静希君は見えなかったそうよ、青子」"
msgstr "By the way, Yuika said she couldn't see Sizuki.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:2017:16005: scene=B_6
#: B_6:2017
msgctxt "text_id=16005 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ばたん、とドアは閉められた。"
msgstr "  The door closed with a thud."

#. Occurrence B_6:2057:16006: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_6_0042; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_6
#: B_6:2057
msgctxt "text_id=16006 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ふーん。そりゃまた珍しい」"
msgstr "\"Huh. That doesn't happen every day.\""

#. Occurrence B_6:2063:16007: scene=B_6
#: B_6:2063
msgctxt "text_id=16007 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は横になったまま、やや嬉しげに呟いた。"
msgstr "  Aoko mumbled to herself from her bed, seeming slightly happier."

#. Occurrence B_6:2092:16008: scene=B_6
#: B_6:2092
msgctxt "text_id=16008 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先天的に盲目だった<周|す><瀬|せ><唯架|ゆいか>は、感覚で物事をとらえる。"
msgstr "  Blind since birth, Yuika Suse saw the world through her other senses."

#. Occurrence B_6:2097:16009: scene=B_6
#: B_6:2097
msgctxt "text_id=16009 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　特に外敵、悪意のある者には敏感だ。"
msgstr "  She was especially sensitive to enemies, or those who bore ill will,"

#. Occurrence B_6:2102:16010: scene=B_6
#: B_6:2102
msgctxt "text_id=16010 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　基本、彼女はあらゆる人間を“脅威”として知覚する。"
msgstr "  and typically viewed almost everyone as a threat-"

#. Occurrence B_6:2107:16011: scene=B_6
#: B_6:2107
msgctxt "text_id=16011 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それがもっとも感じやすい気配なのだそうだ。"
msgstr "  presumably because that was the easiest thing to pick up on."

#. Occurrence B_6:2112:16012: scene=B_6
#: B_6:2112
msgctxt "text_id=16012 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな彼女に見えなかったという事は、草十郎は底抜けに害のない人間だと、太鼓判を<捺|お>されたようなものだった。"
msgstr "  So when she said she \"couldn't see Soujyuro,\" that meant he was completely harmless."

#. Occurrence B_7:53:16013: scene=B_7
#: B_7:53
msgctxt "text_id=16013 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　で。"
msgstr "  And then..."

#. Occurrence B_7:67:16014: scene=B_7
#: B_7:67
msgctxt "text_id=16014 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その害のない<某|なにがし>は、しばらくしてから病室にやってきた。"
msgstr "  That harmless individual decided to pay the small sickroom a visit."

#. Occurrence B_7:73:16015: scene=B_7
#: B_7:73
msgctxt "text_id=16015 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　貧血一歩手前の、まったく元気のない草十郎の顔にどっちが病人なんだか、と青子は内心呟いてみる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro looked like a stiff breeze could knock him over. It made Aoko wonder who the real patient was."

#. Occurrence B_7:94:16016: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:94
msgctxt "text_id=16016 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「何しにきたの、アンタ」"
msgstr "\"What do you want?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:125:16017: scene=B_7
#: B_7:125
msgctxt "text_id=16017 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はベッドに横になったまま、来訪者を突き放した。"
msgstr "  Though Aoko could barely move, she was still able to give him the cold shoulder."

#. Occurrence B_7:130:16018: scene=B_7
#: B_7:130
msgctxt "text_id=16018 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は弱り切った顔のまま、うん、などと意味不明の返答をする。"
msgstr "  His expression gaunt, Soujyuro grunted something or other, before beginning to speak more coherently."

#. Occurrence B_7:161:16019: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:161
msgctxt "text_id=16019 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「有珠が客間で眠ったから礼拝堂にいたんだけど。人が集まりだしたんで、こっちに逃げてきた」"
msgstr "\"Alice was sleeping in the guest room, and I was in the chapel. People started coming in, so I came here.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:167:16020: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:167
msgctxt "text_id=16020 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あ、礼拝の時間か……クリスマスだってのによくやるわ」"
msgstr "\"Ah, must be time to worship. It is Christmas.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:199:16021: scene=B_7
#: B_7:199
msgctxt "text_id=16021 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今日はクリスマスだが、ミサのピークは２４日までだ。"
msgstr "  It was indeed Christmas, but regular mass was on Christmas Eve."

#. Occurrence B_7:204:16022: scene=B_7
#: B_7:204
msgctxt "text_id=16022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　礼拝堂に集まっている人々はよほど信心深いのだろう。"
msgstr "  The ones gathering in the chapel must have been truly devout followers."

#. Occurrence B_7:209:16023: scene=B_7
#: B_7:209
msgctxt "text_id=16023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三咲町に住む外国人は少ない。"
msgstr "  Tourists were rare in Misaki, after all."

#. Occurrence B_7:214:16024: scene=B_7
#: B_7:214
msgctxt "text_id=16024 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、いないとさえ言っていい。礼拝堂に集まった人々は、ここ周辺の住人だ。"
msgstr "  So much so that almost no one visited the area this time of year. The worshippers must have been locals."

#. Occurrence B_7:246:16025: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:246
msgctxt "text_id=16025 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それで？　別にどうってコトないでしょ。探せば顔見知りもいるんじゃない？」"
msgstr "\"So? Why do you care? There might be someone there you know.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:254:16026: scene=B_7
#: B_7:254
msgctxt "text_id=16026 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも、なお冷たく青子は突っぱねる。"
msgstr "  Aoko was as distant as ever."

#. Occurrence B_7:259:16027: scene=B_7
#: B_7:259
msgctxt "text_id=16027 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先ほど有珠から聞いた『自分を見て吐いた』という事実は、いろんな意味で青子を意地悪にさせているようだ。"
msgstr "  She clearly had not forgotten the fact he had vomited when he saw her, and a hint of spite leaked into her voice."

#. Occurrence B_7:279:16028: scene=B_7
#: B_7:279
msgctxt "text_id=16028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もっとも、"
msgstr "  Then again..."

#. Occurrence B_7:304:16029: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:304
msgctxt "text_id=16029 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、ちょうどいい機会だから色々と聞きたくなって。"
msgstr "\"It's not that. I just thought it might be a good chance to ask you some things."

#. Occurrence B_7:311:16030: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:311
msgctxt "text_id=16030 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "少し、話をしていいかな」"
msgstr "Can we talk for a bit?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:317:16031: scene=B_7
#: B_7:317
msgctxt "text_id=16031 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はいつだって不機嫌なので、草十郎は彼女の微妙な変化に気付かなかった。"
msgstr "  Since Aoko was always in a bad mood, Soujyuro did not pick up on anything out of the ordinary. "

#. Occurrence B_7:354:16032: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:354
msgctxt "text_id=16032 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_7:360:16033: scene=B_7
#: B_7:360
msgctxt "text_id=16033 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子としては、その前に水でも飲んで自分の顔色の悪さをどうにかしろ、と言いたいのだが、草十郎に自覚はないようだ。"
msgstr "  She wanted to tell him to go drink some water because he looked ready to collapse, but he didn't seem aware of his own condition."

#. Occurrence B_7:365:16034: scene=B_7
#: B_7:365
msgctxt "text_id=16034 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠曰く、本当にひどい状態だったから、血を見慣れていない男の子ならクラっときてもおかしくない、とのコトだが……。"
msgstr "  And to be fair to him, Alice did say Aoko was in bad shape. Given how unaccustomed to blood Soujyuro was, it was no wonder he had fainted."

#. Occurrence B_7:406:16035: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:406
msgctxt "text_id=16035 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ああ、そうか。"
msgstr "\"Oh... of course."

#. Occurrence B_7:412:16036: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:412
msgctxt "text_id=16036 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　話なんてまだ無理だな。すまない、出直してくる」"
msgstr "  You're probably still too injured to talk. Sorry, I'll come back later.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:430:16037: scene=B_7
#: B_7:430
msgctxt "text_id=16037 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　思案していた青子の様子から、“まだ話す体力もない”と誤解したらしい。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro seemed to have misunderstood Aoko being deep in thought as not having enough stamina to speak."

#. Occurrence B_7:435:16038: scene=B_7
#: B_7:435
msgctxt "text_id=16038 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはそれで、なんだか癪に障る青子だった。"
msgstr "  Naturally this did not sit well with Aoko."

#. Occurrence B_7:459:16039: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:459
msgctxt "text_id=16039 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「待ちなさいよ。話だけなら別にかまわないわ。やる気もて余してるし、暇つぶしがてらに相手してあげるわよ。"
msgstr "\"Hold it right there. If you came to talk, I can talk just fine. I've been cooped up in here, so I could use the distraction."

#. Occurrence B_7:465:16040: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:465
msgctxt "text_id=16040 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……まあ退屈しのぎにしてはちょっとグレード下がるけど、この際ぜいたく言ってられないし」"
msgstr "  ...Okay, so you're not the best distraction, but beggars can't be choosers.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:474:16041: scene=B_7
#: B_7:474
msgctxt "text_id=16041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんか散々な言われようだが、それなら、"
msgstr "  Soujyuro sensed this was going to be rough,"

msgctxt "text_id=16042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "と草十郎はベッド横の椅子に腰を下ろした。"
msgstr " but took a seat on the chair next to the bed."

#. Occurrence B_7:497:16043: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:497
msgctxt "text_id=16043 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「で。何が聞きたいの？」"
msgstr "\"So, what do you want to ask me?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:503:16044: scene=B_7
#: B_7:503
msgctxt "text_id=16044 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は患者衣の弱々しさを払拭するように、きびきびと声をあげる。"
msgstr "  Aoko spoke energetically in an attempt to distract from her weakened appearance."

#. Occurrence B_7:508:16045: scene=B_7
#: B_7:508
msgctxt "text_id=16045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どう見ても強がりなのに、そんな弱さは微塵も見せない。"
msgstr "  Naturally, she knew she was fooling no one."

#. Occurrence B_7:529:16046: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:529
msgctxt "text_id=16046 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――うん。やっぱり蒼崎は強いな。安心した」"
msgstr "\"You really are strong, Aozaki. I'm relieved to see that you're okay.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:568:16047: scene=B_7
#: B_7:568
msgctxt "text_id=16047 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　感服してうなずく草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro said, nodding in admiration."

#. Occurrence B_7:573:16048: scene=B_7
#: B_7:573
msgctxt "text_id=16048 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな賞賛の言葉に、青子は呆れた視線を向けた。"
msgstr "  Aoko shot him an unimpressed look in response to the unwanted praise."

#. Occurrence B_7:594:16049: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:594
msgctxt "text_id=16049 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……。"
msgstr "\"..."

#. Occurrence B_7:601:16050: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:601
msgctxt "text_id=16050 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "アンタって、ほんと、間が悪いわ」"
msgstr "Honestly, you have the worst timing.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:613:16051: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:613
msgctxt "text_id=16051 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「？」"
msgstr "\"?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:619:16052: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:619
msgctxt "text_id=16052 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いいわよ、別に。"
msgstr "\"Nothing. Forget it."

#. Occurrence B_7:625:16053: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:625
msgctxt "text_id=16053 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私の夢の話だから、そっちが気に病むことは―――」"
msgstr "  Just something from a dream. It's nothing to do with you.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:660:16054: scene=B_7
#: B_7:660
msgctxt "text_id=16054 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先ほどの夢を思いだして、つい苦い顔をする。"
msgstr "  She glowered, remembering."

#. Occurrence B_7:665:16055: scene=B_7
#: B_7:665
msgctxt "text_id=16055 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そういえば、<教会|ここ>には夢の登場人物がほぼ揃っているコトに気付き、苦い顔は本当に不機嫌な顔になってしまった。"
msgstr "  Come to think of it, almost everyone in her dream was here in the church, turning her dour expression into a irritated one."

#. Occurrence B_7:696:16056: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:696
msgctxt "text_id=16056 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「やめやめ、こんなつまんない話。聞きたい事があるならてっとり早く済ませちゃってよ、草十郎」"
msgstr "\"Enough about that. You said you had questions, so out with them.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:702:16057: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:702
msgctxt "text_id=16057 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「よかった。じゃあ、まず今の状況を聞かせてくれないか。"
msgstr "\"All right. Can you tell me what's going on?"

#. Occurrence B_7:708:16058: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:708
msgctxt "text_id=16058 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　橙子さんの話じゃ、俺も無関係じゃないそうだし」"
msgstr "  I mean with Touko. Now that I'm involved and all.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:742:16059: scene=B_7
#: B_7:742
msgctxt "text_id=16059 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　落ち着いて問いただす草十郎だが、その意味が本当に分かっているかどうか、青子には疑問である。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro spoke calmly, making Aoko wonder if he really understood the gravity of his situation."

#. Occurrence B_7:747:16060: scene=B_7
#: B_7:747
msgctxt "text_id=16060 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子に狙われている以上、自衛手段のない草十郎を誰かが守らなければいけない。"
msgstr "  He was Touko's enemy now; he was defenseless and needed protection."

#. Occurrence B_7:752:16061: scene=B_7
#: B_7:752
msgctxt "text_id=16061 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど青子にも有珠にもそんな余裕はないし、この教会だって、いつまで彼を保護してくれるか知れたものではない。"
msgstr "  Neither Aoko nor Alice could help him, and the Church could withdraw their sanctuary at any moment."

#. Occurrence B_7:772:16062: scene=B_7
#: B_7:772
msgctxt "text_id=16062 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<青子|じぶん>たちに味方した以上、橙子にとって草十郎は無関係どころか排斥対象である。"
msgstr "  He had picked a side, and that had turned him from innocent bystander into target."

#. Occurrence B_7:777:16063: scene=B_7
#: B_7:777
msgctxt "text_id=16063 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　質問の答えはそれだけだ。"
msgstr "  The answer he sought was as simple as that."

#. Occurrence B_7:782:16064: scene=B_7
#: B_7:782
msgctxt "text_id=16064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　現状を知ったところで、魔術師ではない草十郎には何も出来ない。"
msgstr "  He knew the facts: he was not a mage and was therefore powerless."

#. Occurrence B_7:803:16065: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:803
msgctxt "text_id=16065 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……まあ、それでも有珠は助けられたワケだし」"
msgstr "\"...I guess you did help Alice.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:821:16066: scene=B_7
#: B_7:821
msgctxt "text_id=16066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　借りはできてしまった。"
msgstr "  Aoko did owe him for that."

#. Occurrence B_7:826:16067: scene=B_7
#: B_7:826
msgctxt "text_id=16067 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その礼として、今までの経緯をまともに話すぐらいは筋ではないか、と青子は自分なりに納得する。"
msgstr "  To say thanks, she decided to at least give him the whole story up until now."

#. Occurrence B_7:858:16068: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:858
msgctxt "text_id=16068 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「よし、今までの経緯もふくめて軽く説明してみましょうか。"
msgstr "\"Okay, I'll quickly walk you through everything."

#. Occurrence B_7:864:16069: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:864
msgctxt "text_id=16069 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私も、なにか得る物があるかもしれないし」"
msgstr "  Y'know, maybe even I'll get something out of it.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:879:16070: scene=B_7
#: B_7:879
msgctxt "text_id=16070 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気を取り直して青子は語り始める。"
msgstr "  Aoko composed herself before beginning her explanation."

#. Occurrence B_7:884:16071: scene=B_7
#: B_7:884
msgctxt "text_id=16071 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　十一月の終わりから始まった戦い。"
msgstr "  The battle began at the end of November."

#. Occurrence B_7:889:16072: scene=B_7
#: B_7:889
msgctxt "text_id=16072 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希草十郎との出会いもふくめた、長かったけれど新鮮でもあった、一連の出来事を。"
msgstr "  A lot had happened since then, including meeting Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence B_7:935:16073: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:935
msgctxt "text_id=16073 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「事の起こりは一ヶ月前。"
msgstr "\"It all started a month ago,"

#. Occurrence B_7:941:16074: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:941
msgctxt "text_id=16074 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　三咲市に張られた結界のはじっこが、何者かに消されたのが発端だった。"
msgstr "  when the edge of the Bounded Field around Misaki City was taken down-"

#. Occurrence B_7:947:16075: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:947
msgctxt "text_id=16075 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私が後継ぎになってから五度目の、三咲市を狙う敵の登場ってワケ」"
msgstr "  the fifth time since I became successor. Misaki City was officially under attack.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:978:16076: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:978
msgctxt "text_id=16076 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「今回の敵は私たちとは直接戦わず、まず土地を奪うところから始めたわ。"
msgstr "\"This time, instead of attacking us directly, the enemy started by taking the land."

#. Occurrence B_7:984:16077: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:984
msgctxt "text_id=16077 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　今までのヤツは私たちを半人前と舐めていたから、たいていは真っ正面から仕掛けてきて、かってに有珠の猟犬の餌食になったんだけど、まあ、それはどうでもいいとして」"
msgstr "  Everyone that had come before her had been a bunch of amateurs all full of themselves, attacking us head-on. They all ended up as kibble for Alice's watchdog.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1005:16078: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1005
msgctxt "text_id=16078 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「町の結界には二種類あって、侵入者を見つけるものと、土地の力を有効利用するものがあるの。"
msgstr "\"Anyway, two types of Bounded Fields surround this area: one detects intruders; one siphons energy from the land."

#. Occurrence B_7:1011:16079: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1011
msgctxt "text_id=16079 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　敵が壊したのは土地の結界の方で、これが全部壊されると私や有珠は土地の所有権を失ってしまう。"
msgstr "  The enemy attacked the latter. If the entire field is destroyed, then Alice and I effectively lose our ownership of this land."

#. Occurrence B_7:1017:16080: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1017
msgctxt "text_id=16080 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　土地のないはぐれ魔術師と同じになっちゃうのよ」"
msgstr "  Without land, we become no different than rogue mages.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1038:16081: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0023; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1038
msgctxt "text_id=16081 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「勿論、そうならないように侵入者をあぶりだすための結界があるんだけど、こっちには何の反応もなかった。"
msgstr "\"Of course, we had another field set up to detect intruders, but it didn't do what it was supposed to."

#. Occurrence B_7:1044:16082: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0024; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1044
msgctxt "text_id=16082 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ま、当然よね。"
msgstr "  And now we know why."

#. Occurrence B_7:1050:16083: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0025; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1050
msgctxt "text_id=16083 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　今回の敵は私の姉貴、蒼崎橙子その人だったんだから」"
msgstr "  The enemy was my sister, Touko Aozaki.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1071:16084: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0026; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1071
msgctxt "text_id=16084 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「蒼崎の結界は同族である姉貴を敵と見なさなかった。"
msgstr "\"Aozaki Bounded Fields aren't going to recognize a fellow Aozaki as a threat."

#. Occurrence B_7:1077:16085: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0027; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1077
msgctxt "text_id=16085 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……あるいは、姉貴は結界の抜け道、構造の死角をついたのかもしれない。"
msgstr "  Alternatively, she may have just known about a blind spot and slipped in that way."

#. Occurrence B_7:1083:16086: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0028; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1083
msgctxt "text_id=16086 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　もともとうちの後継者はあの人だし、それぐらいの知識はあったでしょう」"
msgstr "  As the original successor, it's only natural she'd have that knowledge to begin with.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1104:16087: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0029; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1104
msgctxt "text_id=16087 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうして、姉貴は私たちに見つかる事なく好き勝手に結界の支点を壊しはじめた。"
msgstr "\"So, since she was invisible to us, she had free rein to break Bounded Field sigils."

#. Occurrence B_7:1110:16088: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0030; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1110
msgctxt "text_id=16088 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　時間をかけてゆっくり壊していったのは、“外からやってきた部外者”を演じていたからでしょうね。"
msgstr "  She deliberately attacked them slowly, one by one, to make us think it was an outsider."

#. Occurrence B_7:1116:16089: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0031; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1116
msgctxt "text_id=16089 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　さすがに連続して壊されれば、こっちも身内の犯行だと疑うし。うち、親戚である<浅葱|あさぎ>家とは仲悪いままだしさ」"
msgstr "  If she'd broken them all at once, I'd suspect it was one of my relatives, such as someone from the Asagi family.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1147:16090: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0032; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1147
msgctxt "text_id=16090 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……まあ、姉貴の芝居に騙された私たちが間抜けなんだけど、セオリーとして、結界崩しは長丁場になるものなの。"
msgstr "\"While we were stupid to fall for her little game, it's also possible it took her a long time to destroy the field."

#. Occurrence B_7:1153:16091: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0033; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1153
msgctxt "text_id=16091 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　管理地の結界は強固に作られているからね。普通は半年単位での攻防になる」"
msgstr "  Our fields are made of strong stuff. They typically last for six months.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1174:16092: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0034; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1174
msgctxt "text_id=16092 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「攻める側は、まず結界を<象|かたちど>る支点が何個あるか、それがどの五大要素でくくられているか、退去の正しい順序はどれか、それらを地道に解き明かしていく。"
msgstr "\"An enemy would need to figure out how many sigils supported the field, what elements comprise them, and the correct order to take them down."

#. Occurrence B_7:1180:16093: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0035; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1180
msgctxt "text_id=16093 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　もちろん、管理地の魔術師たちの目を盗みながら」"
msgstr "  All the while making sure the mage they belong to doesn't notice.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1201:16094: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0036; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1201
msgctxt "text_id=16094 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「対して、守る側は侵入者がいるコトに気づくから、悪さをされる前に敵の拠点を見つけだして、外敵を排除する。"
msgstr "\"If we did notice, we'd locate the intruder's base and eliminate them before any damage could be done."

#. Occurrence B_7:1207:16095: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0037; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1207
msgctxt "text_id=16095 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　こんな感じで、結界崩しは長期戦、あるいは前哨戦になるものなの。"
msgstr "  So, Bounded Fields are either broken during a drawn-out battle or preemptively before it even starts."

#. Occurrence B_7:1213:16096: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0038; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1213
msgctxt "text_id=16096 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　たいていは攻める側が支点を壊すぞとアピールして、土地の持ち主を<翻弄|ほんろう>、<疲弊|ひへい>させてから、魔術師同士の直接対決で決着がつくわ」"
msgstr "  Usually, the enemy threatens to break the sigils to lure the landowner out. Then things are settled there and then with a duel between mages.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1234:16097: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0039; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1234
msgctxt "text_id=16097 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なんで、結界を<全部|ぜんぶ>壊す必要はないのよ。"
msgstr "\"Doing that eliminates the need to completely destroy a field."

#. Occurrence B_7:1240:16098: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0040; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1240
msgctxt "text_id=16098 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　管理地の持ち主を始末した方が早いし、その後は術式さえ解読しちゃえば、土地を結界ごと横取りできる。"
msgstr "  It's much faster to take out the landowner and-as long as they can decipher the formula-seize the fields and land afterward."

#. Occurrence B_7:1246:16099: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0041; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1246
msgctxt "text_id=16099 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　わざわざ壊して作り直すより、昔からある結界の方が土地に馴染んでいて強力だしで一石二鳥でしょ」"
msgstr "  If you don't destroy the fields, you don't have to remake them. Besides, ones that have been in the land for years are stronger.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1266:16100: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1266
msgctxt "text_id=16100 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……そういった<定石|セオリー>から、青子たちは相手の思惑を読み違えてしまった。"
msgstr "  That was how Aoko and Alice were duped."

#. Occurrence B_7:1271:16101: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1271
msgctxt "text_id=16101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まさか相手が結界の支点をすべて壊すなど、そんな無駄な労力は割くまいとタカをくくっていたのだ。"
msgstr "  They never thought the enemy would waste the time and effort needed to break all sigils."

#. Occurrence B_7:1321:16102: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0042; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1321
msgctxt "text_id=16102 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「だから、私と有珠はとりあえず受けに回った。"
msgstr "\"That's why Alice and I went on the defensive."

#. Occurrence B_7:1327:16103: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0043; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1327
msgctxt "text_id=16103 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　支点を探すために街を調査している敵を待ち伏せて、これを片っ端から倒そうって。"
msgstr "  We figured we could surprise the enemy while they searched for the sigils; take them out one by one."

#. Occurrence B_7:1333:16104: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0044; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1333
msgctxt "text_id=16104 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　でも、そのうちの一つがケチのつき始めだった。"
msgstr "  But that's when things started to go south."

#. Occurrence B_7:1339:16105: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0045; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1339
msgctxt "text_id=16105 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　三咲町の公園でヤマはって待ち受けていた時、どうでもいい第三者が覗き見してやがったのよ」"
msgstr "  When a certain busybody saw something he shouldn't have at the local park.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1366:16106: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1366
msgctxt "text_id=16106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――そう。"
msgstr "  Indeed."

#. Occurrence B_7:1371:16107: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1371
msgctxt "text_id=16107 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術世界におけるトップクラスの<禁忌|タブー>。"
msgstr "  It was the ultimate taboo in the world of magecraft:"

#. Occurrence B_7:1376:16108: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1376
msgctxt "text_id=16108 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　関わりのない第三者に、魔術師であるコトを知られてしまったのである。"
msgstr "  The existence of mages must never be revealed to outsiders."

#. Occurrence B_7:1397:16109: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0046; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1397
msgctxt "text_id=16109 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「その後の事は分かるでしょう？"
msgstr "\"And you know the rest, right?"

#. Occurrence B_7:1429:16110: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0047; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1429
msgctxt "text_id=16110 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私は敵との小競り合いを有珠に任せて、それより重要な目撃者狩りに専念せざるを得なくなった。"
msgstr "  I had no choice but to leave our battle with the enemy to Alice, and devote my time to searching for the eye-witness."

#. Occurrence B_7:1446:16111: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0048; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1446
msgctxt "text_id=16111 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……言っとくけど、これはアンタの事だからね。そこでワレ<関|カン>セズ、みたいな顔しないこと」"
msgstr "  ...And in case you haven't realized, I'm talking about you, so don't give me a soppy look like you're surprised.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1482:16112: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1482
msgctxt "text_id=16112 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子にじろりと睨まれて、草十郎はそうなのか？　と目を見開いた。"
msgstr "  No sooner had Aoko said that, Soujyuro gave her that exact look."

#. Occurrence B_7:1487:16113: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1487
msgctxt "text_id=16113 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おとなしく話を聞いているものの、やはり、あまり理解していないようだ。"
msgstr "  Clearly, he had been listening, but not necessarily understanding."

#. Occurrence B_7:1519:16114: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0049; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1519
msgctxt "text_id=16114 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ま、いいけどね。草十郎がそんなだから秘密は漏れなかったんだし。"
msgstr "\"Whatever. It's water under the bridge. Actually, thanks to your cluelessness, our secret is still safe."

#. Occurrence B_7:1525:16115: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0050; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1525
msgctxt "text_id=16115 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　で、アンタっていう目撃者を消そうとした私の単独行動は、敵にしても都合のいいものだった」"
msgstr "  Anyway, the fact I went looking for you worked in the enemy's favor.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1571:16116: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0051; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1571
msgctxt "text_id=16116 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「強敵である有珠がいないんだから、敵はこれを機会に私を始末しようと、特注品の人形を差し向けた……"
msgstr "\"Alice was their biggest threat. With us separated, she could take me out. That's when she sent her special puppet."

#. Occurrence B_7:1577:16117: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0052; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1577
msgctxt "text_id=16117 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　と思っていたけど、アレはただの嫌がらせね、間違いなく。"
msgstr "  Or so I thought at the time. It turns out she only sent it to mess with me."

#. Occurrence B_7:1584:16118: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0053; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1584
msgctxt "text_id=16118 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "そうでなきゃ私そっくりの人形なんて派遣するかっての」"
msgstr "Otherwise why use a puppet that looked just like me?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1603:16119: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1603
msgctxt "text_id=16119 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ああ、あの青子人形、と相づちを打つ草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded, thinking back to the Aoko replica."

#. Occurrence B_7:1629:16120: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0054; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1629
msgctxt "text_id=16120 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「アレの事は忘れてちょうだい。"
msgstr "\"Remember, I'd prefer it if you forgot about that incident altogether."

#. Occurrence B_7:1641:16121: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0055; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1641
msgctxt "text_id=16121 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……まあ、そこから先はアンタも薄々知ってるでしょ。"
msgstr "  After that, you can fill in the blanks."

#. Occurrence B_7:1647:16122: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0056; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1647
msgctxt "text_id=16122 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私と有珠は敵との戦いに専念する事になって、毎日のように捜査の手を空振って、決戦の夜を迎えて、今はこうしてる。"
msgstr "  Alice and I turned our attention to fighting the enemy, spending most nights tracking her fruitlessly, until the fight last night."

#. Occurrence B_7:1653:16123: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0057; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1653
msgctxt "text_id=16123 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　だいたいの経緯はこんなところよ」"
msgstr "  That's the long and short of it.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1689:16124: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1689
msgctxt "text_id=16124 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　振り返ってみて納得したのか、ふむ、と青子はぞんざいに自分の体を見つめていた。"
msgstr "  She stared down at her body, as if recalling what had happened would help her accept her current state."

#. Occurrence B_7:1694:16125: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1694
msgctxt "text_id=16125 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シーツの下の体は、まだところどころ包帯が巻かれているものの、少しずつ<魔力|けつえき>が<通|かよ>いだしている。"
msgstr "  Under the sheet, magical energy steadily flowed through her partially bandaged body."

#. Occurrence B_7:1715:16126: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1715
msgctxt "text_id=16126 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……蒼崎。これまでの君たちの話は分かった。"
msgstr "\"Okay, Aozaki. I think I'm all caught up."

#. Occurrence B_7:1721:16127: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1721
msgctxt "text_id=16127 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　けど、肝心の今の状況はどうなっているんだ？」"
msgstr "  But what about you? Why are you in this state?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1761:16128: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1761
msgctxt "text_id=16128 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子がここに<臥|ふ>している理由。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's specific concern was the reason Aoko was lying there."

#. Occurrence B_7:1766:16129: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1766
msgctxt "text_id=16129 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎にとって最大の関心は、昨日の夜、何があったかという事だ。"
msgstr "  More than anything, he wanted to know what had happened to her the night before."

#. Occurrence B_7:1800:16130: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0058; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1800
msgctxt "text_id=16130 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「バカね。状況も何も、完全に私たちの負けじゃない」"
msgstr "\"Simple. We lost. What more is there to say?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1806:16131: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1806
msgctxt "text_id=16131 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　両手が満足に動けたのならバンザイでもしそうな口調で、青子はあっさり敗北宣言をした。"
msgstr "  Judging by her tone, she would have raised both hands sarcastically in celebration if she could."

#. Occurrence B_7:1843:16132: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1843
msgctxt "text_id=16132 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「負けた……？」"
msgstr "\"You lost...?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1849:16133: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0059; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1849
msgctxt "text_id=16133 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そ。事実は正しく受け止めなくっちゃね。"
msgstr "\"Yep. It sucks, but there's no getting around it."

#. Occurrence B_7:1855:16134: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0060; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1855
msgctxt "text_id=16134 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　五つの支点がぜんぶ壊された時点で、勝負はついたの。"
msgstr "  The moment all five sigils were broken, it was over."

#. Occurrence B_7:1861:16135: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0061; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1861
msgctxt "text_id=16135 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　管理地の所有権は宙ぶらりで、明日には橙子の手に渡るでしょう。"
msgstr "  The land rights are up in the air, until tomorrow when Touko claims them."

#. Occurrence B_7:1880:16136: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0062; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1880
msgctxt "text_id=16136 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　で、それを阻止したいこっちは、私も有珠もこの有様。"
msgstr "  In trying to prevent that, Alice and I ended up like this."

#. Occurrence B_7:1886:16137: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0063; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1886
msgctxt "text_id=16137 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　もう立場は逆転したから、これから私たちは挑戦者……つまり、はぐれ魔術師ってコトよ」"
msgstr "  The tables have turned. So from here on, we'll be the challengers. We are the rogue mages.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:1906:16138: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1906
msgctxt "text_id=16138 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なので、青子たちがこの教会に厄介になれるのも、あと数日だけだった。"
msgstr "  Which meant that Aoko, Alice, and Soujyuro only had a few more days with which to utilize the Church's services."

#. Occurrence B_7:1922:16139: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1922
msgctxt "text_id=16139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この合田教会は魔術協会の支部でもあり、異端を監視する聖堂教会とやらの支部でもある。"
msgstr "  Aida Church was not only an arm of the Mage's Association, but also a branch of the Holy Church that monitored heresy."

#. Occurrence B_7:1927:16140: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1927
msgctxt "text_id=16140 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子たちはそのどちらにも所属していない、三咲市だけの有権者だ。"
msgstr "  Aoko and Alice were owners of Misaki City's spiritual lands, but they belonged to neither of these organizations."

#. Occurrence B_7:1947:16141: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1947
msgctxt "text_id=16141 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　教会が青子たちに力を貸しているのは、彼女たちが土地の管理者であったから。"
msgstr "  The only reason the Church helped them at all was because they were the land's administrators."

#. Occurrence B_7:1952:16142: scene=B_7
#: B_7:1952
msgctxt "text_id=16142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その権利を失うのなら、教会として肩入れする理由は皆無である。"
msgstr "  Once those rights were lost, the Church would have no reason to provide any further aid."

#. Occurrence B_7:1975:16143: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0064; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1975
msgctxt "text_id=16143 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「詠梨神父は<中立者|こうもり>だから私を助けてくれたけど、唯架さんは教会の代行者だから、傷が塞がったなら明日にでも出ていけって言ってくる。"
msgstr "\"Father Eiri is helping us because he's neutral in all this, but Yuika is a Church Executor. Once I'm healed, she'll kick me out."

#. Occurrence B_7:1982:16144: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0065; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1982
msgctxt "text_id=16144 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "教会にとっちゃ、魔術師なんてもともと排除すべき商売敵だからね。"
msgstr "The Church sees mages as their professional competition."

#. Occurrence B_7:1990:16145: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0066; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:1990
msgctxt "text_id=16145 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　バカ律架は―――まあ、泣きつけば力にはなってくれるでしょうけど」"
msgstr "  And that stupid Ritsuka... Well, she might help out if I cried.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2024:16146: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2024
msgctxt "text_id=16146 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぶつぶつと草十郎には分からない話をする青子。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro understood little of what Aoko was talking about."

#. Occurrence B_7:2031:16147: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2031
msgctxt "text_id=16147 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうじゃなくて、蒼崎。"
msgstr "\"I didn't mean that, Aozaki."

#. Occurrence B_7:2038:16148: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2038
msgctxt "text_id=16148 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "昨日の夜、何があったんだ」"
msgstr "I meant, what actually happened last night?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2075:16149: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2075
msgctxt "text_id=16149 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一番聞きたい事を話したがらない青子に、草十郎は自分から切りだした。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro pressed her, and Aoko really wished he had not."

#. Occurrence B_7:2109:16150: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0067; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2109
msgctxt "text_id=16150 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……見て分からない？　惨敗なんてものじゃないわ。"
msgstr "\"...You can't tell by looking? They wiped the floor with me."

#. Occurrence B_7:2115:16151: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0068; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2115
msgctxt "text_id=16151 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　喉に食い付かれる、体中好き放題噛まれまくる、あげくに右の<腿|もも>なんてなくなってたそうよ。"
msgstr "  My throat was torn to pieces along with the rest of me; my right thigh was basically gone."

#. Occurrence B_7:2121:16152: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0069; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2121
msgctxt "text_id=16152 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ま、有珠のチョコレイトのおかげで出血死は免れたけど」"
msgstr "  If it wasn't for Alice's chocolate, I'd have bled to death.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2143:16153: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2143
msgctxt "text_id=16153 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はぽん、とギプスに包まれた片足を叩いた。"
msgstr "  She knocked on the cast around her leg."

#. Occurrence B_7:2148:16154: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2148
msgctxt "text_id=16154 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気楽に言いながらも、その奥には雪辱への闘志が見え隠れしている。"
msgstr "  Aoko spoke casually, but was trying to hide how much she wanted revenge for being humiliated."

#. Occurrence B_7:2176:16155: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2176
msgctxt "text_id=16155 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2182:16156: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2182
msgctxt "text_id=16156 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな青子とは反対に、彼に起きた感情は『空白』だった。"
msgstr "  In contrast, Soujyuro felt empty."

#. Occurrence B_7:2187:16157: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2187
msgctxt "text_id=16157 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青ざめた顔色がいっそう白く、色を削ぎ落とす。"
msgstr "  The little color he had in his face began to fade."

#. Occurrence B_7:2192:16158: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2192
msgctxt "text_id=16158 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　凄惨な行為からの逃避か、あるいは反感か。"
msgstr "  Was he repulsed by the terrible situation, or were his instincts telling him to flee?"

#. Occurrence B_7:2197:16159: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2197
msgctxt "text_id=16159 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どちらにせよ、人間らしい感情の発露だった。"
msgstr "  Regardless, he appeared very human."

#. Occurrence B_7:2243:16160: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0070; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2243
msgctxt "text_id=16160 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なんでそこで固まる……あ、そっか。"
msgstr "\"What the hell's wrong with you? ...Oh, wait. I know."

#. Occurrence B_7:2262:16161: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0071; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2262
msgctxt "text_id=16161 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私を見て吐き出しちゃうぐらいナイーヴなんだっけ、草十郎ってば。大丈夫よ、今はくっついてるから。"
msgstr "  You were stupid enough to look at me and throw up, am I right? Well you can stop worrying. I'm in one piece now."

#. Occurrence B_7:2268:16162: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0072; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2268
msgctxt "text_id=16162 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　唯架さんは治療専門だし、私だってただやられてたワケじゃないし。復元は蒼崎の得意分野だから、あれくらい問題ないわ」"
msgstr "  Yuika's a pro, and I'm still alive. Regeneration is a specialty of the Aozaki mages, so I'll be fine.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2288:16163: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2288
msgctxt "text_id=16163 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから心配はいらない、と視線で語る青子だが、草十郎の様子は一向に変わらない。"
msgstr "  She gave him a reassuring look, but his expression was unchanged."

#. Occurrence B_7:2306:16164: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2306
msgctxt "text_id=16164 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……見当違いとはいえ、ここまで心配されると青子も文句は言い辛い。"
msgstr "  Aoko had expected him to worry, but this level of concern made it hard for even her to berate him."

#. Occurrence B_7:2311:16165: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2311
msgctxt "text_id=16165 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんだか照れ臭くなって、青子は会話を再開した。"
msgstr "  Feeling embarrassed, she started talking again."

#. Occurrence B_7:2345:16166: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0073; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2345
msgctxt "text_id=16166 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「けど姉貴ったら、どうやってあんなのを<手懐|てなず>けたんだろう。金の<狼|おおかみ>なんて、伝説の中にしかいないと思ってた。"
msgstr "\"The question is how on earth did my sister manage to tame a golden wolf? I didn't even think they existed."

#. Occurrence B_7:2351:16167: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0074; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2351
msgctxt "text_id=16167 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……神代の神秘であるあいつには千年クラスの魔術じゃないと太刀打ちできない。かといって殴り合いでどうにかできる相手じゃないし……」"
msgstr "  He's a relic from the Age of Gods; you'd need magecraft a millennium in the making just to stand a chance against him. Never mind trying to take him in a fistfight...\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2382:16168: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2382
msgctxt "text_id=16168 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　昨夜の惨状を思い出し、青子は悔しげに唇を噛む。"
msgstr "  As images of the night before entered Aoko's mind, she bit her lip in anguish."

#. Occurrence B_7:2388:16169: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2388
msgctxt "text_id=16169 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「金の……狼……？」"
msgstr "\"A golden... wolf...?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2406:16170: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2406
msgctxt "text_id=16170 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、聞きなれない言葉を聞いて、草十郎はショック状態から回復したようだ。"
msgstr "  Conversely, the bizarre phrase snapped Soujyuro out of his state of shock."

#. Occurrence B_7:2440:16171: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0075; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2440
msgctxt "text_id=16171 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そ、<黄金|おうごん>の<人狼|じんろう>。<金狼|きんろう>って言った方がいいのかな。"
msgstr "\"Yeah. A golden wolf. A golden werewolf, to be exact."

#. Occurrence B_7:2446:16172: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0076; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2446
msgctxt "text_id=16172 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　狼男……って言っても分からないわよね。人間と狼のいいとこどりみたいなヤツと思えばいいわ。"
msgstr "  Then again, you've probably never heard of a werewolf. Think part human, part wolf, but only the best parts."

#. Occurrence B_7:2468:16173: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0077; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2468
msgctxt "text_id=16173 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　野獣というより魔獣のたぐいよ。"
msgstr "  It's a magical beast, as opposed to a wild one."

#. Occurrence B_7:2474:16174: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0078; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2474
msgctxt "text_id=16174 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　普通の人狼なら対抗手段はあるんだけど、橙子が連れてるのは黄金の毛並みをした怪物でさ」"
msgstr "  There are ways to deal with regular werewolves, but the one with Touko has a golden coat.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2495:16175: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0079; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2495
msgctxt "text_id=16175 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あれは原初の人狼の血統で、魔獣を通り越して幻獣の域に達している。"
msgstr "\"He's a descendant of the first werewolves; a transcended magical beast, Phantasmal Beast."

#. Occurrence B_7:2514:16176: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0080; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2514
msgctxt "text_id=16176 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　聖域の相手には、そいつらを上回る神秘……積み重ねた時間とか、魔術の奥義……じゃないと無効化されるのよ。"
msgstr "  To take on such a pure monster, you'd need a Mystic with a longer history or some really secret magecraft. Nothing else will even scratch him."

#. Occurrence B_7:2520:16177: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0081; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2520
msgctxt "text_id=16177 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　魔術は万能だけど、この“年月の差”だけは<覆|くつがえ>せない。"
msgstr "  Magecraft can do almost anything, but it just can't compete with something so ancient."

#. Occurrence B_7:2537:16178: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0082; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2537
msgctxt "text_id=16178 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ま、人間の魔術師にとっては天敵みたいな自然災害ね」"
msgstr "  He's the kind of natural disaster than any human mage dreads fighting.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2557:16179: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2557
msgctxt "text_id=16179 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　憎しみはなく、感心するように青子は語る。"
msgstr "  Her words indicated more admiration than hatred."

#. Occurrence B_7:2562:16180: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2562
msgctxt "text_id=16180 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな呟きに、"
msgstr "  The way she'd whispered about the wolf..."

#. Occurrence B_7:2582:16181: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0016; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2582
msgctxt "text_id=16181 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2587:16182: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2587
msgctxt "text_id=16182 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なにやら意味不明な納得をする草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  ...strangely, made sense to Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence B_7:2626:16183: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0083; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2626
msgctxt "text_id=16183 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「？　な、なに？」"
msgstr "\"Wh-What? Out with it already.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2637:16184: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0017; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2637
msgctxt "text_id=16184 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、要するに蒼崎たちじゃ敵わない相手なんだな。"
msgstr "\"Oh, I was just thinking how there's something out there that even you and Alice can't defeat."

#. Occurrence B_7:2648:16185: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0018; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2648
msgctxt "text_id=16185 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……なんて酷いヤツだ。"
msgstr "  ...It must be truly awful."

#. Occurrence B_7:2655:16186: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0019; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2655
msgctxt "text_id=16186 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "有珠はお<腹|なか>が裂かれてた。蒼崎は傷ついてない<箇所|ところ>はないぐらいだ。"
msgstr "It tore apart Alice's stomach; and you... well, you don't have anywhere that wasn't torn apart."

#. Occurrence B_7:2661:16187: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0020; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2661
msgctxt "text_id=16187 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　子供なのに……いや、子供だから加減がないのか」"
msgstr "  How could a kid-actually, I guess it's because he's a kid that he doesn't know how to hold back.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2695:16188: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2695
msgctxt "text_id=16188 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青ざめた顔で、<訥々|とつとつ>と呟く草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's face was a ghostly pale as he muttered nervously."

#. Occurrence B_7:2711:16189: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2711
msgctxt "text_id=16189 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は同感だ、とばかりにうなずいた。"
msgstr "  Aoko merely nodded in agreement."

#. Occurrence B_7:2730:16190: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0084; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2730
msgctxt "text_id=16190 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ほーんと。"
msgstr "\"Now you get it."

#. Occurrence B_7:2737:16191: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0085; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2737
msgctxt "text_id=16191 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "人の体を何だと思っているのかしらね、あのお子さ―――なぬ？」"
msgstr "What kid has the nerve to do *that* to someone's-wait, what did you just say?!\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2781:16192: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2781
msgctxt "text_id=16192 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこまで言いかけて、青子はバッと顔をあげた。"
msgstr "  Aoko raised her head."

#. Occurrence B_7:2786:16193: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2786
msgctxt "text_id=16193 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつかのように、意外なお化けを見たように。"
msgstr "  She looked as if she had seen a ghost."

#. Occurrence B_7:2807:16194: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0086; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2807
msgctxt "text_id=16194 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いま子供って言った？"
msgstr "\"Did you just say 'kid?'"

#. Occurrence B_7:2813:16195: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0087; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2813
msgctxt "text_id=16195 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　アンタ、なんでそんなコトまで知ってるの？」"
msgstr "  How the heck do you know that?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2819:16196: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0021; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2819
msgctxt "text_id=16196 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「やっぱりそうなのか。金色の髪なんて二人もいないと思ったんだ。そいつなら一度見かけた事がある。"
msgstr "\"...I realized it was him that day. I'd never seen someone with such golden hair in my life. It has to have been him."

#. Occurrence B_7:2841:16197: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0022; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2841
msgctxt "text_id=16197 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　蒼崎が口にしたような怪物じゃなかったけど、森の奥で。"
msgstr "  We were deep in the woods. It didn't look anything like the monster you described, though."

#. Occurrence B_7:2847:16198: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0023; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2847
msgctxt "text_id=16198 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　木乃美が二人がかりでとっちめよう、なんて怖いコト言いだしてさ。<敵|かな>いっこないから止めたんだよ」"
msgstr "  Kinomi wanted me to run after him. I told him no way, of course, the kid freaked me out. I knew there was no catching him.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2891:16199: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2891
msgctxt "text_id=16199 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不思議な事を、不思議な口調で草十郎は言う。"
msgstr "  His tone was as curious as the things he was trying to articulate."

#. Occurrence B_7:2896:16200: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2896
msgctxt "text_id=16200 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子にはそれを追及する余裕もない。"
msgstr "  Aoko, however, had more pressing matters."

#. Occurrence B_7:2901:16201: scene=B_7
#: B_7:2901
msgctxt "text_id=16201 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女的に、他にもっと重要な事がある―――"
msgstr "  Much more pressing."

#. Occurrence B_7:2923:16202: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0088; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2923
msgctxt "text_id=16202 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「見たって、どこで！？」"
msgstr "\"You saw him?! Where?!\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2937:16203: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0024_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2937
msgctxt "text_id=16203 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「学校の旧校舎。"
msgstr "\"At the old school campus."

#. Occurrence B_7:2952:16204: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0024_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2952
msgctxt "text_id=16204 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "あ、そういえば挨拶ていどなら話もしたっけ。一度だけ、アルバイトの時に牛肉五十キロを生で届けた事があって……」"
msgstr "Come to think of it, I might have even met him. Just once, when I was working. I delivered fifty kilos of raw beef, and-\""

#. Occurrence B_7:2985:16205: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0089; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:2985
msgctxt "text_id=16205 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「こ、この大馬鹿ものーーーーお！」"
msgstr "\"Oh my god, y-you absolute idiot!\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3026:16206: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3026
msgctxt "text_id=16206 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　すぱかーん、と心地よい音がした。"
msgstr "  A strangely satisfying slapping sound rang out."

#. Occurrence B_7:3031:16207: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3031
msgctxt "text_id=16207 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　体の傷もなんのその、青子は神速で床のスリッパを取ると、草十郎の平和そうな顔に思いっきり投げ付けた。"
msgstr "  Ignoring her wounds completely, Aoko had grabbed a slipper and thrown it at Soujyuro's unassuming face as hard as she could."

#. Occurrence B_7:3051:16208: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3051
msgctxt "text_id=16208 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はあはあと肩で息をする青子と、顔面を強襲したスリッパの衝撃で、座ったまま倒れこむ草十郎。"
msgstr "  She panted, as Soujyuro was knocked completely out of his chair."

#. Occurrence B_7:3074:16209: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3074
msgctxt "text_id=16209 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しばし、ふたりはそのままで動かなかった。"
msgstr "  For a while, neither moved."

#. Occurrence B_7:3109:16210: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0025; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3109
msgctxt "text_id=16210 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――なんで怒るんだ、蒼崎」"
msgstr "\"...What was that for, Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3115:16211: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3115
msgctxt "text_id=16211 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　むくりと起き上がる不屈の男。"
msgstr "  The boy asked, unfazed, as he slowly picked himself up."

#. Occurrence B_7:3120:16212: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3120
msgctxt "text_id=16212 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<小法師|こぼし>の如く<胡坐|あぐら>をかく彼を、青子は敵を見る目で睨みつける。"
msgstr "  He sat cross legged, as Aoko scowled at him like an enemy."

#. Occurrence B_7:3156:16213: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0090; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3156
msgctxt "text_id=16213 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あったりまえじゃない！"
msgstr "\"What do you think?!"

#. Occurrence B_7:3162:16214: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0091; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3162
msgctxt "text_id=16214 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　なんでそんな怪しいコト黙ってんのよ、アンタはっ！」"
msgstr "  Who keeps something like that to themselves!\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3175:16215: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0026; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3175
msgctxt "text_id=16215 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……言うほどの事でもない。第一、君たちにこんな話をしても怒られるだけじゃないか」"
msgstr "\"...I didn't think it was worth mentioning. Even if I had, the two of you would've just gotten mad at me.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3208:16216: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3208
msgctxt "text_id=16216 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎のもっともな意見に、青子はうっと言葉を飲んだ。"
msgstr "  Aoko knew he was right, and so she swallowed her words."

#. Occurrence B_7:3228:16217: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3228
msgctxt "text_id=16217 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夕食中、"
msgstr "  She imagined themselves at dinner."

#. Occurrence B_7:3248:16218: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0027; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3248
msgctxt "text_id=16218 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "『ところで今日、牛肉の山をかついで届けたんだ。一匹丸ごと。いや、あるところにはあるものだね、お金と食欲』"
msgstr "\"You'll never guess what I did today―I delivered a mountain of beef to an animal. One animal. Rich people live in a different world, am I right?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3271:16219: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3271
msgctxt "text_id=16219 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんて話をされたら、<青子|じぶん>と有珠がどんな反応するか、考えるまでもない。"
msgstr "  If he had actually said it, Aoko and Alice's response would have been less than cordial."

#. Occurrence B_7:3298:16220: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0092; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3298
msgctxt "text_id=16220 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「っ……それは、そうだけど。"
msgstr "\"...Okay, you're probably right."

#. Occurrence B_7:3319:16221: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0093; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3319
msgctxt "text_id=16221 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……ほんとに、金髪の子供が旧校舎にいたの？」"
msgstr "  Anyway, was there really a golden-haired child at the old school building?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3339:16222: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0028; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3339
msgctxt "text_id=16222 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それが蒼崎の言うジンロウかどうか、自信はないけど。"
msgstr "\"I don't know whether he was your werewolf."

#. Occurrence B_7:3345:16223: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0029; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3345
msgctxt "text_id=16223 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　少なくとも街中の料理店が入れ代わりでおかしな注文を届けてるのは事実だ。駅前の大帝都なんてお得意様だって」"
msgstr "  And we've had some strange orders from restaurants in town. Especially that Imperial Metropolis near the station.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3379:16224: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0094; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3379
msgctxt "text_id=16224 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……たしかに、食事のたびにあいつを外に出してちゃ目立つだろうけど……」"
msgstr "\"That makes sense. There was no way he could eat out without drawing lots of attention to himself.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3385:16225: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3385
msgctxt "text_id=16225 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……あんまり信じたくはないが、そこが人狼の住み家である可能性は高すぎる。"
msgstr "  She did not want to believe it, but the child had to be the werewolf."

#. Occurrence B_7:3390:16226: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3390
msgctxt "text_id=16226 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子なりに人狼の存在を隠したのだろうが、その方法はどこか間が抜けていた。"
msgstr "  Could Touko really have been so careless as to hide him in plain sight?"

#. Occurrence B_7:3421:16227: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3421
msgctxt "text_id=16227 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……しかし、ともかくだ。"
msgstr "  It didn't matter at this point."

#. Occurrence B_7:3426:16228: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3426
msgctxt "text_id=16228 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼の住み家が判明した以上、探していた橙子の本拠地も判明した事になる。"
msgstr "  With the werewolf's habitat revealed, Touko's base had been revealed, too."

#. Occurrence B_7:3431:16229: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3431
msgctxt "text_id=16229 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも結界の張り替えには資材が保管できて、人目につかない拠点が必要なのだ。"
msgstr "  To take over the Bounded Field, she needed an inconspicuous place to store materials."

#. Occurrence B_7:3436:16230: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3436
msgctxt "text_id=16230 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三咲高校の旧校舎は、その条件を備えている。"
msgstr "  Misaki High School's old school building was the perfect place."

#. Occurrence B_7:3468:16231: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0095; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3468
msgctxt "text_id=16231 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……つまり、全ての鍵はアンタが隠し持ってたってワケね」"
msgstr "\"Huh, you were hiding the key to the puzzle this whole time.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3488:16232: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0030; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3488
msgctxt "text_id=16232 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「隠していたんじゃない。"
msgstr "\"I wasn't hiding anything."

#. Occurrence B_7:3495:16233: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0031; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3495
msgctxt "text_id=16233 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "だいたい、蒼崎が裏山の掃除に参加していたら、その時に分かったんじゃないか？"
msgstr "If you'd actually helped with cleaning the backhills, you'd have found out for yourself."

#. Occurrence B_7:3501:16234: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0032; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3501
msgctxt "text_id=16234 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　鳶丸ひとりに任せず、蒼崎も掃除にでれば良かったんだ」"
msgstr "  You shouldn't have left it to Tobimaru.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3539:16235: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0096; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3539
msgctxt "text_id=16235 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「…………………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3560:16236: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3560
msgctxt "text_id=16236 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……ごもっともな意見に、青子はぱちりと指を鳴らす。"
msgstr "  In response to Soujyuro's infallible logic, Aoko snapped her fingers."

#. Occurrence B_7:3594:16237: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3594
msgctxt "text_id=16237 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　スリッパ爆弾の代わりに、白い首輪は忠実に、彼女の気持ちを代弁したのだった。"
msgstr "  Instead of another slipper missile, she let the faithful white collar express how she felt."

#. Occurrence B_7:3638:16238: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3638
msgctxt "text_id=16238 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして。"
msgstr "  And with the tightening of the collar..."

#. Occurrence B_7:3643:16239: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3643
msgctxt "text_id=16239 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎がひとしきり首輪の圧迫に苦しんだあと、"
msgstr "  Soujyuro realized something."

#. Occurrence B_7:3648:16240: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3648
msgctxt "text_id=16240 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼ははっきりと、青子の変化に気が付いた。"
msgstr "  Aoko had changed."

#. Occurrence B_7:3672:16241: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3672
msgctxt "text_id=16241 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベッドの上の少女は、<凛|リン>と遠くを見据えている"
msgstr "  From the bed, she looked down on him with a commanding glare."

#. Occurrence B_7:3677:16242: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3677
msgctxt "text_id=16242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　傷ついて力がなかった<面|おも>もちも、患者衣の悲愴なイメージを打ち消すぐらいシャンとしていた。"
msgstr "  Though weak from her injuries, she was as sharp as ever; you would be forgiven for forgetting she was ever a patient."

#. Occurrence B_7:3683:16243: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3683
msgctxt "text_id=16243 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ようするにやる気に満ちあふれているのだ、青子は。"
msgstr "  She was raring to fight."

#. Occurrence B_7:3688:16244: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3688
msgctxt "text_id=16244 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが誰に対して、何に対してかは言うまでもない。"
msgstr "  It went without saying who her rage was directed at."

#. Occurrence B_7:3726:16245: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3726
msgctxt "text_id=16245 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「…………"
msgstr "\"..."

#. Occurrence B_7:3734:16246: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0033; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3734
msgctxt "text_id=16246 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "蒼崎？」"
msgstr "Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3754:16247: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0097; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3754
msgctxt "text_id=16247 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ん？」"
msgstr "\"Hm?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3760:16248: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3760
msgctxt "text_id=16248 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の呼びかけに、青子は無防備な声をあげた。"
msgstr "  Aoko responded in a vulnerable tone."

#. Occurrence B_7:3765:16249: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3765
msgctxt "text_id=16249 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　事実、不意を突いたのだろう。"
msgstr "  Perhaps she had been taken by surprise."

#. Occurrence B_7:3770:16250: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3770
msgctxt "text_id=16250 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目標を定めた彼女は、完全にひとりの世界に入っていたのだから。"
msgstr "  Now she had an objective, she had been lost in her own little world."

#. Occurrence B_7:3803:16251: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0098; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3803
msgctxt "text_id=16251 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ありがと、草十郎」"
msgstr "\"Thanks, Soujyuro.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3826:16252: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3826
msgctxt "text_id=16252 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先ほどの不意打ちの仕返し……なんて<悪戯|いたずら>心からではない。"
msgstr "  He expected her to be sarcastic, but this was different."

#. Occurrence B_7:3831:16253: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3831
msgctxt "text_id=16253 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はごく自然に感謝を口にした。"
msgstr "  She was genuinely thanking him."

#. Occurrence B_7:3836:16254: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3836
msgctxt "text_id=16254 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　聞きなれない言葉に、草十郎はハト<豆鉄砲|まめでっぽう>状態だ。"
msgstr "  He had never known her to be like this and was taken aback."

#. Occurrence B_7:3872:16255: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0099; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3872
msgctxt "text_id=16255 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……あのね。とにかく、橙子の居場所が判ったのはアンタのおかげだから、礼ぐらい言っておこうと思ったの。"
msgstr "\"I, um, I'm just showing my appreciation because you helped me figure out where Touko's hideout is."

#. Occurrence B_7:3878:16256: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0100; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3878
msgctxt "text_id=16256 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それがお気に召さなかった？」"
msgstr "  Satisfied?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3900:16257: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0034; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3900
msgctxt "text_id=16257 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、お礼を言ってもらえるのはいい事だけど。"
msgstr "\"Sure. It's nice to be thanked, but..."

#. Occurrence B_7:3906:16258: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0035; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3906
msgctxt "text_id=16258 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……まさか、その体で橙子さんの所に行くつもりか？」"
msgstr "  Are you seriously going after Touko, in that condition?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3912:16259: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3912
msgctxt "text_id=16259 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<労|いたわ>りより叱責の色が濃い。"
msgstr "  His tone was closer to scolding than sympathetic."

#. Occurrence B_7:3917:16260: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3917
msgctxt "text_id=16260 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな問いに、青子は当然とばかりに頷いた。"
msgstr "  Aoko simply nodded resolutely."

#. Occurrence B_7:3965:16261: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0101; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3965
msgctxt "text_id=16261 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「取られた物は取り返すものよ、草十郎。"
msgstr "\"I'm just going to take back what's mine, while I still can."

#. Occurrence B_7:3971:16262: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0102; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:3971
msgctxt "text_id=16262 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それもすぐに、相手の物になってしまう前にね。ぐずぐずしている暇はないわ」"
msgstr "  My sister won't waste a moment, and neither will I.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:3977:16263: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3977
msgctxt "text_id=16263 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こうして我を言いきる時の青子の気迫には逆らえないものがある。"
msgstr "  She sounded unshakeable."

#. Occurrence B_7:3982:16264: scene=B_7
#: B_7:3982
msgctxt "text_id=16264 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも、草十郎は<頑|がん>として引かなかった。"
msgstr "  Even so, Soujyuro would not back down."

#. Occurrence B_7:4003:16265: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0036; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4003
msgctxt "text_id=16265 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「勝ち目がなくてもか。暇はないと言うけど、今はそれ以上に休息が必要だろう。"
msgstr "\"Even if you've got almost no chance of winning? What you need right now is rest."

#. Occurrence B_7:4010:16266: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0037; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4010
msgctxt "text_id=16266 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "その傷だって、今は見れるけど昨日は酷かったじゃないか。生きていたのが幸運なぐらいだ」"
msgstr "Yesterday you were really messed up; you still are now. You're lucky to be alive.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4018:16267: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0103; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4018
msgctxt "text_id=16267 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「違うわ。あれは幸運なんかじゃない。そんなタマかっていうのよ、橙子が」"
msgstr "\"It's not luck. It's Touko.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4030:16268: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0038; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4030
msgctxt "text_id=16268 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「幸運じゃない……？」"
msgstr "\"I don't understand.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4056:16269: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0104; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4056
msgctxt "text_id=16269 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そ。橙子はね、私が生き残れる程度の傷にとどめたのよ。今回は見逃してやるから、もう一度やってこいって意味でね。"
msgstr "\"Touko. She purposely kept me alive to taunt me. To make me try again."

#. Occurrence B_7:4062:16270: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0105; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4062
msgctxt "text_id=16270 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　だから私は生きてるんだし、橙子は私が行くのを待ってる。お互いが、お互いの舞台の幕を下ろすために。そうでなければここまで待った意味がないでしょう。"
msgstr "  She's waiting for me so we can settle the score. If she wasn't waiting, she'd have made her move already."

#. Occurrence B_7:4068:16271: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0106; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4068
msgctxt "text_id=16271 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……イヤだけど、アンタの言葉を借りるなら、ね」"
msgstr "  As much as it pains me to, I'm taking your words to heart.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4111:16272: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4111
msgctxt "text_id=16272 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　忌ま忌ましげに語る青子の横顔は、鬼気迫るものがあった。"
msgstr "  Irritation tainted Aoko's words; from the side she looked terrifyingly serious."

#. Occurrence B_7:4116:16273: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4116
msgctxt "text_id=16273 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎から見れば、殺し合いを良しとする青子も、そうなるように仕向けている橙子も、遠い世界の住人のようだ。"
msgstr "  She was ready to fight to the death; Touko had given her little choice. Soujyuro could understand neither sister."

#. Occurrence B_7:4144:16274: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0039; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4144
msgctxt "text_id=16274 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……殺すために生かしたっていうのか、橙子さんは。"
msgstr "\"Touko left you alive so she could kill you later?"

#. Occurrence B_7:4150:16275: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0040; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4150
msgctxt "text_id=16275 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　蒼崎はそれが分かっているのに行こうとしている」"
msgstr "  And yet you're still going after her.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4176:16276: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0107; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4176
msgctxt "text_id=16276 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうよ。勝負はついたけど、まだ私たちの話は終わっていないもの。"
msgstr "\"Exactly. She might have won the battle, but she hasn't won the war."

#. Occurrence B_7:4182:16277: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0108; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4182
msgctxt "text_id=16277 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　たしかに全快してから行ったほうがいいに決まってる。けど、そうしている間に橙子は三咲の深部にたどり着く。そうなったら、私の最後の切札さえ使えなくなる。"
msgstr "  I know I'd have a better chance fully healed, but while I'm recovering, Touko has gotten her claws into Misaki. That means I need to play my trump card."

#. Occurrence B_7:4203:16278: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0109; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4203
msgctxt "text_id=16278 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　自分にできる事を、自分から無くしてしまうのは―――」"
msgstr "  I have to do what I can while I can.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4224:16279: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4224
msgctxt "text_id=16279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは死より深い痛みではないけれど―――"
msgstr "  Though the pain in her azure eyes was not as deep as the pain of death,"

#. Occurrence B_7:4230:16280: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4230
msgctxt "text_id=16280 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　命あるかぎり逃げられない後悔だと、青い瞳が語っていた。"
msgstr "  it spoke of the regret she would feel if she did not do everything possible while blood still flowed through her veins."

#. Occurrence B_7:4263:16281: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0041; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4263
msgctxt "text_id=16281 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4281:16282: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0110; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4281
msgctxt "text_id=16282 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「納得いったのなら黙ってて。"
msgstr "\"Understand now? Good. Then don't try and stop me."

#. Occurrence B_7:4287:16283: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0111; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4287
msgctxt "text_id=16283 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　いい、これは私の戦い。アンタには何の責任も関わりもない、私の人生なの。"
msgstr "  Listen to me, Soujyuro. You're not responsible for anything. Not my life, and not this fight."

#. Occurrence B_7:4293:16284: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0112; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4293
msgctxt "text_id=16284 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　座して死を待つなんてまっぴらゴメンよ。勝つ気があるなら、いつまでもベッドで寝てるワケにはいかないでしょう」"
msgstr "  And I refuse to sit in bed waiting to die. Who'd do that if they felt they could win?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4313:16285: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4313
msgctxt "text_id=16285 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の返答は、草十郎への完全な拒絶だ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was dumbstruck."

#. Occurrence B_7:4318:16286: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4318
msgctxt "text_id=16286 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他人の関わる余地はない。"
msgstr "  Aoko could never let anyone else get involved."

#. Occurrence B_7:4323:16287: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4323
msgctxt "text_id=16287 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが優しさからくるものなのか、<嘲|あざけ>りからくるものなのか、草十郎には読み取れない。"
msgstr "  Whether that was because she cared or cared less, he could not tell."

#. Occurrence B_7:4342:16288: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4342
msgctxt "text_id=16288 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　分かるのは、彼女を止めたければ、彼女を手にかけるだけの覚悟が必要ということ。"
msgstr "  What he did understand, though, was if he wanted to stop her he would have to do so with his bare hands."

#. Occurrence B_7:4348:16289: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4348
msgctxt "text_id=16289 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "その覚悟がないものに、蒼崎青子を批難する事は許されない。"
msgstr "And he knew better than to try that."

#. Occurrence B_7:4374:16290: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0042; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4374
msgctxt "text_id=16290 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4380:16291: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4380
msgctxt "text_id=16291 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも、もう説得するのは無理だと悟ってしまっても、草十郎は最後の疑問を口にする。"
msgstr "  Even so, he had to ask one last question."

#. Occurrence B_7:4385:16292: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4385
msgctxt "text_id=16292 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを聞かないかぎり、自分は、この部屋を出る事さえできない気がして。"
msgstr "  If he did not, he would not be able to live with himself after leaving this room."

#. Occurrence B_7:4411:16293: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0043; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4411
msgctxt "text_id=16293 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……分からないな。蒼崎はなんでそこまでするのか、俺には想像もできない。"
msgstr "\"I don't get why you need to go to these lengths."

#. Occurrence B_7:4418:16294: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0044; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4418
msgctxt "text_id=16294 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "君を縛っているのは義務と強制、どっちなんだろうね」"
msgstr "Is it out of obligation, or are you just forcing yourself?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4424:16295: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4424
msgctxt "text_id=16295 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の瞳は、どこか悲しい。"
msgstr "  There was a sadness in his eyes."

#. Occurrence B_7:4429:16296: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4429
msgctxt "text_id=16296 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを前にしても、青子は表情を崩さなかった。"
msgstr "  However, Aoko was unmoved by them."

#. Occurrence B_7:4467:16297: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0113; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4467
msgctxt "text_id=16297 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「らしくなく、難しいこと訊いてくるのね。"
msgstr "\"It's not like you to ask something so deep."

#. Occurrence B_7:4473:16298: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0114; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4473
msgctxt "text_id=16298 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　いいわ、口にしても仕方のない事だけど答えてあげる」"
msgstr "  All right, I'll answer-even though it won't change anything.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4506:16299: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0115; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4506
msgctxt "text_id=16299 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「その二つはね、常に私を圧迫してるものだと思う。"
msgstr "\"To be honest, I'm caught between the two."

#. Occurrence B_7:4512:16300: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0116; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4512
msgctxt "text_id=16300 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　けど、勘違いはしないで。義務も強制も、誇りも<畏|おそ>れも、<他人|まわり>から与えられた物じゃない。"
msgstr "  Don't get me wrong, though. Any sense of obligation, compulsion, pride, or fear comes from me and me alone."

#. Occurrence B_7:4518:16301: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0117; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4518
msgctxt "text_id=16301 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　橙子と戦うのを止めたところで祖父は私を<叱|しか>らないだろうし、有珠も文句は言わないでしょう。"
msgstr "  My grandfather wouldn't be mad if I stopped fighting Touko; I doubt Alice would complain, either."

#. Occurrence B_7:4524:16302: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0118; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4524
msgctxt "text_id=16302 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ここで逃げても、それはそれで誰にとってもどうでもいい話になって終わるだけ。だから他人は関係ない。"
msgstr "  If I chose to run, nobody would give it a second thought. That's why this is all on me."

#. Occurrence B_7:4530:16303: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0119; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4530
msgctxt "text_id=16303 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ホントに意味なんてないのよ、何にだって」"
msgstr "  I know it doesn't make a lot of sense.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4551:16304: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0120; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4551
msgctxt "text_id=16304 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でも私は橙子から逃げたりしない。"
msgstr "\"But I won't run away from Touko."

#. Occurrence B_7:4557:16305: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0121; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4557
msgctxt "text_id=16305 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　これはただの、ここにいるっていう存在証明なの。"
msgstr "  All that matters is proving to myself that I'm alive."

#. Occurrence B_7:4563:16306: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0122; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4563
msgctxt "text_id=16306 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私は単に、意味がないからこそ、できる事はぜんぶやるって決めただけなんだから」"
msgstr "  I know that my life has no meaning, and that's why I can do anything.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4601:16307: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4601
msgctxt "text_id=16307 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　火のような激しさで、蒼崎青子はそう言い切った。"
msgstr "  With fiery passion, Aoko Aozaki had said her piece."

#. Occurrence B_7:4622:16308: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4622
msgctxt "text_id=16308 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――胸にあるのは、<棘|とげ>のような反発だけ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was left with a pang in his chest."

#. Occurrence B_7:4627:16309: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4627
msgctxt "text_id=16309 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜ青子の言葉が苛立たしいのか、草十郎には分からない。"
msgstr "  He did not know why, but her words angered him."

#. Occurrence B_7:4663:16310: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4663
msgctxt "text_id=16310 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……ただ、同時に。"
msgstr "  Then again, at the same time..."

#. Occurrence B_7:4668:16311: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4668
msgctxt "text_id=16311 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこまで自分を律する彼女だからこそ、自分は目を奪われたのだと思い知った。"
msgstr "  Her self-confidence had him in wonder."

#. Occurrence B_7:4674:16312: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4674
msgctxt "text_id=16312 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　意味がないと言いながらも。"
msgstr "  Even though she had said that her life had no meaning."

#. Occurrence B_7:4679:16313: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4679
msgctxt "text_id=16313 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その何もかもをに、意味を持たせようとする<頑|かたく>なさに。"
msgstr "  Her stubbornness gave meaning to everything."

#. Occurrence B_7:4700:16314: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0045; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4700
msgctxt "text_id=16314 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……じゃあ、それが、たとえ」"
msgstr "\"So... would that still apply if...\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4715:16315: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4715
msgctxt "text_id=16315 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　知らず、草十郎は問いかけていた。"
msgstr "  Without thinking, he started to ask another question."

#. Occurrence B_7:4720:16316: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4720
msgctxt "text_id=16316 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の考えを改めさせる為か、それとも、彼自身がその答えを聞きたかったからか。"
msgstr "  Maybe he wanted to change her mind. Maybe he just wanted to hear her answer."

#. Occurrence B_7:4727:16317: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0046; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4727
msgctxt "text_id=16317 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「たとえ、他の誰も、見ていなかったとしても？」"
msgstr "\"...if, say, no one was watching?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4747:16318: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4747
msgctxt "text_id=16318 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呟くような一言。"
msgstr "  It came out as a murmur."

#. Occurrence B_7:4752:16319: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4752
msgctxt "text_id=16319 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……そう。誰も見ていないのなら、逃げた事は分からない。"
msgstr "  Indeed, if no one was watching, no one could know that she had fled."

#. Occurrence B_7:4757:16320: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4757
msgctxt "text_id=16320 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の青子はそういう状況だ。それでも、彼女はあっさりと否定した。"
msgstr "  This was the situation Aoko was in. Even so, she shot him down instantly."

#. Occurrence B_7:4791:16321: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0123; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4791
msgctxt "text_id=16321 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あら、見てるわよ。少なくとも私自身がね」"
msgstr "\"Someone's always watching you. Even if it's only yourself.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4810:16322: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4810
msgctxt "text_id=16322 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あんまりに当たり前の事を言わせたからか、青子の表情は不意をつかれたような、どこか明るいものになっていた。"
msgstr "  Her expression brightened, possibly because she had been surprised at having to state the obvious."

#. Occurrence B_7:4815:16323: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4815
msgctxt "text_id=16323 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目を見張る草十郎と真逆に、青子はつまらなそうに返答する。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was wide-eyed in shock, but Aoko remained nonchalant."

#. Occurrence B_7:4850:16324: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0124; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4850
msgctxt "text_id=16324 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「知らないの草十郎？"
msgstr "\"Haven't you figured it out yet, Soujyuro?"

#. Occurrence B_7:4856:16325: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0125; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4856
msgctxt "text_id=16325 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　生きてく上で一番の観客っていうのはね、他ならぬ自分自身なのよ。だから人生っていうのは油断ならないんじゃない」"
msgstr "  Nobody watches you more than you. That's why you have to stay on your toes.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4888:16326: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4888
msgctxt "text_id=16326 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呆れて語る青子に、草十郎は何も返さずに立ち上がった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro did not respond to her somewhat exasperated tone, but simply rose to his feet."

#. Occurrence B_7:4893:16327: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4893
msgctxt "text_id=16327 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その姿は敗北者じみた<翳|かげ>があって、実に彼らしくない。"
msgstr "  He looked defeated, which was not like him at all."

#. Occurrence B_7:4914:16328: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_7_0126; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4914
msgctxt "text_id=16328 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎？」"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro?\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4933:16329: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0047; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4933
msgctxt "text_id=16329 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……すまない。君が素晴らしいことを言っているのは解るんだ。"
msgstr "\"...I'm sorry. I know you're saying something really incredible."

#. Occurrence B_7:4940:16330: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0048; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:4940
msgctxt "text_id=16330 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "けど、俺には分からない」"
msgstr "It's just, I don't understand it.\""

#. Occurrence B_7:4973:16331: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4973
msgctxt "text_id=16331 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　足音も弱く歩いていく。"
msgstr "  He meekly walked toward the door."

#. Occurrence B_7:4978:16332: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4978
msgctxt "text_id=16332 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は廊下に通じるドアに手を置いて立ち止まった。"
msgstr "  As he placed his hand on the doorknob, he paused."

#. Occurrence B_7:4983:16333: scene=B_7
#: B_7:4983
msgctxt "text_id=16333 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ほんの数秒の、何度も発言を<躊躇|ためら>わせた、短い葛藤。"
msgstr "  For a few seconds, he fought with himself, desperately trying to think of something to say."

#. Occurrence B_7:5004:16334: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_7_0049; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_7
#: B_7:5004
msgctxt "text_id=16334 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_7:5012:16335: scene=B_7
#: B_7:5012
msgctxt "text_id=16335 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　結局、青子にかける言葉を口にできず、草十郎はドアを開けた。"
msgstr "  No words came forth. And so he opened the door,"

#. Occurrence B_7:5037:16336: scene=B_7
#: B_7:5037
msgctxt "text_id=16336 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ドアは無機質な音をたてて開き、来訪者は部屋を後にする。"
msgstr "  which swung with a strange creak, and he left the room."

#. Occurrence B_7:5048:16337: scene=B_7
#: B_7:5048
msgctxt "text_id=16337 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の背中を無言で見送った後、青子はちらりと窓に視線を投げた。"
msgstr "  After watching him go, Aoko turned her gaze toward the window."

#. Occurrence B_7:5053:16338: scene=B_7
#: B_7:5053
msgctxt "text_id=16338 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　じき夕暮れ。"
msgstr "  It was nearly evening."

#. Occurrence B_7:5058:16339: scene=B_7
#: B_7:5058
msgctxt "text_id=16339 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外の町並みには、もう薄い闇がかかろうとしていた。"
msgstr "  A thin veil of darkness was threatening to descend on the town outside."

#. Occurrence B_8:50:16340: scene=B_8
#: B_8:50
msgctxt "text_id=16340 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜になって、礼拝堂には草十郎だけが残された。"
msgstr "  By evening, only Soujyuro remained in the chapel."

#. Occurrence B_8:56:16341: scene=B_8
#: B_8:56
msgctxt "text_id=16341 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年はひとり、長椅子の端に座っている。"
msgstr "  He sat alone at the end of a pew..."

#. Occurrence B_8:61:16342: scene=B_8
#: B_8:61
msgctxt "text_id=16342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　懺悔する者のように、かたちのない無力感を持て余している。"
msgstr "  ...slouching helplessly like a guilty believer ready to confess."

#. Occurrence B_8:83:16343: scene=B_8
#: B_8:83
msgctxt "text_id=16343 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　寒気の<蔦|つた>が壁を伝う。"
msgstr "  The chilly air seeped through the walls,"

#. Occurrence B_8:88:16344: scene=B_8
#: B_8:88
msgctxt "text_id=16344 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　暖の無い礼拝堂では、はき出される呼吸は魂のように白い。"
msgstr "  turning breath to mist."

#. Occurrence B_8:93:16345: scene=B_8
#: B_8:93
msgctxt "text_id=16345 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冷気は容赦なく体から熱を奪っていく。"
msgstr "  The frigid air stole the heat from the body without mercy."

#. Occurrence B_8:98:16346: scene=B_8
#: B_8:98
msgctxt "text_id=16346 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　礼拝堂の高い天井が、広い講堂が、冬の寒さを一層増しているようにしか、草十郎には思えなかった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro looked around at the chapel's tall ceiling and spacious hall; the room made the air feel colder somehow."

#. Occurrence B_8:131:16347: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:131
msgctxt "text_id=16347 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「………………………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_8:137:16348: scene=B_8
#: B_8:137
msgctxt "text_id=16348 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やり場のない感情を持て余して、彼は力なく天井を見つめている。"
msgstr "  Unsure of what to do with himself, he stared into space."

#. Occurrence B_8:142:16349: scene=B_8
#: B_8:142
msgctxt "text_id=16349 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　思考はまったく定まらない。"
msgstr "  His thoughts were entirely unfocused."

#. Occurrence B_8:147:16350: scene=B_8
#: B_8:147
msgctxt "text_id=16350 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　胸のざわつきが何であるのか、まずそれが分からない。"
msgstr "  First and foremost, he could not understand what the buzzing sensation was in his chest."

#. Occurrence B_8:171:16351: scene=B_8
#: B_8:171
msgctxt "text_id=16351 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　答えのないまま時間だけが過ぎていく。"
msgstr "  Time passed by; no answers came."

#. Occurrence B_8:176:16352: scene=B_8
#: B_8:176
msgctxt "text_id=16352 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その様は何かを思案しているようにも取れるし、眠っているようにも取れる。放っておけば石にでも成りかねない、見るも無惨な意気消沈。"
msgstr "  To onlookers, he must have seemed deep in thought, or in a deep sleep, like he would turn to stone if left be. Either way, he clearly looked down."

#. Occurrence B_8:181:16353: scene=B_8
#: B_8:181
msgctxt "text_id=16353 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　問題は、それを彼自身、まったく自覚していない事だ。"
msgstr "  The problem was his lack of awareness-not that he was aware of it, of course."

#. Occurrence B_8:202:16354: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:202
msgctxt "text_id=16354 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「おや。夜間の礼拝とは感心です」"
msgstr "\"Worshipping at this hour? You're quite the devotee.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:242:16355: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:242
msgctxt "text_id=16355 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_8:247:16356: scene=B_8
#: B_8:247
msgctxt "text_id=16356 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　突然の声に顔をあげる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro raised his head, and turned to where the voice had come from."

#. Occurrence B_8:252:16357: scene=B_8
#: B_8:252
msgctxt "text_id=16357 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……いつからそこにいたのか、祭壇の前には昨夜見た神父服の男が立っていた。"
msgstr "  Stood before the altar was the man from last night, dressed in priestly garbs. How long had he been standing there?"

#. Occurrence B_8:277:16358: scene=B_8
#: B_8:277
msgctxt "text_id=16358 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　乾いた音が礼拝堂に<木霊|こだま>する。"
msgstr "  Sound reverberated dryly throughout the chapel hall."

#. Occurrence B_8:282:16359: scene=B_8
#: B_8:282
msgctxt "text_id=16359 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いまさら立ち去るのも、そもそも立ち上がる気力もない草十郎は、歩み寄る影を見届けるしかない。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro did not have the strength to stand, let alone leave. He just stared at the approaching shadow."

#. Occurrence B_8:303:16360: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:303
msgctxt "text_id=16360 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「もっとも、この教会に聖霊なんていませんけどね。"
msgstr "\"Though, you'll not find the Holy Spirit in this church."

#. Occurrence B_8:309:16361: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:309
msgctxt "text_id=16361 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　ここ、座りますがよろしいですか？」"
msgstr "  Do you mind if I sit?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:327:16362: scene=B_8
#: B_8:327
msgctxt "text_id=16362 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父は草十郎と同じ長椅子を指さした。"
msgstr "  The priest pointed at Soujyuro's pew."

#. Occurrence B_8:332:16363: scene=B_8
#: B_8:332
msgctxt "text_id=16363 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎とは逆位置の<端|はじ>っこに、返事を待たず腰をかける。"
msgstr "  Without waiting for an answer, he took a seat at the opposite end."

#. Occurrence B_8:371:16364: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:371
msgctxt "text_id=16364 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「改めて挨拶を。私は<文柄|ふみづか><詠梨|えいり>、この教会の……なんなんでしょうかね、書類の上では持ち主になるんでしょうか。詠梨神父と呼んでください。"
msgstr "\"I never formally introduced myself. I'm Eiri Fumidsuka, this church's... hmmm... 'owner' you could say-on paper, at least. Call me Father Eiri."

#. Occurrence B_8:382:16365: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:382
msgctxt "text_id=16365 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　貴方は静希草十郎君ですか。なるほど、たしかに唯架には見えない」"
msgstr "  You must be Soujyuro Sizuki, yes? I can see why Yuika didn't notice you.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:402:16366: scene=B_8
#: B_8:402
msgctxt "text_id=16366 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　穏やかな口調だが、神父の声には白々しいほど感情がこもっていない。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri spoke in a gentle, but uninvested tone."

#. Occurrence B_8:407:16367: scene=B_8
#: B_8:407
msgctxt "text_id=16367 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　徹底した利<己主義|エゴイスト>者。"
msgstr "  He was a thorough egoist."

#. Occurrence B_8:434:16368: scene=B_8
#: B_8:434
msgctxt "text_id=16368 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こういう声をする人間を、草十郎はよく知っている。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro knew all too well about people who spoke this way."

#. Occurrence B_8:439:16369: scene=B_8
#: B_8:439
msgctxt "text_id=16369 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山から下りる際、彼の世話をしてくれた恩人がこういった<感|こ><情|え>をだす人物だった。"
msgstr "  The individual who cared for him when he first came down from the mountain was one of them."

#. Occurrence B_8:460:16370: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:460
msgctxt "text_id=16370 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_8:465:16371: scene=B_8
#: B_8:465
msgctxt "text_id=16371 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　座ったまま、草十郎は無関心に神父を一瞥する。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro glanced across at him apathetically."

#. Occurrence B_8:470:16372: scene=B_8
#: B_8:470
msgctxt "text_id=16372 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心ここにあらず、といった状態だが、詠梨は気にしていないようだ。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri seemed unfazed by the lack of direction to the conversation."

#. Occurrence B_8:514:16373: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:514
msgctxt "text_id=16373 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「少し君と話がしたいのですが、よろしいでしょうか？」"
msgstr "\"I was wondering if I could speak with you for a moment.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:519:16374: scene=B_8
#: B_8:519
msgctxt "text_id=16374 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はうなずきで答えた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro responded with a nod."

#. Occurrence B_8:524:16375: scene=B_8
#: B_8:524
msgctxt "text_id=16375 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは良かった、と作り物めいた笑みの神父。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri replied with an artificial smile."

#. Occurrence B_8:545:16376: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:545
msgctxt "text_id=16376 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「青子が心配のようですね」"
msgstr "\"You seem terribly worried about Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:551:16377: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:551
msgctxt "text_id=16377 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「別に。律架さんにもそう聞かれましたけど、蒼崎の心配はしていないんです」"
msgstr "\"Not really. Ritsuka said the same thing to me, but that's not it.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:557:16378: scene=B_8
#: B_8:557
msgctxt "text_id=16378 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父を見ずに、前を向いたまま草十郎は返す。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro stared straight ahead as he answered,"

#. Occurrence B_8:562:16379: scene=B_8
#: B_8:562
msgctxt "text_id=16379 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　迷いに満ちた、彼らしからぬ弱々しい声で。"
msgstr "  his voice sounding uncharacteristically weak and unsure."

#. Occurrence B_8:608:16380: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:608
msgctxt "text_id=16380 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「けど、今はずっと彼女の事が気にかかっている。それが何だか分からなくて、さっきから考えてる最中です」"
msgstr "\"She's been on my mind a lot, and I don't know why. I'm trying to figure that out.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:630:16381: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:630
msgctxt "text_id=16381 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「簡単ですよ。君は単に、青子に嫉妬しているのです」"
msgstr "\"The answer's simple: you envy her.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:656:16382: scene=B_8
#: B_8:656
msgctxt "text_id=16382 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれだけ元気のなかった少年の顔が、その一言で蘇った。"
msgstr "  With those few words, Soujyuro snapped out of his funk."

#. Occurrence B_8:661:16383: scene=B_8
#: B_8:661
msgctxt "text_id=16383 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は水を得た魚のように、ぽん、と両手を打って神父に顔を向ける。"
msgstr "  He clapped his hands, and turned toward the priest."

#. Occurrence B_8:689:16384: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:689
msgctxt "text_id=16384 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そっか。俺はたんに、蒼崎が<羨|うらや>ましかっただけなんだ。"
msgstr "\"I see. So I just envy her."

#. Occurrence B_8:702:16385: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:702
msgctxt "text_id=16385 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　―――いや、でも、それは困るな。"
msgstr "  ...Wait a second. That can't be good."

#. Occurrence B_8:709:16386: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:709
msgctxt "text_id=16386 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "自分の中に、そういうところがあるなんて、気づきもしなかった」"
msgstr "I didn't know I could feel that way.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:715:16387: scene=B_8
#: B_8:715
msgctxt "text_id=16387 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　懺悔のような呟きに、神父は何も返さない。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri did not respond to his confession-like ramblings."

#. Occurrence B_8:743:16388: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:743
msgctxt "text_id=16388 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それで、話っていうのはなんですか？」"
msgstr "\"So, what did you want to talk to me about?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:773:16389: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0008; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:773
msgctxt "text_id=16389 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いえ、話というより質問です。"
msgstr "\"Well, it's more of a question I'd like to ask, really."

#. Occurrence B_8:779:16390: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0009; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:779
msgctxt "text_id=16390 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　君は今まで山奥に住んでいたと聞きました。そこで一つ、どうしても気になる事があって」"
msgstr "  I heard you lived deep in the mountains until recently. Something strikes me as curious.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:785:16391: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:785
msgctxt "text_id=16391 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「気になる事、ですか？」"
msgstr "\"Really? What?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:806:16392: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0010; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:806
msgctxt "text_id=16392 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「はい。おそらく、今まで誰も貴方にこの手の質問をしなかったのでしょう。"
msgstr "\"Well, I doubt anyone has asked you this before."

#. Occurrence B_8:813:16393: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0011; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:813
msgctxt "text_id=16393 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "それは貴方が、他人にその手の不安を感じさせないからです。実際私もそう思いますし。"
msgstr "No doubt, because you don't unnerve the people around you. I admit, I feel the same way, talking to you."

#. Occurrence B_8:825:16394: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0012; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:825
msgctxt "text_id=16394 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　ですから、まあ。これも縁ですし、私も肩書きが<神父|コレ>ですしねぇ。迷える子羊がいるんですから、それなりの<勤|つと>めをはたさないと後ろめたいというか」"
msgstr "  Maybe it's opportunity presenting itself, or my sense of obligation as a man of the cloth, but when I see a lost lamb, I feel a need to guide it.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:864:16395: scene=B_8
#: B_8:864
msgctxt "text_id=16395 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして、神父は穏やかな瞳を草十郎へ向けた。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri looked at Soujyuro placidly;"

#. Occurrence B_8:869:16396: scene=B_8
#: B_8:869
msgctxt "text_id=16396 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　容赦なく暗い、罪を<暴|あば>くような瞳を。"
msgstr "  his pupils were like black holes that could suck the soul out of your body."

#. Occurrence B_8:907:16397: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:907
msgctxt "text_id=16397 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「おかしなコトが気になるんですね。"
msgstr "\"I'm not sure what you're talking about."

#. Occurrence B_8:913:16398: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:913
msgctxt "text_id=16398 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……その、質問というのは？」"
msgstr "  ...What's your question exactly?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:934:16399: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0013; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:934
msgctxt "text_id=16399 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いえ、ごく自然の疑問ですよ。"
msgstr "\"Oh, don't worry. It's nothing unusual."

#. Occurrence B_8:940:16400: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0014; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:940
msgctxt "text_id=16400 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　貴方はなぜ山から下りてきたのか。そこでなら君は幸福だったでしょうに」"
msgstr "  Simply, why did you come down here? You seem like you'd be happier back home.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:967:16401: scene=B_8
#: B_8:967
msgctxt "text_id=16401 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　罪状こそ確かではないが、それは確かに告発だった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was not sure what he had done, but it sounded as though the priest was accusing him of something."

#. Occurrence B_8:972:16402: scene=B_8
#: B_8:972
msgctxt "text_id=16402 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　遅すぎたといえば遅すぎ、当然と言えば当然の質問。"
msgstr "  Then again, it was a reasonable question, if a little pointless."

#. Occurrence B_8:993:16403: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:993
msgctxt "text_id=16403 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_8:998:16404: scene=B_8
#: B_8:998
msgctxt "text_id=16404 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎に返答はない。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro had no answer."

#. Occurrence B_8:1003:16405: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1003
msgctxt "text_id=16405 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　苦虫をかみつぶす少年を無視して神父は続ける。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri ignored the sullen boy and continued."

#. Occurrence B_8:1025:16406: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0015; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1025
msgctxt "text_id=16406 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「山での生活がいかに厳しいものかは、私も人並みには知っています。若い頃、ちょっとした手違いで遭難した事もありますしね。"
msgstr "\"I'm somewhat aware of the challenges a life in the mountains might bring. I experienced it firsthand when I made a small mistake in my youth."

#. Occurrence B_8:1031:16407: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0016; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1031
msgctxt "text_id=16407 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　山での生活はこの上なく簡素です。なにしろ生きること以外に時間をさく余裕がない。愉しむ為に生きるのではなく、生きる為にただ生きる。生活は必要最小限を、さらに切り詰めたものとなっていく」"
msgstr "  Life in the mountains is incredibly simple: your time is dedicated to survival. You don't live for joy, but rather to stay alive. It makes a minimalist lifestyle seem full of excess.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1069:16408: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0017; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1069
msgctxt "text_id=16408 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「山での生活に比べれば、都市の在り方は楽園以外の何物でもないでしょう。"
msgstr "\"Compared to that, city life should be nothing short of paradise."

#. Occurrence B_8:1075:16409: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0018; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1075
msgctxt "text_id=16409 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　ですが。楽園の定義は、人それぞれです」"
msgstr "  However, paradise means something different to everyone.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1081:16410: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1081
msgctxt "text_id=16410 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は答えない。表情も何も語らない。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro still did not answer; his expression remained blank."

#. Occurrence B_8:1086:16411: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1086
msgctxt "text_id=16411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ、神父の声だけが礼拝堂に<木霊|こだま>する。"
msgstr "  The only sound was the priest's voice echoing around the chapel."

#. Occurrence B_8:1119:16412: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0019; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1119
msgctxt "text_id=16412 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「一粒の種の誕生すら喜びになる生活。"
msgstr "\"A life where even a single seed could bring joy..."

#. Occurrence B_8:1125:16413: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0020; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1125
msgctxt "text_id=16413 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　電気の明かりがどれだけ暖かでも、自然のままの厳しい寒さを君は<尊|とうと>んでいた筈です。"
msgstr "  No matter the warmth the light of electricity brings, I expect you respect the bitter cold of nature more."

#. Occurrence B_8:1146:16414: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0021; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1146
msgctxt "text_id=16414 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　なのになぜ、下りてきたのですか。山にいれば、君は<倖|しあわ>せだったでしょうに」"
msgstr "  So tell me, why come here when you'd be happier in the mountains?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1166:16415: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1166
msgctxt "text_id=16415 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父の問いが、もう一度繰り返される。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri repeated his question."

#. Occurrence B_8:1171:16416: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1171
msgctxt "text_id=16416 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は堅く口を閉ざしている。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's mouth remained firmly shut."

#. Occurrence B_8:1181:16417: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1181
msgctxt "text_id=16417 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは答えたくないのではなく、彼自身、どうしてそうなったのか未だ分からないからだ。"
msgstr "  Not because he did not want to answer, but because he simply did not know how to."

#. Occurrence B_8:1204:16418: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1204
msgctxt "text_id=16418 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……確かな事は、帰りたくとも、もう帰ってはいけないという事実だけ。"
msgstr "  All he knew was even if he wanted to go back, he could not."

#. Occurrence B_8:1225:16419: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0022; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1225
msgctxt "text_id=16419 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「困ったものです。そこをはっきりさせない事には、いつまでも救いがない。"
msgstr "\"My son. Salvation will not be forthcoming to those who choose to ignore its calling."

#. Occurrence B_8:1243:16420: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0023; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1243
msgctxt "text_id=16420 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　故郷を捨てた理由も分からないのに、旅先の土地を愛するコトなんて、まっとうな人間にはできませんよ。"
msgstr "  If you don't know why you left, you won't be able to love where you arrived."

#. Occurrence B_8:1249:16421: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0024; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1249
msgctxt "text_id=16421 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　これは忠告ですが。すべてを無条件に肯定したところで、幸福になれるとはかぎりません。"
msgstr "  A word of advice: happiness doesn't come from the unquestionable acceptance of everything."

#. Occurrence B_8:1255:16422: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0025; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1255
msgctxt "text_id=16422 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　貴方はもう少し、自分の心を許してあげないと」"
msgstr "  Be fairer to yourself.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1296:16423: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1296
msgctxt "text_id=16423 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎には、神父の言葉はまったく理解できない。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro could not make sense of what he was being told."

#. Occurrence B_8:1301:16424: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1301
msgctxt "text_id=16424 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ、最後の言葉だけは印象的だった。"
msgstr "  Only the father's last words made any impression on him."

#. Occurrence B_8:1333:16425: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1333
msgctxt "text_id=16425 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の心を許せ、と言うけど。"
msgstr "  Being fairer to yourself is easier said than done, of course."

#. Occurrence B_8:1339:16426: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1339
msgctxt "text_id=16426 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼には、その心のカタチがよく分からない。"
msgstr "  And what that entailed, Soujyuro was uncertain of."

#. Occurrence B_8:1368:16427: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1368
msgctxt "text_id=16427 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ああ、そう言えば―――」"
msgstr "\"Actually, that makes sense...\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1374:16428: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1374
msgctxt "text_id=16428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　同じような事を、蒼崎橙子も口にしていた。"
msgstr "  Touko had mentioned something similar before, and it had impressed him."

#. Occurrence B_8:1379:16429: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1379
msgctxt "text_id=16429 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子といい、この神父といい、口にしてもいない事をよく言い当てられるものだな、と草十郎は感心する。"
msgstr "  First her, now this priest. How could people know things he hadn't even told them?"

#. Occurrence B_8:1425:16430: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1425
msgctxt "text_id=16430 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……すごいですね。神父さんっていうのは、みんなそうなんですか」"
msgstr "\"...Wow. Are all priests like you?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1431:16431: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1431
msgctxt "text_id=16431 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さっきまでの暗さはどこへいったのか、不思議そうに草十郎は言った。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro said, curious as to where the weight on his shoulders had gone to."

#. Occurrence B_8:1436:16432: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1436
msgctxt "text_id=16432 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心の傷が表に<顕|あらわ>れない、ある意味、鉄の心臓がこの少年の特徴である。"
msgstr "  In a way, one of his strong points is the fact that his emotional scars do not show on the surface."

#. Occurrence B_8:1473:16433: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0026; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1473
msgctxt "text_id=16433 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ええ。神父は悩みを<暴|あば>くのが仕事ですから。"
msgstr "\"Indeed. A priest is obliged to shine a light on troubled hearts."

#. Occurrence B_8:1480:16434: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0027; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1480
msgctxt "text_id=16434 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "ま、たいていは暴くだけで埋めるのに失敗するんですけどね」"
msgstr "Though, of course, that's not always enough.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1501:16435: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1501
msgctxt "text_id=16435 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……。悩みを暴くって、つまり相談事ですか？」"
msgstr "\"By 'shine a light,' do you mean 'talk things over'?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1520:16436: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0028; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1520
msgctxt "text_id=16436 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「そういうソフトなのも<承|うけたまわ>っています。私が解決できる悩みなど、タカが知れているようですけど」"
msgstr "\"Yes. To a certain extent at least. The only problems I can solve are mostly small.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1546:16437: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1546
msgctxt "text_id=16437 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父は困ったように肩をすくめる。"
msgstr "  The priest shrugged, looking a little disconcerted."

#. Occurrence B_8:1551:16438: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1551
msgctxt "text_id=16438 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　信用できないコトこの上ないが、今の草十郎には誰であろうと後光が差して見えるのだった。"
msgstr "  Granted Soujyuro still did not trust Father Eiri at all, but at that moment anyone was ray of light in his eyes."

#. Occurrence B_8:1586:16439: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0016; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1586
msgctxt "text_id=16439 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あの。じゃあ、タカが知れた程度の悩みを聞いてもらえますか」"
msgstr "\"Um, do you mind helping me with another small problem?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1605:16440: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0029; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1605
msgctxt "text_id=16440 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「君が青子をなぜ<羨|うらや>むか、ですね」"
msgstr "\"You want to know why you're envious of Aoko, correct?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1611:16441: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1611
msgctxt "text_id=16441 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人の心でも読めるのか、神父は穏やかな眼差しのまま草十郎の台詞を先読みする。"
msgstr "  It was as though the priest could see into the boy's soul with his serene eyes."

#. Occurrence B_8:1652:16442: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0017; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1652
msgctxt "text_id=16442 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「えっと……まあ、そういう事です。"
msgstr "\"Well... yeah."

#. Occurrence B_8:1659:16443: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0018_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1659
msgctxt "text_id=16443 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　自分でも、どうしてそう思うのかが分からない。"
msgstr "  I don't even know why I feel this way myself."

#. Occurrence B_8:1672:16444: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0018_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1672
msgctxt "text_id=16444 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "でも貴方なら、それを知ってそうだ」"
msgstr " But you seem to.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1709:16445: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0030; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1709
msgctxt "text_id=16445 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「知りませんけど、まあ、無責任に答えましょうか。"
msgstr "\"I don't. I can simply guess, not being the one to shoulder the burden."

#. Occurrence B_8:1715:16446: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0031; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1715
msgctxt "text_id=16446 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　それはおそらく、貴方には根拠がないからですよ。"
msgstr "  Your envy may come from your lack of a foundation."

#. Occurrence B_8:1722:16447: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0032; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1722
msgctxt "text_id=16447 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "自分の色がない、と喩えた方が正確ですが」"
msgstr "Or, more accurately, your lack of a color of your own.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1742:16448: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1742
msgctxt "text_id=16448 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　すっぱりと答える詠梨神父に、草十郎は難解そうに目を細めた。色がない、とはどういう意味なのだろう、と。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro squinted, trying to understand the priest's complicated yet concise answer."

#. Occurrence B_8:1768:16449: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0033; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1768
msgctxt "text_id=16449 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ほら、そこです。君に<勝|すぐ>れた部分があるとしたら、その順応性です。"
msgstr "\"This is what I'm talking about. You are extraordinarily flexible."

#. Occurrence B_8:1774:16450: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0034; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1774
msgctxt "text_id=16450 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　山という異界から町に下りて、一人で暮らしていけた事。"
msgstr "  You learned to live alone in a city after coming down from the mountains."

#. Occurrence B_8:1780:16451: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0035; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1780
msgctxt "text_id=16451 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　ようやく慣れた常識の中で、青子たちという非常識と関わっても暮らしていけた事。"
msgstr "  And then, once you'd gotten used to that, you started living with Aoko and Alice in a very different world."

#. Occurrence B_8:1787:16452: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0036; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1787
msgctxt "text_id=16452 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "……そうであれと努めているにしても、貴方の順応性は<際|きわ>だっている。"
msgstr "I don't know if you consciously try to adapt, but regardless, your ability to do so is astonishing."

#. Occurrence B_8:1793:16453: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0037; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1793
msgctxt "text_id=16453 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　原因は知りませんが、君には初めから、自我というものが第一に表れてはいないのです」"
msgstr "  Also, I don't know why, but you do not appear to exhibit signs of a regular ego.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1819:16454: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0038; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1819
msgctxt "text_id=16454 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「何事にも対応できるものの、<朱|しゅ>に<交|まじ>わるほど器用でもない。"
msgstr "\"You can respond to anything, but aren't influenced by it."

#. Occurrence B_8:1825:16455: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0039; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1825
msgctxt "text_id=16455 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　しいて言うのなら、色の乗っていない空白ですかね。"
msgstr "  To be frank, you're a blank canvas that stays blank."

#. Occurrence B_8:1831:16456: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0040; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1831
msgctxt "text_id=16456 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　風景に溶けこむ自然さは素晴らしい人徳ですが、自我がないという事は、居場所がないという事ですから。"
msgstr "  While blending in to your surroundings is a wonderful thing, no sense of self means having no place to call home."

#. Occurrence B_8:1837:16457: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0041; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1837
msgctxt "text_id=16457 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　いいコトばかりじゃありません」"
msgstr "  Your talent is a double-edged sword.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1879:16458: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0042; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1879
msgctxt "text_id=16458 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「唯架にまで見えない、というのは予想以上でしたが。"
msgstr "\"The fact Yuika didn't see you was unexpected."

#. Occurrence B_8:1885:16459: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0043; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1885
msgctxt "text_id=16459 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　姿なき精霊すら捉えるアレが見えなかったのですから、君の無欲ぶりも筋金入りだ」"
msgstr "  She can perceive even incorporeal elemental spirits, and yet not you. That says a lot about your lack of greed.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:1932:16460: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1932
msgctxt "text_id=16460 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なにが嬉しいのか、微笑みながら神父はそう告げた。"
msgstr "  As if amused by something, Father Eiri grinned."

#. Occurrence B_8:1937:16461: scene=B_8
#: B_8:1937
msgctxt "text_id=16461 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎には彼の言いたい事も、その笑顔の意味もさっぱり分からない。"
msgstr "  However, Soujyuro understood neither the meaning of his smile nor his words."

#. Occurrence B_8:1986:16462: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0044; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1986
msgctxt "text_id=16462 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「憶測にすぎませんが、青子は貴方を見て反感を覚えたと思いますよ。"
msgstr "\"This is mere speculation, but I believe Aoko feels resentment when she looks at you."

#. Occurrence B_8:1992:16463: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0045; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1992
msgctxt "text_id=16463 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　自分のない貴方は、自己を押し通してきた彼女にとって認めがたいものだったでしょうから。"
msgstr "  To a brazen soul like her, your lack of self is something she simply cannot accept."

#. Occurrence B_8:1998:16464: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0046; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:1998
msgctxt "text_id=16464 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　そして同時に、貴方は青子に、自分ではどうしても手に入れられないものを見てしまった」"
msgstr "  And yet, you see something in Aoko you could never attain.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:2037:16465: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0047; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2037
msgctxt "text_id=16465 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「言葉にすると下らない表現になりますが、そういう事です。"
msgstr "\"It feels crude to put such things into words, but it is what it is."

#. Occurrence B_8:2043:16466: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0048; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2043
msgctxt "text_id=16466 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　先程は嫉妬と言いましたが、それは訂正しましょう。"
msgstr "  A moment ago, I said you envied Aoko, but that's not quite true."

#. Occurrence B_8:2049:16467: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0049; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2049
msgctxt "text_id=16467 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　君は青子に―――いや、いいです。"
msgstr "  In fact, you... No. Never mind."

#. Occurrence B_8:2056:16468: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0050; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2056
msgctxt "text_id=16468 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "言葉にするのは、それこそ<野|や><暮|ぼ>だ」"
msgstr "Some things are best left unsaid.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:2088:16469: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2088
msgctxt "text_id=16469 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　柔らかに神父は笑った。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri smiled gently."

#. Occurrence B_8:2093:16470: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2093
msgctxt "text_id=16470 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは詠梨本来の年齢を思わせる、若々しい笑みだった。"
msgstr "  It was a fresh-faced grin that belied his age."

#. Occurrence B_8:2111:16471: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2111
msgctxt "text_id=16471 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この人物は青子の事になると<神父然|しんぷぜん>とした姿勢が崩れるようだ。"
msgstr "  Whenever it came to Aoko, he seemed to forget his role as a priest."

#. Occurrence B_8:2116:16472: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2116
msgctxt "text_id=16472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　と、それはともかく。"
msgstr "  But that was irrelevant to Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence B_8:2143:16473: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0019; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2143
msgctxt "text_id=16473 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「えっと、神父さん。それで結局、自分は青子のどこらへんに憧れてるんですか？」"
msgstr "\"So, um, Father, what exactly do I admire about Aoko, then?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:2169:16474: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2169
msgctxt "text_id=16474 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　要領を得ない詠梨の言葉に、草十郎は真っ正面から聞き返す。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro responded to Father Eiri's rambling by being direct."

#. Occurrence B_8:2174:16475: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2174
msgctxt "text_id=16475 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　順を追って話していた詠梨だが、この相手には冗長すぎたようだ。"
msgstr "  Some would say the priest had been direct himself, but this was Soujyuro, and he needed things spelled out."

#. Occurrence B_8:2212:16476: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0051; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2212
msgctxt "text_id=16476 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「……今のでも分からない、と。"
msgstr "\"...You still don't get it?"

#. Occurrence B_8:2218:16477: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0052; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2218
msgctxt "text_id=16477 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　まいりましたね。こういう事は言葉を尽くすほど実感が湧かないものですが……ま、私も神父と呼ばれる身です。少し切り口を変えて代弁してみましょう。"
msgstr "  Then you have me beat, Soujyuro. Some things really are difficult to put into words. Then again, I am simply a man of the cloth. How about a change of tack?"

#. Occurrence B_8:2251:16478: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0053; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2251
msgctxt "text_id=16478 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　貴方は青子の過去を知っていますか？」"
msgstr "  Do you know about Aoko's past?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:2308:16479: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0020; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2308
msgctxt "text_id=16479 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「詳しくは知りません。高校デビューとか、おかしな言葉を口にしてましたけど」"
msgstr "\"Not much. She told me some weird stuff I didn't understand about her start to high school and things.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:2360:16480: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0054; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2360
msgctxt "text_id=16480 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「まったく知らないというコトですね。"
msgstr "\"So by 'not much,' you mean 'nothing.'"

#. Occurrence B_8:2366:16481: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0055; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2366
msgctxt "text_id=16481 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　いいでしょう。では静希君、益体のないたとえ話ですが。"
msgstr "  Very well, Sizuki. Allow me to try something more abstract."

#. Occurrence B_8:2377:16482: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0056; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2377
msgctxt "text_id=16482 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　君は、突然自殺しろと言われて従えますか？」"
msgstr "  If you were suddenly told to kill yourself, could you?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:2383:16483: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0021; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2383
msgctxt "text_id=16483 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「自殺……ですか？」"
msgstr "\"K-Kill myself...?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:2409:16484: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0057; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2409
msgctxt "text_id=16484 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「そう、自殺です。神父である私が口にしていい事ではありませんが、ま、私は格好だけなのでいいでしょう。"
msgstr "\"Yes, kill yourself. Of course, a priest shouldn't talk about such things, but my appearance is only skin deep."

#. Occurrence B_8:2436:16485: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0058; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2436
msgctxt "text_id=16485 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　青子はね、近いことを求められたのです、十五歳の時に。"
msgstr "  Anyway, Aoko was asked to do something along those lines when she was fifteen."

#. Occurrence B_8:2442:16486: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0059; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2442
msgctxt "text_id=16486 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　彼女がそれまで積み重ねてきた努力も希望も、過去も未来もすべて捨てること。今日からおまえは違う生き物として生きろ、とね。"
msgstr "  Throw away her hopes and dreams, her past and future, everything she was up to that point. Become a different being entirely."

#. Occurrence B_8:2448:16487: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0060; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2448
msgctxt "text_id=16487 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　どうです？　それは自己の抹消、未来の死と同じだと思いませんか？」"
msgstr "  Well? The end of your self is the end of your future, wouldn't you agree?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:2484:16488: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0022; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2484
msgctxt "text_id=16488 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_8:2490:16489: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2490
msgctxt "text_id=16489 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父の言葉は、たしかに青子が口にした過去と一致する。"
msgstr "  His words fit what Aoko had said about her past."

#. Occurrence B_8:2495:16490: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2495
msgctxt "text_id=16490 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎青子は中学まで、普通の学生として暮らしてきた。"
msgstr "  Until middle school, she led a normal life."

#. Occurrence B_8:2500:16491: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2500
msgctxt "text_id=16491 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが突然、姉に代わって家を継ぐ事になってしまった。"
msgstr "  Then out of the blue, she became the family heiress in place of her sister."

#. Occurrence B_8:2543:16492: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2543
msgctxt "text_id=16492 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法使いになる、という事は、今までの生活を捨てる、という事らしい。"
msgstr "  Becoming a Magician meant casting aside the life she had known."

#. Occurrence B_8:2548:16493: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2548
msgctxt "text_id=16493 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は知識としてしか受けとめていなかった魔術師の観念を常識にして、今までの努力も展望も捨てて、違う生き方を余儀なくされた。"
msgstr "  She had to leave behind her ambitions and prospects, and live the life of a mage-something she barely knew anything about."

#. Occurrence B_8:2569:16494: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2569
msgctxt "text_id=16494 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして、その生き方は、それまでの青子の常識からすれば、苦痛しかともなわない道だった。"
msgstr "  Her life up to that point had taught her that everything from then on would bring her misery."

#. Occurrence B_8:2596:16495: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2596
msgctxt "text_id=16495 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……青子の祖父は、彼女に強制はしなかった。"
msgstr "  Aoko's grandfather was not the forceful type."

#. Occurrence B_8:2601:16496: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2601
msgctxt "text_id=16496 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“姉が駄目になったので、次はおまえだ”としか言わなかったらしい。"
msgstr "  Your sister has failed. Now, it's your turn, he had said."

#. Occurrence B_8:2606:16497: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2606
msgctxt "text_id=16497 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はそれを拒んだろうか……？"
msgstr "  Did Aoko resist?"

#. Occurrence B_8:2611:16498: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2611
msgctxt "text_id=16498 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎には考えもつかない。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro could not begin to imagine."

#. Occurrence B_8:2648:16499: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2648
msgctxt "text_id=16499 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……けれど。彼女がそのカードを、喜んで選んでいない事だけは断言できる。"
msgstr "  All he knew is that she could not be happy with the hand she was dealt."

#. Occurrence B_8:2654:16500: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2654
msgctxt "text_id=16500 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法使いとしての生き方が魅力的だったとしても、今までの生活をあっさりと切り捨てる事なんて、あの少女にはあり得ない。"
msgstr "  Even if the life of a Magician was attractive, to believe the possibility that Aoko could give up her lifestyle up to that point was to not know her at all."

#. Occurrence B_8:2674:16501: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2674
msgctxt "text_id=16501 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だって、蒼崎青子はいつだって本気で走っていた。"
msgstr "  Aoko Aozaki put her all into everything."

#. Occurrence B_8:2680:16502: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2680
msgctxt "text_id=16502 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　必然、彼女の十五年間はその努力の分だけ、十分に報われていた筈だ。"
msgstr "  She had probably achieved a lot in those fifteen years."

#. Occurrence B_8:2685:16503: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2685
msgctxt "text_id=16503 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それまでの成果も、将来の展望も、誰もが羨むだけの輝きを持っていた筈なのだ。"
msgstr "  Her achievements and prospects were no doubt enough to make anyone jealous."

#. Occurrence B_8:2691:16504: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2691
msgctxt "text_id=16504 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "それを白紙に戻して、一からやり直す決意を持てるものなのか。"
msgstr "But did she have the conviction to those away and go back to square one?"

#. Occurrence B_8:2718:16505: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2718
msgctxt "text_id=16505 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……単純に、やり直すだけではなく。"
msgstr "  And \"square one\" did not come close to the reality of it."

#. Occurrence B_8:2724:16506: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2724
msgctxt "text_id=16506 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ずっと描いていた<未来|ゆめ>を、完膚無きまでに、殺す事になったとしても。"
msgstr "  The future she had envisioned for so long would have been obliterated."

#. Occurrence B_8:2780:16507: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0023; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2780
msgctxt "text_id=16507 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……青子は、どうしたんですか？」"
msgstr "\"...So, what did Aoko do?\""

#. Occurrence B_8:2817:16508: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0061; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2817
msgctxt "text_id=16508 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いや、これがもう、まったくの頑固者でして。"
msgstr "\"Well, we're talking about one exceptionally stubborn girl."

#. Occurrence B_8:2823:16509: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0062; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2823
msgctxt "text_id=16509 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　立ち会った私でさえどうかと思うぐらい、簡単に<頷|うなず>きました。"
msgstr "  Had I not witnessed it myself I wouldn't have believed it, but... she nodded."

#. Occurrence B_8:2830:16510: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0063; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2830
msgctxt "text_id=16510 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "震える指を懸命に握りこんで、やってやろうじゃない、と見得を切ってね。"
msgstr "She stood there defiantly, curling her shaking fingers into balled fists."

#. Occurrence B_8:2836:16511: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0064; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2836
msgctxt "text_id=16511 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　彼女は祖父の期待や蒼崎の責任感からではなく、逃げる事を嫌って、魔術師の道を取ったんですよ」"
msgstr "  Not to appease her grandfather. Not out of obligation to the Aozaki family. But because she hates to run away from anything.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:2885:16512: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0065; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2885
msgctxt "text_id=16512 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「拒む事は逃げではないのでしょうが、青子にはそう思えたんでしょう。……逃避という行為は、これまでの自分の<人生|じかん>を否定する事になると。"
msgstr "\"Now, refusing something is not the same as running away from it, but try telling that to Aoko. To her, running away would be rejecting the life she'd forged."

#. Occurrence B_8:2891:16513: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0066; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2891
msgctxt "text_id=16513 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　今までの自分を嘘にしてしまうのなら―――今までの生活に別れを告げる事を、青子は選んだのです。"
msgstr "  If that was all to go, she would say farewell on her own terms. So that was what she did."

#. Occurrence B_8:2897:16514: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0067; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:2897
msgctxt "text_id=16514 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　ま、極端ではありますが。アレは前に進む為なら、全てを捨てられる人間なんです」"
msgstr "  Extreme, but she's the kind of person who would sacrifice everything in the name of progress.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:2977:16515: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2977
msgctxt "text_id=16515 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　詠梨神父は懐かしむように微笑んだ。"
msgstr "  An affectionate smile crossed Father Eiri's face."

#. Occurrence B_8:2982:16516: scene=B_8
#: B_8:2982
msgctxt "text_id=16516 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこには青子に対する親近感というよりは、保護者としての誇らしさがうかがえた。"
msgstr "  Rather than signaling his closeness to Aoko, it conveyed the pride of a guardian."

#. Occurrence B_8:3034:16517: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0068; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3034
msgctxt "text_id=16517 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「……ですが、私も思い違いをしていました。結局はそうなるように、青子は育てられていたのです。"
msgstr "\"However, I was also mistaken. As it turns out, Aoko had been raised to become a mage all along."

#. Occurrence B_8:3040:16518: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0069; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3040
msgctxt "text_id=16518 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　彼女の祖父は、橙子が家を出る事も、青子が後継ぎを了解する事も読んだ上で、あの二人を育ててきた」"
msgstr "  Her grandfather predicted Touko would leave, and that Aoko would become his heiress. So he raised them both accordingly.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:3079:16519: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0070; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3079
msgctxt "text_id=16519 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「カタチだけですが、私も神父としてさすがにそれはどうかと思いましてね。<柄|がら>にもなく青子を説得したものです。"
msgstr "\"As a priest-if only by name-I felt uncomfortable about that; I knew she had no interest in her new role."

#. Occurrence B_8:3085:16520: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0071; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3085
msgctxt "text_id=16520 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　祖父の思い通りになる事はありません、なんなら私とメキシコあたりに逃げませんかと。"
msgstr "  Things could hardly go exactly how her grandfather had planned, so I asked her to flee with me to Mexico."

#. Occurrence B_8:3091:16521: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0072; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3091
msgctxt "text_id=16521 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　―――しかしまぁ、躊躇なくフられました。"
msgstr "  Alas, she turned me down without a moment's thought."

#. Occurrence B_8:3097:16522: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0073; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3097
msgctxt "text_id=16522 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　その時の彼女の返答は、今でも一言一句覚えています」"
msgstr "  I still remember every word of her answer...\""

#. Occurrence B_8:3139:16523: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_8_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3139
msgctxt "text_id=16523 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "『……だって、私ひとりがどんなに泣き叫んでも今の状況は変わらないんでしょ？"
msgstr "\"...Well, me crying isn't going to change anything, is it?"

#. Occurrence B_8:3145:16524: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_8_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3145
msgctxt "text_id=16524 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私にしかできないなら、正面から受けて立つ。"
msgstr "  If I'm the only one who can do it, I'll do it."

#. Occurrence B_8:3151:16525: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_8_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3151
msgctxt "text_id=16525 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　たとえ不本意で、とつぜん投げこまれた川の中でだって、出来ることはあるはずだもの。"
msgstr "  Even if I get thrown to the wolves, I'll just have to find a way to survive."

#. Occurrence B_8:3157:16526: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_8_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3157
msgctxt "text_id=16526 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　逃げるなんてのは最後の最後。"
msgstr "  Running away is only a last resort."

#. Occurrence B_8:3163:16527: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_B_8_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3163
msgctxt "text_id=16527 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それまでは、せいぜい華麗に踊ってやるわ』"
msgstr "  Until then, hear me roar.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:3216:16528: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3216
msgctxt "text_id=16528 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　過去を懐かしむように、神父は少女の台詞を暗唱した。"
msgstr "  The priest recited her words as if recalling lines from a favorite play."

#. Occurrence B_8:3221:16529: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3221
msgctxt "text_id=16529 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは、たしかに彼女らしい台詞だった。"
msgstr "  It certainly seemed like something she would say."

#. Occurrence B_8:3226:16530: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3226
msgctxt "text_id=16530 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　病室で青子と交わした最後の台詞は、たぶんそういう意味なのだ。"
msgstr "  The last thing Aoko said in the room she was recovering in probably meant the same."

#. Occurrence B_8:3259:16531: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3259
msgctxt "text_id=16531 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　観客はもちろんいるし、喝采も当然のように求めるべきものだ。"
msgstr "  Of course, when an audience is watching, you want their approval."

#. Occurrence B_8:3264:16532: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3264
msgctxt "text_id=16532 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、それを一番初めに贈るのは自分であって、決して他人ではない。"
msgstr "  However, approval must come from within first."

#. Occurrence B_8:3269:16533: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3269
msgctxt "text_id=16533 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　周りに認められるより先に、あの少女はまず、自分自身に胸を張れるよう走ってきた。"
msgstr "  Aoko worked to feel proud of herself before worrying about how others viewed her."

#. Occurrence B_8:3290:16534: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3290
msgctxt "text_id=16534 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　せめて美しく。"
msgstr "  She at least wanted to do her job with grace."

#. Occurrence B_8:3295:16535: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3295
msgctxt "text_id=16535 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無くしてきた多くのものに応えられるように、たとえ地上に一人きりになっても、ああやってやせ我慢を続けるのだ。"
msgstr "  In response to everything she had lost, she would hang in there, even if it meant going it alone."

#. Occurrence B_8:3364:16536: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3364
msgctxt "text_id=16536 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜ羨んでいるのかなんて、言葉にするまでもない。"
msgstr "  As for why Soujyuro envied her... well, that was obvious."

#. Occurrence B_8:3369:16537: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3369
msgctxt "text_id=16537 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼には、彼女の在り方があまりにも誇らしかった。"
msgstr "  To Soujyuro, she lived her life with her head held high."

#. Occurrence B_8:3408:16538: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3408
msgctxt "text_id=16538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　全てを受け入れていながら、その実、何も手に入れていない人間がいて、"
msgstr "  He was a boy who accepted everything, but had nothing."

#. Occurrence B_8:3414:16539: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3414
msgctxt "text_id=16539 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　全てを捨ててきたようで、その実、何一つ失ってはいない少女がいた。"
msgstr "  She was a girl who threw it all away, but never lost a thing."

#. Occurrence B_8:3442:16540: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3442
msgctxt "text_id=16540 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……まだ誰とも出会っていなかった雨の会議室。"
msgstr "  He stood in the meeting room alone,"

#. Occurrence B_8:3447:16541: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3447
msgctxt "text_id=16541 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自らの醜さと、"
msgstr "  seeing the ugliness within,"

#. Occurrence B_8:3452:16542: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3452
msgctxt "text_id=16542 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正反対の気高さを見た。"
msgstr "  and the sublime outside."

#. Occurrence B_8:3458:16543: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3458
msgctxt "text_id=16543 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　思えばあの時。"
msgstr "  Looking back,"

#. Occurrence B_8:3463:16544: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3463
msgctxt "text_id=16544 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼はようやく、自分の棘に気が付いたのだ。"
msgstr "  he finally realized what was eating at him."

#. Occurrence B_8:3528:16545: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0074; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3528
msgctxt "text_id=16545 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「もういいでしょう。君は青子の容姿に感じ入ったのではなく、蒼崎青子という生き方に感じ入ったのです。"
msgstr "\"I think you see it now. It's not her appearance that strikes you as beautiful, but her spirit."

#. Occurrence B_8:3534:16546: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0075; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3534
msgctxt "text_id=16546 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　ま、青子は青子でれっきとした美人ですが」"
msgstr "  Not that she isn't physically beautiful, of course.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:3577:16547: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3577
msgctxt "text_id=16547 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年はうなずく。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded."

#. Occurrence B_8:3582:16548: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3582
msgctxt "text_id=16548 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　初めて少女に出会ったあの日。"
msgstr "  From the day he first met her,"

#. Occurrence B_8:3587:16549: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3587
msgctxt "text_id=16549 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無意識に感じた印象は、それ以外の何物でもないと。"
msgstr "  that was indeed how he had felt; it just took him till now to realize it."

#. Occurrence B_8:3593:16550: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3593
msgctxt "text_id=16550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　強い眼差しと、ただ自分であろうとする彼女の意志に、彼はあんなにも見惚れたのだ。"
msgstr "  The strength in her eyes and her unwavering will had captured his heart."

#. Occurrence B_8:3622:16551: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_8_0024; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3622
msgctxt "text_id=16551 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……なんか、すごいやせ我慢だ」"
msgstr "\"She... puts up with a lot.\" "

#. Occurrence B_8:3648:16552: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_8_0076; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_8
#: B_8:3648
msgctxt "text_id=16552 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「本当に。小娘のクセに、ギネス級の頑固さです」"
msgstr "\"She really does. There's a lot of fight packed into that small frame.\""

#. Occurrence B_8:3654:16553: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3654
msgctxt "text_id=16553 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父の同意は心からのものだ。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri spoke from the heart."

#. Occurrence B_8:3659:16554: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3659
msgctxt "text_id=16554 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は小さく、この数時間の自分の馬鹿さかげんを笑うように頬をかいて、顔を上げた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro raised his head, gave a small grin, and scratched his cheek; so many hours wasted brooding like an idiot."

#. Occurrence B_8:3710:16555: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3710
msgctxt "text_id=16555 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正体不明の気持ちはまだ持て余しているが、どうもそれは解決しなくてもいいものらしい。"
msgstr "  A part of him still felt strange, but it didn't bother him to leave the question unsolved for now."

#. Occurrence B_8:3715:16556: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3715
msgctxt "text_id=16556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いてもたってもいられず立ち上がる。"
msgstr "  Unable to stay still, he stood up."

#. Occurrence B_8:3720:16557: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3720
msgctxt "text_id=16557 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎の家のことも、魔術師同士の争いも、死にに行こうとする青子のことも、どうでもいい。"
msgstr "  He couldn't care less about the Aozaki family, mage battles, or Aoko rushing off to her death."

#. Occurrence B_8:3726:16558: scene=B_8
#: B_8:3726
msgctxt "text_id=16558 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今はただ、彼女の顔が見たかった。"
msgstr "  Right now, he just wanted to see her face."

#. Occurrence B_9:52:16559: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:52
msgctxt "text_id=16559 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「お待ちなさい。病室は立ち入り禁止です」"
msgstr "\"Stop. The recovery room is off-limits.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:58:16560: scene=B_9
#: B_9:58
msgctxt "text_id=16560 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と。"
msgstr "  The cold words echoed around the chapel."

#. Occurrence B_9:63:16561: scene=B_9
#: B_9:63
msgctxt "text_id=16561 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　礼拝堂の奥、病室に向かう草十郎に、冷たい声が浴びせられた。"
msgstr "  They reached Soujyuro as he was about to head back to Aoko."

#. Occurrence B_9:79:16562: scene=B_9
#: B_9:79
msgctxt "text_id=16562 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　祭壇の横に控えていたのか、盲目のシスターは草十郎を律するように、ドアの前に移動した。"
msgstr "  The sightless sister must have been waiting by the altar. She moved quickly to block his path."

#. Occurrence B_9:105:16563: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_9_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_9
#: B_9:105
msgctxt "text_id=16563 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「唯架さん。いま、病室には入れないんですか？」"
msgstr "\"Miss Yuika. I'm not allowed in?\""

#. Occurrence B_9:116:16564: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:116
msgctxt "text_id=16564 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「はい。しばらく<人除|ひとよ>けをしてほしいと、久遠寺様から言付かっています」"
msgstr "\"Correct. Miss Kuonji told me to make sure nobody enters.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:122:16565: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_9_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_9
#: B_9:122
msgctxt "text_id=16565 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「有珠が……？」"
msgstr "\"Alice said that?\""

#. Occurrence B_9:161:16566: scene=B_9
#: B_9:161
msgctxt "text_id=16566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人除けとはどういう事か。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was suspicious of why Alice would have said that."

#. Occurrence B_9:166:16567: scene=B_9
#: B_9:166
msgctxt "text_id=16567 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　傷の手当て、容態の悪化といった理由で面会謝絶になるのなら分かるが、シスターの言葉から、そういった事情は感じとれない。"
msgstr "  He could understand being kept out if Aoko was being treated, or her condition had worsened. But this seemed different."

#. Occurrence B_9:172:16568: scene=B_9
#: B_9:172
msgctxt "text_id=16568 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも、治療はもう終わっていると青子自身が―――"
msgstr "  Besides, Aoko herself said her treatment had finished."

#. Occurrence B_9:206:16569: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:206
msgctxt "text_id=16569 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「人がいいのですね、シスター唯架は。そんな方便をしなくてもいいんですよ。"
msgstr "\"Now now, Sister Yuika. There's no need to be so curt."

#. Occurrence B_9:212:16570: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:212
msgctxt "text_id=16570 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　はっきり言ってあげればいい。今から病室に行っても無駄です、と。"
msgstr "  Why not just tell him the truth? That the room is actually empty."

#. Occurrence B_9:219:16571: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:219
msgctxt "text_id=16571 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "青子はとっくに出発しているんですから」"
msgstr "Aoko left some time ago.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:245:16572: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:245
msgctxt "text_id=16572 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「エイリ神父」"
msgstr "\"But Father Eiri!\""

#. Occurrence B_9:302:16573: scene=B_9
#: B_9:302
msgctxt "text_id=16573 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　長椅子に座ったまま、神父はにこやかに説明した。"
msgstr "  The priest began to explain everything from the pew he still sat in."

#. Occurrence B_9:307:16574: scene=B_9
#: B_9:307
msgctxt "text_id=16574 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先ほどまでの一連のやりとり。"
msgstr "  About the things he and Soujyuro had spoken about."

#. Occurrence B_9:312:16575: scene=B_9
#: B_9:312
msgctxt "text_id=16575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼はなぜ、頼まれもせず他人の悩みを解いていたのか。"
msgstr "  And why he, a stranger, would be so concerned about a person he knew nothing about."

#. Occurrence B_9:317:16576: scene=B_9
#: B_9:317
msgctxt "text_id=16576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……その真意は、もう語るまでもない。"
msgstr "  It all became clear to Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence B_9:362:16577: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_9_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_9
#: B_9:362
msgctxt "text_id=16577 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「初めから、そのつもりだったんですね」"
msgstr "\"This was your plan all along.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:367:16578: scene=B_9
#: B_9:367
msgctxt "text_id=16578 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　怒気を含んだ声を、神父は眉ひとつ動かさず受けとめる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's voice was full of anger, but Father Eiri did not flinch."

#. Occurrence B_9:402:16579: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:402
msgctxt "text_id=16579 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「申し訳ありません。青子に貴方の保護を頼まれたもので。"
msgstr "\"My apologies. Aoko requested I look after you."

#. Occurrence B_9:408:16580: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:408
msgctxt "text_id=16580 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　彼女の準備が整うまでの時間稼ぎでしたが、私が貴方と話をしたかったのは事実ですよ」"
msgstr "  While I did need to buy her time to prepare, I honestly did want to talk to you.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:413:16581: scene=B_9
#: B_9:413
msgctxt "text_id=16581 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこは誤解なきよう、と神父は誠意のかけらもない弁明をした。"
msgstr "  The priest's attempt to smooth things over was far from sincere."

#. Occurrence B_9:456:16582: scene=B_9
#: B_9:456
msgctxt "text_id=16582 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　強く、激情から歯を噛み締める。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro grit his teeth to control his rage."

#. Occurrence B_9:462:16583: scene=B_9
#: B_9:462
msgctxt "text_id=16583 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……なぜ青子たちの自殺行為を止めなかったのか、なんて罵倒はない。"
msgstr "  Why had they not stopped Aoko and Alice from heading towards certain death?"

#. Occurrence B_9:482:16584: scene=B_9
#: B_9:482
msgctxt "text_id=16584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父もシスターも魔術師と同類だ。"
msgstr "  Because both the nun and priest were of the same ilk as the mages."

#. Occurrence B_9:487:16585: scene=B_9
#: B_9:487
msgctxt "text_id=16585 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼らにとって見れば青子の選択は当然であり、そもそも、この神父は青子を知っている。"
msgstr "  As such, they understood Aoko's decision, and the priest understood Aoko, too."

#. Occurrence B_9:492:16586: scene=B_9
#: B_9:492
msgctxt "text_id=16586 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たとえ彼に青子を止める力があったとしても、彼はすっぱり見送っただろう。"
msgstr "  Even if he did have the power to stop her, he would not have."

#. Occurrence B_9:497:16587: scene=B_9
#: B_9:497
msgctxt "text_id=16587 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このまま教会でくすぶっている青子なんて、彼の知る蒼崎青子ではないのだから。"
msgstr "  The Aoko Aozaki he knew was not about to hide away in a church and lick her wounds."

#. Occurrence B_9:523:16588: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_9_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_9
#: B_9:523
msgctxt "text_id=16588 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「有珠は？」"
msgstr "\"Where's Alice?\""

#. Occurrence B_9:558:16589: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:558
msgctxt "text_id=16589 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「青子と行きましたよ。あれから三十分は過ぎていますね」"
msgstr "\"With Aoko. They left about thirty minutes ago.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:564:16590: scene=B_9
#: B_9:564
msgctxt "text_id=16590 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父はご丁寧にも、時間まで口にした。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri even went so far as to divulge the time."

#. Occurrence B_9:585:16591: scene=B_9
#: B_9:585
msgctxt "text_id=16591 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三十分。ちょうど神父が現れた時間と一致する。"
msgstr "  Thirty minutes ago: the same time the priest reared his head."

#. Occurrence B_9:590:16592: scene=B_9
#: B_9:590
msgctxt "text_id=16592 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この教会から学校までは二十分かからない。"
msgstr "  It would not take even half that long to get to the school from here."

#. Occurrence B_9:595:16593: scene=B_9
#: B_9:595
msgctxt "text_id=16593 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこから三咲高校の旧校舎までなら、走れば十分たらずで到着してしまう―――"
msgstr "  And then another ten minutes or less to get to Misaki High's old school building from there."

#. Occurrence B_9:616:16594: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_9_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_9
#: B_9:616
msgctxt "text_id=16594 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「っ…………！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence B_9:621:16595: scene=B_9
#: B_9:621
msgctxt "text_id=16595 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は礼拝堂の玄関へと踵を返す。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro turned to the entrance of the chapel."

#. Occurrence B_9:628:16596: scene=B_9
#: B_9:628
msgctxt "text_id=16596 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを、"
msgstr "  However..."

#. Occurrence B_9:661:16597: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:661
msgctxt "text_id=16597 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「待ちなさい。何処へ行くつもりですか」"
msgstr "\"Stop. Where do you think you're going?\""

#. Occurrence B_9:666:16598: scene=B_9
#: B_9:666
msgctxt "text_id=16598 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　盲目のシスターが、声だけで押し止めた。"
msgstr "  The sound of her voice stopped him in his tracks."

#. Occurrence B_9:701:16599: scene=B_9
#: B_9:701
msgctxt "text_id=16599 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――見えない重圧が草十郎の足を止めている。"
msgstr "  An unseen pressure had locked him in place."

#. Occurrence B_9:706:16600: scene=B_9
#: B_9:706
msgctxt "text_id=16600 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シスターの声は呪縛となって、向こう見ずな少年を<諫|いさ>めていた。"
msgstr "  Her admonition seemed to carry a spellbinding power, stopping the foolhardy boy where he stood."

#. Occurrence B_9:733:16601: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0004; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:733
msgctxt "text_id=16601 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「貴方は魔術師同士の争いを知りません。"
msgstr "\"You know nothing of mage battles."

#. Occurrence B_9:739:16602: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0005; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:739
msgctxt "text_id=16602 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　何の助力にもならないばかりか、彼女たちの<足枷|あしかせ>になるだけです。"
msgstr "  You're too weak to help; you'd be a liability."

#. Occurrence B_9:745:16603: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0006; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:745
msgctxt "text_id=16603 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　彼女たちが命を落とすのは彼女たちの業によるもの。望むままに傷つけ合えばいいでしょう。"
msgstr "  If they fall, that's their prerogative. Let them tear each other apart as they wish."

#. Occurrence B_9:752:16604: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0007; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:752
msgctxt "text_id=16604 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "貴方のような何の<咎|とが>もない若者が、凶事に立ち会う事はありません」"
msgstr "A young, innocent bystander like you has no business taking part in such a calamity.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:772:16605: scene=B_9
#: B_9:772
msgctxt "text_id=16605 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シスターの声には静かな怒りがある。"
msgstr "  She spoke with quiet anger."

#. Occurrence B_9:777:16606: scene=B_9
#: B_9:777
msgctxt "text_id=16606 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子たちへの嫌悪ではなく、それを承知の上で命を粗末にする草十郎を<諫|いさ>めている。"
msgstr "  Her contempt was not directed at Aoko or Alice, though, but Soujyuro for being so eager to waste his life."

#. Occurrence B_9:826:16607: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0008; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:826
msgctxt "text_id=16607 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「なにかしら希望があるのなら私も止めはしません。"
msgstr "\"If there was a shred of hope, I wouldn't stop you."

#. Occurrence B_9:832:16608: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0009; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:832
msgctxt "text_id=16608 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　ですがこの件は別です。貴方が行っても、彼女たちが助かる事はありません」"
msgstr "  But there isn't. There's nothing you can do for them, either.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:879:16609: scene=B_9
#: B_9:879
msgctxt "text_id=16609 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……たしかに、草十郎が追いついたところで、何がどうなる訳でもない。"
msgstr "  She was right. It would be pointless of him to go."

#. Occurrence B_9:884:16610: scene=B_9
#: B_9:884
msgctxt "text_id=16610 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　遊園地の時だって、結局は役に立たなかったのだ。"
msgstr "  At the amusement park, he had been useless in the end."

#. Occurrence B_9:889:16611: scene=B_9
#: B_9:889
msgctxt "text_id=16611 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　相手はあの夜以上の怪物だと言うなら、何が出来るかすら思いつかない。"
msgstr "  Now, they faced something even worse. He couldn't even imagine how he might contribute this time."

#. Occurrence B_9:931:16612: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0010; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:931
msgctxt "text_id=16612 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「言っておきますが、蒼崎青子は祖父に護身術を教えこまれています。魔術以外でも貴方より腕は立つ。"
msgstr "\"Listen carefully. Aoko Aozaki's grandfather trained her to protect herself. Magecraft aside, she's still tougher than you."

#. Occurrence B_9:937:16613: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0011; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:937
msgctxt "text_id=16613 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　その彼女も、あの使い魔が相手では勝負にならない」"
msgstr "  Even so, she still doesn't stand a chance against that beast of a familiar.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:976:16614: scene=B_9
#: B_9:976
msgctxt "text_id=16614 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　唯一の利点である男の腕力も無駄らしい。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's physical strength-his only edge-meant nothing."

#. Occurrence B_9:982:16615: scene=B_9
#: B_9:982
msgctxt "text_id=16615 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "このまま行ったところで足手まといになるのは目に見えている。"
msgstr "If he went now, he would only get in their way."

#. Occurrence B_9:987:16616: scene=B_9
#: B_9:987
msgctxt "text_id=16616 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シスターの言はすべて正しい。"
msgstr "  Yuika was correct."

#. Occurrence B_9:992:16617: scene=B_9
#: B_9:992
msgctxt "text_id=16617 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも―――"
msgstr "  And yet..."

#. Occurrence B_9:1038:16618: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_9_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1038
msgctxt "text_id=16618 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「でも、行かないと。青子には、返さなくちゃいけない借りがあります」"
msgstr "\"I have to go. I owe Aoko a debt I must repay.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1062:16619: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1062
msgctxt "text_id=16619 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりに落ち着いた、厳格な響き。"
msgstr "  He spoke calmly, but firmly."

#. Occurrence B_9:1067:16620: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1067
msgctxt "text_id=16620 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それについ<絆|ほだ>されかけ、シスターは眉をひそめた。"
msgstr "  Though almost moved, the sister frowned slightly."

#. Occurrence B_9:1077:16621: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1077
msgctxt "text_id=16621 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……気は乗らないがこれも少年のためだ。"
msgstr "  She felt bad for him, but her warning was for his own good."

#. Occurrence B_9:1082:16622: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1082
msgctxt "text_id=16622 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言葉で分からないのなら無理矢理にでも眠らせるしかないと、呪縛の指を草十郎に向け―――"
msgstr "  If he would not listen to reason, then she would have to make him sleep. She raised a finger of binding at Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence B_9:1103:16623: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1103
msgctxt "text_id=16623 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「それを言うなら返したい借りがある、ですよ草十郎君。"
msgstr "\"You mean you *want* to repay your debt, Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence B_9:1165:16624: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1165
msgctxt "text_id=16624 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　それとシスター唯架、教会内での魔術は控えてくださいね。"
msgstr "  Incidentally, Sister Yuika, please refrain from using magecraft within the church."

#. Occurrence B_9:1171:16625: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0008; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1171
msgctxt "text_id=16625 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　使うのなら秘蹟にとどめてもらわないと、私の査定に響きます。"
msgstr "  At least save it for religious ceremonies, or it'll affect my investigation."

#. Occurrence B_9:1178:16626: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0009; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1178
msgctxt "text_id=16626 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "……まったく。大人しそうに見えて律架クンより短気なんですから、貴女は」"
msgstr "...Dear Lord, give me strength. You seem so quiet, Soujyuro, but you're more short-tempered than Ritsuka.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1224:16627: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0012; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1224
msgctxt "text_id=16627 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「エイリ神父、しかし」"
msgstr "\"If I may, Father Eiri...\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1230:16628: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0010; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1230
msgctxt "text_id=16628 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「行かせてあげればいいじゃないですか。それとも貴女は、やはり青子たちに退場してほしいと？」"
msgstr "\"I see no harm in letting him go. Or would you rather see Touko destroy Aoko and Alice?\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1256:16629: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0013; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1256
msgctxt "text_id=16629 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「……その問題と、彼の献身は別の話です。"
msgstr "\"That issue is separate from this suicidal devotion."

#. Occurrence B_9:1262:16630: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0014; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1262
msgctxt "text_id=16630 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　<改|あらた>めなさい静希さん。貴方が行っても、何も出来はしないのですから」"
msgstr "  Reconsider, Mr. Sizuki. Even if you go, there's nothing you can do for them.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1285:16631: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_9_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1285
msgctxt "text_id=16631 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1305:16632: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1305
msgctxt "text_id=16632 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　……それは、何より彼自身が痛感している真実だった。"
msgstr "    The truth of the statement cut Soujyuro deep."

#. Occurrence B_9:1310:16633: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1310
msgctxt "text_id=16633 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも答えは決まっている。"
msgstr "  But despite everything that was being said, his mind was made up."

#. Occurrence B_9:1315:16634: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1315
msgctxt "text_id=16634 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　初めからそうだった。どうせ自分すら確かではないのなら、せめて、迷わないように。"
msgstr "  It always had been. Even if he was not certain, he at least would not hesitate."

#. Occurrence B_9:1320:16635: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1320
msgctxt "text_id=16635 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自然にうかんだ気持ちだけは貫こうと思ったのは、もうずっと以前からの事だ。"
msgstr "  He had always followed his instincts to the end, no matter where they took him."

#. Occurrence B_9:1346:16636: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_9_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1346
msgctxt "text_id=16636 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「分かっています。"
msgstr "\"I know."

#. Occurrence B_9:1353:16637: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_9_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1353
msgctxt "text_id=16637 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "……でも、行かないと。"
msgstr "But I'm still going."

#. Occurrence B_9:1359:16638: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_9_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1359
msgctxt "text_id=16638 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　ここにいたら、本当に何もできない」"
msgstr "  If I stay here, I really am powerless.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1379:16639: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1379
msgctxt "text_id=16639 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　胸にあるのは未熟な<衝動|こころ>だけ。"
msgstr "  His heart burned in his chest."

#. Occurrence B_9:1384:16640: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1384
msgctxt "text_id=16640 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父の話を聞いた時、彼はただ、彼女に会いたいと思った。"
msgstr "  While he listened to the priest talk, he could only think of seeing Aoko."

#. Occurrence B_9:1389:16641: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1389
msgctxt "text_id=16641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心配や助けなんて浮かばず、それだけしか思えなかった。"
msgstr "  He was not worried; he did not want to help."

#. Occurrence B_9:1394:16642: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1394
msgctxt "text_id=16642 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから―――"
msgstr "  He just wanted to see her."

#. Occurrence B_9:1400:16643: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1400
msgctxt "text_id=16643 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "その後の事は、その時にしか考えられない。"
msgstr "He would figure out what came next once he got there."

#. Occurrence B_9:1453:16644: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0011; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1453
msgctxt "text_id=16644 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ほら。献身なんて考え自体が間違ってるんです。"
msgstr "\"See? He isn't suicidal."

#. Occurrence B_9:1459:16645: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0012; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1459
msgctxt "text_id=16645 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　足を引っ張るといいますが、どのみち青子たちに勝ち目はないんでしょう？"
msgstr "  You say he'll get in the way, but Aoko and Alice stand no chance of winning anyway, correct?"

#. Occurrence B_9:1467:16646: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0013; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1467
msgctxt "text_id=16646 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　"
msgstr "  "

msgctxt "text_id=16647 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "なら、彼がマイナスになってもいいじゃないですか。どうせ破産するなら、豪快に破産すれば」"
msgstr "So what's the problem? Better to burn out in a blaze of glory.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1505:16648: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0015; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1505
msgctxt "text_id=16648 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「神父」"
msgstr "\"Father...\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1558:16649: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0014; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1558
msgctxt "text_id=16649 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ほら草十郎くん、行って行って。"
msgstr "\"What are you waiting for, Soujyuro? Get going."

#. Occurrence B_9:1564:16650: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0015; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1564
msgctxt "text_id=16650 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　シスター、今の貴方の返事で心が折れましたから。"
msgstr "  Your response has moved Sister Yuika."

#. Occurrence B_9:1570:16651: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0016; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1570
msgctxt "text_id=16651 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　足、動くでしょう？」"
msgstr "  And now you can move your legs, right?\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1630:16652: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1630
msgctxt "text_id=16652 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父に指摘され、草十郎は体を確かめる。"
msgstr "  As soon as the priest pointed at Soujyuro, he could move again."

#. Occurrence B_9:1635:16653: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1635
msgctxt "text_id=16653 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　肩にのしかかっていた重圧は薄れ、彼自身が抱いていたかすかな恐れ―――"
msgstr "  The pressure weighing on his shoulders lifted, along with the fear in his heart."

#. Occurrence B_9:1641:16654: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1641
msgctxt "text_id=16654 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "自分は役に立たないどころか、青子たちを危険に<晒|さら>すだけかもしれない―――も、完全に吹き飛んでいた。"
msgstr "Could he help? Would he expose Aoko and Alice to more danger? All such doubts had vanished."

#. Occurrence B_9:1667:16655: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_B_9_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1667
msgctxt "text_id=16655 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――行きます。<縁|えん>が残っていれば、また」"
msgstr "\"I'm heading out, then. With any luck, we'll meet again.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1683:16656: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_9000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1683
msgctxt "text_id=16656 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「はい。何であれ、後悔のない一日を」"
msgstr "\"Good. Whatever happens, no regrets.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1728:16657: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1728
msgctxt "text_id=16657 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　走りだす草十郎を、神父は満足げに見送った。"
msgstr "  And with that, Soujyuro began to run, as Father Eiri watched with a look of satisfaction."

#. Occurrence B_9:1733:16658: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1733
msgctxt "text_id=16658 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どのみち青子を説得する事も無理なら、彼を納得させる事も無理だと分かっていたように。"
msgstr "  The priest knew if he could not persuade Aoko, he could not convince Soujyuro either."

#. Occurrence B_9:1771:16659: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1771
msgctxt "text_id=16659 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　走り去っていく、がむしゃらな少年の後ろ姿。"
msgstr "  He watched the impetuous boy run away,"

#. Occurrence B_9:1776:16660: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1776
msgctxt "text_id=16660 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　盲目のシスターは、その音を聞き届ける事しかできない。"
msgstr "  as the blind nun listened to his footsteps fade into the distance."

#. Occurrence B_9:1781:16661: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1781
msgctxt "text_id=16661 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……彼女は神父とも草十郎とも違う。"
msgstr "  Yuika was different from Soujyuro and the priest."

#. Occurrence B_9:1786:16662: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1786
msgctxt "text_id=16662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悪徳にも独善にも慈悲は見せないが、無垢な<中庸|ちゅうよう>さには<慈|じ><愛|あい>を抱くのだ。"
msgstr "  While she showed no mercy to corruption or self-righteousness, she embraced benevolence to the innocent."

#. Occurrence B_9:1791:16663: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1791
msgctxt "text_id=16663 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの平凡な少年が天寿を全うするのは素晴らしいが、むざむざ異端たちの地獄に堕ちるのは心苦しい。"
msgstr "  Such an ordinary boy with his life ahead of him... and yet he chose to follow heretics into Hell."

#. Occurrence B_9:1825:16664: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0016; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1825
msgctxt "text_id=16664 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「……最悪ですね、エイリ神父。"
msgstr "\"How can you live with yourself, Father Eiri?"

#. Occurrence B_9:1831:16665: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_B_9_0017; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1831
msgctxt "text_id=16665 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　分別の付かない子供を導くのが、責任のある大人だと思いましたが」"
msgstr "  I thought responsible adults guided wayward children.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1837:16666: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1837
msgctxt "text_id=16666 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　刺々しい抗議の声。"
msgstr "  She made no effort to hide her biting disapproval."

#. Occurrence B_9:1842:16667: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1842
msgctxt "text_id=16667 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は彼女なりに、あの少年の身を案じていたのだ。"
msgstr "  It was simply her way of showing concern for the boy."

#. Occurrence B_9:1847:16668: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1847
msgctxt "text_id=16668 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなシスターの気遣いに、神父はやれやれと肩をすくめて、"
msgstr "  Father Eiri shrugged."

#. Occurrence B_9:1888:16669: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0017; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1888
msgctxt "text_id=16669 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「だから、色々と間違えていますよシスター唯架。"
msgstr "\"You're mistaken about a few things, Sister Yuika."

#. Occurrence B_9:1894:16670: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0018; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1894
msgctxt "text_id=16670 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　責任のある大人、なんて言葉自体がおかしい。"
msgstr "  Your use of the term 'responsible adult' for a start."

#. Occurrence B_9:1900:16671: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_B_9_0019; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=B_9
#: B_9:1900
msgctxt "text_id=16671 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　<何|・><が|・><起|・><き|・><て|・><も|・><責|・><任|・><を|・><と|・><る|・>。それが、正しい大人というものです」"
msgstr "  An adult is someone who takes responsibility no matter what.\""

#. Occurrence B_9:1942:16672: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1942
msgctxt "text_id=16672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰が死んでも構わない、と。"
msgstr "  The rest went unspoken: it didn't matter to him which of them died."

#. Occurrence B_9:1947:16673: scene=B_9
#: B_9:1947
msgctxt "text_id=16673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父らしい温かな笑顔のまま、彼女の間違いを訂正した。"
msgstr "  With a warm, goodly smile, the priest corrected the nun's misunderstanding."

#. Occurrence C_0:63:16674: scene=C_0
#: C_0:63
msgctxt "text_id=16674 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<下界|まち>の<喧噪|におい>に、ピンと耳を立てる。"
msgstr "  The Golden Wolf's ears stood pointed, twitching in response to the sounds around it."

#. Occurrence C_0:69:16675: scene=C_0
#: C_0:69
msgctxt "text_id=16675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　食事を済ませ<午睡|ごすい>に身を任せていた金色の狼は、クワア、と大きなあくびをして、退屈そうに身を丸めた。"
msgstr "  Its meal finished, it curled up into a ball in anticipation of nap time, and yawned, half from boredom."

#. Occurrence C_0:115:16676: scene=C_0
#: C_0:115
msgctxt "text_id=16676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その役割を終え、久しく使われていなかった教室。"
msgstr "  The old, abandoned classroom had fulfilled its purpose many moons ago."

#. Occurrence C_0:120:16677: scene=C_0
#: C_0:120
msgctxt "text_id=16677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　積み重ねた<瓦礫|つくえ>の上で身を休めるのが、ここ一ヶ月の彼の日常だ。"
msgstr "  For a month, the wolf had spent his time resting on top a heap of disheveled desks."

#. Occurrence C_0:126:16678: scene=C_0
#: C_0:126
msgctxt "text_id=16678 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の名はルゥ・ベオウルフ。"
msgstr "  His name was Lugh Beowulf."

#. Occurrence C_0:131:16679: scene=C_0
#: C_0:131
msgctxt "text_id=16679 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　故郷では太陽の名で呼ばれ、故郷を後にしてからは勇者の名を<戴|いただ>いた、純血の人狼である。"
msgstr "  He was a purebred werewolf, named after the sun at his birthplace and a hero of legend upon leaving there."

#. Occurrence C_0:198:16680: scene=C_0
#: C_0:198
msgctxt "text_id=16680 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言うまでもなく、彼の故郷はこの国ではない。"
msgstr "  It goes without saying he was not from this country."

#. Occurrence C_0:203:16681: scene=C_0
#: C_0:203
msgctxt "text_id=16681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ヨーロッパ深部、山と森に守られた荒野が彼の<世界|ふるさと>だ。"
msgstr "  He came from a land deep within the European wilderness, surrounded by mountains and forests."

#. Occurrence C_0:208:16682: scene=C_0
#: C_0:208
msgctxt "text_id=16682 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いまだ人智の及ばぬ秘境。"
msgstr "  His homeland was a realm no human had ever set foot in."

#. Occurrence C_0:213:16683: scene=C_0
#: C_0:213
msgctxt "text_id=16683 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰一人として訪れる事のない停止した世界で、ゆるやかに絶えるだけの日々を送っていた人狼たち。"
msgstr "  In their isolated world forgotten by time, a diminishing race of werewolves lived in peace."

#. Occurrence C_0:233:16684: scene=C_0
#: C_0:233
msgctxt "text_id=16684 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その中に、<彼|ベオ>は忽然と現れた。"
msgstr "  This was where Beo first appeared."

#. Occurrence C_0:238:16685: scene=C_0
#: C_0:238
msgctxt "text_id=16685 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<人狼|かれ>らの祖と同じ金の毛並みを持った子供は、村はずれの洞穴で発見された。"
msgstr "  In a cave on the outskirts of their village, the werewolves found a child bearing the same golden coat as their ancestors."

#. Occurrence C_0:243:16686: scene=C_0
#: C_0:243
msgctxt "text_id=16686 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　安らかな寝息をたてて、まるで、そこに<存|い>るのが当然といった様子で。"
msgstr "  The child was sleeping soundly, as if in his natural habitat."

#. Occurrence C_0:263:16687: scene=C_0
#: C_0:263
msgctxt "text_id=16687 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　村は新しい仲間の誕生と、その貴重性に沸き立った。"
msgstr "  The village welcomed their new member with open arms."

#. Occurrence C_0:268:16688: scene=C_0
#: C_0:268
msgctxt "text_id=16688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　文明が消費を良しとしてからはや二千年。"
msgstr "  Two thousand years of advancing civilization had been cruel to them."

#. Occurrence C_0:273:16689: scene=C_0
#: C_0:273
msgctxt "text_id=16689 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　森が<暴|あば>かれ、谷が埋められ、海の<混濁|よごれ>が進むにつれ、<人狼|かれ>らの生殖機能は落ちていた。"
msgstr "  As the forests were destroyed, valleys unearthed, and waters polluted, the werewolf birthrate dwindled."

#. Occurrence C_0:278:16690: scene=C_0
#: C_0:278
msgctxt "text_id=16690 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一族の者が子を<孕|はら>むだけでも十年に一度の祝い事だ。"
msgstr "  They were now facing one birth a decade."

#. Occurrence C_0:298:16691: scene=C_0
#: C_0:298
msgctxt "text_id=16691 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが灰や白を飛び越え、<人狼|かれ>らが森の神とされていた頃の金の獣性を持っていたのだから、村に降りた希望がどれほどのものだったか、想像に難くない。"
msgstr "  The child's golden coat-deviating from the typical gray or white and shared only by their ancestors who were treated as gods-felt like a sign their prayers had been answered."

#. Occurrence C_0:335:16692: scene=C_0
#: C_0:335
msgctxt "text_id=16692 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　衰退していく一族。"
msgstr "  A bloodline in atrophy,"

#. Occurrence C_0:340:16693: scene=C_0
#: C_0:340
msgctxt "text_id=16693 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　転換を受け入れざるをえない時代。"
msgstr "  the werewolves were forced to embrace change."

#. Occurrence C_0:345:16694: scene=C_0
#: C_0:345
msgctxt "text_id=16694 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それら根本的な問題を一時でも忘れてしまうほど、その赤子は輝かしかったのだ。"
msgstr "  This radiant child at least temporarily made them forget about their troubles."

#. Occurrence C_0:383:16695: scene=C_0
#: C_0:383
msgctxt "text_id=16695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……だが。"
msgstr "  Alas..."

#. Occurrence C_0:388:16696: scene=C_0
#: C_0:388
msgctxt "text_id=16696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時が経つに連れ、喜びは失望へと変わっていった。"
msgstr "  As time passed, their hopes turned to disappointment."

#. Occurrence C_0:393:16697: scene=C_0
#: C_0:393
msgctxt "text_id=16697 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　金狼は何も救わない。"
msgstr "  The golden wolf was not their salvation."

#. Occurrence C_0:398:16698: scene=C_0
#: C_0:398
msgctxt "text_id=16698 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ルゥ―――太陽と愛された子供は、不思議な事に発見された時から今の<カ|・><タ|・><チ|・>をしていた。"
msgstr "  For some reason, Lugh―that ray of golden sun―remained a child."

#. Occurrence C_0:434:16699: scene=C_0
#: C_0:434
msgctxt "text_id=16699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そればかりか、何十年経とうと一向に成長しない。"
msgstr "  Decades passed and still he did not grow."

#. Occurrence C_0:439:16700: scene=C_0
#: C_0:439
msgctxt "text_id=16700 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は不老であり、不滅であり、それ故に不遇だった。"
msgstr "  Forever young; immortal; cursed."

#. Occurrence C_0:445:16701: scene=C_0
#: C_0:445
msgctxt "text_id=16701 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　村中を探しても、彼を生んだ母親はいなかった。"
msgstr "  He searched the village for his birth mother, but to no avail."

#. Occurrence C_0:450:16702: scene=C_0
#: C_0:450
msgctxt "text_id=16702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　村中を探しても、彼を理解できる人狼はいなかった。"
msgstr "  He searched the village for someone who understood his plight, but to no avail."

#. Occurrence C_0:470:16703: scene=C_0
#: C_0:470
msgctxt "text_id=16703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして彼本人も、その事実を百年かけて実感した。"
msgstr "  Over hundreds of years, he came to realize something."

#. Occurrence C_0:475:16704: scene=C_0
#: C_0:475
msgctxt "text_id=16704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分は何もかもが他の連中と違う。"
msgstr "  He was different. Very different."

#. Occurrence C_0:480:16705: scene=C_0
#: C_0:480
msgctxt "text_id=16705 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雄も雌もない。"
msgstr "  Neither male nor female."

#. Occurrence C_0:485:16706: scene=C_0
#: C_0:485
msgctxt "text_id=16706 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<強|つよ>きも<弱|よわ>きもない。"
msgstr "  Neither strong nor weak."

#. Occurrence C_0:490:16707: scene=C_0
#: C_0:490
msgctxt "text_id=16707 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生も死も、<悦|えつ>も恐れもまだ知らない。"
msgstr "  Ignorant of life and death, joy and fear."

#. Occurrence C_0:539:16708: scene=C_0
#: C_0:539
msgctxt "text_id=16708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『アレは自然発生した精霊だ。人狼の姿をしているが、我々とはまったく違う生きものだろう―――』"
msgstr "(That thing's a spirit, born of nature. Might look like us werewolves, but don't let that fool you.)"

#. Occurrence C_0:581:16709: scene=C_0
#: C_0:581
msgctxt "text_id=16709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　陰口を言われるまでもなく、彼もそれを実感していた。"
msgstr "  But the child himself needed not conjecture to know his own true nature."

#. Occurrence C_0:586:16710: scene=C_0
#: C_0:586
msgctxt "text_id=16710 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　完成しているからこその<閉塞感|へいそくかん>。"
msgstr "  He was perfect, and therefore he was alone."

#. Occurrence C_0:591:16711: scene=C_0
#: C_0:591
msgctxt "text_id=16711 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　金の獣にとって、肌に感じる世界はあまりにも狭すぎる。"
msgstr "  To the Golden Wolf, the world was too small."

#. Occurrence C_0:596:16712: scene=C_0
#: C_0:596
msgctxt "text_id=16712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だからこそ―――"
msgstr "  That was why..."

#. Occurrence C_0:616:16713: scene=C_0
#: C_0:616
msgctxt "text_id=16713 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう、だからこそ。"
msgstr "  Indeed, that was the very reason..."

#. Occurrence C_0:632:16714: scene=C_0
#: C_0:632
msgctxt "text_id=16714 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生命とは何かを知りたい。"
msgstr "  He wanted to know what life was."

#. Occurrence C_0:637:16715: scene=C_0
#: C_0:637
msgctxt "text_id=16715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　欠落とは何かを知りたい。"
msgstr "  He wanted to know loss."

#. Occurrence C_0:642:16716: scene=C_0
#: C_0:642
msgctxt "text_id=16716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　万能であるのなら、万能であるが故の未知を知りたい。"
msgstr "  If he was all-powerful, he wanted to know the mystery behind his all-powerfulness."

#. Occurrence C_0:649:16717: scene=C_0
#: C_0:649
msgctxt "text_id=16717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だってこのままでは、"
msgstr "  Because as it was,"

msgctxt "text_id=16718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生きている意味がまるで無い―――"
msgstr "  his existence was meaningless."

#. Occurrence C_0:683:16719: scene=C_0
#: C_0:683
msgctxt "text_id=16719 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　金の狼は自分自身を持て余す。"
msgstr "  The Golden Wolf was at a loss,"

#. Occurrence C_0:688:16720: scene=C_0
#: C_0:688
msgctxt "text_id=16720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして<人狼|かれ>らも、この太陽を持て余した。"
msgstr "  as were the werewolves around him."

#. Occurrence C_0:693:16721: scene=C_0
#: C_0:693
msgctxt "text_id=16721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　敬いはするが、同時に関わりたくもない。"
msgstr "  They revered him, but at the same time wanted nothing to do with him."

#. Occurrence C_0:726:16722: scene=C_0
#: C_0:726
msgctxt "text_id=16722 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ルゥは自分が発見された洞穴に居を構え、神子として、一生を<独|ひと>りのまま過ごすと宿命付けられた。"
msgstr "  Lugh moved back to the cave he was discovered in, and resigned himself to a life of seclusion."

#. Occurrence C_0:752:16723: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_0_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_0
#: C_0:752
msgctxt "text_id=16723 | speaker=touko"
msgid "『太陽のルゥ？　<ルー・ガルー|loup-garou>じゃなくて？"
msgstr "\"Lugh? Like the sun god Lugh? I thought it was short for 'loup-garou'!"

#. Occurrence C_0:758:16724: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_0_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_0
#: C_0:758
msgctxt "text_id=16724 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ハ、そりゃ面白い！　偶然にしちゃあ出来すぎだ！』"
msgstr "  Ha! That's one heck of a coincidence!\""

#. Occurrence C_0:764:16725: scene=C_0
#: C_0:764
msgctxt "text_id=16725 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その村に、風変わりな魔術師が訪れるまでは。"
msgstr "  And then one day, a quirky mage visited the village."

#. Occurrence C_0:819:16726: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_0_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_0
#: C_0:819
msgctxt "text_id=16726 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“……またガタガタとうるさい……トーコさんはアレだよね、派手好きなクセにマメだよね……”」"
msgstr "\"...You're too loud, Miss Touko. Why do you have to be so dramatic all the time?\""

#. Occurrence C_0:826:16727: scene=C_0
#: C_0:826
msgctxt "text_id=16727 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　瓦礫の上で身を丸めながら、ベオは廊下の様子を盗み聴く。"
msgstr "  From his place on top of the rubble, Beo peered into the hallway."

#. Occurrence C_0:831:16728: scene=C_0
#: C_0:831
msgctxt "text_id=16728 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小うるさい主人は三咲市全体の霊脈の掌握とやらに忙しい……と思いきや、飽きもせず趣味の仕掛けをこしらえているようだ。"
msgstr "  He thought his fussy master was busy dealing with Misaki City's leylines, but she was engrossed in making traps."

#. Occurrence C_0:865:16729: scene=C_0
#: C_0:865
msgctxt "text_id=16729 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この廃屋を仮の工房に使い始めて一ヶ月。"
msgstr "  One month passed since they made the dilapidated building their makeshift workshop."

#. Occurrence C_0:870:16730: scene=C_0
#: C_0:870
msgctxt "text_id=16730 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一日に一つ、新しい侵入者用のトラップを作るのが彼女のひそかな趣味らしい。"
msgstr "  Creating a new trap for intruders became a daily pursuit of Touko's."

#. Occurrence C_0:891:16731: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_0_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_0
#: C_0:891
msgctxt "text_id=16731 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“……安全を用意しておくなんて、他の生き物はタイヘンだ”」"
msgstr "\"You worry about your safety, but what about the other creatures?\""

#. Occurrence C_0:897:16732: scene=C_0
#: C_0:897
msgctxt "text_id=16732 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生まれながらこのカタチ―――赤子という未成熟な立場も、老衰という劣化も知らない<彼|ベオ>は、通常の生き物とは在り方も思想も違う。"
msgstr "  Having been like this since birth, knowing neither infancy nor dotage, he thought differently than others."

#. Occurrence C_0:932:16733: scene=C_0
#: C_0:932
msgctxt "text_id=16733 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼はその発生からして“完全”だった。"
msgstr "  For he was perfect from the day he was born."

#. Occurrence C_0:937:16734: scene=C_0
#: C_0:937
msgctxt "text_id=16734 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何も引くものがなく、何も付け足すところがない。"
msgstr "  Never declining; never improving."

#. Occurrence C_0:942:16735: scene=C_0
#: C_0:942
msgctxt "text_id=16735 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　故に、あらゆる弱さを実感できない。"
msgstr "  As such, he had no comprehension of weakness."

#. Occurrence C_0:947:16736: scene=C_0
#: C_0:947
msgctxt "text_id=16736 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無邪気かつ天衣無縫の気分屋で、人間としての善悪も、狼としての良し悪しも計らない。"
msgstr "  Child-like, fickle, and without morals, he had no concept of good and bad as either a human or a wolf."

#. Occurrence C_0:952:16737: scene=C_0
#: C_0:952
msgctxt "text_id=16737 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この美しい獣は、周囲と没交渉でありながら、自分以外の生き物を見下している。"
msgstr "  A beautiful creature disconnected from the world around him, he was on top of all other creatures."

#. Occurrence C_0:991:16738: scene=C_0
#: C_0:991
msgctxt "text_id=16738 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その例外が彼の主人、蒼崎橙子である。"
msgstr "  With one exception: his master, Touko Aozaki."

#. Occurrence C_0:996:16739: scene=C_0
#: C_0:996
msgctxt "text_id=16739 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　キラキラするモノ、美味しいモノを教えてくれたし、なにより匂いがすっきりしている。"
msgstr "  She showed him a sparkling, delicious world, and above all he found her scent refreshing."

#. Occurrence C_0:1016:16740: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1016
msgctxt "text_id=16740 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼にとっての良し悪しの基準は、単純に「格好いい」か「格好悪い」か。"
msgstr "  To him, the world was divided into what was cool and what was not."

#. Occurrence C_0:1021:16741: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1021
msgctxt "text_id=16741 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　趣味嗜好、外見性別は問わない。"
msgstr "  Your preference in leisure pursuits were of no consequence to him, and he never took gender into account."

#. Occurrence C_0:1026:16742: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1026
msgctxt "text_id=16742 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何であろうと、その生き方に筋が通っているのなら「格好のいい」匂いがする。"
msgstr "  The only thing that mattered to him was whether a person's life was logical, and therefore \"cool.\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1036:16743: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1036
msgctxt "text_id=16743 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子は、色々とねじまがっているが、彼にしてみるといい匂いの人間なのだった。"
msgstr "  Touko Aozaki had her faults, but she smelled good."

#. Occurrence C_0:1081:16744: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_0_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1081
msgctxt "text_id=16744 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ベオ、昼食は済ませたか？」"
msgstr "\"Finished your lunch, Beo?\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1101:16745: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1101
msgctxt "text_id=16745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下の仕掛けが済んだのか、教室に<件|くだん>の主人が入ってくる。"
msgstr "  Beo's master entered the classroom, presumably done with her traps for the day."

#. Occurrence C_0:1118:16746: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_0_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1118
msgctxt "text_id=16746 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「夜が本番だ。それまで、あまりハメを外すなよ」"
msgstr "\"It's showtime tonight. Just keep it together until then.\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1124:16747: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1124
msgctxt "text_id=16747 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この通り少々口やかましいところがあるが、彼はこの主人を基本的に気に入っている。"
msgstr "  Sometimes-like now-she would nag him, but on the whole his master pleased him."

#. Occurrence C_0:1144:16748: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1144
msgctxt "text_id=16748 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　実際のところ、<彼|ベオ>を縛っている彼女の契約はさして強力なものでもない。"
msgstr "  In reality, the contract binding her to him was not particularly powerful;"

#. Occurrence C_0:1149:16749: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1149
msgctxt "text_id=16749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<彼|・>が本気になれば<噛|か>み<千|ち><切|ぎ>れる程度のものだ。"
msgstr "  if he wanted to, he could tear her to pieces at any time."

#. Occurrence C_0:1159:16750: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1159
msgctxt "text_id=16750 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼を縛り付けられる人間などいる筈がない。"
msgstr "  No human could restrain him."

#. Occurrence C_0:1221:16751: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1221
msgctxt "text_id=16751 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が、そうは言っても、橙子を殺して自由になる気もない。"
msgstr "  However, he had no intention of killing Touko in exchange for his freedom."

#. Occurrence C_0:1226:16752: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1226
msgctxt "text_id=16752 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その理由が見あたらない。"
msgstr "  And there was a reason for this."

#. Occurrence C_0:1231:16753: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1231
msgctxt "text_id=16753 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼が人間社会で気ままにやっていくのには、便利な人間が必要なのだ。"
msgstr "  In order to move about freely in human society, he needed someone like her."

#. Occurrence C_0:1236:16754: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1236
msgctxt "text_id=16754 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　よほど彼の気分を害さないかぎり、この主人をどうこうするつもりはない。"
msgstr "  As long as she did not offend him, he had no reason to rock the boat."

#. Occurrence C_0:1260:16755: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1260
msgctxt "text_id=16755 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もっとも―――"
msgstr "  However..."

#. Occurrence C_0:1298:16756: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_0_0002; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1298
msgctxt "text_id=16756 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“やっと本番か。<待|・><た|・><せ|・><す|・><ぎ|・>だよ、トーコさん”」"
msgstr "\"Finally, the main event! I was getting tired of waiting, Miss Touko.\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1303:16757: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1303
msgctxt "text_id=16757 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼を連れ出した時の約束と、現実が少しズレはじめている。"
msgstr "  ...the promise she had made him in his cave and the reality of their situation had begun to come apart at the seams."

#. Occurrence C_0:1310:16758: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_0_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1310
msgctxt "text_id=16758 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“来い。最高の神秘と戦わせてやる”"
msgstr "\"Come here. I'll let you fight the most powerful Mystic there is.\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1316:16759: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1316
msgctxt "text_id=16759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その口車に乗って今まで従ってきたが、そろそろ我慢の限界だ。待ちに待った昨夜の戦いは特に酷い。“最新の魔法使い”なんて、名前負けもいいところだった。"
msgstr "  He was compliant up to now, but his patience was wearing thin-the fight with the newest Magician last night was an enormous letdown."

#. Occurrence C_0:1337:16760: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_0_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1337
msgctxt "text_id=16760 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そう言うな。私も昨日は拍子抜けだったんだから」"
msgstr "\"Oh hush. I was just as disappointed as you were.\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1343:16761: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_0_0003; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1343
msgctxt "text_id=16761 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“……いいけどね。実はあの娘、使わないんじゃなくて、使えないだけじゃないの？”」"
msgstr "\"...I'm not that bummed. But why won't the girl use it? Because she can't?\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1368:16762: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1368
msgctxt "text_id=16762 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　む、と主人の顔が険しくなる。"
msgstr "  His master's expression turned serious."

#. Occurrence C_0:1373:16763: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1373
msgctxt "text_id=16763 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の疑問に賛同しての事ではない。"
msgstr "  Not in agreement at the wolf's question, though."

#. Occurrence C_0:1378:16764: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1378
msgctxt "text_id=16764 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソレが<あ|・><る|・>か<な|・><い|・>かの問答など、彼女はとっくに通り越している。"
msgstr "  For she had already asked herself the same and many other similar questions."

#. Occurrence C_0:1424:16765: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_0_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1424
msgctxt "text_id=16765 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……いや。使うぐらいなら死んだ方がまし……なのかもな」"
msgstr "\"...No. Because she'd be better off dying than to use it, I suppose.\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1430:16766: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_0_0004; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1430
msgctxt "text_id=16766 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“？？　そんなバカな事があるの？　使わないと死んじゃう状態だったんだよ？”」"
msgstr "\"That doesn't make any sense! She almost died because she didn't use it.\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1441:16767: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_0_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1441
msgctxt "text_id=16767 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「だから、そんなバカな考えが成立するぐらい―――」"
msgstr "\"Which proves my point...\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1464:16768: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1464
msgctxt "text_id=16768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おぞましいモノなんだろう、と。"
msgstr "  \"That it must be too terrifying to use,\" Touko finished in her head."

#. Occurrence C_0:1469:16769: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1469
msgctxt "text_id=16769 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう口にしかけて、彼女は感傷的な自分を<嘲|わ><笑|ら>うように首を振った。"
msgstr "  She stopped short of voicing it, and chuckled at her emotional outburst."

#. Occurrence C_0:1527:16770: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_0_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1527
msgctxt "text_id=16770 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「どれほどのものか想像がつかないのは確かだ。"
msgstr "\"Sure, I can't even imagine what it must be."

#. Occurrence C_0:1533:16771: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_0_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1533
msgctxt "text_id=16771 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　だがまあ、根本は変わらないさ。魔法がどのような奇跡神秘の類であれ、魔術師である以上、青子に勝ち目はない」"
msgstr "  Still, this changes nothing. Whatever sort of miraculous Mystic her Magic is, as long as she remains a mage, she can't win.\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1571:16772: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1571
msgctxt "text_id=16772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう残して、彼の主人は教室を後にした。"
msgstr "  With those words, Beo's master walked out of the room,"

#. Occurrence C_0:1576:16773: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1576
msgctxt "text_id=16773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おまえの相手、おまえの出番は“その一点だけ”と念を押して。"
msgstr "  emphasizing that his role in all this was to face Aoko *only* at that very moment."

#. Occurrence C_0:1654:16774: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_0_0005; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1654
msgctxt "text_id=16774 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“―――魔法、ねぇ―――”」"
msgstr "\"True Magic, huh...?\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1662:16775: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1662
msgctxt "text_id=16775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　退屈に沈んでいた彼の目が、ぐにゃりと<歪|ゆが>む。"
msgstr "  The bored look in his eyes shifted."

#. Occurrence C_0:1667:16776: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1667
msgctxt "text_id=16776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　昨夜の少女の<腿|あじ>を思い出して、長い舌が、べろりとノコギリのような口を舐める。"
msgstr "  He recalled the taste of that girl, his long tongue sliding over his chainsaw-like fangs."

#. Occurrence C_0:1706:16777: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1706
msgctxt "text_id=16777 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もちろん、言われるまでもなく<蹂躙|じゅうりん>しよう。"
msgstr "  Make no mistake, he would finish his meal."

#. Occurrence C_0:1711:16778: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1711
msgctxt "text_id=16778 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は最古の人狼、黄金の森の神。"
msgstr "  He was the oldest werewolf; the golden god of the forest."

#. Occurrence C_0:1716:16779: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1716
msgctxt "text_id=16779 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　物心ついた時―――いや、この地上に発生した時から、自身が“最も強い生き物の一つ”だと認識している。"
msgstr "  For as long as he could remember-no, from the moment he appeared, he had been the most powerful creature of all."

#. Occurrence C_0:1747:16780: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1747
msgctxt "text_id=16780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼からすれば人間の手による神秘など<塵芥|ちりあくた>も同然。"
msgstr "  All manmade Mystics were trash before him."

#. Occurrence C_0:1752:16781: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1752
msgctxt "text_id=16781 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術など無駄であり、その上にある神秘―――人造の奇跡など無用だ。存在すら気にくわない。"
msgstr "  Magecraft was laughable, and even Mystics―artificial miracles―were futile. Their very existence was an insult to him."

#. Occurrence C_0:1801:16782: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_0_0006; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_0
#: C_0:1801
msgctxt "text_id=16782 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“……もちろん。そういう契約だし、ちゃんと<平|たい>らげはするけれど”」"
msgstr "\"After all, that was the deal. When the time comes, I dig right in.\""

#. Occurrence C_0:1810:16783: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1810
msgctxt "text_id=16783 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　契約はそこまで。"
msgstr "  That was the extent of their pact."

#. Occurrence C_0:1815:16784: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1815
msgctxt "text_id=16784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法とやらを食い破った後、どうするかは彼の自由だ。"
msgstr "  Once he had dealt with this so-called True Magic, he was free."

#. Occurrence C_0:1844:16785: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1844
msgctxt "text_id=16785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……いびつな瞳に、狼の<彩|いろ>が宿る。"
msgstr "  His eyes burned with the wolf inside of him,"

#. Occurrence C_0:1849:16786: scene=C_0
#: C_0:1849
msgctxt "text_id=16786 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは<淫蕩|いんとう>に<耽|ふけ>る、<嗜虐|しぎゃく>に満ちた、<卑|いや>しい獣の笑みだった。"
msgstr "  his fanged maw twisting into a sadistic, beastly grin."

#. Occurrence C_1:63:16787: scene=C_1
#: C_1:63
msgctxt "text_id=16787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　午後七時過ぎ。"
msgstr "  It was just past 7:00 p.m."

#. Occurrence C_1:68:16788: scene=C_1
#: C_1:68
msgctxt "text_id=16788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三咲高校の校舎は、完全に<睡没|すいぼつ>していた。"
msgstr "  Misaki High School's old building stood silently."

#. Occurrence C_1:73:16789: scene=C_1
#: C_1:73
msgctxt "text_id=16789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　街から夜の明かりは届いているものの、校舎周辺の山林は静まりかえっている。"
msgstr "  While light from the city reached the area, the forest and mountains kept the area hushed."

#. Occurrence C_1:116:16790: scene=C_1
#: C_1:116
msgctxt "text_id=16790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それも無理からぬ事だ。"
msgstr "  Nothing unusual."

#. Occurrence C_1:121:16791: scene=C_1
#: C_1:121
msgctxt "text_id=16791 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冬休み中、校舎は数えるほどしか使われておらず、校庭は昨夜からの雪に包まれている。"
msgstr "  During winter vacation, the old building-now still covered in yesterday's snow-was rarely used."

#. Occurrence C_1:126:16792: scene=C_1
#: C_1:126
msgctxt "text_id=16792 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……使う者のいない建造物は、その時点で<慰霊碑|モニュメント>と変わらなくなる。"
msgstr "  Without signs of life, such unused structures were mere monuments of what once was, nothing more."

#. Occurrence C_1:131:16793: scene=C_1
#: C_1:131
msgctxt "text_id=16793 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いま死者に近いこの建物は、新学期まで息を吹き返す事はない。"
msgstr "  The old school building would remain that way until the start of the new semester."

#. Occurrence C_1:177:16794: scene=C_1
#: C_1:177
msgctxt "text_id=16794 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その背後に広がる森は、更に闇を増している。"
msgstr "  Behind it, the vast forest grew darker by the minute."

#. Occurrence C_1:182:16795: scene=C_1
#: C_1:182
msgctxt "text_id=16795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二週間たらずの休みで校舎が死に絶えるのなら、数年にわたり忘れ去られてきた森は如何なるものか。"
msgstr "  If the building had died in just under two weeks of vacation, what had become of forest over the years?"

#. Occurrence C_1:203:16796: scene=C_1
#: C_1:203
msgctxt "text_id=16796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　木々の壁の向こうは、街の喧噪はおろか、月明かりでさえ入れずにいる。"
msgstr "  The wall of overgrown trees filtered out the noise of the city, and most of the moonlight."

#. Occurrence C_1:208:16797: scene=C_1
#: C_1:208
msgctxt "text_id=16797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人々の住まう町から、三キロも離れていない魔境。"
msgstr "  An otherworldly realm had taken root, not even two miles away from town."

#. Occurrence C_1:213:16798: scene=C_1
#: C_1:213
msgctxt "text_id=16798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな、しんしんと凍てつく夜気の中、新雪を踏みしだく足音が二つ。"
msgstr "  Piercing the cold night air, footsteps crunched through the powdery snow."

#. Occurrence C_1:251:16799: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_1_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_1
#: C_1:251
msgctxt "text_id=16799 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「このあたりに仕掛けはなさそうね。"
msgstr "\"No traps this way."

#. Occurrence C_1:260:16800: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_1_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_1
#: C_1:260
msgctxt "text_id=16800 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……それで、どうするの？　このまま旧校舎に忍びこむ？」"
msgstr "  So... what's the plan? Sneak into the old school building?\""

#. Occurrence C_1:297:16801: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:297
msgctxt "text_id=16801 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「まさか。私らがやってきたコトなんて、とっくにバレてるわ。"
msgstr "\"Yeah, right. She already knows we're here."

#. Occurrence C_1:304:16802: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:304
msgctxt "text_id=16802 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "隠れても意味はないし、なにより、敵の<工房|アジト>に入ってどうするのよ。盗みが目的じゃないでしょ、今回は」"
msgstr "Why hide? And what would we do once we were in her hideout? We're not here to steal anything.\""

#. Occurrence C_1:338:16803: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_1_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_1
#: C_1:338
msgctxt "text_id=16803 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……後ろから斬りつけるのは、強盗と言うのじゃなくて？」"
msgstr "\"What about the element of surprise?\""

#. Occurrence C_1:384:16804: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:384
msgctxt "text_id=16804 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……それができれば苦労はないんだけどね。まあ、忍者の真似事は私……というか、有珠の芸風じゃないでしょ。"
msgstr "\"If we could do that, it'd make our job easier, but playing ninja isn't really my thing... nor yours, for that matter."

#. Occurrence C_1:390:16805: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:390
msgctxt "text_id=16805 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　そもそも―――」"
msgstr "  And anyway...\""

#. Occurrence C_1:427:16806: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:427
msgctxt "text_id=16806 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――そもそも。"
msgstr "\"...Anyway,"

#. Occurrence C_1:433:16807: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:433
msgctxt "text_id=16807 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　やる気満々なのは、こっちもあっちも同じってコト」"
msgstr "  ...we're not the only ones out for blood tonight.\""

#. Occurrence C_1:439:16808: scene=C_1
#: C_1:439
msgctxt "text_id=16808 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雪を踏むふたりの足音が、言い合わせたように停止する。"
msgstr "  The sound of their footsteps stopped in unison."

#. Occurrence C_1:479:16809: scene=C_1
#: C_1:479
msgctxt "text_id=16809 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三咲高校の裏山に残る旧校舎。"
msgstr "  The old forgotten Misaki High School building stood before them."

#. Occurrence C_1:484:16810: scene=C_1
#: C_1:484
msgctxt "text_id=16810 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かつての<校庭|グラウンド>は一面の雪原となっていた。"
msgstr "  What used to be the school yard was now a barren snowscape."

#. Occurrence C_1:489:16811: scene=C_1
#: C_1:489
msgctxt "text_id=16811 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　森に取り残された建物は、もの言わぬ死者のようだ。"
msgstr "  Reclaimed by the forest, the building looked a shell of its former self."

#. Occurrence C_1:494:16812: scene=C_1
#: C_1:494
msgctxt "text_id=16812 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな時代の残骸を<祀|まつ>るように、木々は壁となって周囲を<覆|おお>っている。"
msgstr "  The surrounding trees resembled standing mourners at a funeral."

#. Occurrence C_1:532:16813: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:532
msgctxt "text_id=16813 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「せっかちなお嬢さん<方|がた>だ。タイムリミットまで、あと四時間はあるというのに」"
msgstr "\"Talk about impatient. There's still four hours until the time limit.\""

#. Occurrence C_1:568:16814: scene=C_1
#: C_1:568
msgctxt "text_id=16814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その白い祭壇の中心に、橙色の魔術師が一人。"
msgstr "  Alone in the middle of the white altar was the lone, Scarred Red mage."

#. Occurrence C_1:573:16815: scene=C_1
#: C_1:573
msgctxt "text_id=16815 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　森を抜けてきた少女―――蒼崎青子はわずかに腰を落として、遠方の標的を睨む。"
msgstr "  As she came out from the forest, Aoko lowered herself slightly, scowling at her distant target."

#. Occurrence C_1:578:16816: scene=C_1
#: C_1:578
msgctxt "text_id=16816 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の<傍|かたわ>らに立つ久遠寺有珠は指一本動かさない。"
msgstr "  Next to her, Alice stood motionless."

#. Occurrence C_1:603:16817: scene=C_1
#: C_1:603
msgctxt "text_id=16817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　枝葉を落とした木々の影は<茨|いばら>を思わせる。"
msgstr "  The bare branches of the trees cast long, thorny shadows."

#. Occurrence C_1:608:16818: scene=C_1
#: C_1:608
msgctxt "text_id=16818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　眠り続ける姫の童話を連想した青子だが、あの魔術師はお姫さまほど<幸福|しあわせ>な性格はしていなかったらしい。"
msgstr "  Aoko was reminded of Sleeping Beauty, except this mage wasn't nearly as pleasant as the princess in that."

#. Occurrence C_1:613:16819: scene=C_1
#: C_1:613
msgctxt "text_id=16819 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　王子を待つのも、眠っているのも性に合わない、と。"
msgstr "  Not to mention she wasn't sleeping... and there was no prince."

#. Occurrence C_1:618:16820: scene=C_1
#: C_1:618
msgctxt "text_id=16820 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　旧校舎という城に棲んでいた姫は、現れた挑戦者を堂々と出迎えたのだから。"
msgstr "  Regardless, this princess came out of her schoolhouse castle to greet her challengers."

#. Occurrence C_1:669:16821: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:669
msgctxt "text_id=16821 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「その体で無理をして。"
msgstr "\"Pushing yourself in that condition?"

#. Occurrence C_1:675:16822: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:675
msgctxt "text_id=16822 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　貴女のそういうところ、姉としてどうかと思うわ青子」"
msgstr "  You do make your big sister worry, Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence C_1:694:16823: scene=C_1
#: C_1:694
msgctxt "text_id=16823 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は微笑みを浮かべている。"
msgstr "  Touko grinned faintly."

#. Occurrence C_1:699:16824: scene=C_1
#: C_1:699
msgctxt "text_id=16824 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　文句のひとつでも返したい青子だが、ここは我慢と口を<噤|つぐ>んだ。"
msgstr "  Aoko fought back the urge to respond."

#. Occurrence C_1:704:16825: scene=C_1
#: C_1:704
msgctxt "text_id=16825 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は一律で無言。両者の因縁に関心はないと、その態度で示している。"
msgstr "  Meanwhile, Alice stood in silence, uninterested in sibling rivalry."

#. Occurrence C_1:751:16826: scene=C_1
#: C_1:751
msgctxt "text_id=16826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　両陣営の距離は三十メートルほど。"
msgstr "  Touko stood about a hundred feet away."

#. Occurrence C_1:756:16827: scene=C_1
#: C_1:756
msgctxt "text_id=16827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　互いの声が届くのは森の静けさと、魔術によって強化された五感の<賜|たまもの>だ。"
msgstr "  With their senses sharpened through magecraft and the silence of the forest, they could hear each other perfectly."

#. Occurrence C_1:762:16828: scene=C_1
#: C_1:762
msgctxt "text_id=16828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子の<傍|かたわ>らに金狼の姿はない。"
msgstr "  The golden wolf was nowhere to be seen."

#. Occurrence C_1:767:16829: scene=C_1
#: C_1:767
msgctxt "text_id=16829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は体ひとつで青子たちと対峙している。"
msgstr "  Touko faced the two girls alone."

#. Occurrence C_1:825:16830: scene=C_1
#: C_1:825
msgctxt "text_id=16830 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は黒い<外套|コート>に帽子をかぶった、典型的な魔術戦の出で立ち。"
msgstr "  Alice's black overcoat and winter hat were typical items of clothing for a mage battle."

#. Occurrence C_1:830:16831: scene=C_1
#: C_1:830
msgctxt "text_id=16831 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その有珠より半歩前に出ている青子の服装は、場にそぐわない事この上ない、三咲高校の学生服だ。"
msgstr "  A few paces in front of her was Aoko, whose combat garb was comparatively out of place: a Misaki High School uniform."

#. Occurrence C_1:875:16832: scene=C_1
#: C_1:875
msgctxt "text_id=16832 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠に着替えを持ってくるよう頼んだところ、何を勘違いしたのか、私服ではなく制服を持ってきた為である。"
msgstr "  She had asked Alice to bring a change of clothes for her, but there must have been some misunderstanding..."

#. Occurrence C_1:881:16833: scene=C_1
#: C_1:881
msgctxt "text_id=16833 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな些細な事情なのだが、橙子は特別な意味があると見たらしい。"
msgstr "  Though it was a trivial miscommunication, Touko seemed to think it had some special meaning."

#. Occurrence C_1:927:16834: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:927
msgctxt "text_id=16834 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ところで、始める前にひとついいかな。"
msgstr "\"Before we start, mind if I ask something?"

#. Occurrence C_1:943:16835: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:943
msgctxt "text_id=16835 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　気になって仕方がないし、この先、機会もないだろうから訊くんだけど……貴女の戦闘服ってそれなの、青子？」"
msgstr "  I can't help but be curious-and this is probably my last chance to ask-but is that seriously what you're going to fight in, Aoko?\""

#. Occurrence C_1:970:16836: scene=C_1
#: C_1:970
msgctxt "text_id=16836 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　離れた距離も関係なく、橙子の声はよく響いた。"
msgstr "  Touko spoke clearly, and despite the distance"

#. Occurrence C_1:975:16837: scene=C_1
#: C_1:975
msgctxt "text_id=16837 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心底から不快そうな、侮辱というより軽蔑すらこもった<韻|いん>も、のこさず聞き取れる。"
msgstr "  was able to communicate her deep-seated scorn without trouble."

#. Occurrence C_1:1005:16838: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1005
msgctxt "text_id=16838 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_1:1010:16839: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1010
msgctxt "text_id=16839 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無駄話はせず、ほぼ奇襲のカタチで橙子を仕留めるつもりだった青子だが、さすがに今のは無視できない。"
msgstr "  Aoko would rather attack than engage in small talk, but she decided to take the bait."

#. Occurrence C_1:1038:16840: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1038
msgctxt "text_id=16840 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そんなワケないでしょ。今までこういう機会が多かっただけよ。数えるなら今日を含めて四回しかないわ。"
msgstr "\"Don't lie. You've had plenty of chances to ask me. Four times, including today."

#. Occurrence C_1:1051:16841: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1051
msgctxt "text_id=16841 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……ま、私はまだ<現|・><役|・>だからそれも悪くはないかもしれないけど？　いつか流行るでしょ、こういうのも」"
msgstr "  ...Well, this is my 'job' right now, so I think it's fitting. Besides, my fashion's ahead of the times.\""

#. Occurrence C_1:1064:16842: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1064
msgctxt "text_id=16842 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　現役、という単語を強調する青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko was sure to emphasize her words."

#. Occurrence C_1:1069:16843: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1069
msgctxt "text_id=16843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一瞬、橙子の瞳が青子もかくやといった鋭さを帯びた。"
msgstr "  For a split second, Touko's eyes narrowed."

#. Occurrence C_1:1107:16844: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1107
msgctxt "text_id=16844 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……呆れたな。あいかわらずのローセンスだ」"
msgstr "\"...Figures. Same bad taste, as always.\""

#. Occurrence C_1:1130:16845: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1130
msgctxt "text_id=16845 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それはどうも、人形を実の妹に見立てる異常者にそう言われるなら、一周まわって安心よ」"
msgstr "\"Thanks. It's actually a relief hearing that from a creepy puppet-maker.\""

#. Occurrence C_1:1143:16846: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1143
msgctxt "text_id=16846 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それきり、ふたりは無言で見つめ合った。"
msgstr "  With that, the two fell silent and glared at each other."

#. Occurrence C_1:1148:16847: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1148
msgctxt "text_id=16847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　凍える大気に、<姉妹|しまい>間<独特|どくとく>の殺意が火花を散らす。"
msgstr "  Their bloodlust cut through the thick, cold air like a knife."

#. Occurrence C_1:1226:16848: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_1_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1226
msgctxt "text_id=16848 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_1:1232:16849: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1232
msgctxt "text_id=16849 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりが<牽制|けんせい>し合う中、有珠は<橙|て><子|き>の周囲を解析する。"
msgstr "  While the two of them sized each other up, Alice surveyed the area around Touko."

#. Occurrence C_1:1252:16850: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1252
msgctxt "text_id=16850 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……橙子の周りに何者かが<潜|ひそ>んでいる気配はない。"
msgstr "  There was no indication anyone or anything was lying in wait near her."

#. Occurrence C_1:1257:16851: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1257
msgctxt "text_id=16851 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼はいまだ旧校舎に残っていると見るべきか。"
msgstr "  Perhaps she should see if the werewolf was still in the old school building."

#. Occurrence C_1:1263:16852: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1263
msgctxt "text_id=16852 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　傷ついた青子と有珠、二人でようやく一人分の戦力と見ているのか―――"
msgstr "  Maybe Touko didn't feel like Aoko and Alice were much of a threat in their injured state."

#. Occurrence C_1:1269:16853: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1269
msgctxt "text_id=16853 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "それとも本当に、この時間での反撃を予測しておらず、人狼の準備が整っていないのか。"
msgstr "Or was she really not expecting a counterattack so early, so the werewolf wasn't ready?"

#. Occurrence C_1:1301:16854: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1301
msgctxt "text_id=16854 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静かな心持ちで、有珠は前者だと判断した。"
msgstr "  After some contemplation, Alice surmised it was the former."

#. Occurrence C_1:1306:16855: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1306
msgctxt "text_id=16855 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　敵は<単身|ひとり>で戦うつもりだ。"
msgstr "  She really was going to fight alone."

#. Occurrence C_1:1311:16856: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1311
msgctxt "text_id=16856 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<橙|て><子|き>の武装は、魔眼と修得しているルーン。"
msgstr "  Her arsenal comprised her Mystic Eyes and rune magecraft."

#. Occurrence C_1:1316:16857: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1316
msgctxt "text_id=16857 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それだけで現状の青子と有珠を処理して余りあるのだから。"
msgstr "  That was more than enough to deal with Aoko and Alice in their current state."

#. Occurrence C_1:1336:16858: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1336
msgctxt "text_id=16858 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“―――有珠。初撃で決めるから”"
msgstr "(...Alice, all I need is one shot.)"

#. Occurrence C_1:1362:16859: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1362
msgctxt "text_id=16859 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は背後の有珠へ、指先の動きだけでそう伝えた。"
msgstr "  Aoko signaled to Alice behind her with the movement of her finger."

#. Occurrence C_1:1367:16860: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1367
msgctxt "text_id=16860 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠に異論はない。"
msgstr "  Alice had no objections."

#. Occurrence C_1:1372:16861: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1372
msgctxt "text_id=16861 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……当初の予定では人狼は有珠が引き付け、"
msgstr "  The original plan was for her to keep the werewolf busy."

#. Occurrence C_1:1377:16862: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1377
msgctxt "text_id=16862 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は『鏡』のバックアップを受けつつ、橙子を奇襲する算段だった。"
msgstr "  With the mirror as a backup, Aoko was hoping to catch Touko off-guard."

#. Occurrence C_1:1397:16863: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1397
msgctxt "text_id=16863 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他にも幾つか奥の手はあったが、青子たちが魔術師である以上、何であれ人狼には通じない。"
msgstr "  They had a few other cards up their sleeves, but the fact remained that as mages their attacks wouldn't affect the werewolf."

#. Occurrence C_1:1402:16864: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1402
msgctxt "text_id=16864 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なので人狼は無視し、橙子のみを標的にする。"
msgstr "  So they decided to ignore it, and focus on taking out Touko."

#. Occurrence C_1:1407:16865: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1407
msgctxt "text_id=16865 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　都合のいい作戦ではあるが、ふたりにはそれしか選択の余地はなかったのだ。"
msgstr "  Not the best strategy, but it was all the two of them could come up with."

#. Occurrence C_1:1456:16866: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1456
msgctxt "text_id=16866 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……が、事態は想定していたものと違っていた。"
msgstr "  ...But they had been thrown a curveball."

#. Occurrence C_1:1461:16867: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1461
msgctxt "text_id=16867 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は自軍の有利性から、人狼の出陣を<渋|しぶ>っている。"
msgstr "  Touko had the upper hand, so she was reluctant to use the beast."

#. Occurrence C_1:1467:16868: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1467
msgctxt "text_id=16868 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ならば、と青子は即断した。"
msgstr "  Aoko wasn't about to let this opportunity go to waste."

#. Occurrence C_1:1472:16869: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1472
msgctxt "text_id=16869 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<和気藹々|わきあいあい>とした姉妹の談話の隙をついて、人狼が出てくる前に決着をつけるのみ、と。"
msgstr "  By distracting her with sibling banter, she would settle things before the werewolf even showed up."

#. Occurrence C_1:1516:16870: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1516
msgctxt "text_id=16870 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「じゃあ今度はこっちの番ね。"
msgstr "\"My turn to ask a question."

#. Occurrence C_1:1560:16871: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1560
msgctxt "text_id=16871 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　どう、結界の張り直しは進んでる？」"
msgstr "  How're the fields working out?\""

#. Occurrence C_1:1599:16872: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1599
msgctxt "text_id=16872 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「まさか、昨日の今日よ。まだ手を付けてもいない。<急|せ>いては事をし損じる。"
msgstr "\"Oh please. It's barely been a day. I haven't touched them yet. Can't rush these things."

#. Occurrence C_1:1606:16873: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1606
msgctxt "text_id=16873 | speaker=touko"
msgid "だいたい、私の目的は霊脈の奥にあるもので結界そのものじゃない。張り直しは予定にないさ。"
msgstr "Besides, I want what's inside the leylines, not the Bounded Fields. I have no plans to reset them."

#. Occurrence C_1:1617:16874: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1617
msgctxt "text_id=16874 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　まあ―――土地を<暴|あば>くなんて面倒な真似をするより、<貴女|おまえ>を暴いた方が早いのかもしれないが」"
msgstr "  Tearing into you is probably way faster than tearing into the land anyway.\""

#. Occurrence C_1:1668:16875: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1668
msgctxt "text_id=16875 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ふん、やっぱりそれが目的だったのね。"
msgstr "\"Hmph. I knew it."

#. Occurrence C_1:1674:16876: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1674
msgctxt "text_id=16876 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……なら尚のこと、アンタを魔法使いにするワケにはいかないわ」"
msgstr "  All the more reason I can't let you become a Magician.\""

#. Occurrence C_1:1718:16877: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1718
msgctxt "text_id=16877 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青い瞳に明確な戦意が<宿|やど>る。"
msgstr "  Aoko's blue eyes burned brightly with a fiery fighting spirit."

#. Occurrence C_1:1723:16878: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1723
msgctxt "text_id=16878 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今まさに仕掛けてきそうな妹の様子を見ても、橙子に動きはない。その唇が皮肉げに動くだけだ。"
msgstr "  Even though her sister was ready to pounce, Touko remained motionless but for her mouth, which twisted into a smirk."

#. Occurrence C_1:1744:16879: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1744
msgctxt "text_id=16879 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「魔法使い、か。たしかにまだ執着はあるね。"
msgstr "\"A Magician, huh? Got to admit, I like the sound of that."

#. Occurrence C_1:1750:16880: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1750
msgctxt "text_id=16880 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　私には移植されなかった魔術刻印と、蒼崎の伝える魔法の正体。"
msgstr "  The Magic Crests that weren't implanted in me, and the True Magic of the Aozaki family..."

#. Occurrence C_1:1757:16881: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1757
msgctxt "text_id=16881 | speaker=touko"
msgid "だがもういいよ。欲しくはあるが、<到|・><達|・><す|・><れ|・><ば|・>どちらも自分で用意できる。"
msgstr "But it's fine. I do want them, but I can get them on my own."

#. Occurrence C_1:1784:16882: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0012; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:1784
msgctxt "text_id=16882 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　それとも……今ここで、私の為に魔法の正体を見せてくれるのかい、青子？」"
msgstr "  Oh, wait... Did you come here to show me your Magic, Aoko?\""

#. Occurrence C_1:1804:16883: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1804
msgctxt "text_id=16883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の瞳は、言葉とは裏腹に青子を<嘲|あざけ>っていた。"
msgstr "  Touko's words came out flatly, but her eyes mocked her sister."

#. Occurrence C_1:1814:16884: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1814
msgctxt "text_id=16884 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……青子が<橙|て><子|き>を排除したいのなら、正体の分からない『魔法』を使うのが最良であり、確実だ。"
msgstr "  It was true, however, that if Aoko wanted to defeat Touko, her best chance would be to use this mysterious True Magic."

#. Occurrence C_1:1819:16885: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1819
msgctxt "text_id=16885 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが青子にはそれが出来ない。"
msgstr "  The only problem was that she couldn't."

#. Occurrence C_1:1824:16886: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1824
msgctxt "text_id=16886 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　出来るのなら昨夜の窮地で使用している。"
msgstr "  If she could, she would have used it to avoid being mauled last night."

#. Occurrence C_1:1872:16887: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1872
msgctxt "text_id=16887 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎青子は魔法を使用できない。"
msgstr "  Aoko Aozaki couldn't use True Magic."

#. Occurrence C_1:1877:16888: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1877
msgctxt "text_id=16888 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子はそれを何らかの条件付けと考えた。"
msgstr "  Touko believed she needed to fulfill some kind of condition."

#. Occurrence C_1:1882:16889: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1882
msgctxt "text_id=16889 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　祖父の<術式防護|プロテクト>が、安易な奇跡の発現を禁じているのだと。"
msgstr "  The protection their grandfather placed on the formulae was to prohibit miracles from being easily realized."

#. Occurrence C_1:1889:16890: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1889
msgctxt "text_id=16890 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが―――あの<祖父|おとこ>は、人の世を<顧|かえり>みる人格者ではない。"
msgstr "  However, that wasn't because he was concerned about the human world."

#. Occurrence C_1:1895:16891: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1895
msgctxt "text_id=16891 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大げさな話でなく、魔法の発現でこの街が消え去っても何の感慨も浮かべまい。"
msgstr "  It was no exaggeration to say he'd feel nothing if Magic leveled the entire city."

#. Occurrence C_1:1915:16892: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1915
msgctxt "text_id=16892 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　初めから、<魔|・><法|・><に|・><条|・><件|・><付|・><け|・><な|・><ど|・><な|・><い|・>。"
msgstr "  The truth was, *True Magic never had any conditions.*"

#. Occurrence C_1:1963:16893: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1963
msgctxt "text_id=16893 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子を縛っているものはトラウマにすぎない。"
msgstr "  Aoko was being held back by trauma."

#. Occurrence C_1:1968:16894: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1968
msgctxt "text_id=16894 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地上でただ五つの特権を、精神的な<枷|かせ>で縛っている。"
msgstr "  These five privileges, the only powers of their kind, were bound by cognitive seals."

#. Occurrence C_1:1973:16895: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1973
msgctxt "text_id=16895 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　故に、橙子の瞳は未熟な妹を<嘲|あざけ>るのだ。"
msgstr "  That's why Touko looked down on her naive little sister."

#. Occurrence C_1:1978:16896: scene=C_1
#: C_1:1978
msgctxt "text_id=16896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その弱さ。人の身に背負いきれない『魔法』なぞ、一振りの剣にも劣ると。"
msgstr "  So weak. A body incapable of handling Magic could be cut down with a mere sword."

#. Occurrence C_1:2049:16897: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2049
msgctxt "text_id=16897 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを何よりも自覚しているからこそ、青子にはその嘲笑は許せない。"
msgstr "  Aoko knew that better than anyone else, which is why she couldn't forgive her sister's ridicule."

#. Occurrence C_1:2054:16898: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2054
msgctxt "text_id=16898 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法を使ってみせろ？"
msgstr "  Just try using True Magic, huh?"

#. Occurrence C_1:2091:16899: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2091
msgctxt "text_id=16899 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんて安い挑発。"
msgstr "  A pathetic taunt."

#. Occurrence C_1:2096:16900: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2096
msgctxt "text_id=16900 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなもの、言われるまでもなく―――"
msgstr "  If that was how she wanted to play, then so be it..."

#. Occurrence C_1:2119:16901: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:2119
msgctxt "text_id=16901 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ええ、お望みとあらばね――――――！」"
msgstr "\"Have it your way!\""

#. Occurrence C_1:2182:16902: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2182
msgctxt "text_id=16902 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　切りつけんばかりの殺気と共に、青子はスタートをきった。"
msgstr "  With a burst of pure rage, Aoko made her move."

#. Occurrence C_1:2199:16903: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2199
msgctxt "text_id=16903 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――<未到|みとう>の雪原に、無色の靴が駆け抜ける。"
msgstr "  Her colorless shoes sped across the untainted snowfield..."

#. Occurrence C_1:2250:16904: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:2250
msgctxt "text_id=16904 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_1:2255:16905: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2255
msgctxt "text_id=16905 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まるで<水面|みなも>の飛び石だ。"
msgstr "  ...like a stone skipping across the water."

#. Occurrence C_1:2260:16906: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2260
msgctxt "text_id=16906 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　高速で橙子に向かう青子の体は、完全に“消失”していた。"
msgstr "  As Aoko charged forward, she disappeared."

#. Occurrence C_1:2280:16907: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2280
msgctxt "text_id=16907 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　足跡だけが<弾痕|だんこん>のように迫ってくる。"
msgstr "  Only her footprints advanced, like bullet holes in the snow."

#. Occurrence C_1:2285:16908: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2285
msgctxt "text_id=16908 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを橙子は不動のまま待ち受けた。"
msgstr "  Touko held her ground."

#. Occurrence C_1:2316:16909: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2316
msgctxt "text_id=16909 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　姿隠しは簡単な魔術だ。"
msgstr "  Concealment was elementary magecraft."

#. Occurrence C_1:2321:16910: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2321
msgctxt "text_id=16910 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おそらくは有珠が用意した小道具の力だろう。"
msgstr "  More than likely, the power came from one of Alice's trinkets."

#. Occurrence C_1:2326:16911: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2326
msgctxt "text_id=16911 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　単純だが、効果的な魔眼対策である。"
msgstr "  It was a simple yet effective countermeasure to Mystic Eyes."

#. Occurrence C_1:2331:16912: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2331
msgctxt "text_id=16912 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<捕縛|ロック>の呪いに特化した橙子の魔眼は、不正を<見|み><抜|ぬ>き<明|あき>らかにする“<真理|ロゴス>”の特性を持っていない。"
msgstr "  Touko's Mystic Eyes used the Lock property to bind an opponent; it did not have the Logos property to discern truth through an illusion."

#. Occurrence C_1:2336:16913: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2336
msgctxt "text_id=16913 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　仕組みを知られた魔術は、このようにたやすく打破される。"
msgstr "  Once a magecraft's workings were revealed, its weakness was exposed."

#. Occurrence C_1:2388:16914: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0014; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:2388
msgctxt "text_id=16914 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“足癖が悪いのも変わらず、か”"
msgstr "(Still the same sloppy footwork.)"

#. Occurrence C_1:2394:16915: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2394
msgctxt "text_id=16915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　既に四秒。十メートルもの距離を<詰|つ>め、さらに加速する姿なき襲撃者。"
msgstr "  In a mere four seconds, her opponent had closed ten yards and was still speeding up."

#. Occurrence C_1:2399:16916: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2399
msgctxt "text_id=16916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術戦では敵わぬと見て、殴り合いならぬ蹴り合いを挑むつもりらしい。"
msgstr "  It appeared that she had given up on a mage battle, and was going to move in for melee."

#. Occurrence C_1:2404:16917: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2404
msgctxt "text_id=16917 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう一人の少女、久遠寺有珠は一歩も動かず。"
msgstr "  The other girl, Alice Kuonji, didn't take a single step."

#. Occurrence C_1:2438:16918: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0015; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:2438
msgctxt "text_id=16918 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“<被弾|ひだん>覚悟の特攻―――有珠から護符でも貰っているのでしょうけど、反省なさい青子。"
msgstr "(A suicide charge, open to friendly fire from the rear... Even with Alice's protection, this is dumb. You'll regret this, Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_1:2445:16919: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0016; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:2445
msgctxt "text_id=16919 | speaker=touko"
msgid "切札というものは、あくまで自己の力によるものを言うのよ”"
msgstr "Your trump card has to come from your own deck.)"

#. Occurrence C_1:2451:16920: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2451
msgctxt "text_id=16920 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　くっ、と口端をつり上げて橙子は左腕を構えた。"
msgstr "  Sneering, Touko raised her left arm,"

#. Occurrence C_1:2456:16921: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2456
msgctxt "text_id=16921 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぎ払うように、胸の前で水平に。"
msgstr "  holding it out in front of her threateningly."

#. Occurrence C_1:2491:16922: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2491
msgctxt "text_id=16922 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残り十メートル。"
msgstr "  Ten more yards."

#. Occurrence C_1:2496:16923: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2496
msgctxt "text_id=16923 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本来なら不可視の青子の<位置|すがた>は、不運にも足跡が十分に示していた。"
msgstr "  Unfortunately, her footprints gave away her position."

#. Occurrence C_1:2530:16924: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0017; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:2530
msgctxt "text_id=16924 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「<[swel]|ソウ>―――」"
msgstr "\"Sow-\""

#. Occurrence C_1:2564:16925: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2564
msgctxt "text_id=16925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ルーンの呪詛を<刻|きざ>む橙子。"
msgstr "  Touko began engraving a rune into the air."

#. Occurrence C_1:2569:16926: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2569
msgctxt "text_id=16926 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それより早く、青子の足跡はぴたりと止まった。"
msgstr "  But before she could finish, Aoko's footprints stopped."

#. Occurrence C_1:2580:16927: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2580
msgctxt "text_id=16927 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　格闘戦を行うにはまだ遠すぎる。"
msgstr "  She was still too far away for close combat."

#. Occurrence C_1:2585:16928: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2585
msgctxt "text_id=16928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの位置で止まるのはあまりに不可解。"
msgstr "  What a strange place to end her attack..."

#. Occurrence C_1:2590:16929: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2590
msgctxt "text_id=16929 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや。それ以前に、あのスピードで急停止などできるものだろうか……？"
msgstr "  No, wait. Could she really stop so suddenly at that speed...?"

#. Occurrence C_1:2615:16930: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:2615
msgctxt "text_id=16930 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“跳んだか―――！”"
msgstr "(She jumped...!)"

#. Occurrence C_1:2663:16931: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2663
msgctxt "text_id=16931 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一瞬の判断。"
msgstr "  Touko made a snap decision."

#. Occurrence C_1:2668:16932: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2668
msgctxt "text_id=16932 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　水平に構えられた橙子の腕が、月を<仰|あお>ぐよう上空に向けられる。"
msgstr "  She quickly raised her outstretched arm toward the sky as if saluting the moon."

#. Occurrence C_1:2715:16933: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0019; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:2715
msgctxt "text_id=16933 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「<[swel]|ソウェル>―――！」"
msgstr "\"Sowilo!\""

#. Occurrence C_1:2818:16934: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2818
msgctxt "text_id=16934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大気を<滑|はし>る、<劫火|ごうか>の導線。"
msgstr "  Flames tore through the air."

#. Occurrence C_1:2823:16935: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2823
msgctxt "text_id=16935 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<刻印|ルーン>は空中の見えざる人体に<刻|きざ>まれ、わずか一秒で炎を巻き起こした。"
msgstr "  The rune carved into the body above her, bathing it in a pillar of flames."

#. Occurrence C_1:2828:16936: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2828
msgctxt "text_id=16936 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　内部からの魔術抵抗は意味をなさない。"
msgstr "  No internal resistance spell could help."

#. Occurrence C_1:2833:16937: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2833
msgctxt "text_id=16937 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ルーンは対象を燃やしたのではなく、対象を炎で包み込んだのだから。"
msgstr "  Rather than simply burning their target, the runes wrapped them in a wreath of flame."

#. Occurrence C_1:2946:16938: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2946
msgctxt "text_id=16938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悲鳴をあげて雪原に落ちる襲撃者。"
msgstr "  The assailant screamed, falling onto the snow-covered ground."

#. Occurrence C_1:2951:16939: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2951
msgctxt "text_id=16939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<苦悶|くもん>に荒れ狂う体、助けを<乞|こ>うように<掲|かか>げられる手は、夢に出てきそうなほど見苦しい。"
msgstr "  In agony, she extended a burning hand out from the hellish fire, as if begging for mercy. It was the stuff of nightmares."

#. Occurrence C_1:2956:16940: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2956
msgctxt "text_id=16940 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　炎は消えず、積もった雪を溶かしながら、襲撃者は息絶えるまであぶられ続ける。"
msgstr "  The snow melted as the fire burned the attacker alive."

#. Occurrence C_1:2963:16941: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2963
msgctxt "text_id=16941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　チチチ、チチチと。"
msgstr "  Chirp chirp."

#. Occurrence C_1:2968:16942: scene=C_1
#: C_1:2968
msgctxt "text_id=16942 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子らしからぬ、あまりにも大げさな<三流芝居|だんまつま>をあげながら。"
msgstr "  The movement was far too theatrical to be Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_1:3006:16943: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0020; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:3006
msgctxt "text_id=16943 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_1:3011:16944: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3011
msgctxt "text_id=16944 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の視線は、既に有珠に向けられている。"
msgstr "  Touko had already turned her gaze to Alice."

#. Occurrence C_1:3050:16945: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3050
msgctxt "text_id=16945 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　燃えカスなどはじめから見てはいない。"
msgstr "  She hadn't been watching the burning corpse at all."

#. Occurrence C_1:3055:16946: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3055
msgctxt "text_id=16946 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は<ソ|・><レ|・>が無抵抗に落下した時から、青子ではないと判断していた。"
msgstr "  Touko knew it wasn't Aoko from the moment the body fell to the ground."

#. Occurrence C_1:3093:16947: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0021; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:3093
msgctxt "text_id=16947 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“チッ、マインスターの使い魔は何匹いる…………！”"
msgstr "(Tch... Another dumb Meinster familiar!)"

#. Occurrence C_1:3099:16948: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3099
msgctxt "text_id=16948 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<苛|いら>だたしげに舌打ちしつつ、橙子は有珠を凝視する。"
msgstr "  Irritated, Touko glared at Alice."

#. Occurrence C_1:3104:16949: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3104
msgctxt "text_id=16949 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしかに青子の姿は透明化していた。"
msgstr "  While Aoko had vanished into thin air,"

#. Occurrence C_1:3109:16950: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3109
msgctxt "text_id=16950 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただし、本人は一歩たりとも動いてはいない。"
msgstr "  she hadn't moved at all."

#. Occurrence C_1:3154:16951: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3154
msgctxt "text_id=16951 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子が立っていた地面には、青い円陣が回りだしている。"
msgstr "  Blue energy traced a circle around where she stood."

#. Occurrence C_1:3221:16952: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3221
msgctxt "text_id=16952 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは魔術刻印を動員した、<四小節の大魔術|フォース・トゥ・フォース>。"
msgstr "  It was Force to Fourth, a four-bar grand magecraft, mobilizing her Magic Crest."

#. Occurrence C_1:3226:16953: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3226
msgctxt "text_id=16953 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<一工程|シングルアクション>のルーンしか―――"
msgstr "  Touko only had single-action runes-"

#. Occurrence C_1:3231:16954: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3231
msgctxt "text_id=16954 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、そもそも二小節以上の魔術を修得できない橙子にとっては、太刀打ちできない魔力の奔流―――！"
msgstr "  no, she hadn't mastered anything above two bars to begin with. This torrent of energy was too much to handle!"

#. Occurrence C_1:3318:16955: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0022; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:3318
msgctxt "text_id=16955 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「―――<[eywz]|エイワズ>！」"
msgstr "\"Eihwaz!\""

#. Occurrence C_1:3436:16956: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3436
msgctxt "text_id=16956 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　円陣の上に、ルーンの軌跡が刻まれる。"
msgstr "  The rune formed in the magic circle."

#. Occurrence C_1:3567:16957: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3567
msgctxt "text_id=16957 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<退去|エイワズ>のルーンで青子にかかった姿隠しを解呪し、橙子は<角|ひ><膜|とみ>を切り替える。"
msgstr "  Eihwaz, the rune of withdrawal, was evoked and Aoko's concealment was undone, allowing Touko to utilize her Mystic Eyes."

#. Occurrence C_1:3572:16958: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3572
msgctxt "text_id=16958 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　新たに開かれる<瞳|もの>は、見たものを眼球内の無限地獄に捕らえる、合わせ鏡の積重魔眼―――！"
msgstr "  Within her opened pupil, the infinitely mirrored eyes captured their target in an endless hell!"

#. Occurrence C_1:3712:16959: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0023; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:3712
msgctxt "text_id=16959 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「っ……！？」"
msgstr "\"Ngh...?!\""

#. Occurrence C_1:3742:16960: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3742
msgctxt "text_id=16960 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、魔術師の視線は文字通り<両|・><断|・>された。"
msgstr "  But the mage's sight was literally split in two."

#. Occurrence C_1:3747:16961: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3747
msgctxt "text_id=16961 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の前の空間が歪んでいる。"
msgstr "  The space in front of Aoko distorted,"

#. Occurrence C_1:3752:16962: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3752
msgctxt "text_id=16962 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜気は霧のように重なり、青子の姿を<被|だぶ>らせている。"
msgstr "  obscuring her form like an icy mist."

#. Occurrence C_1:3757:16963: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3757
msgctxt "text_id=16963 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の魔眼が合わせ鏡なら、あれは三角点に置かれたマジックミラーだ。"
msgstr "  If Touko's eye was like opposing mirrors, then this was like sticking a one-way mirror at the triangulation point."

#. Occurrence C_1:3762:16964: scene=C_1
#: C_1:3762
msgctxt "text_id=16964 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の位置からでは視界が二つに別けられ、正面の<像|あおこ>を視認できない……！"
msgstr "  With her vision split in two, she couldn't lock on to Aoko!"

#. Occurrence C_1:3895:16965: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_1_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_1
#: C_1:3895
msgctxt "text_id=16965 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「午睡の鏡の効果よ、橙子さん。"
msgstr "\"The Mirror of Slumber, Touko."

#. Occurrence C_1:3902:16966: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_1_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_1
#: C_1:3902
msgctxt "text_id=16966 | speaker=alice"
msgid "青子は鏡のＹ字路の奥にいる。一本道から見ている貴女に、中心は見渡せない」"
msgstr "Aoko's deep in the fork in the road the mirror creates. From where you are, you'll never be able to see her.\""

#. Occurrence C_1:3949:16967: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0024; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:3949
msgctxt "text_id=16967 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence C_1:4044:16968: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4044
msgctxt "text_id=16968 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつかの逆転とばかりに有珠は言い捨てた。"
msgstr "  Alice explained without concern."

#. Occurrence C_1:4049:16969: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4049
msgctxt "text_id=16969 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠自身、橙子に飲まされた薬草によって魔術は使えない。"
msgstr "  Due to the herb Touko made Alice swallow, she was still unable to use her own magecraft."

#. Occurrence C_1:4054:16970: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4054
msgctxt "text_id=16970 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、既に起動しているプロイたち……洋館の『鏡』と、無駄に動き回る青い鳥は、彼女の魔力がなくとも最低限の機能は果たせるのだ。"
msgstr "  However, she could use Ploys already in motion without using magical energy...such as the mansion's mirror and the aimless little blue bird."

#. Occurrence C_1:4098:16971: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4098
msgctxt "text_id=16971 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして、暴風の<魔弾|まだん>が<装填|そうてん>される。"
msgstr "  Finally, the magic bullet was loaded."

#. Occurrence C_1:4176:16972: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:4176
msgctxt "text_id=16972 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「<接続|セット>―――<刻印|ルート>、<交流数紋|ディレクト・カーラント>」"
msgstr "\"Set route. Direct current.\""

#. Occurrence C_1:4294:16973: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4294
msgctxt "text_id=16973 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　右腕を<掲|かか>げ、<光|ひ><芒|か>る刻印をあらわにし、青子は三十メートル先の標的を見据える。"
msgstr "  Raising her right arm to reveal her luminescent crests, Aoko took aim at her target a hundred feet ahead."

#. Occurrence C_1:4299:16974: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4299
msgctxt "text_id=16974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<砲|う><身|で>は十分な魔力に満ちている。"
msgstr "  Magical energy coursed through her gun barrel arm."

#. Occurrence C_1:4337:16975: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4337
msgctxt "text_id=16975 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の姿隠しを受けた瞬間から、青子は魔術の詠唱を始めていた。"
msgstr "  From the moment she had received Alice's invisibility, Aoko had begun chanting her magecraft."

#. Occurrence C_1:4381:16976: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4381
msgctxt "text_id=16976 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子が気付くまでの数秒間。"
msgstr "  It took Touko a few seconds to notice."

#. Occurrence C_1:4386:16977: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4386
msgctxt "text_id=16977 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最速の手順で形成し、起動させた魔術回路の回転数は自己ベストを超えている。"
msgstr "  Aoko produced more spins in the awakened Magic Circuits than she had ever done before."

#. Occurrence C_1:4426:16978: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4426
msgctxt "text_id=16978 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<一工程|スナップ>でも<二|ド><工|ロ><程|ウ>でもない、三工程以上の<魔力圧縮|マジック・ブロウ>。"
msgstr "  She readied not Snap, nor Draw. Instead, she advanced past her third process, a compression of magical energy: Magic Blow."

#. Occurrence C_1:4432:16979: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4432
msgctxt "text_id=16979 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生成され、目前に集められて渦巻く青いエーテルは、単純に撃ち出すだけで１０トン相当の質量。"
msgstr "  If she fired the blue Ether that gathered before her, it would fly with the force of ten tons."

#. Occurrence C_1:4437:16980: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4437
msgctxt "text_id=16980 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これを魔術刻印によって加工し、相乗に相乗を重ねて掃射すれば、背後の旧校舎さえ粉砕できる―――！"
msgstr "  Using her Magic Crests to multiply the energy and machine-gun her target, it was enough power to demolish even the old building behind her!"

#. Occurrence C_1:4502:16981: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:4502
msgctxt "text_id=16981 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「橙子――――――！」"
msgstr "\"Toukooo!!!\""

#. Occurrence C_1:4542:16982: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4542
msgctxt "text_id=16982 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　覚悟、とばかりに青子は姉を見据えた。"
msgstr "  Aoko stared intensely at her sister, ready to fire."

#. Occurrence C_1:4568:16983: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4568
msgctxt "text_id=16983 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子には対抗する時間も、回避するだけの<移動力|あし>もない。"
msgstr "  Touko had no time to counterattack, or even the speed to evade."

#. Occurrence C_1:4573:16984: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4573
msgctxt "text_id=16984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを誰より理解しているのか、彼女は驚愕のまま動かなかった。"
msgstr "  The fact she didn't move implied she knew that better than anyone."

#. Occurrence C_1:4578:16985: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4578
msgctxt "text_id=16985 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<怯|おび>えはなく、敗北を悟った自責の瞳。"
msgstr "  Acceptance filled her eyes, not fear."

#. Occurrence C_1:4583:16986: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4583
msgctxt "text_id=16986 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに青子は躊躇する事なく、右手の引き金に力をいれた。"
msgstr "  Aoko didn't hesitate. She squeezed the trigger on her right hand."

#. Occurrence C_1:4676:16987: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:4676
msgctxt "text_id=16987 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「<魔弾|ツアー><形式|プラン>、<収束|スター><投射|マイン>―――回路、放て………！！！！」"
msgstr "\"<Magic bullet configuration, convergent launch|Tour Plan, Starmine>... Circuit, FIRE!!!\""

#. Occurrence C_1:4829:16988: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4829
msgctxt "text_id=16988 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　叫び声にも似た最後の一節。"
msgstr "  The last word came out like a scream."

#. Occurrence C_1:4834:16989: scene=C_1
#: C_1:4834
msgctxt "text_id=16989 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　撃ち出された架<空要|エーテル>素は仮初めの熱量となって、降り積もった雪を波と散らす。"
msgstr "  Under the impact of the Ether, the surrounding snow melted and flew around."

#. Occurrence C_1:5240:16990: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5240
msgctxt "text_id=16990 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――橙子を飲みこむ、圧倒的なまでの土砂。"
msgstr "  Touko was engulfed in dirt."

#. Occurrence C_1:5294:16991: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5294
msgctxt "text_id=16991 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　できうるかぎりの魔力を用いた青子の魔弾は、逃れようのない死の一撃となった。"
msgstr "  No way she could survive Aoko's magic bullet; it contained every bit of Aoko's magical energy she could muster."

#. Occurrence C_1:5299:16992: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5299
msgctxt "text_id=16992 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その衝突を目の当たりにして、青子は自分の勝利を受け入れた。"
msgstr "  Viewing the chaos, Aoko confirmed her victory."

#. Occurrence C_1:5304:16993: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5304
msgctxt "text_id=16993 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……どこか、苦い感情と共に。"
msgstr "  ...And yet, somehow she felt bitter."

#. Occurrence C_1:5345:16994: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5345
msgctxt "text_id=16994 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――そして。"
msgstr "  But then..."

#. Occurrence C_1:5362:16995: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5362
msgctxt "text_id=16995 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自らを飲みこんだ魔力の<奔|な><流|み>を後にして、橙子は青子の甘さに舌打ちした。"
msgstr "  Choosing to deal with the torrent of magical energy she swallowed up later, Touko tutted at Aoko's childishness."

#. Occurrence C_1:5367:16996: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5367
msgctxt "text_id=16996 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子とは真逆の、失望に満ちた苦さと共に。"
msgstr "  Her disappointment was so deep it bordered on despair."

#. Occurrence C_1:5427:16997: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0025; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:5427
msgctxt "text_id=16997 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「学ぶにしては遅すぎたが、まあ聞いておけ青子。"
msgstr "\"It's a little too late now, but listen up anyway, Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_1:5433:16998: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_1_0026; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_1
#: C_1:5433
msgctxt "text_id=16998 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　切札というものは、先に出した方の負けなんだよ」"
msgstr "  Never play your trump card first. You'll lose.\""

#. Occurrence C_1:5439:16999: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5439
msgctxt "text_id=16999 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　超然とした声には、何のダメージも見られない。"
msgstr "  Her voice cold and aloof, she was completely unscathed."

#. Occurrence C_1:5444:17000: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5444
msgctxt "text_id=17000 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雪原に立つ魔術師の<外套|コート>には<煤|すす>一つない。"
msgstr "  The mage stood in the snow field, not a single speck of dirt on her overcoat."

#. Occurrence C_1:5449:17001: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5449
msgctxt "text_id=17001 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――<渾身|こんしん>の魔弾は、橙子の体に触れる寸前で、同位の魔力によって周囲へと<弾|はじ>き飛ばされたのだ。"
msgstr "  Just before the bullet reached Touko, she deflected it with magical energy of the same level."

#. Occurrence C_1:5493:17002: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_1_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_1
#: C_1:5493
msgctxt "text_id=17002 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_1:5499:17003: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5499
msgctxt "text_id=17003 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その光景を、青子はただ見つめていた。"
msgstr "  Aoko could only stare at the scene before her."

#. Occurrence C_1:5504:17004: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5504
msgctxt "text_id=17004 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自身の魔術の消滅を、ではない。"
msgstr "  The negation of her magecraft hadn't shocked her, though."

#. Occurrence C_1:5509:17005: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5509
msgctxt "text_id=17005 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悪夢でも見るように、姉の背後に浮遊するモノを凝視する。"
msgstr "  Leaf-like objects floated behind her sister; Aoko stared like she was living a nightmare."

#. Occurrence C_1:5515:17006: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5515
msgctxt "text_id=17006 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の背後に現れた、<夥|おびただ>しいまでの魔術刻印を。"
msgstr "  Countless Magic Crests poured out from Touko's back."

#. Occurrence C_1:5551:17007: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5551
msgctxt "text_id=17007 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それは一瞬の出来事だった。"
msgstr "  ...It all happened in an instant."

#. Occurrence C_1:5556:17008: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5556
msgctxt "text_id=17008 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大波となって押し寄せる魔弾を前に、橙子は軽やかに右指を鳴らした。"
msgstr "  The magic bullet approaching like a tsunami. Touko lightly snapped her fingers,"

#. Occurrence C_1:5576:17009: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5576
msgctxt "text_id=17009 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　途端、背後からざあ、と音をたてて幾多もの文字が羅列されていったのだ。"
msgstr "  causing a stream of letters to rush out from behind her."

#. Occurrence C_1:5582:17010: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5582
msgctxt "text_id=17010 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<言葉|テキスト>は<美術|アート>となり、金色の花に成った。"
msgstr "  Text became art; golden flowers bloomed."

#. Occurrence C_1:5587:17011: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5587
msgctxt "text_id=17011 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おそらくは数百の。"
msgstr "  There must have been hundreds..."

#. Occurrence C_1:5592:17012: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5592
msgctxt "text_id=17012 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　西欧だけに留まらない、多種多様な魔術の<群像|カタチ>。"
msgstr "  All sorts of magecraft from even beyond Western Europe."

#. Occurrence C_1:5613:17013: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5613
msgctxt "text_id=17013 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本来、魔術師の肌に刻む筈の、"
msgstr "  The kind normally carved into the flesh of a mage;"

#. Occurrence C_1:5619:17014: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5619
msgctxt "text_id=17014 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本来、蒼崎橙子には無い筈の、"
msgstr "  the kind Touko Aozaki shouldn't possess;"

#. Occurrence C_1:5624:17015: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5624
msgctxt "text_id=17015 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本来、その門派の後継者しか知らない筈の、"
msgstr "  the kind only followers of those schools should know..."

#. Occurrence C_1:5633:17016: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5633
msgctxt "text_id=17016 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　月光より鮮やかに咲く魔術刻印。"
msgstr "  Blossoming Magic Crests, brighter than the moon."

#. Occurrence C_1:5665:17017: scene=C_1
#: C_1:5665
msgctxt "text_id=17017 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは橙子を守る<守護の獣|トーテムポール>となって、彼女の背後の空間に刻まれていた。"
msgstr "  Inscribed in the air, they formed a totem pole, a guardian beast, to protect Touko."

#. Occurrence C_10:63:17018: scene=C_10
#: C_10:63
msgctxt "text_id=17018 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――詰まるところ。"
msgstr "  To put it simply..."

#. Occurrence C_10:68:17019: scene=C_10
#: C_10:68
msgctxt "text_id=17019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術とは人智であり世界であり、"
msgstr "  Magecraft is human wisdom; it is the world as we know it."

#. Occurrence C_10:73:17020: scene=C_10
#: C_10:73
msgctxt "text_id=17020 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法とはそれらに含まれない、<埒|らち><天外|てんがい>の孤独である。"
msgstr "  Magic is the singularity that exists beyond either of those."

#. Occurrence C_10:96:17021: scene=C_10
#: C_10:96
msgctxt "text_id=17021 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……はじめの一つは全てを変えた。"
msgstr "  ...At the beginning, the First changed all."

#. Occurrence C_10:102:17022: scene=C_10
#: C_10:102
msgctxt "text_id=17022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……つぎの二つは多くを認めた。"
msgstr "  ...Next, the Second recognized many."

#. Occurrence C_10:108:17023: scene=C_10
#: C_10:108
msgctxt "text_id=17023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……受けて三つは未来を示した。"
msgstr "  ...In answer, the Third showed the future."

#. Occurrence C_10:114:17024: scene=C_10
#: C_10:114
msgctxt "text_id=17024 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……繋ぐ四つは姿を隠した。"
msgstr "  ...Tethered, The Fourth concealed itself."

#. Occurrence C_10:121:17025: scene=C_10
#: C_10:121
msgctxt "text_id=17025 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして終わりの五つ目は、とっくに<意義|せき>を失っていた。"
msgstr "  And the final Fifth had long since lost its significance."

#. Occurrence C_10:142:17026: scene=C_10
#: C_10:142
msgctxt "text_id=17026 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三つ目で終わっていれば良かったのに、と誰かが言った。"
msgstr "  Someone once said, \"Had it only ended at the Third...\""

#. Occurrence C_10:179:17027: scene=C_10
#: C_10:179
msgctxt "text_id=17027 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術とは歴史の研鑽。"
msgstr "  Magecraft is the study of history;"

#. Occurrence C_10:184:17028: scene=C_10
#: C_10:184
msgctxt "text_id=17028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人の手による<業|わざ>と、星の元に<巡|めぐ>る命だ。"
msgstr "  feats of our making, and life orbiting the planet."

#. Occurrence C_10:189:17029: scene=C_10
#: C_10:189
msgctxt "text_id=17029 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど魔法は<天|てん>の<外|そと>の神の摂理。"
msgstr "  But True Magic is the providence of a god beyond the heavens."

#. Occurrence C_10:194:17030: scene=C_10
#: C_10:194
msgctxt "text_id=17030 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人にも星にも含まれない<業|わざ>を、一体地上の誰が、どうして、奇跡と<讃|たた>え<尊|とうと>ぶものか。"
msgstr "  Why do those who stand on the earth extol the virtues of miracles beyond humankind and the planet?"

#. Occurrence C_10:218:17031: scene=C_10
#: C_10:218
msgctxt "text_id=17031 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　明白な罪科。"
msgstr "  This was an undeniable sin."

#. Occurrence C_10:223:17032: scene=C_10
#: C_10:223
msgctxt "text_id=17032 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法とは、人類の敵そのもの。"
msgstr "  Magic was the enemy of humanity."

#. Occurrence C_10:228:17033: scene=C_10
#: C_10:228
msgctxt "text_id=17033 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　故に―――"
msgstr "  That is why..."

#. Occurrence C_10:238:17034: scene=C_10
#: C_10:238
msgctxt "text_id=17034 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<新|あら>たに魔法を<宿|やど>したものは、その赤い影に殺される。"
msgstr "  Those who obtain a new Magic are killed by the red shadow."

#. Occurrence C_10:331:17035: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_10_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_10
#: C_10:331
msgctxt "text_id=17035 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――<聴|き>け、万物の霊長」"
msgstr "\"Hear me, prime species of all Creation.\""

#. Occurrence C_10:443:17036: scene=C_10
#: C_10:443
msgctxt "text_id=17036 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　声は高らかに、冬の空に響き渡る。"
msgstr "  Aoko's voice resonated through and high above the winter skies."

#. Occurrence C_10:448:17037: scene=C_10
#: C_10:448
msgctxt "text_id=17037 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　空間そのものに走る断裂。"
msgstr "  The air began to fracture,"

#. Occurrence C_10:453:17038: scene=C_10
#: C_10:453
msgctxt "text_id=17038 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　周囲の<風景|カタチ>が軋んでいく様は、<伽藍|がらん>の崩壊を思わせる。"
msgstr "  turning the scenery to broken glass."

#. Occurrence C_10:562:17039: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_10_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_10
#: C_10:562
msgctxt "text_id=17039 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_10:568:17040: scene=C_10
#: C_10:568
msgctxt "text_id=17040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　撤退すべきか、それとも戦うべきか。"
msgstr "  Touko wondered whether she should fight or flee."

#. Occurrence C_10:573:17041: scene=C_10
#: C_10:573
msgctxt "text_id=17041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は<逸|はや>る気持ちを抑えながら、無様にも事の<顛末|てんまつ>を見届けてしまう。"
msgstr "  She decided to try and keep her feelings in check and see this through."

#. Occurrence C_10:578:17042: scene=C_10
#: C_10:578
msgctxt "text_id=17042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　長年の苦悩―――これまで追い続けてきたモノを前にして、合理的な判断などできよう筈がない。"
msgstr "  But the object of her obsession for so many years was right in front of her. Rationality was slipping from her grasp."

#. Occurrence C_10:604:17043: scene=C_10
#: C_10:604
msgctxt "text_id=17043 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　互いの命運は、今や不確定にたゆたっている。"
msgstr "  Both of their fates were now uncertain."

#. Occurrence C_10:609:17044: scene=C_10
#: C_10:609
msgctxt "text_id=17044 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背後の魔術刻印と地形の有利性から、橙子の戦力は青子の十倍強。負ける道理はない。"
msgstr "  Touko had an overwhelming advantage when it came to her crests and the terrain."

#. Occurrence C_10:629:17045: scene=C_10
#: C_10:629
msgctxt "text_id=17045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが魔法は別だ。"
msgstr "  When it came to True Magic, however..."

#. Occurrence C_10:634:17046: scene=C_10
#: C_10:634
msgctxt "text_id=17046 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　仮に、蒼崎の魔法が久遠寺有珠の“童話の怪物”と同系統のモノなら、術者の力量差は関係ない。"
msgstr "  If the Aozaki Magic was anything like Alice Kuonji's fairy-tale monsters, then mage strength was not a part of the equation."

#. Occurrence C_10:639:17047: scene=C_10
#: C_10:639
msgctxt "text_id=17047 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その時は“魔法”と“蒼崎橙子”の戦いになる。"
msgstr "  At this point, it was Touko against Magic itself."

#. Occurrence C_10:644:17048: scene=C_10
#: C_10:644
msgctxt "text_id=17048 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……勝ち目はない。"
msgstr "  And there was no winning against Truth."

#. Occurrence C_10:649:17049: scene=C_10
#: C_10:649
msgctxt "text_id=17049 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法の特異性、超越性は、魔術の技量差など吹き飛ばしてしまうだろう。"
msgstr "  The transcendence and idiosyncrasy of True Magic rendered things like magecraft irrelevant."

#. Occurrence C_10:705:17050: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_10_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_10
#: C_10:705
msgctxt "text_id=17050 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「―――だが」"
msgstr "\"...But can you...?\""

#. Occurrence C_10:774:17051: scene=C_10
#: C_10:774
msgctxt "text_id=17051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本当に使えるのか、と橙子は妹を凝視する。"
msgstr "  Touko stared at her sister, wondering if she could actually use it."

#. Occurrence C_10:779:17052: scene=C_10
#: C_10:779
msgctxt "text_id=17052 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の宣言には力がなかった。"
msgstr "  Her proclamation lacked conviction."

#. Occurrence C_10:784:17053: scene=C_10
#: C_10:784
msgctxt "text_id=17053 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　高らかに声をあげながら、あるのは自制心だけで、何者をも代償にする<傲慢|つよさ>が存在しなかった。"
msgstr "  She had raised her voice, but that was out of discipline; it had not been the arrogant conviction to sacrifice someone else for her own gain."

#. Occurrence C_10:804:17054: scene=C_10
#: C_10:804
msgctxt "text_id=17054 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法を身に宿すとはどのような事なのか、選ばれなかった橙子には分からない。"
msgstr "  Having not been chosen to inherit it, Touko could not imagine what the Magic in her sister was..."

#. Occurrence C_10:809:17055: scene=C_10
#: C_10:809
msgctxt "text_id=17055 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが世界を変えるという暴挙。"
msgstr "  ...only that it was a force violent enough to change the world."

#. Occurrence C_10:814:17056: scene=C_10
#: C_10:814
msgctxt "text_id=17056 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　星を敵に回す<不遜|ふそん>に、人の精神が耐えられる筈がない。"
msgstr "  No human mind could withstand the audacity required to make an enemy of the world itself."

#. Occurrence C_10:885:17057: scene=C_10
#: C_10:885
msgctxt "text_id=17057 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　迷いがあるのなら尚のこと、あの少女には魔法の力は重すぎる―――！"
msgstr "  Especially not someone as indecisive as her sister. The power of Magic would surely cripple her!"

#. Occurrence C_10:979:17058: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_10_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_10
#: C_10:979
msgctxt "text_id=17058 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――そりゃあ、ね」"
msgstr "\"...Well...\""

#. Occurrence C_10:985:17059: scene=C_10
#: C_10:985
msgctxt "text_id=17059 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の視線を受けて、青子はひとり自嘲した。"
msgstr "  Feeling Touko's eyes on her, Aoko doubted herself."

#. Occurrence C_10:990:17060: scene=C_10
#: C_10:990
msgctxt "text_id=17060 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　迷いは晴れない。"
msgstr "  She could not help but hesitate."

#. Occurrence C_10:995:17061: scene=C_10
#: C_10:995
msgctxt "text_id=17061 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　胸の恐れが消える事なんてきっとない。"
msgstr "  Terror gripped her heart tighter."

#. Occurrence C_10:1028:17062: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_10_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_10
#: C_10:1028
msgctxt "text_id=17062 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――でも、だからって」"
msgstr "\"I have to.\""

#. Occurrence C_10:1034:17063: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1034
msgctxt "text_id=17063 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつまでも逃げる訳にはいかない。"
msgstr "  She could not run away forever."

#. Occurrence C_10:1039:17064: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1039
msgctxt "text_id=17064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　迷いも恐れも消えないからこそ、そんなもので立ち止まる自分が許せないと。"
msgstr "  Her hesitation and terror meant she would never forgive herself for stopping now."

#. Occurrence C_10:1044:17065: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1044
msgctxt "text_id=17065 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　瞳を閉じて、彼女は最後の工程に身を投げた。"
msgstr "  Closing her eyes, she pushed herself into the final stage."

#. Occurrence C_10:1136:17066: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1136
msgctxt "text_id=17066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　光を閉ざすように、時を止める。"
msgstr "  Time stopped, like a light being switched off."

#. Occurrence C_10:1142:17067: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1142
msgctxt "text_id=17067 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして、彼女は自己の闇へと埋没した。"
msgstr "  She submerged herself in her own darkness."

#. Occurrence C_10:1148:17068: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1148
msgctxt "text_id=17068 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何もかもが止まったまま過ぎていく。"
msgstr "  Everything froze; only she moved."

#. Occurrence C_10:1154:17069: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1154
msgctxt "text_id=17069 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女以外のすべてが途絶えた、果てのない星の運河に。"
msgstr "  Everything around her disappeared, as she passed a limitless stream of stars."

#. Occurrence C_10:1183:17070: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1183
msgctxt "text_id=17070 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　途端。"
msgstr "  And as soon as she did..."

#. Occurrence C_10:1188:17071: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1188
msgctxt "text_id=17071 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何の答えもなく<彼|コ><方|コ>に訪れた浅はかさに、消えたくなる。"
msgstr "  She wanted to disappear into the empty, thoughtlessness place she arrived in without any answers."

#. Occurrence C_10:1220:17072: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1220
msgctxt "text_id=17072 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　―――ああ、また。"
msgstr "                              ...Not again."

#. Occurrence C_10:1227:17073: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1227
msgctxt "text_id=17073 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今度こそ、あの赤い影がやってくる。"
msgstr "  The red shadow will surely come this time."

#. Occurrence C_10:1294:17074: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1294
msgctxt "text_id=17074 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不意に、"
msgstr "  Suddenly,"

#. Occurrence C_10:1299:17075: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1299
msgctxt "text_id=17075 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　新しい記憶を見た。"
msgstr "          I saw a new memory."

#. Occurrence C_10:1305:17076: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1305
msgctxt "text_id=17076 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他者を媒介にして　　を交換しようとした結果だろう。"
msgstr "  Possibly because I used another to make the trade for _____."

#. Occurrence C_10:1310:17077: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1310
msgctxt "text_id=17077 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ワタシは、聞いた事もないクセに、慣れ親しんだその音を聴く。"
msgstr "  I heard a familiar yet new sound..."

#. Occurrence C_10:1388:17078: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1388
msgctxt "text_id=17078 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　"
msgstr "                                    "

msgctxt "text_id=17079 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "何も望まないように。"
msgstr "I wish for nothing."

msgctxt "text_id=17080 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　何も求めないように。"
msgstr "                                      I seek nothing."

#. Occurrence C_10:1481:17081: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1481
msgctxt "text_id=17081 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今はゼロに向けて逆行する意識を、"
msgstr "  Only to fuse with the consciousness"

#. Occurrence C_10:1486:17082: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1486
msgctxt "text_id=17082 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　一つに統合しなくてはならない。"
msgstr "                          that hurtles backward in time to zero."

#. Occurrence C_10:1491:17083: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1491
msgctxt "text_id=17083 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんな音。"
msgstr "  This sound..."

#. Occurrence C_10:1496:17084: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1496
msgctxt "text_id=17084 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんな、悔しくて涙がでそうな戯言に、"
msgstr "  The bitter, sad meaninglessness pulls me by my hair,"

#. Occurrence C_10:1501:17085: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1501
msgctxt "text_id=17085 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　後ろ髪を引かれている場合じゃない。"
msgstr "                      but I have to resist."

#. Occurrence C_10:1507:17086: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1507
msgctxt "text_id=17086 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそもワタシの最大の問題は、あの赤い幽霊で―――"
msgstr "  The red ghost was always going to be my biggest hurdle."

#. Occurrence C_10:1583:17087: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1583
msgctxt "text_id=17087 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　"
msgstr "                                "

msgctxt "text_id=17088 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "生の価値も覚えてはいけません。"
msgstr "I must forget the value of life."

msgctxt "text_id=17089 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　死の<尊|とうと>さも、考えてはいけません。"
msgstr "                            I must forget the dignity of death."

#. Occurrence C_10:1676:17090: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1676
msgctxt "text_id=17090 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　音は続いていく。"
msgstr "  The sound persists."

#. Occurrence C_10:1681:17091: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1681
msgctxt "text_id=17091 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはこの旅路に組みこまれている物ではなく、"
msgstr "  It's got nothing to do with this journey."

#. Occurrence C_10:1686:17092: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1686
msgctxt "text_id=17092 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　　外部からの妨害に他ならない。"
msgstr "                            It's just an external distraction."

#. Occurrence C_10:1692:17093: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1692
msgctxt "text_id=17093 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なのに、ここまで自分の心を乱す音の正体を、"
msgstr "  And yet, I think I finally understand."

#. Occurrence C_10:1697:17094: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1697
msgctxt "text_id=17094 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　ワタシはようやく悟った。"
msgstr "                                I know what noise has been making me so uneasy."

#. Occurrence C_10:1732:17095: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1732
msgctxt "text_id=17095 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“……なに、それ”"
msgstr "\"What... the...\""

#. Occurrence C_10:1738:17096: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1738
msgctxt "text_id=17096 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不快げな呟きは、音の主に向けられたものだった。"
msgstr "  The unsettling whispers were directed at me."

#. Occurrence C_10:1744:17097: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1744
msgctxt "text_id=17097 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もしくは、その声をおとなしく聞いている誰かに対して。"
msgstr "  Or perhaps, the red shadow was perplexed"

#. Occurrence C_10:1780:17098: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1780
msgctxt "text_id=17098 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　赤い影は戸惑っている。"
msgstr "  by the quiet soul listening to it."

#. Occurrence C_10:1785:17099: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1785
msgctxt "text_id=17099 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　答えも覚悟も持ってこなかったワタシを、憎悪に満ちた目で睨んでいる。"
msgstr "  It glares at me, its eyes full of hatred. How could I be so unprepared?"

#. Occurrence C_10:1823:17100: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1823
msgctxt "text_id=17100 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　オマエは、まさか。"
msgstr "  Don't tell me."

#. Occurrence C_10:1828:17101: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1828
msgctxt "text_id=17101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まさか、<そ|・><ん|・><な|・><理|・><由|・><で|・>。"
msgstr "  You can't be serious."

#. Occurrence C_10:1864:17102: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1864
msgctxt "text_id=17102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな思いつきで、ワタシの獲物になるつもりか―――！"
msgstr "  You're going to turn me into your prey for *that*?!"

#. Occurrence C_10:1921:17103: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1921
msgctxt "text_id=17103 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　"
msgstr "                                "

msgctxt "text_id=17104 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "それが貴方の全てです。"
msgstr "That is your everything."

msgctxt "text_id=17105 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　それ以外、貴方には何も無いのです。"
msgstr "                                You have nothing else."

#. Occurrence C_10:1992:17106: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1992
msgctxt "text_id=17106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　巻き戻しの影響―――否を許さない断定。"
msgstr "  The effect of rewinding... The decision to never say never..."

#. Occurrence C_10:1997:17107: scene=C_10
#: C_10:1997
msgctxt "text_id=17107 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の一番だった頃―――あまりにも意味のない人生。"
msgstr "  His prime... His meaningless life..."

#. Occurrence C_10:2003:17108: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2003
msgctxt "text_id=17108 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを彼女は打ち消した。"
msgstr "  She negated it."

#. Occurrence C_10:2008:17109: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2008
msgctxt "text_id=17109 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼にとって絶対の<原則|もの>であるその音を、さらに上回る力強さで。"
msgstr "  She used her superior power to negate that sound which was an absolute rule to him."

#. Occurrence C_10:2014:17110: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2014
msgctxt "text_id=17110 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　邪魔だ、と目の前の蜘蛛の巣を払い除けるように。"
msgstr "  Just brushed it aside, like it was a cobweb."

#. Occurrence C_10:2057:17111: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2057
msgctxt "text_id=17111 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　音は千切れ、また違う音が耳に響く。"
msgstr "  The sound disappeared; a new one replaced it."

#. Occurrence C_10:2064:17112: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2064
msgctxt "text_id=17112 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　／何も望まない。"
msgstr "                  /I wish for nothing."

msgctxt "text_id=17113 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "何も欲しくない。"
msgstr " I want nothing."

#. Occurrence C_10:2072:17114: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2072
msgctxt "text_id=17114 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　断定に従う、無垢な心。"
msgstr "  A pure, obedient heart."

#. Occurrence C_10:2079:17115: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2079
msgctxt "text_id=17115 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　／だから、"
msgstr "                /That's why..."

msgctxt "text_id=17116 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "何を与えられる事はない。"
msgstr " you get nothing."

#. Occurrence C_10:2087:17117: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2087
msgctxt "text_id=17117 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　肯定が導く、不実の命。"
msgstr "  A life of falsehood, led by affirmation."

#. Occurrence C_10:2130:17118: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2130
msgctxt "text_id=17118 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“……あんまりにも、バカげてる”"
msgstr "\"...This is ridiculous.\""

#. Occurrence C_10:2136:17119: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2136
msgctxt "text_id=17119 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<未|ま><来|え>を目指す足が止まる。"
msgstr "  My legs move toward the future. But they stop."

#. Occurrence C_10:2142:17120: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2142
msgctxt "text_id=17120 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ワタシは思いつきで<航|み><路|ち>を変える。"
msgstr "  Change of plans: I'm taking a different path."

#. Occurrence C_10:2148:17121: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2148
msgctxt "text_id=17121 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大事なものが変わったというより、ひどく頭にくるコトができてしまって、なんて言うか―――"
msgstr "  Nothing's changed. It's just something has made me real mad. How can I put it...?"

#. Occurrence C_10:2337:17122: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2337
msgctxt "text_id=17122 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“こんな物が過去だって言うの、アンタは……！”"
msgstr "\"You call this the past, you idiot?!\""

#. Occurrence C_10:2343:17123: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2343
msgctxt "text_id=17123 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰かに、文句の一つでも言わないと気が済まない……！！"
msgstr "  If I don't complain about something to someone, I'll explode!"

#. Occurrence C_10:2363:17124: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2363
msgctxt "text_id=17124 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　声の主か、それを聞き届ける彼か、"
msgstr "  Even if it's just to the voice, or to he who hears it,"

#. Occurrence C_10:2368:17125: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2368
msgctxt "text_id=17125 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを黙って見ているだけの自分か、"
msgstr "  or to the part of me who just stays quiet and watches,"

#. Occurrence C_10:2373:17126: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2373
msgctxt "text_id=17126 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それとも、彼をそうしてしまった何者へか。"
msgstr "  or to the one who did that to him."

#. Occurrence C_10:2379:17127: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2379
msgctxt "text_id=17127 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　答えは出ないまま、ワタシは閉じた<目蓋|まぶた>を開いて―――"
msgstr "  With no answer, I open my eyes."

#. Occurrence C_10:2444:17128: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_10_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_10
#: C_10:2444
msgctxt "text_id=17128 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――告げる」"
msgstr "\"I declare.\""

#. Occurrence C_10:2450:17129: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2450
msgctxt "text_id=17129 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　引き上げてきたものを解放する。"
msgstr "  Aoko released everything she had dragged up."

#. Occurrence C_10:2455:17130: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2455
msgctxt "text_id=17130 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何を見てきたのか、何があったのかなど、青子の記憶には残っていない。"
msgstr "  As for what was there, or what she saw, she could not remember."

#. Occurrence C_10:2460:17131: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2460
msgctxt "text_id=17131 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あるのは心臓を<昂|たか>ぶらせる激情だけ。"
msgstr "  All she held on to was the fury that burned in her heart."

#. Occurrence C_10:2465:17132: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2465
msgctxt "text_id=17132 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分でも正体の分からないものに押されて、彼女は魔法のフタを開く。"
msgstr "  Pushed on by something-she did not know what-she opened the door to Magic."

#. Occurrence C_10:2548:17133: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2548
msgctxt "text_id=17133 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　変化は劇的だった。"
msgstr "  The change was extraordinary."

#. Occurrence C_10:2553:17134: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2553
msgctxt "text_id=17134 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女の足下の雪が消え、緑の地面が<覗|のぞ>いていく。"
msgstr "  Beneath her, the snow vanished, replaced by a small patch of lush, green grass."

#. Occurrence C_10:2558:17135: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2558
msgctxt "text_id=17135 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは雪解けによるものではなく、まったく別の風景に書き換わったものであり、"
msgstr "  This ground had never existed under the frozen blanket; it had been rewritten into a new landscape."

#. Occurrence C_10:2568:17136: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2568
msgctxt "text_id=17136 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを批難するように、あらゆる要素が、彼女の行為を消しにかかる。"
msgstr "  The very elements rejected her, as if the world itself was fighting back."

#. Occurrence C_10:2631:17137: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_10_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_10
#: C_10:2631
msgctxt "text_id=17137 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「っ、―――」"
msgstr "\"Ngh...\""

#. Occurrence C_10:2637:17138: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2637
msgctxt "text_id=17138 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　放電は彼女自身をも許さない。"
msgstr "  The electrical discharge lashed at her body."

#. Occurrence C_10:2642:17139: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2642
msgctxt "text_id=17139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その奇跡は世界を壊すと。"
msgstr "  This miracle threatened to destroy the world;"

#. Occurrence C_10:2647:17140: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2647
msgctxt "text_id=17140 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自らの保身の為、世界自身が彼女の抹殺に動き出す。"
msgstr "  the world had to protect itself. It moved to expunge her."

#. Occurrence C_10:2813:17141: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_10_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_10
#: C_10:2813
msgctxt "text_id=17141 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「っ、―――！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence C_10:2819:17142: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2819
msgctxt "text_id=17142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　全身の細胞を焼く痛みに、意識が現世から消失する。"
msgstr "  Pain scorched her every cell, trying to tear away her consciousness."

#. Occurrence C_10:2887:17143: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2887
msgctxt "text_id=17143 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが怯まない。"
msgstr "  But she did not falter."

#. Occurrence C_10:2892:17144: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2892
msgctxt "text_id=17144 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この痛みもこの孤立も、全ては生身のまま根源に至る為。"
msgstr "  All this pain and this loneliness was to take her to the Root."

#. Occurrence C_10:2897:17145: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2897
msgctxt "text_id=17145 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法を継いだ時から、この程度の責め苦、彼女は何度も超えてきた。"
msgstr "  Ever since inheriting True Magic, she had suffered this torture time and time again."

#. Occurrence C_10:2974:17146: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_10_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_10
#: C_10:2974
msgctxt "text_id=17146 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_10:2980:17147: scene=C_10
#: C_10:2980
msgctxt "text_id=17147 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　声なき声をあげて、<宇|ソ><宙|ラ>の在り方と拮抗する。"
msgstr "  She contended against the voiceless protest of the cosmos."

#. Occurrence C_10:3054:17148: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3054
msgctxt "text_id=17148 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　負荷は彼女の<網膜|もうまく>も神経も焼き捨てる。"
msgstr "  The burden engulfed her retinas and nerves in flames."

#. Occurrence C_10:3059:17149: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3059
msgctxt "text_id=17149 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その果てに、"
msgstr "  And then..."

#. Occurrence C_10:3110:17150: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3110
msgctxt "text_id=17150 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　光を見た。"
msgstr "  ...light."

#. Occurrence C_10:3124:17151: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3124
msgctxt "text_id=17151 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何の為に戻ってきたのか。"
msgstr "  She finally understood."

#. Occurrence C_10:3129:17152: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3129
msgctxt "text_id=17152 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何を叫びたいのか、彼女はようやく思い出し―――"
msgstr "  She remembers why she came back, and what she wanted to scream―"

#. Occurrence C_10:3181:17153: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_10_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_10
#: C_10:3181
msgctxt "text_id=17153 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「<秩序|あお>を示す我が<銘|な>において告げる」"
msgstr "\"By the name Blue, I speak for order. Hear me.\""

#. Occurrence C_10:3193:17154: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3193
msgctxt "text_id=17154 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　止めろ、と<正|ただ>す声がする。"
msgstr "  A censuring voice told her to stop."

#. Occurrence C_10:3198:17155: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3198
msgctxt "text_id=17155 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　忘我の果てに魔法の正体に手が届く。"
msgstr "  At the edges of oblivion, her hand touched the true form of Magic."

#. Occurrence C_10:3203:17156: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3203
msgctxt "text_id=17156 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでは意味がない、と牙を伸ばす赤色の影がいる。"
msgstr "  The snarling red shadow was there, telling her it was no use."

#. Occurrence C_10:3208:17157: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3208
msgctxt "text_id=17157 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　多くの迷い、多くの怒り。"
msgstr "  So much doubt, so much fear."

#. Occurrence C_10:3214:17158: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3214
msgctxt "text_id=17158 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれどそんなもの、彼女には／ワタシには関係ない。"
msgstr "  But such things mean nothing to her... to me."

#. Occurrence C_10:3235:17159: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3235
msgctxt "text_id=17159 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法使いの責務とか、これで人類滅亡とか勝手にしろ。"
msgstr "  I don't care about a Magician's obligations or the destruction of mankind."

#. Occurrence C_10:3240:17160: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3240
msgctxt "text_id=17160 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いいかげんもう聞き飽きた。"
msgstr "  I'm sick and tired of hearing about it."

#. Occurrence C_10:3245:17161: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3245
msgctxt "text_id=17161 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いま、私が指を動かす理由はたった一つ。"
msgstr "  I only have one reason for doing *anything* right now."

#. Occurrence C_10:3251:17162: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3251
msgctxt "text_id=17162 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "つまり、なんていうか、口にするのもどうかと思うけど―――"
msgstr "I just... God, I can't believe I'm saying this out loud..."

#. Occurrence C_10:3261:17163: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3261
msgctxt "text_id=17163 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　私はこんなにも、コイツを助けたがってる……！！！！"
msgstr "  I just want to save him!!!"

#. Occurrence C_10:3392:17164: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_10_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_10
#: C_10:3392
#. Occurrence C_10:4183:17164: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_10_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_10
#: C_10:4183
msgctxt "text_id=17164 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――<全て|not,>は<正し|SANE>く」"
msgstr "\"All is not sane, yet all shall be right.\""

#. Occurrence C_10:3398:17165: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3398
#. Occurrence C_10:4189:17165: scene=C_10
#: C_10:4189
msgctxt "text_id=17165 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　沸き上がる青い旋風。"
msgstr "  A blue whirlwind whisked up around her."

#. Occurrence C_10:3403:17166: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3403
#. Occurrence C_10:4194:17166: scene=C_10
#: C_10:4194
msgctxt "text_id=17166 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　迷いも<憂|うれ>いも捨てさった瞳で、魔法使いは世界を相手にペテンを始める。"
msgstr "  Casting aside her doubt and sorrow, the Magician played her trick upon the world."

#. Occurrence C_10:3509:17167: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3509
#. Occurrence C_10:4291:17167: scene=C_10
#: C_10:4291
msgctxt "text_id=17167 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　逆行する時間。"
msgstr "  Time flowed backward."

#. Occurrence C_10:3750:17168: scene=C_10
#: C_10:3750
#. Occurrence C_10:4512:17168: scene=C_10
#: C_10:4512
msgctxt "text_id=17168 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　書き換えられる原風景。"
msgstr "  Childhood memories were overwritten."

#. Occurrence C_10:4049:17169: scene=C_10
#: C_10:4049
#. Occurrence C_10:4760:17169: scene=C_10
#: C_10:4760
msgctxt "text_id=17169 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見れば、それは白い花だった。"
msgstr "  White flowers appeared, as far as the eye could see."

#. Occurrence C_10:4054:17170: scene=C_10
#: C_10:4054
#. Occurrence C_10:4765:17170: scene=C_10
#: C_10:4765
msgctxt "text_id=17170 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雪よりも真白い野花の<群|むれ>は、さざ波のように世界を侵食していき、そして―――"
msgstr "  Brighter than snow, they rippled like a wave across the world, devouring it."

#. Occurrence C_10:4866:17171: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_10_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_10
#: C_10:4866
msgctxt "text_id=17171 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――秩<序|five>は、こ<こに崩れ落ち|　timeless words>た」"
msgstr "\"Five timeless words: Order has fallen to ruin.\""

#. Occurrence C_10:4872:17172: scene=C_10
#: C_10:4872
msgctxt "text_id=17172 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　宣言通り。"
msgstr "  What was declared had come to be."

#. Occurrence C_10:4877:17173: scene=C_10
#: C_10:4877
msgctxt "text_id=17173 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　五番目の魔法が、この時間、この領域にだけ、その姿を現した。"
msgstr "  In this time and place alone, the Fifth Magic made itself known."

#. Occurrence C_11:157:17174: scene=C_11
#: C_11:157
msgctxt "text_id=17174 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人里離れた雪の広場は、<瞬|またた>きの間に変貌した。"
msgstr "  In the blink of an eye, the snowy clearing had transformed."

#. Occurrence C_11:162:17175: scene=C_11
#: C_11:162
msgctxt "text_id=17175 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一面に咲き誇る白花の海。"
msgstr "  A sea of fully-bloomed white flowers blanketed the grounds."

#. Occurrence C_11:167:17176: scene=C_11
#: C_11:167
msgctxt "text_id=17176 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　周囲にある裸の木々と朽ちた旧校舎だけが、ここが元の世界である事を告げている。"
msgstr "  Only the dilapidated school building and the bare winter trees signified this was the original world."

#. Occurrence C_11:172:17177: scene=C_11
#: C_11:172
msgctxt "text_id=17177 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冷たい風もこの野原では暖かだ。"
msgstr "  The once-cold wind now blew with a pleasant warmth across the landscape."

#. Occurrence C_11:177:17178: scene=C_11
#: C_11:177
msgctxt "text_id=17178 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見上げる夜空すら、満天の星の夜に戻っている。"
msgstr "  Even the night sky was once again teeming with stars."

#. Occurrence C_11:212:17179: scene=C_11
#: C_11:212
msgctxt "text_id=17179 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手を伸ばせば届きそうなほど近い星の明かり。"
msgstr "  If one reached out, one could almost touch them."

#. Occurrence C_11:217:17180: scene=C_11
#: C_11:217
msgctxt "text_id=17180 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　淋しさも心地よさも混ざり合った、虫の羽音と夜の<囁|ささや>きだけの孤影。"
msgstr "  It was a mix of comfort and solitude, quiet enough to carry the sound of insects flying through the air."

#. Occurrence C_11:222:17181: scene=C_11
#: C_11:222
msgctxt "text_id=17181 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人の営みを<排|はい>した、<穢|けが>れも<悼|いた>みもない風景。"
msgstr "  A scene far removed from the impurity and grief of humans."

#. Occurrence C_11:227:17182: scene=C_11
#: C_11:227
msgctxt "text_id=17182 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何もないけれど、同時に何も必要としない世界。"
msgstr "  A world with nothing, yet one that needed nothing."

#. Occurrence C_11:233:17183: scene=C_11
#: C_11:233
msgctxt "text_id=17183 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……そしてそれが、彼の一番だった頃。"
msgstr "  It was... his most precious memory."

#. Occurrence C_11:303:17184: scene=C_11
#: C_11:303
msgctxt "text_id=17184 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冬の荒地を、春の草原に変えてしまう。"
msgstr "  The winter tundra had changed into a spring meadow."

#. Occurrence C_11:308:17185: scene=C_11
#: C_11:308
msgctxt "text_id=17185 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが青子の言う『魔法』だという事に、橙子は呆然としていた。"
msgstr "  Aoko's so-called True Magic confused Touko."

#. Occurrence C_11:313:17186: scene=C_11
#: C_11:313
msgctxt "text_id=17186 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これはこれで悪くはないが、彼女の見たかった『魔法』は断じて、こんなロマンチックなだけのものではない。"
msgstr "  Sure it was pleasing to the eye, but she wanted to see something less idyllic."

#. Occurrence C_11:333:17187: scene=C_11
#: C_11:333
msgctxt "text_id=17187 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何か大がかりな術式を展開したようだが、周囲の<魔力|マナ>に変化もない。"
msgstr "  Aoko's spell was clearly no small feat, but the surrounding mana had not changed."

#. Occurrence C_11:338:17188: scene=C_11
#: C_11:338
msgctxt "text_id=17188 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　拍子抜けもいいところだ。久遠寺有珠のフラットスナークに比べれば<児|じ><戯|ぎ>に等しい。"
msgstr "  Better to be confused, though, than deal with something like Alice Kuonji's Flat Snark."

#. Occurrence C_11:380:17189: scene=C_11
#: C_11:380
msgctxt "text_id=17189 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　変わったのはこの花園と、あの―――"
msgstr "  The only changes seemed to be the flower field, and..."

#. Occurrence C_11:433:17190: scene=C_11
#: C_11:433
msgctxt "text_id=17190 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　出で立ちの変わった青子だけ。"
msgstr "  Aoko's appearance."

#. Occurrence C_11:438:17191: scene=C_11
#: C_11:438
msgctxt "text_id=17191 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自身の肉体に何らかの<強化|ブースト>をかけたと見るべきだが、今の青子では何をしようと橙子には及ばない。"
msgstr "  She seemed to have received some enhancement to her physical form, but it would never be enough to match Touko."

#. Occurrence C_11:444:17192: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_11_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_11
#: C_11:444
msgctxt "text_id=17192 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……たしかに、魔法といえば魔法だが」"
msgstr "\"...Okay, so I know this is Magic,\""

#. Occurrence C_11:449:17193: scene=C_11
#: C_11:449
msgctxt "text_id=17193 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呟きには微かな苛立ちがある。"
msgstr "  Touko said with a hint of annoyance,"

#. Occurrence C_11:470:17194: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_11_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_11
#: C_11:470
msgctxt "text_id=17194 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「あいにくと、お互い夢見る年頃ではないんだ。"
msgstr "\"but I'll be honest, this is a letdown."

#. Occurrence C_11:515:17195: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_11_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_11
#: C_11:515
msgctxt "text_id=17195 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　まさか、それで終わりではないだろう？」"
msgstr "  There has to be more, surely. This can't be it.\""

#. Occurrence C_11:537:17196: scene=C_11
#: C_11:537
msgctxt "text_id=17196 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は花の海を歩き始める。"
msgstr "  Aoko began walking through the sea of flowers."

#. Occurrence C_11:554:17197: scene=C_11
#: C_11:554
msgctxt "text_id=17197 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　向かう先は、遠方にいる橙子に他ならない。"
msgstr "  But she was not heading toward Touko."

#. Occurrence C_11:569:17198: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_11_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_11
#: C_11:569
msgctxt "text_id=17198 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いえ、これでおしまいよ。私も、貴女も」"
msgstr "\"This is it. For me, and for you.\""

#. Occurrence C_11:618:17199: scene=C_11
#: C_11:618
msgctxt "text_id=17199 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　短く返された言葉に、橙子は微妙な違和感をおぼえた。"
msgstr "  Aoko's words sent a wave of unease through Touko."

#. Occurrence C_11:629:17200: scene=C_11
#: C_11:629
msgctxt "text_id=17200 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の声は、青子とは違う気がする。"
msgstr "  Her sister's voice seemed different, somehow."

#. Occurrence C_11:634:17201: scene=C_11
#: C_11:634
msgctxt "text_id=17201 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　声質はほぼ同じだから、口調が違うのだろうか？"
msgstr "  It was mostly the same in pitch, so it had to be the tone."

#. Occurrence C_11:639:17202: scene=C_11
#: C_11:639
msgctxt "text_id=17202 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、それも同じだ。"
msgstr "  No, that was the same, too."

#. Occurrence C_11:644:17203: scene=C_11
#: C_11:644
msgctxt "text_id=17203 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どこか違うとしたら、それは………。"
msgstr "  Something was off. Could it be...?"

#. Occurrence C_11:704:17204: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_11_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_11
#: C_11:704
msgctxt "text_id=17204 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「――――――！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence C_11:710:17205: scene=C_11
#: C_11:710
msgctxt "text_id=17205 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこで、橙子はもう一つの変化に気が付いた。"
msgstr "  It was then Touko noticed something else that had changed-"

#. Occurrence C_11:715:17206: scene=C_11
#: C_11:715
msgctxt "text_id=17206 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　変わったのは広場と青子だけではない。"
msgstr "  not just Aoko and the clearing."

#. Occurrence C_11:720:17207: scene=C_11
#: C_11:720
msgctxt "text_id=17207 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の足下、二つになっていた死体が復元している。"
msgstr "  The severed body lying at Aoko's feet: it was now whole."

#. Occurrence C_11:803:17208: scene=C_11
#: C_11:803
msgctxt "text_id=17208 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　死者の蘇生？　傷の治療？"
msgstr "  Corpse reanimation? Wound healing?"

#. Occurrence C_11:808:17209: scene=C_11
#: C_11:808
msgctxt "text_id=17209 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな大がかりな術式を施した様子はないし、何より、体を復元したところで“死”は<覆|くつがえ>らない。"
msgstr "  It did not look like Aoko had used a significant formula; and besides, regenerating a body did not bring it back to life."

#. Occurrence C_11:813:17210: scene=C_11
#: C_11:813
msgctxt "text_id=17210 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　古来、死者の<完|・><全|・><な|・>蘇生は魔法ですら叶えていない。"
msgstr "  Since the dawn of time, even True Magic has never been able to bring back the dead."

#. Occurrence C_11:818:17211: scene=C_11
#: C_11:818
msgctxt "text_id=17211 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが―――青子の背後で倒れている青年が、意識がないまま呼吸をしているのはどう説明する―――！？"
msgstr "  But the body of the boy behind Aoko was moving! It was breathing, like it was taking a nap!"

#. Occurrence C_11:889:17212: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_11_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_11
#: C_11:889
msgctxt "text_id=17212 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“死者の蘇生が蒼崎の魔法……？"
msgstr "(Can the Aozaki Magic resurrect the dead...?"

#. Occurrence C_11:895:17213: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_11_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_11
#: C_11:895
msgctxt "text_id=17213 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　いや違う。あれは蘇生というより……”"
msgstr "  No way. This isn't resurrection, it's...)"

#. Occurrence C_11:970:17214: scene=C_11
#: C_11:970
msgctxt "text_id=17214 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その答えが出るより早く、橙子は違和感の正体に気が付いた。"
msgstr "  Before she could think of an answer, Touko realized what had seemed out of place to her before."

#. Occurrence C_11:975:17215: scene=C_11
#: C_11:975
msgctxt "text_id=17215 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先ほどの青子の仕草は年相応のものではなかった。"
msgstr "  Aoko's mannerisms appeared beyond her years."

#. Occurrence C_11:980:17216: scene=C_11
#: C_11:980
msgctxt "text_id=17216 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わずかな外見の変化より、留意すべきは中身の変化だ。"
msgstr "  Her appearance had changed ever-so slightly, but beyond there had been a change from within."

#. Occurrence C_11:985:17217: scene=C_11
#: C_11:985
msgctxt "text_id=17217 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まさかの結論に達した時、青子は橙子との距離を残り十メートルまで詰めていた。"
msgstr "  By the time Touko arrived at that seemingly impossible conclusion, Aoko had closed the distance between them."

#. Occurrence C_11:1008:17218: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_11_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_11
#: C_11:1008
msgctxt "text_id=17218 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――<回路|タービン>、<接続|セット>」"
msgstr "\"...<Circuit, connected.|Turbine, set.>\""

#. Occurrence C_11:1014:17219: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1014
msgctxt "text_id=17219 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その左手が、目の高さまで上げられる。"
msgstr "  Aoko raised her left hand to eye level."

#. Occurrence C_11:1109:17220: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1109
msgctxt "text_id=17220 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の体内で生成される魔力量が目に見えて……いや、耳に聞こえるほど違う。"
msgstr "  Touko could see-no, hear the magical energy generating inside Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_11:1114:17221: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1114
msgctxt "text_id=17221 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子ですら聞いた事のない快音。"
msgstr "  It was sound Touko had never heard before."

#. Occurrence C_11:1119:17222: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1119
msgctxt "text_id=17222 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子のソレは、<凡夫|ぼんぷ>の魔術師に見られる、単一機能しか持たない低級魔術回路だ。魔力の生成量は橙子を遥かに下回る。"
msgstr "  Aoko only possessed single function, low-grade circuits no better than any other third-rate mage, so she generated magical energy at a much lower rate than Touko."

#. Occurrence C_11:1139:17223: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1139
msgctxt "text_id=17223 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だがあの速度は異常にすぎる。"
msgstr "  However, this speed was absurdly quick."

#. Occurrence C_11:1144:17224: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1144
msgctxt "text_id=17224 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あきらかに血流の速度を上回っているし、なにより―――"
msgstr "  Moving even faster than the blood pumping through her body."

#. Occurrence C_11:1212:17225: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1212
msgctxt "text_id=17225 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術による<振動|おと>ならともかく、<た|・><だ|・><魔|・><術|・><回|・><路|・><が|・><起|・><動|・><す|・><る|・><だ|・><け|・><で|・><波|おと>をあげるなど、協会でも聞いた事がない―――！"
msgstr "  Magecraft could vibrate, but how in the hell were the activated Magic Circuits audible? Even the Association had never heard of such a thing!"

#. Occurrence C_11:1256:17226: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_11_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_11
#: C_11:1256
msgctxt "text_id=17226 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「我が目前に勝利ありき―――」"
msgstr "\"Onward, to victory.\""

#. Occurrence C_11:1358:17227: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1358
msgctxt "text_id=17227 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<悪寒|おかん>に<急|せ>かされるよう、橙子は中空にルーンを刻む。"
msgstr "  Spurred to action by the sudden dread she felt, Touko hurriedly carved runes into the air."

#. Occurrence C_11:1363:17228: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1363
msgctxt "text_id=17228 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子が仕掛けてくるであろう魔術を防ぐため<勝利|トゥール>の加護を張り、さらに刻印の力で強化し、障壁としたのだ。"
msgstr "  Touko summoned the divine protection of victory, Tyr, to surround herself with a barrier, which was further enhanced by her crests."

#. Occurrence C_11:1450:17229: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1450
msgctxt "text_id=17229 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　対して、青子は意にも介さず、照準を合わせる為に腕をあげる事もなく、"
msgstr "  Paying it no mind, Aoko held her arm steady, not moving it up to strike her target directly."

#. Occurrence C_11:1457:17230: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_11_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_11
#: C_11:1457
msgctxt "text_id=17230 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――魔弾、展開」"
msgstr "\"...Bullets, deploy.\""

#. Occurrence C_11:1463:17231: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1463
msgctxt "text_id=17231 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　短く、自分自身に命令した。"
msgstr "  Aoko commanded herself succinctly."

#. Occurrence C_11:1768:17232: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_11_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_11
#: C_11:1768
msgctxt "text_id=17232 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「！！！？」"
msgstr "\"???!!!\""

#. Occurrence C_11:1774:17233: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1774
msgctxt "text_id=17233 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術の起こりさえ見えない。"
msgstr "  This was beyond magecraft."

#. Occurrence C_11:1779:17234: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1779
msgctxt "text_id=17234 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一言で放たれた魔弾は実に二十発。"
msgstr "  In just a few words, she had fired twenty magic bullets."

#. Occurrence C_11:1784:17235: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1784
msgctxt "text_id=17235 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは流星のように、ロケット弾すら弾くルーンの壁を溶解し、蒼崎橙子の<礼装|コート>を撃ち抜いた。"
msgstr "  Like a meteor shower, the bullets smashed through the rocket-proof rune barrier, as well as Touko's spell-woven coat."

#. Occurrence C_11:1944:17236: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_11_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_11
#: C_11:1944
msgctxt "text_id=17236 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「っ、装填ではなく展開だと―――！？」"
msgstr "\"You shot them without loading?!\""

#. Occurrence C_11:1950:17237: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1950
msgctxt "text_id=17237 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<礼装|コート>にかけてある防護のルーンが悲鳴をあげる。"
msgstr "  The protective runes lining her coat screamed."

#. Occurrence C_11:1955:17238: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1955
msgctxt "text_id=17238 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの掃射をもう一度受ければ<保|も>たない。"
msgstr "  They would not be able to take another barrage like that."

#. Occurrence C_11:1960:17239: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1960
msgctxt "text_id=17239 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それ以前に、今の直撃で間違いなく<内臓|かいろ>に傷が入った。"
msgstr "  And she had already taken internal injuries."

#. Occurrence C_11:1980:17240: scene=C_11
#: C_11:1980
msgctxt "text_id=17240 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　認めたくはないが、直接的な火力において蒼崎青子は蒼崎橙子を上回っている。"
msgstr "  She loathed to admit it, but Aoko vastly outclassed Touko in terms of raw power."

#. Occurrence C_11:2035:17241: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2035
msgctxt "text_id=17241 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さらに認めがたいのは―――おそらく、あの女はまだ<本|・><気|・><に|・><す|・><ら|・><な|・><っ|・><て|・><い|・><な|・><い|・>……！"
msgstr "  Even harder to admit was that her sister probably had not even brought out the big guns yet."

#. Occurrence C_11:2072:17242: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_11_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_11
#: C_11:2072
msgctxt "text_id=17242 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「<[ansz]|アンサズ>、<[swel]|ソウェル>、<[ingz]|イングズ>ッ！」"
msgstr "\"Ansuz, Sowilo, Ingwaz!\""

#. Occurrence C_11:2109:17243: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2109
msgctxt "text_id=17243 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は跳びのきながら中空にルーンを描く。"
msgstr "  Jumping backward, Touko drew more runic symbols in the air."

#. Occurrence C_11:2114:17244: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2114
msgctxt "text_id=17244 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一喝に応じて刻印は炎へと転じていく。"
msgstr "  In response, her crests burned brightly."

#. Occurrence C_11:2119:17245: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2119
msgctxt "text_id=17245 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが。"
msgstr "  But..."

#. Occurrence C_11:2128:17246: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_11_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_11
#: C_11:2128
msgctxt "text_id=17246 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――<古|おそ>いっ！」"
msgstr "\"...Too slow!\""

#. Occurrence C_11:2210:17247: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2210
msgctxt "text_id=17247 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを、青子はただ一言で打ち消した。"
msgstr "  With a single word, Aoko nullified the runes,"

#. Occurrence C_11:2215:17248: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2215
msgctxt "text_id=17248 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ルーンは意味を持つ前に砕け散る。"
msgstr "  dissolving them before they could be given meaning."

#. Occurrence C_11:2220:17249: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2220
msgctxt "text_id=17249 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　単純に、ルーンをカタチにする橙子の魔力より、彼女の言葉の力が上回ったのだ。"
msgstr "  The power of Aoko's words had surpassed the magical energy of Touko's rune magecraft."

#. Occurrence C_11:2280:17250: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2280
msgctxt "text_id=17250 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ルーンを無効化し、青子は白い花園を突き進む。"
msgstr "  With the runes nullified, Aoko continued advancing through the white flowers."

#. Occurrence C_11:2285:17251: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2285
msgctxt "text_id=17251 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その<表情|かお>も、安定した魔術回路の働きも、息遣いさえ今までの彼女とは違う。"
msgstr "  From her calmness to the robust spinning of her Magic Circuits and her breathing, she was different."

#. Occurrence C_11:2290:17252: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2290
msgctxt "text_id=17252 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは多くの戦闘経験を得た者にしか出来えない、最適化された自己管理だ。"
msgstr "  A woman with sublime self-control, a trait only found in mages with a lifetime of combat experience."

#. Occurrence C_11:2311:17253: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_11_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_11
#: C_11:2311
msgctxt "text_id=17253 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「―――あれは、<経験|じかん>か―――？」"
msgstr "\"Y-You traveled in time!\""

#. Occurrence C_11:2316:17254: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2316
msgctxt "text_id=17254 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが蒼崎の魔法の正体だとしたら、たしかにすべてが<符|ふ><合|ごう>する。"
msgstr "  Given the evidence, that was the only explanation for the Aozaki Magic."

#. Occurrence C_11:2336:17255: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2336
msgctxt "text_id=17255 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の魔術回路が増幅されたのではない。"
msgstr "  Aoko's Magic Circuits had not been amplified."

#. Occurrence C_11:2341:17256: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2341
msgctxt "text_id=17256 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそもそんな事は出来ないし、橙子のように外付けにしたところで、増えるのは魔力の総量と使用可能な術式だけ。"
msgstr "  That would have been impossible anyway. Like Touko, she would have to externalize them, which would just increase the scope of her magical energy and techniques."

#. Occurrence C_11:2347:17257: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2347
msgctxt "text_id=17257 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "魔術師自体の資質、魔術回路の純度は変わらない。"
msgstr "By nature, the quality of a mage's Magic Circuits did not change."

#. Occurrence C_11:2352:17258: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2352
msgctxt "text_id=17258 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、今の青子は明らかに<魔|・><術|・><師|・><と|・><し|・><て|・>蒼崎橙子を凌駕している。"
msgstr "  But Aoko was now clearly a superior mage to Touko."

#. Occurrence C_11:2373:17259: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2373
msgctxt "text_id=17259 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ならば答えは一つ。"
msgstr "  So there was only one logical conclusion."

#. Occurrence C_11:2396:17260: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2396
msgctxt "text_id=17260 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの見習い魔術師は一瞬で一人前の魔術師に成長―――"
msgstr "  In an instant, she had grown from an amateur to a veteran."

#. Occurrence C_11:2396:17261: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2396
msgctxt "text_id=17261 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、自身の<時|・><間|・><を|・><早|・><送|・><り|・>したのだ。"
msgstr "  She fast-forwarded her own time."

#. Occurrence C_11:2463:17262: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_11_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_11
#: C_11:2463
msgctxt "text_id=17262 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「っ―――！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence C_11:2497:17263: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2497
msgctxt "text_id=17263 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子に背を向けて、オレンジ色の魔術師は走りだした。"
msgstr "  The Scarred Red mage turned her back on her sister and ran."

#. Occurrence C_11:2502:17264: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2502
msgctxt "text_id=17264 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<こ|・><こ|・>では勝ち目がないと直感し、旧校舎に逃げこんでいく。"
msgstr "  She knew she could not win, so she fled toward the old school building."

#. Occurrence C_11:2507:17265: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2507
msgctxt "text_id=17265 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その背中を青子は狙わなかった。"
msgstr "  Aoko did not fire."

#. Occurrence C_11:2512:17266: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2512
msgctxt "text_id=17266 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　情けからではなく、冷静に、この距離からでは仕損じると判断して。"
msgstr "  Not out of pity, but because she deduced that an attack at this range was risky."

#. Occurrence C_11:2533:17267: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2533
msgctxt "text_id=17267 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　逃すまいと青子は身を乗り出し、はた、と思い立ったように足を止めた。"
msgstr "  She went to chase after her sister, but stopped suddenly."

#. Occurrence C_11:2579:17268: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2579
msgctxt "text_id=17268 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……言葉にするのは少し迷う。"
msgstr "  ...A few words caught in her throat."

#. Occurrence C_11:2584:17269: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2584
msgctxt "text_id=17269 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は小さく息を呑んで、"
msgstr "  She took a small breath."

#. Occurrence C_11:2601:17270: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_11_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_11
#: C_11:2601
msgctxt "text_id=17270 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「アリス。そいつ、お願い」"
msgstr "\"Watch him, Alice.\""

#. Occurrence C_11:2674:17271: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2674
msgctxt "text_id=17271 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大人びた声を恥じるように、そんな言葉を口にした。"
msgstr "  She said, slightly embarrassed by the maturity of her voice."

#. Occurrence C_11:2757:17272: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2757
msgctxt "text_id=17272 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　白い花が散っていく。"
msgstr "  White petals flitted through the air."

#. Occurrence C_11:2762:17273: scene=C_11
#: C_11:2762
msgctxt "text_id=17273 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は振り返らず、長い髪をなびかせて橙子の後を追っていった。"
msgstr "  Without looking back, she made after Touko, her long hair flowing behind her."

#. Occurrence C_12:70:17274: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:70
msgctxt "text_id=17274 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――あれ？」"
msgstr "\"...Huh?\""

#. Occurrence C_12:76:17275: scene=C_12
#: C_12:76
msgctxt "text_id=17275 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぱちり、と軽快に<目蓋|まぶた>が開く。"
msgstr "  His eyelids snapped open."

#. Occurrence C_12:81:17276: scene=C_12
#: C_12:81
msgctxt "text_id=17276 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<永|なが>い休眠から草十郎は目を覚ました。"
msgstr "  At last, Soujyuro awoke from his long slumber."

#. Occurrence C_12:101:17277: scene=C_12
#: C_12:101
msgctxt "text_id=17277 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　仰向けに寝っころがっているらしく、視界にはいっぱいの星空が広がっている。"
msgstr "  Lying on his back, he gazed up at the stars."

#. Occurrence C_12:106:17278: scene=C_12
#: C_12:106
msgctxt "text_id=17278 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　木々によって形作られた円形の空。"
msgstr "  The trees around him created a porthole into space."

#. Occurrence C_12:111:17279: scene=C_12
#: C_12:111
msgctxt "text_id=17279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは初めて見たものなのに、"
msgstr "  Despite seeing all this for the first time,"

#. Occurrence C_12:116:17280: scene=C_12
#: C_12:116
msgctxt "text_id=17280 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久しく忘れていた景色に見えて、居心地が悪かった。"
msgstr "  he felt an uncomfortable sense of déjà vu."

#. Occurrence C_12:187:17281: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:187
msgctxt "text_id=17281 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_12:193:17282: scene=C_12
#: C_12:193
msgctxt "text_id=17282 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうにも自分が確かではない。"
msgstr "  So many questions."

#. Occurrence C_12:198:17283: scene=C_12
#: C_12:198
msgctxt "text_id=17283 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　眠る前に何をしていたのか、"
msgstr "  What happened before he fell asleep?"

#. Occurrence C_12:203:17284: scene=C_12
#: C_12:203
msgctxt "text_id=17284 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうして眠っていたのか、"
msgstr "  Why had he been sleeping?"

#. Occurrence C_12:208:17285: scene=C_12
#: C_12:208
msgctxt "text_id=17285 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　キレイさっぱり記憶にない。"
msgstr "  Everything was just so hazy."

#. Occurrence C_12:213:17286: scene=C_12
#: C_12:213
msgctxt "text_id=17286 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これから出かけようと玄関をすぎた直後、目を開けたらベッドにいたような気分だ。"
msgstr "  It was like he had walked out the door one minute, and woken up in bed the next."

#. Occurrence C_12:234:17287: scene=C_12
#: C_12:234
msgctxt "text_id=17287 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　前後の出来事が無さすぎて、自分が何者であるのかさえ、すぐには思い至らない。"
msgstr "  With so many thoughts clouding his mind, he could barely recall his own name."

#. Occurrence C_12:285:17288: scene=C_12
#: C_12:285
msgctxt "text_id=17288 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　思い出せるのはただ、"
msgstr "  All he could remember..."

#. Occurrence C_12:345:17289: scene=C_12
#: C_12:345
msgctxt "text_id=17289 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見たこともない女の人と、"
msgstr "  ...was a girl he'd never seen before,"

#. Occurrence C_12:407:17290: scene=C_12
#: C_12:407
msgctxt "text_id=17290 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　首にかかった細い"
msgstr "  and something thin around his neck."

#. Occurrence C_12:443:17291: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:443
msgctxt "text_id=17291 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「静希君」"
msgstr "\"Sizuki.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:502:17292: scene=C_12
#: C_12:502
msgctxt "text_id=17292 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　真横から誰かの声……低いのによく通る声は、たしか、久遠寺有珠という少女の物だ。"
msgstr "  The voice-quiet but clear-belonged to the girl named Alice Kuonji, who was at his side."

#. Occurrence C_12:523:17293: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:523
msgctxt "text_id=17293 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そういえば、そうだった」"
msgstr "\"Oh yeah...\""

#. Occurrence C_12:582:17294: scene=C_12
#: C_12:582
msgctxt "text_id=17294 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　脈絡のない呟きと共に、草十郎は体を起こす。"
msgstr "  He sat up, mumbling incoherently."

#. Occurrence C_12:656:17295: scene=C_12
#: C_12:656
msgctxt "text_id=17295 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目を覚ました彼の横には、黒衣の少女が正座していた。"
msgstr "  The black-clad girl knelt next to him."

#. Occurrence C_12:681:17296: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:681
msgctxt "text_id=17296 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……花だ」"
msgstr "\"...Flowers,\""

#. Occurrence C_12:720:17297: scene=C_12
#: C_12:720
msgctxt "text_id=17297 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<傍|かたわ>らの有珠を見ず、ぼんやりと口にする。"
msgstr "  he said, paying no mind to Alice."

#. Occurrence C_12:725:17298: scene=C_12
#: C_12:725
msgctxt "text_id=17298 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……<蒼|あお>い月明かりの下、枯れた木々と雪原に囲まれて、春の花園が<揺|ゆ>らめいていた。"
msgstr "  Under the blue moonlight, spring flowers swayed, surrounded by dead trees and snow."

#. Occurrence C_12:780:17299: scene=C_12
#: C_12:780
msgctxt "text_id=17299 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜風に散る花びらは蝶のように、白い身を闇夜にくっきりと浮かびあがらせる。"
msgstr "  Against the curtain of night, white petals danced in the breeze like butterflies."

#. Occurrence C_12:785:17300: scene=C_12
#: C_12:785
msgctxt "text_id=17300 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　長く、その光景を見つめて、草十郎はそっと首に指を置いた。"
msgstr "  Staring long and hard at the spectacle, Soujyuro suddenly raised his fingers to his neck."

#. Occurrence C_12:796:17301: scene=C_12
#: C_12:796
msgctxt "text_id=17301 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はじめは、傷口に触れるように恐る恐る。"
msgstr "  He moved carefully, like he was touching a wound."

#. Occurrence C_12:802:17302: scene=C_12
#: C_12:802
msgctxt "text_id=17302 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あとは、握りこむように、強く強く。"
msgstr "  Then, gradually, he began squeezing. Harder. Harder."

#. Occurrence C_12:823:17303: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:823
msgctxt "text_id=17303 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――静希君」"
msgstr "\"...Sizuki.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:829:17304: scene=C_12
#: C_12:829
msgctxt "text_id=17304 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その暗転を止めたのは、傍らの少女の声だった。"
msgstr "  The voice of the girl beside him brought him back to reality."

#. Occurrence C_12:850:17305: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:850
msgctxt "text_id=17305 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「せっかく戻れたのに、またいくの……？」"
msgstr "\"Leaving so soon? You just came back.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:936:17306: scene=C_12
#: C_12:936
msgctxt "text_id=17306 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　問いかけの意味を、草十郎は掴めなかった。"
msgstr "  She sounded both sad and reproachful,"

#. Occurrence C_12:941:17307: scene=C_12
#: C_12:941
msgctxt "text_id=17307 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　批難と哀しみの混じった声。"
msgstr "  but Soujyuro did not understand why."

#. Occurrence C_12:946:17308: scene=C_12
#: C_12:946
msgctxt "text_id=17308 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その、有珠らしからぬ眼差しに責められて、彼は無意識から解放された。"
msgstr "  Seeing the uncharacteristic concern in her eyes snapped him to his senses."

#. Occurrence C_12:1004:17309: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1004
msgctxt "text_id=17309 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いくって、どこに」"
msgstr "\"Leaving? Where would I go?\""

#. Occurrence C_12:1010:17310: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1010
msgctxt "text_id=17310 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　首から落ちる指。"
msgstr "  His fingers fell away from his neck."

#. Occurrence C_12:1015:17311: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1015
msgctxt "text_id=17311 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は答えず、無表情に空を見上げた。"
msgstr "  Without answering, she blankly looked to the sky."

#. Occurrence C_12:1021:17312: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1021
msgctxt "text_id=17312 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこにあるのは、ただ暗いばかりの――――――。"
msgstr "  Though there was only the infinite darkness of space."

#. Occurrence C_12:1042:17313: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1042
msgctxt "text_id=17313 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……ま、いいや。それより俺は何をしてたんだろう。"
msgstr "\"...Well, whatever. What was I doing again?"

#. Occurrence C_12:1048:17314: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1048
msgctxt "text_id=17314 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　なんかヘンだ。ごちゃごちゃしてる」"
msgstr "  My head feels strange, like it's full of cobwebs.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:1102:17315: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1102
msgctxt "text_id=17315 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はて、と首を傾げる草十郎を、有珠はじいっと観察する。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro tilted his head in confusion. Alice observed him motionlessly."

#. Occurrence C_12:1107:17316: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1107
msgctxt "text_id=17316 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さっきの人狼を一蹴した少年と、こうやって呆けている少年はまるっきり別人で、そのくせ、まるで違和感がない。"
msgstr "  This bewildered boy was a far cry from the one that made short work of a werewolf. Then again, this was Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence C_12:1127:17317: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1127
msgctxt "text_id=17317 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その不思議を見抜こうと少年を見つめるのだが、納得いく答えは出ないだろう事も、なんとなく有珠は認めていた。"
msgstr "  As she stared at him, she realized she did not have an answer he could understand."

#. Occurrence C_12:1150:17318: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1150
msgctxt "text_id=17318 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして問いかける。"
msgstr "  So she tried asking a question."

#. Occurrence C_12:1155:17319: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1155
msgctxt "text_id=17319 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼が眠っていた間、遠く離れた彼女が何度も繰り返して、しまいには怒って止めてしまった、その問いを。"
msgstr "  The same question she had asked him repeatedly as he slept but eventually gave up expecting a response to."

#. Occurrence C_12:1283:17320: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1283
msgctxt "text_id=17320 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……今まで、静希君は何をしていたの？」"
msgstr "\"...Tell me. Do you remember what you were doing, Sizuki?\""

#. Occurrence C_12:1289:17321: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1289
msgctxt "text_id=17321 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静かな問いかけは、旅人を魅了する魔術に等しい。"
msgstr "  Her quiet question was spoken like an enthralling spell of magecraft."

#. Occurrence C_12:1294:17322: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1294
msgctxt "text_id=17322 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに魅了されてか、草十郎は記憶の海に沈みこむ。"
msgstr "  Said spell seemed to work, and Soujyuro sank into a sea of memories."

#. Occurrence C_12:1335:17323: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1335
msgctxt "text_id=17323 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　沈黙の間、ふたりは兄妹のように、白い丘に<佇|たたず>んでいた。"
msgstr "  Atop the bright, white hill, they quietly sat for a while, like siblings."

#. Occurrence C_12:1356:17324: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1356
msgctxt "text_id=17324 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……誰かの声が聞こえた気がする。"
msgstr "\"...I remember hearing someone's voice."

#. Occurrence C_12:1363:17325: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1363
msgctxt "text_id=17325 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "何かを訊いているようだった。けど、自分は最後まで、一言も返せなかった」"
msgstr "I think they were asking me something. But I couldn't respond at all.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:1369:17326: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1369
msgctxt "text_id=17326 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　死中の闇において繰り返された問いを、彼はおぼろげに思い出した。"
msgstr "  Though consumed by the darkness of death, he could still vaguely recall the girl's question."

#. Occurrence C_12:1374:17327: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1374
msgctxt "text_id=17327 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　死んでいた事すら分かっていないが、彼女の時間と交差した断片は残っているようだ。"
msgstr "  He was not aware that he had died, but it seemed a fragment of time remained from when he had been with her."

#. Occurrence C_12:1431:17328: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1431
msgctxt "text_id=17328 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は悔いるように顔を<曇|くも>らせる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's expression darkened, filled with regret."

#. Occurrence C_12:1436:17329: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1436
msgctxt "text_id=17329 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その横顔に有珠は静かに問いかける。"
msgstr "  Looking at his profile, Alice pressed him further."

#. Occurrence C_12:1445:17330: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1445
msgctxt "text_id=17330 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……それで、欲しい物は見つかった？」"
msgstr "\"And did you find what you were looking for?\""

#. Occurrence C_12:1544:17331: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1544
msgctxt "text_id=17331 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが『誰か』に訊ねられていた事だと思い出して、彼はかすかにうなずいた。"
msgstr "  Remembering that someone had asked him questions, he gave a slight nod."

#. Occurrence C_12:1678:17332: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1678
msgctxt "text_id=17332 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……ああ、そうだった。"
msgstr "\"...Yeah. I did."

#. Occurrence C_12:1685:17333: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1685
msgctxt "text_id=17333 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "けれどね、有珠。そんな物は、見つからないって思っていたんだ。"
msgstr "But, I honestly didn't think I would, Alice."

#. Occurrence C_12:1691:17334: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1691
msgctxt "text_id=17334 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……うん。ずっと、そう思っていた」"
msgstr "  This whole time. I didn't think I would.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:1704:17335: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1704
msgctxt "text_id=17335 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悔いる声には、かすかな強さが混じっている。"
msgstr "  The regret in his voice was accompanied by a hint of strength."

#. Occurrence C_12:1709:17336: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1709
msgctxt "text_id=17336 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見下ろす白い花園は、死者を迎える<彼岸|ひがん>のようだ。"
msgstr "  Lowering his gaze, Soujyuro saw a white flower garden that looked like something from the afterlife."

#. Occurrence C_12:1714:17337: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1714
msgctxt "text_id=17337 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが、少しだけ草十郎には<眩|まぶ>しかった。"
msgstr "  It shone brightly, captivating him."

#. Occurrence C_12:1765:17338: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1765
msgctxt "text_id=17338 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「思い出した。青子の前でざっくりいったんだっけ。"
msgstr "\"I remember now. I think I... got cut in half... in front of Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_12:1771:17339: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1771
msgctxt "text_id=17339 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　なのに生きているのは、どういう事なんだろう」"
msgstr "  But then why am I alive?\""

#. Occurrence C_12:1798:17340: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1798
msgctxt "text_id=17340 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不思議そうに体を触る草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro said, prodding his body curiously."

#. Occurrence C_12:1803:17341: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1803
msgctxt "text_id=17341 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　両腕も完全に元のままで、肝心の青子の姿はない。"
msgstr "  His arms were their old selves again, but what of Aoko?"

#. Occurrence C_12:1882:17342: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1882
msgctxt "text_id=17342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　答えを求めて有珠に視線を向けると、彼女は座ったままで、どこか拗ねるように、"
msgstr "  He turning toward Alice for an answer, who was sat among the flowers looking sullen."

#. Occurrence C_12:1954:17343: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1954
msgctxt "text_id=17343 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「巻き戻されたのよ、静希君は。"
msgstr "\"You were rewound, Sizuki."

#. Occurrence C_12:1960:17344: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:1960
msgctxt "text_id=17344 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　この風景も本来は貴方の記憶だけど、わからない……？」"
msgstr "  This place is from your memories. Don't you remember?\""

#. Occurrence C_12:1966:17345: scene=C_12
#: C_12:1966
msgctxt "text_id=17345 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　などと、おかしな言葉を口にした。"
msgstr "  Alice seemed to be speaking in riddles."

#. Occurrence C_12:2007:17346: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2007
msgctxt "text_id=17346 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「俺の、記憶って……そのわりには、知らないところなんだけど」"
msgstr "\"My memories? That's weird. I... I'm drawing a blank.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:2013:17347: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2013
msgctxt "text_id=17347 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「いま静希君の時間は青子に使われているから。それが戻されるまで思い出す事はないわ」"
msgstr "\"Right now, your time is being used by Aoko. Until that time is returned, you won't be able to remember.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:2019:17348: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2019
msgctxt "text_id=17348 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　物騒な返答をして、有珠は花園を見渡した。"
msgstr "  She answered ominously, as she cast her gaze over the flower garden."

#. Occurrence C_12:2082:17349: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2082
msgctxt "text_id=17349 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……でも、これが消えてしまうのは残念ね。"
msgstr "\"A shame all this won't stay."

#. Occurrence C_12:2088:17350: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2088
msgctxt "text_id=17350 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　元に戻れば、思い返せるのはわたしだけなのに」"
msgstr "  Once your time's returned, I'll be the only one who remembers.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:2094:17351: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2094
msgctxt "text_id=17351 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一瞬だけ瞳を細めて、有珠は白い花々を見る。"
msgstr "  Looking at the white blossoms, she smiled momentarily."

#. Occurrence C_12:2155:17352: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2155
msgctxt "text_id=17352 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_12:2160:17353: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2160
msgctxt "text_id=17353 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女の言葉は、草十郎にはやっぱりさっぱり。"
msgstr "  Her words only confused him further."

#. Occurrence C_12:2231:17354: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0016; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2231
msgctxt "text_id=17354 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「有珠。君、答える気がないんだろう」"
msgstr "\"You're not going to tell me, are you, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence C_12:2236:17355: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2236
msgctxt "text_id=17355 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の声に、有珠はつい、と振り向いた。"
msgstr "  He said dejectedly, prompting Alice to face him."

#. Occurrence C_12:2294:17356: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2294
msgctxt "text_id=17356 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　深い瞳は、どんな感情を秘めているかも分からない。"
msgstr "  What emotions lay inside those deep eyes?"

#. Occurrence C_12:2370:17357: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2370
msgctxt "text_id=17357 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「意味のない話だけど、聞きたい？」"
msgstr "\"It's pointless having me tell you, but do you want to hear anyway?\""

#. Occurrence C_12:2376:17358: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0017; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2376
msgctxt "text_id=17358 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「聞きたい。有珠が教えてくれるなら尚更だ」"
msgstr "\"Yeah. If it's not too bothersome, Alice.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:2437:17359: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2437
msgctxt "text_id=17359 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　力強くうなずく草十郎に、有珠はそう、とため息まじりに目を閉じた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded enthusiastically, while Alice took a deep breath and closed her eyes."

#. Occurrence C_12:2442:17360: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2442
msgctxt "text_id=17360 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも口を開いたのは、草十郎を嫌っての事ではなく、彼女なりに気を遣っているからだろう。"
msgstr "  When she spoke, she spoke in as caring a tone as she was capable of."

#. Occurrence C_12:2590:17361: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2590
msgctxt "text_id=17361 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……結論だけ言うと、貴方は一度死んで、生き返ったの。"
msgstr "\"...The long and short of it is, you died. Then you came back to life."

#. Occurrence C_12:2596:17362: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2596
msgctxt "text_id=17362 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　静希君が橙子さんに殺されてから、青子が目を覚ますまでの五分間分の時間を巻き戻して。"
msgstr "  After you were killed by Touko, Aoko rewound the five minutes before you opened your eyes."

#. Occurrence C_12:2602:17363: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2602
msgctxt "text_id=17363 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　その時、貴方は十年近い年月を青子に使われた。"
msgstr "  Meanwhile, she used roughly ten years of your time."

#. Occurrence C_12:2608:17364: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2608
msgctxt "text_id=17364 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　二人とも肉体年齢は変わってないから、<精神|なか>の時間だけ持っていったんでしょうね。"
msgstr "  Neither of you changed physically, so she must've borrowed time from you mentally."

#. Occurrence C_12:2614:17365: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2614
msgctxt "text_id=17365 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　だから今、この景色を懐かしく思えるのは青子だけ。"
msgstr "  That's why right now, this beautiful scenery would only bring back memories for Aoko, in possession of your time."

#. Occurrence C_12:2621:17366: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2621
msgctxt "text_id=17366 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　そして…………」"
msgstr "  And...\""

#. Occurrence C_12:2641:17367: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2641
msgctxt "text_id=17367 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして、時間の交換が終われば、この数分たらずの出来事は、青子と草十郎の記憶から失われる。"
msgstr "  And once the time exchange was over, neither Aoko nor Soujyuro would remember what happened during these moments."

#. Occurrence C_12:2647:17368: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2647
msgctxt "text_id=17368 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子ひとりだけの変化ではなく、他人を媒介にした魔法の結果だ。"
msgstr "  When Aoko used someone else to channel her True Magic, it did not affect her alone."

#. Occurrence C_12:2652:17369: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2652
msgctxt "text_id=17369 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子ひとりでの逆行であれば、時間軸の矛盾もふくめて彼女の経験になるが、今回は<ま|・><っ|・><と|・><う|・>な時間旅行である。"
msgstr "  If she had rewound time for only herself, the temporal inconsistencies would form part of her own experience; however, this was proper time travel."

#. Occurrence C_12:2657:17370: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2657
msgctxt "text_id=17370 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　矛盾はきちんと修正される。"
msgstr "  The inconsistencies would be corrected."

#. Occurrence C_12:2683:17371: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2683
msgctxt "text_id=17371 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いずれ魔法が解ければ、"
msgstr "  When the Magic ended,"

#. Occurrence C_12:2688:17372: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2688
msgctxt "text_id=17372 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　此処を懐かしく思った青子も、"
msgstr "  both Aoko's memories of this place"

#. Occurrence C_12:2693:17373: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2693
msgctxt "text_id=17373 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　此処を初めてと感じた草十郎も、"
msgstr "  and Soujyuro's unfamiliarity with it"

#. Occurrence C_12:2698:17374: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2698
msgctxt "text_id=17374 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なかった事として修正される。"
msgstr "  would be corrected."

#. Occurrence C_12:2704:17375: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2704
msgctxt "text_id=17375 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この奇跡。"
msgstr "  This miracle would become unrealized."

#. Occurrence C_12:2709:17376: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2709
msgctxt "text_id=17376 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　白い花の海を覚えていられるのは、第三者である有珠と橙子だけになる。"
msgstr "  Only the observers would remember this brilliant white sea of flowers: Alice and Touko."

#. Occurrence C_12:2730:17377: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0018; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2730
msgctxt "text_id=17377 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……時間を、持っていく……？」"
msgstr "\"She borrowed... my time...?\""

#. Occurrence C_12:2736:17378: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2736
msgctxt "text_id=17378 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ますます首を傾げる草十郎に、有珠はとりあえず形だけ説明する事にした。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro asked, his head tilting even farther at Alice's general explanation."

#. Occurrence C_12:2741:17379: scene=C_12
#: C_12:2741
msgctxt "text_id=17379 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　理解してもらえなくても、概要を説明してあげれば草十郎は聞き返してこない、と青子が言っていたのを思いだして。"
msgstr "  She recalled how Aoko said that if you gave Soujyuro a roundabout answer he would stop asking questions, even if he did not comprehend it."

#. Occurrence C_12:2762:17380: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2762
msgctxt "text_id=17380 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「静希君を生き返らせる方法はなかったから、生命の復元より、死そのものの回避を青子は<試|こころ>みたのよ。"
msgstr "\"There was no way to resurrect you, so instead Aoko attempted to circumvent your death completely."

#. Occurrence C_12:2768:17381: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2768
msgctxt "text_id=17381 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　まだ青子には無理なのか、それとも、今回も<日|ひ><和|よ>ったのか。"
msgstr "  Perhaps because she was unable, or because she was hesitant,"

#. Occurrence C_12:2774:17382: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2774
msgctxt "text_id=17382 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　大きな操作は避けて、小さな操作―――自分と貴方だけの交換に<留|とど>めたようね」"
msgstr "  she avoided any large-scale manipulation, and settled for a smaller exchange between the two of you.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:2882:17383: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2882
msgctxt "text_id=17383 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「貴方はいま、五分間だけ時間を跳んだ事になるわ。"
msgstr "\"That means you've effectively jumped through time by five minutes."

#. Occurrence C_12:2888:17384: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2888
msgctxt "text_id=17384 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　仮に、遠い未来、この時間を検索できる人がいたとしても、貴方だけは誰にも見つけられない。だって、時間軸の上にいなかったんですもの」"
msgstr "  Even if someone from the distant future was able to look through time, they couldn't find you in those five minutes, because you don't exist in regular time anymore.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:2962:17385: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2962
msgctxt "text_id=17385 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「そして同時に、青子は自分の時間を上乗せするために、貴方から時間を借り受けた。"
msgstr "\"Simultaneously, Aoko borrowed your time to advance her own."

#. Occurrence C_12:2968:17386: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:2968
msgctxt "text_id=17386 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　たぶん幼年期の時間でしょうね。個人の時間操作は、忘却している部分の方が楽だと聞くし……静希君？」"
msgstr "  More than likely, time from your childhood. From what I understand, individual time manipulation is easier when using forgotten memories... Sizuki?\""

#. Occurrence C_12:3029:17387: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3029
msgctxt "text_id=17387 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もうこの辺で止めておく？"
msgstr "  \"Should I slow down?\" Alice asked with her eyes."

#. Occurrence C_12:3034:17388: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3034
msgctxt "text_id=17388 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　という有珠の視線に、頷く事しかできない草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  All Soujyuro could do was nod."

#. Occurrence C_12:3073:17389: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:3073
msgctxt "text_id=17389 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……つまり、二つの奇跡を青子は行使したの。"
msgstr "\"...So, Aoko used two miracles."

#. Occurrence C_12:3079:17390: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:3079
msgctxt "text_id=17390 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　貴方の体の巻き戻しと、自分の体の早送りね。"
msgstr "  She rewound your body, and fast-forwarded her own."

#. Occurrence C_12:3085:17391: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:3085
msgctxt "text_id=17391 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　静希君の時間に介入する際、ついでに十年分の時間を借り受けて、未来の自分を持ってきた」"
msgstr "  When going into your time, she borrowed ten years of yours to bring her future self closer.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:3106:17392: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:3106
msgctxt "text_id=17392 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「だから、いま橙子さんを殺そうとしているのは<二|・><十|・><七|・><歳|・>分の<経験|じかん>をもった蒼崎青子という事になるわ」"
msgstr "\"Therefore, the one trying to kill Touko right now is actually an Aoko Aozaki with twenty seven years of experience.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:3112:17393: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3112
msgctxt "text_id=17393 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……だから、まったくちんぷんかんぷんなんだ、有珠。"
msgstr "  What on earth was Alice talking about?"

#. Occurrence C_12:3117:17394: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3117
msgctxt "text_id=17394 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな感想を表情で示しながらも、橙子に関する説明に草十郎は眉をひそめた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's expression gave away his thoughts. Though the part about Touko made him furrow his brow."

#. Occurrence C_12:3138:17395: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_12_0019; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_12
#: C_12:3138
msgctxt "text_id=17395 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……橙子さんを殺すって、青子が？」"
msgstr "\"Aoko's going to... kill Touko?\""

#. Occurrence C_12:3190:17396: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0028; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:3190
msgctxt "text_id=17396 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「もう、終わってるでしょうけど」"
msgstr "\"If she hasn't already, yes.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:3283:17397: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3283
msgctxt "text_id=17397 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の返答に、草十郎は即座に走りだした。"
msgstr "  As soon as Alice answered, Soujyuro sped off."

#. Occurrence C_12:3288:17398: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3288
msgctxt "text_id=17398 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　白い花びらを散らしながら駆けていく姿は、人狼と対した時の勇ましさを思わせる。"
msgstr "  Kicking up white petals behind him as he ran, the brave boy who defeated a werewolf was back."

#. Occurrence C_12:3360:17399: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3360
msgctxt "text_id=17399 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は引き止める事もせず、ただその姿を見続けた。"
msgstr "  Alice watched him go."

#. Occurrence C_12:3448:17400: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3448
msgctxt "text_id=17400 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……ある雪の日の夜。"
msgstr "  On a snowy night..."

#. Occurrence C_12:3453:17401: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3453
msgctxt "text_id=17401 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰かのために白犬塚の坂を駆け下りていったであろう、少年の姿と重ねながら。"
msgstr "  ...the same boy ran down Shiroinuzuka hill for her, too."

#. Occurrence C_12:3496:17402: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3496
msgctxt "text_id=17402 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は旧校舎に入っていく。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro entered the old school building."

#. Occurrence C_12:3501:17403: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3501
msgctxt "text_id=17403 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先ほどから破滅的な音と光が<乱舞|らんぶ>し、<瓦解|がかい>寸前の<墓標|ぼひょう>となった場所に、戸惑う事もなく。"
msgstr "  Lights flashed and the sounds of destruction exploded around him, threatening to turn the area into a burial ground. Still, he remained focused."

#. Occurrence C_12:3524:17404: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:3524
msgctxt "text_id=17404 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――ほら。"
msgstr "\"See, Aoko?"

#. Occurrence C_12:3563:17405: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_12_0030; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_12
#: C_12:3563
msgctxt "text_id=17405 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　悪いけれど、やっぱり無駄だったわ、青子」"
msgstr "  Sorry, but I knew this would happen.\""

#. Occurrence C_12:3569:17406: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3569
msgctxt "text_id=17406 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　白い花の中でひとり呟く。"
msgstr "  Her words only reached the white flowers around her."

#. Occurrence C_12:3574:17407: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3574
msgctxt "text_id=17407 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はこうなる事を予期して、草十郎の足止めを有珠に託したのだ。"
msgstr "  Aoko knew Soujyuro too well, so she wanted Alice to stop him."

#. Occurrence C_12:3579:17408: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3579
msgctxt "text_id=17408 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子との交戦中に割って入られたら、今度こそかばいようがないと。"
msgstr "  If he tried to interfere in the battle against Touko, she could not protect him this time."

#. Occurrence C_12:3629:17409: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3629
msgctxt "text_id=17409 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が、青子の見事なまでの草十郎の把握ぶりもこうなっては後の祭りだ。"
msgstr "  But it was too late to celebrate Aoko's judgment now."

#. Occurrence C_12:3634:17410: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3634
msgctxt "text_id=17410 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　追いかける気にもならず、"
msgstr "  The girl in black had no intention of going after him."

#. Occurrence C_12:3639:17411: scene=C_12
#: C_12:3639
msgctxt "text_id=17411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　黒衣の少女は細い眉をかすかに曇らせて、消えていく花園の中で<佇|たたず>むのだった。"
msgstr "  She simply sat for a while, gazing forlornly at the transient flower garden."

#. Occurrence C_13:461:17412: scene=C_13
#: C_13:461
msgctxt "text_id=17412 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　飛び交う<電刃|でんじん>を、暴風の如き<魔弾|まだん>が叩き伏せる。"
msgstr "  A storm of magic bullets struck down a hail of lightning blades."

#. Occurrence C_13:546:17413: scene=C_13
#: C_13:546
msgctxt "text_id=17413 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術師にとって、拠点とする<工房|アジト>は始まりにして最後の切札である。"
msgstr "  A mage's workshop was their home base, and last line of defense."

#. Occurrence C_13:551:17414: scene=C_13
#: C_13:551
msgctxt "text_id=17414 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<不遜|ふそん>な挑戦者、<不埒|ふらち>な盗人を切りきざむ為、<幾重|いくえ><数多|あまた>の防衛術式が張られている。"
msgstr "  It featured an abundance of defensive spells designed to cut down brazen challengers and thieves."

#. Occurrence C_13:556:17415: scene=C_13
#: C_13:556
msgctxt "text_id=17415 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この旧校舎もその例に漏れず、希代の人形師にしてルーン使いである蒼崎橙子の手が入っていた。"
msgstr "  The old school building was no exception, painstakingly rigged by the puppet master and rune mage, Touko Aozaki."

#. Occurrence C_13:561:17416: scene=C_13
#: C_13:561
msgctxt "text_id=17416 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女の<偏執|へんしつ>的なこだわりを反映させた<工房|ソレ>は、訪れるものを人魔区別なく<鏖殺|おうさつ>する。"
msgstr "  A reflection of her bizarre obsessions, the workshop was set to indiscriminately destroy any intruders."

#. Occurrence C_13:667:17417: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:667
msgctxt "text_id=17417 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「っ、足止めぐらいは果たせバカモン―――！」"
msgstr "\"Grrr! Stay still for one damn second, you freak!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:673:17418: scene=C_13
#: C_13:673
msgctxt "text_id=17418 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下を走りながら、橙子は廊下に組み込んだトラップを起動させていく。"
msgstr "  Touko complained, as she ran down the hallway, activating her traps along the way."

#. Occurrence C_13:678:17419: scene=C_13
#: C_13:678
msgctxt "text_id=17419 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、その一切は通用しない。"
msgstr "  But nothing seemed to work."

#. Occurrence C_13:843:17420: scene=C_13
#: C_13:843
msgctxt "text_id=17420 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　質、<量|りょう>問わず、十や二十のルーンでは、あの小娘を止める事さえ出来ない。"
msgstr "  None of the runes-regardless of their quality or quantity-could slow her sister down."

#. Occurrence C_13:848:17421: scene=C_13
#: C_13:848
msgctxt "text_id=17421 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　卓越した運動神経と攻撃予測、"
msgstr "  Her reaction speed and ability to predict attacks could only be described as transcendent."

#. Occurrence C_13:853:17422: scene=C_13
#: C_13:853
msgctxt "text_id=17422 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　両手にまとった魔弾の威力は、橙子の用意したルーンを壁ごとぶち抜いて余りある―――！"
msgstr "  Even magic bullets she fired from both her arms were too much, destroying the runes and the very walls that housed them...!"

#. Occurrence C_13:1142:17423: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0001_0; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:1142
msgctxt "text_id=17423 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「それで一人前のつもりか単細胞め―――"
msgstr "\"Is this all your newfound maturity has got you?!"

#. Occurrence C_13:1149:17424: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0001_1; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:1149
msgctxt "text_id=17424 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　熟成したところで壊すコトしか出来ないとは、呆れたな！」"
msgstr "  The ability to smash things like a child?!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:1348:17425: scene=C_13
#: C_13:1348
msgctxt "text_id=17425 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<罵倒|ばとう>と共に天井が開き、ルーンによる重圧がかけられる。"
msgstr "  As she spat out her words, the ceiling opened, increasing the pressure from the runes."

#. Occurrence C_13:1353:17426: scene=C_13
#: C_13:1353
msgctxt "text_id=17426 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下は不可視の壁に、"
msgstr "  Invisible walls popped up in the hallway."

#. Occurrence C_13:1358:17427: scene=C_13
#: C_13:1358
msgctxt "text_id=17427 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ゼラチンと化した大気を前に、青子は走る足を止め、右足を跳ね上げた。"
msgstr "  Aoko stopped and swung her right leg upward."

#. Occurrence C_13:1589:17428: scene=C_13
#: C_13:1589
msgctxt "text_id=17428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まさに<天墜|てんつい>。"
msgstr "  Straight toward the celling."

#. Occurrence C_13:1595:17429: scene=C_13
#: C_13:1595
msgctxt "text_id=17429 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "真一文字に蹴り上げられた足は大気を裂き、そのままルーンごと天井を粉砕する。"
msgstr "Her foot cut through the thick air like a knife through butter, shattering the ceiling and the runes along with it."

#. Occurrence C_13:1699:17430: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:1699
msgctxt "text_id=17430 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「アンタの方こそ、いつまでたってもこの凝り性……！"
msgstr "\"You're one to talk! Always going overboard!"

#. Occurrence C_13:1705:17431: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:1705
msgctxt "text_id=17431 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　どこもかしこもルーンだらけ、少しは遠慮ってもんがないの！？　宇宙要塞ばりに改造してんじゃないってぇの！"
msgstr "  Don't you ever get fed up of creating runes?! You're not trying to build a space fortress!"

#. Occurrence C_13:1798:17432: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:1798
msgctxt "text_id=17432 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　みんなの思い出の校舎なんだから、もっと大切に扱いなさいよね！」"
msgstr "  This building holds precious memories for people! So show some damn respect!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:1939:17433: scene=C_13
#: C_13:1939
msgctxt "text_id=17433 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　くたびれた板張りの廊下を、"
msgstr "  The wooden boards along the hallway"

#. Occurrence C_13:1944:17434: scene=C_13
#: C_13:1944
msgctxt "text_id=17434 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何十年と風雪に耐えてきた壁を、<木|こ>っ<端|ぱ>と散らしながら青子は走る。"
msgstr "  that had withstood decades of wind and snow were now destroyed. Aoko charged forward."

#. Occurrence C_13:1949:17435: scene=C_13
#: C_13:1949
msgctxt "text_id=17435 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ごく当然の惨劇である。"
msgstr "  The chaos was inevitable."

#. Occurrence C_13:1954:17436: scene=C_13
#: C_13:1954
msgctxt "text_id=17436 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子のルーンはあくまで対人に効果を発揮する“呪い”だが、青子の魔弾は何であろうと分け<隔|へだ>てなく<猛威|もうい>を振るう。"
msgstr "  While Touko's runes cursed living creatures, Aoko's magic bullets destroyed all without prejudice."

#. Occurrence C_13:2035:17437: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:2035
msgctxt "text_id=17437 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「っ、<優雅|ゆうが>さの欠片もない！"
msgstr "\"Hah! You don't have an elegant bone in your body!"

#. Occurrence C_13:2041:17438: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:2041
msgctxt "text_id=17438 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　あんなのが自分の妹だと思うと―――」"
msgstr "  To think YOU'RE my sister!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:2047:17439: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2047
msgctxt "text_id=17439 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　吐き気はしないまでも全身の血を交換したくなる橙子だが、今はそれどころではない。"
msgstr "  Touko would do anything to change her blood, but there were more pressing matters at hand."

#. Occurrence C_13:2055:17440: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2055
msgctxt "text_id=17440 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　追ってくる少女は先ほどまでの蒼崎青子ではなく、“完成した”蒼崎青子なのだ。"
msgstr "  The girl rushing her now was not the sister she remembered, but rather a more complete version of her."

#. Occurrence C_13:2060:17441: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2060
msgctxt "text_id=17441 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　髪の毛一本ほどの油断も許されまい。"
msgstr "  Touko couldn't afford to let her guard down for a second."

#. Occurrence C_13:2081:17442: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2081
msgctxt "text_id=17442 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが―――"
msgstr "  But..."

#. Occurrence C_13:2144:17443: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:2144
msgctxt "text_id=17443 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「笑わせる。そんなものが魔法であるものか！」"
msgstr "\"This is supposed to be Magic?! Don't make me laugh!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:2150:17444: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2150
msgctxt "text_id=17444 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　個人限定の時間旅行―――それが蒼崎の魔法の正体などとは、橙子は思っていない。"
msgstr "  Localized time travel... Touko didn't believe that was the true nature of the Aozaki's Magic."

#. Occurrence C_13:2155:17445: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2155
msgctxt "text_id=17445 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の変化はあくまで魔法の副産物だ。"
msgstr "  Aoko's transformation had to be a mere byproduct of True Magic."

#. Occurrence C_13:2160:17446: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2160
msgctxt "text_id=17446 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法の正体、その深淵に<青子|アレ>が届いたかまでは測れないが、決して、そんな単純な奇跡ではない。"
msgstr "  She couldn't make heads or tails out of its depths even with Aoko having achieved it; at the very least, it was not so simple a miracle."

#. Occurrence C_13:2243:17447: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2243
msgctxt "text_id=17447 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜなら―――時間旅行の概念は、既に第二魔法に含まれている。"
msgstr "  After all, the concept of time travel was already made possible through the Second Magic."

#. Occurrence C_13:2248:17448: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2248
msgctxt "text_id=17448 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　記録の<改竄|かいざん>、<事象|じしょう>の書き換え等は、すなわち並行世界の運営にあたる。"
msgstr "  Record manipulation, revision of possibilities, and so forth involved the operation of parallel worlds."

#. Occurrence C_13:2253:17449: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2253
msgctxt "text_id=17449 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いまさらそんなものが第五魔法と呼ばれる筈もない。"
msgstr "  So, there was no way that could be the Fifth Magic."

#. Occurrence C_13:2295:17450: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:2295
msgctxt "text_id=17450 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「―――となると、次に出てくる疑問はこれか。"
msgstr "\"...Which brings me to my next question, Aoko!"

#. Occurrence C_13:2330:17451: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:2330
msgctxt "text_id=17451 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　青子！　貴様、その十年分の時間をどこから持ってきた！」"
msgstr "  Where the hell did you get those ten years from?!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:2560:17452: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:2560
msgctxt "text_id=17452 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あのボンクラからよ、悪い!?"
msgstr "\"From that moron outside! Gotta problem?!"

#. Occurrence C_13:2567:17453: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:2567
msgctxt "text_id=17453 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　後で返すんだから、アンタに批難される覚えはありませんけど！」"
msgstr "  I'm going to give his time back after, so don't you dare judge me!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:2607:17454: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2607
msgctxt "text_id=17454 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう、それはいい。"
msgstr "  That made sense."

#. Occurrence C_13:2612:17455: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2612
msgctxt "text_id=17455 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方的ではあるが、この時間軸での時間の総量は変わっていない。"
msgstr "  There was a bias, but the amount of time on this axis had not been changed."

#. Occurrence C_13:2617:17456: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2617
msgctxt "text_id=17456 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが―――"
msgstr "  But..."

#. Occurrence C_13:2706:17457: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:2706
msgctxt "text_id=17457 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「では、あの五分間はどうする!?"
msgstr "\"So what're you going to do with those five minutes?!"

#. Occurrence C_13:2712:17458: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:2712
msgctxt "text_id=17458 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　まさか私を始末した後、彼を元の状態に戻すのか!?」"
msgstr "  Finish me then return him to his former state: is that your plan?!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:2775:17459: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2775
msgctxt "text_id=17459 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の足が止まる。"
msgstr "  Aoko stopped in her tracks."

#. Occurrence C_13:2841:17460: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2841
msgctxt "text_id=17460 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎の魔法の矛盾と、青子の人間性の矛盾。"
msgstr "  Touko had took aim at Aoko's glaring oversight:"

#. Occurrence C_13:2891:17461: scene=C_13
#: C_13:2891
msgctxt "text_id=17461 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二つの隙が、橙子に反撃の<狼煙|のろし>をあげさせる。"
msgstr "  Aozaki Magic and Aoko's humanity were inconsistent."

#. Occurrence C_13:2996:17462: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:2996
msgctxt "text_id=17462 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そうだ。時間操作では死者の蘇生は許されない。"
msgstr "\"Yeah. You can't revive someone by manipulating time."

#. Occurrence C_13:3021:17463: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:3021
msgctxt "text_id=17463 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　おまえがしたコトは一時だけの気休めか―――」"
msgstr "  All you've done is console yourself for a moment!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:3027:17464: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3027
msgctxt "text_id=17464 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の背中の魔術刻印が、その真価を発揮する。"
msgstr "  The Magic Crests on Touko's back began to demonstrate their true worth."

#. Occurrence C_13:3032:17465: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3032
msgctxt "text_id=17465 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　刻印からの魔力提供を受け、廊下に仕込まれた最大の仕掛けが物質化する。"
msgstr "  Drawing upon the magical energy stored in the crests, she materialized her largest trap yet in the hallway."

#. Occurrence C_13:3278:17466: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:3278
msgctxt "text_id=17466 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「―――あるいは、より<罪|つみ>深い<暴虐|ぼうぎゃく>というコトだ！」"
msgstr "\"Or maybe you committed an even greater sin!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:3340:17467: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3340
msgctxt "text_id=17467 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　現れる三枚のルーン石。"
msgstr "  Three rune stones appeared."

#. Occurrence C_13:3345:17468: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3345
msgctxt "text_id=17468 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その規模も込められた魔力も、これまでのモノとはケタが違う。"
msgstr "  Their scale and level of magical energy were wildly different from the other runes."

#. Occurrence C_13:3350:17469: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3350
msgctxt "text_id=17469 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これこそ北欧の巨人の<御業|みわざ>、"
msgstr "  Created by Touko herself at the Mage's Association,"

#. Occurrence C_13:3355:17470: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3355
msgctxt "text_id=17470 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子が魔術協会で復元・分生させた、失われた“原初のルーン”のレプリカである。"
msgstr "  they were replicas of one of the lost Primordial Runes created by a Nordic giant."

#. Occurrence C_13:3381:17471: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3381
msgctxt "text_id=17471 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三枚の水晶膜は刻まれたルーンを一千万規模に膨張させる。"
msgstr "  The three thin, crystalline lenses amplified her carved runes tens of millions of times;"

#. Occurrence C_13:3386:17472: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3386
msgctxt "text_id=17472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔弾による相殺など許さない。"
msgstr "  they rendered projectiles like magic bullets ineffective."

#. Occurrence C_13:3391:17473: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3391
msgctxt "text_id=17473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の出力が橙子を遥かに上回るものだとしても、この巨石はさらに数倍。"
msgstr "  Even if Aoko's magical output far exceeded Touko's, these giant slabs were several times more powerful still."

#. Occurrence C_13:3396:17474: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3396
msgctxt "text_id=17474 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『魔力を放出する』だけの青子の魔術特性では、この呪いを防ぐ事も躱す事も出来はしない……！"
msgstr "  Aoko's signature magecraft could only release magical energy, so she had no way to defend or evade the attack!"

#. Occurrence C_13:3638:17475: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:3638
msgctxt "text_id=17475 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――<主|メ><観|イ><軸|ン>、<固定|セット>」"
msgstr "\"...<Affix subjective axis.|Main, set.>\""

#. Occurrence C_13:3644:17476: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3644
msgctxt "text_id=17476 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　短い自己暗示と、意を決する深呼吸。"
msgstr "  Pushing herself on, Aoko took a deep breath of resolve."

#. Occurrence C_13:3649:17477: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3649
msgctxt "text_id=17477 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は防ぎもせず避けもせず、ルーンの嵐へと突進する。"
msgstr "  Instead of defending or dodging, she went low and charged into the rune storm."

#. Occurrence C_13:3922:17478: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0012; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:3922
msgctxt "text_id=17478 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「貴様―――この時間軸に存在していないな!?」"
msgstr "\"Y-You don't even exist within this time axis, do you?!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:3928:17479: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3928
msgctxt "text_id=17479 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やはり、と得心しながら、橙子は魔術刻印をフル稼働させる。"
msgstr "  Infuriated by the realization, Touko set her Magic Crests to full-power."

#. Occurrence C_13:3935:17480: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3935
msgctxt "text_id=17480 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子にルーンが作用しないのは、アレが今も秒単位で時間旅行を繰り返しているからだ。"
msgstr "  Through repeated, second-long bursts of time travel, Aoko was able to avoid the runes completely."

#. Occurrence C_13:3940:17481: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3940
msgctxt "text_id=17481 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　着弾したルーンをいずこかの時間に跳ばしているのか、"
msgstr "  She was either sending the attack's impact to a different time,"

#. Occurrence C_13:3945:17482: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3945
msgctxt "text_id=17482 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それとも、何千という“<自分|たて>”を重ね着しているのか。"
msgstr "  or layering several thousands of herself atop one another."

#. Occurrence C_13:3950:17483: scene=C_13
#: C_13:3950
msgctxt "text_id=17483 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どちらにせよそんなデタラメ、魔力が続くはずがない……！"
msgstr "  Whatever. No way she could keep up that kind of magical energy output...!"

#. Occurrence C_13:4060:17484: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:4060
msgctxt "text_id=17484 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「一枚目！」"
msgstr "\"One down!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:4066:17485: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4066
msgctxt "text_id=17485 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　巨石が文字通り一蹴される。"
msgstr "  Aoko kicked the crystal slab to pieces."

#. Occurrence C_13:4071:17486: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4071
msgctxt "text_id=17486 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残りは二枚。距離にして十メートル。"
msgstr "  Two remained. Distance, thirty feet."

#. Occurrence C_13:4127:17487: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4127
msgctxt "text_id=17487 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の魔力残量は十分だ。刻印を使い果たすが、十秒は掃射を続けられる。"
msgstr "  Touko had ten seconds of magical energy left, but that was all she needed."

#. Occurrence C_13:4203:17488: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4203
msgctxt "text_id=17488 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　対する青子は、魔術師としての常識で考えるのならここで打ち止め。"
msgstr "  Aoko, on the other hand, would stop now if she had any common sense as a mage."

#. Occurrence C_13:4208:17489: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4208
msgctxt "text_id=17489 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これ以上の反則は行えまい。"
msgstr "  She couldn't continue breaking the rules for much longer."

#. Occurrence C_13:4214:17490: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4214
msgctxt "text_id=17490 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが―――反則と言うのなら、それは時間旅行の段階で反則である。"
msgstr "  Then again, time travel itself was breaking the rules."

#. Occurrence C_13:4298:17491: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:4298
msgctxt "text_id=17491 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「青子―――！」"
msgstr "\"Aoko...!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:4634:17492: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4634
msgctxt "text_id=17492 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　同じ展開が繰り返される。"
msgstr "  Once again, Aoko used the same technique."

#. Occurrence C_13:4639:17493: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4639
msgctxt "text_id=17493 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の疑念は、ここに至って憎悪に変貌した。"
msgstr "  Touko's suspicion turned into white-hot hatred."

#. Occurrence C_13:4644:17494: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4644
msgctxt "text_id=17494 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時間旅行の術式などどうでもいい。"
msgstr "  She couldn't care less about her time travel formula;"

#. Occurrence C_13:4649:17495: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4649
msgctxt "text_id=17495 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　問題はあの魔力量。"
msgstr "  it was the amount of magical energy she had."

#. Occurrence C_13:4655:17496: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4655
msgctxt "text_id=17496 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "時間旅行に必要なだけのエネルギーを、あの女はどこから捻出しているのか……？"
msgstr "Where was she pulling the energy necessary to jump through time for so long...?"

#. Occurrence C_13:4730:17497: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0014; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:4730
msgctxt "text_id=17497 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「やはりそうか。おまえは―――！」"
msgstr "\"Wait! I knew it...!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:4815:17498: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4815
msgctxt "text_id=17498 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希草十郎の死。"
msgstr "  It was the death of Soujyuro Sizuki."

#. Occurrence C_13:4820:17499: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4820
msgctxt "text_id=17499 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼を、まだ生きていた頃の五分前に戻したというが、では、その五分間はどこに行くのか。"
msgstr "  If she had brought him back five minutes to when he was still alive, where would those five minutes go?"

#. Occurrence C_13:4917:17500: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4917
msgctxt "text_id=17500 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の魔法は、世界そのものを書き換える“並行世界の運営”ではない。"
msgstr "  Aoko's Magic wasn't using parallel worlds to change this one."

#. Occurrence C_13:4922:17501: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4922
msgctxt "text_id=17501 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は『草十郎の五分間』だけを巻き戻した。"
msgstr "  She had only rewound Soujyuro's five minutes."

#. Occurrence C_13:4927:17502: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4927
msgctxt "text_id=17502 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が、それでは魔法が切れた時、彼が死体に戻るのも道理。"
msgstr "  Then, logically, he'd return to being a corpse as soon as the Magic ended."

#. Occurrence C_13:4932:17503: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4932
msgctxt "text_id=17503 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　世界を換えずに行う時間旅行では、そもそも過去を変えられない。"
msgstr "  Time travel that didn't change the world couldn't change the past."

#. Occurrence C_13:4974:17504: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4974
msgctxt "text_id=17504 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……故に。"
msgstr "  Therefore..."

#. Occurrence C_13:4979:17505: scene=C_13
#: C_13:4979
msgctxt "text_id=17505 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼を救いたいのなら死者を蘇生させるか、"
msgstr "  If she wanted to save him, she had to either truly resurrect him,"

#. Occurrence C_13:5034:17506: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5034
msgctxt "text_id=17506 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それとも―――現実にあった<五分間|エネルギー>を、このままどこにも還さず、遠い場所に<棚|たな>上げしておくしかない―――！"
msgstr "  or send those five minutes of reality somewhere far away without returning them!"

#. Occurrence C_13:5147:17507: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:5147
msgctxt "text_id=17507 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「二枚目！」"
msgstr "\"Two down!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:5153:17508: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5153
msgctxt "text_id=17508 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の進撃は止まらない。"
msgstr "  Aoko showed no sign of slowing."

#. Occurrence C_13:5158:17509: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5158
msgctxt "text_id=17509 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は憎しみをもって、最後の<巨石|まもり>の後ろで青子を睨む。"
msgstr "  From behind her crystal barrier, Touko glared at Aoko with disdain."

#. Occurrence C_13:5247:17510: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0015; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:5247
msgctxt "text_id=17510 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「答えろ青子！　貴様、彼の時間をどこにやった！"
msgstr "\"Answer me, Aoko! What did you do with his time?!"

#. Occurrence C_13:5254:17511: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0016; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:5254
msgctxt "text_id=17511 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　そこにあった熱量の帳尻を、どうやって合わせている！？」"
msgstr "  How're you going to balance all that heat?!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:5360:17512: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:5360
msgctxt "text_id=17512 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「っ、そんなの知るか！　アイツの時間なら、遥かな未来に<措|お>いてきたわよ！」"
msgstr "\"How the hell should I know?! I tossed his time somewhere into the distant future!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:5392:17513: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0017; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:5392
msgctxt "text_id=17513 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「な―――」"
msgstr "\"What...?!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:5455:17514: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5455
msgctxt "text_id=17514 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あと五メートル。"
msgstr "  Fifteen feet to go."

#. Occurrence C_13:5460:17515: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5460
msgctxt "text_id=17515 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　肉薄するデタラメに、橙子は目を<覆|おお>いたくなった。"
msgstr "  Faced with such madness, Touko wanted to cover her eyes."

#. Occurrence C_13:5465:17516: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5465
msgctxt "text_id=17516 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いま<現在|ここ>で作った負債を、未来に<措|お>いてきただと？"
msgstr "  She put the debt of the present in the distant future?"

#. Occurrence C_13:5470:17517: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5470
msgctxt "text_id=17517 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　タイムパラドックスの方がまだ人道的だ。"
msgstr "  A time paradox would've been more humane."

#. Occurrence C_13:5475:17518: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5475
msgctxt "text_id=17518 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな膨大な、無計画な熱量の消費を許してはならない。"
msgstr "  Such an enormous, haphazard consumption of heat could not be allowed."

#. Occurrence C_13:5576:17519: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5576
msgctxt "text_id=17519 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そも、時間旅行だけでも膨大なエネルギーを要する。"
msgstr "  After all, time travel alone required a massive amount of energy."

#. Occurrence C_13:5581:17520: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5581
msgctxt "text_id=17520 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここに無いものを持ってくる事にも魔力は必要だが、"
msgstr "  Magical energy was required to bring things from somewhere else;"

#. Occurrence C_13:5586:17521: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5586
msgctxt "text_id=17521 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それと同じに、ここに有るものを“無くす”事にも莫大なエネルギーが<消費|うしな>われる。"
msgstr "  at the same time, losing something that exists here consumed an incredible amount of energy."

#. Occurrence C_13:5591:17522: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5591
msgctxt "text_id=17522 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その冷却に使われた魔力はどうする？"
msgstr "  And what about the magical energy used for cooling?"

#. Occurrence C_13:5596:17523: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5596
msgctxt "text_id=17523 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　プラスにしろマイナスにしろ、それは秩序の崩壊だ。"
msgstr "  If either fell out of equilibrium, it would mean total chaos."

#. Occurrence C_13:5601:17524: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5601
msgctxt "text_id=17524 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法の作る<歪|ゆが>みは、いずれこの<宙域|ちゅういき>すべてに及ぶだろう。"
msgstr "  The distortion caused by her Magic would come to affect this entire sector of space."

#. Occurrence C_13:5648:17525: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:5648
msgctxt "text_id=17525 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ば―――バカここに極まったな！"
msgstr "\"How... How in the HELL can you be so dumb?!"

#. Occurrence C_13:5688:17526: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0019; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:5688
msgctxt "text_id=17526 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　何千億年後にくる宇宙の死滅、人類の行く末に待つ<どん詰|デッド><まり|エンド>に、さらなる負債を押しつける気か!?"
msgstr "  You're going to pile that debt onto the dead end that humanity will reach? You're going to lay it at the feet of the heat death of the universe?"

#. Occurrence C_13:5695:17527: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0020; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:5695
msgctxt "text_id=17527 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　この星の頭上に隕石を作っているようなものだぞ!?"
msgstr "  That's like hanging a world-ending meteor over the head of this planet!"

#. Occurrence C_13:5781:17528: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0021; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:5781
msgctxt "text_id=17528 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　というか、おまえの重みでこの星を押し潰す気か!?」"
msgstr "  Or are you planning on crushing the Earth under your own weight?!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:5825:17529: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:5825
msgctxt "text_id=17529 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「な―――」"
msgstr "\"What...?!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:5831:17530: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5831
msgctxt "text_id=17530 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その喩えはあんまりだ、と目をむく青子。"
msgstr "  That last comment made Aoko's eyes widen."

#. Occurrence C_13:5836:17531: scene=C_13
#: C_13:5836
msgctxt "text_id=17531 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　突き進む足も、勢いあまって床をブチ抜いていたりする。"
msgstr "  Her every step exerted such force it broke the floorboards beneath her feet."

#. Occurrence C_13:5947:17532: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:5947
msgctxt "text_id=17532 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「その時はその時で、今度は負債を過去に送ってやるわよ！　それなら文句ないんでしょう！？"
msgstr "\"I'll worry about that later! Next time I'll put the debt in the past! That better?!"

#. Occurrence C_13:5954:17533: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:5954
msgctxt "text_id=17533 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　歪みに潰されるのは過去だけなんだから！」"
msgstr "  Then only the past will be crushed by the distortion!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:6025:17534: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0022; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:6025
msgctxt "text_id=17534 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「それで解決したつもりか！？"
msgstr "\"That's your master plan?!"

#. Occurrence C_13:6031:17535: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0023; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:6031
msgctxt "text_id=17535 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　現在が確定している以上、過去を消滅させてもいいと！？"
msgstr "  Save the present by destroying the past?!"

#. Occurrence C_13:6037:17536: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0024; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:6037
msgctxt "text_id=17536 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　それでいいのは私たちだけだ！　問題の総量、宇宙の負債はどうする！？」"
msgstr "  That saves us, but what about the heat problem, and the burden on the rest of the universe?!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:6099:17537: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6099
msgctxt "text_id=17537 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――そう。"
msgstr "  Exactly."

#. Occurrence C_13:6128:17538: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6128
msgctxt "text_id=17538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　宇宙が閉じているにせよ、現在も<拡|ひろ>がっているにせよ、"
msgstr "  Even if the universe were closed, or the present were still expanding,"

#. Occurrence C_13:6133:17539: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6133
msgctxt "text_id=17539 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　消費熱量の増大は手に負えないものになる。"
msgstr "  the absurd increase in heat consumption would become uncontrollable."

#. Occurrence C_13:6153:17540: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6153
msgctxt "text_id=17540 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　際限のない広がり、"
msgstr "  That which waits for the end of infinite expansion,"

#. Occurrence C_13:6158:17541: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6158
msgctxt "text_id=17541 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　際限のない消費、"
msgstr "  infinite consumption,"

#. Occurrence C_13:6163:17542: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6163
msgctxt "text_id=17542 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　際限のない成長の末に待つモノは、希望に満ちた未来などではない。"
msgstr "  and infinite growth is a future without hope."

#. Occurrence C_13:6169:17543: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6169
msgctxt "text_id=17543 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<開闢|かいびゃく>の前の無。"
msgstr "  The nothingness before creation."

#. Occurrence C_13:6174:17544: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6174
msgctxt "text_id=17544 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いずれ宇宙は<熱的死|ねつてきし>する。"
msgstr "  Eventually the universe would burn up."

#. Occurrence C_13:6195:17545: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0025; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:6195
msgctxt "text_id=17545 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「青子の―――蒼崎の魔法は、その結末をより確かなものにするだけだ！　その責任を、おまえは―――！」"
msgstr "\"Your-I mean, the Aozaki's Magic only makes that conclusion more certain! And that's on you!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:6201:17546: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:6201
msgctxt "text_id=17546 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「言われなくても分かってる！"
msgstr "\"Don't you think I know that already?!"

#. Occurrence C_13:6207:17547: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:6207
msgctxt "text_id=17547 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　責任なんて、私が生きてる間になんとかするわよ！」"
msgstr "  I'll figure it out! As long as I live, I'll figure something out!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:6298:17548: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6298
msgctxt "text_id=17548 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残り二メートル。"
msgstr "  Five feet to go."

#. Occurrence C_13:6303:17549: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6303
msgctxt "text_id=17549 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ルーンの掃射は、もはや橙子の憎悪を宿した<熱線|ねっせん>となって突き刺さる。"
msgstr "  The rune blast, now carrying all of Touko's hatred, focused into a scorching hot laser beam."

#. Occurrence C_13:6308:17550: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6308
msgctxt "text_id=17550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その熱さに身を裂かれながらも、より強い感情で青子は地面を蹴り―――"
msgstr "  Her body being torn into by the intense heat, and her emotions raging, Aoko drove her foot into the ground..."

#. Occurrence C_13:6516:17551: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0026; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:6516
msgctxt "text_id=17551 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「責任をとると言ったな……！　では、その具体案は！？」"
msgstr "\"Oh, you'll take responsibility, will you?! How exactly?!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:6602:17552: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_13_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_13
#: C_13:6602
msgctxt "text_id=17552 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そんなの―――これから考えるに決まってるでしょう！」"
msgstr "\"I said I'd figure it out, didn't I?! Starting now!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:6659:17553: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6659
msgctxt "text_id=17553 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「―――"
msgstr "\"..."

#. Occurrence C_13:6667:17554: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_13_0027; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_13
#: C_13:6667
msgctxt "text_id=17554 | speaker=touko"
msgid "おまえは、最悪だ！」"
msgstr " You make me sick!\""

#. Occurrence C_13:6855:17555: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6855
msgctxt "text_id=17555 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――砕け散る最後の守り。"
msgstr "  Touko's last defense was shattered."

#. Occurrence C_13:6860:17556: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6860
msgctxt "text_id=17556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二人の魔術師は拳を打てば届く距離で魔術を組み上げる。"
msgstr "  Close enough to connect, the two mages unleashed their magecraft."

#. Occurrence C_13:6868:17557: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6868
msgctxt "text_id=17557 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　赤色のルーンと、青色のエーテル流。"
msgstr "  Red runes... Blue Ether..."

#. Occurrence C_13:6875:17558: scene=C_13
#: C_13:6875
msgctxt "text_id=17558 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　撃ち出された魔弾は<瀑布|ばくふ>となって、背後に浮かんだ刻印ごと、蒼崎橙子を粉砕した。"
msgstr "  In a cascade of magic bullets, Touko Aozaki's crests were torn to pieces, and so was Touko herself."

#. Occurrence C_14:80:17559: scene=C_14
#: C_14:80
msgctxt "text_id=17559 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の言った通り。"
msgstr "  It was just as Alice said."

#. Occurrence C_14:85:17560: scene=C_14
#: C_14:85
msgctxt "text_id=17560 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎が追いつく前に、決着はついていた。"
msgstr "  By the time Soujyuro arrived, it was already over."

#. Occurrence C_14:113:17561: scene=C_14
#: C_14:113
msgctxt "text_id=17561 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何十年もの風化に耐えてきた木造の校舎は、実に分かりやすく彼女たちの道行きを示していた。"
msgstr "  The old school building's wooden boards had survived the elements for decades, but they were not ready for a mage duel."

#. Occurrence C_14:118:17562: scene=C_14
#: C_14:118
msgctxt "text_id=17562 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外れて戸が開かなくなった昇降口、"
msgstr "  The entrance door hung off its hinges;"

#. Occurrence C_14:123:17563: scene=C_14
#: C_14:123
msgctxt "text_id=17563 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぎしぎしと音をたてる廊下、"
msgstr "  the floorboards groaned;"

#. Occurrence C_14:128:17564: scene=C_14
#: C_14:128
msgctxt "text_id=17564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　体重をのせれば踏み抜けそうな階段。"
msgstr "  the stairs were ready to collapse underfoot."

#. Occurrence C_14:167:17565: scene=C_14
#: C_14:167
msgctxt "text_id=17565 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それらを徹底的に破壊しながら続く逃走とその追跡は、二階の奥で終わりを告げていた。"
msgstr "  Touko's escape and Aoko's pursuit had left a trail of destruction leading all the way to the second floor."

#. Occurrence C_14:239:17566: scene=C_14
#: C_14:239
msgctxt "text_id=17566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下の突き当たり、三階に続く小階段の前。"
msgstr "  The chaos continued to the end of the hallway, by the stairs to the third floor."

#. Occurrence C_14:244:17567: scene=C_14
#: C_14:244
msgctxt "text_id=17567 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は壁に背を預けるかたちで崩れ落ちていた。"
msgstr "  Touko sat in a heap with her back against the wall."

#. Occurrence C_14:249:17568: scene=C_14
#: C_14:249
msgctxt "text_id=17568 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　傷つきながらも青子から視線は逸らさない。"
msgstr "  Despite her injuries, she kept her eyes firmly on Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_14:299:17569: scene=C_14
#: C_14:299
msgctxt "text_id=17569 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　内部出血、さらには骨折。"
msgstr "  She was bleeding internally and had multiple broken bones;"

#. Occurrence C_14:304:17570: scene=C_14
#: C_14:304
msgctxt "text_id=17570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女の<骨格|フレーム>はもう満足に動かない。"
msgstr "  she would not be moving any time soon."

#. Occurrence C_14:309:17571: scene=C_14
#: C_14:309
msgctxt "text_id=17571 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の跳び蹴りでショートしたのか、<魔眼|ひだりめ>は内部から破裂し、開かれる事はない。"
msgstr "  Possibly damaged by Aoko's flying kick, her Mystic Eyes had ruptured from within, closing them indefinitely."

#. Occurrence C_14:314:17572: scene=C_14
#: C_14:314
msgctxt "text_id=17572 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それだけの<満身|まんしん><創痍|そうい>ぶりで、呼吸を乱していないのは最後の意地か。"
msgstr "  Despite her battered and broken body, she was still breathing steadily-a testament to her stubbornness."

#. Occurrence C_14:319:17573: scene=C_14
#: C_14:319
msgctxt "text_id=17573 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目前で、無傷のまま見下ろしてくる妹に対しての。"
msgstr "  Before her stood Aoko, staring down at her, uninjured."

#. Occurrence C_14:360:17574: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:360
msgctxt "text_id=17574 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……屋上までは、<保|も>つと思っていたんだが」"
msgstr "\"Thought I could...make it to the roof.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:383:17575: scene=C_14
#: C_14:383
msgctxt "text_id=17575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自嘲ではなく、純粋な思いを橙子は口にした。"
msgstr "  Touko was not trying to be facetious; she sounded genuinely disappointed."

#. Occurrence C_14:388:17576: scene=C_14
#: C_14:388
msgctxt "text_id=17576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は冷たい視線だけを返す。"
msgstr "  Aoko responded with a cold glare."

#. Occurrence C_14:467:17577: scene=C_14
#: C_14:467
msgctxt "text_id=17577 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先ほどからまったく変わらない青色の目。"
msgstr "  Her azure eyes had not changed one bit."

#. Occurrence C_14:472:17578: scene=C_14
#: C_14:472
msgctxt "text_id=17578 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冴え<凍|こご>えるそれは、冷酷なものだとしても、どうしようもなく美しい。"
msgstr "  They were callous as ever, yet undeniably beautiful."

#. Occurrence C_14:477:17579: scene=C_14
#: C_14:477
msgctxt "text_id=17579 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は橙子には近寄らず、数歩の距離を開けて右手を差しだした。"
msgstr "  From where she stood, Aoko held her hand out toward Touko,"

#. Occurrence C_14:523:17580: scene=C_14
#: C_14:523
msgctxt "text_id=17580 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　撃ち落とした獲物に<引導|いんどう>を渡す、<射手|しゃしゅ>のように。"
msgstr "  like a hunter about to put a wounded prey out of its misery."

#. Occurrence C_14:585:17581: scene=C_14
#: C_14:585
msgctxt "text_id=17581 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　勝負はついた。"
msgstr "  The victor was decided."

#. Occurrence C_14:590:17582: scene=C_14
#: C_14:590
msgctxt "text_id=17582 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　管理地を奪いに来た魔術師は、死をもって敗北とする。"
msgstr "  The mage came to steal land and got a death sentence for her trouble."

#. Occurrence C_14:647:17583: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:647
msgctxt "text_id=17583 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_14:691:17584: scene=C_14
#: C_14:691
msgctxt "text_id=17584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不必要な沈黙。"
msgstr "  The silence was disquieting."

#. Occurrence C_14:696:17585: scene=C_14
#: C_14:696
msgctxt "text_id=17585 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　半壊した壁から差しこむ月明かりが、二人の影を廊下に映している。"
msgstr "  Moonlight peered through the demolished ceiling, illuminating the two sisters with its stare."

#. Occurrence C_14:701:17586: scene=C_14
#: C_14:701
msgctxt "text_id=17586 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先ほどまでの<馬|バ><鹿|カ><騒|さわ>ぎも既に無い。"
msgstr "  The utterly mad sibling squabble was over."

#. Occurrence C_14:707:17587: scene=C_14
#: C_14:707
msgctxt "text_id=17587 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<火花|ひばな><散|ち>る嵐は過ぎ、"
msgstr "  Now the fireworks were finished,"

msgctxt "text_id=17588 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　張り詰めた寒気だけが、旧校舎を支配している。"
msgstr "  and the cold wind had returned to claim the old school building."

#. Occurrence C_14:730:17589: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:730
msgctxt "text_id=17589 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「何か、言い残す事はある？」"
msgstr "\"Any last words?\""

#. Occurrence C_14:780:17590: scene=C_14
#: C_14:780
msgctxt "text_id=17590 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　唐突に青子は口を開けた。"
msgstr "  Aoko's voice cut through the silence."

#. Occurrence C_14:785:17591: scene=C_14
#: C_14:785
msgctxt "text_id=17591 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子はそうだな、としばし考えこむ。"
msgstr "  Touko thought for a moment,"

#. Occurrence C_14:790:17592: scene=C_14
#: C_14:790
msgctxt "text_id=17592 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　途中、コートのポケットを軽く叩き、何も入っていない音に渋い顔をした。"
msgstr "  before lightly patting her coat pocket. Nothing. She frowned."

#. Occurrence C_14:835:17593: scene=C_14
#: C_14:835
msgctxt "text_id=17593 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「…………"
msgstr "\"..."

#. Occurrence C_14:843:17594: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:843
msgctxt "text_id=17594 | speaker=touko"
msgid "最後に<一服|いっぷく>と思ったが、あいにく、おまえを待っている間に吸い切ってしまってね。"
msgstr "I thought I'd have one last smoke... but it looks like I burned through them all... while waiting for you."

msgctxt "text_id=17595 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "日本の煙草は<旨|うま>すぎていけない」"
msgstr " They're bad for me, anyway. Japanese cigarettes taste too good.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:850:17596: scene=C_14
#: C_14:850
msgctxt "text_id=17596 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の言葉に、青子はそう、と小さくうなずく。"
msgstr "  Aoko gave a small nod."

#. Occurrence C_14:856:17597: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:856
msgctxt "text_id=17597 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なかなか、常人には真似できない<遺言|ゆいごん>だったわ」"
msgstr "\"Not exactly the last words I was expecting.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:863:17598: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:863
msgctxt "text_id=17598 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「待て待て。いくら私でも、遺言まで謎かけをする気はないよ。お望み通り、敗者は敗者らしく<遠吠|とおぼ>えをあげるから聞くといい」"
msgstr "\"Wait, wait... Okay. Fine. Tough crowd. I'll give you what you want: the meaningless final cry of a loser.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:897:17599: scene=C_14
#: C_14:897
msgctxt "text_id=17599 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の声は皮肉げではあるものの、青子への敵意も憎悪もない。"
msgstr "  Touko's voice was laden with sarcasm, but not hostility or hatred."

#. Occurrence C_14:902:17600: scene=C_14
#: C_14:902
msgctxt "text_id=17600 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――おそらく。"
msgstr "  Perhaps..."

#. Occurrence C_14:907:17601: scene=C_14
#: C_14:907
msgctxt "text_id=17601 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女が報復しようとしたものは青子個人ではなく、自分と妹を取りこんだ、魔術師の家系そのものだったからだろう。"
msgstr "  Perhaps her vendetta was not directed at Aoko herself, but rather a product of two sisters born into a mage family."

#. Occurrence C_14:945:17602: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:945
msgctxt "text_id=17602 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……蒼崎の魔法が、時間旅行に端を発するものとは思わなかった。まだ事情がありそうだが、当事者ではない私には何ともね。"
msgstr "\"I never thought the Aozaki Magic would be time travel. Some kinks obviously need ironing out... but that's not really for me to say."

#. Occurrence C_14:952:17603: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:952
msgctxt "text_id=17603 | speaker=touko"
msgid "<凡夫|ぼんぷ>には分からない悩みだ、せいぜい大事に付き合っていけばいいさ。"
msgstr "What would I know anyway? Just... take it seriously, and you'll be fine."

#. Occurrence C_14:979:17604: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:979
msgctxt "text_id=17604 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　……しかし、十年経ってもソレでは先が思いやられる。有珠は何をしていたんだか」"
msgstr "  ...The fact you... took ten years to figure it out doesn't give me confidence, though. I expected more of Alice.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:1049:17605: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1049
msgctxt "text_id=17605 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「アリスにしてはよく付き合ってくれた方よ。魔術師としてはいつまでも半人前っていうのが彼女の結論。"
msgstr "\"Alice helped in her own way. She doesn't think I'll ever make a real mage, though."

#. Occurrence C_14:1116:17606: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1116
msgctxt "text_id=17606 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　―――けどまあ、そうね。"
msgstr "  Can't say I disagree."

#. Occurrence C_14:1122:17607: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1122
msgctxt "text_id=17607 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あの狼となら、いい勝負をしたんじゃない？」"
msgstr "  That wolf would've made for an interesting match.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:1162:17608: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1162
msgctxt "text_id=17608 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「うん？　あれはダメだ、敗北を知ってしまった。もう完全じゃあない。"
msgstr "\"Him...? No. He's useless now he's tasted defeat."

#. Occurrence C_14:1169:17609: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1169
msgctxt "text_id=17609 | speaker=touko"
msgid "半人前に<値|あたい>で<勝|まさ>っていようが、魔法の前には特異性を見失うだろう。"
msgstr "Before you wielded Magic, perhaps, but... he's lost himself now."

#. Occurrence C_14:1175:17610: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1175
msgctxt "text_id=17610 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ところで青子。"
msgstr "  Tell me something, Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_14:1181:17611: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1181
msgctxt "text_id=17611 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　おまえの魔法とやらは、手段か、それとも結果か？」"
msgstr "  Your Magic...is it cause, or is it effect...?\""

#. Occurrence C_14:1212:17612: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1212
msgctxt "text_id=17612 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先なのか、後なのか。"
msgstr "  Touko wanted to know if it came before, or came after."

#. Occurrence C_14:1234:17613: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1234
msgctxt "text_id=17613 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ある場所を目指す為に魔法を必要としたのか、"
msgstr "  Did Aoko need Magic to get her where she needed to go?"

#. Occurrence C_14:1239:17614: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1239
msgctxt "text_id=17614 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その場所に到達した為に魔法が出来てしまったのか。"
msgstr "  Or did she obtain Magic as a result of reaching that place?"

#. Occurrence C_14:1260:17615: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1260
msgctxt "text_id=17615 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――後よ。私は扉の前で尻尾をまいたから、じじいの思惑なんて知らないけど」"
msgstr "\"...Effect. I turned tail when I got to the door, so I never found out what that old man was thinking.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:1266:17616: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1266
msgctxt "text_id=17616 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「第一魔法と同じ経緯か。ますます業が深い。第二から第四はその場所へ到達する為に生み出されたものと聞く。"
msgstr "\"Then it was the same process as the First Magic. Even more sinful... I heard the Second through the Fourth were created to reach that place."

#. Occurrence C_14:1273:17617: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1273
msgctxt "text_id=17617 | speaker=touko"
msgid "同族嫌悪は世の常だ。いずれ第一と食い合わなければいいのだがね。"
msgstr "If opposites attract... I guess similars repulse. Better hope the First doesn't bite back."

#. Occurrence C_14:1279:17618: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0012; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1279
msgctxt "text_id=17618 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　……しかし、扉ときたか。魔法の継承とは<路|パス>の継承のようだな。ではやはり、ここに<泉|ユミル>の入り口があると？」"
msgstr "  But you reached the door, then? Which tells me Magic inheritance is similar to path inheritance. So, Ymir's Entrance was here all along.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:1316:17619: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1316
msgctxt "text_id=17619 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「北欧かぶれの貴女にとってはね。私にとってはアカシャの門と言えるものよ。"
msgstr "\"That's the Scandinavian name; I call it the Gate of Akasha."

#. Occurrence C_14:1322:17620: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1322
msgctxt "text_id=17620 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……最初からそれを狙っていたんでしょう、貴女は」"
msgstr "  ...And what you were after the whole time, correct?\""

#. Occurrence C_14:1341:17621: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1341
msgctxt "text_id=17621 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の問いに、橙子は残された命をはき出すように、ああ、と力なくうなずいた。"
msgstr "  Touko used every ounce of strength she could find to nod."

#. Occurrence C_14:1363:17622: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1363
msgctxt "text_id=17622 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……望めば手に入るというのに、何代も待つのは嫌だったんだ。"
msgstr "\"...And it was going to be mine, but I couldn't wait generations."

msgctxt "text_id=17623 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "祖父とはそれで決別したようなものだったよ。"
msgstr " That's where Grandfather and I parted ways."

#. Occurrence C_14:1373:17624: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0014; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1373
msgctxt "text_id=17624 | speaker=touko"
msgid "蒼崎に対する復讐心は、それには優先されなかった。"
msgstr "From then on, I had better things to do than chase revenge."

#. Occurrence C_14:1393:17625: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0015; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1393
msgctxt "text_id=17625 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　まあ、全ては終わった事だ。もう語る必要はない。"
msgstr "  Well... It's over now. No use talking about it anymore."

#. Occurrence C_14:1399:17626: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0016; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1399
msgctxt "text_id=17626 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　……最後に、<根源|こんげん>に触れた感想が聞きたいな」"
msgstr "  There's just one last thing to ask. What was it like touching the Root?\""

#. Occurrence C_14:1467:17627: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1467
msgctxt "text_id=17627 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　深く息を吸いこんで橙子は言った。"
msgstr "  Touko spoke after taking a deep breath."

#. Occurrence C_14:1472:17628: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1472
msgctxt "text_id=17628 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　憎しみのない<遺言|ゆいごん>。"
msgstr "  Her last words showed no trace of hatred."

#. Occurrence C_14:1477:17629: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1477
msgctxt "text_id=17629 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は答えず、右手を高々とかかげる。"
msgstr "  Aoko remained silent, as she began raising her right hand up high."

#. Occurrence C_14:1514:17630: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1514
msgctxt "text_id=17630 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　数少ない祖父の言いつけ。"
msgstr "  She recalled her grandfather's orders."

#. Occurrence C_14:1519:17631: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1519
msgctxt "text_id=17631 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法の源。"
msgstr "  The source of True Magic."

#. Occurrence C_14:1524:17632: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1524
msgctxt "text_id=17632 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<根源|こんげん>に関しての知識、<所感|しょかん>は一切<漏|も>らしてはならない。"
msgstr "  Revealing one's knowledge or impressions of the Root was strictly forbidden."

#. Occurrence C_14:1552:17633: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1552
msgctxt "text_id=17633 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、姉の最後の頼みならば、その感想ぐらいは伝えてあげるべきなのだろうか。"
msgstr "  But this was her sister's dying wish; maybe it would be okay?"

#. Occurrence C_14:1595:17634: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1595
msgctxt "text_id=17634 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……天を指すその腕が振り落とされれば、話は終わりだ。"
msgstr "  The conversation would end the moment she brought her arm down."

#. Occurrence C_14:1614:17635: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1614
msgctxt "text_id=17635 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この朽ちた建物が姉だった人の<墓標|ぼひょう>になるだろう。"
msgstr "  Then, this rotting shell of a building would become her sibling's tomb."

#. Occurrence C_14:1638:17636: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1638
msgctxt "text_id=17636 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なら素直になるべきだし、そもそも、青子は祖父の言いつけを守る気などさらさら無い。"
msgstr "  What harm could it do? And it's not like she planned to follow her grandfather's rules anyway."

#. Occurrence C_14:1687:17637: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1687
msgctxt "text_id=17637 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……白状するとね、姉さん」"
msgstr "\"...I have a confession to make.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:1735:17638: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1735
msgctxt "text_id=17638 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼い廊下に、声は響く。"
msgstr "  Aoko's voice carried through the blue hallway."

#. Occurrence C_14:1788:17639: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1788
msgctxt "text_id=17639 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――正直、ぜんっぜん分からなかったわ」"
msgstr "\"To be honest, I don't remember anything.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:1798:17640: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1798
msgctxt "text_id=17640 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんだかミもフタもない感想を告げて、落雷のように、青子は右腕を振り落とした。"
msgstr "  Aoko gave a blunt reply, and brought her arm down like a bolt of lightning."

#. Occurrence C_14:1838:17641: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1838
msgctxt "text_id=17641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……いや、落とそうとした。"
msgstr "  ...Or at least, she tried to."

#. Occurrence C_14:1859:17642: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1859
msgctxt "text_id=17642 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど腕は青子の意に反して止まり、どんなに力を入れても下げられない。"
msgstr "  Her arm wouldn't listen to her; it wouldn't budge."

#. Occurrence C_14:1884:17643: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1884
msgctxt "text_id=17643 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――何の、つもり」"
msgstr "\"What. Are you doing?\""

#. Occurrence C_14:1890:17644: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1890
msgctxt "text_id=17644 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アリスの役たたず、と内心恨みながら青子は不愉快そうに吐き捨てた。"
msgstr "  Cursing Alice, Aoko spat her question out with venom."

#. Occurrence C_14:1895:17645: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1895
msgctxt "text_id=17645 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の背後に現れて、かかげた右手を掴んでいる静希草十郎に向けて。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro materialized from behind, taking hold of her raised arm."

#. Occurrence C_14:1913:17646: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1913
msgctxt "text_id=17646 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　表情にこそでていないが、橙子も彼の乱入に驚いている。"
msgstr "  Though unable to express it, Touko was shocked to see him too."

#. Occurrence C_14:1955:17647: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:1955
msgctxt "text_id=17647 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「手、離して」"
msgstr "\"Let. Go.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:1961:17648: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1961
msgctxt "text_id=17648 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎に振り返る事も、掴まれた腕を見る事もせず、前だけを見つめて青子は言う。"
msgstr "  Without looking at him, or even at her restrained hand, Aoko spoke sternly, her eyes forward."

#. Occurrence C_14:1966:17649: scene=C_14
#: C_14:1966
msgctxt "text_id=17649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……そういえば、懐かしいあの時も、この男は唐突に現れて人形から自分をかばったんだっけ、などと思いつつ。"
msgstr "  Come to think of it, at the amusement park he appeared out of nowhere to protect her from that puppet."

#. Occurrence C_14:2003:17650: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:2003
msgctxt "text_id=17650 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「聞こえなかった？　二度はないわよ」"
msgstr "\"Are you deaf? I won't say it again.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:2020:17651: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2020
msgctxt "text_id=17651 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の声に嘘はない。"
msgstr "  She was not bluffing."

#. Occurrence C_14:2025:17652: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2025
msgctxt "text_id=17652 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　邪魔をするのなら、草十郎だろうと容赦はしない。"
msgstr "  If he interfered, even he would be given no mercy."

#. Occurrence C_14:2030:17653: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2030
msgctxt "text_id=17653 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『命だけは助けてあげる』"
msgstr "\"I've decided to let you live.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:2035:17654: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2035
msgctxt "text_id=17654 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その約束とは矛盾しているけれど、そこまでしないと草十郎には伝わらないと理解している。"
msgstr "  It would go against that promise, but he should know better."

#. Occurrence C_14:2066:17655: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2066
msgctxt "text_id=17655 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、青子のそんな鉄の意志を聞いても、草十郎は腕を掴んだまま離さない。"
msgstr "  Even so, he maintained his grip on her arm."

#. Occurrence C_14:2087:17656: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:2087
msgctxt "text_id=17656 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いい加減に……」"
msgstr "\"Do as you're...\""

#. Occurrence C_14:2107:17657: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2107
msgctxt "text_id=17657 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　離せッ……！　と青子は振り向く。"
msgstr "  As Aoko turned around,"

#. Occurrence C_14:2112:17658: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2112
msgctxt "text_id=17658 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とたん、声の続きは<喉|のど>に<詰|つ>まってしまった。"
msgstr "  the word \"told\" caught in her throat."

#. Occurrence C_14:2149:17659: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2149
msgctxt "text_id=17659 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……その<表情|かお>を、見るべきではなかったと後悔する。"
msgstr "  She immediately regretted looking at him."

#. Occurrence C_14:2154:17660: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2154
msgctxt "text_id=17660 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の腕を掴んでいる少年の顔を見て、青子は鏡だな、と痛感した。"
msgstr "  She saw herself in his expression."

#. Occurrence C_14:2191:17661: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2191
msgctxt "text_id=17661 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<悼|いた>むような哀しみ。"
msgstr "  Mournful sadness..."

#. Occurrence C_14:2196:17662: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2196
msgctxt "text_id=17662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<糾|ただ>すような怒り。"
msgstr "  Judgmental anger..."

#. Occurrence C_14:2202:17663: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2202
msgctxt "text_id=17663 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　相容れない感情に沈んだ顔は、自分の中にある都合の悪い面を連想させる。"
msgstr "  His conflicting emotions spoke to her of her own internal struggle."

#. Occurrence C_14:2261:17664: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2261
msgctxt "text_id=17664 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静かに、声もなく、意志もなく。"
msgstr "  Voicelessly, quietly, without volition."

#. Occurrence C_14:2266:17665: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2266
msgctxt "text_id=17665 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<贖|あがな>いがたい罪を問う、灰色のさびた瞳。"
msgstr "  Rustic, gray eyes, questioning a deep sin."

#. Occurrence C_14:2310:17666: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:2310
msgctxt "text_id=17666 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……言いたい事があるなら、はっきり口にしなさい。"
msgstr "\"If you've got something to say, then spit it out."

#. Occurrence C_14:2316:17667: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:2316
msgctxt "text_id=17667 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それが出来ないなら消えて」"
msgstr "  Otherwise, get out of my face.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:2341:17668: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2341
msgctxt "text_id=17668 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　態度を崩さない青子から、草十郎はそっと手をほどいた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro gently released Aoko's arm, as she maintained her resolve."

#. Occurrence C_14:2348:17669: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2348
msgctxt "text_id=17669 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりは敵と味方のように見つめ合う。"
msgstr "  They locked eyes, neither friend nor foe."

#. Occurrence C_14:2395:17670: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2395
msgctxt "text_id=17670 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　互いに口にする事はなくて、あるのは終わらない沈黙の<苦|にが>さだけ。"
msgstr "  Their bitterness clashed without words."

#. Occurrence C_14:2423:17671: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2423
msgctxt "text_id=17671 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その中で、不意に、"
msgstr "  And then suddenly..."

#. Occurrence C_14:2434:17672: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_14_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_14
#: C_14:2434
msgctxt "text_id=17672 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「人殺しは、いけない事だ」"
msgstr "\"Murder is wrong.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:2463:17673: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2463
msgctxt "text_id=17673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりにも聞き慣れた、短い言葉が告げられた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro stated in that matter-of-fact way of his with which Aoko had become all-too familiar."

#. Occurrence C_14:2495:17674: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:2495
msgctxt "text_id=17674 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_14:2500:17675: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2500
msgctxt "text_id=17675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは気持ちを形にしただけの、つまらない言葉だったけれど。"
msgstr "  His words were empty-trite even."

#. Occurrence C_14:2505:17676: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2505
msgctxt "text_id=17676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の青子には、その重さが嫌というほど分かってしまう。"
msgstr "  And yet, given her current state, they reached her."

#. Occurrence C_14:2510:17677: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2510
msgctxt "text_id=17677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いずれ忘れてしまうとしても、静希草十郎の過去を断片的に知ってしまった彼女には、本当に痛いほど理解できた。"
msgstr "  Although she would soon forget the fragments of Soujyuro's memories, they made her painfully aware of how he felt."

#. Occurrence C_14:2549:17678: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2549
msgctxt "text_id=17678 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれどうなずく事はできない。"
msgstr "  Still, she could not agree with him."

#. Occurrence C_14:2554:17679: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2554
msgctxt "text_id=17679 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　立場は逆転していくものだ。今を逃したら次は自分が追い詰められる。"
msgstr "  It would come back to bite her. If she let Touko go now, her sister would come for her again."

#. Occurrence C_14:2559:17680: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2559
msgctxt "text_id=17680 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だいたい、一度ならず二度までも殺されかけた。"
msgstr "  She had already made two attempts on her life."

#. Occurrence C_14:2564:17681: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2564
msgctxt "text_id=17681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この借りを帳消しにするほど彼女は優しくはないし、"
msgstr "  Aoko did not have it in her to forgive her sister for what she had done."

#. Occurrence C_14:2569:17682: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2569
msgctxt "text_id=17682 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なにより―――このままでは、橙子の言う通り、いつまでも半人前だ。"
msgstr "  Above all―just as Touko said―if Aoko did not change she would be a novice forever."

#. Occurrence C_14:2623:17683: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2623
msgctxt "text_id=17683 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まだ彼女は、魔術師として最初の<咎|とが>を果たしていない。"
msgstr "  She had not even won her first mage battle yet."

#. Occurrence C_14:2628:17684: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2628
msgctxt "text_id=17684 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その機会が肉親になるのなら、なにより強い決意になると青子は知っている。"
msgstr "  And she knew putting down a blood relative would require even more conviction."

#. Occurrence C_14:2696:17685: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:2696
msgctxt "text_id=17685 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「…………っ」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_14:2701:17686: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2701
msgctxt "text_id=17686 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なのに、心の中では彼の台詞が繰り返されている。"
msgstr "  Nevertheless, his words echoed over and over in her heart."

#. Occurrence C_14:2706:17687: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2706
msgctxt "text_id=17687 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……人殺しは、いけない事だ。"
msgstr "  Murder is wrong."

#. Occurrence C_14:2711:17688: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2711
msgctxt "text_id=17688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　子供じみた<率直|そっちょく>さ。その願いが彼にとってどれほど<尊|とうと>いものなのか、憎らしいほど感じ取れる。"
msgstr "  Such a childish phrase. But the earnestness with which he said it... It was enough to make her sick."

#. Occurrence C_14:2716:17689: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2716
msgctxt "text_id=17689 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを振り払うため、青子は草十郎を睨みつけた。"
msgstr "  Resisting, Aoko glowered at Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence C_14:2768:17690: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0020_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:2768
msgctxt "text_id=17690 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「だから？　"
msgstr "\"So what? "

msgctxt "text_id=17691 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "殺されたクセに、その相手まで<庇|かば>うっていうのアンタは？　"
msgstr "She just *killed* you, and you're going to protect her? "

#. Occurrence C_14:2779:17692: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0020_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:2779
msgctxt "text_id=17692 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "元気になったら懲りずにやってくる殺人鬼が相手でも見逃してやれっていうの？」"
msgstr "You're going to let her go, so she can come back and kill you again once she's recovered?\""

#. Occurrence C_14:2810:17693: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_14_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_14
#: C_14:2810
msgctxt "text_id=17693 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……まさか。そこまでいったら聖者だ。自分には、そこまでの事は言えない」"
msgstr "\"No. I don't have it in me to be a saint.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:2855:17694: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2855
msgctxt "text_id=17694 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、彼は見逃すだろう。"
msgstr "  But he would probably still let her go."

#. Occurrence C_14:2860:17695: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2860
msgctxt "text_id=17695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悪人の改心を期待するのではなく、"
msgstr "  He did not think that Touko would change."

#. Occurrence C_14:2865:17696: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2865
msgctxt "text_id=17696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悪人の人生を考慮してのものでもなく。"
msgstr "  He also did not care to rationalize her actions based on her life."

#. Occurrence C_14:2893:17697: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2893
msgctxt "text_id=17697 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ、誰かが生きている事に、感謝したいだけなのだと。"
msgstr "  He was simply thankful. Thankful that this person before him was still alive."

#. Occurrence C_14:2938:17698: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2938
msgctxt "text_id=17698 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“……じゅうぶん聖者なのよ、あなたは……！”"
msgstr "\"You seem pretty damn saintly to me!\""

#. Occurrence C_14:2944:17699: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2944
msgctxt "text_id=17699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから、それが頭にくる。"
msgstr "  That was what had made Aoko so angry."

#. Occurrence C_14:2949:17700: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2949
msgctxt "text_id=17700 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<無|む><知|ち><善良|ぜんりょう>すぎて頭にくるなんて、これでは本当にミラーハウスの焼き直しだ。"
msgstr "  His overwhelming innocence and self-righteousness enraged her, like the hall of mirrors was happening all over again."

#. Occurrence C_14:2968:17701: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2968
msgctxt "text_id=17701 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　違うのは、草十郎がそこまで固執する理由を、今の青子は知っている事。"
msgstr "  The only difference was now she knew why he was acting like this."

#. Occurrence C_14:2973:17702: scene=C_14
#: C_14:2973
msgctxt "text_id=17702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はその経緯を、今は彼女に奪われている事。"
msgstr "  It was because she had taken a part of him."

#. Occurrence C_14:3011:17703: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3011
msgctxt "text_id=17703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は、彼女とすれ違うように前に出た。"
msgstr "  He took a step forward, passing by her,"

#. Occurrence C_14:3016:17704: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3016
msgctxt "text_id=17704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自身が、決して口にしてはならない言葉と共に。"
msgstr "  saying words he knew he should not."

#. Occurrence C_14:3051:17705: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_14_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3051
msgctxt "text_id=17705 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「仕返しなら、殺された人間がやるのが筋だろう。"
msgstr "\"If it's revenge we're talking about, it seems logical that the guy who was murdered should be the one to do it."

#. Occurrence C_14:3057:17706: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_14_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3057
msgctxt "text_id=17706 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　君を止められないのは分かってる。"
msgstr "  I know I can't stop you."

#. Occurrence C_14:3064:17707: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_14_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3064
msgctxt "text_id=17707 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "だから、蒼崎がやるぐらいなら、俺がやる」"
msgstr "So I may as well do it, Aozaki.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3100:17708: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3100
msgctxt "text_id=17708 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3106:17709: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3106
msgctxt "text_id=17709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……その言葉に敗北を感じたのは、果たして誰だったのか。"
msgstr "  It was difficult to discern who was the more pathetic in all of this."

#. Occurrence C_14:3111:17710: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3111
msgctxt "text_id=17710 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二人を無言で見つめていた橙子は眠るように目蓋を閉じた。"
msgstr "  Touko, who had been staring at them the whole time, closed her other eye as if drifting off to sleep."

#. Occurrence C_14:3132:17711: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_14_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3132
msgctxt "text_id=17711 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ごめんなさい、橙子さん」"
msgstr "\"I'm sorry, Miss Touko.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3138:17712: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3138
msgctxt "text_id=17712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　歩み出る草十郎に、橙子は仕方なげに、小さくうなずいた。"
msgstr "  Knowing her fate, Touko dropped her head as best she could as he walked toward her."

#. Occurrence C_14:3191:17713: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0017; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3191
msgctxt "text_id=17713 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……そうだな。君には、それもいいかもしれない。"
msgstr "\"You know... It's better if you're the one to do it."

#. Occurrence C_14:3197:17714: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3197
msgctxt "text_id=17714 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　今は特殊な状況だから、醒めた後に君がどれほど悔やむ事になるか想像もできない。"
msgstr "  Things are... crazy right now; I can't imagine how much regret you'll feel after this all calms down."

#. Occurrence C_14:3203:17715: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0019; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3203
msgctxt "text_id=17715 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ただ、それで君の停滞は終わるだろう。晴れて<禊|みそ>ぎ落としというワケだ。純粋に祝福してあげられる。"
msgstr "  But you'll be out of purgatory. You can shake off... shake off your old self and move on."

#. Occurrence C_14:3209:17716: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0020; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3209
msgctxt "text_id=17716 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　気に食わないのは、それを決意させたのが私ではなかったという事ぐらいか」"
msgstr "  The only thing I regret is... it wasn't me who made you like this.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3241:17717: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3241
msgctxt "text_id=17717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎には分からない言葉を告げて、橙子は唇を堅く閉じた。"
msgstr "  She knew that Soujyuro could not understand. Her words hanging in the air, she closed her lips tightly..."

#. Occurrence C_14:3246:17718: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3246
msgctxt "text_id=17718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……無防備な、細い首が差し出される。"
msgstr "  ...then weakly stuck out her slender neck."

#. Occurrence C_14:3251:17719: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3251
msgctxt "text_id=17719 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さらに一歩踏みだす草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro took another step forward."

#. Occurrence C_14:3288:17720: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0023; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3288
msgctxt "text_id=17720 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3393:17721: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3393
msgctxt "text_id=17721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それより早く青子は動いた。"
msgstr "  Before he could do anything, Aoko moved."

#. Occurrence C_14:3398:17722: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3398
msgctxt "text_id=17722 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の前に回りこんで、全身に巡る魔力をすべてカットして、力のかぎり右手を振るった。"
msgstr "  Spinning in front of Soujyuro, she cut off her magical energy, and swung her hand as hard as she could."

#. Occurrence C_14:3403:17723: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3403
msgctxt "text_id=17723 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　頬を叩く乾いた音と、廊下を数歩よろめく足音。"
msgstr "  The sound of her slapping his face echoed through the hall, along with his staggering steps."

#. Occurrence C_14:3463:17724: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_14_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3463
msgctxt "text_id=17724 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……あお……崎……？」"
msgstr "\"...A-Ao-zaki...?\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3559:17725: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0024; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3559
msgctxt "text_id=17725 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「この、卑怯者―――」"
msgstr "\"You coward.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3617:17726: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3617
msgctxt "text_id=17726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　泣きそうなほど怒っている青子は、そのままくるりと草十郎に背を向ける。"
msgstr "  Tears of anger welling in her eyes, Aoko turned her back to Soujyuro,"

#. Occurrence C_14:3622:17727: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3622
msgctxt "text_id=17727 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これ以上その顔を見ていたら、本気で殺しかねないと拗ねるように。"
msgstr "  sulking, as though she would kill him as soon as she looked at him again."

#. Occurrence C_14:3643:17728: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0021; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3643
msgctxt "text_id=17728 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「他人の記憶を取り込んだ代償か。引きずられたな、青子」"
msgstr "\"That's what you get for taking another person's memories. He must've gotten inside your head, Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3649:17729: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0025; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3649
msgctxt "text_id=17729 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうよ。自分の意志を<他|ひ><人|と>に曲げられるのが、こんなに悔しいなんて、知らなかった」"
msgstr "\"Yeah. I had no idea it sucked so much to have your own will influenced by someone else.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3670:17730: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3670
msgctxt "text_id=17730 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　皮肉げな呟きに、青子はついそんな返答をしてしまった。"
msgstr "  That was about all Aoko could mutter in response."

#. Occurrence C_14:3675:17731: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3675
msgctxt "text_id=17731 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は可笑しそうに唇をつり上げる。"
msgstr "  The corners of Touko's lips curled into a grin."

#. Occurrence C_14:3718:17732: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0026; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3718
msgctxt "text_id=17732 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……何が可笑しいのよ、貴女」"
msgstr "\"What's so funny?\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3756:17733: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0022; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3756
msgctxt "text_id=17733 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「いや、おまえにも人並の情けがあるとは思っていなくてね。"
msgstr "\"Nothing. It's just... I didn't think you were capable of normal human compassion."

#. Occurrence C_14:3762:17734: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0023; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3762
msgctxt "text_id=17734 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　バカ呼ばわりは訂正しておくよ。他人の理想を<背|せ><負|お>うのに<怯|おび>えるなんて、十年経っても可愛いじゃないか」"
msgstr "  Being scared of taking on other people's burdens for ten whole years... You're not stupid, you're adorable.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3815:17735: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0027; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3815
msgctxt "text_id=17735 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――アンタね」"
msgstr "\"Now listen here―\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3865:17736: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0024; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3865
msgctxt "text_id=17736 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そう睨むな、今のは心からの賛辞だ。"
msgstr "\"Don't glare at me like that. I meant what I said."

#. Occurrence C_14:3871:17737: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0025; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3871
msgctxt "text_id=17737 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　で、私をどうする？　彼に殺させるか、それとも見逃すか？」"
msgstr "  So what's going to happen to me? Are you going to let him kill me, or let me go?\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3877:17738: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0028; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:3877
msgctxt "text_id=17738 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……仕方ないでしょ。貴女の言う通り、これが何よりの代償だったんだから」"
msgstr "\"It's not like I have a choice. Like you said, this is my reward,\""

#. Occurrence C_14:3951:17739: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3951
msgctxt "text_id=17739 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言って、青子はちらりと草十郎の顔を見た。"
msgstr "  Aoko said begrudgingly, shooting Soujyuro a sideways glance."

#. Occurrence C_14:3956:17740: scene=C_14
#: C_14:3956
msgctxt "text_id=17740 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<頬|ほほ>を<叩|たた>かれた事で緊張が解けたのか、いつもの<呆|ぼう>とした表情に戻っている。"
msgstr "  He seemed to have recovered from the slap, and his usual, absentminded look had returned."

#. Occurrence C_14:4002:17741: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4002
msgctxt "text_id=17741 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……たとえ今は過去の記憶がなくとも、深層意識に刻まれた<不文律|ふぶんりつ>は消えはしない。"
msgstr "  He may have had no memories of his past, but his morals and values were too deep to be erased."

#. Occurrence C_14:4007:17742: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4007
msgctxt "text_id=17742 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを、草十郎は自ら犯そうとした。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was trying to violate those."

#. Occurrence C_14:4012:17743: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4012
msgctxt "text_id=17743 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自己を永遠に壊し続けるであろう事を代償に。"
msgstr "  It would eat away at him forever."

#. Occurrence C_14:4017:17744: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4017
msgctxt "text_id=17744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希草十郎のためでなく、蒼崎青子を守るために。"
msgstr "  And he would be doing it not for himself but for Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_14:4052:17745: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4052
msgctxt "text_id=17745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の青子にはそれがよく解っている。"
msgstr "  Aoko understood this all too well now."

#. Occurrence C_14:4057:17746: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4057
msgctxt "text_id=17746 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから彼が『自分がやる』といった瞬間、敗北を知らされた。"
msgstr "  The moment he said he would do it was the moment he lost."

#. Occurrence C_14:4062:17747: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4062
msgctxt "text_id=17747 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは彼を見殺しにする事と同義であり―――"
msgstr "  Not stopping him would be no different than watching him die."

#. Occurrence C_14:4067:17748: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4067
msgctxt "text_id=17748 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なにより、それを許せば自分は、彼にとって命より大事な物になってしまう。"
msgstr "  And she would lose something important inside her."

#. Occurrence C_14:4088:17749: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4088
msgctxt "text_id=17749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……そんな物に、青子はなりたくはなかったのだ。"
msgstr "  Aoko did not want that to happen."

#. Occurrence C_14:4109:17750: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_14_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4109
msgctxt "text_id=17750 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……蒼崎、やっぱりその、自分の受けた傷は自分で返さないと気が済まない性格か？」"
msgstr "\"Aozaki, don't tell me you're one of those people who has to enact revenge on their own terms.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:4132:17751: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4132
msgctxt "text_id=17751 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見当違いの心配をしている草十郎から、ぷい、と青子は顔を背ける。"
msgstr "  Aoko ignored Soujyuro, who seemed to have gotten the wrong idea."

#. Occurrence C_14:4137:17752: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4137
msgctxt "text_id=17752 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あとは目前に倒れこむ橙子を、いつも通りの不機嫌そうな視線で見下ろした。"
msgstr "  Instead, she directed her scowl at Touko, who still lay collapsed in front of her."

#. Occurrence C_14:4184:17753: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0029; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4184
msgctxt "text_id=17753 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……分かったわよ。橙子、今回は見逃してあげる。"
msgstr "\"...Fine. I'll let you live this time, Touko."

#. Occurrence C_14:4190:17754: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0030; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4190
msgctxt "text_id=17754 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　けど、ただで帰れるとは思ってないわよね？」"
msgstr "  But don't think you can just come and go as you please.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:4196:17755: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4196
msgctxt "text_id=17755 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　声もなく口元に笑みを浮かべる青子を、橙子は眉をひそめて見つめた。"
msgstr "  Touko scowled at her little sister, standing smugly over her."

#. Occurrence C_14:4251:17756: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0026; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4251
msgctxt "text_id=17756 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「祖父の所に突き出すのなら、ここで引導を渡してくれ」"
msgstr "\"If you're planning on handing me over to Grandfather, you may as well kill me now.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:4258:17757: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0031; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4258
msgctxt "text_id=17757 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「まさか。私もあの人には会いたくないもの。貴女にはこのまま出ていってもらうわ。"
msgstr "\"Yeah, right. I don't want to see him, either. You're going to leave this place, though."

msgctxt "text_id=17758 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "邪魔もしないし、協会に届けも出さない。"
msgstr " I won't get in your way, or send word to the Association."

#. Occurrence C_14:4266:17759: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0032; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4266
msgctxt "text_id=17759 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　律架は私が言いふくめておくから、今回の件は私たちだけの秘密よ」"
msgstr "  I'll be reporting what happened to Ritsuka myself; this'll be our secret.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:4301:17760: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4301
msgctxt "text_id=17760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子はますます眉をひそめる。"
msgstr "  Touko's brow creased further."

#. Occurrence C_14:4306:17761: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4306
msgctxt "text_id=17761 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな都合のいい話、ある訳がない。"
msgstr "  There had to be a catch."

#. Occurrence C_14:4339:17762: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0027; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4339
msgctxt "text_id=17762 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「青子。何を企んでいる」"
msgstr "\"Aoko. What are you scheming?\""

#. Occurrence C_14:4404:17763: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0033; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4404
msgctxt "text_id=17763 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「別に。"
msgstr "\"Nothing."

msgctxt "text_id=17764 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "そのかわりに呪いをプレゼントしようと思って。今までさんざんガンドくらってきたし、おあいこでしょ？"
msgstr " Just thinking about which spell to use on you. But I won't use Gandr, no... You've tasted that one enough already."

#. Occurrence C_14:4412:17765: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0034; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4412
msgctxt "text_id=17765 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　まあ、私のはちょっと強力だけど。"
msgstr "  Yes, the curse I have in mind is a little stronger."

#. Occurrence C_14:4419:17766: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0035; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4419
msgctxt "text_id=17766 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "今後この土地に入ろうものなら、マダガスカルガエルになってもらうわ」"
msgstr "If you ever show your face around here again, you'll turn into a frog.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:4425:17767: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4425
msgctxt "text_id=17767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まるで明日の夕飯は中華にしよう、という気軽さで微笑んで、彼女は橙子へと歩み寄った。"
msgstr "  Smiling as if they had just arranged to eat Chinese food tomorrow night, Aoko walked toward Touko."

#. Occurrence C_14:4485:17768: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0028; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4485
msgctxt "text_id=17768 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「待て……！"
msgstr "\"W-Wait...!"

#. Occurrence C_14:4491:17769: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0029; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4491
msgctxt "text_id=17769 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　なんでそういうモノだけ修得してるんだ、おまえは！」"
msgstr "  Who taught you how to do something like that?!\""

#. Occurrence C_14:4497:17770: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0036; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4497
msgctxt "text_id=17770 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そりゃ師匠がアリスだもの。<偏|かたよ>るのは当然でしょ？」"
msgstr "\"My mentor was Alice, of course. She always was an odd duck, wouldn't you agree?\""

#. Occurrence C_14:4537:17771: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4537
msgctxt "text_id=17771 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　むう、と納得しつつ眉をひそめる蒼崎・姉。"
msgstr "  The elder Aozaki sister's brow knitted so hard it could have produced a sweater."

#. Occurrence C_14:4542:17772: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4542
msgctxt "text_id=17772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　妹がいつまで経っても半人前なのは、そのあたりに原因があったのかと。"
msgstr "  Perhaps this is why her sister would stay a novice forever."

#. Occurrence C_14:4590:17773: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0037; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4590
msgctxt "text_id=17773 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎、席<外|はず>して。"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro, get out of here."

#. Occurrence C_14:4596:17774: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0038; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4596
msgctxt "text_id=17774 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　覗き見が趣味なら、別に見ていってもいいけど」"
msgstr "  Unless you're a creepy pervert. Then go ahead and watch. I don't care.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:4627:17775: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4627
msgctxt "text_id=17775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言いつつ、青子は姉のコートをはぎ取りにかかる。"
msgstr "  As she spoke, she began removing her sister's overcoat."

#. Occurrence C_14:4632:17776: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4632
msgctxt "text_id=17776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子のイヤそうな目と、青子のどことなく楽しげな目が対照的で、草十郎は少しだけ悩んでしまった。"
msgstr "  The uncomfortable look in Touko's eyes compared to the strangely cheerful one in Aoko's caused Soujyuro to hesitate."

#. Occurrence C_14:4637:17777: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4637
msgctxt "text_id=17777 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はたして、このまま青子と橙子をふたりだけにしていいものか、と。"
msgstr "  Was it really okay to leave the two of them alone?"

#. Occurrence C_14:4657:17778: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4657
msgctxt "text_id=17778 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど結局、罰ゲームを思わせる姉妹の様子に草十郎はうん、と頷き、"
msgstr "  Eventually, he nodded: this was just a weird game between sisters."

#. Occurrence C_14:4670:17779: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_14_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4670
msgctxt "text_id=17779 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「覗き見は、たしかにいい趣味じゃないな」"
msgstr "\"Best not be a pervert.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:4682:17780: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4682
msgctxt "text_id=17780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつかのように呟いて、適当な空き教室へ退場した。"
msgstr "  Muttering more to himself than anything, he ducked into an empty classroom."

#. Occurrence C_14:4729:17781: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_14_0030; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4729
msgctxt "text_id=17781 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ちょっ、なんだその不細工で悪趣味な術式は……！　"
msgstr "\"H-Hey...! What kind of dumbass formula is that?! "

msgctxt "text_id=17782 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "センスがないにも程がある！　おまえ、本当に私の妹か！？」"
msgstr "Are we really related?!\""

#. Occurrence C_14:4739:17783: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_14_0039; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_14
#: C_14:4739
msgctxt "text_id=17783 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ええ。この通り、芸術的才能はぜんぶ姉貴に持っていかれた憐れな妹でして。嘆くなら自分の天才性を嘆きなさい、橙子」"
msgstr "\"Afraid so. You took all the artistic genes for yourself, without thinking about your poor little sister. If you want to blame anyone, blame yourself.\""

#. Occurrence C_14:4745:17784: scene=C_14
#: C_14:4745
msgctxt "text_id=17784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下には泣き声とも笑い声ともつかない苦悶の声が、遠吠えのように響いていった。"
msgstr "  Down the cold, dilapidated hallway, cries of sadness, joy, and anguish rang out."

#. Occurrence C_15:97:17785: scene=C_15
#: C_15:97
msgctxt "text_id=17785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　咲き乱れていた白い花々は、ひとつ、またひとつと夜空へ舞い上がっていく。"
msgstr "  Outside, the fully bloomed, white flower petals floated one by one into the night."

#. Occurrence C_15:102:17786: scene=C_15
#: C_15:102
msgctxt "text_id=17786 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<吹|ふ><雪|ぶ>く<花霞|はながすみ>の中、有珠は原初の星空を見つめていた。"
msgstr "  Standing among the ballet of petals, Alice gazed up at the sky."

#. Occurrence C_15:107:17787: scene=C_15
#: C_15:107
msgctxt "text_id=17787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　花びらは<群雲|むらくも>になって、静かに、眠るように欠けていく。"
msgstr "  The blossoms gathered into a cloud, then slowly vanished, as though falling asleep."

#. Occurrence C_15:112:17788: scene=C_15
#: C_15:112
msgctxt "text_id=17788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いずれは一輪の<華影|かえい>もなく、広場はもとの雪原に<還|かえ>るのだろう。"
msgstr "  Soon, not a single flower would remain, and the clearing would return to a snowy tundra."

#. Occurrence C_15:207:17789: scene=C_15
#: C_15:207
msgctxt "text_id=17789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法は終わり。"
msgstr "  The Magic had ended."

#. Occurrence C_15:212:17790: scene=C_15
#: C_15:212
msgctxt "text_id=17790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　過去の光景は、あと数分足らずで退場する。"
msgstr "  In a matter of minutes, the past would return to its rightful place,"

#. Occurrence C_15:217:17791: scene=C_15
#: C_15:217
msgctxt "text_id=17791 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年と少女の、行き違った時間のように。"
msgstr "  along with it the time shared between the boy and the girl."

#. Occurrence C_15:290:17792: scene=C_15
#: C_15:290
msgctxt "text_id=17792 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　旧校舎から音が<絶|た>えて<久|ひさ>しい。"
msgstr "  The old school building was still."

#. Occurrence C_15:295:17793: scene=C_15
#: C_15:295
msgctxt "text_id=17793 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は無言で待ち続ける。"
msgstr "  Alice embraced the silence and patiently waited."

#. Occurrence C_15:300:17794: scene=C_15
#: C_15:300
msgctxt "text_id=17794 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しばらくの<後|あと>、旧校舎から現れた草十郎の姿を見て、有珠は白い息をこぼした。"
msgstr "  After a while, Soujyuro emerged from the building, and Alice released a puff of white breath."

#. Occurrence C_15:306:17795: scene=C_15
#: C_15:306
msgctxt "text_id=17795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かすかな安堵をふくんだ、終わりを認める嘆息を。"
msgstr "  A small sigh of relief; it was over."

#. Occurrence C_15:355:17796: scene=C_15
#: C_15:355
msgctxt "text_id=17796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は青子を抱えてやってきた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro approached, carrying Aoko,"

#. Occurrence C_15:360:17797: scene=C_15
#: C_15:360
msgctxt "text_id=17797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背中におぶるのではなく、前に寝かせるように両手で。"
msgstr "  cradling her in his arms."

#. Occurrence C_15:382:17798: scene=C_15
#: C_15:382
msgctxt "text_id=17798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は眠っているのか、安らかな顔で目蓋を閉じていた。"
msgstr "  Was she asleep? Her eyes were closed and she seemed peaceful."

#. Occurrence C_15:387:17799: scene=C_15
#: C_15:387
msgctxt "text_id=17799 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぐったりとした、けれどしなやかな体と長い髪が、童話の眠り姫を連想させる。"
msgstr "  Her hair and limp body dangled like a silk drape; she looked just like Sleeping Beauty."

#. Occurrence C_15:423:17800: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:423
msgctxt "text_id=17800 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「待っていてくれたんだ、有珠」"
msgstr "\"So you decided to wait for us, Alice.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:429:17801: scene=C_15
#: C_15:429
msgctxt "text_id=17801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　苦もなく青子を抱える草十郎に、有珠は頷きだけで返答した。"
msgstr "  He said, holding Aoko with little effort. Alice nodded."

#. Occurrence C_15:450:17802: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:450
msgctxt "text_id=17802 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「橙子さんはどうなったの？」"
msgstr "\"What happened to Touko?\""

#. Occurrence C_15:456:17803: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:456
msgctxt "text_id=17803 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……いや。よく分からないけど、橙子さんは帰ったよ。"
msgstr "\"Uh, to be honest, I don't really know, but she's gone."

#. Occurrence C_15:462:17804: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:462
msgctxt "text_id=17804 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　蒼崎が言うにはそう簡単に解呪できない呪いをかけたから、むこう十年は三咲市には入ってこれないって。"
msgstr "  Aozaki said she placed a really strong curse on her so she wouldn't come back to Misaki for ten years."

#. Occurrence C_15:468:17805: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:468
msgctxt "text_id=17805 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　その後、橙子さんが尻尾をまくのを仁王立ちで見届けて、見えなくなったらそのまま倒れたんだ」"
msgstr "  After that she stood and watched Touko run away until she was out of sight. Then she collapsed.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:505:17806: scene=C_15
#: C_15:505
msgctxt "text_id=17806 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その光景は簡単に想像できるのか、有珠はそう、と素っ気なく応えた。"
msgstr "  Alice's response was brief, as if she was wondering if things were really so simple."

#. Occurrence C_15:510:17807: scene=C_15
#: C_15:510
msgctxt "text_id=17807 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の心配はするクセに青子の心配はこれっぽっちもしていないらしい。"
msgstr "  She seemed more concerned about Touko than Aoko,"

#. Occurrence C_15:515:17808: scene=C_15
#: C_15:515
msgctxt "text_id=17808 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子と有珠の関係そのものを、ちょっと心配してしまう草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  which made Soujyuro concerned about Alice and Aoko's relationship more than anything."

#. Occurrence C_15:551:17809: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:551
msgctxt "text_id=17809 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それはともかくとして。"
msgstr "\"Okay, well anyway,"

#. Occurrence C_15:557:17810: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:557
msgctxt "text_id=17810 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　青子はどうなっているんだろう？」"
msgstr "  what's going on with Aoko?\""

#. Occurrence C_15:563:17811: scene=C_15
#: C_15:563
msgctxt "text_id=17811 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わりとどうでもいいような口ぶりで、草十郎は寝息をたてている少女の顔を覗きこむ。"
msgstr "  He asked nonchalantly as he looked at Aoko breathing deeply in her sleep."

#. Occurrence C_15:601:17812: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:601
msgctxt "text_id=17812 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……<無順|むじゅん>と<正順|せいじゅん>を合わせているのね。"
msgstr "\"...It looks like the variables are still balancing out."

#. Occurrence C_15:607:17813: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:607
msgctxt "text_id=17813 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　彼女の時間は今の時間とは異なってしまったから、歯車を合わせるまで目は覚めないわ」"
msgstr "  Since her time diverged from our current time, she likely won't open her eyes until all the gears line up again.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:613:17814: scene=C_15
#: C_15:613
msgctxt "text_id=17814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の言葉に、なるほど、などと<胡乱|うろん>な相づちをうって、草十郎は旧校舎を振り返った。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded in understanding, very clearly still not comprehending a word Alice had just said."

#. Occurrence C_15:665:17815: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:665
msgctxt "text_id=17815 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「なんか拍子抜けしたよ。"
msgstr "\"It's a bit of an anti-climax."

#. Occurrence C_15:671:17816: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:671
msgctxt "text_id=17816 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　結局、橙子さんと蒼崎、どっちが勝ったのかよく掴めない」"
msgstr "  I can't tell if Aozaki or Miss Touko won.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:692:17817: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:692
msgctxt "text_id=17817 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……そうね。魔術師の争いには明確な点数はつけられないから。どちらが強いかで勝負はつかないわ。"
msgstr "\"...Right. Mage battles aren't always cut and dry. It's not always just about who was more powerful."

#. Occurrence C_15:698:17818: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:698
msgctxt "text_id=17818 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　橙子さんの大目的が蒼崎の魔法の解明なら、魔法を使わされた時点で青子の負けよ。"
msgstr "  If Touko's objective was to discover the Aozakis' True Magic, then Aoko lost the moment she used it."

#. Occurrence C_15:705:17819: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:705
msgctxt "text_id=17819 | speaker=alice"
msgid "……その後のいざこざは、<凱旋|がいせん>する勝者を夜道で襲ったようなものだし」"
msgstr "...Everything that happened after was merely the triumphant winner being accosted by the loser.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:725:17820: scene=C_15
#: C_15:725
msgctxt "text_id=17820 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言って、有珠は森の方角に視線を投げた。"
msgstr "  Alice said, as she turned her sights to the forest."

#. Occurrence C_15:730:17821: scene=C_15
#: C_15:730
msgctxt "text_id=17821 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが『帰りましょう』という意思表示である事は、草十郎にも読み取れた。"
msgstr "  Even Soujyuro could tell that was Alice's way of saying, \"Let's go home.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:783:17822: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:783
msgctxt "text_id=17822 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうだね。蒼崎も有珠も、このままじゃ風邪をひく。"
msgstr "\"Yeah. Let's go. At this rate, you'll both catch a cold."

#. Occurrence C_15:789:17823: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:789
msgctxt "text_id=17823 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　ああ、それと。蒼崎が橙子さんに呪いをかける時、何かしてたんだけど」"
msgstr "  Oh, I almost forgot. When Aozaki cursed Miss Touko, she did something else...\""

#. Occurrence C_15:795:17824: scene=C_15
#: C_15:795
msgctxt "text_id=17824 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わかる？　と訊きたがる草十郎に、有珠はやや作り物っぽい、いつもの無感情な視線を向けた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro trailed off, hoping Alice would tell him what it was, but a stony―and somewhat affected―gaze was her response."

#. Occurrence C_15:843:17825: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:843
msgctxt "text_id=17825 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……見たの、静希君？」"
msgstr "\"...Did you watch, Sizuki?\""

#. Occurrence C_15:849:17826: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:849
msgctxt "text_id=17826 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、蒼崎が出てけって」"
msgstr "\"No. Aozaki told me to get out.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:865:17827: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:865
msgctxt "text_id=17827 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……そう。それで、青子はどんな呪いをかけたの？」"
msgstr "\"...Good. Did she say what curse she placed on her?\""

#. Occurrence C_15:871:17828: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:871
msgctxt "text_id=17828 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「えーと、カエルがどうとか」"
msgstr "\"Umm... something about turning her into a frog.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:901:17829: scene=C_15
#: C_15:901
msgctxt "text_id=17829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の言葉に、有珠はますます顔を<曇|くも>らせる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's explanation made Alice's expression darken."

#. Occurrence C_15:906:17830: scene=C_15
#: C_15:906
msgctxt "text_id=17830 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……体を変異させる呪いなんて、青子はまだ修得していないはずなのに。"
msgstr "  Aoko was still a long way from learning any sort of polymorph spells."

#. Occurrence C_15:979:17831: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:979
msgctxt "text_id=17831 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「そ―――」"
msgstr "\"That's...\""

#. Occurrence C_15:985:17832: scene=C_15
#: C_15:985
msgctxt "text_id=17832 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　思い立って、その言葉を飲む。"
msgstr "  Her thoughts prevented her from finishing the sentence."

#. Occurrence C_15:990:17833: scene=C_15
#: C_15:990
msgctxt "text_id=17833 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう、たしかにさっきまでの彼女なら、それぐらいは知っていたかもしれない。"
msgstr "  In actuality, it was perfectly within Aoko's abilities considering where she was in time at that moment."

#. Occurrence C_15:995:17834: scene=C_15
#: C_15:995
msgctxt "text_id=17834 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうなると青子の言う通り、むこう十年は呪いの解呪はできないだろう。"
msgstr "  As Aoko had said: Touko would not be able to dispel the curse for ten years."

#. Occurrence C_15:1015:17835: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1015
msgctxt "text_id=17835 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なにしろ呪いをかけた本人が、その呪いをまだ修得していないのだ。"
msgstr "  And the Aoko of this time had not the ability to use such a curse."

#. Occurrence C_15:1020:17836: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1020
msgctxt "text_id=17836 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<回|まわ>そうにも、呪い返す相手がいない。"
msgstr "  Which meant Touko did not have anyone to rebound the curse to."

#. Occurrence C_15:1025:17837: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1025
msgctxt "text_id=17837 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いかに橙子が優れた呪いの破壊を開発しても、因にあたる<青子|あいて>がいないのでは成立しない。"
msgstr "  No matter how much she researched dispelling powerful curses, she could not do it with the Aoko of this timeline."

#. Occurrence C_15:1101:17838: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1101
msgctxt "text_id=17838 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「青子が橙子さんにつけたのは<切傷|きりきず>ぐらいだから、静希君が心配するような事はないわ。"
msgstr "\"Aoko only cut Touko a little bit. It's nothing for you to worry about."

#. Occurrence C_15:1107:17839: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1107
msgctxt "text_id=17839 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……青子にしては、ずいぶんと<生温|なまぬる>い処置だけど」"
msgstr "  I expected her to do something much worse.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1153:17840: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1153
msgctxt "text_id=17840 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わりと非道な事を言って、有珠は歩きだした。"
msgstr "  After her slightly unsettling remark, Alice quietly began to walk."

#. Occurrence C_15:1158:17841: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1158
msgctxt "text_id=17841 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎も青子を抱いたまま付いていく。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro followed her, Aoko in his arms."

#. Occurrence C_15:1171:17842: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1171
msgctxt "text_id=17842 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりは広場から出て森の中に入る。"
msgstr "  Together, they left the clearing and moved into the forest."

#. Occurrence C_15:1176:17843: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1176
msgctxt "text_id=17843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その時、不意に草十郎は足を止めた。"
msgstr "  As they did, Soujyuro abruptly froze."

#. Occurrence C_15:1223:17844: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1223
msgctxt "text_id=17844 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「…………静希君？」"
msgstr "\"...Sizuki?\" "

#. Occurrence C_15:1229:17845: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1229
msgctxt "text_id=17845 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は不思議そうに、旧校舎の広場を振り返る。"
msgstr "  He looked back toward the old school building's field with a strange expression."

#. Occurrence C_15:1329:17846: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1329
msgctxt "text_id=17846 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　眼差しは、望郷の<類|たぐい>だろうか。"
msgstr "  Was it homesickness he felt?"

#. Occurrence C_15:1334:17847: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1334
msgctxt "text_id=17847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一夜だけの、二度と見る事のない風景を<懐|なつ>かしみながらも、二度と出会えない事を<悟|さと>っている顔。"
msgstr "  Though this was only his second time seeing it, he had a nostalgic feeling... like he would never be back."

#. Occurrence C_15:1339:17848: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1339
msgctxt "text_id=17848 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　戻らない船を見送る子供のようだ。"
msgstr "  He looked like a child saying goodbye to an old toy that was to be thrown away."

#. Occurrence C_15:1345:17849: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1345
msgctxt "text_id=17849 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……その横顔に、わずかな同情を抱いている事に気付いて、有珠は自らを<戒|いまし>めた。"
msgstr "  Seeing his expression, Alice felt a hint of sympathy, and chided herself."

#. Occurrence C_15:1417:17850: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1417
msgctxt "text_id=17850 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「あの<荒地|あれち>がどうかした……？」"
msgstr "\"Something on your mind...?\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1423:17851: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1423
msgctxt "text_id=17851 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雪原に戻りかける花園を、少女は荒地と言った。"
msgstr "  She asked him, watching the flowery garden fade into a snowy field."

#. Occurrence C_15:1428:17852: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1428
msgctxt "text_id=17852 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の問いかけに、草十郎はいや、と首を振る。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro shook his head."

#. Occurrence C_15:1449:17853: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1449
msgctxt "text_id=17853 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「なんとなく知っている場所に似てる気がして。"
msgstr "\"Not really. It's just... I feel like I know that place."

#. Occurrence C_15:1455:17854: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1455
msgctxt "text_id=17854 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　おかしいな、やってきた時はそんな気はしなかったのに」"
msgstr "  It's weird, right? I didn't feel that way when I got here.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1507:17855: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1507
msgctxt "text_id=17855 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は、いつまでも名残惜しそうに雪原を見つめていた。"
msgstr "  He stood staring at the tundra for what seemed like an eternity, reluctant to leave."

#. Occurrence C_15:1512:17856: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1512
msgctxt "text_id=17856 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　放っておけば朝が来るまで、いや、朝が来ても見つめたままだろう。"
msgstr "  If she left him there, he would still be gazing at it by morning-probably even longer."

#. Occurrence C_15:1517:17857: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1517
msgctxt "text_id=17857 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……けれど、それは意味のない行為だ。"
msgstr "  But there was no point in doing that."

#. Occurrence C_15:1522:17858: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1522
msgctxt "text_id=17858 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼が恋焦がれている風景は、有珠だけが覚えているものなのだから。"
msgstr "  In the end, Alice was the only one who would remember the beautiful scenery he yearned for."

#. Occurrence C_15:1550:17859: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1550
msgctxt "text_id=17859 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……ここは、その場所にそんなに似てる？」"
msgstr "\"Does it really look that familiar?\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1556:17860: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1556
msgctxt "text_id=17860 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ぜんぜん似てない。<面影|おもかげ>すら<皆無|かいむ>だ」"
msgstr "\"Not at all. Not one bit of it.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1562:17861: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1562
msgctxt "text_id=17861 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「なら、それは気の迷いよ」"
msgstr "\"Then it's just your imagination.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1600:17862: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1600
msgctxt "text_id=17862 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　強く断定する有珠の言葉に、草十郎は静かに頷いた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded at Alice's harsh conclusion."

#. Occurrence C_15:1605:17863: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1605
msgctxt "text_id=17863 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ありえないものに焦がれるのは、もう止めようと微笑むように。"
msgstr "  He smiled slightly, deciding it was pointless to want something that did not exist."

#. Occurrence C_15:1676:17864: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1676
msgctxt "text_id=17864 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうだね。たぶん、幻を見ていたんだ。"
msgstr "\"Yeah. Maybe I saw it in a dream."

#. Occurrence C_15:1682:17865: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0016; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1682
msgctxt "text_id=17865 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……あれは一度、幸福だった時の夢だった」"
msgstr "  A dream where I was happy...\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1688:17866: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1688
msgctxt "text_id=17866 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　尽きぬ名残を断ち切って、草十郎は雪原から目を背ける。"
msgstr "  Severing the ties that bound him, Soujyuro turned his back away from the snowy clearing,"

#. Occurrence C_15:1693:17867: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1693
msgctxt "text_id=17867 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どこにも共通点のない、彼が一度だけ幸福だった野原から。"
msgstr "  away from the unfamiliar yet familiar place where he had known happiness."

#. Occurrence C_15:1746:17868: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0017; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1746
msgctxt "text_id=17868 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「さ、早く帰ろう。蒼崎は重いし、体も疲れてる。"
msgstr "\"Let's get back. I'm tired, and Aozaki's heavy."

#. Occurrence C_15:1752:17869: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0018; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1752
msgctxt "text_id=17869 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　洋館についたらあったかいお茶を淹れよう、有珠」"
msgstr "  How about we have a warm cup of tea once we're back at the mansion, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1772:17870: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1772
msgctxt "text_id=17870 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鮮やかな笑顔をうかべて、草十郎は少女の名を呼びかけた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro spoke her name with a smile."

#. Occurrence C_15:1777:17871: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1777
msgctxt "text_id=17871 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに一瞬だけ有珠は息を止めてしまう。"
msgstr "  Her heart skipped a beat."

#. Occurrence C_15:1782:17872: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1782
msgctxt "text_id=17872 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんな風に、あんまりにも自然に名を呼ばれたのはいつ以来だろう。"
msgstr "  Since when did he start saying her name so casually like that?"

#. Occurrence C_15:1787:17873: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1787
msgctxt "text_id=17873 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんとか頷き返す有珠と、歩きだす草十郎。"
msgstr "  Somehow she managed a nod, before beginning to walk again."

#. Occurrence C_15:1792:17874: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1792
msgctxt "text_id=17874 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その背中に、有珠はちょっとした疑問を投げかけてみた。"
msgstr "  As he moved away from her, she asked a small question to his back."

#. Occurrence C_15:1813:17875: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1813
msgctxt "text_id=17875 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……重いって、わたしより？」"
msgstr "\"Is she heavier than me...?\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1847:17876: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1847
msgctxt "text_id=17876 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……青子と有珠では身長差がある。"
msgstr "  Aoko was a bit taller than Alice,"

#. Occurrence C_15:1852:17877: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1852
msgctxt "text_id=17877 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の方が軽いのは当たり前のコトだろうけど、その答えを、少女は彼の口から聞いてみたかったのかも知れない。"
msgstr "  so naturally she would weigh more, but Alice wanted to hear him say it anyway."

#. Occurrence C_15:1857:17878: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1857
msgctxt "text_id=17878 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな有珠の期待にそうように、草十郎はきっぱりと口にした。"
msgstr "  Not one to disappoint, Soujyuro answered without missing a beat."

#. Occurrence C_15:1884:17879: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0019; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1884
msgctxt "text_id=17879 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ああ。数値的に言うのなら、有珠より十キロ増しぐらい」"
msgstr "\"Definitely. By about... twenty pounds.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1890:17880: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1890
msgctxt "text_id=17880 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「そう。青子が聞いてたら大変ね」"
msgstr "\"You do realize if Aoko knew you'd said that, she'd kill you.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1907:17881: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1907
msgctxt "text_id=17881 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは、後で青子に告げ口をしよう、という悪戯心を思わせる口調だった。"
msgstr "  Judging by Alice's tone, she was probably going to tell Aoko later."

#. Occurrence C_15:1928:17882: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0020; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1928
msgctxt "text_id=17882 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……意地が悪いな、有珠も。"
msgstr "\"You're kinda mean, Alice."

#. Occurrence C_15:1935:17883: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0021; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1935
msgctxt "text_id=17883 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "それに、さっきのは本人の名誉のために四捨五入してたんだぞ、いちおう」"
msgstr "Y'know, I did round down, too, just to be nice.\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1965:17884: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_15_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1965
msgctxt "text_id=17884 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_15:1971:17885: scene=C_15
#: C_15:1971
msgctxt "text_id=17885 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　弁解どころか、青子が本気で怒りかねない事実だった。"
msgstr "  His attempts at being kind had likely drawn him closer to his deathbed."

#. Occurrence C_15:1992:17886: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0022; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:1992
msgctxt "text_id=17886 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「…………ダメかな？」"
msgstr "\"...No good, huh?\""

#. Occurrence C_15:2035:17887: scene=C_15
#: C_15:2035
msgctxt "text_id=17887 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　困った顔で有珠の様子をうかがう草十郎。"
msgstr "  He asked nervously."

#. Occurrence C_15:2040:17888: scene=C_15
#: C_15:2040
msgctxt "text_id=17888 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その仕草は妙に温かで、有珠はつい、<緩|ゆる>んだ頬をかすかな笑顔に変えてしまった。"
msgstr "  Alice could not help but crack a smile at his innocence."

#. Occurrence C_15:2065:17889: scene=C_15
#: C_15:2065
msgctxt "text_id=17889 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人前で笑う事に慣れていないためか、有珠は顔を背けて森へと歩きだした。"
msgstr "  However, she was not used to smiling in front of others, so she turned away and walked into the woods."

#. Occurrence C_15:2070:17890: scene=C_15
#: C_15:2070
msgctxt "text_id=17890 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな有珠の後ろ姿を見ながら、草十郎は相変わらず見当違いの感想を口にする。"
msgstr "  From Soujyuro's perspective, she was storming off in a mood."

#. Occurrence C_15:2111:17891: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0023; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:2111
msgctxt "text_id=17891 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――なんだ。"
msgstr "\"...What?"

#. Occurrence C_15:2118:17892: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_15_0024; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_15
#: C_15:2118
msgctxt "text_id=17892 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "友達の悪口で怒るなんて、やっぱり仲はいいんじゃないか、蒼崎」"
msgstr "She must really care if she's mad at me for saying that about you, right, Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence C_15:2128:17893: scene=C_15
#: C_15:2128
msgctxt "text_id=17893 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子を抱いたまま呟いて、草十郎はしずしずと有珠の後を追っていった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro rushed to catch up with Alice, gently carrying Aoko along the way."

#. Occurrence C_15:2179:17894: scene=C_15
#: C_15:2179
msgctxt "text_id=17894 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　森の中、眠り姫に口づけする勇気もなく、助けただけでお城に帰還しようとする若い騎士。"
msgstr "  Though the prince lacked the courage to kiss the sleeping princess, he had at least saved her, and was bringing her back to her castle."

#. Occurrence C_15:2185:17895: scene=C_15
#: C_15:2185
msgctxt "text_id=17895 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　十分な活躍はした筈なのに格好がつかない彼は、そんな物語の主人公を思わせた。"
msgstr "  Despite what he had been through, he did not look like your typical hero. Still, in this story at least, he most certainly was."

#. Occurrence C_2:68:17896: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:68
msgctxt "text_id=17896 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「と、まあこういう訳だ。"
msgstr "\"Now you see."

#. Occurrence C_2:74:17897: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:74
msgctxt "text_id=17897 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ベオだけに頼ってはいない事がよく分かったろう」"
msgstr "  I don't need to rely on just Beo.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:80:17898: scene=C_2
#: C_2:80
msgctxt "text_id=17898 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　表情は冷淡なまま。勝利は<揺|ゆ>るぎないものとなったのに、橙子には喜びの笑みもない。"
msgstr "  Touko's expression was steely. Victory was in her grasp, and there was no room to rest on her laurels."

#. Occurrence C_2:129:17899: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:129
msgctxt "text_id=17899 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「姿を隠したのは鏡の応用か。"
msgstr "\"So it was the mirror that concealed you?"

#. Occurrence C_2:135:17900: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:135
msgctxt "text_id=17900 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　……探知や隔離だけでなく、援護まで行えるとはね。"
msgstr "  ...You used it to detect, capture, and act as backup. Impressive."

#. Occurrence C_2:141:17901: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:141
msgctxt "text_id=17901 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　三大のプロイには含まれないものの、汎用性の面で言えばアレも破格のプロイだな」"
msgstr "  Not quite one of the Great Three, but a very versatile, and, might I add, exceptional Ploy.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:166:17902: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:166
msgctxt "text_id=17902 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……持ち上げるじゃない。なに、騙された負けおしみ？」"
msgstr "\"Quit patronizing us. You're just upset you got duped.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:218:17903: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:218
msgctxt "text_id=17903 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「いや、ただの自画自賛だよ。"
msgstr "\"Not at all. I'm just giving credit where credit's due."

#. Occurrence C_2:224:17904: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:224
msgctxt "text_id=17904 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　なにしろ今の<鏡|バージョン>は私とマインスターの合作だ。趣味に興じすぎてあれこれと機能を足してしまったと、今更ながら悔いているところさ」"
msgstr "  It was me who worked with Meinster on the thing in the first place. I'm just kind of annoyed that someone got carried away and couldn't help but add functions to it.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:250:17905: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:250
msgctxt "text_id=17905 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「その後、青子に見せかけて私に向かってきたのは例の駒鳥。それに気を取られている間の大規模な魔術の発動。"
msgstr "\"And then the little robin, coming at me disguised as you... You used it to distract me with it while you charged up your huge attack."

#. Occurrence C_2:261:17906: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:261
msgctxt "text_id=17906 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　私の魔眼は有珠が防ぎ、青子は攻撃だけに専念する……組み立ては悪くはない。よくやったと言っておくよ」"
msgstr "  Alice avoided my Mystic Eyes while you focused on offense. Not a bad plan. Y'know, all in all, you did pretty well.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:310:17907: scene=C_2
#: C_2:310
msgctxt "text_id=17907 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一連の攻防を顧みて、所感を述べる橙子。"
msgstr "  Touko recounted their strategy, sharing her impressions as she went."

#. Occurrence C_2:315:17908: scene=C_2
#: C_2:315
msgctxt "text_id=17908 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は橙子の背後に咲いた魔術刻印に気を取られている。"
msgstr "  Aoko could not take her eyes off Touko's blooming Magic Crests."

#. Occurrence C_2:320:17909: scene=C_2
#: C_2:320
msgctxt "text_id=17909 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠だけが、橙子の言動を正確に把握していた。"
msgstr "  Only Alice was paying close attention to Touko's words."

#. Occurrence C_2:361:17910: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:361
msgctxt "text_id=17910 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「しかし、それもここまでだ。"
msgstr "\"Well, I'm afraid this is the end of the line."

#. Occurrence C_2:367:17911: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:367
msgctxt "text_id=17911 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　惜しいな青子。わずか二年であれだけの魔術を使えるのなら、あと数年もすれば一流の<射手|しゃしゅ>になっていただろうに」"
msgstr "  It's such a shame, Aoko. I can't believe you're still using such magecraft after two years. You could've become a world-class marksman.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:377:17912: scene=C_2
#: C_2:377
msgctxt "text_id=17912 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は再度指を鳴らす。"
msgstr "  Touko snapped her fingers again."

#. Occurrence C_2:382:17913: scene=C_2
#: C_2:382
msgctxt "text_id=17913 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　中空に浮かぶ刻印に、さらなる光が灯っていく―――"
msgstr "  The floating crests began to glow more brightly."

#. Occurrence C_2:425:17914: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:425
msgctxt "text_id=17914 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "“……有珠。アレは何？”"
msgstr "\"...Alice. What are those?\""

#. Occurrence C_2:431:17915: scene=C_2
#: C_2:431
msgctxt "text_id=17915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　傍らの有珠の手に触れて、青子は呼びかけた。"
msgstr "  Aoko whispered to Alice standing next to her as she held her hand."

#. Occurrence C_2:436:17916: scene=C_2
#: C_2:436
msgctxt "text_id=17916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は振り返る事さえできない。"
msgstr "  She could not risk turning around."

#. Occurrence C_2:441:17917: scene=C_2
#: C_2:441
msgctxt "text_id=17917 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子から目を離した瞬間、この戦いが終わる事を肌で感じているからだ。"
msgstr "  The second she took her eye off of Touko, the fight would be over."

#. Occurrence C_2:468:17918: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_2_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_2
#: C_2:468
msgctxt "text_id=17918 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「見ての通り、魔術刻印よ。……信じられないけど」"
msgstr "\"As you can see, they're Magic Crests... as hard as it is to believe.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:474:17919: scene=C_2
#: C_2:474
msgctxt "text_id=17919 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の声には、驚きと、不快感がこめられていた。"
msgstr "  Alice's voice was filled with shock and discomfort."

#. Occurrence C_2:479:17920: scene=C_2
#: C_2:479
msgctxt "text_id=17920 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その気持ちは青子にも理解できる。"
msgstr "  Aoko shared Alice's sentiment."

#. Occurrence C_2:484:17921: scene=C_2
#: C_2:484
msgctxt "text_id=17921 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも、魔術刻印とは各々の家系が独特の形で伝える物だ。文字である事から魔道書と同一に思われるが、その実態は大きく異なる。"
msgstr "  Magic Crests were passed down through a family line and took unique forms. At heart, they were merely personalized inscriptions, and technically no different from grimoires. However, the reality was far different."

#. Occurrence C_2:530:17922: scene=C_2
#: C_2:530
msgctxt "text_id=17922 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術には形がない。"
msgstr "  Magecraft had no set form."

#. Occurrence C_2:535:17923: scene=C_2
#: C_2:535
msgctxt "text_id=17923 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　実像がなく、再現性さえ不確かだ。"
msgstr "  Without a set shape, the ability to recreate Mystics was itself flawed."

#. Occurrence C_2:544:17924: scene=C_2
#: C_2:544
msgctxt "text_id=17924 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソレを明確な形にしようと、莫大な時間、心血を削る技術をかけたもの―――"
msgstr "  To craft it into a form required an immeasurable investment of time and devotion."

#. Occurrence C_2:550:17925: scene=C_2
#: C_2:550
msgctxt "text_id=17925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "一族の悲願と希望の結晶が、各門派の後継者の証、魔術刻印なのである。"
msgstr "Magic Crests were the crystallization of a family's desires and ambitions, and proof of a successor's lineage."

#. Occurrence C_2:570:17926: scene=C_2
#: C_2:570
msgctxt "text_id=17926 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして、刻印は単体では効果を発揮しない。"
msgstr "  Crests had no effects on their own,"

#. Occurrence C_2:575:17927: scene=C_2
#: C_2:575
msgctxt "text_id=17927 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一族の先端にいるモノ。"
msgstr "  but they were the ultimate symbol of a family."

#. Occurrence C_2:580:17928: scene=C_2
#: C_2:580
msgctxt "text_id=17928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　刻印を身に宿し、いずれ自身も刻印の一部になる事を覚悟した魔術師がいなければ、そもそも意味を見失う。"
msgstr "  If no mage was willing to imbue themselves with a crest, or lacked the resolve to merge with it, then the crest's meaning was lost."

#. Occurrence C_2:601:17929: scene=C_2
#: C_2:601
msgctxt "text_id=17929 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔道書との最大の違いはそこだ。"
msgstr "  That was the key difference between a crest and a mere spellbook."

#. Occurrence C_2:606:17930: scene=C_2
#: C_2:606
msgctxt "text_id=17930 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　刻印は写本した所で意味はないし、分け与える事もできない。"
msgstr "  Crests could not be shared, and imitating them was pointless."

#. Occurrence C_2:611:17931: scene=C_2
#: C_2:611
msgctxt "text_id=17931 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　故に。"
msgstr "  It only stood to reason, then,"

#. Occurrence C_2:616:17932: scene=C_2
#: C_2:616
msgctxt "text_id=17932 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の背後に出現している刻印が他人の写しだとしても、本来の持ち主にしか<恩恵|おんけい>はないのだが―――"
msgstr "  that even if the crests manifesting behind Touko belonged to someone else, only the original owner could benefit from them."

#. Occurrence C_2:769:17933: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:769
msgctxt "text_id=17933 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "“でも、たしかに私の魔弾はあの刻印からの魔術で<弾|はじ>かれた。……あれは、もしかすると”"
msgstr "\"Those crests have to be what's deflecting my magic bullets. Don't tell me, she's...\""

#. Occurrence C_2:775:17934: scene=C_2
#: C_2:775
msgctxt "text_id=17934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見えない物を必死に見るように、青子は目を細めて橙子を見つめる。"
msgstr "  Searching for answers, Aoko squinted her eyes as she glared at Touko."

#. Occurrence C_2:780:17935: scene=C_2
#: C_2:780
msgctxt "text_id=17935 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　刻印をコピーしても意味はない。"
msgstr "  She knew that copying a crest had no purpose."

#. Occurrence C_2:785:17936: scene=C_2
#: C_2:785
msgctxt "text_id=17936 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　刻印は受け継いだ後継者でなければ発動できない。"
msgstr "  Only the original inheritor could invoke one."

#. Occurrence C_2:790:17937: scene=C_2
#: C_2:790
msgctxt "text_id=17937 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――なら、それは―――"
msgstr "  There was only one possible conclusion."

#. Occurrence C_2:875:17938: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_9000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:875
msgctxt "text_id=17938 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……そう。"
msgstr "\"...I see."

#. Occurrence C_2:875:17939: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_9000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:875
msgctxt "text_id=17939 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　肌に刻まず中空に浮かべてるのは、そういう事……」"
msgstr "  If they aren't inscribed on your skin and just floating in the air...\""

#. Occurrence C_2:881:17940: scene=C_2
#: C_2:881
msgctxt "text_id=17940 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不快だ、と吐き捨てる青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko spat a curse at her sister."

#. Occurrence C_2:886:17941: scene=C_2
#: C_2:886
msgctxt "text_id=17941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は理解の早い敵に、満足してうなずいた。"
msgstr "  Touko nodded, pleased at her enemies' quick wit."

#. Occurrence C_2:939:17942: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:939
msgctxt "text_id=17942 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ああ、この体には合わないのでな、私の背後の空間に固定している。"
msgstr "\"The crests didn't suit my body, so I fixed them to the space behind me."

#. Occurrence C_2:946:17943: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0012; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:946
msgctxt "text_id=17943 | speaker=touko"
msgid "本当はね、おまえたちのように肉に刻んだほうがいいんだ。魔術の起動が一動作で済むんだから。"
msgstr "Of course crests like yours that are engraved into the flesh are much better, because they can be activated in one go."

#. Occurrence C_2:952:17944: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:952
msgctxt "text_id=17944 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　だが実際に使用するのなら、こうするしかない」"
msgstr "  For me, though, this was the only way.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:979:17945: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0014; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:979
msgctxt "text_id=17945 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「起動までの手順は一つ増えるが、なに、マイナスばかりでもない。所詮は他人事なんでね、<痛|・><み|・><は|・><ま|・><っ|・><た|・><く|・><感|・><じ|・><な|・><い|・>」"
msgstr "\"And while I do need to perform an extra step to activate them, they're not mine, so I don't feel any pain.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:999:17946: scene=C_2
#: C_2:999
msgctxt "text_id=17946 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは肉体的なものであり、精神的なものだろう。"
msgstr "  And it seemed neither physically, nor mentally."

#. Occurrence C_2:1029:17947: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1029
msgctxt "text_id=17947 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子とて姉の非人間性を知ってはいたが、ここまでのものとは予想していなかった。"
msgstr "  Aoko knew her sister was inhuman, but she never thought she would go this far."

#. Occurrence C_2:1055:17948: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1055
msgctxt "text_id=17948 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ふん、合うワケないじゃない。他人の魔術刻印を<剥|は>がしてるんだから、血筋の照合からして馴染むはずがないわ。"
msgstr "\"...Hmph. Well, you're right about them not suiting you. You stole them from someone else, so your bloodline can never match up."

#. Occurrence C_2:1066:17949: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1066
msgctxt "text_id=17949 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　―――で。"
msgstr "  Which means..."

#. Occurrence C_2:1073:17950: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1073
msgctxt "text_id=17950 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "奪われた連中は死ぬ事もできず、今もどこかに<幽閉|いかされ>ているワケだ。刻印の持ち主が死んだら起動すらできないものね、それ」"
msgstr "The person or persons you stole them from can't die, so you must be have them locked up somewhere. If they died, you couldn't activate their crests.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:1150:17951: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_2_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1150
msgctxt "text_id=17951 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「―――橙子さん、貴女―――」"
msgstr "\"Touko, you...\" "

#. Occurrence C_2:1187:17952: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0015; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1187
msgctxt "text_id=17952 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「非難される覚えはないんだが。"
msgstr "\"I don't remember anyone complaining."

#. Occurrence C_2:1194:17953: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0016; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1194
msgctxt "text_id=17953 | speaker=touko"
msgid "私はかかる火の粉を払っただけだよ。向こうから戦いを挑んできたんだから、戦利品ぐらいは用意してもらわないと。"
msgstr "They were asking for it. They should've been better prepared if they wanted to face me."

#. Occurrence C_2:1205:17954: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0017; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1205
msgctxt "text_id=17954 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　まあ、中にはつまらない単語を口にした馬鹿者もいるが、それはそれだ。"
msgstr "  There were some rather rude fools who used questionable language."

#. Occurrence C_2:1231:17955: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1231
msgctxt "text_id=17955 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　むしろ優しいと思うけどね。私を殺しに来た連中を、わざわざ生かしてあげてるんだから」"
msgstr "  But I think I've been quite kind really. They came to kill me, and I let them live.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:1260:17956: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1260
msgctxt "text_id=17956 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「は。その魔術師たちがちゃんと<人|・><間|・><の|・><カ|・><タ|・><チ|・>をしてる事を祈るわ、肉親として」"
msgstr "\"Really? As a fellow mage, I only hope they're okay.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:1333:17957: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0019; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1333
msgctxt "text_id=17957 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「おまえね、私をなんだと思ってるんだ。"
msgstr "\"You're probably wondering what I've done to them."

#. Occurrence C_2:1380:17958: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0020; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1380
msgctxt "text_id=17958 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　脳だけ保存とか、面倒だから百人ひとまとめにした肉塊とか、そんな手抜きなんぞするものか！"
msgstr "  'Has she preserved their brains? Or maybe she's just lumped them all into a ball of flesh?' As if I'd do that!"

#. Occurrence C_2:1386:17959: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0021; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1386
msgctxt "text_id=17959 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　きちんとカフェを用意して、食事も娯楽も睡眠も自由に提供してるんだぞ？　中には“一生ここで暮らしたい！”なんて騒ぎ立てる莫迦もいるぐらいだ！」"
msgstr "  I built them a café, and provided plenty of food, entertainment, sleep, and freedom! Some of them even said they wanted to live like that forever!\""

#. Occurrence C_2:1469:17960: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1469
msgctxt "text_id=17960 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……どこまで信じていいものか微妙な返答だったが、橙子の刻印がコピーではなく本物である事は真実だ。"
msgstr "  Touko's words were hardly believable, but it was clear her crests weren't copies."

#. Occurrence C_2:1474:17961: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1474
msgctxt "text_id=17961 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はますます眉をひそめる。"
msgstr "  Alice's scowl deepened."

#. Occurrence C_2:1479:17962: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1479
msgctxt "text_id=17962 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜなら、その行為自体にあまり意味がない。"
msgstr "  What Touko had described had no discernible benefit in her mind."

#. Occurrence C_2:1484:17963: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1484
msgctxt "text_id=17963 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他者の刻印を奪い、自分用に加工するのはたいへんな手間だったろう。"
msgstr "  Why had she gone to the trouble of stealing other mages' crests?"

#. Occurrence C_2:1530:17964: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1530
msgctxt "text_id=17964 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな事をしている時間があるなら、刻印を材料にして模造品を造った方がはるかに効率がいい。"
msgstr "  It would have been more efficient to break down the crests into components and make replicas."

#. Occurrence C_2:1535:17965: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1535
msgctxt "text_id=17965 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他の魔術師ならいざ知らず、卓越した人形師である橙子なら、刻印を利用してより強力な人形を造れただろう。"
msgstr "  For a skilled puppet master like Touko, she could have made a much more powerful puppet with those crests."

#. Occurrence C_2:1540:17966: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1540
msgctxt "text_id=17966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　刻印の持ち主である魔術師以上の、自分の命令通りに動く人形を。"
msgstr "  It would have made a pawn loyal to her every command at that, much more useful than any enslaved mage."

#. Occurrence C_2:1585:17967: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_2_9000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1585
msgctxt "text_id=17967 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……なんで、そんな事を」"
msgstr "\"...Why, Touko?\""

#. Occurrence C_2:1607:17968: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1607
msgctxt "text_id=17968 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そういう人なのよ、姉貴は。これで行く、と決めたらそれしか目に入らない人なの。過程より結果の人なの。"
msgstr "\"That's Touko for you. Once she decides to do something, that's it. Everything's a means to an end."

#. Occurrence C_2:1622:17969: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1622
msgctxt "text_id=17969 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……ある日の話よ。テレビでピザのＣＭをやっててさ、私たちは唐突にあのデブ<食|しょく>を食べたくなった。"
msgstr "  ...Listen to this: one time, we were watching TV and a pizza commercial came on. We both *really* wanted to eat something greasy."

#. Occurrence C_2:1629:17970: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1629
msgctxt "text_id=17970 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "でも悲しいかな、一般家庭であるうちにあったのはサラミだけ」"
msgstr "Unfortunately, our super-boring family only had the pepperoni.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:1657:17971: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1657
msgctxt "text_id=17971 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「うちの実家、山奥にあるの知ってるでしょ？"
msgstr "\"You know my house was on the top of a big hill, right?"

#. Occurrence C_2:1663:17972: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1663
msgctxt "text_id=17972 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　町まで行くのに一時間はかかる。中学一年だった私は我慢できなくて町まで行ったけど、ピザ屋なんか一軒もなくてとぼとぼ帰ったの」"
msgstr "  Getting to the city took an hour. But I just had to have that pizza, so I walked it. Could I find a pizza place? Nope! So I walked home empty-handed.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:1691:17973: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1691
msgctxt "text_id=17973 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　田舎町の悲劇だった。"
msgstr "  It was the tragedy of living in the countryside."

#. Occurrence C_2:1696:17974: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1696
msgctxt "text_id=17974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　回転寿司がようやくできた三咲町において、ピザ屋の台頭はあと二年待たねばならない。"
msgstr "  Misaki, which had only recently gotten a conveyor belt sushi restaurant, would not see a pizzeria for another two years."

#. Occurrence C_2:1782:17975: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1782
msgctxt "text_id=17975 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なのに。"
msgstr "\"Then when I got home, hungry and tired..."

#. Occurrence C_2:1789:17976: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1789
msgctxt "text_id=17976 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "骨折り損で家に帰ったら、姉貴のヤツ、おかえりー、とか手を振ってピザ食べてやがったのよ……！"
msgstr "my damn sister waved at me, all 'Welcome back!' with a big slice of pizza hanging out of her stupid face!"

#. Occurrence C_2:1795:17977: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1795
msgctxt "text_id=17977 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　お<煎餅|せんべい>を下地にしてみたわー、とか言って。"
msgstr "  She was like, 'I tried using rice crackers as a base.'"

#. Occurrence C_2:1801:17978: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1801
msgctxt "text_id=17978 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　外みたら鶏三羽と牛一頭まるまる消えてて、ああ、この女には等価交換とか手間とかお金の問題とか、そういうの一切頭にないんだって思い知らされたわ！」"
msgstr "  When I looked outside, three chickens and one cow were gone. That's when I realized she had no concept of the value of money, hard work, or fairness!\""

#. Occurrence C_2:1848:17979: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1848
msgctxt "text_id=17979 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはそれで凄い事だと思う有珠であった。"
msgstr "  Alice agreed that was pretty crazy."

#. Occurrence C_2:1921:17980: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1921
msgctxt "text_id=17980 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そんな無茶な奴だから、ガンド撃ちで目に見える傷跡を出そうなんて、平気で考えるのよね。"
msgstr "\"Stupid crap like that means I'm perfectly fine with putting a hole through her chest with a Gandr Shot."

#. Occurrence C_2:1927:17981: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_2_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_2
#: C_2:1927
msgctxt "text_id=17981 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あんなの、ゲマトリア一節分の詠唱で同じ効果を出せるのに、あくまで呪術にこだわるから空も飛べない人形になるのよ、バカ姉貴っ！」"
msgstr "  I mean she could've just chanted a single verse from the Gematria to get the same effect, but nooo, she was so obsessed with curses she made a puppet that couldn't even fly!\""

#. Occurrence C_2:1980:17982: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1980
msgctxt "text_id=17982 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分そっくりに造られた人形を思いだし、ここぞとばかりに怒鳴る青子。"
msgstr "  The thought of the puppet doppelgänger made her blood boil."

#. Occurrence C_2:1985:17983: scene=C_2
#: C_2:1985
msgctxt "text_id=17983 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今にして思えば、あれは彼女への痛烈な嫌味だったからだ。"
msgstr "  It was clear to Aoko now that Touko had done it on purpose to annoy her."

#. Occurrence C_2:2004:17984: scene=C_2
#: C_2:2004
msgctxt "text_id=17984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の<罵倒|ばとう>に、橙子の細い眉が微かに動く。"
msgstr "  Touko furrowed her eyebrows at Aoko's verbal assault."

#. Occurrence C_2:2009:17985: scene=C_2
#: C_2:2009
msgctxt "text_id=17985 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今まで表情のなかった橙子だが、自慢の人形をけなされて気分をいたく害したらしい。"
msgstr "  She had been stoic up until now, but speaking rudely about her prized puppet was crossing the line."

#. Occurrence C_2:2044:17986: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0023; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:2044
msgctxt "text_id=17986 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……その人形に追い詰められたのはおまえだったね。"
msgstr "\"If I recall, that puppet had you on the ropes."

#. Occurrence C_2:2050:17987: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0024; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:2050
msgctxt "text_id=17987 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　それと、数<値変換|ゲマトリア>式はカバラの秘術だ。私はルーン専門だから、おまえのように広く浅く知識を広める気はないよ。"
msgstr "  And for your information, Gematria numerology is a Kabbalah secret. I'm a rune specialist, so I don't need to learn anything and everything like you do."

#. Occurrence C_2:2088:17988: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0025; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:2088
msgctxt "text_id=17988 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　―――まあ、もっとも。"
msgstr "  ...Well, I did learn something."

#. Occurrence C_2:2095:17989: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0026; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:2095
msgctxt "text_id=17989 | speaker=touko"
msgid "この刻印の所有者の一人から、ケルトの結界を教わりはしたがね」"
msgstr "One owner of these crests taught me about Celtic Bounded Fields.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:2115:17990: scene=C_2
#: C_2:2115
msgctxt "text_id=17990 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は左後方の刻印に視線を向ける。"
msgstr "  Touko looked to the crest over her left shoulder."

#. Occurrence C_2:2120:17991: scene=C_2
#: C_2:2120
msgctxt "text_id=17991 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こうしている今も光り輝いている刻印。"
msgstr "  Its shine was ever-radiant,"

#. Occurrence C_2:2125:17992: scene=C_2
#: C_2:2125
msgctxt "text_id=17992 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは、たえず何らかの魔術を行使している証だ。"
msgstr "  proving that its magecraft was active."

#. Occurrence C_2:2184:17993: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0027; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:2184
msgctxt "text_id=17993 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「これは『城』で祖父を封じこめるのに使っていてね。"
msgstr "\"I used this 'castle' to seal away Grandfather."

#. Occurrence C_2:2190:17994: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0028; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:2190
msgctxt "text_id=17994 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　半人半妖のドルイド僧を閉じこめた塔……とまではいかないが―――そうだな、私では郵便ポストぐらいの大きさが限界か。"
msgstr "  I trapped that half-yokai druid-monk in a tower. Well, I say 'tower,' but it's closer to a mailbox in size."

#. Occurrence C_2:2202:17995: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0029; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:2202
msgctxt "text_id=17995 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ほら、むかし<青子|おまえ>が壊した赤いポスト。ちょうどあれぐらいの可愛い鳥小屋だよ。"
msgstr "  Like that red mailbox you broke, remember? About that big, but it's a cute little birdcage."

#. Occurrence C_2:2209:17996: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0030; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:2209
msgctxt "text_id=17996 | speaker=touko"
msgid "人間ひとり分を仕舞うには窮屈だろうが、祖父は肉体というより霊体に近い。見様によっては、そっちの方が相応しいかもしれないね」"
msgstr "A bit cramped for one person, but Grandfather's more spirit than body, so I guess it's more appropriate for him anyway.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:2234:17997: scene=C_2
#: C_2:2234
msgctxt "text_id=17997 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<陰鬱|いんうつ>な笑いをかみ殺しながら、橙子は淡々と説明する。"
msgstr "  Touko stifled a sinister laugh, her explanation chilling."

#. Occurrence C_2:2239:17998: scene=C_2
#: C_2:2239
msgctxt "text_id=17998 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　常に冷静な彼女だが、祖父に対しては感情を<抑|おさ>えきれないらしい。"
msgstr "  Her cold veneer seemed to slip slightly when it came to her grandfather,"

#. Occurrence C_2:2273:17999: scene=C_2
#: C_2:2273
msgctxt "text_id=17999 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが<鬱積|うっせき>した憎悪である事は、彼女の笑みを見れば明らかだった。"
msgstr "  her smile betraying the long festering hatred she still clung to."

#. Occurrence C_2:2294:18000: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0031; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:2294
msgctxt "text_id=18000 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そういった訳でね、先の青子の魔術を防いだので、この刻印もしばらくは使用不能なんだ。"
msgstr "\"Anyway, because I blocked your attack, I can't use this crest for a while."

#. Occurrence C_2:2332:18001: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0032; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:2332
msgctxt "text_id=18001 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　今のが本当の魔法だったなら、わずか三行の刻印では打ち消せなかっただろうに。青子。おまえは<僅差|きんさ>で負けたんだ。恥じる事はないよ。"
msgstr "  Though, if you'd used True Magic, a three-line crest wouldn't have countered it. You only lost by a slight margin, Aoko. You should be proud."

#. Occurrence C_2:2344:18002: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0033; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:2344
msgctxt "text_id=18002 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　じゃあそろそろ終わりにしよう。"
msgstr "  Right then, let's wrap this up."

#. Occurrence C_2:2350:18003: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_2_0034; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_2
#: C_2:2350
msgctxt "text_id=18003 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　抵抗をするのは自由だが、ベオ相手にそれは辛いぞ」"
msgstr "  Feel free to fight back, but remember you're against Beo.\""

#. Occurrence C_2:2411:18004: scene=C_2
#: C_2:2411
msgctxt "text_id=18004 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぱちん、と橙子の左手が鳴る。"
msgstr "  Touko snapped her fingers one more time."

#. Occurrence C_2:2416:18005: scene=C_2
#: C_2:2416
msgctxt "text_id=18005 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　旧校舎に<潜|ひそ>む黄金の人狼。"
msgstr "  The golden werewolf was hiding in the old school building."

#. Occurrence C_2:2421:18006: scene=C_2
#: C_2:2421
msgctxt "text_id=18006 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼を呼び出す合図は、森に<木霊|こだま>するように長く響いた。"
msgstr "  The signal to him echoed eerily through the surrounding woods."

#. Occurrence C_2:2426:18007: scene=C_2
#: C_2:2426
msgctxt "text_id=18007 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その残響が消えるより早く、青子は背後にいる有珠へ叫ぶ。"
msgstr "  Before the echo stopped, Aoko shouted back at Alice."

#. Occurrence C_3:39:18008: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:39
msgctxt "text_id=18008 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「行って、有珠！」"
msgstr "\"Alice, go!\""

#. Occurrence C_3:84:18009: scene=C_3
#: C_3:84
msgctxt "text_id=18009 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<叱咤|しった>に近い指示に、有珠は無言で従った。"
msgstr "  The order sounded like a reprimand, but Alice silently obeyed."

#. Occurrence C_3:89:18010: scene=C_3
#: C_3:89
msgctxt "text_id=18010 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子と対峙する青子を残し、有珠はためらう事なく森へと<踵|きびす>を返す。"
msgstr "  Without hesitation, she left Aoko behind to handle Touko, and made for the forest."

#. Occurrence C_3:109:18011: scene=C_3
#: C_3:109
msgctxt "text_id=18011 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……敗北が決定的になった以上、ふたり一緒に殺される愚だけは犯せない。"
msgstr "  ...If defeat was inevitable, it would be pointless for both of them to die."

#. Occurrence C_3:114:18012: scene=C_3
#: C_3:114
msgctxt "text_id=18012 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どちらかが生き延びれば三度目の正直もある。"
msgstr "  If one of them could survive, there could be a round three."

#. Occurrence C_3:119:18013: scene=C_3
#: C_3:119
msgctxt "text_id=18013 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その為に犠牲になるのは自分の役割だと青子は判断したのだ。"
msgstr "  That was why Aoko decided to be the sacrificial pawn."

#. Occurrence C_3:180:18014: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:180
msgctxt "text_id=18014 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "『……橙子自身の切札も分かったし、有珠が本調子になれば勝てない相手じゃないものね……』"
msgstr "\"Now we know what Touko's trump card is, if Alice can get back to normal, she'll stand a chance...\""

#. Occurrence C_3:188:18015: scene=C_3
#: C_3:188
msgctxt "text_id=18015 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　走り去る有珠の足音を聞きながら、青子は少しだけ残念そうに呟いた。"
msgstr "  Aoko muttered bitterly to herself as Alice's feet crunched through the snow."

#. Occurrence C_3:193:18016: scene=C_3
#: C_3:193
msgctxt "text_id=18016 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……惜しいのは自分の死ではなく、有珠が橙子を打ち負かす瞬間が見られない事だけ。"
msgstr "  Instead of cursing her own death, she cursed the fact she would not see Alice defeat Touko."

#. Occurrence C_3:198:18017: scene=C_3
#: C_3:198
msgctxt "text_id=18017 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それ以外に何を無念に思う事があるだろうか。"
msgstr "  For what else was there to curse except this."

#. Occurrence C_3:218:18018: scene=C_3
#: C_3:218
msgctxt "text_id=18018 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠が森へと消えていく。"
msgstr "  Alice disappeared into the forest."

#. Occurrence C_3:223:18019: scene=C_3
#: C_3:223
msgctxt "text_id=18019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを背中で感じながら、青子は橙子を睨み続ける。"
msgstr "  Feeling her fellow mage's presence fade, Aoko continued to glare at her sister."

#. Occurrence C_3:254:18020: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:254
msgctxt "text_id=18020 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……いつまで焦らす気？"
msgstr "\"...How long do you plan to drag this out?"

#. Occurrence C_3:254:18021: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:254
msgctxt "text_id=18021 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私、待たされるのは好きじゃないんだけど」"
msgstr "  You know I hate it when people make me wait.\""

#. Occurrence C_3:272:18022: scene=C_3
#: C_3:272
msgctxt "text_id=18022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　合図はされたものの、人狼の姿はない。"
msgstr "  Speaking of waiting, the werewolf Touko had called was nowhere to be seen."

#. Occurrence C_3:277:18023: scene=C_3
#: C_3:277
msgctxt "text_id=18023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの怪物なら一分とかからず、旧校舎から飛んでくるだろうに、と。"
msgstr "  It should not have taken him more than a few seconds to come flying out of the old school building."

#. Occurrence C_3:298:18024: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_3_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_3
#: C_3:298
msgctxt "text_id=18024 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そう急くな。いま赤ずきんを追っているところだ。"
msgstr "\"What's the big hurry? He's after Little Red Riding Hood for the time being."

#. Occurrence C_3:304:18025: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_3_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_3
#: C_3:304
msgctxt "text_id=18025 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　黒帽子の彼女をそう喩えるのは、やや無理があるがね」"
msgstr "  Or rather, 'Little Black Hat,' to force the metaphor.\""

#. Occurrence C_3:348:18026: scene=C_3
#: C_3:348
msgctxt "text_id=18026 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　皮肉げに響く橙子の声。"
msgstr "  Her tone reeked of irony."

#. Occurrence C_3:375:18027: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:375
msgctxt "text_id=18027 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_3:380:18028: scene=C_3
#: C_3:380
msgctxt "text_id=18028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　校庭で流れる、関わりのない放送みたいだ。"
msgstr "  The words traveled aimlessly across the school yard like a rambling announcement."

#. Occurrence C_3:400:18029: scene=C_3
#: C_3:400
msgctxt "text_id=18029 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は呆然と立ちつくす。"
msgstr "  Aoko stood frozen and dumbfounded."

#. Occurrence C_3:419:18030: scene=C_3
#: C_3:419
msgctxt "text_id=18030 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の橙子の言葉を、青子は<忘我|ぼうが>する事で、現実ではないと聞き流し―――"
msgstr "  Everything Touko was saying seemed so far away from reality."

#. Occurrence C_3:473:18031: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:473
msgctxt "text_id=18031 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「有珠―――！」"
msgstr "\"Alice...!\""

#. Occurrence C_3:479:18032: scene=C_3
#: C_3:479
msgctxt "text_id=18032 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誤魔化しきれるはずもなく、青子は背後を振り返った。"
msgstr "  Aoko was done with being fooled, so she turned around."

#. Occurrence C_3:484:18033: scene=C_3
#: C_3:484
msgctxt "text_id=18033 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……夜の森は白雪のおかげで、月明かりだけでも十分に遠くを見通せた。"
msgstr "  The moonlight shining off of the fallen snow allowed her to see far into the forest."

#. Occurrence C_3:489:18034: scene=C_3
#: C_3:489
msgctxt "text_id=18034 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その真白い闇の中から、ひとりの少年が歩いてくるのが見てとれる。"
msgstr "  From the white darkness, a lone boy came into view, walking toward her."

#. Occurrence C_3:542:18035: scene=C_3
#: C_3:542
msgctxt "text_id=18035 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の胸より背の低い少年は、自分より大きな<有珠|ひとかげ>を肩にかけて歩いていた。"
msgstr "  He could not have been any taller than Aoko's chest, but he carried Alice over his shoulder with ease."

#. Occurrence C_3:547:18036: scene=C_3
#: C_3:547
msgctxt "text_id=18036 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年は無造作に有珠の体を投げ捨てる。"
msgstr "  As if she was nothing, he tossed her body upward."

#. Occurrence C_3:601:18037: scene=C_3
#: C_3:601
msgctxt "text_id=18037 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　放られた有珠は、数メートルもの放物線を描いて、青子の目前に落下する。"
msgstr "  She arched through the air for several feet before dropping head first before Aoko's eyes."

#. Occurrence C_3:606:18038: scene=C_3
#: C_3:606
msgctxt "text_id=18038 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　頭から。ごきりと、首の骨を折るように。"
msgstr "  Her neck would snap on impact."

#. Occurrence C_3:749:18039: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:749
msgctxt "text_id=18039 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――っ！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence C_3:755:18040: scene=C_3
#: C_3:755
msgctxt "text_id=18040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やめたほうがいいのに、と思いつつ青子は有珠を受けとめた。"
msgstr "  Even though she was wiser not to, Aoko reached out and caught her."

#. Occurrence C_3:760:18041: scene=C_3
#: C_3:760
msgctxt "text_id=18041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の軽い体が何倍にもなって両腕にのし掛かる。"
msgstr "  Alice's light body weighed heavy as she fell into Aoko's arms."

#. Occurrence C_3:781:18042: scene=C_3
#: C_3:781
msgctxt "text_id=18042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……縫合したばかりの傷が、容赦なく開いていく。"
msgstr "  The stitches on her wounds tore,"

#. Occurrence C_3:786:18043: scene=C_3
#: C_3:786
msgctxt "text_id=18043 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　受けとめた両腕が赤い。"
msgstr "  dyeing Aoko's arms crimson."

#. Occurrence C_3:791:18044: scene=C_3
#: C_3:791
msgctxt "text_id=18044 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぬらりとした血の感触と激痛に、青子は歯を食いしばって耐えた。"
msgstr "  Aoko gritted her teeth, fighting the pain that shot through her body and the sensation of the warm blood."

#. Occurrence C_3:847:18045: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:847
msgctxt "text_id=18045 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「有珠、無事……？」"
msgstr "\"Alice, are you still...?\""

#. Occurrence C_3:853:18046: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_C_3_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=C_3
#: C_3:853
msgctxt "text_id=18046 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_3:859:18047: scene=C_3
#: C_3:859
msgctxt "text_id=18047 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　返事はないものの、意識はあるようだ。"
msgstr "  Alice did not respond, but Aoko could see she was at least conscious."

#. Occurrence C_3:864:18048: scene=C_3
#: C_3:864
msgctxt "text_id=18048 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は森に入ったところで人狼の奇襲を受けたのだろう。"
msgstr "  The werewolf must have ambushed her right after she ran into the woods."

#. Occurrence C_3:869:18049: scene=C_3
#: C_3:869
msgctxt "text_id=18049 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　昨夜、狼に切り裂かれた腹部は、青子と同じように血で<滲|にじ>んでいた。"
msgstr "  Alice bled heavily from where the wolf tore her abdomen open last night, just like he had done to Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_3:890:18050: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:890
msgctxt "text_id=18050 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……はじめから、森に<潜|ひそ>ませていたとはね」"
msgstr "\"You were hiding in the woods this entire time.\""

#. Occurrence C_3:930:18051: scene=C_3
#: C_3:930
msgctxt "text_id=18051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　チ、と自分の浅はかさを呪いながら、有珠の体をそっと下ろす。"
msgstr "  Cursing her own carelessness, she gently lay Alice's body down."

#. Occurrence C_3:935:18052: scene=C_3
#: C_3:935
msgctxt "text_id=18052 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の視線は目前の敵―――金髪の少年に向けられている。"
msgstr "  She set her sights on the blond-haired boy-her new target,"

#. Occurrence C_3:978:18053: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:978
msgctxt "text_id=18053 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「つまり、あれよね。"
msgstr "\"So that's how it is, huh?"

#. Occurrence C_3:984:18054: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:984
msgctxt "text_id=18054 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　甘く見ていたフリで、初めから、余裕なかったんだ」"
msgstr "  A wolf in a little boy's clothing.\""

#. Occurrence C_3:1047:18055: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1047
msgctxt "text_id=18055 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の怒気を受けても、少年はうす笑いを崩さない。"
msgstr "  Even in the face of Aoko's rage, he did not stop smirking."

#. Occurrence C_3:1052:18056: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1052
msgctxt "text_id=18056 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女たちを見つめる瞳は<爛|らん>と輝き、明らかに、この後の惨劇を待ち焦がれている風だ。"
msgstr "  He stared back at the girls, eyes gleaming, twinkling with excitement at the brutality to come."

#. Occurrence C_3:1057:18057: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1057
msgctxt "text_id=18057 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜目にも鮮やかな金髪とグリーンの瞳、"
msgstr "  The blond hair and green eyes she saw last night"

#. Occurrence C_3:1062:18058: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1062
msgctxt "text_id=18058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年というよりは少女に見える顔立ちも、"
msgstr "  and his effeminate features now"

#. Occurrence C_3:1068:18059: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1068
msgctxt "text_id=18059 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "今はそういうカタチをしただけの、違う星の生き物としか思えない―――"
msgstr " seemed ethereal, like he had changed into a being from another planet."

#. Occurrence C_3:1134:18060: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_3_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_3
#: C_3:1134
msgctxt "text_id=18060 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ベオ。今日は喰っていいぞ」"
msgstr "\"You'll feast tonight, Beo.\""

#. Occurrence C_3:1140:18061: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1140
msgctxt "text_id=18061 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　遠くから響く、橙子の短い声。"
msgstr "  Touko's voice echoed from afar."

#. Occurrence C_3:1145:18062: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1145
msgctxt "text_id=18062 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年は小さく笑ったように見えた。"
msgstr "  The boy's grin broadened."

#. Occurrence C_3:1150:18063: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1150
msgctxt "text_id=18063 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、まさか。"
msgstr "  Nobody could have expected what came next."

#. Occurrence C_3:1253:18064: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1253
msgctxt "text_id=18064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこで青子が<自|・><分|・>から少年に走り出すなど、誰に予想できただろうか。"
msgstr "  Aoko rushed head first at the boy."

#. Occurrence C_3:1313:18065: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1313
msgctxt "text_id=18065 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　足跡だけの駒鳥より早く、両手から赤い血を地面にこぼしながら、青子は少年へと疾走する。"
msgstr "  Faster than the robin decoy, she sped, blood dripping from both arms."

#. Occurrence C_3:1318:18066: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1318
msgctxt "text_id=18066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は予想外の展開に目を見張り、"
msgstr "  Touko watched wide-eyed at the spectacle."

#. Occurrence C_3:1323:18067: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1323
msgctxt "text_id=18067 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地面に寝かされた有珠は<虚|うつ>ろな目で見守る事しかできない。"
msgstr "  Alice could only look on with vacant eyes, as she lay helplessly on the ground."

#. Occurrence C_3:1328:18068: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1328
msgctxt "text_id=18068 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼の少年とて、今まで獲物としか思っていなかった<雌鹿|めじか>の反撃に意表を突かれていた。"
msgstr "  The werewolf boy was caught off guard by the prey becoming predator."

#. Occurrence C_3:1448:18069: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1448
msgctxt "text_id=18069 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　六メートルもの間合いを一気に詰めて、青子は片足で雪原をダン、と踏み付けた。"
msgstr "  Aoko crossed a twenty-foot gap in a second before planting a foot in the snow."

#. Occurrence C_3:1453:18070: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1453
msgctxt "text_id=18070 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　停止と回転軸を兼ねた踏みこみ。"
msgstr "  It arrested her momentum and pivoted her body like a top."

#. Occurrence C_3:1458:18071: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1458
msgctxt "text_id=18071 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　攻撃意図を瞬時に悟るも、少年の跳び退きは間に合わない。"
msgstr "  Even if he instantly understood what was coming, the boy wouldn't be able to dodge in time."

#. Occurrence C_3:1536:18072: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:1536
msgctxt "text_id=18072 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――首！」"
msgstr "\"...The neck!\""

#. Occurrence C_3:1542:18073: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1542
msgctxt "text_id=18073 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　片足が、走った勢いもそのままに跳ね上がる。"
msgstr "  Using the momentum from her sprint, she pushed her leg into the ground and sprang up."

#. Occurrence C_3:1547:18074: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1547
msgctxt "text_id=18074 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年の首を狙った回し蹴りは弧を描いて、この上ないタイミングで少年の<延髄|えんずい>に<炸裂|さくれつ>した。"
msgstr "  With deadly timing, her roundhouse kick swung in a wide ark toward the boy's neck, sending an explosion of force to his brain stem."

#. Occurrence C_3:1624:18075: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1624
msgctxt "text_id=18075 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔力によって強化された白兵術式。"
msgstr "  It was an expert display of martial arts, strengthened by magical energy."

#. Occurrence C_3:1629:18076: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1629
msgctxt "text_id=18076 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人形との戦いでコツを掴んだ青子の、この森の痩せた木なら<粉砕|ふんさい>しかねない、強烈な一撃だった。"
msgstr "  She'd gotten the hang of close combat while fighting Touko's puppets. The violent kick was powerful enough to shatter a tree trunk."

#. Occurrence C_3:1678:18077: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1678
msgctxt "text_id=18077 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年は動かない。"
msgstr "  The boy did not move."

#. Occurrence C_3:1683:18078: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1683
msgctxt "text_id=18078 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして青子も、右足を首に直撃させたまま止まっていた。"
msgstr "  Aoko's right shin connected firmly, and stopped."

#. Occurrence C_3:1724:18079: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:1724
msgctxt "text_id=18079 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_3:1730:18080: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1730
msgctxt "text_id=18080 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　首筋が、<戦慄|せんりつ>で凍りついている。"
msgstr "  A shockwave rippled through his neck."

#. Occurrence C_3:1735:18081: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1735
msgctxt "text_id=18081 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの人形を破壊したのと同等の手応え。"
msgstr "  It was the same feedback Aoko had felt when she destroyed the puppet."

#. Occurrence C_3:1740:18082: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1740
msgctxt "text_id=18082 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　倒せないまでも、首の骨にダメージを与えた筈だ。"
msgstr "  Even if he wasn't defeated, she had to have severely damaged his spine."

#. Occurrence C_3:1747:18083: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1747
msgctxt "text_id=18083 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう確信した青子の思い上がりを正すように、少年は眉すら動かさず、目前の青子を見つめていた。"
msgstr "  As she looked at him to confirm her kill, the boy simply stared back at her, not even bothering to twitch an eyebrow."

#. Occurrence C_3:1782:18084: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_3_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_3
#: C_3:1782
msgctxt "text_id=18084 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「……ふーん。お姉さんの右足は、たしか噛み切った方だ。"
msgstr "\"Hmph. That must be the leg I bit."

#. Occurrence C_3:1788:18085: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_3_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_3
#: C_3:1788
msgctxt "text_id=18085 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　それで首を狙ったのは、すごいよね。女の人は本能的に自分の体を<庇|かば>うものだって、トーコさんは言ってたのに。"
msgstr "  I can't believe you went for my neck like that. I mean, wow. Miss Touko said that girls instinctively try to spare their own bodies."

#. Occurrence C_3:1794:18086: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_3_0002; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_3
#: C_3:1794
msgctxt "text_id=18086 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　けど残念、せっかくの勇気も無駄でした。ボクの体毛の質は、<こ|・><の|・><姿|・>でも変わらない。うぶ毛だけでも、お姉さんの蹴りを受けとめる事はできる」"
msgstr "  It was a valiant move, but you wasted it. My hair is as strong as when I'm a wolf. Even my peach fuzz can stop your kick.\""

#. Occurrence C_3:1814:18087: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1814
msgctxt "text_id=18087 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　痛みがあるのは青子の方だけ。"
msgstr "  The only one hurt between the two was Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_3:1819:18088: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1819
msgctxt "text_id=18088 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　延髄を蹴った足の<脛|すね>は、まるで斧で切り落とされたように、感覚というものがない―――"
msgstr "  The leg she had lodged in his neck was totally numb, like it had been chopped clean off with a hatchet."

#. Occurrence C_3:1840:18089: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_3_0003; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_3
#: C_3:1840
msgctxt "text_id=18089 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「それに、少しだけ迷いがあったな。くっつけたばっかりの足だから庇ったでしょ？"
msgstr "\"You held back a bit, too, right? You wanted to protect your leg, I guess."

#. Occurrence C_3:1847:18090: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_3_0004; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_3
#: C_3:1847
msgctxt "text_id=18090 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　人間がボクの相手をするなら、そんなこと気にしちゃいけないのに。"
msgstr "  Humans need to forget that kinda thing when fighting me."

#. Occurrence C_3:1853:18091: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_3_0005; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_3
#: C_3:1853
msgctxt "text_id=18091 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　ああ、でも―――」"
msgstr "  Still...\""

#. Occurrence C_3:1859:18092: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1859
msgctxt "text_id=18092 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の驚愕を浴びながら少年は笑う。"
msgstr "  The boy smiled, basking in Aoko's shock and awe."

#. Occurrence C_3:1864:18093: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1864
msgctxt "text_id=18093 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　足は戻せない。"
msgstr "  She could not free her leg."

#. Occurrence C_3:1870:18094: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1870
msgctxt "text_id=18094 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "たぶん地面に下ろした瞬間、自分が腹から裂かれると青子は予測してしまい―――"
msgstr "No doubt as soon as she regained her footing, he would tear her stomach open."

#. Occurrence C_3:1913:18095: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_3_0006; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_3
#: C_3:1913
msgctxt "text_id=18095 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「どっちにしろミンチだから、気にしても仕方がないよね？」"
msgstr "\"...Well, you're mincemeat anyway, so I guess it doesn't matter.\""

#. Occurrence C_3:1942:18096: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_3_0007; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_3
#: C_3:1942
msgctxt "text_id=18096 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ほら、もったいない。せっかく治ったばかりなのに」"
msgstr "\"See? What a waste. And it just healed up, too.\""

#. Occurrence C_3:1955:18097: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1955
msgctxt "text_id=18097 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年の指らしきものが、右足に食いこんだ事が、青子にはよく判らなかった。"
msgstr "  Aoko was not sure, but it felt like he had sunk his finger into the flesh of her right leg."

#. Occurrence C_3:1975:18098: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1975
msgctxt "text_id=18098 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もともと少年の言うとおり、右足には感覚なんてほとんどなかったのだ。"
msgstr "  He was right about her leg; she barely had any feeling in it."

#. Occurrence C_3:1980:18099: scene=C_3
#: C_3:1980
msgctxt "text_id=18099 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の一撃で完全に麻痺した足は、またも<凄惨|せいさん>な運命を繰り返したらしい。"
msgstr "  It had been completely paralyzed after the last attack, and was now back in the same horrid state."

#. Occurrence C_3:2027:18100: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2027
msgctxt "text_id=18100 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……ただ、今回は千切られる事なく、骨まで握られた。"
msgstr "  Except this time, instead of being torn to pieces, it had been crushed to the bone."

#. Occurrence C_3:2032:18101: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2032
msgctxt "text_id=18101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　感覚はないけれど、<夥|おびただ>しい血の量と、<無惨|むざん>にやせこけた自分の足の<醜|みにく>さが、目に痛い。"
msgstr "  Her leg might have been numb, but just the look of it was enough to horrify her. The way it was crumpled... All that blood..."

#. Occurrence C_3:2037:18102: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2037
msgctxt "text_id=18102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　普通なら出血量だけでショック死。"
msgstr "  Any normal person would have died from shock."

#. Occurrence C_3:2084:18103: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2084
msgctxt "text_id=18103 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術刻印というものは、こういう時に残酷よね、と他人事のように青子は思う。"
msgstr "  As if thinking about someone else, Aoko considered how cruel Magic Crests could be."

#. Occurrence C_3:2138:18104: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_3_0008; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_3
#: C_3:2138
msgctxt "text_id=18104 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「あれ？　まだ目が死んでない。"
msgstr "\"Huh? Still some life in your eyes."

#. Occurrence C_3:2157:18105: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_3_0009; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_3
#: C_3:2157
msgctxt "text_id=18105 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　……あんまり苦しめたくないんだけど。ガンジョウなのも考え物だよ、お姉さん」"
msgstr "...I don't really wanna torture you. You should drop the tough act.\""

#. Occurrence C_3:2163:18106: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2163
msgctxt "text_id=18106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年の手が、青子の胸に<放|はな>たれる。"
msgstr "  The boy thrust his hand out at Aoko's chest."

#. Occurrence C_3:2185:18107: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2185
msgctxt "text_id=18107 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　胸の中心に刺さった<杭|くい>―――いや、少年の拳の痛みに、青子の意識が消えかかる。"
msgstr "  Her consciousness flickered from the sudden pain of a stake- no, a child's fist piercing her torso."

#. Occurrence C_3:2255:18108: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2255
msgctxt "text_id=18108 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……飛んでいる。"
msgstr "  The scenery flew by."

#. Occurrence C_3:2260:18109: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2260
msgctxt "text_id=18109 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　中身のない空気人形のように、自分の体が飛んでいるのが分かる。"
msgstr "  She soared through the air, like a rag doll tossed away by a bored child."

#. Occurrence C_3:2265:18110: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2265
msgctxt "text_id=18110 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先ほどの有珠と同じように大きく空中に放られて、青子は背中から地面に落ちた。"
msgstr "  Just like Alice a moment ago, she tumbled through the air and hit the ground, hard."

#. Occurrence C_3:2393:18111: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2393
msgctxt "text_id=18111 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　潰された右足と、胸に残る拳の衝撃。"
msgstr "  Her right leg was crushed; her chest caved in."

#. Occurrence C_3:2399:18112: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:2399
msgctxt "text_id=18112 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「っ―――、…………！」"
msgstr "\"Hngh...!\""

#. Occurrence C_3:2404:18113: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2404
msgctxt "text_id=18113 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　満足な呼吸はできず、心臓をえぐり取られたとしか思えない痛みに、視界が点滅する。"
msgstr "  It was as if her heart had been scooped out of her chest; each gasp of breath left her wanting more."

#. Occurrence C_3:2409:18114: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2409
msgctxt "text_id=18114 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目から火が出るとはこういう事か。"
msgstr "  Was this what it was like to see stars?"

#. Occurrence C_3:2422:18115: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2422
msgctxt "text_id=18115 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　恐ろしいのは痛みがまったく<薄|うす>れないこと。"
msgstr "  The terrifying part was the pain; it never let up."

#. Occurrence C_3:2427:18116: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2427
msgctxt "text_id=18116 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無惨にあえぐ青子の胸には、いまも拳大の、杭の感覚が残っている―――"
msgstr "  Desperately trying to suck in oxygen, she could still feel his fist."

#. Occurrence C_3:2502:18117: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2502
msgctxt "text_id=18117 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……少年はゆっくりと、雪原に殴り飛ばされた青子に近寄っていく。"
msgstr "  ...Leisurely the boy strolled across the snow toward Aoko's broken body,"

#. Occurrence C_3:2507:18118: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2507
msgctxt "text_id=18118 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　唇を舐める赤い舌。"
msgstr "  his red tongue gliding over his lips."

#. Occurrence C_3:2512:18119: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2512
msgctxt "text_id=18119 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　喜びに<濁|にご>った目が、呼吸すら精一杯の<獲物|あおこ>を見つめている。"
msgstr "  He stared at his prey, who was desperately trying to breathe. His eyes filled with glee."

#. Occurrence C_3:2572:18120: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:2572
msgctxt "text_id=18120 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "“―――、―――…………”"
msgstr "\"-, -...\""

#. Occurrence C_3:2578:18121: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2578
msgctxt "text_id=18121 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう、ここで意識を失ってしまおうか、なんて甘さを青子はかみ砕く。"
msgstr "  Aoko bit down the temptation to drift away."

#. Occurrence C_3:2583:18122: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2583
msgctxt "text_id=18122 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……けれど、頑張ってどうなるのか。"
msgstr "  Even though she could find no reason to fight on."

#. Occurrence C_3:2588:18123: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2588
msgctxt "text_id=18123 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　落下した背中は雪に助けられたが、拳を受けた胸の<陥没|かんぼつ>と、潰された右足が、容赦なく生命を奪っていく。"
msgstr "  The snow had broken her fall slightly, but her death was all but certain-the fist-sized crater in her chest, and her mangled leg made sure of that."

#. Occurrence C_3:2643:18124: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2643
msgctxt "text_id=18124 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分がスクラップみたいに壊れてしまったと分かるのに、"
msgstr "  Even though she knew she was a broken mess,"

#. Occurrence C_3:2648:18125: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2648
msgctxt "text_id=18125 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうして今も、必死に痺れた心臓を蘇生させようと、魔術刻印を回しているのか。"
msgstr "  ...her Magic Crests frantically worked to resuscitate her heart. But why...?"

#. Occurrence C_3:2762:18126: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:2762
msgctxt "text_id=18126 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "“―――ぁ…………、れは”"
msgstr "\"Wh―\""

#. Occurrence C_3:2844:18127: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2844
msgctxt "text_id=18127 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　絶望的な状況で青子の意識を繋ぎ止めていたのは、遠くで<佇|たたず>む橙子の姿だった。"
msgstr "  The sight of Touko in the distance... was the only thing that kept her conscious."

#. Occurrence C_3:2864:18128: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2864
msgctxt "text_id=18128 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……橙子は、たしかに驚いている。"
msgstr "  Her sister looked... surprised, for some reason."

#. Occurrence C_3:2869:18129: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2869
msgctxt "text_id=18129 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何か意外な物を見たような、彼女らしからぬ思考停止。"
msgstr "  Like she was witnessing some strange phenomenon. That wasn't like her."

#. Occurrence C_3:2874:18130: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2874
msgctxt "text_id=18130 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが何であるかが気になって、青子はいまだ意識を保っていた。"
msgstr "  Wondering what it was, Aoko tried to stay conscious."

#. Occurrence C_3:2910:18131: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_3_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_3
#: C_3:2910
msgctxt "text_id=18131 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "“…………な、に？”"
msgstr "\"...Wh-What's... happening...?\""

#. Occurrence C_3:2929:18132: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2929
msgctxt "text_id=18132 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　沈みかける顔を起こして、橙子の視線の先を見る。"
msgstr "  Feebly trying to raise her head, she looked to where Touko was staring."

#. Occurrence C_3:2934:18133: scene=C_3
#: C_3:2934
msgctxt "text_id=18133 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いったい、この絶対的な勝利の状況で、あの女を驚かせる物とは何なのだろう、と。"
msgstr "  Why did she look like that when she was so close to victory?"

#. Occurrence C_4:87:18134: scene=C_4
#: C_4:87
msgctxt "text_id=18134 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　胸の<鼓動|おと>が平常時より高い。"
msgstr "  His heart was beating faster than normal."

#. Occurrence C_4:93:18135: scene=C_4
#: C_4:93
msgctxt "text_id=18135 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<千々|ちぢ>に乱れていく思考を、彼は慎重に抑えつける。"
msgstr "  The fragmented and disturbing images kept returning, and he desperately pushed them to the back of his mind."

#. Occurrence C_4:128:18136: scene=C_4
#: C_4:128
msgctxt "text_id=18136 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心を弱める雑念。"
msgstr "  They were thoughts that shook his resolve."

#. Occurrence C_4:133:18137: scene=C_4
#: C_4:133
msgctxt "text_id=18137 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　寄り道でしかない不要な意識を、できるだけ見えない<左脳|ところ>に整理する。"
msgstr "  He did his best to file them away into an unseen corner of his consciousness."

#. Occurrence C_4:182:18138: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_4_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_4
#: C_4:182
msgctxt "text_id=18138 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_4:188:18139: scene=C_4
#: C_4:188
msgctxt "text_id=18139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呼吸が速いのも、力が入っているのも、<偏|ひとえ>に自分の責任だ。"
msgstr "  Right now, he could only focus on controlling his breathing and his exertion."

#. Occurrence C_4:193:18140: scene=C_4
#: C_4:193
msgctxt "text_id=18140 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は努めて、冷静であれと繰り返す。"
msgstr "  Just stay calm, he repeated to himself."

#. Occurrence C_4:234:18141: scene=C_4
#: C_4:234
msgctxt "text_id=18141 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　教会を出てからここまで、一秒も止まらなかった。"
msgstr "  He had not stopped for a second since leaving the church,"

#. Occurrence C_4:239:18142: scene=C_4
#: C_4:239
msgctxt "text_id=18142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここからはどうだろう。"
msgstr "  even without giving a thought to what he would do next."

#. Occurrence C_4:281:18143: scene=C_4
#: C_4:281
msgctxt "text_id=18143 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　信号が多い。"
msgstr "  So many traffic lights..."

#. Occurrence C_4:286:18144: scene=C_4
#: C_4:286
msgctxt "text_id=18144 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人が多い。"
msgstr "  So many people..."

#. Occurrence C_4:291:18145: scene=C_4
#: C_4:291
msgctxt "text_id=18145 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　タクシーを使うのも手ではあるが、クリスマスの街は混みあっている。"
msgstr "  It was Christmas. There was no way he would find a taxi."

#. Occurrence C_4:297:18146: scene=C_4
#: C_4:297
msgctxt "text_id=18146 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "だいたいタクシー待ちが多すぎる。それならこのまま、小回りのきく自分の足を信用した。"
msgstr "Waiting for one was not an option; it was why he had put his trust in his legs."

#. Occurrence C_4:302:18147: scene=C_4
#: C_4:302
msgctxt "text_id=18147 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　昨夜以上に最短距離で行けるよう、夜の街を駆けていく。"
msgstr "  He dashed through the city streets. He had to find a shorter route than last night."

#. Occurrence C_4:370:18148: scene=C_4
#: C_4:370
msgctxt "text_id=18148 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　胸の<鼓|お><動|と>は針のようだ。"
msgstr "  His heart was ready to jump out of his chest,"

#. Occurrence C_4:376:18149: scene=C_4
#: C_4:376
msgctxt "text_id=18149 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<早鐘|はやがね>は依然として鳴り続けている。"
msgstr "  pounding like a hammer against a fire bell."

#. Occurrence C_4:381:18150: scene=C_4
#: C_4:381
msgctxt "text_id=18150 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この程度の距離で音を上げる事はないのに、まったくもって落ち着かない。"
msgstr "  He had no intention of giving up yet, but he could not seem to calm himself down."

#. Occurrence C_4:416:18151: scene=C_4
#: C_4:416
msgctxt "text_id=18151 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふわふわした<自分|からだ>には、その音はいささか大きすぎるようだった。"
msgstr "  In his precarious condition, even surrender seemed too great of an effort to spare."

#. Occurrence C_4:421:18152: scene=C_4
#: C_4:421
msgctxt "text_id=18152 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　嫌な予感だけが先走ってしまう。"
msgstr "  Visions of horrible outcomes flashed through his mind."

#. Occurrence C_4:426:18153: scene=C_4
#: C_4:426
msgctxt "text_id=18153 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　でも冷静に、冷静に。"
msgstr "  No. Calm. He needed to stay calm."

#. Occurrence C_4:431:18154: scene=C_4
#: C_4:431
msgctxt "text_id=18154 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だって、それだけが彼の武器だ。"
msgstr "  That was his only weapon."

#. Occurrence C_4:436:18155: scene=C_4
#: C_4:436
msgctxt "text_id=18155 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無力であるが故に、落ち着く事だけが自分にできる最善だと、彼はよく理解していた。"
msgstr "  He was painfully aware he was powerless; the best thing he could do was to keep his head on straight."

#. Occurrence C_4:507:18156: scene=C_4
#: C_4:507
msgctxt "text_id=18156 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――反面。"
msgstr "  While he wrangled with his mind..."

#. Occurrence C_4:512:18157: scene=C_4
#: C_4:512
msgctxt "text_id=18157 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しゃにむに走るたび、胸の鼓動は速くなる。"
msgstr "  His pulse seemed to quicken, with every step."

#. Occurrence C_4:601:18158: scene=C_4
#: C_4:601
msgctxt "text_id=18158 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　月光が森をかすかに照らす。"
msgstr "  The forest was faintly lit by the moon."

#. Occurrence C_4:606:18159: scene=C_4
#: C_4:606
msgctxt "text_id=18159 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はげ山にはそれだけで十分だった。"
msgstr "  That was more than enough on such a bare mountain."

#. Occurrence C_4:611:18160: scene=C_4
#: C_4:611
msgctxt "text_id=18160 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたり分の足跡を追いかける。"
msgstr "  He followed the two sets of footprints."

#. Occurrence C_4:616:18161: scene=C_4
#: C_4:616
msgctxt "text_id=18161 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この先はいつかの遊園地と同じ、彼には関わりのない窮地だ。"
msgstr "  Ahead lay a situation he had nothing to do with-just like at the amusement park."

#. Occurrence C_4:685:18162: scene=C_4
#: C_4:685
msgctxt "text_id=18162 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『―――貴方が行っても何も出来ない』"
msgstr "\"Even if you go, there's nothing you can do for them.\""

#. Occurrence C_4:733:18163: scene=C_4
#: C_4:733
msgctxt "text_id=18163 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　戒めの言葉に、心音だけが高くなる。"
msgstr "  The only effect her admonishing words had was to hasten his pace."

#. Occurrence C_4:738:18164: scene=C_4
#: C_4:738
msgctxt "text_id=18164 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地を蹴る足は勢いをまして、戸惑う心は後方に千切れて消えていく。"
msgstr "  He pushed the ground with his legs even harder, trying to leave his doubt in the kicked up snow behind him."

#. Occurrence C_4:765:18165: scene=C_4
#: C_4:765
msgctxt "text_id=18165 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな事、言われるまでもない。"
msgstr "  Of course he was powerless."

#. Occurrence C_4:770:18166: scene=C_4
#: C_4:770
msgctxt "text_id=18166 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何より彼自身が痛感している。"
msgstr "  The pain in his chest told him so."

#. Occurrence C_4:775:18167: scene=C_4
#: C_4:775
msgctxt "text_id=18167 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　役に立たないだけならまだマシで、最悪、彼女たちにとってマイナスにしかならないのではと。"
msgstr "  At best he would be useless, and at the worst he would be a liability."

#. Occurrence C_4:780:18168: scene=C_4
#: C_4:780
msgctxt "text_id=18168 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが教会で一瞬だけ足を止めた呪縛だった。"
msgstr "  He recalled the binding spell placed on him at the church."

#. Occurrence C_4:786:18169: scene=C_4
#: C_4:786
msgctxt "text_id=18169 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　でも、結局は―――"
msgstr "  It did not matter."

#. Occurrence C_4:850:18170: scene=C_4
#: C_4:850
msgctxt "text_id=18170 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　体は、何もしない後悔より、砕け散る後悔を選んだ。"
msgstr "  His body told him he would regret being torn to pieces less than if he did nothing."

#. Occurrence C_4:856:18171: scene=C_4
#: C_4:856
msgctxt "text_id=18171 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　森を走る足取りは乱れない。"
msgstr "  Not once did his legs fail him as he ran through the woods;"

#. Occurrence C_4:861:18172: scene=C_4
#: C_4:861
msgctxt "text_id=18172 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　乱れそうなのは鼓動だけ。"
msgstr "  though it felt as though his heart could at any moment."

#. Occurrence C_4:866:18173: scene=C_4
#: C_4:866
msgctxt "text_id=18173 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の弱さだけが叫んでいる。"
msgstr "  His weakness screamed at him from within."

#. Occurrence C_4:918:18174: scene=C_4
#: C_4:918
msgctxt "text_id=18174 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの遊園地の空を駆け下りた時とまったく同じ。"
msgstr "  Just like back at the amusement park."

#. Occurrence C_4:944:18175: scene=C_4
#: C_4:944
msgctxt "text_id=18175 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どんな理由も<経緯|いきさつ>も関係ない。"
msgstr "  He was beyond reason or circumstances now."

#. Occurrence C_4:966:18176: scene=C_4
#: C_4:966
msgctxt "text_id=18176 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　結局のところ、"
msgstr "  Ultimately..."

#. Occurrence C_4:991:18177: scene=C_4
#: C_4:991
msgctxt "text_id=18177 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“―――自分が、<彼女|だれか>を助けたいんだ”"
msgstr "\"...I just want to help her.\""

#. Occurrence C_4:997:18178: scene=C_4
#: C_4:997
msgctxt "text_id=18178 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただそれだけの、純粋な欲求だ。"
msgstr "  ...that was all he really desired."

#. Occurrence C_4:1050:18179: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1050
msgctxt "text_id=18179 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心音は調子を崩さない。"
msgstr "  His heart pounded with vigor."

#. Occurrence C_4:1055:18180: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1055
msgctxt "text_id=18180 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　暗い森を走っていく間、彼の脳裏を占めていたものは一つだけ。"
msgstr "  As he ran through the dark, wintry forest, only one thing gnawed at his mind."

#. Occurrence C_4:1060:18181: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1060
msgctxt "text_id=18181 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女たちへの心配でも、橙子に対する敵意でもない。"
msgstr "  Not concern for the girls, nor anger toward Touko."

#. Occurrence C_4:1110:18182: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1110
msgctxt "text_id=18182 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　赤い花に飾られたような肢体。"
msgstr "  The red roses bursting forth from her limbs."

#. Occurrence C_4:1115:18183: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1115
msgctxt "text_id=18183 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　産声にも似た苦痛の声。"
msgstr "  Screams of agony, like childbirth."

#. Occurrence C_4:1120:18184: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1120
msgctxt "text_id=18184 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　美しいと感じたものが、静かに死滅していく現実。"
msgstr "  The harsh reality of something beautiful dying."

#. Occurrence C_4:1126:18185: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1126
msgctxt "text_id=18185 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんて<拭|ぬぐ>いがたい悪夢。"
msgstr "  The nightmare was tenacious."

#. Occurrence C_4:1131:18186: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1131
msgctxt "text_id=18186 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから、もう二度と。"
msgstr "  Never again."

#. Occurrence C_4:1136:18187: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1136
msgctxt "text_id=18187 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あんな光景は、見たくなかったのに。"
msgstr "  Never ever again did he want to see something like that again, if he could help it."

#. Occurrence C_4:1185:18188: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1185
msgctxt "text_id=18188 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　森はじき終わろうとしている。"
msgstr "  Just ahead was the forest clearing."

#. Occurrence C_4:1190:18189: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1190
msgctxt "text_id=18189 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　月光はさえざえと旧校舎を示している。"
msgstr "  The moonlight shone on the old school building like a spotlight."

#. Occurrence C_4:1195:18190: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1195
msgctxt "text_id=18190 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その、絶望的なタイミングで思い至ってしまった。"
msgstr "  Once again, those thoughts crept back."

#. Occurrence C_4:1200:18191: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1200
msgctxt "text_id=18191 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あんな光景は二度と見たくない。"
msgstr "  He could not bear seeing something like that again."

#. Occurrence C_4:1205:18192: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1205
msgctxt "text_id=18192 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そのためにこうして自分は走っている。"
msgstr "  That was why he ran."

#. Occurrence C_4:1227:18193: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1227
msgctxt "text_id=18193 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……けれど。"
msgstr "  But..."

#. Occurrence C_4:1233:18194: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1233
msgctxt "text_id=18194 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "もし二度目と直面した時、どうすれば冷静でいられるのか。"
msgstr "If he had to face it a second time, how could he stay calm?"

#. Occurrence C_4:1297:18195: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1297
msgctxt "text_id=18195 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして、彼は広場に辿り着いた。"
msgstr "  With that thought in mind, he arrived at the clearing."

#. Occurrence C_4:1302:18196: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1302
msgctxt "text_id=18196 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　長く走った事で乱れた呼吸も、<瘧|おこり>のように上下する肩も、嘘のように消え去った。"
msgstr "  Somehow, his frantic breathing, his rising and lowering shoulders stopped."

#. Occurrence C_4:1307:18197: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1307
msgctxt "text_id=18197 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<排気|はいき>も<慣性|かんせい>もない、時間停止のような思考停止。"
msgstr "  No exhaustion. No inertia. Just blankness. Like his mind was frozen in time."

#. Occurrence C_4:1313:18198: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1313
msgctxt "text_id=18198 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二度目は、たしかにあった。"
msgstr "  This was the second time he felt like this."

#. Occurrence C_4:1360:18199: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1360
msgctxt "text_id=18199 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一度目のような目眩と吐き気はあったかどうか。"
msgstr "  But the nausea and dizziness from the first time..."

#. Occurrence C_4:1365:18200: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1365
msgctxt "text_id=18200 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここまで積み重ねてきた弱音。"
msgstr "  The pathetic whining of the last few weeks..."

#. Occurrence C_4:1370:18201: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1370
msgctxt "text_id=18201 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　頭を乱していた迷いは、より強い感情で、跡形もなく消え去った。"
msgstr "  The doubts clouding his mind... they were all gone,"

#. Occurrence C_4:1376:18202: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1376
msgctxt "text_id=18202 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "完全に、<頭蓋|ずがい>の外にはじき出された。"
msgstr " displaced entirely from his mind by an even stronger emotion."

#. Occurrence C_4:1467:18203: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1467
msgctxt "text_id=18203 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――心音は胸を貫く<楔|くさび>のように。"
msgstr "  His heart pounded with the force of a sledgehammer."

#. Occurrence C_4:1472:18204: scene=C_4
#: C_4:1472
msgctxt "text_id=18204 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはひときわ高い、意識を覚ます原初の鼓動。"
msgstr "  It was a primal sound, loud enough to bring him to his senses."

#. Occurrence C_5:78:18205: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_5_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_5
#: C_5:78
msgctxt "text_id=18205 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_5:84:18206: scene=C_5
#: C_5:84
msgctxt "text_id=18206 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<深|ふか>く<細|ほそ>く息を吐いて、草十郎は広場に足を踏み入れた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro stepped into the clearing, letting out a deep but steady exhale."

#. Occurrence C_5:105:18207: scene=C_5
#: C_5:105
msgctxt "text_id=18207 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　視線は金髪の少年に合わせてはいるものの、意識は自分に向けられている。"
msgstr "  Although his eyes were locked with the blond-haired boy's, his concentration was focused inward."

#. Occurrence C_5:110:18208: scene=C_5
#: C_5:110
msgctxt "text_id=18208 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冷静であれ、冷静であれ、と。"
msgstr "  Be calm. Be calm."

#. Occurrence C_5:146:18209: scene=C_5
#: C_5:146
msgctxt "text_id=18209 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は全身全霊で、<努|つと>めて呼吸を合わせている。"
msgstr "  Every fiber of his being worked to control his breathing."

#. Occurrence C_5:166:18210: scene=C_5
#: C_5:166
msgctxt "text_id=18210 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　広場の状況は、青子たちの敗北を物語っていた。"
msgstr "  The clearing told the story of Aoko and Alice's crushing defeat."

#. Occurrence C_5:197:18211: scene=C_5
#: C_5:197
msgctxt "text_id=18211 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は<仰向|あおむ>けに倒れている。"
msgstr "  Aoko was lying face up in the snow,"

#. Occurrence C_5:202:18212: scene=C_5
#: C_5:202
msgctxt "text_id=18212 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　片足は真っ赤で、<腿|もも>は<醜|みにく>く潰されていた。"
msgstr "  her right leg bright red and crushed at the thigh."

#. Occurrence C_5:222:18213: scene=C_5
#: C_5:222
msgctxt "text_id=18213 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の<瞳|め>は<霞|かす>んでいるものの、やってきた草十郎を見すえる程度には、気丈な意志が残っている。"
msgstr "  Her eyes were glazed over, but Soujyuro could tell she was still bravely fighting."

#. Occurrence C_5:227:18214: scene=C_5
#: C_5:227
msgctxt "text_id=18214 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小さく咳きこんでいるところを見ると、腹部か背中を強く殴打したのだろう。"
msgstr "  Judging by her spluttering, she had taken a hard blow to her chest or back."

#. Occurrence C_5:232:18215: scene=C_5
#: C_5:232
msgctxt "text_id=18215 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、その両方か、と草十郎は判断した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro deduced it was most likely both."

#. Occurrence C_5:286:18216: scene=C_5
#: C_5:286
msgctxt "text_id=18216 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は青子ほど重傷には見えないが、やはり地面に倒れたまま動けない。"
msgstr "  Alice's injuries seemed less serious than Aoko's, but she lay motionless on the ground nevertheless."

#. Occurrence C_5:291:18217: scene=C_5
#: C_5:291
msgctxt "text_id=18217 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子とは反対にうつぶせで、懸命に両肘を地面に立て、起きあがろうとしているのが痛々しかった。"
msgstr "  She was lying across from Aoko, face down in the snow, arms out in front, as though pushing herself up was too painful."

#. Occurrence C_5:371:18218: scene=C_5
#: C_5:371
msgctxt "text_id=18218 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　広場の奥に鎮座する旧校舎の前には、いつか見た魔術師の姿。"
msgstr "  Before the old school building stood the figure of the mage he had seen before."

#. Occurrence C_5:376:18219: scene=C_5
#: C_5:376
msgctxt "text_id=18219 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それにはまったくの無意志を<示|しめ>し、草十郎は歩きだした。"
msgstr "  Paying her no mind, Soujyuro began to walk forward."

#. Occurrence C_5:428:18220: scene=C_5
#: C_5:428
msgctxt "text_id=18220 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は広場に到着した時より落ち着いた面もちで、青子へと足を進める。"
msgstr "  Feeling calmer since arriving at the clearing, he advanced toward Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_5:433:18221: scene=C_5
#: C_5:433
msgctxt "text_id=18221 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子はそれを止めない。"
msgstr "  Touko did nothing to stop him."

#. Occurrence C_5:438:18222: scene=C_5
#: C_5:438
msgctxt "text_id=18222 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ、誰に気付かれるコトなく、瞳に苦悩の色を浮かべただけだった。"
msgstr "  No one noticed, but the faintest look of worry flickered in her eyes."

#. Occurrence C_5:472:18223: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_5_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_5
#: C_5:472
msgctxt "text_id=18223 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「お兄さんも、その人たちの仲間？」"
msgstr "\"Are you a friend of theirs, mister?\""

#. Occurrence C_5:478:18224: scene=C_5
#: C_5:478
msgctxt "text_id=18224 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　勝者の余裕か、人狼の少年は親しげに話しかける。"
msgstr "  The child werewolf spoke amicably, confident in his victory,"

#. Occurrence C_5:483:18225: scene=C_5
#: C_5:483
msgctxt "text_id=18225 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　新しい獲物が来た、程度の気持ちなのだろう。"
msgstr "  and perhaps also eyeing up a new meal."

#. Occurrence C_5:493:18226: scene=C_5
#: C_5:493
msgctxt "text_id=18226 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は応えずに青子へと歩いていく。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro ignored him, and kept walking toward Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_5:518:18227: scene=C_5
#: C_5:518
msgctxt "text_id=18227 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　完全な無視に、少年から笑みが消えた。"
msgstr "  The complete disregard wiped the smile from the boy's face."

#. Occurrence C_5:523:18228: scene=C_5
#: C_5:523
msgctxt "text_id=18228 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悪魔の機嫌を損ねた事も気にならないのか、草十郎は歩みを止めない。"
msgstr "  Still Soujyuro carried on; the beast's feelings were the last thing on his mind."

#. Occurrence C_5:553:18229: scene=C_5
#: C_5:553
msgctxt "text_id=18229 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして青子の元まで到着すると、彼は痛ましげに顔を<曇|くも>らせた。"
msgstr "  Once he reached Aoko, he looked down at her with a pained expression on his face."

#. Occurrence C_5:602:18230: scene=C_5
#: C_5:602
msgctxt "text_id=18230 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……らしくなく、自然な言葉が見つからない。"
msgstr "  Strangely, he was at a loss for words."

#. Occurrence C_5:607:18231: scene=C_5
#: C_5:607
msgctxt "text_id=18231 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　短い逡巡の<末|すえ>、かろうじて口に出来たのは、"
msgstr "  After a slight hesitation, all he could manage to say was,"

#. Occurrence C_5:664:18232: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_5_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_5
#: C_5:664
msgctxt "text_id=18232 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「なってないぞ生徒会長。"
msgstr "\"That wasn't very polite, Ms. President."

#. Occurrence C_5:670:18233: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_5_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_5
#: C_5:670
msgctxt "text_id=18233 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　行く時ぐらい、声をかけるものだろう」"
msgstr "  You shouldn't have left the church without saying goodbye.\""

#. Occurrence C_5:676:18234: scene=C_5
#: C_5:676
msgctxt "text_id=18234 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　叱るような<気遣|きづか>うような、不器用な呼びかけだけだった。"
msgstr "  His awkward remark was half scolding and half affectionate."

#. Occurrence C_5:725:18235: scene=C_5
#: C_5:725
msgctxt "text_id=18235 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「………………"
msgstr "\"..."

#. Occurrence C_5:732:18236: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_5_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_5
#: C_5:732
msgctxt "text_id=18236 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "この、ばか」"
msgstr "You... numbskull...\""

#. Occurrence C_5:737:18237: scene=C_5
#: C_5:737
msgctxt "text_id=18237 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　腹の痛みもなんのその、青子は自分をかばうように立つ草十郎を罵倒する。"
msgstr "  Despite the pain in her stomach, Aoko was able to throw an insult his way."

#. Occurrence C_5:777:18238: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_5_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_5
#: C_5:777
msgctxt "text_id=18238 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「安心した。余裕あるじゃないか、蒼崎」"
msgstr "\"Glad to see you still have some fight in you, Aozaki.\""

#. Occurrence C_5:782:18239: scene=C_5
#: C_5:782
msgctxt "text_id=18239 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな青子の強がりを真に受けたのか、草十郎の声は明るい。"
msgstr "  His voice brightened, as if buying her bravado."

#. Occurrence C_5:802:18240: scene=C_5
#: C_5:802
msgctxt "text_id=18240 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……実際、青子には余裕どころか体力も無い。"
msgstr "  The truth was that she barely had the strength to live."

#. Occurrence C_5:807:18241: scene=C_5
#: C_5:807
msgctxt "text_id=18241 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なのに草十郎の返事はいつも通りで、"
msgstr "  Despite that, Soujyuro looked like he wanted to respond in his usual way."

#. Occurrence C_5:812:18242: scene=C_5
#: C_5:812
msgctxt "text_id=18242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『さすが蒼崎、殺しても死なないな』とでも言いたげな<暢気|のんき>さだ。"
msgstr "  Something like, \"see, Aozaki? You're too tough to die, even when someone kills you.\""

#. Occurrence C_5:860:18243: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_5_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_5
#: C_5:860
msgctxt "text_id=18243 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「アンタ、ね―――」"
msgstr "\"You know...\""

#. Occurrence C_5:874:18244: scene=C_5
#: C_5:874
msgctxt "text_id=18244 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つい口に出して、青子は息を呑んだ。"
msgstr "  As soon as she tried to speak, she ran out of breath."

#. Occurrence C_5:879:18245: scene=C_5
#: C_5:879
msgctxt "text_id=18245 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……草十郎は何も勘違いしていない。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro heard her loud and clear this time."

#. Occurrence C_5:884:18246: scene=C_5
#: C_5:884
msgctxt "text_id=18246 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いかに間が抜けていても、今の状況がどれほど危険なのか、痛いほど理解している。"
msgstr "  He might have looked absentminded, but he knew exactly how dangerous the situation was."

#. Occurrence C_5:913:18247: scene=C_5
#: C_5:913
msgctxt "text_id=18247 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その証拠に、暢気な台詞が空々しく聞こえるほど、その表情は凍りついていた。"
msgstr "  Aoko knew because his carefree-sounding words did not match his expressionless face."

#. Occurrence C_5:934:18248: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_5_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_5
#: C_5:934
msgctxt "text_id=18248 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……いったい、何のつもりで……」"
msgstr "\"...What do you... think... you're...?\""

#. Occurrence C_5:956:18249: scene=C_5
#: C_5:956
msgctxt "text_id=18249 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　来たのよ、といいかけて青子は咳きこんでしまった。"
msgstr "  Before she could say \"doing,\" she coughed painfully."

#. Occurrence C_5:961:18250: scene=C_5
#: C_5:961
msgctxt "text_id=18250 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は人差し指を口元に立てて頷く。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro pressed his finger to his lips and nodded."

#. Occurrence C_5:966:18251: scene=C_5
#: C_5:966
msgctxt "text_id=18251 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子には理解しがたいが、無理して話しちゃダメだ、というジェスチャーらしい。"
msgstr "  Aoko could not quite believe it, but it looked as though Soujyuro had gestured to her to not speak."

#. Occurrence C_5:987:18252: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_5_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_5
#: C_5:987
msgctxt "text_id=18252 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「だって、ほら。状況はあの時と一緒だ。"
msgstr "\"Isn't it obvious? It's the same as last time."

#. Occurrence C_5:1005:18253: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_5_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_5
#: C_5:1005
msgctxt "text_id=18253 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　君がやられたら、次はこっちの番なんだろう？　だから協力をしに来たんじゃないか。"
msgstr "  If you go down, I step in, right? So I'm here."

#. Occurrence C_5:1011:18254: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_5_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_5
#: C_5:1011
msgctxt "text_id=18254 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……まあ。何もできないのも、あの時と変わってはいないんだけど」"
msgstr "  Okay, I still can't do anything, but still...\""

#. Occurrence C_5:1058:18255: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1058
msgctxt "text_id=18255 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子には答えもない。"
msgstr "  Aoko did not know what to say."

#. Occurrence C_5:1063:18256: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1063
msgctxt "text_id=18256 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ呆然と顔をあげて、本気で呆れるように、草十郎を見つめ返す事しかできなかった。"
msgstr "  She could only look up at him, amazed and awed."

#. Occurrence C_5:1111:18257: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1111
msgctxt "text_id=18257 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなふたりを、人狼は<苛立|いらだ>たしく見つめている。"
msgstr "  The werewolf stared at them, visibly frustrated."

#. Occurrence C_5:1116:18258: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1116
msgctxt "text_id=18258 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼には王者としての自意識がある。"
msgstr "  After all, he believed himself to be the noblest of all creatures."

#. Occurrence C_5:1121:18259: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1121
msgctxt "text_id=18259 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無視されただけでも<轢殺|れきさつ>もので、橙子さえいなければサクッと草十郎の喉を噛みちぎっている。"
msgstr "  Ignoring him was treason, punishable by death. Had Touko not been there, he would have sunk his teeth into Soujyuro's neck by now."

#. Occurrence C_5:1158:18260: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1158
msgctxt "text_id=18260 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の重圧は確かに伝わっている筈だ。"
msgstr "  He was sure he had been intimidating enough."

#. Occurrence C_5:1163:18261: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1163
msgctxt "text_id=18261 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なのに獲物からは、まったく恐れが伝わってこない。"
msgstr "  However, his prey did not show any signs of fear."

#. Occurrence C_5:1168:18262: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1168
msgctxt "text_id=18262 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……考えづらいが、まさか、ひょっとして。"
msgstr "  It was hard to imagine, but maybe, just maybe..."

#. Occurrence C_5:1185:18263: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1185
msgctxt "text_id=18263 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの人間の視界には、自分はどうでもいいモノとして映っているのではないだろうか―――？"
msgstr "  This guy did not view him as a threat."

#. Occurrence C_5:1228:18264: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_5_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_5
#: C_5:1228
msgctxt "text_id=18264 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「……まあ、誰でもいいんだけど。筋ばった肉は歯ごたえがあっていいし、何より食いでがある。"
msgstr "\"Whatever. As long as the meat is tender, juicy, and filling, I don't care whose it is."

#. Occurrence C_5:1234:18265: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_5_0002; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_5
#: C_5:1234
msgctxt "text_id=18265 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　先に、そのお兄さんからハジメテもかまわないよね？」"
msgstr "  Hey, you. You don't mind if I start with you, do you?\""

#. Occurrence C_5:1295:18266: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1295
msgctxt "text_id=18266 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年はもう一度呼びかけた。"
msgstr "  The boy wolf called out once again."

#. Occurrence C_5:1300:18267: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1300
msgctxt "text_id=18267 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それにも応えず、草十郎は片手をゆっくりと鼻にあてた。"
msgstr "  Still not responding, Soujyuro raised a hand to his nose."

#. Occurrence C_5:1305:18268: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1305
msgctxt "text_id=18268 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<極|きわ>めて冷静に。"
msgstr "  Cool, calm, and collected."

#. Occurrence C_5:1310:18269: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1310
msgctxt "text_id=18269 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年に意識は向けず、けれど目は逸らさず。"
msgstr "  Paying no mind to the boy, yet keeping an eye on him."

#. Occurrence C_5:1349:18270: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_5_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_5
#: C_5:1349
msgctxt "text_id=18270 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……匂うな」"
msgstr "\"...Something reeks.\""

#. Occurrence C_5:1368:18271: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_5_0003; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_5
#: C_5:1368
msgctxt "text_id=18271 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「…………？」"
msgstr "\"...?\""

#. Occurrence C_5:1421:18272: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1421
msgctxt "text_id=18272 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不快げに呟かれた声に誰もが首をかしげる。"
msgstr "  Everyone present was confused."

#. Occurrence C_5:1426:18273: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1426
msgctxt "text_id=18273 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の言う匂いなんて、少しも嗅ぎ取れないからだ。"
msgstr "  No one seemed to be able to smell anything but him."

#. Occurrence C_5:1468:18274: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_5_0004; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_5
#: C_5:1468
msgctxt "text_id=18274 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「……へえ。何が匂うって言うのかな、お兄さん」"
msgstr "\"Oh? What do you smell, mister?\""

#. Occurrence C_5:1485:18275: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1485
msgctxt "text_id=18275 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　余裕に満ちてはいるが、苛立ちに急かされた声。"
msgstr "  Beo's voice retained his usual arrogance, but was tinged with impatience."

#. Occurrence C_5:1496:18276: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1496
msgctxt "text_id=18276 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<度重|たびかさ>なる無視に少年は怒気を抑えきれない。"
msgstr "  The boy was unable to hide his irritation at being ignored."

#. Occurrence C_5:1501:18277: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1501
msgctxt "text_id=18277 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでようやく、草十郎は遠くの、けれど真っ正面にいる少年へと体を向けた。"
msgstr "  Finally, Soujyuro turned to face the boy just a short distance from him."

#. Occurrence C_5:1559:18278: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_5_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_5
#: C_5:1559
msgctxt "text_id=18278 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「品のない肉の匂いがする。これだから犬は嫌いなんだ」"
msgstr "\"It's like rotten meat. This is why I hate dogs.\""

#. Occurrence C_5:1565:18279: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1565
msgctxt "text_id=18279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心底から不快だ、と言わんばかりの声。"
msgstr "  His voice was filled with disgust and contempt."

#. Occurrence C_5:1571:18280: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1571
msgctxt "text_id=18280 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎にとってはただの独り言。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was mainly speaking to himself,"

#. Occurrence C_5:1577:18281: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1577
msgctxt "text_id=18281 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年にとって侮辱以外の何物でもない。"
msgstr "  but the werewolf boy had never felt so insulted."

#. Occurrence C_5:1583:18282: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1583
msgctxt "text_id=18282 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎本人に、そんなつもりが全くなかったとしても。"
msgstr "  Even if that was not Soujyuro's intent at all."

#. Occurrence C_5:1642:18283: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_5_0005; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_5
#: C_5:1642
msgctxt "text_id=18283 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「―――、は」"
msgstr "\"...Hmph.\""

#. Occurrence C_5:1648:18284: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1648
msgctxt "text_id=18284 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　瞬間、たしかに風が吹いた。"
msgstr "  In a moment, the wind picked up,"

#. Occurrence C_5:1653:18285: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1653
msgctxt "text_id=18285 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼に起きた感情の変化だろう。"
msgstr "  perhaps signaling a change in the werewolf's mood."

#. Occurrence C_5:1658:18286: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1658
msgctxt "text_id=18286 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　獣気は大気を焼く風になって、雪原に<風紋|ふうもん>を走らせた。"
msgstr "  A fiery gale whipped around, carving patterns in the snow."

#. Occurrence C_5:1716:18287: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_5_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_5
#: C_5:1716
msgctxt "text_id=18287 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎…………！」"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro...!\""

#. Occurrence C_5:1722:18288: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1722
msgctxt "text_id=18288 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このままでは草十郎が真っ先に殺される、と青子は体に力をいれた。"
msgstr "  Sensing he was about to be killed, Aoko desperately tried to move."

#. Occurrence C_5:1727:18289: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1727
msgctxt "text_id=18289 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、壊れた体は指先ぐらいしか動かない。"
msgstr "  But her broken body would not respond."

#. Occurrence C_5:1732:18290: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1732
msgctxt "text_id=18290 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見れば、草十郎の失言だけは聞こえていたのか、有珠もなんとか立ち上がろうとしている。"
msgstr "  After hearing Soujyuro's insult, Alice was unsuccessfully struggling to get to her feet, too."

#. Occurrence C_5:1771:18291: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1771
msgctxt "text_id=18291 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の姿は、そんなふたりとは対照的だった。"
msgstr "  In complete contrast, Soujyuro stood there."

#. Occurrence C_5:1776:18292: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1776
msgctxt "text_id=18292 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<泰然|たいぜん>としてさえ見える立ち姿。"
msgstr "  Firmly and unfazed."

#. Occurrence C_5:1781:18293: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1781
msgctxt "text_id=18293 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年の苛立ちは、それで限界を超えてしまった。"
msgstr "  The little blond boy's well of patience had run dry."

#. Occurrence C_5:1826:18294: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_5_0006_0; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_5
#: C_5:1826
msgctxt "text_id=18294 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「……そうか。ようするに、ボクが子供だからって舐めてるんだね、"
msgstr "\"...I get it. You're underestimating me because I look like a kid, huh?"

#. Occurrence C_5:1840:18295: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_5_0006_1; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_5
#: C_5:1840
msgctxt "text_id=18295 | speaker=beo"
msgid "お兄さんは…………！」"
msgstr " BIG mistake!\""

#. Occurrence C_5:1946:18296: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1946
msgctxt "text_id=18296 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――人間の時間が終わる。"
msgstr "  His time playing human was over."

#. Occurrence C_5:1954:18297: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1954
msgctxt "text_id=18297 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　怒気を含んだ言葉と共に、少年の<躯|からだ>が変化する。"
msgstr "  Enraged, the boy transformed."

#. Occurrence C_5:1959:18298: scene=C_5
#: C_5:1959
msgctxt "text_id=18298 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　肉体はさらに大きく、その肌は悪魔の牙めいた、刺々しい毛並みに包まれていく。"
msgstr "  He grew larger and larger, golden fur sprouting from his pale flesh."

#. Occurrence C_5:2156:18299: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2156
msgctxt "text_id=18299 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人間の物だった顔も手も、いびつなカタチに膨れ上がっていく。"
msgstr "  His mouth grew razor-sharp fangs; his hands grew claws."

#. Occurrence C_5:2161:18300: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2161
msgctxt "text_id=18300 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは大気中の魔力を取りこみ、存在規模を膨張させていく異形の獣―――ヒトのカタチをした、狼の姿だった。"
msgstr "  Drawing from the magical energy in the air, he transformed into a preternatural beast: a wolf in the shape of a human."

#. Occurrence C_5:2183:18301: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_5_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_5
#: C_5:2183
msgctxt "text_id=18301 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「獣化の許しは出していないぞ、ベオ……！」"
msgstr "\"Beo! Did I say you could transform?!\""

#. Occurrence C_5:2195:18302: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2195
msgctxt "text_id=18302 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　傍観していた橙子が叫ぶが、人狼と化した少年は応えない。"
msgstr "  Touko yelled at him, but the werewolf did not respond."

#. Occurrence C_5:2200:18303: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2200
msgctxt "text_id=18303 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その荒い息遣いをケモノの口から吐き出すだけだ。"
msgstr "  He only huffed deep breaths of hot air."

#. Occurrence C_5:2253:18304: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_5_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_5
#: C_5:2253
msgctxt "text_id=18304 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そんな、バカな話、が」"
msgstr "\"Did you really just...?\""

#. Occurrence C_5:2259:18305: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2259
msgctxt "text_id=18305 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年の変身を見届けて、ぽつりと草十郎は漏らす。"
msgstr "  That was all Soujyuro could say in response to the boy's metamorphosis."

#. Occurrence C_5:2264:18306: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2264
msgctxt "text_id=18306 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人から獣に変わっただけでも悪夢なのだ。"
msgstr "  Such a transformation was the stuff of nightmares."

#. Occurrence C_5:2269:18307: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2269
msgctxt "text_id=18307 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　加えて、自分より小さかった少年が二メートル近い大きさになれば、もう理解の外だろう。正常な理性が残っているかすら怪しい。"
msgstr "  What was worse, the beast now towered above him. It was enough to make anybody question reality itself."

#. Occurrence C_5:2296:18308: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_5_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_5
#: C_5:2296
msgctxt "text_id=18308 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……驚いた」"
msgstr "\"Amazing.\" "

#. Occurrence C_5:2325:18309: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2325
msgctxt "text_id=18309 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　獲物の呟きに、人狼は満足そうに口元を歪ませた。"
msgstr "  Seeing his prey's reaction satisfied the werewolf, and his maw twisted into a satisfied grin."

#. Occurrence C_5:2330:18310: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2330
msgctxt "text_id=18310 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おかしな人間だったが、結局はいつも通りだと。"
msgstr "  He was a strange one, this guy, but meat was meat."

#. Occurrence C_5:2363:18311: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2363
msgctxt "text_id=18311 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……けれど。"
msgstr "  However..."

#. Occurrence C_5:2369:18312: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2369
msgctxt "text_id=18312 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "彼の虚栄心が満たされたのはほんの一瞬。"
msgstr "the beast's arrogance was short lived."

#. Occurrence C_5:2374:18313: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2374
msgctxt "text_id=18313 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狩られるだけの<獲物|にんげん>は、心底呆れたように息をついて、"
msgstr "  The prey breathed a sigh of exasperation before speaking."

#. Occurrence C_5:2400:18314: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_5_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_5
#: C_5:2400
msgctxt "text_id=18314 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それじゃ、ほんとに犬そのものじゃないか」"
msgstr "\"You really are a dog.\""

#. Occurrence C_5:2476:18315: voice_id=X30_C_5_0000; voice_prefix=X30; voice_category=0; scene=C_5
#: C_5:2476
msgctxt "text_id=18315 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_5:2482:18316: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2482
msgctxt "text_id=18316 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<木|こ>っ<端|ぱ><微塵|みじん>に砕け散るような沈黙。"
msgstr "  You could hear a pin drop, even in the snow."

#. Occurrence C_5:2487:18317: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2487
msgctxt "text_id=18317 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子も有珠も、橙子さえも声がない。"
msgstr "  Aoko, Alice, and Touko were all dumbfounded."

#. Occurrence C_5:2539:18318: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2539
msgctxt "text_id=18318 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分たちでさえ目を<背|そむ>ける人狼の獣化を目の当たりにして、まさか、そんな言葉を返せる人間がいようとは。"
msgstr "  Were they really seeing a human not just stare a werewolf down, but insult it to its face?"

#. Occurrence C_5:2580:18319: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2580
msgctxt "text_id=18319 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　楽観者は子供騙しの映画を見たような不満顔。"
msgstr "  They simply could not believe it."

#. Occurrence C_5:2616:18320: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_5_0007; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_5
#: C_5:2616
msgctxt "text_id=18320 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“―――、―――、―――”」"
msgstr "\"-, -, -!\""

#. Occurrence C_5:2625:18321: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2625
msgctxt "text_id=18321 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……もはや、何もかも手遅れだった。"
msgstr "  It was too late."

#. Occurrence C_5:2645:18322: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2645
msgctxt "text_id=18322 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　絶対者としての風格。"
msgstr "  Any trace of the wolf's pride or dignity"

#. Occurrence C_5:2650:18323: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2650
msgctxt "text_id=18323 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最強を自負していた人狼から、感情の起こりが消えていく。"
msgstr "  faded away."

#. Occurrence C_5:2656:18324: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2656
msgctxt "text_id=18324 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つまり本気になったのだ、と理解できた者は何人いたか。"
msgstr "  The onlookers finally realized that the wolf was serious."

#. Occurrence C_5:2705:18325: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_5_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_5
#: C_5:2705
msgctxt "text_id=18325 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ベオ、殺すな―――！」"
msgstr "\"Beo! Do NOT kill him!\""

#. Occurrence C_5:2711:18326: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2711
msgctxt "text_id=18326 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　仮初めの主人の制止など、金の獣には届かない。"
msgstr "  But Touko's command fell on deaf ears."

#. Occurrence C_5:2716:18327: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2716
msgctxt "text_id=18327 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼は前傾姿勢になりながら、たった十メートル先の草十郎を凝視する。"
msgstr "  The wolf prepared to lunge, his emerald eyes fixed on Soujyuro not thirty feet in front of him."

#. Occurrence C_5:2776:18328: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2776
msgctxt "text_id=18328 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう、たった十メートル。"
msgstr "  A mere thirty feet."

#. Occurrence C_5:2781:18329: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2781
msgctxt "text_id=18329 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<突進|はし>って０．５秒。"
msgstr "  A half-second was all he needed."

#. Occurrence C_5:2786:18330: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2786
msgctxt "text_id=18330 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　上から下、顔から足首まで、その爪で三枚に下ろすのにさらに０．５秒。"
msgstr "  Another half-second to bring his claw down, and slice his prey from head to toe."

#. Occurrence C_5:2796:18331: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_5_0008; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_5
#: C_5:2796
msgctxt "text_id=18331 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“死んだよ、おまえ……！”」"
msgstr "\"You're dead!\""

#. Occurrence C_5:2862:18332: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2862
msgctxt "text_id=18332 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　凶悪な<悦|よろこ>びに満ちた呟き。"
msgstr "  A roar of joyous, unbridled fury echoed far and wide."

#. Occurrence C_5:2867:18333: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2867
msgctxt "text_id=18333 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それだけを合図にして、人狼は草十郎へと弾け跳ぶ。"
msgstr "  It was the only warning the werewolf gave as he exploded toward Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence C_5:2873:18334: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2873
msgctxt "text_id=18334 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まさしく一秒。"
msgstr "  One second."

#. Occurrence C_5:2878:18335: scene=C_5
#: C_5:2878
msgctxt "text_id=18335 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　金の毛並みは残像<遥|はる>かに、それは、暴風にしか見えない程の<速度|たけり>だった。"
msgstr "  A golden blur swept forth in a furious gust, too fast for eyes to follow."

#. Occurrence C_5B:36:18336: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:36
msgctxt "text_id=18336 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――ならば、それは神速か。"
msgstr "  In the face of unworldly speed, there was only one thing to do."

#. Occurrence C_5B:47:18337: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:47
msgctxt "text_id=18337 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　弾け跳んだ人狼が黒影なら、<迎|むか>え撃たんと踏みこむ彼も無音の影。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro stepped forward, a silent shadow opposite the beastly silhouette of the incoming werewolf."

#. Occurrence C_5B:52:18338: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:52
msgctxt "text_id=18338 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　向かうべき位置はきっかり三歩分。"
msgstr "  He needed exactly three paces."

#. Occurrence C_5B:57:18339: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:57
msgctxt "text_id=18339 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その、わずか一メートルの前進に、彼は<人生|おのれ>の全てを<賭|と>した。"
msgstr "  He bet his entire life on around three feet of distance."

#. Occurrence C_5B:107:18340: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:107
msgctxt "text_id=18340 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<瞬|またた>きひとつ分の時間で迫る死。"
msgstr "  In the blink of an eye, death would be upon him."

#. Occurrence C_5B:112:18341: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:112
msgctxt "text_id=18341 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　疾走する巨大な暴力を前にして、彼は避ける素振りさえ見せなかった。"
msgstr "  Yet, he did not show the slightest indication he intended to avoid the lunging behemoth."

#. Occurrence C_5B:185:18342: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:185
msgctxt "text_id=18342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地面よ割れよとばかりに踏みこまれる前<脚|あし>。"
msgstr "  The wolf's foreleg slammed into the ground with earth-shaking fury."

#. Occurrence C_5B:319:18343: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:319
msgctxt "text_id=18343 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ありあまる脚力が、はち切れんばかりの<背筋|はいきん>が、人狼の腕を振り下ろさせる。"
msgstr "  His back muscles tensed up so much they seemed barely contained in his frame, as he swept a raised paw downward."

#. Occurrence C_5B:383:18344: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:383
msgctxt "text_id=18344 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わずかな踏み込みが人狼の爪を<躱|かわ>す。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's small step neatly evaded the claws."

#. Occurrence C_5B:388:18345: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:388
msgctxt "text_id=18345 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、彼が飛びこんだのは回避の為ではない。"
msgstr "  But he had a different motive."

#. Occurrence C_5B:393:18346: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:393
msgctxt "text_id=18346 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼にはただ、この位置が必要だっただけ。"
msgstr "  He was merely positioning himself for the next move."

#. Occurrence C_5B:399:18347: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:399
msgctxt "text_id=18347 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そも、<躱|かわ>すも<躱|かわ>さないもない。"
msgstr "  His intention was never to avoid anything."

#. Occurrence C_5B:404:18348: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:404
msgctxt "text_id=18348 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の思考には初めから、<そ|・><の|・><点|・>しか存在しない。"
msgstr "  From the beginning, his mind was focused on but one thing."

#. Occurrence C_5B:445:18349: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:445
msgctxt "text_id=18349 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――狙うは一点。"
msgstr "  One point to aim for."

#. Occurrence C_5B:475:18350: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:475
msgctxt "text_id=18350 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　意識の同一、"
msgstr "  One mind."

#. Occurrence C_5B:519:18351: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:519
msgctxt "text_id=18351 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呼吸の合致。"
msgstr "  One breath."

#. Occurrence C_5B:561:18352: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:561
msgctxt "text_id=18352 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<体幹|たいかん>の見切りと筋肉の<凝固|ぎょうこ><弛緩|しかん>その<隙間|すきま>。"
msgstr "  He picked the perfect opening in the wolf's torso, the precise microsecond between contraction and relaxation."

#. Occurrence C_5B:595:18353: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:595
msgctxt "text_id=18353 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その地点こそ、唯一とも言える、<生命|いのち>の壁の亀裂である。"
msgstr "  That one point alone was the crack in the dam of life."

#. Occurrence C_5B:949:18354: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:949
msgctxt "text_id=18354 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼の胸に<叩|たた>きつけられる、あまりにも弱い人の力。"
msgstr "  He punched the werewolf in its chest, with his feeble human strength."

#. Occurrence C_5B:992:18355: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:992
msgctxt "text_id=18355 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鈍い打撃音と、飛び散る血飛沫。"
msgstr "  There was a dull thud, and a burst of blood."

#. Occurrence C_5B:997:18356: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:997
msgctxt "text_id=18356 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　肉片も流血もすべては彼のもの。"
msgstr "  The twisted flesh and gore were all Soujyuro's own."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1066:18357: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_5B_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1066
msgctxt "text_id=18357 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“、―――！？”」"
msgstr "\"...?!\""

#. Occurrence C_5B:1072:18358: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1072
msgctxt "text_id=18358 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　振り上げた人狼の爪が<痙攣|けいれん>する。"
msgstr "  The werewolf's raised claw convulsed."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1077:18359: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1077
msgctxt "text_id=18359 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼の精神より先に、人狼の肉体が、取るに足りない衝撃に虚脱した。"
msgstr "  From an insignificant impact, the beast's body was the first to collapse, then his spirit."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1098:18360: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1098
msgctxt "text_id=18360 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正体の分からない一瞬の不明。"
msgstr "  There was a moment of utter incomprehension."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1104:18361: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1104
msgctxt "text_id=18361 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　息を吐こうと喉をあげる狼の口。"
msgstr "  The wolf opened his jaws to try and pull air into his lungs."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1110:18362: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1110
msgctxt "text_id=18362 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狼は知らず、あえぐようにうつぶせに倒れかける。"
msgstr "  Gasping, he began to topple forward."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1162:18363: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1162
msgctxt "text_id=18363 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その横を、か細い人影がすり抜ける。"
msgstr "  The slender figure slipped around to his flank."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1327:18364: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1327
msgctxt "text_id=18364 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　衝撃は短い槍のように。"
msgstr "  The next blow pierced him like a spear."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1332:18365: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1332
msgctxt "text_id=18365 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人影は折れた左腕を<庇|かば>いもせず、前のめりに倒れこむ人狼の背中へ、残る右腕を<抉|えぐ>り打つ。"
msgstr "  Ignoring his mangled left arm, the silhouette whirled around and drove his right elbow into the collapsing werewolf's back."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1393:18366: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1393
msgctxt "text_id=18366 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう一度、鈍い音がした。"
msgstr "  There was another muffled impact."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1398:18367: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1398
msgctxt "text_id=18367 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正面から<穿|うが>った位置と寸分違わぬ箇所を<貫|つ>く、心臓を圧する破裂の<楔|くさび>。"
msgstr "  The second strike penetrated to the exact same spot the first strike had, crushing the beast's heart."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1403:18368: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1403
msgctxt "text_id=18368 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一度目と違うのは飛び散る<血潮|ちしお>がない事と、獣のあえぎがした事だけ。"
msgstr "  This time, the blood that flew into the air belonged to the gasping wolf."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1492:18369: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1492
msgctxt "text_id=18369 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ガ、と吐血をして人狼は倒れこんだ。"
msgstr "  The werewolf fell to the ground, choking on his own blood."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1497:18370: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1497
msgctxt "text_id=18370 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　立ち上がる気配はない。"
msgstr "  He did not get up."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1503:18371: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1503
msgctxt "text_id=18371 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "なぎ払われた命はない。"
msgstr "He showed no sign of life."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1555:18372: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1555
msgctxt "text_id=18372 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<以|もっ>て事は終わった。"
msgstr "  It was over."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1560:18373: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1560
msgctxt "text_id=18373 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　振るわれた暴力に一切の<撓|たわ>みなく、"
msgstr "  There was no remorse, no hesitation in that brief act of violence."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1565:18374: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1565
msgctxt "text_id=18374 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　猛る金獣の四肢、無欠にして<天賦|てんぷ><盤石|ばんじゃく>。"
msgstr "  The perfect, furious, golden beast lay still."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1570:18375: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1570
msgctxt "text_id=18375 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　されど。わずか三秒の<交|まじ>わりで、人狼は敗北した。"
msgstr "  Felled in a mere three seconds."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1651:18376: voice_id=X30_C_5B_0000; voice_prefix=X30; voice_category=0; scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1651
msgctxt "text_id=18376 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_5B:1657:18377: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1657
msgctxt "text_id=18377 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この世のものとは思えない結末に誰もが目を疑う。"
msgstr "  No sane person would have bet on this outcome."

#. Occurrence C_5B:1686:18378: scene=C_5B
#: C_5B:1686
msgctxt "text_id=18378 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　当事者は呼吸さえ乱さず、淡々と、倒れ<臥|ふ>した人狼を見下ろしていた。"
msgstr "  His breathing calm, the victor stood over the fallen behemoth's body."

msgctxt "text_id=18379 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ならば、それは神速か。"
msgstr "  There was only one thing to do."

msgctxt "text_id=18380 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　弾け跳んだ人狼が黒影なら、<迎|むか>え撃たんと踏みこむ彼も無音の黒影。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro stepped forward, a silent shadow opposite the beastly silhouette of the incoming werewolf."

msgctxt "text_id=18381 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　向かうべき位置はきっかり三歩分。"
msgstr "  He needed exactly three paces."

msgctxt "text_id=18382 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その、わずか一メートルの前進に、彼は<人生|おのれ>の全てを<賭|と>した。"
msgstr "  He bet his entire life on around three feet of distance."

msgctxt "text_id=18383 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

msgctxt "text_id=18384 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この世のものとは思えない結末に、当事者以外の誰もが目を疑う。"
msgstr "  Something just as otherworldly had occurred. You had to be there to believe it."

msgctxt "text_id=18385 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを一身に受けながら、人狼を見下ろしているのは言うまでもなく、静希草十郎という名前の、ごく当たり前の少年だった。"
msgstr "  Taking it all in, standing above the fallen werewolf was none other than an ordinary boy, named Soujyuro Sizuki."

#. Occurrence C_6:40:18386: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:40
msgctxt "text_id=18386 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“……なんで……ボクが……？”"
msgstr "\"...But... how...?\""

#. Occurrence C_6:61:18387: scene=C_6
#: C_6:61
msgctxt "text_id=18387 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地面に倒れ臥した後でも、<人|カ><狼|レ>は自分に起きた出来事を把握できなかった。"
msgstr "  Even as the beast lay crumpled in the snow, he could not grasp what had happened."

#. Occurrence C_6:66:18388: scene=C_6
#: C_6:66
msgctxt "text_id=18388 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心臓が破裂し、血液の逆流によって脳をふくむ身体機能が停止し、地面に倒れこんだ。"
msgstr "  His heart had ruptured, cutting the blood flow to his body and brain, leaving him helpless."

#. Occurrence C_6:71:18389: scene=C_6
#: C_6:71
msgctxt "text_id=18389 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこまでは確認できる。"
msgstr "  That much he knew."

#. Occurrence C_6:76:18390: scene=C_6
#: C_6:76
msgctxt "text_id=18390 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　通常の動物なら、それが死である事も承知している。"
msgstr "  If he were a normal creature, he would be dead."

#. Occurrence C_6:108:18391: scene=C_6
#: C_6:108
msgctxt "text_id=18391 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが<人|カ><狼|レ>にとってはどうでもいい問題だ。"
msgstr "  As it was, this was a trifling inconvenience."

#. Occurrence C_6:121:18392: scene=C_6
#: C_6:121
msgctxt "text_id=18392 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なにしろ心臓は復元を終え、身体機能はほぼ回復している。"
msgstr "  Once his heart was repaired, his body would heal as well."

#. Occurrence C_6:126:18393: scene=C_6
#: C_6:126
msgctxt "text_id=18393 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の神秘性を上回る魔術を受けた訳でもなし、こんな傷、小石につまずいたのと変わらない。"
msgstr "  It was not as if he had been struck by magecraft exceeding his own Mystical nature. This was little different than a grazed knee."

#. Occurrence C_6:143:18394: scene=C_6
#: C_6:143
msgctxt "text_id=18394 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……だから、<矛盾|もんだい>は。"
msgstr "  ..Which is what was so strange-"

#. Occurrence C_6:148:18395: scene=C_6
#: C_6:148
msgctxt "text_id=18395 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小石につまずいた程度で、心臓が止まる生き物はいないということ。"
msgstr "  Your heart does not stop from a grazed knee."

#. Occurrence C_6:169:18396: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:169
msgctxt "text_id=18396 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“……思い、出さないと……”"
msgstr "\"...What did I... do wrong...?\""

#. Occurrence C_6:187:18397: scene=C_6
#: C_6:187
msgctxt "text_id=18397 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<人|カ><狼|レ>は必死に記憶を呼び覚ます。"
msgstr "  The werewolf frantically searched his memory."

#. Occurrence C_6:192:18398: scene=C_6
#: C_6:192
msgctxt "text_id=18398 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　爪を振り上げたところまでは、なんとか思い出せる。"
msgstr "  He managed to remember right up until the moment he raised his claws."

#. Occurrence C_6:197:18399: scene=C_6
#: C_6:197
msgctxt "text_id=18399 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　論点はその後だ。"
msgstr "  But what had come after that?"

#. Occurrence C_6:202:18400: scene=C_6
#: C_6:202
msgctxt "text_id=18400 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　形状次第では速射砲の直撃すら耐える自分が、なぜ、人間程度の腕力に倒されたのか。"
msgstr "  Given the right transformation, he knew he could withstand even a cannon blast. How had a puny human dropped him?"

#. Occurrence C_6:234:18401: scene=C_6
#: C_6:234
msgctxt "text_id=18401 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや。"
msgstr "  Wait."

#. Occurrence C_6:240:18402: scene=C_6
#: C_6:240
msgctxt "text_id=18402 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "なぜ、と言うのなら、そもそも相手が何をしたのかが分からない。"
msgstr "Before that he had to figure out exactly what his opponent did to him."

#. Occurrence C_6:258:18403: scene=C_6
#: C_6:258
msgctxt "text_id=18403 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしか、<懐|ふところ>に入られた瞬間、小さな衝撃を一点に<搾|しぼ>りこむような接触があった。"
msgstr "  The moment he got in close... Yes. He had felt a small impact."

#. Occurrence C_6:263:18404: scene=C_6
#: C_6:263
msgctxt "text_id=18404 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの正確な一撃によって、心臓だけがダメージを受けたのかもしれない。"
msgstr "  The attack was so accurate that it probably only affected his heart."

#. Occurrence C_6:308:18405: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0002; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:308
msgctxt "text_id=18405 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“ハ―――”"
msgstr "\"Hah...\""

#. Occurrence C_6:314:18406: scene=C_6
#: C_6:314
msgctxt "text_id=18406 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな馬鹿な話はない。"
msgstr "  Ridiculous."

#. Occurrence C_6:319:18407: scene=C_6
#: C_6:319
msgctxt "text_id=18407 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　仮にそうだとしても、それだけで止まる心臓なぞ<人|カ><狼|レ>は待ち合わせていない。"
msgstr "  Even if that was possible, there was no way that that alone could stop a werewolf's heart."

#. Occurrence C_6:352:18408: scene=C_6
#: C_6:352
msgctxt "text_id=18408 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　結局、どれだけ自問しても明確な答えはでなかった。"
msgstr "  In the end, no matter how much he thought about it, nothing added up."

#. Occurrence C_6:358:18409: scene=C_6
#: C_6:358
msgctxt "text_id=18409 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも“窮地に陥る”経験がなく、人間の<研磨|けんま>を知らない<人|カ><狼|レ>に、その答えは遠すぎた。"
msgstr "  The answer was out of reach for a werewolf with no knowledge of being backed into a corner, let alone the limits of human skill."

#. Occurrence C_6:391:18410: scene=C_6
#: C_6:391
msgctxt "text_id=18410 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なので、<人|カ><狼|レ>にとって確かな事は、己が倒れ臥している事実だけ。"
msgstr "  Only one thing was certain: he had lost."

#. Occurrence C_6:396:18411: scene=C_6
#: C_6:396
msgctxt "text_id=18411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手探りで経緯を思い返す。"
msgstr "  He tried to piece together the sequence of events."

#. Occurrence C_6:402:18412: scene=C_6
#: C_6:402
msgctxt "text_id=18412 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――胸に<炸裂|さくれつ>した衝撃と、一瞬の空白。"
msgstr "  The explosion in his chest... The flash of white..."

#. Occurrence C_6:408:18413: scene=C_6
#: C_6:408
msgctxt "text_id=18413 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その後、相手におおい<被|かぶ>さるように倒れこむ<最中|さなか>、もう一度背中に衝撃が走ったのだ。"
msgstr "  After that, as he was falling over, he took another blow to his back."

#. Occurrence C_6:413:18414: scene=C_6
#: C_6:413
msgctxt "text_id=18414 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心臓を破ったのは、その一撃によるものらしい。"
msgstr "  That was the one that disrupted his heart."

#. Occurrence C_6:446:18415: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0003; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:446
msgctxt "text_id=18415 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“……ふざけてる。そんな事で、ボクが―――”"
msgstr "(...This can't be. There's no way I...)"

#. Occurrence C_6:467:18416: scene=C_6
#: C_6:467
msgctxt "text_id=18416 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　倒される筈はない。"
msgstr "  Could lose? Indeed."

#. Occurrence C_6:472:18417: scene=C_6
#: C_6:472
msgctxt "text_id=18417 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　物理的に間違っている。"
msgstr "  It was physically impossible."

#. Occurrence C_6:477:18418: scene=C_6
#: C_6:477
msgctxt "text_id=18418 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　反則じみた結末に、少年は歯ぎしりをして全身に力をこめた。"
msgstr "  The boy gnashed his teeth and tensed his body in indignation at this unfair conclusion."

#. Occurrence C_6:498:18419: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0004; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:498
msgctxt "text_id=18419 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“―――そうだ。こんなのはウソだ。同族でだってボクを負かせる奴はいなかった。"
msgstr "(Oh, I know... none of this is real. No other werewolf ever managed to lay a claw on me."

#. Occurrence C_6:505:18420: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0005; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:505
msgctxt "text_id=18420 | speaker=beo"
msgid "こんな痛みも、こんな事態も、全部ウソだ。"
msgstr "This pain-this whole situation isn't really happening."

#. Occurrence C_6:512:18421: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0006; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:512
msgctxt "text_id=18421 | speaker=beo"
msgid "不合理に狂っている。"
msgstr "It makes no sense."

#. Occurrence C_6:519:18422: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0007; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:519
msgctxt "text_id=18422 | speaker=beo"
msgid "だって、この<器|ボク>が、他の生き物に負けるハズが……！”"
msgstr "Who on this planet could beat ME?!)"

#. Occurrence C_6:543:18423: scene=C_6
#: C_6:543
msgctxt "text_id=18423 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　考察の時間は終わりだ。"
msgstr "  Enough thinking."

#. Occurrence C_6:548:18424: scene=C_6
#: C_6:548
msgctxt "text_id=18424 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とうに傷は癒えている。"
msgstr "  He was ready."

#. Occurrence C_6:553:18425: scene=C_6
#: C_6:553
msgctxt "text_id=18425 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　再戦のため、<人|カ><狼|レ>は倒れたまま、傍らに立つ敵を睨みつけ、"
msgstr "  From the ground, he glared at his enemy to his side."

#. Occurrence C_6:584:18426: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0008; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:584
msgctxt "text_id=18426 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“負ける――ハズ、が―――”"
msgstr "\"I. Don't. Lose.\""

#. Occurrence C_6:609:18427: scene=C_6
#: C_6:609
msgctxt "text_id=18427 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　瞬間。"
msgstr "  The very next moment..."

#. Occurrence C_6:614:18428: scene=C_6
#: C_6:614
msgctxt "text_id=18428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　よく分からない新種の痛みが、人狼の背中を走り抜けた。"
msgstr "  An unknown type of pain coursed down his spine."

#. Occurrence C_6:680:18429: scene=C_6
#: C_6:680
msgctxt "text_id=18429 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　頭上には無機質な<視|め>。<眼|め>。<目|め>。"
msgstr "  It had eyes. Cold eyes. Staring. Piercing."

#. Occurrence C_6:685:18430: scene=C_6
#: C_6:685
msgctxt "text_id=18430 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりにも<活|いろ>がない。"
msgstr "  Colorless."

#. Occurrence C_6:690:18431: scene=C_6
#: C_6:690
msgctxt "text_id=18431 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まだ虚空にある月の方が<活|い>きている。"
msgstr "  The moon looked more alive."

#. Occurrence C_6:695:18432: scene=C_6
#: C_6:695
msgctxt "text_id=18432 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソレの両腕は折れている。"
msgstr "  Its arms were broken."

#. Occurrence C_6:700:18433: scene=C_6
#: C_6:700
msgctxt "text_id=18433 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人智に収まらぬ強打によって跡形もない。"
msgstr "  Its inhumanly powerful attack had mangled them beyond recognition."

#. Occurrence C_6:705:18434: scene=C_6
#: C_6:705
msgctxt "text_id=18434 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　痛覚があるのなら<叫|こえ>が漏れる。"
msgstr "  If it was in pain, it would have cried out."

#. Occurrence C_6:710:18435: scene=C_6
#: C_6:710
msgctxt "text_id=18435 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なのに無音という事は。"
msgstr "  But it was silent."

#. Occurrence C_6:715:18436: scene=C_6
#: C_6:715
msgctxt "text_id=18436 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　故に／"
msgstr "  Was..."

#. Occurrence C_6:715:18437: scene=C_6
#: C_6:715
msgctxt "text_id=18437 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "あるいは元より"
msgstr "...it..."

#. Occurrence C_6:715:18438: scene=C_6
#: C_6:715
msgctxt "text_id=18438 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "／生きていない。／"
msgstr "...ever..."

#. Occurrence C_6:715:18439: scene=C_6
#: C_6:715
msgctxt "text_id=18439 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "のか。"
msgstr "...alive...?"

#. Occurrence C_6:735:18440: scene=C_6
#: C_6:735
msgctxt "text_id=18440 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソレは死人のような<貌|め>で<人|カ><狼|レ>を凝視している。"
msgstr "  Those dead eyes..."

#. Occurrence C_6:740:18441: scene=C_6
#: C_6:740
msgctxt "text_id=18441 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　"
msgstr "                              "

#. Occurrence C_6:740:18442: scene=C_6
#: C_6:740
msgctxt "text_id=18442 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "近いモノなら知っている。"
msgstr "He'd seen eyes like those before."

#. Occurrence C_6:745:18443: scene=C_6
#: C_6:745
msgctxt "text_id=18443 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　憎悪もなし歓喜もなし。"
msgstr "  Those eyes without hatred. Without joy."

#. Occurrence C_6:750:18444: scene=C_6
#: C_6:750
msgctxt "text_id=18444 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いかなる意思の発露もなし。"
msgstr "  Without any feeling behind them at all."

#. Occurrence C_6:755:18445: scene=C_6
#: C_6:755
msgctxt "text_id=18445 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　"
msgstr "                              "

#. Occurrence C_6:755:18446: scene=C_6
#: C_6:755
msgctxt "text_id=18446 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "<脳|ちせい>のない昆虫だ。"
msgstr "It was a mindless insect."

#. Occurrence C_6:775:18447: scene=C_6
#: C_6:775
msgctxt "text_id=18447 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぞわりと体毛がささくれ立つ。"
msgstr "  The werewolf's hair stood on end."

#. Occurrence C_6:780:18448: scene=C_6
#: C_6:780
msgctxt "text_id=18448 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　己が背に走る感情の名を、人狼は知らない。"
msgstr "  What was this creeping chill, crawling up his spine?"

#. Occurrence C_6:785:18449: scene=C_6
#: C_6:785
msgctxt "text_id=18449 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その不可解さに<怖|おじ>けてしまったことを、そもそも恐怖を知らなかった<人|カ><狼|レ>には、微塵たりとも自覚できない。"
msgstr "  Having never experienced fear, the werewolf did not know what had become of him."

#. Occurrence C_6:839:18450: scene=C_6
#: C_6:839
msgctxt "text_id=18450 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……金狼は今まで、多くの神秘と戦い、これを打ち破ってきた。"
msgstr "  Despite countless clashes against other Mystics, it had been a human that broke him."

#. Occurrence C_6:845:18451: scene=C_6
#: C_6:845
msgctxt "text_id=18451 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カレは自分以上の巨体を誇る獣を知っている。"
msgstr "  He knew beasts even larger than himself."

#. Occurrence C_6:850:18452: scene=C_6
#: C_6:850
msgctxt "text_id=18452 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分と同じ、伝承から生まれた獣も知っている。"
msgstr "  He knew legendary creatures like himself."

#. Occurrence C_6:856:18453: scene=C_6
#: C_6:856
msgctxt "text_id=18453 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、コレは知らない。"
msgstr "  He did not know this."

#. Occurrence C_6:861:18454: scene=C_6
#: C_6:861
msgctxt "text_id=18454 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人間ほどの大きさをした昆虫など、彼は出会ってもいないし、想像した事さえなかった。"
msgstr "  He'd never met, much less imagined, a human-sized bug."

#. Occurrence C_6:911:18455: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0009; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:911
msgctxt "text_id=18455 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“―――、―――”"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_6:919:18456: scene=C_6
#: C_6:919
msgctxt "text_id=18456 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背筋が二つに割れそうな<悪寒|おかん>。"
msgstr "  The chill down the werewolf's spine was so vicious it threatened to split him in two."

#. Occurrence C_6:924:18457: scene=C_6
#: C_6:924
msgctxt "text_id=18457 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今ここで少しでも動けば、何の理由も初動もなく、首めがけてあの足が落ちてくる。"
msgstr "  If he moved even an inch, it would crush his skull underfoot."

#. Occurrence C_6:929:18458: scene=C_6
#: C_6:929
msgctxt "text_id=18458 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな絶望的な予感とは裏腹に、この相手は決して動かない事も、少年は感じ取っていた。"
msgstr "  In spite of the despair gripping him, the boy paradoxically sensed that his opponent would not move at all."

#. Occurrence C_6:966:18459: scene=C_6
#: C_6:966
msgctxt "text_id=18459 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この人間は、これ以上の暴力は振るわない。"
msgstr "  This human would exhibit no further violence."

#. Occurrence C_6:971:18460: scene=C_6
#: C_6:971
msgctxt "text_id=18460 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生き物らしい……いや、動物らしい本能がない石くれのクセに、<人|・><間|・><ら|・><し|・><い|・><分|・><別|・><で|・><動|・><い|・><て|・><い|・><る|・>。"
msgstr "  It was a creature-no, a stone-that held no animal instincts. It masqueraded as a human."

#. Occurrence C_6:1020:18461: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1020
msgctxt "text_id=18461 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その矛盾が、<人|カ><狼|レ>の<価値観|こころ>に粘りつく。"
msgstr "  The contradiction grated against his heart, his values."

#. Occurrence C_6:1025:18462: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1025
msgctxt "text_id=18462 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　未知の<感情|きょうふ>からくる<幻肢痛|げんしつう>。"
msgstr "  A phantom pain borne of an unknown emotion: fear."

#. Occurrence C_6:1030:18463: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1030
msgctxt "text_id=18463 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぷつぷつと音をたてて、小さな<画鋲|がびょう>が心臓に迫るようだ。"
msgstr "  It wasn't just grating; it was like many needles, slowly digging into his heart."

#. Occurrence C_6:1036:18464: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1036
msgctxt "text_id=18464 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは<人|カ><狼|レ>がはじめて出会った疑問であり、現実だった。"
msgstr "  This had been his first taste of doubt-of reality."

#. Occurrence C_6:1042:18465: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1042
msgctxt "text_id=18465 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この世にはどうしようもない矛盾があり、そして―――"
msgstr "  Such contradictions existed in the world, after all."

#. Occurrence C_6:1047:18466: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1047
msgctxt "text_id=18466 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　答えなど知りたくもない“不合理”があるのだと。"
msgstr "  They were irrationalities and questions you did not want to hear the answers to."

#. Occurrence C_6:1100:18467: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0010; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:1100
msgctxt "text_id=18467 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“っ―――い、た―――ぃ”"
msgstr "(It... hurts...)"

#. Occurrence C_6:1106:18468: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1106
msgctxt "text_id=18468 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それまで遮断していた痛覚が、全身にあふれ出す。"
msgstr "  The suppressed pain suddenly flowed through his body like a raging river."

#. Occurrence C_6:1111:18469: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1111
msgctxt "text_id=18469 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんな事も初めてだった。"
msgstr "  This was also a first."

#. Occurrence C_6:1116:18470: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1116
msgctxt "text_id=18470 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今まで<人|カ><狼|レ>の体は痛覚すら制御してきた。"
msgstr "  Until now, he had always been able to control pain."

#. Occurrence C_6:1121:18471: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1121
msgctxt "text_id=18471 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも悪寒など感じた事もなかった。"
msgstr "  He had never known what it was like to tremble."

#. Occurrence C_6:1126:18472: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1126
msgctxt "text_id=18472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　精霊がいたのなら嘆いただろう。"
msgstr "  An elemental might have even felt sorry for him, if it were here to watch."

#. Occurrence C_6:1131:18473: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1131
msgctxt "text_id=18473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……ああ。生まれながら完成していたモノが、人の世の不条理に混乱している。"
msgstr "  How sad... Born complete, yet lost in the lunacy of the human world."

#. Occurrence C_6:1195:18474: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0011; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:1195
msgctxt "text_id=18474 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“いた―――いたい、いたい、いたい―――！”"
msgstr "(It... it hurts! It hurts! It hurts so much!)"

#. Occurrence C_6:1201:18475: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1201
msgctxt "text_id=18475 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心臓は完治している。"
msgstr "  His heart had fully regenerated."

#. Occurrence C_6:1207:18476: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1207
msgctxt "text_id=18476 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "恐れからくる幻肢痛にあえぎながら、<人|カ><狼|レ>は震える体を抱きしめる。"
msgstr "Howling in mental agony, the beast clutched his own trembling body."

#. Occurrence C_6:1213:18477: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1213
msgctxt "text_id=18477 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　頭上にはレンズのような人間の目。"
msgstr "  Those eyes! Those human eyes looking straight through him!"

#. Occurrence C_6:1218:18478: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1218
msgctxt "text_id=18478 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それで、少年は自分が生きている理由をようやく悟った。"
msgstr "  And then, the boy realized the only reason he was still alive."

#. Occurrence C_6:1238:18479: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1238
msgctxt "text_id=18479 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たとえ両腕がなくても、残った足だけでこの相手は自分を殺せただろう。"
msgstr "  Even with both arms broken, the human could have finished him off with its legs."

#. Occurrence C_6:1243:18480: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1243
msgctxt "text_id=18480 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれどそれはありえない。"
msgstr "  But it mattered not."

#. Occurrence C_6:1248:18481: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1248
msgctxt "text_id=18481 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜなら、この相手は<た|・><だ|・><や|・><り|・><返|・><し|・><た|・><だ|・><け|・>なのだから。"
msgstr "  Because his opponent was giving him a taste of his own medicine."

#. Occurrence C_6:1254:18482: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1254
msgctxt "text_id=18482 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼を殺そうとした狼に対しての反撃、ではない。"
msgstr "  This was not revenge for trying to kill him."

#. Occurrence C_6:1259:18483: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1259
msgctxt "text_id=18483 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これは彼女たちを傷つけた行為に対する、当然の報復だった。"
msgstr "  This was revenge for the wounds he inflicted on the girls."

#. Occurrence C_6:1301:18484: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0012; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:1301
msgctxt "text_id=18484 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“―――、……、―――”"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_6:1307:18485: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1307
msgctxt "text_id=18485 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おかしさから<喉|のど>がひきつる。"
msgstr "  The absurdity of it all made his throat tighten."

#. Occurrence C_6:1312:18486: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1312
msgctxt "text_id=18486 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呼吸はさっきから乱れっぱなし。"
msgstr "  His breathing was frantic."

#. Occurrence C_6:1317:18487: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1317
msgctxt "text_id=18487 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この人間には自己がない。"
msgstr "  This human had no sense of self."

#. Occurrence C_6:1323:18488: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1323
msgctxt "text_id=18488 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "立ち塞がった金狼を、己に向けられた脅威だと計りもしない。"
msgstr "It had no concern for its own safety when it stood between him and the girls."

#. Occurrence C_6:1328:18489: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1328
msgctxt "text_id=18489 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　憎悪も恐怖も、おそらくは殺意すらなかったのはそういう事だ。"
msgstr "  That must be why it had no hate or fear... or perhaps even intent to kill him."

#. Occurrence C_6:1375:18490: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1375
msgctxt "text_id=18490 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――そう。人狼が生かされているのは、この人間の意志によるものではない。"
msgstr "  Indeed. The fact that he was alive had nothing to do with the human's will."

#. Occurrence C_6:1380:18491: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1380
msgctxt "text_id=18491 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　戦いも機械的なら、その判断も機械的。"
msgstr "  The fight was machine-like; so was its judgment."

#. Occurrence C_6:1385:18492: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1385
msgctxt "text_id=18492 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この生き物はただ、<等|・><価|・><な|・><交|・><換|・><を|・><行|・><っ|・><た|・>だけなのだ。"
msgstr "  An eye for an eye, and nothing more."

#. Occurrence C_6:1390:18493: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1390
msgctxt "text_id=18493 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼が彼女たちを一人でも手に掛けていれば、この差し引きは違っただろう。"
msgstr "  If the werewolf had killed one of the girls, this exchange would have ended differently."

#. Occurrence C_6:1437:18494: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0013; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:1437
msgctxt "text_id=18494 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“……殺していたら、殺されていた……？”"
msgstr "(...If I'd killed them, would I have been killed?)"

#. Occurrence C_6:1443:18495: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1443
msgctxt "text_id=18495 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その問いかけに、ぞくりとした。"
msgstr "  He shuddered at the thought."

#. Occurrence C_6:1448:18496: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1448
msgctxt "text_id=18496 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今まで考える事すらなかった恐れ。"
msgstr "  He had never entertained such a possibility."

#. Occurrence C_6:1453:18497: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1453
msgctxt "text_id=18497 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分はその<規律|ルール>の外にいるのだと、当然のように思っていたのに―――！"
msgstr "  He had never had to, because he was supposed to be the one exception to that rule!"

#. Occurrence C_6:1516:18498: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1516
msgctxt "text_id=18498 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　体中に痛みが走る。"
msgstr "  Agony kicked him hard in the gut."

#. Occurrence C_6:1521:18499: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1521
msgctxt "text_id=18499 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いかな神秘であろうと、傷つき、朽ちる事に例外はない。"
msgstr "  No matter the Mystic, nothing was immune from injury, from decay."

#. Occurrence C_6:1526:18500: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1526
msgctxt "text_id=18500 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな当たり前の摂理を、少年はようやく思い知った。"
msgstr "  The boy finally understood an obvious law of the world..."

#. Occurrence C_6:1531:18501: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1531
msgctxt "text_id=18501 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、思い知らされてしまった。"
msgstr "  ...or rather, he had been taught."

#. Occurrence C_6:1587:18502: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0014; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:1587
msgctxt "text_id=18502 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“……殺されてた……間違いなく……”"
msgstr "(He would've killed me... I know it...)"

#. Occurrence C_6:1593:18503: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1593
msgctxt "text_id=18503 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無機質な目は、感慨もなく見下ろしている。"
msgstr "  Those eyes. They would not stop staring down at him."

#. Occurrence C_6:1598:18504: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1598
msgctxt "text_id=18504 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　報復は万物に共通する摂理だ。"
msgstr "  Retribution was a universal law."

#. Occurrence C_6:1603:18505: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1603
msgctxt "text_id=18505 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはもう痛いほどよく分かった。"
msgstr "  He was now painfully aware of that fact."

#. Occurrence C_6:1609:18506: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1609
msgctxt "text_id=18506 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――なのに。"
msgstr "  And yet."

msgctxt "text_id=18507 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "なのに。"
msgstr " And yet."

msgctxt "text_id=18508 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "なのに。"
msgstr " And yet."

#. Occurrence C_6:1619:18509: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1619
msgctxt "text_id=18509 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを体現した生き物が、なにより、その決まりから外れているおぞましさ……！"
msgstr "  The one who brought form to this idea was this human!"

#. Occurrence C_6:1695:18510: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1695
msgctxt "text_id=18510 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　敗北の痛み、心臓の痛み、なにより、不可解を知った痛み。"
msgstr "  The pain of defeat! The pain in his heart! The pain of comprehending the incomprehensible!"

#. Occurrence C_6:1700:18511: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1700
msgctxt "text_id=18511 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　痛み、痛み、痛み。"
msgstr "  Pain, pain, pain..."

#. Occurrence C_6:1719:18512: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1719
msgctxt "text_id=18512 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あり得ない出来事によって、完璧だった世界が崩れていく。"
msgstr "  The impossibility of it all had shattered his perfect world."

#. Occurrence C_6:1724:18513: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1724
msgctxt "text_id=18513 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは全身を食い尽くす<茨|いばら>となって、少年の心柱を切断していった。"
msgstr "  It ate at him, consumed every fiber of his being."

#. Occurrence C_6:1771:18514: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1771
msgctxt "text_id=18514 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　目眩を起こすほどの疑問。"
msgstr "              The doubt made his head spin."

#. Occurrence C_6:1776:18515: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1776
msgctxt "text_id=18515 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　ああ―――"
msgstr "      It was too much."

#. Occurrence C_6:1782:18516: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1782
msgctxt "text_id=18516 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "人間は、<あ|・><ま|・><り|・><に|・><も|・><不|・><可|・><解|・><す|・><ぎ|・><る|・>。"
msgstr "Humans were impossible to understand."

#. Occurrence C_6:1822:18517: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_C_6_0015; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=C_6
#: C_6:1822
msgctxt "text_id=18517 | speaker=beo"
msgid "“……殺されてた。殺されてた、殺されてた……”"
msgstr "\"...I'd have been killed. I'd have been killed. I'd have been killed...\""

#. Occurrence C_6:1829:18518: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1829
msgctxt "text_id=18518 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他人の死に向けられたものではなく、己が生に対する<畏|おそ>れ。"
msgstr "  He had not been made to face the death of another, but his own."

#. Occurrence C_6:1834:18519: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1834
msgctxt "text_id=18519 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに耐えられなくなって、<人|カ><狼|レ>は獣から人間に戻ってしまった。"
msgstr "  Unable to cope, he reverted to his human form."

#. Occurrence C_6:1839:18520: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1839
msgctxt "text_id=18520 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……静かに。"
msgstr "  Quietly..."

#. Occurrence C_6:1844:18521: scene=C_6
#: C_6:1844
msgctxt "text_id=18521 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　母親の膝で<怯|おび>える子供のように、体を震わせながら。"
msgstr "  He shivered like a frightened child in a mother's lap."

#. Occurrence C_7:80:18522: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_7_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_7
#: C_7:80
msgctxt "text_id=18522 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「な…………」"
msgstr "\"Y...\""

#. Occurrence C_7:86:18523: scene=C_7
#: C_7:86
msgctxt "text_id=18523 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　倒れたまま、青子はつい声を飲んでしまった。"
msgstr "  Still lying in the snow, Aoko choked on her words,"

#. Occurrence C_7:91:18524: scene=C_7
#: C_7:91
msgctxt "text_id=18524 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正直、目の前で起こった事が把握できない。"
msgstr "  unable to entirely comprehend what had unfolded."

#. Occurrence C_7:136:18525: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_7_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_7
#: C_7:136
msgctxt "text_id=18525 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……草十郎、アンタ……」"
msgstr "\"...Soujyuro, you...\""

#. Occurrence C_7:141:18526: scene=C_7
#: C_7:141
msgctxt "text_id=18526 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つい呼びかける声が震えてしまう。"
msgstr "  She could not hide the trembling in her voice."

#. Occurrence C_7:147:18527: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_7_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_7
#: C_7:147
msgctxt "text_id=18527 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「なに？」"
msgstr "\"What?\""

#. Occurrence C_7:168:18528: scene=C_7
#: C_7:168
msgctxt "text_id=18528 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はいつもの口調で、ごく自然に振り向いた。"
msgstr "  Speaking in his usual way, Soujyuro nonchalantly turned toward her."

#. Occurrence C_7:189:18529: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_7_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_7
#: C_7:189
msgctxt "text_id=18529 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なにって……いま自分が何をしたか分かってんの！？」"
msgstr "\"What do you mean 'What'?! Do you even know what you just did?!\""

#. Occurrence C_7:250:18530: scene=C_7
#: C_7:250
msgctxt "text_id=18530 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悪いのはアンタの方、と言わんばかりの怒鳴り声だった。"
msgstr "  She shouted angrily, as though he had done something wrong."

#. Occurrence C_7:260:18531: scene=C_7
#: C_7:260
msgctxt "text_id=18531 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は目を点にして、青子が怒るような事をしたかな、と考えこむ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro looked surprised, wondering what on earth he had done to upset her."

#. Occurrence C_7:298:18532: scene=C_7
#: C_7:298
msgctxt "text_id=18532 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　視線を下に向けると、人狼は少年の姿に戻っていた。"
msgstr "  He lowered his gaze back to the wolf boy."

#. Occurrence C_7:303:18533: scene=C_7
#: C_7:303
msgctxt "text_id=18533 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……青子はこの事を言っているんだろうか、とようやく気付いて、草十郎は不機嫌そうに眉をひそめた。"
msgstr "  Knitting his brow in dismay, Soujyuro finally realized what Aoko was referring to."

#. Occurrence C_7:339:18534: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_7_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_7
#: C_7:339
msgctxt "text_id=18534 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「心外だな。蒼崎は分かってると思ってた」"
msgstr "\"That's weird, Aozaki. I thought you knew.\""

#. Occurrence C_7:344:18535: scene=C_7
#: C_7:344
msgctxt "text_id=18535 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　向けられる批難の目。"
msgstr "  He looked at her in disappointment."

#. Occurrence C_7:350:18536: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_7_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_7
#: C_7:350
msgctxt "text_id=18536 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え……わ、分かってるって、何をよ」"
msgstr "\"'Knew'...? Knew what? What're you talking about?\""

#. Occurrence C_7:355:18537: scene=C_7
#: C_7:355
msgctxt "text_id=18537 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　非難される覚えはないので、青子もややつっけんどんに聞き返す。"
msgstr "  Feeling slightly affronted, Aoko responded curtly."

#. Occurrence C_7:365:18538: scene=C_7
#: C_7:365
msgctxt "text_id=18538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに、草十郎は重いため息を洩らした。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro sighed."

#. Occurrence C_7:399:18539: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_7_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_7
#: C_7:399
msgctxt "text_id=18539 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「山じゃ、熊はそう珍しいものじゃない。"
msgstr "\"Bears are actually pretty common in the mountains."

#. Occurrence C_7:405:18540: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_7_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_7
#: C_7:405
msgctxt "text_id=18540 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　以前、確かに言ったじゃないか」"
msgstr "  Remember me telling you that?\""

#. Occurrence C_7:443:18541: scene=C_7
#: C_7:443
msgctxt "text_id=18541 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「――――――"
msgstr "\"..."

#. Occurrence C_7:452:18542: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_7_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_7
#: C_7:452
msgctxt "text_id=18542 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "は？」"
msgstr "Huh?\""

#. Occurrence C_7:472:18543: scene=C_7
#: C_7:472
msgctxt "text_id=18543 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……開いた口が<塞|ふさ>がらない。"
msgstr "  Aoko's jaw dropped."

#. Occurrence C_7:477:18544: scene=C_7
#: C_7:477
msgctxt "text_id=18544 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の言葉をそのままの意味として受け入れるのには、幾分かの時間を要した。"
msgstr "  It took her a moment to process what he had just said."

#. Occurrence C_7:497:18545: scene=C_7
#: C_7:497
msgctxt "text_id=18545 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はいつかの、他愛のないやりとりを思い出す。"
msgstr "  She recalled some meaningless conversation or other from who knows when."

#. Occurrence C_7:548:18546: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_7_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_7
#: C_7:548
msgctxt "text_id=18546 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "『……君、もしかして俺を罵迦にしているのか？"
msgstr "\"...Are you making fun of me?"

#. Occurrence C_7:554:18547: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_7_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_7
#: C_7:554
msgctxt "text_id=18547 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　まったく、なんで熊を倒すためなんかに修業しなくちゃいけないんだ』"
msgstr "  Good grief. Why did they train me to fight bears, of all things?\""

#. Occurrence C_7:614:18548: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_7_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_7
#: C_7:614
msgctxt "text_id=18548 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence C_7:619:18549: scene=C_7
#: C_7:619
msgctxt "text_id=18549 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう。よくよく思い返してみると、アレはおかしな言い回しだったのだ。"
msgstr "  Yes. Now she thought about it, they had spoken about that."

#. Occurrence C_7:624:18550: scene=C_7
#: C_7:624
msgctxt "text_id=18550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　熊という巨獣に慣れていないと言えない台詞だし、"
msgstr "  He'd mentioned being familiar with large beasts,"

#. Occurrence C_7:629:18551: scene=C_7
#: C_7:629
msgctxt "text_id=18551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも何より、彼本人が“修業をしていた”なんて時代錯誤な言葉を否定していない。"
msgstr "  and she couldn't deny that she'd heard him utter some anachronistic nonsense about training against them."

#. Occurrence C_7:678:18552: scene=C_7
#: C_7:678
msgctxt "text_id=18552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と、なると。"
msgstr "  Which meant..."

#. Occurrence C_7:713:18553: scene=C_7
#: C_7:713
msgctxt "text_id=18553 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼にとって、自分より大きな動物は珍しいものではなく。"
msgstr "  He was used to dealing with animals larger than himself."

#. Occurrence C_7:719:18554: scene=C_7
#: C_7:719
msgctxt "text_id=18554 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　野生の熊と遭遇するような生活をしていたのなら、人間が狼になる程度、驚くことはあれ、恐れることはないのかもしれない。"
msgstr "  If he'd lived the sort of life that involved run-ins with wild bears, then a man-wolf might only have been surprising, but not particularly frightening."

#. Occurrence C_7:769:18555: scene=C_7
#: C_7:769
msgctxt "text_id=18555 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこまで思い至って、青子は大きくうなだれた。"
msgstr "  Aoko hung her head."

#. Occurrence C_7:774:18556: scene=C_7
#: C_7:774
msgctxt "text_id=18556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　初めから、いちばん常識から外れていたのは、一体誰だったのか―――"
msgstr "  After all this time, who was it that really made no sense?"

#. Occurrence C_7:795:18557: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_7_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_7
#: C_7:795
msgctxt "text_id=18557 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……まいったわ。貴方の勝ちよ、草十郎」"
msgstr "\"...Okay. You win this one, Soujyuro.\""

#. Occurrence C_7:819:18558: scene=C_7
#: C_7:819
msgctxt "text_id=18558 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　感服したのか、それとも心底呆れたのか。"
msgstr "  It was hard to tell whether she spoke in admiration or exasperation."

#. Occurrence C_7:824:18559: scene=C_7
#: C_7:824
msgctxt "text_id=18559 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とにかく肩の力をがっくりと落として、青子は自分にだけ聞こえるよう、そんな台詞を呟いた。"
msgstr "  Either way, as she slouched in the snow, Aoko spoke quietly enough so only she could hear her words."

#. Occurrence C_8:74:18560: scene=C_8
#: C_8:74
msgctxt "text_id=18560 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、橙子は一連の出来事を正確に把握していた。"
msgstr "  Touko, on the other hand, understood exactly what had transpired."

#. Occurrence C_8:79:18561: scene=C_8
#: C_8:79
msgctxt "text_id=18561 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　倒れ<臥|ふ>し、人型になってしまったベオと、"
msgstr "  Beo lay fallen, now just a sobbing boy;"

#. Occurrence C_8:84:18562: scene=C_8
#: C_8:84
msgctxt "text_id=18562 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その傍らに立っている、両腕を粉砕した少年。"
msgstr "  and another boy stood over him with two shattered arms."

#. Occurrence C_8:104:18563: scene=C_8
#: C_8:104
msgctxt "text_id=18563 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼の一撃を受けて青子と有珠はまだ立ち上がれそうにないが、呼吸ができる程度には回復している。"
msgstr "  Near-fatally wounded, Aoko and Alice still could not stand, but had recovered enough to breathe."

#. Occurrence C_8:109:18564: scene=C_8
#: C_8:109
msgctxt "text_id=18564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　対して、自分に残された物はあと数刻……三、四回分のルーン文字だけである。"
msgstr "  As for Touko, she had only a few tricks up her sleeve. Maybe three or four more runes at best."

#. Occurrence C_8:129:18565: scene=C_8
#: C_8:129
msgctxt "text_id=18565 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背後の魔術刻印は使えない。"
msgstr "  The Magic Crests on her back were unusable."

#. Occurrence C_8:134:18566: scene=C_8
#: C_8:134
msgctxt "text_id=18566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　刻印の残魔力量―――祖父を密閉している結界を解除すれば攻撃に回せるが、それは下策にすぎる。"
msgstr "  She could use the remaining magical energy from the field imprisoning her grandfather, but that would be stupid;"

#. Occurrence C_8:196:18567: scene=C_8
#: C_8:196
msgctxt "text_id=18567 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも、いま祖父を解放すれば霊地の所有権は根こそぎ奪われる。"
msgstr "  if she released her grandfather, she would lose ownership of the sacred ground."

#. Occurrence C_8:201:18568: scene=C_8
#: C_8:201
msgctxt "text_id=18568 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここで青子たちに勝利しても始めからやり直し―――なんて徒労は容認できないし、なにより、この姉妹喧嘩に二度目はない。"
msgstr "  Failing to defeat Aoko and Alice now would mean starting over from square one, and she could not afford that. This sibling rivalry had to end."

#. Occurrence C_8:206:18569: scene=C_8
#: C_8:206
msgctxt "text_id=18569 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一度きりの奇襲だからこそ、彼女は全ての資金を<費|つい>やしたのだ。"
msgstr "  Touko had gambled everything on her surprise attack,"

#. Occurrence C_8:262:18570: scene=C_8
#: C_8:262
msgctxt "text_id=18570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分がまだ蒼崎の身内である事を利用した侵攻。"
msgstr "  using the fact she was still an Aozaki to infiltrate Misaki's defenses."

#. Occurrence C_8:267:18571: scene=C_8
#: C_8:267
msgctxt "text_id=18571 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　身を粉にして得た三年間の成果を協会に売り渡し、"
msgstr "  For three years she had labored, selling her work to the Association."

#. Occurrence C_8:272:18572: scene=C_8
#: C_8:272
msgctxt "text_id=18572 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二十年分の髪を代償にし、新たな使い魔を動員した。"
msgstr "  And she had used twenty years' worth of hair to mobilize an army of familiars."

#. Occurrence C_8:278:18573: scene=C_8
#: C_8:278
msgctxt "text_id=18573 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この条件で戦える事など、おそらく二度とはありえまい。"
msgstr "  It was now or never."

#. Occurrence C_8:318:18574: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:318
msgctxt "text_id=18574 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“―――だが、私は失敗した”"
msgstr "\"...But I failed.\""

#. Occurrence C_8:324:18575: scene=C_8
#: C_8:324
msgctxt "text_id=18575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　敗因は一点、人狼の力を絶対視しすぎていた事だ。"
msgstr "  She had overestimated the werewolf's power."

#. Occurrence C_8:329:18576: scene=C_8
#: C_8:329
msgctxt "text_id=18576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本来、そこに間違いはない。"
msgstr "  It should have been enough."

#. Occurrence C_8:334:18577: scene=C_8
#: C_8:334
msgctxt "text_id=18577 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　相手が魔術師であるのなら黄金のベオウルフだけで完璧なまでに勝利できる。"
msgstr "  Against mages alone, Beowulf by himself would have been enough to ensure complete victory."

#. Occurrence C_8:383:18578: scene=C_8
#: C_8:383
msgctxt "text_id=18578 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……ただ、そこに神風みたいなトラブルが紛れこんだ。"
msgstr "  But things did not always go according to plan."

#. Occurrence C_8:389:18579: scene=C_8
#: C_8:389
msgctxt "text_id=18579 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオの強さは相性の強さだ。"
msgstr "  Beo's incredible strength was conditional."

#. Occurrence C_8:394:18580: scene=C_8
#: C_8:394
msgctxt "text_id=18580 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを熟知しておきながら、なぜ、アレを食い物にできる例外もあると<留意|りゅうい>しなかったのか。"
msgstr "  She knew he was not infallible, so why hadn't she prepared a contingency plan?"

#. Occurrence C_8:414:18581: scene=C_8
#: C_8:414
msgctxt "text_id=18581 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は冷えきった心で、立ち尽くす少年を凝視する。"
msgstr "  Her heart as cold as ice, Touko stared at Soujyuro, who stood tall."

#. Occurrence C_8:474:18582: scene=C_8
#: C_8:474
msgctxt "text_id=18582 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……草十郎の両腕は、ひどい事になっていた。"
msgstr "  His arms were a hideous mess."

#. Occurrence C_8:480:18583: scene=C_8
#: C_8:480
msgctxt "text_id=18583 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正面からベオを打った左手は、腕のカタチをしていない。"
msgstr "  The arm he used to strike Beo head-on barely even resembled an arm."

#. Occurrence C_8:485:18584: scene=C_8
#: C_8:485
msgctxt "text_id=18584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　知恵の輪のように折れ曲がった骨と、はじけ散った筋肉繊維。<粉砕|ふんさい><骨折|こっせつ>と呼ぶのも馬鹿らしい。"
msgstr "  His bones were bent out of shape; his muscles were torn to shreds. To say his arm was simply broken would be a gross understatement."

#. Occurrence C_8:505:18585: scene=C_8
#: C_8:505
msgctxt "text_id=18585 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残った右腕も、肘に赤い血がにじみ出ている。"
msgstr "  Streams of crimson ran down his other arm onto the white snow."

#. Occurrence C_8:510:18586: scene=C_8
#: C_8:510
msgctxt "text_id=18586 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオの背中を強打した肘は、その肩の筋組織まで破裂させたのだろう。"
msgstr "  The elbow he drove into Beo's back was likely shattered, and his muscle and tendons torn up to his shoulder."

#. Occurrence C_8:545:18587: scene=C_8
#: C_8:545
msgctxt "text_id=18587 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……だらりと下がっている両腕を見ると、どちらも二度とは振るえまい。"
msgstr "  Judging from the state of his arms, it was doubtful he would be able to use them again."

#. Occurrence C_8:565:18588: scene=C_8
#: C_8:565
msgctxt "text_id=18588 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、より深い損傷を負っているのは彼の腕ではなく、内臓と左足だ。"
msgstr "  Worse than his arms were his left leg, and no doubt his internal organs, too."

#. Occurrence C_8:570:18589: scene=C_8
#: C_8:570
msgctxt "text_id=18589 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　軸足となった草十郎の左足は、ベオの突進を支えたに等しい。"
msgstr "  He had used the leg to take the full brunt of Beo's charge."

#. Occurrence C_8:576:18590: scene=C_8
#: C_8:576
msgctxt "text_id=18590 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "無事のように見えるが、あれはもう、ただ胴体に付いているだけの肉片だ。"
msgstr "At a glance, it looked fine, but it was now just a useless hunk of meat attached to his torso."

#. Occurrence C_8:581:18591: scene=C_8
#: C_8:581
msgctxt "text_id=18591 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<内臓|なかみ>はもっと酷い。ベオの体重を受け止めた事で背骨は<軋|きし>み、所々が内出血をしている。"
msgstr "  His insides were worse. Supporting the weight of Beo had ruptured his spine, causing widespread internal bleeding."

#. Occurrence C_8:631:18592: scene=C_8
#: C_8:631
msgctxt "text_id=18592 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つまり死に<体|たい>。"
msgstr "  Basically, he was a dead man standing."

#. Occurrence C_8:636:18593: scene=C_8
#: C_8:636
msgctxt "text_id=18593 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれは翼を失った鳥と同じ。"
msgstr "  A bird with clipped wings."

#. Occurrence C_8:641:18594: scene=C_8
#: C_8:641
msgctxt "text_id=18594 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生きる為のカタチを捨てた、終わった命。"
msgstr "  Living like that would not be living at all."

#. Occurrence C_8:646:18595: scene=C_8
#: C_8:646
msgctxt "text_id=18595 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう一度戦えば、彼に戦う<術|すべ>はない。"
msgstr "  He could barely stand, let alone fight again."

#. Occurrence C_8:692:18596: scene=C_8
#: C_8:692
msgctxt "text_id=18596 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　対して、倒れている人狼に傷はない。"
msgstr "  In contrast, the collapsed werewolf was unscathed."

#. Occurrence C_8:697:18597: scene=C_8
#: C_8:697
msgctxt "text_id=18597 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　口から吐いた<血咳|けっせき>は一度だけだ。"
msgstr "  Only once had he coughed up blood."

#. Occurrence C_8:702:18598: scene=C_8
#: C_8:702
msgctxt "text_id=18598 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雪原を染める赤い血は、草十郎だけが流している。"
msgstr "  The majority of the pool of red on the snow was Soujyuro's,"

#. Occurrence C_8:707:18599: scene=C_8
#: C_8:707
msgctxt "text_id=18599 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの鋼より硬い人狼の体毛を、躊躇する事なく殴り付けた証拠である。"
msgstr "  a crimson tapestry telling the story of the boy who stood strong and defeated a werewolf."

#. Occurrence C_8:741:18600: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:741
msgctxt "text_id=18600 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“……当然だ。衝撃には反動が伴う。"
msgstr "(...Every action has an equal and opposite reaction."

#. Occurrence C_8:747:18601: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:747
msgctxt "text_id=18601 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　拳を振るうのなら相応の負担がある。まして相手は人狼。"
msgstr "  You strike, and you face the consequences-especially if you hit a werewolf."

#. Occurrence C_8:753:18602: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:753
msgctxt "text_id=18602 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　走ってくる鉄の壁を真っ向から殴るようなものだ。"
msgstr "  It would be like punching a moving freight train."

#. Occurrence C_8:771:18603: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:771
msgctxt "text_id=18603 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　それを―――”"
msgstr "  Did he-)"

#. Occurrence C_8:801:18604: scene=C_8
#: C_8:801
msgctxt "text_id=18604 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　承知の上で、平然と<行|おこな>ったのか。"
msgstr "  Perhaps he had known what would happen."

#. Occurrence C_8:806:18605: scene=C_8
#: C_8:806
msgctxt "text_id=18605 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　動物は自分の体を庇って、本能的に力を加減してしまう。"
msgstr "  Animals instinctively limit their strength in order to protect their body."

#. Occurrence C_8:811:18606: scene=C_8
#: C_8:811
msgctxt "text_id=18606 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを理性の力、技術の<巧|たく>みで<補|おぎな>うのが人間の利点だとしたら、今のは人間の長所の結晶であり、同時に、あまりにも人間性からかけ離れている。"
msgstr "  Compensating for physical weakness with intellect and technique was humanity's forte, and that clash had shown humans at their very best. And yet, it had also been beyond human."

#. Occurrence C_8:843:18607: scene=C_8
#: C_8:843
msgctxt "text_id=18607 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自身の保存を顧みない、無償の一撃。"
msgstr "  He had attacked without concern for his own safety."

#. Occurrence C_8:848:18608: scene=C_8
#: C_8:848
msgctxt "text_id=18608 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自己保存の<楔|くさび>を外せば、その一撃は驚異的なものになるだろう。"
msgstr "  Without self-preservation in mind, he could go beyond human capability."

#. Occurrence C_8:853:18609: scene=C_8
#: C_8:853
msgctxt "text_id=18609 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鋼の如き人狼の体毛を貫通したのはその結果だ。"
msgstr "  Enough to strike through the steel-like fur of a legendary werewolf."

#. Occurrence C_8:871:18610: scene=C_8
#: C_8:871
msgctxt "text_id=18610 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……けれど、人間程度の腕力で、戦車の砲撃にも耐えるあの怪物を倒せるなどとは誰が思おうか。"
msgstr "  But who would have thought that a beast, able to withstand a shot from a tank, would be felled by a mere human?"

#. Occurrence C_8:915:18611: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:915
msgctxt "text_id=18611 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“……いや、違う。"
msgstr "\"...No, that's not right."

#. Occurrence C_8:922:18612: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:922
msgctxt "text_id=18612 | speaker=touko"
msgid "ためらう事なく殴り付けたから壊れた、のではない。"
msgstr "The boy didn't break because he struck without hesitation."

#. Occurrence C_8:929:18613: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:929
msgctxt "text_id=18613 | speaker=touko"
msgid "初めから、アレは<壊|・><す|・><事|・><を|・><前|・><提|・><に|・><し|・><て|・>いたな……”"
msgstr "He struck knowing he was going to break.\""

#. Occurrence C_8:962:18614: scene=C_8
#: C_8:962
msgctxt "text_id=18614 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　身体を引き替えにした心臓撃ち。"
msgstr "  He sacrificed his entire body to destroy Beo's heart."

#. Occurrence C_8:999:18615: scene=C_8
#: C_8:999
msgctxt "text_id=18615 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の狼退治を脳裏に再生した途端、橙子はぞくりとした感覚を味わった。"
msgstr "  Touko felt a chill come over her as she went over in her head what had transpired."

#. Occurrence C_8:1019:18616: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1019
msgctxt "text_id=18616 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女にとっては悪夢でしかない筈なのに、目を奪った人体合理の極北。"
msgstr "  It should have been a nightmarish scene, but she was captivated by that supreme display of physical rationality."

#. Occurrence C_8:1041:18617: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1041
msgctxt "text_id=18617 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　門外漢である橙子に見えたものは、アレはわずかな偶然もふくまない、当然の帰結であるという事だけ。"
msgstr "  From the outside looking in, she had witnessed not an accident, but a rational consequence."

#. Occurrence C_8:1046:18618: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1046
msgctxt "text_id=18618 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年はあの瞬間―――ベオの胸板を貫く事だけに<専心|せんしん>していた。"
msgstr "  In that instant, the boy had put his entire being into piercing Beo's chest."

#. Occurrence C_8:1090:18619: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1090
msgctxt "text_id=18619 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この広場に現れ、青子たちを視界に収めた時から。"
msgstr "  As soon as he laid eyes on Aoko and Alice, he had committed himself fully to the task."

#. Occurrence C_8:1095:18620: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1095
msgctxt "text_id=18620 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオを観察し、ベオと呼吸を合わせ、"
msgstr "  He sized Beo up, synchronized his breathing,"

#. Occurrence C_8:1100:18621: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1100
msgctxt "text_id=18621 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオの欠点、交差するのならどの位置が適切か、どのタイミングなら決して<覆|くつがえ>らない天秤が覆るのかを算出し。"
msgstr "  found his weak point, and calculated the exact position, timing, and distance he would need to hold his ground."

#. Occurrence C_8:1122:18622: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1122
msgctxt "text_id=18622 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<こ|・><の|・><条|・><件|・>なら勝機があると読み、そうなるように、自身の全てを費やした。"
msgstr "  He knew what he had to do to win, and did it with everything he had."

#. Occurrence C_8:1142:18623: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1142
msgctxt "text_id=18623 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それは、野生の感性などでは決してない。"
msgstr "  It had nothing to do with instinct."

#. Occurrence C_8:1148:18624: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1148
msgctxt "text_id=18624 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　野生の獣なら、勝てない相手には挑まない。"
msgstr "  A wild creature would not have tried to beat something it could not."

#. Occurrence C_8:1168:18625: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1168
msgctxt "text_id=18625 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　勝ち目のない戦いに命を賭すのは、人間だけの矛盾である。"
msgstr "  Only a human would risk his life when faced with the impossible."

#. Occurrence C_8:1226:18626: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1226
msgctxt "text_id=18626 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その矛盾が、あの一撃を練りあげた。"
msgstr "  That contradiction fed his attack."

#. Occurrence C_8:1231:18627: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1231
msgctxt "text_id=18627 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　全身の円運動、<踝|かかと>から首までの捻りだしを、<錐|きり>状にして集結させた。"
msgstr "  He twisted his body from his heel to his neck to focus his energy."

#. Occurrence C_8:1236:18628: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1236
msgctxt "text_id=18628 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……あるいは、ベオが突進による<轢殺|れきさつ>を目的としたのなら、草十郎は為す術なくひき殺されていただろう。"
msgstr "  If Beo had simply tried to run Soujyuro down, the werewolf would probably have won."

#. Occurrence C_8:1241:18629: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1241
msgctxt "text_id=18629 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だがベオは相手を引き裂く事を選んだ。"
msgstr "  But the beast wanted to rip him to shreds."

#. Occurrence C_8:1247:18630: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1247
msgctxt "text_id=18630 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "いや、安い挑発で選ばされた。"
msgstr "Or rather, he was baited into doing so."

#. Occurrence C_8:1311:18631: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1311
msgctxt "text_id=18631 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　金狼が突進し、踏みこむ瞬間。"
msgstr "  After Beo charged, when he planted his feet..."

#. Occurrence C_8:1333:18632: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1333
msgctxt "text_id=18632 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　爪を振り上げ、下ろす時の<気勢|いしき>の淀み。"
msgstr "  ...he raised his claw, then swung it downward, putting himself off-balance."

#. Occurrence C_8:1364:18633: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1364
msgctxt "text_id=18633 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　運動の基点、脈拍の乱れ、一瞬の無防備さ。"
msgstr "  His pulse was erratic, his movement wild; in that moment, he was vulnerable."

#. Occurrence C_8:1385:18634: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1385
msgctxt "text_id=18634 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼が突いたのはその一点だ。"
msgstr "  That was when Soujyuro made his move."

#. Occurrence C_8:1391:18635: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1391
msgctxt "text_id=18635 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　力を持て余し、ただ周囲にまき散らすだけの怪物と。"
msgstr "  The beast had overwhelming power, but it was sloppy."

#. Occurrence C_8:1396:18636: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1396
msgctxt "text_id=18636 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　数少ない力を<束|たば>ね、極小の一点に注ぎこむ人間の執念。"
msgstr "  whereas the human concentrated all of his meager power into a single point."

#. Occurrence C_8:1401:18637: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1401
msgctxt "text_id=18637 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その差が、天秤を人間に<傾|かたむ>けた。"
msgstr "  That was how the human shifted the balance in his favor."

#. Occurrence C_8:1446:18638: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1446
msgctxt "text_id=18638 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その後、あの<無様|ぶざま>な肘撃ちでベオの心臓は破裂した。"
msgstr "  The follow-up elbow attack would rupture Beo's heart."

#. Occurrence C_8:1451:18639: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1451
msgctxt "text_id=18639 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二撃目の肘撃ちには何の美しさもない。"
msgstr "  It was a graceless second strike,"

#. Occurrence C_8:1456:18640: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1456
msgctxt "text_id=18640 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　力まかせの、ベオと大差ない未熟な攻撃だった。"
msgstr "  a sloppy blow no different from Beo's."

#. Occurrence C_8:1461:18641: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1461
msgctxt "text_id=18641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本来ならベオの体毛に弾かれるだけの肘撃ちを致命傷たらしめたのは、最初の一撃があってこそ。"
msgstr "  The elbow was only able to penetrate the beast's golden fur because of the first attack to his chest."

#. Occurrence C_8:1495:18642: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:1495
msgctxt "text_id=18642 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“……あの時点でベオは丸裸にされていた。"
msgstr "(...It left Beo wide open."

#. Occurrence C_8:1501:18643: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:1501
msgctxt "text_id=18643 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　無敵の人狼が、その機能の一切を休止させられた。"
msgstr "  Took away his invincibility for a split second."

#. Occurrence C_8:1507:18644: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:1507
msgctxt "text_id=18644 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　つまり―――”"
msgstr "  Basically...)"

#. Occurrence C_8:1570:18645: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1570
msgctxt "text_id=18645 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アレは『壊す』のではなく、『止める』ための芸術だ。"
msgstr "  The strike was not meant to break, but to disable."

#. Occurrence C_8:1611:18646: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1611
msgctxt "text_id=18646 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生物には欠点がある。"
msgstr "  All living creatures had weaknesses."

#. Occurrence C_8:1640:18647: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1640
msgctxt "text_id=18647 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どのような強者であれ、弱い部分、弱い瞬間、弱い時間は存在する。"
msgstr "  No matter how strong the creature, it had weak points and weak moments."

#. Occurrence C_8:1645:18648: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1645
msgctxt "text_id=18648 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは<生態機能|フィジカル>だけに及ばず、<精神|メンタル>にもある落とし穴だ。"
msgstr "  Not just physically, but mentally, too."

#. Occurrence C_8:1665:18649: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1665
msgctxt "text_id=18649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　曰く、調子が悪い。"
msgstr "  A time when they aren't in their best shape,"

#. Occurrence C_8:1670:18650: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1670
msgctxt "text_id=18650 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　思考が冴えない、気分が乗らない。"
msgstr "  unable to focus, or find motivation."

#. Occurrence C_8:1675:18651: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1675
msgctxt "text_id=18651 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<病|やまい>、睡眠、食事、最小単位で言うのなら呼吸の隙間。"
msgstr "  Sickness, or a lack of sleep or food, for example, can cause the body's rhythm to go out of sync."

#. Occurrence C_8:1681:18652: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1681
msgctxt "text_id=18652 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　多くの理由から、理性あるものはその力を十全に発揮できない危険がある。"
msgstr "  For a variety of reasons, intelligent beings risked losing their ability to function properly."

#. Occurrence C_8:1686:18653: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1686
msgctxt "text_id=18653 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いかな神話の獣と言えど、ヒトであるかぎりその縛りからは逃れられない。"
msgstr "  Legendary beasts were no exception."

#. Occurrence C_8:1746:18654: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:1746
msgctxt "text_id=18654 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“……弱点、欠点を突く魔術なら知っているが―――全てを投げうって<弱|・><点|・><を|・><生|・><む|・>とはな”"
msgstr "(...Weaknesses. I know some magecraft that targets weaknesses, but I've never heard of a technique that risks everything to create a weakness.)"

#. Occurrence C_8:1786:18655: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1786
msgctxt "text_id=18655 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの少年の心臓撃ちは、ベオを殺す目的で撃たれたものではない。"
msgstr "  The boy's strike to the heart was not an attempt to kill Beo;"

#. Occurrence C_8:1791:18656: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1791
msgctxt "text_id=18656 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アレは弱点がないものに、弱点を作っただけ。"
msgstr "  it was designed to create a weakness in something that had none."

#. Occurrence C_8:1796:18657: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1796
msgctxt "text_id=18657 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その後の肘撃ちが力任せでありながらベオを粉砕したのは、既にベオが己の完全性を見失っていたからだ。"
msgstr "  The elbow attack took advantage of that break in Beo's invulnerability."

#. Occurrence C_8:1858:18658: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0012; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:1858
msgctxt "text_id=18658 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“……加えて、笑える事に不意打ちですらない。"
msgstr "(Laughably, it wasn't even a surprise attack."

#. Occurrence C_8:1864:18659: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:1864
msgctxt "text_id=18659 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ベオの神経の伝達速度なら、毒が当たった瞬間に感知し、対応できる。"
msgstr "  With Beo's reflexes, he should've been able to react."

#. Occurrence C_8:1875:18660: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0014; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:1875
msgctxt "text_id=18660 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　だが―――そもそも、それを毒と認識できなければ変形のしようもない。"
msgstr "  But he didn't even realize he was being attacked."

#. Occurrence C_8:1882:18661: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0015; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:1882
msgctxt "text_id=18661 | speaker=touko"
msgid "<毒|・><で|・><は|・><な|・><い|・><も|・><の|・><が|・><毒|・><に|・><な|・><る|・>なんて落とし穴を、誰が教えてやれるものか―――”"
msgstr "How do you teach that even something non-threatening can be a threat?)"

#. Occurrence C_8:1930:18662: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1930
msgctxt "text_id=18662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　舌打ちの一つもしたくなる。"
msgstr "  She was frustrated, to say the least."

#. Occurrence C_8:1935:18663: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1935
msgctxt "text_id=18663 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アレは究極の<献身|けんしん>。もしくは<捨身|しゃしん>。"
msgstr "  The boy was totally committed, utterly selfless."

#. Occurrence C_8:1940:18664: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1940
msgctxt "text_id=18664 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見返りを一切考えず、たった一秒の空白を作り上げる為だけに己の全てを賭した。"
msgstr "  He bet his life on that single moment without expecting a single thing in return."

#. Occurrence C_8:1945:18665: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1945
msgctxt "text_id=18665 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが出来る技量と経験を、あの少年は持っていたのだ。"
msgstr "  That boy had acquired the experience and skill to do such a thing."

#. Occurrence C_8:1965:18666: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1965
msgctxt "text_id=18666 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　奇跡を呼ぶ幸運も、"
msgstr "  It was not a miracle of luck,"

#. Occurrence C_8:1970:18667: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1970
msgctxt "text_id=18667 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　奇跡を掴む情熱も、あの行為には関わりがない。"
msgstr "  nor a miracle of passion."

#. Occurrence C_8:1998:18668: scene=C_8
#: C_8:1998
msgctxt "text_id=18668 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アレは才能によるものではなく、執念、怨念の<類|たぐい>。"
msgstr "  It was not talent, tenacity, or hatred."

#. Occurrence C_8:2004:18669: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2004
msgctxt "text_id=18669 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　過度の、極限状態での<鍛練|くりかえし>でなければ、あんな、一瞬で自身を焼却するような真似はできない。"
msgstr "  Without constant, intense training, no one could destroy their own body on a whim like that."

#. Occurrence C_8:2025:18670: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0016; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:2025
msgctxt "text_id=18670 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“……子供には、相手が悪かったようね”"
msgstr "(He made a poor opponent for a child.)"

#. Occurrence C_8:2048:18671: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2048
msgctxt "text_id=18671 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うずくまるベオを見て、橙子は自身の甘さに失望した。"
msgstr "  Seeing Beo cowering in the snow, Touko was disappointed in her own lack of foresight."

#. Occurrence C_8:2053:18672: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2053
msgctxt "text_id=18672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　性能のみを評価して連れてきたが、経験の少なさがこの結果を生んだのだ。"
msgstr "  She had used him for his talent alone, ignoring his inexperience."

#. Occurrence C_8:2058:18673: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2058
msgctxt "text_id=18673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオが子供でなければ、せめて一度でも自分と対等の相手と命を削りあう経験があったのなら、すぐさま立ち上がって草十郎を食い殺していただろうに。"
msgstr "  If Beo was not a child, his life experience might have given him the strength to bounce back and devour Soujyuro after regenerating."

#. Occurrence C_8:2090:18674: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0017; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:2090
msgctxt "text_id=18674 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“ベオを責めるべきか、それとも……君を評価すべきなのか”"
msgstr "(Should I scold you, Beo? Or praise you?)"

#. Occurrence C_8:2098:18675: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2098
msgctxt "text_id=18675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして、彼女は静かに左手を持ち上げる。"
msgstr "  Touko quietly lifted her left hand."

#. Occurrence C_8:2118:18676: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2118
msgctxt "text_id=18676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気が付く者は一人もいなかった。"
msgstr "  Nobody noticed."

#. Occurrence C_8:2138:18677: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2138
msgctxt "text_id=18677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　遠くで立つ少年の姿は、絵本の狩人に見えた。"
msgstr "  Standing far away, the boy standing there looked like a hunter from a picture book."

#. Occurrence C_8:2143:18678: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2143
msgctxt "text_id=18678 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　細い肉付きだが、アレは意図的に無駄を削ぎ落とされた結果だろう。"
msgstr "  He had a slender build, but that was likely because he intentionally shed any excess."

#. Occurrence C_8:2148:18679: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2148
msgctxt "text_id=18679 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の光景の後だと、その<飄然|ひょうぜん>とした仕草も、獲物を狙う獣のしなやかさを思わせる。"
msgstr "  Given what she just witnessed, his cluelessness had to be part of an act-the act of a hunter."

#. Occurrence C_8:2153:18680: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2153
msgctxt "text_id=18680 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを感じながら、橙子は不意に思い出した。"
msgstr "  As she thought to herself, she suddenly remembered."

#. Occurrence C_8:2158:18681: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2158
msgctxt "text_id=18681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分が彼と初めて話をした時、まっさきに脳裏によぎった事柄を。"
msgstr "  The first thing that crossed her mind the first time they spoke..."

#. Occurrence C_8:2179:18682: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:2179
msgctxt "text_id=18682 | speaker=touko"
msgid "“……そうだったな。"
msgstr "(...I remember now."

#. Occurrence C_8:2185:18683: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_8_0019; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_8
#: C_8:2185
msgctxt "text_id=18683 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　だが、それは忘れていたかったよ、草十郎君”"
msgstr "  And how I so wanted to forget, dear Soujyuro.)"

#. Occurrence C_8:2227:18684: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2227
msgctxt "text_id=18684 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分らしからぬ感傷を、鉄の理性が飲み下す。"
msgstr "  No sooner had she felt a slither of sentiment, she returned to her unshakeable resolve."

#. Occurrence C_8:2232:18685: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2232
msgctxt "text_id=18685 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手段の善悪など、蒼崎の後継ぎとして育てられた時に消失している。"
msgstr "  She was raised as the heir to the Aozaki household, taught never to question the morality of her actions."

#. Occurrence C_8:2237:18686: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2237
msgctxt "text_id=18686 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから、今からでも。"
msgstr "  That was why, even now..."

#. Occurrence C_8:2242:18687: scene=C_8
#: C_8:2242
msgctxt "text_id=18687 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女のやるべき行為は、たった一つに決まっていた。"
msgstr "  She knew exactly what she had to do."

#. Occurrence C_9:56:18688: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:56
msgctxt "text_id=18688 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「でも、よかった」"
msgstr "\"I'm glad that went well.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:62:18689: scene=C_9
#: C_9:62
msgctxt "text_id=18689 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　折れた両腕が痛むのか、草十郎は一歩も動かずに、そんな事を呟いた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro muttered, unmoving perhaps because of the pain in his broken arms."

#. Occurrence C_9:125:18690: scene=C_9
#: C_9:125
msgctxt "text_id=18690 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は青子を見ていない。"
msgstr "  He did not look at Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_9:130:18691: scene=C_9
#: C_9:130
msgctxt "text_id=18691 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　労りのこもった視線は、遠くの有珠に向けられている。"
msgstr "  Instead his gaze was focused on Alice, who was lying prone some way away."

#. Occurrence C_9:135:18692: scene=C_9
#: C_9:135
msgctxt "text_id=18692 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうしてか、その姿が孤独に見えて、"
msgstr "  Aoko thought he looked lonely."

#. Occurrence C_9:142:18693: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:142
msgctxt "text_id=18693 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「よかったって、なにがよ」"
msgstr "\"'That went well'? What did?\""

#. Occurrence C_9:148:18694: scene=C_9
#: C_9:148
msgctxt "text_id=18694 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　焚きつけるように、青子はそう問いかけた。"
msgstr "  She asked, spurring him on."

#. Occurrence C_9:168:18695: scene=C_9
#: C_9:168
msgctxt "text_id=18695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりの距離は離れてはいるが、互いが二歩も踏みだせば手が届く距離でもあった。"
msgstr "  They were mere steps from each other, close enough to touch hands."

#. Occurrence C_9:173:18696: scene=C_9
#: C_9:173
msgctxt "text_id=18696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小さな声も、この静けさではよく届く。"
msgstr "  Their quiet voices carried in the stillness."

#. Occurrence C_9:197:18697: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:197
msgctxt "text_id=18697 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「私たちが無事だったから、なんて言ったら怒るわよ」"
msgstr "\"Don't you dare say you're happy we're alive or I'll be so pissed.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:236:18698: scene=C_9
#: C_9:236
msgctxt "text_id=18698 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本心から青子は言う。"
msgstr "  She was not joking."

#. Occurrence C_9:241:18699: scene=C_9
#: C_9:241
msgctxt "text_id=18699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は青子から少しだけ顔を背けて、いや、と首を振った。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro turned away from her slightly, shaking his head."

#. Occurrence C_9:279:18700: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:279
msgctxt "text_id=18700 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「口にするのは三度目だけど、蒼崎の心配はしていないんだ。"
msgstr "\"I'll say it a third time, but I'm not worried about your safety, Aozaki."

#. Occurrence C_9:285:18701: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:285
msgctxt "text_id=18701 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……いや、さっきはちょっと、意識が飛んだようなんだけど」"
msgstr "  ...Y'know, I could swear I blacked out back there just for a moment.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:310:18702: scene=C_9
#: C_9:310
msgctxt "text_id=18702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　照れくさそうに苦笑する。"
msgstr "  He said, as an embarrassed smile crossed his face."

#. Occurrence C_9:315:18703: scene=C_9
#: C_9:315
msgctxt "text_id=18703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一度目は目眩で意識を失った。けれど、二度目は目眩も吐き気も、強い激情でかき消された。"
msgstr "  The first time, he outright fainted. But the second time, his passion pushed the dizziness and nausea aside."

#. Occurrence C_9:320:18704: scene=C_9
#: C_9:320
msgctxt "text_id=18704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は彼なりに冷静に、やれる事に<努|つと>めただけ。"
msgstr "  He just calmly did what he could as best he could."

#. Occurrence C_9:325:18705: scene=C_9
#: C_9:325
msgctxt "text_id=18705 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ、どんなに冷静になろうとしたところで、その根底にあったものは、自分本意な怒りだったのだ。"
msgstr "  Nevertheless, no matter how calm he tried to be, deep within festered a very real rage."

#. Occurrence C_9:365:18706: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:365
msgctxt "text_id=18706 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ふーん……じゃ、何がよかったのよ、草十郎」"
msgstr "\"Hmph... Okay, Soujyuro, what is it you think went so well?\""

#. Occurrence C_9:370:18707: scene=C_9
#: C_9:370
msgctxt "text_id=18707 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やや不満そうな青子の声。"
msgstr "  Aoko's voice had a slight tinge of annoyance."

#. Occurrence C_9:375:18708: scene=C_9
#: C_9:375
msgctxt "text_id=18708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに、"
msgstr "  Soujyuro responded,"

#. Occurrence C_9:396:18709: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:396
msgctxt "text_id=18709 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「だって、ようやく約束が守れた。そっちだけが約束を守っているのに、こっちは果たせなかっただろ。"
msgstr "\"Because I was finally able to keep my promise. You held up your end of the deal, but I hadn't delivered yet."

#. Occurrence C_9:402:18710: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:402
msgctxt "text_id=18710 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　それがずっと気になっていたんだ。その機会があって、本当によかった」"
msgstr "  That always bothered me. I'm so glad I got the chance to set things straight.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:424:18711: scene=C_9
#: C_9:424
msgctxt "text_id=18711 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は本当に嬉しそうに、ささやかな笑顔を浮かべた。"
msgstr "  His relief expressed itself as a small but heartfelt smile."

#. Occurrence C_9:506:18712: scene=C_9
#: C_9:506
msgctxt "text_id=18712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は呆然とその言葉を聞いている。"
msgstr "  Aoko listened, astonished."

#. Occurrence C_9:523:18713: scene=C_9
#: C_9:523
msgctxt "text_id=18713 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一瞬、草十郎の言う約束とは何なのか、彼女には思い当たらなかった。"
msgstr "  For a moment she could not recall what promise Soujyuro was talking about."

#. Occurrence C_9:528:18714: scene=C_9
#: C_9:528
msgctxt "text_id=18714 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それがもう遥か昔の出来事のような、遊園地でのものと気付いた時、思考が真っ白になってしまった。"
msgstr "  When she remembered what he was talking about-what she had told him all that time ago in the amusement park-her mind went blank."

#. Occurrence C_9:571:18715: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:571
msgctxt "text_id=18715 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "『アイツをやっつけるのに協力したら、俺の事は見逃してくれる？』"
msgstr "\"If I agree to help you kill that thing, will you let me go?\""

#. Occurrence C_9:577:18716: scene=C_9
#: C_9:577
msgctxt "text_id=18716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分から提案を持ちだしたものの、結局、あまり役には立てなかった。"
msgstr "  He proposed the deal, but in the end he hadn't been of any use."

#. Occurrence C_9:582:18717: scene=C_9
#: C_9:582
msgctxt "text_id=18717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを彼はずっと気に病んでいたのだろう。"
msgstr "  It must have been eating away at him this entire time."

#. Occurrence C_9:613:18718: scene=C_9
#: C_9:613
msgctxt "text_id=18718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……青子にとってあの約束は、自分だけの<約|も><束|の>だと思っていたのに。"
msgstr "  Aoko had considered the agreement binding, but only for herself."

#. Occurrence C_9:664:18719: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:664
msgctxt "text_id=18719 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……あんな、どうでもいい事を……？」"
msgstr "\"You were worried about *that*?\""

#. Occurrence C_9:670:18720: scene=C_9
#: C_9:670
msgctxt "text_id=18720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　信じられない、と呟く青子。"
msgstr "  She muttered in disbelief."

#. Occurrence C_9:675:18721: scene=C_9
#: C_9:675
msgctxt "text_id=18721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　か細いその声に、草十郎はああ、とうなずいた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro gave a nod, and affirmed with a tiny voice."

#. Occurrence C_9:696:18722: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:696
msgctxt "text_id=18722 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「約束は、自分のために果たすものだって、教えてくれたのは蒼崎だ。"
msgstr "\"You're the one who taught me that promises are things you make to yourself, Aozaki."

#. Occurrence C_9:724:18723: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:724
msgctxt "text_id=18723 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　だから、君が守っているかぎり俺も守らないといけない。"
msgstr "  So as long as you keep your word, I need to keep mine."

#. Occurrence C_9:735:18724: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:735
msgctxt "text_id=18724 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……ああ。ずっと、俺はそうしたかったんだ」"
msgstr "  Whew... What a weight off my shoulders.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:777:18725: scene=C_9
#: C_9:777
msgctxt "text_id=18725 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　告解のような独白に、青子は答えない。"
msgstr "  As if listening to a confessional, Aoko stayed silent."

#. Occurrence C_9:782:18726: scene=C_9
#: C_9:782
msgctxt "text_id=18726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　返答する言葉が見当たらない。"
msgstr "  She could not find the words to say, anyway."

#. Occurrence C_9:787:18727: scene=C_9
#: C_9:787
msgctxt "text_id=18727 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……何なんだろう、この男は。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro proved ever the enigma."

#. Occurrence C_9:792:18728: scene=C_9
#: C_9:792
msgctxt "text_id=18728 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あんな些細な約束を大事に思って、こんな簡単な言葉を大切そうに口にして。"
msgstr "  Taking such a trivial promise so seriously, and speaking so sincerely about something so basic..."

#. Occurrence C_9:812:18729: scene=C_9
#: C_9:812
msgctxt "text_id=18729 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼を倒してしまった事も謎なら、その性格も謎だらけだ。"
msgstr "  She could not wrap her head around how he had beaten a werewolf, but his personality? That was the true mystery."

#. Occurrence C_9:817:18730: scene=C_9
#: C_9:817
msgctxt "text_id=18730 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――いまさら思い返すまでもなく。"
msgstr "  It was no use trying to figure that out now."

#. Occurrence C_9:822:18731: scene=C_9
#: C_9:822
msgctxt "text_id=18731 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少なくとも蒼崎青子にとって、この相手は<徹頭|てっとう><徹尾|てつび>、正体不明の存在なのだった。"
msgstr "  To Aoko Aozaki, he was a riddle wrapped in an enigma wrapped in a conundrum."

#. Occurrence C_9:854:18732: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:854
msgctxt "text_id=18732 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それじゃ、借りは返したから帳尻はゼロだ。"
msgstr "\"So, I've paid my dues."

#. Occurrence C_9:860:18733: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:860
msgctxt "text_id=18733 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　これで貸し借りはなしだぞ、蒼崎」"
msgstr "  We're even, Aozaki.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:866:18734: scene=C_9
#: C_9:866
msgctxt "text_id=18734 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は冗談っぽく口にする。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro said lightly,"

#. Occurrence C_9:871:18735: scene=C_9
#: C_9:871
msgctxt "text_id=18735 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無言で沈みこむ青子に気を利かせたのだろう。"
msgstr "  perhaps attempting to break the silence."

#. Occurrence C_9:876:18736: scene=C_9
#: C_9:876
msgctxt "text_id=18736 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつもは気が付かないけれど、今回ばかりは、彼のそんな穏やかな優しさは伝わったようだ。"
msgstr "  Normally this would have passed her by, but she saw his kindness for what it was."

#. Occurrence C_9:922:18737: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:922
msgctxt "text_id=18737 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「貸しがついたのはこっちの方よ。"
msgstr "\"It's me who owes you one now."

#. Occurrence C_9:929:18738: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:929
msgctxt "text_id=18738 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "……これじゃ、どうやって返していいか分からないじゃない」"
msgstr "I don't even know how to begin to pay you back.\" Aoko grumbled."

#. Occurrence C_9:935:18739: scene=C_9
#: C_9:935
msgctxt "text_id=18739 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子のぼやきに、草十郎はもう一度、ああ、と嬉しげに頷いた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded in happy agreement."

#. Occurrence C_9:971:18740: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:971
msgctxt "text_id=18740 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それより蒼崎の足、なんか<塞|ふさ>がってるな。"
msgstr "\"Anyway, your leg looks a lot better."

#. Occurrence C_9:988:18741: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_C_9_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=C_9
#: C_9:988
msgctxt "text_id=18741 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　もしかして、もう立てるのか？」"
msgstr "  Can you stand?\""

#. Occurrence C_9:994:18742: scene=C_9
#: C_9:994
msgctxt "text_id=18742 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あったりまえよ、と青子は目で意地を張る。"
msgstr "  She shot him a stubborn look as if to say, \"well, duh, obviously.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:1008:18743: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1008
msgctxt "text_id=18743 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その気丈さに呆れながら、草十郎は右手を差し伸べた。"
msgstr "  Ever amazed by her grit, he offered her his right hand."

#. Occurrence C_9:1030:18744: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1030
msgctxt "text_id=18744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　肘が砕けているのに、青子にはその右手は何より頑丈そうに見えた。"
msgstr "  Despite being broken at the elbow, to Aoko it looked as sturdy as ever."

#. Occurrence C_9:1035:18745: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1035
msgctxt "text_id=18745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どう見ても再起不能。おそらくは<一生涯|いっしょうがい><完治|かんち>しまい。"
msgstr "  By all appearances, it was beyond recovery, and would be for the rest of his life."

#. Occurrence C_9:1040:18746: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1040
msgctxt "text_id=18746 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも青子を立たせる為なら、その時だけは痛まないのだろう。"
msgstr "  Even so, he seemed able to ignore the pain for Aoko's sake."

#. Occurrence C_9:1061:18747: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:1061
msgctxt "text_id=18747 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ほんと、アンタってばか」"
msgstr "\"You really are hopeless.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:1070:18748: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1070
msgctxt "text_id=18748 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見上げながら青子は小さく呟いた。"
msgstr "  She uttered under her breath, looking up at him."

#. Occurrence C_9:1075:18749: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1075
msgctxt "text_id=18749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悔しいけれど、今はその手を拒めそうにない。"
msgstr "  As much as she hated to admit, she could not refuse his hand."

#. Occurrence C_9:1080:18750: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1080
msgctxt "text_id=18750 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は仕方なげに、草十郎の手を取ろうと手を伸ばす。"
msgstr "  Resigning herself, she reached out to Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence C_9:1117:18751: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1117
msgctxt "text_id=18751 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、その手が触れ合う事はなかった。"
msgstr "  But her hand never reached his."

#. Occurrence C_9:1127:18752: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1127
msgctxt "text_id=18752 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しゃん、と鈴を鳴らす音。"
msgstr "  A small bell chimed."

#. Occurrence C_9:1144:18753: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1144
msgctxt "text_id=18753 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　風は線を引いて走った。"
msgstr "  A line of wind whipped through the air."

#. Occurrence C_9:1149:18754: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1149
msgctxt "text_id=18754 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　断頭台の刃は、胴体を裂くように横なぐりに。"
msgstr "  It cut through his waist, like a guillotine."

#. Occurrence C_9:1189:18755: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1189
msgctxt "text_id=18755 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あっけなく崩れ落ちる。"
msgstr "  Pieces began to fall."

#. Occurrence C_9:1196:18756: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1196
msgctxt "text_id=18756 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目の前に落ちた<物|モ><体|ノ>が一秒前まで誰だったか、彼女はすぐに、思い出せなかった。"
msgstr "  What were those things dropping before her eyes? Aoko could not remember who they belonged to."

#. Occurrence C_9:1234:18757: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:1234
msgctxt "text_id=18757 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そう……じゅうろう……？」"
msgstr "\"Sou...jyuro...?\""

#. Occurrence C_9:1254:18758: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1254
msgctxt "text_id=18758 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分と同じく地に臥した、そう呼ばれていた物に青子は語りかけた。"
msgstr "  That used to be his name, right? The name of whoever lay in the red snow in front of her."

#. Occurrence C_9:1259:18759: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1259
msgctxt "text_id=18759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の顔はもう、自分より低いところに倒れている。"
msgstr "  His face now rested on the ground beneath her chin."

#. Occurrence C_9:1264:18760: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1264
msgctxt "text_id=18760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鼻腔をつく<臓|ハ><物|ラ>の異臭。"
msgstr "  The smell of viscera assaulted her nostrils."

#. Occurrence C_9:1269:18761: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1269
msgctxt "text_id=18761 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かつて胃のあった箇所から、赤い血液が飛散している。"
msgstr "  A river of blood flowed from what used to be a stomach."

#. Occurrence C_9:1302:18762: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1302
msgctxt "text_id=18762 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一瞬の出来事だった。"
msgstr "  It happened so fast."

#. Occurrence C_9:1307:18763: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1307
msgctxt "text_id=18763 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　水のつまったバケツを倒した時みたいに、何もかも一瞬で終わってしまって、現実感がまるで無い。"
msgstr "  Too fast for her mind to process in fact."

#. Occurrence C_9:1326:18764: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1326
msgctxt "text_id=18764 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　唯一の救いは、たぶん、痛みさえ一瞬だった事ぐらい。"
msgstr "  Her only solace was he probably did not suffer."

#. Occurrence C_9:1331:18765: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1331
msgctxt "text_id=18765 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は一変した状況を目前にしながら、冷静に、即死だな、と判断する自分に腹を立てた。"
msgstr "  How could she think that so calmly, especially after what she had witnessed? Her blood boiled at her own stupidity."

#. Occurrence C_9:1347:18766: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1347
msgctxt "text_id=18766 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……しかし。"
msgstr "  Which begged the question..."

#. Occurrence C_9:1353:18767: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1353
msgctxt "text_id=18767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "そうなると、これを行った相手にはどんな感情をぶつければいいのだろう。"
msgstr "How should she treat the one who did this?"

#. Occurrence C_9:1396:18768: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1396
msgctxt "text_id=18768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　怒りは自分相手に使ってしまった。"
msgstr "  She had used all her anger on herself."

#. Occurrence C_9:1401:18769: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1401
msgctxt "text_id=18769 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他人に回す余裕なんて許さない。"
msgstr "  She had none left to give anyone else."

#. Occurrence C_9:1406:18770: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1406
msgctxt "text_id=18770 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この憎悪は自分を焼く為に使うと決めた。"
msgstr "  But this hatred was hers and hers alone."

#. Occurrence C_9:1411:18771: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1411
msgctxt "text_id=18771 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　次の問題は、コレを上回る激情が、はたして自分の中にあるかどうか。"
msgstr "  Her problem was this: could she muster the emotions from this drought of anger?"

#. Occurrence C_9:1416:18772: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1416
msgctxt "text_id=18772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　疑問に思いつつ、それを探すのはわりと楽しそうな気がして、彼女はくすりと<微笑|わら>ってしまった。"
msgstr "  She was not sure, but the thought of hunting them down made her smile unconsciously in anticipation."

#. Occurrence C_9:1463:18773: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1463
msgctxt "text_id=18773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　旧校舎に視線を向けると、片腕を胸の位置に構えた蒼崎橙子の姿がある。"
msgstr "  Aoko turned to the old school building, to where Touko was standing with her arm out in front of her."

#. Occurrence C_9:1468:18774: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1468
msgctxt "text_id=18774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は青子や有珠には魔力で<弾|はじ>かれる簡素なルーン魔術を、刻印を持たない<草|あ><十|い><郎|て>に放ったのだ。"
msgstr "  She had used the same rune magecraft she used against Aoko and Alice. Except Soujyuro had no Magic Crests."

#. Occurrence C_9:1502:18775: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1502
msgctxt "text_id=18775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は琥珀色の瞳をやや細めて、崩れ落ちた死体を見つめている。"
msgstr "  Touko's amber eyes were narrowed, staring intensely at the fallen corpse."

#. Occurrence C_9:1507:18776: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1507
msgctxt "text_id=18776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこにどんな感情があるかなんて、青子はいちいち考えてみる気にもならなかった。"
msgstr "  As to what she might have been feeling, Aoko could not care less."

#. Occurrence C_9:1512:18777: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1512
msgctxt "text_id=18777 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もし仮に後悔の色なんてあったりしたら、それこそ一生許せないだろうし。"
msgstr "  Even if Touko felt regret, Aoko would never forgive her for as long as she drew breath."

#. Occurrence C_9:1578:18778: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_9_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_9
#: C_9:1578
msgctxt "text_id=18778 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「やはり、君からこうしておくべきだったな」"
msgstr "\"I should have killed you when I had the chance.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:1584:18779: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1584
msgctxt "text_id=18779 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は青子にではなく、もう応えない死体に語りかけた。"
msgstr "  Touko was not speaking to Aoko, but to the dead body."

#. Occurrence C_9:1589:18780: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1589
msgctxt "text_id=18780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　反応もない。"
msgstr "  There was no response."

#. Occurrence C_9:1595:18781: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1595
msgctxt "text_id=18781 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "呼吸もない。"
msgstr "No clouds of breath."

#. Occurrence C_9:1600:18782: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1600
msgctxt "text_id=18782 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが完全に死んでいる事を確認して、青子は腕に力をこめて立ち上がった。"
msgstr "  Coming to terms that he was truly dead, Aoko pushed herself up to her feet."

#. Occurrence C_9:1660:18783: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:1660
msgctxt "text_id=18783 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「案外、無様ね」"
msgstr "\"That was surprisingly gruesome for you.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:1666:18784: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1666
msgctxt "text_id=18784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　遠く離れた姉に向けて、青子は乾いた声で語りかける。"
msgstr "  Facing her sister in the distance, Aoko spoke hoarsely."

#. Occurrence C_9:1673:18785: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:1673
msgctxt "text_id=18785 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でも正しい選択だわ。これで勝負はやり直しだもの」"
msgstr "\"But you made the right choice. Now we can finish this.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:1749:18786: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1749
msgctxt "text_id=18786 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の死体に背を向けて、青子は橙子へと向き直った。"
msgstr "  She turned away from Soujyuro and stared at Aoko."

#. Occurrence C_9:1754:18787: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1754
msgctxt "text_id=18787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　両者の距離は遠い。"
msgstr "  They stood far apart."

#. Occurrence C_9:1759:18788: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1759
msgctxt "text_id=18788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは実際の広がりより、遥かに遠い<断絶|だんぜつ>。"
msgstr "  Farther apart than their positions made them seem."

#. Occurrence C_9:1764:18789: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1764
msgctxt "text_id=18789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本当は交わす言葉なんて無いのだけど、今までの姉妹としての人生に敬意を表して、ふたりは益体のない会話を交わす。"
msgstr "  Though there was nothing left to say, the two of them exchanged words in respect of the fact they were once sisters."

#. Occurrence C_9:1785:18790: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_9_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_9
#: C_9:1785
msgctxt "text_id=18790 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「―――ああ。魔術刻印という私の切札はこの通りで、人狼というカードもおまえの切札の前に破れ去った。"
msgstr "\"...Right. You've seen the aces up my sleeve: my Magic Crests, and the werewolf you've trumped."

#. Occurrence C_9:1791:18791: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_9_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_9
#: C_9:1791
msgctxt "text_id=18791 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　だが、そちらも刻印を使いきり、彼もいま息絶えた。"
msgstr "  I've used all my crests up. And your trump card's been torn to pieces."

#. Occurrence C_9:1797:18792: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_9_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_9
#: C_9:1797
msgctxt "text_id=18792 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　互いに決定打はなくなった訳だ」"
msgstr "  Stalemate.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:1818:18793: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:1818
msgctxt "text_id=18793 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうね。私も甘かった。人狼が再起不能になった時点で、貴女が敗北を認めたなんて勝手に思い上がるんだから。"
msgstr "\"Looks that way. I suppose I was naive, too. I should've known you wouldn't accept defeat after your werewolf failed."

#. Occurrence C_9:1824:18794: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:1824
msgctxt "text_id=18794 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……本来ならそうなるんだけど、貴女がそんなに<諦|あきら>めがいいのなら、この町に戻ってきはしないものね。"
msgstr "  If you weren't so stubborn, you'd never have come back to Misaki."

#. Occurrence C_9:1858:18795: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1858
msgctxt "text_id=18795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　――――――"
msgstr "  ..."

#. Occurrence C_9:1867:18796: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:1867
msgctxt "text_id=18796 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "本当に、甘かった」"
msgstr "I... really was naïve.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:1917:18797: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1917
msgctxt "text_id=18797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の声が、自分の<言霊|ことだま>を圧倒している事を橙子は認めた。"
msgstr "  It was clear to Touko that Aoko was trying to suppress her emotions."

#. Occurrence C_9:1922:18798: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1922
msgctxt "text_id=18798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の見解は正しい。それほど橙子は<使い魔|ベオウルフ>に依存していた。"
msgstr "  Aoko was right, though. Her sister had counted on Beowulf to succeed."

#. Occurrence C_9:1927:18799: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1927
msgctxt "text_id=18799 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠と青子にどんな切札があろうと、彼女たちが魔術師である以上、倒しようのなかった最強の人狼。"
msgstr "  As mages, no matter what cards Aoko or Alice had in their hands, they were helpless against the werewolf."

#. Occurrence C_9:1932:18800: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1932
msgctxt "text_id=18800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを破った草十郎がいるかぎりは、橙子に勝利はない。"
msgstr "  But then, Soujyuro had shown up, and Touko couldn't win as long as he was around."

#. Occurrence C_9:1937:18801: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1937
msgctxt "text_id=18801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど草十郎は人狼を討つ事はできても、魔術師に対しては、そのかぎりではなかったのだ。"
msgstr "  Unfortunately, though he had stopped the werewolf, he had been defenseless against a mage."

#. Occurrence C_9:1979:18802: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1979
msgctxt "text_id=18802 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから殺した。"
msgstr "  So she had to kill him."

#. Occurrence C_9:1984:18803: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1984
msgctxt "text_id=18803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎さえ退場すれば人狼を阻む者はいなくなる。"
msgstr "  With Soujyuro out of the way, no one could hold Beo back."

#. Occurrence C_9:1989:18804: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1989
msgctxt "text_id=18804 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼の再起に時間はかかるだろうが、精神的なものであるなら治療可能だ。"
msgstr "  It would take time for him to recover, but as long as his wounds were only mental, that could be overcome."

#. Occurrence C_9:1994:18805: scene=C_9
#: C_9:1994
msgctxt "text_id=18805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その前に青子たちは挑んでくるだろうが、有珠の体内の毒草を解呪しないかぎり橙子の優位は動かない。"
msgstr "  Alice and Aoko could try to attack again before he recovered, but Alice was being kept in check by the poison, so Touko still had the advantage."

#. Occurrence C_9:2068:18806: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2068
msgctxt "text_id=18806 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この通り、今はお互い決定打が無い。"
msgstr "  Stalemate, still."

#. Occurrence C_9:2073:18807: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2073
msgctxt "text_id=18807 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　戦いはどう見ても後日に引き伸ばされる事になる。"
msgstr "  The battle would drag on."

#. Occurrence C_9:2091:18808: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2091
msgctxt "text_id=18808 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――青子が、それを使わなければ。"
msgstr "  Unless Aoko were to use *it*."

#. Occurrence C_9:2167:18809: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2167
msgctxt "text_id=18809 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　粉雪が舞う。"
msgstr "  Powdery snow began to whirl around."

#. Occurrence C_9:2172:18810: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2172
msgctxt "text_id=18810 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女を中心に、大気そのものが<軋|きし>みをあげる。"
msgstr "  The air around her wailed."

#. Occurrence C_9:2178:18811: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2178
msgctxt "text_id=18811 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――神秘を<超越|ちょうえつ>した魔術。"
msgstr "  It was magecraft that transcended all that was mystical-"

#. Occurrence C_9:2184:18812: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2184
msgctxt "text_id=18812 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人智を<拒|こば>む奇跡の扉が、この雪原に下りようとしている。"
msgstr "  the gate to miracles beyond human comprehension, ready to show itself."

#. Occurrence C_9:2259:18813: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_C_9_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=C_9
#: C_9:2259
msgctxt "text_id=18813 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「やる気のようね、青子」"
msgstr "\"You always did love to fight, Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:2351:18814: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2351
msgctxt "text_id=18814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は結界の維持を解除した。"
msgstr "  Touko released the crests maintaining the fields."

#. Occurrence C_9:2356:18815: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2356
msgctxt "text_id=18815 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これで祖父は自由になり、ここまで破壊した三咲の結界は修復されてしまうだろう。"
msgstr "  With that, her grandfather would be freed, and the barriers around Misaki would be restored."

#. Occurrence C_9:2361:18816: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2361
msgctxt "text_id=18816 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、今ここで刻印を使わなければ自分の命が無いと彼女は即断した。"
msgstr "  Which was not what Touko wanted, but it was that or forfeit her life."

#. Occurrence C_9:2381:18817: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2381
msgctxt "text_id=18817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　使用可能になった橙子の刻印は、青子の<刻印|それ>の二倍強。"
msgstr "  The crests at her disposal were now twice as powerful as her sister's."

#. Occurrence C_9:2407:18818: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2407
msgctxt "text_id=18818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その脅威を青子は半眼で眺めている。"
msgstr "  Aoko gazed at this new threat with her eyes half-closed."

#. Occurrence C_9:2423:18819: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2423
msgctxt "text_id=18819 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まるっきり興味の外。"
msgstr "  None of this was her concern."

#. Occurrence C_9:2428:18820: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2428
msgctxt "text_id=18820 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女はそんな<外部|モノ>より、心中に<潜|ひそ>むモノを探りあて、慎重に捕まえていた。"
msgstr "  Far removed from the situation, she was searching for something hidden deeper inside herself, desperate to reach it."

#. Occurrence C_9:2476:18821: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2476
msgctxt "text_id=18821 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それは、<藻|も>のような手応えだった。"
msgstr "  There it was, an odd feeling, like picking up algae."

#. Occurrence C_9:2481:18822: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2481
msgctxt "text_id=18822 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　激情の<類|たぐい>ではないし、堅くも、大きくもない。"
msgstr "  It was not the fire of emotion. It was not solid, nor great."

#. Occurrence C_9:2493:18823: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2493
msgctxt "text_id=18823 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　きっと、こんなのはその場の<勢|いきお>い。"
msgstr "  It must have been people meant by \"rising to the occasion.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:2498:18824: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2498
msgctxt "text_id=18824 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は思考そのものを放棄して、心中のわだかまりを掌中に収め、強く敵を凝視する。"
msgstr "  Abandoning thought itself, Aoko held on to that feeling as she stared at her enemy."

#. Occurrence C_9:2522:18825: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:2522
msgctxt "text_id=18825 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いいわよ、橙子」"
msgstr "\"All right, Touko.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:2527:18826: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2527
msgctxt "text_id=18826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小さな、けれど叫びより確かな呟き。"
msgstr "  She spoke softly, yet more loudly than a scream."

#. Occurrence C_9:2534:18827: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_C_9_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=C_9
#: C_9:2534
msgctxt "text_id=18827 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――お望みどおり、本当の『魔法』を見せてあげる」"
msgstr "\"You want True Magic? You've got it.\""

#. Occurrence C_9:2540:18828: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2540
msgctxt "text_id=18828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　輝きを失った右腕の刻印に<意識|ちから>を込めて、彼女はその続きをはっきりと紡いだ。"
msgstr "  Focusing her power into the dim crests on her right arm, she weaved the words together."

#. Occurrence C_9:2616:18829: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2616
msgctxt "text_id=18829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ひとつの呪文。"
msgstr "  A single incantation."

#. Occurrence C_9:2623:18830: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2623
msgctxt "text_id=18830 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　深い想いが<籠|こ>められた彼女の訣別。"
msgstr "  A final, heartfelt farewell."

#. Occurrence C_9:2629:18831: scene=C_9
#: C_9:2629
msgctxt "text_id=18831 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは、ある誰かの幸福だった時間を巻き戻す、青い色をした魔法のことば。"
msgstr "  A brilliant, blue-colored Magic, taking time back to when a certain someone had been blessed."

#. Occurrence D_1:52:18832: scene=D_1
#: D_1:52
msgctxt "text_id=18832 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それから六日が経って、天気は晴れて。"
msgstr "  Six days passed, the weather in that time sunny and clear."

#. Occurrence D_1:109:18833: scene=D_1
#: D_1:109
msgctxt "text_id=18833 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼がその話を聞いたのは、一日かけての大掃除が終わって、有珠と一服している時。"
msgstr "  It first came to Soujyuro's attention when he was resting with Alice after spending all day cleaning."

#. Occurrence D_1:133:18834: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_1
#: D_1:133
msgctxt "text_id=18834 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎、今日ぐらいはバイト休みでしょ？」"
msgstr "\"You're off work today, right, Soujyuro?\""

#. Occurrence D_1:139:18835: scene=D_1
#: D_1:139
msgctxt "text_id=18835 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間に入ってくるなり、青子はいつもの調子でそう言った。"
msgstr "  Aoko asked him in her usual manner immediately upon entering the drawing room."

#. Occurrence D_1:170:18836: scene=D_1
#: D_1:170
msgctxt "text_id=18836 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜もふけて、時刻は九時になろうとしている。"
msgstr "  It was already nighttime, approaching nine o'clock."

#. Occurrence D_1:175:18837: scene=D_1
#: D_1:175
msgctxt "text_id=18837 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　昼間の晴天から一変して、窓の外は厚い雲。"
msgstr "  The afternoon's sunny weather had changed abruptly, and thick clouds were visible out the window."

#. Occurrence D_1:180:18838: scene=D_1
#: D_1:180
msgctxt "text_id=18838 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それをのんびり眺めていた草十郎は、うん？と平和そうに首をかしげた。"
msgstr "  Awoken from his nonchalant daydreaming, Soujyuro tilted his head to the side and replied calmly."

#. Occurrence D_1:201:18839: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_1_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_1
#: D_1:201
msgctxt "text_id=18839 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「休みだけど、どうして？」"
msgstr "\"I'm off today, but why do you ask?\""

#. Occurrence D_1:207:18840: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_1_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_1
#: D_1:207
msgctxt "text_id=18840 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「これから実家に戻るから、用意しておいて」"
msgstr "\"I'm making a trip home in a bit, so get your things ready.\""

#. Occurrence D_1:213:18841: scene=D_1
#: D_1:213
msgctxt "text_id=18841 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　緩みきった草十郎の表情は、青子の登場でとたんに曇ってしまう。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's peaceful expression had grown tense the moment she appeared."

#. Occurrence D_1:218:18842: scene=D_1
#: D_1:218
msgctxt "text_id=18842 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の台詞が自分にどう関係するのか掴めず、草十郎は正面に座っている有珠をちらりと盗み見た。"
msgstr "  Unsure of what any of this had to do with him, he stole a glance at Alice, who was seated across from him."

#. Occurrence D_1:255:18843: scene=D_1
#: D_1:255
msgctxt "text_id=18843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠にとっても今の台詞は意外だったらしく、わずかに目を開かせて、青子と草十郎を<見比|みくら>べている。"
msgstr "  However, she looked surprised as well, her eyes widening ever so slightly as she studied the other two."

#. Occurrence D_1:303:18844: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_1_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_1
#: D_1:303
msgctxt "text_id=18844 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「用意って、何の？」"
msgstr "\"Huh? What things?\""

#. Occurrence D_1:308:18845: scene=D_1
#: D_1:308
msgctxt "text_id=18845 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大掃除が終わるまで行方を<暗|くら>ましていた青子への批難をぐっと<堪|こら>えて、草十郎は恐る恐る聞き返す。"
msgstr "  He replied timidly, struggling to hide his bitterness at Aoko for waiting until the cleaning was finished before deciding to show up."

#. Occurrence D_1:333:18846: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_1_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_1
#: D_1:333
msgctxt "text_id=18846 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「用意は用意よ。一時間ぐらい歩く山の上だから、寒くない格好しろって言ってるの」"
msgstr "\"Your things. Get them ready. It takes an hour to walk up the mountain, so make sure you dress accordingly.\""

#. Occurrence D_1:369:18847: scene=D_1
#: D_1:369
msgctxt "text_id=18847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はますます顔を曇らせる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's expression only grew darker."

#. Occurrence D_1:374:18848: scene=D_1
#: D_1:374
msgctxt "text_id=18848 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の言い回しだと、まるで―――"
msgstr "  The way she spoke made it sound like..."

#. Occurrence D_1:381:18849: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_D_1_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=D_1
#: D_1:381
msgctxt "text_id=18849 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……静希君を連れていくの？」"
msgstr "\"You're taking Sizuki with you?\""

#. Occurrence D_1:407:18850: scene=D_1
#: D_1:407
msgctxt "text_id=18850 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎が口にするより早く、有珠が青子に問いかけた。"
msgstr "  Alice spoke up before Soujyuro himself could manage to say anything."

#. Occurrence D_1:412:18851: scene=D_1
#: D_1:412
msgctxt "text_id=18851 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それにいけない？　と青子は言い返す。"
msgstr "  Aoko brusquely asked if there was a problem."

#. Occurrence D_1:447:18852: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_1_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_1
#: D_1:447
msgctxt "text_id=18852 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「私だってあんなとこに行きたくないわよ。"
msgstr "\"I don't even want to go."

#. Occurrence D_1:453:18853: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_1_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_1
#: D_1:453
msgctxt "text_id=18853 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　けど今日ぐらいは顔を出せってうるさいから、ホントに顔だけ見せにいくの。"
msgstr "  But they keep asking me to stop by, so I'm gonna make a brief visit."

#. Occurrence D_1:460:18854: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_1_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_1
#: D_1:460
msgctxt "text_id=18854 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "草十郎を連れていくのは、たんに暇だからだけど」"
msgstr "I just thought I'd bring Soujyuro along since he's free. That's all.\""

#. Occurrence D_1:491:18855: scene=D_1
#: D_1:491
msgctxt "text_id=18855 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　文句ないでしょ？　と胸を張って主張する。"
msgstr "  She stood tall as if challenging her roommate to oppose her decision."

#. Occurrence D_1:516:18856: scene=D_1
#: D_1:516
msgctxt "text_id=18856 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠はどこかうかない顔をして青子を見る。"
msgstr "  Alice's face was dour as she gazed back."

#. Occurrence D_1:528:18857: scene=D_1
#: D_1:528
msgctxt "text_id=18857 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎も露骨にイヤそうな顔をして青子を見る。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's irritation was obvious as well as he glared at Aoko."

#. Occurrence D_1:557:18858: scene=D_1
#: D_1:557
msgctxt "text_id=18858 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなふたりの無言の抗議は、もちろん、青子にはまったく通じなかった。"
msgstr "  Of course, their unspoken objection had no effect on Aoko in the slightest."

#. Occurrence D_1:584:18859: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_1_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_1
#: D_1:584
msgctxt "text_id=18859 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それじゃ、<半|はん>になったら出かけるからね」"
msgstr "\"We're leaving at nine-thirty.\""

#. Occurrence D_1:596:18860: scene=D_1
#: D_1:596
msgctxt "text_id=18860 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言いたい事だけ言って、青子は居間から姿を消した。"
msgstr "  Having said all she wanted, Aoko disappeared from the room once again."

#. Occurrence D_1:625:18861: scene=D_1
#: D_1:625
msgctxt "text_id=18861 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残ったふたりは呆然とするばかりだ。"
msgstr "  Alice and Soujyuro could only sit in dumbfounded silence."

#. Occurrence D_1:676:18862: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_1_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_1
#: D_1:676
msgctxt "text_id=18862 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「有珠。蒼崎の家って、遠いのか？」"
msgstr "\"Alice? Is Aozaki's house very far from here?\""

#. Occurrence D_1:682:18863: scene=D_1
#: D_1:682
msgctxt "text_id=18863 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　九時半まであと十分ほどの時計を見つめながら、草十郎は問いかけた。"
msgstr "  He stared at the clock as he spoke. There were only ten minutes to go until half past the hour."

#. Occurrence D_1:703:18864: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_D_1_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=D_1
#: D_1:703
msgctxt "text_id=18864 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「場所的には三咲市の端よ。ここから電車で四駅分<下|くだ>った、小さな山の中にあるわ。"
msgstr "\"It's at the edges of Misaki City. Four stops away by train, up on a small mountain."

#. Occurrence D_1:709:18865: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_D_1_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=D_1
#: D_1:709
msgctxt "text_id=18865 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……貴方の住んでいたところに比べれば丘でしょうけど」"
msgstr "  Though it's more like a hill by your standards, I'd imagine.\""

#. Occurrence D_1:723:18866: scene=D_1
#: D_1:723
msgctxt "text_id=18866 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　表情こそ変わらないものの、有珠の声は思いっきり不機嫌そうだった。……本人がそうと気付いていないところが、いっそうのご機嫌斜めぶりを<示|しめ>している。"
msgstr "  Her expression had not changed, but her voice made it obvious she was in a poor mood. His complete obliviousness to this fact only showed how clueless he truly was."

#. Occurrence D_1:744:18867: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_1_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_1
#: D_1:744
msgctxt "text_id=18867 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そっか。今から行ったら、帰ってくるのは明日になるね」"
msgstr "\"Gotcha. So if we leave now, we won't be able to make it back till tomorrow.\""

#. Occurrence D_1:750:18868: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_D_1_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=D_1
#: D_1:750
msgctxt "text_id=18868 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……帰ってこられたらの話だけど」"
msgstr "\"Yes... If you even make it back.\""

#. Occurrence D_1:770:18869: scene=D_1
#: D_1:770
msgctxt "text_id=18869 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の独り言に、有珠も独り言で反応した。"
msgstr "  Each spoke to themselves as if there were no one else in the room."

#. Occurrence D_1:775:18870: scene=D_1
#: D_1:775
msgctxt "text_id=18870 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これから旅立つ人間に、思いっきり不吉な予言をするように。"
msgstr "  Those about to embark on a journey always feel a sense of dread, and he was no exception."

#. Occurrence D_1:796:18871: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_1_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_1
#: D_1:796
msgctxt "text_id=18871 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……蒼崎の家ってお化けでも出るのか？」"
msgstr "\"Is Aozaki's place, like, haunted? With ghosts?\""

#. Occurrence D_1:807:18872: scene=D_1
#: D_1:807
msgctxt "text_id=18872 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の問いに有珠は答えない。"
msgstr "  Alice did not say anything in response."

#. Occurrence D_1:812:18873: scene=D_1
#: D_1:812
msgctxt "text_id=18873 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ティーカップから視線を上げ、無言で草十郎を眺めるだけだった。"
msgstr "  All she did was raise her eyes from her teacup to stare wordlessly at him."

#. Occurrence D_1:833:18874: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_1_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_1
#: D_1:833
msgctxt "text_id=18874 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……有珠？」"
msgstr "\"What is it, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence D_1:859:18875: scene=D_1
#: D_1:859
msgctxt "text_id=18875 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どこか様子のおかしい彼女に呼びかけると、有珠はふい、と顔を背けてしまった。"
msgstr "  His question caused her to suddenly avert her eyes. Something seemed off about her today."

#. Occurrence D_1:864:18876: scene=D_1
#: D_1:864
msgctxt "text_id=18876 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……時計は、もうじき半になろうとしている。"
msgstr "  The minute hand on the clock was about to reach thirty."

#. Occurrence D_1:869:18877: scene=D_1
#: D_1:869
msgctxt "text_id=18877 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠の様子は気がかりだが、草十郎は仕方なくソファーから立ち上がった。"
msgstr "  Bothered as he was by Alice's odd behavior, Soujyuro had no choice but to stand up from the sofa and take his leave."

#. Occurrence D_1:892:18878: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_1_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_1
#: D_1:892
msgctxt "text_id=18878 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それじゃ、行ってくるよ」"
msgstr "\"Well, see you later.\""

#. Occurrence D_1:952:18879: scene=D_1
#: D_1:952
msgctxt "text_id=18879 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　トコトコと居間を横切る草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro hurried through the drawing room."

#. Occurrence D_1:957:18880: scene=D_1
#: D_1:957
msgctxt "text_id=18880 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その背中を、有珠はいつまでも見つめ続けた。"
msgstr "  Alice kept staring at his back until he was gone."

#. Occurrence D_1:1002:18881: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1002
msgctxt "text_id=18881 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎が部屋に戻って外行きに着替え、ロビーまで下りた時、青子はとっくに準備を済ませて待っていた。"
msgstr "  By the time he had changed in his room and returned to the foyer, Aoko was already waiting and ready to go."

#. Occurrence D_1:1008:18882: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1008
msgctxt "text_id=18882 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の横には有珠がいて、何やら話しこんでいる。"
msgstr "  Furthermore, Alice was at her side and they were deep in conversation."

#. Occurrence D_1:1013:18883: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1013
msgctxt "text_id=18883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎が階段を下りきると、青子はよし、と調子をとるように会話を切った。"
msgstr "  She abruptly ended their chat as soon as he descended the stairs."

#. Occurrence D_1:1046:18884: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_1_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_1
#: D_1:1046
msgctxt "text_id=18884 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それじゃ行きましょうか。有珠、留守番よろしくね」"
msgstr "\"All right, let's head out. Keep an eye on things while we're gone, okay, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence D_1:1068:18885: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1068
msgctxt "text_id=18885 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠は頷きだけで応えた。"
msgstr "  She responded with a simple nod."

#. Occurrence D_1:1075:18886: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1075
msgctxt "text_id=18886 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はつかつかと玄関へ歩いていく。"
msgstr "  There was determination in Aoko's step as she strode to the door."

#. Occurrence D_1:1080:18887: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1080
msgctxt "text_id=18887 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はロビーでコートを羽織りつつ、青子の後を追うように歩きだした。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro made to follow her as he donned his coat in the foyer."

#. Occurrence D_1:1116:18888: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_1_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_1
#: D_1:1116
msgctxt "text_id=18888 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ほら、ぐずぐずしないっ！」"
msgstr "\"Hurry it up!\""

#. Occurrence D_1:1127:18889: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1127
msgctxt "text_id=18889 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の呼びかけに足を速める草十郎だったが、何を思ったか唐突に立ち止まった。"
msgstr "  Her words made him pick up his pace, but he stopped suddenly, as if he had remembered something."

#. Occurrence D_1:1132:18890: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1132
msgctxt "text_id=18890 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そういえば部屋のストーブがつけっぱなしだったな、なんて素振りで、ひとり<佇|たたず>む有珠へと振り返る。"
msgstr "  He looked back at Alice as if to say that he had left the heater on in his room, or some other important matter."

#. Occurrence D_1:1169:18891: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_1_9000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_1
#: D_1:1169
msgctxt "text_id=18891 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それじゃ行ってくる。できるだけ早めに帰ってくるから、寝ないで待ってるんだぞ有珠」"
msgstr "\"Bye. I'll be back as soon as I can, but try to stay awake this time while waiting for me, okay?\""

#. Occurrence D_1:1219:18892: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1219
msgctxt "text_id=18892 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　突然の言いつけに、有珠は不意をつかれたように<瞬|またた>きをした。"
msgstr "  Alice blinked in shock at his unexpected request."

#. Occurrence D_1:1224:18893: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1224
msgctxt "text_id=18893 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は返事を待っていて、"
msgstr "  Aoko looked on with arms folded as"

#. Occurrence D_1:1229:18894: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1229
msgctxt "text_id=18894 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は腕を組んでふたりのやりとりを眺めている。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro stood waiting for a response."

#. Occurrence D_1:1250:18895: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1250
msgctxt "text_id=18895 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それに少し戸惑ってから、有珠は無言で居間へと行ってしまった。"
msgstr "  Bewildered, Alice finally returned to the drawing room without uttering a single word."

#. Occurrence D_1:1270:18896: scene=D_1
#: D_1:1270
msgctxt "text_id=18896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうでもいい草十郎の言葉に、こくんと<控|ひか>え目にうなずいてから。"
msgstr "  Her only response had been the very smallest of nods."

#. Occurrence D_2:57:18897: scene=D_2
#: D_2:57
msgctxt "text_id=18897 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<秋古城|あきこしろ>というのが、その駅の名前だった。"
msgstr "  They were headed for Akikoshiro train station."

#. Occurrence D_2:81:18898: scene=D_2
#: D_2:81
msgctxt "text_id=18898 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜はふけて十一時より少し前。"
msgstr "  The night had grown late; it was nearly eleven o'clock."

#. Occurrence D_2:86:18899: scene=D_2
#: D_2:86
msgctxt "text_id=18899 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　参拝客の一団を乗せた<上|のぼ>りの列車とは逆行して、ふたりはその小さな駅に着いた。"
msgstr "  A train full of tourists went by in the opposite direction before the two finally arrived at the tiny station."

#. Occurrence D_2:106:18900: scene=D_2
#: D_2:106
msgctxt "text_id=18900 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　周囲はあまりにも暗く、静かだ。"
msgstr "  The surrounding area was incredibly dark and quiet."

#. Occurrence D_2:111:18901: scene=D_2
#: D_2:111
msgctxt "text_id=18901 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駅というより深夜の波止場を思わせる。"
msgstr "  In fact, it felt less like a station and more like a small boat dock."

#. Occurrence D_2:131:18902: scene=D_2
#: D_2:131
msgctxt "text_id=18902 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　平時でさえ、この駅で降りる人は少ないのだろう。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro had a hard time imagining that many people came here, even during the day."

#. Occurrence D_2:136:18903: scene=D_2
#: D_2:136
msgctxt "text_id=18903 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時折やってくる列車を見送るだけの停留所。"
msgstr "  It had only the absolute bare minimum necessary to greet the odd visitor."

#. Occurrence D_2:141:18904: scene=D_2
#: D_2:141
msgctxt "text_id=18904 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駅のまわりにはコンビニエンスストアの一軒もなく、あるのは一面の畑と、道に立てられた街灯だけ。"
msgstr "  There were no convenience stores in sight, only fields and the streetlights that dotted the road."

#. Occurrence D_2:161:18905: scene=D_2
#: D_2:161
msgctxt "text_id=18905 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駅員室で座ったまま眠る駅員の前にキップを置いて、青子は時刻表を確認する。"
msgstr "  Aoko placed her ticket in front of the attendant who sat sleeping in his chair, and skimmed the train schedule."

#. Occurrence D_2:166:18906: scene=D_2
#: D_2:166
msgctxt "text_id=18906 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　零時半過ぎに、もう一本だけ帰りの電車がある。"
msgstr "  The last and only train back departed just after half-past midnight."

#. Occurrence D_2:172:18907: scene=D_2
#: D_2:172
msgctxt "text_id=18907 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最終電車を確認して、青子は急ぎ足で駅を後にした。"
msgstr "  Having confirmed her options, she headed hastily out of the station."

#. Occurrence D_2:220:18908: scene=D_2
#: D_2:220
msgctxt "text_id=18908 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……年老いた駅員はひとりきりだった。"
msgstr "  The elderly station attendant was all alone..."

#. Occurrence D_2:225:18909: scene=D_2
#: D_2:225
msgctxt "text_id=18909 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼はストーブとテレビをつけたまま、こくこくと船を<漕|こ>いでいる。"
msgstr "  He had dozed off with both the heater and television still turned on."

#. Occurrence D_2:245:18910: scene=D_2
#: D_2:245
msgctxt "text_id=18910 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その寝顔は満ち足りている。"
msgstr "  As he slept, his face looked completely content."

#. Occurrence D_2:250:18911: scene=D_2
#: D_2:250
msgctxt "text_id=18911 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりにも広大な夜の闇。"
msgstr "  The night felt vast in its darkness."

#. Occurrence D_2:255:18912: scene=D_2
#: D_2:255
msgctxt "text_id=18912 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自動車の供給と共に<廃|すた>れてしまった小さな駅。"
msgstr "  The small train station had been rendered obsolete now that cars were commonplace."

#. Occurrence D_2:283:18913: scene=D_2
#: D_2:283
msgctxt "text_id=18913 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　暗い宇宙の中でただひとつ光を放つ、孤独な星のようだ。"
msgstr "  It was like a lone star shining in the night sky."

#. Occurrence D_2:289:18914: scene=D_2
#: D_2:289
msgctxt "text_id=18914 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを何十年と守り、これからも人生の終わりまで付きそう事を良しとした老人に一礼して、草十郎も暗い夜に足を向けた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro thanked the attendant for his service before stepping out into the darkness. The man must have looked after the station for decades at this point, and would likely continue until the day he died."

#. Occurrence D_2:347:18915: scene=D_2
#: D_2:347
msgctxt "text_id=18915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駅から出ると、そこは村というよりは里だった。"
msgstr "  Outside the station, there was little in the way of human development. It could scarcely be called a village."

#. Occurrence D_2:352:18916: scene=D_2
#: D_2:352
msgctxt "text_id=18916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駅前には<広場|ロータリー>すらない。"
msgstr "  There was not even an area out front for cars and buses to drop people off."

#. Occurrence D_2:357:18917: scene=D_2
#: D_2:357
msgctxt "text_id=18917 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　パノラマに広がる平地は一面の畑で、網の目のように<畦道|あぜみち>がある。"
msgstr "  Their eyes were met only with a panorama of flat fields interlaced with a lattice of footpaths."

#. Occurrence D_2:362:18918: scene=D_2
#: D_2:362
msgctxt "text_id=18918 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夏であれば風紋を走らせる小麦畑も、冬の夜では荒地にしか見えない。"
msgstr "  Though surely a sea of beautiful green in the summertime, during winter it was more like a wasteland."

#. Occurrence D_2:367:18919: scene=D_2
#: D_2:367
msgctxt "text_id=18919 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ一面の闇の中、電灯だけが場違いに<灯|とも>っている。"
msgstr "  However, electric lights that felt strangely out of place illuminated one side of the dark vista."

#. Occurrence D_2:395:18920: scene=D_2
#: D_2:395
msgctxt "text_id=18920 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　寒さは夜になってより厳しさを増していた。"
msgstr "  The cold only grew harsher as the night wore on."

#. Occurrence D_2:400:18921: scene=D_2
#: D_2:400
msgctxt "text_id=18921 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冷気は容赦なく、指先から<感覚|ねつ>を奪っていく。"
msgstr "  It relentlessly snatched all sensation from the fingertips."

#. Occurrence D_2:422:18922: scene=D_2
#: D_2:422
msgctxt "text_id=18922 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　両手をポケットにいれて、青子は畦道を歩きだした。"
msgstr "  Aoko thus kept her hands in her pockets as she strode through the paths among the fields."

#. Occurrence D_2:427:18923: scene=D_2
#: D_2:427
msgctxt "text_id=18923 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<靴|ブーツ>には土の感触。"
msgstr "  She could feel the ground below through her shoes."

#. Occurrence D_2:432:18924: scene=D_2
#: D_2:432
msgctxt "text_id=18924 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　町とは違う柔らかさに、青子は懐かしさを感じている。"
msgstr "  Its softness was unlike that of the city, and for her it brought back countless memories."

#. Occurrence D_2:437:18925: scene=D_2
#: D_2:437
msgctxt "text_id=18925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女にとっては、中学生時代まで毎日のように通った道だ。"
msgstr "  She had walked this path every day in middle school, after all."

#. Occurrence D_2:472:18926: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_2_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_2
#: D_2:472
msgctxt "text_id=18926 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あの山の真ん中あたり、家の明かりが見えるでしょ？"
msgstr "\"See the lights of that house in the middle of that mountain?"

#. Occurrence D_2:472:18927: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_2_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_2
#: D_2:472
msgctxt "text_id=18927 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　アレがうち」"
msgstr "  That's my place.\""

#. Occurrence D_2:478:18928: scene=D_2
#: D_2:478
msgctxt "text_id=18928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もりあがった<山|やみ>を指さす青子。"
msgstr "  She pointed out a mountain that rose up before them with her finger."

#. Occurrence D_2:483:18929: scene=D_2
#: D_2:483
msgctxt "text_id=18929 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここからだと四十分も歩けば辿り着けるだろう。"
msgstr "  The journey looked like it would take about forty minutes on foot."

#. Occurrence D_2:503:18930: scene=D_2
#: D_2:503
msgctxt "text_id=18930 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　道は長く、しばらくは畦道が続いている。"
msgstr "  For now, they remained among the rice fields, though their journey would continue beyond them."

#. Occurrence D_2:508:18931: scene=D_2
#: D_2:508
msgctxt "text_id=18931 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は振り返らず、明かりに照らされた道を歩いていく。"
msgstr "  Aoko followed the path bathed in light without looking back."

#. Occurrence D_2:514:18932: scene=D_2
#: D_2:514
msgctxt "text_id=18932 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　浮かび上がった道は、暗い海にかけられた<桟橋|さんばし>のように見えた。"
msgstr "  The path seemed to hang before them like a pier leading out into the darkness of the ocean."

#. Occurrence D_2:569:18933: scene=D_2
#: D_2:569
msgctxt "text_id=18933 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山に近づくにつれ、暗闇は深くなる。"
msgstr "  The closer they got to the mountain, the darker it became."

#. Occurrence D_2:574:18934: scene=D_2
#: D_2:574
msgctxt "text_id=18934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここでは人の<喧|お><噪|と>は忘れ去られている。"
msgstr "  All signs of the hustle and bustle of human life were absent."

#. Occurrence D_2:579:18935: scene=D_2
#: D_2:579
msgctxt "text_id=18935 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　頭上の月の光は眩しいほど。"
msgstr "  The dark stillness made the moon overhead seem dazzling."

#. Occurrence D_2:584:18936: scene=D_2
#: D_2:584
msgctxt "text_id=18936 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　真っ黒い山道は、その光に照らされて<闇色|やみいろ>から<影色|かげいろ>になっている。"
msgstr "  Its light transformed the mountain path from blackness into mere shadow."

#. Occurrence D_2:589:18937: scene=D_2
#: D_2:589
msgctxt "text_id=18937 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　周りは暗いけれど、世界はたしかに見渡せた。"
msgstr "  Though dark, their surroundings were not totally indiscernible."

#. Occurrence D_2:636:18938: scene=D_2
#: D_2:636
msgctxt "text_id=18938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ゴールの見えない道は<延々|えんえん>と続いている。"
msgstr "  The seemingly unending path stretched on and on."

#. Occurrence D_2:641:18939: scene=D_2
#: D_2:641
msgctxt "text_id=18939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子のペースに合わせて歩きながら、ふと草十郎は彼女の横顔を盗み見た。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro, doing his best to match Aoko's pace, stole a momentary glance at the profile of her face."

#. Occurrence D_2:661:18940: scene=D_2
#: D_2:661
msgctxt "text_id=18940 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　月明かりが鮮やかとは言え、ここまで静かな夜道に青子は不安を感じないのだろうか。"
msgstr "  Did she not feel frightened in this quiet darkness, even with the moon to light the way?"

#. Occurrence D_2:666:18941: scene=D_2
#: D_2:666
msgctxt "text_id=18941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は無言のまま、いたって普通の顔つきで歩いている。"
msgstr "  Her expression showed no outward signs of discomfort as she strode on in silence."

#. Occurrence D_2:696:18942: scene=D_2
#: D_2:696
msgctxt "text_id=18942 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんな顔の時は、決まって強がっている時だ。"
msgstr "  In fact, this was how she always looked when she was trying to act tough."

#. Occurrence D_2:701:18943: scene=D_2
#: D_2:701
msgctxt "text_id=18943 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一ヶ月程度の未熟な経験からではあるが、草十郎は確かにそう感じ取った。"
msgstr "  He had only had a month's experience with her, but that much he knew."

#. Occurrence D_2:706:18944: scene=D_2
#: D_2:706
msgctxt "text_id=18944 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何か、些細だけれど無視できない問題を、彼女は飲みこもうとしているらしい。"
msgstr "  There was obviously something on her mind she couldn't ignore, no matter how small it might be."

#. Occurrence D_2:747:18945: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_2_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_2
#: D_2:747
msgctxt "text_id=18945 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「蒼崎でもこういうところは恐いのかい？」"
msgstr "\"Are you scared to be out here in the dark?\""

#. Occurrence D_2:753:18946: scene=D_2
#: D_2:753
msgctxt "text_id=18946 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　試しに訊いてみると、青子は意外にも頷いた。"
msgstr "  She responded to his tentative question with a surprising nod."

#. Occurrence D_2:800:18947: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_2_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_2
#: D_2:800
msgctxt "text_id=18947 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「こんな夜道を恐がらない人なんて、普通いないでしょう。"
msgstr "\"Who wouldn't be scared walking on these paths at night?"

#. Occurrence D_2:806:18948: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_2_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_2
#: D_2:806
msgctxt "text_id=18948 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　我慢できるか無視できるかの二つだけよ。そのどちらも出来ない人は、夜に出歩かないわ」"
msgstr "  All you can do is endure and ignore it. If you can't do either, then you really shouldn't be strolling around in the middle of the night.\""

#. Occurrence D_2:812:18949: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_2_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_2
#: D_2:812
msgctxt "text_id=18949 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「なるほど。それじゃ、どうして自分を連れてきたんだ」"
msgstr "\"I see. So why'd you bring me?\""

#. Occurrence D_2:858:18950: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_2_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_2
#: D_2:858
msgctxt "text_id=18950 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「言わなかった？　こんな何もない道をひとりで歩くのは時間の無駄でしょ。退屈しのぎに話し相手がほしかったの」"
msgstr "\"Didn't you hear what I said earlier? All this walking in the middle of nowhere is a waste of time. I wanted someone to talk to so it'd go by faster.\""

#. Occurrence D_2:864:18951: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_2_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_2
#: D_2:864
msgctxt "text_id=18951 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……そういえば、そんな事を言ってたな」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, I guess you did say something like that.\""

#. Occurrence D_2:933:18952: scene=D_2
#: D_2:933
msgctxt "text_id=18952 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それきり草十郎は黙りこむ。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro fell into silence."

#. Occurrence D_2:938:18953: scene=D_2
#: D_2:938
msgctxt "text_id=18953 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　別に青子の言葉に落ちこんだ訳でもなく、必死に何かを探しているような素振りだ。"
msgstr "  He was not bothered by what she said; rather, he was desperately searching for something to say in response."

#. Occurrence D_2:1017:18954: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1017
msgctxt "text_id=18954 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜の道は続いていく。"
msgstr "  Their path through the night continued onward."

#. Occurrence D_2:1023:18955: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1023
msgctxt "text_id=18955 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりの足音だけが響く中、青子は彼女なりに耐えてみたけれど、それも限界とばかりに口を開けた。"
msgstr "  Only the sound of their footsteps could be heard. Eventually, Aoko was unable to endure the silence any longer despite her best efforts."

#. Occurrence D_2:1047:18956: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_2_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_2
#: D_2:1047
msgctxt "text_id=18956 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎、退屈しのぎに何か話してよ」"
msgstr "\"Talk about something, Soujyuro.\""

#. Occurrence D_2:1053:18957: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_2_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_2
#: D_2:1053
msgctxt "text_id=18957 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……まいったな。話すような事はないんだけど」"
msgstr "\"But I don't have anything to talk about.\""

#. Occurrence D_2:1059:18958: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1059
msgctxt "text_id=18958 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　面目ない、と頭を抱える。"
msgstr "  He felt clueless and ashamed."

#. Occurrence D_2:1064:18959: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1064
msgctxt "text_id=18959 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうも、さっき黙りこんだのは<話|そ><題|れ>を探しての事らしい。"
msgstr "  He had been searching unsuccessfully for a topic throughout their awkward silence."

#. Occurrence D_2:1069:18960: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1069
msgctxt "text_id=18960 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は呆れながらも温かなため息をひとつ。"
msgstr "  Shocked though she was, Aoko let out a gentle sigh."

#. Occurrence D_2:1074:18961: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1074
msgctxt "text_id=18961 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とことん律儀な草十郎の人柄が、彼女を悩ませていたモノを少しだけ<剥|は>がしていった。"
msgstr "  At least for a moment, his simple earnestness was enough to make her forget all about her troubles."

#. Occurrence D_2:1103:18962: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_2_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_2
#: D_2:1103
msgctxt "text_id=18962 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「莫迦ね、嘘でもなんでもいいから、とにかく話をすればいいの。別に面白い話なんて期待してないから」"
msgstr "\"Don't be stupid. Make something up if you have to. It doesn't even have to be interesting. Anything will do.\""

#. Occurrence D_2:1117:18963: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1117
msgctxt "text_id=18963 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は素っ気ない態度で、あんまりな事を言う。"
msgstr "  Her blunt retort was not entirely honest."

#. Occurrence D_2:1122:18964: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1122
msgctxt "text_id=18964 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも嘘なんて言ったら、それこそお仕置きタイムだ。"
msgstr "  She would surely scold him if he dared lie to her."

#. Occurrence D_2:1127:18965: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1127
msgctxt "text_id=18965 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　前に嘘は嫌い、といったのは蒼崎本人じゃないか、と草十郎は内心でごちてみた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro said as much, reminding her of how she had claimed to hate lies."

#. Occurrence D_2:1132:18966: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1132
msgctxt "text_id=18966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　当然、青子からの返事はない。"
msgstr "  Naturally, she did not bother responding."

#. Occurrence D_2:1186:18967: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_2_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_2
#: D_2:1186
msgctxt "text_id=18967 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……仕方ない。話はないけど、聞きたい事ならあった。"
msgstr "\"Damned either way, I guess. I don't have anything else to talk about, but there is something I wanted to ask."

#. Occurrence D_2:1192:18968: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_2_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_2
#: D_2:1192
msgctxt "text_id=18968 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　何でもいいならそれもいいだろう？」"
msgstr "  You said anything goes, right?\""

#. Occurrence D_2:1252:18969: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1252
msgctxt "text_id=18969 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の提案に、青子はかすかに眉を寄せた。"
msgstr "  A slight scowl crossed her face at his suggestion."

#. Occurrence D_2:1257:18970: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1257
msgctxt "text_id=18970 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれどそれも一瞬で、彼女はすぐに元の、落ち着いた<表情|かお>に戻る。"
msgstr "  But it lasted only a moment before she returned to her previous calm state."

#. Occurrence D_2:1317:18971: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_2_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_2
#: D_2:1317
msgctxt "text_id=18971 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ま、それもいいか。どうせ、もうすぐ忘れるんだから」"
msgstr "\"All right, go ahead. I'll probably forget as soon as we're done, anyway.\""

#. Occurrence D_2:1323:18972: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1323
msgctxt "text_id=18972 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎から目を逸らして、呟くように青子は答えた。"
msgstr "  She muttered her reply without making eye contact."

#. Occurrence D_2:1328:18973: scene=D_2
#: D_2:1328
msgctxt "text_id=18973 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山中の目的地は、まだ影も形も見えてこない。"
msgstr "  Their destination in the mountains remained hidden from them, revealing not even a hint of its form."

#. Occurrence D_3:55:18974: scene=D_3
#: D_3:55
msgctxt "text_id=18974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれからずっと<抱|かか>えていた疑問。"
msgstr "  It had bothered him ever since that night."

#. Occurrence D_3:60:18975: scene=D_3
#: D_3:60
msgctxt "text_id=18975 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今回の事件の<顛末|てんまつ>と、姉妹間の決着。"
msgstr "  What was the truth behind it all, and how would the two sisters' drama unfold?"

#. Occurrence D_3:65:18976: scene=D_3
#: D_3:65
msgctxt "text_id=18976 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そういった余分な話を、草十郎は口にする。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro decided to press Aoko for details."

#. Occurrence D_3:86:18977: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_3_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_3
#: D_3:86
msgctxt "text_id=18977 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それで、橙子さんは何がしたかったんだ？」"
msgstr "\"So what was it that Miss Touko wanted to accomplish?\""

#. Occurrence D_3:92:18978: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:92
msgctxt "text_id=18978 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あれ、言わなかった？　<蒼崎|わたし>への復讐と、根源に接触する事だって。"
msgstr "\"I thought I told you. She wanted to get revenge against me, and then there's the whole coming in contact with the Root thing."

#. Occurrence D_3:99:18979: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:99
msgctxt "text_id=18979 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "根源の渦については前に少しだけ話したでしょ」"
msgstr "We already talked about the Swirl of the Root, remember?\""

#. Occurrence D_3:105:18980: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_3_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_3
#: D_3:105
msgctxt "text_id=18980 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……たしか、魔術の源だっけ」"
msgstr "\"It's like... the source of magecraft, right?\""

#. Occurrence D_3:152:18981: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:152
msgctxt "text_id=18981 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そう。そして最終目的でもあるわ。"
msgstr "\"Right. And also its end goal."

#. Occurrence D_3:163:18982: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:163
msgctxt "text_id=18982 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　根源の渦っていうのは、全ての<叡知|えいち>が記録された位置、全ての事柄が決定された場所。"
msgstr "  The place where all knowledge is recorded, where all matters are settled."

#. Occurrence D_3:169:18983: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:169
msgctxt "text_id=18983 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　そこを見て、触れて、理解できれば不可能なんて言葉すら作り替えられる。伝承によって呼び名は様々だけど、ようするに神さまのいる位置なんでしょうね」"
msgstr "  To see, touch, and understand it makes even the impossible possible. It has gone by many names over the years, but you could say it's where God lives.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:216:18984: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_3_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_3
#: D_3:216
msgctxt "text_id=18984 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「神さまっていうのは、<八百万|やおよろず>的なものじゃなく？」"
msgstr "\"God? So there's just one, then? Not a bunch, like in Shinto?\""

#. Occurrence D_3:256:18985: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:256
msgctxt "text_id=18985 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……たまにそういうコト言いだすから厄介よねアンタは。"
msgstr "\"There you go again with your annoying questions."

#. Occurrence D_3:262:18986: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:262
msgctxt "text_id=18986 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　そりゃ万象に宿る神さまもいるでしょうけど、これはその前、そういうのを決めた大前提みたいなものよ」"
msgstr "  There are gods in everything around us, but there's also one big underlying force that existed way before all that.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:288:18987: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:288
msgctxt "text_id=18987 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そんなものの入り口がどうして三咲にあったのかは知らないけど、祖父はそれを発見して、新しい魔法を作り出した。"
msgstr "\"Who knows why an entrance to the Root is located in Misaki, but my grandfather discovered it and was able to create a new kind of Magic."

#. Occurrence D_3:294:18988: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:294
msgctxt "text_id=18988 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　でも、その後に根源への<路|みち>を閉ざしちゃったのよ。"
msgstr "  But then he closed the way to the Root."

#. Occurrence D_3:301:18989: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:301
msgctxt "text_id=18989 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "魔法さえ成立したのなら、神さまへの<路|みち>は消えるべきだって」"
msgstr "He said that if this path to God enabled us to create Magic, then no one should be allowed to go there.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:349:18990: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:349
msgctxt "text_id=18990 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……たぶん、私たちが生きているかぎり開放する気はなくて、橙子はそれが腹立たしかったんだと思う。"
msgstr "\"He has no intention of opening it again as long as we're alive, which made Touko crazy mad."

#. Occurrence D_3:355:18991: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:355
msgctxt "text_id=18991 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　たとえ力不足で取り込まれても、道があるのなら試すべきだ。自己の消滅を恐れるぐらいなら、そもそも魔術なんて学ばなかった―――ってね」"
msgstr "  She said that the path is meant to be explored, even if we aren't strong enough to handle what we find. And that you shouldn't be studying magecraft in the first place if you're afraid of getting killed.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:381:18992: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:381
msgctxt "text_id=18992 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でも祖父は<礎|いしずえ>になろうとする意志さえ認めなかった。"
msgstr "\"But my grandfather didn't appreciate her ambition."

#. Occurrence D_3:387:18993: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:387
msgctxt "text_id=18993 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　もっと強力な後継ぎが生まれるまで、根源の解析は許可しない。後継ぎに魔法は<譲|ゆず>るけれど、根源への路だけは閉ざしていたのよ。"
msgstr "  He refused to allow anyone to investigate the Root until a stronger heir was born. He's willing to pass on True Magic, just not the way to reach the Root."

#. Occurrence D_3:393:18994: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:393
msgctxt "text_id=18994 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……橙子の気持ちも分かるけど、私は祖父に賛成だわ。"
msgstr "  I understand where Touko's coming from, but I agree with my grandfather."

#. Occurrence D_3:399:18995: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:399
msgctxt "text_id=18995 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　根源なんてものに興味はないし、第一、今まで一人も生還者がいないんだもの。それが本当に神々の座なのか保証もないし」"
msgstr "  I don't care about the Root, and anyway, to this day there haven't been any survivors. There's not even proof that it's really the seat of the gods.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:448:18996: scene=D_3
#: D_3:448
msgctxt "text_id=18996 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　話しているうちに機嫌を損ねたのか、後半はなかば文句になっていた。"
msgstr "  Her mood gradually soured as she spoke, and towards the end, it sounded more like a list of complaints."

#. Occurrence D_3:453:18997: scene=D_3
#: D_3:453
msgctxt "text_id=18997 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんだかんだ言って、青子本人も祖父には賛同しきれない部分があるらしい。"
msgstr "  Despite her words, however, part of Aoko was unable to agree completely with her grandfather's decision."

#. Occurrence D_3:458:18998: scene=D_3
#: D_3:458
msgctxt "text_id=18998 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを気にしながら、草十郎は今の話のおかしな部分について訊き返す。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro took note and followed up with a question about something he found strange."

#. Occurrence D_3:503:18999: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_3_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_3
#: D_3:503
msgctxt "text_id=18999 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「蒼崎。一人も生還者がいないって、どういう事だ？」"
msgstr "\"What did you mean about how there haven't been any survivors?\""

#. Occurrence D_3:509:19000: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:509
msgctxt "text_id=19000 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「根源に触れて、帰ってきた者は一人もいないの。世界規模でね。"
msgstr "\"I meant that no one's ever come in contact with the Root and returned to talk about it. Not a single person in the entire world."

#. Occurrence D_3:515:19001: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:515
msgctxt "text_id=19001 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　触れれば即消滅。人間程度の魂だと触れた瞬間に<元|・><に|・><戻|・><る|・>とか、根源に取りこまれるとか」"
msgstr "  Coming in contact with it means instant death. The soul of a mere human simply 'returns to the source,' so to speak. In other words, it gets sucked into the Root.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:536:19002: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:536
msgctxt "text_id=19002 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なんで、どんなに歴史に名を残した魔術師でも、あれにだけは触れていないわ。せいぜい間近にして、大急ぎで自分の魔術を安定させた程度だもの」"
msgstr "\"That's why not even the greatest mages in history dared to touch it. Just coming close is enough to send them frantically trying to stabilize their magecraft.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:542:19003: scene=D_3
#: D_3:542
msgctxt "text_id=19003 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこがおかしい、と草十郎は眉をひそめる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro furrowed his brow at the oddness of it all."

#. Occurrence D_3:563:19004: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_3_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_3
#: D_3:563
msgctxt "text_id=19004 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それじゃあ、どうしてそこがそういう場所だって分かるんだ」"
msgstr "\"Then how does anyone know so much about this place?\""

#. Occurrence D_3:569:19005: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:569
msgctxt "text_id=19005 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そりゃあ、中に入って伝えた人がいたからでしょう」"
msgstr "\"Because there is one person who went and made it back.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:604:19006: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_3_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_3
#: D_3:604
msgctxt "text_id=19006 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「でも生還者はいないって」"
msgstr "\"But you said there were no survivors...\""

#. Occurrence D_3:644:19007: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:644
msgctxt "text_id=19007 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「だから。そういう人たちは、中で神さまにでもなっちゃったんじゃない？」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, because everyone who's gone in turns into God, too.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:649:19008: scene=D_3
#: D_3:649
msgctxt "text_id=19008 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　実にきっぱりと彼女は言った。"
msgstr "  She spoke very matter-of-factly."

#. Occurrence D_3:654:19009: scene=D_3
#: D_3:654
msgctxt "text_id=19009 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何でもない話のように、昨日の話をするように。"
msgstr "  As if it was only a minor detail about something that had happened the other day."

#. Occurrence D_3:680:19010: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:680
msgctxt "text_id=19010 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうなればこっちに帰ってくる必要はないでしょうし、もしかすると、単に帰って来られないだけかもね。"
msgstr "\"So why would they even bother coming back to our world? Or maybe they can't, who knows."

#. Occurrence D_3:691:19011: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:691
msgctxt "text_id=19011 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……ま、神さまって位置づけが私たちが思っているようなものとは思えないから、あまり幸福そうには思えないけど」"
msgstr "  Being God is probably totally different than what we imagine. I doubt it's very fun.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:724:19012: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_3_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_3
#: D_3:724
msgctxt "text_id=19012 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence D_3:744:19013: scene=D_3
#: D_3:744
msgctxt "text_id=19013 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　成功者も失敗者も、それに触れては、こちらの世界に帰っては来られない。"
msgstr "  Whether they succeed or fail in their endeavor, those who reach the Root become unable to return to the normal world."

#. Occurrence D_3:749:19014: scene=D_3
#: D_3:749
msgctxt "text_id=19014 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　根源の渦とやらを人々に伝えたのは、"
msgstr "  Maybe the first person to become God felt lonely"

#. Occurrence D_3:749:19015: scene=D_3
#: D_3:749
msgctxt "text_id=19015 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一番初めに神さまになった誰かが、淋しさから仲間を欲しがった結果なのかもしれない。"
msgstr "  and spread the word about the Swirl of the Root in order to have others join them there."

#. Occurrence D_3:754:19016: scene=D_3
#: D_3:754
msgctxt "text_id=19016 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……あるいは、あちらの仕事はあまりにも膨大で、他にも仲間を欲しがったのか。"
msgstr "  Or maybe they had so much work to do as God they just needed some help."

#. Occurrence D_3:759:19017: scene=D_3
#: D_3:759
msgctxt "text_id=19017 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎には、いくら考えても掴めない事ではあるが。"
msgstr "  None of it made any sense no matter how long Soujyuro thought about it."

#. Occurrence D_3:785:19018: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_3_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_3
#: D_3:785
msgctxt "text_id=19018 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……橙子さんは、そうなりたかったのかな」"
msgstr "\"You think Miss Touko wanted to become a god?\""

#. Occurrence D_3:819:19019: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0023; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:819
msgctxt "text_id=19019 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「まさか。あの人は単に知りたかっただけよ。"
msgstr "\"Oh, please. She just wanted to know the truth."

#. Occurrence D_3:825:19020: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0024; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:825
msgctxt "text_id=19020 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　その後に残された人たちの事なんて興味はないの。昔から、目標に没頭しても成果を愛する人じゃなかったから」"
msgstr "  She doesn't care what happens to the next person. That's how she's always been. She just focuses completely on her goal and doesn't worry about what comes next.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:883:19021: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0025; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:883
msgctxt "text_id=19021 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「正直なところ、そのあたり姉貴は突き抜けてるわ。"
msgstr "\"She's a bit on the extreme side, to be honest."

#. Occurrence D_3:890:19022: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0026; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:890
msgctxt "text_id=19022 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "ホントの天才ってのはああいう非人間のコト言うのよ。苦労して作り上げたモノの、その後をまったく考えないんだから」"
msgstr "But geniuses always have an inhumane side to them like that. They work and work on their masterpiece without so much as considering what will happen once it's complete.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:896:19023: scene=D_3
#: D_3:896
msgctxt "text_id=19023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呆れているようにも認めているようにも取れる口ぶり。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro wasn't sure whether she spoke out of disgust or respect."

#. Occurrence D_3:924:19024: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0027; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:924
msgctxt "text_id=19024 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でも、そのくせ面倒見はいいって言うか。"
msgstr "\"But she's still pretty considerate to others in the moment."

#. Occurrence D_3:930:19025: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_3_0028; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_3
#: D_3:930
msgctxt "text_id=19025 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　未来の事は考えないのに、今あるものには何にでも興味を持つんだから」"
msgstr "  Since she doesn't worry about the future, she focuses all her energy on the here and now.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:943:19026: scene=D_3
#: D_3:943
msgctxt "text_id=19026 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これだから天才肌の女は、と悪態をつく青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko praised her sister's genius even while cursing her every being."

#. Occurrence D_3:948:19027: scene=D_3
#: D_3:948
msgctxt "text_id=19027 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<敵意|てきい>の<欠片|かけら>もない声は、聞くものとしては微笑ましい。"
msgstr "  Though her tone of voice was perfectly pleasant and lacked any audible animosity."

#. Occurrence D_3:1002:19028: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_3_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_3
#: D_3:1002
msgctxt "text_id=19028 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうだね。それに、橙子さんはこっちの方が好きみたいだったから」"
msgstr "\"Right. She does seem like she'd rather stay here.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:1008:19029: scene=D_3
#: D_3:1008
msgctxt "text_id=19029 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな事を口にしたら、草十郎は先ほどの言葉の意味も分かってしまった。"
msgstr "  As soon as he spoke, he was struck by the meaning of Aoko's earlier words."

#. Occurrence D_3:1027:19030: scene=D_3
#: D_3:1027
msgctxt "text_id=19030 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“根源になんて興味はない”"
msgstr "\"I don't care about the Root.\""

#. Occurrence D_3:1060:19031: scene=D_3
#: D_3:1060
msgctxt "text_id=19031 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つまり青子も、橙子と同じ気持ちなのだろう、と。"
msgstr "  He realized that she must feel the same way as Touko."

#. Occurrence D_4:40:19032: scene=D_4
#: D_4:40
msgctxt "text_id=19032 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――と。"
msgstr "  Still..."

#. Occurrence D_4:45:19033: scene=D_4
#: D_4:45
msgctxt "text_id=19033 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子と言えば、草十郎にはちょっとした疑問があった。"
msgstr "  There was one thing that had been bothering Soujyuro regarding Touko."

#. Occurrence D_4:93:19034: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_4_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_4
#: D_4:93
msgctxt "text_id=19034 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そういえば。カエルにするって、いったい……」"
msgstr "\"What did you mean about turning her into a frog?\""

#. Occurrence D_4:99:19035: scene=D_4
#: D_4:99
msgctxt "text_id=19035 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれ以来まったく口にしなかった話題を、草十郎は口にしてみた。"
msgstr "  He ventured to bring up the topic no one had been talking about since it occurred."

#. Occurrence D_4:104:19036: scene=D_4
#: D_4:104
msgctxt "text_id=19036 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを訊くのは<禁忌|タブー>のように思えていたし、なにより、その<突飛|とっぴ>さ故、真実を聞くのが<躊躇|ためら>われたというか。"
msgstr "  It had always seemed taboo to bring up, so the sense of transgression made him hesitate as he finally sought the truth."

#. Occurrence D_4:153:19037: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:153
msgctxt "text_id=19037 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いったいも何も、言葉通りの意味だけど。"
msgstr "\"Exactly what it sounds like."

#. Occurrence D_4:159:19038: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:159
msgctxt "text_id=19038 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　もともとルーン使いには変身術があるぶん、橙子にはかかりやすかったみたいよ？」"
msgstr "  Rune mages can shapeshift, so apparently that made her especially susceptible to the curse.\""

#. Occurrence D_4:198:19039: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_4_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_4
#: D_4:198
msgctxt "text_id=19039 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、そんな当然のように言われても……」"
msgstr "\"That sounds like a bigger deal than you're making it out to be...\""

#. Occurrence D_4:204:19040: scene=D_4
#: D_4:204
msgctxt "text_id=19040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本気でどう切り返していいか、ちくりと胃が痛む草十郎だった。"
msgstr "  His stomach hurt from the stress of not knowing how to respond to her cavalier attitude."

#. Occurrence D_4:264:19041: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_4_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_4
#: D_4:264
msgctxt "text_id=19041 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「…………まあ。それで、どうやって？」"
msgstr "\"I mean... how is it even possible to turn someone into a frog?\""

#. Occurrence D_4:270:19042: scene=D_4
#: D_4:270
msgctxt "text_id=19042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　聞きたくはないけれど、話の流れから問いたださずにはいられない。"
msgstr "  He did not particularly want to ask, but it was the natural extension of his current line of inquiry."

#. Occurrence D_4:275:19043: scene=D_4
#: D_4:275
msgctxt "text_id=19043 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の嫌そうな顔には気が付かず、青子は前を見たまま、教師よろしく説明をする。"
msgstr "  Aoko stared straight ahead as she lectured him, completely ignoring the pained expression on his face."

#. Occurrence D_4:321:19044: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:321
msgctxt "text_id=19044 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「二種類あって、精神を入れ替えるのか、肉体を再編成するかね。"
msgstr "\"So, there are two ways to go about it: a mind swap, or a reconfiguration of the person's physical form."

#. Occurrence D_4:327:19045: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:327
msgctxt "text_id=19045 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　精神だけを入れ替えるのは簡単な分、すぐ元に戻れるわ。"
msgstr "  Swapping minds is easy, but the effects don't last long."

#. Occurrence D_4:333:19046: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:333
msgctxt "text_id=19046 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　夢を見ているようなものだし、ちょっとしたショックで元の体に意識が戻ってくれるから」"
msgstr "  It feels like you're dreaming, and then there's a little jolt when you return to your body.\""

#. Occurrence D_4:360:19047: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:360
msgctxt "text_id=19047 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「厄介なのは肉体そのものを変えてしまう方で、この場合、術が切れるまで元に戻るのは難しいでしょうね。"
msgstr "\"Changing someone's physical form is more tricky, and it's hard to revert back before the spell ends."

#. Occurrence D_4:366:19048: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:366
msgctxt "text_id=19048 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私がやったのは、その再編成の方みたい。"
msgstr "  I used the physical reconfiguration approach, I guess."

#. Occurrence D_4:378:19049: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:378
msgctxt "text_id=19049 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　たぶん塩基配列を組み換えるんだろうけど、もうちんぷんかんぷん。ま、魔術が科学的な説明するのもナンセンスだし？」"
msgstr "  Something about reconstructing the base DNA sequence... I don't know, it's all gibberish to me! You can't explain magecraft with scientific jargon, anyway, right?\""

#. Occurrence D_4:398:19050: scene=D_4
#: D_4:398
msgctxt "text_id=19050 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しれっと、まさに他人事のように青子は言った。"
msgstr "  Aoko spoke as if it were not her own actions she were discussing."

#. Occurrence D_4:403:19051: scene=D_4
#: D_4:403
msgctxt "text_id=19051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの時の青子が扱った魔術は前借りしたようなもので、今の青子にはまったく使えないものらしい。"
msgstr "  Apparently, she had been borrowing magecraft from her future self and could not use any of it in the present."

#. Occurrence D_4:441:19052: scene=D_4
#: D_4:441
msgctxt "text_id=19052 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不幸中の幸いではあるが、同時に、十年後にくる逃れられない脅威でもある。"
msgstr "  Her actions had also created a looming threat that would come back to haunt them in ten years' time."

#. Occurrence D_4:446:19053: scene=D_4
#: D_4:446
msgctxt "text_id=19053 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とばっちりを受ける候補その一としては、たいへん頭の痛い問題だった。"
msgstr "  Trying to comprehend even a fraction of all the intricacies involved made Soujyuro's head hurt."

#. Occurrence D_4:473:19054: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_4_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_4
#: D_4:473
msgctxt "text_id=19054 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あと数年後には蒼崎はそんな事もできるのか。"
msgstr "\"But several years from now, you'll know how to do stuff like that?"

#. Occurrence D_4:479:19055: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_4_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_4
#: D_4:479
msgctxt "text_id=19055 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　…………<末|すえ>恐ろしいな」"
msgstr "  Pretty scary if you ask me.\""

#. Occurrence D_4:491:19056: scene=D_4
#: D_4:491
msgctxt "text_id=19056 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心底からの気持ちを呟く草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was being completely honest with her."

#. Occurrence D_4:496:19057: scene=D_4
#: D_4:496
msgctxt "text_id=19057 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに青子はきょとんと目を見開く。"
msgstr "  In response, Aoko only stared ahead blankly, eyes open wide."

#. Occurrence D_4:501:19058: scene=D_4
#: D_4:501
msgctxt "text_id=19058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何をいまさら、と言いたげな顔だった。"
msgstr "  She looked like she wanted to scold him."

#. Occurrence D_4:552:19059: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:552
msgctxt "text_id=19059 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「えっとね。有珠ならそれぐらい、今でもできるわよ」"
msgstr "\"Physical reconfiguration would be no problem for Alice even now, you know.\""

#. Occurrence D_4:635:19060: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_4_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_4
#: D_4:635
msgctxt "text_id=19060 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――――なん、だと？」"
msgstr "\"Wait, what?\""

#. Occurrence D_4:696:19061: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:696
msgctxt "text_id=19061 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……やっぱりね、そんな事だと思ってたわ。"
msgstr "\"I said you should take her more seriously, remember?"

#. Occurrence D_4:702:19062: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:702
msgctxt "text_id=19062 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　前にも言ったでしょ、アンタはあの娘を甘く見てるって。"
msgstr "  You really never listen."

#. Occurrence D_4:708:19063: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:708
msgctxt "text_id=19063 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　有珠の部屋のもろもろの人形は、あの娘に逆らった執事たちのなれの果てなんだから」"
msgstr "  Know those dolls in her room? They're all that's left of people who opposed her.\""

#. Occurrence D_4:736:19064: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_4_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_4
#: D_4:736
msgctxt "text_id=19064 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……まさか。有珠はそんなコトしないぞ」"
msgstr "\"...Surely, Alice would never do something like that.\""

#. Occurrence D_4:799:19065: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:799
msgctxt "text_id=19065 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いやいや、これがこれが。私もねー、付き合い初めて半年はそう思ってたんだけどねー」"
msgstr "\"That's exactly what I thought for the first six months or so.\""

#. Occurrence D_4:804:19066: scene=D_4
#: D_4:804
msgctxt "text_id=19066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　軽快に笑いとばす青子だが、その陽気さが逆に怖い。"
msgstr "  The light, cheerful laughter that followed only made her statement all the more chilling."

#. Occurrence D_4:854:19067: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_4_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_4
#: D_4:854
msgctxt "text_id=19067 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……蒼崎。その冗談、笑えないぞ」"
msgstr "\"It's not funny to joke like that, Aozaki.\""

#. Occurrence D_4:886:19068: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:886
msgctxt "text_id=19068 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あら、私は笑わせる気なんて、これっぽっちもないんだけど？」"
msgstr "\"Do I look like I'm trying to make you laugh?\""

#. Occurrence D_4:936:19069: scene=D_4
#: D_4:936
msgctxt "text_id=19069 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は明らかに草十郎をからかっている。"
msgstr "  She was clearly making fun of him at this point."

#. Occurrence D_4:941:19070: scene=D_4
#: D_4:941
msgctxt "text_id=19070 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どこまで信じていいのか判別がつかず、ますます顔をしかめる草十郎。"
msgstr "  Unable to determine how serious to take what she had said, Soujyuro's mood and expression only grew darker."

#. Occurrence D_4:947:19071: scene=D_4
#: D_4:947
msgctxt "text_id=19071 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "そんな消沈ぶりが楽しくて、青子はにまにまと微笑んでいる。"
msgstr "His obvious dejection made Aoko smile with satisfaction."

#. Occurrence D_4:1006:19072: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_4_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_4
#: D_4:1006
msgctxt "text_id=19072 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "“……ま、あそこでアンタの言葉にうなずいちゃうあの娘が、そこまで魔女になれる筈もないんだけど―――”"
msgstr "\"She shouldn't be able to be a witch in the first place if she agrees with what you're saying...\""

#. Occurrence D_4:1012:19073: scene=D_4
#: D_4:1012
msgctxt "text_id=19073 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　温かな感想を胸に留めた少女は、彼の横顔を見ながら歩いていく。"
msgstr "  She gazed at him as they walked, her chest warm with emotion."

#. Occurrence D_5:72:19074: scene=D_5
#: D_5:72
msgctxt "text_id=19074 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　道はいつしか、<畦道|あぜみち>から山道になっていた。"
msgstr "  The path they strode had shifted from footpaths through rice fields to a road climbing the mountain."

#. Occurrence D_5:78:19075: scene=D_5
#: D_5:78
msgctxt "text_id=19075 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小振りな山は思いのほか<拓|ひら>けていて、木々はあるものの、山道は横に広い。"
msgstr "  It was surprisingly wide given the mountain's small size, though with no shortage of trees on either side."

#. Occurrence D_5:83:19076: scene=D_5
#: D_5:83
msgctxt "text_id=19076 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自然の並木道は<延々|えんえん>と山頂に向かっている。"
msgstr "  The forest road led them up to the top of the mountain."

#. Occurrence D_5:109:19077: scene=D_5
#: D_5:109
msgctxt "text_id=19077 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　土の道には<轍|わだち>がある。"
msgstr "  Wheel marks were etched into the dirt underfoot."

#. Occurrence D_5:114:19078: scene=D_5
#: D_5:114
msgctxt "text_id=19078 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おそらく蒼崎の家から車が通っているのだろう。"
msgstr "  No doubt the Aozaki family came through here by car."

#. Occurrence D_5:119:19079: scene=D_5
#: D_5:119
msgctxt "text_id=19079 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はげ山には街灯も民家もなく、明かりは星と月の光だけだった。"
msgstr "  The only light at the summit was that of the moon and stars overhead; the bald mountaintop lacked streetlights and houses as well as vegetation."

#. Occurrence D_5:168:19080: scene=D_5
#: D_5:168
msgctxt "text_id=19080 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山道の傾斜は、段々と平坦になっていく。"
msgstr "  Near the top, the incline of their path began to even out."

#. Occurrence D_5:173:19081: scene=D_5
#: D_5:173
msgctxt "text_id=19081 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　道はずっと先にある民家の前で途切れようとしていた。"
msgstr "  The road ended abruptly at a house, still a good way away before them."

#. Occurrence D_5:179:19082: scene=D_5
#: D_5:179
msgctxt "text_id=19082 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まだ遠くで建物の<輪郭|りんかく>も掴めないけれど、暖かそうな窓明かりから、あれが蒼崎の家だろうと草十郎は読み取った。"
msgstr "  It was too far to make out the shape of the building, but Soujyuro assumed it was Aozaki's house based on the warm light coming from the windows."

#. Occurrence D_5:201:19083: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_5_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_5
#: D_5:201
msgctxt "text_id=19083 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ところで、君が家で団らんしている間、自分は何をしていればいいんだろう」"
msgstr "\"So, what should I do while you're busy with your family bonding time?\""

#. Occurrence D_5:207:19084: scene=D_5
#: D_5:207
msgctxt "text_id=19084 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一家<団欒|だんらん>する青子の姿は想像しにくかったが、無理やりしてみると、それはそれでたいへん幸福そうな場面が想像できた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro had a hard time imagining Aoko engaging in any sort of \"family bonding time,\" but with effort, he could imagine that it must be a joyful time for her."

#. Occurrence D_5:212:19085: scene=D_5
#: D_5:212
msgctxt "text_id=19085 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分が入る事でそれを壊すのは<忍|しの>びなく、草十郎は青子にそう訊ねたのだ。"
msgstr "  He did not want to ruin that by intruding, which is why he brought up the subject now."

#. Occurrence D_5:302:19086: scene=D_5
#: D_5:302
msgctxt "text_id=19086 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎としては今から帰っても、ここで一晩<野営|やえい>しても文句はない。"
msgstr "  If he had to, he would not have minded spending the night camping outside."

#. Occurrence D_5:307:19087: scene=D_5
#: D_5:307
msgctxt "text_id=19087 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、青子の返答は予想外のものだった。"
msgstr "  Her reply was not what he had expected."

#. Occurrence D_5:329:19088: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:329
msgctxt "text_id=19088 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「君は、うちの離れにいって祖父に会うの。"
msgstr "\"You're going to go meet my grandfather."

#. Occurrence D_5:335:19089: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:335
msgctxt "text_id=19089 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　たぶん、そこで今日までの記憶を消されるわ」"
msgstr "  He might be able to erase your memories of everything that's happened.\""

#. Occurrence D_5:342:19090: scene=D_5
#: D_5:342
msgctxt "text_id=19090 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぴたりと足を止めて青子はそう言った。"
msgstr "  She stopped dead in her tracks as she spoke."

#. Occurrence D_5:347:19091: scene=D_5
#: D_5:347
msgctxt "text_id=19091 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今までの打ち解けた雰囲気もなく、他人と話すように。"
msgstr "  The frank and open attitude she had shown all night was now gone."

#. Occurrence D_5:402:19092: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_5_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_5
#: D_5:402
msgctxt "text_id=19092 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「え………………？」"
msgstr "\"...Huh?\""

#. Occurrence D_5:407:19093: scene=D_5
#: D_5:407
msgctxt "text_id=19093 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　驚いて、草十郎も足を止める。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro was too shocked to take another step forward."

#. Occurrence D_5:430:19094: scene=D_5
#: D_5:430
msgctxt "text_id=19094 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　追い抜いてしまった青子を振り返ると、それが真実である事がはっきりと分かった。"
msgstr "  He turned back to look at her, having been walking a little ways ahead, and realized she was not joking."

#. Occurrence D_5:451:19095: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:451
msgctxt "text_id=19095 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「…………………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence D_5:456:19096: scene=D_5
#: D_5:456
msgctxt "text_id=19096 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　睨むような沈黙と、それを自然に受けとめる草十郎。"
msgstr "  He stood still, taking in the glaring silence."

#. Occurrence D_5:461:19097: scene=D_5
#: D_5:461
msgctxt "text_id=19097 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　先に口を開けたのは、やっぱり青子だった。"
msgstr "  Naturally, Aoko was the first to resume speaking."

#. Occurrence D_5:492:19098: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:492
msgctxt "text_id=19098 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「驚かないのね、貴方」"
msgstr "\"Nothing surprises you, does it?\""

#. Occurrence D_5:528:19099: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_5_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_5
#: D_5:528
msgctxt "text_id=19099 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……いや、驚いたけど。でも、それは初めから決まっていた事だ。そうか、それで蒼崎は俺を連れて来たのか」"
msgstr "\"No, I'm surprised. Of course I am. And now I understand why you wanted to bring me along.\""

#. Occurrence D_5:540:19100: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:540
msgctxt "text_id=19100 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「退屈しのぎは本当よ。それとは別に、祖父が貴方を連れて来いって言ったの」"
msgstr "\"I wasn't lying about wanting someone to talk to, though. It just so happens that my grandfather also told me to bring you to see him.\""

#. Occurrence D_5:656:19101: scene=D_5
#: D_5:656
msgctxt "text_id=19101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なるほど、と少年はうなずく。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro nodded in acceptance."

#. Occurrence D_5:661:19102: scene=D_5
#: D_5:661
msgctxt "text_id=19102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜は<密|ひそ>やかに変わりなく、少年も、なにひとつ変わりはなかった。"
msgstr "  He was as quiet and unchanging as the night around him."

#. Occurrence D_5:666:19103: scene=D_5
#: D_5:666
msgctxt "text_id=19103 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……目前の少女が、その在り方を憎らしいと思うほどに。"
msgstr "  Aoko found it thoroughly irritating."

#. Occurrence D_5:694:19104: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_5_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_5
#: D_5:694
msgctxt "text_id=19104 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それじゃ行こうか。立っていると寒い」"
msgstr "\"Well, we should get going then. It gets cold when you stop moving.\""

#. Occurrence D_5:700:19105: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:700
msgctxt "text_id=19105 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎」"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro.\""

#. Occurrence D_5:705:19106: scene=D_5
#: D_5:705
msgctxt "text_id=19106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　歩きだそうとする草十郎を、青子は声で引き止める。"
msgstr "  Aoko's voice stopped him in his tracks just as he was about to resume walking toward her house."

#. Occurrence D_5:711:19107: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:711
msgctxt "text_id=19107 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「貴方はそれでいいの？"
msgstr "\"Are you sure you're okay with this?"

#. Occurrence D_5:717:19108: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:717
msgctxt "text_id=19108 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　記憶を消されるって事は、今までの一ヶ月がなくなるのと同じなのよ」"
msgstr "  If he erases your memory, it'll be like this whole month never happened.\""

#. Occurrence D_5:786:19109: scene=D_5
#: D_5:786
msgctxt "text_id=19109 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の問いに、草十郎はそうか、と呟いた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro murmured in understanding."

#. Occurrence D_5:791:19110: scene=D_5
#: D_5:791
msgctxt "text_id=19110 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の事はもちろん、有珠の事や、あの洋館での暮らしを忘れて一ヶ月前の自分に戻るのは、手に入れかけた宝物を無くしてしまうような気がする。"
msgstr "  The thought of returning to his old self and forgetting about Aoko, Alice, and the mansion altogether felt like giving up a treasure that he had discovered."

#. Occurrence D_5:796:19111: scene=D_5
#: D_5:796
msgctxt "text_id=19111 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、それを惜しいと、彼は思わなかった。"
msgstr "  But he didn't feel that he was unable to let them go, either."

#. Occurrence D_5:847:19112: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_5_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_5
#: D_5:847
msgctxt "text_id=19112 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「たしかにそれは嫌だな。蒼崎と知り合ってからの一ヶ月は楽しかったし、有珠とも約束したばっかりだし。"
msgstr "\"It would definitely be bad. It's been a fun month since I met you, and I just made that promise to Alice, too."

#. Occurrence D_5:853:19113: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_5_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_5
#: D_5:853
msgctxt "text_id=19113 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　でも蒼崎が消えるわけじゃないんだろう？　冬休みが終われば、また学校で会えるじゃないか」"
msgstr "  But it's not like you'll disappear. We'll still see each other at school once winter break's over, right?\""

#. Occurrence D_5:900:19114: scene=D_5
#: D_5:900
msgctxt "text_id=19114 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに青子は返答しなかった。"
msgstr "  There was no answer from Aoko."

#. Occurrence D_5:905:19115: scene=D_5
#: D_5:905
msgctxt "text_id=19115 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はあえて口にはしなかったが、記憶を消されるのは草十郎だけではない。"
msgstr "  She did not tell him that he was not the only one who would be losing their memory."

#. Occurrence D_5:910:19116: scene=D_5
#: D_5:910
msgctxt "text_id=19116 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女の祖父が介入する以上、青子も草十郎に関する記憶を消されるのだ。"
msgstr "  Intervention by her grandfather would erase her own memories of Soujyuro, too."

#. Occurrence D_5:978:19117: scene=D_5
#: D_5:978
msgctxt "text_id=19117 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その後には、お互いの接点はないように思われた。"
msgstr "  Once it was done, they would most likely never even speak with one another again."

#. Occurrence D_5:983:19118: scene=D_5
#: D_5:983
msgctxt "text_id=19118 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんな関係になる事もなく、ただ気に食わない生徒にしか見えない。"
msgstr "  Each would become just another random student at school."

#. Occurrence D_5:988:19119: scene=D_5
#: D_5:988
msgctxt "text_id=19119 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どんなに優れた偶然が働いても、もう、今の状況には戻れない。"
msgstr "  Even if they did happen to meet by some lucky circumstance, things would not be the same as they were now."

#. Occurrence D_5:993:19120: scene=D_5
#: D_5:993
msgctxt "text_id=19120 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それを少し残念だと思うのは、たしかに、未練だと認めるしかない。"
msgstr "  She could not deny that a small part of her was going to miss him."

#. Occurrence D_5:1014:19121: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1014
msgctxt "text_id=19121 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そう。なら行きましょ」"
msgstr "\"Right. Let's get going.\""

#. Occurrence D_5:1060:19122: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1060
msgctxt "text_id=19122 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　整理のつかないまま、理屈だけで感情を切り捨てて、青子は歩きだした。"
msgstr "  She rationalized her feelings away instead of processing them and set off once more toward the house."

#. Occurrence D_5:1066:19123: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1066
msgctxt "text_id=19123 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そのとなりに草十郎は付き添っていく。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro followed along at her side."

#. Occurrence D_5:1087:19124: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1087
msgctxt "text_id=19124 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目的地まであと数分。"
msgstr "  It was a matter of several minutes before they reached their destination."

#. Occurrence D_5:1092:19125: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1092
msgctxt "text_id=19125 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎はいつも通りの顔で歩いていて、青子にはそれが腹立たしい。"
msgstr "  She was irritated to see that the expression on his face looked exactly the same as it always did."

#. Occurrence D_5:1105:19126: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1105
msgctxt "text_id=19126 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こっちはホンの少しだけど未練と思っているのに、この男は<微塵|みじん>もそう思っていないのだ。"
msgstr "  Forgetting their time together was sad for her, if only slightly so, but it did not seem to bother him in the least."

#. Occurrence D_5:1133:19127: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1133
msgctxt "text_id=19127 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……そりゃあね、平気で自分の腕を叩き折れるヤツに、そんな<繊細|せんさい>なコト期待していないけ、ど……」"
msgstr "\"Guess you can't expect much sensitivity from someone who has no problem putting themselves in harm's way by breaking both his...\""

#. Occurrence D_5:1167:19128: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1167
msgctxt "text_id=19128 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つい憎まれ口を叩いて、青子は唐突に思い出した。"
msgstr "  Halfway through muttering her complaint, Aoko suddenly remembered."

#. Occurrence D_5:1172:19129: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1172
msgctxt "text_id=19129 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、思い至ってしまった。"
msgstr "  Or rather, she realized something."

#. Occurrence D_5:1219:19130: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1219
msgctxt "text_id=19130 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一度きりの狼退治。"
msgstr "  Something about the one-time werewolf killer before her."

#. Occurrence D_5:1224:19131: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1224
msgctxt "text_id=19131 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希草十郎とは何者なのか、という不明点を。"
msgstr "  And the mystery of who Soujyuro Sizuki really was."

#. Occurrence D_5:1229:19132: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1229
msgctxt "text_id=19132 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの夜の青子は草十郎の<時間|きおく>を知ってはいたが、今の青子は知る<由|よし>もない。"
msgstr "  The older version of herself that night had had memories and knowledge of Soujyuro beyond what she knew now."

#. Occurrence D_5:1239:19133: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1239
msgctxt "text_id=19133 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この凡庸な少年の間違い。"
msgstr "  She knew something about this seemingly average boy's mistakes―"

#. Occurrence D_5:1245:19134: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1245
msgctxt "text_id=19134 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "なぜあんな事が出来たのか、そもそも、彼は山でどんな生活をしていたのか。"
msgstr "why he was able to do what he did, and why he was raised in the mountains in the first place."

#. Occurrence D_5:1270:19135: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1270
msgctxt "text_id=19135 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今まで気になってはいたものの、ついに聞き出す機会には恵まれなかった。"
msgstr "  She had always wondered but never had a chance to ask him about it... until now."

#. Occurrence D_5:1275:19136: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1275
msgctxt "text_id=19136 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その疑問も、祖父に会えば疑問と思う事さえなくなってしまうだろう。"
msgstr "  Once her grandfather was through with them, all those questions she had about Soujyuro would be gone, too."

#. Occurrence D_5:1304:19137: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1304
msgctxt "text_id=19137 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence D_5:1310:19138: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1310
msgctxt "text_id=19138 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たとえすぐに忘れてしまうにしても―――いや、数分後には何もかも無かった事になるのなら。"
msgstr "  There was no point in asking right before they had their memories erased. But then again, she might as well if she was going to forget everything anyway."

#. Occurrence D_5:1315:19139: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1315
msgctxt "text_id=19139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼に、その矛盾を吐き出させる機会は今しかない。"
msgstr "  This was her only chance to demand an explanation for his contradictory behavior."

#. Occurrence D_5:1364:19140: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1364
msgctxt "text_id=19140 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「待って。私も最後にひとつ、訊きたい事がある。"
msgstr "\"Wait. There's one thing I wanted to ask you before this is all over."

#. Occurrence D_5:1370:19141: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1370
msgctxt "text_id=19141 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　―――アンタ、山でどんな生活を送ってたの？」"
msgstr "  What was your life like when you lived in the mountains? What were you doing there?\""

#. Occurrence D_5:1378:19142: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1378
msgctxt "text_id=19142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の問いに、草十郎はぴたりと足を止めた。"
msgstr "  Her questions stopped him on the spot."

#. Occurrence D_5:1383:19143: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1383
msgctxt "text_id=19143 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その顔は今までのどんなものより<辛|つら>そうに見える。"
msgstr "  She had never seen him make such a pained expression."

#. Occurrence D_5:1425:19144: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_5_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1425
msgctxt "text_id=19144 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「つまらないよ、そんな話は」"
msgstr "\"Why do you want to talk about something so boring?\""

#. Occurrence D_5:1431:19145: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1431
msgctxt "text_id=19145 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「面白い話は期待してないって言ったでしょ。"
msgstr "\"I already told you I don't expect you to say anything interesting."

#. Occurrence D_5:1437:19146: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1437
msgctxt "text_id=19146 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　どうせ私も草十郎の事は忘れるんだから、それぐらい話してくれてもいいんじゃない？」"
msgstr "  I'm about to forget everything you say, so just humor me on this one, okay?\""

#. Occurrence D_5:1443:19147: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1443
msgctxt "text_id=19147 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けち、とばかりに見据える青子の発言に、草十郎は驚いて顔をあげた。"
msgstr "  Her words and demanding gaze caused him to lift his head in surprise."

#. Occurrence D_5:1469:19148: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_5_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1469
msgctxt "text_id=19148 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……忘れるって、蒼崎が？」"
msgstr "\"...You mean you'll forget, too?\""

#. Occurrence D_5:1498:19149: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1498
msgctxt "text_id=19149 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「当然よ。アンタが忘れても、私が覚えているんじゃ意味がないでしょう。お互いが忘れなくちゃ人と人の関係は断てないわ。"
msgstr "\"Of course. It would be pointless if I remember everything. We won't be able to make a clean break unless we both forget."

#. Occurrence D_5:1510:19150: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1510
msgctxt "text_id=19150 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……行って来いで公平じゃない。"
msgstr "  It makes sense when you think about it."

#. Occurrence D_5:1517:19151: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1517
msgctxt "text_id=19151 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "なんで、そんな顔するの」"
msgstr "So, quit looking at me like that.\""

#. Occurrence D_5:1537:19152: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1537
msgctxt "text_id=19152 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言われて、草十郎は口元を手で隠した。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's hand shot up to cover his mouth in response."

#. Occurrence D_5:1542:19153: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1542
msgctxt "text_id=19153 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分がどんな顔をしていたか判らないが、情けない顔をしている気がして。"
msgstr "  He had no idea what kind of look he had been giving her, but he had a feeling it had been pretty pathetic."

#. Occurrence D_5:1637:19154: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_5_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1637
msgctxt "text_id=19154 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうか、蒼崎も忘れるのか。"
msgstr "\"So we'll both forget..."

#. Occurrence D_5:1642:19155: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1642
msgctxt "text_id=19155 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　…………"
msgstr "  ..."

#. Occurrence D_5:1649:19156: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_5_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1649
msgctxt "text_id=19156 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "そこまでは、考えていなかった」"
msgstr "I wasn't expecting that.\""

#. Occurrence D_5:1655:19157: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1655
msgctxt "text_id=19157 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ええ。そして、私は貴方とは会わなくなる。断定はできないけど、まず間違いなくね」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, so we won't see each other anymore. You never know, but most likely not.\""

#. Occurrence D_5:1675:19158: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1675
msgctxt "text_id=19158 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから、これは最後の会話。"
msgstr "  Thus, this would be their last conversation."

#. Occurrence D_5:1680:19159: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1680
msgctxt "text_id=19159 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の台詞からも、お互いが忘れるという事からも、それは感じ取れた。"
msgstr "  The way she spoke made it obvious, even if he had been unaware of what awaited him."

#. Occurrence D_5:1700:19160: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1700
msgctxt "text_id=19160 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎青子は変わらず学校にいて、その後ろ姿に草十郎は<憧|あこが>れる。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro might see her walk by at school and feel a desire to talk,"

#. Occurrence D_5:1705:19161: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1705
msgctxt "text_id=19161 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、その先に接点はない。"
msgstr "  but they would have no reason to interact."

#. Occurrence D_5:1711:19162: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1711
msgctxt "text_id=19162 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "どんなに草十郎が話しかけても、青子は他人を必要としていないのだから。"
msgstr "Even if he tried to strike up a conversation, he knew she was not the type to bother much with other people."

#. Occurrence D_5:1716:19163: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1716
msgctxt "text_id=19163 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……いや、そもそも自分から話しかける事が彼にはできない。少なくとも、一ヶ月前の草十郎には。"
msgstr "  More importantly, he was not the type to strike up conversations in the first place. Not the way he had been a month ago, at least."

#. Occurrence D_5:1845:19164: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1845
msgctxt "text_id=19164 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこでようやく、彼は忘却の<無|む><慈|じ><悲|ひ>さを知った。"
msgstr "  That was when he finally realized how cruel it could be to forget something."

#. Occurrence D_5:1850:19165: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1850
msgctxt "text_id=19165 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の事を忘れる、とは彼女との出来事を忘れるのではなく、蒼崎青子という名前、存在からして忘れる、という事だ。"
msgstr "  Not only would he forget what they had done together, he would not so much as know her name or even be aware that she existed."

#. Occurrence D_5:1855:19166: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1855
msgctxt "text_id=19166 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女に憧れる自分はいても、その正体を掴む事はない。"
msgstr "  Even if he felt strangely drawn to her, he would never understand why."

#. Occurrence D_5:1860:19167: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1860
msgctxt "text_id=19167 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どんなに優れた偶然が働いても、今の状況には戻れない。"
msgstr "  Even if some lucky twist of fate brought them together, things would never be the same."

#. Occurrence D_5:1880:19168: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1880
msgctxt "text_id=19168 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この夜の歩みは、互いの死を見取る<葬式|そうしき>と変わらない。"
msgstr "  Their walk that night was no less than a funeral for them both."

#. Occurrence D_5:1888:19169: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1888
msgctxt "text_id=19169 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は蒼崎青子という人物を殺して、"
msgstr "  He would essentially kill the person he knew as Aoko Aozaki,"

#. Occurrence D_5:1893:19170: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1893
msgctxt "text_id=19170 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は静希草十郎という人物を殺す。"
msgstr "  and she would kill the person she knew as Soujyuro Sizuki."

#. Occurrence D_5:1899:19171: scene=D_5
#: D_5:1899
msgctxt "text_id=19171 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その後に残るものは、何もない。"
msgstr "  Afterward, nothing would remain."

#. Occurrence D_5:1968:19172: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_5_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_5
#: D_5:1968
msgctxt "text_id=19172 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「だから、その前に聞いておきたいの。嫌だっていうなら、あとはこのまま家まで直行するだけだけど」"
msgstr "\"That's why I wanted to ask. But if you don't want to talk about it, we can just go straight inside instead.\""

#. Occurrence D_5:2000:19173: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_5_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_5
#: D_5:2000
msgctxt "text_id=19173 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それはさみしいな。"
msgstr "\"That would be sad."

#. Occurrence D_5:2007:19174: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_5_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_5
#: D_5:2007
msgctxt "text_id=19174 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "……うん、くだらない話だけど、会話がないよりはましだろう」"
msgstr "Okay, I guess it's better than not talking at all. But don't blame me if it's boring.\""

#. Occurrence D_5:2100:19175: scene=D_5
#: D_5:2100
msgctxt "text_id=19175 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呟いて、草十郎は歩きだした。"
msgstr "  Muttering under his breath, Soujyuro set off towards the house once again."

#. Occurrence D_5:2106:19176: scene=D_5
#: D_5:2106
msgctxt "text_id=19176 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今度は青子が付き添うよう、となりに並ぶ。"
msgstr "  This time it was Aoko who matched his pace."

#. Occurrence D_5:2112:19177: scene=D_5
#: D_5:2112
msgctxt "text_id=19177 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　道はあと数分足らずで終わろうとしている。"
msgstr "  There were only minutes left before their path came to its end."

#. Occurrence D_5:2118:19178: scene=D_5
#: D_5:2118
msgctxt "text_id=19178 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　寒さのせいでふたりの吐息は白く、暗い夜道によく残った。"
msgstr "  The cold air turned their breath into white puffs that hung frozen in the dark night."

#. Occurrence D_6:42:19179: scene=D_6
#: D_6:42
msgctxt "text_id=19179 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　後になって青子は振り返る。"
msgstr "  Looking back on their conversation later,"

#. Occurrence D_6:47:19180: scene=D_6
#: D_6:47
msgctxt "text_id=19180 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれは会話ではなく告解に近いもので―――"
msgstr "  Aoko would think it seemed more of a confession than anything else."

#. Occurrence D_6:52:19181: scene=D_6
#: D_6:52
msgctxt "text_id=19181 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼にしては長く続けられた、不出来な昔話のようだったと。"
msgstr "  For Soujyuro, however, it was like one long, poorly told fairy tale."

#. Occurrence D_6:87:19182: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:87
msgctxt "text_id=19182 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「山での暮らしは、別に、どうという事はない。"
msgstr "\"Life in the mountains was nothing special."

msgctxt "text_id=19183 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "毎日同じ事を繰り返して、毎日同じ事を教えられた。"
msgstr " We were taught and did the exact same things every day."

#. Occurrence D_6:95:19184: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:95
msgctxt "text_id=19184 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　そこでは明日はないんだ。"
msgstr "  There never was such a thing as tomorrow."

#. Occurrence D_6:103:19185: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:103
msgctxt "text_id=19185 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "始まりが朝で、夜になれば終わる。一日は次の日には繋がらない。"
msgstr "Things started in the morning and ended when night came; the days weren't linked in any way."

msgctxt "text_id=19186 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "だから、明日を夢見る事もない」"
msgstr " So I never had any hopes or dreams about the future.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:128:19187: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:128
msgctxt "text_id=19187 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「次の日を楽しみにする、なんて言葉は、こっちに来てから知った感覚だったな。"
msgstr "\"Looking forward to the next day was a totally foreign concept until I moved here."

#. Occurrence D_6:134:19188: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:134
msgctxt "text_id=19188 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　初めは馴染めなかったし、馴染む気もなかった。"
msgstr "  It was hard to get used to at first, and I didn't particularly even want to."

#. Occurrence D_6:140:19189: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:140
msgctxt "text_id=19189 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　けど、みんながまた明日、と満足そうに口にする。いつのまにか、そういうものを夢見るようになっている自分がいた」"
msgstr "  But everybody kept saying 'See you tomorrow!' with such confidence. Before I knew it, I started dreaming about tomorrow, too.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:219:19190: scene=D_6
#: D_6:219
msgctxt "text_id=19190 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　歩きながら草十郎は語っていく。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro kept walking as he spoke."

#. Occurrence D_6:224:19191: scene=D_6
#: D_6:224
msgctxt "text_id=19191 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子には視線を向けず、前を見つめながら、夜に語りかけるように。"
msgstr "  He stared straight ahead as if telling his story to the night itself, not once turning to face Aoko."

#. Occurrence D_6:229:19192: scene=D_6
#: D_6:229
msgctxt "text_id=19192 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は沈黙に徹している。"
msgstr "  For her part, Aoko was utterly silent."

#. Occurrence D_6:234:19193: scene=D_6
#: D_6:234
msgctxt "text_id=19193 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うなずきも問いかけも、今は無意味な行いだ。"
msgstr "  She knew it was pointless to so much as nod or ask a question."

#. Occurrence D_6:255:19194: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:255
msgctxt "text_id=19194 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「目が覚めていつもの一日に戻って、ふと気が付くと昨日までいた誰かがいない。"
msgstr "\"One day, I woke up and got started like any other day, but then I realized someone whom I'd seen every day was suddenly gone."

#. Occurrence D_6:261:19195: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:261
msgctxt "text_id=19195 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　訊ねてみると、夜に体調を崩したらしい。たまにね、眠れなくなって家から出ていって、それっきりな人もいたんだ。"
msgstr "  I asked around, and apparently they'd started feeling unwell during the night. Sometimes, people who can't sleep go out on a walk by themselves, you know?"

#. Occurrence D_6:267:19196: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:267
msgctxt "text_id=19196 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　見なくなってしばらくした後、崖の下で見覚えのある遺体を見付けた事もあった」"
msgstr "  A while later, people discovered a familiar-looking corpse at the bottom of the cliff.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:288:19197: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:288
msgctxt "text_id=19197 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……今にして思うと、それは異常な事だ。"
msgstr "\"Now that I think about it, that was pretty strange..."

#. Occurrence D_6:294:19198: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:294
msgctxt "text_id=19198 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　集まって暮らしていればそんな事にはならなかったのに、自分たちは関わらなかった。一日で完結する世界だったから、他人は必要じゃなかったのかも知れない」"
msgstr "  It never would've happened if we'd all been living together, but no one was bothered by it. Maybe people didn't value each other since everyone lived on a day-to-day basis.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:383:19199: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:383
msgctxt "text_id=19199 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「山では食べる物も少なかった。飢えないためには、他の人がよりつけない場所に行くことが多くなる。その途中の道で、いなくなってしまう人も多かった」"
msgstr "\"There wasn't much to eat in the mountains. To avoid starvation, we often went to places most people wouldn't go. Lots of people died on the way, too.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:404:19200: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:404
msgctxt "text_id=19200 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「山では、誰も他人から奪うことを考えなかった。"
msgstr "\"No one would even dream of stealing from others in the mountains. "

#. Occurrence D_6:411:19201: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:411
msgctxt "text_id=19201 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　口にできるものを探す時、気をくばる相手は犬だの熊だのだけで、人を気にする事はなかったんだよ。"
msgstr "  When you're out searching for food, the only things you need to watch out for are dogs and bears, not other people."

msgctxt "text_id=19202 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "今は、その逆になりつつあるけど。"
msgstr " Here things are the other way around, though."

#. Occurrence D_6:419:19203: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:419
msgctxt "text_id=19203 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　ともかく、生活の半分はそれだけで済んでいた」"
msgstr "  Anyway, half our time was taken up just with that.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:439:19204: scene=D_6
#: D_6:439
msgctxt "text_id=19204 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は変わらず前を見つめている。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro continued to stare straight ahead."

#. Occurrence D_6:444:19205: scene=D_6
#: D_6:444
msgctxt "text_id=19205 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　思い出に苦しんでいる様子はない。"
msgstr "  He did not seem troubled by his memories."

#. Occurrence D_6:449:19206: scene=D_6
#: D_6:449
msgctxt "text_id=19206 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子から見ればとても人の住む環境ではないソレを、彼は当然と思っている。むしろ懐かしがってさえいるようだ。"
msgstr "  To Aoko's ears, it sounded like he was describing a place no one in their right mind would want to live as if it were perfectly normal. It was almost as if he missed it."

#. Occurrence D_6:455:19207: scene=D_6
#: D_6:455
msgctxt "text_id=19207 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、そこからの告白は、ゆっくりと苦悩を刻んでいった。"
msgstr "  But from that point onward, he slowly began to show more signs of distress as he spoke."

#. Occurrence D_6:496:19208: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:496
msgctxt "text_id=19208 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「もう半分は、まあ、身を守る手段を教わっていた。"
msgstr "\"The other half of our time was spent learning how to defend ourselves."

#. Occurrence D_6:502:19209: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0016; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:502
msgctxt "text_id=19209 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　学校の授業に比べたら些細な事だ。単に、自分の体はどう動くものなのか、生き物はどう動くものなのかを、よく見て、よく考えろと言われた。"
msgstr "  It wasn't much compared to classes at school now. They just told us to notice how our bodies move and how other animals' bodies move, and had us think about it."

#. Occurrence D_6:508:19210: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0017; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:508
msgctxt "text_id=19210 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　単純な反復運動だ。小石を蹴ったり森の中にこもったり、まあ、そんな意味合いのコトをやっていたんだ」"
msgstr "  We repeated some simple drills. Kicking stones, surviving in the forest, stuff like that.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:585:19211: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0018; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:585
msgctxt "text_id=19211 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あの決まり事がはじまると朝も夜もなかった。"
msgstr "\"Once we got into one of those sessions, night and day no longer mattered."

#. Occurrence D_6:591:19212: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0019; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:591
msgctxt "text_id=19212 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　外の変化に気持ちを向ける余裕はなくて、ふと気が付くとずいぶん長く食事をしていない、なんてのもざらだった。"
msgstr "  We didn't have the energy to notice the time of day. Sometimes you'd go a long time and realize you hadn't eaten anything for ages."

#. Occurrence D_6:597:19213: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0020; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:597
msgctxt "text_id=19213 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　あ、ちゃんとご<飯|はん>はもらえたよ、そういうのの後は」"
msgstr "  I mean, we did get food eventually, so don't feel bad for us or anything.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:618:19214: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0021; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:618
msgctxt "text_id=19214 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あれが何のためだったのかは、今でも分からない。"
msgstr "\"I still have no idea why we did that stuff, though."

#. Occurrence D_6:624:19215: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0022; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:624
msgctxt "text_id=19215 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　ただ山で暮らしていくには役に立ったし、そもそもあれだって生活の一部だった。"
msgstr "  But it definitely made living in the mountains easier, so I just accepted it as what we had to do."

#. Occurrence D_6:630:19216: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0023; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:630
msgctxt "text_id=19216 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　生きるって事はそうする事だって思ってた。こうやって息をして歩くためには、あの繰り返しは当然のものだったんだ」"
msgstr "  I thought that was how life was for everyone. It felt natural and even necessary to do all that training.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:674:19217: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:674
msgctxt "text_id=19217 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎、それは」"
msgstr "\"Uh, Soujyuro?\""

#. Occurrence D_6:694:19218: scene=D_6
#: D_6:694
msgctxt "text_id=19218 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎は淡々と語るけれど、その異常さに青子は口を挟んでしまった。"
msgstr "  His tone was totally indifferent, but the strangeness of it all forced Aoko to interject."

#. Occurrence D_6:699:19219: scene=D_6
#: D_6:699
msgctxt "text_id=19219 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は歩きながら、うん、とうなずいて青子にちらりと視線を移す。"
msgstr "  He glanced at Aoko and nodded as if to show he knew what she was thinking."

#. Occurrence D_6:746:19220: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0024; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:746
msgctxt "text_id=19220 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「何かがおかしかったんだろう。あれは身を守る知恵じゃなくて、もっと違う用途のものだった。"
msgstr "\"I know it sounds strange. The training definitely seemed like it was for something more than just self-defense."

#. Occurrence D_6:752:19221: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0025; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:752
msgctxt "text_id=19221 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　たまにいなくなる知り合いは、山の土になったんじゃなくて、他の場所で、他の理由で消えた場合もあったんだろう」"
msgstr "  I have a feeling the people who sometimes disappeared actually left the mountain for some other reason.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:851:19222: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0026; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:851
msgctxt "text_id=19222 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「でも、考える事さえなかった。"
msgstr "\"But I never thought about any of that then."

#. Occurrence D_6:857:19223: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0027; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:857
msgctxt "text_id=19223 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　精神の<隙間|すきま>を知れだの、命の勝ち負けを知れだの、意味をくみ取らないまま<鵜|う><呑|の>みにして、当然のように繰り返した。"
msgstr "  I accepted it all without really knowing what was going on or having any qualms about it, without knowing whether people were even still alive."

#. Occurrence D_6:863:19224: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0028; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:863
msgctxt "text_id=19224 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　それがどう評価されるものなのか、俺には分からない。"
msgstr "  Maybe some people would judge me for what I did. I don't know."

#. Occurrence D_6:869:19225: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0029; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:869
msgctxt "text_id=19225 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　ただ、知らなければ。"
msgstr "  But I do know one thing."

#. Occurrence D_6:875:19226: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0030; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:875
msgctxt "text_id=19226 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　外の事なんて知らなければ、悩むことなく、自分はそこに居続けられたと思う」"
msgstr "  If I hadn't learned about the outside world, I probably would've stayed there without a care in the world forever.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:881:19227: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:881
msgctxt "text_id=19227 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……貴方の嫌いな、生き死にの真似を続けて？」"
msgstr "\"You would've kept living on the verge of death like that? Even though you didn't like it?\""

#. Occurrence D_6:928:19228: scene=D_6
#: D_6:928
msgctxt "text_id=19228 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その問いに、彼は答えなかった。"
msgstr "  He did not respond to her question."

#. Occurrence D_6:933:19229: scene=D_6
#: D_6:933
msgctxt "text_id=19229 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無言のまま足は進む。"
msgstr "  From then on, they continued walking in silence."

#. Occurrence D_6:938:19230: scene=D_6
#: D_6:938
msgctxt "text_id=19230 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……数々の矛盾、点在していた不合理を、今更ながら青子は噛みしめる。"
msgstr "  Aoko could not stop thinking about all the contradictions and absurdities in what he had said."

#. Occurrence D_6:1002:19231: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1002
msgctxt "text_id=19231 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たとえば、この少年の教養のバランスだ。"
msgstr "  The imbalance in his education, for one."

#. Occurrence D_6:1007:19232: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1007
msgctxt "text_id=19232 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　文明の機器をまったく知らないくせに、基礎知識だけは持ち合わせていた。"
msgstr "  His knowledge of the basics of human life was thorough, yet he knew next to nothing about modern technology."

#. Occurrence D_6:1012:19233: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1012
msgctxt "text_id=19233 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の話では人付き合いは皆無だというのに、意思の<疎通|そつう>、言葉による対話に慣れていた。"
msgstr "  He always said he was not good at socializing, but he seemed accustomed to talking and discussion."

#. Occurrence D_6:1017:19234: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1017
msgctxt "text_id=19234 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは偶発的には生まれるはずのない環境、第三者の意図によって作られた<異常性|おかしさ>だ。"
msgstr "  His upbringing could not have happened that way by chance; it was most certainly an environment purposefully constructed by some third party."

#. Occurrence D_6:1037:19235: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1037
msgctxt "text_id=19235 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……その、第三者の意図など青子には分からない。"
msgstr "  Aoko had no idea what that purpose could be, or who the third party was, though."

#. Occurrence D_6:1042:19236: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1042
msgctxt "text_id=19236 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼のような人間を育てる事に何の意味があったのか。"
msgstr "  Why would anyone want to create someone with a background like Soujyuro's?"

#. Occurrence D_6:1047:19237: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1047
msgctxt "text_id=19237 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　利害目的か、それとも、その山奥ではいまだに当然の<生活|ありかた>だったのか。"
msgstr "  Was it all part of a grander plan? Or, was there really a place deep in the mountains where it was normal to live like that?"

#. Occurrence D_6:1069:19238: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1069
msgctxt "text_id=19238 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は一度だけ、どうして、と訊ねたコトがあるらしい。"
msgstr "  He had asked about this once in his home in the mountains, apparently."

#. Occurrence D_6:1074:19239: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1074
msgctxt "text_id=19239 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　疑問を覚えた彼に、彼を引き取った老人は、"
msgstr "  When he expressed his confusion, an elder had taken him aside, saying,"

#. Occurrence D_6:1080:19240: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1080
msgctxt "text_id=19240 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“んなもんオメエ、昔から続いているだけだろうよ。"
msgstr "\"This is just how things have always been around here, boy."

#. Occurrence D_6:1085:19241: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1085
msgctxt "text_id=19241 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　続ける理由もなかったが、止める理由もなかったのさ”"
msgstr "  There's no reason to keep doing it, but there's also no reason to stop.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:1091:19242: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1091
msgctxt "text_id=19242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう笑って、彼に<戸籍|こせき>と新生活を<見繕|みつくろ>って、山以外で<野|の><垂|た>れ死ねと見送った。"
msgstr "  With a laugh, the elder chose a new identity and life outside the mountains for young Soujyuro and sent him off to live on his own."

#. Occurrence D_6:1152:19243: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1152
msgctxt "text_id=19243 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　道の終わりには、彼女の帰る場所があった。"
msgstr "  Aoko's home loomed at the end of their path."

#. Occurrence D_6:1157:19244: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1157
msgctxt "text_id=19244 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これといって特色のない一般家屋。"
msgstr "  It was a generic home without any real distinguishing features."

#. Occurrence D_6:1162:19245: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1162
msgctxt "text_id=19245 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　街にある一戸建てをそのまま持ってきて、日々の趣味として畑や家畜を育てている、あまりにも平和な家。"
msgstr "  It seemed as if a house from town had been picked up and dropped here. One could imagine the residents were peaceful people who engaged in farming and raising animals in their spare time."

#. Occurrence D_6:1168:19246: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1168
msgctxt "text_id=19246 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを視界に収めて、先ほどの少女の問いに答えようと、彼は口を開けた。"
msgstr "  Gazing at what lay before him, Soujyuro finally opened his mouth to answer Aoko's earlier question."

#. Occurrence D_6:1215:19247: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0031; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1215
msgctxt "text_id=19247 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「自分には、できなかった。知らなければ良かったのに、知ってしまったから。"
msgstr "\"I would have. If I'd never learned about the outside world, I would've stayed there forever. But now I know, and I can never go back."

#. Occurrence D_6:1222:19248: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0032; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1222
msgctxt "text_id=19248 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "その後は簡単だ。"
msgstr "Coming here made everything simple."

#. Occurrence D_6:1228:19249: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0033; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1228
msgctxt "text_id=19249 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　鳴けない鳥はいらないと言われた。"
msgstr "  Someone once told me that no one wants a bird that can't sing."

#. Occurrence D_6:1234:19250: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0034; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1234
msgctxt "text_id=19250 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　今まで疑いもなく出来た事を、意味を知っただけで出来なくなったものはいらないと」"
msgstr "  It's the same when you learn the truth about something you'd never questioned before. Once you know the truth, you just don't want it in your life anymore.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:1318:19251: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0035; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1318
msgctxt "text_id=19251 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「どんなに山にいたくても、できないのなら意味がない。"
msgstr "\"No matter how badly I want to be back in the mountains, I can't live like that anymore. There's no point even trying."

#. Occurrence D_6:1324:19252: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0036; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1324
msgctxt "text_id=19252 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　俺は意味を知った瞬間に、意味を信じるコトができなくなった。だから山を下りたんだ。"
msgstr "  Once I learned that things meant something, I couldn't just blindly believe things anymore. That's why I left the mountains."

#. Occurrence D_6:1330:19253: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0037; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1330
msgctxt "text_id=19253 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……けれど、どうなんだろう。"
msgstr "  But who knows..."

#. Occurrence D_6:1336:19254: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0038; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1336
msgctxt "text_id=19254 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　そこでは、そうする事だけが全てだった。"
msgstr "  That was all I'd ever known."

#. Occurrence D_6:1342:19255: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0039; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1342
msgctxt "text_id=19255 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　そうする事だけしか教えられなかった。"
msgstr "  It was all I'd ever been taught to do."

#. Occurrence D_6:1349:19256: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0040; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1349
msgctxt "text_id=19256 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "だから―――」"
msgstr "That's why...\""

#. Occurrence D_6:1369:19257: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1369
msgctxt "text_id=19257 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　間違えていたのは。"
msgstr "  There had been only one problem with his life in the mountains: himself, for having questioned it."

#. Occurrence D_6:1374:19258: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1374
msgctxt "text_id=19258 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おかしかったのは、疑いを持ってしまった自分だったのか、と。"
msgstr "  It was all his mistake."

#. Occurrence D_6:1379:19259: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1379
msgctxt "text_id=19259 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自戒のように、彼の呟きは途切れていった。"
msgstr "  He muttered as much to himself, his voice dripping with criticism."

#. Occurrence D_6:1420:19260: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1420
msgctxt "text_id=19260 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……青子は思う。"
msgstr "  In Aoko's opinion,"

#. Occurrence D_6:1425:19261: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1425
msgctxt "text_id=19261 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の<棲|す>んでいた世界は、ある意味で完成していた。"
msgstr "  the world he described was, in a sense, perfect."

#. Occurrence D_6:1506:19262: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1506
msgctxt "text_id=19262 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一つの事柄を成立させたければ、それ以外は何もない世界を作ればいい。"
msgstr "  The best environment to achieve a goal was one in which all elements extraneous to that goal had been removed."

#. Occurrence D_6:1511:19263: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1511
msgctxt "text_id=19263 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それがどんな不道徳な事でも、不道徳という概念を知らなければ、それは正義だ。"
msgstr "  As long as the people involved had no concept of morality, they would consider the immoral to be correct."

#. Occurrence D_6:1516:19264: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1516
msgctxt "text_id=19264 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、そもそも正しさの観念すらない。"
msgstr "  No; even \"correctness\" would be a foreign concept."

#. Occurrence D_6:1522:19265: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1522
msgctxt "text_id=19265 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あるのはただ一つ。"
msgstr "  Only one thing was for sure:"

#. Occurrence D_6:1528:19266: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1528
msgctxt "text_id=19266 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "その世界が、あまりにも行き止まっている、という事だけ。"
msgstr " the world Soujyuro had come from was frozen in time."

#. Occurrence D_6:1548:19267: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1548
msgctxt "text_id=19267 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……悲劇は、そこで満ち足りてしまった事だ。"
msgstr "  That was what made his tragedy possible."

#. Occurrence D_6:1554:19268: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1554
msgctxt "text_id=19268 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その間違いだらけの世界で、"
msgstr "  A world of wrongdoing and mistakes"

#. Occurrence D_6:1559:19269: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1559
msgctxt "text_id=19269 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　間違いだらけの人間として、"
msgstr "      had created a human riddled with"

#. Occurrence D_6:1564:19270: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1564
msgctxt "text_id=19270 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　こうやって残ってしまった。"
msgstr "        mistakes as well."

#. Occurrence D_6:1584:19271: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1584
msgctxt "text_id=19271 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼はそれを悪と知りながら、今でも美しいと感じている。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro understood that it was wrong, and yet he still thought it beautiful even now."

#. Occurrence D_6:1590:19272: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1590
msgctxt "text_id=19272 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　真相はどうあれ、彼にとって、その世界は完成していた。"
msgstr "  Regardless of what the truth behind it might have been, he considered that world perfect."

#. Occurrence D_6:1595:19273: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1595
msgctxt "text_id=19273 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悪いのは外の世界を知ってしまった自分。"
msgstr "  He only blamed himself for having learned what existed outside that world."

#. Occurrence D_6:1600:19274: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1600
msgctxt "text_id=19274 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だって、それを知らなければ、彼は今でも幸福だったのだから。"
msgstr "  Just earlier, he'd said that he would have been happier."

#. Occurrence D_6:1700:19275: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0041; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1700
msgctxt "text_id=19275 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "“知らなければ、良かったのに。”"
msgstr "\"If I'd never learned about the outside world, I would've stayed there forever.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:1706:19276: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1706
msgctxt "text_id=19276 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その言葉の罪深さは、呟く本人が誰よりも。"
msgstr "  He surely felt the weight of the sinful words he spoke more deeply than anyone else."

#. Occurrence D_6:1726:19277: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1726
msgctxt "text_id=19277 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから彼は問うたのだ。"
msgstr "  That's why he still wondered:"

#. Occurrence D_6:1731:19278: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1731
msgctxt "text_id=19278 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おかしいのは一体なんなのか。"
msgstr "  What had gone awry?"

#. Occurrence D_6:1736:19279: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1736
msgctxt "text_id=19279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　間違っていたのは誰なのかを。"
msgstr "  Whose fault was it, really?"

#. Occurrence D_6:1741:19280: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1741
msgctxt "text_id=19280 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の言葉ではなく、少女の言葉で、明確に告発してほしかった。"
msgstr "  He did not want to answer these questions alone. He wanted her to state it clearly for him."

#. Occurrence D_6:1747:19281: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1747
msgctxt "text_id=19281 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一瞬の、けれど<永劫|えいごう>のような思考の末、"
msgstr "  There was a moment of silence that felt like an eternity before she spoke."

#. Occurrence D_6:1790:19282: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1790
msgctxt "text_id=19282 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「―――私には、答えられないわ」"
msgstr "\"...I can't answer those questions for you.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:1870:19283: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1870
msgctxt "text_id=19283 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少女は静かに、そう返答した。"
msgstr "  Her reply came quietly."

#. Occurrence D_6:1875:19284: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1875
msgctxt "text_id=19284 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　分からない、ではなく、答えられない。"
msgstr "  She had an answer, but she couldn't tell him―"

#. Occurrence D_6:1880:19285: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1880
msgctxt "text_id=19285 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは嘘を言わない彼女にとって、精一杯の回答だった。"
msgstr "  it was a struggle for her to tell such a bold-faced lie."

#. Occurrence D_6:1885:19286: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1885
msgctxt "text_id=19286 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年は深くかみしめる。"
msgstr "  The boy reflected deeply on what she said."

#. Occurrence D_6:1890:19287: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1890
msgctxt "text_id=19287 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今のがどれほど優しい言葉なのか、考えるまでもないのだから。"
msgstr "  He knew right away that her words were coming from a place of kindness."

#. Occurrence D_6:1912:19288: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0042_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1912
msgctxt "text_id=19288 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「うん、そうだな。"
msgstr "\"Yeah, I understand."

#. Occurrence D_6:1919:19289: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0042_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1919
msgctxt "text_id=19289 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "君の最初の優しさが、今でよかった」"
msgstr " Now I can appreciate your kindness during those early days.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:1925:19290: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1925
msgctxt "text_id=19290 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　などと、<倖|しあわ>せそうに言う草十郎を、青子はじとりと睨みつけた。"
msgstr "  A pleasant look floated across his face, at which Aoko could only scowl."

#. Occurrence D_6:1946:19291: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1946
msgctxt "text_id=19291 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なによそれ。"
msgstr "\"What do you mean?"

#. Occurrence D_6:1952:19292: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1952
msgctxt "text_id=19292 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　まるで、普段から優しくないみたいじゃない」"
msgstr "  I haven't been any nicer to you than I normally am.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:1958:19293: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0043; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:1958
msgctxt "text_id=19293 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「蒼崎は優しくないじゃないか」"
msgstr "\"Well, you're not very nice normally, are you?\""

#. Occurrence D_6:1964:19294: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1964
msgctxt "text_id=19294 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　きっぱりと言われて、青子は反論できなかった。"
msgstr "  She found herself unable to offer any protest against such a blunt statement."

#. Occurrence D_6:1969:19295: scene=D_6
#: D_6:1969
msgctxt "text_id=19295 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それは、たしかに彼の言う通りで。"
msgstr "  It was because she knew he was correct."

#. Occurrence D_6:2041:19296: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:2041
msgctxt "text_id=19296 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……そうね。優しくなんかないわね、私」"
msgstr "\"I... guess you're right. I'm not very nice.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:2047:19297: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2047
msgctxt "text_id=19297 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どこか<寂|さみ>しげな青子の同意に、ほら、と草十郎は笑った。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro smiled in response to her vaguely sad consent as if to say, \"Told you so.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:2052:19298: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2052
msgctxt "text_id=19298 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見守るような微笑みは、彼が誰よりも、それを誇りに思っているからだろう。"
msgstr "  His indulgent smirk arose from his sense of personal pride in the situation."

#. Occurrence D_6:2072:19299: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2072
msgctxt "text_id=19299 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが気まずくて温かくて、青子はあんな質問をした事を後悔した。"
msgstr "  It was both warm-hearted and uncomfortable, causing Aoko to instantly regret her question."

#. Occurrence D_6:2077:19300: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2077
msgctxt "text_id=19300 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もっと違う、なんでもない話をすれば、こんな<陰欝|いんうつ>とした気分にはならなかったのにと。"
msgstr "  If only she had asked about something else, something random that did not matter, then she never would have ended up in a mood like this."

#. Occurrence D_6:2121:19301: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2121
msgctxt "text_id=19301 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　道は、あと数歩分もない。"
msgstr "  Only a few minutes remained until their path came to an end."

#. Occurrence D_6:2126:19302: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2126
msgctxt "text_id=19302 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　木の柵に囲まれた建物は、冬の中にある<憩|いこ>いの宿に見えた。"
msgstr "  Surrounded by a wooden fence, the house resembled an inn for passing travelers in winter."

#. Occurrence D_6:2131:19303: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2131
msgctxt "text_id=19303 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　窓からこぼれる明かりが、今の気分に逆らって食卓の<賑|にぎ>わいを想像させる。"
msgstr "  The light spilling out from the window brought to mind images of a lively dinner table, quite the opposite of the current mood between the two."

#. Occurrence D_6:2152:19304: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:2152
msgctxt "text_id=19304 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ごめん。悪いこと聞いちゃって」"
msgstr "\"Sorry. I shouldn't have pried.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:2159:19305: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2159
msgctxt "text_id=19305 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は庭の入り口で立ち止まる。"
msgstr "  Aoko stopped at the entrance to the yard."

#. Occurrence D_6:2164:19306: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2164
msgctxt "text_id=19306 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最後なのに、それとも最後だから、一度くらいは謝っておこうと思ったのか。"
msgstr "  Did she feel compelled to apologize despite―no, because it was their last conversation?"

#. Occurrence D_6:2169:19307: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2169
msgctxt "text_id=19307 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに草十郎はいや、と答えるだけだった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's only response was to shrug it off."

#. Occurrence D_6:2214:19308: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:2214
msgctxt "text_id=19308 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「話、途中なのにね」"
msgstr "\"There's still a lot to talk about.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:2220:19309: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2220
msgctxt "text_id=19309 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　辿り着いてしまった家を見上げて、白い息をこぼす。"
msgstr "  He looked up at the house they had hiked so far to reach, his breath hanging white in the air."

#. Occurrence D_6:2225:19310: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2225
msgctxt "text_id=19310 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うなずく草十郎の顔に、もう<昏|くら>い<翳|かげ>りは微塵もない。"
msgstr "  All signs of gloom were gone from Soujyuro's face as he nodded."

#. Occurrence D_6:2246:19311: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0044; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:2246
msgctxt "text_id=19311 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「自分も、話してみてようやく振り向けたと思う。だから蒼崎には感謝してるよ。"
msgstr "\"I think talking about it helped me reflect on the past. So I appreciate it."

#. Occurrence D_6:2252:19312: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0045; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:2252
msgctxt "text_id=19312 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　―――それに、これはもう終わった事だ。"
msgstr "  Besides, it's all in the past now."

#. Occurrence D_6:2258:19313: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0046; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:2258
msgctxt "text_id=19313 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　続きを話すのは、また機会があった時にしよう」"
msgstr "  Maybe I can continue the story the next time we have a chance to talk.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:2359:19314: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2359
msgctxt "text_id=19314 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　消え入るような笑顔で、草十郎は青子と顔を向き合わせる。"
msgstr "  He turned his head to face Aoko with an ephemeral smile."

#. Occurrence D_6:2364:19315: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2364
msgctxt "text_id=19315 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今まで通りの、何でもない静希草十郎として。"
msgstr "  He was his usual, nonchalant self, the same as every other day."

#. Occurrence D_6:2369:19316: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2369
msgctxt "text_id=19316 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが痛ましくて、そんな日がこない事を青子は祈った。"
msgstr "  Aoko prayed that day would never come."

#. Occurrence D_6:2374:19317: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2374
msgctxt "text_id=19317 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分のためと、この特異な少年のために。"
msgstr "  For her own peace of mind, but also for the wellbeing of this very unique boy."

#. Occurrence D_6:2424:19318: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:2424
msgctxt "text_id=19318 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "“……もっとも、そんな機会はもうこないか”"
msgstr "(There probably won't be a next time.)"

#. Occurrence D_6:2430:19319: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2430
msgctxt "text_id=19319 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして、彼女は一軒家の更に向こう、小さな森に隠れた<洞|どう><穴|けつ>を指さした。"
msgstr "  Then she pointed in the direction of a cave hidden by a small forest on the other side of the house."

#. Occurrence D_6:2477:19320: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:2477
msgctxt "text_id=19320 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あそこ、ちょっとした洞穴があるの。そこに祖父がいるから、行って。"
msgstr "\"My grandfather's in the cave over there, so you should go see him."

#. Occurrence D_6:2483:19321: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:2483
msgctxt "text_id=19321 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……ほんとはもっと違った話が聞きたかったけど。仕方ないか、魔法は十二時になるときれちゃうものだしね」"
msgstr "  I actually wanted to ask about something else, but whatever. The spell will wear off at midnight anyway, right?\""

#. Occurrence D_6:2528:19322: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2528
msgctxt "text_id=19322 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　皮肉げな微笑みを浮かべて、青子はそう言った。"
msgstr "  A sarcastic grin spread across her face as she spoke."

#. Occurrence D_6:2534:19323: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2534
msgctxt "text_id=19323 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それがどんな童話の引用かも知らず、草十郎は歩きだす。"
msgstr "  And so Soujyuro walked off, totally clueless as to what fairy tale she was referencing."

#. Occurrence D_6:2540:19324: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2540
msgctxt "text_id=19324 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　家から離れた森は遠すぎて、青子には<地上|ここ>とは別の場所のように思えた。"
msgstr "  The forest felt so far from the house to Aoko that it was like a different place on earth altogether."

#. Occurrence D_6:2545:19325: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2545
msgctxt "text_id=19325 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　実際は五分もかからない、短く、手の届く距離なのに。"
msgstr "  In reality it wasn't far at all, only five minutes away."

#. Occurrence D_6:2566:19326: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:2566
msgctxt "text_id=19326 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「さよなら、静希くん」"
msgstr "\"Farewell, Sizuki.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:2572:19327: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2572
msgctxt "text_id=19327 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　振り向かずに歩いていく背中に、青子は呟きかける。"
msgstr "  She said it to herself as she watched him simply walk away without turning back."

#. Occurrence D_6:2577:19328: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2577
msgctxt "text_id=19328 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　聞こえる筈のないそれを、やっぱり草十郎は聞き届けたようだ。"
msgstr "  Though he wasn't meant to hear her words of parting, they apparently reached his ears anyway."

#. Occurrence D_6:2584:19329: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_6_0047; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_6
#: D_6:2584
msgctxt "text_id=19329 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ああ。じゃあまた明日、町の何処かで」"
msgstr "\"Right. See you around town tomorrow.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:2590:19330: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2590
msgctxt "text_id=19330 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年は片手を上げて答えると、彼方の森へと消えていった。"
msgstr "  He raised his hand in farewell and then disappeared into the forest."

#. Occurrence D_6:2716:19331: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2716
msgctxt "text_id=19331 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを見届けて、青子はひとり<天|そら>を<仰|あお>ぐ。"
msgstr "  As soon as she was sure he was gone, she turned her gaze to the sky."

#. Occurrence D_6:2721:19332: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2721
msgctxt "text_id=19332 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今夜は月よりも星が綺麗だ。"
msgstr "  That night the stars were even more beautiful than the moon."

#. Occurrence D_6:2726:19333: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2726
msgctxt "text_id=19333 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それをさっきまで懐かしそうに眺めていた人物は、嘘みたいにあっさり、別れの言葉を告げて消えていった。"
msgstr "  He had been looking at her fondly only moments before, and now he was gone into the forest with only a brief word of parting. It did not feel real."

#. Occurrence D_6:2732:19334: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2732
msgctxt "text_id=19334 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まったく、と青子は今更ながら納得する。"
msgstr "  And with that she finally understood, if a little too late to matter."

#. Occurrence D_6:2737:19335: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2737
msgctxt "text_id=19335 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　結局、いちばん普通じゃなかったのは誰だったのか。"
msgstr "  She understood who had truly been the strange and unusual one."

#. Occurrence D_6:2757:19336: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2757
msgctxt "text_id=19336 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎の行いは、言ってしまえば誰にだってできる事だ。"
msgstr "  Anyone could have ended up behaving like Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence D_6:2762:19337: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2762
msgctxt "text_id=19337 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、彼の言う繰り返しを続けられる人間はそうはいない。"
msgstr "  But not many could keep talking on and on the way he did."

#. Occurrence D_6:2767:19338: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2767
msgctxt "text_id=19338 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あんな山での生活をしていれば、たしかに、今までの出来事なんてどうという事もなかったのだろう。"
msgstr "  Everything he had done was now perfectly sensible in light of his former life in the mountains."

#. Occurrence D_6:2773:19339: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2773
msgctxt "text_id=19339 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分は魔法使いだから奇跡を起こすけれど、"
msgstr "  As a Magician she was supposed to make miracles happen,"

#. Occurrence D_6:2778:19340: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2778
msgctxt "text_id=19340 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は常識を繰り返した<末|すえ>にひとつの奇跡に辿り着いて、最後に、あんな魔法を見せたのだ。"
msgstr "  but he had arrived at a miracle of his own through the trials and tribulations of following what he considered to be common sense."

#. Occurrence D_6:2799:19341: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_6_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_6
#: D_6:2799
msgctxt "text_id=19341 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「素手で熊を倒すなんて、私にはどう転んでもできないし」"
msgstr "\"I could never take down a bear with my own hands, after all.\""

#. Occurrence D_6:2805:19342: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2805
msgctxt "text_id=19342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だから、それはすごいコトだ。"
msgstr "  It was pretty impressive."

#. Occurrence D_6:2810:19343: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2810
msgctxt "text_id=19343 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……その魔法は、彼にとって哀しいぐらい、無意味な物だったとしても。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's own magic was so mundane to him that it made him depressed to talk about it, but even so..."

#. Occurrence D_6:2815:19344: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2815
msgctxt "text_id=19344 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれは確かに、人間だけが持つ輝きだった。"
msgstr "  It was the kind of brilliance only possessed by humans."

#. Occurrence D_6:2875:19345: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2875
msgctxt "text_id=19345 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は星空から目を離して歩きだした。"
msgstr "  She pulled her eyes back down from the starry sky and began to walk."

#. Occurrence D_6:2880:19346: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2880
msgctxt "text_id=19346 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　玄関の明かりはついていて、鍵はかかっていない。"
msgstr "  The lights were on inside the entrance and the door was unlocked."

#. Occurrence D_6:2885:19347: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2885
msgctxt "text_id=19347 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　くっと服の袖をあげて時計を見ると、時刻はあと半刻で零時になろうとしていた。"
msgstr "  Aoko rolled up her sleeves and checked the time―one hour left until midnight."

#. Occurrence D_6:2890:19348: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2890
msgctxt "text_id=19348 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……どうやら、年内に来いという両親の言いつけは守れたようだ。"
msgstr "  She had just barely managed to satisfy her parents' request to visit before the end of the year."

#. Occurrence D_6:2910:19349: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2910
msgctxt "text_id=19349 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　扉に手を掛けて、深呼吸を一度する。"
msgstr "  Placing her hand on the door, she took a deep breath."

#. Occurrence D_6:2915:19350: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2915
msgctxt "text_id=19350 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それで、さっきまでの淡い未練を、彼女は綺麗に断ち切った。"
msgstr "  She promptly stifled the faint affection and sadness she had been feeling."

#. Occurrence D_6:2958:19351: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2958
msgctxt "text_id=19351 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　実家に帰ってくるのは二年ぶりだ。"
msgstr "  It was her first time back in two years."

#. Occurrence D_6:2963:19352: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2963
msgctxt "text_id=19352 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　高校に入学してから下宿を始めて、今日までの二年間。"
msgstr "  Upon entering high school two years ago, she had begun living on her own."

#. Occurrence D_6:2968:19353: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2968
msgctxt "text_id=19353 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　早かったといえば早くすぎたその月日は、なぜか今になって思い出のように、自分の中を走り抜けていった。"
msgstr "  How time flew by. For some reason, the memories began to race through her mind."

#. Occurrence D_6:2974:19354: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2974
msgctxt "text_id=19354 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　扉に手をかけて、今までの事を思い出すのなら。"
msgstr "  There she stood, one hand on the door, reflecting on the past."

#. Occurrence D_6:2979:19355: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2979
msgctxt "text_id=19355 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　扉を開ければ、これからの事を見つめる事になるのだろう。"
msgstr "  Once the door was open, she would be staring at her future instead."

#. Occurrence D_6:2999:19356: scene=D_6
#: D_6:2999
msgctxt "text_id=19356 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ノブを持つ手に力をいれる。"
msgstr "  Her hand holding the doorknob began to move."

#. Occurrence D_6:3004:19357: scene=D_6
#: D_6:3004
msgctxt "text_id=19357 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……中の風景はどこか微妙に違うけれど、記憶の中で見なれた温かい風景だった。"
msgstr "  She was met with the warm scene she expected, though strangely different than that of her memories."

#. Occurrence D_6:3026:19358: scene=D_6
#: D_6:3026
msgctxt "text_id=19358 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分が去って、月日が経っても変わらず出迎えてくれるものがある事は、なんて幸福なんだろう。"
msgstr "  It was comforting to encounter something familiar after being away for so long."

#. Occurrence D_6:3031:19359: scene=D_6
#: D_6:3031
msgctxt "text_id=19359 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それにほんの些細な、言葉にしない小さな感謝をして、彼女は自分の家に帰ってきた。"
msgstr "  And so it was with small, unspoken gratitude that Aoko returned to her home."

#. Occurrence D_6:3038:19360: scene=D_6
#: D_6:3038
msgctxt "text_id=19360 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呼び鈴も押さずに、ただいまと微笑んで。"
msgstr "  Without stopping to ring the doorbell, she called out with a smile, \"I'm home!\""

#. Occurrence D_7:63:19361: scene=D_7
#: D_7:63
msgctxt "text_id=19361 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その洞穴に入った瞬間、奇妙な懐かしさに襲われた。"
msgstr "  The moment Soujyuro stepped inside, he was struck with a strange feeling of familiarity."

#. Occurrence D_7:70:19362: scene=D_7
#: D_7:70
msgctxt "text_id=19362 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<郷愁|きょうしゅう>ではなく、もっと<前期|いぜん>の。"
msgstr "  It was not mere nostalgia either. No, it reached further back into the past."

#. Occurrence D_7:77:19363: scene=D_7
#: D_7:77
msgctxt "text_id=19363 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の自分すら遠く想うほどの、<彼方|かなた>に至る懐かしさだ。"
msgstr "  It was a feeling from far beyond what he could even imagine."

#. Occurrence D_7:151:19364: scene=D_7
#: D_7:151
msgctxt "text_id=19364 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その人物が何者であったかは、よく覚えていない。"
msgstr "  He was reminded of someone, but he could not remember whom."

#. Occurrence D_7:156:19365: scene=D_7
#: D_7:156
msgctxt "text_id=19365 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分と同じだったかも知れないし、老人だった気もする。"
msgstr "  Perhaps he was only reminded of himself, or perhaps of the old man before him now in the cavern."

#. Occurrence D_7:161:19366: scene=D_7
#: D_7:161
msgctxt "text_id=19366 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人らしき<輪郭|りんかく>だけがあり、その中身を判別する事はできなかった。"
msgstr "  It appeared to be an old man, anyway. Soujyuro could not make out any details beyond a vague outline."

#. Occurrence D_7:166:19367: scene=D_7
#: D_7:166
msgctxt "text_id=19367 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　叶ったとしても、表現するための適切なパーツが思いつかない。"
msgstr "  As far as he could tell, the figure did not seem to have anything in the way of a face capable of making expressions."

#. Occurrence D_7:171:19368: scene=D_7
#: D_7:171
msgctxt "text_id=19368 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はっきりしていたのは、その煙のような人物が、青子の言う『祖父』という事だけだった。"
msgstr "  All he knew was that the smoke-like figure before him was the one Aoko called \"Grandfather.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:192:19369: voice_id=F60_D_7_0000; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:192
msgctxt "text_id=19369 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「娘たちが世話になった」"
msgstr "\"I want to thank you for everything you did for my girls.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:199:19370: scene=D_7
#: D_7:199
msgctxt "text_id=19370 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　老人の声はしわがれていたが、張りがあり、洞穴によく響いた。"
msgstr "  Though hoarse, the old man's voice was powerful and rang throughout the cavern."

#. Occurrence D_7:222:19371: voice_id=F60_D_7_0001; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:222
msgctxt "text_id=19371 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「これも縁だ。望みがあるのなら聞こう」"
msgstr "\"It was fate that we would meet. Tell me, what is it you wish for?\""

#. Occurrence D_7:228:19372: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_7_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_7
#: D_7:228
msgctxt "text_id=19372 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「望みはないです。でも、訊きたい事は一つあります。"
msgstr "\"I don't wish for anything. But there is something I'd like to ask you."

#. Occurrence D_7:234:19373: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_7_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_7
#: D_7:234
msgctxt "text_id=19373 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　……どうして、二人を争わせたんですか？」"
msgstr "  Why are you making those two fight each other?\""

#. Occurrence D_7:240:19374: voice_id=F60_D_7_0002; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:240
msgctxt "text_id=19374 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「それは私の外で起きた物語だ。答える事はできない」"
msgstr "\"I cannot provide an answer to that. Theirs is a story outside my control.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:246:19375: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_7_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_7
#: D_7:246
msgctxt "text_id=19375 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうしむけたのは貴方だと聞きました」"
msgstr "\"I heard you were the one responsible for it.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:267:19376: voice_id=F60_D_7_0003; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:267
msgctxt "text_id=19376 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「星の<巡|めぐ>りだ。あれらは相容れない才能を与えられ、あのような形でしか<交|か>み合えない人間だ。私の意図に関係なく、共に居ればどちらかが<軋|きし>みをあげた。"
msgstr "\"The stars are to blame; the two were given incompatible talents. This is simply how they respond to one another. Whenever they're together, they find a way to fight, not through any design of mine."

#. Occurrence D_7:273:19377: voice_id=F60_D_7_0004; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:273
msgctxt "text_id=19377 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、確かに衝突を避ける余地はあった。あれらの意志が凡庸であったか、あるいは破格のものであったのなら、多くの<不純|ふじゅん>に耐えただろう。"
msgstr "  They used to keep enough distance to avoid conflict, though. Perhaps the things they fought over were more innocuous. Or perhaps they were very serious, in which case they must have suffered immensely."

#. Occurrence D_7:279:19378: voice_id=F60_D_7_0005; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:279
msgctxt "text_id=19378 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　君のように、自己の崩壊が見えていても、共存を尊ぶように。しかし娘たちはそれを選ばなかった」"
msgstr "  You value a spirit of coexistence even when you can see that it would harm you. But the girls chose not to follow that path.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:300:19379: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_7_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_7
#: D_7:300
msgctxt "text_id=19379 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「彼女たちが争うのは彼女たちのせいだって言うんですね。その原因は、貴方にあるのに」"
msgstr "\"So you're putting the blame on them. Even though the reasons for their fighting all lead back to you.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:306:19380: voice_id=F60_D_7_0006; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:306
msgctxt "text_id=19380 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「そうだ。あれらの争いは、あれらの生をあらわすもの。原因と言うのなら、私などゼロに等しい」"
msgstr "\"Indeed. The girls' fighting is a reflection of their lives. I take zero responsibility for the reasons for which they do it.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:312:19381: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_7_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_7
#: D_7:312
msgctxt "text_id=19381 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ゼロ……？　形が無いという事ですか」"
msgstr "\"You mean there's zero physical proof of your involvement?\""

#. Occurrence D_7:333:19382: voice_id=F60_D_7_0007; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:333
msgctxt "text_id=19382 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「形ではなく、意味が無い。"
msgstr "\"No. The claim is simply meaningless."

#. Occurrence D_7:339:19383: voice_id=F60_D_7_0008; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:339
msgctxt "text_id=19383 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　私という起因から起こり、娘たちが一つの<題目|いのち>を得た時点で、私は<現代|ぶたい>から消え失せた。その後の因は、常に娘たちから生じたものだ。私の介入はない」"
msgstr "  When the girls were born―the only real line of causality you can draw between us―I had already left this era. They have given rise to all events since. I played no intervening role.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:360:19384: voice_id=F60_D_7_0009; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:360
msgctxt "text_id=19384 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「今回、どちらが時間を終わらせても、あるいは両者が終わらせても、私には無価値だった。"
msgstr "\"If either of them reaches the end of their time in this realm, or even if they both do, it matters not to me."

#. Occurrence D_7:366:19385: voice_id=F60_D_7_0010; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:366
msgctxt "text_id=19385 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、もとより無価値だ。"
msgstr "  In fact, I have never considered that to be of importance."

#. Occurrence D_7:372:19386: voice_id=F60_D_7_0011; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:372
msgctxt "text_id=19386 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　私に価値を与える<題目|いのち>は、まだ生まれていない。"
msgstr "  A life―a title deserving the value I can offer has not yet come to be."

#. Occurrence D_7:378:19387: voice_id=F60_D_7_0012; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:378
msgctxt "text_id=19387 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれらがどうなろうと、やるべき事は変わらない」"
msgstr "  Whatever may happen between the two of them, it doesn't change what I have to do.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:399:19388: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_7_9000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_7
#: D_7:399
msgctxt "text_id=19388 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……青子が生きていても死んでいても、後継ぎを作るという事ですか」"
msgstr "\"You mean all you care about is getting your heir, no matter whether Aoko lives or dies?\""

#. Occurrence D_7:405:19389: voice_id=F60_D_7_0013; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:405
msgctxt "text_id=19389 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「おそらく。この体が消えないのは、そういう事だ」"
msgstr "\"In a manner of speaking, yes. That's why my body has yet to disappear.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:432:19390: scene=D_7
#: D_7:432
msgctxt "text_id=19390 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洞穴に充満した、蒸気のような<精気|オド>に目眩がした。"
msgstr "  The steamy energy that filled the cavern made Soujyuro's head reel."

#. Occurrence D_7:437:19391: scene=D_7
#: D_7:437
msgctxt "text_id=19391 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この老人は、青子と橙子が生まれた瞬間に、彼女たちが孫である事を忘れたのだ。"
msgstr "  The moment Aoko and Touko were born, their grandfather seemed to have completely forgotten that they were his granddaughters."

#. Occurrence D_7:442:19392: scene=D_7
#: D_7:442
msgctxt "text_id=19392 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……正統な蒼崎の後継者は、たぶん、永遠に誕生しないだろう。"
msgstr "  It was hard to imagine a satisfactory Aozaki heir ever being born."

#. Occurrence D_7:447:19393: scene=D_7
#: D_7:447
msgctxt "text_id=19393 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この老人がいるかぎり、<際限|さいげん>なく新しい力は求められる。"
msgstr "  No amount of power would satisfy the old man."

#. Occurrence D_7:452:19394: scene=D_7
#: D_7:452
msgctxt "text_id=19394 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこには<妥協|だきょう>も<限界|げんかい>もない。"
msgstr "  He showed no signs of compromise or restraint."

#. Occurrence D_7:473:19395: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_7_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_7
#: D_7:473
msgctxt "text_id=19395 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「青子は、そのために過去を捨てたのに？」"
msgstr "\"I assume you know Aoko threw everything away for this.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:496:19396: scene=D_7
#: D_7:496
msgctxt "text_id=19396 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　沈黙があった。"
msgstr "  There was nothing but silence."

#. Occurrence D_7:502:19397: scene=D_7
#: D_7:502
msgctxt "text_id=19397 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ただ一度だけの、短い沈黙。"
msgstr "However, this short moment of quiet would occur only once."

#. Occurrence D_7:507:19398: scene=D_7
#: D_7:507
msgctxt "text_id=19398 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不確かな人物像は、その輪郭さえぼやけていく。"
msgstr "  The unreadable outline of the old man grew blurrier still."

#. Occurrence D_7:528:19399: scene=D_7
#: D_7:528
msgctxt "text_id=19399 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――昔。"
msgstr "  Long ago..."

#. Occurrence D_7:534:19400: scene=D_7
#: D_7:534
msgctxt "text_id=19400 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　因の切れた幼子が、この洞穴に入ってきた事がある。"
msgstr "  a child wandered into the cave, her karma empty."

#. Occurrence D_7:539:19401: scene=D_7
#: D_7:539
msgctxt "text_id=19401 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<無|む><知|ち>、<無|む><垢|く>から生まれた願いを、老人は自動的に叶えてやった。"
msgstr "  The old man automatically granted her request born from innocence and ignorance."

#. Occurrence D_7:544:19402: scene=D_7
#: D_7:544
msgctxt "text_id=19402 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　老人は長く残るために自我を失った魔法使いで、そのとき自分にできる事なら、なんでも叶えてしまうのだ。"
msgstr "  He was a Magician who had given up his ego in order to extend his own lifespan, and he did whatever he could to help the child."

#. Occurrence D_7:558:19403: scene=D_7
#: D_7:558
msgctxt "text_id=19403 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そしてあの日は、何もかもが符合しすぎていた。"
msgstr "  It had been an incredible coincidence to happen that day."

#. Occurrence D_7:600:19404: scene=D_7
#: D_7:600
msgctxt "text_id=19404 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<自|みずか>らが<招|まね>いた罪を見て、<幼子|おさなご>は瞳にいっぱいの涙をためて、老人を睨みつけた。"
msgstr "  Faced with the sin that she had invited, the child had glared at the old man with tear-filled eyes."

#. Occurrence D_7:605:19405: scene=D_7
#: D_7:605
msgctxt "text_id=19405 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　全ては失われる。誰でもいい貴方の失敗一つで、前置きもなく、あっさりと。"
msgstr "  \"Everything will be lost. It will happen, completely and without warning, thanks to the failure of a nobody―thanks to you,\" he had declared."

#. Occurrence D_7:610:19406: scene=D_7
#: D_7:610
msgctxt "text_id=19406 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　幼子はその不条理に<癇癪|かんしゃく>を起こした。"
msgstr "  The child threw a tantrum at how unfair it all was."

#. Occurrence D_7:615:19407: scene=D_7
#: D_7:615
msgctxt "text_id=19407 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　世界なんてそんなもんじゃぞ、と嘆息する魔法使いに、"
msgstr "  The Magician claimed that was merely the way of the world. "

#. Occurrence D_7:615:19408: scene=D_7
#: D_7:615
msgctxt "text_id=19408 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“ジジイ、うるさい”と真っ向から立ち向かった。"
msgstr "  The child stood up to him. \"Shut up, old man.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:632:19409: scene=D_7
#: D_7:632
msgctxt "text_id=19409 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして―――"
msgstr "  And then..."

#. Occurrence D_7:667:19410: scene=D_7
#: D_7:667
msgctxt "text_id=19410 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――そう、そして。"
msgstr "  Yes, and then,"

#. Occurrence D_7:672:19411: scene=D_7
#: D_7:672
msgctxt "text_id=19411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一つの命と全ての命を、同じものとして<償|つぐな>ってみせると、泣きながら走り出した。"
msgstr "  the child ran around in tears trying to make the old man pay for the cost of a life, at the cost of all lives."

#. Occurrence D_7:733:19412: voice_id=F60_D_7_0014; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:733
msgctxt "text_id=19412 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「それは間違いだ、少年」"
msgstr "\"You're mistaken, boy.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:741:19413: scene=D_7
#: D_7:741
msgctxt "text_id=19413 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……あの時、あるいは。"
msgstr "  Perhaps that's how it happened."

#. Occurrence D_7:751:19414: voice_id=F60_D_7_0015; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:751
msgctxt "text_id=19414 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「捨てたのではない。"
msgstr "\"She didn't throw anything away."

#. Occurrence D_7:758:19415: voice_id=F60_D_7_0016; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:758
msgctxt "text_id=19415 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "<過|そ><去|れ>を美しくする為に、アレは生きているのだ」"
msgstr "She lives to make her past more beautiful.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:767:19416: scene=D_7
#: D_7:767
msgctxt "text_id=19416 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<己|そ>の役割は、とうに終わっていたのかも知れないが。"
msgstr "  That role had likely come to an end long ago, however."

#. Occurrence D_7:787:19417: scene=D_7
#: D_7:787
msgctxt "text_id=19417 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　老人の姿は青年に変わって見えた。"
msgstr "  The old man's appearance seemed to change before Soujyuro's eyes."

#. Occurrence D_7:792:19418: scene=D_7
#: D_7:792
msgctxt "text_id=19418 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ほんの一瞬だけの、陽炎のような揺らぎだった。"
msgstr "  For just a brief moment, he wavered in the air as if in a haze."

#. Occurrence D_7:848:19419: voice_id=F60_D_7_0017; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:848
msgctxt "text_id=19419 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「君の過ちを正そう。娘たちは、私という物をよく解っている。ともすれば、私本人より理解しているとも言える。"
msgstr "\"Let me correct your error. The girls understand me very well. In fact, I think they understand me better than I do myself."

#. Occurrence D_7:854:19420: voice_id=F60_D_7_0018; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:854
msgctxt "text_id=19420 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　私が娘たちの人格を考慮せぬように、娘たちもまた、私という物の人格を認めていない。"
msgstr "  I am not concerned with who they are, and likewise, they don't appreciate who I am."

#. Occurrence D_7:860:19421: voice_id=F60_D_7_0019; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:860
msgctxt "text_id=19421 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　祖父さえいなかったのなら、という考えさえないだろう」"
msgstr "  I doubt thoughts of my absence have ever crossed their minds.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:881:19422: voice_id=F60_D_7_0020; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:881
msgctxt "text_id=19422 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「あれらはそもそも、争いあう自分たちを一度も<卑|ひ><下|げ>はしない筈だ。"
msgstr "\"They've always been so proud in all their fighting, unwilling to debase themselves."

#. Occurrence D_7:888:19423: voice_id=F60_D_7_0021; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:888
msgctxt "text_id=19423 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "君に、その関係を解れというのは酷だろうが。"
msgstr "It's cruel to expect you to deal with all that, though."

#. Occurrence D_7:894:19424: voice_id=F60_D_7_0022; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:894
msgctxt "text_id=19424 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　訊ね事は終わったようだ。"
msgstr "  You seem to be through asking questions now."

#. Occurrence D_7:900:19425: voice_id=F60_D_7_0023; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:900
msgctxt "text_id=19425 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　次は私の番だ。"
msgstr "  It's my turn."

#. Occurrence D_7:906:19426: voice_id=F60_D_7_0024; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:906
msgctxt "text_id=19426 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　君の名前を知りたい」"
msgstr "  What is your name?\""

#. Occurrence D_7:942:19427: scene=D_7
#: D_7:942
msgctxt "text_id=19427 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　老人の問いに答える。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro answered the old man's question."

#. Occurrence D_7:952:19428: scene=D_7
#: D_7:952
msgctxt "text_id=19428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　煙は顔をしかめるように、かすかに揺らいでいた。"
msgstr "  The smoky face seemed to frown, quivering ever so slightly."

#. Occurrence D_7:973:19429: voice_id=F60_D_7_0025; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:973
msgctxt "text_id=19429 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「……意外だ。君は孤立しているというのに、複数を示す名が付いているとは思わなかった。"
msgstr "\"How unexpected. You say you're all alone, and yet the meaning of your name implies the existence of multiple, bearing the character for 'ten.'"

#. Occurrence D_7:979:19430: voice_id=F60_D_7_0026; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:979
msgctxt "text_id=19430 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　似合わん。まったく、似合わん。"
msgstr "  It doesn't suit you. No, not at all."

#. Occurrence D_7:985:19431: voice_id=F60_D_7_0027; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:985
msgctxt "text_id=19431 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だが、そちらでは正しい事だ。不釣り合いな場所にいるのなら、不釣り合いな名が必要だろう。"
msgstr "  But I think it is correct. When in a place of imbalance, one needs an imbalanced name to match."

#. Occurrence D_7:991:19432: voice_id=F60_D_7_0028; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:991
msgctxt "text_id=19432 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　稀少ではあるが、やはり無価値だ。"
msgstr "  Rare, yes, but also worthless."

#. Occurrence D_7:997:19433: voice_id=F60_D_7_0029; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:997
msgctxt "text_id=19433 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　全てを肯定する<諦|あきら>めは死に<由来|ゆらい>するものだろう。続くものがない以上、一代かぎりの才能は無価値だ」"
msgstr "  Resigning oneself to affirmation stems from a will to die. A one-time talent in a single generation means nothing if there is no one to continue the family line.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:1052:19434: voice_id=F60_D_7_0030; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:1052
msgctxt "text_id=19434 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「―――<青子|アレ>の行く末に影響を与えた君に興味を持ったが、失望した。"
msgstr "\"I was interested in the way you were able to influence Aoko... but ultimately, you did not meet expectations."

#. Occurrence D_7:1058:19435: voice_id=F60_D_7_0031; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:1058
msgctxt "text_id=19435 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無駄な時間を過ごしたようだ。"
msgstr "  It seems the time was spent for nothing."

#. Occurrence D_7:1064:19436: voice_id=F60_D_7_0032; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:1064
msgctxt "text_id=19436 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今は結ばれているが、いずれ離れていくのは変えようのない結末だ。"
msgstr "  You are bound together for the time being, but it is inevitable that you will go your separate ways."

#. Occurrence D_7:1070:19437: voice_id=F60_D_7_0033; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:1070
msgctxt "text_id=19437 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　では立ち去りたまえ。"
msgstr "  Now, begone."

#. Occurrence D_7:1076:19438: voice_id=F60_D_7_0034; voice_prefix=F60; voice_category=0; scene=D_7
#: D_7:1076
msgctxt "text_id=19438 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　私は死者に用はない。二度と会う事はないだろう」"
msgstr "  I have no use for the dead. We will not meet again.\""

#. Occurrence D_7:1109:19439: scene=D_7
#: D_7:1109
msgctxt "text_id=19439 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　風景が霞んでいく。"
msgstr "  Everything grew blurry."

#. Occurrence D_7:1115:19440: scene=D_7
#: D_7:1115
msgctxt "text_id=19440 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　記憶が薄れていく。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's memories began to fade."

#. Occurrence D_7:1122:19441: scene=D_7
#: D_7:1122
msgctxt "text_id=19441 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　答えのなかった会話。"
msgstr "  It had been a conversation without any answers..."

#. Occurrence D_7:1128:19442: scene=D_7
#: D_7:1128
msgctxt "text_id=19442 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　意義のなかった時間のあと、全ては夢のように霧散した。"
msgstr "  an encounter without any significance, now vanished completely like a dream."

#. Occurrence D_8:59:19443: scene=D_8
#: D_8:59
msgctxt "text_id=19443 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜気は寒くて、空は綺麗だった。"
msgstr "  The air was cold, the sky beautiful."

#. Occurrence D_8:64:19444: scene=D_8
#: D_8:64
msgctxt "text_id=19444 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一日の終わりに<映|うつ>る光景は、けれど、一日だって同じ事はない。"
msgstr "  The evening sky at the end of each day looked different from the last."

#. Occurrence D_8:69:19445: scene=D_8
#: D_8:69
msgctxt "text_id=19445 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今日の景色は今日だけの物だ。"
msgstr "  Each sunset could be seen for one day, and one day only."

#. Occurrence D_8:74:19446: scene=D_8
#: D_8:74
msgctxt "text_id=19446 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人の知覚では大差のない風景にしか映らなくても、"
msgstr "  Though the sky may not look dramatically different to the human eye from one day to the next,"

#. Occurrence D_8:79:19447: scene=D_8
#: D_8:79
msgctxt "text_id=19447 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その時の風景の美しさも、ありのままに感じる傷心も、すべてが<儚|はかな>くて、明日は違った自分で目が覚める。"
msgstr "  every day we wake up a new person and forget the beautiful sights, the moments of heartbreak, and all the other fleeting feelings that seemed so real the day before."

#. Occurrence D_8:99:19448: scene=D_8
#: D_8:99
msgctxt "text_id=19448 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山の閑散とした空気の中では、そんなあたり前の事が冬の寒さよりずっと、体に沁みこんでくるようだった。"
msgstr "  Simple statements such as these felt all the more profound in the still air of the mountains, more bone-piercing than the winter cold itself."

#. Occurrence D_8:105:19449: scene=D_8
#: D_8:105
msgctxt "text_id=19449 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は時を忘れたように空を見上げている。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro stared up at the sky as if he'd forgotten when and where he was."

#. Occurrence D_8:110:19450: scene=D_8
#: D_8:110
msgctxt "text_id=19450 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを止めたのは、呆然と立ち尽くす青子の視線だった。"
msgstr "  Aoko's look of stunned surprise brought him back to the present."

#. Occurrence D_8:131:19451: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:131
msgctxt "text_id=19451 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「なんだ。早かったな、蒼崎」"
msgstr "\"Aozaki. That was fast.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:179:19452: scene=D_8
#: D_8:179
msgctxt "text_id=19452 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　庭から出てきたばかりの青子に向けて、草十郎は話しかけた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro turned to face Aoko, who had only just stepped outside her family's yard."

#. Occurrence D_8:212:19453: scene=D_8
#: D_8:212
msgctxt "text_id=19453 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は言葉もなく立ち尽くしていたけれど、すぐに気を取り直してつかつかと歩きだした。"
msgstr "  At first she had been too shocked to move or speak, but she quickly regained her composure and marched forward."

#. Occurrence D_8:224:19454: scene=D_8
#: D_8:224
msgctxt "text_id=19454 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そのまま草十郎の前まで行くと、じろりとした目で睨む。"
msgstr "  She continued until she was standing right before him, with an intense scowl on her face."

#. Occurrence D_8:229:19455: scene=D_8
#: D_8:229
msgctxt "text_id=19455 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんなヤツ認めない、と言わんばかりの視線の激しさに、草十郎は肩をすくめた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro slouched instinctively, bracing for impact."

#. Occurrence D_8:234:19456: scene=D_8
#: D_8:234
msgctxt "text_id=19456 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子がどうしてこんなに怒っているか、草十郎にはまったく見当がつかない。"
msgstr "  He had not the slightest idea what could have made her so angry."

#. Occurrence D_8:281:19457: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:281
msgctxt "text_id=19457 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……なんで、まだここにいるのよ」"
msgstr "\"What are you still doing here?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:287:19458: scene=D_8
#: D_8:287
msgctxt "text_id=19458 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“……自分は、なんとか割り切ったのに”"
msgstr "(After I finally managed to convince myself that things were over.)"

#. Occurrence D_8:293:19459: scene=D_8
#: D_8:293
msgctxt "text_id=19459 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それなのに、この男が目の前にいるコトが青子には憎らしかったらしい。喜ぶべき事なのか悲しむべき事なのかを考えるのは、たぶん、その怒りが治まってからだろう。"
msgstr "  She was obviously irritated with him, in any case. The anger would have to subside before she could decide whether she was happy or sad to see him."

#. Occurrence D_8:298:19460: scene=D_8
#: D_8:298
msgctxt "text_id=19460 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人間、思い通りにいかないと無性に腹が立つものなのだ。"
msgstr "  Humans get angry when things do not go the way they had hoped."

#. Occurrence D_8:319:19461: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:319
msgctxt "text_id=19461 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「さっきから十分と二十秒も経ってない。"
msgstr "\"It's hardly been more than ten minutes."

#. Occurrence D_8:325:19462: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:325
msgctxt "text_id=19462 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　なんでこんなところで突っ立ってるのよ、アンタ」"
msgstr "  How can you be standing here?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:331:19463: scene=D_8
#: D_8:331
msgctxt "text_id=19463 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いかに祖父といえど、記憶を消去して空白の一ヶ月をつなげるのには一日を要する筈だ。"
msgstr "  It was supposed to have taken an entire day for her grandfather to erase his memories from the past month."

#. Occurrence D_8:336:19464: scene=D_8
#: D_8:336
msgctxt "text_id=19464 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だからあとの処置はぜんぶ祖父に任せようと思ったのに、草十郎はここでぼんやりと空を見上げていた。"
msgstr "  She had been planning to let her grandfather handle all the details, and yet here Soujyuro was, staring dumbly at the sky."

#. Occurrence D_8:356:19465: scene=D_8
#: D_8:356
msgctxt "text_id=19465 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“……<祈祷師|きとうし>じゃあるまいし、ほんと、夜空を見上げるのが好きな奴”"
msgstr "(He's no astrologer. He just likes looking at the night sky.)"

#. Occurrence D_8:362:19466: scene=D_8
#: D_8:362
msgctxt "text_id=19466 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな青子の、口にはしない一方的な感情をぶつけられながら、草十郎は事情を説明する。"
msgstr "  Bombarded with Aoko's unspoken emotion, he proceeded to explain himself."

#. Occurrence D_8:413:19467: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:413
msgctxt "text_id=19467 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……あの老人からの伝言だけど。"
msgstr "\"He gave me a message for you."

#. Occurrence D_8:419:19468: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:419
msgctxt "text_id=19468 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　記憶の消去は君の役目で、人に頼るな、だそうだ。今日呼ばれたのは、たんに悪口を聞かせたかっただけらしいよ」"
msgstr "  He said you shouldn't go around asking other people to erase my memories. You should do it yourself. Apparently he wanted me to come just to have someone to complain to.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:431:19469: scene=D_8
#: D_8:431
msgctxt "text_id=19469 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その言葉で青子の憑き物は落ちた。"
msgstr "  Hearing this, Aoko finally began to feel like herself again."

#. Occurrence D_8:436:19470: scene=D_8
#: D_8:436
msgctxt "text_id=19470 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今にも平手打ちが飛んできそうな態度が、すう、と落ち着いたものになる。"
msgstr "  Despite having been ready to dish out the punishment only a few moments earlier, she now felt quite calm."

#. Occurrence D_8:463:19471: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:463
msgctxt "text_id=19471 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……そっか。"
msgstr "\"Huh."

#. Occurrence D_8:463:19472: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:463
msgctxt "text_id=19472 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　人に任せるなんて、たしかに私らしくなかった」"
msgstr "  Well, he's right that it's not like me to expect someone else to clean up my messes.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:469:19473: scene=D_8
#: D_8:469
msgctxt "text_id=19473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　きびしかった瞳が、段々といつもの、不機嫌そうな顔になっていく。"
msgstr "  The intense look in her eyes slowly faded to her usual mildly irritated expression."

#. Occurrence D_8:494:19474: scene=D_8
#: D_8:494
msgctxt "text_id=19474 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ホッと安堵する草十郎。"
msgstr "  It relieved Soujyuro to see her like this."

#. Occurrence D_8:499:19475: scene=D_8
#: D_8:499
msgctxt "text_id=19475 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ご機嫌は、なんとか戻ってくれたようだ。"
msgstr "  She was finally back to her normal self."

#. Occurrence D_8:537:19476: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:537
msgctxt "text_id=19476 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「納得いったなら、行こう。"
msgstr "\"If that's enough for you, then let's get going."

#. Occurrence D_8:543:19477: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:543
msgctxt "text_id=19477 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　急がないと最終電車に間に合わない」"
msgstr "  We'll miss the last train if we don't hurry.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:564:19478: scene=D_8
#: D_8:564
msgctxt "text_id=19478 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　返事を待たず草十郎は歩きだした。"
msgstr "  With that he walked off without waiting for an answer."

#. Occurrence D_8:569:19479: scene=D_8
#: D_8:569
msgctxt "text_id=19479 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はその背中を少しの間だけ見つめてから、小言を言いつつ付いていく。"
msgstr "  Aoko stared at his retreating figure for a brief moment before quietly cursing him under her breath and following after him."

#. Occurrence D_8:645:19480: scene=D_8
#: D_8:645
msgctxt "text_id=19480 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　帰り道は、来る時より楽だった。"
msgstr "  Their descent back to the station was much easier than the way there."

#. Occurrence D_8:650:19481: scene=D_8
#: D_8:650
msgctxt "text_id=19481 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　眼下の景色は一面の闇。"
msgstr "  A sheet of darkness spread out below them."

#. Occurrence D_8:655:19482: scene=D_8
#: D_8:655
msgctxt "text_id=19482 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その黒い海の中、灯台のように、小さな駅が輝いている。"
msgstr "  There in the middle of that ocean of black was a single light: the tiny, glowing station."

#. Occurrence D_8:675:19483: scene=D_8
#: D_8:675
msgctxt "text_id=19483 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりはしばらく、言葉もなく歩いていた。"
msgstr "  They walked for some time in silence."

#. Occurrence D_8:680:19484: scene=D_8
#: D_8:680
msgctxt "text_id=19484 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は来る時の会話を思い出して、若かったなぁ、と反省中。"
msgstr "  Aoko recalled their earlier conversation and felt she had been too naive."

#. Occurrence D_8:685:19485: scene=D_8
#: D_8:685
msgctxt "text_id=19485 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんな事なら、あんなしんみりとした話をするんじゃなかった、と照れている。"
msgstr "  She should have avoided all the serious stuff if this was how things were going to end up."

#. Occurrence D_8:705:19486: scene=D_8
#: D_8:705
msgctxt "text_id=19486 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方の草十郎は、いつも通り、何も考えてはいなかった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro, meanwhile, was thinking of nothing at all, just like usual."

#. Occurrence D_8:710:19487: scene=D_8
#: D_8:710
msgctxt "text_id=19487 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　草十郎にとっては普通の、青子にとっては気まずい沈黙。"
msgstr "  For him the silence felt quite natural, while for her it was awkwardly uncomfortable."

#. Occurrence D_8:715:19488: scene=D_8
#: D_8:715
msgctxt "text_id=19488 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな中、不意に草十郎はおかしな事を言いだした。"
msgstr "  Suddenly Soujyuro blurted out the strangest thing without thinking."

#. Occurrence D_8:789:19489: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:789
msgctxt "text_id=19489 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「有珠には、お<餅|もち>を買っていってあげよう」"
msgstr "\"We should pick up some mochi for Alice on the way back.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:854:19490: scene=D_8
#: D_8:854
msgctxt "text_id=19490 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目を点にする青子。"
msgstr "  Aoko's eyes grew wide, her pupils reduced to mere points."

#. Occurrence D_8:902:19491: scene=D_8
#: D_8:902
msgctxt "text_id=19491 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この男はいったいなんなんだろう、という不満とか疑問がありありと浮かんでいる。"
msgstr "  Aoko had so many questions going around in her head she wanted to rail at the paradox that was Soujyuro."

#. Occurrence D_8:964:19492: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:964
msgctxt "text_id=19492 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「お餅が、なに……？」"
msgstr "\"Mochi? Why?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1011:19493: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1011
msgctxt "text_id=19493 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「お土産。有珠、ひとりで待っているんだから、喜ぶと思う」"
msgstr "\"As a gift. We left her all alone at the mansion, we should do something nice for her. It'll make her happy.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1048:19494: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1048
msgctxt "text_id=19494 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うーん、と青子は難しそうに口に手をあてた。"
msgstr "  Aoko raised her hand to her head in concern."

#. Occurrence D_8:1053:19495: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1053
msgctxt "text_id=19495 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手袋をしていない細い指が、寒さで白く染まっている。"
msgstr "  Unprotected by the warmth of a pair of gloves, her slender fingers were white from the cold."

#. Occurrence D_8:1074:19496: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1074
msgctxt "text_id=19496 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "“……あの娘にはそういうの逆効果だけど、草十郎がやるぶんには大丈夫か……”"
msgstr "(I don't think she'll be happy, but maybe coming from Soujyuro it'll be okay...?)"

#. Occurrence D_8:1079:19497: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1079
msgctxt "text_id=19497 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見るからに無欲という彼の雰囲気は、こういう<時|とき>便利だ。"
msgstr "  His seemingly selfless attitude came in handy sometimes."

#. Occurrence D_8:1084:19498: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1084
msgctxt "text_id=19498 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠も素直に厚意を受け取る公算<大|だい>である。"
msgstr "  Alice would most likely accept his gift without making a scene."

#. Occurrence D_8:1105:19499: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1105
msgctxt "text_id=19499 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうね。たしかに有珠はこういうの根にもって、口に出さずに恨んでる<性質|たち>だけど。"
msgstr "\"Gotcha. She's the type to resent something like that and hold a silent grudge over it, though."

#. Occurrence D_8:1111:19500: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1111
msgctxt "text_id=19500 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　また、なんだってお土産がお餅なの？」"
msgstr "  Why does the gift have to be mochi, anyway?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1117:19501: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1117
msgctxt "text_id=19501 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「だって、食べた事なさそうだろ、彼女」"
msgstr "\"Well, I get the feeling she's never eaten one before.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1155:19502: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1155
msgctxt "text_id=19502 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あっさりと返答されて、青子はたしかに、と同意してしまった。"
msgstr "  All Aoko could do in response to such a simpleminded observation was nod in agreement."

#. Occurrence D_8:1160:19503: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1160
msgctxt "text_id=19503 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有珠がお餅を食べている姿をつい想像し、とたんに帰るのが楽しみになってくる。"
msgstr "  The image of Alice eating mochi popped into her head and suddenly the prospect of getting back to the mansion felt a little more exciting."

#. Occurrence D_8:1190:19504: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1190
msgctxt "text_id=19504 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「アンタって本当に無心よね。"
msgstr "\"You really are a regular space cadet, you know that?"

#. Occurrence D_8:1205:19505: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1205
msgctxt "text_id=19505 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……そういえば前から不思議に思ってたんだけど、いつから有珠と仲良くなったの？　そのきっかけが、私には分からないんだけど」"
msgstr "  Speaking of which, since when have you and Alice been on such good terms? Did something happen?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1255:19506: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1255
msgctxt "text_id=19506 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　隣りから覗きこむように見つめられて、草十郎はさて、と考えを巡らせた。"
msgstr "  Aoko peered at him the way she would at a strange specimen as he took a deep breath and launched into an earnest explanation."

#. Occurrence D_8:1281:19507: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1281
msgctxt "text_id=19507 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「大きなきっかけとか、そういうのはないと思うけど。"
msgstr "\"I don't think there's any particular time I can point to when it happened."

#. Occurrence D_8:1287:19508: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1287
msgctxt "text_id=19508 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　しいていうなら初めて話した時かな。もっと確かになったのはロビーで話した時だろうね」"
msgstr "  But if I had to I'd say, it started the first time we spoke. And we got a lot closer after talking that time in the foyer, too.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1293:19509: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1293
msgctxt "text_id=19509 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「たったそれだけ？」"
msgstr "\"...That's it?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1304:19510: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1304
msgctxt "text_id=19510 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ああ。親しくなるっていうのは、そういう事だろ？」"
msgstr "\"Yeah. Getting to know someone is all about little moments like that, wouldn't you agree?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1329:19511: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1329
msgctxt "text_id=19511 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　変なこと訊くんだな、と草十郎は言葉をきった。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro seemed to find her question odd."

#. Occurrence D_8:1334:19512: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1334
msgctxt "text_id=19512 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言葉ではなく感性で通じ合う。"
msgstr "  The way he and Alice communicated went beyond words."

#. Occurrence D_8:1339:19513: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1339
msgctxt "text_id=19513 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしかに、この少年と有珠はそんな関係なのかも知れない。"
msgstr "  Aoko could only assume that was how he did it."

#. Occurrence D_8:1398:19514: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1398
msgctxt "text_id=19514 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……そういえば、初めから『有珠』って呼び捨てだったものね、アンタは」"
msgstr "\"Come to think of it, you've always just called her 'Alice' and not by her surname.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1417:19515: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1417
msgctxt "text_id=19515 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうだっけ？　よく覚えていないけど。……それより、なにを怒ってるんだ蒼崎？」"
msgstr "\"Have I? I don't even remember now. More importantly, though, why are you so mad?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1457:19516: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1457
msgctxt "text_id=19516 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「別に怒ってないわよ、私」"
msgstr "\"I'm not mad.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1463:19517: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1463
msgctxt "text_id=19517 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その返答は、やや冷たくて、どことなく愛らしかった。"
msgstr "  Her response was slightly cold, but also somehow gentle."

#. Occurrence D_8:1483:19518: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1483
msgctxt "text_id=19518 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山道は半分にさしかかる。"
msgstr "  They approached the halfway point of the mountain path."

#. Occurrence D_8:1488:19519: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1488
msgctxt "text_id=19519 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　平地に近づくにつれ星空は遠のいていくようで、草十郎はぼんやりと空を見上げ続ける。"
msgstr "  The night sky appeared more distant as they neared the bottom, and Soujyuro continued to stare absentmindedly at the stars."

#. Occurrence D_8:1493:19520: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1493
msgctxt "text_id=19520 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　来る時からその素振りが気になっていた青子だが、ここにきてようやく、その理由に思い至った。"
msgstr "  Then it finally hit her why his behavior had been bothering her since their ascent."

#. Occurrence D_8:1498:19521: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1498
msgctxt "text_id=19521 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ようするに、彼は懐かしがっているのだ。"
msgstr "  She realized he must be feeling nostalgia."

#. Occurrence D_8:1503:19522: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1503
msgctxt "text_id=19522 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山から見る星空というヤツを。"
msgstr "  He missed the way the stars looked from up in the mountains."

#. Occurrence D_8:1523:19523: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1523
msgctxt "text_id=19523 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「――――――"
msgstr "\"..."

#. Occurrence D_8:1530:19524: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0012; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1530
msgctxt "text_id=19524 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "蒼崎」"
msgstr "Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1550:19525: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1550
msgctxt "text_id=19525 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不意に、草十郎は見上げたまま問いかけてきた。"
msgstr "  He spoke without looking down from the heavens."

#. Occurrence D_8:1557:19526: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0013; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1557
msgctxt "text_id=19526 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ひとつ聞きたいんだけど、君に後悔はあるのかな」"
msgstr "\"I've been meaning to ask, do you have anything you regret?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1563:19527: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1563
msgctxt "text_id=19527 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　両手を上着のポケットにいれたまま、白い息をする草十郎。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's breath was white in the night air, his hands jammed in his pockets."

#. Occurrence D_8:1568:19528: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1568
msgctxt "text_id=19528 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子にはその姿が、幻のように遠く感じられた。"
msgstr "  Aoko had the vague feeling somewhere deep inside that he was only a figment of her imagination."

#. Occurrence D_8:1603:19529: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1603
msgctxt "text_id=19529 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……どうしたの、突然そんなこと聞いて」"
msgstr "\"Where did that question come from?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1609:19530: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0014; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1609
msgctxt "text_id=19530 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いいから、答えて。聞きたいんだ。"
msgstr "\"Just answer it. I want to know."

#. Occurrence D_8:1616:19531: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0015; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1616
msgctxt "text_id=19531 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "君に、悔いはあるのかないのかを」"
msgstr "Do you have any regrets or not?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1629:19532: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1629
msgctxt "text_id=19532 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それは、哀しい問いだった。"
msgstr "  It was a sad thing to be asked."

#. Occurrence D_8:1634:19533: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1634
msgctxt "text_id=19533 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんと答えても彼は多くの物を失うのだろう。"
msgstr "  He would be hurt one way or another no matter how she answered."

#. Occurrence D_8:1639:19534: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1639
msgctxt "text_id=19534 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも答えを求めている以上、青子はさっぱりと返答する。"
msgstr "  But he wanted an answer, and so she gave him one."

#. Occurrence D_8:1678:19535: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1678
msgctxt "text_id=19535 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ないわよ、そんなの。だってそれをしない為に、今を頑張ってるんだもの。"
msgstr "\"Regrets? Of course not. I make a point to live my life with no regrets."

#. Occurrence D_8:1684:19536: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1684
msgctxt "text_id=19536 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　後悔なんてのはね、草十郎。するものじゃなくて、無くしていく為にあるものなのよ」"
msgstr "  Regrets aren't something you have, Soujyuro. They're something you get rid of.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1704:19537: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1704
msgctxt "text_id=19537 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「―――――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1752:19538: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1752
msgctxt "text_id=19538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……ああ、と。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro grunted in response."

#. Occurrence D_8:1757:19539: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1757
msgctxt "text_id=19539 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　噛みしめるように、彼は万感の想いを<葬|みおく>った。"
msgstr "  He bit his lip and pushed down the flood of emotions that rose up inside him."

#. Occurrence D_8:1763:19540: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1763
msgctxt "text_id=19540 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう形も匂いも薄れている全てに、手を伸ばさず、手を振った。"
msgstr "  He waved his hand slightly without actually raising it, as if to shoo away something formless and odorless."

#. Occurrence D_8:1784:19541: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0017; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1784
msgctxt "text_id=19541 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――そうか。後悔も、無くなるものなのか」"
msgstr "\"So regrets are just something to get rid of, huh?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1790:19542: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1790
msgctxt "text_id=19542 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呟く顔にはかすかな痛み。"
msgstr "  Pain was subtly visible on his face as he spoke."

#. Occurrence D_8:1795:19543: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1795
msgctxt "text_id=19543 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ、<鮮|あざ>やかで。"
msgstr "  And yet it was so vivid."

#. Occurrence D_8:1800:19544: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1800
msgctxt "text_id=19544 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう言い切れるほど自分は強くはないけれど、それに焦がれている。そう言い切れる彼女に、強く焦がれている。"
msgstr "  As much as he wanted to he did not have the strength to say it aloud. He was not like her, able to speak her mind so readily."

#. Occurrence D_8:1805:19545: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1805
msgctxt "text_id=19545 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なら、いつか―――"
msgstr "  Maybe someday..."

#. Occurrence D_8:1882:19546: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1882
msgctxt "text_id=19546 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いまは、空も闇も遠く。"
msgstr "  The sky and the darkness were both far away now."

#. Occurrence D_8:1888:19547: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1888
msgctxt "text_id=19547 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今日だけの景色が、いつまでも美しく思えるのなら。"
msgstr "  Tonight's grand view, only to be seen this once. He hoped its beauty would remain in his mind forever."

#. Occurrence D_8:1893:19548: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1893
msgctxt "text_id=19548 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残してきた<幾|いく>つかの悔いが、星のように思える日が、いつかはあるのだろうか？"
msgstr "  But what then of the regrets he had come to hold inside, of the days he had spent that now shone like stars in the sky? Would they too be with him forever?"

#. Occurrence D_8:1958:19549: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:1958
msgctxt "text_id=19549 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いい空ね。町じゃ、ちょっと見れないな」"
msgstr "\"Nice sky tonight. It's a much better view than the one from town.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:1964:19550: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1964
msgctxt "text_id=19550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見上げる草十郎にならって、青子は暗い空を眺めた。"
msgstr "  Aoko mimicked Soujyuro, looking up at the darkness overhead."

#. Occurrence D_8:1969:19551: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1969
msgctxt "text_id=19551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　星は町でのそれより強く輝いている。"
msgstr "  The stars shone brighter here than in town."

#. Occurrence D_8:1974:19552: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1974
msgctxt "text_id=19552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　澄んだ空気と、明かりのない闇のおかげだ。"
msgstr "  This clarity was thanks to the absence of any other lights amidst the darkness."

#. Occurrence D_8:1979:19553: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1979
msgctxt "text_id=19553 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを憎むような眼差しで草十郎は見つめていた。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro stared at her with almost a sense of loathing."

#. Occurrence D_8:1984:19554: scene=D_8
#: D_8:1984
msgctxt "text_id=19554 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……こんなにも綺麗な星なのに、それを偽物と決め付けるように。"
msgstr "  As beautiful as the stars were, they were not the real thing, not here."

#. Occurrence D_8:2005:19555: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0018; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2005
msgctxt "text_id=19555 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……そうだね。でも、ここでも手は届きそうにない」"
msgstr "\"Yeah. But they're still too far to ever reach.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:2011:19556: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2011
msgctxt "text_id=19556 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え……？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:2017:19557: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2017
msgctxt "text_id=19557 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　突然の否定に驚いて、青子は草十郎の顔を覗き見る。"
msgstr "  Soujyuro's sudden negativity caused her to turn to him in shock."

#. Occurrence D_8:2022:19558: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2022
msgctxt "text_id=19558 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……憎むような瞳は、もうくすんだ色に戻っていた。"
msgstr "  The anger in his eyes had died down now."

#. Occurrence D_8:2027:19559: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2027
msgctxt "text_id=19559 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一呼吸して草十郎は呟く。"
msgstr "  Taking a breath, he began to speak as if talking to himself."

#. Occurrence D_8:2032:19560: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2032
msgctxt "text_id=19560 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　視線はいまだ星空に釘付けたまま。"
msgstr "  His gaze never left the stars."

#. Occurrence D_8:2084:19561: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0019; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2084
msgctxt "text_id=19561 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「山ではね、蒼崎。星は本当に手が届きそうなんだ。届かないのは分かっていても、望めば掴めそうなぐらい近いのに。"
msgstr "\"It's not like this in the mountains. There the stars feel so close. Even if they're technically too far away to touch, it really feels like you could just reach out and grab them."

#. Occurrence D_8:2091:19562: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0020; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2091
msgctxt "text_id=19562 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "都会の星は、そう思う事さえ許してくれない」"
msgstr "The stars in the city don't give you that feeling.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:2190:19563: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2190
msgctxt "text_id=19563 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが本当のソラ。"
msgstr "  He was speaking of the sky in its purest state."

#. Occurrence D_8:2195:19564: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2195
msgctxt "text_id=19564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼の語る山の星空は、<天象儀|プラネタリウム>より素晴らしい物だった。"
msgstr "  The starry skies in the mountains far exceeded those of any urban planetarium."

#. Occurrence D_8:2200:19565: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2200
msgctxt "text_id=19565 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　降り注ぐ雨のような、回る星々。"
msgstr "  Their movement was like the pouring of rain."

#. Occurrence D_8:2205:19566: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2205
msgctxt "text_id=19566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　指でなぞるだけで観測できる、原初のままの夜空。"
msgstr "  He spoke of the primal sky, unchanged from the past. The same sky humans had traced with their fingers since prehistoric times."

#. Occurrence D_8:2211:19567: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2211
msgctxt "text_id=19567 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それは、彼にはもう戻る事のできない、帰り道すら知らない故郷。"
msgstr "  For him it was a past to which he could never return, a place to which he did not even know the way back."

#. Occurrence D_8:2232:19568: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0021; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2232
msgctxt "text_id=19568 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……今まで、目に映るすべてを山と比べていた。こんな場所は、本当は嫌いだったんだ。今でも、正直なじめない。"
msgstr "\"I used to compare everything here to the mountains. I really hated it then. And I'm still not used to it now."

#. Occurrence D_8:2238:19569: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0022; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2238
msgctxt "text_id=19569 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　でも、いつか比べるのは街になってしまうんだろう。自分は、こっちに下りてきてしまったんだから」"
msgstr "  At some point I'll start looking at the mountains from a city-dweller's perspective, I'm sure. The mountains are in my past now.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:2303:19570: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2303
msgctxt "text_id=19570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが今までの後悔。"
msgstr "  That was his one regret."

#. Occurrence D_8:2308:19571: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2308
msgctxt "text_id=19571 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　星空から視線を離して、草十郎は青子へと視線を向ける。"
msgstr "  He lowered his gaze from the stars and turned to Aoko."

#. Occurrence D_8:2313:19572: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2313
msgctxt "text_id=19572 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつもとは違う、ためらいがちの彼女の瞳が、少し痛い。"
msgstr "  Her eyes were unusually hesitant, and looked slightly hurt."

#. Occurrence D_8:2318:19573: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2318
msgctxt "text_id=19573 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは自分への同情か、それともただの<憐愍|れんびん>か。"
msgstr "  Was it empathy they showed, or pity?"

#. Occurrence D_8:2323:19574: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2323
msgctxt "text_id=19574 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……そのどちらにしたって、彼女らしくない瞳をさせているのは自分だ。"
msgstr "  Either way, he was the reason for the uncharacteristic look on her face now."

#. Occurrence D_8:2328:19575: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2328
msgctxt "text_id=19575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の無言の問いかけに、草十郎は目を閉じてうなずいた。"
msgstr "  He shut his eyes and nodded in response to her unspoken question."

#. Occurrence D_8:2379:19576: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0023; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2379
msgctxt "text_id=19576 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……うん。それは仕方のない事だ。"
msgstr "\"It's true. I can't help it."

#. Occurrence D_8:2385:19577: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0024; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2385
msgctxt "text_id=19577 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　ただ、そうなるのなら、そうなってしまう以上に、すばらしい物を手に入れないといけない。"
msgstr "  But if this is the way it's going to be, I've got to make the most of it."

#. Occurrence D_8:2391:19578: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0025; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2391
msgctxt "text_id=19578 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　後悔を、いつか、後悔と思わないために」"
msgstr "  So that someday I can stop seeing it as a regret.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:2422:19579: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2422
msgctxt "text_id=19579 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼は感謝するように、そう告白した。"
msgstr "  There was gratitude in Soujyuro's voice as he confessed his feelings."

#. Occurrence D_8:2427:19580: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2427
msgctxt "text_id=19580 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　古いカラは捨てなければいけない。"
msgstr "  Remnants from the past must one day be released."

#. Occurrence D_8:2432:19581: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2432
msgctxt "text_id=19581 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　喪失は踏み越えなければならない。"
msgstr "  Loss must be overcome."

#. Occurrence D_8:2438:19582: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2438
msgctxt "text_id=19582 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが、青子の答えで彼が失った、彼の全てだったモノ。"
msgstr "  He had lost it, his everything, the moment she had answered his query."

#. Occurrence D_8:2483:19583: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2483
msgctxt "text_id=19583 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……やめてよね。私の一言でいちいち<人生観|じんせいかん>変えられちゃ、荷が重いじゃない」"
msgstr "\"Oh, cut it out. Don't act like I caused some kind of turning point in your life.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:2489:19584: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2489
msgctxt "text_id=19584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　向けられた笑顔があんまりに柔らかくて、青子は顔を背けながら憎まれ口を言う。"
msgstr "  She smiled weakly and averted her eyes as she spoke these hurtful words."

#. Occurrence D_8:2494:19585: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2494
msgctxt "text_id=19585 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……本音である可能性も大きいが、それはそれで彼女らしい。"
msgstr "  Most likely she was being completely honest, and in that she was being true to herself."

#. Occurrence D_8:2545:19586: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2545
msgctxt "text_id=19586 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それで、祖父と何を話したの？"
msgstr "\"So what did you and my grandfather talk about?"

#. Occurrence D_8:2551:19587: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2551
msgctxt "text_id=19587 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あの人が他人に興味を持つなんて、すごい事よ」"
msgstr "  It's rare for him to care about anyone besides himself.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:2557:19588: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2557
msgctxt "text_id=19588 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　せっかくの質問だったが、あの老人との会話について、草十郎は答えなかった。"
msgstr "  The topic had finally been broached, and yet Soujyuro said nothing."

#. Occurrence D_8:2562:19589: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2562
msgctxt "text_id=19589 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　当たり障りのない返答をしてお茶をにごす。"
msgstr "  An empty reply can be used to buy time."

#. Occurrence D_8:2643:19590: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2643
msgctxt "text_id=19590 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　道は、もうじき平坦な路面に戻ろうとしていた。"
msgstr "  They had nearly reached the flat road at the base of the mountain."

#. Occurrence D_8:2648:19591: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2648
msgctxt "text_id=19591 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　柔らかな土の地面は、<畦道|あぜみち>の固い土の道になるのだろう。"
msgstr "  The soft earth here would soon give way to the tightly packed dirt of the paths running between the rice fields."

#. Occurrence D_8:2654:19592: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2654
msgctxt "text_id=19592 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その前に、ぴたりと草十郎は立ち止まった。"
msgstr "  But before they got that far, Soujyuro came to an abrupt halt."

#. Occurrence D_8:2659:19593: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2659
msgctxt "text_id=19593 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目を閉じて、耳を澄ます。"
msgstr "  Closing his eyes he listened carefully."

#. Occurrence D_8:2664:19594: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2664
msgctxt "text_id=19594 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その後にうん、とうなずいて青子に向き直った。"
msgstr "  He then gave a firm nod and turned to face Aoko."

#. Occurrence D_8:2716:19595: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0026; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2716
msgctxt "text_id=19595 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「おめでとう、蒼崎」"
msgstr "\"Congratulations, Aozaki.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:2721:19596: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2721
msgctxt "text_id=19596 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子はわけも分からず目をまたたかせる。"
msgstr "  She blinked, not knowing what to make of it."

#. Occurrence D_8:2735:19597: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2735
msgctxt "text_id=19597 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なによ、突然」"
msgstr "\"What's with you all of a sudden?\""

#. Occurrence D_8:2740:19598: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2740
msgctxt "text_id=19598 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　当然の反応。"
msgstr "  It was a perfectly natural response."

#. Occurrence D_8:2745:19599: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2745
msgctxt "text_id=19599 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに、少年はほころぶように、"
msgstr "  The tension melted from his face as he said,"

#. Occurrence D_8:2789:19600: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0027; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2789
msgctxt "text_id=19600 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「新しい年だ」"
msgstr "\"Happy New Year.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:2794:19601: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2794
msgctxt "text_id=19601 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　喜びに満ちた笑顔で、そう返答した。"
msgstr "  He now wore a smile full of joy."

#. Occurrence D_8:2815:19602: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:2815
msgctxt "text_id=19602 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence D_8:2904:19603: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2904
msgctxt "text_id=19603 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子は呆然と、ただ彼の顔を見てしまう。"
msgstr "  Dumbfounded, all Aoko could do was stare back at his calm visage."

#. Occurrence D_8:2909:19604: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2909
msgctxt "text_id=19604 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりの不意打ちで、遠く離れた<社木|やしろぎ>から<除夜|じょや>の鐘が聞こえた気がするぐらいだ。"
msgstr "  His surprise attack hit her so hard she thought she could hear the shrine bell in Yashirogi ringing in the new year."

#. Occurrence D_8:2914:19605: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2914
msgctxt "text_id=19605 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今日が<今年|ことし>最後の日だと知っていたのに、彼女はそれをどうとも思っていなかった。"
msgstr "  She had known it was the last day of the year but had not given it much thought beyond that."

#. Occurrence D_8:2967:19606: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2967
msgctxt "text_id=19606 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なのに、たった少しの言葉だけで。"
msgstr "  And so his succinct words gave her quite the shock."

#. Occurrence D_8:2972:19607: scene=D_8
#: D_8:2972
msgctxt "text_id=19607 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　遠い昔に置いたままの、鐘の音の奇跡を信じていた少女が振り向いた気がしたのだ。"
msgstr "  As if the girl who believed in the power of the bell all those years ago had come back."

#. Occurrence D_8:3028:19608: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_8_0023; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_8
#: D_8:3028
msgctxt "text_id=19608 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そっか……午前零時で、もう新しい年なんだ」"
msgstr "\"Oh, right... It's midnight now so the new year is here.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:3034:19609: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3034
msgctxt "text_id=19609 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　知らなかった事のように青子は呟く。"
msgstr "  She spoke in a hushed tone as if this were shocking news."

#. Occurrence D_8:3039:19610: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3039
msgctxt "text_id=19610 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その口元に、少しだけの微笑みを浮かべて。"
msgstr "  At the same time, a slight smile crept onto her face."

#. Occurrence D_8:3108:19611: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3108
msgctxt "text_id=19611 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……そう。"
msgstr "  A new year, indeed..."

#. Occurrence D_8:3113:19612: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3113
msgctxt "text_id=19612 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　思い出の中で振り向く少女は、初めての<振|ふ>り<袖|そで>なのに緊張の素振りもなくて、あんまり可愛くはなかったけれど。"
msgstr "  She recalled the first time she had worn a full-length kimono, how she had not been particularly uncomfortable or embarrassed, but not especially pretty, either."

#. Occurrence D_8:3118:19613: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3118
msgctxt "text_id=19613 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも、鏡越しに微笑んでしまうだけの愛らしさはあったのだ。"
msgstr "  The only pretty thing about her had been the moment she smiled at herself in the mirror."

#. Occurrence D_8:3123:19614: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3123
msgctxt "text_id=19614 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　温かそうな青子の顔を見て、草十郎は満足そうに目蓋を閉じた。それが何より嬉しい、と言うように。"
msgstr "  Seeing the warmth in her eyes, Soujyuro closed his own in satisfaction. It made him happy to see her like that."

#. Occurrence D_8:3187:19615: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0028; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:3187
msgctxt "text_id=19615 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「―――うん、色々あったけど。"
msgstr "\"Well, a lot happened in the past year."

#. Occurrence D_8:3193:19616: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_D_8_0029; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=D_8
#: D_8:3193
msgctxt "text_id=19616 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　新しい年を、君と<迎|むか>えられて良かった」"
msgstr "  But I'm glad to be able to start a new one with you.\""

#. Occurrence D_8:3299:19617: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3299
msgctxt "text_id=19617 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう言って草十郎は歩きだした。"
msgstr "  With that he went walking off once more."

#. Occurrence D_8:3312:19618: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3312
msgctxt "text_id=19618 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たぶん、こんな夜なのにひとりで待っている有珠の為に。"
msgstr "  The thought of Alice waiting alone was probably what spurred him into action."

#. Occurrence D_8:3317:19619: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3317
msgctxt "text_id=19619 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その横を歩きながら、青子はさっきの言葉をもう一度だけ思いだす。"
msgstr "  Aoko recalled his words as she walked alongside him."

#. Occurrence D_8:3353:19620: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3353
msgctxt "text_id=19620 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　新年を告げる言葉。"
msgstr "  The moment he had declared the start of a new year..."

#. Occurrence D_8:3358:19621: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3358
msgctxt "text_id=19621 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本当に自然に告げられたあの一言のせいで、もう何年も前から知り合っている友人の気さえした。"
msgstr "  The way he had spoken so naturally... It made her suddenly feel like they had known each other for years."

#. Occurrence D_8:3363:19622: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3363
msgctxt "text_id=19622 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それをとても幸福な事だと感じるのは、たぶん間違いじゃないはずだ。"
msgstr "  She could not be blamed for being filled with happiness at the thought."

#. Occurrence D_8:3395:19623: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3395
msgctxt "text_id=19623 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いずれ、この少年ともあっさりと別れる日が来るのだろうけど。"
msgstr "  And yet a day would surely come when they would have to say their goodbyes."

#. Occurrence D_8:3400:19624: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3400
msgctxt "text_id=19624 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その時まで、こんな風に自然に、古い友人のように付き合えるのなら、それは悪いことじゃない。"
msgstr "  Until then, however, it would not do any harm to behave as if they were old friends."

#. Occurrence D_8:3447:19625: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3447
msgctxt "text_id=19625 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一見<素朴|そぼく>な、けれど特異な少年。"
msgstr "  He was a naïve yet incredibly unique young man."

#. Occurrence D_8:3452:19626: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3452
msgctxt "text_id=19626 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼との束の間の友情がいったい<何|い><時|つ>まで続くか考えながら、青子は足を進ませる。"
msgstr "  As they walked, she wondered how long this fleeting feeling of friendship would last."

#. Occurrence D_8:3457:19627: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3457
msgctxt "text_id=19627 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　途中で一度だけ、草十郎のように、名残惜しく夜空を見上げてから。"
msgstr "  She looked up wistfully at the sky, just the way Soujyuro had done earlier on their walk."

#. Occurrence D_8:3510:19628: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3510
msgctxt "text_id=19628 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　空には満天の星の夜。"
msgstr "  Every star was out, without a cloud in the sky."

#. Occurrence D_8:3515:19629: scene=D_8
#: D_8:3515
msgctxt "text_id=19629 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふたりは届かない星空の<下|した>、山道を<下|お>りていく。"
msgstr "  The two strode down the mountain path, beneath stars that lay ever beyond their reach."

#. Occurrence D_9:78:19630: scene=D_9
#: D_9:78
msgctxt "text_id=19630 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　私がその本を見つけたのは、"
msgstr "            It was on a lazy Sunday morning"

msgctxt "text_id=19631 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　日曜のけだるい午前中の事だった。"
msgstr "            that I discovered the book."

#. Occurrence D_9:130:19632: scene=D_9
#: D_9:130
msgctxt "text_id=19632 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　部外者……というか約一名の冒険野郎……立ち入り禁止の、久遠寺邸の図書室。"
msgstr "  Was I an intruder... No, no, *adventurer*. Either way, I'd made my way into the forbidden Kuonji Estate library."

#. Occurrence D_9:136:19633: scene=D_9
#: D_9:136
msgctxt "text_id=19633 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本棚の上に隠すように置かれたそれは、なんとなく秘密めいて私の興味をひいたのだ。"
msgstr "  The book instantly drew my attention as it looked like it had been intentionally hidden there on the bookshelf."

#. Occurrence D_9:157:19634: scene=D_9
#: D_9:157
msgctxt "text_id=19634 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　盾にでもなりそうなほど大きな本を、苦労しながら本棚の上から引っ張り出す。"
msgstr "  It was large enough to double as a shield and so took great effort for me to remove it from the shelf."

#. Occurrence D_9:163:19635: scene=D_9
#: D_9:163
msgctxt "text_id=19635 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　パラパラとめくっていくうちに、これがルーン魔術の<魔導|グリ><書|モア>、それも<原書|オリジナル>に関するものである事に気が付いた。"
msgstr "  Flipping through I realized it was a grimoire of rune magecraft, and a first edition at that."

#. Occurrence D_9:184:19636: scene=D_9
#: D_9:184
msgctxt "text_id=19636 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まさかね、と思っているうちに、ここのところ探す<素|そ><振|ぶ>りさえ<止|や>めてしまった、目的の物が発見された。"
msgstr "  Surprised as I was by my find, my search came to a halt on the page I'd been looking for."

#. Occurrence D_9:190:19637: scene=D_9
#: D_9:190
msgctxt "text_id=19637 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　北欧の大神が戦乙女に使ったとされる、存在だけは有名な忘却のルーン文字だ。"
msgstr "  It was the rune for memory erasure that the Nordic gods had once used on a valkyrie."

#. Occurrence D_9:211:19638: scene=D_9
#: D_9:211
msgctxt "text_id=19638 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その使用法が如実に書かれたページとにらめっこすること数分。"
msgstr "  For minutes I simply stared at the page where the rune methodology was laid out."

#. Occurrence D_9:217:19639: scene=D_9
#: D_9:217
msgctxt "text_id=19639 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "……結局、私は本を閉じる事にした。"
msgstr "And then, finally, I shut the book."

#. Occurrence D_9:223:19640: scene=D_9
#: D_9:223
msgctxt "text_id=19640 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして元の位置より、もうちょっと見付けにくい場所に戻そうとした時、あれっと思い出す。"
msgstr "  I returned it to the shelf in an even harder to detect location than where I'd originally found it. That's when it hit me."

#. Occurrence D_9:228:19641: scene=D_9
#: D_9:228
msgctxt "text_id=19641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……この本を、どこかで見た事があるのだ。"
msgstr "  I'd seen this book before somewhere."

#. Occurrence D_9:249:19642: scene=D_9
#: D_9:249
msgctxt "text_id=19642 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれはいつだったろう。"
msgstr "  When and where exactly had I seen it, though?"

#. Occurrence D_9:254:19643: scene=D_9
#: D_9:254
msgctxt "text_id=19643 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしか……そう、彼が初めて遊びに行こうと誘った時。"
msgstr "  Yeah... It was when he first invited me to spend time with him."

#. Occurrence D_9:259:19644: scene=D_9
#: D_9:259
msgctxt "text_id=19644 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の目前に座っていた少女が手にしていたのが、この本だったと思うけど……。"
msgstr "  The girl sitting before me had it in hand at the time."

#. Occurrence D_9:280:19645: scene=D_9
#: D_9:280
msgctxt "text_id=19645 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、きっとそうだ。"
msgstr "  That must have been it."

#. Occurrence D_9:285:19646: scene=D_9
#: D_9:285
msgctxt "text_id=19646 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小さな笑いをこらえきれず、私は本を寸分違わない元の場所に戻すことにした。"
msgstr "  Unable to keep the smile off my face, I decided to put the book back exactly where I'd found it."

#. Occurrence D_9:290:19647: scene=D_9
#: D_9:290
msgctxt "text_id=19647 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここの蔵書量なら本棚の中に混ぜたほうが見付ける可能性は低いのだけど、ここは彼女の微笑ましい努力をくんで見なかった事にしよう。"
msgstr "  It would be most difficult to find when mixed in with the other books on the shelf; however, out of respect for her gracious efforts I decided to pretend I'd never seen it at all."

#. Occurrence D_9:295:19648: scene=D_9
#: D_9:295
msgctxt "text_id=19648 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……文字通り、自分の事を棚に上げてる、とは思うけど。"
msgstr "  I shelved my discovery, so to speak."

#. Occurrence D_9:316:19649: scene=D_9
#: D_9:316
msgctxt "text_id=19649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その時、本館の方から聞きなれた叫び声が聞こえてきた。"
msgstr "  That's when I heard the shouting of a familiar voice in the main building."

#. Occurrence D_9:322:19650: scene=D_9
#: D_9:322
msgctxt "text_id=19650 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最近、彼は家政婦業に目覚めたのか、洋館のいたるところを掃除しようと頑張っている。"
msgstr "  Lately, he seemed to have found his calling as a housekeeper and had taken to cleaning every corner of the mansion."

#. Occurrence D_9:343:19651: scene=D_9
#: D_9:343
msgctxt "text_id=19651 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……それはいいんだけど、この洋館には私や有珠にだって手を出せない開かずの間が幾つもある。"
msgstr "  That was all well and good, but there were a few things that were off-limits, which neither Alice nor I dared touch."

#. Occurrence D_9:349:19652: scene=D_9
#: D_9:349
msgctxt "text_id=19652 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それを構わず開けてしまうものだから、火の粉はこっちにまで飛んでくる。"
msgstr "  He was the type to open things without asking, which put us all in hot water."

#. Occurrence D_9:370:19653: scene=D_9
#: D_9:370
msgctxt "text_id=19653 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この前は、有珠のお母さんが保存していた亡霊船を開放して大騒ぎになったんだっけ。"
msgstr "  There had been an uproar when he released the ghost ship that Alice's mother had kept around."

#. Occurrence D_9:376:19654: scene=D_9
#: D_9:376
msgctxt "text_id=19654 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カティサークとかいう<飛ばし屋|スピードスター>を捕まえるのは、本当に苦労した。"
msgstr "  Catching that little speed demon known as the Cutty Sark had been quite the ordeal."

#. Occurrence D_9:382:19655: scene=D_9
#: D_9:382
msgctxt "text_id=19655 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "あのいけすかない金狼の手を借りるのはもうゴメンである。"
msgstr "I still felt bad for having to rely on that creepy golden wolf for help."

#. Occurrence D_9:403:19656: scene=D_9
#: D_9:403
msgctxt "text_id=19656 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その前は地下室の悪霊さんご一行の封印を解いて、"
msgstr "  And before that, he'd lifted the seal on the troupe of spirits in the basement,"

#. Occurrence D_9:408:19657: scene=D_9
#: D_9:408
msgctxt "text_id=19657 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さらにいけすかない教会ご一行が洋館に乗りこんでくるだけでなく、一週間も滞在しやがったし。"
msgstr "  which had led to the even creepier people from the Church coming to the mansion for an entire week."

#. Occurrence D_9:414:19658: scene=D_9
#: D_9:414
msgctxt "text_id=19658 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう少しさかのぼれば、有珠の部屋に勝手に入って、そのとばっちりで私も鏡の国に落っこちて、あやうく有珠と全面戦争をする羽目になりかけた。"
msgstr "  Going back even further, there was also the time he'd ventured unsolicited into Alice's room. In the ensuing chaos, I fell into the mirror, and we almost ended up in an all-out war with Alice."

#. Occurrence D_9:446:19659: scene=D_9
#: D_9:446
msgctxt "text_id=19659 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……考えてみると。"
msgstr "  Come to think of it..."

#. Occurrence D_9:451:19660: scene=D_9
#: D_9:451
msgctxt "text_id=19660 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あいつ、学習能力がないみたい。"
msgstr "  He really and truly lacked any capacity for learning."

#. Occurrence D_9:469:19661: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_D_9_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=D_9
#: D_9:469
msgctxt "text_id=19661 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「もう、いい加減にしてよね、あのバカ……！」"
msgstr "\"That idiot needs to get a handle on himself!\""

#. Occurrence D_9:505:19662: scene=D_9
#: D_9:505
msgctxt "text_id=19662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さっきまでの幸福な気分が台無しになって、私は図書室から飛び出した。"
msgstr "  The good mood I'd been in up until that moment was spoiled, and I went dashing out of the library."

#. Occurrence D_9:510:19663: scene=D_9
#: D_9:510
msgctxt "text_id=19663 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たぶん、この後は廊下で立ち尽くしている元凶に飛び蹴りでも食らわせる、なんて未来視をうかべながら。"
msgstr "  I imagined coming upon the architect of my troubles standing there in the hallway and giving him the swift dropkick to the face he deserved."

#. Occurrence D_9:532:19664: scene=D_9
#: D_9:532
msgctxt "text_id=19664 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　でもまあ、それはそれで楽しい日常には変わりはない。"
msgstr "  As far as I was concerned, that would be just another fun day in the mansion."

#. Occurrence D_9:553:19665: scene=D_9
#: D_9:553
msgctxt "text_id=19665 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　棚の上に隠された私たちふたりの秘密。"
msgstr "  And so our little secret remained hidden on the bookshelf..."

#. Occurrence D_9:558:19666: scene=D_9
#: D_9:558
msgctxt "text_id=19666 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの本はたぶん、もう開かれる事はないだろう―――"
msgstr "  ...likely never to be opened again."

#. Occurrence NZ1:112:19667: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:112
msgctxt "text_id=19667 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　 なぜなにー"
msgstr "      The Wonderful World of..."

#. Occurrence NZ1:144:19668: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:144
msgctxt "text_id=19668 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　プロイー"
msgstr "                  Ploys."

#. Occurrence NZ1:175:19669: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:175
msgctxt "text_id=19669 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "魔法の魔の字も知らない全国のシャバ僧ども。"
msgstr "    Pathetic humans who know nofink of magic or incantations."

#. Occurrence NZ1:175:19670: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:175
msgctxt "text_id=19670 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ヒロインにならんと高校デビューしたものの、"
msgstr "    High school firsties in blue sweaters tryin' to make it big"

#. Occurrence NZ1:175:19671: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:175
msgctxt "text_id=19671 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "真のヒロインにその座を奪われた青セーターども。"
msgstr "    only to be one-upped by the superior heroine..."

#. Occurrence NZ1:208:19672: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:208
msgctxt "text_id=19672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　こんばんはッス。"
msgstr "      Good evening."

#. Occurrence NZ1:208:19673: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:208
msgctxt "text_id=19673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　よく分からない話をよく分からない方向でレクチャーする"
msgstr "      It's time for my new series of lectures, where I tell you about the most"

#. Occurrence NZ1:208:19674: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:208
msgctxt "text_id=19674 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　真番組『なぜなにプロイ』の時間っスよ。"
msgstr "      esoteric of topics in the most esoteric of ways."

#. Occurrence NZ1:258:19675: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:258
msgctxt "text_id=19675 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　 …………。"
msgstr "                    ..."

#. Occurrence NZ1:289:19676: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:289
msgctxt "text_id=19676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　司会はグレートスリー<＋|プラス>１こと、"
msgstr "        I am your host, the Great Three plus one,"

#. Occurrence NZ1:289:19677: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:289
msgctxt "text_id=19677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　コマドリ・ザ・くるっくー。"
msgstr "        Robin the Crook."

#. Occurrence NZ1:315:19678: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0004; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:315
msgctxt "text_id=19678 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ティーチャ役にはマイ天使であるところの"
msgstr "      I've invited my Angel Mum 'ere tonight to"

#. Occurrence NZ1:315:19679: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0004; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:315
msgctxt "text_id=19679 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさんをお招きしたッス。"
msgstr "      act as your teacher."

#. Occurrence NZ1:346:19680: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:346
msgctxt "text_id=19680 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "つーかここアリスさんの部屋ッスね！"
msgstr "      I mean, we are 'ere in her room after all!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:346:19681: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:346
msgctxt "text_id=19681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "時間になってもアリスさんがスタジオに来ないんで、"
msgstr "      She wouldn't come down to the studio"

msgctxt "text_id=19682 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "アリスさんの部屋にカメラ持ち込んだッスよ。"
msgstr "      so I decided to bring the camera up to her."

#. Occurrence NZ1:385:19683: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:385
msgctxt "text_id=19683 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　発想の転換？　なんス？"
msgstr "  I'm thinkin' outside the cage, as they say."

#. Occurrence NZ1:385:19684: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:385
msgctxt "text_id=19684 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　ゲストが来ないなら、"
msgstr "  If the guest won't turn up of her own volition,"

#. Occurrence NZ1:385:19685: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:385
msgctxt "text_id=19685 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　ゲストの部屋でやればいいじゃない？"
msgstr "  why not shoot the show in her lovely chambers?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:434:19686: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:434
msgctxt "text_id=19686 | speaker=alice"
msgid "……いいから、はじめてちょうだい。"
msgstr "  Can we just get started already?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:434:19687: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:434
msgctxt "text_id=19687 | speaker=alice"
msgid "一秒でも早く終わらせて、光より早く出て行って。"
msgstr "  I want to finish this and get out of here as soon as possible."

#. Occurrence NZ1:501:19688: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:501
msgctxt "text_id=19688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　うひゃー、照れるッスー！"
msgstr "    Ah, you're embarrassin' me!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:501:19689: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:501
msgctxt "text_id=19689 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　のたうちまわるっス－！"
msgstr "    You put me in a right two and eight!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:565:19690: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:565
msgctxt "text_id=19690 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　………………………なぜ？"
msgstr "                ...Why?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:625:19691: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:625
msgctxt "text_id=19691 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　や、ジブン的に"
msgstr "      Ah, well, I took it as"

#. Occurrence NZ1:625:19692: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:625
msgctxt "text_id=19692 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　「ビジネスはすぐに終わらせて、アナタとプライベート"
msgstr "      \"I want to finish this nonsense so I can have some quality"

#. Occurrence NZ1:625:19693: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:625
msgctxt "text_id=19693 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　タイムに入りたいの……」と解釈したッス。"
msgstr "      private time with you instead.\""

#. Occurrence NZ1:690:19694: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:690
msgctxt "text_id=19694 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "人語の奥の深さってやべぇッスよね。"
msgstr "Human language sure is a deep blue tit."

#. Occurrence NZ1:690:19695: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:690
msgctxt "text_id=19695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "正直、相手やジブンが何を伝えたいのか、九割方は<意味不能|イ　ミ　フ>ッス。"
msgstr "Honestly, I barely have any grasp of what anyone is ever tryin' to say."

#. Occurrence NZ1:741:19696: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:741
msgctxt "text_id=19696 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　そうね。"
msgstr "  Quite."

#. Occurrence NZ1:741:19697: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:741
msgctxt "text_id=19697 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　わたしも、その意見には賛成よ。"
msgstr "  I actually agree with you for once."

#. Occurrence NZ1:801:19698: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0010; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:801
msgctxt "text_id=19698 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　うはっ、このほとばしる信頼感……！"
msgstr "      Hah! I never knew you put so much trust in me gab!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:801:19699: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0010; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:801
msgctxt "text_id=19699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　頼られるって時に重いッス。"
msgstr "      I'm not sure I can bear the pieces 'o eight."

#. Occurrence NZ1:801:19700: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0010; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:801
msgctxt "text_id=19700 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　というか、物理的に重いッス？"
msgstr "      Won't that heft just make me quake?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:877:19701: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:877
msgctxt "text_id=19701 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　ロビン。"
msgstr "                  Robin..."

#. Occurrence NZ1:930:19702: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:930
msgctxt "text_id=19702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　チャッス。"
msgstr "                Ah, right."

#. Occurrence NZ1:963:19703: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:963
msgctxt "text_id=19703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　今回は初歩の初歩、使い魔の説明っスよ。"
msgstr "So in this lesson, I'll be discussin' the most basic of basics^when it comes to familiars."

#. Occurrence NZ1:963:19704: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:963
msgctxt "text_id=19704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　魔術オンチなイチゲンさんに優しい授業。"
msgstr "I promise this'll be bright and breezy for ye newbies of magery."

#. Occurrence NZ1:963:19705: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:963
msgctxt "text_id=19705 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　それが「なぜなにプロイ」なワケッスね。"
msgstr "That's why it's \"The Wonderful World of Ploys,\" after all!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:994:19706: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:994
msgctxt "text_id=19706 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　で。この『使い魔』ってなんスかアリスさん。"
msgstr "  So tell us, Miss Alice, what exactly are familiars?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:994:19707: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:994
msgctxt "text_id=19707 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分、生まれてこの方、"
msgstr "  Explain it for someone who's never seen"

#. Occurrence NZ1:994:19708: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:994
msgctxt "text_id=19708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見たことも聞いたコトもないッスよ？"
msgstr "  or even heard of such a thing."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1025:19709: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1025
msgctxt "text_id=19709 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　使い魔というのは、"
msgstr "          Okay. So familiars are sort of like"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1025:19710: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1025
msgctxt "text_id=19710 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　魔術師が使役するロボットみたいなものよ。"
msgstr "          robots that a mage controls."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1051:19711: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1051
msgctxt "text_id=19711 | speaker=alice"
msgid "古来から、魔術師は工房にこもって研鑽を重ねるのが<生業|なりわい>だから。信頼できるモノに素材集めや外界の偵察、外敵の駆除を任せるの。"
msgstr "Magecraft has always been a practice that requires mages to hole up inside their workshops for extended periods of study. We need an entity we can trust to collect materials, keep watch on the outside world, and eliminate outside threats for us."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1082:19712: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0014; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1082
msgctxt "text_id=19712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ただのコマ使いっスね。"
msgstr "  They're basically like a pawn."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1082:19713: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0014; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1082
msgctxt "text_id=19713 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　それは弟子とは違うんスか？"
msgstr "  'Ow they different from a disciple?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1114:19714: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1114
msgctxt "text_id=19714 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　違うわ。"
msgstr "    They are different in many ways."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1114:19715: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1114
msgctxt "text_id=19715 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　弟子というのは<業|わざ>を引き継いで師を越える後継者でしょう？"
msgstr "    A master passes down wisdom to a disciple in the hopes that^    one day the disciple will succeed them."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1140:19716: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1140
msgctxt "text_id=19716 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　<弟子|かれら>はいずれ師を超える義務があるし、"
msgstr "    It is in fact a disciple's duty to surpass their master,"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1140:19717: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1140
msgctxt "text_id=19717 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　師も、そういうものでなければ弟子にはとらないわ。"
msgstr "    and a master would not accept a disciple they did not feel^    was capable of achieving that."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1166:19718: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1166
msgctxt "text_id=19718 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　でも使い魔は造られた時の性能がすべてだから。"
msgstr "      Conversely, familiars are only capable of the abilities that^      they are imbued with at the time of their creation."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1166:19719: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1166
msgctxt "text_id=19719 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　成長しないものを、後継ぎにはできないわ。"
msgstr "      You can't pass down any skills or wisdom to an entity that^      never grows."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1197:19720: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1197
msgctxt "text_id=19720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "そっかー。道理でジブン、何年経っても記憶容量増えないワケッスねー。然るに、生まれた時から<完成|パーフェクト>だった、と。"
msgstr "I see. Guess that's why I never seem to learn anythin' new no matter 'ow many donkey's ears pass. Put another way, I've been perfect since birth."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1230:19721: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1230
msgctxt "text_id=19721 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　そうね。パーフェクトに役たたずね。"
msgstr "                  Yes, perfectly useless."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1261:19722: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1261
msgctxt "text_id=19722 | speaker=alice"
msgid "使い魔の多くは小動物をベースに造られるわ。"
msgstr "  Many familiars are created by using a small animal as a base."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1261:19723: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1261
msgctxt "text_id=19723 | speaker=alice"
msgid "これは、使い魔は術者からの魔力供給で活動するタイプが多いから。"
msgstr "  That's because many familiars require magical energy from their^  mage owner to operate."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1287:19724: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1287
msgctxt "text_id=19724 | speaker=alice"
msgid "使い魔は大きいほど魔力提供を必要とする。"
msgstr "The larger the familiar, the more magical energy is required."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1287:19725: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1287
msgctxt "text_id=19725 | speaker=alice"
msgid "だから魔力消費も少なく、造ってしまえば<栄養|どうりょく>を自力で補充できる小動物は便利なの。"
msgstr "Small animals are convenient because they don't require much magical energy to create, and once they're made they can subsist on their own."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1320:19726: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1320
msgctxt "text_id=19726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　？　ジブン、狩りとかしたコトないッスよ？"
msgstr "  Subsist? I've never 'unted for anyfing in me life!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1320:19727: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1320
msgctxt "text_id=19727 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蛋白質も食物繊維も要らないッス？"
msgstr "  I don't need protein or fiber or nothin' like that!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1353:19728: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1353
msgctxt "text_id=19728 | speaker=alice"
msgid "貴方たちプロイはまた別のくくり。"
msgstr "  Right. Ploys are different from other living creatures."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1353:19729: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1353
msgctxt "text_id=19729 | speaker=alice"
msgid "とにかく、魔術師たちにとって、使い魔は自分の命令を聞く「従者」「ペット」だと思えばいいわ。"
msgstr "  Anyway my point is, familiars are like servants or pets to mages."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1394:19730: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1394
msgctxt "text_id=19730 | speaker=alice"
msgid "このように、猫や鳥、鼠を使い魔にするのが一般的ね。"
msgstr "It's common to use animals like cats, birds, or mice as familiars."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1433:19731: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0017; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1433
msgctxt "text_id=19731 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさん、この物騒なのは"
msgstr "  Miss Alice, what about this dangerous-^  looking character 'ere?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1433:19732: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0017; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1433
msgctxt "text_id=19732 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　どういうカテゴリーッスか？"
msgstr "  What category would they be in?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1464:19733: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1464
msgctxt "text_id=19733 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　これは戦闘用に調律された自動人形。"
msgstr "  This is an automaton, designed specifically for use in combat."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1464:19734: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1464
msgctxt "text_id=19734 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　ここまでくると<使い魔|ファミリア>というより<衛兵|センチネル>だけど。"
msgstr "  It's really more like a sentinel than a familiar, to be honest."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1490:19735: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1490
msgctxt "text_id=19735 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　……これは使い魔のセオリーから外れた特注品よ。"
msgstr "    Automata are a special case, entirely separate from the concept^    of a familiar."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1490:19736: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1490
msgctxt "text_id=19736 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　また、アナタのように人間互換できる知性を持った使い魔も"
msgstr "    Intelligent familiars who can get along with humans like yourself"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1490:19737: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1490
msgctxt "text_id=19737 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　特例にあたるわ。"
msgstr "    are also a special case."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1526:19738: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1526
msgctxt "text_id=19738 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　でも、そんなのは魔力の無駄ね。コストが高いだけ。"
msgstr "That said, they're a waste of energy-just too expensive to make."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1526:19739: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1526
msgctxt "text_id=19739 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　たいていは術者本人が済ませた方が早かったり、"
msgstr "It would be faster for the mage to do most of the tasks on her own,"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1526:19740: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1526
msgctxt "text_id=19740 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　もっと安い材料で代用できるから。"
msgstr "and she can make a familiar with cheaper materials."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1557:19741: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0018; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1557
msgctxt "text_id=19741 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　手段と結果を間違える、"
msgstr "      It's a case of the ends not really"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1557:19742: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0018; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1557
msgctxt "text_id=19742 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ってやつッスね。"
msgstr "      justifyin' the means, eh?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1588:19743: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0019_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1588
msgctxt "text_id=19743 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ん？　んじゃ、使い魔は術者より弱いんスね。"
msgstr "  So from what you're sayin', seems familiars are always less^  powerful than their mage."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1588:19744: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0019_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1588
msgctxt "text_id=19744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あくまで前座ってコトっスか？"
msgstr "  Always livin' in the shadow of their wings, eh?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1599:19745: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0019_1; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1599
msgctxt "text_id=19745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うは、マジ使えないヤツらッスー！"
msgstr "  What a bunch of useless freeloaders!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1631:19746: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1631
msgctxt "text_id=19746 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　アナタらしい短絡思考ねロビン。"
msgstr "    How very short-sighted of you as usual, Robin."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1631:19747: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1631
msgctxt "text_id=19747 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　痺れるわ。これがわたしの使い魔だなんて、"
msgstr "    Sometimes I can't believe you're one of my"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1631:19748: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1631
msgctxt "text_id=19748 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　どうにかなってしまいそう。"
msgstr "    familiars."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1662:19749: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0020; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1662
msgctxt "text_id=19749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アリスさん、"
msgstr "        Miss Alice, why must your words excite"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1662:19750: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0020; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1662
msgctxt "text_id=19750 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言葉はステキなのにどうして顔が怖いんスか？"
msgstr "        yet your expression be a fright?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1693:19751: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1693
msgctxt "text_id=19751 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　術者の十分の一ぐらいの性能しかなくても、"
msgstr "  Even if they have only one-tenth the power of their mage,"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1693:19752: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1693
msgctxt "text_id=19752 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　本人より“強い”使い魔を造る事は簡単よ。"
msgstr "  it's actually quite easy to create a familiar that is stronger^  than their master."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1724:19753: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1724
msgctxt "text_id=19753 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　試しに、こんどアナタのお腹に"
msgstr "      Maybe next time I'll try embedding"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1724:19754: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1724
msgctxt "text_id=19754 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　デリンジャーを埋め込んでみましょうか。"
msgstr "      a derringer in your stomach or something."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1755:19755: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1755
msgctxt "text_id=19755 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　泣いたり笑ったり飛んだりはできなくなるけど、"
msgstr "  You won't be able to laugh or cry or fly anymore,"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1755:19756: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1755
msgctxt "text_id=19756 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　相手を驚かせるぐらいはできるわ、きっと。"
msgstr "  but you can at least scare the stuffing out of anyone that^  crosses us, that's for sure."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1832:19757: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0021; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1832
msgctxt "text_id=19757 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　コ―――コマドリ・ザ・クラッカー！"
msgstr "      Ohhhhhh! Robin the Firecracker!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1832:19758: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0021; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1832
msgctxt "text_id=19758 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　かっちょいいッスー！"
msgstr "      That's so chicken and rice!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1832:19759: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0021; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1832
msgctxt "text_id=19759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　クリスマスに大活躍の予感……！"
msgstr "      Looks like I'll be a 'uge hit this Christmas!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1868:19760: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1868
msgctxt "text_id=19760 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　まさに豆鉄砲ね。"
msgstr "    I'm talking about a cap gun, just so you're aware."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1868:19761: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1868
msgctxt "text_id=19761 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　そのまま消費されてくれないかしら。"
msgstr "    Maybe that's a better idea, though. One pop and you're^    out of my hair forever."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1901:19762: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0022; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1901
msgctxt "text_id=19762 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　なんか当たりキツイッス。"
msgstr "  Hey, come on, now yer just bein' mean."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1901:19763: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0022; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1901
msgctxt "text_id=19763 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　でも、これで大まかな説明はしたっスね。"
msgstr "  Anyway, I think you've pretty much covered the basics."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1927:19764: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0023; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1927
msgctxt "text_id=19764 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　使い魔は魔術師を守るロボットで、"
msgstr "A familiar is like a robot that protects its mage creator,"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1927:19765: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0023; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1927
msgctxt "text_id=19765 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その性能は造った魔術師によってマチマチ、と。"
msgstr "and its abilities are entirely up to the mage that makes it."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1958:19766: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0024; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1958
msgctxt "text_id=19766 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ん？　万能感あふれるアリスさんはともかく、"
msgstr "    Hm, so wait. I know you're a top class mage, Alice,"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1958:19767: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0024; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1958
msgctxt "text_id=19767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子さんが使い魔を造ったらどうなるッスか？"
msgstr "    but what would 'appen if someone like Aoko made a familiar?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1958:19768: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0024; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1958
msgctxt "text_id=19768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やっぱり、起動・即・自爆？"
msgstr "    Would it just blow itself up immediately or somethin'?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:1989:19769: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1989
msgctxt "text_id=19769 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　あり得ない仮定ね。"
msgstr "  What a ridiculous hypothesis."

#. Occurrence NZ1:1989:19770: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:1989
msgctxt "text_id=19770 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　青子には使い魔を造るだけの技量はないもの。"
msgstr "  Aoko doesn't even have the capabilities to begin creating a familiar yet."

#. Occurrence NZ1:2020:19771: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2020
msgctxt "text_id=19771 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　そもそも、彼女は壊す事しかできないのよ？"
msgstr "    She can only destroy things, remember?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:2020:19772: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2020
msgctxt "text_id=19772 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　その唯一の特技を使い魔に任せてしまったら、"
msgstr "    If she gave up her lone skill to a familiar,"

#. Occurrence NZ1:2020:19773: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2020
msgctxt "text_id=19773 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　存在意義も跡形もなく壊れてしまうわ。"
msgstr "    she would lose her entire reason to even exist."

#. Occurrence NZ1:2051:19774: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0025; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2051
msgctxt "text_id=19774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ハハハ。"
msgstr "Hahaha!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:2051:19775: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0025; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2051
msgctxt "text_id=19775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　さりげにひどい発言ッス。"
msgstr "Never one to mince yer words, Angel Mum."

#. Occurrence NZ1:2082:19776: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2082
msgctxt "text_id=19776 | speaker=alice"
msgid "戦闘において、青子は使い魔に任せる必要がない。"
msgstr "  Aoko has no reason to use a familiar for combat."

#. Occurrence NZ1:2082:19777: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2082
msgctxt "text_id=19777 | speaker=alice"
msgid "逆に、私は戦う事はできないから―――"
msgstr "  Conversely, I can't fight at all so..."

#. Occurrence NZ1:2113:19778: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0026; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2113
msgctxt "text_id=19778 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　なるほどー。"
msgstr "      Ah, makes eighteen pence."

#. Occurrence NZ1:2113:19779: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0026; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2113
msgctxt "text_id=19779 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　青子さんは青子さん自身が強い。"
msgstr "      Aoko is strong all by herself."

#. Occurrence NZ1:2113:19780: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0026; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2113
msgctxt "text_id=19780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさんはアリスさんの周りが強い。"
msgstr "      You surround yourself with strong allies."

#. Occurrence NZ1:2153:19781: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2153
msgctxt "text_id=19781 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　チェス……いえ、将棋で喩えるなら、"
msgstr "  Right. If you were to compare it to chess,"

#. Occurrence NZ1:2153:19782: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2153
msgctxt "text_id=19782 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　青子は王将（角・飛車の能力アリ）だけの陣営。"
msgstr "  Aoko would be a strong piece that could stand on its own,^  like the queen."

#. Occurrence NZ1:2179:19783: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0028; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2179
msgctxt "text_id=19783 | speaker=alice"
msgid "わたしは陣営こそ強力だけど、王将自体が「歩」の^能力しかない、というイメージね。"
msgstr " I, on the other hand, utilize many pieces but I myself^ only have the strength of a pawn."

#. Occurrence NZ1:2218:19784: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0027; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2218
msgctxt "text_id=19784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そーッス、アリスさんは"
msgstr " Ah, yes, I see!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:2218:19785: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0027; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2218
msgctxt "text_id=19785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　体力も運動神経もない運痴キャラだったッス！"
msgstr " I forgot just how weak and out of shape you are!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:2249:19786: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0028; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2249
msgctxt "text_id=19786 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　泳ぎは犬かきしかできない、"
msgstr "    You can only barely dog paddle to swim,"

#. Occurrence NZ1:2249:19787: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0028; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2249
msgctxt "text_id=19787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　鉄棒もできなければ自転車にも乗れない、"
msgstr "    can't do a single push-up, can't ride a bicycle,"

#. Occurrence NZ1:2275:19788: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0029; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2275
msgctxt "text_id=19788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "体育の時間は校庭のはじっこで座っているだけのカ^ンタンなお仕事。"
msgstr "      and spend gym class sitting around doing^      mostly nuffin'."

#. Occurrence NZ1:2306:19789: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0030_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2306
msgctxt "text_id=19789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だがそれがいい！"
msgstr "    But that's fine! You're right Robin Hood!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:2306:19790: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0030_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2306
msgctxt "text_id=19790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ジブン、盗撮してるから知ってるッスよー！"
msgstr "    And if we get down to brass tacts, its 'cause I'm always tailin' you!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:2319:19791: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0030_1; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2319
msgctxt "text_id=19791 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　マイ天使よ、ただ美しく"
msgstr "    My Angel Mum... You are far too beautiful to exert yourself."

#. Occurrence NZ1:2336:19792: voice_id=BA0_NZ1_0030_2; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2336
msgctxt "text_id=19792 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "アレ！？"
msgstr "Hm?!"

#. Occurrence NZ1:2404:19793: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2404
msgctxt "text_id=19793 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　……失礼ね。"
msgstr "            ...You are incredibly vile, do you know that?"

#. Occurrence NZ1:2404:19794: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ1_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ1
#: NZ1:2404
msgctxt "text_id=19794 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　わたしだって、走るだけなら少しはこなせるわ。"
msgstr "            I'll have you know I can jog short distances."

#. Occurrence NZ2:108:19795: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:108
msgctxt "text_id=19795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　コンチハ。"
msgstr "      'Ello there!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:108:19796: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:108
msgctxt "text_id=19796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　日課のマンウォッチをこなし、"
msgstr "      Relieved of his daily guard duties,"

#. Occurrence NZ2:108:19797: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:108
msgctxt "text_id=19797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　さっそうと園に降り立つ青い影。"
msgstr "      a blue shadow descends upon the garden."

#. Occurrence NZ2:139:19798: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:139
msgctxt "text_id=19798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "さしずめ、鳥は舞い降りた、というところッスか。"
msgstr "    When all's said and done, this bird has landed with aplomb."

#. Occurrence NZ2:139:19799: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:139
msgctxt "text_id=19799 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "今回はここ、アリスさんが指定した"
msgstr "    I'm 'ere to get started with another lecture in this"

#. Occurrence NZ2:139:19800: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:139
msgctxt "text_id=19800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "特設会場でレクチャーを始めるんスけど……"
msgstr "    special location requested by Miss Alice herself."

#. Occurrence NZ2:170:19801: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:170
msgctxt "text_id=19801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ここ、どう見てもフツーの園ッスよね。"
msgstr "    As you can see, it's nothin' special-just an ordinary garden."

#. Occurrence NZ2:170:19802: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:170
msgctxt "text_id=19802 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさんはどこに……"
msgstr "    Now where could that Alice be?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:197:19803: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:197
msgctxt "text_id=19803 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　遅かったわねロビン。"
msgstr "      I've been waiting for you, Robin."

#. Occurrence NZ2:197:19804: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:197
msgctxt "text_id=19804 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　出演者としての自覚はあるのかしら。"
msgstr "      You do realize you're a part of this^      lecture series too, right?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:223:19805: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:223
msgctxt "text_id=19805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ハッ！？　声はすれども姿はなしッス！？"
msgstr "  Huh?! I can 'ear you but I don't see you anywhere!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:223:19806: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:223
msgctxt "text_id=19806 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ここには園児しかいないというのに、"
msgstr "  What kind of trick are you tryin' to pull?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:223:19807: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:223
msgctxt "text_id=19807 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさんは何処に！？"
msgstr "  Where the 'eck are you, Alice?!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:260:19808: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:260
msgctxt "text_id=19808 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　ここよ。"
msgstr "            I'm right here."

#. Occurrence NZ2:291:19809: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:291
msgctxt "text_id=19809 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　なぜなにー、プロイー。"
msgstr "    The Wonderful World of Ploys."

#. Occurrence NZ2:344:19810: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0004; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:344
msgctxt "text_id=19810 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　―――。"
msgstr "                    ..."

#. Occurrence NZ2:397:19811: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:397
msgctxt "text_id=19811 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　なぜなにー、プロイー。"
msgstr "      The Wonderful World of Ploys."

msgctxt "text_id=19812 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　…………なぜ黙っているのかしら、ロビン？"
msgstr "      ...Well, aren't you going to speak, Robin?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:430:19813: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:430
msgctxt "text_id=19813 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、別になんでもないッス。"
msgstr "    Erm, yeah. I'm 'ere to bubble and squeak."

#. Occurrence NZ2:430:19814: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:430
msgctxt "text_id=19814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ジブン的には、何の違和感もなかったところが"
msgstr "    I was just a little startled is all, seeing as 'ow"

#. Occurrence NZ2:430:19815: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:430
msgctxt "text_id=19815 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　よけい怖かっただけッス。"
msgstr "    I didn't really notice anyfink out the ordinary."

#. Occurrence NZ2:461:19816: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:461
msgctxt "text_id=19816 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　さすがマイ天使であるところのアリスさん。"
msgstr "    That's my Angel Alice, she is."

#. Occurrence NZ2:461:19817: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:461
msgctxt "text_id=19817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　なにを着てもヤバイぐらい似合うッス。"
msgstr "    You always scrub up real nice."

#. Occurrence NZ2:461:19818: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:461
msgctxt "text_id=19818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ほんとバイヤー。"
msgstr "    Like a right proper lady."

#. Occurrence NZ2:494:19819: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:494
msgctxt "text_id=19819 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ところで。"
msgstr "    Anyway..."

#. Occurrence NZ2:494:19820: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:494
msgctxt "text_id=19820 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　素朴な疑問なんスけど、ここで何を？"
msgstr "    Quick question, what exactly are we doing 'ere?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:494:19821: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:494
msgctxt "text_id=19821 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　あと何で？"
msgstr "    And why?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:525:19822: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:525
msgctxt "text_id=19822 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　マンネリズムはよくないでしょう？"
msgstr "    I just thought it'd be a good idea to change things up a bit."

#. Occurrence NZ2:525:19823: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:525
msgctxt "text_id=19823 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　オマケコーナーだからって素材を使い回すのはわたしの美学に"
msgstr "    It goes against my aesthetics to keep using the same props"

#. Occurrence NZ2:525:19824: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:525
msgctxt "text_id=19824 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　反するわ。なんとか道場じゃあるまいし。"
msgstr "    and setting every time. This isn't some kind of dojo."

#. Occurrence NZ2:558:19825: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:558
msgctxt "text_id=19825 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　だから場所を変えたッスか。"
msgstr "    So that's why you moved the lecture 'ere!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:558:19826: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:558
msgctxt "text_id=19826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　なるほど。それはおおむね理解したッス。"
msgstr "    I see, I see. I gots me an earwig."

#. Occurrence NZ2:558:19827: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:558
msgctxt "text_id=19827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　青子さんもビックリの浪費家ぶりっス。"
msgstr "    Aoko's a surprisingly big spender."

#. Occurrence NZ2:589:19828: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:589
msgctxt "text_id=19828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "でもジブン、スモックよりワンピの方が好みなんスよね。ドレスみたいなの。女神っぽいの。いや、スモックがダメという話ではなくてッスね、あくまでイメージの問題？　絵画にした時の説得力？"
msgstr "    I prefer a dress rather than a smock, though. I fink it makes you look like a^    goddess! Not saying a smock is bad, but it's all about image. How powerful^    would this butcher's hook be if it were in a painting? That kinda thing."

#. Occurrence NZ2:614:19829: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0010; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:614
msgctxt "text_id=19829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『森と鳥と少女』みたいな？ほら、『鳥と園児』じゃ園児のインパクトが強すぎて鳥にフォーカスがあたらないっつーか、"
msgstr "Say you have a painting of a forest and a bird and some children. If the impact of the kids is too strong, you'd lose focus of the bird."

#. Occurrence NZ2:646:19830: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:646
msgctxt "text_id=19830 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　いけない。菓子作りの途中だったわ。"
msgstr "      Oh no! I forgot I was in the middle of^      making some sweets."

#. Occurrence NZ2:699:19831: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:699
msgctxt "text_id=19831 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ナチュラルに無視。"
msgstr "Annnnnnd I'm being ignored."

#. Occurrence NZ2:699:19832: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:699
msgctxt "text_id=19832 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ところで、アリスさんは普段なにをやってるッスか？"
msgstr "So, Miss Alice, what is it that you do all day anyway?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:725:19833: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:725
msgctxt "text_id=19833 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　青子さんは生徒会。"
msgstr "    Aoko's the student council president."

#. Occurrence NZ2:725:19834: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:725
msgctxt "text_id=19834 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　シャバ僧はアルバイト。"
msgstr "    Soujyuro's got his work."

#. Occurrence NZ2:725:19835: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:725
msgctxt "text_id=19835 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさんは帰宅部ッス？"
msgstr "    D'you just mind the old rat and mouse?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:781:19836: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:781
msgctxt "text_id=19836 | speaker=alice"
msgid "見ての通りよ。"
msgstr " I do exactly what you see here."

#. Occurrence NZ2:781:19837: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:781
msgctxt "text_id=19837 | speaker=alice"
msgid "時間があればプロイを作っているわ。"
msgstr " I spend my free time making Ploys."

#. Occurrence NZ2:812:19838: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:812
msgctxt "text_id=19838 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "わー。"
msgstr "  Wow!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:812:19839: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:812
msgctxt "text_id=19839 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "まんま、童話の魔女のイメージっス。"
msgstr "  You're just like a witch in those old fairy tales."

#. Occurrence NZ2:812:19840: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:812
msgctxt "text_id=19840 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "プロイって鍋で作ってたッスか。"
msgstr "  I didn't know you made Ploys in a cauldron."

#. Occurrence NZ2:843:19841: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0014; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:843
msgctxt "text_id=19841 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　っていうか、この匂いはチョコレイト？"
msgstr "        And what's that smell? Chocolate?!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:843:19842: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0014; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:843
msgctxt "text_id=19842 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まさか……"
msgstr "        Wait a tick..."

#. Occurrence NZ2:843:19843: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0014; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:843
msgctxt "text_id=19843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　プロイってお菓子だったんスかーーーー！？"
msgstr "        Are Ploys made of sweets?!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:895:19844: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:895
msgctxt "text_id=19844 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　……アナタね。プロイのくせに、"
msgstr "    Robin... You're a Ploy yourself."

#. Occurrence NZ2:895:19845: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:895
msgctxt "text_id=19845 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　プロイの仕組みを知らないの？"
msgstr "    Are you telling me you don't know what Ploys are made of?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:895:19846: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:895
msgctxt "text_id=19846 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　気付きたくはなかったけれど、やっぱりただの鳥だった？"
msgstr "    Maybe you're just a regular bird after all."

#. Occurrence NZ2:926:19847: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:926
msgctxt "text_id=19847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そのあたり、ジブンでもよく分からないッス。"
msgstr "  Hey look, I don't know anyfink about that sort!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:926:19848: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:926
msgctxt "text_id=19848 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　でもプロイの仕組みは分かるッスよ。"
msgstr "  Pretty sure I know how Ploys work, though."

#. Occurrence NZ2:926:19849: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:926
msgctxt "text_id=19849 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜなら―――"
msgstr "  Because..."

#. Occurrence NZ2:973:19850: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:973
msgctxt "text_id=19850 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　なぜなら、これからアリスさんが"
msgstr "      Of course, our lovely Alice 'ere will give"

#. Occurrence NZ2:973:19851: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:973
msgctxt "text_id=19851 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　海より深く<宙|そら>より広く、"
msgstr "      a gloss deeper 'n the housemaid's knee"

#. Occurrence NZ2:973:19852: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:973
msgctxt "text_id=19852 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　かっちょいい説明してくれるからッス！"
msgstr "      and broader than the skies above! Right?!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1004:19853: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1004
msgctxt "text_id=19853 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　本編で説明している通りよ。"
msgstr "    What more can I add to the ^    explanation in the main story?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1004:19854: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1004
msgctxt "text_id=19854 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　以上、解散。"
msgstr "    We're done here. Class dismissed."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1038:19855: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0017; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1038
msgctxt "text_id=19855 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　このコーナーの根底を崩す一言ッスね。"
msgstr "  You're really trying to kill this segment, aren't you!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1070:19856: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1070
msgctxt "text_id=19856 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　何か意見があって？"
msgstr "          Got any better ideas?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1101:19857: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0018; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1101
msgctxt "text_id=19857 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ないッス。"
msgstr "    Nah."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1101:19858: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0018; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1101
msgctxt "text_id=19858 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　でも、せめて概要だけでもレクチャーしてほしいッス。"
msgstr "    I at least wanted you to give a brief overview or somethin'!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1101:19859: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0018; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1101
msgctxt "text_id=19859 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　これじゃこのコーナー、なんとか道場以下ッスよ？"
msgstr "    Wouldn't want us to look worse than that dojo!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1132:19860: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1132
msgctxt "text_id=19860 | speaker=alice"
msgid "………………それは避けたいわね。"
msgstr "...I suppose I do want to avoid that."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1132:19861: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1132
msgctxt "text_id=19861 | speaker=alice"
msgid "それじゃあ……"
msgstr "All right, fine..."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1172:19862: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1172
msgctxt "text_id=19862 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　これがプロイキッシャーの綴り。"
msgstr "      I'll talk a little bit about how Ploy Kickshaws are made."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1172:19863: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1172
msgctxt "text_id=19863 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　これだけで説明になると思うのだけど、どう？"
msgstr "      But that's all I'm going to discuss today, got it?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1204:19864: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0019; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1204
msgctxt "text_id=19864 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　ぷろい？　きっくしゃー？"
msgstr "          Ploy... Kisshaws...?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1235:19865: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1235
msgctxt "text_id=19865 | speaker=alice"
msgid "キックシャーのクはほとんどサイレントよ。"
msgstr "      That's just how you pronounce it. The \"ck\" sound is almost"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1235:19866: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1235
msgctxt "text_id=19866 | speaker=alice"
msgid "西欧圏の、子供のオモチャ、子供だまし、軽蔑的に珍しいもの、"
msgstr "      entirely silent. A kickshaw is what the Europeans call an"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1235:19867: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1235
msgctxt "text_id=19867 | speaker=alice"
msgid "といった意味ね。"
msgstr "      insignificant children's toy or trinket."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1266:19868: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0020; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1266
msgctxt "text_id=19868 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あ。知ってるッス、"
msgstr "  Oh, I knew that!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1266:19869: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0020; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1266
msgctxt "text_id=19869 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それ変人の意味でも用い―――"
msgstr "  I've also 'eard it used in the bed-"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1337:19870: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1337
msgctxt "text_id=19870 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　プロイも同様に西欧圏のオモチャで、"
msgstr "      Ploys are similar in that here in Japan"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1337:19871: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1337
msgctxt "text_id=19871 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　こっちは戦争ごっこに使われるもの。"
msgstr "      we use them to play pretend war and simulate combat."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1337:19872: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1337
msgctxt "text_id=19872 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　子供の教育用玩具の総称ね。"
msgstr "      They are a kind of children's educational tool."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1368:19873: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1368
msgctxt "text_id=19873 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　戦略、戦術の俗語でもあり、"
msgstr "      Ploy is also another word for strategy or battle plan,"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1368:19874: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1368
msgctxt "text_id=19874 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　スコットランドだと……な意味もあるけれど、"
msgstr "      and in Scotland it has...well, another meaning."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1368:19875: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1368
msgctxt "text_id=19875 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　それは忘れて。"
msgstr "      That one's not important."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1402:19876: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0021; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1402
msgctxt "text_id=19876 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふむ。この二つの単語をむりやり繋げたのが"
msgstr "        Hmm. So basically you just threw a bottle of glue"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1402:19877: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0021; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1402
msgctxt "text_id=19877 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　プロイキッシャーなんスね。"
msgstr "        at two words to make \"Ploy Kickshaw\" then?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1402:19878: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0021; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1402
msgctxt "text_id=19878 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もしかしてアリスさんオリジナル？"
msgstr "        Did you whip up this bit of word salad, Miss Alice?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1433:19879: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1433
msgctxt "text_id=19879 | speaker=alice"
msgid "……わたしの母に伝わっていた独自の魔術系統よ。"
msgstr "...It's a unique kind of magecraft passed down to me from my mother."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1433:19880: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1433
msgctxt "text_id=19880 | speaker=alice"
msgid "魔術協会に公開して権利と利益を得る、なんて低俗^な事はしていないから。"
msgstr "We never registered it with the Mage's Association to earn royalties from it or anything cheap like that."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1466:19881: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0022; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1466
msgctxt "text_id=19881 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　まあ、公開したところでアリスさんにしか"
msgstr "   Eh, I guess even if you did you'd still be the only"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1466:19882: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0022; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1466
msgctxt "text_id=19882 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　扱えないんですけどね！"
msgstr "   one who could actually use it!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1466:19883: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0022; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1466
msgctxt "text_id=19883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　マインスターの血に縛られてるッス！"
msgstr "   Bound by that Meinster blood I suppose!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1497:19884: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1497
msgctxt "text_id=19884 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　……アナタ、"
msgstr "    Robin..."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1497:19885: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1497
msgctxt "text_id=19885 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　本当はちゃんと分かっているんじゃないの？"
msgstr "    Have you understood a thing I've said so far?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1528:19886: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0023; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1528
msgctxt "text_id=19886 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "？　すまないッス、今なに言ったのか忘れたッス。"
msgstr "Hm? Sorry, forgot what I was chirpin' about."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1528:19887: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0023; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1528
msgctxt "text_id=19887 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ジブン、昔のコトは未来よりあやふやッスから。"
msgstr "I'm more unsure of the past than I am of the future, is all."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1559:19888: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1559
msgctxt "text_id=19888 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……。"
msgstr "  ..."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1559:19889: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1559
msgctxt "text_id=19889 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　マインスターというのは、なに？"
msgstr "  Who exactly were you referring to^  when you said Meinster?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1608:19890: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0024; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1608
msgctxt "text_id=19890 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "マイ女神ッス。アリスさんの母君ッスね。"
msgstr "        Goddess Mum! Your mother, of course."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1608:19891: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0024; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1608
msgctxt "text_id=19891 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "あと、純血の魔女とか、いかにもなセカンドネームがあったッス。"
msgstr "        People called her a pure-blooded Witch."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1641:19892: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0025; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1641
msgctxt "text_id=19892 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　でも母君、ミーハーだったんスよね。"
msgstr "    Though she always was a bit of a bandwagoner,"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1641:19893: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0025; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1641
msgctxt "text_id=19893 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　流行り物に弱いというか。"
msgstr "    your mum. Always chasing the latest trends..."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1641:19894: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0025; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1641
msgctxt "text_id=19894 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ルイスキャロルの大ファンでもあったッス。"
msgstr "    A big fan of ol' Lewis Carroll..."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1672:19895: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0026; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1672
msgctxt "text_id=19895 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔女は自分の代で、先代から遺されたプロイを"
msgstr "    A Witch traditionally takes the Ploy passed down to them"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1672:19896: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0026; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1672
msgctxt "text_id=19896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分用にチューンナップするッスよ。"
msgstr "    and fine-tunes it to her own needs."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1672:19897: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0026; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1672
msgctxt "text_id=19897 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　母君、キャロルにはまってたからあの始末ッス。"
msgstr "    Since your mum fancied Carroll so, that's how it came about."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1703:19898: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0027; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1703
msgctxt "text_id=19898 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　 禁を犯した時も、ノータイムで"
msgstr "      When she broke the rules and had you,"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1703:19899: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0027; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1703
msgctxt "text_id=19899 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　「名前はアリスにしましょう」なんて"
msgstr "      she decided to name you Alice, of all things."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1703:19900: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0027; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1703
msgctxt "text_id=19900 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　 微笑んだぐらいッスから！"
msgstr "      I still remember the big ol' grin on her face!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1740:19901: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1740
msgctxt "text_id=19901 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　……あきれた。"
msgstr "    ...I think I've heard enough."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1740:19902: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1740
msgctxt "text_id=19902 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　少女趣味のかたまりだったのね、あの人。"
msgstr "    She was always a child at heart, that woman."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1777:19903: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0028_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1777
msgctxt "text_id=19903 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ハハハなに言ってるッスか、"
msgstr "  Hahaha, you're one to talk!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1777:19904: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0028_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1777
msgctxt "text_id=19904 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　シャバ僧が帰ってくると必ず目を覚ます"
msgstr "  Whenever that boy comes to the gates o' Rome you always perk right up!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1777:19905: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0028_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1777
msgctxt "text_id=19905 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさんも"
msgstr "  The apple doesn't fall far from the tree, "

#. Occurrence NZ2:1785:19906: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0028_1; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1785
msgctxt "text_id=19906 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "負けてはいな"
msgstr "as they say. "

msgctxt "text_id=19907 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ぐぼぁ!?"
msgstr "Grargh!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1863:19908: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1863
msgctxt "text_id=19908 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　 次回のレクチャーは"
msgstr "        Let's make the topic of our next lecture"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1863:19909: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1863
msgctxt "text_id=19909 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　『プロイキッシャー：個別』にしましょう。"
msgstr "        \"Ploy Kickshaws: A Tutorial.\""

#. Occurrence NZ2:1894:19910: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1894
msgctxt "text_id=19910 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　それじゃロビン、お店の予約をしておいて。"
msgstr " Robin, make a reservation at the usual place, will you?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1894:19911: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1894
msgctxt "text_id=19911 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　それが済んだらチョコレイトの湯煎。"
msgstr " Then when you're finished with that, double boil this chocolate."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1894:19912: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1894
msgctxt "text_id=19912 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　それが済んだら鏡の<磨|みが>き。"
msgstr " After that, polish the mirror."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1925:19913: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1925
msgctxt "text_id=19913 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　それが済んだら……そうね。"
msgstr "  And then... hmm."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1925:19914: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1925
msgctxt "text_id=19914 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　電柱にでもぶつかって、盛大に死んでちょうだい。"
msgstr "  Fly yourself into a telephone pole and die, maybe?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1959:19915: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0029; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1959
msgctxt "text_id=19915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　いつも通りってコトッスね！"
msgstr "      So the usual routine, gotcha!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1959:19916: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0029; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1959
msgctxt "text_id=19916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさん、なんか当たりきついッス！"
msgstr "      You're so 'ard on me today, Miss Alice!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:1990:19917: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1990
msgctxt "text_id=19917 | speaker=alice"
msgid "わたし、本来はこういうキャラよ。"
msgstr "This is how I always am."

#. Occurrence NZ2:1990:19918: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1990
msgctxt "text_id=19918 | speaker=alice"
msgid "本編では面倒だから黙っているだけ。"
msgstr "I'm just too lazy to deal with it all in the main story, that's all."

#. Occurrence NZ2:2024:19919: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0030; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2024
msgctxt "text_id=19919 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　面倒って、なにがッスか。"
msgstr "    Too lazy to deal with what?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:2057:19920: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2057
msgctxt "text_id=19920 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　貴方のような"
msgstr "Too lazy to waste my precious "

msgctxt "text_id=19921 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "××を罵るのに"
msgstr "calories"

msgctxt "text_id=19922 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いちいちカロリーを使うとか。"
msgstr "belaboring a stupid ■■■ like you, for one thing."

msgctxt "text_id=19923 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それだけの価値があると思って？"
msgstr "Do you think you're really worth my time?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:2091:19924: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0031_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2091
msgctxt "text_id=19924 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たまんないッスー！"
msgstr "  Well, pluck me bald!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:2091:19925: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0031_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2091
msgctxt "text_id=19925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ジブン、グリコのキャラメル以下だったスね！"
msgstr "  'Ere I was thinkin' people gave a tomtit about me!"

#. Occurrence NZ2:2097:19926: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0031_1; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2097
msgctxt "text_id=19926 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　でも。"
msgstr "  But, "

#. Occurrence NZ2:2104:19927: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0031_2; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2104
msgctxt "text_id=19927 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "それなら。"
msgstr "if that's the case, "

#. Occurrence NZ2:2111:19928: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0031_3; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2111
msgctxt "text_id=19928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "舐めて。"
msgstr "I wouldn't mind "

#. Occurrence NZ2:2118:19929: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0031_4; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2118
msgctxt "text_id=19929 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ほしい。"
msgstr "if you gave me a lick "

#. Occurrence NZ2:2125:19930: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0031_5; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2125
msgctxt "text_id=19930 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ッス。"
msgstr "sometimes."

#. Occurrence NZ2:2159:19931: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2159
msgctxt "text_id=19931 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　そうね。"
msgstr "  I bet you wouldn't."

#. Occurrence NZ2:2159:19932: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2159
msgctxt "text_id=19932 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　それでも死なないか、一度試してみましょうか。"
msgstr "  If only it'd annoy you so much you'd leave for good."

#. Occurrence NZ2:2239:19933: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0032_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2239
msgctxt "text_id=19933 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ノータイムでマルカジリ。"
msgstr "      Oof, the one-two knockout right at the bell."

#. Occurrence NZ2:2245:19934: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0032_1; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2245
msgctxt "text_id=19934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やっぱりプロイってお菓子なんス？"
msgstr "      So, are Ploys made of sweets or not?"

#. Occurrence NZ2:2251:19935: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0032_2; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:2251
msgctxt "text_id=19935 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　んー、あめえ。"
msgstr "      Mmm, sweets..."

#. Occurrence NZ3:157:19936: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:157
msgctxt "text_id=19936 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　シェフ。"
msgstr "    Chef."

#. Occurrence NZ3:157:19937: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:157
msgctxt "text_id=19937 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　マグロ三種盛り、一つ。"
msgstr "    One three-piece tuna special."

#. Occurrence NZ3:263:19938: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:263
msgctxt "text_id=19938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アリスさん、なんスかそれ？"
msgstr "      What's that, Miss Alice?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:263:19939: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:263
msgctxt "text_id=19939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんか、見たこともない金色のお皿ッスね。"
msgstr "      Never seen a gold plate like that before."

#. Occurrence NZ3:305:19940: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:305
msgctxt "text_id=19940 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　たいしたことはないわ。"
msgstr "          It's nothing special."

#. Occurrence NZ3:331:19941: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:331
msgctxt "text_id=19941 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　普通のと、"
msgstr "        Just a regular tuna,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:331:19942: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:331
msgctxt "text_id=19942 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　中トロと、"
msgstr "        a fatty tuna belly,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:331:19943: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:331
msgctxt "text_id=19943 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　大トロのセットなだけよ。"
msgstr "        and an extra fatty one."

#. Occurrence NZ3:357:19944: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:357
msgctxt "text_id=19944 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "鮮血のトリコロール。フランスの国旗みたいッスね。"
msgstr "  It looks like a bloody French flag!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:357:19945: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:357
msgctxt "text_id=19945 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ジブン、経済的な理由で玉子とイカとイナリしか頼めないッス。"
msgstr "  I can only ever afford the crappy ones, like egg, squid, or inari."

#. Occurrence NZ3:398:19946: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:398
msgctxt "text_id=19946 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　シェフ。"
msgstr "  Chef."

#. Occurrence NZ3:398:19947: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:398
msgctxt "text_id=19947 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　中トロをもう一度。"
msgstr "  Another plate of medium-fat tuna."

#. Occurrence NZ3:509:19948: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:509
msgctxt "text_id=19948 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　また赤いのッスか。"
msgstr "      You're going for another red one."

#. Occurrence NZ3:509:19949: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:509
msgctxt "text_id=19949 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　光りものとか白身とかいかないんスか？"
msgstr "      What about something white or silver?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:509:19950: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:509
msgctxt "text_id=19950 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　イワシとかカンパチとかいけるッスよ。"
msgstr "      Sardine and amberjack are pretty tasty."

#. Occurrence NZ3:540:19951: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:540
msgctxt "text_id=19951 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　シェフ。"
msgstr "        Chef."

#. Occurrence NZ3:540:19952: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:540
msgctxt "text_id=19952 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　大トロをもう一度。"
msgstr "        Another full-fat tuna."

#. Occurrence NZ3:615:19953: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:615
msgctxt "text_id=19953 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　その皿ひとつで、"
msgstr "      That one plate of sushi"

#. Occurrence NZ3:615:19954: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:615
msgctxt "text_id=19954 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　いつもの夕食一回分の値段なんスね。"
msgstr "      costs as much as an entire John Skinner."

#. Occurrence NZ3:615:19955: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:615
msgctxt "text_id=19955 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　サーモンで妥協とかしないんスか？"
msgstr "      How about settling for salmon?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:646:19956: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:646
msgctxt "text_id=19956 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　たいしたことはないわ。"
msgstr "      Cost is no concern."

#. Occurrence NZ3:646:19957: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:646
msgctxt "text_id=19957 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　シェフ。大トロをリピート。"
msgstr "      Chef. Another full-fat tuna."

#. Occurrence NZ3:698:19958: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0004; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:698
msgctxt "text_id=19958 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　はじめからマグロしか眼中にないとか、"
msgstr "      It's just tuna, tuna, tuna with you."

#. Occurrence NZ3:698:19959: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0004; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:698
msgctxt "text_id=19959 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　さすがアリスさんッスーーー！"
msgstr "      Should've expected no less of Miss Alice!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:698:19960: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0004; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:698
msgctxt "text_id=19960 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　久遠寺財閥の娘は伊達じゃないッスね！"
msgstr "      Sometimes I forget you're a posh heiress!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:730:19961: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0006_0; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:730
msgctxt "text_id=19961 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　お金はこういう時に使うのよ、ロビン。"
msgstr "    How else should I spend my money, Robin?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:730:19962: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0006_0; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:730
msgctxt "text_id=19962 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　チャンスで出し渋るのはよくないわ。"
msgstr "    If you have it, spend it."

#. Occurrence NZ3:740:19963: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0006_1; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:740
msgctxt "text_id=19963 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　今日は、青子のお財布を借りているのだけど。"
msgstr "    Well, Aoko's paying today, but still."

#. Occurrence NZ3:771:19964: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:771
msgctxt "text_id=19964 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　そッスか。"
msgstr "    Ah, I see 'ow it works."

#. Occurrence NZ3:771:19965: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:771
msgctxt "text_id=19965 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　青子さんの。"
msgstr "    Aoko's coughin' up for dinner."

#. Occurrence NZ3:846:19966: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:846
msgctxt "text_id=19966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　でもそれ、すぐにカラにならないッスか。"
msgstr "        Does she have enough bread and honey for this?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:846:19967: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:846
msgctxt "text_id=19967 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　青子さんの財布の中身、お寒いッスよ。"
msgstr "        Think of her poor wallet."

#. Occurrence NZ3:846:19968: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:846
msgctxt "text_id=19968 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　あの人、すぐに物を買うから。"
msgstr "        She spends money like it's going out of style."

#. Occurrence NZ3:878:19969: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0007_0; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:878
msgctxt "text_id=19969 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　だいじょうぶ。"
msgstr "      It's fine."

#. Occurrence NZ3:878:19970: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0007_0; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:878
msgctxt "text_id=19970 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　備えあれば、よロビン。"
msgstr "      I always come prepared."

#. Occurrence NZ3:888:19971: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0007_1; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:888
msgctxt "text_id=19971 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　ここにもう一つ、温かなお財布があるわ。"
msgstr "      I brought my second purse just in case."

#. Occurrence NZ3:920:19972: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:920
msgctxt "text_id=19972 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　ぶほっ"
msgstr "                  Bwah!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:955:19973: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:955
msgctxt "text_id=19973 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　　なに？"
msgstr "                  What?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:986:19974: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:986
msgctxt "text_id=19974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　なンでもないッス。"
msgstr "      Nothing, nothing."

#. Occurrence NZ3:986:19975: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:986
msgctxt "text_id=19975 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさんは家主。すなわち絶対者。"
msgstr "      You're the queen of the castle, so what you say goes."

#. Occurrence NZ3:986:19976: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:986
msgctxt "text_id=19976 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　あの洋館に住むもので誰が逆らえようか。"
msgstr "      I'm just a lowly guest."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1017:19977: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1017
msgctxt "text_id=19977 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……にしても、あのシャバ僧、小金持ちッスね。"
msgstr "   ...That twerp's got more dosh than I thought, eh?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1017:19978: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1017
msgctxt "text_id=19978 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ずっしり来るッスよ、この財布。"
msgstr "   Get a load of that bangers and mash!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1049:19979: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1049
msgctxt "text_id=19979 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　うなる札束ね。"
msgstr "        All that cash!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1049:19980: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1049
msgctxt "text_id=19980 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　ドキドキするわ。"
msgstr "        Someone fan me, quick!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1122:19981: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1122
msgctxt "text_id=19981 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　……赤身がこないわね。"
msgstr "        Where's my tuna...?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1175:19982: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0010; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1175
msgctxt "text_id=19982 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　上座の席で独占しているヤツがいるみたいッス。"
msgstr "  Looks like someone is 'ogging it all in the VIP seat."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1175:19983: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0010; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1175
msgctxt "text_id=19983 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　緑色のコートで。メガネで。"
msgstr "  Check out the green get-up and glasses."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1175:19984: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0010; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1175
msgctxt "text_id=19984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　麻雀牌をつもるような優雅さで二貫ぺろりと。"
msgstr "  'Ogging all the 'ighest quality stuff."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1201:19985: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1201
msgctxt "text_id=19985 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あえて誰かは言わないんスけど、"
msgstr "  Not my place to say,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1201:19986: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1201
msgctxt "text_id=19986 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれヤケ食いッスね。"
msgstr "  but that looks like stress-eatin' to me."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1201:19987: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1201
msgctxt "text_id=19987 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　声、かけるッスか？"
msgstr "  Should I say somefin'?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1227:19988: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1227
msgctxt "text_id=19988 | speaker=alice"
msgid "放っておきましょう。"
msgstr "        Leave it alone."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1227:19989: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1227
msgctxt "text_id=19989 | speaker=alice"
msgid "誰にだって、知り合いに見られたくない時はあるわ。"
msgstr "        Everybody deserves a little me time."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1317:19990: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1317
msgctxt "text_id=19990 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アリスさん、お皿取らないッスか？"
msgstr "      Not going to take a plate, Miss Alice?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1349:19991: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1349
msgctxt "text_id=19991 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　……仕方ないわね。"
msgstr "        I guess I can fit it in."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1349:19992: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1349
msgctxt "text_id=19992 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　じゃあ、これ。"
msgstr "        This one, then."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1431:19993: voice_id=C20_NZ3_0000; voice_prefix=C20; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1431
msgctxt "text_id=19993 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　おめでとーございまーす！"
msgstr "            Congratulations!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1458:19994: voice_id=C30_NZ3_0000; voice_prefix=C30; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1458
msgctxt "text_id=19994 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　ありがとうございまーす！"
msgstr "                Thank you!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1484:19995: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1484
msgctxt "text_id=19995 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　誰ッスか？"
msgstr "    Huh? Who's this?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1484:19996: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1484
msgctxt "text_id=19996 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　テコイレ？"
msgstr "    Are we that short-handed?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1511:19997: voice_id=C20_NZ3_0001; voice_prefix=C20; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1511
msgctxt "text_id=19997 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　説明しよう！"
msgstr "              Let us explain!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1538:19998: voice_id=C30_NZ3_0001; voice_prefix=C30; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1538
msgctxt "text_id=19998 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　説明するよ！"
msgstr "                I'll explain!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1565:19999: voice_id=C20_NZ3_0002; voice_prefix=C20; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1565
msgctxt "text_id=19999 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　何を隠そう僕らこそ！"
msgstr "      We're the best-kept secret!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1592:20000: voice_id=C30_NZ3_0002; voice_prefix=C30; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1592
msgctxt "text_id=20000 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　誰が語ろう僕らこそ！"
msgstr "  We're talked about far and wide!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1619:20001: voice_id=C20_NZ3_0003; voice_prefix=C20; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1619
msgctxt "text_id=20001 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ご主人様の<寵愛|ちょうあい><篤|あつ>い、変幻自在のシックスフォース！"
msgstr "We're our master's favorite, versatile, and ever-changing Six Force!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1645:20002: voice_id=C30_NZ3_0003; voice_prefix=C30; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1645
msgctxt "text_id=20002 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ほ乳類から鳥類まで完全網羅の高級プロイ！"
msgstr "    We're elite Ploys, who can transform^    into mammals, birds... you name it!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1645:20003: voice_id=C30_NZ3_0003; voice_prefix=C30; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1645
msgctxt "text_id=20003 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　おしゃべり双子とは僕らのコト"
msgstr "    We're twins and we're pretty chatty!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1721:20004: voice_id=C20_NZ3_0004; voice_prefix=C20; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1721
msgctxt "text_id=20004 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おおーーー！？"
msgstr "    Whoa!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1721:20005: voice_id=C20_NZ3_0004; voice_prefix=C20; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1721
msgctxt "text_id=20005 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まったく真っ暗どっちらけ、これじゃあゲームもできやしない！"
msgstr "    How can you play games when it's this dark?!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1747:20006: voice_id=C30_NZ3_0004; voice_prefix=C30; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1747
msgctxt "text_id=20006 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あやーーー！！"
msgstr "Hey!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1747:20007: voice_id=C30_NZ3_0004; voice_prefix=C30; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1747
msgctxt "text_id=20007 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見る者いなけりゃどんな目だろうと同じこと！"
msgstr "If you can't see, then you can't see the number on the die!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1747:20008: voice_id=C30_NZ3_0004; voice_prefix=C30; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1747
msgctxt "text_id=20008 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　賭けの続きは薄墨の、<鶏|とり>の卵が回った後で！"
msgstr "Looks like we'll have to resume gambling later then!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1792:20009: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0014; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1792
msgctxt "text_id=20009 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　あ、いまの、もしかしてブタコンビ!?"
msgstr "        Wait! Are they the pig twins?!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1792:20010: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0014; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1792
msgctxt "text_id=20010 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アイツら、人間にもなれるッスかーーー！？"
msgstr "        They can turn into humans, too?!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1823:20011: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1823
msgctxt "text_id=20011 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　……一の目をだすと人間になるそうよ。"
msgstr "    They're known to turn into humans when they roll a one."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1823:20012: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1823
msgctxt "text_id=20012 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　詳しくは、こう。"
msgstr "    Let me explain."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1869:20013: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1869
msgctxt "text_id=20013 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　名前はおしゃべり双子。"
msgstr "            They're called the Chatty Twins."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1869:20014: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1869
msgctxt "text_id=20014 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　うるさい方がトゥィードルダム、"
msgstr "            The noisy one's Tweedle Dum."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1869:20015: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1869
msgctxt "text_id=20015 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　さわがしい方がトゥィードルディー。"
msgstr "            The loud one's Tweedle Dee."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1895:20016: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1895
msgctxt "text_id=20016 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　ダイスを振って、"
msgstr "          They're Ploys, but they transform"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1895:20017: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1895
msgctxt "text_id=20017 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　出た目で変形するカタチが変わるプロイね。"
msgstr "          with the roll of a die."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1926:20018: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1926
msgctxt "text_id=20018 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　人間社会に毒されているから、"
msgstr "      Sadly, human society has poisoned them,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1926:20019: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1926
msgctxt "text_id=20019 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　普通の魔術が効きやすいのが欠点よ。"
msgstr "      so they're susceptible to weak magecraft."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1958:20020: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1958
msgctxt "text_id=20020 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "一の目とか、だしたコトあるッスか？"
msgstr "      You ever rolled a one?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:1989:20021: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1989
msgctxt "text_id=20021 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　わたしじゃ無理みたい。"
msgstr "      No, I can't seem to be able to."

#. Occurrence NZ3:1989:20022: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:1989
msgctxt "text_id=20022 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　子ブタの姿以外、見たこともないもの。"
msgstr "      I've only ever seen them transform into pigs."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2039:20023: voice_id=C20_NZ3_0005; voice_prefix=C20; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2039
msgctxt "text_id=20023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　無理も何も、ご主人様は清純すぎる！"
msgstr "      It's not impossible! You're just too simple!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2039:20024: voice_id=C20_NZ3_0005; voice_prefix=C20; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2039
msgctxt "text_id=20024 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　どんなものにも裏はある、"
msgstr "      There are multiple sides to everything!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2039:20025: voice_id=C20_NZ3_0005; voice_prefix=C20; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2039
msgctxt "text_id=20025 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　僕らは振るにゃあコツがいる！"
msgstr "      You need to roll the die right!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2069:20026: voice_id=C30_NZ3_0005; voice_prefix=C30; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2069
msgctxt "text_id=20026 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　そうそう、時にはダーティーに！"
msgstr "      Exactly! You've got to cheat sometimes!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2069:20027: voice_id=C30_NZ3_0005; voice_prefix=C30; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2069
msgctxt "text_id=20027 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　とかく、この世はイカサマだらけ、"
msgstr "      This world is full of cheaters!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2069:20028: voice_id=C30_NZ3_0005; voice_prefix=C30; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2069
msgctxt "text_id=20028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ズルをしないと六の目以外は出ないが定め！"
msgstr "      No one rolls a six without cheating!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2135:20029: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2135
msgctxt "text_id=20029 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　夜の饗宴が、お皿に乗ってやってきたわね。"
msgstr "      Ah, the evening feast is here."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2166:20030: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2166
msgctxt "text_id=20030 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おなじみの『ディドルディドル』ッスね。"
msgstr "      I know \"Diddle Diddle.\""

#. Occurrence NZ3:2166:20031: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2166
msgctxt "text_id=20031 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ジブンも知ってるッスよ。このマザーグース。"
msgstr "      From Mother Goose, right?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2198:20032: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2198
msgctxt "text_id=20032 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　それだけ有名というコトよ。"
msgstr "      Yeah, it's quite famous."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2229:20033: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2229
msgctxt "text_id=20033 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　『ヘイ、ディドル、ディドル。"
msgstr "          \"Hey diddle diddle,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2229:20034: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2229
msgctxt "text_id=20034 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　　猫とヴァイオリン。"
msgstr "              The cat and the fiddle,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2229:20035: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2229
msgctxt "text_id=20035 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　牛が月を飛び越えた。"
msgstr "            The cow jumped over the moon."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2254:20036: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2254
msgctxt "text_id=20036 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　そのおもしろい光景を見て犬が笑った。"
msgstr "      The little dog laughed to see such sport,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2254:20037: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2254
msgctxt "text_id=20037 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　そしてお皿はスプーンと逃げた。』"
msgstr "        And the dish ran away with the spoon.\""

#. Occurrence NZ3:2285:20038: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2285
msgctxt "text_id=20038 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　典型的な<韻踏み唄|マザーグース>ね。"
msgstr "      It's a typical Mother Goose rhyme."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2285:20039: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2285
msgctxt "text_id=20039 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　真夜中、猫がヴァイオリンをひいて、"
msgstr "      In the middle of the night there's a cat playing a fiddle;"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2310:20040: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2310
msgctxt "text_id=20040 | speaker=alice"
msgid "牛が月を飛び越えて、犬が笑って、"
msgstr "  a dog laughs at a cow jumping over the moon;"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2310:20041: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2310
msgctxt "text_id=20041 | speaker=alice"
msgid "擬人化された皿とスプーンが逃げていくだけの唄。"
msgstr "  and an anthropomorphic plate and spoon run away together."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2336:20042: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2336
msgctxt "text_id=20042 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　一説ではギリシャ・エジプトの神話を元にした……"
msgstr "        Some say it's based on a Greek and Egyptian legend,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2336:20043: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2336
msgctxt "text_id=20043 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　とも言われているわ。星の運営を表しているのなら、"
msgstr "        and that it's talking about the movement of the stars."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2336:20044: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2336
msgctxt "text_id=20044 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　牛は<牡牛座|タウルス>のもじりでしょう。"
msgstr "        The cow most likely represents Taurus."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2367:20045: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0017; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2367
msgctxt "text_id=20045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　これは使い切りのプロイッスね。"
msgstr "      They're one-time-use Ploys, right?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2367:20046: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0017; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2367
msgctxt "text_id=20046 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　一回使ったら壊れるッス。"
msgstr "      One use and they break."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2367:20047: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0017; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2367
msgctxt "text_id=20047 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　アリスさん、そのたびに作ってるッスか？"
msgstr "      D'you make new ones each time, Miss Alice?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2399:20048: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2399
msgctxt "text_id=20048 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　当然でしょう。"
msgstr "  Of course."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2399:20049: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2399
msgctxt "text_id=20049 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　ディドルディドルはわたしの魔術の基本だもの。"
msgstr "  Diddle Diddle forms the basis of my magecraft."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2431:20050: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2431
msgctxt "text_id=20050 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　これを地面に沈めると、夜を助長させるの。"
msgstr "If I place them into the ground they'll deepen the night."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2431:20051: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2431
msgctxt "text_id=20051 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　夜が深まれば、それだけわたしの魔術―――"
msgstr "The deeper the night, the more my magecraft―"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2431:20052: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2431
msgctxt "text_id=20052 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　童話詠唱が確かな意味を持つようになるわ。"
msgstr "rather, the more the fairy tale means."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2458:20053: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2458
msgctxt "text_id=20053 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　詳しくはこう。"
msgstr "        That's all there is to it."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2492:20054: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0018; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2492
msgctxt "text_id=20054 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　わりと使いどころ限定なプロイッスね。"
msgstr "    So Ploys like these only work in certain situations."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2492:20055: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0018; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2492
msgctxt "text_id=20055 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさん、都市部じゃ能力半減っつーか、"
msgstr "    Y'know, you don't function nearly as well in the city."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2492:20056: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0018; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2492
msgctxt "text_id=20056 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　森ガールだったッスか。"
msgstr "    You really are a forest girl at heart."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2541:20057: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0028; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2541
msgctxt "text_id=20057 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　これは「名無しの森」ね。"
msgstr "          These are the \"Nameless Woods.\""

#. Occurrence NZ3:2541:20058: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0028; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2541
msgctxt "text_id=20058 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　これ単体だと意味がないから、"
msgstr "          By itself it doesn't mean anything."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2541:20059: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0028; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2541
msgctxt "text_id=20059 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　<地図|どだい>になるものが必要なのだけど……"
msgstr "          You need a map."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2582:20060: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2582
msgctxt "text_id=20060 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　この「午睡の鏡」とセットで使うものよ。"
msgstr "  You use it with this Mirror of Slumber."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2582:20061: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2582
msgctxt "text_id=20061 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　この鏡は三大プロイにはなれなかったけど、"
msgstr "  This mirror didn't quite become one of the three great Ploys,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2582:20062: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2582
msgctxt "text_id=20062 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　機能的には三大に負けていないわ。"
msgstr "  but it functions just as well."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2615:20063: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0030; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2615
msgctxt "text_id=20063 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　詳しくは、"
msgstr "          More specifically,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2645:20064: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0031; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2645
msgctxt "text_id=20064 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　基本的には三咲市全体の索敵と洋館内の警備。"
msgstr "  it usually scans for enemies across Misaki City and guards the mansion."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2645:20065: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0031; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2645
msgctxt "text_id=20065 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　たまに暴走して洋館内にゲートを作って、"
msgstr "  Unfortunately, sometimes it goes a little haywire and makes a gate"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2645:20066: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0031; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2645
msgctxt "text_id=20066 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　通る人を鏡の中に招いてしまうのが難点ね。"
msgstr "  that beckons people in the mansion inside it."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2676:20067: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0019; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2676
msgctxt "text_id=20067 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ははは。それであのシャバ僧が何度死にかけたか。"
msgstr "  Haha! I bet that dustbin lid almost got killed a few dozen times!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2676:20068: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0019; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2676
msgctxt "text_id=20068 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "原点は鏡の国のアリスっスね。"
msgstr "  From \"Through the Looking-Glass,\" was it?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2708:20069: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0032; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2708
msgctxt "text_id=20069 | speaker=alice"
msgid "そうね。元々は内側に異世界を持つだけの<魔術卵|エンブリオ>で、"
msgstr "  Right. Originally it was just an embryo that held an^  other-realm inside."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2708:20070: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0032; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2708
msgctxt "text_id=20070 | speaker=alice"
msgid "長いこと壊れていたらしいわ。"
msgstr "  It looked like it'd been broken for a long time."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2734:20071: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0033; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2734
msgctxt "text_id=20071 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　それを母と橙子さんが協力して作り直した、"
msgstr "  Touko and my mother both helped"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2734:20072: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0033; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2734
msgctxt "text_id=20072 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　という話よ。"
msgstr "  to repair it."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2765:20073: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0020; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2765
msgctxt "text_id=20073 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "？　なんでそんなコトするッスか？"
msgstr "    Oh? Why'd you need the help?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2765:20074: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0020; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2765
msgctxt "text_id=20074 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "マイ女神だけで十分じゃないッスか。"
msgstr "    Couldn't you do it yourself?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2797:20075: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0034; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2797
msgctxt "text_id=20075 | speaker=alice"
msgid "魔女はその生で一つ、至高のプロイを遺さないとい^けない決まりがあるから。"
msgstr "      A Witch is required to leave behind at least^      one elite Ploy in her lifetime."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2829:20076: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0035; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2829
msgctxt "text_id=20076 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　「彼女はこの鏡を作り直して、"
msgstr "          \"She wanted to repair this mirror;"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2829:20077: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0035; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2829
msgctxt "text_id=20077 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　自分の最高傑作にしたかったのよ、きっと」"
msgstr "          make it her masterpiece,\""

#. Occurrence NZ3:2829:20078: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0035; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2829
msgctxt "text_id=20078 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　そう橙子さんは言っていたけど、どうだか。"
msgstr "          is what Touko always said."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2882:20079: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0036; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2882
msgctxt "text_id=20079 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　どうかしら。こんなふうに午睡の鏡の表面を三咲の地図にして、"
msgstr "  If you make the surface of the mirror a map of Misaki"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2882:20080: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0036; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2882
msgctxt "text_id=20080 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　その上にコマを置くとそこが「名無しの森」になるの。"
msgstr "  and place this piece on it, that area becomes the Nameless Woods."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2932:20081: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0037; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2932
msgctxt "text_id=20081 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　青子のデビュー戦で使っていたのはこのプロイね。"
msgstr "          We used it in Aoko's first battle."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2932:20082: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0037; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2932
msgctxt "text_id=20082 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　このプロイの効果範囲に来ると『この先に用はない』"
msgstr "          Anyone who comes within its range feels compelled"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2932:20083: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0037; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2932
msgctxt "text_id=20083 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　と暗示がかかって人避けになるのだけど……"
msgstr "          to leave, so it's good for keeping people away."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2964:20084: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0021; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2964
msgctxt "text_id=20084 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " 空気読まないヤツには通用しないってコトッスね。"
msgstr "    But it doesn't work on prats!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:2996:20085: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0038; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2996
msgctxt "text_id=20085 | speaker=alice"
msgid "……そうね。"
msgstr "  ...Indeed."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2996:20086: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0038; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2996
msgctxt "text_id=20086 | speaker=alice"
msgid "わたしのミスではないけれど、配慮が足りなかった。"
msgstr "  It's not exactly a mistake; I just didn't even consider that."

#. Occurrence NZ3:2996:20087: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0038; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:2996
msgctxt "text_id=20087 | speaker=alice"
msgid "次からは、本当に気をつけるわ。"
msgstr "  Next time, I won't make the same oversight."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3041:20088: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0039; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3041
msgctxt "text_id=20088 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　気を取り直して、次のプロイは―――"
msgstr "      Anyway, the next Ploy-"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3080:20089: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0022; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3080
msgctxt "text_id=20089 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　ヤフー！"
msgstr "          Woohoo!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3080:20090: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0022; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3080
msgctxt "text_id=20090 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　ジブンでも食べられる玉子ッスー！"
msgstr "          Egg! I can eat egg!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3114:20091: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0023; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3114
msgctxt "text_id=20091 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　うめぇ。玉子うめぇ。"
msgstr "        Oh, wow. This egg is pucker!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3114:20092: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0023; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3114
msgctxt "text_id=20092 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　でも、なんかハラにたまるッスこの玉子。"
msgstr "        Tho' it sits heavy on the butter 'n jelly."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3147:20093: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0024; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3147
msgctxt "text_id=20093 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　消化できないっつーか、"
msgstr "      Like I'm not quite digesting it..."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3147:20094: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0024; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3147
msgctxt "text_id=20094 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんか、体の中心からチクタクチクタク音が"
msgstr "      I dunno, I feel like I can 'ear a pecking noise"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3147:20095: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0024; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3147
msgctxt "text_id=20095 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　するってゆーかぁ。"
msgstr "      coming from inside me body."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3178:20096: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0040; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3178
msgctxt "text_id=20096 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　スリー。"
msgstr "                Three."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3209:20097: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0025; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3209
msgctxt "text_id=20097 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　アリスさん？"
msgstr "      Miss Alice?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3209:20098: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0025; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3209
msgctxt "text_id=20098 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　なんで離れるッスか？"
msgstr "      Why're you backing away?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3240:20099: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0041; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3240
msgctxt "text_id=20099 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　トゥー。"
msgstr "                  Two."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3271:20100: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0026; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3271
msgctxt "text_id=20100 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんで"
msgstr "        Why the"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3271:20101: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0026; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3271
msgctxt "text_id=20101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　“かわいそうだけど、あと一秒で爆発するのよ”"
msgstr "        \"sorry, but you're going to explode\""

#. Occurrence NZ3:3271:20102: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0026; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3271
msgctxt "text_id=20102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　みたいな目で見るッスか？"
msgstr "        expression...?"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3302:20103: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0042; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3302
msgctxt "text_id=20103 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　ワン。"
msgstr "                  One."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3334:20104: voice_id=BA0_NZ3_0027; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3334
msgctxt "text_id=20104 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　タスケテ。"
msgstr "                    Help."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3365:20105: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0043; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3365
msgctxt "text_id=20105 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　ゼロ。"
msgstr "                Zero."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3416:20106: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0044; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3416
msgctxt "text_id=20106 | speaker=alice"
msgid "これはスクラッチ・ダンプティね。"
msgstr "        This Ploy is called Scratch Dumpty."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3416:20107: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0044; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3416
msgctxt "text_id=20107 | speaker=alice"
msgid "マザーグースの唄にあるハンプティ・ダンプティを"
msgstr "        It's based on the old Humpty Dumpty"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3416:20108: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0044; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3416
msgctxt "text_id=20108 | speaker=alice"
msgid "モデルにしたものよ。"
msgstr "        nursery rhyme."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3442:20109: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0045; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3442
msgctxt "text_id=20109 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　“塀に上った卵はあぶなかしくて、"
msgstr "      \"An egg sat precariously on a wall,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3442:20110: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0045; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3442
msgctxt "text_id=20110 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　通りがかった王様が降りろと言っても無視するばかり。"
msgstr "      ignoring the King passing by, who told him to come down."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3468:20111: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0046; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3468
msgctxt "text_id=20111 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　怒った王様は兵士たちに命じたけれど、"
msgstr "  The angry King ordered his men to bring him down,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3468:20112: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0046; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3468
msgctxt "text_id=20112 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　兵士たちでも卵を下ろすコトはできなかった。"
msgstr "  but they couldn't."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3494:20113: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0047; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3494
msgctxt "text_id=20113 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　もう好きにしろ、と疲れた王様は目を離す。"
msgstr "    The King gave up and left the egg to his own devices."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3494:20114: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0047; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3494
msgctxt "text_id=20114 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　そのとたんに卵は落ちて、"
msgstr "    Then, the egg fell,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3494:20115: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0047; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3494
msgctxt "text_id=20115 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　見るも無惨、聞くも痛快に、粉々に砕け散った。"
msgstr "    and tragically cracked into a million pieces."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3520:20116: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0048; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3520
msgctxt "text_id=20116 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　油断も後悔も後のお祭り。"
msgstr "      No matter how hard they tried-"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3520:20117: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0048; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3520
msgctxt "text_id=20117 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　星のような欠片たちは、"
msgstr "      'All the King's horses and all the King's men"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3520:20118: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0048; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3520
msgctxt "text_id=20118 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　王の軍勢をもっても拾いきれない―――”"
msgstr "      couldn't put Humpty together again.'\""

#. Occurrence NZ3:3557:20119: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0049; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3557
msgctxt "text_id=20119 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　壊れた物は直らない、という寓話ね。"
msgstr "Basically, it's a fable saying you can't fix something that's been broken."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3557:20120: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0049; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3557
msgctxt "text_id=20120 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　はた迷惑なお話だけど。"
msgstr "I find it irritating."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3605:20121: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0050; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3605
msgctxt "text_id=20121 | speaker=alice"
msgid "ちなみに、"
msgstr "  By the way,"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3605:20122: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0050; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3605
msgctxt "text_id=20122 | speaker=alice"
msgid "ハンプティが卵型になったのは１９世紀半ばから。"
msgstr "  Humpty only became an egg in the 19th century."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3631:20123: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0051; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3631
msgctxt "text_id=20123 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　１８４３年にアリキスというペンネームで、"
msgstr "    He appeared earlier in a panoramic picture book"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3631:20124: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0051; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3631
msgctxt "text_id=20124 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　マベリー牧師という人がハンプティの"
msgstr "    authored by Samuel Edward Maberly under"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3631:20125: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0051; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3631
msgctxt "text_id=20125 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　パノラマ絵本を書いたのがはしり。"
msgstr "    the pen name Aliquis."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3662:20126: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0052; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3662
msgctxt "text_id=20126 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　ルイスキャロルのハンプティは、"
msgstr "  Lewis Carroll's Humpty was most"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3662:20127: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0052; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3662
msgctxt "text_id=20127 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　それを参考にしたのでしょう。"
msgstr "  likely based on this version."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3761:20128: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0053_0; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3761
msgctxt "text_id=20128 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　 今夜は品切れのようね。"
msgstr "    Looks like they're all sold out."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3767:20129: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0053_1; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3767
msgctxt "text_id=20129 | speaker=alice"
msgid " 　シェフ、オカンジョーをお願い。"
msgstr "    Check, please!"

#. Occurrence NZ3:3921:20130: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0054; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3921
msgctxt "text_id=20130 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　次は―――"
msgstr "  Next time..."

#. Occurrence NZ3:3921:20131: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ3_0054; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ3
#: NZ3:3921
msgctxt "text_id=20131 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　店中の大トロを、残らずいただくわ。"
msgstr "  ...I'm going to eat all the fatty tuna this place has."

#. Occurrence NZ4:126:20132: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:126
msgctxt "text_id=20132 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "おーす、今日もワンワン働いているッスかシャバ僧。"
msgstr "        Hey, working hard as always, lad?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:126:20133: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:126
msgctxt "text_id=20133 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "これで鳥の餌を一ダースくれ。"
msgstr "        Can I get a dozen bags of birdseed?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:126:20134: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:126
msgctxt "text_id=20134 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ヒエかムギの一番いいところを頼む。"
msgstr "        Gimme yer best millet and wheat."

#. Occurrence NZ4:159:20135: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:159
msgctxt "text_id=20135 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　いらっしゃいませ。"
msgstr "    Hello. Welcome."

#. Occurrence NZ4:159:20136: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:159
msgctxt "text_id=20136 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　昼間から買い物なんて、いい身分ねロビン。"
msgstr "    I'm surprised to see you out shopping^    during the day, Robin."

#. Occurrence NZ4:196:20137: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:196
msgctxt "text_id=20137 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　げぇ、アリスさん！？"
msgstr "    Gah! Miss Alice?!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:196:20138: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:196
msgctxt "text_id=20138 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ななな、なんで店員とかしてるッスー！？"
msgstr "    W-w-w-what are you doing working here?!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:196:20139: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:196
msgctxt "text_id=20139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　シャバ僧はどこいったッスか！？"
msgstr "    Where the heck is the kid?!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:227:20140: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:227
msgctxt "text_id=20140 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　トリ頭のクセに細かいコトを気にするのね。"
msgstr "    You sure care a lot about trivial things for a bird brain."

#. Occurrence NZ4:227:20141: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:227
msgctxt "text_id=20141 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　今日はわたしが店番をしているの。"
msgstr "    I'm in charge of the store today."

#. Occurrence NZ4:227:20142: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:227
msgctxt "text_id=20142 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　何か、意見があって？"
msgstr "    Do you have a problem with that?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:258:20143: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:258
msgctxt "text_id=20143 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "いや、ないッスけど。"
msgstr "  No... Of course not."

#. Occurrence NZ4:258:20144: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:258
msgctxt "text_id=20144 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "あ。ピンときたッスよ。さてはアリスさん、"
msgstr "  You fit right in."

#. Occurrence NZ4:258:20145: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:258
msgctxt "text_id=20145 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "シャバ僧と一緒にアルバイトとかスイーツなコ、"
msgstr "  I assume you're here to satisfy your sweet tooth."

#. Occurrence NZ4:295:20146: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:295
msgctxt "text_id=20146 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　なぜなにー、プロイー。"
msgstr "    The Wonderful World of Ploys."

#. Occurrence NZ4:368:20147: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:368
msgctxt "text_id=20147 | speaker=alice"
msgid "今回は比較的安全なプロイキッシャーの紹介よ。"
msgstr "  Today we're going to talk about a relatively safe Ploy."

#. Occurrence NZ4:368:20148: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:368
msgctxt "text_id=20148 | speaker=alice"
msgid "さあロビン。"
msgstr "  Okay, Robin..."

#. Occurrence NZ4:368:20149: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:368
msgctxt "text_id=20149 | speaker=alice"
msgid "好きなものを選びなさい。"
msgstr "  Pick your favorite."

#. Occurrence NZ4:408:20150: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:408
msgctxt "text_id=20150 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ケーキショップかと思ったら、"
msgstr "  Would ya Adam and Eve it?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:408:20151: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:408
msgctxt "text_id=20151 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　プロイキッシャーを売ってる闇市場だった。"
msgstr "  This \"bakery\" is a Ploy Kickshaw black market!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:408:20152: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:408
msgctxt "text_id=20152 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三咲町はホント地獄ッスね。"
msgstr "  Misaki's positively mental."

#. Occurrence NZ4:441:20153: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0004; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:441
msgctxt "text_id=20153 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　じゃあ右端から順にいくッスか。"
msgstr "    Let's go in order from the right."

#. Occurrence NZ4:441:20154: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0004; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:441
msgctxt "text_id=20154 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この宝石箱っぽいヤツは何スか？"
msgstr "    What's this thing 'ere that^    looks like a jewelry box?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:518:20155: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:518
msgctxt "text_id=20155 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　それは６ペンスの歌。"
msgstr "      That's Sixpence."

#. Occurrence NZ4:518:20156: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:518
msgctxt "text_id=20156 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　ジャック・イン・ザ・ボックス、"
msgstr "      It's a jack-in-the-box"

#. Occurrence NZ4:518:20157: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:518
msgctxt "text_id=20157 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　シックス・スィング・チョコレイトよ。"
msgstr "      called Six Sing Chocolates."

#. Occurrence NZ4:582:20158: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:582
msgctxt "text_id=20158 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　地味に見えるけど、役に立つプロイね。"
msgstr "    It looks pretty plain and boring, but it's actually^    quite useful."

#. Occurrence NZ4:582:20159: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:582
msgctxt "text_id=20159 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　どこかの誰かさんとは大違い。"
msgstr "    Unlike some Ploys around here."

#. Occurrence NZ4:631:20160: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:631
msgctxt "text_id=20160 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "あったりまえッス！"
msgstr "      Well, of course!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:631:20161: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:631
msgctxt "text_id=20161 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "鳥はすべて有能かつエレガントな使い魔ッスから。"
msgstr "      A bird's a capable and elegant familiar."

#. Occurrence NZ4:664:20162: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:664
msgctxt "text_id=20162 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　かくいうジブンも"
msgstr "      And that's precisely why"

#. Occurrence NZ4:664:20163: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:664
msgctxt "text_id=20163 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　６ペンスの歌なら知ってるッスよ。"
msgstr "      I know that ol' Sixpence bit."

#. Occurrence NZ4:664:20164: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:664
msgctxt "text_id=20164 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　鳥つながりで。"
msgstr "      Y'know, because of the bird connection."

#. Occurrence NZ4:708:20165: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:708
msgctxt "text_id=20165 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『６ペンスの歌を歌うッス～♪"
msgstr "    \"Sing a song of sixpence,"

#. Occurrence NZ4:708:20166: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:708
msgctxt "text_id=20166 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ポケットにはいっぱいのライ麦ッス～♪"
msgstr "    a pocket full of rye."

#. Occurrence NZ4:708:20167: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:708
msgctxt "text_id=20167 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "24羽の黒ムクドリ～パイの中に焼きこまれた～♪』"
msgstr "    Four and twenty blackbirds, baked in a pie.\""

#. Occurrence NZ4:739:20168: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:739
msgctxt "text_id=20168 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "……むう。"
msgstr "    ...Oh, jeepers."

#. Occurrence NZ4:739:20169: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:739
msgctxt "text_id=20169 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "なぜ意味もなく鳥を虐殺するのか分かんないッス。"
msgstr "    Who'd murder innocent birds for no reason?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:739:20170: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:739
msgctxt "text_id=20170 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "西欧圏の人間どもは鳥をなんだと思っていたのか。"
msgstr "    Don't continentals love a Richard the Third?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:765:20171: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:765
msgctxt "text_id=20171 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　 その後は『お金の勘定をする王さま』"
msgstr "  Anyway, \"The king was in his counting house, counting out"

#. Occurrence NZ4:765:20172: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:765
msgctxt "text_id=20172 | speaker=alice"
msgid " 　『こっそりハチミツかけたパンを食べる王妃』"
msgstr "  his money; The queen was in the parlor, eating bread and"

#. Occurrence NZ4:765:20173: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:765
msgctxt "text_id=20173 | speaker=alice"
msgid " 　といった歌詞が続くわね。"
msgstr "  honey.\" That's the second verse."

#. Occurrence NZ4:791:20174: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:791
msgctxt "text_id=20174 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　二番目以降は"
msgstr "      From that point onward, the song seems"

#. Occurrence NZ4:791:20175: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:791
msgctxt "text_id=20175 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　当時の政治を風刺した唄なんじゃないかしら。"
msgstr "      to turn into a bit of a political satire."

#. Occurrence NZ4:851:20176: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:851
msgctxt "text_id=20176 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "いや、端的に久遠寺邸の日々を表しているッス。"
msgstr "   Dunno. Sounds like a day in the Kuonji mansion"

#. Occurrence NZ4:851:20177: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:851
msgctxt "text_id=20177 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "金勘定するのが王じゃなくて女王な青セーターで、"
msgstr "   to me. It's not a king that's countin' his money,"

#. Occurrence NZ4:851:20178: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:851
msgctxt "text_id=20178 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "こっそり贅沢をするのが王妃じゃなくてアリ"
msgstr "   it's a queen, and she's wearin' a blue sweater."

#. Occurrence NZ4:888:20179: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:888
msgctxt "text_id=20179 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　さよならー、ロビンー。"
msgstr "            Begone, Robin."

#. Occurrence NZ4:975:20180: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:975
msgctxt "text_id=20180 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　次はなに？"
msgstr "            What's next?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1014:20181: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0010_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1014
msgctxt "text_id=20181 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "生きてる？　とか　愛してる？"
msgstr "  Can't you say,"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1014:20182: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0010_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1014
msgctxt "text_id=20182 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "とか、そういうセリフはないッスか。"
msgstr "  \"Are you okay?\" or \"I love you\"?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1020:20183: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0010_1; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1020
msgctxt "text_id=20183 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ないッスね。"
msgstr "  ...Guess not."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1053:20184: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1053
msgctxt "text_id=20184 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "でもジブン的には<無問題|ノープロ>。"
msgstr "        No prob by me."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1053:20185: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1053
msgctxt "text_id=20185 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "アリスさんの虐待もラブのカタ……"
msgstr "        Tough love is still love."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1091:20186: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1091
msgctxt "text_id=20186 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　ん、ぶはははははは！"
msgstr "            Bwahahahahaha!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1160:20187: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1160
msgctxt "text_id=20187 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　なんスかコレ、超ウケルー！"
msgstr "      What the hell's this?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1160:20188: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1160
msgctxt "text_id=20188 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　このでっぷりしたヤツ、超ブサイクなんですけどー！"
msgstr "      Talk about fugly! A face"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1160:20189: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1160
msgctxt "text_id=20189 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　生きてるのが恥ずかしくなるレベルッスー！"
msgstr "      only a mother could love!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1192:20190: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1192
msgctxt "text_id=20190 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　アナタよ。"
msgstr "              That's you."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1226:20191: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0014; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1226
msgctxt "text_id=20191 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　アナタヨ？"
msgstr "                    Me?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1257:20192: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1257
msgctxt "text_id=20192 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　だから、それがアナタの本体。"
msgstr "          Yeah. Your true form."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1257:20193: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1257
msgctxt "text_id=20193 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　ロスト・ロビン・ロンド、とタグには書かれているけど、"
msgstr "          It says Lost Robin Rondo on the tag."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1257:20194: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1257
msgctxt "text_id=20194 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　アナタには勿体ない名称ね。"
msgstr "          The name's wasted on you."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1288:20195: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1288
msgctxt "text_id=20195 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まさにミケランジェロクラスの造形ッス。"
msgstr "        Like it was chiseled by Michelangelo 'imself!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1288:20196: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1288
msgctxt "text_id=20196 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ジブン、店に入った時から、コイツが一番高価で大人気だって"
msgstr "        I knew from the moment I came through the door"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1288:20197: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1288
msgctxt "text_id=20197 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気付いてたッスよ。ほんとほんと。"
msgstr "        that this'd be the treasure of the store! I mean it!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1319:20198: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1319
msgctxt "text_id=20198 | speaker=alice"
msgid "詳細データは必要ないわね。"
msgstr "No detailed info needed for this one."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1319:20199: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1319
msgctxt "text_id=20199 | speaker=alice"
msgid "アナタ、本編で十分すぎるほど出しゃばってるから。"
msgstr "You already got your time in the limelight in the main story."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1350:20200: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1350
msgctxt "text_id=20200 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　元は葬式の歌よ。"
msgstr "    It's based on an old funeral song."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1350:20201: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1350
msgctxt "text_id=20201 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　殺された<駒鳥|ロビン>を巡ってのお話。"
msgstr "    It tells the story of a robin that was killed."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1376:20202: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1376
msgctxt "text_id=20202 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　「誰が？」という問いかけに、"
msgstr "    The song asks, \"Who killed the robin?\""

#. Occurrence NZ4:1376:20203: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1376
msgctxt "text_id=20203 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　「わたしが」と参列者たちが答えていくの。"
msgstr "    The funeralgoers each respond with, \"I did.\""

#. Occurrence NZ4:1376:20204: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1376
msgctxt "text_id=20204 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　犯人捜しの歌でもあるわ。"
msgstr "    It's a song about finding the culprit."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1402:20205: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1402
msgctxt "text_id=20205 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　大ヒットしたマザーグースで、その後、"
msgstr "      It was a hugely popular Mother Goose rhyme,"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1402:20206: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1402
msgctxt "text_id=20206 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　前日譚である「コックロビンとジェニーレンの幸せな求婚」が"
msgstr "      along with \"The Marriage of Cock Robin and Jenny Wren,\""

#. Occurrence NZ4:1402:20207: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1402
msgctxt "text_id=20207 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　出版され、これまたヒット。"
msgstr "      which was a prequel."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1433:20208: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1433
msgctxt "text_id=20208 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　その後、コックロビンの死の後を歌った"
msgstr "    After that, \"The Trial and Execution of the Sparrow for Killing"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1433:20209: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1433
msgctxt "text_id=20209 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　スズメの裁判と処罰も出版。"
msgstr "    Cock Robin\" was published, which follows the trial of the sparrow."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1433:20210: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1433
msgctxt "text_id=20210 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　羨ましいわ。印税だけで大もうけね、ロビン。"
msgstr "    You ought to be making a killing in royalties, Robin. I envy you."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1465:20211: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1465
msgctxt "text_id=20211 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　鳥には一円も入ってこないッスけどね。"
msgstr "      Birds never get a penny."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1496:20212: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0017; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1496
msgctxt "text_id=20212 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　それよりアリスさん、知ってるッスか。"
msgstr "      Anyway, Alice, did you know?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1496:20213: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0017; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1496
msgctxt "text_id=20213 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　駒鳥はイギリスの国鳥ッスよ。"
msgstr "      The robin is the national bird of Britain."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1496:20214: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0017; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1496
msgctxt "text_id=20214 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　クリスマスの象徴でもあるッス。"
msgstr "      And it symbolizes Christmas."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1523:20215: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0018_0; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1523
msgctxt "text_id=20215 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　つまり―――まほよの主役はジブ"
msgstr "      In other words...^      I'm the bona fide hero of Mahoyo-"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1564:20216: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0018_1; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1564
msgctxt "text_id=20216 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "きゃ。"
msgstr "Agh!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1708:20217: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1708
msgctxt "text_id=20217 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　あんまり調子に乗ってると、たいへんよ"
msgstr "          We can't let your ego get too big."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1735:20218: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0019; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1735
msgctxt "text_id=20218 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　 既にこれ以上ないほど大変ッス"
msgstr "      Might be too late for that."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1766:20219: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1766
msgctxt "text_id=20219 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　あとは……ほとんど残り物ね。"
msgstr "          Not much left to talk about."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1766:20220: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1766
msgctxt "text_id=20220 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　とりたてて紹介するほどの物ではないわ。"
msgstr "          Nothing really worth showing off."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1828:20221: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0020; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1828
msgctxt "text_id=20221 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさんアリスさん。"
msgstr "        Alice! Miss Alice!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1828:20222: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0020; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1828
msgctxt "text_id=20222 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　この三つ目のプロイ、なんスか？"
msgstr "        What's this third Ploy 'ere?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1828:20223: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0020; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1828
msgctxt "text_id=20223 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　目……っぽいカタチをしたキャンディ？"
msgstr "        It's a candy that looks like an eye!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1860:20224: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1860
msgctxt "text_id=20224 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　　　目玉よ。"
msgstr "            It's an eyeball."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1894:20225: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0021; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1894
msgctxt "text_id=20225 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　目玉っぽいキャンディ？"
msgstr "  You mean, a candy that looks like one, right?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1925:20226: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1925
msgctxt "text_id=20226 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　本物の目玉よ。"
msgstr "        No, it's an actual eyeball."

#. Occurrence NZ4:1925:20227: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1925
msgctxt "text_id=20227 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　見る？"
msgstr "        Wanna see?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1976:20228: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0022; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1976
msgctxt "text_id=20228 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ピギャーーーー！？"
msgstr "    Gwaaarghhhh!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:1976:20229: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0022; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1976
msgctxt "text_id=20229 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさんの左目、義眼だったッスか！？"
msgstr "    Your left eye's made of glass?!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2007:20230: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2007
msgctxt "text_id=20230 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　……そういう訳ではないのだけど。"
msgstr "      That's not what I meant."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2007:20231: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2007
msgctxt "text_id=20231 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　わたしの左目もプロイ扱いなだけよ。"
msgstr "      It's used like a Ploy."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2072:20232: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0023; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2072
msgctxt "text_id=20232 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　？　アクロスティック化って、なんスか？"
msgstr "      Oi, what's 'acrostic' mean?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2103:20233: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2103
msgctxt "text_id=20233 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　一つの言葉にたくさんの意味を持たせる事よ。"
msgstr "  Words have many meanings."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2103:20234: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2103
msgctxt "text_id=20234 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　ルイス・キャロルが提示した「鞄語」と同じね。"
msgstr "  Like the many portmanteaus Lewis Carroll used."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2129:20235: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2129
msgctxt "text_id=20235 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　鏡の国でアリスはハンプティにこう質問したの。"
msgstr "  In Through the Looking Glass, Alice asks Humpty,"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2129:20236: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2129
msgctxt "text_id=20236 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　「しなぬるストーブってどういう意味？」"
msgstr "  \"What does the word 'slithy' mean?\""

#. Occurrence NZ4:2160:20237: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2160
msgctxt "text_id=20237 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　ハンプティは答えたわ。"
msgstr "  To which Humpty replied, \"well,"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2160:20238: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2160
msgctxt "text_id=20238 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　「うむ。それはな、しなやかでぬるやかという意味だ」"
msgstr "  'slithy' means 'lithe and slimy.'\""

#. Occurrence NZ4:2191:20239: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2191
msgctxt "text_id=20239 | speaker=alice"
msgid "……分かって？"
msgstr "  ...Got it? "

#. Occurrence NZ4:2191:20240: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2191
msgctxt "text_id=20240 | speaker=alice"
msgid "ようは、異なる二つの意味を新しい「言葉」として"
msgstr "  When you acrostify Mystic Eyes, you change the"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2191:20241: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2191
msgctxt "text_id=20241 | speaker=alice"
msgid "生み出すルール変更。それが魔眼のアクロ化よ。"
msgstr "  rules by mixing meanings to form a new \"word.\""

#. Occurrence NZ4:2222:20242: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2222
msgctxt "text_id=20242 | speaker=alice"
msgid "別にハンプティがモデルという訳ではないのだけど、"
msgstr "    I'm not saying the concept is entirely based^    around Humpty Dumpty;"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2222:20243: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2222
msgctxt "text_id=20243 | speaker=alice"
msgid "彼女はハンプティにちなんだ名前をつけたのね。"
msgstr "    she just gave it a name referencing his idea."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2284:20244: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0024; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2284
msgctxt "text_id=20244 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふーん。ただの思いつきなんスけど、"
msgstr "      Brilliant. This is just a random question,"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2284:20245: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0024; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2284
msgctxt "text_id=20245 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　「初回限定版」と「通常版」をくっつけると"
msgstr "      but what would happen if you combined"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2284:20246: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0024; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2284
msgctxt "text_id=20246 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうなるッスか？"
msgstr "      'limited first edition' and 'standard edition?'"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2315:20247: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2315
msgctxt "text_id=20247 | speaker=alice"
msgid "そうね。その二つを合わせた場合、"
msgstr "Hmm, if you did that, you'd have a"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2315:20248: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2315
msgctxt "text_id=20248 | speaker=alice"
msgid "初回特典付きのアイテムが永遠に"
msgstr "product with the first-edition bonuses"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2315:20249: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2315
msgctxt "text_id=20249 | speaker=alice"
msgid "市場に残り続けるでしょう。"
msgstr "that would stay on the market forever."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2346:20250: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0025; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2346
msgctxt "text_id=20250 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ぶはは！"
msgstr "      Bwahaha! So the new phrase would be"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2346:20251: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0025; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2346
msgctxt "text_id=20251 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "その場合、新しい言葉は「初回限定普及版」ッスね！"
msgstr "      \"special first standard edition!\""

#. Occurrence NZ4:2379:20252: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0028; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2379
msgctxt "text_id=20252 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　違うわ。「ワゴン行き」よ。"
msgstr "      No. You'd get \"bargain bin.\""

#. Occurrence NZ4:2411:20253: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0026; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2411
msgctxt "text_id=20253 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　　げ。"
msgstr "                  Ack!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2478:20254: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2478
msgctxt "text_id=20254 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　……コホン。"
msgstr "      Ahem."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2478:20255: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2478
msgctxt "text_id=20255 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　このように、使い処が難しいプロイなの。"
msgstr "      As you can see, it's a tricky Ploy to use."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2478:20256: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2478
msgctxt "text_id=20256 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　今後は気をつけるわ。"
msgstr "      I'll be more careful in the future."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2517:20257: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0027; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2517
msgctxt "text_id=20257 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "次は……ああ、これっスか。"
msgstr "  Let's see... Next we have... Ah, this one."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2517:20258: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0027; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2517
msgctxt "text_id=20258 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "コイツについては番外編で語るんで、パスっスね。"
msgstr "  Nah, let's save this for another cockney rhyme."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2561:20259: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0028; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2561
msgctxt "text_id=20259 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　次は―――なんスか、これ？"
msgstr "      What about... this one?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2592:20260: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0030; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2592
msgctxt "text_id=20260 | speaker=alice"
msgid "……ただの失敗品よ。"
msgstr "    ...Just a failed creation."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2592:20261: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0030; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2592
msgctxt "text_id=20261 | speaker=alice"
msgid "わたしの最初のプロイ。"
msgstr "    My first Ploy ever. It doesn't have any real use."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2592:20262: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0030; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2592
msgctxt "text_id=20262 | speaker=alice"
msgid "使い道はないのだけど、記念として飾っているの。"
msgstr "    I've just held on to it for sentimental value."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2653:20263: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0031; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2653
msgctxt "text_id=20263 | speaker=alice"
msgid "この通り、魔術戦には使えないわ。"
msgstr "  As you can see, it's not useful in mage battles."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2653:20264: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0031; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2653
msgctxt "text_id=20264 | speaker=alice"
msgid "カタチもよくないから見せる物でもないのだけど……こういうのは、思い出だから。"
msgstr "  It doesn't look very nice either. Still, sentimental value, right?"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2711:20265: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0029; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2711
msgctxt "text_id=20265 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ブローチのカタチをした砂糖細工なんスねー。"
msgstr "      This confectionery's shaped like a brooch."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2711:20266: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0029; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2711
msgctxt "text_id=20266 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うは、あめぇー！"
msgstr "      Wow, it's so sweet!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2711:20267: voice_id=BA0_NZ4_0029; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2711
msgctxt "text_id=20267 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アリスさんの手作りキャンディ、あめぇー！"
msgstr "      You make the best sweets!"

#. Occurrence NZ4:2787:20268: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0032; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2787
msgctxt "text_id=20268 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　そろそろ終業時間ね。"
msgstr "    That wraps up today's lesson."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2787:20269: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0032; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2787
msgctxt "text_id=20269 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　わたしは先に帰っているから、"
msgstr "    I'm heading home."

#. Occurrence NZ4:2787:20270: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0032; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:2787
msgctxt "text_id=20270 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　後片づけをやっておいて。"
msgstr "    You can clean up."

#. Occurrence NZ5:97:20271: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:97
msgctxt "text_id=20271 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふう。この蒼天に浮かれて、"
msgstr "    Whew. What a way to start,"

#. Occurrence NZ5:97:20272: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:97
msgctxt "text_id=20272 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ついタイトルコールを叫んでしまったッス。"
msgstr "    under a bright, blue sky."

#. Occurrence NZ5:128:20273: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:128
msgctxt "text_id=20273 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　しかし、指定場所に来たもののアリスさんの姿はなし。"
msgstr "  Though it don't look like Miss Alice's here yet."

#. Occurrence NZ5:128:20274: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:128
msgctxt "text_id=20274 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　時間と場所はあってるハズなんスけどー。"
msgstr "  Pretty sure I got the right time and place."

#. Occurrence NZ5:128:20275: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:128
msgctxt "text_id=20275 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　もう一回タイトルコール、してみるッスか。"
msgstr "  Maybe I should get a start and save some face."

#. Occurrence NZ5:154:20276: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:154
msgctxt "text_id=20276 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　いいえ。その必要はないわ。"
msgstr "    No, that won't be necessary."

#. Occurrence NZ5:154:20277: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:154
msgctxt "text_id=20277 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　わたしは昨日からビバーク中なのだから。"
msgstr "    I've been camping out here since yesterday."

#. Occurrence NZ5:197:20278: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:197
msgctxt "text_id=20278 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アリスさん！？"
msgstr "      Miss Alice?!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:197:20279: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:197
msgctxt "text_id=20279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ギャハハ、なんスかその完全装備wwwww"
msgstr "      Bwahaha! Talk about over-prepared LOL"

#. Occurrence NZ5:197:20280: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:197
msgctxt "text_id=20280 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ファッションから入る、なんちゃって登山家"
msgstr "      You're taking this way too seriously!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:264:20281: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:264
msgctxt "text_id=20281 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　アマチュアバード！"
msgstr "      Spoken like a true amateur!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:307:20282: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:307
msgctxt "text_id=20282 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　ぴっける！？"
msgstr "                  Gah!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:342:20283: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:342
msgctxt "text_id=20283 | speaker=alice"
msgid "山を甘く見ないことよ。"
msgstr "    Never underestimate mountain climbing."

#. Occurrence NZ5:342:20284: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:342
msgctxt "text_id=20284 | speaker=alice"
msgid "渡り鳥が山越えをする時、何割かは越えられずに脱落死する話を知らないのかしら。"
msgstr "    Some migrating birds die trying to make it over the mountains,^    did you know?"

#. Occurrence NZ5:368:20285: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:368
msgctxt "text_id=20285 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　油断すれば即デッド。"
msgstr "        Stay prepared, or die."

#. Occurrence NZ5:368:20286: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:368
msgctxt "text_id=20286 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　隙あらば是キリング。"
msgstr "        The mountain knows no mercy."

#. Occurrence NZ5:368:20287: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:368
msgctxt "text_id=20287 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　それが、神々の住まう<頂|いただき>への礼儀と知りなさい。"
msgstr "        Disrespect the gods here at your peril."

#. Occurrence NZ5:395:20288: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0004; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:395
msgctxt "text_id=20288 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "つまり、いつもと何も変わらないってコトッスね。"
msgstr "          Yep, you're chicken jalfrezi as ever."

#. Occurrence NZ5:430:20289: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:430
msgctxt "text_id=20289 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　繰り返すわ。"
msgstr "    I'll say it again."

#. Occurrence NZ5:430:20290: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:430
msgctxt "text_id=20290 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　山とわたしを甘く見ないで。"
msgstr "    Do not underestimate me or the mountain."

#. Occurrence NZ5:430:20291: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:430
msgctxt "text_id=20291 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　今日はいつもの二倍はやる気に満ちている。"
msgstr "    I'm twice as prepared today than I am normally."

#. Occurrence NZ5:463:20292: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:463
msgctxt "text_id=20292 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やっべぇー。"
msgstr "        Crikey."

#. Occurrence NZ5:463:20293: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:463
msgctxt "text_id=20293 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんかスイッチ入ってるッスー。"
msgstr "        You're really into it, eh?"

#. Occurrence NZ5:498:20294: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:498
msgctxt "text_id=20294 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　さあ、なぜなにプロイの時間よ、ロビン。"
msgstr "  Anyway, Robin, it's time for \"The Wonderful World of Ploys\" again."

#. Occurrence NZ5:498:20295: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:498
msgctxt "text_id=20295 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　今日は気分がいいから、"
msgstr "  And since I'm in such a good mood today,"

#. Occurrence NZ5:498:20296: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:498
msgctxt "text_id=20296 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　取っておきの話をするとしましょう。"
msgstr "  I'll talk about something very special I've been saving."

#. Occurrence NZ5:529:20297: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:529
msgctxt "text_id=20297 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　あー、ついにきたッスね。"
msgstr "          Yeah! That's what I'm talking about!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:529:20298: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:529
msgctxt "text_id=20298 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　三大プロイ、グレートスリーについて。"
msgstr "          The Great Three Ploys!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:560:20299: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:560
msgctxt "text_id=20299 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　アリスさんの母上の、そのまた母上の、"
msgstr "      Your mum's... mum's..."

#. Occurrence NZ5:560:20300: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:560
msgctxt "text_id=20300 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　そのまた母上の……とにかく初代ッスね。"
msgstr "      ...mum's... mum's... Whatever! The first generation!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:560:20301: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:560
msgctxt "text_id=20301 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　初代の頃から伝わってきた、三つの奇跡。"
msgstr "      Three miracles passed down from the first generation."

#. Occurrence NZ5:591:20302: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:591
msgctxt "text_id=20302 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが三大プロイ。"
msgstr "    That's what we're talkin' about, right?"

#. Occurrence NZ5:591:20303: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:591
msgctxt "text_id=20303 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　初めの魔女が造ったとされる、偉大な三品。"
msgstr "    Three masterpieces forged by the First Witch."

#. Occurrence NZ5:622:20304: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:622
msgctxt "text_id=20304 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　橋の巨人テムズトロル、"
msgstr "          The Thames Troll: the Bridge Giant."

#. Occurrence NZ5:622:20305: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:622
msgctxt "text_id=20305 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　月の油フラットスナーク、"
msgstr "          Flat Snark: Oil of the Moon."

#. Occurrence NZ5:622:20306: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:622
msgctxt "text_id=20306 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　三つ目は……あれ、何だったっス？"
msgstr "          And... er, what's the third one...?"

#. Occurrence NZ5:653:20307: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:653
msgctxt "text_id=20307 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　最後の一体はまだ秘密よ。"
msgstr "    That's still a secret."

#. Occurrence NZ5:653:20308: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:653
msgctxt "text_id=20308 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　今回はテムズの話をしましょう。"
msgstr "    This time I'll talk about Thames."

#. Occurrence NZ5:696:20309: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:696
msgctxt "text_id=20309 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　もとになったマザーグースはロンドン橋。"
msgstr "    It's based on the Mother Goose nursery rhyme \"London Bridge.\""

#. Occurrence NZ5:696:20310: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:696
msgctxt "text_id=20310 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　『ロンドン橋　落ちた　落ちた　落ちた"
msgstr "    \"London Bridge is broken down, broken down, broken down,"

#. Occurrence NZ5:696:20311: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:696
msgctxt "text_id=20311 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　ロンドン橋　落ちた　<わたしのきれいなご婦人よ|マ　イ　フ　ェ　ア　レ　デ　ィ >』"
msgstr "    London Bridge is broken down, my fair lady.\""

#. Occurrence NZ5:722:20312: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:722
msgctxt "text_id=20312 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　日本語訳されて音楽の教材にもなっているから、"
msgstr "  Kids often sing this one in school,"

#. Occurrence NZ5:722:20313: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:722
msgctxt "text_id=20313 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　知っている人も多いでしょうね。"
msgstr "  so it's pretty well known."

#. Occurrence NZ5:753:20314: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0010; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:753
msgctxt "text_id=20314 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　別名、デオチトロルッスー！"
msgstr "  Also known as the \"Great, But Now What? Troll!\""

#. Occurrence NZ5:753:20315: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0010; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:753
msgctxt "text_id=20315 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こいつ、ザコ相手にしか活躍してないッスよね！"
msgstr "  Only useful against the most trivial of trivial enemies!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:784:20316: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:784
msgctxt "text_id=20316 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　……相手が悪かったのよ。"
msgstr "      No, it just needs to be used against the right"

#. Occurrence NZ5:784:20317: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:784
msgctxt "text_id=20317 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　それに、わたしとの相性も悪いし。"
msgstr "      enemy. And honestly, I'm not so compatible"

#. Occurrence NZ5:784:20318: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:784
msgctxt "text_id=20318 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　実はわたし、テムズをうまく使えないの。"
msgstr "      with it. I have a hard time using Thames."

#. Occurrence NZ5:810:20319: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:810
msgctxt "text_id=20319 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　わたしが顕現させられるのは二段階目まで。"
msgstr "    I can only manifest him up to his second form."

#. Occurrence NZ5:810:20320: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:810
msgctxt "text_id=20320 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　三番目と四番目の歌詞は未知の領域よ。"
msgstr "    I don't know the lyrics to his third and fourth."

#. Occurrence NZ5:842:20321: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:842
msgctxt "text_id=20321 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三番目と四番目って、なんスか？"
msgstr "      What're you talking about?"

#. Occurrence NZ5:874:20322: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:874
msgctxt "text_id=20322 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　ロンドン橋の歌詞よ。"
msgstr "      The lyrics to London Bridge."

#. Occurrence NZ5:900:20323: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:900
msgctxt "text_id=20323 | speaker=alice"
msgid "『～木と土は流される"
msgstr "  \"Wood and clay will wash away,"

#. Occurrence NZ5:900:20324: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:900
msgctxt "text_id=20324 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　～煉瓦とモルタルは崩れてしまう』"
msgstr "   bricks and mortar will not stay.\""

#. Occurrence NZ5:926:20325: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:926
msgctxt "text_id=20325 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　『～鉄と鋼は折れ曲がる"
msgstr "  \"Iron and steel will bend and bow,"

#. Occurrence NZ5:926:20326: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:926
msgctxt "text_id=20326 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　～銀と金は盗まれる』"
msgstr "   silver and gold will be stolen away.\""

#. Occurrence NZ5:957:20327: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:957
msgctxt "text_id=20327 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　テムズはロンドン橋のプロイだけど、"
msgstr "        Thames is a Ploy based on London Bridge,"

#. Occurrence NZ5:957:20328: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:957
msgctxt "text_id=20328 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　時代に添ってその在り方を変えてきた。"
msgstr "        but he's changed throughout the ages."

#. Occurrence NZ5:957:20329: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:957
msgctxt "text_id=20329 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　だから、今はマザーグース通り四種類の姿があるの。"
msgstr "        He has four different forms based on the nursery rhyme."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1005:20330: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1005
msgctxt "text_id=20330 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ウッド、ストーンの他にまだ先があるんスね。"
msgstr "        Wood, stone, and then two others."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1005:20331: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1005
msgctxt "text_id=20331 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　でもいいんスか、"
msgstr "        Are you sure you want to be givin'"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1005:20332: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1005
msgctxt "text_id=20332 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんなカンタンに奥の手をさらしちゃって？"
msgstr "        away secret information like that?"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1036:20333: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1036
msgctxt "text_id=20333 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　ええ。ロンドン橋の歌詞なんて、"
msgstr "        It's fine. These days anyone can look up the lyrics"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1036:20334: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1036
msgctxt "text_id=20334 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　いまどき調べれば誰だって分かるのだし。"
msgstr "        to London Bridge and find them out for themselves."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1062:20335: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1062
msgctxt "text_id=20335 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　 そもそもわたし、"
msgstr "     And besides,"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1062:20336: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1062
msgctxt "text_id=20336 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　 どうあってもストーンまでしか使えないわ。"
msgstr "     the best I can do is use his stone form."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1062:20337: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1062
msgctxt "text_id=20337 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　 ネタをバラしても支障はないでしょう？"
msgstr "     So it isn't really a problem if people find out."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1094:20338: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1094
msgctxt "text_id=20338 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　どうして使えないんスか？"
msgstr "    Why can't you use the others?"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1125:20339: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1125
msgctxt "text_id=20339 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　わたし、人間の文明社会に興味がないもの。"
msgstr "      I'm just not interested in human civilization."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1125:20340: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1125
msgctxt "text_id=20340 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　わたしの心象世界にある橋は『木と石まで』、というコトね。"
msgstr "      In my mind, the bridge only goes up to wood and stone."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1156:20341: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0014; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1156
msgctxt "text_id=20341 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんと。"
msgstr "      What? You mean to tell me the invincible"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1156:20342: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0014; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1156
msgctxt "text_id=20342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無敵のアリスさんにも弱点があったんスね……"
msgstr "      Alice actually 'as a weakness?"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1188:20343: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1188
msgctxt "text_id=20343 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " あ。いや、振り返ってみればそんなに"
msgstr "Erm. Actually, now that I think about it,"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1188:20344: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1188
msgctxt "text_id=20344 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " 無敵じゃなかったッスね！　アリスさん、負け星のが多いッス、"
msgstr "you've lost a great hopping pot of times! So much for the invincible!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1188:20345: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1188
msgctxt "text_id=20345 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " ジブンとおそろッスー！"
msgstr "Not that I'm one to talk!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1225:20346: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1225
msgctxt "text_id=20346 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "でも、風の噂によるとテムズトロルは"
msgstr "      Rumor has it the Thames Troll"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1225:20347: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1225
msgctxt "text_id=20347 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "世界屈指のゴーレムと聞いたッスよ。"
msgstr "      is the strongest golem in the world."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1225:20348: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1225
msgctxt "text_id=20348 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "最高級のテムズトロルはどれくらい強いんスか？"
msgstr "      'Ow strong would it be at its max power?"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1256:20349: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1256
msgctxt "text_id=20349 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　そうね。テムズを最後まで建築できる魔女が、"
msgstr "      Well, if there was a witch alive today"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1256:20350: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1256
msgctxt "text_id=20350 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　もし現代にいるのなら―――"
msgstr "      who could take Thames to his final form..."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1282:20351: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1282
msgctxt "text_id=20351 | speaker=alice"
msgid " そのテムズは奥の手を出しきった青子でも"
msgstr "    Then even Aoko wouldn't be able to defeat it"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1282:20352: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1282
msgctxt "text_id=20352 | speaker=alice"
msgid " 倒しきれない、踏破不可能の橋になるでしょうね。"
msgstr "    using her most powerful abilities."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1313:20353: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1313
msgctxt "text_id=20353 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　産業革命時の<煤煙|スモッグ>都市、ロンドン。"
msgstr "You know London, the smoggy heart of the Industrial Revolution."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1313:20354: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1313
msgctxt "text_id=20354 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　その異名を上回る、都市の巨人として顕現するのだから。"
msgstr "Thames would overshadow even that."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1344:20355: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0017; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1344
msgctxt "text_id=20355 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ハハハ、また大きく出たッスね！"
msgstr "      Hahaha, wowser!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1344:20356: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0017; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1344
msgctxt "text_id=20356 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　都市！　都市っスか！"
msgstr "      A whole city?! Blimey!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1344:20357: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0017; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1344
msgctxt "text_id=20357 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　口だけならなんとでも言えるってヤツッス？"
msgstr "      Is that true, or are you just sayin' that?"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1370:20358: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0018; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1370
msgctxt "text_id=20358 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "アリスさん、その見栄っ張りで負けず嫌いなところ、"
msgstr "    You really need to cut the showin' off, Alice."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1370:20359: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0018; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1370
msgctxt "text_id=20359 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "直した方がいいッスよ。"
msgstr "    Take this is as 'eartfelt advice from your"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1370:20360: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0018; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1370
msgctxt "text_id=20360 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "親愛なるプロイからの、涙の忠告ッス！"
msgstr "    most beloved Ploy!"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1401:20361: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1401
msgctxt "text_id=20361 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　ありがとう。"
msgstr "      Most appreciated."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1401:20362: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1401
msgctxt "text_id=20362 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　それじゃあさっそく、"
msgstr "      Well, if I'm going to improve,"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1401:20363: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1401
msgctxt "text_id=20363 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　性格改善に付き合ってもらおうかしら。"
msgstr "      I should start by backing up my statements."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1432:20364: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0022_0; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1432
msgctxt "text_id=20364 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　まずは、“口だけなら”というところから。"
msgstr "    You can help me."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1443:20365: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0022_1; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1443
msgctxt "text_id=20365 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　出番よテムズ。"
msgstr "    Thames, get out here."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1443:20366: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0022_1; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1443
msgctxt "text_id=20366 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　アナタの力を見せてあげなさい。"
msgstr "    Show this bird what you can do."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1513:20367: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0019; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1513
msgctxt "text_id=20367 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　デオチ出たーーーーーー！"
msgstr "    Oh sure, as if this thing could do anything to-"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1513:20368: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0019; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1513
msgctxt "text_id=20368 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　というか、すでにデオチの体の上だったッス？"
msgstr "    Wait a tick... You look stronger than usual."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1513:20369: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0019; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1513
msgctxt "text_id=20369 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　初めからジブンに逃げ場はなかったッス？"
msgstr "    And I've got nowhere to escape."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1539:20370: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1539
msgctxt "text_id=20370 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　そうよ。だから言ったでしょう。"
msgstr "    Remember what I said?"

#. Occurrence NZ5:1539:20371: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ5_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1539
msgctxt "text_id=20371 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　山を舐めるな、と。"
msgstr "    The mountain knows no mercy."

#. Occurrence NZ5:1571:20372: voice_id=BA0_NZ5_0020; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ5
#: NZ5:1571
msgctxt "text_id=20372 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、そういう意味じゃなかった気がするッス。"
msgstr "      Didn't fink you meant THIS!"

#. Occurrence NZ6:162:20373: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:162
msgctxt "text_id=20373 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　この映画、字幕が出てないッスね。"
msgstr "  This movie doesn't have subtitles."

#. Occurrence NZ6:162:20374: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:162
msgctxt "text_id=20374 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　ジブン、ちゃんとセリフあるんスけどー。"
msgstr "  But I actually have lines!"

#. Occurrence NZ6:196:20375: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:196
msgctxt "text_id=20375 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　知ってるわ。"
msgstr "          I know."

#. Occurrence NZ6:196:20376: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:196
msgctxt "text_id=20376 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　でも耳障りだったから、わたし権限で編集さんに"
msgstr "          I found them annoying, so I spoke with the editor,"

#. Occurrence NZ6:196:20377: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:196
msgctxt "text_id=20377 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　　貴方の台詞だけカットしてもらったの。"
msgstr "          and had them cut."

#. Occurrence NZ6:222:20378: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:222
msgctxt "text_id=20378 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " グレイト。もう何もかもアリスさん中心なんスね。"
msgstr "        Great! As always, we're gonna telecom tower you^        with praise, Miss Alice!"

#. Occurrence NZ6:222:20379: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:222
msgctxt "text_id=20379 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " ジブンだけサイレント映画の気分ッス。"
msgstr "        So I'm the only one actin' in a silent flick."

#. Occurrence NZ6:286:20380: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0002; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:286
msgctxt "text_id=20380 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　二体目ッスね。"
msgstr "    This is the second one, right?"

#. Occurrence NZ6:312:20381: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:312
msgctxt "text_id=20381 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　二体目ね。"
msgstr "    Yep."

#. Occurrence NZ6:312:20382: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:312
msgctxt "text_id=20382 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　誤解されそうだから言っておくと、スナークの本体は液体よ。"
msgstr "    Just so everyone knows, Snark's body is liquid."

#. Occurrence NZ6:338:20383: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:338
msgctxt "text_id=20383 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　スナークの二つ名、月の油ッスね。"
msgstr "    That's why some call 'im the \"Oil of the Moon.\""

#. Occurrence NZ6:338:20384: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0003; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:338
msgctxt "text_id=20384 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　フラットスナークの名前は誰が付けたんスか？"
msgstr "    Who gave him the name \"Flat Snark\" anyway?"

#. Occurrence NZ6:403:20385: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:403
msgctxt "text_id=20385 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　アナタもよく知っている彼女だけど。"
msgstr "    Someone you know well."

#. Occurrence NZ6:403:20386: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:403
msgctxt "text_id=20386 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　わたし、彼女と仲良くなるまで、プロイに名前を"
msgstr "    Before I met her,"

#. Occurrence NZ6:403:20387: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:403
msgctxt "text_id=20387 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　つけていなかったから。"
msgstr "    I never gave my Ploys names."

#. Occurrence NZ6:429:20388: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:429
msgctxt "text_id=20388 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　強い順とか、思い入れがある順に、"
msgstr "      I just called them number one, number two, and so on,"

#. Occurrence NZ6:429:20389: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:429
msgctxt "text_id=20389 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　一番、二番、と呼んでいただけだったの。"
msgstr "      based on strength, importance, or whatever I felt like."

#. Occurrence NZ6:498:20390: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0004; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:498
msgctxt "text_id=20390 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　順番？　番号じゃなくて？"
msgstr "  You actually ordered 'em?"

#. Occurrence NZ6:498:20391: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0004; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:498
msgctxt "text_id=20391 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　名前をつけないぐうたら……"
msgstr "  Kinda lazy not giving 'em a name."

#. Occurrence NZ6:498:20392: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0004; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:498
msgctxt "text_id=20392 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、シンプルさはアリスさんらしいッスけど、なんで順番？"
msgstr "  Then again, makes sense to keep it simple. But why so orderly?"

#. Occurrence NZ6:524:20393: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:524
msgctxt "text_id=20393 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　だって、番号を付けても混乱するだけでしょう？"
msgstr "    If I gave them random numbers, that'd be confusing."

#. Occurrence NZ6:524:20394: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:524
msgctxt "text_id=20394 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　どれが強いか、どれが好きかなんて、日によって変わるのだし。"
msgstr "    Which one's strongest and which one I like most depends^    on my mood."

#. Occurrence NZ6:550:20395: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:550
msgctxt "text_id=20395 | speaker=alice"
msgid "だから気持ち次第で、その日ごとに順番は違ったわ。"
msgstr "    I'd change the order based on how I felt."

#. Occurrence NZ6:550:20396: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:550
msgctxt "text_id=20396 | speaker=alice"
msgid "一番はディドルが鉄板。"
msgstr "    Diddle Diddle was always number one, though."

#. Occurrence NZ6:550:20397: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:550
msgctxt "text_id=20397 | speaker=alice"
msgid "テムズはたいてい三番か四番だったわね。"
msgstr "    Thames would usually be three or four."

#. Occurrence NZ6:614:20398: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:614
msgctxt "text_id=20398 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　ああ、思いだした。"
msgstr "    Oh, I just remembered."

#. Occurrence NZ6:614:20399: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:614
msgctxt "text_id=20399 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　彼女とプロイで遊んでいる時、"
msgstr "    When playing with her and the Ploys,"

#. Occurrence NZ6:614:20400: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:614
msgctxt "text_id=20400 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　それで困ったコトになって。"
msgstr "    my numbering system did cause a problem."

#. Occurrence NZ6:684:20401: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B81_NZ6_0000; voice_prefix=B81; voice_category=13; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:684
msgctxt "text_id=20401 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「アリス、明日、新しいパパがやってくるの。"
msgstr "\"Alice, my new daddy's coming tomorrow."

#. Occurrence NZ6:684:20402: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B81_NZ6_0000; voice_prefix=B81; voice_category=13; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:684
msgctxt "text_id=20402 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　だから六番のプロイを貸してちょうだい。"
msgstr " Can I borrow the sixth Ploy?"

#. Occurrence NZ6:684:20403: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B81_NZ6_0000; voice_prefix=B81; voice_category=13; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:684
msgctxt "text_id=20403 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　ワタシ、おめかしして出迎えたいの！」"
msgstr " I really want to impress him!\""

#. Occurrence NZ6:753:20404: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:753
msgctxt "text_id=20404 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　そう言った彼女に、わたし、その日は気分的に"
msgstr "        So, I let her borrow what I'd decided"

#. Occurrence NZ6:753:20405: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:753
msgctxt "text_id=20405 | speaker=alice"
msgid " 「これは六番目」と決めていたプロイを貸したわ。"
msgstr "        was my sixth favorite Ploy that day."

#. Occurrence NZ6:824:20406: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:824
msgctxt "text_id=20406 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　 ……。"
msgstr "      ..."

#. Occurrence NZ6:824:20407: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:824
msgctxt "text_id=20407 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もうだいたい分かったッスけど、いちおう訊いておくッス。"
msgstr "      I fink I know where this is going, but I'll bite."

#. Occurrence NZ6:824:20408: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0005; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:824
msgctxt "text_id=20408 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはなんのプロイだったっスか？"
msgstr "      What Ploy was it?"

#. Occurrence NZ6:855:20409: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:855
msgctxt "text_id=20409 | speaker=alice"
msgid "後に、彼女がゴブリンフロンと名付けるようになった香水よ。"
msgstr "It was a perfume she later called \"Goblin Fron.\""

#. Occurrence NZ6:855:20410: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:855
msgctxt "text_id=20410 | speaker=alice"
msgid "その香水をかけると、一日、悪口とスラングしか言えなくなるの。"
msgstr "Once you put it on, you can only speak in curse words and slang for an entire day."

#. Occurrence NZ6:887:20411: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0006; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:887
msgctxt "text_id=20411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　……………………。"
msgstr "                    ..."

#. Occurrence NZ6:918:20412: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:918
msgctxt "text_id=20412 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　その後、彼女はプロイに名前を付けるよう提案してきたわ。"
msgstr "      That's when she came up with the idea of naming Ploys."

#. Occurrence NZ6:918:20413: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:918
msgctxt "text_id=20413 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　なぜか涙で赤くなった目で。"
msgstr "      For some reason she looked like she had been crying."

#. Occurrence NZ6:949:20414: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:949
msgctxt "text_id=20414 | speaker=alice"
msgid "『これはスイーツハーツ。これはスクリプス・ハンプティ。これはディドルディドル。これはフラットスナーク。いい。これからはこの名前で統一するのよ』"
msgstr "        \"This one's Sweets Hearts. This is Scripps Humpty.^        This is Diddle Diddle. This is Flat Snark.^        Those are their names from now on, okay?\""

#. Occurrence NZ6:980:20415: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:980
msgctxt "text_id=20415 | speaker=alice"
msgid "……名は体を表すと言うでしょう？"
msgstr "    They say that a name defines you, right?"

#. Occurrence NZ6:980:20416: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:980
msgctxt "text_id=20416 | speaker=alice"
msgid "わたし、そんな変換間違えのような名前より、その日の気分で分けた方が楽でいいと思ったのだけど、"
msgstr "    I didn't want to give them the wrong one. So I just categorized^    them based on how I felt."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1011:20417: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1011
msgctxt "text_id=20417 | speaker=alice"
msgid "『アンタの気分なんて他人には分かんないし。その度にアタシの運命が狂っていくコトを、もうちょっと気にしてちょうだい』"
msgstr "\"Nobody can tell how you're feeling. You should realize that what you do affects me, too.\""

#. Occurrence NZ6:1042:20418: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1042
msgctxt "text_id=20418 | speaker=alice"
msgid "『それに近い将来、こういう名前がトレンドになる時代がくるから。絶対。すぐに飽きられるだろうけど』"
msgstr "\"Plus, naming Ploys is going to be the next big thing. For certain. People will tire of it eventually, but still.\""

#. Occurrence NZ6:1073:20419: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1073
msgctxt "text_id=20419 | speaker=alice"
msgid "『なんで、どうせつけるならイカした方がグッドでバッド。せっかくアタシたちだけのオリジナリティなのよ、ポップに流行らせなくちゃ大損だわ！』"
msgstr "  \"And if we're going to name them, we have to name them^  something trendy. Trendiness is key!\""

#. Occurrence NZ6:1104:20420: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1104
msgctxt "text_id=20420 | speaker=alice"
msgid "それ以来、わたしはプロイを名前で呼ぶようになった。いちいち名前を覚える手間はあったけれど、プロイを間違えるコトはなくなったわ。"
msgstr "  I've given my Ploys names ever since. It's kind of a hassle^  remembering them all, but I never mix them up now."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1135:20421: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1135
msgctxt "text_id=20421 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　まさにコロンブスのタマゴね。"
msgstr "  Seemed like an obvious thing to do after the fact."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1135:20422: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1135
msgctxt "text_id=20422 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　なんていう発想の柔軟さ、斬新さかしら。"
msgstr "  But it was such an original idea at the time."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1135:20423: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0016; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1135
msgctxt "text_id=20423 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　時々思うのだけど、あの娘は天才ね。"
msgstr "  Genius, really."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1166:20424: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1166
msgctxt "text_id=20424 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そッスね。ジブンも思うんスけど、"
msgstr "            Yeah. Genius..."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1166:20425: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0007; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1166
msgctxt "text_id=20425 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アリスさんって時々すごくヴァカァですよね。"
msgstr "            Unlike you..."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1329:20426: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1329
msgctxt "text_id=20426 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　……やられてしまったわね。"
msgstr "                ...Ouch."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1362:20427: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1362
msgctxt "text_id=20427 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "油なだけによく燃えるッスねー。"
msgstr " Look at that oil burn."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1362:20428: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0008; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1362
msgctxt "text_id=20428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "スナークはどんなプロイなんスか？"
msgstr " What kind of Ploy is Snark exactly?"

#. Occurrence NZ6:1388:20429: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1388
msgctxt "text_id=20429 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　本編でだいたいのあらましは語っているわ。"
msgstr "    We went over this in the main story."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1388:20430: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1388
msgctxt "text_id=20430 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　細かなデータは、"
msgstr "    If you're looking for more detailed information, well..."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1456:20431: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1456
msgctxt "text_id=20431 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "うむ。"
msgstr "    Right on."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1456:20432: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1456
msgctxt "text_id=20432 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "その貴重な油を、青子さんは燃やしてしまった、と。"
msgstr "    So, Aoko burned all your precious oil."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1456:20433: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0009; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1456
msgctxt "text_id=20433 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "これ、なんとか戻せないんスか？"
msgstr "    How's one get more of that Bodie and Doyle?"

#. Occurrence NZ6:1482:20434: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1482
msgctxt "text_id=20434 | speaker=alice"
msgid "残念ながら不可能よ。"
msgstr "        Unfortunately, no."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1482:20435: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1482
msgctxt "text_id=20435 | speaker=alice"
msgid "この時代ではスナークを精製するコトはできない。"
msgstr "        Snarks can't be recreated in this era."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1515:20436: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0010; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1515
msgctxt "text_id=20436 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "こうして貴重な文化遺産は、フィーリングだけで生きている野蛮人に壊されていくんスねー。"
msgstr "Some people just love destroyin' cultural relics, don't they?"

#. Occurrence NZ6:1515:20437: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0010; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1515
msgctxt "text_id=20437 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "うはっ、文明を蹂躙するのっておもしれぇー！"
msgstr "Whew, gotta love layin' waste to civilization!"

#. Occurrence NZ6:1586:20438: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1586
msgctxt "text_id=20438 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "しっかし、デオチに続いてスナークもこのザマとか！"
msgstr "    Is this all Snark's got, though? I thought that troll was bad enough."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1586:20439: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1586
msgctxt "text_id=20439 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ギャハハ、何がグレートスリーッスか！"
msgstr "    Bwahahaha! Some Great Ploy!"

#. Occurrence NZ6:1586:20440: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0011; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1586
msgctxt "text_id=20440 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "甘え。グレートスリーは甘え。"
msgstr "    I loves me a good tall tale."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1657:20441: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0012; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1657
msgctxt "text_id=20441 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "しかしジブン、やるプロイッスから。産廃を有効利用するッスよ。おーい、外の店員さーん。この残った油で、とりあえずフライドポテトでも揚げてくれ？"
msgstr "Y'know, I'm a pretty damn good Ploy. I never waste anythin'! Hey, you there! Fry me up a bag of chips with this oil!"

#. Occurrence NZ6:1688:20442: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1688
msgctxt "text_id=20442 | speaker=alice"
msgid "あら、アナタにしては名案ねロビン。"
msgstr "Not a bad idea, Robin. For you, at least."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1688:20443: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1688
msgctxt "text_id=20443 | speaker=alice"
msgid "それじゃあ、わたしはフライドチキンにしてもらお^うかしら。"
msgstr "You know, I could go for some fried chicken."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1720:20444: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1720
msgctxt "text_id=20444 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "………………。"
msgstr "    ..."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1720:20445: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0013; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1720
msgctxt "text_id=20445 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "外のメニュー、ホットドッグとポップコーンとポテ^トしかなかったッスよ。"
msgstr "    The menu says hot dogs, popcorn, crisps...^    but definitely NO BIRD-BASED FOOD."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1751:20446: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0014; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1751
msgctxt "text_id=20446 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ジブン、映画館はまず飲食店のメニューからチェックする派ッスから。だいたい映画館でフライドチキンとか、匂いが無頼ッス。他のお客さんに迷惑ッス。"
msgstr "Whenever I go watch a flick, I always check their menu first. Fried chicken's a no-go, what with its pen and ink."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1782:20447: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1782
msgctxt "text_id=20447 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　知っているわ。でも安心して。"
msgstr "      I know. Don't worry."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1782:20448: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1782
msgctxt "text_id=20448 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　わたし、お腹はすいていないから。"
msgstr "      I'm not actually hungry."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1782:20449: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1782
msgctxt "text_id=20449 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　　ただ油で揚げてもらうだけでいいの。"
msgstr "      I just want them to fry a certain bird for me."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1815:20450: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0015; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1815
msgctxt "text_id=20450 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ハハハ。食事として、頼むワケでは、ないと。"
msgstr "      Hahaha... Y-You wouldn't..."

#. Occurrence NZ6:1907:20451: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1907
msgctxt "text_id=20451 | speaker=alice"
msgid "高温で全身まんべんなく、毛先から毛穴までゆであがるのは初めてなんじゃないかしら。"
msgstr "  Wouldn't I? Don't you want to experience the sensation of your^  entire body being boiled in hot oil?"

#. Occurrence NZ6:1907:20452: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:1907
msgctxt "text_id=20452 | speaker=alice"
msgid "また一つ死因コレクションが増えたわね、ロビン。"
msgstr "  Another cause of death to add to your collection."

#. Occurrence NZ6:2019:20453: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2019
msgctxt "text_id=20453 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "この世でいちばん増やしたくないレパートリー、"
msgstr " I need a better hobby."

#. Occurrence NZ6:2019:20454: voice_id=BA0_NZ6_0016; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2019
msgctxt "text_id=20454 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "あざーっスーーーー！　でも世界にはまだまだ未知の死因が隠れているッスよー！"
msgstr " Anyway, a sandshoe for your offer,^ but I'm going to 'ave to decline!"

#. Occurrence NZ6:2106:20455: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2106
msgctxt "text_id=20455 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……映画はここまでのようね。"
msgstr "  ...Looks like the movie's over."

#. Occurrence NZ6:2106:20456: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2106
msgctxt "text_id=20456 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　同時上映のある劇場も、最近は減ってきたわね。"
msgstr "  Few theaters show films and plays at^  the same time these days."

#. Occurrence NZ6:2137:20457: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2137
msgctxt "text_id=20457 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　最後に三体目の紹介をしたかったけど、"
msgstr "  I wanted to end this by introducing my third Ploy,"

#. Occurrence NZ6:2137:20458: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2137
msgctxt "text_id=20458 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　それはまたの機会に。"
msgstr "  but I'll have to save that for next time."

#. Occurrence NZ6:2197:20459: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2197
msgctxt "text_id=20459 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　長かった本編を楽しんでくれた皆さん。"
msgstr "          To all of you who stuck with us through"

#. Occurrence NZ6:2197:20460: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2197
msgctxt "text_id=20460 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　すぐ終わるようで、なかなか終わらなかった"
msgstr "          the lengthy main story, and the side story that"

#. Occurrence NZ6:2197:20461: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2197
msgctxt "text_id=20461 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　番外編に付き合ってくれた皆さん。"
msgstr "          could either end quickly or take forever..."

#. Occurrence NZ6:2223:20462: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2223
msgctxt "text_id=20462 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「魔法使いの夜」は、これで一旦の終了となります。"
msgstr "  This marks the end of Witch on the Holy Night."

#. Occurrence NZ6:2223:20463: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2223
msgctxt "text_id=20463 | speaker=alice"
msgid "続きはまた、いつかどこかで。"
msgstr "  Let us continue the tale someday, someplace,"

#. Occurrence NZ6:2223:20464: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2223
msgctxt "text_id=20464 | speaker=alice"
msgid "旅する星がするりと落ちて、貴方の胸に輝く時に。"
msgstr "  when a bright, roaming star drops from the sky into your lap."

#. Occurrence NZ6:2249:20465: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2249
msgctxt "text_id=20465 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　 ―――それでは。"
msgstr "          From the bottom of our hearts,"

#. Occurrence NZ6:2249:20466: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2249
msgctxt "text_id=20466 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　 長らくのご視聴、ありがとうございました。"
msgstr "          thank you for sharing this long journey with us."

#. Occurrence SP1:41:20467: scene=SP1
#: SP1:41
msgctxt "text_id=20467 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人里<離|はな>れた辺境から都会に来てはや一年。"
msgstr "  It had been one year since he'd moved into the city from his remote village."

#. Occurrence SP1:46:20468: scene=SP1
#: SP1:46
msgctxt "text_id=20468 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ヒトとケモノとで一番の大きな違いは、『好き嫌い』という嗜好性なんじゃないだろうか、とカレは思った。"
msgstr "  One thing he realized during that time was that likes and dislikes were the main difference between human and beast."

#. Occurrence SP1:97:20469: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:97
msgctxt "text_id=20469 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ふーん、ここが新しいアジトかー。"
msgstr "\"So this is the new hideout, huh?"

#. Occurrence SP1:103:20470: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:103
msgctxt "text_id=20470 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　うん、いいんじゃない？　ちょっとみすぼらしいけど、まわりに人間がいないのはキレイでいいよね」"
msgstr "  Not bad, I guess. It's a bit shabby, but I like how there are no people around.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:128:20471: scene=SP1
#: SP1:128
msgctxt "text_id=20471 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　白いコートの人影が、くるくると廊下で<躍|おど>る。"
msgstr "  The figure dressed in a white coat danced to and fro down the hallway."

#. Occurrence SP1:133:20472: scene=SP1
#: SP1:133
msgctxt "text_id=20472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その様はウインドウショッピングを楽しむ少女のようだ。"
msgstr "  He was like a young woman in an old film, enjoying herself window shopping."

#. Occurrence SP1:138:20473: scene=SP1
#: SP1:138
msgctxt "text_id=20473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　事実、ソレは興味津々とばかりに朽ち果てた校舎の無惨を<愉|たの>しんでいる。"
msgstr "  He was actually enjoying the atrocious sight of the school building in ruins."

#. Occurrence SP1:170:20474: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:170
msgctxt "text_id=20474 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そこ、あんまりはしゃがないの。なにしろ<築|ちく>六十年からの廃屋なんだから。"
msgstr "\"Settle down. This place is falling apart. It was built over sixty years ago, you know."

#. Occurrence SP1:176:20475: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:176
msgctxt "text_id=20475 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　調子に乗ってると、バキッと床を<踏|ふ>み抜いて―――」"
msgstr "  The floor could fall out from underneath you at any moment...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:182:20476: scene=SP1
#: SP1:182
msgctxt "text_id=20476 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　楽しいわよ、と言いかけた口が閉じる。"
msgstr "  His mouth shut before he could even say to let him have his fun."

#. Occurrence SP1:213:20477: scene=SP1
#: SP1:213
msgctxt "text_id=20477 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　響いている足音は一人分だけ。"
msgstr "  Only one set of footsteps echoed through the hallway."

#. Occurrence SP1:218:20478: scene=SP1
#: SP1:218
msgctxt "text_id=20478 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　老朽化した廊下を<労|ねぎら>ってか、それとも身も心も浮かれているのか。"
msgstr "  Not a single feather's worth of his seventy-pound body was exerting any force on the floor beneath him."

#. Occurrence SP1:223:20479: scene=SP1
#: SP1:223
msgctxt "text_id=20479 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　コート姿のソレは先ほどから微塵も、自身の三十キロ程度の重さすら、廊下に加えてはいなかった。"
msgstr "  It wasn't clear whether he was paying reverence to the hallway or simply excited by it."

#. Occurrence SP1:259:20480: scene=SP1
#: SP1:259
msgctxt "text_id=20480 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　曰く、<仁獣|じんじゅう>は野原を歩いても草花を傷つけないと云う。"
msgstr "  It's said that even walking through a grassy field, a beast is careful not to harm a single blade of grass."

#. Occurrence SP1:264:20481: scene=SP1
#: SP1:264
msgctxt "text_id=20481 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あのコート姿の人影もその<類|たぐい>の生き物らしい。"
msgstr "  Apparently, this creature wrapped in a coat was no different."

#. Occurrence SP1:269:20482: scene=SP1
#: SP1:269
msgctxt "text_id=20482 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カレは環境側の生き物だ。"
msgstr "  He was more a part of the environment itself than a settler of it."

#. Occurrence SP1:274:20483: scene=SP1
#: SP1:274
msgctxt "text_id=20483 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　高等、下等、どちらであろうと肉持つ獣には何の温情も持たないが、同胞には人並み……いや、狼並みの温情を持つらしい。"
msgstr "  He held no regard for beasts greater or lesser than him, but when it came to his comrades, he at least displayed human-like--or rather, wolf-like clemency."

#. Occurrence SP1:311:20484: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:311
msgctxt "text_id=20484 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ま、相性は良い、とプラスに考えましょう。"
msgstr "\"Well, I'm glad you at least like the place."

#. Occurrence SP1:322:20485: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:322
msgctxt "text_id=20485 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　町に出かけてくるけど、何かほしいものはある？　マンガとか、小説とか」"
msgstr "  I'm going into town. Do you need anything? Comics? Books?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:335:20486: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0002_0; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:335
msgctxt "text_id=20486 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「んー、特にいりません。"
msgstr "\"Hmm, nothing especially."

#. Occurrence SP1:348:20487: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0002_1; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:348
msgctxt "text_id=20487 | speaker=beo"
msgid "あ、帰りにハンバーガー買ってきてくれたら嬉しいな！　あの、パン生地がどっしりしてて、ハンバーグがぎゅっとしたヤツがいい！」"
msgstr " Oh! If you could pick me up a hamburger on your way back, that'd be great! The one with the fluffy bun and thick patty!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:374:20488: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:374
msgctxt "text_id=20488 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「まだオモチャより食い気ときた。食事の調達方法も確保しないとダメみたいね。"
msgstr "\"Still thinking with your stomach, huh? We'll need to figure out a reliable source of food if we want to survive here."

#. Occurrence SP1:380:20489: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:380
msgctxt "text_id=20489 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　……失敗したかな？　ルームサービスのあるホテルの方が、<後々|あとあと>証拠は残らなさそう」"
msgstr "  ...I wonder if this was a mistake? A hotel with room service might actually leave less evidence behind.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:400:20490: scene=SP1
#: SP1:400
msgctxt "text_id=20490 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やれやれとため息をつくのは、言うまでもなく蒼崎橙子である。"
msgstr "  Touko let out a defeated sigh."

#. Occurrence SP1:405:20491: scene=SP1
#: SP1:405
msgctxt "text_id=20491 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　眼鏡をかけているので、口調も仕草も彼女本来のものに固定されている。"
msgstr "  With her glasses on, she was restricted to her original way of speaking and gesturing."

#. Occurrence SP1:439:20492: scene=SP1
#: SP1:439
msgctxt "text_id=20492 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　十二月初頭。"
msgstr "  It was the beginning of December."

#. Occurrence SP1:444:20493: scene=SP1
#: SP1:444
msgctxt "text_id=20493 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女とカレが三咲市にやってきてから、まる一ヶ月が経過しようとしていた。"
msgstr "  Exactly one month had passed since they came to Misaki City."

#. Occurrence SP1:449:20494: scene=SP1
#: SP1:449
msgctxt "text_id=20494 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今までは隣町から三咲町を攻略していた橙子だが、そろそろ本番という事で、<本営|ほんえい>をここ旧校舎に移転させたのである。"
msgstr "  Until now, Touko had been attacking Misaki from a nearby neighborhood. Deciding it was time to get serious, she had moved her base of operations to this old school building."

#. Occurrence SP1:478:20495: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:478
msgctxt "text_id=20495 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「？　なに、ホテルの方が良かったの？」"
msgstr "\"Hm? You think a hotel would've been better?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:495:20496: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:495
msgctxt "text_id=20496 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そりゃあ楽だもの。グレードが良ければホテル暮らしは快適です」"
msgstr "\"That would be easier, for sure. Hotels are nice to live in, especially if they're decent quality.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:501:20497: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0004; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:501
msgctxt "text_id=20497 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ふーん。でもトーコさん、こういう廃墟好きだよね」"
msgstr "\"But I know you, Touko. You're really into these kinds of ruins, aren't you?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:507:20498: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:507
msgctxt "text_id=20498 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「え、そうかな？」"
msgstr "\"Eh? Really?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:513:20499: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0005; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:513
msgctxt "text_id=20499 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「そうだよ。今回みたいなのは特にそう。"
msgstr "\"Yeah! Especially ones like this."

#. Occurrence SP1:519:20500: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0006; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:519
msgctxt "text_id=20500 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　趣味に走る時、まわりにヒトがいるのイヤがるじゃない。いろんな物に興味を持つクセに、興味を持たれるのはメンドウってゆーか」"
msgstr "  Whenever you get interested in something, you don't want anyone to be around you or like the same things you're into. Even though you have so many interests!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:556:20501: scene=SP1
#: SP1:556
msgctxt "text_id=20501 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　指摘されて、そっか、と納得する橙子だった。"
msgstr "  Touko couldn't deny that observation."

#. Occurrence SP1:561:20502: scene=SP1
#: SP1:561
msgctxt "text_id=20502 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カレと契約したのは二年前だが、本格的に護衛として同伴させてからじき一年。"
msgstr "  She had been under contract with him for two years, but it had only been about a year since he became her full-time bodyguard."

#. Occurrence SP1:566:20503: scene=SP1
#: SP1:566
msgctxt "text_id=20503 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子という人間の根っこにある問題を、カレはきちんと把握しているらしい。"
msgstr "  He seemed to be able to see right through to the root of all the problems that plagued Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:601:20504: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:601
msgctxt "text_id=20504 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「人混みは嫌いじゃないんだけどねー。廃ビルでも廃工場でも、いっそあの遊園地でも良かったのよ？"
msgstr "\"I don't particularly hate crowds, though. An abandoned building or factory, or even that old amusement park would've been okay too."

#. Occurrence SP1:607:20505: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:607
msgctxt "text_id=20505 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　でも、こんな田舎町じゃ君を連れているだけで噂になるでしょ。結果的に、<山奥|ここ>に工房を構えるしかなかったの」"
msgstr "  It's just that, here in the countryside, simply having you around is enough to get the rumor mill churning. My only option was to set up operations out here in the mountains.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:634:20506: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0007; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:634
msgctxt "text_id=20506 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「えー。ちゃんとヒト形になってるじゃん、ボク。"
msgstr "\"Aww, but I'm in human form!"

#. Occurrence SP1:634:20507: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0007; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:634
msgctxt "text_id=20507 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　別に目立たないと思うけどなー」"
msgstr "  I don't think I stick out that much.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:645:20508: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:645
msgctxt "text_id=20508 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「色合いの問題です。アジア系は無理にしても、せめて<黒髪|ブルネット>に化けてくれれば、いくらでも誤魔化せるんだけど」"
msgstr "\"It's a matter of fitting in. Even if you can't look Asian, we could probably get by if your hair was at least black.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:678:20509: scene=SP1
#: SP1:678
msgctxt "text_id=20509 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、その要望は叶わない。"
msgstr "  Unfortunately, that wouldn't be happening."

#. Occurrence SP1:683:20510: scene=SP1
#: SP1:683
msgctxt "text_id=20510 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ヒト形になる事自体、カレにとってはストレスなのだ。"
msgstr "  Simply being in human form at all was stressful for him."

#. Occurrence SP1:688:20511: scene=SP1
#: SP1:688
msgctxt "text_id=20511 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カレからしてみれば、せめて好みのカタチになる事がギリギリの妥協点なのである。"
msgstr "  When he had to be human, his only condition was that he could look however he wanted."

#. Occurrence SP1:693:20512: scene=SP1
#: SP1:693
msgctxt "text_id=20512 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今は町から旧校舎に移動する為、やむなくヒト形に変身しているが、寝床になる教室が決まればすぐに狼のカタチに戻ってしまう。"
msgstr "  He was currently only in this form because they had to move from the town to the old school building. Once he found a classroom to sleep in, he'd be back to a wolf."

#. Occurrence SP1:732:20513: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:732
msgctxt "text_id=20513 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「なんだってヒト形でいるのを嫌がるのかしらね。別に難しいワケじゃないんでしょう、ソレ？　もともとアストラル体みたいなものなんだから、貴方」"
msgstr "\"Why do you hate being in human form so much anyway? It's not particularly difficult to stay like that, is it? Aren't you originally an astral body?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:738:20514: scene=SP1
#: SP1:738
msgctxt "text_id=20514 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カレの体は状況に応じて変態する。"
msgstr "  Being an extremely versatile lifeform which required no body to remain stable"

#. Occurrence SP1:743:20515: scene=SP1
#: SP1:743
msgctxt "text_id=20515 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　物質界で安定する為の<触媒|にくたい>を必要としない、万能の生命だ。"
msgstr "  in the physical world, his body could change according to the situation."

#. Occurrence SP1:748:20516: scene=SP1
#: SP1:748
msgctxt "text_id=20516 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔術的に言えば、魂が物質化した高次生命である。"
msgstr "  Magecraft would have defined him as a higher-dimensional lifeform with a materialized soul."

#. Occurrence SP1:783:20517: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0008; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:783
msgctxt "text_id=20517 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「そりゃあ何の力もリスクもないけど、メンドウなものはメンドウだよ。"
msgstr "\"It's not hard or dangerous. Just annoying."

#. Occurrence SP1:789:20518: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0009; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:789
msgctxt "text_id=20518 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　人間だって無駄なコトはしたくないでしょ？"
msgstr "  Humans don't like doing things they don't have to, right?"

#. Occurrence SP1:789:20519: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0009; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:789
msgctxt "text_id=20519 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　ボク、ヒト形になるコトに有利性をまったく感じないしー」"
msgstr "  Well, it's the same for me. There's no practical reason for me to ever be in human form.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:813:20520: scene=SP1
#: SP1:813
msgctxt "text_id=20520 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カレにとって「人間の姿」とは何の価値も見いだせないものらしい。"
msgstr "  Apparently, he saw no value at all in his human form."

#. Occurrence SP1:818:20521: scene=SP1
#: SP1:818
msgctxt "text_id=20521 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なら外見を地味にしても良かろう、と橙子は指摘したものだが、意味がない変態だからこそ、せめて“気持ちの良い”状態を優先するのだ、とカレは言った。"
msgstr "  That was exactly why Touko insisted he make his appearance blend in more. But the boy argued that if he had to be in an unnatural state, he'd at least make himself comfortable."

#. Occurrence SP1:863:20522: scene=SP1
#: SP1:863
msgctxt "text_id=20522 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カレにとってあのカタチはヒト形において唯一『楽しい』イメージらしく、そこから外れる事を<頑|がん>として受け入れない。"
msgstr "  To him, this was the only fun way to be a human, and he wasn't going to accept it any other way."

#. Occurrence SP1:868:20523: scene=SP1
#: SP1:868
msgctxt "text_id=20523 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　結果、地方都市には場違いな、外国の貴人そのもののルックスになる。"
msgstr "  And so, this was why he had taken on the appearance of a foreign aristocrat in a provincial Japanese city."

#. Occurrence SP1:873:20524: scene=SP1
#: SP1:873
msgctxt "text_id=20524 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　着ているコートも、注文の多いカレを納得させる為、橙子が手ずから選んだ逸品だった。"
msgstr "  Even his posh coat had been hand-picked by Touko to satisfy one of his many demands."

#. Occurrence SP1:916:20525: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0012; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:916
msgctxt "text_id=20525 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「じゃ、お留守番お願いねベオ君。"
msgstr "\"Keep an eye on the place while I'm out, Beo."

#. Occurrence SP1:922:20526: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:922
msgctxt "text_id=20526 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　来ないとは思うけど、もし人が来たら捕まえておいて。"
msgstr "  I don't think anyone will stumble upon us, but if they do, be sure to hold them until I get back."

#. Occurrence SP1:922:20527: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:922
msgctxt "text_id=20527 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　その際、<脚|あし>の一本ぐらいなら傷つけてもＯＫだから」"
msgstr "  You can rough them up a bit if you need to, but no more than one leg.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:934:20528: scene=SP1
#: SP1:934
msgctxt "text_id=20528 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　物騒な言いつけを残して、橙子は町へと出かけていく。"
msgstr "  And with that statement, Touko headed off into the city."

#. Occurrence SP1:963:20529: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0010; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:963
msgctxt "text_id=20529 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「はーい、まかされましたー！"
msgstr "\"Okay, you got it!"

#. Occurrence SP1:969:20530: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0011; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:969
msgctxt "text_id=20530 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　だいじょうぶ、人間とかそもそも口に合わないし！"
msgstr "  Don't worry, I don't like how humans taste anyway!"

#. Occurrence SP1:975:20531: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0012; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:975
msgctxt "text_id=20531 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　こっちのコトは気にせず、あのピリピリするお土産よろしくねー！」"
msgstr "  I'll be fine here, just don't forget to bring me back something yummy!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:1023:20532: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1023
msgctxt "text_id=20532 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雇い主を見送って、ベオはトスン、と机に着地した。"
msgstr "  Beo plopped down onto a desk after he saw his employer off."

#. Occurrence SP1:1028:20533: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1028
msgctxt "text_id=20533 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その姿はヒトから狼の姿に変化している。"
msgstr "  He morphed back into his wolf form."

#. Occurrence SP1:1049:20534: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0013; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1049
msgctxt "text_id=20534 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“あーあ、タイクツー。世界中をまわって、こんな田舎町が終着とかヒョウシ抜けもいいところー”」"
msgstr "\"Sooo bored. How did I end up out here in this country town after traveling around the world?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:1068:20535: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1068
msgctxt "text_id=20535 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオが蒼崎橙子と出会ったのは二年前。"
msgstr "  It had been two years since Beo met Touko Aozaki."

#. Occurrence SP1:1073:20536: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1073
msgctxt "text_id=20536 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人狼の里に現れた魔術師は、里の者たちと交渉の末、ベオの教育係を請け負った。"
msgstr "  After some deliberation with the werewolves, the mage was left in charge of Beo's education."

#. Occurrence SP1:1093:20537: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1093
msgctxt "text_id=20537 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無論、里はベオに対して何の拘束力も持ち合わせていない。最終的にベオをその気にさせたのは、里への義理ではなく、橙子への興味だった。"
msgstr "  Of course, his village had no real control over him. He didn't have to go with her. He decided to go simply because she seemed interesting."

#. Occurrence SP1:1098:20538: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1098
msgctxt "text_id=20538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は洞窟で眠るソレの前に立ち、"
msgstr "  Touko stood before him in the cave where he slept and asked,"

#. Occurrence SP1:1126:20539: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0014; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1126
msgctxt "text_id=20539 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「え、生きている意味が知りたい？"
msgstr "\"Wait, you want to know the meaning of life?"

#. Occurrence SP1:1132:20540: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1132
msgctxt "text_id=20540 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　なんだ。そんな事で取引が成立するとはね」"
msgstr "  Is that really why you agreed to this?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:1138:20541: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1138
msgctxt "text_id=20541 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　涼しげに笑った後、その長い髪を切って拘束の<契約|くさり>にした。"
msgstr "  She smiled and cut off her long locks of hair to seal their pact."

#. Occurrence SP1:1170:20542: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0016; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1170
msgctxt "text_id=20542 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「自由を知るには窮屈さを知っておかないとね。"
msgstr "\"To know freedom, you must also know restraint."

#. Occurrence SP1:1176:20543: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0017; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1176
msgctxt "text_id=20543 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　同じように、生きている意味を知りたければ、まずは死ねない<執着|こだわり>を見付けないと。"
msgstr "  Similarly, if you want to know the meaning of life, then you must have a reason not to die."

#. Occurrence SP1:1182:20544: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1182
msgctxt "text_id=20544 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　―――そうだな、例えばの話。そいつを殺すまでは、とてもじゃないが死ねないほどの憎しみとか」"
msgstr "  ...For example, if you harbor a hatred so strong that you yourself can't fathom dying before you kill that person.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:1202:20545: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1202
msgctxt "text_id=20545 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子の二十年分の蓄積。"
msgstr "  That hair was twenty years' worth of Touko's life."

#. Occurrence SP1:1207:20546: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1207
msgctxt "text_id=20546 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　分身とも言える髪を、彼女はあっさりと手放した。"
msgstr "  In a way, her hair was a part of herself, but she parted with it easily."

#. Occurrence SP1:1212:20547: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1212
msgctxt "text_id=20547 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それだけの価値が、今まで貯めてきたものをノータイムで切り捨てられるだけの価値が、ベオにあると確信して。"
msgstr "  She was sure that Beo was worth the twenty years it had taken her to grow that hair."

#. Occurrence SP1:1246:20548: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1246
msgctxt "text_id=20548 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　またベオも同じように、この人間が稀少な価値を持つ生き物だと嗅ぎ取っていた。"
msgstr "  Beo, too, sensed that Touko was a creature of rare value."

#. Occurrence SP1:1251:20549: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1251
msgctxt "text_id=20549 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな異才に認められるのはベオとて悪い気はしなかったし、何より、窮屈さを知れと言いながらも、極めて自由な女性の振るまいに関心を覚えてしまったのだ。"
msgstr "  He was happy to have been selected by someone of her unusual talents and, though she preached learning restraint, he observed that she was a truly free woman."

#. Occurrence SP1:1285:20550: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1285
msgctxt "text_id=20550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして、"
msgstr "  And then..."

#. Occurrence SP1:1290:20551: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1290
msgctxt "text_id=20551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオは契約の縛りを甘んじて受け入れ、里の外―――"
msgstr "  Beo accepted the terms of her contract, and left his village."

#. Occurrence SP1:1295:20552: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1295
msgctxt "text_id=20552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外の世界に足を向けた。"
msgstr "  He took his first steps into the outside world."

#. Occurrence SP1:1345:20553: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1345
msgctxt "text_id=20553 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まずは一年、イギリスの工房で基本的な知識を学んだ。"
msgstr "  The first year was spent at Touko's workshop in England, learning basic knowledge."

#. Occurrence SP1:1350:20554: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1350
msgctxt "text_id=20554 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『時計塔』と呼ばれる魔術協会の学舎での話である。"
msgstr "  Namely, it was at a college of the Mage's Association, called the Clock Tower."

#. Occurrence SP1:1356:20555: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1356
msgctxt "text_id=20555 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その頃、蒼崎橙子には専用の使い魔がいた。"
msgstr "  At the time, Touko had her own dedicated familiar."

#. Occurrence SP1:1361:20556: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1361
msgctxt "text_id=20556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　立場的にはベオの先輩というヤツである。"
msgstr "  Formally speaking, this familiar was Beo's senior,"

#. Occurrence SP1:1366:20557: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1366
msgctxt "text_id=20557 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオは一年で先輩より優れている事を証明し、橙子と共に世界を巡る旅に出かけた。"
msgstr "  but in that year's time, Beo proved himself superior and earned the right to travel the world with Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:1397:20558: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1397
msgctxt "text_id=20558 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　北欧の森を走るという<魔眼収集列車|レール・ツェッペリン>。"
msgstr "  They rode on a train that collected Mystic Eyes, known as the Rail Zeppelin."

#. Occurrence SP1:1402:20559: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1402
msgctxt "text_id=20559 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　北海にいまなお生き続ける<巨大古代種|ムールクラーケ>。"
msgstr "  They saw the Murkrake, an ancient, giant octopus living in the North Sea."

#. Occurrence SP1:1407:20560: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1407
msgctxt "text_id=20560 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三角形に開いた、異界に通じる<帰らず|バミューダ>の海。"
msgstr "  They explored the Bermuda Triangle, a place of no return, connected to other realms."

#. Occurrence SP1:1412:20561: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1412
msgctxt "text_id=20561 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　西欧諸国に潜む、<神代連盟|エルダータイトル>を名乗る魔術師のなれの果て。"
msgstr "  They met the remains of a mage of the Elder Title, a league of ancients, deep in western Europe."

#. Occurrence SP1:1432:20562: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1432
msgctxt "text_id=20562 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いずれも楽しむには十分な“異常”であり、"
msgstr "  All of their exploits were odd and exciting enough to hold his interest,"

#. Occurrence SP1:1437:20563: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1437
msgctxt "text_id=20563 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カレは蒼崎橙子に付いてきた判断を正しく思った。"
msgstr "  and throughout them all, Beo felt that he'd been right to join Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:1442:20564: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1442
msgctxt "text_id=20564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だって、里で眠っていた時に比べれば、少しだけ退屈しない。"
msgstr "  This was certainly less boring than sleeping in his cave."

#. Occurrence SP1:1484:20565: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1484
msgctxt "text_id=20565 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　甘い蜜には、より甘い毒を。"
msgstr "  But sweet honey makes one crave even sweeter poison;"

#. Occurrence SP1:1489:20566: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1489
msgctxt "text_id=20566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　薬に慣れたのなら、更なる劇薬を。"
msgstr "  having developed a taste for adventure, he now demanded even greater thrills."

#. Occurrence SP1:1494:20567: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1494
msgctxt "text_id=20567 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この無邪気な生き物が次の獲物を楽しみにするようになったのは、当然の流れと言える。"
msgstr "  It was only natural that such an innocent creature would start to look forward to its next prey."

#. Occurrence SP1:1499:20568: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1499
msgctxt "text_id=20568 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その娯楽、その期待の最高峰が、蒼崎橙子の最終目的。"
msgstr "  The pinnacle of that desire rested on Touko's final goal:"

#. Occurrence SP1:1504:20569: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1504
msgctxt "text_id=20569 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自由自在な彼女をして、在るだけで許せないモノ、と言わしめた獲物である。"
msgstr "  For all her liberty and aplomb, there was one prey she would not stop chasing until she caught it once and for all."

#. Occurrence SP1:1539:20570: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1539
msgctxt "text_id=20570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　新しい脅威に向かう度、ベオは橙子に問いただしたものだ。"
msgstr "  With every new adventure, Beo would ask,"

#. Occurrence SP1:1549:20571: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0014; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1549
msgctxt "text_id=20571 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“ねえ、これがトーコさんの殺したい相手？”」"
msgstr "\"So, is this the person you want to kill, Touko?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:1555:20572: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1555
msgctxt "text_id=20572 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、魔術師は口元を皮肉げにゆがめて首を横に振るばかり。"
msgstr "  However, the mage would always smile wryly and shake her head in response."

#. Occurrence SP1:1560:20573: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1560
msgctxt "text_id=20573 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんな<易|やさ>しいものじゃあない、と希代の人形師は語る。"
msgstr "  Even this puppet master of extraordinary talent claimed that it was no easy task."

#. Occurrence SP1:1601:20574: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1601
msgctxt "text_id=20574 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それまで橙子とベオが倒してきた相手、"
msgstr "  Her target was in a realm far beyond anyone they'd dealt with so far--"

#. Occurrence SP1:1601:20575: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1601
msgctxt "text_id=20575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　交渉してきた相手は、カレに及ばないまでも、いずれ<人智|じんち>及ばぬ魔境たちだった。"
msgstr "  beyond human knowledge. Perhaps, beyond even Beo."

#. Occurrence SP1:1606:20576: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1606
msgctxt "text_id=20576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　では、それらを向こうに回す敵とは如何ほどのモノか？"
msgstr "  But who could this mysterious person be? And how could they be so powerful?"

#. Occurrence SP1:1611:20577: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1611
msgctxt "text_id=20577 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこまで言われては気になって仕方がない。"
msgstr "  Beo couldn't help but be curious."

#. Occurrence SP1:1616:20578: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1616
msgctxt "text_id=20578 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やがて自分が雇われた目的が“魔法”と知り、"
msgstr "  Discovering that he was hired for \"Magical\" reasons,"

#. Occurrence SP1:1621:20579: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1621
msgctxt "text_id=20579 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それなら相手にとって不足はない、と珍しく闘志を燃やしたのだが―――"
msgstr "  he mustered a rare bit of fighting spirit, thinking he'd found a worthy foe. But..."

#. Occurrence SP1:1656:20580: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1656
msgctxt "text_id=20580 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“レーセイになって考えてみると、本物が偽物を相手にするとかオトナげないかも。"
msgstr "\"You know, I think it's kind of childish for the real thing to take on an impostor."

#. Occurrence SP1:1656:20581: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1656
msgctxt "text_id=20581 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　魔法なんていっても、結局は人間の手によるものなんだし”」"
msgstr "  At the end of the day, this so-called 'Magic' is just another thing that humans made.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:1700:20582: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1700
msgctxt "text_id=20582 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソレの関心は、やはり自分に対してのみ。"
msgstr "  Clearly, it was still only interested in itself."

#. Occurrence SP1:1706:20583: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1706
msgctxt "text_id=20583 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　命を知らず、自由を知らず、楽しみといったら食事だけ。"
msgstr "  It knew nothing of life or freedom. Its only pleasure was found in food."

#. Occurrence SP1:1712:20584: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1712
msgctxt "text_id=20584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな自分に不満はないが、退屈である事だけはいかんともしがたい。"
msgstr "  Beo didn't necessarily feel dissatisfied, but it was becoming harder to stave off his boredom."

#. Occurrence SP1:1717:20585: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1717
msgctxt "text_id=20585 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それと。蒼崎橙子に同行するようになってからは、彼女に対してもよく分からない感情を持ち始めていた。"
msgstr "  Also, since accompanying Touko on her adventures, his feelings toward her had become a bit confused."

#. Occurrence SP1:1754:20586: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0016; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1754
msgctxt "text_id=20586 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“トーコさん、あれでほんと一途だから。"
msgstr "\"Touko, I just think you're obsessed."

#. Occurrence SP1:1760:20587: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0017; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1760
msgctxt "text_id=20587 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　何でもできるのはボクと同じなのに、何にでも一生懸命になれるのって、ちょっとヘンだよね”」"
msgstr "  You can literally do anything you want, just like me, and yet that's what you focus your energy on?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:1779:20588: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1779
msgctxt "text_id=20588 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やれやれ、と大げさに肩をすくめて<瞼|まぶた>を閉じる。"
msgstr "  He slumped his shoulders exaggeratedly and closed his eyes."

#. Occurrence SP1:1784:20589: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1784
msgctxt "text_id=20589 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが<妬|ねた>みという感情である事を知らないまま、金色の狼は意識を落とした。"
msgstr "  The golden wolf drifted off to sleep, not realizing that his feelings were in fact those of jealousy."

#. Occurrence SP1:1845:20590: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0019; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1845
msgctxt "text_id=20590 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「四年ぶりに帰ってきてみれば、住み慣れた町の面影は何処へやら、かあ。"
msgstr "\"This place sure has changed in the last four years."

#. Occurrence SP1:1851:20591: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0020; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1851
msgctxt "text_id=20591 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　駅前なんてもう別物だし、大手術にも程が……ああ、やっぱり<角|かど>の煙草屋さん、なくなってる。"
msgstr "  Did they really need to tear down and rebuild the entire front of the station? And... ah, yep. That smoke shop on the corner is gone."

#. Occurrence SP1:1857:20592: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0021; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1857
msgctxt "text_id=20592 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　あーあ。自動販売機で煙草を買うのにも、そろそろ慣れなくちゃいけないのかも」"
msgstr "  Oh, well. Guess I'll have to get used to the idea of buying cigarettes from a vending machine.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:1891:20593: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1891
msgctxt "text_id=20593 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんてグチをこぼしながら、蒼崎橙子は四年ぶりの故郷を歩く。"
msgstr "  Touko walked through her hometown for the first time in four years, grumbling to herself."

#. Occurrence SP1:1896:20594: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1896
msgctxt "text_id=20594 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その姿は<緩|ゆる>みに緩みきっていた。"
msgstr "  She was on an aimless and careless stroll."

#. Occurrence SP1:1901:20595: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1901
msgctxt "text_id=20595 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　使い魔も連れておらず、"
msgstr "  No familiar escorted her,"

#. Occurrence SP1:1906:20596: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1906
msgctxt "text_id=20596 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　護身用の「鞄」もアジトに置きっぱなし。"
msgstr "  and she'd even left her self-defense 'bag' back at the hideout."

#. Occurrence SP1:1911:20597: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1911
msgctxt "text_id=20597 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気持ちは完全に観光気分で、緊張のキの字もない。"
msgstr "  Today, she was in full tourist mode, not nervous about a thing."

#. Occurrence SP1:1944:20598: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0022; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1944
msgctxt "text_id=20598 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ここなんてあぜ道同然だったのに、今じゃ立派なストリートときた。"
msgstr "\"This place was no bigger than a footpath before, and now it's an actual street."

#. Occurrence SP1:1953:20599: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0023; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1953
msgctxt "text_id=20599 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　因果なものね。帰ってきたっていうのに、あっちに戻った時と同じ気持ちになってきた」"
msgstr "  It's odd. I know I'm home, but it feels like going back to that town overseas.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:1988:20600: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1988
msgctxt "text_id=20600 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子にとって、帰郷はこれで二度目になる。"
msgstr "  This was Touko's second time going back home."

#. Occurrence SP1:1993:20601: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1993
msgctxt "text_id=20601 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　四年前に蒼崎家から出奔し、こうして秘密裏に戻って来たのが<二度目|こんかい>。"
msgstr "  After leaving the Aozaki home four years ago, she'd secretly returned to Misaki."

#. Occurrence SP1:1998:20602: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1998
msgctxt "text_id=20602 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一度目の帰郷はもっと前。"
msgstr "  The first time was longer ago."

#. Occurrence SP1:2003:20603: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2003
msgctxt "text_id=20603 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　十四歳の時、彼女は英国のとある学院に留学していた経歴を持つ。"
msgstr "  When Touko was fourteen years old, she studied abroad at an academy in England."

#. Occurrence SP1:2049:20604: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2049
msgctxt "text_id=20604 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は二年間あちらで学生として過ごし、日本に帰国。"
msgstr "  She'd spent two years there before returning to Japan."

#. Occurrence SP1:2054:20605: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2054
msgctxt "text_id=20605 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　高校は地元の学校を選び、礼園女学院で三年間過ごした後、再び英国に出奔した。"
msgstr "  Then, she'd enrolled in a local high school named Reien Girls' Academy, and headed back to England three years later after graduating."

#. Occurrence SP1:2059:20606: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2059
msgctxt "text_id=20606 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが四年前の出来事だ。"
msgstr "  That was four years ago."

#. Occurrence SP1:2064:20607: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2064
msgctxt "text_id=20607 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その時、英国の田舎町に戻った時と同じ感想を、いま橙子は抱いている。"
msgstr "  Now she felt the same as she did then, when she returned to that English country town where she'd lived for two years."

#. Occurrence SP1:2104:20608: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0024; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2104
msgctxt "text_id=20608 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「寂しい？　んー、ちょっと違う。呆れてる……とも違うし、怖がっている、も近くて遠いような……」"
msgstr "\"Lonely? Hmm, not really. Disappointed? Not exactly. Scared doesn't sound quite right, but maybe?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:2110:20609: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2110
msgctxt "text_id=20609 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　肩を丸めて考えこむ。"
msgstr "  She rounded her shoulders and fell deep into thought."

#. Occurrence SP1:2115:20610: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2115
msgctxt "text_id=20610 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背中にむずむずと湧きたつ、いまいち言語化できないざわめき。"
msgstr "  Touko felt a tingle run up her spine in a way that couldn't really be described in words."

#. Occurrence SP1:2135:20611: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2135
msgctxt "text_id=20611 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　急激な変化を迎えた時代。あらゆるものが安価で、かつ安易に造り替えられていく風潮。"
msgstr "  Times were changing faster than ever. Everything was relatively inexpensive and could be replaced on a whim."

#. Occurrence SP1:2140:20612: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2140
msgctxt "text_id=20612 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子はしばし考えこんでから、そっか、と指を鳴らして足を踏み出した。"
msgstr "  After thinking to herself for a bit, she cracked her knuckles and set forth."

#. Occurrence SP1:2173:20613: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2173
msgctxt "text_id=20613 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　難しく考える必要はない。"
msgstr "  There was no use overthinking any of this."

#. Occurrence SP1:2178:20614: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2178
msgctxt "text_id=20614 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これはただ、今がそういう時代であるだけの話。"
msgstr "  This was just how things were now. That's all there was to it."

#. Occurrence SP1:2183:20615: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2183
msgctxt "text_id=20615 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　単に、古いものを新しいものに取り替える時期が、当然のようにやってきたのだ。"
msgstr "  It was only natural for the old to make way for the new."

#. Occurrence SP1:2197:20616: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0025; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2197
msgctxt "text_id=20616 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「うん。つまり、私の時代ってコトだ！」"
msgstr "\"This is it! My time is now!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:2217:20617: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2217
msgctxt "text_id=20617 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“橙子さん、やっちゃってください”"
msgstr "(You can do this, Touko!)"

#. Occurrence SP1:2223:20618: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2223
msgctxt "text_id=20618 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなノリノリの<自|じ><己|こ><啓発|けいはつ>に背中を押されて、蒼崎橙子は意気揚々と駅に向かって歩きだした。"
msgstr "  This sudden spark of self-enlightenment gave Touko the encouragement she needed, and she set off with high spirits toward the train station."

#. Occurrence SP1:2265:20619: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2265
msgctxt "text_id=20619 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大通りをずんずんと<驀進|ばくしん>する様は、トップモデルか独裁者かという迫力である。"
msgstr "  Striding down the boulevard, she exuded the confidence of a supermodel or dictator."

#. Occurrence SP1:2270:20620: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2270
msgctxt "text_id=20620 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、"
msgstr "  Although she was not about to exclaim,"

#. Occurrence SP1:2270:20621: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2270
msgctxt "text_id=20621 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『手始めに、この大通りをメチャクチャにしてやるぜー！』"
msgstr "\"My conquest begins with Main Street! Time to tear it up!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:2275:20622: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2275
msgctxt "text_id=20622 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　と意気込んでのコトでは、無論、ない。"
msgstr "  Her enthusiasm was, of course, still there."

#. Occurrence SP1:2295:20623: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2295
msgctxt "text_id=20623 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子とて、これからはじまる大掃除、大工事の前にセンスのない町並み……"
msgstr "  Touko, however, had something she had to accomplish first..."

#. Occurrence SP1:2300:20624: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2300
msgctxt "text_id=20624 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何の工夫も見られない、十年後には時代遅れになっているであろう大通り……"
msgstr "  Before she could give thought to putting an end to the town's thoughtless"

#. Occurrence SP1:2305:20625: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2305
msgctxt "text_id=20625 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　を<更地|さらち>にしたいところではあるが、今の彼女にはその前にやらねばならぬ事があるのである。"
msgstr "  attempts at modernization that would become outdated in just a few years."

#. Occurrence SP1:2361:20626: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0026; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2361
msgctxt "text_id=20626 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「甘い設定だ。"
msgstr "\"This machine's a winner for sure."

#. Occurrence SP1:2367:20627: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0027; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2367
msgctxt "text_id=20627 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　こんな釘のしぼりで、客を<煙|けむ>にまけると思ったか」"
msgstr "  Did they really think they could fool anyone with the pegs set like this?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:2390:20628: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2390
msgctxt "text_id=20628 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子がまず向かった先は結界の支点ではなく、繁華街のパチンコ店だった。"
msgstr "  Touko's first destination was not one Misaki's protective sigils, but rather her old favorite pachinko parlor."

#. Occurrence SP1:2395:20629: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2395
msgctxt "text_id=20629 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駅前は様変わりしたといっても、下町はそう変わっていない。"
msgstr "  Though the area around the train station had undergone a dramatic makeover, the back streets were mostly unchanged."

#. Occurrence SP1:2400:20630: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2400
msgctxt "text_id=20630 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は昔馴染みのパチンコ店に突入するや、五千円を銀玉に両替。そのまま二階フロアにあがり、今日一番の出玉設定をしている台を見抜き、ハンドルに手を掛けた。"
msgstr "  Touko had exchanged 5,000 yen for some little silver pachinko balls before going upstairs and sitting at the machine she determined was paying out the most that day."

#. Occurrence SP1:2427:20631: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0028; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2427
msgctxt "text_id=20631 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そろそろ打ち止めかな。ひーふーみー……千両箱が十二箱か。まあ、四年ぶりにしちゃあ上等だろう」"
msgstr "\"Hmm, maybe now's a good time to stop. Let's see... I've got twelve boxes so far. Not too shabby after not playing for four years.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:2433:20632: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2433
msgctxt "text_id=20632 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　台詞は冷めたものだが、口元ではちょろい、と上機嫌の<体|てい>である。"
msgstr "  She sounded slightly disappointed, but her lips and posture betrayed her good humor."

#. Occurrence SP1:2453:20633: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2453
msgctxt "text_id=20633 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　パチンコホールは定番とも言える娯楽提供場だが、<盛|さか>んなのは日本だけで、外国ではあまり見られない。"
msgstr "  Pachinko parlors were a staple form of entertainment in Japan, but they were largely absent in other countries."

#. Occurrence SP1:2458:20634: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2458
msgctxt "text_id=20634 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　効率が悪い、時間がかかる、騙しあいの面白味がない、リスクとリターンがあっていない……等々の理由で、<本|・><場|・>のプレイヤーたちからは子供の遊びと敬遠されている。"
msgstr "  High-stakes gamers criticized it as inefficient, time-consuming, too luck-dependent, unrewarding, and so forth... basically, a child's game."

#. Occurrence SP1:2492:20635: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2492
msgctxt "text_id=20635 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の留学先でもそれは同じで、パチンコ店なぞ影も形も見あたらなかった。"
msgstr "  When Touko was studying abroad, she didn't see anything that even resembled a pachinko parlor."

#. Occurrence SP1:2497:20636: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2497
msgctxt "text_id=20636 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　帰国した彼女が真っ先にパチンコ店に突貫したのは、五年ぶりの懐かしさから―――"
msgstr "  However, she wasn't here playing pachinko because she was feeling nostalgic for it after five years."

#. Occurrence SP1:2502:20637: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2502
msgctxt "text_id=20637 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ではなく、単に、軍資金が底をつきかけた為である。"
msgstr "  She simply needed a war chest."

#. Occurrence SP1:2523:20638: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0029; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2523
msgctxt "text_id=20638 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「しっかし、ヘリのチャーター代だけで足が出るとは。日本は平和すぎて裏稼業の相場が高すぎるんだ、クソッ。"
msgstr "\"I didn't think the helicopter alone would set me over budget. Japan's so absurdly peaceful that all the black market dealers are too damned expensive."

#. Occurrence SP1:2529:20639: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0030; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2529
msgctxt "text_id=20639 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　おかげで無一文だ。とりあえず、ベオの<食|く>い<扶|ぶ><持|ち>だけでも<稼|かせ>がにゃならん」"
msgstr "  Now I'm totally broke. I have to at least make a little coin to keep Beo fed.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:2549:20640: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2549
msgctxt "text_id=20640 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　旧校舎を工房に改造する為、コンテナ三台分の資材をヘリコプターで隣町にまで輸送させた。"
msgstr "  Touko had chartered a helicopter to airlift three shipping containers full of materials to remodel the old school building into a workshop."

#. Occurrence SP1:2554:20641: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2554
msgctxt "text_id=20641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山奥である旧校舎にはトラックを走らせるだけの道がなく、結果、橙子の貯金はすっからかんになってしまったのだ。"
msgstr "  There weren't any roads a truck could take to get to the old school out deep in the mountains, so she had been forced to burn through the last of her savings."

#. Occurrence SP1:2582:20642: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0031; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2582
msgctxt "text_id=20642 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「お、スリーセブン。コイツは本格的におしまいかな。"
msgstr "\"Oh, three sevens! This game's just about done for."

#. Occurrence SP1:2594:20643: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0032; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2594
msgctxt "text_id=20643 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　まったく。こういう、どうでもいいゲームだけは星の巡りがいいときている」"
msgstr "  Really, only these boring games are worth playing for profit these days.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:2600:20644: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2600
msgctxt "text_id=20644 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　文句をいいつつ、口元はやはり上機嫌だ。"
msgstr "  Her smile remained in spite of her complaints."

#. Occurrence SP1:2605:20645: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2605
msgctxt "text_id=20645 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　片手はハンドル、片手は安い煙草、気ままに足を組んでパチンコ店を荒らすのも、まんざらでもない橙子だった。"
msgstr "  There was nothing more Touko-esque than her sitting cross-legged in this pachinko parlor, one hand on the machine with the other holding a cheap cigarette."

#. Occurrence SP1:2672:20646: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0033; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2672
msgctxt "text_id=20646 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「？」"
msgstr "\"Hm?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:2678:20647: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2678
msgctxt "text_id=20647 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　視界の<隅|すみ>で何かが固まっている気配を察して、メガネをかける。"
msgstr "  Touko noticed something out of the corner of her eye and put on her glasses to see better."

#. Occurrence SP1:2683:20648: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2683
msgctxt "text_id=20648 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　妙な物音に橙子が視線を向けると、そこには顔面蒼白の店員の姿があった。"
msgstr "  She glanced over toward the odd sounds she heard and saw a pale-faced parlor employee."

#. Occurrence SP1:2688:20649: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2688
msgctxt "text_id=20649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まだ高校生にしか見えない、童顔の店員である。"
msgstr "  He had a baby face and looked like he was still in high school."

#. Occurrence SP1:2743:20650: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2743
msgctxt "text_id=20650 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何があったのか、店員は橙子を見るなり硬直し、その後、あたふたと走り去った。"
msgstr "  Upon seeing Touko, he froze for a moment, then ran off."

#. Occurrence SP1:2748:20651: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2748
msgctxt "text_id=20651 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　というか、逃げだしていった。"
msgstr "  Or rather, he fled in a panic."

#. Occurrence SP1:2777:20652: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0034; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2777
msgctxt "text_id=20652 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……む。私、そんなに引く感じ？」"
msgstr "\"Oof... Am I that scary?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:2783:20653: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2783
msgctxt "text_id=20653 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子とて年頃の女性である。"
msgstr "  Mage though she was, Touko was still in the prime of her youth."

#. Occurrence SP1:2788:20654: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2788
msgctxt "text_id=20654 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見つめられたり声をかけられたりするのは正直面倒だが、それにしても、一目散に逃げられる、というのはあんまりではなかろうか、と唇をとがらせる。"
msgstr "  Though she didn't like it when guys ogled her or tried to strike up a conversation, she thought a boy running full tilt away from her was a bit much."

#. Occurrence SP1:2793:20655: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2793
msgctxt "text_id=20655 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの高校生……今度見かけたら脅かしてやろう、と心のチェックリストに書き込みつつ、橙子はゲームを再開した。"
msgstr "  Touko made a mental note to scare the crap out of that kid the next time she saw him, and returned to her game."

#. Occurrence SP1:2839:20656: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2839
msgctxt "text_id=20656 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　大量の景品を抱えてパチンコ店を後にする。"
msgstr "  With her winning tickets in hand, Touko left the pachinko parlor."

#. Occurrence SP1:2844:20657: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2844
msgctxt "text_id=20657 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　せっかくの大勝ちなのだが、最後の出来事のおかげで素直に喜べない。"
msgstr "  She had won quite a bit, but it was hard for her to feel good about it after what had happened at the end of her session."

#. Occurrence SP1:2878:20658: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2878
msgctxt "text_id=20658 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子はなんだかなー、と頭を掻きつつ、店の裏手にある換金所に足を向け、"
msgstr "  Wondering what that had been about, she looped around the back of the parlor to redeem her winnings for cash."

#. Occurrence SP1:2885:20659: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2885
msgctxt "text_id=20659 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「おや、橙子さんじゃないですか」"
msgstr "\"Well, if it isn't Touko!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:2891:20660: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2891
msgctxt "text_id=20660 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　四年ぶりに聞く、思い出深い声に呼び止められた。"
msgstr "  She stopped in her tracks, frozen by a familiar voice she hadn't heard in four years."

#. Occurrence SP1:2944:20661: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2944
msgctxt "text_id=20661 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ピン、と眠っていたベオの耳が立つ。"
msgstr "  Beo's ears perked up as he woke from his slumber."

#. Occurrence SP1:2949:20662: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2949
msgctxt "text_id=20662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時刻は日没前。"
msgstr "  It was just before sunset."

#. Occurrence SP1:2954:20663: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2954
msgctxt "text_id=20663 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　嗅ぎ慣れた匂いが近づいてくるのを察して、カレは大きな<欠伸|あくび>と共に目を覚ました。"
msgstr "  He opened his eyes with a big yawn, sniffing at a familiar scent in the air getting closer."

#. Occurrence SP1:3002:20664: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0018; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3002
msgctxt "text_id=20664 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「んー、よっと」"
msgstr "\"Mnggh...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3010:20665: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3010
msgctxt "text_id=20665 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオは机から床に飛び降り、ヒト形に変化する。"
msgstr "  Beo jumped down to the floor and transformed back into his human form."

#. Occurrence SP1:3015:20666: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3015
msgctxt "text_id=20666 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<仮初|かりそ>めの主従関係ではあるが、留守番役として、出迎えぐらいはきっちりとこなす気らしい。"
msgstr "  Though he and Touko didn't have a strict master-servant relationship, he felt he should at least go and greet her since he was supposed to be watching over the place in her absence."

#. Occurrence SP1:3065:20667: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0019; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3065
msgctxt "text_id=20667 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「あれ？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3085:20668: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3085
msgctxt "text_id=20668 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下で顔を会わすなり、ベオは違和感に顔をしかめた。"
msgstr "  Beo's face scrunched into a perplexed frown as they met in the hallway."

#. Occurrence SP1:3090:20669: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3090
msgctxt "text_id=20669 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　嗅ぎ慣れたはずの匂いに、なにか、余分な厚みが混じっている気がしたからだ。"
msgstr "  He sensed something more to the smell he'd been so used to."

#. Occurrence SP1:3122:20670: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0035; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3122
msgctxt "text_id=20670 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ただいまベオくん。"
msgstr "\"Hey Beo, I'm back."

#. Occurrence SP1:3122:20671: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0035; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3122
msgctxt "text_id=20671 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　はい、真面目にお留守番していたお土産」"
msgstr "  Here's your reward for watching the place while I was out.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3129:20672: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3129
msgctxt "text_id=20672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は手にした紙袋をベオに手渡す。"
msgstr "  Touko handed the paper bag she was holding to Beo."

#. Occurrence SP1:3134:20673: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3134
msgctxt "text_id=20673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ハンバーガーのたっぷり詰まった紙袋を受け取って、カレは喜びながら、やっぱりおかしい、と首を傾げた。"
msgstr "  Beo was happy to get his hands on the bag stuffed full of hamburgers, but he tilted his head at the odd lingering scent."

#. Occurrence SP1:3170:20674: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0036; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3170
msgctxt "text_id=20674 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「どうしたの、浮かない顔して。留守中、何かあった？」"
msgstr "\"Why the long face? Did something happen while I was gone?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3176:20675: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0020; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3176
msgctxt "text_id=20675 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「いや、思わず寝ちゃうぐらい何もなかったけど……トーコさんの方こそ何かあった？"
msgstr "\"No. I slept, it was so boring, actually. Did something happen with you, though?"

#. Occurrence SP1:3182:20676: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0021; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3182
msgctxt "text_id=20676 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　なんか元気ないし。妙に疲れてるし。なにより、ちゃんとボクの好きなお店のハンバーガー、買ってきてるし」"
msgstr "  You seem a little down, weirdly tired, and stranger than anything is the fact that you bought me my favorite hamburgers.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3209:20677: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0037; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3209
msgctxt "text_id=20677 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「え、そう？　別に、何もなかったけど？」"
msgstr "\"Oh, really? Nothing happened, though.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3243:20678: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0022; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3243
msgctxt "text_id=20678 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3248:20679: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3248
msgctxt "text_id=20679 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　怪しい。怪しいコトこの上ない。"
msgstr "  This was all extremely suspicious."

#. Occurrence SP1:3253:20680: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3253
msgctxt "text_id=20680 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオの不満点の一つとして、橙子の食事への<拘|こだわ>りの無さがあげられる。"
msgstr "  One pain point for Beo was Touko's usual complete lack of interest in food."

#. Occurrence SP1:3258:20681: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3258
msgctxt "text_id=20681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ハンバーガーなんてどこでも一緒だろう、とのたまう橙子は、どうでもいい店で買い物を済ませてしまうのだ。"
msgstr "  Touko thought that a hamburger was the same no matter where you ate one, so she had often just stopped at wherever was closest."

#. Occurrence SP1:3263:20682: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3263
msgctxt "text_id=20682 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな橙子が、日本ではまだ店舗の少ないロッテリャーでハンバーガーを買ってきてくれるなぞ百回に一回あるかないか。加えて、"
msgstr "  Thus, Touko would only stop at a certain Asian burger chain, still rare in Japan, maybe one percent of the time. Not to mention..."

#. Occurrence SP1:3298:20683: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0038; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3298
msgctxt "text_id=20683 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「い、いいじゃない、"
msgstr "\"W-what's the big deal?"

#. Occurrence SP1:3298:20684: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0038; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3298
msgctxt "text_id=20684 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ちゃんと好きなお店のバーガーを買ってきたんだからっ」"
msgstr "  So I bought you hamburgers from your favorite place, who cares?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3324:20685: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0039; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3324
msgctxt "text_id=20685 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「これは私なりの、ベオくんへの感謝の気持ち。"
msgstr "\"I was just trying to say thank you for everything."

#. Occurrence SP1:3330:20686: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0040; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3330
msgctxt "text_id=20686 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　今まで色々連れ回したけど、これからもよろしくね」"
msgstr "  I've dragged you around all over the place, and I just hope you'll stick with me.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3336:20687: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3336
msgctxt "text_id=20687 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この愛想笑いである。"
msgstr "  She had a sickly-sweet smile on her face."

#. Occurrence SP1:3341:20688: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3341
msgctxt "text_id=20688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　使い魔の人権なんて考えたコトもない蒼崎橙子がこんなコトを言いだしたら、三咲町に放たれた数十体の人形たちはロジックエラーの末、自爆して果てるだろう。"
msgstr "  If any of the puppets she had let loose in Misaki heard what she was saying right now, they'd probably fall into a logic error loop and self-destruct. Touko was not one to ever consider the rights of her familiars."

#. Occurrence SP1:3381:20689: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0023; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3381
msgctxt "text_id=20689 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「<胡散|うさん>くさい、<芝居|しばい>くさい、<抹香|まっこう>くさい！"
msgstr "\"This all smells fake, false, and full of lies to me!"

#. Occurrence SP1:3387:20690: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0024; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3387
msgctxt "text_id=20690 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　優しいトーコさんなんてトーコさんじゃない！"
msgstr "  You're not supposed to be nice! You're never nice!"

#. Occurrence SP1:3400:20691: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0025; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3400
msgctxt "text_id=20691 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　いっつも周りを恨んでいて、文句ばっかり言って、幸せそうなヒトたちをメチャクチャにしたいんだけど大義名分がないから我慢してる……そんな、理性のおかげでかろうじて性格破綻者を<免|まぬが>れてるトーコさんはどこいったのさ？」"
msgstr "  You hate everyone and everything around you, complain constantly, and want to ruin anyone else who's ever having a good time. You only restrain yourself because you don't have a good reason to act... What happened to the Touko that had nothing but a shred of intellect standing between herself and complete moral bankruptcy?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3434:20692: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0041; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3434
msgctxt "text_id=20692 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「失礼しちゃうなあ。私だって、たまには優しくなる時ぐらいあるんだから。"
msgstr "\"Well, that's awfully rude. I can be nice sometimes, you know."

#. Occurrence SP1:3440:20693: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0042; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3440
msgctxt "text_id=20693 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ほら、四年ぶりに故郷に帰ってきたのよ？　ベオくんだって里に帰ったら、ちょっとぐらいホッとするでしょ？"
msgstr "  It's been four years since I've been back here. Wouldn't you feel a little relaxed if you went back to your village?"

#. Occurrence SP1:3446:20694: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0043; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3446
msgctxt "text_id=20694 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　それと同じ。私だって、ホームシックになる程度の可愛らしさはあるんです」"
msgstr "  That's how it is for me. I'm still young, cute, and innocent enough to feel a little homesick from time to time.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3467:20695: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0026; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3467
msgctxt "text_id=20695 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「すっごい嘘。月が涙を流すぐらい嘘！」"
msgstr "\"Wow, what a load of crap. It must be a cold day in Hell!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3473:20696: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0044; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3473
msgctxt "text_id=20696 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ホントですぅ～！"
msgstr "\"I'm serious!"

#. Occurrence SP1:3479:20697: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0045; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3479
msgctxt "text_id=20697 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　もぅ、ベオくんそれ返して！　罰として夕食抜き！」"
msgstr "  That's it, you've ruined the moment. Give me back those hamburgers. You don't get to eat tonight!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3528:20698: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3528
msgctxt "text_id=20698 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　紙袋を取り返そうとする橙子を<躱|かわ>して、ベオは窓の外に飛び出した。"
msgstr "  Touko made a grab for the paper bag, but Beo dodged and jumped out the window."

#. Occurrence SP1:3533:20699: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3533
msgctxt "text_id=20699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そのまま器用に壁を蹴って、旧校舎の屋根まで退避する。"
msgstr "  He dexterously kicked off against the wall and scampered up onto the roof of the old school building."

#. Occurrence SP1:3554:20700: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0027; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3554
msgctxt "text_id=20700 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「なんだい。ほーんと、つまんない！"
msgstr "\"I can't believe what I'm hearing!"

#. Occurrence SP1:3560:20701: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0028; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3560
msgctxt "text_id=20701 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　言い訳するトーコさんとか、ボク、見たくない！」"
msgstr "  I never want to see you making excuses like that, Miss Touko!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3587:20702: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3587
msgctxt "text_id=20702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　紙袋からハンバーガーを取り出し、ぱくりとかぶりつく。"
msgstr "  He pulled out a hamburger from the paper bag and took a big bite out of it."

#. Occurrence SP1:3607:20703: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3607
msgctxt "text_id=20703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……しかし。"
msgstr "  That said..."

#. Occurrence SP1:3612:20704: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3612
msgctxt "text_id=20704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　芝居くさい、とは言ったが、橙子が普段より穏やかだったのは事実だった。"
msgstr "  Though her attitude had seemed like an act to Beo, it was true that Touko was in an unusually good mood."

#. Occurrence SP1:3617:20705: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3617
msgctxt "text_id=20705 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜそうなのかは分からないが、先ほどの橙子には特別な……というか、今までベオには見せなかった……感情があったようだ。"
msgstr "  It was unclear why that was the case, but Touko seemed to be feeling something special, or at least something she hadn't ever shown Beo before."

#. Occurrence SP1:3638:20706: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0029; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3638
msgctxt "text_id=20706 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「……なんだろ、あの匂い。"
msgstr "\"...What could that smell be?"

#. Occurrence SP1:3644:20707: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0030; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3644
msgctxt "text_id=20707 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　妙にふわふわしてて、うっとうしくて―――」"
msgstr "  It was so light, but also annoying...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3650:20708: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3650
msgctxt "text_id=20708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれがどんな感情なのか、ベオには分からない。"
msgstr "  Beo couldn't understand what exactly that feeling was."

#. Occurrence SP1:3655:20709: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3655
msgctxt "text_id=20709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　好きと嫌い、美味しいと不味いしか知らないカレには、まだそういう<機|き><微|び>が分からない。"
msgstr "  He only knew basic feelings such as like and dislike, delicious or disgusting. He wasn't able to articulate much further than that yet."

#. Occurrence SP1:3692:20710: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0031; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3692
msgctxt "text_id=20710 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ま、いいけど。ボクには関係ないし。トーコさんも、明日になればいつものトーコさんだろうし」"
msgstr "\"Eh, whatever. It has nothing to do with me anyway. She'll be the same old Touko tomorrow, I'm sure.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3698:20711: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3698
msgctxt "text_id=20711 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不満げにぼやきながら、パクパクとハンバーガーを消費していく。"
msgstr "  Beo continued to eat through his hamburgers, still not completely satisfied with the day's course of events."

#. Occurrence SP1:3703:20712: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3703
msgctxt "text_id=20712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……正直なところ。"
msgstr "  The truth was..."

#. Occurrence SP1:3708:20713: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3708
msgctxt "text_id=20713 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　分かりたいとは思わないが、未知があるコトに、ちょっとだけ不満なベオだった。"
msgstr "  Even if Beo didn't care enough to understand it, he was still a little upset that there was something he didn't know."

#. Occurrence SP1:3769:20714: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3769
msgctxt "text_id=20714 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それから何日か経過した。"
msgstr "  A few days passed."

#. Occurrence SP1:3774:20715: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3774
msgctxt "text_id=20715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　旧校舎の改造は人知れず進んでいく。"
msgstr "  Unbeknownst to the people of Misaki, progress was being made on the remodeling of the old school building."

#. Occurrence SP1:3779:20716: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3779
msgctxt "text_id=20716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あと一ヶ月近くここで待機、と言いつけられたベオは退屈で仕方がない。"
msgstr "  Meanwhile, Beo was bored out of his mind knowing he had to be stuck here for at least another month."

#. Occurrence SP1:3784:20717: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3784
msgctxt "text_id=20717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　日々とじこもって肉を食べているだけでは、心も体も<鈍|にぶ>るというもの。"
msgstr "  He could feel both his body and his mind dulling as he spent his days simply lounging around eating meat."

#. Occurrence SP1:3789:20718: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3789
msgctxt "text_id=20718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、"
msgstr "  On the other hand..."

#. Occurrence SP1:3833:20719: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0046; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3833
msgctxt "text_id=20719 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「買い出しに出てくるから、後はよろしくねー」"
msgstr "\"I'm going shopping. Take care of the place while I'm gone!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3864:20720: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0047; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3864
msgctxt "text_id=20720 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「元気してた？　はい、お土産のローストビーフ！」"
msgstr "\"Have fun while I was out? Here, I brought you home some roast beef!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3893:20721: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0048; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3893
msgctxt "text_id=20721 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「いってきまーす。屋上の機材、片づけておいてね～」"
msgstr "\"I'm going out for a bit! Tidy up those materials on the roof while I'm out, okay?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3933:20722: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0049; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3933
msgctxt "text_id=20722 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ただいまー。今日もお留守番、ご苦労さま"
msgstr "\"I'm hooome! Thanks for watching over the place again today."

#. Occurrence SP1:3933:20723: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0049; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3933
msgctxt "text_id=20723 | speaker=touko"
msgid "」"
msgstr "\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3965:20724: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0050; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3965
msgctxt "text_id=20724 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「よし、行ってくるでござる」"
msgstr "\"Off I go, my trusty vassal!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:3995:20725: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0051; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3995
msgctxt "text_id=20725 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「おつかれー！　え、お酒くさい？　ばっか、酔ってなんかないですぅー。もーぜんぜん酔ってなんかないもーん」"
msgstr "\"'Eyyy, good work! Huh? I shmell like booze? Oh silly, I'm not drunk at all! Not one... not one bit... I can keep goin'!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4015:20726: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4015
msgctxt "text_id=20726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このように。"
msgstr "  This is what Touko had become."

#. Occurrence SP1:4020:20727: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4020
msgctxt "text_id=20727 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自宅警備中のカレとは対照的に、魔術師は実に行動的、かつ上機嫌だった。"
msgstr "  The mage was constantly out and always in a good mood, in stark contrast to Beo, who spent his days doing nothing."

#. Occurrence SP1:4025:20728: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4025
msgctxt "text_id=20728 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　着々と要塞化していく<臨時工房|アジト>の出来に、よほど満足しているらしい。"
msgstr "  Evidently, she was happy with how her workshop was becoming more and more fortified by the day."

#. Occurrence SP1:4071:20729: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0032; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4071
msgctxt "text_id=20729 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ちがう。もー、ぜぇっっっったいちがう。"
msgstr "\"No. That's DEFINITELY not it."

#. Occurrence SP1:4077:20730: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0033; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4077
msgctxt "text_id=20730 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　そんなんでトーコさんの機嫌はよくなんないし。"
msgstr "  That isn't enough to put Miss Touko in such a good mood."

#. Occurrence SP1:4083:20731: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0034; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4083
msgctxt "text_id=20731 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　<旧校舎|こ　こ>に関しちゃグチグチ不満ばっかりこぼしてるし。"
msgstr "  She's constantly complaining about the state of this place."

#. Occurrence SP1:4089:20732: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0035; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4089
msgctxt "text_id=20732 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　何より、ござるとかバカっぽいコト言わないし」"
msgstr "  Plus, the silly samurai way she's been talking is so not like her.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4116:20733: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0052; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4116
msgctxt "text_id=20733 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「うん？　どうしたのベオくん。すっごく不細工な顔してるけど。そろそろ暴れたくて仕方がない？」"
msgstr "\"Hm? What's wrong, Beo? You look unhappy. I bet you're ready to get out of here and go wild, huh?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4151:20734: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0036; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4151
msgctxt "text_id=20734 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「そういうモンダイじゃありませーん。"
msgstr "\"That's not the problem here."

#. Occurrence SP1:4157:20735: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0037; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4157
msgctxt "text_id=20735 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　……まあそりゃ、早く本命とやらと戦ってみたいけど、もうちょっと先なんでしょ。ならガマンする。トーコさんの言葉は今のところハズレないから、おとなしく従います。"
msgstr "  ...I do want to hurry up and get this fight on, but I know it's not going to be for a while yet. I'm just waiting and doing as you ask."

#. Occurrence SP1:4163:20736: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0038; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4163
msgctxt "text_id=20736 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　けど―――」"
msgstr "  But...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4169:20737: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0053; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4169
msgctxt "text_id=20737 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「けど？」"
msgstr "\"But?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4195:20738: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0039; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4195
msgctxt "text_id=20738 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「なんかヘン。いつも下準備の時はこれぐらいヒマだけど、緊張感がない。"
msgstr "\"Something's... weird. I know there's always nothing to do when we're preparing, but this time it doesn't feel tense the way it should."

#. Occurrence SP1:4201:20739: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0040; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4201
msgctxt "text_id=20739 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　毎日食べて寝て食べて寝てじゃ<肥|ふと>るー。ぶくぶくに<肥|ふと>るよー。そんなのカッコヨクないよー」"
msgstr "  I'm just eating and sleeping, eating and sleeping, every day. It's going to make me fat. I don't want to be fat!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4237:20740: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0054; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4237
msgctxt "text_id=20740 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「なに言ってるんだか。ベオくんにそんな心配は無用でしょう。<排泄|はいせつ>もしないクセに、まともな生き物ぶってるんじゃありません」"
msgstr "\"What are you talking about? You shouldn't be worrying about that. You don't even need to use the bathroom, so don't act like you're any kind of normal creature.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4243:20741: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0041; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4243
msgctxt "text_id=20741 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「うん。だから、おもにトーコさんが。ブクブクに」"
msgstr "\"Fair point. But *you* will! You're going to get as fat as a pig!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4270:20742: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0055; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4270
msgctxt "text_id=20742 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ベオくん、それホント！？"
msgstr "\"Are you serious?!"

#. Occurrence SP1:4276:20743: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0056; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4276
msgctxt "text_id=20743 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　数値は変わってない筈だけど、なんかこう、アストラル的に増えちゃったりしてる！？」"
msgstr "  I've been weighing myself and the number hasn't changed at all. Am I astrally getting fatter?! Can you tell?!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4319:20744: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4319
msgctxt "text_id=20744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これである。"
msgstr "  This is what Beo was talking about."

#. Occurrence SP1:4324:20745: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4324
msgctxt "text_id=20745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオの目の確かさを知っている魔術師は、体重計よりカレの鑑識眼を信じたらしい。"
msgstr "  Touko knew the accuracy of Beo's eye, and trusted his discerning vision over even the numbers on her scale."

#. Occurrence SP1:4329:20746: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4329
msgctxt "text_id=20746 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつもの橙子ならメガネを外し、"
msgstr "  Normally Touko would just remove her glasses and say something like,"

#. Occurrence SP1:4363:20747: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0057; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4363
msgctxt "text_id=20747 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「唐突だが、特攻兵器の有用性を確認したくなった。"
msgstr "\"I know this is out of the blue, but I want to test the utility of this suicide attack weapon."

#. Occurrence SP1:4374:20748: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0058; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4374
msgctxt "text_id=20748 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ああいや、意見は聞いていない。さあベオ、この首輪をつけてみろ。思いっきりハイに飛べるぞ」"
msgstr "  No, no, I don't want to hear your opinion about it, Beo. Just put this collar on. It'll launch you high into the sky!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4380:20749: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4380
msgctxt "text_id=20749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぐらいは本気で実行してくるだろうに、<肥|にぶ>っているにも程がある。"
msgstr "  But she hadn't done anything of the sort, and it was beyond weird for her."

#. Occurrence SP1:4431:20750: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0042; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4431
msgctxt "text_id=20750 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「……別に<増|ふ>えてないよ。"
msgstr "\"...No, you haven't gained any weight."

#. Occurrence SP1:4437:20751: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0043; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4437
msgctxt "text_id=20751 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　昨日とちょっとの上下差はあるけど、そんなの人間なら当たり前だし。いちいち本気にするとか、見苦しいからやめてほしい」"
msgstr "  There's a slight variation from yesterday, but that's normal for a human. It would be really silly for you to worry about that seriously, so please don't.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4471:20752: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0059; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4471
msgctxt "text_id=20752 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「本当？"
msgstr "\"Really?"

#. Occurrence SP1:4477:20753: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0060; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4477
msgctxt "text_id=20753 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　こう、後でボテっとくるような気配とか、ない？」"
msgstr "  You don't think it's just gonna show up later or anything?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4483:20754: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0044; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4483
msgctxt "text_id=20754 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ないってば。昨日摂った栄養分はきれいに分配されてるし。いつも通りのトーコさんだよ」"
msgstr "\"No, the nutrients you consumed yesterday have distributed nicely throughout your body. You're the same Touko as always.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4516:20755: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4516
msgctxt "text_id=20755 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは嘘だ。"
msgstr "  That last part was a lie."

#. Occurrence SP1:4521:20756: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4521
msgctxt "text_id=20756 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　厳密に言えば、橙子はベオの知る“いつも通り”ではない。"
msgstr "  She was not the same Touko that Beo had always known."

#. Occurrence SP1:4526:20757: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4526
msgctxt "text_id=20757 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　肉体面では寸分変わらぬ彼女でも、数日前から妙な違和感が付きまとっている。"
msgstr "  Even though she was physically the same, there was something still odd about her since a few days ago."

#. Occurrence SP1:4546:20758: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4546
msgctxt "text_id=20758 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの、妙に<浮|う>わ<浮|う>わした匂い。"
msgstr "  That strange, floaty, lingering scent was still there."

#. Occurrence SP1:4551:20759: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4551
msgctxt "text_id=20759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　野生の獣にしか嗅ぎ取れない変化だが、それは日に日に増していっている。"
msgstr "  It was a change that only a wild beast like Beo could discern, but it was getting stronger with each passing day."

#. Occurrence SP1:4556:20760: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4556
msgctxt "text_id=20760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カレが不機嫌なのは、あの匂いが“どんな味”なのか、まったく見当がつかないからだった。"
msgstr "  Beo was annoyed because he just could not figure out what that scent was."

#. Occurrence SP1:4587:20761: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0061; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4587
msgctxt "text_id=20761 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「それなら安心安心、と。"
msgstr "\"What a relief!"

#. Occurrence SP1:4601:20762: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0062; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4601
msgctxt "text_id=20762 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　私は出かけてくるから、お留守番よろしくね～！」"
msgstr "  I'm headed out. Take care of the place while I'm out!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4613:20763: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4613
msgctxt "text_id=20763 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオの不機嫌さに気付かず、橙子は緩みきった足取りで旧校舎を後にした。"
msgstr "  Touko failed to notice Beo's poor mood and left the old school building in her usual carefree mood."

#. Occurrence SP1:4618:20764: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4618
msgctxt "text_id=20764 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここ数日、ずっとこれの繰り返しである。"
msgstr "  This was how it'd been for days now."

#. Occurrence SP1:4660:20765: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0045; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4660
msgctxt "text_id=20765 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4665:20766: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4665
msgctxt "text_id=20766 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　窓硝子に映った自分の姿を見て、ベオはしばし思案した。"
msgstr "  Beo stared at his own reflection in the window and contemplated for a while."

#. Occurrence SP1:4670:20767: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4670
msgctxt "text_id=20767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これでは何の解決にもならない。"
msgstr "  Unfortunately, this wouldn't solve anything."

#. Occurrence SP1:4675:20768: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4675
msgctxt "text_id=20768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雇い主の様子がおかしいのはタダさねばならないし、"
msgstr "  It wouldn't change the fact that his employer was still acting strangely,"

#. Occurrence SP1:4680:20769: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4680
msgctxt "text_id=20769 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　胸に湧いたこのモヤモヤも晴らさないと楽しくない。"
msgstr "  and it wouldn't get rid of the uncertainty he was constantly feeling in his chest."

#. Occurrence SP1:4715:20770: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4715
msgctxt "text_id=20770 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　金色の生き物は仕方あるまい、と鹿爪らしく頷いて、"
msgstr "  He knew he didn't have much other choice."

#. Occurrence SP1:4722:20771: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0046; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4722
msgctxt "text_id=20771 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「よし。トーコさんを尾行しよう」"
msgstr "\"I guess I'll just tail her.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4728:20772: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4728
msgctxt "text_id=20772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今日一日だけ、自分の信条を<隅|すみ>に追いやるコトにした。"
msgstr "  He decided to let go of his principles for just this one day."

#. Occurrence SP1:4790:20773: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4790
msgctxt "text_id=20773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“今年の冬の寒さは、例年より厳しくなるらしい。”"
msgstr "\"They say winter's going to be colder than usual this year.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4795:20774: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4795
msgctxt "text_id=20774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“衣食住の備えは万全に。”"
msgstr "\"Make sure you've got sufficient food, clothing, and shelter.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4800:20775: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4800
msgctxt "text_id=20775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“僕らに衣は関係ないけど、残り二つは大切だよ。”"
msgstr "\"We should be fine on clothing, but make sure to shore up the other two.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:4806:20776: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4806
msgctxt "text_id=20776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな世間話を聞きながら、カレは三咲町を横断する。"
msgstr "  He listened to the talk around town as he passed through Misaki."

#. Occurrence SP1:4835:20777: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4835
msgctxt "text_id=20777 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　平日の午後一時過ぎ。"
msgstr "  It was just past one in the afternoon on a weekday."

#. Occurrence SP1:4840:20778: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4840
msgctxt "text_id=20778 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　会社員は昼休みを終えてオフィスビルへ、学生たちはまだ学校で授業中だ。"
msgstr "  Workers had returned to the office after their lunch breaks, and the kids were all still in school."

#. Occurrence SP1:4845:20779: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4845
msgctxt "text_id=20779 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人混みは主婦が中心で、大通りはどことなくまったりとした雰囲気だった。"
msgstr "  The main street was fairly calm and relaxed with mostly housewives out and about."

#. Occurrence SP1:4878:20780: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4878
msgctxt "text_id=20780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな穏やかな世界に、不穏な異分子がひとり。"
msgstr "  Yet one person stood out in this calm and gentle sea of people."

#. Occurrence SP1:4883:20781: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4883
msgctxt "text_id=20781 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　買い物中の奥さま方、売店の店員、外回りのサラリーマン等から様々な視線を浴びながら、蒼崎橙子はどこ吹く風で大通りを闊歩する。"
msgstr "  Touko endured the stares of the housewives out shopping, salespeople in their shops, and salarymen out on business as she walked through the main street."

#. Occurrence SP1:4888:20782: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4888
msgctxt "text_id=20782 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目立つ服装はもとより、彼女本人の“姿勢の強さ”が人目を惹くのだろう。"
msgstr "  It wasn't just her sense of style that stood out, but also her generally powerful presence that attracted eyes."

#. Occurrence SP1:4893:20783: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4893
msgctxt "text_id=20783 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　俗に言う、モデル歩きというヤツである。"
msgstr "  To put it simply, she walked with the confidence of a model on the runway."

#. Occurrence SP1:4934:20784: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0047; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4934
msgctxt "text_id=20784 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“……人には目立つなって言うクセに、本人はアレだもんなあ。潜伏期間中、相手に見つかるのはボクだけのせいじゃないと思う……”」"
msgstr "(She's always telling me to try not to stand out, but look at her! It won't be only my fault if we're discovered...)"

#. Occurrence SP1:4940:20785: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4940
msgctxt "text_id=20785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんて、言いたいコトをぐっと堪えながらカレは雇い主の後方、十メートルの位置をキープする。"
msgstr "  Beo kept about ten yards behind Touko, careful not to actually mutter the words he was thinking in his head."

#. Occurrence SP1:4963:20786: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4963
msgctxt "text_id=20786 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子本人の名誉の為に注釈しておくと、彼女とて自分がどれほど目立つか理解している。"
msgstr "  In Touko's defense, she was fully aware of how much she stood out in a crowd."

#. Occurrence SP1:4968:20787: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4968
msgctxt "text_id=20787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今は人通りの少ない時間帯なのですっぴんだが、学生や社会人が多くなる時間帯では視線よけのルーンを刻んだ<装飾|アクセ>できらびやかさを四割ほど落としているのだ。"
msgstr "  If she was out at a busier time of day, she always wore an accessory inscribed with a rune that diverted people's attention away from her and made her stand out approximately forty percent less."

#. Occurrence SP1:5002:20788: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5002
msgctxt "text_id=20788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子は商店街でいくつか買い物を済ませた後、住宅地に向かった。"
msgstr "  Touko finished up her shopping and headed toward the residential part of town."

#. Occurrence SP1:5007:20789: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5007
msgctxt "text_id=20789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は何の変哲もない一般家屋を訪問した。"
msgstr "  She walked up to a house that looked completely normal, "

#. Occurrence SP1:5012:20790: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5012
msgctxt "text_id=20790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベルを押し、「蒼崎橙子です」と告げると、門は静かに開かれた。"
msgstr "  rang the doorbell and, after stating her name, the door opened quietly."

#. Occurrence SP1:5017:20791: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5017
msgctxt "text_id=20791 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうも、商店街の買い物はこの家への土産であるらしい。"
msgstr "  It looked as though the things she had bought were for the resident of this house."

#. Occurrence SP1:5050:20792: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5050
msgctxt "text_id=20792 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　表札には<浅葱|あさぎ>とある。"
msgstr "  The nameplate outside read \"Asagi.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5055:20793: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5055
msgctxt "text_id=20793 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふと、<潮|しお>の匂いがする、とカレは感じ取ったが、三咲町は山間の街だ。"
msgstr "  Misaki was in the mountains. But, for just a moment, Beo got a whiff of sea brine."

#. Occurrence SP1:5060:20794: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5060
msgctxt "text_id=20794 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんなところに潮の匂いが在るのはおかしい、何か別の匂いだろう、とカレは忘れるコトにした。"
msgstr "  Assuming he must have just mistaken it for some other smell, he put it out of his mind."

#. Occurrence SP1:5094:20795: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5094
msgctxt "text_id=20795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は三十分ほどで出てきた。"
msgstr "  Touko came out of the house after about thirty minutes."

#. Occurrence SP1:5099:20796: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5099
msgctxt "text_id=20796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女の中ではわりと重い案件だったのか、家から出るなり両腕を空に伸ばして深呼吸をする。"
msgstr "  She stretched her arms above her head and took a deep breath. Whatever had gone on inside seemed to have been rather serious."

#. Occurrence SP1:5104:20797: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5104
msgctxt "text_id=20797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　肩の荷を下ろすような、そんな伸びだった。"
msgstr "  It was as if a weight had been lifted from her shoulders."

#. Occurrence SP1:5125:20798: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0063; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5125
msgctxt "text_id=20798 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「これで根回しは終了、っと。"
msgstr "\"That takes care of those negotiations, at least."

#. Occurrence SP1:5131:20799: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0064; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5131
msgctxt "text_id=20799 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　後は―――最後の念押しね。ああ、面倒くさい」"
msgstr "  Now all that's left is a final reminder...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5137:20800: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5137
msgctxt "text_id=20800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やれやれと呟く橙子。"
msgstr "  Touko murmured, exasperated."

#. Occurrence SP1:5142:20801: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5142
msgctxt "text_id=20801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が。口調とは裏腹に、口元からはやっぱり例の、浮わ浮わした匂いがするのであった。"
msgstr "  But lurking behind her words, Beo could still detect that lofty scent emanating from her mouth."

#. Occurrence SP1:5187:20802: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5187
msgctxt "text_id=20802 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子が次に向かったのは、何の変哲もないアパートだった。"
msgstr "  Her next stop was another plain-looking apartment."

#. Occurrence SP1:5192:20803: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5192
msgctxt "text_id=20803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　傍目には偶然通りかかったように見えるが、カレの鼻は誤魔化せない。"
msgstr "  It looked as though she had just happened to walk by, but Beo's nose was not so easily deceived."

#. Occurrence SP1:5197:20804: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5197
msgctxt "text_id=20804 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は散歩するような素振りで時間を調整し、午後二時三十分、きっちりとこの時間に合わせてアパートにやってきたのだ。"
msgstr "  Touko made it look like she was just aimlessly killing time, but she had in fact arranged to arrive at the apartment at exactly 2:30 PM."

#. Occurrence SP1:5217:20805: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5217
msgctxt "text_id=20805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして、アパートの駐車場には、"
msgstr "  In the parking lot of the apartment..."

#. Occurrence SP1:5234:20806: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5234
msgctxt "text_id=20806 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「へ？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5239:20807: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5239
msgctxt "text_id=20807 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たったいま一階の部屋から出てきた、<周瀬|すせ><律架|りつか>の姿があった。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka Suse stepped out of a room on the first floor."

#. Occurrence SP1:5272:20808: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0065; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5272
msgctxt "text_id=20808 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「はあい、お久しぶり。"
msgstr "\"Hey, long time no see!"

#. Occurrence SP1:5272:20809: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0065; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5272
msgctxt "text_id=20809 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　こんなところでバッタリ出会うなんて奇遇ね、律架」"
msgstr "  Fancy seeing you here, Ritsuka!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5290:20810: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5290
msgctxt "text_id=20810 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「うそ、トコちゃん！？　貴女、帰ってきてたの！？」"
msgstr "\"No way! Is that you, Toko?! You're back in town?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5326:20811: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0066; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5326
msgctxt "text_id=20811 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ええ。ちょっと前にね、こっそり、人目を忍ぶように、窓から侵入するサンタクロースさながらに。"
msgstr "\"Yeah, since a little bit ago. I've been hiding out and laying low."

#. Occurrence SP1:5338:20812: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0067; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5338
msgctxt "text_id=20812 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　あ、言うまでもなく目的はこの町をぶっ潰すコト。"
msgstr "  It goes without saying that I'm here to crush this town, of course."

#. Occurrence SP1:5338:20813: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0067; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5338
msgctxt "text_id=20813 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　私の過去共々キレイさっぱり清算するため、この度、準備万端でやってまいりました。"
msgstr "  I've come totally prepared to wipe the slate clean of my past this time."

#. Occurrence SP1:5350:20814: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0068; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5350
msgctxt "text_id=20814 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　なのでぇー。邪魔になる協会の人間とか教会の人間とか、気付かれる前にやっちゃうぞ☆」"
msgstr "  That's why I'm going to get this done before anyone from the Association or Church can stand in my way!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5377:20815: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5377
msgctxt "text_id=20815 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「あらあら、それはご丁寧にどうも……って、"
msgstr "\"Well, how kind of you... Wait."

#. Occurrence SP1:5389:20816: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5389
msgctxt "text_id=20816 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　トコちゃん、それわたしのことー！"
msgstr "  Are you talking about ME?"

#. Occurrence SP1:5389:20817: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5389
msgctxt "text_id=20817 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　協会の人間って、いまわたししかいないんですけどー！」"
msgstr "  I'm the only one in the Association now, you know!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5400:20818: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0069; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5400
msgctxt "text_id=20818 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「あら不思議。むしろラッキー？"
msgstr "\"Oh, how strange! Or maybe that's lucky for me?"

#. Occurrence SP1:5400:20819: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0069; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5400
msgctxt "text_id=20819 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　懐かしくて散歩していたら、まさか標的の一人に出遭うなんて。ひとつ手間が省けた感じ？」"
msgstr "  To think I'd run into one of my targets while out here on a walk like this. I guess that saves me some trouble, huh?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5436:20820: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5436
msgctxt "text_id=20820 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「関係ないのー！　わたし、協会と関係ないからー！"
msgstr "\"I've got nothing to do with the Association, I swear!"

#. Occurrence SP1:5448:20821: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5448
msgctxt "text_id=20821 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　だってここ一年、真面目に仕事してないし！"
msgstr "  I haven't done any serious work in a year or more!"

#. Occurrence SP1:5459:20822: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5459
msgctxt "text_id=20822 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　というか、仮にも兄弟子をつかまえて本気で殺すとか言わないでほしいですー！」"
msgstr "  Please don't tell me you're here to kill me! We were like brothers-in-training, right? Please don't!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5492:20823: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5492
msgctxt "text_id=20823 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アパートから現れた女性は、わたわたと涙目で手を振り回す。"
msgstr "  The woman was tearfully flailing her arms at this point."

#. Occurrence SP1:5497:20824: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5497
msgctxt "text_id=20824 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が、それは無用の心配だ。"
msgstr "  She had nothing to worry about, though."

#. Occurrence SP1:5502:20825: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5502
msgctxt "text_id=20825 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　向かいの家の塀の穴から覗いているカレからしてみれば、橙子の殺気は偽物である。"
msgstr "  Beo could see even from where he was peering through the fence that Touko had no real intent to kill anyone."

#. Occurrence SP1:5507:20826: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5507
msgctxt "text_id=20826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子は、常からして他人をからかって愉しむ癖のある、たいへん困った女性だ。"
msgstr "  She had a terrible habit of messing with people for her own entertainment; this time was no different."

#. Occurrence SP1:5512:20827: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5512
msgctxt "text_id=20827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その困ったところが、あの相手に対しては二倍増しで表れているだけらしい。"
msgstr "  Unfortunately, the pleasure she took in it only made the target of her jokes feel doubly worse."

#. Occurrence SP1:5556:20828: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0070; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5556
msgctxt "text_id=20828 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……はあ。それを言うなら姉弟子でしょ」"
msgstr "\"...Hah. At least say we're like sisters.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5568:20829: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5568
msgctxt "text_id=20829 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「えー。だってトコちゃん、妹って感じしないんだもん。間違っても姉弟子、なんて胸を張って言えませんっ」"
msgstr "\"Whaaat? But Toko, you don't feel like a little sister at all! I'd never dare call myself your big sister!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5580:20830: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0071; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5580
msgctxt "text_id=20830 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そうよね。技量的にも、とても先輩なんて言えるものじゃなかったし。律架の特技なんて、今じゃ深夜販売の商品以下だし。そろそろ職替え考えたら？　いいとこ紹介するよ。イタリアで見付けた、もう廃業寸前のサーカス一座とかどう？」"
msgstr "\"True enough. You don't have the skills to claim to be my senior, to begin with. If I had to describe what you're good at, it's even worse than those dumb late-night infomercial products these days. Have you thought about a career change? I can refer you to a good place. There's this old and nearly bankrupt circus in Italy that's hiring.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5621:20831: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5621
msgctxt "text_id=20831 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「そんな日給バイトはこりごりです！"
msgstr "\"I've had enough of per diem work, thank you very much!"

#. Occurrence SP1:5621:20832: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5621
msgctxt "text_id=20832 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　せめて週給のところを紹介して！」"
msgstr "  Find me something with at least a weekly salary!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5627:20833: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0072; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5627
msgctxt "text_id=20833 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……うわあ。通販以下ってところは否定しないんだ」"
msgstr "\"...Wow, you aren't even denying that you're worse than a mail-order doodad.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5639:20834: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0009; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5639
msgctxt "text_id=20834 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「なぜ？　トコちゃんの指摘は正しいわ。"
msgstr "\"Why would I? You're totally right."

#. Occurrence SP1:5651:20835: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0010; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5651
msgctxt "text_id=20835 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　だってわたし、何もできない役立たずですから。"
msgstr "  I'm completely useless!"

#. Occurrence SP1:5651:20836: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0010; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5651
msgctxt "text_id=20836 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　魔術協会いちのお荷物、ここに参上～♪」"
msgstr "  That's me, the Mage's Association's most worthless piece of baggage!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5691:20837: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5691
msgctxt "text_id=20837 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぽやぽやした笑顔に毒気を抜かれたのか、橙子もつられて微笑む。"
msgstr "  Maybe she was taken aback by Ritsuka's guileless smile, but Touko couldn't help but grin back at her."

#. Occurrence SP1:5696:20838: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5696
msgctxt "text_id=20838 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　傍目には<和|わ><気|き><藹々|あいあい>とした関係だ。"
msgstr "  If one didn't know better, they would seem like good friends."

#. Occurrence SP1:5739:20839: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0011; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5739
msgctxt "text_id=20839 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「あ、わたしへの疑いは解けたとみたわ。"
msgstr "\"I guess that clears up any suspicions you might have had about me."

#. Occurrence SP1:5751:20840: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0012; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5751
msgctxt "text_id=20840 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　それなら寄ってく？　これから用事があったんだけど、別に後回しでいいし。久しぶりだもの、お互いつもる話とか楽しそうじゃない？」"
msgstr "  And if that's the case, do you want to come in for a bit? I have some things I need to get done, but I can do them later. It's been such a long time, and I'd like to catch up.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5778:20841: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0073; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5778
msgctxt "text_id=20841 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ほんと、相変わらずゆるゆるね律架は。"
msgstr "\"You're as easygoing as ever."

#. Occurrence SP1:5784:20842: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0074; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5784
msgctxt "text_id=20842 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　たしかに気が変わったわ。その様子じゃ協会との関係なんて無いようなものだし、貴女は貴女の信条を守っているようだし。"
msgstr "  You're right. You've convinced me. You clearly don't have anything going on with the Association, and you're upholding your own principles."

#. Occurrence SP1:5790:20843: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0075; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5790
msgctxt "text_id=20843 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　―――そう、本気で青子の味方なんだ」"
msgstr "  ...So you're really on Aoko's side, huh?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5817:20844: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0013; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5817
msgctxt "text_id=20844 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「もっちろん！　アコちゃんはまだ半人前ですもの。"
msgstr "\"Of course! She's still learning the ropes."

#. Occurrence SP1:5829:20845: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0014; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5829
msgctxt "text_id=20845 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　付かず離れず、あくまで他人行儀に、アコちゃんが死ぬような目にあっても遠くから見守るわ」"
msgstr "  I just watch over her from a distance. Nothing more, nothing less.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5841:20846: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0076; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5841
msgctxt "text_id=20846 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「それは結構。青子もホント、いい性格をした理解者に恵まれたもんだ」"
msgstr "\"That's fine then. She's lucky to have someone like you that understands her.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5866:20847: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5866
msgctxt "text_id=20847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子は一歩、周瀬律架から身を引いた。"
msgstr "  Touko took a step back, away from Ritsuka."

#. Occurrence SP1:5871:20848: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5871
msgctxt "text_id=20848 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やや名残惜しげな顔が、話はここで終わりである事を示している。"
msgstr "  She looked a bit regretful as she signaled that the conversation was over."

#. Occurrence SP1:5904:20849: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5904
msgctxt "text_id=20849 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「あれ、寄っていかないの？"
msgstr "\"Oh, you're not coming inside?"

#. Occurrence SP1:5910:20850: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0016; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5910
msgctxt "text_id=20850 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　わたし、コーヒー淹れるの上手くなったよ？」"
msgstr "  I pour a pretty good cup of coffee nowadays.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5928:20851: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0077; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5928
msgctxt "text_id=20851 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ありがとう。けど遠慮しとく。こっちはまだ潜伏中だし、街攻略の準備もあるしね。"
msgstr "\"Thanks, but I'll have to pass. I'm still laying low, and I have a lot to do before I take over this town."

#. Occurrence SP1:5928:20852: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0077; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5928
msgctxt "text_id=20852 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ここで緊張感をなくすのは<上|う><手|ま>くないでしょ」"
msgstr "  I shouldn't relax too much just yet.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:5964:20853: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0017; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5964
msgctxt "text_id=20853 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「あらまあ、真面目さん。"
msgstr "\"Well, aren't we the hard worker?"

#. Occurrence SP1:5976:20854: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0018; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5976
msgctxt "text_id=20854 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　でもそうよね、トコちゃんはそういう人でした。根を詰めすぎて、目的より手段そのものに熱中しちゃうタイプ。"
msgstr "  But you've always been like that. You always were one to focus on the process more than the goal."

#. Occurrence SP1:5982:20855: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0019; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5982
msgctxt "text_id=20855 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　ほーんと、どんな準備かは分からないけど、トコちゃんに狙われる人たちはたいへんだ」"
msgstr "  I've no idea what kind of preparations you're up to, but I feel sorry for whoever it is you're going after.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6008:20856: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0078; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6008
msgctxt "text_id=20856 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ん？　別に普通でしょ？　基本、魔術戦やって、こっちが勝ったら刻印を貰うだけ。"
msgstr "\"Eh, it's just the usual. We'll have a magecraft battle, the victor will take the other's Crest, and that'll be it."

#. Occurrence SP1:6014:20857: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0079; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6014
msgctxt "text_id=20857 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　時代遅れの魔女じゃあるまいし、倒した相手に呪いとかかけないわよ、私？」"
msgstr "  I'm not an old-fashioned witch. I'm not going to put a curse on whoever I defeat in battle, you know?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6049:20858: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0020; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6049
msgctxt "text_id=20858 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「だからそこです。"
msgstr "\"That's exactly what I'm talking about, though."

#. Occurrence SP1:6055:20859: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0021; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6055
msgctxt "text_id=20859 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　相手の命より収集を優先してるじゃない。"
msgstr "  You're more interested in collecting their Crest than their life."

#. Occurrence SP1:6066:20860: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0022; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6066
msgctxt "text_id=20860 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　その人たち、目玉だけになっても生きている、なんてコトにならなければいいけど。"
msgstr "  I'd just feel sorry for them if that became their sole purpose in life."

#. Occurrence SP1:6077:20861: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0023; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6077
msgctxt "text_id=20861 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　貴女は気を<遣|つか>っているつもりだろうけど、相手にとっては拷問だからね、それ」"
msgstr "  You might think you're going easy on them, but that's like living under constant torture.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6115:20862: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6115
msgctxt "text_id=20862 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なるほど、と橙子は頷いた。"
msgstr "  Touko nodded to show her agreement."

#. Occurrence SP1:6120:20863: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6120
msgctxt "text_id=20863 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　自分の収集癖は、傍目にはそう映るのかと。"
msgstr "  Her collection of Crests would appear that way on the outside."

#. Occurrence SP1:6179:20864: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6179
msgctxt "text_id=20864 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子は戦闘に利益を求める。"
msgstr "  Touko sought profit in combat."

#. Occurrence SP1:6184:20865: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6184
msgctxt "text_id=20865 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　敵対した魔術師を倒した後、彼らが有益な素材を提供してくれるのなら命までは奪わない。"
msgstr "  If a mage she defeated could provide her with profitable materials, she would not take their life."

#. Occurrence SP1:6189:20866: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6189
msgctxt "text_id=20866 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　むしろ、ギブアンドテイクとばかりに無理やり命を助けさえする。"
msgstr "  She would even save their life if she knew it would be to her advantage to do so."

#. Occurrence SP1:6194:20867: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6194
msgctxt "text_id=20867 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　結果、ロンドンの彼女の工房には『術式提供者用・慰安施設』なるものが出来てしまった。"
msgstr "  As a result, her workshop in London had a facility specifically built for the \"comfort\" of her magical suppliers."

#. Occurrence SP1:6199:20868: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6199
msgctxt "text_id=20868 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女に敗れた、あるいは自分から協力者になった魔術師たちの棲む魔窟である。"
msgstr "  It housed mages who had either lost to her in battle or who had willingly agreed to contribute to her cause."

#. Occurrence SP1:6219:20869: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6219
msgctxt "text_id=20869 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　現在、多くの魔術特許を持ち、月の収入が１万ポンドを超える橙子だが、大半はその施設の維持に充てられている。"
msgstr "  Touko held many magecraft patents which earned her up to 10,000 pounds a month in royalties. However, the majority of this money went to the upkeep of that facility."

#. Occurrence SP1:6224:20870: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6224
msgctxt "text_id=20870 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　棲みついた魔術師たちの要望―――追加施設、特別待遇を望む声は日に日に増しており、いいかげん会社を<興|おこ>すか、あるいは全員<釈|ク><放|ビ>にするかと、悩み多い橙子だった。"
msgstr "  The demands from the residents of the place for additional facilities and special privileges increased with every passing day. It was reaching a point where Touko needed to decide whether to incorporate or just let everyone go and be done with it."

#. Occurrence SP1:6271:20871: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0080; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6271
msgctxt "text_id=20871 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「でも、誓って<拷問室|そういうもの>じゃないわよ？"
msgstr "\"I promise, it's nothing nefarious or evil like a dungeon."

#. Occurrence SP1:6277:20872: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0081; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6277
msgctxt "text_id=20872 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　拷問なんて手間暇かかりすぎるし。娯楽を与える方が管理コストは低いんだってば。"
msgstr "  Torture is too much work anyway. It actually costs less to just entertain them."

#. Occurrence SP1:6283:20873: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0082; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6283
msgctxt "text_id=20873 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　<現代|いま>はいい脚本そろってるしね。適当な映画のプロットを拝借して、それを再現するだけで喜んでもらえるし。"
msgstr "  There are so many good stories out there these days. I can just steal the plot of something and recreate it to make everyone happy."

#. Occurrence SP1:6289:20874: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0083; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6289
msgctxt "text_id=20874 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　仮想であれ現実であれ、自分が主役になれる物語なんて最高じゃない」"
msgstr "  Real or fake, everyone wants to be the hero of their own story.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6326:20875: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0024; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6326
msgctxt "text_id=20875 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「ふーん。つかぬ事をお伺いいたしますけど、上演ジャンルはどのようなバランスで？"
msgstr "\"Hmm, just out of curiosity, what's the ratio of the genres you use?"

#. Occurrence SP1:6332:20876: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0025; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6332
msgctxt "text_id=20876 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　恋愛３、活劇３、サスペンス３、アニメ１？」"
msgstr "  30% romance, 30% action, 30% suspense, 10% cartoons?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6338:20877: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0084; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6338
msgctxt "text_id=20877 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「は？　そりゃ、基本ホラーでしょ。エンタメのすべてが詰まってるんだし」"
msgstr "\"Huh? Basically only horror, actually. Horror films have every element you could ever want!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6350:20878: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0026; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6350
msgctxt "text_id=20878 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「……。わたし、トコちゃんのそういうところ、素で怖いわ。"
msgstr "\"...You know, that was always the part of you that scared me the most."

#. Occurrence SP1:6356:20879: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0027; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6356
msgctxt "text_id=20879 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　というか、女の子なんだからもっとロマンを求めてほしいの」"
msgstr "  You're a girl. You should be more into romance instead of that kinda stuff!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6391:20880: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0085; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6391
msgctxt "text_id=20880 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「む。今回<捕|つか>まえる候補にあがっている人間に言われると、さすがに考慮せざるをえない。"
msgstr "\"Hmph. I guess it's something I should consider if one of my potential targets says as much."

#. Occurrence SP1:6397:20881: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0086; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6397
msgctxt "text_id=20881 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　んー、囚人を放り込む<仮|は><想|こ><現|に><実|わ>の、バランスに気を遣ってみればいいの？　ホラー８ぐらい？」"
msgstr "  Let's see, how does 80% horror sound for the balance of the virtual worlds I throw my prisoners into?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6415:20882: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0028; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6415
msgctxt "text_id=20882 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「恋愛９！　恋愛９でお願いします！　それがダメなら推理９で是非！」"
msgstr "\"90% romance! Come on, please! If not romance, do 90% mystery!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6421:20883: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6421
msgctxt "text_id=20883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子に狙われた場合、絶対に負けると信じきった上での即答だった。"
msgstr "  This was clearly a response from someone who knew she'd lose if she had to go up against Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:6455:20884: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0087; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6455
msgctxt "text_id=20884 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「了解、そういう事態になったら善処する」"
msgstr "\"Very well. If that situation should ever arise, I'll try to accommodate you.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6467:20885: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0029; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6467
msgctxt "text_id=20885 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「はーい。そういう事態って、どんな事態？」"
msgstr "\"Yes! Wait, what situation?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6478:20886: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0088; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6478
msgctxt "text_id=20886 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「誰かの味方をするのはいいけど、私の敵に回った時、かな。あと今日の事を口外した瞬間、足下からパクッといくから気をつけて」"
msgstr "\"It's fine if you're friends with you-know-who, but I'm talking about if you ever become my enemy. Also, if you tell anyone about our conversation today, I'll snap you up from below before you can even blink.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6517:20887: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0030; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6517
msgctxt "text_id=20887 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「へ？　足下って、影のこと？"
msgstr "\"Huh? From below? Like, out of my shadow?"

#. Occurrence SP1:6530:20888: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0031; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6530
msgctxt "text_id=20888 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　あ―――あれ。そもそもなんていうか、トコちゃん。"
msgstr "  But more important than that, Touko..."

#. Occurrence SP1:6538:20889: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0032; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6538
msgctxt "text_id=20889 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　わたし、一歩も動けないんだけどー！」"
msgstr "  I can't move an inch!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6560:20890: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0089; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6560
msgctxt "text_id=20890 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ふふふ、ごめんなさい律架。実は一週間かけて、貴女の部屋に罠をしかけてたの。"
msgstr "\"Hehehe. Sorry Ritsuka, but I actually spent a week setting a trap in your place."

#. Occurrence SP1:6566:20891: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0090; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6566
msgctxt "text_id=20891 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ドアの境界に影で作った使い魔を仕込ませた、みたいな？　しばらくは貴女の影に棲みついているから、私に不利な証言したらたいへんだぞ"
msgstr "  I made a familiar out of a shadow and put it in your doorway. It's going to be living in your shadow for a while, so try not say anything to inconvenience me."

#. Occurrence SP1:6566:20892: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0090; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6566
msgctxt "text_id=20892 | speaker=touko"
msgid "」"
msgstr "\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6601:20893: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0033; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6601
msgctxt "text_id=20893 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「わたし、すでにたいへんだったのかー！"
msgstr "\"You mean I've been in a pickle all along?!"

#. Occurrence SP1:6612:20894: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0034; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6612
msgctxt "text_id=20894 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　悪魔！　人でなし！　天才悪魔！　トコちゃんはもう少し一般常識を学ぶべきです！　もう、どうりで夜な夜な泥棒さんがピッキングしてると思った！」"
msgstr "  Toko, you devil! You brute! You devil-brute! You need to learn some common sense! I knew I heard something the other night! I just thought it was a thief trying to pick my lock!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6647:20895: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6647
msgctxt "text_id=20895 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　影の使い魔には気付かなかったものの、深夜、細工をしている橙子の気配には気付いていたらしい。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka hadn't noticed the shadow familiar, but she had sensed Touko as she was setting her trap late at night."

#. Occurrence SP1:6652:20896: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6652
msgctxt "text_id=20896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただの泥棒と思ってスルーし続けるあたり、律架に一般常識を問われたくない橙子だった。"
msgstr "  Touko didn't think Ritsuka could speak about common sense, since she had ignored an apparent burglar trying to break into her home for a week."

#. Occurrence SP1:6678:20897: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0091; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6678
msgctxt "text_id=20897 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「その使い魔、年明けには溶けるから安心なさい。"
msgstr "\"Don't worry. The familiar will disintegrate at the beginning of the new year."

#. Occurrence SP1:6684:20898: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0092; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6684
msgctxt "text_id=20898 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　じゃあね律架。縁があったらまた会いましょう。その時は自慢のコーヒーをご馳走してね。"
msgstr "  See you around, Ritsuka. Hopefully we'll meet again. I'll take you up on that coffee of yours then, for sure."

#. Occurrence SP1:6695:20899: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0093; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6695
msgctxt "text_id=20899 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ああ、あと深夜販売の商品だってバカにできたもんじゃないわ。あのシンプルさ、けっこう好きよ、私」"
msgstr "  Also, I didn't mean to insult you by comparing you to an infomercial product. You live a simple life. I like that.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6747:20900: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6747
msgctxt "text_id=20900 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　旧知の友人にウインクをして、橙子はアパートを後にする。"
msgstr "  Touko winked at her old friend and left the apartment behind her."

#. Occurrence SP1:6752:20901: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6752
msgctxt "text_id=20901 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“また会いましょう”"
msgstr "\"Hopefully we'll meet again.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6757:20902: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6757
msgctxt "text_id=20902 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その言葉に、橙子自身、空しいものを感じながら。"
msgstr "  Touko realized those were empty words."

#. Occurrence SP1:6777:20903: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6777
msgctxt "text_id=20903 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今回の計画は、どうあっても彼女の肉体を無事には済まさない。成功するにしろ失敗するにしろ、蒼崎橙子はこの世から消失する。"
msgstr "  Her plan would not spare her mortal body. Be it a success, or be it a failure, Touko Aozaki would be erased from this world."

#. Occurrence SP1:6783:20904: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6783
msgctxt "text_id=20904 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでも再会の<空言|からごと>を残す程度には―――"
msgstr "  Still, that was no reason not at least say something about meeting again."

#. Occurrence SP1:6788:20905: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6788
msgctxt "text_id=20905 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子は、周瀬律架に思い入れがあったのだろう。"
msgstr "  Perhaps Touko had more affection for Ritsuka than she realized."

#. Occurrence SP1:6818:20906: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6818
msgctxt "text_id=20906 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな友人を、律架は金縛り状態で見送った。"
msgstr "  Even so, she left that friend behind in a state of paralysis."

#. Occurrence SP1:6823:20907: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6823
msgctxt "text_id=20907 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子が帰ってきた。"
msgstr "  Touko had indeed returned home."

#. Occurrence SP1:6828:20908: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6828
msgctxt "text_id=20908 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架にとって、それは今回の事件の真相を知るに等しい。"
msgstr "  That fact alone revealed much to Ritsuka."

#. Occurrence SP1:6833:20909: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6833
msgctxt "text_id=20909 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子より二歳ほど年上の周瀬律架は、十年前から橙子の祖^父―――五番目の魔法の路を発掘した魔術師―――の監視^役として派遣された魔術師だ。"
msgstr "  Two years older than Touko, Ritsuka had been contracted ten years prior to monitor Touko's grandfather, the mage who discovered the Fifth Magic."

#. Occurrence SP1:6838:20910: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6838
msgctxt "text_id=20910 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は蒼崎橙子の先輩であり、また、蒼崎青子の先輩でもある。"
msgstr "  That made her both Touko and Aoko's senior,"

#. Occurrence SP1:6843:20911: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6843
msgctxt "text_id=20911 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　故に、姉妹の事情をそれなりに把握していた。"
msgstr "  and she knew the sisters rather well."

#. Occurrence SP1:6876:20912: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0035; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6876
msgctxt "text_id=20912 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「うーん。そりゃあ、口止めの一つもしないとね。"
msgstr "\"Hmm, she's gotta keep a few of us from talking, then."

#. Occurrence SP1:6882:20913: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0036; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6882
msgctxt "text_id=20913 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　トコちゃんを見てまっさきに警戒するのはわたしと―――」"
msgstr "  The first people to be on alert upon seeing Toko would be myself and...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6888:20914: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6888
msgctxt "text_id=20914 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あと一人。"
msgstr "  One other person."

#. Occurrence SP1:6893:20915: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6893
msgctxt "text_id=20915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　真の意味で蒼崎姉妹の兄弟子と言える人物。"
msgstr "  Another with more seniority than the Aozaki sisters in the truest sense."

#. Occurrence SP1:6898:20916: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6898
msgctxt "text_id=20916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子の教育係を務めた、ある麗人が残っている。"
msgstr "  There was one other beautiful person, one who had taught Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:6924:20917: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0037; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6924
msgctxt "text_id=20917 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「ま、そっちはそっちで根回ししてるかな。"
msgstr "\"I'm sure she's probably got that handled, though."

#. Occurrence SP1:6930:20918: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0038; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6930
msgctxt "text_id=20918 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　トコちゃんならそのあたり完璧だろうけど―――」"
msgstr "  She's not one to overlook something like that.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6957:20919: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0039; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6957
msgctxt "text_id=20919 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「もうちょっとこう、敵には非情になった方がいいわよね。　トコちゃんは相手の人権を尊重しすぎっていうか、根本が甘いっていうか。"
msgstr "\"Toko really should learn to be colder toward her enemies, though. She's too soft on them--thinks too much of their human rights."

#. Occurrence SP1:6964:20920: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0040; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6964
msgctxt "text_id=20920 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "殺すと決めた相手に顔を見せるとか、どうかと思うの、わたし」"
msgstr "I don't know how I feel about her showing her face to a person she's decided to kill.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:6994:20921: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6994
msgctxt "text_id=20921 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子は魔術師というより研究者で、基本、戦いに向いた人間ではない。"
msgstr "  Touko was a researcher more than she was a mage. Generally, she wasn't a fighter."

#. Occurrence SP1:6999:20922: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6999
msgctxt "text_id=20922 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残酷なクセに冷酷ではない。"
msgstr "  She was cruel, but not cold."

#. Occurrence SP1:7004:20923: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7004
msgctxt "text_id=20923 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　合理的な、むごたらしい仕打ちができるクセに、他人への思いやりなどを持ってしまっている。"
msgstr "  Despite her capability for vicious, ruthless treatment of people, she also displayed a measure of compassion for others."

#. Occurrence SP1:7009:20924: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7009
msgctxt "text_id=20924 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そのあたりの整合性のなさが彼女自身を苦しめなければいいけど、と、律架はひとり、我が事のように嘆息した。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka sighed as if the problem were her own, and hoped that inconsistency wouldn't end up hurting Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:7055:20925: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7055
msgctxt "text_id=20925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子は住宅地を後にすると、街で一番大きな公園に足を向けた。"
msgstr "  Touko left the neighborhood and began heading toward the largest park in the town."

#. Occurrence SP1:7060:20926: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7060
msgctxt "text_id=20926 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　冬の初めの、午後三時過ぎの並木道。"
msgstr "  It was three in the afternoon on this early winter day on the boulevard."

#. Occurrence SP1:7065:20927: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7065
msgctxt "text_id=20927 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　秋であれば散歩をする人々で<彩|いろど>られる道だが、今は橙子の姿しかない。"
msgstr "  If it were autumn, the street would be lined with people out for a walk to look at the colorful trees, but now Touko was alone."

#. Occurrence SP1:7096:20928: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7096
msgctxt "text_id=20928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……いや、正確にはもう一人分。"
msgstr "  ...Though to be accurate, she wasn't quite alone."

#. Occurrence SP1:7102:20929: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7102
msgctxt "text_id=20929 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　十メートル以上の距離をとって芝生を歩くベオは、ここにきて雇い主の変化を嗅ぎ取った。"
msgstr "  Beo was walking along the grass more than ten yards behind his employer when he noticed a change in her scent."

#. Occurrence SP1:7109:20930: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0048; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7109
msgctxt "text_id=20930 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“トーコさん、こんな町中でメガネ、外してる？”」"
msgstr "(Are you really not wearing your glasses out here, Touko?)"

#. Occurrence SP1:7141:20931: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7141
msgctxt "text_id=20931 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子はメガネの有り無しで人格をスイッチする。"
msgstr "  Touko's personality changed significantly depending on whether or not she was wearing her glasses."

#. Occurrence SP1:7146:20932: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7146
msgctxt "text_id=20932 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どちらが素なのかはベオには不明だが、メガネを外した彼女は遊びのない、男性的な思考に変化する。"
msgstr "  Beo wasn't sure which side was her true self, but he did know that she was much more serious and cruel without her glasses."

#. Occurrence SP1:7151:20933: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7151
msgctxt "text_id=20933 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　俗に言う二重人格……ではなく、物事の優先度を組み替えただけのもので、おもに相手を叩きのめす時、彼女はメガネを外す。"
msgstr "  It wasn't quite to the level of a split personality... more like a reordering of priorities. She mainly took off her glasses when she was about to fight someone."

#. Occurrence SP1:7156:20934: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7156
msgctxt "text_id=20934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　妥協、憂慮、同情。そういったものを脳の外に追いやった、非人間に変身するのである。"
msgstr "  Doing so made her less human. It pushed all sense of compromise, concern, and sympathy out of her brain."

#. Occurrence SP1:7191:20935: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0049; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7191
msgctxt "text_id=20935 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“ってコトは、さっきから近づいてくる匂いはトーコさんの敵……なんだ、けど……”」"
msgstr "(That must mean the scent getting closer is of her enemy... I think...)"

#. Occurrence SP1:7197:20936: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7197
msgctxt "text_id=20936 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　木の<陰|かげ>に<潜|ひそ>みながら、ベオはむう、と眉を寄せた。"
msgstr "  Beo furrowed his brow as he hid behind a tree."

#. Occurrence SP1:7202:20937: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7202
msgctxt "text_id=20937 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子からは確かに敵意とか緊張とか、その手の匂いが<零|こぼ>れている。"
msgstr "  He could certainly smell hostility and anticipation emanating from Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:7207:20938: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7207
msgctxt "text_id=20938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど同時に、あの妙な匂いが強くなっている事に、ベオは不満げに鼻をひくつかせるのだった。"
msgstr "  But at the same time, he couldn't help but scrunch his nose up at the strange scent that kept getting stronger."

#. Occurrence SP1:7249:20939: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7249
msgctxt "text_id=20939 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「こんにちは。なんとなしに散歩していただけなのですが、また出逢えるとは奇遇ですね、橙子さん」"
msgstr "\"Hello. I just happened to be out for a walk. What a coincidence meeting you out here, Touko.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7258:20940: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0095; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7258
msgctxt "text_id=20940 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ああ。たまたま続いた偶然だ。世間話をする仲でもなし、挨拶を交わす程度に済ませよう」"
msgstr "\"Ah, yes, what a coincidence indeed. We're not the sort to stop and chat, so let's just keep this to formalities, shall we?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7291:20941: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7291
msgctxt "text_id=20941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子に声をかけたのは、ベオにとって未知の人間だった。"
msgstr "  Beo had no idea who was talking to Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:7296:20942: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7296
msgctxt "text_id=20942 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　男の名は<文柄|ふみづか><詠梨|えいり>。"
msgstr "  His name was Eiri Fumidsuka."

#. Occurrence SP1:7301:20943: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7301
msgctxt "text_id=20943 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　合田教会の司祭代理であり、ベオや橙子からすれば敵よりの人物である。"
msgstr "  He was a priest of Aida Church and an enemy to Beo and Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:7321:20944: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7321
msgctxt "text_id=20944 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が、事前情報を知らないカレにそれを察しろというのは酷な話だろう。"
msgstr "  However, it was impossible for Beo to sense this."

#. Occurrence SP1:7326:20945: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7326
msgctxt "text_id=20945 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なにしろ、司祭には敵意が一切ない。"
msgstr "  He had no personal hostility toward the clergy anyway."

#. Occurrence SP1:7331:20946: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7331
msgctxt "text_id=20946 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオから見て、彼はどこからどう見ても一般人であり、蒼崎橙子が遅れを取る可能性など皆無だからだ。"
msgstr "  As far as Beo could tell, he was just a regular person. There was no chance that Touko could be at a disadvantage here."

#. Occurrence SP1:7337:20947: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7337
msgctxt "text_id=20947 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――後に、カレはその手の“毒を毒と思わせない”タイプの人間から手ひどい教訓を学ぶ事になるが、それはまた別の話である。"
msgstr "  ...He would later learn a harsh lesson from someone who seemed similarly harmless, but that was a tale for another time."

#. Occurrence SP1:7384:20948: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0096; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7384
msgctxt "text_id=20948 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そちらの状況はどうなんだ。神の家は働き者<揃|ぞろ>いだからな。利権をあさりに来る<欲深|よくぶか>は現れそうか？」"
msgstr "\"So how are things going with you? God's house must be full of hard workers. Any greedy trolls show up hungry for concessions?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7395:20949: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7395
msgctxt "text_id=20949 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いやあ。働き者、というのは全力で肯定しますけど、欲が深いとか、そんな人は少ないですよ、こちらは。"
msgstr "\"I can agree on the hard workers part, but greed is not a problem in our organization."

#. Occurrence SP1:7406:20950: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7406
msgctxt "text_id=20950 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　彼らがやってくる時はたいていは教義の為ですから。"
msgstr "  Any who come to us usually do so on the basis of doctrine, nothing more."

#. Occurrence SP1:7406:20951: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7406
msgctxt "text_id=20951 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　欲望より<責務|せきむ>で動く人たちって怖くないですか？」"
msgstr "  Don't people driven by duty rather than greed frighten you more?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7433:20952: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0097; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7433
msgctxt "text_id=20952 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「無駄話はしないと言っただろう。"
msgstr "\"I thought I said we weren't going to waste time on small talk."

#. Occurrence SP1:7439:20953: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0098; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7439
msgctxt "text_id=20953 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　結論を言え。おまえの腰巾着は鐘を鳴らしそうか？」"
msgstr "  Just cut to the chase. Is your follower going to sound the bell or not?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7465:20954: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7465
msgctxt "text_id=20954 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「やれやれ。人のことは言えませんよ。"
msgstr "\"My, my, my. You're one to talk."

#. Occurrence SP1:7465:20955: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7465
msgctxt "text_id=20955 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　橙子さんだってワーカホリック寸前じゃないですか。"
msgstr "  You're very nearly a workaholic yourself, Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:7471:20956: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7471
msgctxt "text_id=20956 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　もっとこう、余裕のあるコミュニケーションをとりませんか？　立場上、いつ最後の<逢瀬|おうせ>になるか分からないワケですし」"
msgstr "  You mean to tell me you don't even have time for a little conversation? After all, this might be the last time we ever see each other again.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7483:20957: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0099; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7483
msgctxt "text_id=20957 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ふざけろ。いつも何も、これが最後だよ詠梨」"
msgstr "\"Please. This is the last time and you know it.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7503:20958: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7503
msgctxt "text_id=20958 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　微笑む司祭の提案を、橙子は一言で斬って捨てた。"
msgstr "  Touko curtly rejected the smiling priest's request for a chat."

#. Occurrence SP1:7508:20959: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7508
msgctxt "text_id=20959 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まさにけんもほろろ状態である。"
msgstr "  She was being as blunt as she could."

#. Occurrence SP1:7543:20960: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0100; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7543
msgctxt "text_id=20960 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「だいたい次があるとしたら、その時は殺し合いだろ。"
msgstr "\"If we were ever to meet again, I'm certain it would only be in a fight to the death."

#. Occurrence SP1:7549:20961: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0101; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7549
msgctxt "text_id=20961 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　お互い手の内は知っているしな。顔を会わせた瞬間、どちらかが死んでいる。会話なんぞしている暇があるか」"
msgstr "  We both know each other's intentions. One of us would be dead the moment we laid eyes on the other. There's no time for idle chitchat.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7555:20962: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7555
msgctxt "text_id=20962 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「それは橙子さんだけの思いこみですけどねぇ。"
msgstr "\"That's just what you happen to think, Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:7561:20963: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7561
msgctxt "text_id=20963 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　どうしてこう、邪魔者は始末する、という方向でしか物事を考えられないんでしょうか、貴女たちは」"
msgstr "  Why is it that you people can only think of eradicating whoever stands in your way?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7581:20964: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7581
msgctxt "text_id=20964 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やれやれと肩をすくめる司祭と、"
msgstr "  Eiri shrugged his shoulders in frustration."

#. Occurrence SP1:7586:20965: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7586
msgctxt "text_id=20965 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その<外套|マント>の下を注意深く見据える橙子。"
msgstr "  Touko kept her gaze fixed intently on his overcoat."

#. Occurrence SP1:7591:20966: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7591
msgctxt "text_id=20966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　司祭が何度「穏便に済ませたい」と口にしても、プライドにかけて信じる気はないようだ。"
msgstr "  No matter how many times he said he wanted to resolve this peacefully, she would bet her pride that he didn't mean it."

#. Occurrence SP1:7627:20967: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0008; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7627
msgctxt "text_id=20967 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「まったく。そういうところも成長して帰ってくるんですから。育つのは女性としての魅力だけに留めておいてほしいものです。"
msgstr "\"See, this is what happens when one goes out, experiences the world, and returns to their home. I would have liked it if you had worked on your personal charm, instead."

#. Occurrence SP1:7633:20968: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0009; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7633
msgctxt "text_id=20968 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　ああ、そう睨まない。本題に入りますから」"
msgstr "  Oh come on, don't glare at me like that. I'm getting to the point.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7662:20969: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0010; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7662
msgctxt "text_id=20969 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「目下、教会への報告は私が一任されています。司祭への報告は『現在、管理者は異端者と交戦中。中立の条約に基づき、司祭代理権限で監督中。なお、異端者の所属は不明、現在、履歴を調査中』といったところです」"
msgstr "\"I am entrusted with all reports to the Church. My report is now, 'The Second Owner is currently battling a heretic. I am monitoring them under my clerical authority, in accordance with the neutrality pact. The affiliation of the heretic is unknown, and I am investigating their history.'\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7683:20970: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0102; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7683
msgctxt "text_id=20970 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「この町に現れた魔術師は所属不明……という事になっているんだな？」"
msgstr "\"So you're telling me that the Church is still unaware of the affiliation of the mage who's appeared in town?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7695:20971: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0011; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7695
msgctxt "text_id=20971 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ええ。シスター<唯架|ゆいか>は私とは別<所轄|しょかつ>の方ですが、彼女は異端者の工房はおろか、その姿さえ掴めていません。"
msgstr "\"Right. Sister Yuika reports to a different jurisdiction from my own, but she has not even seen the heretic, let alone uncovered their workshop."

#. Occurrence SP1:7701:20972: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0012; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7701
msgctxt "text_id=20972 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　彼女が単独で敵の正体を暴くまで、教会から横槍が入る事はないんじゃないですかねぇ。"
msgstr "  There will most likely be no interference from the Church until she is able to reveal who our enemy is."

#. Occurrence SP1:7707:20973: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0013; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7707
msgctxt "text_id=20973 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　今まで通り、土地を狙いにきた魔術師同士の小競り合いだと思っているんじゃないですか？」"
msgstr "  Perhaps they are thinking it's a small turf war between mages who've just come into town?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7742:20974: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0103; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7742
msgctxt "text_id=20974 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そうか。では取引成立だな。"
msgstr "\"I see. So we do have a deal."

#. Occurrence SP1:7748:20975: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0104; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7748
msgctxt "text_id=20975 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　おまえが私の帰国の件を握り潰している間は、私も多少、回り道をする。蒼崎の親戚筋にも手は出さない」"
msgstr "  As long as you're the only one who knows that I'm back in town, I'll lay low. I also won't get in contact with any of my blood relatives.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7769:20976: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0014; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7769
msgctxt "text_id=20976 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「良かった。橙子さんは無差別な破壊工作はしませんが、とにかく最適な<道筋|みちすじ>を好みますから。"
msgstr "\"Very well. I know you're not the type to sabotage things indiscriminately, and that you prefer to do things as efficiently as possible."

#. Occurrence SP1:7776:20977: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7776
msgctxt "text_id=20977 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　勢い、どこぞの工場とかオフィスビルとか秘密基地にしそうでしょう？"
msgstr "  You might get carried away and try to make your secret hideout in some factory or office building somewhere, right?"

#. Occurrence SP1:7782:20978: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0016; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7782
msgctxt "text_id=20978 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　私がこちらに赴任している間、流血事件が続くと困るというか。私の評価が落ちるような事は、なんとも」"
msgstr "  I won't allow the bloodshed in this parish to continue on my watch--or anything else that might sully my reputation.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7807:20979: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7807
msgctxt "text_id=20979 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人の事をなんだと思っているんだ、と抗議したくなる気持ちを抑えこむ。"
msgstr "  Touko had to resist the urge to object and ask just what kind of person he thought she was."

#. Occurrence SP1:7812:20980: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7812
msgctxt "text_id=20980 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子とて無駄は嫌いだが、だからといって最適化の為に社会性を<無|む><下|げ>にするつもりはない。"
msgstr "  She did hate wastefulness, but she wasn't about to entirely abandon society and its norms just for the sake of doing things optimally."

#. Occurrence SP1:7817:20981: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7817
msgctxt "text_id=20981 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも、犯罪行為は後処理が面倒になる。そちらの方が遥かに無駄というものだ。"
msgstr "  Besides, criminal activities were always a pain to clean up later and thus far more inefficient."

#. Occurrence SP1:7848:20982: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0105; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7848
msgctxt "text_id=20982 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……まあいいさ。お互いの利益が一致したんだからな。"
msgstr "\"...I guess that's fine. We're both coming out ahead here."

#. Occurrence SP1:7854:20983: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0106; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7854
msgctxt "text_id=20983 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　では、後は事が済むまで<静観|せいかん>を決めこんでおけ」"
msgstr "  Just keep watch until things are settled.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7860:20984: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0017; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7860
msgctxt "text_id=20984 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「もうお帰りですか。名残惜しいですねぇ。"
msgstr "\"Oh, you're leaving? So soon."

#. Occurrence SP1:7866:20985: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0018; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7866
msgctxt "text_id=20985 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　結局一度も、今の貴女の素顔を見られなかった」"
msgstr "  I haven't had the chance to fully appreciate what you look like now.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7872:20986: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0107; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7872
msgctxt "text_id=20986 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「私は逆だ。そのカマキリ<面|づら>もこれで<見納|みおさ>めかと思うとせいせいする」"
msgstr "\"I feel the opposite. I hope this is the last time I ever have to lay eyes on you again.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7878:20987: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0019; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7878
msgctxt "text_id=20987 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ああ、待ってください。お別れの前に、一つ質問を」"
msgstr "\"Ah, wait. Before you go, let me ask you one thing.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7912:20988: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7912
msgctxt "text_id=20988 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　司祭に顔を向けたまま立ち去ろうとする橙子を、司祭はごく自然に制止させた。"
msgstr "  Eiri spoke just as Touko was about to take a step back."

#. Occurrence SP1:7917:20989: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7917
msgctxt "text_id=20989 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子が足を半歩後ろにズラそうと考えた瞬間に、である。"
msgstr "  He had effortlessly stopped her from leaving."

#. Occurrence SP1:7941:20990: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0020; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7941
msgctxt "text_id=20990 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「所感なのですが。"
msgstr "\"This is the last thing I'll say."

#. Occurrence SP1:7947:20991: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0021; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7947
msgctxt "text_id=20991 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　橙子さん、今、たいへん息苦しくはありませんか？」"
msgstr "  You look quite uneasy, Touko. Are you feeling stifled here?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7959:20992: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0108; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7959
msgctxt "text_id=20992 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「まさか。私はかつてないほど充実しているよ。"
msgstr "\"That couldn't be further from the truth. I'm feeling more fulfilled than ever."

#. Occurrence SP1:7965:20993: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0109; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7965
msgctxt "text_id=20993 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　なぜそんな事を訊く、詠梨」"
msgstr "  Why do you ask, Eiri?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:7987:20994: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0022; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7987
msgctxt "text_id=20994 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いえ。だって楽しそうではありますが、幸せそうではありませんので。貴女自身気付いてはいないようでしたから、<知|ち><己|き>として心配になったのです」"
msgstr "\"You look like you're having fun, but also like you're not truly happy. I was just worried because it seems you don't even realize it yourself.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8025:20995: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0110; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8025
msgctxt "text_id=20995 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……幸せの定義か。思い出したよ。おまえの口癖だったな、それは。幸せのカタチは人それぞれだと。"
msgstr "\"I remember you used to say that everyone finds happiness in different things."

#. Occurrence SP1:8031:20996: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0111; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8031
msgctxt "text_id=20996 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　まったくその通りだ。私の善しとする幸福が、他人であるおまえに分かるものか。つまらん心配はするな」"
msgstr "  But you don't know me. So don't pretend to know what makes me happy.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8052:20997: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0023; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8052
msgctxt "text_id=20997 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いや、そりゃあ細かいところまでは分かりませんけどねぇ。とくに女の人の幸福観なんて、それこそ<奇々怪々|ききかいかい>ですから。"
msgstr "\"Well, of course I don't know down to the fine details. Women in particular have a notoriously bizarre concept of happiness."

#. Occurrence SP1:8058:20998: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0024; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8058
msgctxt "text_id=20998 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　ですがほら、幸福のカタチは二つに大別できます。"
msgstr "  But happiness can easily be categorized into two major types."

#. Occurrence SP1:8064:20999: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0025; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8064
msgctxt "text_id=20999 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　橙子さんの場合、それすら気付いていないようですから。たいへん見苦しいな、と思いまして」"
msgstr "  It seems you haven't even figured that out yet, and it's hard to watch.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8100:21000: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0112; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8100
msgctxt "text_id=21000 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……ほう、ご忠告痛み入る。腐っても兄弟子という訳か。"
msgstr "\"...Oh? I'm greatly obliged for the concern. Still insist on playing senior apprentice, eh?"

#. Occurrence SP1:8106:21001: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0113; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8106
msgctxt "text_id=21001 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　いいぞ、聞いてやるから言ってみろ」"
msgstr "  Fine, I'll listen. Let's see what you have to say.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8112:21002: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8112
msgctxt "text_id=21002 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが下らないものなら、ここで殺す。"
msgstr "  If it happened to be something worthless, she would kill him."

#. Occurrence SP1:8117:21003: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8117
msgctxt "text_id=21003 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この一ヶ月―――いや、この二年間積み重ねてきた計画を白紙に戻す事になっても殺す、と。"
msgstr "  If it erased all the progress she had made on her plans over the past month, or even the two last years, she would kill him."

#. Occurrence SP1:8122:21004: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8122
msgctxt "text_id=21004 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子の敵意は、ここにきて殺意に変貌した。"
msgstr "  Touko's hostility had clearly turned to murderous rage."

#. Occurrence SP1:8155:21005: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0026; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8155
msgctxt "text_id=21005 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「当たり前のコトですよ。"
msgstr "\"It's quite obvious, really."

#. Occurrence SP1:8161:21006: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0027; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8161
msgctxt "text_id=21006 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　相対的なものと絶対的なもの。比べる相手が居るか居ないかが幸福の違いです。"
msgstr "  The two types of happiness are relative and absolute. It depends on whether you compare yourself to others or not."

#. Occurrence SP1:8167:21007: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0028; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8167
msgctxt "text_id=21007 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　自分が穏やかであれば幸福なのか、それとも―――"
msgstr "  You're either happy because you yourself are at peace, or..."

#. Occurrence SP1:8173:21008: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0029; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8173
msgctxt "text_id=21008 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　どんなに満ち足りていても、<他人|ひと>より劣っていては我慢できない人間なのか」"
msgstr "  You're the type of person who can't stand it if you have less than someone else, even if you're otherwise fulfilled.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8194:21009: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0030; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8194
msgctxt "text_id=21009 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「幸福の定義なんて、詰まるところはその二つですよ。"
msgstr "\"The definition of happiness basically comes down to that."

#. Occurrence SP1:8200:21010: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0031; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8200
msgctxt "text_id=21010 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　私が言うまでもありませんが―――"
msgstr "  I know it goes without me saying, but..."

#. Occurrence SP1:8200:21011: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0031; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8200
msgctxt "text_id=21011 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　多くの人間は、ただ、<他人|ひと>より少しだけ幸せでありたいのです」"
msgstr "  Most people want to be happier than those around them.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8232:21012: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8232
msgctxt "text_id=21012 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　涼やかに<微笑|わら>う黒衣の聖者。"
msgstr "  The holy man smiled calmly, wrapped in his shadowy black clothing."

#. Occurrence SP1:8237:21013: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8237
msgctxt "text_id=21013 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ああ、と橙子は思いだした。"
msgstr "  Touko remembered clearly now."

#. Occurrence SP1:8242:21014: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8242
msgctxt "text_id=21014 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この男は根本からして、<幸福|そういうもの>を信じていない悪魔だったと。"
msgstr "  This was a man who actually didn't believe in the concept of true happiness."

#. Occurrence SP1:8279:21015: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0032; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8279
msgctxt "text_id=21015 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ほら、そんな殺気は収めて。シスター唯架が飛んできます。"
msgstr "\"Come now, calm yourself. If you try anything, Sister Yuika will be here in a flash."

#. Occurrence SP1:8285:21016: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0033; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8285
msgctxt "text_id=21016 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　橙子さんの幸福観は絶対的なもの。貴女は自分が確かであれば満ち足りるタイプの人だったんですけどね。"
msgstr "  I know that your idea of happiness is not relative. You were always the type to be satisfied as long as you stayed true to yourself."

#. Occurrence SP1:8291:21017: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0034; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8291
msgctxt "text_id=21017 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　他人が気になるなんて、そんな相対的な幸福観を持っているのは、」"
msgstr "  The only Aozaki I know who has a relative definition of happiness is...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8317:21018: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8317
msgctxt "text_id=21018 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　青子の方、と言いかけて、司祭は自分から身を引いた。"
msgstr "  He stopped himself before he could say Aoko."

#. Occurrence SP1:8322:21019: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8322
msgctxt "text_id=21019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　心底から橙子を心配しての忠告だったが、逆の結果に終わったようだ。"
msgstr "  The priest seemed to have spoken out of genuine concern for Touko, but his words had the opposite effect on her."

#. Occurrence SP1:8327:21020: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8327
msgctxt "text_id=21020 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　司祭としては本当に名残惜しいが、これ以上怒らせて嫌われるのはよろしくない。"
msgstr "  Although he was reluctant to part on such ill terms, Eiri knew it was best not to anger Touko any further."

#. Occurrence SP1:8365:21021: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0035; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8365
msgctxt "text_id=21021 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「言葉がすぎました。お許しを<人形師|ハイマスター>。"
msgstr "\"I've said too much. Please forgive me, puppet master."

#. Occurrence SP1:8371:21022: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0036; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8371
msgctxt "text_id=21022 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　それでは私はこれで。貴女たちにとっていい結果になる事を祈っています」"
msgstr "  I will take my leave now. I pray that you will see a good outcome in your endeavors.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8383:21023: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0114; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8383
msgctxt "text_id=21023 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ふん、さっさと消えろ<穀|ごく>潰し。最後まで陰気くさい真似をしやがって。"
msgstr "\"Good. Get lost. Your gloomy act isn't helping my mood."

#. Occurrence SP1:8389:21024: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0115; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8389
msgctxt "text_id=21024 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　……だいたいその服装、どうなんだ。町中でマントなんて<羽|は><織|お>って、敬遠されないのか？」"
msgstr "  ...What's up with your outfit anyway? Doesn't wearing that cloak around town make people avoid you?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8416:21025: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0037; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8416
msgctxt "text_id=21025 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「皆さん、もう慣れてくださいましたから。"
msgstr "\"Everyone is very much used to it by now."

#. Occurrence SP1:8428:21026: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0038; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8428
msgctxt "text_id=21026 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　それに、ほら。この格好だと<得物|エモノ>を差していてもバレないでしょう？"
msgstr "  Besides, how else can I carry a weapon without people noticing?"

#. Occurrence SP1:8434:21027: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0039; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8434
msgctxt "text_id=21027 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　ま、橙子さんには見抜かれてしまいましたが。相手が貴女ですからね。恥ずかしながら、長物を三本ほど、こっそり」"
msgstr "  I'm sure it was glaringly obvious to you, but I have about three on me right now.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8480:21028: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8480
msgctxt "text_id=21028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最後まで笑顔を絶やさず、司祭はもと来た道へ退散していった。"
msgstr "  Eiri turned and walked back in the direction he came from with a smile still on his face."

#. Occurrence SP1:8496:21029: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0116; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8496
msgctxt "text_id=21029 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……ふざけやがって。こっちは一本、それも短刀ぐらいにしか見抜けなかった。"
msgstr "\"...What a joke. I only saw one, and it was just a small dagger."

#. Occurrence SP1:8502:21030: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0117; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8502
msgctxt "text_id=21030 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　そもそも三本ってなんだ？　魔術師でもないクセに、どうやったら隠せるんだ？　あのバカ、手品師に<鞍替|くらが>えしたワケじゃあるまいな？」"
msgstr "  How would he hide three anyway? He's not even a mage! Is he some kind of street magician now or something?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8535:21031: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8535
msgctxt "text_id=21031 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　橙子はぼやきつつ、先ほどまで目の前にいた男の姿を思い返した。"
msgstr "  Touko muttered to herself as she thought back over the man who had stood before her just moments ago."

#. Occurrence SP1:8540:21032: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8540
msgctxt "text_id=21032 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一枚上をいかれたのは心底<憎|にく>らしいが、同時にホッとしているのも事実である。"
msgstr "  She truly hated the fact that he had the upper hand on her, but she also felt a bit relieved."

#. Occurrence SP1:8560:21033: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8560
msgctxt "text_id=21033 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの短い会話の中、橙子がもし司祭の武装を正確に見抜いてしまっていたら、その瞬間こそ、あの司祭はゼロコンマで戦いの火ぶたを切っただろう。"
msgstr "  If she had actually noticed how heavily armed he was during that brief conversation, it would have been enough to instantly set off a fight."

#. Occurrence SP1:8566:21034: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8566
msgctxt "text_id=21034 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その時―――どちらが生き残るかは、今の蒼崎橙子ですら予測できない。"
msgstr "  Touko wasn't sure which one of them would have come out the victor if that had happened."

#. Occurrence SP1:8598:21035: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8598
msgctxt "text_id=21035 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　文柄詠梨という男は、昔からそういう人間だった。"
msgstr "  Eiri Fumidsuka had been that kind of man for as long as she had known him."

#. Occurrence SP1:8603:21036: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8603
msgctxt "text_id=21036 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　戦う理由も、戦う相手も要らない。"
msgstr "  He didn't need a reason, or even an opponent to fight."

#. Occurrence SP1:8608:21037: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8608
msgctxt "text_id=21037 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　因縁も憎悪も要らない。"
msgstr "  Nor did he need any kind of connection or hatred."

#. Occurrence SP1:8613:21038: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8613
msgctxt "text_id=21038 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただ、「口火を切る」瞬間だけを待つ<自動機械|オートメーション>。"
msgstr "  He was just a machine that simply needed an ignition."

#. Occurrence SP1:8618:21039: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8618
msgctxt "text_id=21039 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人を斬る事について考察さえしない、鍛え上げられた“殺人検証”の化身である。"
msgstr "  He was murder incarnate, with no qualms about cutting someone down."

#. Occurrence SP1:8652:21040: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8652
msgctxt "text_id=21040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女がそれを間近で見たのは一度きり。"
msgstr "  Touko had only seen that side of him once."

#. Occurrence SP1:8658:21041: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8658
msgctxt "text_id=21041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……まだ蒼崎橙子が魔法使いの“幸福な”弟子だった頃。"
msgstr "  It was back when she was still a relatively happy disciple of magecraft."

#. Occurrence SP1:8663:21042: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8663
msgctxt "text_id=21042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの男は、橙子が祖父の前で静かに涙した瞬間、何の前触れもなく、何の躊躇いもなく、自らの師を一刀のもと処断したのだ。"
msgstr "  Touko had been standing quietly before her grandfather, crying. The instant her first tears fell, without warning, without hesitation, Eiri cut down their master in an instant."

#. Occurrence SP1:8714:21043: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A21_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=A21; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8714
msgctxt "text_id=21043 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「なんで！？　どうして、貴方が<祖父|あのひと>を斬りつけたの！？」"
msgstr "\"What have you done?! Why did you just kill him like that?!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8720:21044: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B41_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=B41; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8720
msgctxt "text_id=21044 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いえ。今なら斬れる、と思いましたので」"
msgstr "\"Because I thought I could.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8740:21045: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8740
msgctxt "text_id=21045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あっさりとした返答に、幼い橙子がどれほど感じ入ったのか、当の本人は知るまい。"
msgstr "  Eiri could not fathom how much this curt response would affect such a young Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:8746:21046: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8746
msgctxt "text_id=21046 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“相手が隙を見せたから、勝てると確信したから斬った”"
msgstr "  He had not meant to say,"

#. Occurrence SP1:8746:21047: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8746
msgctxt "text_id=21047 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ではない。"
msgstr "  \"My opponent showed a moment of weakness, and I knew I could win, so I took the opportunity.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8751:21048: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8751
msgctxt "text_id=21048 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“今の自分の気持ちなら斬れると思ったから、斬った”。"
msgstr "  All he meant was..."

#. Occurrence SP1:8783:21049: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8783
msgctxt "text_id=21049 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただそれだけ。"
msgstr "  \"I felt capable of killing him, so I did.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8788:21050: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8788
msgctxt "text_id=21050 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　祖父に弟子入りし、交遊を深め、唯一無二の友人関係を得た男は、胸に飛来した感情に寄って祖父を切断した。"
msgstr "  This man had become her grandfather's disciple, forged an unrivaled friendship with him, and yet had still mercilessly cut him down when the desire arose."

#. Occurrence SP1:8793:21051: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8793
msgctxt "text_id=21051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法使いに限りなく近かった魔術師の肉体を破壊したのは、誰あろう、あの司祭の神技である。"
msgstr "  He possessed some sort of superhuman ability that had allowed him to destroy the mortal vessel of a mage who had been infinitely close to being a Magician."

#. Occurrence SP1:8834:21052: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0118; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8834
msgctxt "text_id=21052 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「あーあ、ほんと胡散くさい、面倒くさい！"
msgstr "\"Argh, this is all so fishy! And a pain!"

#. Occurrence SP1:8840:21053: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0119; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8840
msgctxt "text_id=21053 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　でも<目障|めざわ>りだからぜったい殺すし。魔法を<奪|うば>ってからの仕事がまた一つ増えちゃったじゃない、バカ詠梨」"
msgstr "  I'll have to kill him since he annoys me, but that's just one more thing to do after stealing the Magic. Damn it, Eiri!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8865:21054: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8865
msgctxt "text_id=21054 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　眼鏡をかけ直して、橙子は<踵|きびす>を返した。"
msgstr "  Touko put her glasses back on and turned on her heel."

#. Occurrence SP1:8870:21055: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8870
msgctxt "text_id=21055 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今日の目的はすべてクリアした。"
msgstr "  She had completed all her major tasks for the day."

#. Occurrence SP1:8875:21056: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8875
msgctxt "text_id=21056 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あとは使い魔の食料を調達する為、食費を稼いでアジトに帰るだけである。"
msgstr "  All that was left was to make some money to buy food for her familiar and head back to the hideout."

#. Occurrence SP1:8909:21057: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0050; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8909
msgctxt "text_id=21057 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“ちょっ、なにあの乙女時空ーーーーーー！？”」"
msgstr "(Wait, what was with that sudden romantic mood?!)"

#. Occurrence SP1:8915:21058: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8915
msgctxt "text_id=21058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　と、ベオが叫んだかはさておいて。"
msgstr "  Setting aside Beo's mental shout of dismay for a moment..."

#. Occurrence SP1:8920:21059: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8920
msgctxt "text_id=21059 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　例の浮わ浮わした匂いはどこへやら。"
msgstr "  The scent that had been bothering him for the past few days had suddenly disappeared."

#. Occurrence SP1:8925:21060: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8925
msgctxt "text_id=21060 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雇い主は完全にもとの蒼崎橙子に戻って、繁華街の方角に消えていった。"
msgstr "  His employer was back to being the old Touko Aozaki he knew, and she was headed into the entertainment district."

#. Occurrence SP1:8959:21061: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0051; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8959
msgctxt "text_id=21061 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“………………”」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:8965:21062: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8965
msgctxt "text_id=21062 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　クンクンと鼻を鳴らす。"
msgstr "  Beo sniffed at the air."

#. Occurrence SP1:8970:21063: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8970
msgctxt "text_id=21063 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの匂いが気になってやってきたベオとしては、もはや橙子は尾行する対象になりえない。"
msgstr "  The scent had vanished, and he no longer had a reason to continue tailing Touko."

#. Occurrence SP1:8990:21064: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8990
msgctxt "text_id=21064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜ匂いは消えたのか。"
msgstr "  But where had it gone?"

#. Occurrence SP1:8995:21065: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8995
msgctxt "text_id=21065 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも原因は何だったのか。"
msgstr "  And where had it come from in the first place?"

#. Occurrence SP1:9000:21066: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9000
msgctxt "text_id=21066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カレはカレなりに考えこんだ末、"
msgstr "  Beo thought about it for a few moments."

#. Occurrence SP1:9007:21067: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0052; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9007
msgctxt "text_id=21067 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“うん、さっきの男が怪しいよね！”」"
msgstr "(It must be that shady guy just earlier!)"

#. Occurrence SP1:9013:21068: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9013
msgctxt "text_id=21068 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気を取り直して、先ほどの男の匂いを辿る事にした。"
msgstr "  Beo regained his composure and decided to follow the trail of the man's scent."

#. Occurrence SP1:9033:21069: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9033
msgctxt "text_id=21069 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　行き着く先が雇い主にとって鬼門である事なぞ、無論、ベオには与り知らぬコトである。"
msgstr "  He had no idea that where he was going was his employer's worst nightmare."

#. Occurrence SP1:9090:21070: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9090
msgctxt "text_id=21070 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　唐突だが、<合田|あいだ>教会は年中無休、かつ、来る者拒まずの姿勢を貫いている。"
msgstr "  Aida Church was set up to accept visitors any time of day, any day of the year."

#. Occurrence SP1:9095:21071: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9095
msgctxt "text_id=21071 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　迷うもの、<貧|ひん>するものの味方であり、最近は小金稼ぎに<結|ブ><婚式|ライダル>業にまで手を出した。"
msgstr "  The church was the savior of the lost and the poor, and recently had even ventured into the wedding industry for some extra income."

#. Occurrence SP1:9100:21072: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9100
msgctxt "text_id=21072 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三咲市の福祉事業とも密接な関係にあり、運営はそれなりに順調だ。"
msgstr "  It was closely involved with the public welfare of Misaki City and was doing fairly well for itself in that regard."

#. Occurrence SP1:9105:21073: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9105
msgctxt "text_id=21073 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　唯一の問題は、この通り、"
msgstr "  However, there was one problem."

#. Occurrence SP1:9130:21074: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9130
msgctxt "text_id=21074 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「……詠梨神父はまた外出ですか。"
msgstr "\"...Father Eiri is still not in?"

#. Occurrence SP1:9136:21075: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9136
msgctxt "text_id=21075 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　律架もサボタージュ、奉仕の生徒さんたちも日に日に減っていく一方……結局、労働力は私ひとりだけなのですね」"
msgstr "  Ritsuka is boycotting the Church, and we are losing volunteers with each passing day. I'm the only one working here at this point.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:9142:21076: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9142
msgctxt "text_id=21076 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　台所事情は安泰でも、慢性的な人手不足だけは解消できないのだった。"
msgstr "  Even if their financial situation was stable, they seemed to be chronically understaffed."

#. Occurrence SP1:9175:21077: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9175
msgctxt "text_id=21077 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「だいたい、この街の人々は信心が足りなさすぎます。"
msgstr "\"The people of this city lack faith."

#. Occurrence SP1:9181:21078: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9181
msgctxt "text_id=21078 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　給金がなければ働けないなど、人生をなんだと思っているのでしょう。物欲だけで構成された一日を過ごしていては、<懐|ふところ>は豊かになっても心が貧しくなるだけでしょうに」"
msgstr "  What sort of life is spent demanding money in exchange for labor? Days spent chasing after material desires can only lead to a life of hollow wealth and mental poverty.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:9206:21079: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9206
msgctxt "text_id=21079 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ひとり小言を口にしながら、シスターはひょい、と片手で<脚立|きゃたつ>を持ち上げた。"
msgstr "  The nun muttered to herself quietly as she picked up the stepladder with one hand."

#. Occurrence SP1:9211:21080: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9211
msgctxt "text_id=21080 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　教会の窓掃除に使う本格的な脚立で、大の大人がふたりがかりでも手に余る重量なのだが、このシスターにはそのあたり気にならないようだ。"
msgstr "  Although it was a proper stepladder they used for cleaning the church windows and weighed too much to be carried by even two strong adults, the mass didn't seem to faze her."

#. Occurrence SP1:9245:21081: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0004; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9245
msgctxt "text_id=21081 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「人々の心の<荒廃|こうはい>も気になりますが、物価の上昇も捨て置けません。消費税なるものの導入も<囁|ささや>かれますし、詠梨神父にはもっと、一日で驚異的な成果をあげる結婚式の素晴らしさを知っていただかないと。"
msgstr "\"The desolation of the hearts and minds of our flock is a concern, but we also mustn't forget the increasing costs of living. There are whispers of an impending sales tax, and Father Eiri must be convinced of the great results we can achieve in a single day if we hold more wedding ceremonies."

#. Occurrence SP1:9251:21082: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0005; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9251
msgctxt "text_id=21082 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　あの人は<誰彼|だれかれ>何彼気分で世話をして、後の事とか考えませんから。裏庭に集まった野良猫たちはどうするんですか。ああ、私ですね、それも私が受け持つのですね。もうなんでもかんでも肉体労働は私なのですね」"
msgstr "  He'll go out of his way to help anyone and everyone but won't think about the work that comes after that. What is he going to do about all those stray cats in the back garden? Ah, right, that and any other physical labor always falls to me, doesn't it?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:9282:21083: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9282
msgctxt "text_id=21083 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もはや完全な小言マシーンと化したシスターの名は、<周瀬|すせ><唯架|ゆいか>。"
msgstr "  This nun mumbling to herself at a near-constant pace was Sister Yuika Suse."

#. Occurrence SP1:9287:21084: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9287
msgctxt "text_id=21084 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　普段の彼女からは考えられない光景だが、これにはちょっとした理由がある。"
msgstr "  There was a reason for her unusual behavior."

#. Occurrence SP1:9307:21085: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9307
msgctxt "text_id=21085 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は盲目であるが故に、周囲の気配を察する<感覚|センス>が研ぎ澄まされている。"
msgstr "  Yuika was completely blind and had honed her other senses to keenly perceive her surroundings."

#. Occurrence SP1:9312:21086: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9312
msgctxt "text_id=21086 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　生き物―――特に人間の気配には敏感で、驚くべき事に半径十メートル単位で人の在る無しを判断できる。"
msgstr "  She was extremely sensitive to the presence of living creatures, particularly humans, and could detect when someone was within a radius of thirty feet."

#. Occurrence SP1:9317:21087: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9317
msgctxt "text_id=21087 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いま、彼女が素の自分をさらけだしているのは、周囲に人がいないと感じ取っているからだ。"
msgstr "  She could talk to herself so openly now because she did not sense anyone nearby."

#. Occurrence SP1:9356:21088: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0006; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9356
msgctxt "text_id=21088 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「ええっと、今日の余り物はっと……ああ、もらい物でジャムの詰め合わせがありましたね。"
msgstr "\"Let's see... What leftover food do we have? Ah, there's that set of assorted jams we received as a gift."

#. Occurrence SP1:9362:21089: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0007; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9362
msgctxt "text_id=21089 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　……どうなのでしょう、主よ。猫って二日経った岩のように堅いパンでもペーストすればいけるクチなんでしょうか。玉葱だけは出すな、と律架が言っていた気がしますが」"
msgstr "  What shall we do, my Lord? Can a cat eat two-day-old bread that's rock hard? Ritsuka was clear about not giving them onions, if I remember correctly...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:9382:21090: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9382
msgctxt "text_id=21090 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シスターは掃除器具の後片づけをしつつ、先ほどから裏庭でミャーミャーうるさい小動物たちの<夕餉|ゆうげ>の支度をする。"
msgstr "  Sister Yuika was busy putting away the cleaning tools while simultaneously trying to prepare dinner for the hungry animals mewing in the back garden."

#. Occurrence SP1:9387:21091: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9387
msgctxt "text_id=21091 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　と。"
msgstr "  When suddenly..."

#. Occurrence SP1:9399:21092: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0008; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9399
msgctxt "text_id=21092 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「おや？　新しい迷子ですか？」"
msgstr "\"Oh? Do we have a new lost child among us?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:9404:21093: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9404
msgctxt "text_id=21093 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　盲目のシスターは、ひょこっと教会に現れた、小型犬の気配を感じ取った。"
msgstr "  Sister Yuika suddenly sensed the presence of a small dog in the church."

#. Occurrence SP1:9437:21094: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0009; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9437
msgctxt "text_id=21094 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「ごめんなさい、今日は猫限定の日なの。キミがまざってしまったら猫どもが驚くわ。"
msgstr "\"I'm sorry, little one, but today is for cats only. If I throw you in with that bunch, they'll be too surprised to eat."

#. Occurrence SP1:9443:21095: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0010; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9443
msgctxt "text_id=21095 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　餌ならここで恵んであげますから、中に入るのはまた今度にしてくださいね。それ以上入ったら向かいの家の屋根あたりまでご退場願いますよ」"
msgstr "  I'll give you some food, but you'll have to wait until next time to come inside. We can't be taking in any more animals tonight.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:9463:21096: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9463
msgctxt "text_id=21096 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　教会の門をくぐろうとする茶色の小型犬を、シスターは足で押しとどめる。"
msgstr "  She put her foot in front of the small brown dog to stop him from coming any further inside the church's gate."

#. Occurrence SP1:9468:21097: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9468
msgctxt "text_id=21097 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人間でないものには扱いが少々乱暴な唯架だった。"
msgstr "  Yuika was somewhat rougher in her treatment of non-human creatures."

#. Occurrence SP1:9503:21098: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0053; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9503
msgctxt "text_id=21098 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“なにこの<辛気|しんき>くさい生き物？”」"
msgstr "(What is this irritating creature?)"

#. Occurrence SP1:9509:21099: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9509
msgctxt "text_id=21099 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、小型犬―――狼の信念はとりあえず隅に追いやった―――に変身したベオは、シスターを障害物としか見ていなかった。"
msgstr "  Beo, who'd convinced himself to transform into a small dog instead of a wolf like he really wanted, only saw Sister Yuika as an obstacle in his way."

#. Occurrence SP1:9529:21100: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9529
msgctxt "text_id=21100 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　黒い男の匂いはこの先に続いている。"
msgstr "  He could smell the scent of the man in black ahead, further inside."

#. Occurrence SP1:9534:21101: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9534
msgctxt "text_id=21101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人間なぞどうでもいいカレにとって、立ちふさがるシスターは電柱以下の造形物にすぎない。"
msgstr "  Beo thought little of humans, and in this moment Sister Yuika was simply an obstacle."

#. Occurrence SP1:9539:21102: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9539
msgctxt "text_id=21102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なので当然、シスターの言葉なぞ無視して門をすり抜けようとする。"
msgstr "  So naturally, he ignored her warnings and attempted to push through the gate."

#. Occurrence SP1:9572:21103: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0011; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9572
msgctxt "text_id=21103 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「……え。な、なんでしょう、この色。"
msgstr "\"...Hm? W-what is this color?"

#. Occurrence SP1:9578:21104: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0012; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9578
msgctxt "text_id=21104 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　この子、すごい色していますけど……もしかして高級な品種なのでしょうか……だとしたら……」"
msgstr "  This dog is a most unusual color... Perhaps it's a rare exotic breed, in which case...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:9584:21105: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9584
msgctxt "text_id=21105 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どこぞのお金持ちのペットかもしれない。"
msgstr "  He might be some wealthy person's pet."

#. Occurrence SP1:9589:21106: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9589
msgctxt "text_id=21106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　教会に来るという事は、礼拝に来る裕福層の飼い犬である可能性もある。"
msgstr "  Since the dog came to the church, its rich owner might also attend church services..."

#. Occurrence SP1:9594:21107: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9594
msgctxt "text_id=21107 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これは無下にはできない、と蹴りだそうとした足を止める唯架だった。"
msgstr "  Yuika stopped trying to push the dog away from the gate."

#. Occurrence SP1:9634:21108: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0013; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9634
msgctxt "text_id=21108 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「ごめんなさいね。詠梨神父が目当てなんでしょうけど、また出かけてしまったの。今日いちばんの餌をあげますから、大人しく帰ってくださいません？」"
msgstr "\"I'm sorry. I'm sure you're here to see Father Eiri, but he's still out at the moment. I'll give you the best food we have today if you just run on along home, okay?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:9640:21109: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0054; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9640
msgctxt "text_id=21109 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“ああもう、邪魔、この辛気くさい人！"
msgstr "(Ugh, what an annoying, irritating woman!"

#. Occurrence SP1:9640:21110: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0054; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9640
msgctxt "text_id=21110 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　よし、まわりに誰もいないし、首を噛み折ろ―――”」"
msgstr "  Perfect, nobody's around. I'll just go for her throa-)"

#. Occurrence SP1:9675:21111: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9675
msgctxt "text_id=21111 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　飛びかかろうとしたベオの前脚が、急停止する。　"
msgstr "  Beo's front legs stopped suddenly before he could launch himself at Sister Yuika.  "

#. Occurrence SP1:9681:21112: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9681
msgctxt "text_id=21112 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　カパッ。"
msgstr "  Pop."

#. Occurrence SP1:9687:21113: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9687
msgctxt "text_id=21113 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シスターは手にした瓶の蓋をあけて、キラキラ光る液体状のものを小皿にそそいで、"
msgstr "  Sister Yuika opened the lid of the bottle she held and poured out a glimmering liquid into a small dish."

msgctxt "text_id=21114 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "小型犬の前に差しだした。"
msgstr " She set it down in front of the dog."

#. Occurrence SP1:9722:21115: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0055; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9722
msgctxt "text_id=21115 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“えっと―――”」"
msgstr "(Umm...)"

#. Occurrence SP1:9728:21116: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0014; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9728
msgctxt "text_id=21116 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「ほら、お食べ」"
msgstr "\"Here you go. Eat up!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:9752:21117: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9752
msgctxt "text_id=21117 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　差し出された正体不明の液体。"
msgstr "  The mysterious, unknown liquid sat in front of Beo."

#. Occurrence SP1:9757:21118: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9757
msgctxt "text_id=21118 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはまたしても、カレにとってはじめて嗅ぐ匂いだった。"
msgstr "  It smelled like nothing he'd ever smelled before."

#. Occurrence SP1:9762:21119: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9762
msgctxt "text_id=21119 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　好奇心にはひたすらに弱いベオである。"
msgstr "  Beo was known to let curiosity get the best of him."

#. Occurrence SP1:9767:21120: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9767
msgctxt "text_id=21120 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たとえ毒が入っていようと、自然界の毒ならカレには通じない。"
msgstr "  Even if it was poisoned, no poison of the natural world could harm him."

#. Occurrence SP1:9772:21121: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9772
msgctxt "text_id=21121 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぺろりと一口舐める。"
msgstr "  He lapped up a mouthful."

#. Occurrence SP1:9807:21122: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0056; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9807
msgctxt "text_id=21122 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“――――――なに”」"
msgstr "(...W-what...)"

#. Occurrence SP1:9812:21123: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9812
msgctxt "text_id=21123 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　すこし舐める。"
msgstr "  He lapped up a little more."

#. Occurrence SP1:9818:21124: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0057; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9818
msgctxt "text_id=21124 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“――――――この”」"
msgstr "(...is this...)"

#. Occurrence SP1:9823:21125: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9823
msgctxt "text_id=21125 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さらに舐める。"
msgstr "  He lapped up even more."

#. Occurrence SP1:9829:21126: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0058; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9829
msgctxt "text_id=21126 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“――――――あじ！”」"
msgstr "(...flavor!?)"

#. Occurrence SP1:9834:21127: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9834
msgctxt "text_id=21127 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もっと舐める。"
msgstr "  He lapped up more and more."

#. Occurrence SP1:9865:21128: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9865
msgctxt "text_id=21128 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「おや。牛乳を飲むような舐めっぷり。"
msgstr "\"My, my! You're lapping that up like it was milk!"

#. Occurrence SP1:9865:21129: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9865
msgctxt "text_id=21129 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　犬ながら惚れ惚れします」"
msgstr "  I think I might actually like you, even though you are a dog.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:9871:21130: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0059; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9871
msgctxt "text_id=21130 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“これ、もっとほしい！”」"
msgstr "(I want more!)"

#. Occurrence SP1:9877:21131: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9877
msgctxt "text_id=21131 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夕暮れの教会に、ワン、と元気な吠え声が響きわたる。"
msgstr "  The church became filled with the echoes of Beo's boisterous barking."

#. Occurrence SP1:9882:21132: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9882
msgctxt "text_id=21132 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この時点で、ベオにとって男の匂いなぞどうでもいい物になっていた。"
msgstr "  At this point he'd completely forgotten about the man's scent."

#. Occurrence SP1:9909:21133: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0016; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9909
msgctxt "text_id=21133 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「ふふ、甘いですか？　私も感動しました。"
msgstr "\"Hehe, it's sweet and delicious, isn't it? I'm impressed."

#. Occurrence SP1:9909:21134: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0016; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9909
msgctxt "text_id=21134 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　犬どもにも甘味をたしなむ心があるのですね」"
msgstr "  I didn't know dogs could have such a sweet tooth.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:9928:21135: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0060; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9928
msgctxt "text_id=21135 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“甘い？　これが甘いってコト？”」"
msgstr "(Sweet? Is this what sweet takes like?)"

#. Occurrence SP1:9934:21136: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9934
msgctxt "text_id=21136 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シスターの呟きに、ベオはハッと顔をあげた。"
msgstr "  Beo looked up at Sister Yuika as she whispered to him."

#. Occurrence SP1:9939:21137: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9939
msgctxt "text_id=21137 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今の単語はなんだか大切な気がする。"
msgstr "  He had the feeling that sweet was an important word he should remember."

#. Occurrence SP1:9944:21138: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9944
msgctxt "text_id=21138 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそもこの食べ物が閃光のような衝撃だった。"
msgstr "  This food sent a sensation through him that was like a flash of lightning."

#. Occurrence SP1:9986:21139: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9986
msgctxt "text_id=21139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオにとって、食事は燃料補給のパターンの一つにすぎない。"
msgstr "  Until this point, eating food had been nothing more than a process of refueling."

#. Occurrence SP1:9991:21140: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9991
msgctxt "text_id=21140 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ハンバーガーのえり好みはあるが、あれはあくまで“噛みごこち”の良し悪しだった。どうせ栄養摂取をしなくちゃいけないのだから、仕方なく食べているにすぎない。"
msgstr "  He liked hamburgers, but that never amounted to more than a preference for a particular mouthfeel. He only ate because he needed the nutrition."

#. Occurrence SP1:9997:21141: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9997
msgctxt "text_id=21141 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が、これは違う。肉食動物の“命”を燃料にするカレにとって、この食べ物はまったく意味がない。"
msgstr "  But this was different. This food was not necessary to his survival."

#. Occurrence SP1:10029:21142: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10029
msgctxt "text_id=21142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、もっと食べたい。"
msgstr "  And yet he knew he wanted more."

#. Occurrence SP1:10034:21143: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10034
msgctxt "text_id=21143 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　必要はないけど、これはなんていうか、すごく気持ちのいいものだ。"
msgstr "  He didn't really need it, but it made him feel good."

#. Occurrence SP1:10039:21144: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10039
msgctxt "text_id=21144 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　体ではなく、心の栄養になるような。"
msgstr "  It was like food for his soul rather than his body."

#. Occurrence SP1:10060:21145: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0061; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10060
msgctxt "text_id=21145 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「“―――あれ、そもそもこの匂いって―――”」"
msgstr "(Wait, isn't this smell...)"

#. Occurrence SP1:10066:21146: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10066
msgctxt "text_id=21146 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　むむ、と振りまくっていた尻尾が止まる。"
msgstr "  He stopped wagging his tail."

#. Occurrence SP1:10071:21147: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10071
msgctxt "text_id=21147 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小型犬に<扮|ふん>した黄金の狼は、自分の名前の由来である食べ物を前にして、解けない難問につきあたるのだった。"
msgstr "  The golden wolf in the form of a small dog sat with the food that was the very origin of his name in front of him. Beowulf was faced with a difficult problem he was unable to solve."

#. Occurrence SP1:10155:21148: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0062; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10155
msgctxt "text_id=21148 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ただいまー」"
msgstr "\"I'm home!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10174:21149: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0120; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10174
msgctxt "text_id=21149 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「はい、お帰りなさいベオくん。"
msgstr "\"Welcome back, Beo."

#. Occurrence SP1:10180:21150: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0121; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10180
msgctxt "text_id=21150 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　遅いお帰りにお姉さん心配しちゃった。こんな時間まで無断外出とか心配したゾ。教育係<兼|けん>飼い主として、バッボーイしなくちゃいけないからそこに正座」"
msgstr "  I was worried about you. It's late! As your trainer and master, I have to punish you for staying out so late without checking in with me. Kneel right there.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10201:21151: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10201
msgctxt "text_id=21151 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオがヒト形に変身して工房に戻ると、笑顔でこめかみをひくつかせた蒼崎橙子が待っていた。"
msgstr "  Beo had transformed back into human form and returned to the workshop. Touko was waiting there for him with a big, strained smile on her face."

#. Occurrence SP1:10225:21152: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0063; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10225
msgctxt "text_id=21152 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「あ、そうか」"
msgstr "\"Ah, right.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10230:21153: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10230
msgctxt "text_id=21153 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　失敗しちゃった、とベオは素直に反省する。"
msgstr "  Beo knew he had messed up."

#. Occurrence SP1:10235:21154: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10235
msgctxt "text_id=21154 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シスターとの一件で、先回りして帰る事を失念していた。"
msgstr "  He had failed to get back home before Touko because of Sister Yuika."

#. Occurrence SP1:10262:21155: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0064; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10262
msgctxt "text_id=21155 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「えー、正座はいやですー。"
msgstr "\"Aw, do I really have to kneel in the corner?"

#. Occurrence SP1:10268:21156: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0065; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10268
msgctxt "text_id=21156 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　そりゃあ無断で外に出てたけど、誰にも見つかってないし。別にボク、悪いことしてないし」"
msgstr "  I was out late, but nobody saw me! I wasn't doing anything bad!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10274:21157: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0122; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10274
msgctxt "text_id=21157 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「誰にも見つかっていない？"
msgstr "\"Are you sure nobody saw you?"

#. Occurrence SP1:10280:21158: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0123; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10280
msgctxt "text_id=21158 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ってコトはベオくん、裏山で遊んでたの？」"
msgstr "  Were you out playing in the mountains?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10292:21159: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0066; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10292
msgctxt "text_id=21159 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ううん、裏山じゃなくて町。気付かなかったでしょ、実はトーコさんを尾行していただけなのです！」"
msgstr "\"No, I was in town. But nobody noticed me, I'm sure of it. I was actually following you!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10325:21160: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10325
msgctxt "text_id=21160 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　予想外の返答に固まる橙子。"
msgstr "  Touko froze at Beo's completely unexpected response."

#. Occurrence SP1:10335:21161: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10335
msgctxt "text_id=21161 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が、さすがにカレの扱いには慣れたものなのか、そう、とため息で頭痛を押さえこんだ。"
msgstr "  But, she was used to him by now. She just sighed and rubbed her head, now throbbing from a terrible headache."

#. Occurrence SP1:10356:21162: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0124; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10356
msgctxt "text_id=21162 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……いいでしょう。見つからなければ<悪戯|いたずら>じゃない、と教えたのは私だしね。主人の尾行禁止、とは命令していなかったし。今回の尾行については不問に付します。"
msgstr "\"...Fine. I suppose I was the one who taught you that nothing's bad, as long as you don't get caught. I also never explicitly told you that you couldn't follow me, so I'll let this one slide."

#. Occurrence SP1:10367:21163: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0125; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10367
msgctxt "text_id=21163 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　でも、どうやって人目を避けたの？　その格好だったらさすがに気付くと思うんだけど、私」"
msgstr "  But how did you avoid being noticed? I'm pretty sure you would've drawn attention to yourself in that form.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10402:21164: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0067; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10402
msgctxt "text_id=21164 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「そこはキギョウヒミツです。教えたら今日みたいなトーコさん、もう見れなくなっちゃうし。楽しそうだったよね、あのヒトと」"
msgstr "\"That's my trade secret. If I told you, then I won't be able to see you like I did today. You looked like you were really having fun with that person.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10421:21165: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0126; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10421
msgctxt "text_id=21165 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10437:21166: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10437
msgctxt "text_id=21166 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　らしくなく、素直に反応する橙子。"
msgstr "  Touko's response was both honest and out of character."

#. Occurrence SP1:10442:21167: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10442
msgctxt "text_id=21167 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな雇い主の動揺に、ベオも意表をつかれてしまった。"
msgstr "  Even Beo was surprised at how taken aback she was by his statement."

#. Occurrence SP1:10477:21168: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0127; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10477
msgctxt "text_id=21168 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「それは違う。どんな勘違いをしたのか知らないけど、アレはただの交渉よ。教会の神父相手に、町を人質に見立てて不干渉を念押ししただけで、」"
msgstr "\"That wasn't fun. I don't know what kind of weird idea you got from that, but it was a negotiation. I was simply holding the entire town hostage to keep him from interfering as a priest of the Church, and...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10483:21169: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0068; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10483
msgctxt "text_id=21169 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「いや、楽しそうに見えたのは女のヒトの方だけど。"
msgstr "\"Well, I was actually talking about the girl."

#. Occurrence SP1:10489:21170: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0069; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10489
msgctxt "text_id=21170 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　あの、全身ぐるぐる巻きに自分を縛ってた方」"
msgstr "  The one that you left unable to move.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10495:21171: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0128; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10495
msgctxt "text_id=21171 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「むっ」"
msgstr "\"Urgh...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10530:21172: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10530
msgctxt "text_id=21172 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しばし無言で見つめ合う一人と一匹。"
msgstr "  Woman and wolf stared at each other for a silent moment."

#. Occurrence SP1:10535:21173: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10535
msgctxt "text_id=21173 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　野生のカレは、ふーん、と訳知り顔で納得して、"
msgstr "  Beo looked satisfied with himself and his secret information."

#. Occurrence SP1:10547:21174: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0070; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10547
msgctxt "text_id=21174 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「………………。"
msgstr "\"..."

#. Occurrence SP1:10559:21175: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0071; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10559
msgctxt "text_id=21175 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　つまり、アレってトーコさんのつがい？」"
msgstr "  But I guess that means that guy's your mate, right?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10578:21176: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0129; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10578
msgctxt "text_id=21176 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「っ……！」"
msgstr "\"Ngh...!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10583:21177: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10583
msgctxt "text_id=21177 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子をして吹き出させる、神をも恐れぬ疑問を投げかけた。"
msgstr "  Touko nearly choked at the utterly fearless question."

#. Occurrence SP1:10609:21178: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10609
msgctxt "text_id=21178 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人形師は無言で眼鏡を外して、まなじりを強く押さえた。"
msgstr "  The puppet master wordlessly removed her glasses and tamped down her emotions."

#. Occurrence SP1:10620:21179: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0130; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10620
msgctxt "text_id=21179 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「なんでそんな言葉だけ知ってるんだオマエは。"
msgstr "\"Tell me, Beo, why do you even know that word?"

#. Occurrence SP1:10620:21180: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0130; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10620
msgctxt "text_id=21180 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　<耳年増|みみどしま>にも程があるぞ」"
msgstr "  There's no reason for you to know about such things.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10652:21181: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0072; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10652
msgctxt "text_id=21181 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「こんなの、生き物としてフツーの言葉じゃない。"
msgstr "\"Why wouldn't I? It's a word all creatures are familiar with."

#. Occurrence SP1:10658:21182: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0073; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10658
msgctxt "text_id=21182 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　……まあ、トーコさんがフツーの生き物だとは思っていなかったから、ボクとしても意外だけど。"
msgstr "  ...Granted, I never thought of you as a normal creature, so I'm a little surprised myself."

#. Occurrence SP1:10669:21183: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0074; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10669
msgctxt "text_id=21183 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　それで、どうなの？　あのパッとしないポテトみたいな<雄|おす>、なに？」"
msgstr "  Anyway, who is that plain, potato-looking male anyway?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10689:21184: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10689
msgctxt "text_id=21184 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何が気に食わないのか、ベオは唐突に不機嫌になった。"
msgstr "  Beo was suddenly irritated."

#. Occurrence SP1:10694:21185: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10694
msgctxt "text_id=21185 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオ自身、自分が<苛|いら>ついている事は理解できたが、なぜ苛ついているのかまでは理解できていない。"
msgstr "  He was irritated, but he couldn't figure out why."

#. Occurrence SP1:10736:21186: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0131; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10736
msgctxt "text_id=21186 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「何もなにも、オマエの言う通りしなびたフライドポテトだよ。少なくとも私にとってはね。気にする価値もないし、食べたくなるような魅力もない」"
msgstr "\"He's literally nothing. To me, anyway. Your assessment is correct. He isn't worth thinking about, and he's not even good enough for you to eat.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10747:21187: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0075; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10747
msgctxt "text_id=21187 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ホント？　ただの敵？　トーコさんにとって特別なのは、ボクだけ？」"
msgstr "\"Really? He's just an enemy? And I'm the only special person in your life?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10774:21188: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0132; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10774
msgctxt "text_id=21188 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「ああ、今のところはね。"
msgstr "\"For the time being, yes."

#. Occurrence SP1:10780:21189: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0133; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10780
msgctxt "text_id=21189 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　……やけぼっくいに火がつくかとも思ったが、完全に<湿気|しけ>っていた。アレを前にしてどうこう思うのは、もう二度とないだろうさ」"
msgstr "  ...I thought it might rekindle something, but there was absolutely nothing there. I don't think I'll ever think about him like that again.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10791:21190: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0076; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10791
msgctxt "text_id=21190 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「そっか！　なんでもないならもう忘れるコトにしまーす！　でも、ヤケボックイってなに？」"
msgstr "\"All right, then! If that's the case then I'll forget about it! Say, what do you mean by 'rekindle' anyway?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10826:21191: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0134; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10826
msgctxt "text_id=21191 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「思い出を蒸し返して、前後不覚におちいるコト。"
msgstr "\"It's just when you think you can make a relationship like it was in the past."

#. Occurrence SP1:10832:21192: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0135; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10832
msgctxt "text_id=21192 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ま、その可能性だって少しはあったと思うよ。あんなんでも、私の初恋の相手のようだし」"
msgstr "  I mean, I guess there was a slight chance of that happening. He was my first love, after all.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10838:21193: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0077; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10838
msgctxt "text_id=21193 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「へ？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10843:21194: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10843
msgctxt "text_id=21194 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　恋は未経験なれど、初恋の意味ぐらいは知っているベオだった。"
msgstr "  Beo had no firsthand experience with love, but he at least understood the concept of first love."

#. Occurrence SP1:10864:21195: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0078; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10864
msgctxt "text_id=21195 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ハツコイって、トーコさんに！？」"
msgstr "\"YOU had a first love?!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10870:21196: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0136; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10870
msgctxt "text_id=21196 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「……つがいはアリで初恋はナシとか、どれだけ私を動物的に観ているんだ、オマエは。"
msgstr "\"...I'm not sure why you think a mate is more believable than a first love."

#. Occurrence SP1:10876:21197: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0137; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10876
msgctxt "text_id=21197 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　昔の話だよ。私が十代になったばかりで、<詠梨|アレ>が祖父の弟子だった頃の話だ。ヤツは魔術ではなく、精神修行の一環として祖父と付き合っていたが」"
msgstr "  It was a long time ago. I was still a teenager, and he had just started studying under my grandfather. He wasn't studying magecraft. He was just training under him to hone his mind.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10905:21198: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10905
msgctxt "text_id=21198 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　淡々と語る橙子の横顔から、未練らしきものは見られない。"
msgstr "  Touko spoke indifferently, and it was clear from the look on her face that there was no longer any attachment there."

#. Occurrence SP1:10910:21199: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10910
msgctxt "text_id=21199 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なのにこう、普段より<言霊|ことだま>に温かみがある、とベオは眉を曇らせた。"
msgstr "  Yet there was still a tenderness in her words that caused Beo to furrow his brow."

#. Occurrence SP1:10946:21200: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0079; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10946
msgctxt "text_id=21200 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「トーコさん、まだスキなわけ？」"
msgstr "\"Miss Touko... do you still like him?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10957:21201: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0138; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10957
msgctxt "text_id=21201 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「いや。自分でも呆れるぐらい何もなかった。"
msgstr "\"No. I was surprised at how little I felt for him."

#. Occurrence SP1:10963:21202: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0139; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10963
msgctxt "text_id=21202 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　ただ青春の幻影というのかな。そういう頃の象徴のような知人とは、話すだけで懐かしいものなんだよ。"
msgstr "  There's just this remnant of my adolescence there. Just talking to people I know from that time takes me back, you know?"

#. Occurrence SP1:10969:21203: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0140; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10969
msgctxt "text_id=21203 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　人間的にはまったく魅力を感じなくなったが、ヤツと話しているだけで、こう、昔の自分を思い返して笑いたくなる」"
msgstr "  I'm not attracted to him at all anymore as a person. But when I talk to him, I can remember that past version of myself so clearly it makes me want to laugh.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:10989:21204: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10989
msgctxt "text_id=21204 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<感慨|かんがい>深く語る橙子に、ベオはますます首を<傾|かし>げる。"
msgstr "  Beo grew only more confused as Touko spoke with such passion."

#. Occurrence SP1:10994:21205: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10994
msgctxt "text_id=21205 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　すごく嫌いなのにわりと好き、というのは理屈に合わない気がするからだ。"
msgstr "  He couldn't wrap his head around the concept that she hated him yet somehow also still liked him."

#. Occurrence SP1:11021:21206: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0080; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11021
msgctxt "text_id=21206 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「そういうの、ボク分かんないなー」"
msgstr "\"I don't get it.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11033:21207: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0141; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11033
msgctxt "text_id=21207 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「オマエには好き嫌いがないからな。<理屈|ロジック>だけじゃヒトの関係は解けないよ」"
msgstr "\"That's because you don't have likes or dislikes. Sometimes you can't use logic to understand human relationships.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11045:21208: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0081; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11045
msgctxt "text_id=21208 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「そんなのありますー！"
msgstr "\"I do too have likes and dislikes!"

#. Occurrence SP1:11045:21209: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0081; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11045
msgctxt "text_id=21209 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　食べ物だってえり好みするじゃんか、ボク！」"
msgstr "  There are certain foods that I like more than others, you know!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11082:21210: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0142; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11082
msgctxt "text_id=21210 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「オマエの基準は有益か無益かだけだろ。"
msgstr "\"You only work on the standard of whether something is useful or not."

#. Occurrence SP1:11088:21211: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0143; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11088
msgctxt "text_id=21211 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　野生動物にとって味覚は、十分な栄養値があるかないかを測るセンサーでしかない。"
msgstr "  Wild animals only use taste as a sensor to measure how nutritious something is."

#. Occurrence SP1:11094:21212: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0144; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11094
msgctxt "text_id=21212 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　栄養値を度外視して食事をとるのは人間だけだ。"
msgstr "  Only humans eat for reasons other than pure nutritional value."

#. Occurrence SP1:11100:21213: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0145; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11100
msgctxt "text_id=21213 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　……自分の体に合っているからその食材を好む、ではないんだよ。ヒトは \"楽しい\" か \"楽しくない\" かで食事をとる。好きなものが甘く見えるのはその為だ」"
msgstr "  Some of the food we like doesn't help sustain us. We eat what we eat because we enjoy it. That's also why things we like look sweet.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11131:21214: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0082; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11131
msgctxt "text_id=21214 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「甘いもの―――好きなものって、甘く見えるの？」"
msgstr "\"Things you like look sweet?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11137:21215: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0146; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11137
msgctxt "text_id=21215 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「物の喩えだが、苦くは見えないだろ。……まあ、ヒトによってはそれもありだが。"
msgstr "\"I mean, that was just an example. But we don't look at something we like and think it's bitter. Well, maybe some people do, I don't know."

#. Occurrence SP1:11143:21216: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0147; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11143
msgctxt "text_id=21216 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　そのあたりはアレだな、性癖の問題だ。"
msgstr "  It all depends on what you're into, I guess."

#. Occurrence SP1:11149:21217: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0148; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11149
msgctxt "text_id=21217 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　たまごが先か、にわとりが先かの話さ。好きだから甘いのか、甘いから好きなのか、とね」"
msgstr "  It's like 'what came first, the chicken or the egg?' Is something sweet because we like it, or do we like it because it's sweet?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11176:21218: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0083; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11176
msgctxt "text_id=21218 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「でもボク、トーコさんは甘く見えないけど」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, but, I don't think you look sweet.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11197:21219: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0149; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11197
msgctxt "text_id=21219 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そりゃそうだろ。そもそもオマエはまだ“生きて”いないからな。"
msgstr "\"Of course not! You're not actually 'alive!'"

#. Occurrence SP1:11203:21220: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0150; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11203
msgctxt "text_id=21220 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　在るだけのモノと、生きているコトはまた別の話だ。"
msgstr "  You exist, but you're not really alive. There's a difference."

#. Occurrence SP1:11209:21221: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0151; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11209
msgctxt "text_id=21221 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　皮肉な話だがね。その違いを知った時、オマエは無敵ではなくなるよ、ベオ」"
msgstr "  It's kind of ironic, actually. If you were to ever figure that difference out, you wouldn't be invincible anymore.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11220:21222: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0084; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11220
msgctxt "text_id=21222 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11245:21223: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0152; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11245
msgctxt "text_id=21223 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「さ、夕食だ。今日も大勝したからな、<霜降|しもふ>りのいいところを買ってきたぞ」"
msgstr "\"Anyway, it's time for dinner. I won a lot today, so I bought some nice marbled beef for you.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11263:21224: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11263
msgctxt "text_id=21224 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雇い主はいつもの調子で教室に入っていった。"
msgstr "  Touko walked into the classroom, back in her usual mood."

#. Occurrence SP1:11268:21225: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11268
msgctxt "text_id=21225 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオは浮かない顔で廊下に佇む。"
msgstr "  Beo lingered in the hallway looking dejected."

#. Occurrence SP1:11273:21226: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11273
msgctxt "text_id=21226 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“オマエはまだ生きていない”"
msgstr "\"You're not actually alive!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11278:21227: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11278
msgctxt "text_id=21227 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その台詞はベオの心をざわめかせたが、なぜそう思うのか、今のカレには分からない。"
msgstr "  Those words pierced right through Beo's heart, but he didn't quite know why yet."

#. Occurrence SP1:11312:21228: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11312
msgctxt "text_id=21228 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その答えの手がかりを得るのは、これから約三週間後。"
msgstr "  Three weeks would pass before he got a hint of why that was the case."

#. Occurrence SP1:11317:21229: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11317
msgctxt "text_id=21229 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　完全であるルゥ・ベオウルフが、"
msgstr "  Lugh Beowulf was perfect..."

#. Occurrence SP1:11322:21230: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11322
msgctxt "text_id=21230 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まったく完全でない生き物に、"
msgstr "  ...and yet he would lose,"

#. Occurrence SP1:11322:21231: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11322
msgctxt "text_id=21231 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あっさり黒星をつけられた後のコトになる。"
msgstr "  at the hands of a particularly imperfect creature."

#. Occurrence SP1:11377:21232: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11377
msgctxt "text_id=21232 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無人の校舎に場違いな<呼び鈴|コール>が響き渡る。"
msgstr "  The sound of a phone ringing echoed through the empty hallways of the school."

#. Occurrence SP1:11399:21233: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11399
msgctxt "text_id=21233 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　建物を改築した主も、"
msgstr "  It was January, and both the mage who had remodeled the building,"

#. Occurrence SP1:11404:21234: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11404
msgctxt "text_id=21234 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その主を撃退した魔法使いも退場して<久|ひさ>しい、一月某日。"
msgstr "  and the Magician who had expelled her from it, were long gone."

#. Occurrence SP1:11409:21235: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11409
msgctxt "text_id=21235 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子が気まぐれで取り付けていった電話機は、そこに誰かがいる事を確信しているように、飽きることなく鳴り続けていた。"
msgstr "  The telephone that Touko had installed on a whim rang and rang without letting up, as if it knew for sure that someone was there to answer it."

#. Occurrence SP1:11438:21236: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0085; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11438
msgctxt "text_id=21236 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ああもう、うるさいなあ」"
msgstr "\"Argh, shut up!\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11444:21237: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11444
msgctxt "text_id=21237 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな中、ごそり、と動く気配があった。"
msgstr "  Something rustled inside."

#. Occurrence SP1:11449:21238: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11449
msgctxt "text_id=21238 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　校舎は無人には違いないが、人間ではないモノが一つ、いまだ<寝床|ねどこ>にしていたらしい。"
msgstr "  There were definitely no people inside the school building, but there was one non-human creature sleeping there."

#. Occurrence SP1:11498:21239: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0086; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11498
msgctxt "text_id=21239 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「はい、こちらガランノドウ第二出張店ー。"
msgstr "\"Hi, you've reached the Misaki branch of the Hollow Shrine."

#. Occurrence SP1:11504:21240: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0087; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11504
msgctxt "text_id=21240 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　店主はシッポまいて逃げだしたアトですので、ご用のある方は発信音のアトにメッセージを――あ、トーコさん？"
msgstr "  The owner has run away with her tail between her legs and is currently unavailable, so please leave a message after the... ah, Miss Touko?"

#. Occurrence SP1:11510:21241: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0088; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11510
msgctxt "text_id=21241 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　うん、はいはい。どーぞ行ってらっしゃい、ボクのコトはお構いなく」"
msgstr "  Ah, yes, yes. That's fine. Have a good trip. Don't worry about me.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11548:21242: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11548
msgctxt "text_id=21242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　教室に居たのは金髪の少年だ。"
msgstr "  The classroom was occupied by a young boy with blond hair."

#. Occurrence SP1:11553:21243: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11553
msgctxt "text_id=21243 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソレは呼び鈴が鳴る前からヒトの姿をしていた。"
msgstr "  Even before the phone rang, he was in human form."

#. Occurrence SP1:11558:21244: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11558
msgctxt "text_id=21244 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かつて、ひとりきりでいる時は狼の姿で微睡みに落ちていたが、今は違う。"
msgstr "  It used to be that when he was alone, he would always doze off in his wolf form. But not anymore."

#. Occurrence SP1:11563:21245: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11563
msgctxt "text_id=21245 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソレはそうである必要もないのに、ヒトのカタチを維持している。"
msgstr "  There was no real need for him to stay in his human form, but he did anyway."

#. Occurrence SP1:11568:21246: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11568
msgctxt "text_id=21246 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どのような心境の変化か、戦闘時以外はこちらの姿を“平常”に切り替えていた。"
msgstr "  It was now his normal state of being when he was not in combat."

#. Occurrence SP1:11594:21247: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0089; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11594
msgctxt "text_id=21247 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「じゃ、必要になったら呼んでよね。契約は切れたけど、ボクはまだトーコさんの使い魔だし。"
msgstr "\"Just call me if you need anything. I know my contract is up, but I'm still your familiar."

#. Occurrence SP1:11600:21248: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0090; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11600
msgctxt "text_id=21248 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　うん、そう、嫌味なんかじゃないって。狼はね、誇り高いんだよ。トーコさん以上の雇い主が見つかるまで、首輪はそっちに預けておきます」"
msgstr "  No, I'm not being sarcastic. I'm proud to be your familiar. Until I find a better employer, I'm leaving my collar with you.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11635:21249: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11635
msgctxt "text_id=21249 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふと、ソレは受話器の向こうの相手が、どこを旅しているのか気になった。"
msgstr "  Beo couldn't help but wonder where Touko was traveling."

#. Occurrence SP1:11640:21250: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11640
msgctxt "text_id=21250 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は敗北を認め、使い魔との契約を<断|た>った。"
msgstr "  She had accepted her loss and ended her contract with her familiar."

#. Occurrence SP1:11645:21251: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11645
msgctxt "text_id=21251 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　魔法の相手をさせてやる、という約束を違えたからだという。"
msgstr "  She said it was because she hadn't fulfilled her promise to let him fight Magic."

#. Occurrence SP1:11650:21252: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11650
msgctxt "text_id=21252 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれどそれは使い魔の落ち度であって彼女の責任ではない。護衛役としては、ソレはまだ仕事を果たしていないのだ。"
msgstr "  However, that was actually the fault of her familiar, and not her responsibility at all. Beo had not fulfilled his duty as her bodyguard yet."

#. Occurrence SP1:11686:21253: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0091; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11686
msgctxt "text_id=21253 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「で、トーコさんはいまどこ？」"
msgstr "\"So, where are you now?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11692:21254: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11692
msgctxt "text_id=21254 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　受話器からは聞き慣れない国の名前。"
msgstr "  It was the name of a country he wasn't familiar with."

#. Occurrence SP1:11697:21255: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11697
msgctxt "text_id=21255 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は呪いの解呪手段を開発する為、早々に日本を発ったのだ。"
msgstr "  After the battle, she had promptly left Japan to develop a way to break the curse."

#. Occurrence SP1:11718:21256: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0092; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11718
msgctxt "text_id=21256 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「なにが敗北を認めた、だよ。"
msgstr "\"What do you mean, accept your loss?"

#. Occurrence SP1:11724:21257: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0093; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11724
msgctxt "text_id=21257 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　それって、まだ諦めてないってコトじゃん」"
msgstr "  Does that mean you haven't given up yet?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11730:21258: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11730
msgctxt "text_id=21258 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まったくだ、と笑い声が返ってくる。"
msgstr "  Touko laughed on the other end of the line."

#. Occurrence SP1:11735:21259: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11735
msgctxt "text_id=21259 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　受話器の向こうからは、なんとなく、熱帯の香りがした。"
msgstr "  Somehow, Beo sensed a tropical scent coming through the phone."

#. Occurrence SP1:11740:21260: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11740
msgctxt "text_id=21260 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが蒼崎橙子お手製の電話機による神秘か、"
msgstr "  Whether that was a Mystical effect of Touko's handcrafted phone,"

#. Occurrence SP1:11745:21261: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11745
msgctxt "text_id=21261 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソレ自身の超感覚によるものかは分からない。"
msgstr "  or the werewolf's super senses, was unclear."

#. Occurrence SP1:11777:21262: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0094; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11777
msgctxt "text_id=21262 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「じゃ、さっさと帰ってきてね。ボクはこっちに残ってるから、美味しいお土産、よろしく」"
msgstr "\"Well, come home soon, okay? I'll be here waiting. Bring me back something delicious, will you?\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11783:21263: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11783
msgctxt "text_id=21263 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜ？　と受話器から声がする。"
msgstr "  Touko asked him why."

#. Occurrence SP1:11788:21264: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11788
msgctxt "text_id=21264 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女の使い魔を続けると決めたのなら、この土地に残る道理はないのだから。"
msgstr "  If he had really decided to stay on as her familiar, there was no reason for him to stay there."

#. Occurrence SP1:11822:21265: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0095; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11822
msgctxt "text_id=21265 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「んー……実はボクも、よく分かんない、だけど」"
msgstr "\"Hmm... I don't really know myself, actually.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11828:21266: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11828
msgctxt "text_id=21266 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソレは言葉を詰まらせながら、胸に手をペタペタと当てて、以前味わった痛みを<反芻|はんすう>して、"
msgstr "  As he stumbled over his words, Beo patted his chest a few times and remembered the pain he had felt."

#. Occurrence SP1:11859:21267: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0096; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11859
msgctxt "text_id=21267 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「えへへ。まあ、なんといいましょうか。"
msgstr "\"Ehehe. How do I put this...?"

#. Occurrence SP1:11865:21268: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0097; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11865
msgctxt "text_id=21268 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　ここにいれば甘いってどんなものか、分かるような気がするのです」"
msgstr "  It's like... when I'm here, I think I can understand what sweet really means.\""

#. Occurrence SP1:11871:21269: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11871
msgctxt "text_id=21269 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無駄を知った狼は、どことなく楽しそうな声で、今後の目的を口にした。"
msgstr "  The wolf who had learned to accept being wasteful expressed his future goal, a vague hint of delight in his voice."

#. Occurrence SP1:11890:21270: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11890
msgctxt "text_id=21270 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これもまた<初恋|はちみつ>に関する、極めて稀少な<事件|ケース>である。"
msgstr "  Thus concluded an exceptionally rare case of first love, sweet as honey."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_A:47:21271: scene=WIK_B_1_A
#: WIK_B_1_A:47
msgctxt "text_id=21271 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　東館に入ると、すぐに蒼崎が待っていた。"
msgstr "  Aozaki was waiting in the east wing."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_A:53:21272: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_A
#: WIK_B_1_A:53
msgctxt "text_id=21272 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ごめん、待たせた？」"
msgstr "\"Sorry. Did I keep you long?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_A:62:21273: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_A_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_A
#: WIK_B_1_A:62
msgctxt "text_id=21273 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ん、別に。私も今のところやる事ないし。"
msgstr "\"No. Not like I have anything else to do anyway."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_A:74:21274: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_A_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_A
#: WIK_B_1_A:74
msgctxt "text_id=21274 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　とりあえず中に入って。顔見知りばっかりだけど、一応挨拶はしておかないとね」"
msgstr "  Let's head inside. I think you know most of the guests, but we should still introduce you.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_A:79:21275: scene=WIK_B_1_A
#: WIK_B_1_A:79
msgctxt "text_id=21275 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　親しき仲にも礼儀あり、という事だろう。"
msgstr "  That's Aozaki for you. Always likes to do things properly."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_A:84:21276: scene=WIK_B_1_A
#: WIK_B_1_A:84
msgctxt "text_id=21276 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女らしい律儀な台詞と共に、ドアノブは回された。"
msgstr "  With her characteristic sincerity on full display, she turned the doorknob."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:110:21277: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:110
msgctxt "text_id=21277 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　中に入るなり、わたしは飛び上がりそうになる自分の体を押さえつけるハメになった。"
msgstr "  The moment I entered, I had to stop myself from jumping out of my skin."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:115:21278: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:115
msgctxt "text_id=21278 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ロビーに比べたら親しみのある居間の様子にホッとする暇もない。"
msgstr "  The parlor was cozy compared to the lobby, but I didn't have time to appreciate it."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:120:21279: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:120
msgctxt "text_id=21279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこには、見知っているけど予想外の顔があったからだ。"
msgstr "  I was too distracted by a familiar face I hadn't expected to run into."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:167:21280: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:167
msgctxt "text_id=21280 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まず彼女、久遠寺有珠。"
msgstr "  First was Alice Kuonji."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:172:21281: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:172
msgctxt "text_id=21281 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　顔を合わせたのは一度か二度だけなので緊張はするが、予想外ではない。"
msgstr "  I was nervous because I'd only met her once or twice, but she wasn't the one who surprised me."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:228:21282: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:228
msgctxt "text_id=21282 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　次にベオ。"
msgstr "  Next was Beo."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:233:21283: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:233
msgctxt "text_id=21283 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　商店街の座敷童、居ついた店はかならず繁盛するというお子さま。と言うか、ていのいいたかり魔。彼とは何度も話しているから、これも予想外ではない。"
msgstr "  He was a child who often hung around the shopping district, almost like a guardian spirit... or perhaps, a greedy little goblin. I'd spoken to him before, so he wasn't a shocker either."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:288:21284: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:288
msgctxt "text_id=21284 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最後に副会長。"
msgstr "  Last was the student council vice president."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:293:21285: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:293
msgctxt "text_id=21285 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　考えてみれば、蒼崎と静希の知人で、町の名士の息子なのだから、この誕生会にいない方がおかしい。"
msgstr "  Come to think of it, he was acquainted with Aozaki and Sizuki, so it made sense he'd be at this birthday party."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:299:21286: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:299
msgctxt "text_id=21286 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……おかしい、のだけど。"
msgstr "  It did make sense... right?"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:354:21287: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:354
msgctxt "text_id=21287 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ちょっと。なんで<槻司|つきじ>がいるの？」"
msgstr "\"Hey. What's Tsukiji doing here?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:365:21288: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:365
msgctxt "text_id=21288 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あら、<鳶丸|とびまる>も来るって言ってなかったっけ。"
msgstr "\"Oh, didn't I say he was coming?"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:371:21289: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:371
msgctxt "text_id=21289 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　というか、いちいち言わないとダメだったかしら？」"
msgstr "  Should I have let you know if he was going to show up?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:382:21290: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:382
msgctxt "text_id=21290 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「だ……ダメって事は、別にないけど」"
msgstr "\"I... don't exactly have a problem with him.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:408:21291: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_B_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:408
msgctxt "text_id=21291 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ならいいじゃない。生徒会じゃ毎日顔会わせているんだし、気にならないでしょ」"
msgstr "\"So what's the issue? We see each other every day at the student council, don't we?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:419:21292: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:419
msgctxt "text_id=21292 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「が、学校の中と外は別よ。だいたいわたし、これ普段着なんだし」"
msgstr "\"Well, we're not in school. And, well... I'm in my regular clothes.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:455:21293: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:455
msgctxt "text_id=21293 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は、それが何か問題でも？　といった顔。"
msgstr "  Aozaki gave me a look that said, \"and...?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:460:21294: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:460
msgctxt "text_id=21294 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もちろん、問題も問題だ。"
msgstr "  Of course there was a problem."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:465:21295: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:465
msgctxt "text_id=21295 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　隠していても仕方がないのでハッキリ言うと、わたし、久万梨金鹿は槻司鳶丸に片思い中なのである。"
msgstr "  Could you blame me for hiding it? To be frank, I had a crush on Tobimaru Tsukiji."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:470:21296: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:470
msgctxt "text_id=21296 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それも歴史にして三年。"
msgstr "  I'd felt this way for three years."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:475:21297: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:475
msgctxt "text_id=21297 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　告白までこぎつけるコトもできず、あれよあれよと三年間。我がコトながら、<唾|だ><棄|き>すべき軟弱っぷり。"
msgstr "  Three whole years, and I still hadn't said anything. I knew it was spineless of me."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:507:21298: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:507
msgctxt "text_id=21298 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、多少なりとも弁明すると、はじめからここまで臆病だったワケじゃない。"
msgstr "  This might not mean much coming from me, but I wasn't always a coward."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:512:21299: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:512
msgctxt "text_id=21299 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一年生の頃は漠然と、そもそも槻司のコトは蒼崎の相方としか思っていなかったし。"
msgstr "  During my freshman year, I was only vaguely aware of him as Aozaki's coworker."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:517:21300: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:517
msgctxt "text_id=21300 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はっきりと自覚したのは二年生の時だ。"
msgstr "  I only really became aware of my feelings during my second year."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:522:21301: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:522
msgctxt "text_id=21301 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎の友人という事で信頼されていたのか、槻司はわたしによく話しかけてきた。"
msgstr "  He spoke to me often, maybe because he trusted me as Aozaki's friend."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:527:21302: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:527
msgctxt "text_id=21302 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうした後は、ひとり帰り道で訳もなく嬉しくなって、なぜだろう？　と首をかしげていたものだ。"
msgstr "  And whenever he did, I went home happy; at the time, I didn't know why."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:555:21303: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:555
msgctxt "text_id=21303 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　決定打は二年生の文化祭の後片づけの時。"
msgstr "  The realization hit me when we happened to be cleaning up together after a school festival in my second year."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:560:21304: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:560
msgctxt "text_id=21304 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たまたまふたりで生徒会の演し物を片づけていた時、“あれ、もしかしてわたし、この人に一目惚れしていたのではないだろうか”と気が付いてしまった。"
msgstr "  We were just tidying things away, when bam! I realized maybe I'd liked him all along."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:566:21305: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:566
msgctxt "text_id=21305 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　恋は<猛毒|もうもく>と言うが、"
msgstr "  They say love's a poison,"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:571:21306: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:571
msgctxt "text_id=21306 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まったく、遅効性にも程がある。"
msgstr "  but yeesh, talk about delayed effects."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:604:21307: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:604
msgctxt "text_id=21307 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこから先は、しかし、何の変化もない。"
msgstr "  Anyway, nothing really changed after that."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:609:21308: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:609
msgctxt "text_id=21308 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは野蛮な脳筋一族に反抗し、"
msgstr "  In an act of rebellion against my simple-minded family,"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:614:21309: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:614
msgctxt "text_id=21309 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このまま家業を継がされる運命に反逆し、"
msgstr "  I decided to never inherit the family business."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:619:21310: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:619
msgctxt "text_id=21310 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その為に中学からコツコツと律してきた自分を、少なからず誇りに思っていた。"
msgstr "  That was why I liked to believe I've been hard-working and disciplined since middle school. It's a personal point of pride."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:624:21311: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:624
msgctxt "text_id=21311 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なので、そんな、降って湧いた思春期特有の幻想なんぞに膝を屈するのは、どうにも我慢できなかったのである。"
msgstr "  And, it made it all the more excruciating to accept that I'd been overtaken by teenage infatuation."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:629:21312: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:629
msgctxt "text_id=21312 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　勇気がなかったとも言える。"
msgstr "  You could say that I lacked courage."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:657:21313: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:657
msgctxt "text_id=21313 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうこうしている内に、時間はついに底を見せ始めた。"
msgstr "  Eventually, the school year passed by even as I did nothing about my feelings..."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:662:21314: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:662
msgctxt "text_id=21314 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの気持ちはいっこうにふわふわしたまま。"
msgstr "  ...but I never got over him."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:667:21315: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:667
msgctxt "text_id=21315 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　卒業を間近にした三年の秋になって、本気でわたしは、わたしをどうしたいのか分からなくなっていた。"
msgstr "  We entered the fall of my third year. Graduation was close, but I still had no idea what to do about my crush."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:697:21316: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:697
msgctxt "text_id=21316 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司の進学先は、意外な事に地元の大学らしい。生徒会役員としての権限をフルに使って調べたので間違いない。"
msgstr "  Then, I learned to my surprise that Tsukiji would be attending a local college. I had this on good authority, since I'd flexed my powers as a student council member to dig into it."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:702:21317: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:702
msgctxt "text_id=21317 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さすがに渠裸ではなかったけど、槻司が地元に進学するのなら、なんというか、未練がましいコトに可能性が出てきてしまう。"
msgstr "  It wasn't Mizora, but if he was going to a nearby school, that would be... unfortunate."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:707:21318: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:707
msgctxt "text_id=21318 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしも、このまま地元の大学に進めば、まだ縁は切れないのだと。"
msgstr "  After all, if I also went to college nearby, I wouldn't be able to cut my ties with him."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:737:21319: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:737
msgctxt "text_id=21319 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎曰く、"
msgstr "  Aozaki told me once."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:746:21320: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_B_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:746
msgctxt "text_id=21320 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "『鳶丸、クマのこと気に入ってると思うけど。"
msgstr "\"Pretty sure Tobimaru's interested in you, Kuma."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:758:21321: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_B_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:758
msgctxt "text_id=21321 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　だってあいつ、好きなヤツとしか世間話しないでしょ』"
msgstr "  He only makes small talk with people he likes, right?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:796:21322: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:796
msgctxt "text_id=21322 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この通り、脈はある、と信じたい。"
msgstr "  I wanted to believe it was true."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:818:21323: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:818
msgctxt "text_id=21323 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今年の夏の騒ぎの時だって、なんか、腕折ってまで助けてくれたし。"
msgstr "  I mean, he even broke his arm to save me during the craziness this summer."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:823:21324: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:823
msgctxt "text_id=21324 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司にカノジョがいるかどうかはわたしの知るところじゃないけど、いま告白すれば可能性はなくもない。"
msgstr "  I didn't know if Tsukiji had a girlfriend, but I was sure I had a chance if I asked him out."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:850:21325: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:850
msgctxt "text_id=21325 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし。しかしだ。"
msgstr "  But... but..."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:855:21326: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:855
msgctxt "text_id=21326 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それでは何の為に、物心ついた時から陰に日向に戦ってきたのか、悔しくなる。"
msgstr "  Giving in felt like throwing away everything I'd fought for so far."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:872:21327: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:872
msgctxt "text_id=21327 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　子供の頃からきっかり将来設計を持ってきたわたしは、恋だの夢だのにうつつをぬかしている同級生たちを軽蔑さえしていた。"
msgstr "  Ever since I was a kid, I'd planned ahead. I used to look down on classmates who were obsessed with childish dreams and romance."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:898:21328: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:898
msgctxt "text_id=21328 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そのわたしがここにきて、そんな綿アメみたいな理由で六年間の努力を無駄にするとか、本気で信じられない。"
msgstr "  And now, here I was, actually willing to give up six long years of hard work for the dumbest of reasons."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:903:21329: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:903
msgctxt "text_id=21329 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなのは、わたしが目指してきた久万梨金鹿ではないと思う。"
msgstr "  That wasn't me. That wasn't the Kojika Kumari I was trying to become."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:943:21330: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_B_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:943
msgctxt "text_id=21330 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「金鹿？　どしたの、考え事？」"
msgstr "\"Earth to Kuma. You okay there?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:956:21331: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0003_0; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:956
msgctxt "text_id=21331 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「うん、ちょっと頭冷やしてた。おかげで落ち着いたから問題なし。"
msgstr "\"Yeah, I just needed a moment to clear my head. I'm A-OK now."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:970:21332: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0003_1; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:970
msgctxt "text_id=21332 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "さて、久遠寺さんに挨拶しないとね」"
msgstr "I think I'll go say hi to Miss Kuonji.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:992:21333: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:992
msgctxt "text_id=21333 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……などと言いつつ、少しだけ後悔する。"
msgstr "  ...so I said, but I couldn't shake a slight tinge of regret."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:997:21334: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:997
msgctxt "text_id=21334 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎から“パーティーを開くからできるだけオシャレな格好で来い”と言われた時、鼻で笑った自分を鍋で<叩|はた>きたい気分。"
msgstr "  I should've listened to Aozaki, instead of laughing through my nose when she said to wear something nice to the party."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1022:21335: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1022
msgctxt "text_id=21335 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1027:21336: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1027
msgctxt "text_id=21336 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まあ、もともとドレスなんて持ってないし、頑張ったところで何もできなかっただろう。"
msgstr "  Well, it's not like I had a nice dress to wear anyway, so there isn't much I could've done to impress him."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1043:21337: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1043
msgctxt "text_id=21337 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはピシャと頬を叩いて、努めて、いつもの自分であるよう気を引き締めた。"
msgstr "  I clapped my hands on my cheeks to get my head on straight, and tried to carry myself as I always did."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1128:21338: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1128
msgctxt "text_id=21338 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　館の主人である久遠寺さんに挨拶をして、隣室であるサンルームに移動する。"
msgstr "  After greeting the mistress of the house, I went into the adjacent sunroom."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1152:21339: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1152
msgctxt "text_id=21339 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　集まっているゲストは誰もが顔見知りなので、改めて自己紹介をする必要はない。"
msgstr "  I recognized the other guests here, so there was no need for introductions."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1157:21340: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1157
msgctxt "text_id=21340 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　サンルームと居間は一続きなので、サンルームからでも居間の様子は窺えた。"
msgstr "  The sunroom and drawing room were connected, and you could see each room from the other."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1192:21341: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1192
msgctxt "text_id=21341 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間のソファーには久遠寺さんが座って、優雅にお茶を飲んでいる。"
msgstr "  Miss Kuonji sat on a sofa in the drawing room, elegantly sipping a cup of tea."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1204:21342: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1204
msgctxt "text_id=21342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その周囲で騒いでいるのは"
msgstr "  Chatting nearby were "

msgctxt "text_id=21343 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "芳助と、"
msgstr "Housuke and "

msgctxt "text_id=21344 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "芳助と、"
msgstr "Housuke and "

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1225:21345: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1225
msgctxt "text_id=21345 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "意外なコトに山城先生だった。"
msgstr "Mr. Yamasiro--didn't expect to see him here."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1287:21346: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1287
msgctxt "text_id=21346 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「ほう。裏庭の方にちらりと見えたのはオークの木なのですか。日本で言えば<楢|なら>ですが……うーん、僕の記憶には該当しないなあ。"
msgstr "\"Ah, so those were oak trees in the backyard. We have 'nara' trees here in Japan, but hmm... I don't remember them looking like yours."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1299:21347: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1299
msgctxt "text_id=21347 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "　何か特別な品種なんでしょうね。日本のものとイギリスのものは見た目からして違いますし、オークの品種はそれこそ四百以上ありますから」"
msgstr "  It must be a unique species. Japanese and British oaks look very different, and I understand that there are some four hundred or more species of oak.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1330:21348: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1330
msgctxt "text_id=21348 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「うお、相変わらず自分の言いたい事しか言わないよねこの人。有珠ちゃん、この先生は人の心にズカズカ踏みこんでくる蛮族だから、無視しちゃっていいぜ。"
msgstr "\"He's just dronin' on about the stuff he likes, as if anyone else actually cares. Fair warning, Alice--he's the kind of teacher who doesn't give a damn what students think, so you're better off ignoring him."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1342:21349: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1342
msgctxt "text_id=21349 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　それよりオレと冬休みの予定について話し合わない？"
msgstr "  Never mind that. Want to do anything over winter break?"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1355:21350: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_B_1_B_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1355
msgctxt "text_id=21350 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　有珠ちゃん、スキーとか苦手そうだナー。そこで、この頼れる木乃美芳助が手取り足取り教えたいナー」"
msgstr "  You don't seem like much of a skier. I could teach you how, if you want.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1381:21351: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1381
msgctxt "text_id=21351 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ふたりとも、退屈とはほど遠い人なのね。"
msgstr "\"Can't either of you talk about something interesting for once?"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1392:21352: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1392
msgctxt "text_id=21352 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　理解したわ。木乃美君と先生は、仕付けられたウッドペッカーのよう」"
msgstr "  It's like listening to a pair of woodpeckers.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1444:21353: voice_id=BA0_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1444
msgctxt "text_id=21353 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『ハハハ、あの木を<突|つつ>くか<喋|しゃべ>ってるだけの<阿呆鳥|あほうどり>と同格っスかこのシャバ僧ども！　アリスさんから鳥認定されない草の字に比べて、ちょっとだけ格上と見たっス。"
msgstr "\"Hahaha! You're putting these front doors on the same level as those pecking, blathering, birdbrains?! Better than Sono-G, I guess, but only slightly."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1475:21354: voice_id=BA0_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1475
msgctxt "text_id=21354 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ま、死ぬか生きるかだけのジブンに比べたらどっちも小物っスけど！』"
msgstr "  Still, I'm way better than either of them! And all I do is live or die!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1514:21355: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1514
msgctxt "text_id=21355 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……なに、あのまるっとした鳥」"
msgstr "\"...What's wrong with that fat bird?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1546:21356: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1546
msgctxt "text_id=21356 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺さんの肩には青い駒鳥がしきりにまとわりついているが、彼女の肩にとまる度に払い落とされていた。"
msgstr "  There was a blue robin flitting to and fro around Miss Kuonji's head, chirping adorably."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1551:21357: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1551
msgctxt "text_id=21357 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　チチチ、チチチと愛らしい声で鳴いているが、放し飼いにされているのだろうか？"
msgstr "  But whenever it tried to land on her shoulder, she batted it away. Is that how she raised her pets?"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1587:21358: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1587
msgctxt "text_id=21358 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎の姿はない。台所かトイレだろう。"
msgstr "  Aozaki was nowhere to be seen. She was probably in the kitchen or bathroom."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1592:21359: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1592
msgctxt "text_id=21359 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは話し相手もなく、ひとりぼんやりしていると、"
msgstr "  With nobody to talk to, I took a seat and let my thoughts wander, until..."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1616:21360: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1616
msgctxt "text_id=21360 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「久万梨も招待されてたんだな。"
msgstr "\"Hey, Kumari. Did they invite you too?"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1622:21361: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1622
msgctxt "text_id=21361 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　ずいぶんと遅かったが、またアルバイトか？」"
msgstr "  Work get out late today?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1640:21362: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1640
msgctxt "text_id=21362 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1645:21363: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1645
msgctxt "text_id=21363 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司はいつもの調子で話しかけてきた。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji kicked off a conversation in his usual, casual way."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1650:21364: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1650
msgctxt "text_id=21364 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　スラリとした手足とか、ジュースの入ったグラスを持っているだけで絵になっている。"
msgstr "  His slender arms were picturesque, even while holding a glass of juice."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1676:21365: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1676
msgctxt "text_id=21365 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「アルバイトは休み。今回の三連休、ぜんぶ休み入れたから。お金も予定額たまったし」"
msgstr "\"I'm off work today. Took three whole days off, actually. I'm on track to hit my budget, anyway.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1711:21366: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1711
msgctxt "text_id=21366 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そうか、そりゃよかった。三咲脱出ロケットはもう秒読み段階ってコトだな。"
msgstr "\"Nice! So the countdown's ticking until liftoff from Misaki, eh?"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1718:21367: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0003_0; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1718
msgctxt "text_id=21367 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "となると、早朝のコンビニで顔を合わせるのもいよいよおしまいか。"
msgstr "I guess we won't be saying good morning to each other at the corner store anymore."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1730:21368: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0003_1; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1730
msgctxt "text_id=21368 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　ん？　そういえば、俺が煙草を吸おうとしたら水ぶっかけてきたの、おまえさんだったっけか」"
msgstr "  Wait. Wasn't it you who dumped water on me for trying to smoke once?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1787:21369: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1787
msgctxt "text_id=21369 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　懐かしい話だ。"
msgstr "  That took me back."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1792:21370: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1792
msgctxt "text_id=21370 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一年生の頃、コンビニの駐車場で堂々と煙草を吸っている生徒がいた。"
msgstr "  Back in my freshman year, there was a student cocky enough to smoke in my store's parking lot."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1797:21371: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1797
msgctxt "text_id=21371 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他校の生徒だったけど見てしまったものは仕方がない。駆け寄って注意して、かつホースで水を撒いたら、まったく関係のない男子生徒に水を被せてしまった。"
msgstr "  He was from a different school, but that didn't matter. I ran up to him, warned him, then hosed him down with water. Can you believe I did that to a stranger?"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1802:21372: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1802
msgctxt "text_id=21372 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あわてて謝ろうとしたら、その男子生徒の手には今まさに吸われようとしていた煙草が一本。"
msgstr "  I got flustered and tried to apologize, but the boy was already reaching for another cigarette before I even finished."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1807:21373: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1807
msgctxt "text_id=21373 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それがこの男、槻司鳶丸だったのである。"
msgstr "  He'd turned out to be Tobimaru Tsukiji."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1841:21374: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1841
msgctxt "text_id=21374 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いやあ。あの後、まさか生徒会室で再会するとは思わなかった。俺はアレかね、気に入った女どもにはまず水かケンカをふっかけられる運命なのかねぇ」"
msgstr "\"Man, I really didn't expect to see you again, much less in the student council room. Maybe that's my destiny? To get sprayed with water by girls I like.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1852:21375: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1852
msgctxt "text_id=21375 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「たまたまでしょ。それより槻司、いつから来てたの？」"
msgstr "\"Life's just like that sometimes. When did you get here, Tsukiji?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1878:21376: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1878
msgctxt "text_id=21376 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「俺たちは午前中からだよ。木乃美のヤロウが張りきっててな、仕方なくだ。"
msgstr "\"We've been here since morning. Kinomi got a bug in his ass, so I didn't have a choice."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1889:21377: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1889
msgctxt "text_id=21377 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　誕生会は夕方六時からだから、まだ時間に余裕はある。"
msgstr "  The birthday party isn't 'til six, so we've still got plenty of time."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1895:21378: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1895
msgctxt "text_id=21378 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　疲れてるなら部屋で休んできたらどうだ？　ちょいと顔色悪いぜ」"
msgstr "  If you're tired, why don't you go take a nap in one of the rooms? You look pretty pale.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1933:21379: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1933
msgctxt "text_id=21379 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1938:21380: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1938
msgctxt "text_id=21380 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この男の何が卑怯かって、粗雑で無遠慮のクセに、細かいところに気が利くことだと思う。"
msgstr "  If I had to describe the most unfair aspect of Tsukiji, it was his ability to be sensitive even while coming off as rude."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1943:21381: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1943
msgctxt "text_id=21381 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは人見知りが激しい。"
msgstr "  For my part, I was way too shy."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1948:21382: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1948
msgctxt "text_id=21382 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いくら顔見知りといっても、慣れない場所で多くの人間と話すのは体力を使う。"
msgstr "  It took a serious effort to talk to a lot of people in a new place, even if I already knew them."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1975:21383: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1975
msgctxt "text_id=21383 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そうね。ちょっと客室で一息いれてくる」"
msgstr "\"Yeah. Good idea. I'll go take a break.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1995:21384: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1995
msgctxt "text_id=21384 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「おう、そうしろそうしろ。久万梨の部屋は、たしか」"
msgstr "\"That's the spirit. Which one was your room again...?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2007:21385: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2007
msgctxt "text_id=21385 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ねー、トビー。草十郎さん、どこいったか知らない？」"
msgstr "\"Hey, Toby! Do you know where Soujyuro went?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2018:21386: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2018
msgctxt "text_id=21386 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「草十郎なら買い出しじゃないのか？"
msgstr "\"Shopping, I think."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2024:21387: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0010; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2024
msgctxt "text_id=21387 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　飲み物が足りない、とか言ってたしな」"
msgstr "  Said something about needing more drinks.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2050:21388: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2050
msgctxt "text_id=21388 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ほんと？　もう、行くならボクに声かけてくれれば良かったのに。あの人の、自分で出来るコトは全部ひとりでやっちゃうところ、ボクどうかと思うなー。"
msgstr "\"Well, he coulda said something! I wish he wouldn't try to do everything by himself all the time."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2061:21389: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_B_1_B_0002; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2061
msgctxt "text_id=21389 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　まあ、そこが動物っぽくていいんだけど！」"
msgstr "  Not that I got anything against lone wolves!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2105:21390: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2105
msgctxt "text_id=21390 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　改めて解説すると、この金髪の子供はベオ。"
msgstr "  As I mentioned earlier, the blond boy's name was Beo."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2118:21391: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2118
msgctxt "text_id=21391 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　フルネームは知らない。名乗られたこともない。"
msgstr "  I didn't know his full name, nor had he ever formally introduced himself."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2123:21392: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2123
msgctxt "text_id=21392 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司や蒼崎、静希がベオと呼んでいるので、わたしもそれに<倣|なら>っているだけだ。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji, Aozaki, and Sizuki all called him Beo, so I just followed their lead."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2128:21393: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2128
msgctxt "text_id=21393 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この子は妙に静希に<懐|なつ>いていて、隙さえあれば、"
msgstr "  He seemed to be fond of Sizuki. Whenever he had a chance, you'd hear him go,"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2166:21394: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_B_1_B_0003; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2166
msgctxt "text_id=21394 | speaker=beo"
msgid "『草十郎さん、今度のお休み、遊園地に行きたいです』"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro, I want to go to a theme park the next time you're on break.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2177:21395: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_B_1_B_0004; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2177
msgctxt "text_id=21395 | speaker=beo"
msgid "『草十郎さん、お腹へっちゃってません？　ぜひご一緒しましょう』"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro, are you hungry? Let's go out for lunch!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2188:21396: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_B_1_B_0005; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2188
msgctxt "text_id=21396 | speaker=beo"
msgid "『草十郎さん、特に理由はありませんけど頭、なでてほしいです』"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro, could you pat me on the head? No real reason, I just want you to.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2225:21397: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2225
msgctxt "text_id=21397 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　などと、猫のように身をすり寄せている。"
msgstr "  And so on. He clung to him like a cat to a curtain."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2230:21398: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2230
msgctxt "text_id=21398 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希はあれで子供に好かれる性格なのだろうか。草十郎サン草十郎サン、と実にやかましい。"
msgstr "  Was Sizuki even the kind of person that was popular with kids? All the \"Soujyuro, Soujyuro\" every day was starting to grate on me."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2278:21399: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2278
msgctxt "text_id=21399 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ともあれ、今は客室に移動しよう。"
msgstr "  Anyway, I went to find my guest room."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2284:21400: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0011; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2284
msgctxt "text_id=21400 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「久万梨、部屋は分かってんのか？」"
msgstr "\"Kumari, do you know where your room is?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2290:21401: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0011; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2290
msgctxt "text_id=21401 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「はじめに蒼崎に聞いた。三十分ぐらいで戻るから」"
msgstr "\"I asked Aozaki earlier. She'll be back in about thirty minutes.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1:33:21402: scene=WIK_B_1
#: WIK_B_1:33
msgctxt "text_id=21402 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何はともあれ、屋敷の主人や、先に来ているゲストたちに挨拶をしなくては。"
msgstr "  At the very least, I should greet the mansion's owner and the guests."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1:38:21403: scene=WIK_B_1
#: WIK_B_1:38
msgctxt "text_id=21403 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここは寄り道せず居間に向かおう。"
msgstr "  I decided to head straight to the drawing room."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1:48:21404: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1
#: WIK_B_1:48
msgctxt "text_id=21404 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「こっちこっち。もうだいたい集まってるから」"
msgstr "\"Come on. Pretty much everyone's here already.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1:53:21405: scene=WIK_B_1
#: WIK_B_1:53
msgctxt "text_id=21405 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一階、東館の廊下はやや薄暗い。"
msgstr "  The corridor of the east wing's first floor was dimly lit."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1:58:21406: scene=WIK_B_1
#: WIK_B_1:58
msgctxt "text_id=21406 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手前にあるドアから談笑が漏れてきている。"
msgstr "  I could hear the sound of friendly chatter from beyond the door ahead."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:24:21407: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:24
msgctxt "text_id=21407 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その前に、客室の様子を見に行く事に決めた。"
msgstr "  I'll check out the guest room first."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:45:21408: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:45
msgctxt "text_id=21408 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「芳助、やっぱり荷物返して。先に自分の部屋を見てくるから。蒼崎、その客室ってどこ？」"
msgstr "\"Housuke, give me back my luggage. I'm going to go look at my room. Where're the guest rooms, Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:51:21409: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_2_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:51
msgctxt "text_id=21409 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「クマの部屋は二階の東館の、手前から二つ目。"
msgstr "\"Second floor of the east wing. Yours is the second one down."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:57:21410: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_2_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:57
msgctxt "text_id=21410 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　鍵は開いてるわ。部屋の机の上に鍵があるから、出てくる時はそれで施錠して」"
msgstr "  It's unlocked. But there's a key on the desk in there, so go ahead and use it to lock the door on your way out.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:77:21411: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:77
msgctxt "text_id=21411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　了解、と頷いて移動する。"
msgstr "  I nodded before making my way to the stairs."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:104:21412: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:104
msgctxt "text_id=21412 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　階段から二階に上がる。"
msgstr "  On the second floor, I found my room"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:109:21413: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:109
msgctxt "text_id=21413 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの部屋は手前から二つ目の部屋だ。"
msgstr "  as described."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:159:21414: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:159
msgctxt "text_id=21414 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　部屋には誰もいない。"
msgstr "  It was unoccupied."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:164:21415: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:164
msgctxt "text_id=21415 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは無人である事を確かめて、荷物を置き、サイフをポケットにいれた。"
msgstr "  I checked to make sure I was alone, then put down my luggage and stowed my wallet in a pocket."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:169:21416: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:169
msgctxt "text_id=21416 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　お<守|まも>り<兼|けん>お気に入りである<×口|バツくち>兎のパスケースを携帯するかは迷ったが、どうせ中には定期と学祭での記念写真しか入っていないので、テーブルに置いておく。"
msgstr "  I considered keeping my favorite bunny-shaped commuter pass--and lucky charm--with me, but all it contained was a yearly school festival photo anyway. I left it on the table."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:174:21417: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:174
msgctxt "text_id=21417 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　馴染みのない建物で過ごすのだ。体はできるだけ身軽の方が疲れない。"
msgstr "  I was going to be spending the night in an unfamiliar building. It was best to travel light."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:195:21418: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_2_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:195
msgctxt "text_id=21418 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「鍵は……ああ、これね」"
msgstr "\"Where's that key...? Oh, here it is.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:201:21419: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:201
msgctxt "text_id=21419 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<真鍮|しんちゅう>の鍵。この洋館に相応しい、古めかしくも凝ったデザインだった。"
msgstr "  It was a brass key, with an old-fashioned and elaborate design that perfectly complemented the mansion's European theme."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:230:21420: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:230
msgctxt "text_id=21420 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下に出ると、"
msgstr "  I stepped back into the second-floor corridor."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:265:21421: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:265
msgctxt "text_id=21421 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ちらりと、二階のホールに老人の姿が見えた。"
msgstr "  In the corner of my eye, I spotted an old man in the hall."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:270:21422: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:270
msgctxt "text_id=21422 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ゲストの一人だろう。挨拶をしておこうとホールに向かう。"
msgstr "  Must be one of the guests. I set off in his direction to greet him."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:319:21423: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_2_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:319
msgctxt "text_id=21423 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あれ？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:324:21424: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:324
msgctxt "text_id=21424 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と。"
msgstr "  As soon as I did,"

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:329:21425: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:329
msgctxt "text_id=21425 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二階のホールに老人の姿はなく、一階に下りたものと思ってロビーに下りてみたが、そこにも老人の姿はなかった。"
msgstr "  the old man had vanished. I checked the foyer downstairs, but he wasn't there either."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:350:21426: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_2_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:350
msgctxt "text_id=21426 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「西館の方に行ったとか？」"
msgstr "\"Maybe he went to the west wing.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:355:21427: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:355
msgctxt "text_id=21427 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少しだけ気になったが、主人に挨拶もしていない状態で館内を歩き回るのも失礼だ。"
msgstr "  It was a little concerning, but it would've been rude to wander around the house without greeting the owner first."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:360:21428: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:360
msgctxt "text_id=21428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは笑い声が聞こえてくる、東館の居間へ足を向けた。"
msgstr "  I headed for the east wing drawing room, where laughter was ringing from within."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:33:21429: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:33
msgctxt "text_id=21429 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　意味のない行動をすると決めた。"
msgstr "  I decided to do something completely meaningless."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:39:21430: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:39
msgctxt "text_id=21430 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、ほんとに意図はない。思いつき以下の、１００パー気まぐれ、気の迷い。"
msgstr "  Honestly, I didn't mean anything by it. It wasn't even a sudden idea―just a whim, a flight of fancy."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:63:21431: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_3_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:63
msgctxt "text_id=21431 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ちょっと落とし物したかも。外を捜してくるから、先に居間に行っていて」"
msgstr "\"I think I dropped something. I'm going to go look outside, so head on to the drawing room without me.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:74:21432: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_3_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:74
msgctxt "text_id=21432 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「外に戻るの？　それなら私も行くわ」"
msgstr "\"You're going outside? I'll come with you.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:112:21433: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_B_3_0000_0; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:112
msgctxt "text_id=21433 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「えー。なにいってんだよ会長、落とし物したのは金鹿のドジだろ、会長関係ねぇーじゃん。"
msgstr "\"Aw c'mon. Kojika's the klutz, so let her deal with it herself."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:123:21434: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_B_3_0000_1; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:123
msgctxt "text_id=21434 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　それより居間に来てくれよー。会長がいないと有珠ちゃんになに話していいか分かんないよー」"
msgstr "  You should come with me, prez. I won't know what to talk with Alice about if you aren't there.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:164:21435: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_3_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:164
msgctxt "text_id=21435 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え……でも、クマひとりには、」"
msgstr "\"Huh? But I shouldn't let Kuma go by her―\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:192:21436: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_B_3_0000; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:192
msgctxt "text_id=21436 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「蒼崎くん、とりあえず居間まで案内してくれません？　このロビー、ちょっと冷えますので」"
msgstr "\"Would you mind taking us to the drawing room first, Aozaki? It's a little chilly here in the foyer.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:218:21437: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_3_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:218
msgctxt "text_id=21437 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いや、でもゲストをひとりっきりにするワケには」"
msgstr "\"But I really shouldn't leave a guest alone.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:229:21438: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_3_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:229
msgctxt "text_id=21438 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「いいって、気にしないで。すぐに戻るから。"
msgstr "\"It's fine, really. I'll be back before you know it."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:241:21439: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_3_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:241
msgctxt "text_id=21439 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　芳助、荷物返して。やっぱり自分で持つ」"
msgstr "  Housuke, give me my luggage. I can handle it from here.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:316:21440: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:316
msgctxt "text_id=21440 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎を振り切るかたちで外に向かう。"
msgstr "  I left the others behind and headed outside."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:321:21441: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:321
msgctxt "text_id=21441 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外に出て洋館の周りの森を、目的もなく観察する。"
msgstr "  Aimlessly, I wandered the woods near the mansion, gawking like a tourist."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:326:21442: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:326
msgctxt "text_id=21442 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人気はなく、天気はますます曇っていく。"
msgstr "  No one was around, and the sky was getting increasingly cloudy."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:332:21443: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_3_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:332
msgctxt "text_id=21443 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「？」"
msgstr "\"Hm?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:337:21444: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:337
msgctxt "text_id=21444 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、ふと、視線を感じた。"
msgstr "  That was strange. I felt like someone was watching me."

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:342:21445: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:342
msgctxt "text_id=21445 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは―――"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_C:8:21446: scene=WIK_SELECT_C
#: WIK_SELECT_C:8
msgctxt "text_id=21446 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｃ～"
msgstr "-Decision C-"

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:23:21447: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:23
msgctxt "text_id=21447 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……追いかけよう。"
msgstr "  ...Time to find out who that was."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:28:21448: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:28
msgctxt "text_id=21448 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不穏なものを感じつつ、わたしは視線の主を追った。"
msgstr "  It went against my better judgment, but I decided to track down whoever had been watching me."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:59:21449: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:59
msgctxt "text_id=21449 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館の裏側に回りこむと、そこはちょっとした林だった。"
msgstr "  I headed around to the rear of the mansion, where there was a small thicket."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:64:21450: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:64
msgctxt "text_id=21450 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館を隠す森より、少しだけ手入れがされている。"
msgstr "  It looked only slightly better kept than the woods surrounding the estate."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:70:21451: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:70
msgctxt "text_id=21451 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこに、"
msgstr "  There,"

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:78:21452: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:78
msgctxt "text_id=21452 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　場違いな女性がひとり。"
msgstr "  I saw a woman. She looked terribly out of place."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:115:21453: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:115
msgctxt "text_id=21453 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「おや。君も今日のゲスト？」"
msgstr "\"Hello, there. Are you one of today's guests?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:120:21454: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:120
msgctxt "text_id=21454 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは無意識に後退していた。"
msgstr "  Instinctively, I backed away."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:125:21455: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:125
msgctxt "text_id=21455 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それぐらい、あの女性には凄みがあった。"
msgstr "  That was how overwhelming her presence was."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:162:21456: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:162
msgctxt "text_id=21456 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぱち、ぱち。"
msgstr "  The leaves crinkled and crunched as my heels trampled them"

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:167:21457: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:167
msgctxt "text_id=21457 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　逃げ気味のわたしのカカトが落ち葉を踏む音。"
msgstr "  during my hasty retreat."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:172:21458: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:172
msgctxt "text_id=21458 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな小動物めいたわたしを、女性は楽しげに眺めている。"
msgstr "  The woman watched me with amusement, as if observing a small animal."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:221:21459: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:221
msgctxt "text_id=21459 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「いやあ、ゲストには何の期待もしていなかったんだが、いるじゃないか、私好みの目の保養が！"
msgstr "\"I didn't expect much from their guests, but how mistaken I was! Here you are, a feast for my eyes!"

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:233:21460: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:233
msgctxt "text_id=21460 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　いいね、青子も気が利くようになったもんだ。これなら退屈はしなさそうだよ」"
msgstr "  I have to say, Aoko might actually have some taste after all. This will make things much more interesting.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:239:21461: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:239
msgctxt "text_id=21461 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こちらを見る目が、ちょっと、いや、かなり怪しい。"
msgstr "  The way she looked at me was a little―no, *incredibly* off-putting."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:244:21462: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:244
msgctxt "text_id=21462 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　警察はどこだ。"
msgstr "  Where are the police when you need them?"

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:272:21463: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:272
msgctxt "text_id=21463 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「そう警戒するな。私も君と同じゲストだ、仲良くしよう。"
msgstr "\"No need to be alarmed. I'm a guest just like you. Let's be friends."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:285:21464: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:285
msgctxt "text_id=21464 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　……しかし。<何|・><事|・><か|・><始|・><ま|・><る|・>前に周囲の地形を確認にくる人間が、私の他にいるとはね。"
msgstr "  To be frank, I didn't expect anyone else to be checking out the lay of the land, before things *go down*."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:297:21465: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:297
msgctxt "text_id=21465 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　うん、気に入った。気に入ったし可愛いので大サービスしてあげよう。"
msgstr "  Oh, I like you. I like you, and you're cute... so here's a freebie."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:309:21466: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:309
msgctxt "text_id=21466 | speaker=touko"
msgid "　私は普段、よく見えない。私は蒼崎の部屋にいる。そして私は犯人ではない」"
msgstr "  I normally can't see very well. I'm in Aozaki's room. And, I'm not the culprit.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:315:21467: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_C_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:315
msgctxt "text_id=21467 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「え……？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:342:21468: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:342
msgctxt "text_id=21468 | speaker=touko"
msgid "「切り札になるから、あまり口外しないようにね」"
msgstr "\"Trust me, it'll come in handy. Just keep a lid on it, okay?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:352:21469: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:352
msgctxt "text_id=21469 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　女性はおかしな台詞を残して、洋館の方に立ち去っていった。"
msgstr "  And with those strange words, the woman walked off in the direction of the mansion."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:358:21470: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:358
msgctxt "text_id=21470 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは後を追う気にもなれず、洋館の正面玄関に戻る事にした。"
msgstr "  I didn't feel like following her, so I reentered the house from the front door."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:418:21471: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:418
msgctxt "text_id=21471 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ロビーに戻ると、右手の東館―――居間の方から笑い声が聞こえてきた。"
msgstr "  Once in the foyer, I could hear laughter coming from the east wing drawing room, to my right."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:423:21472: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:423
msgctxt "text_id=21472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎を待たせている。"
msgstr "  I'd kept Aozaki waiting long enough."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:428:21473: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:428
msgctxt "text_id=21473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは荷物を抱え直して、居間に足を向けた。"
msgstr "  Picking up my luggage, I made my way over."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_2:48:21474: scene=WIK_C_2
#: WIK_C_2:48
msgctxt "text_id=21474 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……明らかに、不穏なものを感じる。"
msgstr "  ...Something clearly wasn't right."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_2:53:21475: scene=WIK_C_2
#: WIK_C_2:53
msgctxt "text_id=21475 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　幽霊屋敷の異名を思い出し、わたしは無視する事に決めた。屋敷の周りを探索する時は、誰かと一緒の時がいいだろう。"
msgstr "  I recalled this place's reputation as a haunted mansion, but firmly resolved to put that out of my mind. Still, if I was going to explore, it was best not to go alone."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_2:85:21476: scene=WIK_C_2
#: WIK_C_2:85
msgctxt "text_id=21476 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ロビーに戻ると、右手の東館―――居間の方から笑い声が聞こえてきた。"
msgstr "  Returning to the foyer, I could hear laughter coming from the east wing drawing room, to my right."

#. Occurrence WIK_C_2:90:21477: scene=WIK_C_2
#: WIK_C_2:90
msgctxt "text_id=21477 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは荷物を抱え直して、居間に足を向けた。"
msgstr "  I picked up my luggage and made my way over."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:57:21478: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:57
msgctxt "text_id=21478 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「これは酷い」"
msgstr "\"Oh, dear.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:63:21479: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:63
msgctxt "text_id=21479 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館の三階。"
msgstr "  We were on the third floor."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:68:21480: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:68
msgctxt "text_id=21480 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ホールの真上にあたる屋根裏部屋に入ると、そこはこの世のものとは思えぬ地獄だった。"
msgstr "  A hellish scene greeted us in the attic directly above the hall."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:88:21481: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:88
msgctxt "text_id=21481 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　部屋の中心には土桔由里彦氏……"
msgstr "  In the center of the room was Yurihiko Tokitsu..."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:106:21482: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:106
msgctxt "text_id=21482 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　と思われる遺体がある。"
msgstr "  ...or so we believed."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:111:21483: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:111
msgctxt "text_id=21483 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手足は半分以上千切れ、焼かれ、顔もない。"
msgstr "  The faceless body had been burned, and most of its limbs mangled."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:116:21484: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:116
msgctxt "text_id=21484 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かろうじて原形を<留|とど>めているのは胴体部分だけ。"
msgstr "  Only the torso remained in a vaguely recognizable shape."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:121:21485: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:121
msgctxt "text_id=21485 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　部屋には焦げた臭いが充満し、壁は<煤|すす>だらけだった。"
msgstr "  A burning stench filled the air inside the soot-covered walls."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:171:21486: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:171
msgctxt "text_id=21486 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……顔はもう分からないが、こりゃ土桔の爺さんのスーツだ。間違いない」"
msgstr "\"...Can't tell whose face that is anymore, but that's definitely the old man's suitcase.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:183:21487: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:183
msgctxt "text_id=21487 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「オレ見ないからね！　絶対見ないから！」"
msgstr "\"Forget it! I ain't looking!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:193:21488: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:193
msgctxt "text_id=21488 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「トッキィーったら、素敵な人ね。死に様までお祭りのよう」"
msgstr "\"Good old Tokie. Grandiose even in death.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:203:21489: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:203
msgctxt "text_id=21489 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「焼き肉が食べたい」"
msgstr "\"I'm in the mood for barbeque now.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:213:21490: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:213
msgctxt "text_id=21490 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ねえ、部屋に鍵はかけてあったの？」"
msgstr "\"Hey, was the room locked?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:223:21491: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:223
msgctxt "text_id=21491 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎のへ……いえ、屋根裏部屋に鍵は付いていないわ。常時、誰でも入れる状態よ」"
msgstr "\"No, Soujyuro's room―I mean, the attic doesn't have a lock. Anyone can come in.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:248:21492: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:248
msgctxt "text_id=21492 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「シット。これ、死因は爆発による損傷と火傷ね。"
msgstr "\"Well, shit. Looks like an explosion killed him."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:254:21493: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP2START_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:254
msgctxt "text_id=21493 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　爆発もとは見あたらないけど……ユリヒコ、爆弾で遊ぶ性癖があったとか？　まあ、芸術家らしいけど」"
msgstr "  I don't see any source of the combustion, though... did Yurihiko like playing with explosives? I wouldn't put it past an artist.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:287:21494: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:287
msgctxt "text_id=21494 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「みんな冷静になりましょう。これは犯罪よ。犯罪の<匂|にお>いがするわ」"
msgstr "\"Let's all just calm down. I think this was premeditated. This is a crime scene.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:302:21495: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:302
msgctxt "text_id=21495 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「どちらかというと、小麦粉ではないだろうか」"
msgstr "\"Is this flour?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:336:21496: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:336
msgctxt "text_id=21496 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　芳助は怖がって二階で待機している。"
msgstr "  Housuke remained on the second floor, trembling."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:341:21497: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:341
msgctxt "text_id=21497 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしたちは代わる代わる現場を視認していった。"
msgstr "  The rest of us took turns surveying the scene."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:378:21498: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:378
msgctxt "text_id=21498 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「みんな、現場には手を触れないようにね。"
msgstr "\"Nobody touch anything, okay?"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:399:21499: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:399
msgctxt "text_id=21499 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　見るときは二人一組で、どちらかが偽装工作をしないか監視しながら調査して。"
msgstr "  Look around in pairs, and make sure the other person doesn't do anything suspicious."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:420:21500: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:420
msgctxt "text_id=21500 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　アッちゃん、警察に連絡をいれてもいい？　ありがと、それじゃあロビーの電話、借りるわね」"
msgstr "  Allie, do you mind if I call the police? Thanks. I'll go use the phone in the foyer.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:445:21501: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:445
msgctxt "text_id=21501 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　活き活きしはじめた律架さんの指示に従って、二人一組で行動する。"
msgstr "  Following the orders of a now quite animated Ritsuka, we moved about in pairs."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:450:21502: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:450
msgctxt "text_id=21502 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　芳助が逃げてしまったため、流れ的に、わたしは槻司と組むコトになった。"
msgstr "  Since Housuke ran off, I ended up paired with Tsukiji."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:485:21503: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:485
msgctxt "text_id=21503 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「―――しっかし、とんでもねえ死因だな。"
msgstr "\"Damn. What a way to go out."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:491:21504: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:491
msgctxt "text_id=21504 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　爆発って、犯人はなに考えてやがる」"
msgstr "  Who kills someone with an explosion?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:500:21505: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:500
msgctxt "text_id=21505 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　意外なのは、槻司がもう「何者かによる殺人事件」と断定している事だ。"
msgstr "  I was surprised Tsukiji already saw this as a murder."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:526:21506: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP2START_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:526
msgctxt "text_id=21506 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……これ、事故じゃないの？」"
msgstr "\"...You don't think it was an accident?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:538:21507: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:538
msgctxt "text_id=21507 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「土桔の爺さんが久遠寺邸で爆発物を取り扱う可能性はゼロだからな」"
msgstr "\"No, I don't. There's zero chance Tokitsu would handle explosives in the Kuonji house.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:565:21508: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:565
msgctxt "text_id=21508 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ほら、この胴体、ちょっと見てみろ。腰のあたりに妙な焼け跡がある。これロープじゃねえかな。"
msgstr "\"Just look at his torso. There are faint scorch marks around his waist. Could be rope burns."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:571:21509: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:571
msgctxt "text_id=21509 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　土桔の爺さんは、この部屋でロープで縛られて、軟禁されていたと見るのが妥当だろう」"
msgstr "  It's possible he was tied up and held prisoner.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:582:21510: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP2START_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:582
msgctxt "text_id=21510 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:602:21511: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:602
msgctxt "text_id=21511 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　では、ロープで縛られて、誰にも気付かれないうちに爆弾で殺された……？"
msgstr "  Tied up and killed with a bomb without anyone noticing...?"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:613:21512: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP2START_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:613
msgctxt "text_id=21512 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「でも、なんだって」"
msgstr "\"But, why?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:625:21513: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:625
msgctxt "text_id=21513 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ああ。なんだって、そんな回りくどいコトをしたかって話だ。"
msgstr "\"Why indeed. Who would go through this much trouble?"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:638:21514: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:638
msgctxt "text_id=21514 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "爆発物を使う利点は……そうだな、起爆までのタイムラグを利用した時間操作と、遠隔操作があげられる。どちらも<不在証明|アリバイ>作りには有利だな」"
msgstr "I suppose the advantage of using explosives is... you can detonate them remotely at a time of your choosing. Helps with creating an alibi.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:663:21515: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:663
msgctxt "text_id=21515 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……驚きだ。"
msgstr "  Wow."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:668:21516: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:668
msgctxt "text_id=21516 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司は死体を前にしても怯んでいない。"
msgstr "  Dead body or not, Tsukiji didn't skip a beat."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:673:21517: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:673
msgctxt "text_id=21517 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いたって冷静に、かつ真剣に、この状況を分析しようとしている。"
msgstr "  He stayed calm and composed as he analyzed the situation."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:678:21518: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:678
msgctxt "text_id=21518 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こういう時の槻司は、たいへん絵になる。"
msgstr "  At times like this, he seemed so perfect."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:683:21519: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:683
msgctxt "text_id=21519 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　というか、基本的にこの男は、本気になれば文句なしに格好いいのだ。"
msgstr "  Actually, whenever I saw him get serious about anything, he was so damned cool."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:710:21520: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:710
msgctxt "text_id=21520 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「だがまあ凶器は分かった。パンだ」"
msgstr "\"But now, I know what the murder weapon was: bread.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:721:21521: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP2START_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:721
msgctxt "text_id=21521 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「はい？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:726:21522: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:726
msgctxt "text_id=21522 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その時、下からわたしたちを呼ぶ声があった。"
msgstr "  A voice called out to us from below."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:747:21523: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:747
msgctxt "text_id=21523 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「みんな、ちょっと来てー！　大変よー！"
msgstr "\"Down here, everyone! We've got a problem!"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:753:21524: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:753
msgctxt "text_id=21524 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　電話、繋がってないわー！」"
msgstr "  The phone line is out!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:776:21525: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:776
msgctxt "text_id=21525 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司と顔を見合わせる。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji and I looked at each other."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:788:21526: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:788
msgctxt "text_id=21526 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「久万梨、行くぞ」"
msgstr "\"We should check it out, Kumari.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:798:21527: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:798
msgctxt "text_id=21527 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　頷いて屋根裏を後にする。"
msgstr "  I nodded, and we exited the attic together."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:820:21528: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:820
msgctxt "text_id=21528 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二階で待機していた詠梨神父は、わたしたちが出ると扉を閉め、外付けの南京錠で部屋を施錠した。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri closed and locked the door behind us after we returned to the second floor."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:868:21529: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:868
msgctxt "text_id=21529 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雨音が耳に痛い。"
msgstr "  The sound of the rain was deafening."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:873:21530: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:873
msgctxt "text_id=21530 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　屋根裏から下りてきたわたしたちは、受話器の前に集まっていた。"
msgstr "  We gathered around the telephone."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:899:21531: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:899
msgctxt "text_id=21531 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「電話線が切れている……んじゃなくて、電話線そのものが抜かれてるわ。これじゃあ警察に通報するのはおろか、外部への連絡も不可能よ」"
msgstr "\"The phone's disconnected. Or rather, the line itself has been cut. We can't call anyone, let alone the police.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:908:21532: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP2START_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:908
msgctxt "text_id=21532 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「じゃあ、直接呼びに行ってきます」"
msgstr "\"I'll go tell them in person.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:917:21533: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP2START_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:917
msgctxt "text_id=21533 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いえ、それは待ってください。いま単独行動をされるのはよろしくありません。ほら、外も」"
msgstr "\"No, wait. We shouldn't go off on our own for the time being. Besides, look outside.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:937:21534: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:937
msgctxt "text_id=21534 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父が天窓を指さす。"
msgstr "  The priest pointed toward the skylight."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1000:21535: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1000
msgctxt "text_id=21535 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……雨だれがうるさい筈だ。"
msgstr "  Raindrops struck the glass hard in a thunderous cadence."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1005:21536: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1005
msgctxt "text_id=21536 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外の天気は、もはや嵐と呼んでいい荒れ方だった。"
msgstr "  At this point, we were in the midst of a full-blown storm."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1010:21537: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1010
msgctxt "text_id=21537 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　徒歩でやって来たわたしたちだが、この天気で山を下りるのは少しばかり危険な気がする。"
msgstr "  We'd all come on foot, so it would be risky to go back down the mountain in this weather."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1030:21538: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1030
msgctxt "text_id=21538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに……詠梨神父が“単独行動はよろしくない”と言った理由は、何も静希の安全を気遣っての事ではない。"
msgstr "  However, Father Eiri hadn't stopped Sizuki for his own safety."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1035:21539: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1035
msgctxt "text_id=21539 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この状況でひとりきりで行動されるのは、残された者たちにとっても不利益なのだ。"
msgstr "  If someone wandered off by themselves, those left behind would be in a precarious position."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1040:21540: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1040
msgctxt "text_id=21540 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たとえば―――ひとりになった事を利用しての、様々な証拠隠滅、とか。"
msgstr "  For instance, it would be easy to destroy evidence without any witnesses around."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1066:21541: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP2START_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1066
msgctxt "text_id=21541 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「とりあえず居間に集まりましょう。"
msgstr "\"For now, let's all head to the drawing room."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1072:21542: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP2START_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1072
msgctxt "text_id=21542 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　警察に連絡を入れるのは、話を整理してからでも遅くはありません」"
msgstr "  We should talk over what happened until we can call the police.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1130:21543: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1130
msgctxt "text_id=21543 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父の意見にみんな賛成する。"
msgstr "  Everyone agreed with the priest."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1170:21544: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1170
msgctxt "text_id=21544 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　前言撤回。芳助だけは、“なにこれ、ドッキリ？”と現実を見ていなかった。"
msgstr "  Everyone, except Housuke. He seemed to be waiting for someone to reveal that this was all an elaborate prank."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1220:21545: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP2START_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1220
msgctxt "text_id=21545 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1225:21546: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1225
msgctxt "text_id=21546 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　薄ら寒いものを感じて、なんとなく、玄関に視線をやった。"
msgstr "  Feeling a slight chill, I glanced at the front door."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1230:21547: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1230
msgctxt "text_id=21547 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……微かな違和感。"
msgstr "  ...Just faintly, I had the sense that something was off."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1235:21548: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1235
msgctxt "text_id=21548 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外の雨は強くなる一方だ。"
msgstr "  Outside, the rain became a torrent."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1240:21549: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1240
msgctxt "text_id=21549 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、漠然と、"
msgstr "  With my mind in a haze, I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_F:8:21550: scene=WIK_SELECT_F
#: WIK_SELECT_F:8
msgctxt "text_id=21550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｆ～"
msgstr "-Decision F-"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:138:21551: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:138
msgctxt "text_id=21551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　満場一致で山城先生の捜索が開始された。"
msgstr "  We began a manhunt for Mr. Yamasiro."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:152:21552: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:152
msgctxt "text_id=21552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手分けして館内を回っていると、二階の客室を担当していた律架さんがみんなを呼び集めた。"
msgstr "  Once we'd separated into groups to scour the mansion, Ritsuka, in charge of the second-floor guest rooms, called us together."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:177:21553: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:177
msgctxt "text_id=21553 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ここ、山城先生の客室ね。鍵はかかっているの？」"
msgstr "\"This is Mr. Yamasiro's room. Is it locked?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:187:21554: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0000_0; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:187
msgctxt "text_id=21554 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「かかっていなかったわ。留守だと思って中を覗いてみたん、"
msgstr "\"No, it's not. When he wasn't inside, I took a peek inside,"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:201:21555: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0000_1; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:201
msgctxt "text_id=21555 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "だけど……っっ」"
msgstr " and, well...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:207:21556: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:207
msgctxt "text_id=21556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんはそこで言葉を止めた。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka trailed off."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:212:21557: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:212
msgctxt "text_id=21557 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　最後のあたりはなんとなく笑いを<堪|こら>えているように見えたが、気のせいだと思いたい。"
msgstr "  Was it my imagination or is she stifling a laugh?"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:241:21558: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:241
msgctxt "text_id=21558 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「とにかく中を見て。話はその後にしましょう」"
msgstr "\"Just take a look for yourselves. Then we can talk.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:260:21559: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:260
msgctxt "text_id=21559 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんに<促|うなが>されて、わたしたちは部屋の中に足を踏み入れた。"
msgstr "  Following Ritsuka's direction, we stepped into the room."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:332:21560: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:332
msgctxt "text_id=21560 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　客室に入るとそこは"
msgstr "  Inside..."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:338:21561: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:338
msgctxt "text_id=21561 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一面の花景色。"
msgstr "  There was a field of flowers."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:408:21562: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:408
msgctxt "text_id=21562 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その中心に、山城先生は眠るように息絶えていた。"
msgstr "  In its center lay the body of Mr. Yamasiro."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:461:21563: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:461
msgctxt "text_id=21563 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ちょっ、ファラオ眠りって……！」"
msgstr "\"What's with that pose?! Is he supposed to be a pharaoh or something?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:467:21564: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:467
msgctxt "text_id=21564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は必死に笑いを堪えている。"
msgstr "  Aozaki desperately tried not to laugh."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:495:21565: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:495
msgctxt "text_id=21565 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かくいうわたしも、こみ上げたものを飲みこむので精一杯だった。"
msgstr "  It took a serious effort from me, too."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:500:21566: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:500
msgctxt "text_id=21566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不謹慎だけど、花に囲まれた状態で満足そうに永眠している山城先生のビジュアルは、厳かなお葬式というより、紅白歌合戦の大歌手を連想させたからだ。"
msgstr "  Inappropriately, I couldn't help but see the image of Mr. Yamasiro lying serenely on a bed of flowers more as a Kouhaku new year's singing contestant than as a coffin viewing."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:529:21567: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:529
msgctxt "text_id=21567 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いやはや、いたって健全な方だと思っていたのですが。"
msgstr "\"Oh, dear. Mr. Yamasiro always seemed so normal."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:535:21568: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:535
msgctxt "text_id=21568 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　山城先生は普段、どんな人生を送りたいと思っていたのでしょうね？」"
msgstr "  But this does raise some questions.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:550:21569: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:550
msgctxt "text_id=21569 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「なにこれ。ただの教師がアタシより派手な死に方とか、ふざけてるの？」"
msgstr "\"This has to be a sick joke. How can a schoolteacher die in a more flamboyant way than I live?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:594:21570: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:594
msgctxt "text_id=21570 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「皆さん、詮索はそこまでです。<故人|こじん>の人間性をどうこう言うのはデリカシーが欠けています。"
msgstr "\"Let's leave this here for now. People deserve their dignity, even in death."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:607:21571: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:607
msgctxt "text_id=21571 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　今後、新たな犠牲者が出た時、その死を笑うような事はないように。いいですね」"
msgstr "  If another person passes away, I ask you all treat it with more gravity. Is that clear?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:631:21572: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:631
msgctxt "text_id=21572 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「あ、はい。すみません、確かに不謹慎でした。"
msgstr "\"Forgive me. I shouldn't have been so facetious."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:642:21573: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:642
msgctxt "text_id=21573 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　やはりこういう時は頼りになりますね、唯架くんは」"
msgstr "  You're so reliable at times like these, Sister.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:655:21574: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:655
msgctxt "text_id=21574 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「大人として当然の注意です。学生を監督する立場なのですから、エイリ神父も軽はずみな行為は控えてください」"
msgstr "\"I'm simply being a responsible adult. You should also conduct yourself in a manner befitting a student supervisor, Father.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:690:21575: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:690
msgctxt "text_id=21575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぴしゃりとした唯架さんのお叱りで、部屋の雰囲気は一気に冷えこんだ。"
msgstr "  The room felt colder after Sister Yuika's scolding."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:695:21576: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:695
msgctxt "text_id=21576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしたちは部屋を調べた後、久遠寺さんのマスターキーで山城先生の客室を施錠して、居間に戻ることになった。"
msgstr "  After we finished examining the room, Miss Kuonji locked it behind us, and we returned to the drawing room."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:779:21577: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:779
msgctxt "text_id=21577 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間は重苦しい空気に包まれている。"
msgstr "  A somber mood settled over the parlor."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:784:21578: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:784
msgctxt "text_id=21578 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この重苦しさは死者が増えた事による<悲愴感|ひそうかん>ではない。"
msgstr "  The gloom wasn't from any sense of grief,"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:789:21579: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:789
msgctxt "text_id=21579 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二人一組になった事で、ある種の空気が<蔓延|まんえん>しだしている事に、わたしは気付いていた。"
msgstr "  but rather a certain feeling that pervaded the group after we split into pairs-"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:795:21580: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:795
msgctxt "text_id=21580 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……よくない事に、わたしたちは他のチームを疑い始めてしまっている。"
msgstr "  Suspicion between the teams."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:822:21581: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:822
msgctxt "text_id=21581 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「客室に乱れた様子はなかった。山城を客室に誘い込んだのか、山城が客室にいる時にやってきたのか。"
msgstr "\"There was no evidence of a struggle in the guest room. Either Mr. Yamasiro invited them in, or they invited themselves in before he arrived."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:834:21582: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:834
msgctxt "text_id=21582 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　どちらにせよ、親しい仲での不意打ちだったんだろう。"
msgstr "  Either way, he likely knew them and was taken by surprise."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:834:21583: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:834
msgctxt "text_id=21583 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　山城はルールを知らなかったから、あっさり笑わされたんだろうが……」"
msgstr "  Mr. Yamasiro probably didn't know the rules, so maybe it was easy to make him laugh...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:854:21584: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:854
msgctxt "text_id=21584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司は居間に集まった全員に向けて話しかけていた。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji spoke to everyone in the room."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:859:21585: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:859
msgctxt "text_id=21585 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こういう時、みんなの意見を求める立場である詠梨神父がさっきから押し黙っているため、仕方なく代役を買って出た、という顔だ。"
msgstr "  Usually, Father Eiri was the one leading the discussion, but now that he was silent, maybe Tsukiji felt he had to step up."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:895:21586: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:895
msgctxt "text_id=21586 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なに、鳶丸。アンタにしちゃ歯切れが悪いじゃない。"
msgstr "\"What's gotten into you, Tobimaru? You're normally more direct than this."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:901:21587: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:901
msgctxt "text_id=21587 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　今の憶測に間違いはないと思うけど？」"
msgstr "  Where are you going with all this?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:913:21588: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:913
msgctxt "text_id=21588 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いや、教会組や久遠寺はともかく、俺や蒼崎、久万梨は山城先生をよく知ってるだろ。"
msgstr "\"Oh, it's just that aside from Kuonji and the people from the Church, you, Kumari, and I all knew Mr. Yamasiro well."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:925:21589: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:925
msgctxt "text_id=21589 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　あの昼行灯が、他人の冗談に心から笑う、っていうのはかなりレアな出来事じゃないか？」"
msgstr "  That blockhead wasn't the kind of guy to give you a big belly laugh at your jokes.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:965:21590: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:965
msgctxt "text_id=21590 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうだ。"
msgstr "  He was right."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:970:21591: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:970
msgctxt "text_id=21591 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山城先生はいつもニコニコ顔で穏やかだけど、究極の中立者というか、柳に風、のれんに腕押し、<馬耳東風|ばじとうふう>ぐらいにたいていの意見は受け流してしまう。"
msgstr "  Mr. Yamasiro smiled a lot and was easygoing, but he was neutral to a fault. He never responded strongly to people's opinions, almost to the point of utter indifference."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:975:21592: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:975
msgctxt "text_id=21592 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山城先生が本気で笑うとしたら、それは不意打ちの、ドッキリテレビみたいな<脅|おど>かし方ではないだろうか。"
msgstr "  For him to laugh hard, he must've been taken by surprise, like victims on prank TV shows."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1002:21593: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1002
msgctxt "text_id=21593 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「まあ、『どうやって笑わせたか』は後回しだ。"
msgstr "\"We can figure out how they made him laugh later."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1014:21594: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1014
msgctxt "text_id=21594 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　どうも敵さん本気で攻めてきてるみたいだからな。仲良し時間は終わりにして、本題に入ろうぜ」"
msgstr "  Someone's out to get us. Enough of the friendly chit-chat. Let's get to the real issue.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1023:21595: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1023
msgctxt "text_id=21595 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「そうですね。この中の誰がＡなのか。"
msgstr "\"Agreed. Who among us is the most likely suspect?"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1029:21596: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1029
msgctxt "text_id=21596 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　犯人捜しを始めましょう」"
msgstr "  We should narrow it down.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1065:21597: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1065
msgctxt "text_id=21597 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　聞きたくはない台詞だったけど、同時に誰もが口にしたくてしょうがなかった台詞。"
msgstr "  I don't think anybody wanted to hear that, but we all knew it needed to happen."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1070:21598: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1070
msgctxt "text_id=21598 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう、これは避けては通れない。"
msgstr "  There was no way around it anymore."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1075:21599: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1075
msgctxt "text_id=21599 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この中に土桔由里彦氏と山城先生を『意図的に』笑わせた人物Ａがいるのだ。"
msgstr "  Someone here intentionally made both Mr. Tokitsu and Mr. Yamasiro laugh."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1080:21600: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1080
msgctxt "text_id=21600 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかも土桔氏に対しては爆薬まで用いて―――あれ？"
msgstr "  In Tokitsu's case, they even used explosives... wait."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1116:21601: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1116
msgctxt "text_id=21601 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ごめん。今さらだけど、土桔さんの死因ってもしかして」"
msgstr "\"Um, I know it's a little late to bring this up now, but the way Mr. Tokitsu died...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1127:21602: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1127
msgctxt "text_id=21602 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「うん、パンに殺されたんだろうね」"
msgstr "\"Right. Probably death by bread.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1138:21603: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1138
msgctxt "text_id=21603 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「トッキィーらしいわ。“この世に小麦粉がなければ、僕は前衛美術で世界をすくっていた”とか、よくこぼしていたもの」"
msgstr "\"Makes sense in a way. Tokie did once say that if it wasn't for flour, he'd have saved the world with avant-garde art.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1186:21604: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1186
msgctxt "text_id=21604 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　申し訳なさそうに額をかく槻司。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji scratched his head apologetically."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1191:21605: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1191
msgctxt "text_id=21605 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やれ殺害時間の操作だの、身元の隠蔽だのと考察していた自分に呆れているっぽい。"
msgstr "  He looked frustrated with himself for thinking so much about the time of death and the identity of the killer."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1196:21606: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1196
msgctxt "text_id=21606 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれで繊細なところもあるのだ、コイツは。"
msgstr "  I guess he did have a more sensitive side."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1233:21607: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1233
msgctxt "text_id=21607 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「犯人捜しなんて、するまでもないと思いますが。"
msgstr "\"I don't believe we need to hunt for the culprit."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1245:21608: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1245
msgctxt "text_id=21608 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　これがプロイキッシャーによる犯行なら、第一容疑者は久遠寺有珠、第二容疑者は蒼崎青子、第三容疑者はメイ・リデル・アーシェロット。以上の三名にしぼられます。"
msgstr "  If this is the work of a Ploy Kickshaw, that makes Alice Kuonji the prime suspect, followed by Aoko Aozaki, and May Riddell Archelot."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1257:21609: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1257
msgctxt "text_id=21609 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　彼女たちをここで笑わせてしまえば解決です。脇腹を<抉|えぐ>るなり、足の裏を<削|そ>ぐなりすれば人間は笑います。物理的に」"
msgstr "  Humans naturally laugh when their sides are prodded or the soles of their feet are tickled. There are ways to get the answers we seek... physically.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1306:21610: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1306
msgctxt "text_id=21610 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「唯ちゃん、ちょっと落ち着いて。"
msgstr "\"Calm down, Yui."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1318:21611: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1318
msgctxt "text_id=21611 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　冷静に、冷静になりましょう、みんな。ケンカはよくないわ、犯人の思うつぼよ、きっと！"
msgstr "  We should try to keep cool. No fighting. The culprit's probably counting on us to argue."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1330:21612: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1330
msgctxt "text_id=21612 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　もっとミステリ的に考えましょう。まずはアリバイ検証とか、ほら、物理的に穏やかな方向で！」"
msgstr "  Let's think of this more like a mystery novel and start by checking everyone's alibis, okay? No *physical* interrogations!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1339:21613: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1339
msgctxt "text_id=21613 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「律架に賛成です。唯架くんも、それは最後の手段としてとっておいてくださいね。槻司くんや久万梨さんが同席しているんですから」"
msgstr "\"I agree with Ritsuka. We can use your method as a last resort, Sister. Remember, we have innocent students here in attendance as well.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1388:21614: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1388
msgctxt "text_id=21614 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「アリバイ検証はちょっと待ってもらえますか？"
msgstr "\"Could we wait a bit before we start checking alibis?"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1399:21615: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1399
msgctxt "text_id=21615 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　その前に、スイーツハーツだっけか？　そいつの特徴を詳しく聞きたいんですけど。"
msgstr "  Before that... um, Sweets Hearts, was it? I'd like to hear more about that."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1405:21616: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1405
msgctxt "text_id=21616 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　久遠寺、知ってる事を話してくれ。"
msgstr "  Kuonji, tell us all you know."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1437:21617: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1437
msgctxt "text_id=21617 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　ルールがどうたら以前に、そいつがどういうカタチなのか、俺たちは知らねえんだ」"
msgstr "  We need to understand what it is.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1477:21618: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1477
msgctxt "text_id=21618 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「そうね。肝心な事を説明していなかったわ。"
msgstr "\"I suppose you're right. I didn't explain the essentials."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1489:21619: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1489
msgctxt "text_id=21619 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　スイーツハーツは卵形のプディングよ。<王冠|おうかん>を逆さにして、ゆで卵を載せたようなカタチ」"
msgstr "  Sweets Hearts is an egg-shaped pudding. It kind of looks like a hardboiled egg on top of an upside-down crown.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1640:21620: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1640
msgctxt "text_id=21620 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「斬新ね。プリンに殺されるミステリとか、今まで聞いた事もなかったわ」"
msgstr "\"That's novel. This is the first murder mystery I've heard of where the weapon was a pudding.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1678:21621: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1678
msgctxt "text_id=21621 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「バカなの？　バカしかいないの？"
msgstr "\"Am I surrounded by idiots?"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1690:21622: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1690
msgctxt "text_id=21622 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　それは発動する前のカタチよ。スイーツハーツは自分を食べた相手に、そっくりそのまま<擬態|ぎたい>するの」"
msgstr "  That's merely how it appears before it activates. Sweets Hearts becomes a doppelganger of the person who eats it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1717:21623: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1717
msgctxt "text_id=21623 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「というか、スイーツハーツを食べちゃった時点で、食べた人間……これが使用者ね、使用者は卵の中に閉じこめられて、外にはスイーツハーツが擬態した“使用者”が現れる。"
msgstr "\"To be precise, whoever eats Sweets Hearts is imprisoned inside the egg; outside, the doppelganger appears."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1723:21624: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1723
msgctxt "text_id=21624 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　活動をはじめたスイーツハーツは、人間のカタチをしているってコト」"
msgstr "  So once Sweets Hearts is activated, it'll be in human form.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1781:21625: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0010; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1781
msgctxt "text_id=21625 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「―――理屈も道理もあえて訊かないが、要は、本物と偽者が入れ替わるんだな？」"
msgstr "\"So, basically you're saying a person gets swapped with an imposter, right?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1790:21626: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1790
msgctxt "text_id=21626 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「前言は撤回してあげる。トビマルだけは猿以上ね。"
msgstr "\"Let me correct myself. Only Tobimaru isn't a complete idiot."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1801:21627: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0006; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1801
msgctxt "text_id=21627 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　そう、スイーツハーツは使用者に化けるプロイなの。それも完全によ。なにしろ起動してしまったら、スイーツハーツすら自分が“犯人”だとは思っていないんだもの」"
msgstr "  That's right. Sweets Hearts is a Ploy that transforms into its user. A perfect replica―so perfect, it doesn't realize what it is.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1827:21628: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0007; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1827
msgctxt "text_id=21628 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「完全に化けるってそういうコトでしょう？"
msgstr "\"Too perfect, you could say."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1838:21629: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0008; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1838
msgctxt "text_id=21629 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　犯人と思わしきヤツをどんなに詰問しても、拷問しても、ソレがスイーツハーツだっていう客観的、かつ絶対的な証拠がないと正体は暴けない。"
msgstr "  No matter how much you question or torture the suspect, without objective, absolute proof, they won't be exposed."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1850:21630: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0009; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1850
msgctxt "text_id=21630 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　“使用者”は証拠をつきつけられて、ようやく自分がスイーツハーツだって気が付くのよ」"
msgstr "  Once evidence is presented to them, they finally realize that they are the Sweets Hearts in question.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1909:21631: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1909
msgctxt "text_id=21631 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「あああーん！　なにそのロジックパズル！"
msgstr "\"Oh my god! It's a classic logic puzzle!"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1916:21632: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1916
msgctxt "text_id=21632 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　たまんないですっ！　正直、もうたまんないです！」"
msgstr "  I can't take it anymore! This is so awesome!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1927:21633: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0006; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1927
msgctxt "text_id=21633 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「……一流のスパイは、まず自分はスパイではないと自己暗示をかけると言いますが……厄介ですね」"
msgstr "\"It's said the best spies learn to convince themselves they're not spies, but this... is troublesome.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1940:21634: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1940
msgctxt "text_id=21634 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いえ、それはおかしい。犯人は明確に笑わせにきているのでしょう？　それで自覚がないというのは、どうも」"
msgstr "\"That doesn't sound quite right. The culprit wants us to laugh, no? If they don't know who they are, what would be the point?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1986:21635: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1986
msgctxt "text_id=21635 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「スイーツハーツと、スイーツハーツが代行している人間はオンオフで切り替わるの。"
msgstr "\"Sweets Hearts and its proxy human can switch on and off."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2001:21636: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2001
msgctxt "text_id=21636 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　普段は代行している人間そのものだけど、『ルール実行可能』な条件になると、その時だけスイーツハーツの人格に切り替わる。"
msgstr "  Though normally a perfect doppelganger, its own personality can emerge when certain conditions are met."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2015:21637: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2015
msgctxt "text_id=21637 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　もちろん、『代行している人間』の時の人格には、スイーツハーツを起動した時の記憶は消失しているわ」"
msgstr "  Of course, when it has the personality of its proxy, it has no memory of being activated.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2050:21638: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2050
msgctxt "text_id=21638 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……なんだってのよ、その条件。"
msgstr "  What kind of setup was this?"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2055:21639: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2055
msgctxt "text_id=21639 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まるで姿なき殺戮者、殺意なき殺人鬼じゃない。"
msgstr "  So, we were dealing with a formless butcher. A murderer with no ill intent."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2060:21640: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2060
msgctxt "text_id=21640 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その条件なら誰だって―――わたしですら―――含まれてしまう。"
msgstr "  That meant the murderer could be anyone... even me!"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2065:21641: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2065
msgctxt "text_id=21641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　現状、誰であれスイーツハーツの可能性があるってコトだもの……！"
msgstr "  Any one of us could be Sweets Hearts!"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2095:21642: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2095
msgctxt "text_id=21642 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「みんな、落ち着いて。冷静に、冷静になりましょう。"
msgstr "\"Everyone, relax. Just keep calm."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2110:21643: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0009; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2110
msgctxt "text_id=21643 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　楽しいからって騒いだり、ケンカしたり、もう我慢できないわたしは家に帰るぞー、とか叫んで飛び出していったりしちゃダメよ？　絶対死ぬから」"
msgstr "  If we start having too much fun, or start fighting, or get tired of this and try to go home, we're as good as dead.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2119:21644: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0007; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2119
msgctxt "text_id=21644 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「私としては、まず貴女に冷静になってほしいのですが」"
msgstr "\"If anyone needs to calm down, it's you.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2166:21645: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0010; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2166
msgctxt "text_id=21645 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「いやーん、ダメ、冷静になんてなれない！"
msgstr "\"But how can I be calm in a situation like this?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2190:21646: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0011_0; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2190
msgctxt "text_id=21646 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　お願い、夢でも覚めないでっ！　盛り上げる為に、みんなあと半分ぐらい殺されて！　そして当然、最後に生き残るのはわた、"
msgstr "@o  If this is a dream, I don't want to wake up! At least half the group needs to ^die to really spice things up! And then, once I'm the last one left alive..."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2251:21647: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0011_1; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2251
msgctxt "text_id=21647 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "ぐほっ」"
msgstr "Ack!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2293:21648: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2293
msgctxt "text_id=21648 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そこまでのトンデモプロイとは思わなかったわ。"
msgstr "\"Wow. Talk about a crazy Ploy."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2299:21649: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2299
msgctxt "text_id=21649 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　これは真面目にアリバイ検証をするしかなさそうね」"
msgstr "  I guess all we can do at this point is check everyone's alibis.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2308:21650: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0011; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2308
msgctxt "text_id=21650 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そうだな。誰がスイーツハーツかは判明しないが、誰なら二人を殺せたかは見えてくるかもしれねえ」"
msgstr "\"Right. We might not be able to pin Sweets Hearts, but we might be able to figure out who committed the murders.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2334:21651: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0012; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2334
msgctxt "text_id=21651 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「それぞれこの一日の行動を証言しよう。もし自分の記憶と違ったところがあったら、容赦なく指摘してくれ。"
msgstr "\"Let's testify one by one. We should go over everything we did today. If anything seems inconsistent, don't hold back."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2345:21652: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0013; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2345
msgctxt "text_id=21652 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　それじゃあ、まずは俺からだな」"
msgstr "  I guess I'll start, then.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2379:21653: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2379
msgctxt "text_id=21653 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　提案者である槻司が先陣をきっては、誰も異論は挟めない。"
msgstr "  No one objected to Tsukiji's initiative."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2384:21654: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2384
msgctxt "text_id=21654 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここで待ったをかければ、それこそ自分が怪しいというようなものだし。"
msgstr "  If he didn't want to go first, he'd look suspicious."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2430:21655: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0014; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2430
msgctxt "text_id=21655 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「俺は午前十時に、ベオと木乃美、土桔の爺さんと久遠寺邸に到着した。"
msgstr "\"Beo, Kinomi, Yurihiko, and I all came here at ten this morning."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2442:21656: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0015; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2442
msgctxt "text_id=21656 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　俺たちは久遠寺に挨拶した後、それぞれ与えられた客室で休憩、十一時には居間に再集合し、昼食をとった。"
msgstr "  After saying hi to Kuonji, we each went to our rooms to rest, then met again at 11 o'clock in the drawing room and had lunch."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2454:21657: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0016; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2454
msgctxt "text_id=21657 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　……そうだな、たしかそのあたりで土桔の爺さんはいなくなってたな」"
msgstr "  Oh, yeah. Around that time, Yurihiko went missing.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2481:21658: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0017; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2481
msgctxt "text_id=21658 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「午後になって蒼崎、山城、久万梨が到着。"
msgstr "\"Aozaki, Mr. Yamasiro, and Kumari arrived in the afternoon."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2493:21659: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0018; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2493
msgctxt "text_id=21659 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　夕方になってリデルが呼ばれもしないのに乱入。"
msgstr "  Then, in the evening, Riddell barged in uninvited."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2505:21660: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0019; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2505
msgctxt "text_id=21660 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　何度かトイレで席を立ったが、基本的には居間とサンルームで過ごしていた。"
msgstr "  I went to the bathroom a few times, but besides that I was here in the drawing room and the sunroom."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2517:21661: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0020; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2517
msgctxt "text_id=21661 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　俺が居間にいた間、常に姿があったのは久遠寺だけだ」"
msgstr "  During that period, the only person who never left the parlor was Kuonji.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2555:21662: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2555
msgctxt "text_id=21662 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「私は午前中は街で買い物をして、そのまま昼過ぎに久万梨と合流。なぜか山城先生もいたわ。"
msgstr "\"This morning, I went shopping in town, then met Kumari straight away in the afternoon. For some reason, Mr. Yamasiro was also there."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2567:21663: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2567
msgctxt "text_id=21663 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　三人で洋館に到着したのが二時過ぎ。"
msgstr "  The three of us arrived at the mansion sometime after two."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2579:21664: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2579
msgctxt "text_id=21664 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　居間で鳶丸たちに挨拶して、あとは居間とサンルームをいったりきたり、だったかな。"
msgstr "  After saying hello to Tobimaru in the drawing room, I spent the rest of the time between there and the sunroom."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2591:21665: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2591
msgctxt "text_id=21665 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ご不浄で何度か席を立ったけど、一度もトッキィーとは顔を合わせていないわ」"
msgstr "  I left a few times for the restroom, but I didn't see Tokie once.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2629:21666: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2629
msgctxt "text_id=21666 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ボクもするの？　いいけど、みんなと変わらないよ？"
msgstr "\"Huh? Do I have to go too? Whatever, but my story's the same as everyone else's."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2641:21667: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2641
msgctxt "text_id=21667 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　えーと、三連休だったので、昨日はトビーの家で寝泊まりしてあげてたよ。ホースケも一緒だったんで、うるさいコトこの上なかったです。"
msgstr "  Y'know, it's a long weekend, so I hit Toby up and spent the night at his house yesterday. Housuke was there, too, so it was wild."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2653:21668: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2653
msgctxt "text_id=21668 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　で、朝になってから三人で一緒に公園までいって、爺さんと合流して、ロールス・ロイスでここの門に到着。"
msgstr "  In the morning, we all went to the park together to meet up with the old guy, before coming here in a sweet Rolls-Royce."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2665:21669: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2665
msgctxt "text_id=21669 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　十時にはアリスに挨拶して、あとはずっとゴロゴロしてましたー！」"
msgstr "  At ten, I said what's up to Alice. Since then, I've just been here chilling the whole time!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2698:21670: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2698
msgctxt "text_id=21670 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……わたしは、"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_I:8:21671: scene=WIK_SELECT_I
#: WIK_SELECT_I:8
msgctxt "text_id=21671 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｉ～"
msgstr "-Decision I-"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:95:21672: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:95
msgctxt "text_id=21672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残されたわたしたちは、居間に移る事もできずロビーで立ち尽くしていた。"
msgstr "  Unable to go to the drawing room, those of us left behind were stuck standing in the foyer."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:115:21673: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:115
msgctxt "text_id=21673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間はほぼ明かりが落ちている。"
msgstr "  It was surprisingly dark in here."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:120:21674: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:120
msgctxt "text_id=21674 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このまま明かりを求めて客室に移動するのがまっとうな考えなんだろうけど、ここで孤立するのはきまりが悪い。"
msgstr "  The guest rooms were probably better lit, and I considered going there. Might look weird going by myself, though."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:125:21675: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:125
msgctxt "text_id=21675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　十三人目のゲスト、蒼崎のお姉さんが本当にいるのかどうか。"
msgstr "  Was Aozaki's older sister, the thirteenth guest, really here?"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:130:21676: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:130
msgctxt "text_id=21676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　せめてそれを解明しないと、おちおち部屋に戻れないのだ。"
msgstr "  I couldn't go back to my room yet until that mystery was solved, at least."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:163:21677: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP4START_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:163
msgctxt "text_id=21677 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「とりあえず、唯架さんの彫像は部屋の隅に移動させよう。"
msgstr "\"For now, let's move Sister Yuika's statue to the corner."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:187:21678: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP4START_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:187
msgctxt "text_id=21678 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "あれ、重いな。すごく重いぞ唯架さん。"
msgstr "Huh? She's heavy. Very heavy."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:199:21679: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP4START_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:199
msgctxt "text_id=21679 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "鳶丸、手伝ってくれ」"
msgstr "Tobimaru, help me out.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:208:21680: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:208
msgctxt "text_id=21680 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「あいよ、俺うしろな。"
msgstr "\"Sure thing, I'll take the back."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:220:21681: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:220
msgctxt "text_id=21681 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "……む、見た目通りいい曲線してやがんな唯架さん。"
msgstr "...Y'know. She's pretty cute."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:231:21682: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:231
msgctxt "text_id=21682 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　シスター目当てで教会に通い詰める野郎が多いわけだ」"
msgstr "  No wonder so many lowlifes go to the church.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:287:21683: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:287
msgctxt "text_id=21683 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希と槻司はこんな状況でも仲がいい。"
msgstr "  Even in this situation, Sizuki and Tsukiji were friendly."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:294:21684: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:294
msgctxt "text_id=21684 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　というより、パニックに<陥|おちい>っていない。"
msgstr "  I couldn't believe how calm they both were."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:299:21685: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:299
msgctxt "text_id=21685 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはもう限界ギリギリで、いま後ろから<脅|おど>かされたら笑い死ぬ前にショック死しそうだ。"
msgstr "  I felt like I was nearing a breaking point. If something jumped out at me, I'd die of shock before I died from laughter."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:323:21686: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:323
msgctxt "text_id=21686 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「クマ、お茶でも淹れてこようか？　顔色、真っ青よ」"
msgstr "\"Do you want some tea, Kuma? You look pale.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:335:21687: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP4START_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:335
msgctxt "text_id=21687 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ありがと。けど要らない」"
msgstr "\"Thanks, but I'm fine.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:341:21688: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:341
msgctxt "text_id=21688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　トイレ、近くなったらイヤだし。この屋敷のトイレ、奥まったところにあるから怖いのだ。"
msgstr "  The last thing I wanted was to have to use the toilet, and I was scared of venturing far into the mansion to find one."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:367:21689: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:367
msgctxt "text_id=21689 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「お、余裕じゃない。その調子なら朝まで持ちそうね。"
msgstr "\"Seems like you're doing fine, then. Just keep that spirit up until morning."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:378:21690: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:378
msgctxt "text_id=21690 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　詠梨と唯架さんは残念な事になったけど、ある意味、ちょっと安心した。この面子なら気心知れてるし、疑いあう事もないしね。"
msgstr "  It's too bad about Eiri and Yuika, but in a way, I'm actually kind of relieved. At least we're all good friends here, so we can trust each other."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:389:21691: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:389
msgctxt "text_id=21691 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あとは橙子を見付ければ、」"
msgstr "  We just need to find Touko.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:395:21692: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:395
msgctxt "text_id=21692 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「いえ、それには及ばないわ。ゲームはこれで終わり。"
msgstr "\"No need for that. The game's over."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:401:21693: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:401
msgctxt "text_id=21693 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　今までよくやってくれたものね、アコちゃん？」"
msgstr "  I'm impressed, Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:446:21694: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP4START_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:446
msgctxt "text_id=21694 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「律架さん？」"
msgstr "\"Ritsuka?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:467:21695: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:467
msgctxt "text_id=21695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　声は階段から聞こえてきた。"
msgstr "  The voice came from the stairs."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:473:21696: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:473
msgctxt "text_id=21696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオを探しに行った律架さんが戻ってきたのだ。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka had returned from her search for Beo."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:505:21697: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:505
msgctxt "text_id=21697 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……なによ。今のどういう意味、律架」"
msgstr "\"What's that supposed to mean?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:517:21698: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:517
msgctxt "text_id=21698 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「だから、芝居はもういいって事です。"
msgstr "\"It's about time you dropped the charade."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:529:21699: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:529
msgctxt "text_id=21699 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　チェックメイトよアコちゃん。どうしてこんな凶行に及んだのかはぜんっぜん分からないけど、物的証拠が真実を示しているの。"
msgstr "  Checkmate, Ako. I haven't got the faintest idea why you went to such lengths, but the physical evidence doesn't lie."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:541:21700: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:541
msgctxt "text_id=21700 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　まだ断定はしないけど、十中八九、貴女がスイーツハーツ最有力候補よ」"
msgstr "  It's not an open and shut case quite yet, but you're the most likely Sweets Hearts suspect.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:597:21701: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:597
msgctxt "text_id=21701 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「な、なに言いだすのよバカ律架。私がスイーツハーツだなんて、そんな訳ないじゃないっ。"
msgstr "\"Wha... What the hell're you talking about? There's no way I'm Sweets Hearts."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:608:21702: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:608
msgctxt "text_id=21702 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……えーと、ないわよね？　ない筈だと思うけど……」"
msgstr "  I mean, um... I'm pretty sure there's no way...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:620:21703: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:620
msgctxt "text_id=21703 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「しらばっくれるのもそこまで。"
msgstr "\"Don't play dumb."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:631:21704: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:631
msgctxt "text_id=21704 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　ベオくんを捜している時に、貴女の部屋を見させてもらったわ。動かぬ証拠がそこにあるのよ」"
msgstr "  While searching for Beo, I went into your room, and found irrefutable evidence!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:663:21705: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:663
msgctxt "text_id=21705 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「うえ!?　ア、アンタ、どうやって私の部屋に入ったのよ!?鍵、かけてあったでしょ!?」"
msgstr "\"What?! Y-You... How did you get into my room?! I thought I locked it!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:681:21706: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:681
msgctxt "text_id=21706 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「わたしの数少ない特技、本格推理ピッキングです！」"
msgstr "\"One of my few special skills: lockpicking!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:707:21707: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:707
msgctxt "text_id=21707 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ないから！　本格でピッキングはご法度だから！"
msgstr "\"Hey! Lockpicking's illegal!"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:718:21708: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:718
msgctxt "text_id=21708 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　そんなんで、人が必死に隠してた死体を見付けるとか、反則じゃない！」"
msgstr "  Finding a dead body that someone desperately tried to hide is totally against the rules!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:779:21709: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:779
msgctxt "text_id=21709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　取り乱す蒼崎。"
msgstr "  Aozaki was losing it."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:785:21710: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:785
msgctxt "text_id=21710 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな彼女を、わたしたちはじーっと無言で観察する。"
msgstr "  We all stared at her, silently."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:812:21711: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0010_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:812
msgctxt "text_id=21711 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あ、いや、その……"
msgstr "\"Uh, no, I mean..."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:825:21712: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0010_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:825
msgctxt "text_id=21712 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "てへ☆」"
msgstr "Teehee!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:836:21713: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:836
msgctxt "text_id=21713 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「草十郎、蒼崎の部屋は？」"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro, where's Aozaki's room?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:847:21714: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP4START_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:847
msgctxt "text_id=21714 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「東館の二階の突き当たりだ」"
msgstr "\"East wing, second floor, end of the hall.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:899:21715: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:899
msgctxt "text_id=21715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんの先導で、わたしたちは蒼崎の部屋に向かった。"
msgstr "  We followed Ritsuka to Aozaki's bedroom."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:904:21716: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:904
msgctxt "text_id=21716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は苦虫をかみつぶしたような顔で付いてくる。"
msgstr "  Our suspect tagged along, pouting and sulking."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:914:21717: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:914
msgctxt "text_id=21717 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「ドアを開けるわ」"
msgstr "\"I'm going in.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:919:21718: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:919
msgctxt "text_id=21718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんがドアを開ける。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka opened the door."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:978:21719: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:978
msgctxt "text_id=21719 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　暗い廊下から、暗い室内へ。"
msgstr "  We moved from the dark corridor to the equally dim bedroom."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:983:21720: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:983
msgctxt "text_id=21720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしたちが蒼崎の部屋に入ると、そこには"
msgstr "  When I entered, I was greeted by the sight of a"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1088:21721: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1088
msgctxt "text_id=21721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　同性のわたしでさえ、一目で綺麗だと見惚れる美人が、"
msgstr "  a woman beautiful enough to make me question my sexuality,"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1094:21722: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1094
msgctxt "text_id=21722 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　片手にマイク、"
msgstr "  clutching a microphone in one hand,"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1100:21723: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1100
msgctxt "text_id=21723 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かたわらに一升瓶を抱えたまま、"
msgstr "  cradling a huge bottle of liquor in the other,"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1106:21724: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1106
msgctxt "text_id=21724 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　満足そうな顔で永眠していた。"
msgstr "  taking a satisfied, eternal slumber."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1126:21725: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1126
msgctxt "text_id=21725 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　くわえて、"
msgstr "  And the walls..."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1168:21726: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1168
msgctxt "text_id=21726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　部屋には一面、ヘンなポスターが貼られていた。"
msgstr "  ...were plastered with bizarre posters."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1192:21727: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1192
msgctxt "text_id=21727 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「きゅ、急性アルコール中毒……！」"
msgstr "\"A-Alcohol poisoning?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1201:21728: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0009; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1201
msgctxt "text_id=21728 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「これが動かぬ証拠よ。アコちゃん、いくらトコちゃんが邪魔だからって、こんな、恥ずかしい姿のまま放置しておくなんて……！"
msgstr "\"This is the irrefutable evidence, Ako! I know you and Toko don't get along, but how could you leave her like this?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1213:21729: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0010_0; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1213
msgctxt "text_id=21729 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　トコちゃん、“私はプログレ派だー”なんて言ってたけど、ホントは演歌好きだったのね……"
msgstr "  Toko, you always said you liked prog rock, but really you just liked enka oldies..."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1226:21730: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0010_1; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1226
msgctxt "text_id=21730 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "しかも、マイマイクまで持っちゃって……」"
msgstr " You even brought your own microphone...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1253:21731: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1253
msgctxt "text_id=21731 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ああ、身内の恥すぎる……だから見せたくなかったのに！」"
msgstr "\"Gah! My family's so embarrassing... I didn't want anyone to see this!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1259:21732: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1259
msgctxt "text_id=21732 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　身もだえする蒼崎。"
msgstr "  Aozaki was squirming up a storm."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1264:21733: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1264
msgctxt "text_id=21733 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし。どんな理由であれ、彼女が犠牲者を<隠蔽|いんぺい>していたのは事実である。"
msgstr "  However, this didn't change the fact that she concealed a victim."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1306:21734: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP4START_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1306
msgctxt "text_id=21734 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そっか……思い返してみれば、蒼崎は自分の部屋に誰も寄りつかないよう動いていたんだ。"
msgstr "\"Now that I think about it, you seemed to be working hard to make sure no one came near your room."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1318:21735: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP4START_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1318
msgctxt "text_id=21735 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　この人の死体が見つかったら、色々と不便だから」"
msgstr "  It wouldn't look good if anyone found the body, right?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1344:21736: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1344
msgctxt "text_id=21736 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「違う、違うってば！　私も被害者なんだって！"
msgstr "\"No, that's not how it is! I'm the victim here!"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1350:21737: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1350
msgctxt "text_id=21737 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　昼過ぎに部屋に戻ってみたら、姉貴がいきなり死んでるんだもん！　そりゃ隠すでしょ、フツー！」"
msgstr "  After lunch, I came here and my sister was dead! Who wouldn't hide that fact?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1395:21738: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1395
msgctxt "text_id=21738 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……残念だが、蒼崎。おまえさんの弁明はもう遅い。"
msgstr "\"Sorry, Aozaki, but it's too late for excuses."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1407:21739: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1407
msgctxt "text_id=21739 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　それならどうして十三人目がいるかいないかを話しあっている時、姉貴の事を話さなかったんだ？」"
msgstr "  Why didn't you tell everyone about this when we were discussing the thirteenth guest?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1433:21740: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1433
msgctxt "text_id=21740 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「だだ、だって、あの時に切り出しても、どうして黙っていたんだって追及されるじゃない？　詠梨と唯架さんからしてみれば、私を<弾劾|だんがい>する絶好の機会だし。"
msgstr "\"B-B-Because if I'd said something, I would've been grilled about why I hadn't said anything yet! It would've been the perfect opportunity for Eiri and Yuika to accuse me!"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1444:21741: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1444
msgctxt "text_id=21741 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それなら黙っていて、私の手で犯人を捕まえようって……」"
msgstr "  I figured if that was the case, then I'd just find the criminal myself...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1487:21742: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0011; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1487
msgctxt "text_id=21742 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「そうかしら。“十三人目”がいるって状態にしておけば、アコちゃんが自由に暗躍できるからじゃないの？"
msgstr "\"I don't buy it. You created the thirteenth guest narrative so you could operate behind the scenes."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1499:21743: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0012; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1499
msgctxt "text_id=21743 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　事実、トコちゃんを捜そうとしてベオくんも詠梨さんも唯ちゃんもリタイヤしちゃったんだし」"
msgstr "  The fact of the matter is that Beo, Eiri, and Yui all went down while searching for Toko.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1509:21744: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1509
msgctxt "text_id=21744 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「だから、それは詠梨たちが自滅しただけで、」"
msgstr "\"That wasn't me! They self-destructed!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1542:21745: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1542
msgctxt "text_id=21745 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「悪いな蒼崎。久遠寺の説明からすると、スイーツハーツとやらは“自分でも分からない”犯人だ。"
msgstr "\"Sorry, Aozaki. Kuonji said that Sweets Hearts doesn't know it's the culprit."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1554:21746: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1554
msgctxt "text_id=21746 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　こいつの正体を暴くには、動機より状況証拠を優先しないといけない」"
msgstr "  Until we expose its true form, we have to prioritize circumstantial evidence over motive.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1581:21747: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1581
msgctxt "text_id=21747 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「現状、もっとも“今までの犠牲者たち”を殺害できる可能性があったのは、おまえだ」"
msgstr "\"Right now, the one who could easily have killed all the victims is you.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1593:21748: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0013; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1593
msgctxt "text_id=21748 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「ええ。悲しいけど、これ推理なのよね……」"
msgstr "\"Yeah. It pains me to admit it, but that's deduction...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1613:21749: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1613
msgctxt "text_id=21749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司と律架さんが、蒼崎の両手を掴む。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji and Ritsuka grabbed her arms."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1621:21750: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1621
msgctxt "text_id=21750 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希もさりげなく手伝っていた。"
msgstr "  Sizuki casually helped."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1646:21751: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1646
msgctxt "text_id=21751 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ちょっ、どうするつもり！？"
msgstr "\"Hey, what do you think you're doing?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1660:21752: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1660
msgctxt "text_id=21752 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　まままさか、疑わしきは殺すってワケ！？」"
msgstr "  Y-you're just gonna kill me because you suspect me!?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1687:21753: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0014; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1687
msgctxt "text_id=21753 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「落ち着いて、<隔離|かくり>するだけよアコちゃん。"
msgstr "\"Calm down. We're just putting you under quarantine."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1699:21754: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0015; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1699
msgctxt "text_id=21754 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　犯人と思わしき者は警察が来るまで閉じこめて、凶行をストップさせる……ミステリの常道ね。"
msgstr "  Lock up the suspect and wait for the police. End the madness. That's how mystery stories go."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1711:21755: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0016; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1711
msgctxt "text_id=21755 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　えーと、外から鍵をかけられる監獄っぽい部屋はあるかしら、アッちゃん？」"
msgstr "  So, um, is there a room that locks from the outside somewhere, Allie?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1753:21756: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP4START_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1753
msgctxt "text_id=21756 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「それなら地下室があるわ。雪山のペンションにありそうな、細い階段から直通の狭い部屋が。"
msgstr "\"Just the cellar. It's a pretty tiny room you get to via a narrow staircase."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1765:21757: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP4START_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1765
msgctxt "text_id=21757 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　青子にはそこで一晩あかしてもらいましょう」"
msgstr "  Aoko can spend the night there.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1789:21758: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1789
msgctxt "text_id=21758 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「スキー跡！"
msgstr "\"What is this, the South Pole?!"

msgctxt "text_id=21759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そのペンションの名前、スキー跡とか言わない有珠！？」"
msgstr "  Don't tell me this guest house is an Antarctic research station, Alice!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1820:21760: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0010; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1820
msgctxt "text_id=21760 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「蒼崎。おまえさんがスイーツハーツでないにしろ、そこに閉じこもっていれば安全だろ。これは最後の保険でもあるんだ、観念して生け贄になってくれ」"
msgstr "\"Even if you're not Sweets Hearts, Aozaki, it's safest if we lock you up. It provides us some final insurance. Think of it as taking one for the team.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1831:21761: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1831
msgctxt "text_id=21761 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「うっ……確かに、そういう理屈になるわね。"
msgstr "\"Ugh... Fine. I suppose you're right."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1842:21762: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1842
msgctxt "text_id=21762 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　民主主義的に、閉じこめられる隙を見せた私の負けってコトか……」"
msgstr "  I guess I opened myself up to pesky democracy...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1877:21763: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1877
msgctxt "text_id=21763 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう。本当はこの方法を真っ先にしてしまえば良かったんだ。"
msgstr "  Yeah. We should've locked her up from the start."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1882:21764: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1882
msgctxt "text_id=21764 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎がスイーツハーツなら、もうこれ以上、不意をついて笑わせられる犠牲者は出ない。"
msgstr "  If Aozaki really was Sweets Hearts, no one else would die from any sudden bouts of comedy."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1887:21765: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1887
msgctxt "text_id=21765 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎がスイーツハーツでないなら、彼女は最後まで生き残るのだから、それでこのゲームはクリアとなる。"
msgstr "  And if she wasn't, then he'd survive until the game was over."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1919:21766: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1919
msgctxt "text_id=21766 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けど、誰だって「おまえが犯人だ」と決めつけられて閉じこめられるのはイヤなものだ。"
msgstr "  Who wouldn't protest though, if they were labelled prime suspect?"

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1924:21767: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1924
msgctxt "text_id=21767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手を下す人間も気持ちが悪い。"
msgstr "  It felt awful to be the one handing down a verdict."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1929:21768: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1929
msgctxt "text_id=21768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この貧乏クジを引くのは、誰から見ても“有罪”な人間でなくてはならなかった。"
msgstr "  One of us had to unlucky enough to take the fall."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1961:21769: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1961
msgctxt "text_id=21769 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でも、これだけは言っておくわ。"
msgstr "\"Just let me say this."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1967:21770: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0023; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1967
msgctxt "text_id=21770 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　相手はとんでもないキレ者よ。もしかしたら本当に姿のない十三人目はいるかもしれない。最後まで気を抜かないで」"
msgstr "  Your opponent's smart. The thirteenth person may not have a form. Don't let your guard down.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:2002:21771: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:2002
msgctxt "text_id=21771 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが蒼崎の最後の言葉になった。"
msgstr "  Those were Aozaki's last words."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:2007:21772: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:2007
msgctxt "text_id=21772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしたちは彼女を地下室に閉じこめ、外から南京錠で鍵をかけ、ようやく安心を手に入れたのである。"
msgstr "  After shutting her in the cellar and locking it from the outside with a padlock, we finally breathed a sigh of relief."

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:2013:21773: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:2013
msgctxt "text_id=21773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして、わたしは―――"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_R:8:21774: scene=WIK_SELECT_R
#: WIK_SELECT_R:8
msgctxt "text_id=21774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｒ～"
msgstr "-Decision R-"

#. Occurrence WIK_D_1:35:21775: scene=WIK_D_1
#: WIK_D_1:35
msgctxt "text_id=21775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんには申し訳ないけど、このまま雨脚は強くなる一方だろうな、と思った。"
msgstr "  I'm sorry, Ritsuka, but it looks like the rain's only going to get worse."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_2:36:21776: scene=WIK_D_2
#: WIK_D_2:36
msgctxt "text_id=21776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんには申し訳ないけど、このまま雨は雹になるな、と思った。"
msgstr "  I'm sorry, Ritsuka, but it looks like the rain might turn to hail."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:36:21777: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:36
msgctxt "text_id=21777 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、このまま帰ってしまおうか、と思った。"
msgstr "  Maybe I should just go home."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:62:21778: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_3_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:62
msgctxt "text_id=21778 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「天気予報はずっとお日様マークだったのに。"
msgstr "\"The weather forecast said it'd be sunny..."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:73:21779: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_3_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:73
msgctxt "text_id=21779 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　……んー、本降りになったら帰りはタイヘンかも。ほら、山の中程までしかあがってこないでしょ、タクシー」"
msgstr "  Hmm. If this gets any worse, it might be hard to get home. Most taxis are only willing to drive halfway up the mountain.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:106:21780: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:106
msgctxt "text_id=21780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんの言う通りだ。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka was right."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:111:21781: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:111
msgctxt "text_id=21781 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本格的に降り出したら、帰りは濡れるのを覚悟しないといけない。"
msgstr "  If you really wanted to go home, you'd have to be ready to be soaked to the bone."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:116:21782: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:116
msgctxt "text_id=21782 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二年以上ここから学校に通っていた蒼崎のタフさに、今更ながら感心するような、呆れるような。"
msgstr "  Thinking about it, I couldn't believe Aozaki stuck out the commute to and from school for over two years. I was impressed."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:153:21783: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_3_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:153
msgctxt "text_id=21783 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「あれ？　どうしたの金鹿ちゃん？"
msgstr "\"Huh? What's up, Kojika?"

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:159:21784: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_3_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:159
msgctxt "text_id=21784 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　みんな居間にいるんじゃないの？」"
msgstr "  Isn't everyone in the drawing room?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:170:21785: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_3_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:170
msgctxt "text_id=21785 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「いえ、部屋に忘れ物があるんです。"
msgstr "\"I just forgot something in my room."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:181:21786: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_3_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:181
msgctxt "text_id=21786 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　みなさん、先に行っていてください」"
msgstr "  You guys can go on ahead.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:303:21787: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:303
msgctxt "text_id=21787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　客室からボストンバッグを回収して、ロビーに戻る。"
msgstr "  I retrieved my overnight bag from the guest room and returned to the foyer."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:308:21788: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:308
msgctxt "text_id=21788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間からは律架さんたちの笑い声が聞こえてくる。"
msgstr "  I could hear Ritsuka and the others laughing in the drawing room."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:313:21789: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:313
msgctxt "text_id=21789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは賑わいに後ろ髪を引かれながらも、久遠寺邸を後にした。"
msgstr "  Reluctantly, I left the Kuonji Estate."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:361:21790: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:361
msgctxt "text_id=21790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうして帰る気になったのか、自分でもいまいち不明。"
msgstr "  I'm not exactly sure why I wanted to go home."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:366:21791: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:366
msgctxt "text_id=21791 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館の雰囲気に気圧されたとか、"
msgstr "  Maybe I felt overwhelmed by the mansion."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:371:21792: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:371
msgctxt "text_id=21792 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やっぱり柄じゃないとか、"
msgstr "  Maybe it just wasn't my scene."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:376:21793: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:376
msgctxt "text_id=21793 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司がいたコトとか、たぶん、いろいろ合わさって面倒くさくなったのだ。"
msgstr "  Or maybe... it was because Tsukiji was there. It was probably a combination of all three."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:409:21794: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:409
msgctxt "text_id=21794 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もうじき日も沈む。"
msgstr "  The sun was nearly below the horizon."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:414:21795: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:414
msgctxt "text_id=21795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜になる前に帰れば、何事もなく今日は終わるだろう。"
msgstr "  If I could just get home before dark, I could end the day without incident."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:419:21796: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:419
msgctxt "text_id=21796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　念願の大学受験を前にして、槻司と顔を合わせるのはいろいろブレそうで怖いし。"
msgstr "  I wasn't ready to face Tsukiji, with entrance exams around the corner."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:424:21797: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:424
msgctxt "text_id=21797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これでいいんだ、と自分に言い聞かせて、わたしは白犬塚を下りていく。"
msgstr "  Walking down Shiroinuzuka, I told myself this was for the best."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:486:21798: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:486
msgctxt "text_id=21798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――そんな時。"
msgstr "  But then..."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:491:21799: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:491
msgctxt "text_id=21799 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはふと、子供たちに伝わっていた伝説を、もう一つだけ思い出した。"
msgstr "  ...I suddenly recalled another urban legend."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:515:21800: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:515
msgctxt "text_id=21800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　『<逢魔|おうま>が<時|とき>にひとりで山を下りると、"
msgstr "          \"Descend the mountain alone in the witching hour"

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:520:21801: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:520
msgctxt "text_id=21801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　　　　　人食い鬼が待っている』"
msgstr "            and a cannibal will be waiting for you at the bottom.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:540:21802: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:540
msgctxt "text_id=21802 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺邸が建つ前からもっと昔、この山には鬼が隠れ住んでいて、ひとりきりで輪から外れようとする人間を襲って殺す鬼がいた。"
msgstr "  Long before the Kuonji Estate was built, this mountain was home to a monster who attacked and killed anyone foolish enough to stray too far from their group."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:545:21803: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:545
msgctxt "text_id=21803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　襲って食べる、というのではなく、殺す、というのが人間的で生々しい。"
msgstr "  The words \"attacked and killed\" make it sound more humane than \"ate.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:550:21804: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:550
msgctxt "text_id=21804 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　村社会のしきたりから外れた人間を村ぐるみで闇に葬った、なんて解釈もできる。"
msgstr "  It was probably someone who was cast out of their village."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:555:21805: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:555
msgctxt "text_id=21805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな、暗い妄想に<耽|ふけ>っていると、"
msgstr "  Wow, these are some dark thoughts I'm h―"

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:605:21806: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_3_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:605
msgctxt "text_id=21806 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あれ？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:611:21807: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:611
msgctxt "text_id=21807 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　道を間違えたのだろうか。"
msgstr "  I must have taken a wrong turn."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:616:21808: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:616
msgctxt "text_id=21808 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは久遠寺邸の裏側に出てしまった。"
msgstr "  I was back behind the Kuonji Estate."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:637:21809: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_3_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:637
msgctxt "text_id=21809 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「おかしいな……ちゃんと下に向かってたわよね、わたし」"
msgstr "\"That's weird... I'm sure I was heading down the hill.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:643:21810: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:643
msgctxt "text_id=21810 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不安をごまかすように独り言をもらす。"
msgstr "  I thought out loud to try and ease my tension. "

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:665:21811: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:665
msgctxt "text_id=21811 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と。"
msgstr "  Wait, what was that?"

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:670:21812: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:670
msgctxt "text_id=21812 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　木の陰に、何か、人間ほどの影があった。"
msgstr "  A shadow in the shade of the trees. It looked human."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:705:21813: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_3_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:705
msgctxt "text_id=21813 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「誰……？」"
msgstr "\"Is someone there?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:711:21814: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:711
msgctxt "text_id=21814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　声をかける。"
msgstr "  My voice rang out."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:717:21815: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:717
msgctxt "text_id=21815 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "返事はない。"
msgstr "No response."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:723:21816: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:723
msgctxt "text_id=21816 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "空は暗い。"
msgstr "It was getting dark out."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:729:21817: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:729
msgctxt "text_id=21817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "風は吹かない。"
msgstr "There wasn't even a breeze."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:734:21818: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:734
msgctxt "text_id=21818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　帰ろうと思った本当の理由が頭をよぎる。"
msgstr "  Now I remembered why I wanted to go home."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:739:21819: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:739
msgctxt "text_id=21819 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、そうだ。"
msgstr "  Yeah."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:744:21820: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:744
msgctxt "text_id=21820 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このまま洋館にいたら、何か、よくない事が起きそうだと感じたから―――"
msgstr "  I had a feeling that something bad would happening if I stayed―"

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:796:21821: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_3_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:796
msgctxt "text_id=21821 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あ―――」"
msgstr "\"Ah...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:819:21822: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:819
msgctxt "text_id=21822 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ありえない光景を直視した。"
msgstr "  Something... impossible unfolded before my eyes."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:824:21823: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:824
msgctxt "text_id=21823 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　お腹がひとりでにへこむような衝撃。"
msgstr "  I felt a sudden shock in my stomach."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:829:21824: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:829
msgctxt "text_id=21824 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　反射的に口に手を当てたけれど、間に合わなかった。"
msgstr "  Reflexively, I brought my hand to my mouth. Too late."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:885:21825: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:885
msgctxt "text_id=21825 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……地面に倒れる。"
msgstr "  I fell to the ground."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:893:21826: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:893
msgctxt "text_id=21826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　全身の<血|ねつ>が、力が流れていく。"
msgstr "  Warm blood flowed out of me, along with my strength."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:898:21827: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:898
msgctxt "text_id=21827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　助けを呼ぶ手も、むなしく空を切る。"
msgstr "  My hands helplessly reached to the sky for help."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:903:21828: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:903
msgctxt "text_id=21828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは最後の力を振り絞って、目の前の人影を視界に収める。"
msgstr "  It took the last of my strength, but I managed to catch sight of the shadow."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:934:21829: voice_id=X00_WIK_D_3_0000; voice_prefix=X00; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:934
msgctxt "text_id=21829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『……ダメジャナイカ。始マル前カラ、終ワルナンテ』"
msgstr "\"NOw, tHat WoN't dO. DoN'T fiNiSh ThIs BEfoRE WE'Ve EVen STARteD.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:982:21830: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:982
msgctxt "text_id=21830 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　振り下ろされる鉈状のナニカ。"
msgstr "  Something axe-shaped came swinging down."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:987:21831: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:987
msgctxt "text_id=21831 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鬼の<面|かお>をした誰かが、死にいくわたしにそう言った。"
msgstr "  The last words I ever heard came from someone with the face of a monster."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:41:21832: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:41
msgctxt "text_id=21832 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「さむっ。ここ、外より寒くない？」"
msgstr "\"Brrr. It feels colder here than it does outside.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:52:21833: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:52
msgctxt "text_id=21833 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ですね。居間に移動しましょう」"
msgstr "\"Yeah. Let's move to the drawing room.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:63:21834: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:63
msgctxt "text_id=21834 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「賛成だけど…"
msgstr "\"I agree, but..."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:76:21835: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:76
msgctxt "text_id=21835 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "…ま、草十郎さんには草十郎さんの仕事があるんでしょうしね。待っててあげようと思ったけど、余計な気遣いかも」"
msgstr "Ah well, Soujyuro's business is Soujyuro's business. I was going to wait for him, but there's probably no need.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:102:21836: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_A_9000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:102
msgctxt "text_id=21836 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「？　静希、外にいたんですか？」"
msgstr "\"Sizuki was outside?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:114:21837: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:114
msgctxt "text_id=21837 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「ええ。山道の方で草を刈っていたわ。すごい勢いで、ヘリポートでも造るかっていうぐらい」"
msgstr "\"Yeah, cutting the grass near the road. He was going at it hard, like he's expecting royalty.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:140:21838: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_A_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:140
msgctxt "text_id=21838 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:145:21839: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:145
msgctxt "text_id=21839 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　相変わらず、謎の行動力である。"
msgstr "  I could never figure out what made that guy tick."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:150:21840: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:150
msgctxt "text_id=21840 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希の奇行を追及しても疲れるだけだ。"
msgstr "  It was too tiring to even try."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:155:21841: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:155
msgctxt "text_id=21841 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしたちは暖を求めて居間に移動した。"
msgstr "  We moved to the drawing room in search of warmth."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:239:21842: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:239
msgctxt "text_id=21842 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　降り出した雨は、一向に止む気配を見せない。"
msgstr "  The rain showed no sign of stopping."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:244:21843: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:244
msgctxt "text_id=21843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　むしろ勢いは増すばかりで、日没前だというのに外は夜並みの暗さになっていた。"
msgstr "  In fact, it seemed to be getting stronger. The sun hadn't set yet, but it was already as dark as night outside."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:264:21844: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:264
msgctxt "text_id=21844 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　パーティーはまだ始まらない。"
msgstr "  The party had yet to begin."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:269:21845: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:269
msgctxt "text_id=21845 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間とサンルームを見渡すと、"
msgstr "  Looking over the drawing room and the sunroom,"

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:319:21846: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:319
msgctxt "text_id=21846 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これだけの人数が談話にふけっていた。"
msgstr "  I saw everyone engaged in conversation."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:350:21847: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:350
msgctxt "text_id=21847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間では芳助が持ちこんできたカードゲームが思いの外盛り上がっている。"
msgstr "  The card game Housuke brought had caused a stir in the drawing room."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:381:21848: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:381
msgctxt "text_id=21848 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おもに、いがみ合う方向で。"
msgstr "  It was getting competitive, mainly."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:401:21849: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:401
msgctxt "text_id=21849 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんでも『<傀儡|かいらい>さんが<徹|トゥー>る』という、ドイツ製の、ファンタジー版ゼネコンシミュレーションゲームなのだそうだ。"
msgstr "  Apparently they were playing a fantasy-themed construction game from Germany, called Puppet Pass."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:406:21850: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:406
msgctxt "text_id=21850 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　基本、いかに相手の足を引っ張るかというゲームなので、みな愛想笑いをしながら内心ではまったく笑えず、騙し討ちの機会を狙っている。"
msgstr "  It was basically the kind of game where players try to sabotage their opponents, so everyone was putting on forced smiles while they schemed against each other."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:427:21851: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:427
msgctxt "text_id=21851 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、サンルームの大人組はワインなどを片手に、そんな学生たちの様子を眺めている。"
msgstr "  In contrast, the older people in the sunroom were drinking wine and watching the students intently."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:453:21852: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_D_A_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:453
msgctxt "text_id=21852 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「驚きましたね。誕生会が始まるまで、館内は自由に歩いていい決まりだとは。有珠さん、どんな心境の変化ですか？」"
msgstr "\"I'm surprised you're allowing people to roam around before the birthday party, Alice. Had a change of heart?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:474:21853: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_D_A_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:474
msgctxt "text_id=21853 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……別に。入られたら困るところは、そもそも壁に変えたから。今日だけの変更だけど、それなら遭難者もでないでしょう」"
msgstr "\"...Not particularly. I made walls where I didn't want people to go. It's only for today, so no one should get lost.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:508:21854: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_D_A_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:508
msgctxt "text_id=21854 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「？　壁に変えたってなにをー？"
msgstr "\"You made walls? From what?"

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:521:21855: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_D_A_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:521
msgctxt "text_id=21855 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　それに遭難者とか、有珠ちゃんったら大げさなんだから～。そりゃでけえ屋敷だけど、迷子になんかなりませんよ？」"
msgstr "And what do you mean about people getting lost? I know the mansion's big, but it's not that big.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:561:21856: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:561
msgctxt "text_id=21856 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「私たちの客室も用意してくれたのね。夜になったら帰る予定だけど、心遣いは助かっちゃうな～♪"
msgstr "\"Thank you for preparing guest rooms for us, by the way. I plan to leave this evening, but I appreciate the gesture!"

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:572:21857: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:572
msgctxt "text_id=21857 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　唯ちゃん、せっかくだし服、着替えてこない？"
msgstr "  Since we're here, Yui, why don't you go change?"

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:583:21858: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:583
msgctxt "text_id=21858 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　お姉さんのチャイナドレスとか貸してあげるから。さすがにパーティー会場にシスターはどうかと思うし」"
msgstr "  I'll lend you my qipao. Even a nun shouldn't attend a party in her habit.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:614:21859: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_D_A_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:614
msgctxt "text_id=21859 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「結構です。魔女の家で礼装を脱ぐなど自殺行為。私は貴女のように、遊びに来ている訳ではありませんので」"
msgstr "\"I'm fine, thank you. Taking off my Mystic Code in a witch's house would be tantamount to suicide. Unlike you, I'm not here for fun.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:639:21860: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_D_A_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:639
msgctxt "text_id=21860 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いや、遊びに来てるんですけどねぇ。私ですら手ぶらで来ているのに、シスター唯架ときたら……。"
msgstr "\"We *are* here for fun, actually. Even I came unarmed, but Sister Yuika insisted..."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:651:21861: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_D_A_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:651
msgctxt "text_id=21861 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　どうしてこう、いつでも臨戦状態、よらば切る出刃包丁みたいな性格になったんだか」"
msgstr "  Why do you always have to be so on edge, like you're ready to fight at a moment's notice?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:665:21862: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_D_A_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:665
msgctxt "text_id=21862 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「貴方たち二人が不真面目な分、私が引き締めなくてはいけないだけですっ」"
msgstr "\"Someone has to be serious out of the three of us.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:734:21863: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:734
msgctxt "text_id=21863 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時刻は六時になった。"
msgstr "  The clock struck six."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:739:21864: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:739
msgctxt "text_id=21864 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外はもう完全に夜。"
msgstr "  Outside, it was completely dark."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:744:21865: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:744
msgctxt "text_id=21865 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山城先生や教会組がいるから、帰りの夜道は安全だろうけど、それでもこの雨脚には不安をあおられる。"
msgstr "  With Mr. Yamasiro and the church staff here, it would probably be safe to go home tonight, but the rain gave me pause."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:801:21866: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_D_A_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:801
msgctxt "text_id=21866 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……そろそろ支度をするべきではないかしら。"
msgstr "\"...I think it's about time we got ready."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:814:21867: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_D_A_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:814
msgctxt "text_id=21867 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　トッキィーはどこに？」"
msgstr "  Has anyone seen Tokie?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:820:21868: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:820
msgctxt "text_id=21868 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何度目かのカードゲームを終えて、ふと、久遠寺さんが妙なコトを口にした。"
msgstr "  Miss Kuonji declared the end to the card games with an unexpected question."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:845:21869: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_A_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:845
msgctxt "text_id=21869 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「トッキィー？　トッキィーって、誰？」"
msgstr "\"Tokie? Who's Tokie?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:856:21870: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_D_A_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:856
msgctxt "text_id=21870 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「誰って、土桔の爺さんだろ。あれ……？"
msgstr "\"You mean Mr. Tokitsu? He's... huh?"

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:869:21871: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_D_A_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:869
msgctxt "text_id=21871 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　もしかして金鹿、爺さんに挨拶してねえの？」"
msgstr "  Wait, Kojika, you haven't spoken to the old man yet?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:881:21872: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_A_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:881
msgctxt "text_id=21872 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「知らない。まだこの家に人がいるの？　……いまさらだけど、全部で何人の予定なの、このパーティー」"
msgstr "\"What old man? Are there even more people coming? How many guests are going to be at this party, anyway?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:908:21873: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_D_A_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:908
msgctxt "text_id=21873 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「わたし、青子、静希君、槻司君、木乃美君、久万梨さん、トッキィー、その他、で合計十三人。"
msgstr "\"Me, Aoko, Sizuki, Tsukiji, Kinomi, you, Tokie, and a few others. Thirteen in all."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:914:21874: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_D_A_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:914
msgctxt "text_id=21874 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　さっきから一堂には揃わないみたいだけど」"
msgstr "  We haven't been able to get everyone in the same room yet, though.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:926:21875: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_A_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:926
msgctxt "text_id=21875 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「十三人か」"
msgstr "\"Thirteen...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:931:21876: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:931
msgctxt "text_id=21876 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ひと、ふた、みー、と数えてみる。"
msgstr "  One, two, three..."

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:936:21877: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:936
msgctxt "text_id=21877 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今までの情報から数えてみると……"
msgstr "  I counted the people in the room."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_E:8:21878: scene=WIK_SELECT_E
#: WIK_SELECT_E:8
msgctxt "text_id=21878 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｅ～"
msgstr "-Decision E-"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:38:21879: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:38
msgctxt "text_id=21879 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その時、"
msgstr "  Just then..."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:66:21880: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:66
msgctxt "text_id=21880 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「？」"
msgstr "\"...?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:112:21881: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:112
msgctxt "text_id=21881 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外から異様な風切り音が聞こえてきた。"
msgstr "  I heard a strange sound outside, like something cutting through the wind."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:168:21882: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:168
msgctxt "text_id=21882 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館の壁をたたき付けるような爆音。"
msgstr "  It grew into a lour roar that seemed to pound the very walls of the building."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:237:21883: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:237
msgctxt "text_id=21883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それに、誰もが意識を取られている中、"
msgstr "  While we were all distracted by that..."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:338:21884: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:338
msgctxt "text_id=21884 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「このメルヘン女、アタシをのけ者とかザケてんの！？"
msgstr "\"You've got some nerve to exclude me, you little nursery rhyme girl!"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:344:21885: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:344
msgctxt "text_id=21885 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　こんなボンクラどもはホイホイ呼んで、大本命かつ大人気、この超☆英国美少女であるリデル様を、なんで、アンタの誕生会に呼ばないのよっ！！！！」"
msgstr "  You call these dimwits to your birthday party, but not everybody's favorite English beauty, May Riddell Archelot?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:350:21886: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:350
msgctxt "text_id=21886 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外の雨より何倍もやかましい、"
msgstr "  The girl who arrived was several times louder than the storm."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:355:21887: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:355
msgctxt "text_id=21887 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　嵐の化身みたいな女がやって来た。"
msgstr "  Maybe she *was* the storm."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:396:21888: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:396
msgctxt "text_id=21888 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「リデル！？　おまえ、今日は<余所|よそ>でイベントだったじゃねえか。どうやってここに来やがった！？」"
msgstr "\"Riddell?! I thought you had other plans! How the hell did you even get here?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:408:21889: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:408
msgctxt "text_id=21889 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「ふん、決まってるじゃない。ヘリを飛ばして、よ。"
msgstr "\"By helicopter, *obviously*."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:414:21890: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0003; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:414
msgctxt "text_id=21890 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　覚えておきなさいトビマル。アンタたちみたいな端役と違って、アタシに不可能なんてないの。ちょっと一声かければ、地球の裏側からだってミサイル飛ばせるんだから」"
msgstr "  Remember this well, Tobimaru: Unlike you 'extras,' *nothing* is impossible for me. With a snap of my fingers, I can send missiles flying from the other side of the Earth.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:425:21891: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:425
msgctxt "text_id=21891 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いや、ミサイル飛ばされてもな」"
msgstr "\"Well, don't do that.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:459:21892: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:459
msgctxt "text_id=21892 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ピンク色で統一された女は、わたしや芳助には視線も投げず久遠寺さんへと歩み寄る。"
msgstr "  Without so much as a glance in our direction, the girl walked right up to Miss Kuonji. She was dressed in pink from head to toe."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:464:21893: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:464
msgctxt "text_id=21893 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これみよがしにツカツカと響くブーツの音。挑発的な軍靴のようだ。"
msgstr "  It was more accurate to call it a strut than a walk. Her boots made an aggressive clacking sound as they struck the ground."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:505:21894: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0004; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:505
msgctxt "text_id=21894 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「ほら、忙しくて引く手<数多|あまた>、史上初の億超えウィッチ、自他共に認める協会ナンバーワンのアイドルが、わざわざ専用機<飛|と>ばしてまで来てやったわよ？"
msgstr "\"The Association's crème de la crème, adored by countless admirers, the first witch star in history to pass a hundred million fans has taken time out of her busy schedule to come here for you."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:518:21895: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0005; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:518
msgctxt "text_id=21895 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　悔しい？　悔しいでしょ？　夢にも思わなかったぐらいサプライズでしょ？　いいわ、遠慮なく喜びなさい」"
msgstr "  How does that feel? You must feel so *terrible*. But such a wonderful surprise beyond your wildest dreams, no doubt. Go ahead, weep with joy.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:551:21896: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:551
msgctxt "text_id=21896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……すごい。"
msgstr "  Wow..."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:556:21897: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:556
msgctxt "text_id=21897 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの無表情な久遠寺さんが心底うんざりしている場面に出くわすとか、たしかに夢にも思わなかった。"
msgstr "  I never thought I'd see the day Miss Kuonji's stoicism replaced with pure irritation."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:583:21898: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:583
msgctxt "text_id=21898 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ピンク女はげんなりする久遠寺さんを見下ろし、満足そうに頷いて、ようやく周囲を見渡した。"
msgstr "  The girl in pink nodded smugly down at Miss Kuonji, before finally noticing the rest of us."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:608:21899: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0006; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:608
msgctxt "text_id=21899 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「バッド。なにこのトンチキな面子。せっかくの誕生会だってのに、人選どうなってるの？　親の仇まで呼んじゃって、アンタ、そこまで病んじゃった？"
msgstr "\"Atrocious. Who are these nobodies? I thought this was a birthday party! You have terrible taste in company. Are you really so sick in the head as to call your parents' enemies here?"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:620:21900: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0007; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:620
msgctxt "text_id=21900 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　ほら、そこの神父。とりあえず私たちにドゥゲザした<後|あと>、全裸になってチキン食べながら切腹してくれない？」"
msgstr "  Hey you! Priest boy! Why don't you kiss our feet, strip, eat chicken, and then hang yourself?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:645:21901: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:645
msgctxt "text_id=21901 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「はははは。貴女にだけは言われたくありませんねぇ。"
msgstr "\"Hahaha. You are the absolute last person I want to hear that from."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:656:21902: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:656
msgctxt "text_id=21902 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　有珠さんに謝罪というのなら、まず貴女がするべきではないですか？　奪ったものは、きちんと本人に返さなければねぇ」"
msgstr "  Perhaps you're the one who should be apologizing to Alice. When you steal something, it's only right to return it to the proper owner.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:683:21903: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0008; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:683
msgctxt "text_id=21903 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「アタシはいいのよ、ちゃんと後でお金払ったし！"
msgstr "\"I'll have you know I paid her back in full, thank you!"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:696:21904: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0009_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:696
msgctxt "text_id=21904 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　アリスだってキャッシュで受け取ったんだし、アレはもうアタシのモノっ！"
msgstr "  Alice accepted the money, so it's mine now, fair and square!"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:710:21905: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0009_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:710
msgctxt "text_id=21905 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　外野がいちいち口はさんでんじゃないわよ」"
msgstr " Mind your own business!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:721:21906: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:721
msgctxt "text_id=21906 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「なんと。有珠さんが、貴重なプロイを売却するとは」"
msgstr "\"Oh my. Alice sold one of her precious Ploys?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:746:21907: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:746
msgctxt "text_id=21907 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……はあ。お金で解決できる問題じゃないと何度も言ったのだけど。この子、資本主義の犬だから。どう言っても返してくれないの」"
msgstr "\"...Haah. I told her over and over that it wasn't up for sale, but she's a materialistic dog, so she never returned it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:758:21908: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0010; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:758
msgctxt "text_id=21908 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「またまた、照れ隠ししちゃって、この～♪"
msgstr "\"Oh, sweet Alice, still playing coy."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:775:21909: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0011; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:775
msgctxt "text_id=21909 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　アンタも取引上手よね、“お金では譲れない”とか言って巧みにレートをあげていくんだから」"
msgstr "  That was just a savvy sales tactic! Everyone knows 'not for sale' is just code for increasing the price!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:826:21910: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:826
msgctxt "text_id=21910 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「……なあ殿下。あのすげえ女、どっかで見覚えあんだけど。有珠ちゃんの知り合い？」"
msgstr "\"Hey, Your Highness. That girl's something else. I could swear I've seen her somewhere before. Is she a friend of Alice's?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:838:21911: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:838
msgctxt "text_id=21911 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「気のせいだ、忘れとけ。ありゃあ関わったら破滅する系の女だ。百害あって一利もねえ」"
msgstr "\"You're just imagining things. Forget about it. She's nothing but trouble. All harm, no good.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:850:21912: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:850
msgctxt "text_id=21912 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「そ、そうですよね。オレもあそこまでキラキラしている人は、ちょっと……」"
msgstr "\"Y-Yeah, you're right. I probably couldn't handle her...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:884:21913: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:884
msgctxt "text_id=21913 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司はああ言っているけど、わたしは知っている。"
msgstr "  Despite whatever Tsukiji was saying, I knew the truth."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:904:21914: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:904
msgctxt "text_id=21914 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女の名前はリデル。"
msgstr "  Her name was Riddell."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:909:21915: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:909
msgctxt "text_id=21915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一時期、槻司の家にホームステイしていた女の子だ。"
msgstr "  She stayed at Tsukiji's house for a time."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:914:21916: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:914
msgctxt "text_id=21916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司のお父さんとリデルのお父さん、企業間の付き合いでのコトらしい。"
msgstr "  Apparently, their fathers were business acquaintances."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:920:21917: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:920
msgctxt "text_id=21917 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……といっても槻司の屋敷は大きいので、一つ屋根の下、という話ではないだろうし、そう親しい仲ではない、と思いたい。"
msgstr "  Well, I say she stayed with him, but the Tsukiji estate was so large, they were basically in different houses... Or at least, I hope that was the case."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:960:21918: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:960
msgctxt "text_id=21918 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……一応、訊いてあげるけど。"
msgstr "\"I suppose I should ask―"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:966:21919: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:966
msgctxt "text_id=21919 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　リデル。貴女、何をしにきたの？」"
msgstr "  Riddell. What are you doing here?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:991:21920: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0012; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:991
msgctxt "text_id=21920 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「なにって、アンタの誕生会でしょ？"
msgstr "\"What do you mean, Alice? It's your birthday!"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:997:21921: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0013; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:997
msgctxt "text_id=21921 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　トビマルの家に電話したら、“坊ちゃんなら久遠寺さんの家の誕生会にでかけた”とか言っちゃってさ。"
msgstr "  When I called Tobimaru's house, they told me 'the young master is attending a birthday party at Miss Kuonji's house.'"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1009:21922: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0014; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1009
msgctxt "text_id=21922 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　もうカーッと<脳髄|あたま>ハイになっちゃって、ライブキャンセルして飛んできたってワケ」"
msgstr "  I couldn't let that slide, so I cancelled my concert at the last minute and flew here.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1030:21923: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1030
msgctxt "text_id=21923 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……貴女、わたしの誕生日、覚えている？」"
msgstr "\"...Do you even remember when my birthday is?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1042:21924: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0015; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1042
msgctxt "text_id=21924 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「あったりまえじゃない！　自分のは忘れてもアンタのだけは忘れな………"
msgstr "\"Of course I do! I could forget mine, but I could never forget your―"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1054:21925: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0016; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1054
msgctxt "text_id=21925 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　あれ？　まだ秋よね、この国？」"
msgstr "  Wait a second. It's still autumn here, isn't it?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1094:21926: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1094
msgctxt "text_id=21926 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「良かった、脳は<ま|・><だ|・>正常ねリデル。"
msgstr "\"Glad to see you haven't lost your mind completely."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1106:21927: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1106
msgctxt "text_id=21927 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　ほら。わたし、貴女の頭を叩きすぎたでしょう？"
msgstr "  I hit your head a little too hard last time, remember?"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1112:21928: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1112
msgctxt "text_id=21928 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　それで気の毒な結果を招いてしまったのかと、少しだけ心配してしまったわ」"
msgstr "  You had me ever so slightly worried that I might've caused you brain damage.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1142:21929: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0017; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1142
msgctxt "text_id=21929 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「ちょっとトビマル！　なにウソ言ってんのよ、今日はアリスの誕生日じゃないっての！」"
msgstr "\"Tobimaru, you liar! It's not Alice's birthday at all!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1180:21930: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_E_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1180
msgctxt "text_id=21930 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いや、でも招待状には確かに、久遠寺邸で誕生会をするから、ぜひ参加するように、とだな」"
msgstr "\"Wait, the invitation definitely mentioned a birthday party at the Kuonji Estate.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1191:21931: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1191
msgctxt "text_id=21931 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「そうそう。オレも会長から二千円と引き替えに招待状もらったよ？"
msgstr "\"Mine, too. Man, that invitation cost me a fortune. 2000 yen from the prez, can you believe it?"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1203:21932: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_E_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1203
msgctxt "text_id=21932 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　ところで、料金とられたのオレだけじゃないよね？」"
msgstr "Wait... I wasn't the only one who had to pay, was I?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1244:21933: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1244
msgctxt "text_id=21933 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「はははは。知らない方が幸せな話ってどこにでもあるんですねぇ。ああ、私も久遠寺邸で誕生会をする、と覚えてきましたが」"
msgstr "\"Hahahaha. Some things are better left unsaid. Though, I do recall something about a birthday party at the Kuonji Estate.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1256:21934: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1256
msgctxt "text_id=21934 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「でも、アッちゃんの誕生日じゃないのよね？」"
msgstr "\"But it's not Allie's birthday, right?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1302:21935: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1302
msgctxt "text_id=21935 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……なぜそんな勘違いを生んだのかしら。"
msgstr "\"...Looks like there's been a misunderstanding."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1314:21936: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1314
msgctxt "text_id=21936 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　たしかに誕生会だけど、わたしじゃなくてトッキィーの誕生会よ。"
msgstr "  Yes, we are here for a birthday party, but not mine. It's Tokie's."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1321:21937: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1321
msgctxt "text_id=21937 | speaker=alice"
msgid "彼、わたしに祝ってほしいというから、この屋敷を会場にしただけなのだけど」"
msgstr "He wanted me to celebrate his birthday, so I simply made this mansion the venue.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1384:21938: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1384
msgctxt "text_id=21938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは招待状を見直した。"
msgstr "  I reread the invitation."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1389:21939: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1389
msgctxt "text_id=21939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“久遠寺邸で誕生会を開くから、ぜひ参加してほしい”"
msgstr "\"You are cordially invited to a birthday party at the Kuonji Estate.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1394:21940: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1394
msgctxt "text_id=21940 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なるほど。"
msgstr "  Now I see."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1399:21941: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1399
msgctxt "text_id=21941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしかに、誰の誕生日とは書かれていない。"
msgstr "  It didn't say anything about whose party it was."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1457:21942: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1457
msgctxt "text_id=21942 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「やっほー。盛り上がっちゃって、何の騒ぎ？"
msgstr "\"Hey, everyone! What are we all getting so worked up about?"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1476:21943: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1476
msgctxt "text_id=21943 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……って、リデルリドル!?　アンタ、なんでここにいんのよ!?　ライブは!?　ねえ、いまＮＫホールでライブやってんじゃないの!?"
msgstr "  ...Wait, Riddell Riddle?! What're you doing here?! What about your concert at Tokyo Bay?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1482:21944: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1482
msgctxt "text_id=21944 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私、ビデオ録画してるんですけど!?」"
msgstr "  I even set the VCR to record it!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1497:21945: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0018; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1497
msgctxt "text_id=21945 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「サボタージュ。ランチのカレーが<辛|から>かったから」"
msgstr "\"It's been sabotaged. The curry I had for lunch today was too spicy.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1529:21946: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_E_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1529
msgctxt "text_id=21946 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そ、そんなバカな理由でコンサートをドタキャンするヤツがいるかーーーー！　音楽の神に謝れ！　ファンをなんだと思ってんのよアンタは!?」"
msgstr "\"What the hell kind of a reason is that?! Apologize to the god of music, right now! What about your fans?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1555:21947: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0019; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1555
msgctxt "text_id=21947 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「チッ、やっぱりコイツマジうざい。"
msgstr "\"Ugh, it's always yap, yap, yap with you."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1566:21948: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0020; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1566
msgctxt "text_id=21948 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　だいたいアタシ、音楽とかどうでもいいし。ファンなんてアタシに貢ぐだけの働きアリだし。ライブがハネた後はいつも空しくなってリスカするし。"
msgstr "  I don't care about music or any of that crap. Fans support me financially. That's it. I always end up feeling all emo after concerts, anyway. That's when the razor blades come out."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1577:21949: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0021; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1577
msgctxt "text_id=21949 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　スポットライトは当たっても、ホントのアタシは誰も見てくれないし」"
msgstr "  Even when I'm in the spotlight, no one really sees the real me.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1597:21950: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1597
msgctxt "text_id=21950 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ピンク女の空気が突如、一変する。"
msgstr "  Whoa. That took a dark turn."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1646:21951: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1646
msgctxt "text_id=21951 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぶつぶつと呟く彼女の肩に、チチチ、と可愛らしく鳴く青い駒鳥が降り立った。"
msgstr "  Chirping sweetly, a blue robin landed on the girl's shoulder."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1669:21952: voice_id=BA0_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1669
msgctxt "text_id=21952 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『ハハハ、さすがリデルさん、感情のオンオフ激しいっスね！　ホントのアタシを見てー、とか、メルヘン全開で恥ずかしくないッスか？　恥ずかしくないんスよね。スゲー、やっぱリデルさん、魔術師よりアイドル向けッス！』"
msgstr "\"Hahaha! Nothing ever rifle ranges with ye, May! Yer emotions are all over the place! You come into the room like ye own the place and then complain about no one seeing the real you! Come on! You're definitely more a mangle and wringer than a mage!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1696:21953: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0022; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1696
msgctxt "text_id=21953 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「そうよ、悪い。どうせアタシは報われない、自分を主役と勘違いしている乞食みたいな最下層の生き物なのよ。道化なのよ。"
msgstr "\"I know. Sorry. I'm just tired of never seeing my efforts pay off. I go around thinking I'm the best of the best, when really I'm the lowest of the low. Just a dumb clown."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1709:21954: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0023; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1709
msgctxt "text_id=21954 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "わかってるからほっといてよロビン。後できっちり細切れにして、犬に食わせてあげるから」"
msgstr "I know already, so leave it alone, Robin. Or I'll chop you up and feed you to a dog later.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1715:21955: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1715
msgctxt "text_id=21955 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……なんか、鳥と話しているし。"
msgstr "  Our newest guest... was talking to a bird."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1720:21956: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1720
msgctxt "text_id=21956 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本格的に電波だったんだ、あのアイドル。"
msgstr "  She really was one of those crazy pop stars you hear about in the tabloids."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1764:21957: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1764
msgctxt "text_id=21957 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「なるほど、<土桔|ときつ>さんの誕生会でしたか。"
msgstr "\"So it's Mr. Tokitsu's birthday party."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1770:21958: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1770
msgctxt "text_id=21958 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　私たちもどうして呼ばれたのか半信半疑でしたが、それなら合点がいきます。"
msgstr "  We wondered why we'd been invited, but now I understand."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1782:21959: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1782
msgctxt "text_id=21959 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　シスター唯架なんて、これは罠だから完全武装で行くべきです、とか言いだす始末ですし」"
msgstr "  Sister Yuika even suggested we come fully armed, because she thought it was a trap.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1809:21960: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1809
msgctxt "text_id=21960 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「……コホン。"
msgstr "\"...Ahem."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1821:21961: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1821
msgctxt "text_id=21961 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　しかし久遠寺さん、肝心の土桔<由里彦|ゆりひこ>氏は何処に？"
msgstr "  So, Miss Kuonji, where is the guest of honor?"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1827:21962: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1827
msgctxt "text_id=21962 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　私たちも挨拶をしていないのですが」"
msgstr "  We haven't seen him yet.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1852:21963: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1852
msgctxt "text_id=21963 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「そういえば、そうね。"
msgstr "\"Now that you mention it..."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1865:21964: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1865
msgctxt "text_id=21964 | speaker=alice"
msgid "青子、トッキィーは？」"
msgstr "Aoko, have you seen Tokie?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1891:21965: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_E_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1891
msgctxt "text_id=21965 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え、居ないの？　夕食の手配、ぜんぶあの人が担当なのに。とびきりのシェフ団を手配するから、君たちはゆっくりしていなさいって自慢してたじゃない」"
msgstr "\"He's not here? But he was in charge of the dinner arrangements! He told us we could take it easy, because he'd be arranging some top chefs.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1917:21966: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_E_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1917
msgctxt "text_id=21966 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そりゃおかしいな。そういう段取りなら、シェフ団とやらは四時には到着していないと間に合わねえぞ。"
msgstr "\"That's a bit weird, isn't it? If that was the plan, the chefs would need to arrive by four at the latest in order to make it in time for dinner."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1923:21967: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_E_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1923
msgctxt "text_id=21967 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　誰か、土桔の爺さんを見なかったか？」"
msgstr "  Hasn't anybody seen Yurihiko?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1963:21968: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1963
msgctxt "text_id=21968 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「お昼まではここにいたけど、それ以降は見てないよ」"
msgstr "\"He was here until noon, but I haven't seen him since.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1988:21969: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1988
msgctxt "text_id=21969 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「わたしは一度も見てないわ。"
msgstr "\"I haven't seen him at all."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1988:21970: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1988
msgctxt "text_id=21970 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　何度か席を外したけど、その時も見かけなかったし」"
msgstr "  I stepped out a few times, but he wasn't outside, either.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2023:21971: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2023
msgctxt "text_id=21971 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……昼過ぎから今まで、五時間近く、誰もトッキィーを見ていないの……？」"
msgstr "\"It's been nearly five hours since noon. Has nobody seen him during that time?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2043:21972: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2043
msgctxt "text_id=21972 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　返事はない。"
msgstr "  The room was silent."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2048:21973: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2048
msgctxt "text_id=21973 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……全員、何か予感じみたものがあったのか、あのピンク女や芳助でさえ無駄口を叩かない。"
msgstr "  Everyone seemed to be waiting for someone else to say something. Even Housuke and the pink girl didn't have any banter to offer."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2105:21974: voice_id=BA0_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2105
msgctxt "text_id=21974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『ん、なんスかこの空気？　カラオケ？　カラオケはじまるッスか？　ジブン、テディボーイブルースとか得意ッスよ？　フリッキーにも歌つけてくれないっスかね？』"
msgstr "\"Hmm? Why'd the place go all Simon Said? Are we about to do some karaoke? Don't you know I'm so good I'd knock your rhythm n' blues right off? I'm a rock robin, you see? Just stick a microphone under my beak and...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2111:21975: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2111
msgctxt "text_id=21975 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　声を上げているのは、テーブルの上で不思議そうに首を傾げている駒鳥だけ。"
msgstr "  The only one making any noise was the robin on the table. It was bobbing its head in a strange way."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2190:21976: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2190
msgctxt "text_id=21976 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ああ、みんな揃ってた。夕飯の支度は終わった？」"
msgstr "\"Ah, everyone's here. Is dinner ready?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2196:21977: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2196
msgctxt "text_id=21977 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と。"
msgstr "  The voice cut through the tension."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2201:21978: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2201
msgctxt "text_id=21978 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこへ、ひとり<安穏|あんのん>とした男がやってきた。"
msgstr "  A young man, looking calm and composed, had arrived."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2263:21979: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2263
msgctxt "text_id=21979 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　場の雰囲気を察したんだろう。"
msgstr "  He must have picked up on the mood in the room... right?"

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2292:21980: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2292
msgctxt "text_id=21980 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希は例の、なに考えているか分からない笑顔で集まった人々を見渡して、一言。"
msgstr "  With his staple, unreadable grin, Sizuki looked around the room at everyone gathered."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2319:21981: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2319
msgctxt "text_id=21981 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ところで。"
msgstr "\"By the way..."

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2325:21982: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2325
msgctxt "text_id=21982 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　屋根裏で土桔さんが死んでいるんだけど、どうしようか？」"
msgstr "  ...Mr. Tokitsu's dead in the attic. What should we do?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2331:21983: voice_id=X50_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=X50; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2331
msgctxt "text_id=21983 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「な―――」"
msgstr "\"Wh...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2366:21984: voice_id=X50_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=X50; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2366
msgctxt "text_id=21984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「「「「なんだってーーーーーーー！！！？」」」」"
msgstr "\"WHAT?!?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_1:32:21985: scene=WIK_F_1
#: WIK_F_1:32
msgctxt "text_id=21985 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これから陰惨な事件が始まるのだ、と思った。"
msgstr "  I feel like something terrible is about to happen."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_2:32:21986: scene=WIK_F_2
#: WIK_F_2:32
msgctxt "text_id=21986 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これからトンデモな事件が始まるな、と思った。"
msgstr "  I feel like something crazy is about to go down."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_3:24:21987: scene=WIK_F_3
#: WIK_F_3:24
msgctxt "text_id=21987 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんな状況で不謹慎ではあるけれど、槻司と組み分けされる流れになって良かった、と思った。"
msgstr "  I know this isn't the time or place, but I'm glad that Tsukiji and I were paired together."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:110:21988: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:110
msgctxt "text_id=21988 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「しっかし、とんでもない<事態|こと>になったわね」"
msgstr "\"Things sure have gotten out of hand.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:116:21989: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:116
msgctxt "text_id=21989 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎の呟きに、わたしも無言で同意する。"
msgstr "  I silently agreed with Aozaki's muttering."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:144:21990: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:144
msgctxt "text_id=21990 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「外の天気も荒れる一方だ。"
msgstr "\"The weather's getting worse, too."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:150:21991: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:150
msgctxt "text_id=21991 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　こりゃあ土砂崩れの一つも起きてもおかしくねえ。そうなりゃ陸の孤島だな、ここは」"
msgstr "  I wouldn't be surprised if there's a mudslide tonight. It would be like getting stranded on an island.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:173:21992: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:173
msgctxt "text_id=21992 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「うそ、マジ！？　ラッキー、そうなればお泊まりじゃん！　なに、これフラグ？　怖がる有珠ちゃんを励ます係とか、オレ立候補しちゃっていいの！？」"
msgstr "\"Seriously?! Sweet, sleepover! Oh, man. If Alice gets scared, can I be the one who comforts her?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:185:21993: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:185
msgctxt "text_id=21993 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どうぞご自由に。"
msgstr "\"By all means, go ahead."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:191:21994: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:191
msgctxt "text_id=21994 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ま、ひとり死んでるんだから、もうひとり増えてもいいんじゃない？」"
msgstr "  Another dead person's not going to change anything.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:211:21995: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:211
msgctxt "text_id=21995 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしたちは、蒼崎、槻司、芳助の四人で固まっている。"
msgstr "  Aozaki, Tsukiji, Housuke, and I had grouped up."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:216:21996: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:216
msgctxt "text_id=21996 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　仮に、この集まりを学校組と呼ぼう。"
msgstr "  For now, the four of us were Team School."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:257:21997: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:257
msgctxt "text_id=21997 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「エイリ神父、先ほどの死体ですが―――」"
msgstr "\"Father Eiri, about the body...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:268:21998: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:268
msgctxt "text_id=21998 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「分かっています、明らかに殺人事件です。"
msgstr "\"I know. This is clearly a homicide."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:274:21999: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:274
msgctxt "text_id=21999 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　ですが場所が場所ですからねぇ。おいそれと警察を呼ぶ訳にはいきません」"
msgstr "  But given our location, we can't exactly call the police right away.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:310:22000: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:310
msgctxt "text_id=22000 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「……ふふ……ふふふふ…………きたわあ………辛気くさい趣味だってアコちゃんに罵られてはや六年……"
msgstr "\"Hehe... hehehehe... Six years... Six years it's been since Ako made fun of my 'sketchy' hobbies..."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:331:22001: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:331
msgctxt "text_id=22001 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "夢にまで見た、殺人事件の現場がきたーーー！」"
msgstr "And now, we're here... a real murder scene! It's like a dream come true!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:337:22002: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:337
msgctxt "text_id=22002 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　教会組は三人で固まっている。"
msgstr "  Team Church was made of those three."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:342:22003: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:342
msgctxt "text_id=22003 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鉄の結束力に見えて、若干、コンセンサスがとれていない模様。"
msgstr "  I'd expected them to be the most cohesive group, but that didn't seem to be the case."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:389:22004: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:389
msgctxt "text_id=22004 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「ちょっとソウジューロー、お茶もスコーンもでないの？"
msgstr "\"Hey, Soujyuro, where are the tea and scones?"

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:395:22005: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:395
msgctxt "text_id=22005 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　せっかくスターが訪問してあげたのに、ろくな歓迎もなしいきなり殺人事件とか、アナタたち、礼儀ってもんがなってないんじゃない？」"
msgstr "  I'm a star, you know? I come all this way and not only do I get a slipshod welcome, but now there's been a murder! Have you people no sense of courtesy?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:404:22006: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:404
msgctxt "text_id=22006 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、しかし待ってほしい。"
msgstr "\"Well, hold on."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:410:22007: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:410
msgctxt "text_id=22007 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　人がひとり死んでいるのにお茶とお菓子を要求するのは、礼儀以前の問題ではないだろうか」"
msgstr "  Demanding tea and scones after someone's died is worse than bad manners.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:456:22008: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:456
msgctxt "text_id=22008 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「あぁ？　なに、番犬のクセにご主人様に意見しようっての？　どうしてこう、ここぞという時に常識人ぶんのよアンタは！」"
msgstr "\"And what is *that* supposed to mean? Is the dog barking orders at his master? Don't pretend you're the one with common sense here.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:492:22009: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:492
msgctxt "text_id=22009 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希の首輪を掴んで、ガクガクと揺さぶるピンク女。"
msgstr "  The girl in pink grabbed Sizuki by the collar shook him viciously."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:498:22010: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:498
msgctxt "text_id=22010 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「蒼崎……蒼崎が、二人……」"
msgstr "\"Whoa... I see two... Aozakis...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:503:22011: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:503
msgctxt "text_id=22011 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　頸動脈に食い込んでいるのか、静希の目はうつろである。"
msgstr "  Sizuki's eyes began to glaze over, probably because her fingers were digging into his carotid artery."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:567:22012: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:567
msgctxt "text_id=22012 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ふふふ。そこのピンク。不味そうな人間だけど、それ以上草十郎さんに触れたら頭から丸かじるぞ☆」"
msgstr "\"Heh-heh. Hey, pinkie. You don't look very tasty for a human, but hands off Soujyuro before I bite your head off.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:598:22013: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0003_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:598
msgctxt "text_id=22013 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「はあ？　やれるもんならやってみればあ？"
msgstr "\"Oh, really? Why don't you try it?"

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:611:22014: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0003_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:611
msgctxt "text_id=22014 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　ふん、アンタの弱点なんて分かってんだから。また返り討ちにされて、ネズミ<大|だい>の大きさにしてほしいワケ？」"
msgstr " I know your weakness. Want me to beat you again and shrink you down to the size of a mouse?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:648:22015: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:648
msgctxt "text_id=22015 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「へえ。アレがこっちの本気だと思っていたなんて、<目|め><利|き>きが悪いにもホドがある。"
msgstr "\"Oh, so you think you know me, do you? Just shows how blind you really are."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:659:22016: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:659
msgctxt "text_id=22016 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　しょせんは産業革命の陰でポッと発生した<煤|すす>の魔女の末裔ってコト？　ほーんと、格落ち品らしい、スカスカの脳味噌だよねー」"
msgstr "  Don't forget, your ancestors were a bunch of soot witches born in the Industrial Revolution. I don't know how you've done it, but you're even dumber.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:704:22017: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0004_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:704
msgctxt "text_id=22017 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「よし死んで。犬同士仲良く二匹、これ以上ないっていうぐらい愉快に死んで。"
msgstr "\"All right, time to die. I'm happy to add another two mangy mutts to the body count right now."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:717:22018: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0004_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:717
msgctxt "text_id=22018 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "もうひとり死んでるんだし、あと六人ぐらい追加されても構わないわよねぇ？」"
msgstr "There's already one dead guy. What's another six or so corpses on top of that?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:757:22019: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:757
msgctxt "text_id=22019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一方、ソファーに座った久遠寺さんを中心に、とにかく仲の悪いグループを洋館組と呼ぶ。"
msgstr "  Meanwhile, the disagreeable Team Mansion was centered around Miss Kuonji, who was sitting on the sofa."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:762:22020: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:762
msgctxt "text_id=22020 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ピンク女、ベオ、静希は何やら揉めているけど、"
msgstr "  The pink girl, Beo, and Sizuki were bickering bitterly about something or other."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:768:22021: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:768
msgctxt "text_id=22021 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:773:22022: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:773
msgctxt "text_id=22022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　屋敷の主人である久遠寺さんは、さっきから思案顔で一言も発していなかった。"
msgstr "  Miss Kuonji, the mistress of the house, remained silent, her expression pensive."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:778:22023: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:778
msgctxt "text_id=22023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　また、あの青い駒鳥の姿も消えていた。"
msgstr "  That blue robin had gone off somewhere again."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:823:22024: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:823
msgctxt "text_id=22024 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「はいはい、みんなそこまで！"
msgstr "\"Okay, everyone! Enough of that."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:831:22025: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0003_0; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:831
msgctxt "text_id=22025 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　この素敵な展開…"
msgstr "  We're in a wonderful―"

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:845:22026: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0003_1; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:845
msgctxt "text_id=22026 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "…ゴホン、"
msgstr "Ahem."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:858:22027: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0003_2; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:858
msgctxt "text_id=22027 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "異常な事態を前にして、ケンカしている場合じゃありませんっ！"
msgstr "We're in a tight situation. This is no time to fight among ourselves!"

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:870:22028: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:870
msgctxt "text_id=22028 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　状況は火を見るより明らかです。土桔由里彦氏が死亡していた事と、屋敷の電話線が消失していた事。"
msgstr "  Mr. Yurihiko Tokitsu has died; the mansion's telephone line is out."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:882:22029: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:882
msgctxt "text_id=22029 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　この二つの事件は偶然ではありません。"
msgstr "  These two things can't be a coincidence."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:894:22030: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:894
msgctxt "text_id=22030 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　これは連続した、ある人物によって引き起こされた事件と見るほうが論理的です。即ち―――」"
msgstr "  As such, it's logical to conclude that we are dealing with―\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:929:22031: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:929
msgctxt "text_id=22031 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「殺人事件……土桔氏を殺害した何者かは、警察に連絡させないために電話を使用不能にした、という事ですか？」"
msgstr "\"Murder... So you're saying whoever killed Mr. Tokitsu made sure that we couldn't contact the police?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:941:22032: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:941
msgctxt "text_id=22032 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「そう！　その通りよ金鹿ちゃん！"
msgstr "\"Yes! Precisely, Kojika!"

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:948:22033: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0008_0; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:948
msgctxt "text_id=22033 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　これはもう立派な殺人事件です！　そして犯人はこの中にいる！"
msgstr "  This is a perfect murder case! And the murderer is someone here!"

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:962:22034: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0008_1; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:962
msgctxt "text_id=22034 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　といいなー！」"
msgstr "Or I hope so, anyway!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:989:22035: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:989
msgctxt "text_id=22035 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「ええ！？　これ、そういうイベントだったの！？」"
msgstr "\"What?! That's what's going down?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1014:22036: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0009; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1014
msgctxt "text_id=22036 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「そうよ木乃美くん、これはそういうイベントなの！"
msgstr "\"Yes, Kinomi! That is exactly what's going down!"

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1039:22037: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0010; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1039
msgctxt "text_id=22037 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　油断していると後ろからバッサリなんだから！"
msgstr "  Drop your guard, and from behind... BAM! DEAD!"

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1050:22038: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0011; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1050
msgctxt "text_id=22038 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　さあ、誰から<持論|じろん>を<披露|ひろう>しましょうか！」"
msgstr "  Right, who wants to give their theory first?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1091:22039: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1091
msgctxt "text_id=22039 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれほど活き活きとした律架さんを見たのは初めてだ。"
msgstr "  I've never seen Ritsuka so excited."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1096:22040: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1096
msgctxt "text_id=22040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　恐怖の反動で精神が高揚しているのかもしれない。"
msgstr "  Maybe this is how she reacts to fear."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1135:22041: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1135
msgctxt "text_id=22041 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「律架」"
msgstr "\"Ritsuka.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1174:22042: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0012; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1174
msgctxt "text_id=22042 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「ぐっふぅ……！？」"
msgstr "\"Ack!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1264:22043: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1264
msgctxt "text_id=22043 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「申し訳ありません。うちの者が不穏な発言をいたしました。"
msgstr "\"Allow me to apologize for Ritsuka's unsettling remarks."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1275:22044: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1275
msgctxt "text_id=22044 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　しかし、まったくの狂言でない事も理解してください。"
msgstr "  However, despite her enthusiasm, she has a point."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1275:22045: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1275
msgctxt "text_id=22045 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　土桔氏を殺害した犯人がこの中にいる、というのは先走りすぎですが、状況の整理は必要でしょう」"
msgstr "  While we can't be certain Mr. Tokitsu's killer is one of us, we do need to make sense of the situation.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1312:22046: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1312
msgctxt "text_id=22046 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　反論する理由はない。"
msgstr "  That sounded reasonable enough."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1317:22047: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1317
msgctxt "text_id=22047 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　詠梨神父の仕切りで状況整理が始まった。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri kicked off the proceedings."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1342:22048: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1342
msgctxt "text_id=22048 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「まず屋根裏の状況から。"
msgstr "\"Let's start with the scene in the attic."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1348:22049: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1348
msgctxt "text_id=22049 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あの部屋は鍵がなくて、誰でも入れる状況だった。"
msgstr "  As the attic isn't locked, anyone could have entered at any time."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1360:22050: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1360
msgctxt "text_id=22050 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　この中で土桔の爺さんが屋根裏に向かうところを見た人、あるいは相談された人はいる？」"
msgstr "  Did anyone here see Mr. Tokitsu heading for the attic or did he say anything about going there?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1403:22051: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1403
msgctxt "text_id=22051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<挙手|きょしゅ>はない。"
msgstr "  No takers."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1408:22052: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1408
msgctxt "text_id=22052 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　土桔氏はひとりで、誰にも内緒で屋根裏部屋に入ったか、あるいは犯人に連れこまれたのだ。"
msgstr "  Either Mr. Tokitsu entered the attic by himself without telling anyone, or he was taken there by the killer."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1455:22053: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1455
msgctxt "text_id=22053 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「土桔氏を最後に見たのは誰でしょう？"
msgstr "\"Who saw Mr. Tokitsu last?"

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1467:22054: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1467
msgctxt "text_id=22054 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　私たち三人は夕方から入館しましたが、その時点で土桔氏の姿を見てはいません」"
msgstr "  The three of us entered the mansion this evening, but we didn't see him.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1476:22055: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1476
msgctxt "text_id=22055 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「オレたちは午前中から居たけど、朝は一緒だったぜ？"
msgstr "\"We've been here since this morning; he was with us then."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1487:22056: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_F_A_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1487
msgctxt "text_id=22056 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　有珠ちゃんの隣を奪い合ったから、これは間違いない。"
msgstr "  We fought for a seat next to Alice."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1498:22057: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_F_A_0004; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1498
msgctxt "text_id=22057 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　でも……そうだ、あの爺さん、時計を見て“時間だ”とか呟いて、居間から出ていったんだっけ」"
msgstr "  Then... Oh, yeah. I think he looked at the clock, said something about it being 'time,' then left the drawing room.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1518:22058: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1518
msgctxt "text_id=22058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　芳助はああ見えて、記憶力はいい。"
msgstr "  Despite appearances, Housuke had a pretty good memory..."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1523:22059: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1523
msgctxt "text_id=22059 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　勉強以外の、おもにどうでもいい方面で。"
msgstr "  ...when it came to anything besides studying, that is."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1528:22060: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1528
msgctxt "text_id=22060 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　結局、芳助の目撃談が土桔氏を見た最後の証言になった。"
msgstr "  In the end, Housuke's statement was the last eyewitness account we had of Mr. Tokitsu."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1556:22061: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1556
msgctxt "text_id=22061 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「となると……土桔氏が消えたのは正午過ぎから、ですか。まいりましたね。これでは、全員に等しくアリバイがない」"
msgstr "\"That means Mr. Tokitsu disappeared sometime after noon. This is troubling. None of us have a watertight alibi.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1591:22062: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1591
msgctxt "text_id=22062 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう。不在から発見までの時間帯が長すぎるのだ。"
msgstr "  Right. The time between his disappearance and discovery had been too long."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1596:22063: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1596
msgctxt "text_id=22063 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　午後に来たわたしや蒼崎、山城先生でさえ、何度かトイレやら休憩やらで席を立っている。"
msgstr "  Even though I arrived in the afternoon, I'd been to the bathroom a few times. The same went for Aozaki and Mr. Yamasiro."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1601:22064: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1601
msgctxt "text_id=22064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　五分から十分程度なら、ひとりでいる時間が誰にでもあったという事だ。"
msgstr "  Everyone had been alone for at least five to ten minutes at some point."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1606:22065: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1606
msgctxt "text_id=22065 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ずっと誰かといた―――ずっとこの場所にいたのは、久遠寺さんだけである。"
msgstr "  The only exception, who had stayed here with someone the entire time, was Miss Kuonji."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1642:22066: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1642
msgctxt "text_id=22066 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「有珠、詠梨たちを迎えに行く時しか動いてないものね。鉄壁のアリバイだわ」"
msgstr "\"Alice, you only got up once to greet Eiri and the others. That's a pretty strong alibi.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1685:22067: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1685
msgctxt "text_id=22067 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「細かく証言をすりあわせていけばより確かな不在時間がでてくるでしょうが、あまり効果はないでしょうね。誰もが犯人に該当しすぎる。"
msgstr "\"I thought examining everyone's statements would've yielded some insight into his absence...but it appears not. We're all suspects."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1697:22068: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0008; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1697
msgctxt "text_id=22068 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　ここはアリバイより動機、あるいは凶器について話しあいますか」"
msgstr "  I suggest we should discuss the motive and the murder weapon.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1741:22069: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1741
msgctxt "text_id=22069 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「動機の線でいけば、俺たちは全員白ですよ。"
msgstr "\"If we look at motives, then we're all innocent."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1753:22070: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1753
msgctxt "text_id=22070 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　むしろ外部による犯行とした方が通りがいい。土桔の爺さんはあれで大企業のトップですからね。親族による利権がらみで殺された、ってのが普通の考えでしょう。"
msgstr "  It has to be someone from outside who set this up. Old Yurihiko owned a massive enterprise. I can imagine a family member taking him out over rights or inheritance."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1765:22071: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1765
msgctxt "text_id=22071 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　なんで、動機をあれこれ想像するのも無駄骨かと」"
msgstr "  I don't think this line of questioning is going to get us anywhere.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1798:22072: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0013; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1798
msgctxt "text_id=22072 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「うう……その台詞、わたし……わたしが言いたかった……のに……唯ちゃんのボディブロー……痛すぎ……」"
msgstr "\"Ugh... I... I wanted to say that... But Yui's body blow... it hurts...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1835:22073: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0009; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1835
msgctxt "text_id=22073 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「なるほど。では、貴方は凶器について……殺害方法について考察するべきだと言うのですね」"
msgstr "\"I see. So you're saying we should consider the weapon, or the modus operandi.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1846:22074: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1846
msgctxt "text_id=22074 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そういう事になりますかね。凶器を特定させれば、誰なら殺害可能かって問題に移れるでしょ。"
msgstr "\"I'd think so. If we find out what weapon was used, we can figure out who carried it."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1857:22075: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1857
msgctxt "text_id=22075 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　幸い、凶器はハッキリしていますから。詠梨神父は気付いていますか？」"
msgstr "  Luckily, it's clear what the weapon was. Isn't it, Father?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1883:22076: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0010; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1883
msgctxt "text_id=22076 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ええ、それなりには。居間と屋根裏<間|かん>でなぜ聞こえなかったのか、という不思議は残りますが。"
msgstr "\"To a certain extent, yes. I still don't know why we didn't hear it from here, however."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1894:22077: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0011; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1894
msgctxt "text_id=22077 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　皆さんは分かりますか？」"
msgstr "  Does everyone know what it was?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1928:22078: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1928
msgctxt "text_id=22078 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　詠梨神父はこの場にいる全員の顔を観察しながら、意地の悪い質問をした。"
msgstr "  It was a rather mean-spirited question. Father Eiri observed everyone's faces as he waited for a response."

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1933:22079: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1933
msgctxt "text_id=22079 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　土桔由里彦を殺害せしめた手段はなにか？"
msgstr "  So, how was Yurihiko Tokitsu killed?"

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1938:22080: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1938
msgctxt "text_id=22080 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは―――"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_G:8:22081: scene=WIK_SELECT_G
#: WIK_SELECT_G:8
msgctxt "text_id=22081 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｇ～"
msgstr "-Decision G-"

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:83:22082: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:83
msgctxt "text_id=22082 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目を覚ますと、そこは木の床の上だった。"
msgstr "  I woke up to find myself on a wooden floor."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:125:22083: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:125
msgctxt "text_id=22083 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あれ……わたし、なんでこんな所に？」"
msgstr "\"Huh...? What am I doing here...?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:131:22084: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:131
msgctxt "text_id=22084 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ゆっくりと体を起こす。"
msgstr "  I slowly picked myself up."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:136:22085: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:136
msgctxt "text_id=22085 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　場所は久遠寺邸のホール。"
msgstr "  This was the hall of the Kuonji Estate."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:178:22086: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:178
msgctxt "text_id=22086 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　柱時計は午前七時に差し掛かろうとしている。"
msgstr "  The grandfather clock told me it was almost seven in the morning."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:183:22087: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:183
msgctxt "text_id=22087 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ロビーの端っこにはシスター服の女性が、わたしと同じように倒れている。いや、眠っている。"
msgstr "  At the edge of the foyer was a woman dressed like a nun, collapsed on the floor like me. Oh, she was just asleep."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:232:22088: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:232
msgctxt "text_id=22088 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館は静かで、けれど、耳を澄ますと様々な音が聞こえてきた。"
msgstr "  The mansion was quiet, but I could hear several noises if I strained my ears."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:238:22089: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:238
msgctxt "text_id=22089 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　台所からは食器と食器の重なる音。"
msgstr "  There was the clinking of kitchenware."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:244:22090: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:244
msgctxt "text_id=22090 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下を行く足音や、<蝶番|ちょうつがい>の軋む音。"
msgstr "  Footsteps down the corridors. Old doors creaking."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:249:22091: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:249
msgctxt "text_id=22091 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それと、"
msgstr "  And..."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:271:22092: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:271
msgctxt "text_id=22092 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……？　おい、どうなってんだこりゃ。なんで俺ら久遠寺の家で寝てんだ？　起きろ木乃美、話きかせろ！」"
msgstr "\"...? Hey, what's going on here? What're we doing sleeping at Kuonji's place? Hey, wake up, Kinomi! Get your head on straight!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:277:22093: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:277
msgctxt "text_id=22093 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二階からは、聞き慣れたアイツの声。"
msgstr "  A familiar voice echoed from the second floor."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:312:22094: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:312
msgctxt "text_id=22094 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:317:22095: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:317
msgctxt "text_id=22095 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはなぜか胸が楽になって、体を起こした。"
msgstr "  Somehow, the tightness in my chest lightened, and I stood up."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:322:22096: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:322
msgctxt "text_id=22096 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　有り体に言えばホッとしていた。"
msgstr "  To be honest, I was relieved."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:328:22097: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:328
msgctxt "text_id=22097 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふと視線を下にやると、そこには卵のカラのようなものと、一枚のメモがあった。"
msgstr "  I glanced down, and saw something like an eggshell and a note."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:344:22098: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:344
msgctxt "text_id=22098 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　メモにはピンクのクレヨンでたった一言。"
msgstr "  There were just a few words on the note, scribbled in pink crayon."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:369:22099: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_FIN_0000; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:369
msgctxt "text_id=22099 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　　　　　　『恋に生きたっていいんじゃない？』"
msgstr "            \"Why not just live for love?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:390:22100: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:390
msgctxt "text_id=22100 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「は」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:395:22101: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:395
msgctxt "text_id=22101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さすがスイーツ脳。死んでもゴメンだ。"
msgstr "  Stupid sweets-brain. Even after you're dead, you're still a pain in the ass."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:400:22102: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:400
msgctxt "text_id=22102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そもそも、そんな簡単に開き直れないから、アンタの魔の手に引っかかったんじゃない。"
msgstr "  Besides, I was too passive to do that. It's how I fell for your trap to begin with."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:445:22103: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_FIN_0001; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:445
msgctxt "text_id=22103 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "“だよねー！”"
msgstr "(Well, duh!)"

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:450:22104: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:450
msgctxt "text_id=22104 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　妙に元気のいい、こちらを<励|はげ>ますような音。"
msgstr "  Sweets Hearts's tone was lively, yet strangely encouraging."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:462:22105: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:462
msgctxt "text_id=22105 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　卵の表面に<罅|ひび>が入る。"
msgstr "  Cracks began forming in the eggshell,"

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:467:22106: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:467
msgctxt "text_id=22106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはあっさりと砕けて、"
msgstr "  and then it crumbled,"

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:490:22107: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:490
msgctxt "text_id=22107 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何もかも、記憶すら持ちさって退場した。"
msgstr "  taking everything, even my memories, with it."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:511:22108: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:511
msgctxt "text_id=22108 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あれ―――？　何かあった気がするん、だけど」"
msgstr "\"Huh. I feel like I was right in the middle of something.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:517:22109: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:517
msgctxt "text_id=22109 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目の前のおかしなメモを手にして、首をかしげる。"
msgstr "  I picked up the note in front of me and frowned at it."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:522:22110: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:522
msgctxt "text_id=22110 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりに脳天気かつ単細胞な走り書きに怒りを覚えたわたしは、メモをクシャッと握り潰して、ちょっと迷った後、ポケットにしまい込んだ。"
msgstr "  Irritated by the presumptuous, obnoxious scribbling, I crumpled it up... and after a moment's hesitation, stowed it in my pocket."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:561:22111: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:561
msgctxt "text_id=22111 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「お？　久万梨も来てるじゃねえか。"
msgstr "\"Oh, Kumari. You're here too?"

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:567:22112: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:567
msgctxt "text_id=22112 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　どうなってんだこりゃ、パーティーの開始、午前中に変更したのか？」"
msgstr "  What's going on? Did they move up the party?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:573:22113: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:573
msgctxt "text_id=22113 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　階段の上からは、がやがやと人の気配。"
msgstr "  There was a commotion coming from the stairs,"

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:578:22114: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:578
msgctxt "text_id=22114 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　プラス、来ていると聞いていなかったヤツの顔。"
msgstr "  plus the face of a guy I hadn't heard was coming."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:583:22115: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:583
msgctxt "text_id=22115 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは急いで顔をそむけて、ロビーにある鏡で自分をチェック。よし、おかしなところはとりあえず無い。"
msgstr "  I quickly turned away and checked myself in a nearby mirror. Good. Nothing too out of place."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:633:22116: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:633
msgctxt "text_id=22116 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「どうなってるか聞きたいのはこっちの方よ。"
msgstr "\"That's what I'd like to know."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:647:22117: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0005_0; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:647
msgctxt "text_id=22117 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　久遠寺さんの誕生会って、ほんとに今日なの？　招待状の日付、間違えてたんじゃ……"
msgstr "  Is Miss Kuonji's birthday party really today? The date on the invitation could've been wrong..."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:662:22118: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0005_1; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:662
msgctxt "text_id=22118 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "って、あれ？」"
msgstr "Wait, huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:699:22119: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:699
msgctxt "text_id=22119 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この台詞、なんか言った覚えがあるような……？"
msgstr "  Where was this déjà vu coming from?"

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:705:22120: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:705
msgctxt "text_id=22120 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ま、ただの気のせいだろう。"
msgstr "  Must have been my imagination."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:710:22121: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:710
msgctxt "text_id=22121 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今日は<稀少|レア>と言えば<稀少|レア>な、久遠寺邸での誕生会だ。"
msgstr "  It was awfully rare to have a birthday party out at the Kuonji Estate."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:715:22122: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:715
msgctxt "text_id=22122 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　高校生活は残り少ない。"
msgstr "  Our high school days were numbered."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:720:22123: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:720
msgctxt "text_id=22123 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気を抜けば終わってしまうだろう最後の季節を、わたしは後悔のないよう、自分らしくクリアしないと。"
msgstr "  The season would be over before we knew it. I had to make sure I finished it with no regrets."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:763:22124: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_FIN_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:763
msgctxt "text_id=22124 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「うお、金鹿じゃん！？　おまえも呼ばれたワケ！？"
msgstr "\"Whoa, Kojika?! You were invited, too?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:769:22125: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_FIN_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:769
msgctxt "text_id=22125 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　有珠ちゃんと面識あったのかよ！？」"
msgstr "  Do you know Alice?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:782:22126: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0006_0; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:782
msgctxt "text_id=22126 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そりゃあるわよ、蒼崎と友達やってれば。"
msgstr "\"Anyone who's friends with Aozaki knows her."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:796:22127: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0006_1; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:796
msgctxt "text_id=22127 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "ってか少しは落ち着け芳助。アンタ、ガキの頃から成長ないんだから」"
msgstr " Anyway, simmer down, Housuke. You ever thought about growing up?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:849:22128: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:849
msgctxt "text_id=22128 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「おーおー。さすが幼なじみ、仲が良いコトで。"
msgstr "\"Hey, it's good to see childhood friends getting along."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:862:22129: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:862
msgctxt "text_id=22129 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　その調子で木乃美を仕付けてやれよ久万梨。まわりと、何より本人の為になるぜ」"
msgstr "  You should coach him, Kumari. You'd be helping him and everyone around him, too.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:891:22130: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0007_0; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:891
msgctxt "text_id=22130 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「嫌。億つまれたってお断り。労働と報酬が釣り合わないし。わたし、<無駄骨|むだぼね>折ってる時間ないし。"
msgstr "\"No way. No amount of money would be worth that much effort. I may as well bang my head against a wall."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:906:22131: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0007_1; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:906
msgctxt "text_id=22131 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "こいつ、叩いても叩いても元通りになる形状記憶合金だし」"
msgstr " No matter how many times you smack him, he won't change.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:919:22132: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:919
msgctxt "text_id=22132 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「はは、違ぇねえ！　んじゃまあ、コイツはほっといて久遠寺に挨拶に行くか。蒼崎と久遠寺は居間かねぇ」"
msgstr "\"Haha! I guess you're right! In that case, let's leave him and go say hi to Kuonji. She's probably in the drawing room with Aozaki.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:946:22133: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_FIN_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:946
msgctxt "text_id=22133 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「ちょっ、その前にあそこ！　シスターが倒れてるぜ殿下！"
msgstr "\"Hey! Wait, before you go! There's a nun on the floor over there, Your Highness!"

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:962:22134: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_FIN_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:962
msgctxt "text_id=22134 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　おおお、俺が抱き起こしちゃっていいかな！？」"
msgstr "  Maybe I can help her get to her feet and be her hero!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:975:22135: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:975
msgctxt "text_id=22135 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いいんじゃねえの？　最悪、テメエがのされるだけだし」"
msgstr "\"Go ahead. All she'll do is knock you out, at worst.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1024:22136: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1024
msgctxt "text_id=22136 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　平凡で、楽しげな話し声はホールへと下りていく。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji sounded like he was enjoying himself. His voice carried through the hall."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1054:22137: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1054
msgctxt "text_id=22137 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　風に散った粒子は天窓を透り抜けて、太陽に焼かれるように消えていく。"
msgstr "  Dust particles flitted in the air, appearing and disappearing in the rays coming through the skylight."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1062:22138: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_FIN_0002; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1062
msgctxt "text_id=22138 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　　“んー、まあそういうオチもいいっちゃいいか！”"
msgstr "    (Mm, I guess this could've ended worse!)"

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1068:22139: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1068
msgctxt "text_id=22139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　妙に清々しい、カノジョの素直な気持ちを代弁しながら。"
msgstr "  An oddly cheerful voice summed up her honest thoughts."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1109:22140: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1109
msgctxt "text_id=22140 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狂想曲はこれにて終了。"
msgstr "  The mad rhapsody drew to a close."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1114:22141: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1114
msgctxt "text_id=22141 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は「自分らしく」と微笑んだけれど、それもやっぱり人それぞれ。"
msgstr "  She smiled in her own way. Each to their own."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1151:22142: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1151
msgctxt "text_id=22142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少ない時間を惜しむのも、"
msgstr "  Everyone had a choice. To lament the little time one had left,"

msgctxt "text_id=22143 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残った時間に賭けるのも、人それぞれの選択だ。"
msgstr "  or to gamble on it?"

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1159:22144: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1159
msgctxt "text_id=22144 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けだし、過ぎ去るものはみな美しく。"
msgstr "  Perhaps we find things beautiful because they don't last."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1164:22145: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1164
msgctxt "text_id=22145 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　終わりはいつか訪れるにしても、それは<暫|しばら>く先の話。"
msgstr "  Someday, this would all end...but not just yet."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1185:22146: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1185
msgctxt "text_id=22146 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この華やいだ一日も、一編、本棚に収まる程度の<物語|はなし>。"
msgstr "  This jolly tale was simply another book to add to the shelf."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1192:22147: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1192
msgctxt "text_id=22147 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――青春時代は短く長く。"
msgstr "  Youth is both fleeting and never-ending."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1197:22148: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1197
msgctxt "text_id=22148 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　少年少女の物語は、まだ見ぬ波乱に満ちている。"
msgstr "  The stories of young boys and girls are full of hardships yet unseen."

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1204:22149: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1204
msgctxt "text_id=22149 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　であれば皆さま。"
msgstr "  Which means, my friends,"

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1209:22150: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1209
msgctxt "text_id=22150 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつかまた、次の機会にお会いしましょう―――"
msgstr "  we shall no doubt meet again."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_1:30:22151: scene=WIK_G_1
#: WIK_G_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=22151 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、大雑把に言うとパンだ、と思った。"
msgstr "  Broadly speaking, I think the weapon used was bread."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_2:30:22152: scene=WIK_G_2
#: WIK_G_2:30
msgctxt "text_id=22152 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、現実的に小型爆薬だ、と思った。"
msgstr "  I think it was a small explosive, practically speaking."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_3:30:22153: scene=WIK_G_3
#: WIK_G_3:30
msgctxt "text_id=22153 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、ほんっとーに突拍子もないが、犬か何かに食いちぎられたのでは、と思った。"
msgstr "  As crazy as it sounds, maybe he was eaten by a dog or something."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_3:35:22154: scene=WIK_G_3
#: WIK_G_3:35
msgctxt "text_id=22154 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……なんで？"
msgstr "  ...But why?"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:40:22155: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:40
msgctxt "text_id=22155 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え？　なにって一目瞭然でしょ、あんなの。"
msgstr "\"Huh? What do you mean? Isn't it obvious?"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:46:22156: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:46
msgctxt "text_id=22156 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　手と足と顔にダイナマイトつけたんじゃないの？」"
msgstr "  They probably stuck dynamite to his hands, feet, and face.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:56:22157: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:56
msgctxt "text_id=22157 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「ええ、当然の論理的帰結ね。"
msgstr "\"That would be the logical conclusion."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:62:22158: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:62
msgctxt "text_id=22158 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　だって手と足と顔がないんだもの」"
msgstr "  I mean, those parts of his body were totally gone.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:71:22159: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:71
msgctxt "text_id=22159 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:76:22160: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:76
msgctxt "text_id=22160 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　徹底した現実主義な為か、蒼崎はときどき、素っ頓狂な結論に辿り着く。"
msgstr "  Aozaki was a thorough realist, but she could arrive at some pretty wild conclusions sometimes."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:102:22161: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:102
msgctxt "text_id=22161 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「その可能性もなくはないが、今回は別だ。"
msgstr "\"While that's possible, I don't think that's what happened."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:113:22162: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:113
msgctxt "text_id=22162 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　土桔の爺さんがどういう経緯であの部屋に居たかは不明だが、あの部屋で何が起きたかは分かる。<粉塵|ふんじん>爆発だ」"
msgstr "  We don't know how Mr. Tokitsu ended up in the attic, but we do know what happened there. It was a dust explosion.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:160:22163: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:160
msgctxt "text_id=22163 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「はあ？　粉塵爆発って、大気中に可燃性の石炭が舞っていて、花火とかで引火したら爆発するっていう、アレ？」"
msgstr "\"By that, you mean an explosion caused by something like fireworks igniting something combustible in the air?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:198:22164: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:198
msgctxt "text_id=22164 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「大雑把に言うとそうですね。石炭にかぎらず、そこが密室で、一定量の可燃性の粉塵であれば爆発は起きるんですよ。家庭用品でいうと小麦粉ですね。"
msgstr "\"You're on the right track. In a closed space like that, an explosion can occur when there's a certain amount of combustible dust, like flour."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:210:22165: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:210
msgctxt "text_id=22165 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　他には鍋の錆とアルミホイルでテルミットも作れますが、まあ、状況からして粉塵の方でしょう」"
msgstr "  You can even make thermite out of aluminum foil and the rust from old pots and pans. But based on the situation, a powder seems more likely.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:244:22166: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:244
msgctxt "text_id=22166 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「でも、ならどうして胴体だけ残ってたの？"
msgstr "\"But if that was the case, why was only his torso intact?"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:256:22167: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:256
msgctxt "text_id=22167 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　そもそも粉塵爆発ってそんなに強いの？」"
msgstr "  Are dust explosions even that powerful?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:265:22168: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:265
msgctxt "text_id=22168 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そこはこれから探るところだが、爺さんのコート、あれ防弾ジャケットなのかもな。"
msgstr "\"That's what we need to find out. It's possible his jacket was blast-resistant."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:276:22169: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:276
msgctxt "text_id=22169 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　それと、死因は粉塵爆発とはかぎらない。殺した後に爆発を起こした、って線もある。爆発自体は小さいもので、手足と顔は、あらかじめ灼いてあったのかもだ」"
msgstr "  And we don't know if it was the explosion that killed him. The culprit could've set off the blast after they murdered him. Given that the explosion itself was small, his limbs and face could've already been burned.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:315:22170: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:315
msgctxt "text_id=22170 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「そうですね。それなら爆発の音が居間まで聞こえなかった説明にもなる。"
msgstr "\"True. That would also explain why we didn't hear the explosion from the drawing room."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:321:22171: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:321
msgctxt "text_id=22171 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　あの粉塵爆発の跡は、何らかのカモフラージュという説も捨て切れません」"
msgstr "  We can't overlook the possibility that the dust explosion traces are some sort of misdirection.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:331:22172: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:331
msgctxt "text_id=22172 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「カモフラージュって……何を隠すっていうんですか？」"
msgstr "\"Misdirection? What would they be hiding?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:357:22173: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:357
msgctxt "text_id=22173 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ですから、“不自然さ”をです。"
msgstr "\"The unnatural aspects of this entire killing, of course."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:368:22174: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:368
msgctxt "text_id=22174 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　たとえば、あの遺体が土桔氏ではなく、まったく関係のない人間の死体だったらどうです？"
msgstr "  For instance, what if the corpse wasn't actually Mr. Tokitsu's, but someone else's?"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:374:22175: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:374
msgctxt "text_id=22175 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　その場合、顔があってはあの死体が土桔氏でない事は明白です。犯人はなんとしても顔を隠したい。しかし、だからといって顔を焼いては、その行為そのものが証拠になります」"
msgstr "  In that case, the culprit would need to obscure his face. However, burning the face alone would be too obvious.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:400:22176: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:400
msgctxt "text_id=22176 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「なので、焼かれていても不自然ではない状態を演出する為に、あえて不自然な粉塵爆発を使って、大本の不自然さを隠した、とか。"
msgstr "\"Perhaps to make it seem 'normal' his face had been burned, they purposefully disguised their overall approach with an explosion."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:411:22177: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0008; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:411
msgctxt "text_id=22177 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　大きな嘘の前には、小さな嘘が消えてしまうというヤツですよ」"
msgstr "  A bigger deception to mask smaller lies.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:440:22178: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:440
msgctxt "text_id=22178 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「うう……それも言いたかった、言いたかったのにー」"
msgstr "\"Come ooon... I wanted to say that... I really wanted to say that...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:476:22179: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:476
msgctxt "text_id=22179 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神父と槻司の考察に、思わず感心してしまうわたしたちだった。"
msgstr "  Everyone seemed impressed by Tsukiji and the priest. Heck, I sure was."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:481:22180: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:481
msgctxt "text_id=22180 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの部屋で粉塵爆発が起きた可能性までは追及できたとしても、その先、なぜ爆発なんてものを起こしたのか、までわたしは行き着いていなかったのだ。"
msgstr "  Even if I'd pinned down the possibility there was a dust explosion in the room, I wouldn't have figured out why."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:518:22181: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:518
msgctxt "text_id=22181 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「なるほど、粉塵爆発にそんな意味が」"
msgstr "\"A dust explosion, I see.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:523:22182: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:523
msgctxt "text_id=22182 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うむ、ともっともらしく頷く芳助。"
msgstr "  Housuke nodded solemnly."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:535:22183: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:535
msgctxt "text_id=22183 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「で、ごめん。それってどういうコトなの？」"
msgstr "\"Um, what does that mean?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:546:22184: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:546
msgctxt "text_id=22184 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「とりあえず、凶器の所在を明らかにできるってコトだ。"
msgstr "\"For now, it means we can pinpoint the location of the weapon."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:557:22185: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:557
msgctxt "text_id=22185 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　草十郎、台所に小麦粉はあるか？」"
msgstr "  Soujyuro, is there flour in the kitchen?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:563:22186: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:563
msgctxt "text_id=22186 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いま調べてる。……ないな。"
msgstr "\"I'm checking now... Nope, nothing."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:577:22187: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:577
msgctxt "text_id=22187 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　買い置きがあったのに、袋ごとなくなってる」"
msgstr "  I bought extra, but the bags are gone.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:653:22188: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:653
msgctxt "text_id=22188 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「つまり―――どういうコトだってばよ？」"
msgstr "\"Okay... So what does that mean?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:664:22189: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:664
msgctxt "text_id=22189 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「誰かが台所から小麦粉を持ち出したってコトでしょ。"
msgstr "\"Someone took the flour from the kitchen."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:675:22190: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:675
msgctxt "text_id=22190 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　それが示すところは―――」"
msgstr "  Which goes to show...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:681:22191: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:681
msgctxt "text_id=22191 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　犯人は、この家の台所に精通している者……と考えていいのだろうか？"
msgstr "  That the culprit knew their way around the kitchen... right?"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:686:22192: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:686
msgctxt "text_id=22192 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それとも、そう思わせる為のミスリードか？"
msgstr "  Or was this another possible misdirection?"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:706:22193: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:706
msgctxt "text_id=22193 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と。"
msgstr "  Just then..."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:765:22194: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:765
msgctxt "text_id=22194 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今まで何処に行っていたのか、青い駒鳥がパタパタと居間に舞い戻ってきた。"
msgstr "  ...the blue robin, which had been gone all this time, came flapping back into the drawing room."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:770:22195: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:770
msgctxt "text_id=22195 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　駒鳥は久遠寺さんの肩に留まり、チチチ、と甲高い声をあげる。"
msgstr "  It perched on Miss Kuonji's shoulder and let out a shrill chirp."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:817:22196: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:817
msgctxt "text_id=22196 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「まあ」"
msgstr "\"Oh dear.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:849:22197: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:849
msgctxt "text_id=22197 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺さんはソファーから立ち上がると、ぐるりと一同を見渡した。"
msgstr "  Miss Kuonji stood up from the sofa and looked at all of us."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:874:22198: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:874
msgctxt "text_id=22198 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「真剣に討論をしているところ申し訳ないのだけど、皆さんにたいへんなお知らせがあります。"
msgstr "\"Sorry to interrupt the serious discussion, but I have bad news."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:886:22199: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:886
msgctxt "text_id=22199 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　その前に。静希君、少しいい……？」"
msgstr "  Before that, Sizuki, do you have a moment?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:948:22200: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:948
msgctxt "text_id=22200 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺さんは静希を手招きして小声で話しかける。"
msgstr "  She gestured Sizuki over to her, and spoke to him in a hushed voice."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:965:22201: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:965
msgctxt "text_id=22201 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「ちょっと。そこ、近いんじゃないの？"
msgstr "\"Hey, what're you getting all buddy-buddy over there for?"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:971:22202: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:971
msgctxt "text_id=22202 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　隠し事とか、感じ悪いんだけど」"
msgstr "  If you have something to say, say it to all of us. Ugh, some people...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1023:22203: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1023
msgctxt "text_id=22203 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ごめんなさいリデル。でも、その前に静希君から貴女に、とっておきの小話があるそうよ。"
msgstr "\"Sorry, Riddell. But it seems Sizuki has something to say to you."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1029:22204: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1029
msgctxt "text_id=22204 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　きっと素敵な話だろうから、聞いてみてあげて」"
msgstr "  I'm sure it's quite wonderful, so do listen.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1055:22205: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1055
msgctxt "text_id=22205 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ああ。こんなコトでいいなら、是非聞いてほしい。"
msgstr "\"Yeah. This might help."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1066:22206: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1066
msgctxt "text_id=22206 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　リデルの心を打つコト請け合いだって、有珠が。君には何度か助けられたし、喜んでもらえるなら俺も嬉しい」"
msgstr "  Alice assured me you'd be interested. You've helped me time and time again, so it would mean a lot if you would hear me out.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1098:22207: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1098
msgctxt "text_id=22207 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「っ……い、いいじゃない、聞いてあげるから言いなさいよ」"
msgstr "\"F-Fine. I'm listening. Spit it out already.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1181:22208: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1181
msgctxt "text_id=22208 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ジュッティム。ジュテェーム、モナムゥー」"
msgstr "\"Je t'aime. Je t'aime, mon amour.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1274:22209: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1274
msgctxt "text_id=22209 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「は……？」"
msgstr "\"What...?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1303:22210: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1303
msgctxt "text_id=22210 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「って、なにそれ、おっかしいの、似合わない！"
msgstr "\"Why the hell would you of all people say that?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1310:22211: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0007_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1310
msgctxt "text_id=22211 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　ソウジューロー、アリスに遊ばれてるってば、いまの台詞、どんな意味だかわかっ―――"
msgstr "  Soujyuro, Alice is messing with you. Do you even know what you just sai―"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1364:22212: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0007_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1364
msgctxt "text_id=22212 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "ぐはっ！？」"
msgstr " Whuh?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1488:22213: voice_id=X80_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=X80; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1488
msgctxt "text_id=22213 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「ちょっ、いきなり<吐血|とけつ>して倒れこんだーーーーー！？」"
msgstr "\"She vomited blood and collapsed!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1506:22214: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1506
msgctxt "text_id=22214 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　倒れたピンク女に駆け寄る。"
msgstr "  I rushed over to the girl in pink."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1549:22215: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1549
msgctxt "text_id=22215 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　脈拍、なし。呼吸、なし。"
msgstr "  No pulse. She wasn't breathing, either."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1554:22216: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1554
msgctxt "text_id=22216 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　瞳孔、生体反射、なし。"
msgstr "  Pupils unresponsive. No sign of life at all."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1563:22217: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1563
msgctxt "text_id=22217 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「完全に死んでいるわ」"
msgstr "\"She's totally dead.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1603:22218: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1603
msgctxt "text_id=22218 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間はちょっとした混乱状態になった。"
msgstr "  The atmosphere in the drawing room turned frenzied."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1624:22219: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1624
msgctxt "text_id=22219 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　驚く者、"
msgstr "  Some looked shocked,"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1648:22220: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1648
msgctxt "text_id=22220 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　周囲に注意を払う者、"
msgstr "  while others looked cautious."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1667:22221: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1667
msgctxt "text_id=22221 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まったく事態を理解できていない者。"
msgstr "  And a few of us were utterly dumbfounded."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1701:22222: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1701
msgctxt "text_id=22222 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「やっぱり。困ったコトになったわね」"
msgstr "\"Things are getting worse.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1724:22223: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1724
msgctxt "text_id=22223 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どういうこと有珠、リデルのヤツ、なんで死んだの？」"
msgstr "\"What's going on, Alice? Why'd Riddell die?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1736:22224: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1736
msgctxt "text_id=22224 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「説明するのは簡単よ。"
msgstr "\"It's simple, actually."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1742:22225: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1742
msgctxt "text_id=22225 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　トッキィーの殺害現場で気になる事があったから、さっきロビンに保管庫の様子を見に行かせたの。"
msgstr "  I had my suspicions when we found Tokie in the attic, so I had Robin go and check the vault."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1748:22226: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1748
msgctxt "text_id=22226 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　そうしたら一体分、プロイキッシャーが空席だって」"
msgstr "  One Ploy Kickshaw's missing.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1774:22227: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1774
msgctxt "text_id=22227 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「プロイが……？　じゃあ爺さんとリデルを殺ったのはそのプロイだって言うの？」"
msgstr "\"Missing? So you're saying Mr. Tokitsu and Riddell were killed by a Ploy?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1786:22228: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1786
msgctxt "text_id=22228 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「正確にはプロイのルールにひっかかった、というべきね。"
msgstr "\"It'd be more accurate to say they were caught by the Ploy's rules."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1798:22229: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1798
msgctxt "text_id=22229 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　隠していても仕方のない事だから、はっきりと言うわ。"
msgstr "  No point in hiding anything now, so I'll explain."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1804:22230: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1804
msgctxt "text_id=22230 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　これから朝まで、笑うのは絶対に禁止よ」"
msgstr "  Until tomorrow morning, laughter is strictly forbidden.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1848:22231: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1848
msgctxt "text_id=22231 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「なんで？」"
msgstr "\"Why?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1860:22232: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1860
msgctxt "text_id=22232 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「だって。この洋館、笑ったら死ぬ世界になったから」"
msgstr "\"The mansion has become a world where those who laugh... die.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1919:22233: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1919
msgctxt "text_id=22233 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「そんなあ、笑ったら死ぬとかマジ怖いじゃん！"
msgstr "\"No way! That's crazy scary!"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1932:22234: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1932
msgctxt "text_id=22234 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　有珠ちゃんったら冗談うまいんだから、ははははは！」"
msgstr "  You got me, Alice! Great joke! Hahahaha!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2112:22235: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2112
msgctxt "text_id=22235 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ほ、芳助ぇぇーーーーえ！？」"
msgstr "\"H-Housuke?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2240:22236: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2240
msgctxt "text_id=22236 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……<本気|マジ>のようね」"
msgstr "\"It seems 'crazy' is right...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2252:22237: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2252
msgctxt "text_id=22237 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「木乃美君のおかげでよりルールが見えてきたわ。"
msgstr "\"Thanks to Kinomi, the Ploy's rules are clear now."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2258:22238: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2258
msgctxt "text_id=22238 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　自分から笑う分にはノーカウントで、愛想笑いも除外。"
msgstr "  Laughing of your own accord doesn't count; neither does insincere laughter."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2264:22239: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2264
msgctxt "text_id=22239 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　でも人の言動や仕掛けで、心の底から笑ってしまったらアウトと判断されるのね」"
msgstr "  However, laugh from the gut about another person's words, actions, or tricks, and you're out.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2274:22240: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2274
msgctxt "text_id=22240 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「え……え？」"
msgstr "\"Uh... what?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2294:22241: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2294
msgctxt "text_id=22241 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ちょっと、本気で、意味が分からない。"
msgstr "  I had no idea what was going on."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2299:22242: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2299
msgctxt "text_id=22242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　笑わされたら死ぬって、はい？"
msgstr "  Laugh and you die? Really?"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2304:22243: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2304
msgctxt "text_id=22243 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺さん、ちょっと普通じゃないと思ったけど、本気で電波な人だった？　いや、でも実際、爆笑して死亡したのが目の前に二人もいて、じゃあなに、これって本当の話なの？"
msgstr "  I knew Miss Kuonji wasn't exactly normal, but I didn't know she was insane... Then again, two people died in front of me after bursting out laughing, so was it true after all?"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2344:22244: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0009; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2344
msgctxt "text_id=22244 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「プロイキッシャーが稼働している、というのですか。"
msgstr "\"So you're saying that a Ploy Kickshaw is active."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2355:22245: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0010; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2355
msgctxt "text_id=22245 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　しかし、そんな魔力の流れがあるのならシスター唯架に気付かれない筈がありません」"
msgstr "  But, if that's so, why hasn't Sister Yuika noticed?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2368:22246: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0016_0; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2368
msgctxt "text_id=22246 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「これは完全潜行型のプロイ。"
msgstr "\"This Ploy has perfect camouflage."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2382:22247: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0016_1; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2382
msgctxt "text_id=22247 | speaker=alice"
msgid "それに、唯架さん」"
msgstr " That and Yuika―\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2406:22248: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2406
msgctxt "text_id=22248 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「はい。久遠寺邸の中で魔力の<多|た><寡|か>を測るのは馬鹿げています。エイリ神父、私たちは一つの巨大な神秘の中にいるのです。魔力の流れなんて、この山に入った時点で測りようがありません」"
msgstr "\"Right. I couldn't even attempt to measure the amount of magical energy within the Kuonji Estate. We're inside an enormous Mystic as it is. Measuring the flow of energy became impossible the moment we stepped foot on this mountain.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2420:22249: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0011; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2420
msgctxt "text_id=22249 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「そうでしたね。……お恥ずかしい、私も混乱しているようです」"
msgstr "\"You're right. Do pardon me. I seem to be a bit disoriented.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2440:22250: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2440
msgctxt "text_id=22250 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、この状況で冷静である方がおかしい。"
msgstr "  Being calm in this situation would be weirder."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2445:22251: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2445
msgctxt "text_id=22251 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　詠梨神父には冷たいイメージしかなかったけど、あの人、わりと真人間なのかもしれない。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri seemed cold at first glance, but maybe he's actually a more feeling person than I realized."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2450:22252: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2450
msgctxt "text_id=22252 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　でもプロイってなに？"
msgstr "  But what on Earth was a Ploy?"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2455:22253: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2455
msgctxt "text_id=22253 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　事は完全に、わたしを置いてけぼりにして進んでいる。"
msgstr "  The conversation was starting to leave me in the dust."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2496:22254: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2496
msgctxt "text_id=22254 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……ひとついいか？　笑わされたら死ぬ、ってのはいいよ。アンタの事だ、それぐらいあるかもしれねえ。"
msgstr "\"I have a question. I get that if someone makes you laugh, you die."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2508:22255: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2508
msgctxt "text_id=22255 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　だが死に方が一致しないのはどういう事だ？"
msgstr "  But why are people dying in different ways?"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2514:22256: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2514
msgctxt "text_id=22256 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　爺さんもリデルも木乃美もそれぞれ違う死に方だ。ルールと言ったが、そこはランダムなのか？」"
msgstr "  Gramps, Riddell, Kinomi―all different. You said something about rules, but is it random?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2540:22257: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2540
msgctxt "text_id=22257 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「死に方は、その人の人間性によるわ」"
msgstr "\"Their deaths relate to their nature.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2567:22258: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2567
msgctxt "text_id=22258 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「人間性……トラウマとか本質とか、そういうのを表すの？」"
msgstr "\"Their nature...? Like their issues, personality, and all that?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2578:22259: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2578
msgctxt "text_id=22259 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ええ。隠された<性癖|せいへき>も<暴露|ばくろ>されかねないわ」"
msgstr "\"Right. Even their hidden idiosyncrasies.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2607:22260: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2607
msgctxt "text_id=22260 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ああ、そういう事だったのね……ようやく合点がいった。いくらなんでもおかしいと思ったのよ。あの死に様はそういう<絡繰|カラクリ>だったのか……」"
msgstr "\"Oh, I get it now. I thought something was strange, but their deaths are also part of the design.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2633:22261: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2633
msgctxt "text_id=22261 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「……木乃美くん、札束まき散らして死ぬとか、どれだけゴージャスな人生を期待していたのかしら……」"
msgstr "\"Wow. So Kinomi must have really wanted to be rich to die in a shower of money...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2660:22262: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0010; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2660
msgctxt "text_id=22262 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「その札束もこれじゃあ救えねえがな」"
msgstr "\"Ironically, money couldn't've saved him this time.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2697:22263: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2697
msgctxt "text_id=22263 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「リデルは普通なんだな。"
msgstr "\"Riddell died a pretty normal death."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2708:22264: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2708
msgctxt "text_id=22264 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　彼女の事だから、俺はてっきり飛行機とかクルーザーに変形するかと思ったのに」"
msgstr "  Knowing her, I expected her to transform into an airplane or a yacht or something.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2759:22265: voice_id=BA0_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2759
msgctxt "text_id=22265 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『そッスね、さすがリデルさん、見かけ倒し度がハンパないッス！　吐血して突然死とか、本気で地味すぎるっていうかぁ、木乃美のダンナ以下とか、これだから<三下|さんした>はデオチすぎて救えねぇーッス！』"
msgstr "\"Yeah, yeah! Riddell's all bark no bite! Vomiting claret and dying right then and there is balls! Even worse than Kinomi's death... All icing, no Sexton Blake!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2787:22266: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0008_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2787
msgctxt "text_id=22266 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「"
msgstr "\""

msgctxt "text_id=22267 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "だ、"
msgstr "W... "

msgctxt "text_id=22268 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "誰がっ、"
msgstr "Watch..."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2807:22269: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0008_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2807
msgctxt "text_id=22269 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "三下、"
msgstr "your..."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2823:22270: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0008_2; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2823
msgctxt "text_id=22270 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "だっつーのっっっっ！」"
msgstr "beak...!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2875:22271: voice_id=X60_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=X60; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2875
msgctxt "text_id=22271 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「い、生き返ったぁ！？」"
msgstr "\"She's alive!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2920:22272: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0009_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2920
msgctxt "text_id=22272 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「"
msgstr "\"Don't... "

msgctxt "text_id=22273 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "舐めんじゃ、"
msgstr "under―"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2933:22274: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0009_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2933
msgctxt "text_id=22274 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "ないわよ！　"
msgstr "ungh... "

msgctxt "text_id=22275 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ぐっ、"
msgstr "underestimate me..."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2949:22276: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0010_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2949
msgctxt "text_id=22276 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "心臓止まったぐらいで、"
msgstr "Stopping my heart..."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2960:22277: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0010_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2960
msgctxt "text_id=22277 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "うぐぅ、"
msgstr "unf..."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2970:22278: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0011_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2970
msgctxt "text_id=22278 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "死んで、"
msgstr "isn't... "

msgctxt "text_id=22279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "死んで"
msgstr "going to..."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2980:22280: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0011_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2980
msgctxt "text_id=22280 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "たまるもん、"
msgstr "STOP... "

msgctxt "text_id=22281 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "かっ！」"
msgstr "ME!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3002:22282: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_G_A_0000_0; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3002
msgctxt "text_id=22282 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「うわあ……心停止を気合いで耐えた人類、初めて見ました……"
msgstr "\"Whoa...! I didn't know humans could survive heart attacks just by being stubborn!"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3016:22283: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_G_A_0000_1; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3016
msgctxt "text_id=22283 | speaker=beo"
msgid "あの程度の笑いじゃ、リデルさんは殺せそうにありませんねー」"
msgstr " Looks like you need better jokes to kill her.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3056:22284: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3056
msgctxt "text_id=22284 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「すごいな。今度、その<秘訣|ひけつ>を教えてほしい」"
msgstr "\"Incredible. You'll have to teach me that trick sometime!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3068:22285: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3068
msgctxt "text_id=22285 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ええ、完成されたゾンビのよう。わたしは信じていたわ、リデル」"
msgstr "\"I knew you'd come back from the dead, Riddell. Like a zombie.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3080:22286: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0012; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3080
msgctxt "text_id=22286 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「ア、アンタたち、褒める前に謝るのが、先じゃない！？"
msgstr "\"Hey! How about an apology?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3092:22287: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0013; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3092
msgctxt "text_id=22287 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　だいたい、試すならそこの<人狼|ウェアウルフ>の方が適任でしょ！？"
msgstr "  Why not test your theory on that stupid werewolf over there?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3092:22288: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0013; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3092
msgctxt "text_id=22288 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　殺してもほっとけば生き返るんだから！　なんでアタシを狙い撃ちなのよ！」"
msgstr "  He resurrects no matter what! Why go for me?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3119:22289: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3119
msgctxt "text_id=22289 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「え？　……だってわたしたち、ライバルなんでしょう？"
msgstr "\"What do you mean 'why?' We're rivals, aren't we?"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3125:22290: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3125
msgctxt "text_id=22290 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　なら、殺し合いをするのは当然だと思うけど」"
msgstr "  Of course we'd try to kill each other.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3137:22291: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0014; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3137
msgctxt "text_id=22291 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「え……あ、うん、そうよ、ライバルってそういうものよ。"
msgstr "\"Uh... um... yeah... Yeah, of course!"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3149:22292: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0015; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3149
msgctxt "text_id=22292 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　や、やるじゃない。隙あらば仕掛けてくるなんて、見直したわ」"
msgstr "  N-Not bad. You really took me by surprise. I underestimated you!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3187:22293: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0011; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3187
msgctxt "text_id=22293 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「やっぱりあの女、殺しても死なない系だったか。……たまんねえな」"
msgstr "\"Figures she'd be the type to survive even if someone kills her. Damn.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3193:22294: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3193
msgctxt "text_id=22294 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなピンク女のホラーショウを、槻司は呆れつつもすんなり受け入れていた。"
msgstr "  Though clearly shocked by the girl in pink's horror show, Tsukiji was taking this way too well."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3220:22295: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3220
msgctxt "text_id=22295 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……ちょっと槻司。アンタ、今のおかしいと思わないの？　人が死んだのよ？"
msgstr "\"Um, Tsukiji? Don't you think this is weird? Someone just died, you know!"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3232:22296: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3232
msgctxt "text_id=22296 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　芳助とか紙吹雪になって死体もないのよ？　笑ったら死ぬとか、なんだっていうのよコレ？　もしかしてわたし、とっくに夢見ちゃってる？」"
msgstr "  And Housuke turned into confetti! Dying from laughter... I mean, what is all this? Am I dreaming?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3258:22297: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0012; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3258
msgctxt "text_id=22297 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「落ち着け、信じたくねえが現実だよ。"
msgstr "\"Calm down. I don't want to believe this is happening, but it is."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3269:22298: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0013; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3269
msgctxt "text_id=22298 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　久遠寺の言う通り、この洋館はそういうルールの世界になって、リデルはそれに引っかかったが、自力でルールに抵抗したってワケだ。"
msgstr "  Like Kuonji said, this mansion's another world now, with new rules. Riddell got caught out, but she resisted."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3280:22299: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0014; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3280
msgctxt "text_id=22299 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　頭の痛いことだが、久遠寺とリデルはその手のオカルトがアリな奴らなんだよ」"
msgstr "  I know it all sounds crazy, but Kuonji and Riddell can do some crazy things.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3306:22300: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0015; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3306
msgctxt "text_id=22300 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「俺も具体的には知らねえけどな。というか、踏みこんだら巻きこまれる。ギリギリ外から眺めた結果、あの二人が本物だと判断した。今はそれで納得しとけ」"
msgstr "\"I don't know exactly what they can do, but that's probably for the best. I just know from watching them, they're the real deal. Trust me on this.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3332:22301: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3332
msgctxt "text_id=22301 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「納得できないっ、だって芳助死んじゃったのよ！？」"
msgstr "\"Trust you?! Housuke is dead!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3341:22302: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3341
msgctxt "text_id=22302 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「久万梨さん。木乃美君の死を悲しむのはまだ早いわ。"
msgstr "\"Miss Kumari. You shouldn't mourn Kinomi just yet."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3341:22303: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3341
msgctxt "text_id=22303 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　彼やトッキィーはアウト扱いで退場しただけ。現実ではまだ“行方不明”状態よ。"
msgstr "  He and Tokie simply triggered the Ploy and now they're 'out.' In reality, they're just missing."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3352:22304: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3352
msgctxt "text_id=22304 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　誰かがこのゲームをクリアすればゲーム内容はすべて<無効|むこう>扱いになって、彼らも元通りになるわ」"
msgstr "  If someone wins the game, then it will be rendered null, and everything will return to normal.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3378:22305: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0011; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3378
msgctxt "text_id=22305 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……死んでない？　ゲームをクリアすれば、元通りになる、ですって……？」"
msgstr "\"They're not dead? Someone just needs to win the game?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3384:22306: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3384
msgctxt "text_id=22306 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言っている意味は分かるけど、あいにく、わたしは蒼崎同様、現実主義だ。"
msgstr "  I understood what Miss Kuonji is saying. But, for better or worse, I was a realist like Aozaki."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3389:22307: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3389
msgctxt "text_id=22307 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなＳＦ小説みたいな台詞、簡単には鵜呑みにできない。"
msgstr "  This sci-fi and fantasy nonsense was too hard for me to swallow."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3413:22308: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3413
msgctxt "text_id=22308 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「クマ、落ち着いて。気持ちも信条も分かるけど、今は話を聞きましょう。"
msgstr "\"Relax, Kuma. I know where you're coming from, but listen to what we're saying."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3424:22309: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3424
msgctxt "text_id=22309 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……有珠、もっと詳しく話して。"
msgstr "  Alice, you should explain in more detail."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3430:22310: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3430
msgctxt "text_id=22310 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　プロイの仕業なのは分かったけど、具体的にどういうルールになったの？　クリアってなに？」"
msgstr "  I get that this is the Ploy's doing, but what are the actual current rules? What do you mean by winning the game?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3476:22311: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3476
msgctxt "text_id=22311 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「このプロイは確率変動型のプロイなの。"
msgstr "\"We're dealing with a probability-shifting Ploy."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3482:22312: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3482
msgctxt "text_id=22312 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　使用者が定めた条件が満たされたら発動して、あとはまる一日稼働し続ける。これが『ゲーム』。"
msgstr "  Once the user's conditions are satisfied, it will activate and then operate for a full day. That's the 'game.'"

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3494:22313: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3494
msgctxt "text_id=22313 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　ゲーム中は現実世界に新しい『ルール』が一つ追加される。今回は『笑わされたら死ぬ』でしょうね」"
msgstr "  During the game, a new rule will be added to the real world. In this case, dying when someone makes you laugh.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3521:22314: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3521
msgctxt "text_id=22314 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「また、ゲーム中は区域からの脱出は困難になる。この区域から脱出する方法は二つだけ。"
msgstr "\"And don't even bother trying to escape. It's not possible. There are only two ways to end this."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3536:22315: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0028; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3536
msgctxt "text_id=22315 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　一つは誰がプロイの使用者なのか暴くこと。"
msgstr "  The first is to expose the Ploy's user."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3548:22316: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3548
msgctxt "text_id=22316 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　……でも軽率に犯人を指名するのは避けるべきね。"
msgstr "  However, we shouldn't point the finger at just anyone."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3554:22317: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0030; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3554
msgctxt "text_id=22317 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　もし間違えていたり、証拠が欠けていた場合、犯人を指名した人物も“<消滅|アウト>”になるから」"
msgstr "  If the accuser is mistaken or lacks evidence, they'll be eliminated.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3613:22318: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0031; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3613
msgctxt "text_id=22318 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「もう一つはゲームが終わるまで、プロイ以外の参加者が一人でもいいから生き延びること。"
msgstr "\"The other way is for any player other than the Ploy―even just one person―to survive until the end of the game."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3625:22319: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0032; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3625
msgctxt "text_id=22319 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　このどちらでも『クリア』になるわ。クリアさえしてしまえば、何人犠牲者がでようと帳消し。みんな生き返って、ゲーム中の記憶は失う」"
msgstr "  That's how you 'win' the game and bring all the victims back. Their memories of the game disappear, though.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3690:22320: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3690
msgctxt "text_id=22320 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「……どうなる事かと思いましたが、それなら問題はありませんね。このまま夜が明けるのを待てばいいのですから」"
msgstr "\"...Well, that takes the pressure off. If we wait until dawn, we'll be fine.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3696:22321: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3696
msgctxt "text_id=22321 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シスターは安心したようだけど、わたしはそこまで楽観できない。"
msgstr "  The sister seemed relieved, but I wasn't. Not by a long shot."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3701:22322: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3701
msgctxt "text_id=22322 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　状況がわたしの理解の範疇を超えている、というのもあるけど、どうしても不安がぬぐえない。"
msgstr "  Maybe it was because I was having a hard time wrapping my head around the situation, but I felt so on edge."

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3706:22323: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3706
msgctxt "text_id=22323 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは―――"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_H:8:22324: scene=WIK_SELECT_H
#: WIK_SELECT_H:8
msgctxt "text_id=22324 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｈ～"
msgstr "-Decision H-"

#. Occurrence WIK_H_1:39:22325: scene=WIK_H_1
#: WIK_H_1:39
msgctxt "text_id=22325 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、土桔由里彦氏の死がネックだ、と思った。"
msgstr "  I thought about it, and concluded that Yurihiko Tokitsu's death was what we had to focus on now."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_2:39:22326: scene=WIK_H_2
#: WIK_H_2:39
msgctxt "text_id=22326 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、一晩笑わないのなんて簡単、と思った。"
msgstr "  I think it's easy enough to not laugh for one night."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_3:39:22327: scene=WIK_H_3
#: WIK_H_3:39
msgctxt "text_id=22327 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……わたしは、一人足りない事をそろそろ指摘すべきだろうか、と思った。"
msgstr "  I felt like it was about time I pointed out that we were still missing someone."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:48:22328: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:48
msgctxt "text_id=22328 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「どうかしら。そうはいかないと思うわよ、唯ちゃん」"
msgstr "\"I'm not convinced things will go so smoothly, Yui.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:61:22329: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:61
msgctxt "text_id=22329 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「？　律架、それはどういう―――」"
msgstr "\"What do you mean, Ritsuka?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:88:22330: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:88
msgctxt "text_id=22330 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「木乃美くんやリデルさんはともかく、土桔さんは無理やり誰かに笑わされた可能性があるんだから。"
msgstr "\"Kinomi and Miss Riddell aside, it's possible someone forced Mr. Tokitsu to laugh."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:99:22331: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:99
msgctxt "text_id=22331 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　それにアッちゃんはこう言ったわ。<使|・><用|・><者|・><が|・><定|・><め|・><た|・><条|・><件|・>だって。このプロイは事故で起動したんじゃなくて、誰かが意図的に起動させたって事でしょう？」"
msgstr "  And remember what Allie said? The user decides the rules. This Ploy didn't start by itself; someone activated it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:126:22332: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:126
msgctxt "text_id=22332 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「では……」"
msgstr "\"You mean...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:135:22333: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:135
msgctxt "text_id=22333 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……犯人がいるってコト。"
msgstr "\"...The culprit is still at large."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:141:22334: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:141
msgctxt "text_id=22334 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　そいつが誰かは分からないけど、こんなルールを作った以上、なんとしても私たちを笑わせようとするんじゃない？」"
msgstr "  We still don't know who they are. But seeing as they created the rules, they're probably going to try to make us laugh however they can.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:167:22335: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:167
msgctxt "text_id=22335 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いえ、そうでなくても犠牲者は出るかもしれない。"
msgstr "\"They might not even need to go that far, actually."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:178:22336: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:178
msgctxt "text_id=22336 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……こんなコト言いたくないけど。疑心暗鬼から来客たちが自滅しあうのはミステリの定番でしょ、律架」"
msgstr "  I hate to say it, but in mystery novels the guests often end up tearing each other apart out of suspicion.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:206:22337: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:206
msgctxt "text_id=22337 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「そう、その通りなのです！　さっすがアコちゃん、分かってるぅ！"
msgstr "\"Yes! Bang on, Aoko!"

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:220:22338: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:220
msgctxt "text_id=22338 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　このルールの底意地が悪いところは、殺害方法が犯人だけの特権ではない事よ。極論として、犯人を突き止めなくても生き残れる方法はある。"
msgstr "  The nasty thing about this rule is that anyone can kill anyone. However, that also means we can survive without identifying the culprit."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:232:22339: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:232
msgctxt "text_id=22339 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　要は、他人に笑わせられなければいいんだから―――」"
msgstr "  We only need to make sure no one else can make us laugh.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:256:22340: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:256
msgctxt "text_id=22340 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「やられる前にやれ。"
msgstr "\"Do unto others, before they do unto you."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:262:22341: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:262
msgctxt "text_id=22341 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　自分以外の人間を、先に消してしまえば安全だ。"
msgstr "  You could remove everyone else to guarantee your own safety."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:268:22342: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:268
msgctxt "text_id=22342 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　……まとめるとこういう事ですか？」"
msgstr "  Is that what you're saying?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:294:22343: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:294
msgctxt "text_id=22343 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「１．いま、洋館は笑うと死ぬ世界になっている。"
msgstr "\"Okay, one: The mansion's now a world where you die if you laugh."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:300:22344: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:300
msgctxt "text_id=22344 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　２．その状況を望んだ人物Ａがいる。"
msgstr "  Two: Person A made this happen."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:306:22345: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:306
msgctxt "text_id=22345 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　３．俺たちは、その人物Ａが誰なのかを見抜くまで安心できない。なぜなら、その人物Ａは既に土桔老人を殺害しており、他の人間を殺さない保証はないからである。"
msgstr "  Three: We can't rest until we figure out who the Person A is; they've already murdered Mr. Tokitsu, and they could kill again."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:317:22346: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:317
msgctxt "text_id=22346 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　４．必然、俺たちは自分以外の人間を疑い、正体を暴くか、朝まで身を守るか、笑わせて消していくしかない、と」"
msgstr "  Four: We suspect anyone but ourselves and reveal the culprit, hold out until morning, or make everyone else laugh.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:371:22347: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:371
msgctxt "text_id=22347 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「生き残れるのは、ただ一組」"
msgstr "\"Only one group can survive.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:389:22348: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:389
msgctxt "text_id=22348 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「なに格好よくまとめてんのよアンタは！"
msgstr "\"You think you're some badass, talking like that?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:401:22349: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:401
msgctxt "text_id=22349 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　アリス、これ何番のプロイ？」"
msgstr "  Alice, what number Ploy is this?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:413:22350: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:413
msgctxt "text_id=22350 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「十五番。<呪|まじな>いと確率変動、二心同体、願掛けによる魔力強化のプロイキッシャーよ」"
msgstr "\"Fifteen. It's a Ploy Kickshaw of magical reinforcement via charms, probability shifting, two minds in one body, and prayer.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:439:22351: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:439
msgctxt "text_id=22351 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「あちゃあ……やっぱりスイーツハーツだったか。"
msgstr "\"Oh, bollocks... that sounds like Sweets Hearts, all right."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:450:22352: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0003; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:450
msgctxt "text_id=22352 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　最悪。あんなの使うヤツがいるなんて、どんだけ優柔不断なのよ日本人って」"
msgstr "  Perfect, just perfect. How spineless do Japanese people have to be to use something like that?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:475:22353: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:475
msgctxt "text_id=22353 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「スイーツハーツ……？"
msgstr "\"'Sweets Hearts'?"

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:486:22354: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:486
msgctxt "text_id=22354 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それがこのプロイの名前なの、有珠？」"
msgstr "  Is that this Ploy's name, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:526:22355: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0004; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:526
msgctxt "text_id=22355 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「イエス。一定のルールを作って、その中で生き延びたパーティーの魔力を向上させる、戦闘前の運試しみたいなプロイよ。たいていはみんな全滅してスイーツハーツの一人勝ち、生存者はいないってデスゲームだけど。"
msgstr "\"Yes. It creates rules, and boosts the survivor's magical energy; it's like a test-your-luck Ploy you use before a battle. Usually Sweets Hearts wins and everyone dies, though..."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:537:22356: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0005; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:537
msgctxt "text_id=22356 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　じゃ、アタシはアリスと組むから」"
msgstr "  Very well, I shall be teaming up with Alice.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:548:22357: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:548
msgctxt "text_id=22357 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「は？　何よ、その組むって」"
msgstr "\"Excuse me? Who said we're teaming up?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:595:22358: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0006; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:595
msgctxt "text_id=22358 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「これはパーティーサバイバルなの。ゲームは二心同体、二人一組で挑んだ方が勝率はあがるわ。"
msgstr "\"This is a fight for survival. The game is about trust and betrayal, so grouping up in pairs will give us the best chance of victory."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:601:22359: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0007; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:601
msgctxt "text_id=22359 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　だって、最終的には面倒な犯人当てより、力ずくの笑わせ合いになるのは明白でしょう？　誰だって最後に生き残るのは自分でありたいんだし」"
msgstr "  Instead of running around trying to find the culprit, we should just try to make each other laugh. I mean, we all want to survive, don't we?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:627:22360: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0008; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:627
msgctxt "text_id=22360 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「その点、アタシとアリスなら絶対よ。アリスは笑わないし、アタシは<実力行使|パーティージョーク>を担当できるし。"
msgstr "\"Thus, Alice and I make the ultimate team. Alice never laughs, and I can be the joker."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:638:22361: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0009; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:638
msgctxt "text_id=22361 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　ね、そうでしょうアリス？」"
msgstr "  Right, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:666:22362: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_H_A_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:666
msgctxt "text_id=22362 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「そうね。"
msgstr "\"Hmm."

msgctxt "text_id=22363 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "静希君、お願いできる？」"
msgstr " Mind if I join you, Sizuki?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:687:22364: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:687
msgctxt "text_id=22364 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうだね。聞いたかぎり、有珠なら安全だ」"
msgstr "\"Sure. Based on what I've heard, you're the safest person to be with.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:699:22365: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0010; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:699
msgctxt "text_id=22365 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「優しさとかないの、アンタたちには！？」"
msgstr "\"Whatever happened to kindness in this cruel world?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:747:22366: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:747
msgctxt "text_id=22366 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「なるほど。自分が犯人ではないと思う、信じられる知人をパートナーにして協力しあうのですね。"
msgstr "\"I see. Partner with someone you trust, someone you don't believe to be the culprit, and work together."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:758:22367: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:758
msgctxt "text_id=22367 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　シスター唯架、よろしいですか？」"
msgstr "  Sister Yuika, would you mind?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:769:22368: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_H_A_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:769
msgctxt "text_id=22368 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「そうですね。恐ろしい事ですが、この中でもっとも信用できるのはエイリ神父のようですから」"
msgstr "\"My pleasure. While this is frightening situation, you appear to be the most trustworthy person here.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:793:22369: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:793
msgctxt "text_id=22369 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「えー、わたしはのけ者かー。"
msgstr "\"Hey, what about me?"

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:818:22370: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:818
msgctxt "text_id=22370 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　アコちゃん、わたしと組むー？」"
msgstr "  Want to partner up, Aoko?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:854:22371: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:854
msgctxt "text_id=22371 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「リデル、組みましょう。"
msgstr "\"Riddell. Let's pair up."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:854:22372: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:854
msgctxt "text_id=22372 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　今夜だけは過去のことは水に流して」"
msgstr "  Just for tonight, we should put everything behind us.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:865:22373: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:865
msgctxt "text_id=22373 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「流しましょう！　わたしの事も水に流しましょう！」"
msgstr "\"Oh, come on! You can make peace with me, too!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:894:22374: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0011; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:894
msgctxt "text_id=22374 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「……ふん。いいわよ、好きにして。"
msgstr "\"Hmph. Fine."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:905:22375: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0012; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:905
msgctxt "text_id=22375 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　いざとなれば、ふたりで洋館ごと木っ端微塵よ」"
msgstr "  If push comes to shove, we can just demolish the mansion.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:943:22376: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:943
msgctxt "text_id=22376 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「自然な流れだな。んじゃあまあ、常識人らしく俺たちは俺たちで組むか、久万梨」"
msgstr "\"Makes sense so far. How about it, Kumari? Just two regular Joes with common sense.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:955:22377: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:955
msgctxt "text_id=22377 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「っ」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:982:22378: scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:982
msgctxt "text_id=22378 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　よ、予想外の展開になった……！"
msgstr "  I-I didn't see that coming!"

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:987:22379: scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:987
msgctxt "text_id=22379 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さっきの屋根裏といい、事態は最悪だけど、状況はとんでもない方向に動いている。"
msgstr "  All the weirdness and murder mysteries were bad enough, but now this?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:1011:22380: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_H_A_0000_0; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:1011
msgctxt "text_id=22380 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「んー、草十郎さんと組めないんなら、ボクはひとりでいいや。"
msgstr "\"Hmm. Well, if I can't be with Soujyuro, then I don't need anyone else."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:1023:22381: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_H_A_0000_1; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:1023
msgctxt "text_id=22381 | speaker=beo"
msgid "どうせ遊びだしさー」"
msgstr " This just playtime for me anyway.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:1043:22382: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0009; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:1043
msgctxt "text_id=22382 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「あーん、残念。それじゃあわたしは山城先生と……"
msgstr "\"Aww, I guess that means I'm stuck with Mr. Yamasiro, then..."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:1056:22383: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0010; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:1056
msgctxt "text_id=22383 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　あれ？」"
msgstr "  Huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:1087:22384: scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:1087
msgctxt "text_id=22384 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　全員が顔を合わせる。"
msgstr "  We all looked at each other."

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:1092:22385: scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:1092
msgctxt "text_id=22385 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう。そろそろ誰かが気付くと思っていたけど、ずいぶん前から山城先生の姿はなかったのだ。"
msgstr "  I'd been wondering when someone would notice: Mr. Yamasiro had been missing for a while."

#. Occurrence WIK_I:38:22386: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_I_0000_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:38
msgctxt "text_id=22386 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「うーん。ほとんど屋敷にいたんだけど、パーティーの準備が忙しくてあまりみんなと話していないな。"
msgstr "\"Hmm. I've been in the mansion most of the time. Been too busy preparing for the party to really talk to anyone."

#. Occurrence WIK_I:52:22387: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_I_0000_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:52
msgctxt "text_id=22387 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "誰かさんと誰かさんが手伝ってくれないから。"
msgstr " Mainly because a certain duo didn't want to help."

#. Occurrence WIK_I:64:22388: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_I_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:64
msgctxt "text_id=22388 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　それはともかくとして、基本的には居間にいたよ。"
msgstr "  Aside from that, I was mostly in the drawing room."

#. Occurrence WIK_I:71:22389: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_I_0002_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:71
msgctxt "text_id=22389 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　買い出しとか庭の手入れもしたけど、あれは午後だったかな。"
msgstr "  I did go shopping and tend to the garden, but that was earlier in the afternoon."

#. Occurrence WIK_I:85:22390: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_I_0002_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:85
msgctxt "text_id=22390 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "夕方になって部屋に戻ったら、土桔さんがたいへんなことに」"
msgstr "When I returned to my room in the evening, Mr. Tokitsu was already dead.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:123:22391: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_I_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:123
msgctxt "text_id=22391 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「わたしは……そうね。人手がなかったから、トッキィーが来る前に自分で西館の施錠をすませて居間に移動したわ。"
msgstr "\"As for me... Nobody else was on hand, so I locked the west wing myself before Tokie arrived."

#. Occurrence WIK_I:135:22392: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_I_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:135
msgctxt "text_id=22392 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　プロイの保管庫を含めて、西館には立ち入り禁止の部屋が多いから。"
msgstr "  The west wing contains many rooms that are off-limits, including the Ploy vault."

#. Occurrence WIK_I:147:22393: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_I_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:147
msgctxt "text_id=22393 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　それからはずっと居間でゲストの様子を見ていたけど、誰がいつ、どのくらい席を立っていたかまでは把握していないわ」"
msgstr "  From there, I went to the drawing room to look after the guests; I couldn't tell you who left their seat or for how long.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:185:22394: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_I_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:185
msgctxt "text_id=22394 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「わたしも蒼崎と同じだけど、一応証言はしとく。"
msgstr "\"My story's the same as Aozaki's, but I guess I should tell you anyway."

msgctxt "text_id=22395 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　"
msgstr "  "

#. Occurrence WIK_I:198:22396: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_I_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:198
msgctxt "text_id=22396 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　午後イチに蒼崎、山城先生と合流して、午後二時過ぎに久遠寺邸に到着。"
msgstr "  I met up with Aozaki and Mr. Yamasiro at one in the afternoon, and arrived at the Kuonji Estate sometime after two."

#. Occurrence WIK_I:210:22397: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_I_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:210
msgctxt "text_id=22397 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　客室で一度休憩をとったのが三時半から四時。"
msgstr "  I took a short break in my room from 3:30 to 4:00."

#. Occurrence WIK_I:222:22398: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_I_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:222
msgctxt "text_id=22398 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　四時にロビーに神父さんたちがやってきたのを覚えています。"
msgstr "  I remember the priest and the sisters coming to the foyer at around four o'clock."

#. Occurrence WIK_I:235:22399: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_I_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:235
msgctxt "text_id=22399 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "あ……あと、そうだ。仮眠中、誰かの笑い声が聞こえた気がするけど、気のせいかもしれないし、これは推理の材料にしないで。混乱させるだけだわ」"
msgstr "Oh, also... while I was napping, I thought I heard laughter, but it might've been my imagination. Don't read into it too much. Might make things confusing.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:268:22400: scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:268
msgctxt "text_id=22400 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_J:8:22401: scene=WIK_SELECT_J
#: WIK_SELECT_J:8
msgctxt "text_id=22401 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｊ～"
msgstr "-Decision J-"

#. Occurrence WIK_J:38:22402: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_J_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:38
msgctxt "text_id=22402 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「私は午後の業務を済ませ、青子からの招待状通り、平和的な出で立ちで洋館を目指しました。"
msgstr "\"After I finished my work in the afternoon, I made my way to the mansion, like Aoko's invitation said I should do, with no fuss."

#. Occurrence WIK_J:50:22403: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_J_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:50
msgctxt "text_id=22403 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　午後四時に洋館に到着し、サンルームでお茶をいただいているとリデルくんが乱入し、その後、土桔氏が殺害されている事が判明しました。"
msgstr "  I arrived at about 4 o'clock and had tea in the sunroom until Riddell charged in. I found out Mr. Tokitsu had been killed after that."

#. Occurrence WIK_J:62:22404: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_J_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:62
msgctxt "text_id=22404 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　こちらに来てからは土桔氏と出会っていません。"
msgstr "  I haven't seen him once during my time here."

#. Occurrence WIK_J:74:22405: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_J_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:74
msgctxt "text_id=22405 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　また、山城先生の姿が消えたのは土桔氏の事件が発覚する前だったと思います」"
msgstr "  I recall Mr. Yamasiro disappearing just before the Mr. Tokitsu incident came to light.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:112:22406: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_J_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:112
msgctxt "text_id=22406 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「私もエイリ神父と同じです。"
msgstr "\"I'm the same as Father Eiri."

#. Occurrence WIK_J:125:22407: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_J_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:125
msgctxt "text_id=22407 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　この屋敷に到着してから事件が起きるまで、一度も居間から離れてはいません」"
msgstr "  I haven't left the drawing room since arriving here.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:163:22408: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_J_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:163
msgctxt "text_id=22408 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「わ、わたしは……あっちゃあ、何度か席を立っちゃったなあ。おトイレと、ちょっと洋館探索に。"
msgstr "\"I-I, umm...I left my seat a few times, to use the restroom and explore the mansion."

#. Occurrence WIK_J:175:22409: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_J_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:175
msgctxt "text_id=22409 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　だ、だってアッちゃんが家にあげてくれるなんて珍しいじゃない？　<魔術品|レアもの>も見たいなー、と歩き回ってたけど、案の定、どこもロックは完璧でした。"
msgstr "  I-I mean, how often does Allie invite people over? There are so many rare magical trinkets to appreciate! So I took a little self-guided tour, but everything was locked up tight."

#. Occurrence WIK_J:187:22410: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_J_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:187
msgctxt "text_id=22410 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　あ、でも二階には行ってないわよ。これは本当」"
msgstr "  Oh, but I never went up to the second floor. That's the truth.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:220:22411: scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:220
msgctxt "text_id=22411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_K:8:22412: scene=WIK_SELECT_K
#: WIK_SELECT_K:8
msgctxt "text_id=22412 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｋ～"
msgstr "-Decision K-"

#. Occurrence WIK_K:73:22413: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:73
msgctxt "text_id=22413 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:113:22414: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:113
msgctxt "text_id=22414 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　細かな違和感はあれ、証言されたアリバイに大きな矛盾はなく、居間は沈黙に包まれた。"
msgstr "  The mood was a little tense, but there were no obvious contradictions between the alibis. The room grew silent."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:118:22415: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:118
msgctxt "text_id=22415 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　土桔氏が殺害された時間は特定できない。"
msgstr "  There wasn't enough evidence to pinpoint the time of Tokitsu's death."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:123:22416: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:123
msgctxt "text_id=22416 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰も爆発音を聞いていないし、プロイキッシャーとやらのせいで死後硬直の問題も、かなり曖昧になっているらしい。"
msgstr "  Nobody heard an explosion. And apparently, thanks to this Ploy Kickshaw nonsense, even rigor mortis wasn't a reliable indicator."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:146:22417: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:146
msgctxt "text_id=22417 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　死体の状態から犯行時間が特定できない以上、土桔氏と山城先生、二人がいつみんなの前からいなくなったか、で死亡時間を計るしかない。"
msgstr "  Since there was no way to deduce the exact time of death by examining the body, we could only estimate it based on the last time Tokitsu and Mr. Yamasiro were seen."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:186:22418: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:186
msgctxt "text_id=22418 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　土桔氏の死亡推定時刻は午後一時以降～午後六時まで。"
msgstr "  Mr. Tokitsu likely died between 1:00PM and 6:00PM;"

#. Occurrence WIK_K:194:22419: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:194
msgctxt "text_id=22419 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山城先生は午後四時から八時まで。"
msgstr "  Mr. Yamasiro, between 4:00PM and 8:00PM."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:199:22420: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:199
msgctxt "text_id=22420 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ただし、七時からは全員が集まっていたので、実際には四時から七時までの時間だろう。"
msgstr "  However, everyone was together at 7:00PM, so it had to have been sometime between 4:00PM and 7:00PM."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:246:22421: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:246
msgctxt "text_id=22421 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いずれの時間も、完全なアリバイがあるのは久遠寺さんと詠梨神父、シスター唯架だけ。"
msgstr "  Only three people had solid alibis: Miss Kuonji, Father Eiri, and Sister Yuika."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:251:22422: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:251
msgctxt "text_id=22422 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山城先生に関してはわたしと槻司も完全にアリバイがある。二人とも居間にいたからだ。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji and I have alibis when it comes to Mr. Yamasiro, because we were both in the drawing room at the time."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:287:22423: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:287
msgctxt "text_id=22423 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎と静希とベオは……どうだっただろう、把握していない。"
msgstr "  Aozaki, Sizuki, and Beo... were unknowns."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:331:22424: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:331
msgctxt "text_id=22424 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「でも、怪しいのはプロイの事を知っているアオコとアリス、あとリツカだよね。だって僕ら、スイーツハーツなんて知らなかったんだし」"
msgstr "\"I think the most likely suspects are Aoko, Alice, and Ritsuka; they knew about the Ploy. The rest of us had never heard of this Sweets Hearts.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:362:22425: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:362
msgctxt "text_id=22425 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そうだな。前もって知る機会があったかは別にして、まずはそこから検討しないとな。"
msgstr "\"Right. We should start by considering those who've known about it for a while."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:373:22426: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:373
msgctxt "text_id=22426 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　今日ここで知ったのか、はじめから知っていたのか。この違いは大きいぜ」"
msgstr "  There's a huge difference between them and the rest of us who learned about it today.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:409:22427: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:409
msgctxt "text_id=22427 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう。問題は、いつプロイとやらを起動させたか、だ。"
msgstr "  He was right. We needed to know when the Ploy was activated."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:423:22428: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:423
msgctxt "text_id=22428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たとえばわたしや山城先生がスイーツハーツだとしたら、洋館にやってきてから、見も知らないスイーツハーツとやらを発見し、起動させなくてはならない。"
msgstr "  If it was me or Mr. Yamasiro, once we arrived at the mansion, we'd have needed to find Sweets Hearts and activate it without knowing what it was."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:428:22429: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:428
msgctxt "text_id=22429 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　絶対にないとは言い切れないが、まず現実的ではない。"
msgstr "  Not impossible, but not realistic."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:433:22430: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:433
msgctxt "text_id=22430 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この場合、このゲームは突発的な犯罪に分類される。"
msgstr "  That would classify this game as type of murder mystery involving sudden crimes―"

#. Occurrence WIK_K:438:22431: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:438
msgctxt "text_id=22431 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たまたま、が重なって起きてしまった悲劇という事だ。"
msgstr "  the kind of scenario where unexpected tragedies occurred one after another."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:491:22432: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:491
msgctxt "text_id=22432 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　逆に、前もって知っていて、いつでも使用できる状態だったのなら、これは計画的な犯罪だ。"
msgstr "  On the other hand, if someone knew about the Ploy and had access to it anytime they wanted, that would make this a premeditated crime."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:496:22433: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:496
msgctxt "text_id=22433 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　プロイをいつ見付けたかは推理しなくていい。"
msgstr "  There was no need to figure out when the Ploy was found."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:518:22434: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:518
msgctxt "text_id=22434 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人物Ａは既にプロイと入れ替わっていて、あとはゆっくり、全員が揃ったタイミングでルールを発動させればいいのだから。"
msgstr "  Person A would have already switched places with the Ploy and executed their plan at their leisure once everyone was gathered."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:523:22435: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:523
msgctxt "text_id=22435 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今のところ、可能性はこちらの方が大きいだろう。"
msgstr "  Currently, that was the most likely scenario."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:570:22436: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_K_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:570
msgctxt "text_id=22436 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「はじめからプロイを知っている、という前提で絞るなら、怪しいのは蒼崎だな。"
msgstr "\"If we assume the perpetrator knew about the Ploy from the start, that makes Aozaki a suspect."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:581:22437: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_K_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:581
msgctxt "text_id=22437 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　蒼崎なら両名を殺せる時間があった。"
msgstr "  She had enough time to kill them both."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:587:22438: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_K_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:587
msgctxt "text_id=22438 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　律架さんの場合、土桔爺さんの殺害は難しい。"
msgstr "  It would've been tough for Ritsuka to kill Yurihiko."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:598:22439: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_K_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:598
msgctxt "text_id=22439 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　久遠寺は……ずっと居間にいた唯一の人間だ、犯行にはおよべない」"
msgstr "  Kuonji... was the only person in the drawing room the entire time, so she couldn't have done it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:623:22440: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:623
msgctxt "text_id=22440 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうね。それは否定しないわ。その二人に関してなら、私はいくらでもやれるチャンスはあったでしょう」"
msgstr "\"Can't deny that. I had more than enough chances to do it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:636:22441: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:636
msgctxt "text_id=22441 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「では、やはり」"
msgstr "\"I knew it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:663:22442: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:663
msgctxt "text_id=22442 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「やはりって何よ、やはりって。"
msgstr "\"What's *that* supposed to mean?"

#. Occurrence WIK_K:675:22443: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:675
msgctxt "text_id=22443 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あくまで可能性の話でしょ。それを言うなら、洋館にやってきて、すぐにプロイを発見して、勢い食べちゃって、それでスイーツハーツになっちゃった、って偶然もあるわけだし？"
msgstr "  I'm just saying it's possible. It's also possible somebody came to the mansion, found the Ploy, gobbled it up, and then turned into Sweets Hearts, right?"

#. Occurrence WIK_K:687:22444: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:687
msgctxt "text_id=22444 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　怪しさでいえばみんな同じよ。水掛論だわ」"
msgstr "  Don't be stupid. We're all suspicious to some degree here.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:714:22445: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:714
msgctxt "text_id=22445 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「……私とエイリ神父は潔白だと証明されましたが」"
msgstr "\"...Father Eiri and I have been cleared of guilt, though.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:726:22446: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:726
msgctxt "text_id=22446 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「アンタらがどんな経緯で洋館に来たかは不明よね？"
msgstr "\"But how much do we really know about how you arrived at the mansion?"

#. Occurrence WIK_K:738:22447: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:738
msgctxt "text_id=22447 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ロビーで話し声が聞こえたから有珠が出迎えたんでしょう？　それ以前、アンタらが何処にいたかなんて誰も証明できないじゃない」"
msgstr "  Alice met you in the foyer because she heard your voices, didn't she? You can't prove where you were before that.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:766:22448: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:766
msgctxt "text_id=22448 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「そうねえ。可能性でいうなら、詠梨さんと唯ちゃんとわたしが共謀してる、というのもアリだし」"
msgstr "\"She's right. And it's also possible I'm conspiring with Father Eiri and Yui.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:778:22449: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_K_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:778
msgctxt "text_id=22449 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「姉さん。貴女はどちらの味方ですか」"
msgstr "\"Ritsuka, whose side are you on?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:804:22450: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:804
msgctxt "text_id=22450 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「わたしは論理の味方よ！　マニアの<矜持|きょうじ>に誓って、どちらにも肩入れはしないから！"
msgstr "\"I'm on logic's side! I swear on my pride as a detective (fan) to remain totally impartial!"

#. Occurrence WIK_K:816:22451: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_K_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:816
msgctxt "text_id=22451 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　んー、まあ、それはそれとして、プロイを知っている、って条件ならもう一人、とびきり不自然な<娘|こ>もいるんだけど。それは誰かが指摘するでしょう」"
msgstr "  Anyway, if we're focusing on who already knew about the Ploy, I can think of one other person that doesn't quite add up. Who wants to point her out?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:836:22452: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:836
msgctxt "text_id=22452 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無言で火花を散らすシスターと蒼崎。"
msgstr "  Aozaki and the sister glared at each other so intensely I thought I saw sparks flying."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:841:22453: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:841
msgctxt "text_id=22453 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの二人は日頃から仲が悪いのだろう。"
msgstr "  They probably didn't get along even at the best of times."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:846:22454: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:846
msgctxt "text_id=22454 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この状況では、もはや完全に敵同士だ。"
msgstr "  Given the situation, it's no wonder they were at each other's throats."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:888:22455: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:888
msgctxt "text_id=22455 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「青子。あまり唯架さんを挑発しない方がいいと思うけど。今回のルールでは、彼女は最強の切り札なんだから」"
msgstr "\"Aoko. I wouldn't provoke Yuika if I were you. Given the current rules, she's our best trump card.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:899:22456: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:899
msgctxt "text_id=22456 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「は？　最悪の敵、の間違いじゃない？」"
msgstr "\"Wha? Don't you mean our greatest foe?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:911:22457: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:911
msgctxt "text_id=22457 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「切り札よ。だってあの人、この中で一番安全だもの。"
msgstr "\"No. She's in the safest position."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:923:22458: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_K_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:923
msgctxt "text_id=22458 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　そうでしょう、唯架さん？」"
msgstr "  Isn't that right, Yuika?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:949:22459: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_K_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:949
msgctxt "text_id=22459 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「ええ。私には笑いが分かりませんから。"
msgstr "\"Yes. I literally do not know how to laugh."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:955:22460: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_K_0004; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:955
msgctxt "text_id=22460 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　冗談で笑う、なんて事はまずあり得ません。ですから、先に退場するのは青子さんの方でしょうね」"
msgstr "  Jokes don't work on me. I have no doubt that you'll be the first to self-destruct, Aoko.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:980:22461: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:980
msgctxt "text_id=22461 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺さんは場を<諫|いさ>めたつもりっぽいけど、空気はますます剣呑になっていった。"
msgstr "  Kuonji appeared to have only meant it as a warning, but I could tell that the room was getting more tense."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:985:22462: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:985
msgctxt "text_id=22462 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな中、久遠寺さんの前に青い駒鳥が現れた。"
msgstr "  Just then, the blue robin appeared in front of Miss Kuonji."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1056:22463: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1056
msgctxt "text_id=22463 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　黒いテーブルに着地すると、駒鳥はチチチ、と"
msgstr "  It landed on the black table and started chirping."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1062:22464: voice_id=BA0_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1062
msgctxt "text_id=22464 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『ジブン、ハンニン分かったんスけど、言っていいッスか？』"
msgstr "\"I knows the perp. Wanna hear it?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1067:22465: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1067
msgctxt "text_id=22465 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鳴いた。"
msgstr "  It tweeted."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1146:22466: voice_id=BA0_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1146
msgctxt "text_id=22466 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『ブギャッ！？』"
msgstr "\"Bwark?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1151:22467: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1151
msgctxt "text_id=22467 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺さんの手刀が、容赦なく青い鳥を粉砕した。"
msgstr "  Miss Kuonji mercilessly squashed it with a karate chop."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1164:22468: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_K_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1164
msgctxt "text_id=22468 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……ともかく。"
msgstr "\"...Anyway..."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1176:22469: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_K_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1176
msgctxt "text_id=22469 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　いつまでも笑い話と思っていると、全滅するわよ」"
msgstr "  One funny line could be the end of you.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1200:22470: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1200
msgctxt "text_id=22470 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「そうだね。唯架さんはともかく、笑い上戸な人はどこかに隠れていた方がいいんじゃない？」"
msgstr "\"True. Anyone not named Yuika might want to find a good place to hide before it's too late.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1226:22471: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1226
msgctxt "text_id=22471 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二人の意見はもっともだ。"
msgstr "  That made sense to me."

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1231:22472: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1231
msgctxt "text_id=22472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_L:8:22473: scene=WIK_SELECT_L
#: WIK_SELECT_L:8
msgctxt "text_id=22473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｌ～"
msgstr "-Decision L-"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:30:22474: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=22474 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、"
msgstr "  I felt that it was best..."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:30:22475: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=22475 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それぞれ客室で朝まで過ごすべきでは、と思った。"
msgstr "  ...for everyone to stay in different guest rooms until morning."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:66:22476: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:66
msgctxt "text_id=22476 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「話はここまでです。"
msgstr "\"That's all there is to say."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:77:22477: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_L_1_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:77
msgctxt "text_id=22477 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　疑心暗鬼をこれ以上深める必要はないでしょう。犯人は分からずとも、解決する手段は明白なのですから」"
msgstr "  There's no point in ratcheting up suspicions even further. We can resolve this, whether we know the culprit or not.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:83:22478: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:83
msgctxt "text_id=22478 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぴしゃり、と唯架さんが場を制する。"
msgstr "  Just like that, Sister Yuika took the reins."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:130:22479: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:130
msgctxt "text_id=22479 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その迫力に誰も異論は……いや、律架さんだけはいじいじと拗ねているが、それ以外は誰も口を挟まない。"
msgstr "  Nobody objected to her display of authority. Well, almost nobody. Ritsuka was sulking."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:168:22480: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_L_1_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:168
msgctxt "text_id=22480 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「皆さんはそれぞれ客室で夜を過ごしてください。"
msgstr "\"Everyone, please spend the night in different guest rooms."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:174:22481: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_L_1_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:174
msgctxt "text_id=22481 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　きちんと鍵をかけて、朝まで誰も入れないように。"
msgstr "  Make sure to lock your doors and don't let anyone in until morning."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:180:22482: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_L_1_0004; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:180
msgctxt "text_id=22482 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　私とエイリ神父、律架の三人はここで寝ずの番をしますので、何か異常があるようでしたら駆けつけます」"
msgstr "  Father Eiri, Ritsuka, and I will stand guard here, so if anything unusual happens, we'll come running.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:216:22483: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:216
msgctxt "text_id=22483 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……まあ妥当なところね。"
msgstr "\"...Good enough for me."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:227:22484: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_1_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:227
msgctxt "text_id=22484 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　教会組も犯人候補だけど、唯架さんだけはプロイである可能性はないんだし」"
msgstr "  The suspect could be from the Church, but at least there's no chance Yuika's a Ploy.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:238:22485: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:238
msgctxt "text_id=22485 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それはなぜ？」"
msgstr "\"Why is that?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:264:22486: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_1_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:264
msgctxt "text_id=22486 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「魔女嫌いの唯架さんは、プロイキッシャーの口車には乗らないでしょ。"
msgstr "\"She hates witches. No way she'd ever fall for a Ploy Kickshaw's sweet talk."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:275:22487: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_1_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:275
msgctxt "text_id=22487 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　さ、そうと分かったら解散解散。各自、必要な物を手にしたら客室に戻って、朝まで籠城すること。"
msgstr "  Okay, we're done here. Everyone grab what you need, return to your rooms, and lock yourselves in until morning."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:281:22488: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_1_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:281
msgctxt "text_id=22488 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あと、トイレは物理的に我慢して」"
msgstr "  You'll just have to postpone your toilet breaks until tomorrow.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:317:22489: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:317
msgctxt "text_id=22489 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:323:22490: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:323
msgctxt "text_id=22490 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしが切り出すまでもなく、<籠城|ろうじょう>案が可決された。"
msgstr "  The plan to hole up in our rooms was accepted before I could say anything."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:328:22491: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:328
msgctxt "text_id=22491 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そりゃあ、これが一番安全かつ簡単な方針だろうけど。"
msgstr "  It did seem like the safest and simplest plan."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:364:22492: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_1_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:364
msgctxt "text_id=22492 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……俺の部屋は使えないな。"
msgstr "\"...I can't use my room, though."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:375:22493: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_1_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:375
msgctxt "text_id=22493 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　鳶丸、そっちの客室に行っていいか？」"
msgstr "  Tobimaru, can I stay in yours?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:386:22494: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:386
msgctxt "text_id=22494 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ああ、木乃美がいなくなったからな、ちょうどいい」"
msgstr "\"Yeah. Kinomi's gone, so that's fine.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:407:22495: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:407
msgctxt "text_id=22495 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司は静希からクッキーやら水の入ったピッチャーやらを受け取って、やれやれとロビーに向かう。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji took some cookies and a pitcher of water from Sizuki, before heading begrudgingly for the foyer."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:447:22496: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_1_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:447
msgctxt "text_id=22496 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ちょっと待って、槻司はそれでいいの！？」"
msgstr "\"Hold on, Tsukiji! Are you really fine with this?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:458:22497: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_1_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:458
msgctxt "text_id=22497 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「よくはねえが多数決なら仕方がねえ。問題を解決せずに封殺しちまうのは、民主主義の欠点だな。"
msgstr "\"Hell no, but the majority's spoken. We're smothering the problem without solving it-gotta love democracy."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:469:22498: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_1_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:469
msgctxt "text_id=22498 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　しかしまあ、これも鉄板の選択だ。何かあったら大声で助けを呼んでくれや。俺も二階だから、すぐに駆けつけられる」"
msgstr "  Still, it's the obvious choice. If anything happens, shout for help. I'm on the second floor, so I got you covered.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:519:22499: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:519
msgctxt "text_id=22499 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「あーあ、こんな事ならライブキャンセルするんじゃなかったわ。"
msgstr "\"Ugh. I never should've cancelled my concert."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:531:22500: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_1_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:531
msgctxt "text_id=22500 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "アリス、早く部屋に案内しなさいよ。もちろんゲストルームじゃなくて、アンタの部屋よ。"
msgstr "Alice, show me to my room. And by that, I mean *your* room, obviously; not a guest room."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:542:22501: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_1_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:542
msgctxt "text_id=22501 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　ここじゃロイヤルクラスなんて望むべくもないでしょ？　だから特別に、家主の部屋で妥協してあげるわ」"
msgstr "  I know I can't expect a royal suite here, so I'll suffer the owner's room.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:588:22502: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_1_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:588
msgctxt "text_id=22502 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「私は自分の部屋にいるから。朝まで誰も近づいちゃダメよ」"
msgstr "\"I'll be in my bedroom. Nobody better come near it until morning.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:602:22503: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:602
msgctxt "text_id=22503 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ボクはここで寝てるよー。何かあったら起こしてね」"
msgstr "\"I'll just sleep here. Wake me if anything happens.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:636:22504: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:636
msgctxt "text_id=22504 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……みんな、思い思いの場所に移動していく。"
msgstr "  ...Everyone went their separate ways."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:641:22505: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:641
msgctxt "text_id=22505 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは釈然としないまま、自分用にあてがわれた客室に移動した。"
msgstr "  Doubt still nagged at me, but I went to my assigned guest room for the time being."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:690:22506: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_1_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:690
msgctxt "text_id=22506 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:696:22507: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:696
msgctxt "text_id=22507 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鍵をかけてベッドに横になる。"
msgstr "  I locked the door and lay on the bed."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:703:22508: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:703
msgctxt "text_id=22508 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　万が一の事態に対応できるよう、寝間着には着替えていない。"
msgstr "  Just in case, I decided not to change into my pajamas."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:732:22509: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_1_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:732
msgctxt "text_id=22509 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「笑ったら死ぬ、とかワケが分からないけど……」"
msgstr "\"Laugh and you die? Doesn't make any sense...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:738:22510: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:738
msgctxt "text_id=22510 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここにいるわたしたち全員を殺そうとする何者かがいるのは確かだ。"
msgstr "  Someone or something was clearly trying to kill us all."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:743:22511: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:743
msgctxt "text_id=22511 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは横になって考える。"
msgstr "  I turned on my side, thoughts racing."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:748:22512: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:748
msgctxt "text_id=22512 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司や詠梨神父は論理的すぎて、ある疑問を見逃していると思う。"
msgstr "  To me, Tsukiji and Father Eiri were *too* rational. They'd overlooked something."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:768:22513: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:768
msgctxt "text_id=22513 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしが思うのは犯人の顔や正体じゃない。"
msgstr "  I wasn't fixated on the culprit's face or identity."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:773:22514: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:773
msgctxt "text_id=22514 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そいつは、どうしてこんな事をする気になったのか。"
msgstr "  I was more concerned with the whydunit."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:778:22515: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:778
msgctxt "text_id=22515 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしたち全員を殺して何の得があるんだろう、とうろんな頭で考え続けて―――"
msgstr "  What did the culprit have to gain by killing us all?"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:33:22516: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:33
msgctxt "text_id=22516 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その前に、"
msgstr "  I felt that..."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:33:22517: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:33
msgctxt "text_id=22517 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あのピンク女のアリバイも検証するべきだと思った。"
msgstr "  we needed to dig more into the pink girl's alibi."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:61:22518: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:61
msgctxt "text_id=22518 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「へ？　アタシにもやれっていうの？"
msgstr "\"Huh? You want me to go, too?"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:77:22519: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:77
msgctxt "text_id=22519 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　アタシは関係ないじゃない。だってアタシが来た時、もう爺さんもセンセイとやらもいなくなってたんでしょ？　常識的に考えて、完全にシロよ。"
msgstr "  I've got nothing to do with any of this. If you thought about it for even a second, you'd realize those two idiots died before I got here."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:89:22520: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:89
msgctxt "text_id=22520 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　だいたい、アタシにはスイーツハーツなんて使う理由がないし。なに不自由のないアイドルだし、願い事なんてたいていはお金で解決できるし。どうせ嵐を呼ぶなら、自分の手で起こして、まわりを犠牲にしてもスッパリ成就させまくるし」"
msgstr "  I don't even have a reason to use Sweets Hearts. I'm a rich celebrity; I can solve most of my problems with money, not to mention petty wishes. If I wanted to call down a storm, I'd do it even if it meant sacrificing everyone around me.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:120:22521: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:120
msgctxt "text_id=22521 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「バカいってんじゃねえ、テメエだって怪しいだろ。"
msgstr "\"Don't be a dumbass. You're as much a suspect as anyone."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:131:22522: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:131
msgctxt "text_id=22522 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　プロイとやらを知っていて、蒼崎と久遠寺に恨みがあって、おまけに慢性的なヒスときた。"
msgstr "  You know about Ploys, you have a grudge against Aozaki and Kuonji, and you're way too over the top."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:137:22523: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:137
msgctxt "text_id=22523 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　そもそも、なんで呼ばれもしていないのにやって来た。わざわざヘリ飛ばしてまでよ？」"
msgstr "  On top of that, you showed up uninvited. In a freakin' helicopter!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:164:22524: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:164
msgctxt "text_id=22524 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「つーかアレだ。テメエ、ヘリでやってきた時、まったく雨に濡れていなかったよな？"
msgstr "\"What's more, you weren't wet from the rain when you came in."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:170:22525: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:170
msgctxt "text_id=22525 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　ありゃどういうコトだ。"
msgstr "  Care to explain that?"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:181:22526: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:181
msgctxt "text_id=22526 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　それまで屋敷に隠れていて、ヘリを呼びつけたタイミングで登場すれば、さも“たったいま着きましたー！”って状況になるよなあ？」"
msgstr "  I bet you hid somewhere in the mansion, called your helicopter in, then made it seem like you just got here!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:209:22527: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0003; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:209
msgctxt "text_id=22527 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「なっ、なによそれ！？"
msgstr "\"Oh, come off it!"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:221:22528: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0004; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:221
msgctxt "text_id=22528 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　アタシ、ちゃんとヘリで来たってば！　雨に濡れないのはゴブリンで弾いたからだし！　なんでアタシが、アンタらを皆殺しにしようなんて思うのよ！？」"
msgstr "  Of course I came here in a helicopter! I used my Goblin to keep the rain off me! You seriously think I'd come here just to murder you all?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:258:22529: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:258
msgctxt "text_id=22529 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや。思ってたじゃないか、実際」"
msgstr "\"You've definitely thought about it before.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:264:22530: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:264
msgctxt "text_id=22530 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ええ。したわね、実際」"
msgstr "\"She has.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:291:22531: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0005; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:291
msgctxt "text_id=22531 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「あれはあれ、これはこれでしょう！？"
msgstr "\"That has nothing to do with this!"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:303:22532: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0006; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:303
msgctxt "text_id=22532 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　ああもう、マジ頭きた。アタシ帰る。帰って第二次ブリティッシュ作戦の準備する。もちろん、標的はここだからね」"
msgstr "  Ugh, you're giving me a headache. I'm leaving. Just you wait, I'll be back with an Operation British of my own. Ground zero: this house.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:343:22533: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:343
msgctxt "text_id=22533 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「できるの？　脱出は困難だって、有珠が」"
msgstr "\"Can you even leave? Remember what Alice said?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:355:22534: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_L_2_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:355
msgctxt "text_id=22534 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ええ。スイーツハーツの確率変動で、道は土砂崩れになっている可能性が高いわ。"
msgstr "\"It's highly likely that Sweets Hearts's probability shift has collapsed the roads."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:361:22535: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_L_2_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:361
msgctxt "text_id=22535 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　電話線もなくなってるから、外部と連絡もとれないし」"
msgstr "  And the phone is still out.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:385:22536: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0007; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:385
msgctxt "text_id=22536 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「はん、地上がダメなら空があるわ。"
msgstr "\"Ha! I can still fly."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:396:22537: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0008; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:396
msgctxt "text_id=22537 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　いいわよ、ヘリでしょ、お望み通り呼んでやるわよ。"
msgstr "  I'll just call my helicopter to come pick me up."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:402:22538: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0009; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:402
msgctxt "text_id=22538 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　アタシのゴブリンネストを舐めるんじゃないっての！」"
msgstr "  Don't underestimate the power of my Goblin Nest!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:430:22539: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:430
msgctxt "text_id=22539 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ピンク女は威勢良く<啖呵|たんか>をきって、廊下に出て行った。"
msgstr "  The girl in pink stormed out into the hallway."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:502:22540: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0010; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:502
msgctxt "text_id=22540 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "『ハロー。パパ？　アタシだけど、いますぐミサキ町の白犬塚までヘリ、飛ばして。そう、あのミサキ町。"
msgstr "\"Hello, Daddy? It's me. Can you send a helicopter to Shiroinuzuka in Misaki...? Yes, *that* Misaki."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:515:22541: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0011; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:515
msgctxt "text_id=22541 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "はぁ！？　まだ諦めてないのか、ですって？　ヴァァァァァカ、頭ん中カボチャになってんじゃないの！？　勝つまでやるのがアタシだし！　第一、まだぜんっぜん負けてないし！　あんなの引き分けにすぎないわよ！"
msgstr "What?! What do you mean, give up?! Have you gone SENILE, you old codger?! I decided I'd keep trying until victory is mine! And I NEVER lost in the first place! That was just a draw!"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:528:22542: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0012; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:528
msgctxt "text_id=22542 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　ほら、座標は分かるでしょ。さっさと飛ばして。十分以内よ、十分以内』"
msgstr "  You know the coordinates. Send me a chopper now! You've got ten minutes!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:555:22543: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0013; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:555
msgctxt "text_id=22543 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "『は？　支社にあるヘリじゃ無理？　嵐がひどくて近づけない？　ッタコ、んなコト分かってるわよ！"
msgstr "\"Huh? What do you mean you can't send one in this storm? Do I sound like I care!?"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:561:22544: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0014; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:561
msgctxt "text_id=22544 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　それでも、このアタシが、今すぐ、ミサイルみたいにカッ飛ばせって言ってんの……！"
msgstr "  Or are you suggesting that I fly myself out of here like a missile!?"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:573:22545: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0015; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:573
msgctxt "text_id=22545 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　飛ばしたくても機体がない？　このハイトンチキ、アンタそれでも商人？　頭使いなさいよね。近くに軍用基地あるでしょ。そこに試作の最新鋭機があるって話よ。強襲用の。それ、一機チャーターして』"
msgstr "  ...We don't have any helicopters to send? You call yourself a businessman, you dimwit? Use your brain! There's a military base nearby, remember? They're testing a prototype assault craft there. Just charter it!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:600:22546: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0016; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:600
msgctxt "text_id=22546 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "『あーもう、ムリムリうるさいわねそれしか言えないの？"
msgstr "\"Goodness, can't you do *anything* on your own?"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:612:22547: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0017; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:612
msgctxt "text_id=22547 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　はぁ？　会社の立て直しで<実弾|キャッシュ>がない？　機体プラス、スタッフごと買い取らなきゃならん？　上等じゃない、その程度アタシがいくらでも稼いであげるってーの！　アラブの坊ちゃん宅だろうがチャイナの金満家の所だろうが、プライベートライブ<二三|にさん><発|ぱつ>ぶちかましてあげるわよ！　それでおつりがくるでしょ？』"
msgstr "  WHAT?! What do you mean, cash is tight because you're restructuring?! You'd have to buy the entire aircraft and crew? Go ahead, then! I can make you back that money in a day! I'll just do a private concert for some oil sheikh or a Chinese billionaire! That good enough for you?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:639:22548: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0018; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:639
msgctxt "text_id=22548 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "『うざっ、泣いて喜ぶとか本気で止めて。お金のためよお金のため、音楽業なんてどうでもいいんだから！"
msgstr "\"Oh *please*, don't cry and tell me how proud you are of me. It's just for the *money*, Daddy. I couldn't care less about the music industry!"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:645:22549: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0019; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:645
msgctxt "text_id=22549 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　わかったら十分以内！　最新鋭機の、スーパーカッコイイの！　クソアパッチなんか寄越したら親子の縁切るから、覚悟しておくコトね！』"
msgstr "  Just get me that helicopter within TEN minutes! That new, experimental, super-cool one! NOT some budget Apache or any other rubbish like that, or I'LL NEVER SPEAK TO YOU AGAIN!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:699:22550: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:699
msgctxt "text_id=22550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……なんか、ものすごい罵詈雑言が響いてきている。"
msgstr "  The pink girl's vicious berating could be heard throughout the house."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:704:22551: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:704
msgctxt "text_id=22551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ピンク女は英語でひとりごとを呟いているっぽいんだけど、あまりにも早口＆<俗語|スラング>の連続で、もう何を言っているんだか聞き取れない。"
msgstr "  She was speaking English so quickly and with so much slang mixed in that I couldn't quite catch it all."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:709:22552: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:709
msgctxt "text_id=22552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……そもそもわたし、ヒアリング得意じゃないし。"
msgstr "  ...Listening wasn't a particular strength of mine, anyway."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:737:22553: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:737
msgctxt "text_id=22553 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……あの馬鹿、本気で軍用ヘリ呼びつけやがった……」"
msgstr "\"Did that moron really just order a military chopper?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:778:22554: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0020; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:778
msgctxt "text_id=22554 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「お待たせ。あと十分もしたら救いの天使が来るわ。"
msgstr "\"Right, that's all settled. My guardian angel will be descending from the skies in about ten minutes."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:791:22555: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0021; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:791
msgctxt "text_id=22555 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　スイーツハーツのルールはこの山限定だから、外に出てしまえば何もかもチャラ。アタシは一足先に家に帰って、豪華なディナーとしゃれこませてもらうから」"
msgstr "  Sweets Hearts's rules only apply to this mountain. As soon as I get out of here, I'll put all this behind me. I'll just head home, have a fancy dinner, and relax.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:819:22556: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0022; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:819
msgctxt "text_id=22556 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「ああ、けど安心なさい？"
msgstr "\"Oh, and don't worry."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:832:22557: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0023; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:832
msgctxt "text_id=22557 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　アタシだって鬼じゃないし、どうしてもって言うなら乗っけていってあげてもいいわよ？　こんな犯人当てゲームにこりごりな人は、いますぐアタシ側に来るコトね」"
msgstr "  I'm not that terrible of a person. If any of you want a ride, I'd be happy to oblige. I'm sure some of you are tired of this stupid detective game.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:864:22558: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_2_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:864
msgctxt "text_id=22558 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「待てそこ。どうしてすぐ強い方に付こうとするのか」"
msgstr "\"Hold it, buddy. Where do you think you're going?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:881:22559: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_2_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:881
msgctxt "text_id=22559 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、しかし。自ら救いの天使だと」"
msgstr "\"Well, she said she was our guardian angel.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:912:22560: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:912
msgctxt "text_id=22560 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「やめとけ草十郎。そいつが救いの天使だってんなら、蒼崎なんざ癒しの女神クラスになっちまう。根本的に喩えを間違えてるぞ、アレ」"
msgstr "\"I wouldn't if I were you, Soujyuro. If she's an angel, then that makes Aozaki a goddess of healing. Don't fall for her crazy metaphors.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:938:22561: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_2_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:938
msgctxt "text_id=22561 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……むう。久万梨はどうする？"
msgstr "\"Huh. What about you, Kumari?"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:938:22562: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_2_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:938
msgctxt "text_id=22562 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　鳶丸たちはこう言っているけど」"
msgstr "  You heard what Tobimaru said.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:949:22563: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:949
msgctxt "text_id=22563 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「わたしも辞退。帰るならひとりで帰ってもらえばいい」"
msgstr "\"I'm not going. If she wants to leave, she can go by herself.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:955:22564: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:955
msgctxt "text_id=22564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本当は助けが来るならすぐに乗りたいところだが、あのピンク女の手を借りるのは<御免蒙|ごめんこうむ>る。"
msgstr "  To be honest, if rescue was coming, I really did want to leave. But I wasn't about to owe this pink princess any favors."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:980:22565: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0024; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:980
msgctxt "text_id=22565 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「ふん、この状況でも仲良しごっことか、ドリーマー極まったわね。"
msgstr "\"Hmph. You must all be a bunch of dreamers to stay all chummy at a time like this."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:993:22566: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0025; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:993
msgctxt "text_id=22566 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　いいわよ、好きにすれば？　明日の朝刊の見出しが“山の上の洋館、宿泊客全員行方不明か？”なんてモンにならないよう、せいぜい気をつけなさい」"
msgstr "  You lot can do as you please. Just don't let tomorrow's headline be, 'all guests missing from the hilltop mansion.'\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1019:22567: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_2_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1019
msgctxt "text_id=22567 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「はん。逃げだす女がよく言ったものね。"
msgstr "\"Ha! Snark all you want, coward."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1030:22568: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_2_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1030
msgctxt "text_id=22568 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　そもそもこの天候で助けなんて来るハズないし。外の天気、嵐というより地獄でしょ。夢見がちなのはそっちの頭の方だと思う」"
msgstr "  Nobody's coming for you in this weather. It's like hell out there. Who's really dreaming?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1043:22569: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0026; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1043
msgctxt "text_id=22569 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「っ……！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1065:22570: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1065
msgctxt "text_id=22570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と。"
msgstr "  And then..."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1070:22571: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1070
msgctxt "text_id=22571 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　十分を待たずして外からは強風とは別の、異質な風切り音が聞こえてきた。"
msgstr "  Before even ten minutes had gone by, there was a bizarre noise from outside that was separate from the howling storm."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1102:22572: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0027; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1102
msgctxt "text_id=22572 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「あはっ、予定よりすっごく早い！"
msgstr "\"Aha! Earlier than expected!"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1108:22573: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0028; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1108
msgctxt "text_id=22573 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　さっすがパパ、なんだかんだ言ってコネクションも行動力もあるんだからー♪」"
msgstr "  I knew Daddy would come through! He's got friends in high places, and he knows how to use them!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1212:22574: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1212
msgctxt "text_id=22574 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　吹きすさぶ嵐の中、一つ目の魔鳥が接近してくる。"
msgstr "  In the midst of the tempest, a demonic bird came bearing down on us."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1217:22575: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1217
msgctxt "text_id=22575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目と思われたのは、何キロメートル先さえ照らす強力なサーチライトだ。"
msgstr "  Bright spots that I'd thought were eyes turned out to be a powerful searchlight, its beam stretching out for miles."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1222:22576: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1222
msgctxt "text_id=22576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鋼鉄のヘリコプターは、風速八十キロもの風をものともせず、"
msgstr "  The steel helicopter struggled against winds in excess of 50 miles per hour, and then..."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1580:22577: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_2_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1580
msgctxt "text_id=22577 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あ、落ちた」"
msgstr "\"Oh. It crashed.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1593:22578: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0029; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1593
msgctxt "text_id=22578 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「あ―――あ、あ、あ」"
msgstr "\"Ah... AaaaAAaAAAhhh...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1694:22579: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1694
msgctxt "text_id=22579 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いやあ、この天候でフライトとか、常識的に考えて無茶でしょう。有珠さんでもそこまで世間知らずではありませんよ」"
msgstr "\"They should've known better than to fly in this weather. Even Alice has better common sense than that.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1718:22580: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_L_2_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1718
msgctxt "text_id=22580 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ええ。必ず落ちると思ったわ。リデルの作戦がうまくいった事なんて、今まで一度もないのだし」"
msgstr "\"Right. I knew it was going to crash. None of Riddell's silly plans ever work out.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1728:22581: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0030; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1728
msgctxt "text_id=22581 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「あるわよ、アンタさえ関わらなければいつだってアタシはパーフェクトだっつーの！"
msgstr "\"They work perfectly every time! Just never when you're around!"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1741:22582: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0031; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1741
msgctxt "text_id=22582 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　それに、今のはただのテストよ。"
msgstr "  Anyway, that was just a test."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1755:22583: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0032_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1755
msgctxt "text_id=22583 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　本命は後からやって―――"
msgstr "  My real plan is just beginning."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1769:22584: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0032_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1769
msgctxt "text_id=22584 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "ちょっと待って、タイム」"
msgstr "Hang on, I have to take this. Time out.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1806:22585: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1806
msgctxt "text_id=22585 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ポケットにポケベルでも入っているのか、ピンク女はまた廊下に出て行ってしまった。"
msgstr "  The pink girl went back out into the hallway. Maybe she had a pager in her pocket."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1814:22586: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0033; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1814
msgctxt "text_id=22586 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "『はあ、責任問題になったァ！？　いま特殊部隊が本社ビルの屋上から侵入して来てるですってーー！？』"
msgstr "\"WHAT!? They're claiming you're responsible...?! Special forces are breaching the company office!?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1832:22587: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1832
msgctxt "text_id=22587 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんか、廊下から悲鳴が聞こえてくる。"
msgstr "  Her yelling resonated through the hallway."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1872:22588: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0034; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1872
msgctxt "text_id=22588 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "『落ち着いて、下手な抵抗はしちゃダメよ、すぐ無線で相手のトップと交渉して。え、損害賠償？　プロジェクトごと買い取らないと殺すって？　つーかもう拘束されてる？　ああもう、カイは何やってんのよ！？　で、いくら？　ごはっ、なにその金額、ケタ二つ違くない！？　払えない払えない、そんなのすぐに払えない！"
msgstr "\"Calm down. Don't do anything stupid. Talk to the commanding officer. Huh? They want you to pay for the damages? They're going to kill you if you don't buy out the entire project? You're already tied up? Ugh, what's Kai doing at a time like this?! So how much do they want? Pfft! That's at least two more zeroes than it should be! We can't pay that, not right away!"

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1900:22589: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0035; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1900
msgctxt "text_id=22589 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　ちょっと待って、えーと……う、うん、なんとかなるかも』"
msgstr "Hold on a second, um... hmm... maybe there is a way.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1921:22590: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0036; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1921
msgctxt "text_id=22590 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "『今年のツアー延長と、アタシの持ち株と、タヒチの島を売却すれば、なんとかなりそう。いいわ、契約成立、買い取っちゃって！　軍事産業とか畑違いだけど、とりあえずパパの安全が最優先！』"
msgstr "\"I'll extend my tour this year, sell off my stock, my island in Tahiti... That should be enough. Okay, it's a deal! Sign the papers! The defense industry is new territory for us, but your life is more important, Daddy!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1957:22591: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_2_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1957
msgctxt "text_id=22591 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1962:22592: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1962
msgctxt "text_id=22592 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ちょっと気になる。"
msgstr "  I was a little curious now."

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1967:22593: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1967
msgctxt "text_id=22593 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_M:8:22594: scene=WIK_SELECT_M
#: WIK_SELECT_M:8
msgctxt "text_id=22594 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｍ～"
msgstr "-Decision M-"

#. Occurrence WIK_M_1:30:22595: scene=WIK_M_1
#: WIK_M_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=22595 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、ちらっと廊下の様子を見てみたい、と思った。"
msgstr "  I think I'll take a peek in the hallway."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_1:72:22596: scene=WIK_M_1
#: WIK_M_1:72
msgctxt "text_id=22596 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこには、"
msgstr "  There, I saw..."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_1:85:22597: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_1_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_1
#: WIK_M_1:85
msgctxt "text_id=22597 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「……失った……すべて失ったわ……」"
msgstr "\"...I've lost everything... Everything...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_1:90:22598: scene=WIK_M_1
#: WIK_M_1:90
msgctxt "text_id=22598 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この世の終わりを見たような、語るも無惨な幽鬼の顔があったりした。"
msgstr "  Her face was haunted, as if she'd looked upon the end of the world."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_1:95:22599: scene=WIK_M_1
#: WIK_M_1:95
msgctxt "text_id=22599 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　武士の情けで見なかったフリで、急いでドアを閉める。"
msgstr "  I quickly shut the door and pretended I didn't see anything. She deserved a warrior's dignity, at the very least."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:33:22600: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:33
msgctxt "text_id=22600 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しばらくの間。"
msgstr "  A moment went by."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:38:22601: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:38
msgctxt "text_id=22601 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一分ほど経った後、"
msgstr "  After about a minute..."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:66:22602: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:66
msgctxt "text_id=22602 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「まあ、ヘリの事はきっぱり忘れるとして。"
msgstr "\"Forget that stupid helicopter."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:77:22603: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:77
msgctxt "text_id=22603 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　もっと前向きな話をしましょう」"
msgstr "  Let's think more positively.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:85:22604: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:85
msgctxt "text_id=22604 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は何事もなかったように現れた。"
msgstr "  She returned, acting as if nothing had happened."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:90:22605: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:90
msgctxt "text_id=22605 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　敵ながら、そのプライドの高さは認めざるを得ない。"
msgstr "  We were enemies, but I had to respect her sense of pride."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:127:22606: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:127
msgctxt "text_id=22606 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「リデル、オマ……」"
msgstr "\"Riddell, you...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:138:22607: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:138
msgctxt "text_id=22607 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「トビマル。前向きな話をしましょう」"
msgstr "\"Tobimaru. I said, let's move on.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:149:22608: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:149
msgctxt "text_id=22608 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……分かった。とりあえず、オマエさんが潔白だってのだけは分かった。というか、これでスイーツハーツがオマエだったら、酷すぎて目も当てられねえ」"
msgstr "\"...Fine. At least we know you're innocent. If it turns out you're Sweets Hearts after all this crap, I don't think I can look you in the eye ever again.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:175:22609: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:175
msgctxt "text_id=22609 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「そんなの当たり前でしょ。さっきからアタシは関係ないって言ってるじゃない。"
msgstr "\"I told you I had nothing to do with any of this from the start."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:186:22610: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:186
msgctxt "text_id=22610 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　だいたいね、このアタシ、希代の天才マイスター、新世代魔女であるリデル様が、こーんなバカっぽくて古くさいプロイに引っかかるワケないじゃない」"
msgstr "  I'm a genius, a rare Meinster, a witch for the modern age. The great Riddell would never stoop to using silly obsolete Ploys.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:218:22611: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:218
msgctxt "text_id=22611 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いや、ひっかかっただろ、あのヘリ」"
msgstr "\"But you'd use a helicopter?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:229:22612: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0005; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:229
msgctxt "text_id=22612 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「ヘリはヘリ、アタシはアタシよ！"
msgstr "\"Shut up about the helicopter! This is about ME!"

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:235:22613: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0006; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:235
msgctxt "text_id=22613 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　さっきだって笑ったけど耐えきったでしょ。"
msgstr "  I laughed, but I'm still alive, aren't I?"

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:246:22614: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0007; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:246
msgctxt "text_id=22614 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "　いっとくけど、アタシは絶対笑わないからね。ここでゆっくり、アンタらが古くさいプロイなんかにやられて消えていくのを眺めてやるから！」"
msgstr "  There isn't a chance in hell I'm going to laugh again. I'm going to watch you all get picked off one by one by some ancient Ploy!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:305:22615: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:305
msgctxt "text_id=22615 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　憎まれ口を叩いてはいるが、ピンク女も観念したのだろう。"
msgstr "  She sounded aggressive, but I think the pink girl was more concerned than she let on."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:310:22616: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:310
msgctxt "text_id=22616 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふん、と鼻を鳴らしてソファーに腰を下ろす。"
msgstr "  With one last huff through her nose, she plopped down on the sofa."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:315:22617: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:315
msgctxt "text_id=22617 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしたち同様、この夜に付き合う腹を決めたようだ。"
msgstr "  She seemed to made up her mind to work with us for tonight."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:340:22618: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:340
msgctxt "text_id=22618 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ごめんなさい。少し席を外すわ。すぐに戻ってくるから、話を続けていて」"
msgstr "\"Sorry, but I'll be back in a second. Carry on.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:349:22619: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:349
msgctxt "text_id=22619 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺さんは……あ、トイレか。"
msgstr "  Miss Kuonji was... ah, the bathroom."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:373:22620: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:373
msgctxt "text_id=22620 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「しかし、<図|はか>らずも脱出は不可能である事が証明されてしまいましたね。"
msgstr "\"Now we know for sure that escape is impossible."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:384:22621: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:384
msgctxt "text_id=22621 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　誰がスイーツハーツなのか特定するか、朝まで全滅しないように注意を払うか。私は後者を選びたいところですが」"
msgstr "  We need to figure out who Sweets Hearts is, or survive until morning. I personally favor the latter.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:420:22622: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:420
msgctxt "text_id=22622 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「賛成。薮をつついて蛇を出したら、それこそ全滅の可能性もでてくるし。"
msgstr "\"Me, too. If we keep poking the hornet's nest, we might all end up dead."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:431:22623: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:431
msgctxt "text_id=22623 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　久万梨は？」"
msgstr "  What about you, Kumari?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:457:22624: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:457
msgctxt "text_id=22624 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「わたしはどっちでもいいけど……槻司はどうなの？」"
msgstr "\"I'm fine with either... Tsukiji?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:475:22625: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:475
msgctxt "text_id=22625 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「俺か？　俺は犯人特定に一票だな。"
msgstr "\"Me? I vote we figure out who the killer is."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:487:22626: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:487
msgctxt "text_id=22626 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　こんな状況を作り出した間抜けには、きっちり文句いわねえとな」"
msgstr "  I'd like to give them a piece of my mind.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:525:22627: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:525
msgctxt "text_id=22627 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「私はどちらでも。リデルさんではありませんが、どちらに転んでも安全ですので」"
msgstr "\"I'm fine either way. I don't share Miss Riddell's opinion, but I'll be safe with either option.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:535:22628: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:535
msgctxt "text_id=22628 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「わたしは槻司くんに賛成っ。"
msgstr "\"I'm with Tsukiji."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:535:22629: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:535
msgctxt "text_id=22629 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　推理、推理しましょう、みんな！」"
msgstr "  Time for a little deductive reasoning!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:572:22630: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:572
msgctxt "text_id=22630 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「俺は……そうですね。外の天気も荒れる一方だし、みんな部屋に立てこもった方がいいとは思う。鍵をかけて寝てしまえば他人に笑わせられようがないし」"
msgstr "\"As for me... Let me think. The weather's only getting worse, so maybe we should stay in our rooms, lock the doors, and go to sleep. Nobody can make us laugh, then.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:583:22631: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:583
msgctxt "text_id=22631 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「えー、つまんないでーす！"
msgstr "\"Aww, but that's so boring!"

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:594:22632: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:594
msgctxt "text_id=22632 | speaker=beo"
msgid "　草十郎さん、ここはもうちょっと様子見ようよー。アオコの死に方とか、すごく興味ない？」"
msgstr "  Come on, Soujyuro! Let's stick this out! Don't you want to watch Aoko die?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:606:22633: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_M_A_0001_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:606
msgctxt "text_id=22633 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ベオ、そういうのは冗談でも―――"
msgstr "\"Beo, that's not funny―"

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:619:22634: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_M_A_0001_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:619
msgctxt "text_id=22634 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "む？」"
msgstr "Hm?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:679:22635: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:679
msgctxt "text_id=22635 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「！」"
msgstr "\"!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:684:22636: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:684
msgctxt "text_id=22636 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　突然、部屋が真っ暗になった。"
msgstr "  Suddenly, the room was pitch-dark."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:710:22637: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:710
msgctxt "text_id=22637 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「落ち着いて。電気が切れたようです。皆さん、<無闇|むやみ>に動いてはいけませんよ。<闇|やみ>だけに」"
msgstr "\"Everyone stay calm. It's just a power outage. If I find out who turned the lights out, I'll knock *their* lights out.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:717:22638: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:717
msgctxt "text_id=22638 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:723:22639: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:723
msgctxt "text_id=22639 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　危ない危ない。あまりの寒さに、一周まわって吹きだしかけてしまった。"
msgstr "  That was a close one. I heard several people almost fail to suppress a laugh."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:749:22640: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:749
msgctxt "text_id=22640 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なに考えてんのよ詠梨！　全滅するかと思ったじゃない！」"
msgstr "\"What're you thinking, Eiri?! You could've killed us all!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:754:22641: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:754
msgctxt "text_id=22641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いやそれはない、"
msgstr "  He would've killed *you*, maybe."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:759:22642: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:759
msgctxt "text_id=22642 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とツッコミを入れたいわたしだった。"
msgstr "  But I decided to keep that to myself."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:786:22643: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:786
msgctxt "text_id=22643 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いやあ、今なら切れる、と心が騒いでしまいまして」"
msgstr "\"I couldn't help it. The opportunity presented itself.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:809:22644: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:809
msgctxt "text_id=22644 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「うん、タイミングはバッチリだった。つまんないダジャレも、切り出し方次第で人を殺せるんだな」"
msgstr "\"Good timing, though. Even a silly joke can be effective if the timing is right.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:820:22645: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:820
msgctxt "text_id=22645 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「顔が見えないのがまた効くよな」"
msgstr "\"Something about not being able to see his face makes it funnier, too.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:831:22646: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0008; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:831
msgctxt "text_id=22646 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「まったくよ。このアタシですらちょっとブルっときたわ。もしかしてアイツが犯人なんじゃないの？」"
msgstr "\"Good grief. Even I almost laughed. Are you sure he isn't the killer?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:866:22647: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:866
msgctxt "text_id=22647 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　暗闇の中で会話は続く。"
msgstr "  Our conversation continued in the dark."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:871:22648: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:871
msgctxt "text_id=22648 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……修学旅行の怪談話というか、暗闇の中でのやりとりは妙に興奮するというか。"
msgstr "  It reminded me of telling ghost stories on a school trip; it's just fun to talk in the dark sometimes."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:876:22649: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:876
msgctxt "text_id=22649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんとなく、誰もが“今ならひとりぐらい笑わせてもいいんじゃないかな？”なんて浮ついた空気になってきた。"
msgstr "  For whatever reason, I could tell we were all tempted to make each other laugh."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:908:22650: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:908
msgctxt "text_id=22650 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あ、蝋燭みつけた。誰かライター持ってない？"
msgstr "\"Found a candle. Anyone got some matches?"

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:908:22651: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:908
msgctxt "text_id=22651 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　もしくはマッチ」"
msgstr "  Or a lighter?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:917:22652: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:917
msgctxt "text_id=22652 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ちょっと待ッチ」"
msgstr "\"When my Italian plumber lost weight, he got-a-lighter.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:929:22653: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:929
msgctxt "text_id=22653 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「え、今のも神父さん？」"
msgstr "\"Was that Father Eiri again?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:955:22654: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:955
msgctxt "text_id=22654 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「酷い。酷すぎる」"
msgstr "\"Oh, man. That was so bad.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:967:22655: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:967
msgctxt "text_id=22655 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「脳が退化しているとしか思えません」"
msgstr "\"I feel dumber for having heard it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:978:22656: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:978
msgctxt "text_id=22656 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いや、この原始の状態じゃあ<知性|エスプリ>利かせてもインパクトねぇぞ。シンプルイズベストだ」"
msgstr "\"Nah. I think the simple jokes actually work better given the primal circumstances we're in.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1021:22657: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1021
msgctxt "text_id=22657 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あ。みんな静かに、電気つきそうだぞ」"
msgstr "\"Hey, be quiet. I think the power's coming back on.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1075:22658: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1075
msgctxt "text_id=22658 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺邸には自家発電装置でもあるのだろうか。"
msgstr "  Did the Kuonji Estate have its own power generator?"

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1080:22659: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1080
msgctxt "text_id=22659 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰が復旧させたかはともかく、居間はあっさりと人工の明かりを取り戻した。"
msgstr "  It wasn't clear who restored the power, but the drawing room was flooded with artificial light."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1105:22660: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0009; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1105
msgctxt "text_id=22660 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「あら、古くさい屋敷のクセに設備はしっかりしてるのね。このまま暗闇で朝まで過ごすのかと心配しちゃったわ」"
msgstr "\"Looks like this old mansion at least has some proper equipment. I was worried we were going to be stuck in the dark until morning.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1112:22661: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1112
msgctxt "text_id=22661 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いつの間にか隣にいたピンク女が顔をあげる。"
msgstr "  Riddell had moved next to me at some point. She looked up."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1117:22662: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1117
msgctxt "text_id=22662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしもつられて顔を上げて、"
msgstr "  I followed her gaze..."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1273:22663: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0010; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1273
msgctxt "text_id=22663 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「ぎゃははははははははは"
msgstr "\"Bwahahahaha―"

msgctxt "text_id=22664 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ぎごばぁ！？」"
msgstr "Hurk!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1428:22665: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1428
msgctxt "text_id=22665 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ピンク女は胸にドンドンドンと衝撃を受けて、くるくると踊りながら激倒した。"
msgstr "  The pink girl took what looked like several impacts to the chest, spun around dramatically, and collapsed."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1474:22666: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1474
msgctxt "text_id=22666 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「リデル！？　ちょっと、何があったの！？」"
msgstr "\"Riddell?! What happened?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1486:22667: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1486
msgctxt "text_id=22667 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎がリデルに駆け寄る。"
msgstr "  Aozaki rushed over to her side."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1491:22668: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1491
msgctxt "text_id=22668 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは間一髪の差で助かった。"
msgstr "  I'd narrowly avoided the same fate."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1496:22669: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1496
msgctxt "text_id=22669 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ピンク女……リデルが先に笑っていなかったら、間違いなくわたしが笑っていただろう。"
msgstr "  If she hadn't started laughing first, I'd have busted a gut for sure."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1554:22670: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1554
msgctxt "text_id=22670 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「リデル、しっかりしなさいリデル！"
msgstr "\"Riddell! Hang in there!"

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1560:22671: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1560
msgctxt "text_id=22671 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　死ぬ前に教えて、何を見たの！？　犯人？　犯人ね！？」"
msgstr "  Before you die, tell us what you saw! Was it the killer?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1567:22672: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0011_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1567
msgctxt "text_id=22672 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "「ふ、ふふ……そんな、つまんないヤツ、より……もっとおぞましくて、ぷにぷにした、悪魔、が―――"
msgstr "\"H-Heh... No, something... much more... interesting...much worse... a squishy... demon..."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1577:22673: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0011_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1577
msgctxt "text_id=22673 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "ばたり」"
msgstr "Blargh.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1608:22674: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1608
msgctxt "text_id=22674 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「リデルーーーーーーー！」"
msgstr "\"Riddell!!!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1628:22675: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1628
msgctxt "text_id=22675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　リデルを抱きかかえながら号泣する蒼崎。"
msgstr "  Aozaki burst into tears, clutching May's lifeless body in her arms."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1633:22676: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1633
msgctxt "text_id=22676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　似たもの同士、感じ入るものがあったらしい。"
msgstr "  They were probably more alike than they cared to admit."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1645:22677: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1645
msgctxt "text_id=22677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな中、何事もなかったかのように戻ってくる久遠寺さん。"
msgstr "  Amidst the commotion, Miss Kuonji returned, not appearing to have noticed the death."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1672:22678: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1672
msgctxt "text_id=22678 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「何かあったのかしら」"
msgstr "\"What's going on?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1682:22679: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1682
msgctxt "text_id=22679 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「分からん。わけもなく爆笑して自滅した。"
msgstr "\"I don't know. She just burst out laughing for no reason and then she was gone."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1682:22680: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1682
msgctxt "text_id=22680 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　今度はさすがに復活は無理っぽい」"
msgstr "  Don't think she's coming back from this one.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1716:22681: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1716
msgctxt "text_id=22681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とにかくこのままでは可哀想だ、と槻司はリデルにテーブルクロスをかけて部屋の隅に寝かせる。"
msgstr "  Perhaps out of pity, Tsukiji covered her with a tablecloth and lay her to rest at the side of the room."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1721:22682: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1721
msgctxt "text_id=22682 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはそそそっ、と久遠寺さんに近づいて、耳打ちなど一つ。"
msgstr "  I quietly shuffled over to Miss Kuonji and whispered in her ear."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1763:22683: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1763
msgctxt "text_id=22683 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「久遠寺さん、今の、なに？」"
msgstr "\"Miss Kuonji, what was *that*?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1775:22684: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1775
msgctxt "text_id=22684 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「着替える服を間違えたの。みんなには黙っていてね、久万梨さん」"
msgstr "\"I mixed up my change of clothes. Don't tell anyone, Kumari.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1787:22685: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_M_A_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1787
msgctxt "text_id=22685 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……いいけど。犯人じゃないのよね、貴女？」"
msgstr "\"...Okay, but you're not the killer, are you?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1814:22686: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1814
msgctxt "text_id=22686 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「ええ。今のはただの趣味だから安心して。"
msgstr "\"Of course not. This was just a hobby of mine, don't worry."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1826:22687: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1826
msgctxt "text_id=22687 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　昔から、あの娘を見ていると何故かいじめたくなってしまって」"
msgstr "  For some reason, I've always felt like bullying her, and I can't explain why.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1837:22688: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1837
msgctxt "text_id=22688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　困ったものだわ、と嘆息する久遠寺さん。"
msgstr "  \"It's really too bad,\" she sighed."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1842:22689: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1842
msgctxt "text_id=22689 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは改めて、リデルにちょっとだけ同情したのだった。"
msgstr "  Again, I felt a little sorry for Riddell."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1951:22690: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1951
msgctxt "text_id=22690 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　犠牲者は四人になった。"
msgstr "  That made four victims."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1956:22691: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1956
msgctxt "text_id=22691 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここにきて全体の雰囲気は“部屋に閉じこもって朝を待つ”方向に傾きつつある。"
msgstr "  Everyone seemed resigned to locking ourselves in our rooms for the night."

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1962:22692: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1962
msgctxt "text_id=22692 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_N:8:22693: scene=WIK_SELECT_N
#: WIK_SELECT_N:8
msgctxt "text_id=22693 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｎ～"
msgstr "-Decision N-"

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:93:22694: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:93
msgctxt "text_id=22694 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……風の音で目が覚めた。"
msgstr "  ...I was roused by the sound of wind."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:98:22695: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:98
msgctxt "text_id=22695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　明かりは消えている。"
msgstr "  The lights were out."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:104:22696: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:104
msgctxt "text_id=22696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　寝る前に消灯した記憶はない。"
msgstr "  I didn't remember turning them off before I went to sleep."

msgctxt "text_id=22697 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "何事かと、起きて電灯のスイッチをいれてみたが、反応はない。"
msgstr " I got up and tried the light switch, but nothing happened."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:130:22698: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:130
msgctxt "text_id=22698 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:135:22699: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:135
msgctxt "text_id=22699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時間を確かめたいけど、この暗さでは確かめられない。"
msgstr "  I wanted to check the time, but that wasn't happening in this darkness."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:140:22700: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:140
msgctxt "text_id=22700 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何にも気づかなかったフリをして寝直そうと努力したが、高ぶった神経は寝直す事も、じっとしている事も許してはくれなかった。"
msgstr "  I tried my best to go back to sleep and pretend everything was okay, but I was too on edge. I could barely even stay still."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:161:22701: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_A_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:161
msgctxt "text_id=22701 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……蒼崎の部屋が、一番近いよね……」"
msgstr "\"Aozaki's room is the closest, right...?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:167:22702: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:167
msgctxt "text_id=22702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは物音をたてないよう、静かにドアまで移動して、鍵を開けて、そっと廊下をのぞき見た。"
msgstr "  I moved as quietly as possible to the door, unlocked it, and peeked into the hallway."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:219:22703: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:219
msgctxt "text_id=22703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――廊下に人の気配はない。"
msgstr "  ...It seemed empty."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:225:22704: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:225
msgctxt "text_id=22704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――ただ、風の音と、雨の音だけが。"
msgstr "  ...The only sound came from the wind and rain."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:231:22705: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:231
msgctxt "text_id=22705 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――わたしは何かに誘われるように、廊下の突き当たりの蒼崎の部屋に向かった。"
msgstr "  ...As if led by something, I ventured into the hallway and down towards Aozaki's room."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:251:22706: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:251
msgctxt "text_id=22706 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎の部屋のドアノブに手を置く。"
msgstr "  I placed my hand on her doorknob."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:274:22707: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:274
msgctxt "text_id=22707 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鍵はかかっていなかった。"
msgstr "  It was unlocked."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:279:22708: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:279
msgctxt "text_id=22708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　部屋の中には、"
msgstr "  Inside her room, I found..."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:316:22709: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:316
msgctxt "text_id=22709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見知らぬ女性の、死体がひとつ。"
msgstr "  ...a dead body. The corpse of a woman I've never seen before."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:337:22710: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_A_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:337
msgctxt "text_id=22710 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:342:22711: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:342
msgctxt "text_id=22711 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悲鳴を上げたのか、押し殺せたのか、自分でも分からない。"
msgstr "  Did I scream? Did I manage to hold it in? I couldn't tell."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:347:22712: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:347
msgctxt "text_id=22712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今夜は雨の音が強すぎる。"
msgstr "  The rain tonight was too intense."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:353:22713: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:353
msgctxt "text_id=22713 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　きぃ、きぃ。"
msgstr "  Creak. Creak."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:358:22714: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:358
msgctxt "text_id=22714 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ああ、この音は雨音じゃなくて、<蝶番|ちょうつがい>の音。"
msgstr "  Oh, that wasn't the rain. It was the sound of hinges."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:363:22715: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:363
msgctxt "text_id=22715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ドアが揺れている音だ、と視線を向ける。"
msgstr "  I realized a door was swinging, and looked in its direction."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:383:22716: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:383
msgctxt "text_id=22716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その音は、蒼崎の部屋のすぐ隣りの部屋からだった。"
msgstr "  It was coming from the room next to Aozaki's."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:388:22717: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:388
msgctxt "text_id=22717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこが蒼崎の書斎であることは、静希から聞いていた。"
msgstr "  Sizuki told me before that it was her study."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:393:22718: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:393
msgctxt "text_id=22718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　扉には、"
msgstr "  Something was on the door."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:419:22719: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:419
msgctxt "text_id=22719 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　真っ赤な、ペンキみたいな、液体が、べったりと。"
msgstr "  A liquid, thick... and red... like paint."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:448:22720: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:448
msgctxt "text_id=22720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　書斎の中には"
msgstr "  Inside the study"

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:479:22721: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:479
msgctxt "text_id=22721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎青子の"
msgstr "  I found"

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:525:22722: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:525
msgctxt "text_id=22722 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　無残な"
msgstr "  the gruesome sight of"

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:571:22723: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:571
msgctxt "text_id=22723 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　が。"
msgstr "  Aoko Aozaki."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:639:22724: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_A_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:639
msgctxt "text_id=22724 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「―――！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:686:22725: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:686
msgctxt "text_id=22725 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下を走る。もう物音なんて気にしていられない。そもそもこの嵐だ、走る気配なんてどうでもいい。"
msgstr "  I ran down the hallway. I didn't care about making noise anymore. The storm was too loud to hear anything."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:696:22726: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:696
msgctxt "text_id=22726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは客室という客室を開けていく。"
msgstr "  I threw open the door to each guest room."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:705:22727: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:705
msgctxt "text_id=22727 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　三つ目で、この三年間、意識し続けた男子生徒の死体を発見した。"
msgstr "  In the third room, I find the lifeless body of the boy who'd been on my mind for three years."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:761:22728: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_A_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:761
msgctxt "text_id=22728 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「はっ、はっ、はっ―――！」"
msgstr "\"Hah, hah, hah!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:767:22729: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:767
msgctxt "text_id=22729 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　階段を転がるように下りる。"
msgstr "  Panting, I nearly rolled down the stairs."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:772:22730: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:772
msgctxt "text_id=22730 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　実際、転んでしまって体中を打ち付けながらロビーに転がりでた。"
msgstr "  Too fast. I fell. My body bounced off the steps, and rolled into the foyer."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:792:22731: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:792
msgctxt "text_id=22731 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　人の気配はない。"
msgstr "  Nobody was around."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:797:22732: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:797
msgctxt "text_id=22732 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　来訪者があったのか、玄関は開きっぱなしだ。"
msgstr "  The front door's wide open, as if we had a visitor."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:802:22733: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:802
msgctxt "text_id=22733 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　直感的に、教会の人たちも既に　　でいるのだと理解した。"
msgstr "  My instincts told me that the church members were already ____."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:826:22734: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:826
msgctxt "text_id=22734 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やけに耳に残る、靴の音。"
msgstr "  I heard faint footsteps."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:831:22735: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:831
msgctxt "text_id=22735 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　嵐の音が、意識から除外される。"
msgstr "  The sound of the storm faded."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:836:22736: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:836
msgctxt "text_id=22736 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの世界から、あらゆる音が途絶えていく。"
msgstr "  All sounds around me washed away."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:841:22737: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:841
msgctxt "text_id=22737 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目の前には、"
msgstr "  In front of me..."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:863:22738: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_A_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:863
msgctxt "text_id=22738 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ああ―――」"
msgstr "\"Ahh...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:869:22739: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:869
msgctxt "text_id=22739 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　恐怖も怒りも、なんにもない。"
msgstr "  I felt nothing. No fear. No anger."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:874:22740: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:874
msgctxt "text_id=22740 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは静かな心持ちで、嵐の夜の殺人鬼を見た。"
msgstr "  My heart was as calm as a lake, as I laid eyes on the stormy night killer."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:954:22741: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:954
msgctxt "text_id=22741 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　闇の中で光る二つの目。"
msgstr "  Two eyes flashed in the darkness."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:959:22742: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:959
msgctxt "text_id=22742 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そいつの手にある凶器が光を放つ。"
msgstr "  Light glinted off the weapon in their hands."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:1007:22743: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:1007
msgctxt "text_id=22743 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――この世のものとは思えない、いびつにゆがんだ鬼の<面|かお>。"
msgstr "  Their face was unworldly, twisted, demonic."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:1012:22744: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:1012
msgctxt "text_id=22744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが、わたしの見た、この夜最後の映像だった―――"
msgstr "  It was the last thing I ever saw."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:30:22745: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=22745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、その意見に賛成すべきだ、と思った。"
msgstr "  I agreed that it was the best option we had."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:60:22746: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_N_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:60
msgctxt "text_id=22746 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ここで腹の探り合いをしていても空しいだけね。いいかげん決を採りましょう。"
msgstr "\"We won't gain anything from grilling each other. Let's just make a decision."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:66:22747: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_N_1_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:66
msgctxt "text_id=22747 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　自分の部屋に閉じこもって朝を待つ、に賛成な人」"
msgstr "  Raise your hand if you think we should stay in our rooms until morning.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:102:22748: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:102
msgctxt "text_id=22748 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　賛成、と手を挙げる。"
msgstr "  I raised my hand."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:108:22749: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:108
msgctxt "text_id=22749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手を挙げたのはわたし、蒼崎、唯架さん、静希……と、"
msgstr "  In favor were... Aozaki, Sister Yuika, Sizuki, and..."

msgctxt "text_id=22750 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "それにつられてベオの五人。"
msgstr " Beo, who voted along with Sizuki."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:142:22751: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:142
msgctxt "text_id=22751 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　反対は律架さん、詠梨神父、槻司、久遠寺さんの四人。"
msgstr "  Those against were Ritsuka, Father Eiri, Tsukiji, and Miss Kuonji."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:147:22752: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:147
msgctxt "text_id=22752 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオの差でわたしたちの勝ちである。"
msgstr "  With Beo as the tiebreaker, our side won."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:172:22753: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_N_1_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:172
msgctxt "text_id=22753 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「決まりね。それじゃ各自、部屋にこもって、しっかり鍵かけて、朝まで外にでないこと。"
msgstr "\"That settles it. Everyone go to your rooms, lock them, and don't leave until morning."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:184:22754: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_N_1_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:184
msgctxt "text_id=22754 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　必要な物があったら台所から持っていって。"
msgstr "  If you need anything, get it from the kitchen now."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:196:22755: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_N_1_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:196
msgctxt "text_id=22755 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あと、トイレは精神的に耐えきって」"
msgstr "  If you need to use the toilet, hold it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:233:22756: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:233
msgctxt "text_id=22756 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　みんな長時間の推理に疲れていたのだろう。"
msgstr "  Everyone had to be exhausted from a long night of deduction."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:238:22757: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:238
msgctxt "text_id=22757 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とくに何を言うでもなく、あてがわれた部屋に向かっていった。"
msgstr "  We barely spoke as we headed off to our respective rooms."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:288:22758: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:288
msgctxt "text_id=22758 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「………………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:294:22759: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:294
msgctxt "text_id=22759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鍵をかけてベッドに横になる。"
msgstr "  I locked the door and lay down on the bed."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:301:22760: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:301
msgctxt "text_id=22760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　万が一の事態に対応できるよう、寝間着には着替えていない。"
msgstr "  Just in case, I decided not to change into my pajamas."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:329:22761: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:329
msgctxt "text_id=22761 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もうじき日付が変わる。"
msgstr "  The day was almost over."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:334:22762: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:334
msgctxt "text_id=22762 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　零時を過ぎれば連休の一日目が終わる。"
msgstr "  Once midnight passed, the first day of our three-day break would come to a close."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:339:22763: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:339
msgctxt "text_id=22763 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　せっかくの三連休がこんなカタチで始まるなんて、夢にも思わなかった。"
msgstr "  I never imagined spending a vacation like this in a million years."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:371:22764: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:371
msgctxt "text_id=22764 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……まず……すごく眠い、わたし……」"
msgstr "\"...Oh, crap... getting... sleepy...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:377:22765: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:377
msgctxt "text_id=22765 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　横になったとたん、目蓋が重くなっていく。"
msgstr "  My eyelids grew heavy the instant I lay down."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:382:22766: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:382
msgctxt "text_id=22766 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もっと考えるべき事があるのに、わたしは急速に、浅い眠りに落ちていった。"
msgstr "  I knew I still had things to consider, but warm slumber embraced me in moments."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_2:30:22767: scene=WIK_N_2
#: WIK_N_2:30
msgctxt "text_id=22767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、部屋に閉じこもるのは危険だ、と思った。"
msgstr "  I think it's too dangerous to hole up in our rooms."

#. Occurrence WIK_N_2:35:22768: scene=WIK_N_2
#: WIK_N_2:35
msgctxt "text_id=22768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その根拠として―――"
msgstr "  The reason being..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_O:8:22769: scene=WIK_SELECT_O
#: WIK_SELECT_O:8
msgctxt "text_id=22769 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｏ～"
msgstr "-Decision O-"

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:27:22770: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_NAP_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:27
msgctxt "text_id=22770 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「はー、疲れたぁ」"
msgstr "\"Whew, I'm beat.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:50:22771: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:50
msgctxt "text_id=22771 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぼすん、とベッドに腰を下ろす。"
msgstr "  I plopped my butt down on the bed."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:55:22772: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:55
msgctxt "text_id=22772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司と話すのも気を遣うが、久遠寺さんとはまた違った意味で緊張する。"
msgstr "  I was always self-conscious around Tsukiji, but Miss Kuonji made me nervous in a different way."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:93:22773: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:93
msgctxt "text_id=22773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの<娘|こ>に見つめられると妙な罪悪感に襲われるのだ。"
msgstr "  For some reason, I always felt a pang of guilt whenever she looked at me."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:98:22774: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:98
msgctxt "text_id=22774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　痛くもない腹を探られているというか、自分がしでかしてきた多くの失敗を責め立てられているような。"
msgstr "  It was like being gently interrogated, being confronted with all of my life's failures."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:124:22775: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:124
msgctxt "text_id=22775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女本人にその気はまったくないらしいから、これはわたしの心の問題だろう。"
msgstr "  I doubt she meant to make me feel that way. It was just how I reacted to her."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:129:22776: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:129
msgctxt "text_id=22776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰だって叩けばホコリは出る、というヤツである。"
msgstr "  Nobody was perfect, after all."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:172:22777: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_NAP_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:172
msgctxt "text_id=22777 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「蒼崎も静希も、よくあの娘と暮らせるもんだわ」"
msgstr "\"I don't know how Aozaki and Sizuki can live with her every day.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:178:22778: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:178
msgctxt "text_id=22778 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこは素直に尊敬する。"
msgstr "  I could only respect them for that."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:186:22779: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:186
msgctxt "text_id=22779 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は鉄の精神力、かつ、後ろめたいものがないからだろう。"
msgstr "  Aozaki simply had an iron will; I bet she lived life without any regrets."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:197:22780: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:197
msgctxt "text_id=22780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希の場合は逆で、久遠寺さんの視線の怖さにまったく気付いていないと見た。"
msgstr "  Sizuki was completely different; it was clear he was just oblivious to how scary Miss Kuonji's gaze could be."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:245:22781: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_NAP_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:245
msgctxt "text_id=22781 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「それはともかく」"
msgstr "\"Anyway...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:255:22782: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:255
msgctxt "text_id=22782 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ばふん、とベッドに仰向けに寝ころぶ。"
msgstr "  I fell backward onto the bed."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:280:22783: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:280
msgctxt "text_id=22783 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　窓ごしの空は曇天。"
msgstr "  Outside my window, the sky was overcast."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:285:22784: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:285
msgctxt "text_id=22784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　天気予報によると、この三連休はぜんぶ晴れらしいけど、山の天気はそのかぎりではないらしい。"
msgstr "  The weather forecast had said the three-day weekend was supposed to be sunny. Not so in the mountains, I suppose."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:327:22785: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:327
msgctxt "text_id=22785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺邸に集まった人間で、きちんと挨拶をしたのは今のところ六人。"
msgstr "  At this point, I'd met six people staying here:"

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:334:22786: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:334
msgctxt "text_id=22786 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎、"
msgstr "  Aozaki,"

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:342:22787: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:342
msgctxt "text_id=22787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "久遠寺さん、"
msgstr " Miss Kuonji,"

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:350:22788: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:350
msgctxt "text_id=22788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "静希、"
msgstr " Sizuki,"

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:359:22789: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:359
msgctxt "text_id=22789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "槻司、"
msgstr " Tsukiji"

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:368:22790: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:368
msgctxt "text_id=22790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "<芳|バ><助|カ>、"
msgstr " that idiot Housuke,"

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:376:22791: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:376
msgctxt "text_id=22791 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "山城先生、"
msgstr " Mr. Yamasiro,"

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:385:22792: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:385
msgctxt "text_id=22792 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ベオ。"
msgstr " and Beo."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:390:22793: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:390
msgctxt "text_id=22793 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他にもゲストがいるような事を久遠寺さんは言っていた。"
msgstr "  Miss Kuonji had implied that there were other guests staying here, too."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:407:22794: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:407
msgctxt "text_id=22794 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この洋館では玄関で靴は脱がないので、靴の数で人数を特定する事はできない。"
msgstr "  This was a Western-style house and people didn't take their shoes off at the entrance, so I couldn't guess their number by counting shoes."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:412:22795: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:412
msgctxt "text_id=22795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　館内に何人の人間がいるのか、いまいち定まらないのはそのせいだ。"
msgstr "  For now, I had no idea how many other people were here."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:456:22796: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:456
msgctxt "text_id=22796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目蓋を閉じて、少しだけ眠る事にした。"
msgstr "  I decided to rest my eyes and take a short nap."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:461:22797: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:461
msgctxt "text_id=22797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小刻みなアルバイト生活の<賜|たまもの>か、わたしは十五分単位での仮眠を得意としている。"
msgstr "  One trick I'd picked up from years of part-time work was the ability to sleep in exact 15-minute intervals."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:482:22798: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:482
msgctxt "text_id=22798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……。"
msgstr "  ..."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:487:22799: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:487
msgctxt "text_id=22799 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　………………。"
msgstr "  ......"

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:492:22800: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:492
msgctxt "text_id=22800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　………………………………。"
msgstr "  ........."

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:497:22801: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:497
msgctxt "text_id=22801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　薄いまどろみの中、どこかで、悲鳴のような笑い声が聞こえた気がした。"
msgstr "  As I drifted off, I heard a laugh. Or was it a scream?"

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:74:22802: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:74
msgctxt "text_id=22802 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　居間に置いておいた荷物を肩に担いで、二階の客室を目指す。"
msgstr "  Slinging over my shoulder the bag I'd put down in the drawing room, I headed up to the guest rooms on the second floor."

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:79:22803: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:79
msgctxt "text_id=22803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎の話では二階の東館、手前から二つ目がわたしに宛がわれた部屋だそうだ。"
msgstr "  According to Aozaki, I would be staying in the second room of the east wing."

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:135:22804: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_NOROOM_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:135
msgctxt "text_id=22804 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あら」"
msgstr "\"Oh.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:140:22805: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:140
msgctxt "text_id=22805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下に出ると、蒼崎と出くわした。"
msgstr "  As I headed out into the hallway, I ran into Aozaki."

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:145:22806: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:145
msgctxt "text_id=22806 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は廊下の奥から、ホールに向かっていたところらしい。"
msgstr "  She seemed to be on her way from the bedrooms to the hall."

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:166:22807: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_NOROOM_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:166
msgctxt "text_id=22807 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「蒼崎も休憩？　あの突き当たりってアンタの部屋なの？」"
msgstr "\"You taking a break too, Aozaki? Is that your room on the end there?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:178:22808: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_NOROOM_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:178
msgctxt "text_id=22808 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え、そ、そうだけど、別に部屋には寄ってないわよ？"
msgstr "\"Um, y-yeah, but I'm not going in there."

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:190:22809: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_NOROOM_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:190
msgctxt "text_id=22809 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私はちょっとした探し物の途中だから、気にしないで。"
msgstr "  I'm just looking for something. Don't mind me."

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:202:22810: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_NOROOM_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:202
msgctxt "text_id=22810 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あ、客室の鍵は開いてるから。部屋の机の上に鍵があるから、出る時はそれで施錠してね」"
msgstr "  Oh, the door to your room's open. I left your key on the desk, so make sure to lock the door whenever you leave.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:214:22811: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:214
msgctxt "text_id=22811 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は一階に下りていった。"
msgstr "  Aozaki took the stairs down to the first floor."

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:265:22812: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:265
msgctxt "text_id=22812 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　部屋には誰もいない。"
msgstr "  My room was unoccupied."

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:270:22813: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:270
msgctxt "text_id=22813 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは無人である事を確かめて、荷物を置き、サイフをポケットにいれた。"
msgstr "  I checked to make sure I was alone, then put down my luggage and stowed my wallet in a pocket."

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:275:22814: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:275
msgctxt "text_id=22814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　お<守|まも>り<兼|けん>お気に入りである<×口|バツくち>兎のパスケースを携帯するかは迷ったが、どうせ中には定期と学祭での記念写真しか入っていないので、テーブルに置いておく。"
msgstr "  I considered keeping my favorite bunny-shaped commuter pass-and lucky charm-with me, but all it contained was a yearly school festival photo anyway. I left it on the table."

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:280:22815: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:280
msgctxt "text_id=22815 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　馴染みのない建物で過ごすのだ。体はできるだけ身軽の方が疲れない。"
msgstr "  I was going to be spending the night in an unfamiliar building. It was best to travel light."

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:301:22816: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_NOROOM_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:301
msgctxt "text_id=22816 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「鍵は……ああ、これね」"
msgstr "\"Where's that key...? Oh, here it is.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:307:22817: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:307
msgctxt "text_id=22817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<真鍮|しんちゅう>の鍵。この洋館に相応しい、古めかしくも凝ったデザインだった。"
msgstr "  It was a brass key, with an old-fashioned and elaborate design that perfectly complemented the mansion's European theme."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:30:22818: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:30
msgctxt "text_id=22818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今こそ、あの問題を追及しようと思った。"
msgstr "  I thought it was best to tackle the problem now."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:54:22819: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:54
msgctxt "text_id=22819 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それじゃあ各自、自分の部屋に―――」"
msgstr "\"Okay everyone, to your―\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:65:22820: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:65
msgctxt "text_id=22820 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ちょっと待って。その前に確かめたい事がある。"
msgstr "\"Wait. Before that, I want to check something."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:77:22821: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:77
msgctxt "text_id=22821 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　みんな、今日のゲストは何人か、分かってる？」"
msgstr "  Does everybody know how many guests are here today?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:86:22822: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:86
msgctxt "text_id=22822 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「何人かって、久遠寺いれて十三人だろ。"
msgstr "\"Thirteen, including Kuonji."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:86:22823: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:86
msgctxt "text_id=22823 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　それがどうかしたか？」"
msgstr "  What about it?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:98:22824: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:98
msgctxt "text_id=22824 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「それはリデルを入れての話？」"
msgstr "\"Does that include Riddell?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:125:22825: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:125
msgctxt "text_id=22825 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「―――なに？」"
msgstr "\"What...?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:145:22826: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:145
msgctxt "text_id=22826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司の目が見開かれる。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji's eyes went wide."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:151:22827: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:151
msgctxt "text_id=22827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　リデルと顔見知りである槻司からすれば、リデルは参加していても違和感のないメンバーだ。"
msgstr "  He was acquainted with Riddell, so her being here hadn't felt out of place to him."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:156:22828: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:156
msgctxt "text_id=22828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど彼女とは疎遠なわたしからすれば、リデルの登場は不自然であり、予定外だった。"
msgstr "  But, to someone like me who didn't know her, she stuck out like a sore thumb."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:161:22829: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:161
msgctxt "text_id=22829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女はあくまで乱入者であり、正式な招待客ではないからだ。"
msgstr "  She had crashed the party without a formal invitation."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:187:22830: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:187
msgctxt "text_id=22830 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そうか。リデルは招かれていない。ゲストとは数えないから、最終的な人数は十二人になる」"
msgstr "\"Now you mention it, Riddell wasn't actually invited. So I suppose there's only twelve of us.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:199:22831: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:199
msgctxt "text_id=22831 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「どういう事か説明してくれる、久遠寺さん？」"
msgstr "\"Do you mind explaining, Miss Kuonji?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:243:22832: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:243
msgctxt "text_id=22832 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……そうね。わたしもうっかりしていたわ。招待状はわたしと青子、静希君で分けて出したの。"
msgstr "\"...I didn't realize, either. Aoko and Sizuki were in charge of sending out invitations."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:255:22833: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:255
msgctxt "text_id=22833 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　最終的に九枚消費したとしか、わたしは聞いていなかったから。わたしとトッキィーはホストで、青子と静希君は知っていたから、合わせて十三人だって。"
msgstr "  No one told me they only set out nine invitations. Tokie and I are the hosts, so including Aoko and Sizuki that should've been thirteen."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:267:22834: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:267
msgctxt "text_id=22834 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　ちなみに、わたしは"
msgstr "  Oh, I should mention,"

msgctxt "text_id=22835 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "律架さんと"
msgstr " I personally sent invitations to Ritsuka"

msgctxt "text_id=22836 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ベオに招待状を送ったわ」"
msgstr " and Beo.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:344:22837: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:344
msgctxt "text_id=22837 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「私は"
msgstr "\"I invited "

msgctxt "text_id=22838 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "詠梨と"
msgstr "Eiri, "

msgctxt "text_id=22839 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "唯架さん、"
msgstr "Yuika, "

msgctxt "text_id=22840 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "木乃美と"
msgstr "Kinomi, "

msgctxt "text_id=22841 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "鳶丸」"
msgstr "and Tobimaru.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:447:22842: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_O_0000_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:447
msgctxt "text_id=22842 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「自分は"
msgstr "\"I invited "

msgctxt "text_id=22843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "久万梨と、"
msgstr "Kumari. "

msgctxt "text_id=22844 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "最後に余ったのを"
msgstr "I gave the leftover invitations to "

msgctxt "text_id=22845 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "先生と、"
msgstr "Mr. Yamasiro and "

#. Occurrence WIK_O:479:22846: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_O_0000_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:479
msgctxt "text_id=22846 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "とても名前を口に"
msgstr "someone I really, really "

msgctxt "text_id=22847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "できない人に一枚」"
msgstr "shouldn't mention out loud.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:539:22848: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:539
msgctxt "text_id=22848 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「なるほど、数は合っているわね。"
msgstr "\"So the numbers add up, then."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:550:22849: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:550
msgctxt "text_id=22849 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ところで草十郎、<叱|しか>られる前に白状した方がいいわよ？"
msgstr "  Soujyuro, tell me who you invited, before I yell at you."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:550:22850: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:550
msgctxt "text_id=22850 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　もうなんとなく分かったけど、一体誰に、招待状を、送りやがったの？」"
msgstr "  I'm pretty sure I know already, but tell me. Who you sent. The last invitation to.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:578:22851: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:578
msgctxt "text_id=22851 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……いや、だって。仲間はずれは良くないじゃないか」"
msgstr "\"...Oh, I, um... I mean, it's not good to leave people out, so―\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:618:22852: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:618
msgctxt "text_id=22852 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「橙子ね。橙子を呼びつけたのはアンタだったのね！」"
msgstr "\"Touko. You're the one who invited Touko!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:623:22853: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:623
msgctxt "text_id=22853 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は静希の襟元を掴んで、頭をガクガクと揺らす。"
msgstr "  Aozaki grabbed Sizuki by his collar and shook him violently, like a bobblehead."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:629:22854: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:629
msgctxt "text_id=22854 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「二人……リデルが、二人……」"
msgstr "\"Ohh... Two Riddells...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:666:22855: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:666
msgctxt "text_id=22855 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「橙子さんに招待状を送った……しかし、彼女は今、三咲町には立ち入れない筈ですが」"
msgstr "\"So you invited Touko. But I thought she couldn't step foot inside Misaki anymore.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:675:22856: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:675
msgctxt "text_id=22856 | speaker=beo"
msgid "「ん？　呪いならトーコさん、とっくにクリアしたって言ってたよ？　ハッソウのテンカンだ、とか言って。なんでも、肉体にかかった呪いがとけないなら、その肉体を使わなければいい、とかなんとか」"
msgstr "\"Hm? Miss Touko said she beat that curse a long time ago. Mentioned about 'thinking outside the box.' 'If my body's cursed, I'll just use a new one,' or something like that.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:699:22857: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:699
msgctxt "text_id=22857 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どんな理屈よそれ。"
msgstr "\"What kind of logic is that?"

#. Occurrence WIK_O:699:22858: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:699
msgctxt "text_id=22858 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……相変わらずネジとんでるわね、姉貴」"
msgstr "  ...Ugh. My sister's crazy as always.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:708:22859: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:708
msgctxt "text_id=22859 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……ともかく、橙子さんに招待状が送られてしまった以上、彼女がここに来ている可能性があるのね」"
msgstr "\"At any rate, if she was invited, she could be here.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:746:22860: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:746
msgctxt "text_id=22860 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そう。そこで思い出してほしいのが、電話線がなくなってた時の玄関。"
msgstr "\"Right. And remember the entrance when the phone line was cut?"

#. Occurrence WIK_O:765:22861: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:765
msgctxt "text_id=22861 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　あの時、玄関の床には水滴がついていた。"
msgstr "  There was a puddle on the floor."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:777:22862: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:777
msgctxt "text_id=22862 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　わたしたちは雨が降り出してから一度も外に出ていない。"
msgstr "  None of us have been outside since the rain started."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:783:22863: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:783
msgctxt "text_id=22863 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　だから事件の直前にやってきたリデルの足跡かと思ってたけど、彼女、まったく雨に濡れていなかった。"
msgstr "  I thought it hinted that Riddell might've snuck in here ahead of time, but she wasn't wet at all."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:795:22864: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:795
msgctxt "text_id=22864 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　つまり、」"
msgstr "  In other words...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:829:22865: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:829
msgctxt "text_id=22865 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「あの雨の跡はリデルさん以外の、何者かが洋館に入ってきたという証拠……という事ね？"
msgstr "\"It's evidence that someone other than Riddell entered the mansion, right?"

#. Occurrence WIK_O:841:22866: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:841
msgctxt "text_id=22866 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　あの時、玄関には土桔さんと山城先生以外のみんながいたから―――」"
msgstr "  But everyone except for Mr. Tokitsu and Mr. Yamasiro was there at that time...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:850:22867: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:850
msgctxt "text_id=22867 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「姿のない参加者。"
msgstr "\"So we have an unknown participant."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:856:22868: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:856
msgctxt "text_id=22868 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　十三人目のゲストがいる、という事ですね」"
msgstr "  A thirteenth guest, if you will.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:940:22869: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:940
msgctxt "text_id=22869 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　状況はここにきて一変した。"
msgstr "  This changed everything."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:945:22870: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:945
msgctxt "text_id=22870 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎にお姉さんがいる、というのは初耳だけど、ここは追及している場合じゃない。"
msgstr "  I'd never heard that Aozaki had an older sister, but now wasn't the time to ask about that."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:950:22871: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:950
msgctxt "text_id=22871 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　みんなの緊迫した空気からすると、そのお姉さんとやらはここにいる全員に敵意を持っているらしい。"
msgstr "  The tension in the air was enough to tell me that there was bad blood between her and the people here."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:983:22872: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:983
msgctxt "text_id=22872 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「蒼崎橙子ですか。彼女なら、たしかにプロイに精通し、久遠寺の屋敷の見取りも把握しています。"
msgstr "\"Touko Aozaki. She'd be more than capable of using Ploys, and she's familiar with the Kuonji mansion."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:994:22873: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:994
msgctxt "text_id=22873 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "　なにより私たち―――とくに青子さんに強力な殺意がある。今まで見えてこなかった動機の面でも、最有力候補ですね」"
msgstr "  Most of all, she's out to kill us-or rather, Aoko specifically. That gives her a far stronger motive than any other suspect.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1020:22874: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1020
msgctxt "text_id=22874 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ですね。橙子さんが犯人だとしたら、部屋に閉じこもるのは得策ではありません。何をやっても力ずくで侵入してくるでしょう」"
msgstr "\"Indeed. If Touko is our killer, then locking ourselves in our rooms won't do much good. She could just force her way in.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1047:22875: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1047
msgctxt "text_id=22875 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「うん、トコちゃんならやるわ。だってホラー大好きだもの！　……うーん。ここにきて展開がホラーになるのは残念だけど、まずは安全を確保しないとね」"
msgstr "\"Ooh, she *would* do that! Toko's a huge horror fan, after all! ...Hmm. It would be too bad if the genre shifted to horror, but let's worry about our safety first.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1058:22876: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1058
msgctxt "text_id=22876 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「皆さん、手分けして洋館内を調査しましょう。橙子さんがいるのかいないのか、そこをハッキリさせなくては」"
msgstr "\"Let's split up and search the mansion. We need to figure out if Touko is really here or not.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1096:22877: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1096
msgctxt "text_id=22877 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え？　あ、うん、そうよね。"
msgstr "\"Huh? Oh, um, yeah."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1108:22878: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1108
msgctxt "text_id=22878 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　……じゃ、じゃあ私は、自分の部屋周辺を調べるわ」"
msgstr "  ...I'll, uh, go check the area around my room.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1123:22879: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_O_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1123
msgctxt "text_id=22879 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「わたしは西館と、念のため地下室に。"
msgstr "\"I'll check the west wing and the basement, just in case."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1134:22880: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1134
msgctxt "text_id=22880 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　久万梨さんたちは危険だから、ここで待っていて」"
msgstr "  the rest of you should stay here, for your own safety.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1167:22881: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1167
msgctxt "text_id=22881 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな訳で、ドタバタと慌ただしく居間を後にしていく人々。"
msgstr "  With that, they left the drawing room on a mission,"

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1173:22882: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1173
msgctxt "text_id=22882 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしと槻司、静希、律架さんを残して、みんな館内の探索に出払ってしまった。"
msgstr "  leaving me, Tsukiji, Sizuki, and Ritsuka behind."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1219:22883: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1219
msgctxt "text_id=22883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……時間だけが過ぎていく。"
msgstr "  Time passed by slowly."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1224:22884: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1224
msgctxt "text_id=22884 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　緊張と疲れからか、目蓋がやや重い。"
msgstr "  My eyelids began to feel heavy from anxiety and exhaustion."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1229:22885: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1229
msgctxt "text_id=22885 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時計の針が零時を示す。"
msgstr "  The clock struck midnight."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1280:22886: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1280
msgctxt "text_id=22886 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「紅茶でも淹れてくるか。草十郎、お茶はどこで？」"
msgstr "\"I'll go brew some tea. Soujyuro, where do you keep it?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1290:22887: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1290
msgctxt "text_id=22887 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「それならサンルームのテーブルに、まだ温かいポットがあるよ」"
msgstr "\"There's a pot on the table in the sunroom. Should still be warm.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1301:22888: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1301
msgctxt "text_id=22888 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「よし。取ってくる」"
msgstr "\"Perfect. I'll go get it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1318:22889: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1318
msgctxt "text_id=22889 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気分転換のつもりなんだろう。"
msgstr "  He probably wanted to get his mind off things."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1323:22890: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1323
msgctxt "text_id=22890 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司は自発的にサンルームに向かった。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji strode off toward the sunroom."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1349:22891: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1349
msgctxt "text_id=22891 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「お？」"
msgstr "\"Oh.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1383:22892: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1383
msgctxt "text_id=22892 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　また電気が落ちた。"
msgstr "  Another blackout."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1389:22893: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1389
msgctxt "text_id=22893 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「まいったな、これじゃ何も見え―――」"
msgstr "\"I can't see a damn thi―\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1412:22894: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1412
msgctxt "text_id=22894 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まばゆい閃光。"
msgstr "  There was a dazzling flash of light."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1417:22895: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1417
msgctxt "text_id=22895 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　サンルームの窓ガラス越しに、"
msgstr "  Through the window in the sunroom,"

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1422:22896: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1422
msgctxt "text_id=22896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外の落雷の様子、が―――"
msgstr "  I could see lightning-"

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1604:22897: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1604
msgctxt "text_id=22897 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「きゃーーーーー！」"
msgstr "\"Aghhhhhhhhhhhh!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1610:22898: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1610
msgctxt "text_id=22898 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「槻司くん、下がって！　早く！」"
msgstr "\"Tsukiji, get back! Now!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1635:22899: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1635
msgctxt "text_id=22899 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「な、なんだ今の、誰かいたぞ！？」"
msgstr "\"W-w-what the hell was that!? Someone was there!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1646:22900: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_O_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1646
msgctxt "text_id=22900 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「三人とも、こっち！　ホールに移動しましょう！」"
msgstr "\"You three, over here! Into the hall!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1680:22901: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1680
msgctxt "text_id=22901 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんに手を引かれて、暗闇の居間を後にする。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka grabbed my hand and pulled me away from the pitch-black drawing room."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1685:22902: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1685
msgctxt "text_id=22902 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　落雷による目の錯覚―――にしては、人影は明白すぎた。"
msgstr "  I definitely saw the outline of a person against the lightning."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1690:22903: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1690
msgctxt "text_id=22903 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この強風の中、屋敷の外に誰かがいる。"
msgstr "  Someone was outside, in the raging storm."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1695:22904: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1695
msgctxt "text_id=22904 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはどう考えても、正体不明の“十三人目”の実在を示していた。"
msgstr "  It could only be the thirteenth guest."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1727:22905: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1727
msgctxt "text_id=22905 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　逃げるようにホールに駆け込んだ。"
msgstr "  We fled to the hall."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1732:22906: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1732
msgctxt "text_id=22906 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　壁の電灯は別電源らしく、完全に闇に没していない。"
msgstr "  The wall lamps here appeared to be on separate wiring, so at least it wasn't completely dark."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1756:22907: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1756
msgctxt "text_id=22907 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「クマ？　どうしたのよ、血相変えちゃって」"
msgstr "\"Kuma? What's going on?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1778:22908: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1778
msgctxt "text_id=22908 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そ、外、外に誰かいた！」"
msgstr "\"Th-Th-There was someone outside!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1790:22909: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1790
msgctxt "text_id=22909 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ちょっと見てくる。草十郎、鳶丸、<金鹿|こじか>をお願い」"
msgstr "\"I'll go take a look. Soujyuro, Tobimaru, look after Kojika.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1862:22910: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1862
msgctxt "text_id=22910 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は居間に通じる<廊下|やみ>へと小走りで消えていった。"
msgstr "  Jogging, Aozaki disappeared into the dark corridor connecting to the parlor."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1867:22911: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1867
msgctxt "text_id=22911 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　騒ぎを聞きつけたのか、二階からは詠梨神父、シスター唯架、一階の西館からは久遠寺さんがやってきた。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri and Sister Yuika came down the stairs, and Miss Kuonji returned from the west wing. They must have heard the commotion."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1892:22912: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1892
msgctxt "text_id=22912 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「屋敷の電源がまた落ちたようですが、何かあったのですか？」"
msgstr "\"Looks like the power is out again. Did something happen?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1902:22913: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1902
msgctxt "text_id=22913 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「それが、サンルームの外に人影っぽいものが見えて、つい逃げてきちゃった。いまはアコちゃんが様子を見に行ってるわ」"
msgstr "\"We think we saw someone outside the sunroom, so we ran in here. Aoko went to check on it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1922:22914: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1922
msgctxt "text_id=22914 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　状況を説明していると、すぐに蒼崎が戻ってきた。"
msgstr "  Aozaki returned as we explained the situation."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1932:22915: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1932
msgctxt "text_id=22915 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「とりあえず異状なし。サンルームの窓も割れてないし、誰かが中に入ってきた様子はないわ」"
msgstr "\"Nothing out of the ordinary for the moment. No broken windows in the sunroom, so I don't think anyone slipped inside.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1958:22916: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1958
msgctxt "text_id=22916 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「こちらも異状はありませんでした。館内に橙子さんはいないようです。そうなると……」"
msgstr "\"We also didn't see anything unusual. Touko doesn't seem to be inside the mansion. Which means...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1968:22917: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1968
msgctxt "text_id=22917 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「先ほどの、外に人影を見た、という件ですね。館内に異常がないのなら、あとは屋敷の周りだけです」"
msgstr "\"That could have been her. If we didn't find anything inside, she might be creeping around the grounds.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1994:22918: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1994
msgctxt "text_id=22918 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「分かりました、外を調べに行きましょう。"
msgstr "\"All right, we should look outside then."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2000:22919: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0008; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2000
msgctxt "text_id=22919 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　まずはサンルームのあたりですね。危険ですから、調べに行くのは私とシスター唯架……それと青子、頼めますか？」"
msgstr "  Let's start around the sunroom. It might be dangerous, so Sister Yuika and I will go... Aoko, would you mind coming with us?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2026:22920: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2026
msgctxt "text_id=22920 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「……エイリ神父。この風では、私はあまりお役に立てないかと。耳が利きません」"
msgstr "\"...Unfortunately, Father, I don't think I'll be of much use in this wind. I won't be able to hear a thing.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2052:22921: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0009; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2052
msgctxt "text_id=22921 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「そうでしたね。"
msgstr "\"You're right."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2063:22922: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0010; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2063
msgctxt "text_id=22922 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　しかし、私はともかく青子をひとりにするのは……」"
msgstr "  I just didn't want to make Aoko go alone.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2074:22923: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2074
msgctxt "text_id=22923 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「気にしないで、私はひとりで身を守れるから。"
msgstr "\"Don't worry, I can defend myself."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2080:22924: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2080
msgctxt "text_id=22924 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　詠梨の方こそ大丈夫？　今日、武装してないんでしょ？」"
msgstr "  I'm more worried about you, to be honest. You're not armed.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2106:22925: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0011; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2106
msgctxt "text_id=22925 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「それでしたら……草十郎君、お願いできますか？"
msgstr "\"In that case, can I ask you, Soujyuro?"

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2106:22926: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0011; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2106
msgctxt "text_id=22926 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　彼なら互いの呼吸を心得ていますので」"
msgstr "  We seem to work well enough together.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2128:22927: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2128
msgctxt "text_id=22927 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　詠梨神父の申し出に、静希は深刻な顔で頷いた。"
msgstr "  Sizuki nodded solemnly."

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2133:22928: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2133
msgctxt "text_id=22928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは―――"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_P:8:22929: scene=WIK_SELECT_P
#: WIK_SELECT_P:8
msgctxt "text_id=22929 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｐ～"
msgstr "-Decision P-"

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:36:22930: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:36
msgctxt "text_id=22930 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、蒼崎をひとりにするのは危険だ、と思った。"
msgstr "  I think it's too dangerous to leave Aozaki alone."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:68:22931: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:68
msgctxt "text_id=22931 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「待って蒼崎。わたしも行く」"
msgstr "\"Wait, Aozaki. I'll go with you.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:82:22932: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:82
msgctxt "text_id=22932 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「！？　な、なに言ってんのよクマ、外は危ないんだってば。いいからクマは鳶丸とロビーで待機していてよ」"
msgstr "\"Wh-What're you talking about, Kuma? It's too dangerous outside. Wait in the foyer with Tobimaru.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:93:22933: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:93
msgctxt "text_id=22933 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「危ないのはアンタも同じでしょ。友人として、ひとりで出歩かせることはできないわ」"
msgstr "\"But if it's dangerous, I don't want to let you go out there alone. I'm your friend.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:120:22934: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:120
msgctxt "text_id=22934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こう言えば蒼崎は断れない。"
msgstr "  Aozaki couldn't refuse when I put it like that."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:125:22935: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:125
msgctxt "text_id=22935 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしが同行を申し出たのは、彼女の身を案じて……もあるけど、もうひとつ、見過ごせない理由があるからだ。"
msgstr "  I wanted to watch her back, of course, but I had another reason too."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:192:22936: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:192
msgctxt "text_id=22936 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　残ったメンバーの中で不審な点が多いのは、トップクラスで蒼崎だ。"
msgstr "  Aozaki was currently the most suspicious survivor."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:197:22937: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:197
msgctxt "text_id=22937 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女をひとりで行動させるのは、いろいろと良くない。"
msgstr "  It wasn't a good idea to let her go alone, for multiple reasons."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:202:22938: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:202
msgctxt "text_id=22938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女が真犯人……スイーツハーツとやらならわたしたちの命が危ないし、そうでないなら、後々彼女が疑われてしまう。"
msgstr "  If she was the killer―or Sweets Hearts, or whatever―then our lives were in danger. If I didn't go with her, then it would cast more doubt on her later."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:222:22939: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:222
msgctxt "text_id=22939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外は見るからに危険だし、"
msgstr "  Anyone could see how dangerous it was outside."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:227:22940: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:227
msgctxt "text_id=22940 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司と番をしている未来にも未練はあるけど、"
msgstr "  Of course, I would've liked to stay with Tsukiji,"

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:232:22941: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:232
msgctxt "text_id=22941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここで自分可愛さで黙っていられるほど、蒼崎との高校生活は軽くはなかったのだ。"
msgstr "  but petty feelings like that weren't more important than my friendship with Aozaki."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:288:22942: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:288
msgctxt "text_id=22942 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……オッケー、了解。"
msgstr "\"...Okay. Fine."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:300:22943: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:300
msgctxt "text_id=22943 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　でも、ぜったいに私のそばから離れないでね。"
msgstr "  Just promise you won't leave my side, no matter what."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:306:22944: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:306
msgctxt "text_id=22944 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それでいいでしょ、詠梨？」"
msgstr "  Does that work for you, Eiri?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:315:22945: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_P_1_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:315
msgctxt "text_id=22945 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「ええ、実のところ、私も青子にひとり付けたかったのです。久万梨さんなら適任でしょう」"
msgstr "\"Yes. I wanted to send someone with you anyway. Miss Kumari would be as good as anyone.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:340:22946: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:340
msgctxt "text_id=22946 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　詠梨神父も同じ考えらしい。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri seemed to thinking along the same lines."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:345:22947: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:345
msgctxt "text_id=22947 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……彼、冷酷なイメージがあったけど、ホントは人一倍蒼崎を心配しているんじゃないだろうか？"
msgstr "  ...He had a cool demeanor, but maybe he had genuine concern for Aozaki."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:393:22948: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:393
msgctxt "text_id=22948 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「鳶丸、唯架さんと有珠をよろしくね。二十分捜して何も見つからなかったら戻ってくるから。"
msgstr "\"Tobimaru, look after Yuika and Alice. If we don't find anything in twenty minutes, we'll be back."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:405:22949: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:405
msgctxt "text_id=22949 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　詠梨、外にでたら右手側からぐるっと一周してきて。私は左手側から見ていくから」"
msgstr "  Eiri, when we get outside, you head right; we'll go left.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:417:22950: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_P_1_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:417
msgctxt "text_id=22950 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「賢明です。行きますよ、草十郎君」"
msgstr "\"Sounds like a plan. Let's go, Soujyuro.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:452:22951: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:452
msgctxt "text_id=22951 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎」"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:463:22952: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_P_1_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:463
msgctxt "text_id=22952 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「心配はこっちじゃなく久万梨に。"
msgstr "\"Don't worry about me. Take care of Kumari."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:474:22953: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_P_1_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:474
msgctxt "text_id=22953 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　久万梨、枝が飛んでくるかもしれないから頭を低くしておくんだぞ。蒼崎はこういう時にかぎって不思議な効果を発揮するから、そうなったらフォローしてやってくれ」"
msgstr "  Kumari, watch out for flying branches in this weather. Aozaki is weirdly effective at times like these, so just follow her lead.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:486:22954: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:486
msgctxt "text_id=22954 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「どういう意味よそれ」"
msgstr "\"And what is that supposed to mean?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:521:22955: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:521
msgctxt "text_id=22955 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希の忠告にうなずいて、わたしは蒼崎と一緒に外に出た。"
msgstr "  I nodded to Sizuki, and made my way outside with Aozaki."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:583:22956: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:583
msgctxt "text_id=22956 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「っ……！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:589:22957: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:589
msgctxt "text_id=22957 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外の嵐は予想以上だった。"
msgstr "  The storm was worse than I expected."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:594:22958: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:594
msgctxt "text_id=22958 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　風が強くてまともに目を開けていられない。"
msgstr "  I could barely keep my eyes open in this wind."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:615:22959: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:615
msgctxt "text_id=22959 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「<金鹿|こじか>、手！」"
msgstr "\"Kojika! Give me your hand!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:621:22960: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:621
msgctxt "text_id=22960 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　前を行く蒼崎が左手を出してくる。"
msgstr "  Aozaki extended her left hand toward me."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:626:22961: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:626
msgctxt "text_id=22961 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはしっかり握り返す。蒼崎の手は、ゾッとするほど冷たかった。"
msgstr "  I grabbed hold tightly. Her hand was so cold it sent a shiver down my spine."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:693:22962: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:693
msgctxt "text_id=22962 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　屋敷の側面に回ったあたりで、蒼崎の足が止まった。"
msgstr "  As we rounded one side of the mansion, Aozaki stopped."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:699:22963: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:699
msgctxt "text_id=22963 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「クマー！　今、なにか光らなかった！？」"
msgstr "\"Kuma! Did you see that light?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:705:22964: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:705
msgctxt "text_id=22964 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「なにがーーー！？」"
msgstr "\"What light?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:711:22965: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:711
msgctxt "text_id=22965 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とてもじゃないが目を開けていられない。"
msgstr "  I couldn't even open my eyes."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:716:22966: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:716
msgctxt "text_id=22966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎はちょっとだけ思案した後、"
msgstr "  Aozaki paused before speaking."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:737:22967: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:737
msgctxt "text_id=22967 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「このまま屋敷の壁づたいに玄関まで戻ってて！"
msgstr "\"Stick to the wall and head back to the entrance!"

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:737:22968: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:737
msgctxt "text_id=22968 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　さっきの光、間違いなくアイツだ……！」"
msgstr "  That light had to be the killer!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:744:22969: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:744
msgctxt "text_id=22969 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「え!?　ダ、ダメだってば蒼崎、ひとりになんな―――！」"
msgstr "\"What?! No way! I can't leave you alone out here!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:765:22970: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:765
msgctxt "text_id=22970 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの制止の声も届かない。"
msgstr "  My words failed to reach her."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:770:22971: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:770
msgctxt "text_id=22971 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は屋敷とは反対の、深い森へと走っていってしまった。"
msgstr "  Aozaki ran away from the mansion into the darkness of the woods."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:791:22972: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:791
msgctxt "text_id=22972 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「壁づたいに戻れって……そもそも屋敷まで戻れないわよ、バカーーー！」"
msgstr "\"Stick to the wall... But I can't even get back to the mansion, you idiot!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:796:22973: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:796
msgctxt "text_id=22973 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ヤケになって叫ぶ。"
msgstr "  I screamed out in frustration."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:801:22974: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:801
msgctxt "text_id=22974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　と、わたしの声が聞こえたのか、"
msgstr "  Somehow, she heard me."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:842:22975: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:842
msgctxt "text_id=22975 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え、なにーーー！？　なにか言ったクマーーーー！？」"
msgstr "\"What?! Did you say something, Kuma?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:847:22976: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:847
msgctxt "text_id=22976 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　森からは蒼崎の声が返ってきた。"
msgstr "  Aozaki voice came from the tree line."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:868:22977: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:868
msgctxt "text_id=22977 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「だーかーらー、わたしひとりじゃまっすぐ屋敷まで戻れ、」"
msgstr "\"I said, I can't get back to the mansion by myself―\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:874:22978: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:874
msgctxt "text_id=22978 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「後ろ、すぐ後ろが屋敷だってば！"
msgstr "\"Behind you! The mansion's directly behind you!"

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:880:22979: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:880
msgctxt "text_id=22979 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ちゃんと振り返れば―――ぶっ、あははははははは！」"
msgstr "  Just turn around and―Pffhahahahaha!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:886:22980: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:886
msgctxt "text_id=22980 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　へ？"
msgstr "  Huh?"

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:963:22981: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:963
msgctxt "text_id=22981 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「し、しまったーーーー！"
msgstr "\"OH, CRAP!"

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1024:22982: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1024
msgctxt "text_id=22982 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　そんなネタで釣られた、クマーーーー！？」"
msgstr "  Did I actually just fall for that?! KUMAAA!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1030:22983: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1030
msgctxt "text_id=22983 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　と。蒼崎と思わしき体が、タン、と踊るように横に飛んだ。まるで横から猟銃に撃たれたような挙動。"
msgstr "  Aozaki's words hung in the air, as her body suddenly flew to one side. It was as if she was hit by a high-powered rifle."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1076:22984: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1076
msgctxt "text_id=22984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎はそのまま地面に倒れ、ぴくりとも動かない。"
msgstr "  She lay lifelessly on the ground."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1097:22985: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1097
msgctxt "text_id=22985 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたし、は"
msgstr "  I... I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1103:22986: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1103
msgctxt "text_id=22986 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎がわたしを―――いや、わたしがいる方向を見て爆笑した事を、正しく理解した。"
msgstr "  ...I know she looked in my direction before she burst out laughing."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1124:22987: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1124
msgctxt "text_id=22987 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背後には。"
msgstr "  Behind me."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1129:22988: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1129
msgctxt "text_id=22988 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　雨音に紛れて、忍び寄ってくる足音が。"
msgstr "  Footsteps. I could barely make them out in the rain."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1136:22989: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1136
msgctxt "text_id=22989 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「―――！」"
msgstr "\"...!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1160:22990: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1160
msgctxt "text_id=22990 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　振り返ることも、迷う余裕もなかった。"
msgstr "  I don't have time to look back or think."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1165:22991: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1165
msgctxt "text_id=22991 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは全力で走り出す。"
msgstr "  I ran as fast as I could."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1170:22992: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1170
msgctxt "text_id=22992 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背後に忍び寄った人影から逃げるために。"
msgstr "  I needed to get away from whatever was behind me."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1175:22993: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1175
msgctxt "text_id=22993 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背後にあった屋敷から正反対の、暗い暗い嵐の森に。"
msgstr "  I sprinted into the deep, dark forest, away from the mansion."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1196:22994: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1196
msgctxt "text_id=22994 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「はっ、はっ、はっ、はっ―――！」"
msgstr "\"Hah, hah, hah, hah!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1202:22995: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1202
msgctxt "text_id=22995 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　息をあげて走る。"
msgstr "  My chest burned with the exertion."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1207:22996: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1207
msgctxt "text_id=22996 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　体育の授業でも見せたことのない全力疾走。"
msgstr "  I'd never pushed myself this hard, even during P.E. class."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1212:22997: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1212
msgctxt "text_id=22997 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんだ、わたしも結構走れるじゃん。"
msgstr "  Wow. I was a pretty good runner."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1217:22998: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1217
msgctxt "text_id=22998 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やっぱり人間、死ぬ気になれば最低でも人並みの運動神経は発揮できるんだ、とにやついたりする。"
msgstr "  It's amazing what humans could do when we think we're about to die."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1222:22999: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1222
msgctxt "text_id=22999 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その脳天気に現実逃避のツケが、"
msgstr "  My mind began to wander, trying to escape the reality of the situation, when..."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1274:23000: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1274
msgctxt "text_id=23000 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「え？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1281:23001: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1281
msgctxt "text_id=23001 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　突然の浮遊感。"
msgstr "  Suddenly, I felt like I was floating."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1286:23002: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1286
msgctxt "text_id=23002 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの足は、地面ではなく、何もない中空を蹴っていた。"
msgstr "  My feet kicked wildly at the air."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1307:23003: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1307
msgctxt "text_id=23003 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あ―――れ」"
msgstr "\"Wait... what?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1373:23004: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1373
msgctxt "text_id=23004 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背中から落ちたらしい。"
msgstr "  I seemed to be falling backward."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1378:23005: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1378
msgctxt "text_id=23005 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呼吸をすると背中が痛む。"
msgstr "  Every breath sent a painful spasm through my back."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1383:23006: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1383
msgctxt "text_id=23006 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　やばい、と思って背中に指をあてると、ぬるり、と液体らしきものの感触があった。"
msgstr "  I reached for my back, feeling like something was wrong, and touched something wet."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1406:23007: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1406
msgctxt "text_id=23007 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……しげしげと眺める。"
msgstr "  ...I timidly looked at my hand."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1411:23008: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1411
msgctxt "text_id=23008 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　言いたくないけど、<苺|いちご>みたいに<真|ま>っ<赤|か>っ<赤|か>。"
msgstr "  As much I hated to admit it... my hand was strawberry red."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1416:23009: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1416
msgctxt "text_id=23009 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　舐めてみると、やっぱりかすかな鉄の味。"
msgstr "  I licked it. Yup, tastes like iron."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1421:23010: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1421
msgctxt "text_id=23010 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　出血量は一リットル超えで、いまもまだ増量中。"
msgstr "  I'd lost over a liter of blood, and it only kept flowing."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1442:23011: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0011; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1442
msgctxt "text_id=23011 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……信じ、らんない……」"
msgstr "\"I can't... believe this...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1449:23012: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1449
msgctxt "text_id=23012 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どうしようもない事実に、喉をあえがせる。"
msgstr "  Horrifying reality stopped me from finishing my sentence."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1454:23013: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1454
msgctxt "text_id=23013 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“何者か”が近寄ってくる。"
msgstr "  Something was coming this way."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1459:23014: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1459
msgctxt "text_id=23014 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けどわたしにはもうどうでもいい事だ。"
msgstr "  At this point, I didn't really care."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1464:23015: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1464
msgctxt "text_id=23015 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このまま意識を失って永遠に目覚めないか、"
msgstr "  Would I sleep forever..."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1469:23016: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1469
msgctxt "text_id=23016 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正体不明の殺人鬼に捕まるか。"
msgstr "  ...or be captured by the killer?"

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1490:23017: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1490
msgctxt "text_id=23017 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どちらにせよ、もう、"
msgstr "  Either way,"

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1496:23018: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1496
msgctxt "text_id=23018 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの夜は、ここで、おしまいという事らしい―――"
msgstr "  apparently, this was how my night would end."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:30:23019: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:30
msgctxt "text_id=23019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここは館内で、三人の帰りを待つべきだと思った。"
msgstr "  I should wait inside the mansion for all three of them to return."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:63:23020: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:63
msgctxt "text_id=23020 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それじゃ行ってくる。二十分捜して何も見つからなかったら戻りましょう」"
msgstr "\"I'm going to head out. If I don't find anything after twenty minutes, I'll be back.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:82:23021: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:82
msgctxt "text_id=23021 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「賢明です。行きますよ、草十郎君」"
msgstr "\"Sounds like a plan. Let's go, Soujyuro.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:105:23022: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:105
msgctxt "text_id=23022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　普段は詠梨神父の近くに寄らない静希だけど、今夜はさすがに特別みたいだ。"
msgstr "  Sizuki usually kept his distance from Father Eiri, but there was nothing usual about tonight."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:110:23023: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:110
msgctxt "text_id=23023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぴったりと横に張り付いて、背中を守るように走っていった。"
msgstr "  He kept pace at the priest's side, his head on a swivel."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:208:23024: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:208
msgctxt "text_id=23024 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……待つだけの時間が過ぎていく。"
msgstr "  I waited for what felt like an eternity."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:213:23025: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:213
msgctxt "text_id=23025 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　屋敷の電気はまだ回復しない。"
msgstr "  The power still wasn't back on."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:222:23026: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:222
msgctxt "text_id=23026 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「もう今夜中の復旧はないみたい。"
msgstr "\"Looks like we're not going to get the lights back tonight."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:234:23027: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_P_2_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:234
msgctxt "text_id=23027 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　客室の配線は別系統だから、まだ電源が生きていればいいけど」"
msgstr "  The guest rooms run on a separate set of wiring, so let's hope they're still good.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:255:23028: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:255
msgctxt "text_id=23028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺邸の客室は後から造られたものらしい。"
msgstr "  Those rooms must've been added at a later date."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:260:23029: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:260
msgctxt "text_id=23029 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　古くからある箇所……居間や廊下、西館は完全に闇に没したようだ。"
msgstr "  All the older areas of the mansion, like the drawing room, hallways, and west wing, were pitch-dark."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:285:23030: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:285
msgctxt "text_id=23030 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「待て。ベオはどこにいった？」"
msgstr "\"Wait. Where's Beo?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:295:23031: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:295
msgctxt "text_id=23031 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「！　そういえば何処にもいないけど……」"
msgstr "\"Huh?! Oh, yeah. I don't see him anywhere.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:306:23032: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:306
msgctxt "text_id=23032 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「わたしが捜してくる。みんなはここにいて。いい、決して唯架ちゃんから離れちゃダメよ」"
msgstr "\"I'll go look for him. Everyone else stay here. Don't leave Yuika's side. Got it?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:315:23033: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:315
msgctxt "text_id=23033 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「姉さん」"
msgstr "\"Ritsuka...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:326:23034: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_P_2_0001_B; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:326
msgctxt "text_id=23034 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「大丈夫よ、信頼して。これでも闇夜には慣れてるわ」"
msgstr "\"I'll be fine, trust me. I'm used to dark nights like these.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:351:23035: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:351
msgctxt "text_id=23035 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんは屋敷の二階へと消えていった。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka disappeared up the stairs to the second floor of the mansion."

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:373:23036: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:373
msgctxt "text_id=23036 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_Q:8:23037: scene=WIK_SELECT_Q
#: WIK_SELECT_Q:8
msgctxt "text_id=23037 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｑ～"
msgstr "-Decision Q-"

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_1:30:23038: scene=WIK_Q_1
#: WIK_Q_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=23038 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不謹慎だけど、ホラー映画ならまっさきに死ぬパターンだ、と思った。"
msgstr "  I feel like if this was a horror movie, this would be the part that gets us killed."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_2:30:23039: scene=WIK_Q_2
#: WIK_Q_2:30
msgctxt "text_id=23039 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……そういえば。"
msgstr "  Thinking about it..."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_2:35:23040: scene=WIK_Q_2
#: WIK_Q_2:35
msgctxt "text_id=23040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの人も蒼崎同様、土桔氏と山城先生、その両名を殺害できる“不在時間”を持つ人だった、と思った。"
msgstr "  ...they were away for a while, so, like Aozaki, they could've murdered Mr. Tokitsu and Mr. Yamasiro, too."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:41:23041: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:41
msgctxt "text_id=23041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二十分が経過して、まず蒼崎が戻ってきた。"
msgstr "  After a long twenty minutes, Aozaki returned."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:46:23042: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:46
msgctxt "text_id=23042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は雨ガッパを脱いで、バスタオルで体を拭いている。"
msgstr "  She took off her raincoat, and dried herself off with a towel."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:70:23043: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:70
msgctxt "text_id=23043 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いや、ひどい嵐だわ、こりゃ。"
msgstr "\"Whew, that's some storm out there."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:81:23044: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:81
msgctxt "text_id=23044 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　もう風っていうより壁？　周りの木が飛んでいってないのが不思議なくらい。……まあ、プロイの仕業なんだから、それぐらいアリなんだろうけど」"
msgstr "  The wind's like a brick wall. I'm surprised the trees are still upright... Then again, that's probably the Ploy's doing.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:101:23045: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:101
msgctxt "text_id=23045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は洋館を出て、左手方向からぐるりと洋館を回ってきたらしい。"
msgstr "  Aozaki explained that she'd patrolled a loop of the entire mansion, starting from the left side."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:106:23046: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:106
msgctxt "text_id=23046 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　サンルームの前には何もなかったそうだ。"
msgstr "  She didn't find anything in front of the sunroom."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:132:23047: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:132
msgctxt "text_id=23047 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「それより詠梨と草十郎は？」"
msgstr "\"So where are Father Eiri and Soujyuro?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:148:23048: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_Q_A_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:148
msgctxt "text_id=23048 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「……途中ですれ違わなかったのですか？」"
msgstr "\"...You didn't run into them?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:157:23049: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0003_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:157
msgctxt "text_id=23049 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「ぜんぜん。外に出る時、森の方が気になる、とか言ってたけど……"
msgstr "\"Nope. Soon as we got outside, they said they wanted to check out the forest."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:170:23050: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0003_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:170
msgctxt "text_id=23050 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "まさかあの二人、この嵐の中で森に入ったんじゃ……」"
msgstr "There's no way they went there in this storm, is there...?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:175:23051: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:175
msgctxt "text_id=23051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不安げに顔を合わせる蒼崎とシスター唯架。"
msgstr "  Aozaki and Sister Yuika exchanged concerned glances."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:180:23052: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:180
msgctxt "text_id=23052 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこへ、"
msgstr "  Then..."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:221:23053: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:221
msgctxt "text_id=23053 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:226:23054: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:226
msgctxt "text_id=23054 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　沈んだ顔で、ずぶ濡れの静希が戻ってきた。"
msgstr "  Sizuki came back inside, looking sullen and dripping wet."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:231:23055: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:231
msgctxt "text_id=23055 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　詠梨神父の姿はない。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri wasn't with him."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:257:23056: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:257
msgctxt "text_id=23056 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「……すまない。"
msgstr "\"...Sorry."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:257:23057: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:257
msgctxt "text_id=23057 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　目を離した<隙|すき>に、詠梨神父がすごく面白いコトに」"
msgstr "  I looked away for a second, and then something very funny happened to the Father.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:278:23058: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:278
msgctxt "text_id=23058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　悲愴な顔つきなのに、台詞だけはあいかわらず空気を読まない静希だった。"
msgstr "  Sizuki was clearly downtrodden, but he'd made a bizarre choice of words."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:321:23059: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_Q_A_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:321
msgctxt "text_id=23059 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「静希さん。まさか、エイリ神父が……？」"
msgstr "\"Mr. Sizuki. You mean Father Eiri's...?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:332:23060: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:332
msgctxt "text_id=23060 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……そのまさかみたいね。あの詠梨までやられるなんて……何者なのよ、一体……」"
msgstr "\"...Sounds that way. Who on earth could take out someone like Father Eiri...?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:353:23061: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:353
msgctxt "text_id=23061 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ロビーは沈黙に包まれた。"
msgstr "  The foyer fell silent."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:358:23062: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:358
msgctxt "text_id=23062 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一緒にいながら神父を見失い、みすみす“犯人”の餌食にさせてしまった後悔で、静希は唇を噛みしめている。"
msgstr "  Sizuki was biting his lip, clearly ashamed of losing track of the priest and falling for the killer's trap."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:389:23063: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_Q_A_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:389
msgctxt "text_id=23063 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「？　草十郎、その手に持ってるの、なんだ？」"
msgstr "\"Hm? Soujyuro, what are you holding?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:395:23064: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:395
msgctxt "text_id=23064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　よく見れば、静希は手に二十センチほどの、もふもふしたものを持っていた。"
msgstr "  Looking closer, I could see something long and fluffy in his hand, about eight inches in length."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:423:23065: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:423
msgctxt "text_id=23065 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、館の東側……サンルームの前に落ちてたんだけど」"
msgstr "\"I found it at the east wing, in front of the sunroom.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:446:23066: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:446
msgctxt "text_id=23066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう言って静希が差し出したものは、金色の犬のぬいぐるみだった。額にはおかしな紋様が刻まれている。"
msgstr "  He held up what looked like a golden dog plushie. There was a strange pattern on its forehead."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:476:23067: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_Q_A_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:476
msgctxt "text_id=23067 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「五人目の犠牲者ね」"
msgstr "\"The fifth victim.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:485:23068: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:485
msgctxt "text_id=23068 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「って、それベオ！？"
msgstr "\"Wait, is that Beo?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:485:23069: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:485
msgctxt "text_id=23069 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　じゃあ、あいつがサンルームの前にいた人影！？」"
msgstr "  So he was the one we saw in front of the sunroom?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:494:23070: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_Q_A_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:494
msgctxt "text_id=23070 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「お……言われてみれば、たしかにベオだったな。"
msgstr "\"Oh... now you mention it, it did look like Beo."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:505:23071: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_Q_A_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:505
msgctxt "text_id=23071 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　あれ？　もしかしてアイツ、俺たちに助けを求めていたのか？」"
msgstr "  Wait, was he trying to ask for our help?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:541:23072: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:541
msgctxt "text_id=23072 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……そうなると、どうなる？"
msgstr "  If he was, what did that mean?"

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:583:23073: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:583
msgctxt "text_id=23073 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオはサンルームの外で犯人を見て、"
msgstr "  Beo saw the killer outside the sunroom,"

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:588:23074: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:588
msgctxt "text_id=23074 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何らかの手段で笑わされて、咄嗟に部屋の中にいるわたしたちに助けを求めた……？"
msgstr "  was made to laugh somehow, remembered we were inside, and tried to get our attention?"

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:648:23075: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:648
msgctxt "text_id=23075 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなベオから離れよう、と言いだしたのは律架さんだ。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka was the one who warned us to stay away from Beo."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:653:23076: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:653
msgctxt "text_id=23076 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は闇夜に慣れている、と言っていた。"
msgstr "  She said she was used to dark nights."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:658:23077: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:658
msgctxt "text_id=23077 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ならあの時、律架さんには人影が笑いを堪えようとしているベオだと分かっていたのではないか……？"
msgstr "  Did she know that the silhouette was Beo trying not to laugh?"

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:700:23078: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:700
msgctxt "text_id=23078 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「……ベオは何か見付けたのかもね。ひそかに一番頼りにしてたのに、痛手だわ。"
msgstr "\"Maybe Beo found something. This is bad. I was secretly counting on him the most."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:712:23079: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:712
msgctxt "text_id=23079 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それで草十郎、詠梨はどのあたりでやられたの？」"
msgstr "  Soujyuro, where was Father Eiri killed?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:734:23080: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:734
msgctxt "text_id=23080 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「西側の森だ。"
msgstr "\"On the west side of the forest."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:778:23081: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:778
msgctxt "text_id=23081 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "何か動くものがあるって森に入っていって、すぐに笑い声が聞こえてきた。"
msgstr "We thought we saw something moving, and when we went to check I heard laughter."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:818:23082: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:818
msgctxt "text_id=23082 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　その後、落雷のような悲鳴と、滝のような血が降ってきて……見上げてみたら……」"
msgstr "  Then I heard this scream like thunder, and there was a shower of blood. When I looked up, I saw...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:867:23083: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:867
msgctxt "text_id=23083 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ごくり、と全員が息を呑む。"
msgstr "  Everyone held their breath in anticipation."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:872:23084: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:872
msgctxt "text_id=23084 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの神父さんの死に様は、よほど悲惨なものだろうと覚悟して。"
msgstr "  We all braced for the gruesome description of the priest's demise."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:898:23085: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:898
msgctxt "text_id=23085 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「見上げたら？」"
msgstr "\"You saw...?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:945:23086: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:945
msgctxt "text_id=23086 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「うん。木と木の間に、蜘蛛の巣みたいにロープが張り巡らされていて。"
msgstr "\"A bunch of ropes tied up like a spider's web between the trees."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1143:23087: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1143
msgctxt "text_id=23087 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　その中心で、クネクネしたポーズで死んでた。"
msgstr "  His body was at the center, all twisted."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1149:23088: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1149
msgctxt "text_id=23088 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　なんか裸になって、"
msgstr "  He was completely naked."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1206:23089: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1206
msgctxt "text_id=23089 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "薔薇くわえて」"
msgstr "And he had a rose in his mouth―\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1214:23090: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_Q_A_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1214
msgctxt "text_id=23090 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「あははははははははははは！」"
msgstr "\"Ahahahahahahahaha!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1267:23091: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Q_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1267
msgctxt "text_id=23091 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「へ？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1272:23092: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1272
msgctxt "text_id=23092 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　背後から響いた爆笑に、つい振り返る。"
msgstr "  Instinctively, I turned to face the laughter behind me."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1289:23093: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_Q_A_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1289
msgctxt "text_id=23093 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「―――あ」"
msgstr "\"...Oops.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1329:23094: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1329
msgctxt "text_id=23094 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あっという間の出来事だった。"
msgstr "  It all happened so quickly."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1334:23095: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1334
msgctxt "text_id=23095 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希からの報告を聞いた唯架さんは、一瞬で彫像になっていた。"
msgstr "  Sister Yuika had turned to stone as soon as she heard Sizuki's report."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1381:23096: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1381
msgctxt "text_id=23096 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「唯架さん、石化して死んだーーー！？」"
msgstr "\"Yuika got petrified!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1408:23097: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_Q_A_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1408
msgctxt "text_id=23097 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「悲劇ね。なまじ耳で世界を捉える人だから、静希君の言葉をリアルにイメージできてしまったのよ」"
msgstr "\"Poor Yuika. She must've pictured what Sizuki was talking about.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1417:23098: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_Q_A_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1417
msgctxt "text_id=23098 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「……俺は普段、この人と神父がどんだけ険悪なのか気になって仕方がないが、ともかくこれで七人だ。一気に減ったな」"
msgstr "\"She and Father Eiri were two of the sternest people I've ever met, and yet... Anyway, that's seven victims now. We're dropping like flies.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1437:23099: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1437
msgctxt "text_id=23099 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう。不幸な事故だったけど、犯人にとっては一番厄介な人が、これで消えてしまった。"
msgstr "  Unfortunately for us, all the people who posed the greatest threat to the killer were gone."

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1442:23100: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1442
msgctxt "text_id=23100 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時刻はじき午前一時になろうとしていた。"
msgstr "  The clock approached 1:00 AM."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:36:23101: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:36
msgctxt "text_id=23101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　私は、これで安心して眠れる、と思った。"
msgstr "  I could rest easy now."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:71:23102: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:71
msgctxt "text_id=23102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ひとりきりで部屋に戻る。"
msgstr "  I returned to my room, alone."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:76:23103: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:76
msgctxt "text_id=23103 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　犯人候補の蒼崎が幽閉されても油断は禁物。"
msgstr "  Even with Aozaki in confinement, we still had to stay on guard."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:82:23104: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:82
msgctxt "text_id=23104 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　きっちりドアに鍵をかけて、"
msgstr "  I locked the door to my room"

msgctxt "text_id=23105 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ベッドに横になる。"
msgstr " and lay down on my bed."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:90:23106: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:90
msgctxt "text_id=23106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　後は朝を待つだけだ。"
msgstr "  All that was left to do was wait for morning."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:95:23107: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:95
msgctxt "text_id=23107 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　色々あったけど、これでようやく安心して眠れる。"
msgstr "  So much had happened, but at least I could finally sleep without worrying."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:130:23108: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:130
msgctxt "text_id=23108 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「…………ふう」"
msgstr "\"...Whew.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:136:23109: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:136
msgctxt "text_id=23109 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神様、お願いします。"
msgstr "  God, if you're listening..."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:141:23110: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:141
msgctxt "text_id=23110 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目を覚ましたら、ちゃんと何もかも元通りになっていますように―――"
msgstr "  ...make everything go back to how it was by the time I wake up..."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:259:23111: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_1_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:259
msgctxt "text_id=23111 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:264:23112: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:264
msgctxt "text_id=23112 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小鳥の鳴き声で目を覚ました。"
msgstr "  I woke up to the sound of birds chirping outside."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:271:23113: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_1_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:271
msgctxt "text_id=23113 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「朝……朝に、なってる……」"
msgstr "\"Ungh... It's morning...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:277:23114: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:277
msgctxt "text_id=23114 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時刻は五時半。"
msgstr "  The clock read half past five."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:282:23115: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:282
msgctxt "text_id=23115 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外はうっすらと日が差し始めている。"
msgstr "  The sun was beginning to peek over the horizon."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:304:23116: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:304
msgctxt "text_id=23116 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目覚めがいいのがわたしの数少ない取り柄なのに、疲れがたまっていたんだろう。"
msgstr "  My ability to rise early was one of my few strong points, so I must've been really exhausted."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:309:23117: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:309
msgctxt "text_id=23117 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぼんやりとした頭のまま、姿見で洋服のシワを確認する。"
msgstr "  I foggily examined my wrinkled clothes in the mirror."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:314:23118: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:314
msgctxt "text_id=23118 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外は昨夜の嵐が嘘のように静かだ。"
msgstr "  It was so quiet outside, like last night's storm never happened."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:319:23119: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:319
msgctxt "text_id=23119 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　物音も、人の気配も、話し声もしない朝。"
msgstr "  A silent morning, with no sounds of movement or talking in the house."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:324:23120: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:324
msgctxt "text_id=23120 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは漠然と、ある予感を抱いたまま廊下に出た。"
msgstr "  I stepped out into the hallway, feeling a vague premonition coming on."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:370:23121: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:370
msgctxt "text_id=23121 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静かだ。"
msgstr "  It was quiet."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:375:23122: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:375
msgctxt "text_id=23122 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とても清潔な空気感。"
msgstr "  The air was crisp."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:422:23123: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:422
msgctxt "text_id=23123 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司の客室も清潔。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji's room was clean and tidy."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:427:23124: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:427
msgctxt "text_id=23124 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　詠梨神父用の客室も清潔。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri's room was clean and tidy."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:432:23125: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:432
msgctxt "text_id=23125 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんの客室も清潔。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka's room was clean and tidy."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:454:23126: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_1_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:454
msgctxt "text_id=23126 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「誰か、生きている人、いますかー？」"
msgstr "\"Anyone alive out there?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:460:23127: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:460
msgctxt "text_id=23127 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　西館に呼びかけても返事はない。"
msgstr "  I yelled into the void of the west wing, but no one responded."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:465:23128: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:465
msgctxt "text_id=23128 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ああ、やっぱり、予感の通り。"
msgstr "  My hunch was spot on. Something was wrong."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:471:23129: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:471
msgctxt "text_id=23129 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いま、この屋敷は三咲町で一番、静かで綺麗で、終わっている。"
msgstr "  This mansion was now the cleanest, quietest place in all of Misaki. It was over."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:520:23130: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:520
msgctxt "text_id=23130 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎を閉じこめた地下室に向かう。"
msgstr "  I went down to the basement where Aozaki was confined,"

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:525:23131: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:525
msgctxt "text_id=23131 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狭い階段を下りて、扉につきあたる。"
msgstr "  down the narrow staircase to the door."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:539:23132: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:539
msgctxt "text_id=23132 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　南京錠は外側から外されていた。"
msgstr "  The padlock had been broken clean off from the outside."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:637:23133: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:637
msgctxt "text_id=23133 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狭い地下室には、うつぶせで倒れた死体が一つ。"
msgstr "  Inside the tiny cellar, I saw... a single dead body, lying prone."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:642:23134: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:642
msgctxt "text_id=23134 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彩度の高い、どこか日本人離れした長髪は、間違いなく蒼崎のものだ。"
msgstr "  The beautiful, long hair was all I needed to know who it was. Aozaki."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:648:23135: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:648
msgctxt "text_id=23135 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　完全に呼吸は止まっている。"
msgstr "  She wasn't breathing."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:668:23136: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:668
msgctxt "text_id=23136 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は犯人ではなかった。"
msgstr "  She hadn't been the killer."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:673:23137: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:673
msgctxt "text_id=23137 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女が何時殺されたのかは定かではない。"
msgstr "  It was unclear what time she was murdered."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:678:23138: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:678
msgctxt "text_id=23138 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、鍵をあけ、蒼崎を笑わせた犯人は、なに食わぬ顔で地上に戻り、そして―――"
msgstr "  But whoever the killer was broke the lock, made Aozaki laugh, nonchalantly went upstairs, and..."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:686:23139: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:686
msgctxt "text_id=23139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの逃げ場を塞いで、目の前に現れようとしていた。"
msgstr "  ...cut off my means of escape. They were going to show up soon."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:706:23140: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:706
msgctxt "text_id=23140 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソレはわたしが地下室に入るまで、どこかに隠れていたのだろう。"
msgstr "  They must have been hiding somewhere waiting for me to come down into the basement."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:711:23141: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:711
msgctxt "text_id=23141 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地下室の階段は一本道だ。"
msgstr "  The stairs were the only way out."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:716:23142: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:716
msgctxt "text_id=23142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしが下りた後、後ろから下りればわたしを袋小路に追い詰められる。"
msgstr "  If the killer followed me down here, I was trapped."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:749:23143: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_1_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:749
msgctxt "text_id=23143 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……まあ、もうどうでもいっか」"
msgstr "\"...Oh, well. Doesn't matter anymore.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:755:23144: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:755
msgctxt "text_id=23144 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この状況は、もう手詰まりだ。"
msgstr "  I was at a dead end."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:760:23145: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:760
msgctxt "text_id=23145 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ゲームは真犯人の勝ち。"
msgstr "  Game over. Victory to the real killer."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:765:23146: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:765
msgctxt "text_id=23146 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは何を間違えていたのかをぼんやりと考えながら、破滅の足音に耳をかたむけた―――"
msgstr "  My thoughts were interrupted by the sounds of footsteps. The footsteps of Death..."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:30:23147: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:30
msgctxt "text_id=23147 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、本当にそうだろうか、と思った。"
msgstr "  I wasn't so sure about that."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:69:23148: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_R_2_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:69
msgctxt "text_id=23148 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「これでやっと眠れるわ。"
msgstr "\"Now we can finally get some sleep."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:80:23149: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_R_2_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:80
msgctxt "text_id=23149 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　それじゃあみんな、おやすみなさい」"
msgstr "  Good night, everyone.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:90:23150: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:90
msgctxt "text_id=23150 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんは西館の二階に消えていった。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka disappeared up the west-wing stairs."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:121:23151: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_R_2_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:121
msgctxt "text_id=23151 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「……わたしも休ませてもらうわ。"
msgstr "\"...I'm going to get some rest too."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:132:23152: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_R_2_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:132
msgctxt "text_id=23152 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　静希君は詠梨神父にあてがっていた部屋を使って。夜があけるまで、静希君の部屋は使えないから」"
msgstr "  Sizuki, your room's out of bounds until morning, so take the room you wanted to give to Father Eiri.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:143:23153: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_R_2_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:143
msgctxt "text_id=23153 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「あ、そうだった。ありがとう有珠」"
msgstr "\"Right. Thanks, Alice.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:163:23154: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:163
msgctxt "text_id=23154 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺さんと静希もそれぞれの部屋に戻っていった。"
msgstr "  Miss Kuonji and Sizuki retired to their respective rooms."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:194:23155: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:194
msgctxt "text_id=23155 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:200:23156: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:200
msgctxt "text_id=23156 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:205:23157: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:205
msgctxt "text_id=23157 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あとはわたしたちだけだ。"
msgstr "  It was just us left."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:210:23158: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:210
msgctxt "text_id=23158 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは意を決して槻司の顔を見上げて、"
msgstr "  I mustered up the courage to look at Tsukiji."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:245:23159: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:245
msgctxt "text_id=23159 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「久万梨。話、ちょっとだけいいか？」"
msgstr "\"Kumari, got a minute?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:251:23160: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:251
msgctxt "text_id=23160 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「槻司、少しだけ話さない？」"
msgstr "\"Tsukiji, can I talk to you?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:287:23161: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:287
msgctxt "text_id=23161 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　お互い同じ気持ちであったコトに、ちょっとだけ笑いあったりするのだった。"
msgstr "  We smiled at each other. We'd both had the same idea, apparently."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:413:23162: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:413
msgctxt "text_id=23162 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし、改めて考えると、とんでもないコトになった。"
msgstr "  Things had gotten really out of hand tonight."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:433:23163: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:433
msgctxt "text_id=23163 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時刻は草木も眠る丑三つ時。"
msgstr "  It was an ungodly hour."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:438:23164: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:438
msgctxt "text_id=23164 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　締め切った雨戸の外は、この世の終わりのような嵐。"
msgstr "  The storm's raging outside seemed to portend the end of the world."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:443:23165: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:443
msgctxt "text_id=23165 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　笑ったら死ぬ、なんておかしな世界で、わたしは、三年間それとなく意識していた男子と個室にいるのである。"
msgstr "  If we laugh, we die, and yet here I am with a guy I've had a crush on for three years."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:467:23166: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:467
msgctxt "text_id=23166 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「お茶を淹れられるな、ここ。久万梨は紅茶でいいか？」"
msgstr "\"I'm gonna have some tea. You want some?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:479:23167: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:479
msgctxt "text_id=23167 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「コーヒー。すごく苦いの。砂糖いれないで」"
msgstr "\"I'll take a coffee. Black, no sugar.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:490:23168: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:490
msgctxt "text_id=23168 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そりゃ剛気だ。甘みは必要ねえってか」"
msgstr "\"Very badass. Sweet enough already for you?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:500:23169: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:500
msgctxt "text_id=23169 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司の悪態は、嫌味のようでいて、そうでない。"
msgstr "  That sounded a little sarcastic, but I know he didn't mean it that way."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:536:23170: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:536
msgctxt "text_id=23170 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「話って、人物Ａのコト？」"
msgstr "\"Want to talk about Person A?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:542:23171: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:542
msgctxt "text_id=23171 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「おう。まだ解決とは言えないからな。久万梨だって蒼崎が１００パーセント<星|ほし>だと思ってねえだろ？」"
msgstr "\"Yep. Still haven't got it figured out. You don't think it's 100% Aozaki, do you?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:559:23172: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:559
msgctxt "text_id=23172 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　コーヒーカップを受け取って、口をつけながら頷く。"
msgstr "  He passed me a coffee, and I slowly brought it to my mouth before taking a sip."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:564:23173: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:564
msgctxt "text_id=23173 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ま、そりゃそうよね。"
msgstr "  He was right. I didn't."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:569:23174: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:569
msgctxt "text_id=23174 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こういう話よね、わたしたち。"
msgstr "  We were both on the same page."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:603:23175: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:603
msgctxt "text_id=23175 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「蒼崎が該当するのは確かだけど。それを言うなら律架さんも静希もだしね。"
msgstr "\"Signs point to Aozaki, but you can't rule out Ritsuka and Sizuki, either."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:615:23176: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:615
msgctxt "text_id=23176 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　信頼できるのは久遠寺さんと、事件が起きてからずっと一緒にいたわたしたちぐらいじゃない？」"
msgstr "  The only people we can really trust are Miss Kuonji and each other. I mean, we've all been together since this started.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:636:23177: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:636
msgctxt "text_id=23177 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ん？　久遠寺は信用できねえだろ。"
msgstr "\"Hmm. I don't know about Kuonji."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:648:23178: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:648
msgctxt "text_id=23178 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　アイツ、基本的にプロイとやらの味方じゃねえか」"
msgstr "  Feels to me more like she's on the Ploys' side.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:684:23179: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:684
msgctxt "text_id=23179 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そうなの？　たしかにずっと中立っぽい態度だったけど、根拠は？」"
msgstr "\"Really? She seems neutral to me. Got anything to back that up?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:706:23180: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0007_0; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:706
msgctxt "text_id=23180 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「犯人捜しをする気がないっていうのと……そうだな、"
msgstr "\"She doesn't seem interested in finding the killer, for one... Oh, I know."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:720:23181: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0007_1; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:720
msgctxt "text_id=23181 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "勘で申し訳ないんだが、人物Ａとやらに肩入れしている気がする」"
msgstr " This is just a hunch, but I feel like she's helping them somehow.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:756:23182: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:756
msgctxt "text_id=23182 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そりゃそうでしょ、プロイって久遠寺さんの持ち物なんだし、もう人物Ａはプロイが化けてるんだし。だから中立だったんじゃない？」"
msgstr "\"It's possible. The Ploy belongs to her, and the killer's a Ploy in disguise. Maybe that's why she's neutral.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:792:23183: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:792
msgctxt "text_id=23183 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いや、そっちじゃない。いま動いているプロイにじゃなくて、使ったヤツに対してだよ。"
msgstr "\"I don't mean she's helping the Ploy; I mean the person using it."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:804:23184: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:804
msgctxt "text_id=23184 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　だってアイツ、怒ってなかっただろ。自分の持ち物が勝手に使われたっていうのに」"
msgstr "  For a start, she didn't seem mad at all about someone using her Ploy like that.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:824:23185: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:824
msgctxt "text_id=23185 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あ」"
msgstr "\"Oh.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:844:23186: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:844
msgctxt "text_id=23186 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なるほど、と納得した。"
msgstr "  He was right."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:849:23187: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:849
msgctxt "text_id=23187 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　じゃあ、久遠寺さんは犯人を知っていたのだろうか？"
msgstr "  Does that mean Miss Kuonji knew who the killer was?"

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:875:23188: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0010; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:875
msgctxt "text_id=23188 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「知らないとは思うぜ。だが、あえて口にしていない事はあるだろうな。"
msgstr "\"I don't think she necessarily knows. Still, she's definitely hiding something."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:886:23189: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0011; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:886
msgctxt "text_id=23189 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　たとえばスイーツハーツとやらの詳しい特徴だ。リデルの口ぶりからすると、使う人間にはある種の特徴がありそうだった」"
msgstr "  About Sweets Hearts, for example. Going off what Riddell said, you need a certain something to use it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:912:23190: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0012; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:912
msgctxt "text_id=23190 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「スイーツハーツは誰にでも使えるもんじゃねえと思う。"
msgstr "\"Maybe it's like a magical sword."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:918:23191: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0013; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:918
msgctxt "text_id=23191 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　ほら、妖刀とか名刀とかで、持ち物が持ち主を選ぶって言うじゃねえか。あんな感じでな」"
msgstr "  Y'know, not just anyone can wield it. Only 'the chosen one.'\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:951:23192: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:951
msgctxt "text_id=23192 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……持ち物が使用者を選ぶ……？"
msgstr "  Could a thing really choose who uses it?"

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:956:23193: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:956
msgctxt "text_id=23193 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　では、その条件とやらが久遠寺さん的には応援―――いや、共感できるものだったとか？"
msgstr "  If so, did that mean Miss Kuonji was supporting―no, empathetic to it?"

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:977:23194: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0014; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:977
msgctxt "text_id=23194 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「しっかし。今さらだけどな、久万梨、俺とコンビで良かったのか？」"
msgstr "\"That aside, I know this is a little late to ask, but are you really okay with teaming up with me?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:982:23195: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:982
msgctxt "text_id=23195 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　突然の、とんでもない質問。"
msgstr "  Well, that came out of nowhere."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:987:23196: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:987
msgctxt "text_id=23196 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは努めてクールに返答した。"
msgstr "  I tried my best to stay calm as I answered,"

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1023:23197: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1023
msgctxt "text_id=23197 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「それはいい。わたし、槻司のこと信頼してるし」"
msgstr "\"Yeah. I trust you, Tsukiji.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1054:23198: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0015_0; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1054
msgctxt "text_id=23198 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「いやあ、この場合まずいだろ、それ。"
msgstr "\"Not a good idea trusting anyone in a situation like this."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1068:23199: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0015_1; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1068
msgctxt "text_id=23199 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "今夜にかぎっちゃ信頼している奴ほど危ねえじゃねえか」"
msgstr " Feels like the person you trust the most'll stab you in the back.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1091:23200: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1091
msgctxt "text_id=23200 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……そうね。疑ってかかるぐらいがちょうどいい」"
msgstr "\"...I guess you're right. We should all be wary of everyone.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1126:23201: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0016; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1126
msgctxt "text_id=23201 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そういうコト。この事件で一番信用しちゃあならねえのは自分だ。だから常に、客観的に監視している相棒がいないと無実が証明できない。"
msgstr "\"Exactly. We can only trust ourselves. That's why we all need someone to keep an eye on us, objectively."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1137:23202: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0017; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1137
msgctxt "text_id=23202 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　リデルのヤツが二人一組で行動しようって言いだしたのは、そのあたりも含めてだろうよ。二心同体、スイーツハーツとは良く言ったもんだ」"
msgstr "  It's probably why Riddell wanted us all to pair up, too. Two minds, one body. Kinda appropriate given we're dealing with Sweets Hearts here.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1162:23203: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1162
msgctxt "text_id=23203 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　リデルの話はともかくとして。"
msgstr "  We put Riddell behind us."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1173:23204: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0011; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1173
msgctxt "text_id=23204 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「じゃあ槻司は、誰が一番怪しいと思ってる？」"
msgstr "\"So who do you think's the most likely suspect at this point?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1199:23205: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0018; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1199
msgctxt "text_id=23205 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「全員平等だぜ。怪しいってんなら、俺はまだ土桔の爺さんの死体が本物かどうかさえ保留してるしな。"
msgstr "\"I think we're all on equal ground. I still don't know if Yurihiko's body was the real deal or not."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1210:23206: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0019; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1210
msgctxt "text_id=23206 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　蒼崎が自分の部屋を隠していた事も、ありゃ真犯人にうまく<嵌|は>められたんじゃないかって思ってる。一番の強敵を、真っ先に封じにきた結果かもしれん」"
msgstr "  I think the killer tricked Aozaki into hiding whatever's in her room, too. Get rid of the biggest threat, and all that.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1236:23207: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0012; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1236
msgctxt "text_id=23207 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「蒼崎が嵌められた？」"
msgstr "\"You think she was framed?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1247:23208: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0020; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1247
msgctxt "text_id=23208 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ああ。事実上、あの行動力の固まりみたいな女が、自分の部屋を隠す事で手一杯だっただろ。"
msgstr "\"Yeah. She was too preoccupied with covering something up to think about anything else."

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1259:23209: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0021_0; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1259
msgctxt "text_id=23209 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　それに妙なコト言ってたじゃねえか。蒼崎の姉貴がいつああなったか、"
msgstr "  Plus, she was saying some weird things. When do you think"

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1272:23210: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0021_1; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1272
msgctxt "text_id=23210 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "久万梨はどう思う？」"
msgstr " that business with Touko happened?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1306:23211: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1306
msgctxt "text_id=23211 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……わたしは、"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_S:8:23212: scene=WIK_SELECT_S
#: WIK_SELECT_S:8
msgctxt "text_id=23212 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｓ～"
msgstr "-Decision S-"

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:36:23213: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:36
msgctxt "text_id=23213 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぼんやりと、脳裏によぎった雑感にひたる。"
msgstr "  I spaced out, and random thoughts filled my mind."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:47:23214: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_ROBBY_0000; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:47
msgctxt "text_id=23214 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「久万梨くーん？　何しているんですか、行きますよー」"
msgstr "\"Kumari? What're you doing? Let's go.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:60:23215: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:60
msgctxt "text_id=23215 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あ、はい、すぐ行きます」"
msgstr "\"Oh, sorry. Coming.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:85:23216: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:85
msgctxt "text_id=23216 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは荷物をまとめ直して、いつの間にか先行していたふたりを追いかけた。"
msgstr "  The other two had already set off. I picked up my things and followed them."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:128:23217: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:128
msgctxt "text_id=23217 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は山城先生と口論しながら林道を歩いていく。"
msgstr "  Aozaki was verbally sparring with Mr. Yamasiro as they walked down the tree-lined path."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:133:23218: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:133
msgctxt "text_id=23218 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　遅れないよう彼女の後を追う。"
msgstr "  I hurried after them."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:153:23219: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:153
msgctxt "text_id=23219 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ふと空を仰ぐと、あれだけ晴れていた空模様は崩れ始めていた。"
msgstr "  Looking up at the sky, I saw ominous clouds starting to roll in."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:174:23220: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:174
msgctxt "text_id=23220 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あれ。今日の天気予報、どうだったっけ」"
msgstr "\"Wait, what's the weather forecast for today?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:180:23221: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:180
msgctxt "text_id=23221 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今にも泣き出しそうな空。"
msgstr "  The heavens looked like they could open up any moment."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:185:23222: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:185
msgctxt "text_id=23222 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この分では、下手をすると帰りは雨になるんじゃないだろうな、とわたしは思った。"
msgstr "  Would I have to trek back home in the rain?"

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:310:23223: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:310
msgctxt "text_id=23223 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　林道を抜けると視界が開けた。"
msgstr "  Once we were past of the woods, I could see more clearly."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:315:23224: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:315
msgctxt "text_id=23224 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　くり抜かれた空の下、時代錯誤な建物がある。"
msgstr "  In the clearing stood a large building that felt out of time."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:358:23225: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_ROBBY_0001; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:358
msgctxt "text_id=23225 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「おや、これはまた立派な洋館だ。幽霊屋敷なんて誰が言いだしたんだろうね。<誹謗|ひぼう><中傷|ちゅうしょう>もいいところだ」"
msgstr "\"What a magnificent European mansion! How anyone could call such a work of art a haunted house is beyond me!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:388:23226: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:388
msgctxt "text_id=23226 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうでもないですよ。火のないところに煙は立たないって言葉、ここにかぎっては本当ですから。お化けが出たぐらいで騒がないでくださいね、山城センセ」"
msgstr "\"Well, they kind of have a point. No smoke without fire, right? That kind of thing happens around here. You should keep an eye out for ghosts, Mr. Yamasiro.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:394:23227: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_ROBBY_0002; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:394
msgctxt "text_id=23227 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「ははは。蒼崎くんがそんな冗談を口にするなんて、僕らとしてはそっちの方が怖いな」"
msgstr "\"Hahaha! I find your attempts at humor scarier than any ghost, Aozaki.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:414:23228: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:414
msgctxt "text_id=23228 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎の忠告を、山城先生はどこまで真剣に受けとめているのだろう。"
msgstr "  I wonder if he actually believed her."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:419:23229: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:419
msgctxt "text_id=23229 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　しかし。三年程度の付き合いとはいえ、彼女が<あ|・><の|・><顔|・>で冗談を言った記憶はない。"
msgstr "  I've known Aozaki for three years and I think she's never told a joke with *that* expression."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:446:23230: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:446
msgctxt "text_id=23230 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「蒼崎。今の話、本当？」"
msgstr "\"Aozaki. Were you serious about that?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:472:23231: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0001_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:472
msgctxt "text_id=23231 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「お化けが出るかは別にして、不思議な事なら起こらない事もないわ。"
msgstr "\"Ghosts aside, strange stuff does happen here."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:486:23232: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0001_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:486
msgctxt "text_id=23232 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "大丈夫、おかしなものを見てもスルーすれば害はないから」"
msgstr " Nothing to worry about though. If you see anything weird, ignore it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:507:23233: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:507
msgctxt "text_id=23233 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:512:23234: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:512
msgctxt "text_id=23234 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山城先生の意見に賛成する。"
msgstr "  I agreed with Mr. Yamasiro."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:517:23235: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:517
msgctxt "text_id=23235 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　幽霊を見ても無視すればＯＫ、という蒼崎の性格がいちばん怖い。"
msgstr "  \"Ignore anything weird, even ghosts\" was kind of a scary thing to say."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:605:23236: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:605
msgctxt "text_id=23236 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺邸のロビーは冷えきっていた。"
msgstr "  The foyer of the Kuonji Estate was colder than I expected."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:610:23237: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:610
msgctxt "text_id=23237 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山中なので街より気温が低い……といっても、限度というものがある。"
msgstr "  I knew the mountains were colder, but this was something else."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:615:23238: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:615
msgctxt "text_id=23238 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここではもう、冬が到来しているような寒さだった。"
msgstr "  It felt like winter in here."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:636:23239: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_ROBBY_0003; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:636
msgctxt "text_id=23239 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「中も驚きですねぇ。外見から典型的なチューダー式かと思いましたが、ロビーの造りはロマネスク建築に近い。"
msgstr "\"Would you look at this decor! From the outside, it looks like a standard Tudor style construction, but the foyer is closer to Romanesque architecture."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:642:23240: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_ROBBY_0004; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:642
msgctxt "text_id=23240 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "　隣の通路とロビーとでも大きく年代が違いますね。まるでここだけ違う建物から持ってきた……おや？」"
msgstr "  The connecting hallway and the lobby here appear to be from different time periods. It's as though another building has been tacked on―Oh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:655:23241: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:655
msgctxt "text_id=23241 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「うえー？　不思議ぃー、山城がいるよー？」"
msgstr "\"Whaaaat? Seriously? Mr. Yamasiro?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:676:23242: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:676
msgctxt "text_id=23242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　聞き飽きたバカっぽい声に振り向くと、ロビーにはバカがいた。"
msgstr "  I heard a stupid, irritating voice behind me, and sure enough, there was an idiot standing in the foyer."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:687:23243: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:687
msgctxt "text_id=23243 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「お、<金鹿|こじか>も一緒じゃーん。"
msgstr "\"Whoa! And Kojika, too!"

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:693:23244: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:693
msgctxt "text_id=23244 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　そっか、会長ったら朝からいないと思ったら、ふたりを迎えに行ってたんだな！」"
msgstr "  I wondered where the prez got to this morning. Guess she was picking up you two, huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:730:23245: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:730
msgctxt "text_id=23245 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ちょっと。なんで<芳助|ほうすけ>がいんのよ」"
msgstr "\"Hey, what's Housuke doing here?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:741:23246: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:741
msgctxt "text_id=23246 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「草十郎が声をかけたんでしょ。アイツ、今日はみんなを喜ばせる、とかはりきってたから。"
msgstr "\"Soujyuro probably invited him. He said something this morning about a 'nice surprise' for everyone."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:752:23247: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:752
msgctxt "text_id=23247 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ま、適切なチョイスじゃないけど、最悪ってワケでもないんじゃない？　<木|き><乃|の><美|み>君、とにかく騒がしいし」"
msgstr "  Can't say I agree with his choice, but it could be worse. At least Kinomi can liven the mood.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:789:23248: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:789
msgctxt "text_id=23248 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「おお、まっかせとけ！　ご期待に添うよう、今日は大量に新ネタ仕込んできたからね！　怪談もモノマネ芸も、そう簡単には品切れにはならねーぜ！」"
msgstr "\"Hell yeah I can! I've got a bunch of party tricks and jokes ready to go! Ghost stories, impressions, you name it!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:815:23249: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:815
msgctxt "text_id=23249 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「騒がしいだけならガチョウでも代用は利くでしょうに。"
msgstr "\"If we wanted something loud and annoying, we would've brought a cockatoo."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:815:23250: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:815
msgctxt "text_id=23250 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　静希の考えって、ほんっと分かんない。"
msgstr "  I can never tell what that Sizuki is thinking."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:826:23251: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:826
msgctxt "text_id=23251 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　芳助、バカっとしてないで荷物、持ってよ」"
msgstr "  Housuke, make yourself useful and help me with my luggage.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:837:23252: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0004; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:837
msgctxt "text_id=23252 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「そこはボケだよね！　ボケって言うんだよね、フツー！」"
msgstr "\"Come on! You know I'm funny!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:857:23253: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:857
msgctxt "text_id=23253 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　芳助の軽口を無視して、着替えの入ったボストンバッグを床に置く。"
msgstr "  I ignored him and put my overnight bag down on the floor."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:868:23254: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:868
msgctxt "text_id=23254 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「中身、見ないでよね」"
msgstr "\"Don't look inside.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:879:23255: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0005; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:879
msgctxt "text_id=23255 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "「頼まれたって見ないっショ。金鹿の色気のない着替えとかもうノーサンクス／ノーフューチャー／ノータックス。"
msgstr "\"I know, I know. I don't wanna see your boring grandma underwear anyway!"

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:892:23256: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0006; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:892
msgctxt "text_id=23256 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "　……や、にしても重いな。体に似合わず重装備じゃねえか、オイ」"
msgstr "  ...Oof, man, this is heavy! Your granny panties made from chain mail?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:926:23257: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:926
msgctxt "text_id=23257 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　芳助はわたしの荷物を担いで、ロビーの東側の通路に向かおうとする。"
msgstr "  Housuke picked up my bag and carried it toward the hallway to the east wing."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:931:23258: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:931
msgctxt "text_id=23258 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　重いのは当然だ。万が一の時に備えて、中華鍋と中華包丁、米と金豚チャーシューが入っているんだから。"
msgstr "  Of course it was heavy. Couldn't come here without my trusty wok, cleaver, rice, and char siu. What if I wanted fried rice later?"

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:952:23259: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:952
msgctxt "text_id=23259 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あっちが居間よ。基本、パーティー会場はこっちだから。"
msgstr "\"The drawing room's over there. That's where the party's going to be."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:958:23260: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:958
msgctxt "text_id=23260 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それと、有珠の気遣いで客室も用意されているから、疲れたらそっちに移動して。着替えとかは客室で済ませちゃってね」"
msgstr "  Alice made up guest rooms for each of you, so if you're tired, head on up. You can change in there too, if you like.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:963:23261: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:963
msgctxt "text_id=23261 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうか。"
msgstr "  Hmm."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:968:23262: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:968
msgctxt "text_id=23262 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それじゃあ、わたしは―――"
msgstr "  In that case..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_B:9:23263: scene=WIK_SELECT_B
#: WIK_SELECT_B:9
msgctxt "text_id=23263 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｂ～"
msgstr "-Decision B-"

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:111:23264: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROOM_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:111
msgctxt "text_id=23264 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「あら」"
msgstr "\"Oh!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:116:23265: scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:116
msgctxt "text_id=23265 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下に出ると、蒼崎と出くわした。"
msgstr "  Out in the hallway, I ran into Aozaki."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:121:23266: scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:121
msgctxt "text_id=23266 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は廊下の奥から、ホールに向かっていたところらしい。"
msgstr "  She seemed to be on her way from the bedrooms to the hall."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:142:23267: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROOM_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:142
msgctxt "text_id=23267 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「蒼崎も休憩？　あの突き当たりってアンタの部屋なの？」"
msgstr "\"You taking a break too, Aozaki? Is that your room at the end?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:154:23268: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROOM_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:154
msgctxt "text_id=23268 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「え、そ、そうだけど、別に部屋には寄ってないわよ？"
msgstr "\"Um, y-yeah, but I'm not going in there."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:166:23269: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROOM_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:166
msgctxt "text_id=23269 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　私はちょっとした探し物の途中だから、気にしないで」"
msgstr "  I'm just looking for something. Don't mind me.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:178:23270: scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:178
msgctxt "text_id=23270 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は一階に下りていった。"
msgstr "  Aozaki took the stairs down to the first floor."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:229:23271: scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:229
msgctxt "text_id=23271 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鍵を開けて部屋に入る。"
msgstr "  I unlocked the door and entered my room."

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:234:23272: scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:234
msgctxt "text_id=23272 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　部屋には誰もおらず、荷物が荒らされた痕跡はない。"
msgstr "  Nobody was inside, and there was no sign of any items having been disturbed."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_1:30:23273: scene=WIK_S_1
#: WIK_S_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=23273 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、蒼崎橙子は一番はじめの犠牲者だ、と思った。"
msgstr "  I think Touko Aozaki was the first victim."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_1:64:23274: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_1_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_1
#: WIK_S_1:64
msgctxt "text_id=23274 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ああ、そう考えないと蒼崎の行動はおかしい。"
msgstr "\"Touko has to have been first, otherwise Aozaki wouldn't have acted so weird."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_1:76:23275: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_1_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_1
#: WIK_S_1:76
msgctxt "text_id=23275 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　蒼崎は午前中は街で買い物をしていた。蒼崎姉はあいつが部屋を留守にしている間……久万梨たちを連れて一息ついて、部屋に戻るまでの間に殺されたと見るべきだろう」"
msgstr "  Aozaki was out shopping all morning. Her big sister must have been killed sometime after she left, but before she brought you all here and went back into her room.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_1:99:23276: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_S_1_0000_0; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_S_1
#: WIK_S_1:99
msgctxt "text_id=23276 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「１５時半頃、わたし、二階廊下で蒼崎とすれ違ったけど……"
msgstr "\"I passed Aozaki in the hallway on the second floor around 3:30."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_1:112:23277: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_S_1_0000_1; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_S_1
#: WIK_S_1:112
msgctxt "text_id=23277 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "あの時、東館の奥、蒼崎の部屋は演歌地獄になってた訳ね」"
msgstr " Touko must've been drowning herself in oldies right around then.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_2:36:23278: scene=WIK_S_2
#: WIK_S_2:36
msgctxt "text_id=23278 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、蒼崎橙子が死亡したのは１６時から１８時の間なのかもしれない、と思った。"
msgstr "  I think Touko must've died sometime between 4:00PM and 6:00PM."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_3:36:23279: scene=WIK_S_3
#: WIK_S_3:36
msgctxt "text_id=23279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、蒼崎橙子が死亡したのは１８時から２０時の間なのかもしれない、と思った。"
msgstr "  I think Touko must've died sometime between 6:00PM and 8:00PM."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_4:36:23280: scene=WIK_S_4
#: WIK_S_4:36
msgctxt "text_id=23280 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、蒼崎橙子が死亡したのは２０時から２２時の間なのかもしれない、と思った。"
msgstr "  I think Touko must've died sometime between 8:00PM and 10:00PM."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_5:36:23281: scene=WIK_S_5
#: WIK_S_5:36
msgctxt "text_id=23281 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、蒼崎橙子が死亡したのは２２時から０時の間なのかもしれない、と思った。"
msgstr "  I think Touko must've died sometime between 10:00PM and midnight."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:41:23282: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_A_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:41
msgctxt "text_id=23282 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ま、断定できない以上、<憶測|おくそく>は憶測でしかねえけどな。"
msgstr "\"Well, until we can come up with any real conclusions, this is all just speculation."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:52:23283: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_A_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:52
msgctxt "text_id=23283 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　それよりだ、久万梨。ネックは<何時|いつ>殺したか、じゃなく、どうやって殺したか、だと思わねえか？」"
msgstr "  I think the real problem isn't figuring out when the murder was committed, but how.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:84:23284: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_A_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:84
msgctxt "text_id=23284 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「山城にしろ詠梨神父にしろ、あの鉄仮面たちを笑わせられるのはよっぽどのセンスだ。"
msgstr "\"It takes a serious sense of humor to make someone like Mr. Yamasiro or Father Eiri to laugh out loud."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:95:23285: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_A_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:95
msgctxt "text_id=23285 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　殺害可能時間は平等にあっても、そのセンスだけは限られる。この点で言えば、まあ、草十郎やらベオやら木乃美やらは除外される」"
msgstr "  Other factors like timeframe being equal, just having a sense of humor excludes some people right off the bat, like Soujyuro, Beo, and Kinomi.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:128:23286: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:128
msgctxt "text_id=23286 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司はさも興味深そうに、今まで検討されてこなかった問題点を挙げた。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji had latched onto something big."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:133:23287: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:133
msgctxt "text_id=23287 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たしかにそれは盲点だった。"
msgstr "  Why hadn't anyone else thought of that?"

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:138:23288: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:138
msgctxt "text_id=23288 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　笑いが滑るだけの芳助、まだジョークを理解していないベオには難易度が高すぎる。"
msgstr "  Housuke's jokes only made people cringe; Beo didn't even understand the concept of humor."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:143:23289: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:143
msgctxt "text_id=23289 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希に至っては『冗談のセンスがない』とみんなにダメだしされるほどのボケ体質だし。"
msgstr "  As for Sizuki, I've met planks of wood that get jokes quicker."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:209:23290: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:209
msgctxt "text_id=23290 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　問題点を語りあっているうちに、時間は午前三時になろうとしていた。"
msgstr "  Our discussion carried on until nearly 3:00 AM."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:235:23291: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_S_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:235
msgctxt "text_id=23291 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ふあ……」"
msgstr "\"Huah...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:240:23292: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:240
msgctxt "text_id=23292 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気が緩んだ訳ではないけど、さすがに眠気が襲ってくる。"
msgstr "  I yawned. I was by no means relaxed, just exhausted."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:245:23293: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:245
msgctxt "text_id=23293 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　こんな一日を経験したら、誰だってそろそろエネルギー切れだ。"
msgstr "  After everything that's happened, I'd be surprised if anyone had any real energy left."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:276:23294: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_A_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:276
msgctxt "text_id=23294 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「夜更かししすぎたな。そろそろ眠り時だが、どうする？　念には念だ、オレもそこのソファーで眠るってのもアリだが」"
msgstr "\"It's late. We should probably get some sleep. Are you gonna rest? I can crash on the sofa just to be safe.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:319:23295: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:319
msgctxt "text_id=23295 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎に化けたスイーツハーツ、あるいは他の人物Ａに化けたスイーツハーツの侵入を警戒しての意見だろう。"
msgstr "  He was clearly on guard for Sweets Hearts disguised as Aozaki, or someone else."

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:325:23296: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:325
msgctxt "text_id=23296 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わた、わたしは、"
msgstr "  I yawned again."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_T:8:23297: scene=WIK_SELECT_T
#: WIK_SELECT_T:8
msgctxt "text_id=23297 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｔ～"
msgstr "-Decision T-"

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:40:23298: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:40
msgctxt "text_id=23298 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　鍵をかければ安全だし、それは色々まずい、と思った。"
msgstr "  It should be safe as long as the door is locked, but we still had other things to worry about."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:75:23299: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:75
msgctxt "text_id=23299 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「いい。ここまできたらあと少しだし。"
msgstr "\"We've made it this far. Only a little longer to go."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:81:23300: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:81
msgctxt "text_id=23300 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　だいたい、全員を疑えって言ったの、槻司じゃん」"
msgstr "  Y'know, Tsukiji, you're the one who said not to trust anybody.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:92:23301: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:92
msgctxt "text_id=23301 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そうだったな。俺も容疑者の一人だった。"
msgstr "\"Oh, yeah. I'm a suspect, too."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:103:23302: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:103
msgctxt "text_id=23302 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　さすが久万梨、余計な心配だったぜ」"
msgstr "  Guess I didn't need to worry about you, huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:127:23303: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:127
msgctxt "text_id=23303 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それじゃあな、と槻司はドアに向かう。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji turned to the door, ready to leave."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:132:23304: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:132
msgctxt "text_id=23304 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは何か言おうとして、"
msgstr "  I tried to say something."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:170:23305: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:170
msgctxt "text_id=23305 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「か、関係ないけど。"
msgstr "\"Th-This doesn't have anything to do with anything, but..."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:182:23306: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:182
msgctxt "text_id=23306 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　ひどい一日だったのに、槻司はなんか、満足そうね」"
msgstr "  ...even though it's been, y'know, a rough day, you seem―I dunno―content.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:187:23307: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:187
msgctxt "text_id=23307 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なんだそれ。"
msgstr "  What the hell was I saying?"

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:192:23308: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:192
msgctxt "text_id=23308 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　我がコトながら、とことん可愛げのない女。"
msgstr "  I was just embarrassing myself."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:230:23309: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:230
msgctxt "text_id=23309 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「何人も死んで、自分も殺されかけた一日、か。確かにひでぇ一日だった」"
msgstr "\"People died and I almost joined them. 'Rough day' is putting it lightly.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:235:23310: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:235
msgctxt "text_id=23310 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　でも槻司は真面目に考えてくれて、"
msgstr "  Luckily, he took my question seriously."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:247:23311: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:247
msgctxt "text_id=23311 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「けどまあ、なんだかんだと楽しかったからな。"
msgstr "\"But, I guess, in a way... it's been kind of fun."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:259:23312: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:259
msgctxt "text_id=23312 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　久万梨もそうじゃなかったのか？」"
msgstr "  You feel the same, don't you, Kumari?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:265:23313: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:265
msgctxt "text_id=23313 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの不安を笑い飛ばすように、お気楽な言葉を返した。"
msgstr "  His considerate reply was so reassuring, I almost forgot my anxiety."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:303:23314: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:303
msgctxt "text_id=23314 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「意外。槻司はこういうの、鼻で笑うかと思った」"
msgstr "\"That's a surprise. I thought you looked down on this sort of thing.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:323:23315: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:323
msgctxt "text_id=23315 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そりゃ見込み違いだったな。こういうバカ騒ぎ好きなんだよ、俺。ふざけた人生を送りたいんでな」"
msgstr "\"Well, you were wrong, then. I love this kind of chaos. I don't want to take life too seriously.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:334:23316: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:334
msgctxt "text_id=23316 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「なにそれ。げーん、めーつ」"
msgstr "\"For real? Well, you just blew my mind.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:367:23317: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:367
msgctxt "text_id=23317 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　本気で言いつつ、わたしはコイツを好きだと気付いた原因、はじめのとっかかりを思い出した。"
msgstr "  I was being serious. It reminded of the time I first realized that I'd fallen for him."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:372:23318: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:372
msgctxt "text_id=23318 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司は本当に、すごい人なのだ。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji was an amazing person."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:377:23319: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:377
msgctxt "text_id=23319 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なのにその能力を無駄にしている。"
msgstr "  But he was squandering his potential."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:382:23320: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:382
msgctxt "text_id=23320 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼にはどうしてか名誉欲というか、上昇志向がないのだ。"
msgstr "  He didn't want glory or to move up in the world."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:402:23321: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:402
msgctxt "text_id=23321 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まさに人的資源の無駄遣い。"
msgstr "  It felt like such a waste of human capital."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:407:23322: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:407
msgctxt "text_id=23322 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはそういうのが我慢できない性格で、とにかくコイツを、相応しい場に蹴り出したくて、いつのまにか日々観察していたんだっけ。"
msgstr "  I could never do that. How long had I been watching him, wanting to kick his butt into gear?"

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:443:23323: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:443
msgctxt "text_id=23323 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……こっちも今さらだけど。"
msgstr "\"Look, I know this probably isn't the time..."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:449:23324: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:449
msgctxt "text_id=23324 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　槻司、わりと人付き合い悪いじゃない。なのにどうして、わたしとは普通に話すの？」"
msgstr "  ...but you're not exactly a people-person sometimes, and yet you talk to me. Why is that?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:473:23325: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0006_0; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:473
msgctxt "text_id=23325 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「ん？"
msgstr "\"Hm?"

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:487:23326: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0006_1; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:487
msgctxt "text_id=23326 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　そりゃあおまえさん、親にも教師にも頼らず、六年間ひとりで戦ってきたヤツには敬意を<表|ひょう>すだろ？」"
msgstr " You've worked your ass off for six years, without relying once on your parents, teachers, or anyone else.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:522:23327: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:522
msgctxt "text_id=23327 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「――――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:533:23328: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:533
msgctxt "text_id=23328 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「じゃあな。朝になったらロビーで会おうぜ」"
msgstr "\"Anyway, I'll catch you in the morning down in the foyer.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:574:23329: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:574
msgctxt "text_id=23329 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして、部屋はとたんに静かになった。"
msgstr "  And with that, the room went quiet again."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:579:23330: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:579
msgctxt "text_id=23330 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはなんでか、胸がいっぱいになりながら、"
msgstr "  For some reason, I felt a tight squeezing sensation in my chest."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:585:23331: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:585
msgctxt "text_id=23331 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "“なんだかんだと―――”"
msgstr "\"In a way... it's been kind of fun.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:591:23332: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:591
msgctxt "text_id=23332 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "“久万梨もそうじゃなかったのか？”"
msgstr "\"You feel the same, don't you, Kumari?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:596:23333: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:596
msgctxt "text_id=23333 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さっきの槻司の言葉を思い返す。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji's words replayed themselves over and over in my head."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:639:23334: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:639
msgctxt "text_id=23334 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……うん、そっか。"
msgstr "  ...Yeah. He was right."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:644:23335: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:644
msgctxt "text_id=23335 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしも、やっぱり楽しかったんだ。"
msgstr "  Maybe it had been fun."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:760:23336: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:760
msgctxt "text_id=23336 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:767:23337: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:767
msgctxt "text_id=23337 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小鳥の鳴き声で目を覚ました。"
msgstr "  I woke up to the sound of birds chirping."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:773:23338: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:773
msgctxt "text_id=23338 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「朝……朝に、なってる……」"
msgstr "\"Ungh... It's morning...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:778:23339: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:778
msgctxt "text_id=23339 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時刻は五時半。"
msgstr "  The clock read half past five."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:783:23340: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:783
msgctxt "text_id=23340 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外はうっすらと日が差し始めている。"
msgstr "  The sun was beginning to peek over the horizon."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:804:23341: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:804
msgctxt "text_id=23341 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目覚めがいいのがわたしの数少ない取り柄なのに、疲れがたまっていたんだろう。"
msgstr "  My ability to rise early was one of my few strong points, so I must've been really exhausted."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:809:23342: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:809
msgctxt "text_id=23342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぼんやりとした頭のまま、姿見で洋服のシワを確認する。"
msgstr "  I foggily examined my wrinkled clothes in the mirror."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:829:23343: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:829
msgctxt "text_id=23343 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まだ全身に血が巡っていない。"
msgstr "  My body was still asleep."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:838:23344: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:838
msgctxt "text_id=23344 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　お茶を淹れるのも億劫で、わたしはノソノソとテーブルに置いたお財布とパスケースを手に取る。"
msgstr "  I was too tired to even make tea, so I just grabbed my wallet and card case off the table."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:843:23345: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:843
msgctxt "text_id=23345 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　パスケースには定期と、記念写真が入っている。"
msgstr "  The case contained my commuter pass and some pictures I took each year."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:864:23346: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:864
msgctxt "text_id=23346 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今年の学園祭で、蒼崎が失態をかましたレアな一枚だ。"
msgstr "  I had a rare shot of Aozaki making a fool of herself at this year's school festival."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:884:23347: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:884
msgctxt "text_id=23347 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ジュースと間違えてシャンパンを飲んだのか、"
msgstr "  She either drank champagne thinking it was a soft drink,"

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:889:23348: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:889
msgctxt "text_id=23348 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰かがモンブランの隠し味であるアルコール量を間違えたのか。"
msgstr "  or someone slipped alcohol in the juice cocktail."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:894:23349: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:894
msgctxt "text_id=23349 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とにかく、目を離した隙に蒼崎はとんでもない上機嫌になっていて、“私もあの服きるー！”と暴れてしまった。"
msgstr "  Next thing I knew, she was all hyper, yelling about wearing someone else's clothes."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:937:23350: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:937
msgctxt "text_id=23350 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この一枚はその名場面を使い捨てカメラで撮ったものだ。"
msgstr "  I got a great shot of her with my disposable camera."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:942:23351: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:942
msgctxt "text_id=23351 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりにも面白いので、こうしてパスケースに収めている。"
msgstr "  I loved that photo so much I carried it with me in my card case everywhere I go."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:947:23352: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:947
msgctxt "text_id=23352 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　気分が沈みがちになった時、この愛らしく、普段の蒼崎を知っている人間からするとあり得ない写真を見ると励まされるのである。"
msgstr "  Whenever I felt down, it always cheered me up to look at it and remember how adorable Aozaki could be. It was a side of herself that nobody who knew her would ever expect."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:952:23353: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:952
msgctxt "text_id=23353 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おもに笑い方面で。"
msgstr "  Especially her comedic side."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:987:23354: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0011; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:987
msgctxt "text_id=23354 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「―――あれ？」"
msgstr "\"...Huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:992:23355: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:992
msgctxt "text_id=23355 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なにか、いま。"
msgstr "  Wait a second."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:997:23356: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:997
msgctxt "text_id=23356 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ものすごく、いまになって言わないでほしい、レベルの事を提示しなかった、わたし？"
msgstr "  Did I just think something I really shouldn't have, that would be incredibly bad to bring up now?"

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1018:23357: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0012; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1018
msgctxt "text_id=23357 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そうだ―――みんなは？」"
msgstr "\"Oh, right... where is everyone?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1025:23358: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1025
msgctxt "text_id=23358 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはボストンバッグをあさり、万が一の時に役に立つものはないか、と物色する。"
msgstr "  I rifled through my overnight bag to see if anything might be of use."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1030:23359: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1030
msgctxt "text_id=23359 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<炒飯|チャーハン>を作ろうと持ってきた荷物が役に立った。"
msgstr "  Turns out, the stuff I brought to cook with was worth bringing."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1061:23360: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1061
msgctxt "text_id=23360 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　愛用の中華鍋と中華包丁、どちらにするか迷ったけど、ここは鍋を選んだ。"
msgstr "  I hovered over the wok or the cleaver, ultimately deciding to take the wok with me."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1111:23361: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1111
msgctxt "text_id=23361 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下に出る。"
msgstr "  I went out into the hallway."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1116:23362: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1116
msgctxt "text_id=23362 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　客室よりふたまわり冷たい空気。"
msgstr "  The air was slightly cooler than inside the guest room."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1121:23363: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1121
msgctxt "text_id=23363 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館は静まり返っていた。"
msgstr "  Silence had fallen over the mansion once again."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1126:23364: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1126
msgctxt "text_id=23364 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何の音も、何の気配もない。"
msgstr "  There was no sound, no sign of life."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1131:23365: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1131
msgctxt "text_id=23365 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　昨夜の嵐が嘘のようだ。"
msgstr "  It was like the storm never happened."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1178:23366: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1178
msgctxt "text_id=23366 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司の客室には誰もいなかった。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji's room was empty."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1183:23367: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1183
msgctxt "text_id=23367 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　詠梨神父用の客室に静希の姿はなかった。"
msgstr "  Sizuki wasn't in Father Eiri's room."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1188:23368: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1188
msgctxt "text_id=23368 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんの客室には誰もいなかった。"
msgstr "  Nobody was in Ritsuka's room, either."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1196:23369: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0013; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1196
msgctxt "text_id=23369 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「久遠寺さーん」"
msgstr "\"Miss Kuonji!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1202:23370: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1202
msgctxt "text_id=23370 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　西館に呼びかけても返事はない。"
msgstr "  I called out into the void of the west wing, but got no response."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1208:23371: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1208
msgctxt "text_id=23371 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰も　いない。"
msgstr "  I was alone."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1257:23372: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1257
msgctxt "text_id=23372 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎を閉じこめた地下室に向かう。"
msgstr "  I headed down to the basement where Aozaki was confined,"

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1262:23373: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1262
msgctxt "text_id=23373 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狭い階段を下りて、扉につきあたる。"
msgstr "  down a narrow staircase to a door."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1267:23374: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1267
msgctxt "text_id=23374 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　南京錠は外側から外されていた。"
msgstr "  The padlock had been broken clean off from the outside."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1282:23375: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0014; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1282
msgctxt "text_id=23375 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「―――蒼崎？」"
msgstr "\"...Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1287:23376: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1287
msgctxt "text_id=23376 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはある種の覚悟をして、扉を開ける。"
msgstr "  I braced myself for whatever was to come, and opened the door."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1383:23377: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1383
msgctxt "text_id=23377 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狭い地下室には、うつぶせで倒れた死体がひとつ。"
msgstr "  Inside the tiny cellar, I saw ...a dead body, lying face down."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1388:23378: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1388
msgctxt "text_id=23378 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彩度の高い、どこか日本人離れした長髪は、間違いなく蒼崎のものだ。"
msgstr "  The beautiful, long hair was all I needed to see to know it was Aozaki."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1393:23379: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1393
msgctxt "text_id=23379 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呼吸は完全に止まっている。"
msgstr "  She wasn't breathing."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1398:23380: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1398
msgctxt "text_id=23380 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女は倒れたまま、左手で床に文字を残していた。"
msgstr "  She'd scrawled something with her left hand in her last moments."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1403:23381: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1403
msgctxt "text_id=23381 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　血文字のダイイング・メッセージ。"
msgstr "  It was dying message, written in blood."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1423:23382: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1423
msgctxt "text_id=23382 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　床には、怨念のこもった文字で、"
msgstr "  I could feel the disdain in the words."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1433:23383: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_T_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1433
msgctxt "text_id=23383 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "『やっぱりっていうな』"
msgstr "\"Told you so.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1456:23384: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0015; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1456
msgctxt "text_id=23384 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「やっぱり……」"
msgstr "\"You sure did...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1462:23385: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1462
msgctxt "text_id=23385 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は犯人ではなかったのだ。"
msgstr "  Aozaki wasn't the killer."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1467:23386: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1467
msgctxt "text_id=23386 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女が<何|い><時|つ>殺されたのかは定かではない。"
msgstr "  It wasn't clear when she was murdered."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1472:23387: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1472
msgctxt "text_id=23387 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、鍵をあけ、蒼崎を笑わせた犯人は、なに食わぬ顔で地上に戻り、そして―――"
msgstr "  But whoever the killer was broke the lock, made her laugh, nonchalantly went upstairs, and..."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1520:23388: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0016; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1520
msgctxt "text_id=23388 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「はっ、はっ、は……！」"
msgstr "\"Hah, hah, hah!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1526:23389: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1526
msgctxt "text_id=23389 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　千々に乱れる呼吸と思考を、必死に押さえつける。"
msgstr "  I tried to control my breathing and my racing mind."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1531:23390: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1531
msgctxt "text_id=23390 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　全員死んだ。"
msgstr "  Everyone was dead."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1536:23391: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1536
msgctxt "text_id=23391 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　全員死んだ。"
msgstr "  Everyone was dead."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1541:23392: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1541
msgctxt "text_id=23392 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　おそらく、犯人とわたし以外は全員死んだ。"
msgstr "  Probably, only the killer and I were left."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1571:23393: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1571
msgctxt "text_id=23393 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夜は明けたのに？"
msgstr "  But the sun was already up."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1576:23394: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1576
msgctxt "text_id=23394 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いや、まだ太陽は昇りきっていない。"
msgstr "  Wait, not completely."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1581:23395: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1581
msgctxt "text_id=23395 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　朝を迎えるのが条件なら、まだゲームは終わっていない。"
msgstr "  If the rules said it ended in the morning, then the game wasn't over yet."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1586:23396: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1586
msgctxt "text_id=23396 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なら逃げるか、犯人を特定しなければ。"
msgstr "  I had to get out of here now and figure out who the killer is."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1591:23397: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1591
msgctxt "text_id=23397 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このままだと『クリア』にならない。"
msgstr "  There was no winning this unless I did something."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1596:23398: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1596
msgctxt "text_id=23398 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎たちは死んだまま、もう二度と戻らない。"
msgstr "  Everyone was dead. No turning back now."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1629:23399: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1629
msgctxt "text_id=23399 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_U:8:23400: scene=WIK_SELECT_U
#: WIK_SELECT_U:8
msgctxt "text_id=23400 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｕ～"
msgstr "-Decision U-"

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:41:23401: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:41
msgctxt "text_id=23401 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そ、そういうコトなら、仕方がない、と思った。"
msgstr "  If that's how it has to be, then there's no helping it now."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:82:23402: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:82
msgctxt "text_id=23402 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そ、そうよね、万が一の時、便利だし。"
msgstr "\"Y-Yeah, I guess it's the best option right now."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:93:23403: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:93
msgctxt "text_id=23403 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　わたしはほら、兄貴が売るほどいるから、男子と一緒の部屋とか、たぶんなれてる、し」"
msgstr "  I-I mean I have lots of brothers, so I'm used to sleeping in the same room as boys. It's fine. Completely fine.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:104:23404: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_2_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:104
msgctxt "text_id=23404 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "「そりゃ頼もしい。んじゃ、ソファーを借りるぜ。"
msgstr "\"Perfect. I'll take the sofa then."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:115:23405: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_2_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:115
msgctxt "text_id=23405 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "　いいかげん、俺も気を張り続けて疲れた。久万梨がいるなら、ちっとは安心して眠れる」"
msgstr "  I'm pretty exhausted myself. Hopefully, I can get some rest if I know you're nearby.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:151:23406: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:151
msgctxt "text_id=23406 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　じゃあな、と片手をあげて、槻司はあっさりと眠ってしまった。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji quickly fell asleep after raising his hand to wave goodnight."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:156:23407: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:156
msgctxt "text_id=23407 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　毛布にくるまって、ソファーにごろん、である。"
msgstr "  I looked at him all wrapped up in a blanket..."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:182:23408: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:182
msgctxt "text_id=23408 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「なにそれ」"
msgstr "\"Oh, come on.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:188:23409: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:188
msgctxt "text_id=23409 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりの簡素さに、わたしもすっかり落ち着いてしまった。"
msgstr "  Seeing him fall asleep so quickly helped me to feel relaxed too."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:193:23410: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:193
msgctxt "text_id=23410 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……まあ、この状況でドキドキするのもどうかと思うし。わたしだって疲れているし。"
msgstr "  ...I definitely didn't want to get excited in a situation like this. Plus, I was beat."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:226:23411: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:226
msgctxt "text_id=23411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　寝間着はないし、そもそも着替える気もないし。"
msgstr "  I didn't have any pajamas, and didn't feel like changing anyway."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:235:23412: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:235
msgctxt "text_id=23412 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは洋服のまま、せめてポケットにしまっていたパスケースやら財布やらをテーブルにおいて身軽になって、ベッドに潜りこむ。"
msgstr "  For comfort, I did remove my wallet and card case from my pockets and place them on a table, before sliding under a blanket fully-clothed."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:284:23413: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:284
msgctxt "text_id=23413 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司じゃないけど、目をつむったとたん、意識は闇に落ちていった。"
msgstr "  I couldn't fall asleep as fast as Tsukiji, but I could feel myself drifting off already."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:289:23414: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:289
msgctxt "text_id=23414 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……深い深い眠り。"
msgstr "  Into a deep, deep sleep..."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:294:23415: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:294
msgctxt "text_id=23415 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どこか、すぐ近くで、誰かの笑い声を聞いた気がした。"
msgstr "  Did... I just hear... laughter... next to me...?"

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:407:23416: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:407
msgctxt "text_id=23416 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小鳥の鳴き声で目を覚ました。"
msgstr "  I woke up to the sound of birds chirping."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:414:23417: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:414
msgctxt "text_id=23417 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「朝……朝に、なってる……」"
msgstr "\"Ungh... It's morning...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:420:23418: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:420
msgctxt "text_id=23418 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時刻は五時半。"
msgstr "  The clock read half past five."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:425:23419: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:425
msgctxt "text_id=23419 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外はうっすらと日が差し始めている。"
msgstr "  The sun was beginning to peek over the horizon."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:447:23420: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:447
msgctxt "text_id=23420 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　目覚めがいいのがわたしの数少ない取り柄なのに、疲れがたまっていたんだろう。"
msgstr "  My ability to rise early was one of my few strong points, so I must've been really exhausted."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:452:23421: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:452
msgctxt "text_id=23421 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ぼんやりとした頭で部屋を見渡して、"
msgstr "  I looked around the room, my vision blurry."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:461:23422: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:461
msgctxt "text_id=23422 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そうだ、槻司―――！」"
msgstr "\"Oh! Tsukiji!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:467:23423: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:467
msgctxt "text_id=23423 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは槻司と一緒の部屋にいるコトを思い出して、"
msgstr "  I went to sleep in the same room as him."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:488:23424: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:488
msgctxt "text_id=23424 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「え？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:495:23425: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:495
msgctxt "text_id=23425 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこにいる筈の人物が、いないコトにやっと気づいた。"
msgstr "  I finally realized that he wasn't where I'd last seen him."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:515:23426: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:515
msgctxt "text_id=23426 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソファーには誰もいない。"
msgstr "  There was nobody on the sofa."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:520:23427: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:520
msgctxt "text_id=23427 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あるのは槻司が着ていた洋服だけだ。"
msgstr "  Just his clothes."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:525:23428: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:525
msgctxt "text_id=23428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋服だけが、まるで標本のようにソファーに置かれている。"
msgstr "  They were laid out neatly like they were on display."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:530:23429: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:530
msgctxt "text_id=23429 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　小さくなって消えてしまったとか、氷のように溶けてしまったとか、とにかく、そんな感じ。"
msgstr "  It was like he'd shrunk so small he'd disappeared, or melted away somewhere."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:535:23430: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:535
msgctxt "text_id=23430 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　跡形もなく消える、というのが、アイツの望む“死に方”みたい。"
msgstr "  Maybe he wanted to die by completely vanishing."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:556:23431: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:556
msgctxt "text_id=23431 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……………槻司？」"
msgstr "\"...Tsukiji?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:563:23432: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:563
msgctxt "text_id=23432 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋服に触れてみる。"
msgstr "  I tried touching his clothes."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:568:23433: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:568
msgctxt "text_id=23433 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　毛布とソファーに触れてみる。"
msgstr "  I touched his blanket, and the sofa."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:573:23434: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:573
msgctxt "text_id=23434 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　熱はとっくに冷め切っている。"
msgstr "  His warmth had long since faded."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:578:23435: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:578
msgctxt "text_id=23435 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手があったと思われる位置には、わたしのパスケースが落ちている。"
msgstr "  My card case had fallen around where his hand might have been."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:598:23436: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:598
msgctxt "text_id=23436 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは漠然と、理解した。"
msgstr "  I could guess what happened."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:603:23437: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:603
msgctxt "text_id=23437 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司は眠ってなんかいなかった。"
msgstr "  He never really fell asleep."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:608:23438: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:608
msgctxt "text_id=23438 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　眠ったフリをして、わたしを安心させて、寝ずの番をしていてくれたのだ。"
msgstr "  He pretended to, so I'd relax. Then he stayed up to watch over me all night."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:628:23439: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:628
msgctxt "text_id=23439 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これは密室殺人だ。"
msgstr "  This was a locked-room murder."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:633:23440: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:633
msgctxt "text_id=23440 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　でも凶器はハッキリしているし、わたしもようやく、誰が犯人なのか理解できた。"
msgstr "  It was clear what the murder weapon is, and I was finally close to figuring out who the killer was, too."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:653:23441: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:653
msgctxt "text_id=23441 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはパスケースを拾い上げて、空虚な気持ちで部屋を後にする。"
msgstr "  I picked up my card case, and left the room feeling empty inside."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:673:23442: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:673
msgctxt "text_id=23442 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……ごめんね、槻司。"
msgstr "  ...I'm so sorry, Tsukiji."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:678:23443: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:678
msgctxt "text_id=23443 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あんなもの見ちゃったら、そりゃあ、蒼崎好きのアンタは大笑いしちゃうよね。"
msgstr "  As Aozaki's friend, of course you'd laugh at that photo."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:721:23444: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:721
msgctxt "text_id=23444 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静かだ。"
msgstr "  It was quiet."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:726:23445: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:726
msgctxt "text_id=23445 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とても清潔な空気感。"
msgstr "  The air was crisp."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:731:23446: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:731
msgctxt "text_id=23446 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの気持ちも、もう、笑ってしまうぐらい真っ白だ。"
msgstr "  My mind was so blank I almost laughed."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:778:23447: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:778
msgctxt "text_id=23447 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司の客室も清潔。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji's room was clean and tidy."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:783:23448: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:783
msgctxt "text_id=23448 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　詠梨神父用の客室も清潔。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri's room was clean and tidy."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:788:23449: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:788
msgctxt "text_id=23449 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんの客室も清潔。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka's room was clean and tidy."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:809:23450: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:809
msgctxt "text_id=23450 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「誰か、生きている人、いますかー？」"
msgstr "\"Anyone alive out there?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:815:23451: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:815
msgctxt "text_id=23451 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　西館に呼びかけても返事はない。"
msgstr "  I yelled into the void of the west wing, but no one responded."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:820:23452: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:820
msgctxt "text_id=23452 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ああ、やっぱり、予感の通り。"
msgstr "  My hunch was spot on. Something was wrong."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:826:23453: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:826
msgctxt "text_id=23453 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いま、この屋敷は三咲町で一番、静かで綺麗で、終わっている。"
msgstr "  This mansion was now the cleanest, quietest place in all of Misaki. It was over."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:875:23454: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:875
msgctxt "text_id=23454 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎を閉じこめた地下室に向かう。"
msgstr "  I went down to the basement where Aozaki was confined,"

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:880:23455: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:880
msgctxt "text_id=23455 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狭い階段を下りて、扉につきあたる。"
msgstr "  down the narrow staircase to the door."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:894:23456: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:894
msgctxt "text_id=23456 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　南京錠は外側から外されていた。"
msgstr "  The padlock had been broken clean off from the outside."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:992:23457: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:992
msgctxt "text_id=23457 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　狭い地下室には、うつぶせで倒れた死体が一つ。"
msgstr "  Inside the tiny cellar, I saw... a single dead body, lying prone."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:997:23458: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:997
msgctxt "text_id=23458 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彩度の高い、どこか日本人離れした長髪は、間違いなく蒼崎のものだ。"
msgstr "  The beautiful, long hair was all I needed to know who it was. Aozaki."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1002:23459: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1002
msgctxt "text_id=23459 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　完全に呼吸は止まっている。"
msgstr "  She wasn't breathing."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1022:23460: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1022
msgctxt "text_id=23460 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は犯人ではなかった。"
msgstr "  She hadn't been the killer."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1027:23461: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1027
msgctxt "text_id=23461 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女が何時殺されたのかは定かではない。"
msgstr "  It was unclear what time she was murdered."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1032:23462: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1032
msgctxt "text_id=23462 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど、鍵をあけ、蒼崎を笑わせた犯人は、なに食わぬ顔で地上に戻り、そして―――"
msgstr "  But whoever the killer was broke the lock, made Aozaki laugh, nonchalantly went upstairs, and..."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1040:23463: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1040
msgctxt "text_id=23463 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの逃げ場を塞いで、目の前に現れようとしていた。"
msgstr "  ...cut off my means of escape. They were going to show up soon."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1060:23464: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1060
msgctxt "text_id=23464 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ソレはわたしが地下室に入るまで、どこかに隠れていたのだろう。"
msgstr "  They must have been hiding somewhere waiting for me to come down into the basement."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1065:23465: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1065
msgctxt "text_id=23465 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地下室の階段は一本道だ。"
msgstr "  The stairs were the only way out."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1070:23466: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1070
msgctxt "text_id=23466 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしが下りた後、後ろから下りればわたしを袋小路に追い詰められる。"
msgstr "  If the killer followed me down here, I was trapped."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1104:23467: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1104
msgctxt "text_id=23467 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……まあ、もうどうでもいっか」"
msgstr "\"...Oh, well. Doesn't matter anymore.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1110:23468: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1110
msgctxt "text_id=23468 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この状況は、もう手詰まりだ。"
msgstr "  I was at a dead end."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1115:23469: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1115
msgctxt "text_id=23469 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ゲームは真犯人の勝ち。"
msgstr "  Game over. Victory to the real killer."

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1120:23470: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1120
msgctxt "text_id=23470 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは何を間違えていたのかをぼんやりと考えながら、破滅の足音に耳をかたむけた―――"
msgstr "  My thoughts were interrupted by the sounds of footsteps. The footsteps of Death..."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:65:23471: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:65
msgctxt "text_id=23471 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　午前十二時、中央公園。"
msgstr "  Noon. Central Park."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:70:23472: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:70
msgctxt "text_id=23472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはコンビニで焼き増しを済ませ、手荷物になる使い捨てカメラをゴミ箱に投げ捨てた。"
msgstr "  I finished making extra prints at the store, and threw away the disposable camera so I didn't have to carry it around."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:112:23473: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:112
msgctxt "text_id=23473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　空はご覧の通り、天高く<馬肥|うまこ>ゆる秋。"
msgstr "  It was a beautiful day out; the sky was clear, and the autumn air was crisp."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:117:23474: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:117
msgctxt "text_id=23474 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの物騒な夏が過ぎ去った<晴天|サニーデイ>。"
msgstr "  The troubles of the summer were gone, and it was a brand new day."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:139:23475: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:139
msgctxt "text_id=23475 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしこと<久|く><万|ま><梨|り><金鹿|こじか>は、せっかくの連休をおかしなイベントで消費しようとしていた。"
msgstr "  I, Kojika Kumari, was about to spend my long weekend at the strangest of events."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:194:23476: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:194
msgctxt "text_id=23476 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「お待たせー！"
msgstr "\"Thanks for waiting!"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:205:23477: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:205
msgctxt "text_id=23477 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　あれ、クマったら大荷物。なんでそんな大きなボストンバッグなんて持ってきたの？」"
msgstr "  Whoa, what's with all the stuff? Damn, that's a huge overnight bag.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:225:23478: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:225
msgctxt "text_id=23478 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれからちょっと時間が過ぎて、午後一時。"
msgstr "  An hour had passed already, and it was 1:00 PM."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:230:23479: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:230
msgctxt "text_id=23479 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　待ち合わせ場所に<蒼崎|あおざき><青子|あおこ>がやってきた。"
msgstr "  Aoko Aozaki arrived at our meeting place."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:235:23480: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:235
msgctxt "text_id=23480 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　彼女はわたし、久万梨金鹿の同期生であり友人であり、生徒会の戦友でもある。"
msgstr "  Aozaki was my classmate, friend, and comrade on the student council."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:272:23481: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:272
msgctxt "text_id=23481 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎との付き合いは高校に入ってからだけど、不思議とそんな気はしない。十年来の付き合いのようだ。"
msgstr "  We'd only been friends since high school, but it oddly felt longer, like we'd always known each other."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:283:23482: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:283
msgctxt "text_id=23482 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　見ての通り、<明朗快活|めいろうかいかつ><即日払|そくじつばら>い。"
msgstr "  As you can see, she was as bright and lively as ever."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:288:23483: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:288
msgctxt "text_id=23483 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　飲みもので喩えるなら清涼飲料、でも炭酸系。押してもダメなら押し倒せ系の女、とわたしは思っている。"
msgstr "  If she was a drink, she'd be a soft drink, a carbonated soda. She was the kind of person who solved a tough problem by hitting it until it surrendered."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:323:23484: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:323
msgctxt "text_id=23484 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「今日の<久遠寺|くおんじ>邸パーティーはこっちで色々用意してあるから、手ぶらでいいって招待状に書いてなかった？」"
msgstr "\"Didn't I write on the invitation that I'd have everything for the party at the Kuonji house, so don't bring anything?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:341:23485: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:341
msgctxt "text_id=23485 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「なにそれ、聞いてない。"
msgstr "\"I don't know what you're talking about."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:353:23486: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:353
msgctxt "text_id=23486 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　……まったく、間違いだらけね。誕生日を祝うから連休はじめに来てほしい、各自料理持参、としか書かれていなかったわ」"
msgstr "  The invitation just said there's a birthday party, so come at the start of the long weekend, and bring your own food.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:379:23487: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:379
msgctxt "text_id=23487 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「そうなの？　ごめんごめん、<有珠|ありす>ったらこういうの、まだ慣れていないから。朝イチで“やっぱり迎えに来て”って電話してきたのはそういうワケだったのね。"
msgstr "\"Seriously? Sorry. Alice is new to this kind of thing. That's probably why you called this morning and wanted me to come meet you."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:402:23488: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0004_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:402
msgctxt "text_id=23488 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　まあ、それはそれとして。久万梨さん、"
msgstr "  Anyway, moving on..."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:426:23489: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0004_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:426
msgctxt "text_id=23489 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "後ろのなんとも場違いに地味な方って、もしかしてお連れの方？」"
msgstr " Is that dull guy behind you with you? He looks kinda out of place.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:476:23490: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:476
msgctxt "text_id=23490 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「あれ、いやだなあ。このスーツ、昨日下ろしたばっかりなんだけど、おめかしして見えないかい？」"
msgstr "\"Oh, come on! I just got this suit yesterday. Don't I clean up pretty well?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:500:23491: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:500
msgctxt "text_id=23491 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「コピーペーパーと見間違うほどいつも通りです、<山城|やましろ>先生。"
msgstr "\"As always, you look about as plain as copy paper, Mr. Yamasiro."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:511:23492: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:511
msgctxt "text_id=23492 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　それで、今日はなんでしょう？"
msgstr "  So what're you doing here today?"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:511:23493: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:511
msgctxt "text_id=23493 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　教え子を尾行するとか、あと数年したら立派な犯罪になりますから自重してほしいんですけど」"
msgstr "  Following your students around? You know that'll be illegal one day, so I wouldn't get into a habit of doing it.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:531:23494: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:531
msgctxt "text_id=23494 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は学校の外でも容赦がない。"
msgstr "  Aozaki never pulled her punches, inside or outside of school."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:536:23495: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:536
msgctxt "text_id=23495 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　特に山城先生への当たりは遠慮がなさすぎて、もう兄妹なんじゃないかって思うぐらい。"
msgstr "  She was particularly harsh to Mr. Yamasiro, almost like they were related."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:573:23496: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0001_0; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:573
msgctxt "text_id=23496 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「お、ストーキングってヤツだね。"
msgstr "\"Oh, you mean stalking?"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:585:23497: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0001_1; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:585
msgctxt "text_id=23497 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "そういうのは蒼崎くんの方が得意だと思うんだが。ああいや、あくまで個人的な感想だから聞き流して。"
msgstr " I think you're probably the expert on that, Aozaki. That's just my personal impression of you, though."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:596:23498: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0002; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:596
msgctxt "text_id=23498 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "　ほら、怖い顔しないでこれを見て見て。"
msgstr "  Don't look at me like that. Anyway, here..."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:605:23499: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0003; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:605
msgctxt "text_id=23499 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "　今朝、僕のところにも招待状が送られていてね。見れば生徒会の役員が参加とある。生徒会顧問として、君たちの監督をしないといけないだろう？」"
msgstr "  I received an invitation this morning, so I'm participating as an advisor to the student council. I have a responsibility to chaperone you, don't I?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:644:23500: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:644
msgctxt "text_id=23500 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「―――――」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:649:23501: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:649
msgctxt "text_id=23501 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山城先生の差しだした招待状は、わたしに送られたものと同じものだ。"
msgstr "  The invitation Mr. Yamasiro pulled out was the same as the one I got."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:654:23502: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:654
msgctxt "text_id=23502 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　聞いていなかったのか、蒼崎は心底から驚いている。"
msgstr "  Aozaki looked surprised, to say the least."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:659:23503: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:659
msgctxt "text_id=23503 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そこに演技の香りはしない。"
msgstr "  That was no act."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:686:23504: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:686
msgctxt "text_id=23504 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「くっ、その字は<草十郎|そうじゅうろう>か……あいつがヘンに律儀な事、気をつけておくべきだった……」"
msgstr "\"Ugh. That's Soujyuro's handwriting... I should've known better than to ask him for help...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:711:23505: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0004; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:711
msgctxt "text_id=23505 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「ははは、素晴らしい気遣いじゃないか！"
msgstr "\"Hahaha! I thought it very considerate of him!"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:717:23506: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0005; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:717
msgctxt "text_id=23506 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "　僕はね、蒼崎くん。<静希|しずき>くんはいつかたぶん、おそらく機会さえあれば<や|・><る|・>生徒だと思っていたんだ。"
msgstr "  Why, Aozaki, I imagine Sizuki could really go places, given the right opportunities."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:723:23507: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0006; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:723
msgctxt "text_id=23507 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "　それが、こんな楽しそうなイベントに"
msgstr "  And look at what else he wrote."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:723:23508: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0006; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:723
msgctxt "text_id=23508 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "“蒼崎が何するか不安なのでカントクしに来てください”"
msgstr "'Please watch over the party, because who knows what Aozaki might do.'"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:729:23509: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0007; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:729
msgctxt "text_id=23509 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "　なんて書かれた招待状を送ってくるなんて、成長の度合い<著|いちじる>しい。驚くべき危機管理能力だ」"
msgstr "  He's even preparing for emergencies! Fine management skills, if you ask me.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:755:23510: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:755
msgctxt "text_id=23510 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　観念したのか、蒼崎は力なくため息をついた。"
msgstr "  Aozaki let out a defeated sigh."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:760:23511: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:760
msgctxt "text_id=23511 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　招待されている以上、山城先生を追い返す訳にもいかないのだろう。"
msgstr "  She couldn't turn away Mr. Yamasiro, since he'd been formally invited."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:765:23512: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:765
msgctxt "text_id=23512 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どんなに邪険にしていても、道理が通っているのなら無視はできない彼女である。"
msgstr "  However cold-hearted she appeared, she did have a sense of etiquette."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:802:23513: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:802
msgctxt "text_id=23513 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「仕方ない、コブつきだけど案内するわ。"
msgstr "\"Okay, okay. Follow me, I guess."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:813:23514: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:813
msgctxt "text_id=23514 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ふたりとも、久遠寺邸は初めて？」"
msgstr "  Is this the first time you've both visited the Kuonji Estate?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:829:23515: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0008; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:829
msgctxt "text_id=23515 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「初めてです。地元の住人なら、白犬塚にはあまり近寄りませんからねぇ。今年の夏だって、ほら」"
msgstr "\"It is. People around here don't usually go near Shiroinuzuka. Take what happened this past summer, for instance.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:840:23516: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:840
msgctxt "text_id=23516 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「わたしはそうでもないけど。"
msgstr "\"I've been this way a few times."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:851:23517: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:851
msgctxt "text_id=23517 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　そもそもこの山、このあたりの子供にしたらちょっとした聖地なんだし」"
msgstr "  This mountain's like sacred ground for all the kids around here.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:891:23518: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:891
msgctxt "text_id=23518 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　聖地というのは言い過ぎだが、他に適切な表現がない。"
msgstr "  Maybe \"sacred ground\" was an exaggeration, but I couldn't think of a better way to describe it."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:896:23519: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:896
msgctxt "text_id=23519 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　昔からこの丘には怪談がついてまわる。"
msgstr "  For years, there had been urban legends circulating about the hills there."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:901:23520: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:901
msgctxt "text_id=23520 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　神隠しの化け犬坂。"
msgstr "  Like the \"Demon Dog of the Slope.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:906:23521: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:906
msgctxt "text_id=23521 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　霧の深い日に踏み入ったら別人になって帰ってくるとか、逆に不思議な力を授かるとか。"
msgstr "  Or the one where, if you went into the woods on a foggy day, you'd come out either as someone different or with strange powers."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:926:23522: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:926
msgctxt "text_id=23522 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなうわさ話のせいか、たまに勇気ある小学生たちが肝試しとして山に挑んでいるのだ。"
msgstr "  Those stories were probably the reason kids came here: to test their courage."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:931:23523: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:931
msgctxt "text_id=23523 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　森に入り、お化け屋敷のポストに触れてきた小学生は、以後、卒業まで一目置かれるコトになる。"
msgstr "  In elementary school, if you went into the woods and touched the mailbox of the haunted house, you were officially awesome right up until graduation."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:936:23524: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:936
msgctxt "text_id=23524 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これを聖地と言わずなんと言おう。"
msgstr "  I guess that's why sacred ground seemed to fit the area."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:970:23525: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0009; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:970
msgctxt "text_id=23525 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「なるほど。蒼崎くんは二年半、この道を通学路に使っていたんだね。そりゃあ足も鍛えられるってもんだ」"
msgstr "\"You walked all this way to and from school for over two years, Aozaki? You must be very athletic.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:989:23526: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:989
msgctxt "text_id=23526 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　物珍しいのか、山城先生は楽しそうに眼下の街並みを眺めている。"
msgstr "  Mr. Yamasiro gazed down at the city excitedly; maybe it was the first time he'd seen it from this angle."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:994:23527: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:994
msgctxt "text_id=23527 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしも同じ気持ちになりたいところではあるが、立場上、そこまでお気楽な気持ちにはなれない。"
msgstr "  I'd like to feel that excited, too, but I couldn't relax, given the situation."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:999:23528: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:999
msgctxt "text_id=23528 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なぜなら、"
msgstr "  Because-"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1024:23529: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0010; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1024
msgctxt "text_id=23529 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「蒼崎くん、受験勉強ははかどってる？"
msgstr "\"How's your exam studying going, Aozaki?"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1030:23530: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0011; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1030
msgctxt "text_id=23530 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "　ま、君はきっちり自己管理できる子だから心配するまでもないんだけどね」"
msgstr "  I'm sure you've got it under control, so there's probably no need to worry about you.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1048:23531: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1048
msgctxt "text_id=23531 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「言われなくてもきっちりやってます。"
msgstr "\"Of course, I have it under control."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1054:23532: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1054
msgctxt "text_id=23532 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　山城先生のお手は煩わせません」"
msgstr "  I wouldn't dare cause any trouble for you, Mr. Yamasiro.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1080:23533: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0012; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1080
msgctxt "text_id=23533 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「ならいいけど。蒼崎くん、推薦けっちゃうんだもんなあ。そんなに地元の大学はいやかい？」"
msgstr "\"Glad to hear it. You always turn down my advice, after all. Are you really that against attending a local university?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1108:23534: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1108
msgctxt "text_id=23534 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「いや、という訳ではありません。選択肢を狭めたくなかっただけです。私は結構ですから、助言なら久万梨さんにしてあげてください」"
msgstr "\"Not particularly. I just want to keep my options open. If anyone needs advice, it's Kumari.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1134:23535: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0013; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1134
msgctxt "text_id=23535 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「いや、久万梨くんは鉄板でしょ？　もう<渠裸|ミゾラ>の推薦とっているんですから。ご両親も久万梨くん自身も、渠裸への進学を決めているワケですし」"
msgstr "\"Not at all. She's doing just fine. She's taken my recommendation for Mizora. She and her parents have already decided she'll be attending there.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1163:23536: voice_id=X40_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=X40; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1163
msgctxt "text_id=23536 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「あ」"
msgstr "\"Ah.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1204:23537: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1204
msgctxt "text_id=23537 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　口を滑らせた蒼崎に、わたしは無言で“このままスルーしろ”と合図を送る。"
msgstr "  I silently tried to tell Aozaki to ignore the topic."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1225:23538: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1225
msgctxt "text_id=23538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　さて、ここでわたしの経歴と、今日これからの事情を説明しよう。"
msgstr "  Let me take a moment here to talk about my history and what was happening today."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1259:23539: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1259
msgctxt "text_id=23539 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたし、久万梨金鹿は高校三年生。"
msgstr "  My name is Kojika Kumari; I'm a third-year senior in high school."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1264:23540: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1264
msgctxt "text_id=23540 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　来年の二月までは夢も希望もない受験生である。"
msgstr "  You know what students are like, struggling through exams without any hopes or dreams..."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1269:23541: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1269
msgctxt "text_id=23541 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　……と言いつつ、それは都心の大学を志望した子たちの話であって、わたしには関係ない。"
msgstr "  Well, I'm not a typical student. I want to attend a college in the city."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1275:23542: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1275
msgctxt "text_id=23542 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは地元の大学に推薦をとっており、今の学力なら労せずして進学できるからだ。"
msgstr "  I'm planning to attend a local university. Given my current academic performance, that should be a piece of cake."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1319:23543: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1319
msgctxt "text_id=23543 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もともとわたしの両親はガッチガチの就職派で、地元の大学への進学すら否定的だった。"
msgstr "  My parents insist I get a job; they don't want me attending college at all."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1341:23544: voice_id=D30_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=D30; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1341
msgctxt "text_id=23544 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『おまえはうちの家業を手伝うんだから、大学に行く必要はない』"
msgstr "\"You're going to help out with the family business. Why go to college?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1374:23545: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1374
msgctxt "text_id=23545 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　頭が固くて、体が大きくて、山奥の熊みたいな<父親|オヤジ>の弁である。"
msgstr "  That's my old-fashioned father for you―as big and as hard-headed as a bear."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1379:23546: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1379
msgctxt "text_id=23546 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな時代錯誤で野蛮な父を、兄たちがこぞって説得してくれた。"
msgstr "  Luckily, my older brothers managed to convince him to let me go despite his archaic ways."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1429:23547: voice_id=E80_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=E80; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1429
msgctxt "text_id=23547 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『マッドダディ、金鹿にはまだ学生生活が必要だ。とくに体操競技とか。あん馬をやらずして何が青春か』"
msgstr "\"Mad Daddy, Kojika needs to experience college life, and do gymnastics there. Don't you want to see her on the pommel horse?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1461:23548: voice_id=E90_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=E90; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1461
msgctxt "text_id=23548 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『ははは、だからおまえは長男なのだ。つり輪こそ至宝。あん馬とか軟弱すぎて話にならん』"
msgstr "\"Hahaha, that's why you're the oldest, brother. I think the rings are more her thing! She's too weak for horses.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1493:23549: voice_id=F10_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=F10; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1493
msgctxt "text_id=23549 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『バッカじゃねえのダブル兄貴、カッチョイイのは鉄棒でしょやっぱ。縦回転のグルーブ感とか脳内麻薬ドッパドパ。ありゃハマッたら社会復帰とか難しいから』"
msgstr "\"You kidding, my double bros? The horizontal bar is where it's at! Once you get a taste of those vertical flips, you'll never go back!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1543:23550: voice_id=F20_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=F20; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1543
msgctxt "text_id=23550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『そして自慢したい。うちの妹、三咲で一番可愛いって自慢したい。クソいけすかねえスケート部の奴らとか、間違いなく俺たちに土下座するよね。妹さんをスケート部にくださいって！』"
msgstr "\"Yeah, and she's a hit with the guys. We can use that! I bet those dumbasses at the skating club will beg us to convince her to join their team!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1677:23551: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1677
msgctxt "text_id=23551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正直、うんざりする兄貴どもである。"
msgstr "  Honestly, my brothers are idiots."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1682:23552: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1682
msgctxt "text_id=23552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あと、彼らが口にした体操競技はぜんぶ男性限定だから。"
msgstr "  Those gymnastics events were male-only, for goodness' sake."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1713:23553: voice_id=D30_WIK_TITLEIN_0001; voice_prefix=D30; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1713
msgctxt "text_id=23553 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『な"
msgstr "\"B"

msgctxt "text_id=23554 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ん"
msgstr "U"

msgctxt "text_id=23555 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "と"
msgstr "N"

msgctxt "text_id=23556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "い"
msgstr "C"

msgctxt "text_id=23557 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "う"
msgstr "H"

msgctxt "text_id=23558 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "む"
msgstr "O"

msgctxt "text_id=23559 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "く"
msgstr "F"

msgctxt "text_id=23560 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "つ"
msgstr "C"

msgctxt "text_id=23561 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "け"
msgstr "R"

msgctxt "text_id=23562 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "き"
msgstr "E"

msgctxt "text_id=23563 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "兄"
msgstr "E"

msgctxt "text_id=23564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "妹"
msgstr "P"

msgctxt "text_id=23565 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "愛。"
msgstr "S!"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1774:23566: voice_id=D30_WIK_TITLEIN_0002; voice_prefix=D30; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1774
msgctxt "text_id=23566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "おまえたちのような脳筋をこれ以上増やしたくないが、金鹿ならそんな悪夢は起きまい。"
msgstr "I don't really want to keep any more meatheads around here, but it's the only way to protect Kojika."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1781:23567: voice_id=D30_WIK_TITLEIN_0003; voice_prefix=D30; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1781
msgctxt "text_id=23567 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "しゃあねえ、ミゾラ大なら俺も許す！　地元の大学だし、うちの常連さんも増えるだろうしな！"
msgstr "Fine, but only if it's Mizora College. It's close, and she might even bring in some new regulars!"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1794:23568: voice_id=D30_WIK_TITLEIN_0004; voice_prefix=D30; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1794
msgctxt "text_id=23568 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ガハハハハ』"
msgstr "  Gahahaha!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1799:23569: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1799
msgctxt "text_id=23569 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　兄四匹と父親一匹、がっしりとスクラムを組んでの結論だった。"
msgstr "  That was the decision my four brothers and my father came to in their little huddle."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1850:23570: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1850
msgctxt "text_id=23570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あれがわたしの家族だと思うと死にたくなるが、そんなのは小学校から慣れっこなのでぐっと耐えた。"
msgstr "  Just thinking about my family makes me want to die, but that's how it's been since elementary school, so I'm used to feeling like that."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1867:23571: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1867
msgctxt "text_id=23571 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは父の言いつけに従い、進学先を渠裸体育大に決めた。推薦はあっさり取れた。"
msgstr "  I did as my father asked and set my sights on Mizora Sport Science U."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1879:23572: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1879
msgctxt "text_id=23572 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それで父は安心したが、わたしの逆襲はここからである。"
msgstr "  That put him at ease, but I had other things in mind."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1915:23573: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1915
msgctxt "text_id=23573 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは“あくまで滑り止めだから”と都心の大学を第二候補として書き留めた。"
msgstr "  I convinced him to let me put down a college in the city as my \"safety school.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1922:23574: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1922
msgctxt "text_id=23574 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "『先生への建前上、進路希望には三つまで志望校を書く必要があったの。カタチの上だけだから、受験代の用意はしなくていい』"
msgstr "\"You're supposed to write down up to three schools you're interested in for your teacher to review. Just a formality, so I don't need any extra money or anything.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1942:23575: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1942
msgctxt "text_id=23575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの言葉に、父は完全に騙された。"
msgstr "  My father believed every word of it."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1947:23576: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1947
msgctxt "text_id=23576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もちろん本命はその第二候補。"
msgstr "  Of course, I fully intended to go to my second choice in the city."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1968:23577: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1968
msgctxt "text_id=23577 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そのために父に内緒でアルバイトをし続けた。"
msgstr "  That's why I secretly worked a part-time job."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1973:23578: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1973
msgctxt "text_id=23578 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　入試代金と、合格した後の生活費を三年計画で貯めたのだ。授業料は大学側に借り受けることが前提だが、この計画なら有無を言わさず進学する事ができる。"
msgstr "  I'd saved enough over three years to cover living costs if I got in. I'd have to get a loan for tuition fees, but it was the only way to make the plan work."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2009:23579: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2009
msgctxt "text_id=23579 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　父は頑固で力ずくな性格だが、人の努力を無視できるほど悪人でもない。"
msgstr "  My father was stubborn and brash, but he appreciated hard work and diligence."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2014:23580: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2014
msgctxt "text_id=23580 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしが結果をだして、その後の資金すら貯めていたと知れば、しぶしぶ都心への上京を認めるだろう。"
msgstr "  If he saw that I passed my exams while saving up enough money to pay for myself, he'd probably let me go."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2019:23581: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2019
msgctxt "text_id=23581 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ま、認めなくても上京するけど。"
msgstr "  Not that I wouldn't even if he disapproved."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2053:23582: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2053
msgctxt "text_id=23582 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここまで計画は順調だ。"
msgstr "  Everything was going according to plan so far."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2058:23583: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2058
msgctxt "text_id=23583 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしを止められるものは、入学試験当日に風邪を引いてしまうか、あるいは―――"
msgstr "  The only thing that could stop me was sudden illness preventing me from taking the entrance exam."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2064:23584: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2064
msgctxt "text_id=23584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう、あるいは―――その、"
msgstr "  Oh, right. There was one other thing..."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2085:23585: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0014; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2085
msgctxt "text_id=23585 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「そういえば、蒼崎くんは彼氏とかいないのかい？」"
msgstr "\"So, do you have a boyfriend, Aozaki?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2107:23586: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2107
msgctxt "text_id=23586 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　絶句する蒼崎。"
msgstr "  Aozaki didn't reply."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2112:23587: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2112
msgctxt "text_id=23587 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このよく晴れた日、久遠寺邸でのパーティーというレアイベントに浮かれていたのだろう。"
msgstr "  It's a beautiful day and Mr. Yamasiro had been invited to a party, so he couldn't be thinking straight."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2117:23588: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2117
msgctxt "text_id=23588 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山城先生は三咲高校最大の禁句を口にした。"
msgstr "  He'd unknowingly spoken a word forbidden in Misaki High."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2164:23589: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2164
msgctxt "text_id=23589 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不思議なこと―――もとい、不思議でもなんでもないけど、蒼崎に彼氏はいない。"
msgstr "  Strangely―then again, maybe it's not so strange―Aozaki was single."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2169:23590: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2169
msgctxt "text_id=23590 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　黙っていれば誰もが認める美少女な蒼崎だけど、"
msgstr "  She was undoubtedly attractive if she wasn't speaking to you,"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2200:23591: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2200
msgctxt "text_id=23591 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "基本状態が不機嫌なため、浮ついた話は一切ないのだ。"
msgstr " but she was permanently in a bad mood, and didn't bother with small talk."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2248:23592: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0013_A; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2248
msgctxt "text_id=23592 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「山城先生、徹夜明けですか？」"
msgstr "\"Were you up all night, Mr. Yamasiro?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2259:23593: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0015; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2259
msgctxt "text_id=23593 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「いや、だってほら、気になるでしょ。もうすぐ生徒会の役割から解放される訳ですしねぇ。蒼崎くんほどの子が青春を謳歌しないのは、教師として僕も心苦し、」"
msgstr "\"Oh, I, um, I was just, you know, curious. You're almost free of your student council duties, and I'm simply raising a glass to your youth as your teacher...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2286:23594: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2286
msgctxt "text_id=23594 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「お心遣いありがとうございます、山城センセ。"
msgstr "\"Thank you *ever* so kindly for your concern, Mr. Yamasiro."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2292:23595: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2292
msgctxt "text_id=23595 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　でしたら今から付き合いましょうか、私たち？"
msgstr "  If you're so concerned about me, perhaps we should date."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2305:23596: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0016_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2305
msgctxt "text_id=23596 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　とりあえず、恋人同士らしくそこの暗がりに連れこんでいいですか？"
msgstr "  But what would happen if people were to find out?"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2335:23597: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0016_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2335
msgctxt "text_id=23597 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　ええ、これからするコトとか、あまり人目につくとまずいので」"
msgstr "  What would happen if they found out our dark, little secret?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2341:23598: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2341
msgctxt "text_id=23598 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　にっこりと笑う蒼崎。"
msgstr "  Aozaki beamed."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2346:23599: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2346
msgctxt "text_id=23599 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　間違いなく人殺しの目つきだった。"
msgstr "  If looks could kill..."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2382:23600: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0016; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2382
msgctxt "text_id=23600 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "「―――ごめん、たしかに正気じゃなかった。だからその、明日にも僕から職を奪いそうな企みはやめてくれ。"
msgstr "\"...I'm sorry. I was out of line. Please, don't go doing anything that would put me out of a job."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2396:23601: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0017; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2396
msgctxt "text_id=23601 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "　そ、そもそも受験生に恋はご法度だったしね！"
msgstr "  You've got exams coming up, so of course you don't need to worry about relationships."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2396:23602: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0017; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2396
msgctxt "text_id=23602 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "　いや、健全でおおいに結構！」"
msgstr "  Excellent. Yes. You study hard, Aozaki!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2401:23603: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2401
msgctxt "text_id=23603 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　はははは、と軽やかに笑う山城先生。"
msgstr "  Mr. Yamasiro laughed uncomfortably."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2428:23604: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2428
msgctxt "text_id=23604 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「まったくです。くれぐれも口には気をつけてくださいね山城先生。これから行くところで、そんな浮ついた頭のヤツとかいませんから。ね、クマ」"
msgstr "\"Good. Please, think before you speak in the future. Certain people at the mansion might not take kindly to slips of the tongue. Right, Kuma?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2453:23605: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2453
msgctxt "text_id=23605 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……そうね。"
msgstr "\"Right..."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2465:23606: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2465
msgctxt "text_id=23606 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　パーティーといっても、あくまで誕生会って話だし」"
msgstr "  Sure, it's a party, but it's for someone's birthday.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2499:23607: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2499
msgctxt "text_id=23607 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　返答して、自分のハンパさに滅入ってしまう。"
msgstr "  I was starting to feel a little inadequate."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2504:23608: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2504
msgctxt "text_id=23608 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは蒼崎ほど男前でもないし、格好よくもない。"
msgstr "  I wasn't as attractive or cool as Aozaki."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2509:23609: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2509
msgctxt "text_id=23609 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だって今さら、わたしは自分の計画に迷ってしまっている。臆病になっている、と言っていい。"
msgstr "  I mean, I wasn't even sure my college plan was really going to work. I felt more anxious every day."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2515:23610: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2515
msgctxt "text_id=23610 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ほんと、自分でも情けないと思うんだけど。"
msgstr "  Pathetic, I know."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2520:23611: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2520
msgctxt "text_id=23611 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしにはどうも、進学問題と同じ比重を持った男子生徒が、いるようなのだった。"
msgstr "  If I didn't already have enough to worry about, there was the equally big problem of a boy at school."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2552:23612: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2552
msgctxt "text_id=23612 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「けど、よく久遠寺さんが承諾したわね。蒼崎の話じゃ、彼女の父親でさえ滅多に入れないんでしょう？」"
msgstr "\"I'm surprised Miss Kuonji is holding a party at her place. Aozaki, you mentioned even her father rarely gets to visit.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2573:23613: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2573
msgctxt "text_id=23613 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "「うん、それには私も驚いてる。人間、変われば変わるもんだってね。"
msgstr "\"It came as a shock to me too, actually. I guess people really can change."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2624:23614: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2624
msgctxt "text_id=23614 | speaker=alice"
msgid "“静希君のお友達なら、あがってもらって構わないけど”"
msgstr "'Sizuki's friends can come, too. I don't mind.'"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2630:23615: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2630
msgctxt "text_id=23615 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "　なんて台詞、有珠からでると思わなかったわ」"
msgstr "  Never thought I'd hear Alice say something like that.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2681:23616: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2681
msgctxt "text_id=23616 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　白犬塚の山中にある門は、来訪者を拒むようにそびえ立っている。"
msgstr "  The gate to Shiroinuzuka stood tall, as if designed to warn off visitors."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2686:23617: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2686
msgctxt "text_id=23617 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は解錠の素振りもなく鉄扉を開ける。"
msgstr "  Aozaki opened the gate; it wasn't even locked."

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2691:23618: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2691
msgctxt "text_id=23618 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　門は境界になっているのか、内と外では山林の様子が違って見えた。"
msgstr "  I felt like we were passing into a different world. Was it just me, or did the trees and mountains look different inside?"

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2696:23619: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2696
msgctxt "text_id=23619 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは―――"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_A:9:23620: scene=WIK_SELECT_A
#: WIK_SELECT_A:9
msgctxt "text_id=23620 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ａ～"
msgstr "-Decision A-"

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:30:23621: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=23621 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、このまま朝まで逃げきるべきだ、と思った。"
msgstr "  I think it would be best to run away until the morning."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:63:23622: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_U_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:63
msgctxt "text_id=23622 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あれ？」"
msgstr "\"Huh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:69:23623: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:69
msgctxt "text_id=23623 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今、妙な食い違いがあったような。"
msgstr "  Something felt off for a second there."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:74:23624: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:74
msgctxt "text_id=23624 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの選択と、わたしの口が、微妙にニュアンスが違うことを言ったような。"
msgstr "  It was as if my decision was completely different from the words that came from my mouth."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:95:23625: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_U_1_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:95
msgctxt "text_id=23625 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ううん、それどころじゃない！　早く逃げないと！」"
msgstr "\"No time for that! I have to get out of here!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:171:23626: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:171
msgctxt "text_id=23626 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　太陽が昇りきるまで逃げれば、このゲームはおしまいだ。"
msgstr "  The game would end if I could just keep from getting caught until sunrise."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:176:23627: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:176
msgctxt "text_id=23627 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしという生存者がいるかぎり、スイーツハーツの勝ちにはならない。"
msgstr "  As long as I survived, Sweets Hearts wouldn't win."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:181:23628: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:181
msgctxt "text_id=23628 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　嵐も止んだし、このまま町まで下りてしまえば何もかも元通りなんだ……！"
msgstr "  The storm was over. If I could just make it to the city, everything would go back to normal...!"

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:234:23629: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_U_1_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:234
msgctxt "text_id=23629 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「―――うそ」"
msgstr "\"...No way.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:240:23630: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:240
msgctxt "text_id=23630 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは下に向かって駆け続けたのに、たどり着いたのは洋館の裏。"
msgstr "  I'd been heading downhill all this time, so how did I end up behind the mansion?"

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:320:23631: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:320
msgctxt "text_id=23631 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ああ―――"
msgstr "  Aaah..."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:325:23632: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:325
msgctxt "text_id=23632 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地面が歪んでいる。"
msgstr "  The ground distorted."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:330:23633: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:330
msgctxt "text_id=23633 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　感覚が狂っている。"
msgstr "  My senses went haywire."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:335:23634: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:335
msgctxt "text_id=23634 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　世界は崩れている。"
msgstr "  The world crumbled."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:341:23635: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:341
msgctxt "text_id=23635 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはきっと、何かを、間違えてしまっている。"
msgstr "  I must've done something wrong."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:386:23636: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:386
msgctxt "text_id=23636 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不意に、耳元で"
msgstr "  Suddenly, a voice whispered in my ear."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:396:23637: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_U_1_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:396
msgctxt "text_id=23637 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　　　　　「み"
msgstr "          \"Con-"

msgctxt "text_id=23638 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "な"
msgstr "gra-"

msgctxt "text_id=23639 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ご"
msgstr "tu-"

msgctxt "text_id=23640 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ろ"
msgstr "lations"

msgctxt "text_id=23641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "し、"
msgstr " on"

msgctxt "text_id=23642 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "お"
msgstr " kill-"

msgctxt "text_id=23643 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "め"
msgstr "ing"

msgctxt "text_id=23644 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "で"
msgstr " ev-"

msgctxt "text_id=23645 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "と"
msgstr "ery-"

msgctxt "text_id=23646 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "う」"
msgstr "one.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:428:23647: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:428
msgctxt "text_id=23647 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一度も聞いたコトのない、世にも恐ろしい、"
msgstr "  It was a voice of terror that I'd never heard before,"

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:433:23648: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:433
msgctxt "text_id=23648 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　近しい他人の声を聞いた―――"
msgstr "  yet it sounded so familiar..."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:30:23649: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:30
msgctxt "text_id=23649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、犯人を推理するべきだ、と思った。"
msgstr "  I thought I should try to deduce who the killer is."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:63:23650: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_U_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:63
msgctxt "text_id=23650 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「落ち着け。もう条件は揃ってる、はず」"
msgstr "\"Calm down. Everything should be in order.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:69:23651: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:69
msgctxt "text_id=23651 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　呼吸を整えながら、これまでの事を整理する。"
msgstr "  I controlled my breathing and began to organize the facts in my head."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:74:23652: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:74
msgctxt "text_id=23652 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この<事件|ケース>では、動機も殺害方法も、犯人特定への切り札にはなり得なかった。"
msgstr "  I didn't have a decisive answer to the killer's motive, method, or identity."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:94:23653: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:94
msgctxt "text_id=23653 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　確かなものは一つだけ。"
msgstr "  There was only one thing I knew for sure."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:99:23654: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:99
msgctxt "text_id=23654 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司は何度も言っていた。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji had said it many times."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:104:23655: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:104
msgctxt "text_id=23655 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“誰が殺したか”ではない。"
msgstr "  It's not about who committed the murders,"

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:109:23656: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:109
msgctxt "text_id=23656 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“誰なら殺せるのか”を考えろ、と。"
msgstr "but rather who *could have* committed the murders."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:138:23657: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:138
msgctxt "text_id=23657 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　第一の殺人。土桔氏の軟禁爆破殺人。"
msgstr "  The first murder: Tokitsu's capture and death by explosion."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:144:23658: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:144
msgctxt "text_id=23658 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これが不可能だったと断言できるのはわたし、"
msgstr "  We could exclude the following suspects: Me,"

msgctxt "text_id=23659 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "久遠寺さん、"
msgstr " Miss Kuonji,"

msgctxt "text_id=23660 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "槻司、"
msgstr " Tsukiji,"

msgctxt "text_id=23661 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "芳助、"
msgstr " Housuke,"

msgctxt "text_id=23662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "詠梨神父、"
msgstr " Father Eiri,"

msgctxt "text_id=23663 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "唯架さん。"
msgstr " and Sister Yuika."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:210:23664: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:210
msgctxt "text_id=23664 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　第二の殺人。山城先生の豪華送別式殺人。"
msgstr "  The second murder: Mr. Yamasiro's fabulous funeral."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:215:23665: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:215
msgctxt "text_id=23665 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不可能だったのは―――これは特定できない。"
msgstr "  Impossible to rule any suspects out."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:222:23666: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:222
msgctxt "text_id=23666 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　かろうじて久遠寺さんぐらいだ。"
msgstr "  At a stretch, we could maybe exclude Miss Kuonji."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:227:23667: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:227
msgctxt "text_id=23667 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山城先生がいつ殺されたのかは不明だし、土桔氏の事件の後、みんなで手分けして家捜ししてしまったからだ。"
msgstr "  We don't know when Mr. Yamasiro was killed, because we were all looking around after Tokitsu's murder."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:232:23668: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:232
msgctxt "text_id=23668 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　たった十分程度の時間で、犯行はほぼ不可能だけど、絶対にできなかった、とは断定できない。"
msgstr "  It's unlikely the murder was committed within that ten-minute gap, but we couldn't rule it out completely."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:273:23669: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:273
msgctxt "text_id=23669 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　第三の殺人、芳助＆リデル。"
msgstr "  The third murder: Housuke and Riddell."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:280:23670: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:280
msgctxt "text_id=23670 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これはどうでもいい。"
msgstr "  Who cares?"

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:334:23671: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:334
msgctxt "text_id=23671 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　第四の殺人、ベオ。"
msgstr "  The fourth murder: Beo."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:340:23672: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:340
msgctxt "text_id=23672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不可能だったのは……蒼崎姉を捜しに行かなかったわたしと"
msgstr "  It can't have been me, because I didn't search for Aozaki's sister."

msgctxt "text_id=23673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "槻司、"
msgstr " Neither could it have been Tsukiji,"

msgctxt "text_id=23674 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "静希、"
msgstr " Sizuki,"

msgctxt "text_id=23675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "律架さん。"
msgstr " or Ritsuka."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:432:23676: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:432
msgctxt "text_id=23676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　第五の殺人は詠梨神父の空中耽美系首つり殺人。"
msgstr "  The fifth murder: Father Eiri's web."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:438:23677: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:438
msgctxt "text_id=23677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不可能だったのはロビーに残ったわたしと"
msgstr "  We were in the foyer, so it couldn't have been me,"

msgctxt "text_id=23678 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "槻司、"
msgstr " Tsukiji,"

msgctxt "text_id=23679 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "律架さん、"
msgstr " Ritsuka,"

msgctxt "text_id=23680 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "久遠寺さん。"
msgstr " or Miss Kuonji."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:484:23681: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:484
msgctxt "text_id=23681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　第六の殺人、唯架さん石化殺人。"
msgstr "  The sixth murder: The Yuika statue."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:490:23682: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:490
msgctxt "text_id=23682 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これもどうでもいい。"
msgstr "  This one didn't matter, either."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:514:23683: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:514
msgctxt "text_id=23683 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　第七の殺人、蒼崎姉・みちのくアルコール中毒殺人。"
msgstr "  The seventh murder: the elder Aozaki's death by alcohol poisoning."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:520:23684: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:520
msgctxt "text_id=23684 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　時系列的には第一の事件では、と疑いがあるので、不可能だったのは―――"
msgstr "  This might actually have been the first murder in the timeline. We could exclude..."

msgctxt "text_id=23685 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "かろうじて、久遠寺さんぐらい。"
msgstr " maybe only Miss Kuonji, barely."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:559:23686: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:559
msgctxt "text_id=23686 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしが体験した殺人は以上だ。"
msgstr "  That's everything I knew."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:564:23687: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:564
msgctxt "text_id=23687 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これは単純な消去法の問題。"
msgstr "  Now it came down to simple process of elimination."

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:569:23688: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:569
msgctxt "text_id=23688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰がみんなを笑わせて回った、姿なき殺人者なのか。"
msgstr "  Who was the invisible killer who made everyone laugh?"

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:574:23689: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:574
msgctxt "text_id=23689 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしが指名する犯人は―――"
msgstr "  I think the killer must be..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_V:8:23690: scene=WIK_SELECT_V
#: WIK_SELECT_V:8
msgctxt "text_id=23690 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｖ～"
msgstr "-Decision V-"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:39:23691: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:39
msgctxt "text_id=23691 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――静希だ。"
msgstr "  ...It was Sizuki."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:45:23692: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:45
msgctxt "text_id=23692 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あいつが一番、条件を満たしている。"
msgstr "  If the facts were pointing to anyone, it was him."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:50:23693: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:50
msgctxt "text_id=23693 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この洋館に精通していること。"
msgstr "  He knew this mansion inside and out."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:55:23694: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:55
msgctxt "text_id=23694 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誕生会のホスト側だったので動き回っていても違和感はなかったこと。"
msgstr "  He'd been helping out with the birthday party, so he could move about freely without raising suspicion."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:60:23695: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:60
msgctxt "text_id=23695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして、何より―――"
msgstr "  But the biggest piece of evidence..."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:80:23696: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:80
msgctxt "text_id=23696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あいつと久遠寺さんのアリバイ証言に、致命的な食い違いがあった事。"
msgstr "  ...was the glaring discrepancy between his and Miss Kuonji's alibis."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:85:23697: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:85
msgctxt "text_id=23697 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　朝は屋敷にいたと静希は言っていた。"
msgstr "  Sizuki said he was in the mansion in the morning."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:90:23698: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:90
msgctxt "text_id=23698 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど久遠寺さんはこう言っていた。"
msgstr "  However, that's not what his landlady said."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:95:23699: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:95
msgctxt "text_id=23699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“人手がなかったから、自分が施錠してまわる事になった”と。"
msgstr "  She said that \"no one was around to help,\" so she locked the place up herself."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:115:23700: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:115
msgctxt "text_id=23700 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もともと、屋敷を施錠してまわる役目が彼女のものなら、あんな言い回しはしない筈だ。"
msgstr "  If she did that on a regular basis, she wouldn't have bothered to mention that."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:120:23701: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:120
msgctxt "text_id=23701 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　久遠寺さんは静希、あるいは蒼崎に施錠を頼む気だった。"
msgstr "  Miss Kuonji wanted either Sizuki or Aozaki to lock the doors."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:125:23702: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:125
msgctxt "text_id=23702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎は午前中は街にいた、と証言した。"
msgstr "  Aozaki said she was in town in that morning."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:130:23703: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:130
msgctxt "text_id=23703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは部屋を留守にして、結果的にお姉さんの侵入を許した事で証明できる。"
msgstr "  That's likely why her sister was able to enter her room."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:135:23704: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:135
msgctxt "text_id=23704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けれど静希は、洋館にいた、と嘘の供述をしたのだ。"
msgstr "  Sizuki lied about being at the mansion at that time."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:170:23705: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:170
msgctxt "text_id=23705 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「決め手がそれだけっていうのが、なんとも弱いけど……」"
msgstr "\"Not the strongest case, I know, but that's all I have to go on...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:176:23706: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:176
msgctxt "text_id=23706 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　他にもう一つか二つはある気がするけど、今は頭が働かない。"
msgstr "  I felt that there was more I could pin on him, but I wasn't sure what right now."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:181:23707: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:181
msgctxt "text_id=23707 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　早く、朝になる前に静希を見付けて、見付け―――"
msgstr "  I had to find Sizuki before morning. Before..."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:197:23708: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:197
msgctxt "text_id=23708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　後ろに。誰かが。立っている。気配が。"
msgstr "  Someone was behind me."

msgctxt "text_id=23709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "「アンタが"
msgstr "\"So you're the killer,"

msgctxt "text_id=23710 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "犯人ね静希ーーーー！」"
msgstr " Sizuki!!!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:298:23711: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_1_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:298
msgctxt "text_id=23711 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ごはっ！？」"
msgstr "\"Whuh?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:318:23712: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:318
msgctxt "text_id=23712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だっしゃあーーーーーー！"
msgstr "  Eat this!"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:323:23713: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:323
msgctxt "text_id=23713 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　振り向きざまに、<襲|おそ>われるより先に、手にした中華鍋をフルスイングするわたし。"
msgstr "  I took up my trusty wok and swing it as hard as I could, before he could lay a hand on me."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:354:23714: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:354
msgctxt "text_id=23714 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　決まった。"
msgstr "  It connected, hard."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:359:23715: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:359
msgctxt "text_id=23715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　決まりすぎた。"
msgstr "  Harder than it should have..."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:365:23716: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:365
msgctxt "text_id=23716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希……一瞬だけ見えたけど、やっぱり静希だった……は倒れこみ、"
msgstr "  Sizuki... I only saw him briefly, but I knew it was him. He collapsed to the ground,"

msgctxt "text_id=23717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "床にはおかしなアイテムが転がった。"
msgstr " and a strange item tumbled onto the floor."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:392:23718: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:392
msgctxt "text_id=23718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　アレは―――パーティーアイテムとしてそれなりに定番の、変装グッズ鼻メガネだ。"
msgstr "  ...It was the kind of cheap fake glasses and nose you'd find in any bag of party favors."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:413:23719: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:413
msgctxt "text_id=23719 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そ、そんなんで笑わせるとか、アリ！？」"
msgstr "\"W-Who would actually laugh at this?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:419:23720: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:419
msgctxt "text_id=23720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あんなんで笑うのは箱入り娘の久遠寺さんと、なんだかんだと静希を買っている蒼崎ぐらいだろう。"
msgstr "  The only ones who would were Miss Kuonji who didn't get out much... and Aozaki, who thought so much of Sizuki."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:458:23721: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:458
msgctxt "text_id=23721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ともあれ、わたしは走りだした。"
msgstr "  Whatever. I started running."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:463:23722: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:463
msgctxt "text_id=23722 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　犯人が分かった以上、このゲームはクリアされた。"
msgstr "  As long as I've guessed the killer correctly, I've beaten the game."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:468:23723: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:468
msgctxt "text_id=23723 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けど殴られ、見抜かれ、逆上した静希がいつ反撃してくるか分からない。"
msgstr "  But maybe Sizuki would recover and come after me."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:498:23724: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:498
msgctxt "text_id=23724 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは急いでロビーから脱出する。"
msgstr "  I decided to escape through the foyer."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:504:23725: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:504
msgctxt "text_id=23725 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外に出て森に入ればわたしの勝ち。"
msgstr "  If I could make it to the forest outside, I'd win."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:509:23726: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:509
msgctxt "text_id=23726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　逃げ回っているうちに朝になっているだろう……！"
msgstr "  It had to be morning by now...!"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:555:23727: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:555
msgctxt "text_id=23727 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「え―――？」"
msgstr "\"Huh...?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:561:23728: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:561
msgctxt "text_id=23728 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　外は、まだ、暗い。"
msgstr "  It was still dark outside."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:566:23729: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:566
msgctxt "text_id=23729 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どういうコト？"
msgstr "  What?"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:571:23730: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:571
msgctxt "text_id=23730 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どういうコト？"
msgstr "  How?"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:596:23731: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:596
msgctxt "text_id=23731 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　どういうコトなんだ―――！？"
msgstr "  How was it still dark out?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:617:23732: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_V_1_0000; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:617
msgctxt "text_id=23732 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「貴女―――よくも、やって、くれた、わね―――」"
msgstr "\"Excellent... work... I must say...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:623:23733: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:623
msgctxt "text_id=23733 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「へ？」"
msgstr "\"Eh?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:628:23734: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:628
msgctxt "text_id=23734 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ロビーからは恨みがましい女の声。"
msgstr "  A resentful female voice croaked from the foyer."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:633:23735: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:633
msgctxt "text_id=23735 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　女の声！？"
msgstr "  Wait, female?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:659:23736: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:659
msgctxt "text_id=23736 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　誰だアレ、静希なのに、静希じゃない……！？"
msgstr "  But who was it?! I thought Sizuki was the killer!"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:715:23737: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:715
msgctxt "text_id=23737 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「はっ、はっ、はっ、は―――！」"
msgstr "\"Hah, hah, hah, hah!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:721:23738: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:721
msgctxt "text_id=23738 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　走る。走る。走る。"
msgstr "  Run. Just run. RUN!"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:726:23739: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:726
msgctxt "text_id=23739 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　混乱しながら走る。"
msgstr "  I was confused, but I could still run."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:754:23740: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:754
msgctxt "text_id=23740 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　転んで、立ち上がろうとして、それよりまず、考える方が先だと自分を叱咤した。"
msgstr "  I tripped and fell. As I stood up, I tried to take a second to think."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:774:23741: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:774
msgctxt "text_id=23741 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは間違えていた。"
msgstr "  I was mistaken."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:779:23742: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:779
msgctxt "text_id=23742 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まだゲームは続いている。"
msgstr "  The game was still on."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:784:23743: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:784
msgctxt "text_id=23743 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このままだとスイーツハーツ完全勝利。"
msgstr "  If that was true, then Sweets Hearts had won."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:815:23744: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:815
msgctxt "text_id=23744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　犯人は静希だった。それは間違いない。"
msgstr "  Sizuki was the killer. I was sure of it!"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:820:23745: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:820
msgctxt "text_id=23745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だってそう口にした、わたしがまだ生きている。"
msgstr "  I'd said it out loud, and I was still alive, wasn't I?"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:869:23746: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:869
msgctxt "text_id=23746 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ルールを思い出せ。"
msgstr "  Remember the rules:"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:874:23747: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:874
msgctxt "text_id=23747 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　犯人を告訴しても、間違えていたら死ぬ。"
msgstr "  If you accuse someone and you're wrong, you die."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:879:23748: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:879
msgctxt "text_id=23748 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは生きている以上、静希犯人説は正しい筈だ。"
msgstr "  As long as I was still alive, Sizuki had to be the killer."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:884:23749: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:884
msgctxt "text_id=23749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　間違えていないのなら―――きっと、<何|・><か|・><が|・><足|・><り|・><な|・><い|・><ん|・><だ|・>！"
msgstr "  Was I wrong? *Was I missing something?!*"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:922:23750: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:922
msgctxt "text_id=23750 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「さっきの犯人当て―――"
msgstr "\"My guess about the killer..."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:928:23751: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:928
msgctxt "text_id=23751 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　あれがヒントなのは間違いない……！　考えるんだ、順序だてて、そもそも何が原因なのか……！」"
msgstr "  It must have been a hint! Think! How did things come to this...?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:949:23752: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:949
msgctxt "text_id=23752 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　足音が近づいてくる。"
msgstr "  I heard footsteps getting louder."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:954:23753: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:954
msgctxt "text_id=23753 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　朝が近づいている。"
msgstr "  Morning was almost here."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:959:23754: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:959
msgctxt "text_id=23754 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これが正真正銘、最後のチャンス。"
msgstr "  This is my last and only chance."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:966:23755: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:966
msgctxt "text_id=23755 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_W:8:23756: scene=WIK_SELECT_W
#: WIK_SELECT_W:8
msgctxt "text_id=23756 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｗ～"
msgstr "-Decision W-"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:41:23757: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:41
msgctxt "text_id=23757 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「だめ、根拠が薄い……"
msgstr "\"It's no use. There's not enough evidence..."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:41:23758: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:41
msgctxt "text_id=23758 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　これで指摘したら、わたしがアウトだ……」"
msgstr "  If I guess wrong, I'm done for...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:73:23759: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:73
msgctxt "text_id=23759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　犯人を特定できない。"
msgstr "  I didn't know who the killer was."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:78:23760: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:78
msgctxt "text_id=23760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう洋館にはわたしと真犯人しかいない。"
msgstr "  But we were the only ones left in the mansion."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:83:23761: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:83
msgctxt "text_id=23761 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　当てずっぽうで指名して、わたしが消えてしまったらすべてが終わってしまうのだ。"
msgstr "  If I made a random guess and ended up being eliminated, I was finished."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:88:23762: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:88
msgctxt "text_id=23762 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんなコトになるのなら、このまま逃げ切ってゲームクリアを目指した方がよっぽど現実、的だ―――？"
msgstr "  In that case, maybe I should just make a run for it, and win the game that way...?"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:128:23763: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:128
msgctxt "text_id=23763 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「―――あなた、は―――」"
msgstr "\"You...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:134:23764: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:134
msgctxt "text_id=23764 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしの背後に忍び寄っていた影。"
msgstr "  A shadowy figure crept up behind me."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:139:23765: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:139
msgctxt "text_id=23765 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そいつは朝の挨拶をするように「やあ」と手を挙げて、"
msgstr "  It raised its hand as if to say hello."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:188:23766: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:188
msgctxt "text_id=23766 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ワ"
msgstr "\"I"

msgctxt "text_id=23767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "レ"
msgstr " aM"

msgctxt "text_id=23768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ワ"
msgstr " An"

msgctxt "text_id=23769 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "レ"
msgstr " AlieN"

msgctxt "text_id=23770 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ハ　"
msgstr " FrOM"

msgctxt "text_id=23771 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "宇"
msgstr " OuTeR"

msgctxt "text_id=23772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "宙"
msgstr " SpAcE,"

msgctxt "text_id=23773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "人　"
msgstr " EarTH"

msgctxt "text_id=23774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ダ」"
msgstr " CREatuRE.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:240:23775: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:240
msgctxt "text_id=23775 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ぶっ……！」"
msgstr "\"Pfft!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:245:23776: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:245
msgctxt "text_id=23776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あまりにも原始的、かつ直接的な手段で、わたしの感性を揺らしやがった。"
msgstr "  The primitive directness of his greeting caught me off guard."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:316:23777: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:316
msgctxt "text_id=23777 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「静希……！　あ、あんたが犯人だったの……！？」"
msgstr "\"Sizuki?! You're the killer?!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:324:23778: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:324
msgctxt "text_id=23778 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ソウダ。"
msgstr "\"YeS."

msgctxt "text_id=23779 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ワレワレハ　"
msgstr " wE dID iT."

msgctxt "text_id=23780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ヤッタゼ　"
msgstr " We DId It."

msgctxt "text_id=23781 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ヤッタゼ」"
msgstr " WE DiD iT.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:338:23782: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:338
msgctxt "text_id=23782 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「いや、その演技はいいから」"
msgstr "\"You can cut that voice out now.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:386:23783: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:386
msgctxt "text_id=23783 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　手足のしびれを気合いで押さえ込んで、間抜けメガネにツッコミを入れる。"
msgstr "  I struggled to inject calm into my voice, and to keep my arms and legs from shaking."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:391:23784: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:391
msgctxt "text_id=23784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　確かにアレは凄い。"
msgstr "  That voice really was something."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:396:23785: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:396
msgctxt "text_id=23785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ここに至ってＷＨＷへの疑問より、あのしゃべり方をやめさせる方を優先させるぐらいなんだから。"
msgstr "  So much that I was more concerned with making it stop than whodunits or howdunits."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:435:23786: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:435
msgctxt "text_id=23786 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「――――"
msgstr "\"..."

msgctxt "text_id=23787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ワレワレハ　"
msgstr " wE"

msgctxt "text_id=23788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "火星人　"
msgstr " aRe"

msgctxt "text_id=23789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ダ」"
msgstr " MarTIAnS.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:447:23790: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:447
msgctxt "text_id=23790 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そういう話でもなくて。"
msgstr "\"I don't care."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:454:23791: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:454
msgctxt "text_id=23791 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "いいからまじめに話せバカ。"
msgstr "Just explain what's going on already."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:460:23792: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:460
msgctxt "text_id=23792 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　わたし、笑っちゃったからもうすぐ死ぬのよ。せめて最期に、どうしてこうなったのかをブチまけて」"
msgstr "  I already laughed, so I'm going to die. I'd at least like to know what's going on before I do.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:495:23793: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:495
msgctxt "text_id=23793 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「すまないが、それは説明できない。"
msgstr "\"Sorry, but I can't do that."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:501:23794: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:501
msgctxt "text_id=23794 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　俺が話せるのは俺の事情だけだからだ」"
msgstr "  I can only discuss my own situation.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:507:23795: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:507
msgctxt "text_id=23795 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「？」"
msgstr "\"?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:512:23796: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:512
msgctxt "text_id=23796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それはどういう意味だったのか。"
msgstr "  What was that supposed to mean?"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:517:23797: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:517
msgctxt "text_id=23797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希が話せるのは静希の理由だけ。"
msgstr "  Sizuki could only talk about himself."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:522:23798: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:522
msgctxt "text_id=23798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それは、つまり―――静希の他に―――"
msgstr "  Does that mean... there was someone else...?"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:549:23799: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:549
msgctxt "text_id=23799 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「久万梨。君に分かるだろうか。"
msgstr "\"You've got to understand, Kumari."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:561:23800: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:561
msgctxt "text_id=23800 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　一年間、ひたすら“冗談のセンスがない”と言われ続けた男の気持ちが。"
msgstr "  Can you imagine a whole year of being picked on again and again for having no sense of humor?"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:573:23801: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:573
msgctxt "text_id=23801 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　パーティーを盛り上げようと勇気を振り絞るたびに、お呼びじゃない、と突っ返される男の気持ちが」"
msgstr "  How it feels for a man to muster up the courage to liven the party mood, only to be shot down?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:579:23802: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:579
msgctxt "text_id=23802 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「よし分かった、ブン殴る」"
msgstr "\"I know how it feels to want to punch you right now.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:606:23803: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:606
msgctxt "text_id=23803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もう真剣に考えたくもないが、コイツの動機は“冗談センスの証明”だった。"
msgstr "  I didn't even want to think about this anymore, but did he seriously do all this to prove he has a sense of humor?"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:611:23804: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:611
msgctxt "text_id=23804 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの鼻メガネの段階で証明は失敗しているが、とにかく、この男はそんな理由で真犯人に手を貸していたのだっ！"
msgstr "  I'd say he failed the moment he put on that ridiculous disguise, but was that any reason to help a murderer?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:632:23805: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:632
msgctxt "text_id=23805 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「でも、それで笑うのは蒼崎と久遠寺さんぐらいよ。"
msgstr "\"The only people who'd laugh at something like that are Aozaki and Miss Kuonji."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:638:23806: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0011; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:638
msgctxt "text_id=23806 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　そんな一発芸で笑う文明人が、他にいるハズがない」"
msgstr "  No one else on this planet would.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:651:23807: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:651
msgctxt "text_id=23807 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「いや、でも、久万梨は」"
msgstr "\"No one but you.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:657:23808: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0012; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:657
msgctxt "text_id=23808 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「ほんっとにブン殴るわよ」"
msgstr "\"Oh, I'm gonna hit you.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:669:23809: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:669
msgctxt "text_id=23809 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「ごめんなさい、なんでもないです」"
msgstr "\"I'm sorry. Never mind.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:690:23810: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0013; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:690
msgctxt "text_id=23810 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……あれでしょ。"
msgstr "\"So..."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:690:23811: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0013; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:690
msgctxt "text_id=23811 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　槻司たちを笑わせたのは、蒼崎の写真でしょ？」"
msgstr "  ...it was Aozaki's photo that made Tsukiji and the others laugh, wasn't it?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:702:23812: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:702
msgctxt "text_id=23812 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "「そうだ。あれこそ切り札だ。"
msgstr "\"Yeah. That was the ace up my sleeve."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:708:23813: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:708
msgctxt "text_id=23813 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　同時に、それは俺への報酬でもある」"
msgstr "  And a treat for me, too.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:728:23814: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:728
msgctxt "text_id=23814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの写真。蒼崎の痴態を撮ったアレなら、蒼崎を知っている男連中は笑ってしまう。"
msgstr "  Any of the guys who knew Aozaki would laugh at that picture of her."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:733:23815: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:733
msgctxt "text_id=23815 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　とくに山城先生と槻司、詠梨神父にとってはガード不能の攻撃だったに違いない。"
msgstr "  Particularly Mr. Yamasiro, Tsukiji, and Father Eiri."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:740:23816: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0014; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:740
msgctxt "text_id=23816 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「つまり、犯人は―――」"
msgstr "\"So that means the killer must be...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:805:23817: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:805
msgctxt "text_id=23817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　口にしようとした喉が、ざらりと崩れ去る。"
msgstr "  I tried to speak, but the words didn't come out."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:825:23818: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:825
msgctxt "text_id=23818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　すべてはスイーツハーツの思惑通り。"
msgstr "  I'd played right into Sweets Hearts's hands."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:830:23819: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:830
msgctxt "text_id=23819 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　犯人である静希は最後まで残り、犯人当ては失敗し、わたしはここで真っ白になる。"
msgstr "  The killer―Sizuki―was the last person left standing, while I'd failed to guess correctly and just stood here, mind blank."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:850:23820: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:850
msgctxt "text_id=23820 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――あともう一歩。"
msgstr "  I was just one step away..."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:855:23821: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:855
msgctxt "text_id=23821 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あともう少しで元凶にたどり着いたのに。"
msgstr "  I'd almost figured it all out."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:860:23822: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:860
msgctxt "text_id=23822 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　夕方からこっち、もっとまじめに、"
msgstr "  If I'd just focused more in the evening..."

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:865:23823: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:865
msgctxt "text_id=23823 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　正しい推理を重ねていれば―――"
msgstr "  ...and thought it through a bit more..."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:29:23824: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:29
msgctxt "text_id=23824 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――二つ。"
msgstr "  ...There had to be two."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:35:23825: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:35
msgctxt "text_id=23825 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうだ、二つなんだ、とわたしは思った。"
msgstr "  Yeah, two."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:55:23826: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:55
msgctxt "text_id=23826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一つだと、ひとりだと考えるから無理が生じる。"
msgstr "  It was impossible to explain some things if there was only one method."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:60:23827: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:60
msgctxt "text_id=23827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　でも二つならどうだろう？"
msgstr "  But what if there were two?"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:80:23828: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:80
msgctxt "text_id=23828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　まず殺人の種類。"
msgstr "  First, to consider the nature of the murders."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:85:23829: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:85
msgctxt "text_id=23829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　明確に、“犯人”によって笑わされた場合と、"
msgstr "  They could be divided up into the times the killer made the victim laugh,"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:90:23830: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:90
msgctxt "text_id=23830 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　死体を見て笑ってしまった場合とに分かれる。"
msgstr "  and times when the victim saw a dead body and laughed."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:110:23831: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:110
msgctxt "text_id=23831 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　芳助、リデル、唯架さんが“自爆”組だ。"
msgstr "  Housuke, Riddell, and Sister Yuika fell under the latter self-destructive category,"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:115:23832: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:115
msgctxt "text_id=23832 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けどもうひとり、自爆組に含まれそうなヤツがいる。"
msgstr "  but it might have applied to another victim, too,"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:122:23833: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:122
msgctxt "text_id=23833 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――ベオだ。"
msgstr "  ...Beo."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:170:23834: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:170
msgctxt "text_id=23834 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオはサンルームの外で笑ってしまい、死亡した。"
msgstr "  Beo died outside the sunroom after he laughed,"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:175:23835: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:175
msgctxt "text_id=23835 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けどサンルームにはアイツが笑う要因なんて一つもない。"
msgstr "  but there was nothing in the sunroom that could've made him laugh."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:180:23836: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:180
msgctxt "text_id=23836 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　周囲の森に何か仕掛けられていた、とも考えづらい。"
msgstr "  It was unlikely anything had been set up in the forest,"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:185:23837: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:185
msgctxt "text_id=23837 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの嵐の中、外にトラップをしかけるのは不確実だからだ。"
msgstr "  not when the weather was so bad."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:206:23838: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:206
msgctxt "text_id=23838 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　となると、やはり罠は室内に仕掛けられていた。"
msgstr "  So, the trap must have been laid inside,"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:211:23839: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:211
msgctxt "text_id=23839 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　サンルームにはない。"
msgstr "  but not in the sunroom."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:216:23840: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:216
msgctxt "text_id=23840 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　じゃあサンルームの<上|・>、二階の部屋はどうだろう？"
msgstr "  What about above the sunroom, on the second floor?"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:256:23841: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:256
msgctxt "text_id=23841 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　サンルームの上は蒼崎の部屋。"
msgstr "  Aozaki's bedroom was directly above the sunroom."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:261:23842: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:261
msgctxt "text_id=23842 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオは何者かに「外から蒼崎の部屋を調べてほしい」と頼まれたのではないか？"
msgstr "  Maybe someone had asked Beo to look into Aozaki's room from the outside."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:266:23843: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:266
msgctxt "text_id=23843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうして、ベオは外からあの部屋を見てしまった。"
msgstr "  And then, Beo had seen something:"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:271:23844: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:271
msgctxt "text_id=23844 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎橙子がヘベレケになっている姿を。"
msgstr "  Touko out of her mind, dead drunk."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:317:23845: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:317
msgctxt "text_id=23845 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ベオは蒼崎姉を知っている素振りだった。"
msgstr "  Beo knew Touko well."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:329:23846: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:329
msgctxt "text_id=23846 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "見知った人間のあんな姿を見たら、つい笑ってしまう公算が高い。"
msgstr "There was definitely a chance he'd laugh if he saw her like that."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:334:23847: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:334
msgctxt "text_id=23847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　トラップとしては優秀だ。"
msgstr "  It was ingenious, as traps went."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:339:23848: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:339
msgctxt "text_id=23848 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なにしろベオが笑わなくても、「調べて欲しい」と言った人物に疑いはかからない。"
msgstr "  Either way, even if he didn't laugh, the person who asked him simply told him to check, so they wouldn't seem suspicious."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:344:23849: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:344
msgctxt "text_id=23849 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　蒼崎に不審の目が向けられるターンが早まるだけなのだから。"
msgstr "  It would only make people suspect Aozaki sooner."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:379:23850: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_W_35_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:379
msgctxt "text_id=23850 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……殺害方法は二種類あったんだ。"
msgstr "\"...So there are two M.O.s."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:385:23851: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_W_35_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:385
msgctxt "text_id=23851 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　犯人による直接的な方法と、その後の、犠牲者を利用した二次災害。"
msgstr "  A direct method, and a secondary method that uses the victims."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:391:23852: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_W_35_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:391
msgctxt "text_id=23852 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　それと同じように―――」"
msgstr "  Similarly...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:411:23853: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:411
msgctxt "text_id=23853 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このゲームには、<共|・><犯|・><者|・><が|・><い|・><る|・>。"
msgstr "  There were two killers."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:416:23854: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:416
msgctxt "text_id=23854 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　リデルの台詞。"
msgstr "  Riddell's suggestions."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:421:23855: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:421
msgctxt "text_id=23855 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司の疑問。"
msgstr "  Tsukiji's suspicions."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:447:23856: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:447
msgctxt "text_id=23856 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　二人一組、二心同体。"
msgstr "  Teams of two. Intimate betrayal―two minds, one body."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:452:23857: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:452
msgctxt "text_id=23857 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　願掛けのプロイキッシャー、スイーツハーツ。"
msgstr "  Sweets Hearts, the prayer Ploy Kickshaw."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:457:23858: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:457
msgctxt "text_id=23858 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ああ、なんて露骨な名前だろう。"
msgstr "  In retrospect, it was such a revealing name."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:462:23859: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:462
msgctxt "text_id=23859 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　スイーツが<本体|プリン>なら、ハーツは何を示している？"
msgstr "  If \"sweet\" referred to its pudding body, then what about \"heart\"?"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:483:23860: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_W_35_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:483
msgctxt "text_id=23860 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「人間だ。敵は複数形だった―――！」"
msgstr "\"Humans. The enemy can take on multiple forms!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:500:23861: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:500
msgctxt "text_id=23861 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　だとしたら、スイーツハーツは二人いる。"
msgstr "  That meant there were *two* Sweets Hearts."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:505:23862: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:505
msgctxt "text_id=23862 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このゲームにおいて、実行犯と人物Ａは別人なんだ……！"
msgstr "  In this game, the killer and prime suspect had to be separate people!"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:525:23863: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:525
msgctxt "text_id=23863 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　プロイを使用した人物Ａ。"
msgstr "  The prime suspect used a Ploy,"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:530:23864: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:530
msgctxt "text_id=23864 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして、それに協力している実行犯。"
msgstr "  while their accomplice carried out the killings."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:539:23865: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:539
msgctxt "text_id=23865 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　静希はその協力者、実行犯にすぎない。"
msgstr "  Sizuki merely played the role of the suspect."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:544:23866: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:544
msgctxt "text_id=23866 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　当たっていたけど正解じゃない。"
msgstr "  I had guessed correctly, but I hadn't seen the full picture."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:549:23867: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:549
msgctxt "text_id=23867 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしが消えなかったのはそういう理屈に違いない。"
msgstr "  That must be why I wasn't out of the woods yet, so to speak."

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:608:23868: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_W_35_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:608
msgctxt "text_id=23868 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「待て―――待って、待って待って待って……！"
msgstr "\"Wait. Hold on. Wait one stir-fired second!"

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:614:23869: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_W_35_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:614
msgctxt "text_id=23869 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　それならもう答えは明白、後は、ほら、あの問題を検証すればいいだけだ……！」"
msgstr "  The answer is obvious, now! I just need to solve one problem!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:620:23870: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:620
msgctxt "text_id=23870 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_X:8:23871: scene=WIK_SELECT_X
#: WIK_SELECT_X:8
msgctxt "text_id=23871 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｘ～"
msgstr "-Decision X-"

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:90:23872: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WAKEUP_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:90
msgctxt "text_id=23872 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「よし」"
msgstr "\"All right.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:95:23873: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:95
msgctxt "text_id=23873 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　きっかり十五分で目を覚まして、姿見で全身をチェック。"
msgstr "  Fifteen-minute nap done! I checked myself in the mirror."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:100:23874: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:100
msgctxt "text_id=23874 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　荷物からブラシを取り出して、軽く髪をとかして客室を出た。"
msgstr "  I took a hairbrush out of my bag, quickly brushed my hair, and left the room."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:143:23875: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:143
msgctxt "text_id=23875 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　部屋に鍵をかけていると、一階の方から何やら聞き慣れない声が聞こえてきた。"
msgstr "  As I locked the door behind me, I heard an unfamiliar voice coming from downstairs."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:148:23876: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:148
msgctxt "text_id=23876 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　新しいゲストだろうか？"
msgstr "  A new guest?"

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:153:23877: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:153
msgctxt "text_id=23877 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　廊下では聞こえて、部屋の中では聞こえなかった……部屋の防音はしっかりしている、という事だ。"
msgstr "  I didn't hear a peep until I left the guest room... it must have had great soundproofing."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:229:23878: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_WAKEUP_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:229
msgctxt "text_id=23878 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「いやあ、降ってきましたねぇ。"
msgstr "\"It's really coming down out there."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:235:23879: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_WAKEUP_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:235
msgctxt "text_id=23879 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "　連休中は晴れるという話でしたが、二日目からこれとは我々もついていない」"
msgstr "  I thought it was supposed to be clear skies all through the long weekend, but I guess we couldn't be that lucky.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:247:23880: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_WAKEUP_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:247
msgctxt "text_id=23880 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「どうでしょう。ここに集まった人間に問題があるともとれますが。……まあ、エイリ神父に問題がないかと言えば、それはそれで首を縦に振れないのですけど」"
msgstr "\"Perhaps the problem lies with the people here... Then again, I can hardly disagree with you if you say there isn't a problem, Father.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:271:23881: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:271
msgctxt "text_id=23881 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「しっ、そういう事は思うだけで口にしちゃダメよ<唯|ゆい>ちゃん。"
msgstr "\"Shh. You don't have to say everything you think, Yui!"

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:283:23882: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:283
msgctxt "text_id=23882 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "あ、お洗濯、ちゃんと片づけてきた？　お布団とかだしっぱなしじゃないかしら？」"
msgstr "Oh, did you leave the laundry outside? Please tell me our sheets aren't getting wet as we speak.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:295:23883: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_WAKEUP_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:295
msgctxt "text_id=23883 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「それはご心配なく。今日の面子を聞いた時点で、しっかり取り込ませていただきました。不吉な予感しかしませんでしたので」"
msgstr "\"Don't worry, it's taken care of. I had a feeling something bad would happen today.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:316:23884: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WAKEUP_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:316
msgctxt "text_id=23884 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「…………」"
msgstr "\"...\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:322:23885: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:322
msgctxt "text_id=23885 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　新しくやってきたゲストは、教会の神父たちだった。"
msgstr "  The guests were from Aida Church."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:327:23886: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:327
msgctxt "text_id=23886 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　声を聞きつけたのか、東館から久遠寺さんが出迎えに現れた。"
msgstr "  Miss Kuonji appeared to have overheard them-she came out from the east wing to greet them."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:376:23887: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_WAKEUP_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:376
msgctxt "text_id=23887 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "「面目ない、せっかくお招きいただいたのに遅くなりました。お変わりはありませんか、有珠さん」"
msgstr "\"Forgive our tardiness, after you personally invited us. Are you well, Alice?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:387:23888: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_WAKEUP_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:387
msgctxt "text_id=23888 | speaker=alice"
msgid "「貴方を呼んだ覚えはないけど、来てしまったのなら仕方がないわね。どうぞあちらに。"
msgstr "\"I don't remember inviting you, but you're here now so I suppose that's fine. This way."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:398:23889: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_WAKEUP_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:398
msgctxt "text_id=23889 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　<律架|りつか>さんの席しか用意していなかったけれど、急いで椅子を用意するわ」"
msgstr "  I only prepared a seat for Ritsuka, but I'll get some more chairs.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:430:23890: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_WAKEUP_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:430
msgctxt "text_id=23890 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "「別段お構いなく。律架はともかく、私とエイリ神父は早々に立ち去りますから。"
msgstr "\"No need to go out of your way. Father Eiri and I will be leaving soon."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:443:23891: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_WAKEUP_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:443
msgctxt "text_id=23891 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "それと、椅子も間に合っています。いざとなれば律架が椅子になると」"
msgstr "Besides, if we need to sit down, we can just sit on Ritsuka.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:468:23892: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:468
msgctxt "text_id=23892 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「唯ちゃんひどい！"
msgstr "\"Hey!"

msgctxt "text_id=23893 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　何がひどいって、本気で人間椅子にさせられる現実とか、実力行使できる唯ちゃんとわたしのパワーバランスがひどい！"
msgstr " That's mean, Yui! And what makes it worse is you're not even joking!"

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:478:23894: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:478
msgctxt "text_id=23894 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　……お姉さんに対して当たりきつすぎると思うわ、わたし」"
msgstr "  You should be nicer to your big sister!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:522:23895: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:522
msgctxt "text_id=23895 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　いろいろ面倒なので、彼らを教会組と呼称する。"
msgstr "  Let's just call these guys \"Team Church.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:543:23896: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:543
msgctxt "text_id=23896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　<詠梨|えいり>神父とシスター<唯架|ゆいか>は久遠寺さんの先導で居間に向かっていった。"
msgstr "  Miss Kuonji led Father Eiri and Yuika into the drawing room."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:570:23897: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:570
msgctxt "text_id=23897 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　詠梨神父は見ての通り、楽しげだ。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri looked like he was enjoying himself."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:575:23898: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:575
msgctxt "text_id=23898 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あの神父はいつも笑顔でリラックスしているので、本心ではこのイベントをどう<捉|とら>えているかは分からない。"
msgstr "  He was always so laid back, with a permanent smile on his face. It was hard to tell how he really felt about being here."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:611:23899: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:611
msgctxt "text_id=23899 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　シスター唯架は、これまた見ての通り、不満そうだ。"
msgstr "  Sister Yuika was clearly unhappy."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:616:23900: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:616
msgctxt "text_id=23900 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　あのシスターはいつも辛気くさい顔付きなので、内心はどう思っているのか、これまた定かではない。"
msgstr "  Then again, like Father Eiri, her expression rarely changed, so who knew how she really felt?"

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:621:23901: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:621
msgctxt "text_id=23901 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして、"
msgstr "  And then there was..."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:658:23902: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:658
msgctxt "text_id=23902 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「あ、金鹿ちゃんだー。チャオー♪」"
msgstr "\"Oh, Kojika! Ciao!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:663:23903: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:663
msgctxt "text_id=23903 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このお気楽な人も、心の底ではどんな獣を隠しているものやら。"
msgstr "  ...Ritsuka. I wondered what manner of beast lurked beneath that cheerful veneer."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:668:23904: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:668
msgctxt "text_id=23904 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ま、猫の仔一匹隠れてはいないと思うけど。"
msgstr "  Probably not even a kitten."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:703:23905: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WAKEUP_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:703
msgctxt "text_id=23905 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「こんにちは、律架さん。"
msgstr "\"Hi, Ritsuka."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:709:23906: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WAKEUP_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:709
msgctxt "text_id=23906 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　律架さんたちも誘われたんですか、パーティー」"
msgstr "  I didn't know you were invited.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:720:23907: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:720
msgctxt "text_id=23907 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「ええ、ぜひ来てくださいって、アッちゃんから。"
msgstr "\"Yeah! Allie told me I definitely had to come."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:731:23908: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:731
msgctxt "text_id=23908 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　詠梨さんと唯ちゃんにはアコちゃんから手紙があったみたい。"
msgstr "  Father Eiri and Yuika both got a letter from Ako..."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:742:23909: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:742
msgctxt "text_id=23909 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "　……ん？　もしかして招待状の差出人って、それぞれ違うのかしら」"
msgstr "  Wait. Does that mean different people got different invitations?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:753:23910: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WAKEUP_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:753
msgctxt "text_id=23910 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そうみたいですね。わたしは静希からだったし」"
msgstr "\"Seems like it. I was invited by Sizuki.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:773:23911: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:773
msgctxt "text_id=23911 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんはシスター唯架の姉で、厳密に言えば教会の人ではない。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka was Yuika's sister, and not a real member of the clergy."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:778:23912: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:778
msgctxt "text_id=23912 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　商店街では二日に一度顔を会わす、いたって平凡な三咲町の住人である。"
msgstr "  She was just a regular citizen of Misaki. I saw her every now and then in the shopping district."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:804:23913: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WAKEUP_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:804
msgctxt "text_id=23913 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「それより律架さん。雨、降ってきたんですか？」"
msgstr "\"Anyway, what's the deal with the weather?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:816:23914: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:816
msgctxt "text_id=23914 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "「ええ、パラパラとね。すぐに止んでくれればいいけど」"
msgstr "\"I know, right? It's started raining, but hopefully it'll clear up soon.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:834:23915: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:834
msgctxt "text_id=23915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　律架さんは不安げな視線を外に送る。"
msgstr "  Ritsuka glanced outside, concerned."

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:839:23916: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:839
msgctxt "text_id=23916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは、"
msgstr "  I..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_D:8:23917: scene=WIK_SELECT_D
#: WIK_SELECT_D:8
msgctxt "text_id=23917 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｄ～"
msgstr "-Decision D-"

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:74:23918: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:74
msgctxt "text_id=23918 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――ダメだ、考えがまとまらない！"
msgstr "  ...This wasn't working. I couldn't think straight!"

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:80:23919: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:80
msgctxt "text_id=23919 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このまま犯人を指摘する事はできない。"
msgstr "  At this rate, I'd never figure out who the killer was."

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:85:23920: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:85
msgctxt "text_id=23920 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　今は知能より体力勝負、とにかく逃げ切らないと！"
msgstr "  If I couldn't use my head, I'd have to rely on my legs and get out of here!"

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:135:23921: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:135
msgctxt "text_id=23921 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　太陽が昇りきるまで逃げれば、このゲームはおしまいだ。"
msgstr "  The game would end if I could just keep from getting caught until sunrise."

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:140:23922: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:140
msgctxt "text_id=23922 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしという生存者がいるかぎり、スイーツハーツの勝ちにはならない。"
msgstr "  As long as I survived, Sweets Hearts wouldn't win."

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:145:23923: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:145
msgctxt "text_id=23923 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　嵐も止んだし、このまま町まで下りてしまえば何もかも元通りなんだ……！"
msgstr "  The storm was over. If I could just make it to the city, everything would go back to normal...!"

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:209:23924: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WXYZ_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:209
msgctxt "text_id=23924 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「―――うそ」"
msgstr "\"...No way.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:215:23925: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:215
msgctxt "text_id=23925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしは下に向かって駆け続けたのに、たどり着いたのは洋館の裏。"
msgstr "  I've been heading downhill all this time! How am I at the back of the mansion?!"

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:235:23926: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:235
msgctxt "text_id=23926 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ああ―――"
msgstr "  I'd been heading downhill all this time, so how did I end up behind the mansion?"

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:240:23927: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:240
msgctxt "text_id=23927 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　地面が歪んでいる。"
msgstr "  Aaah..."

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:245:23928: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:245
msgctxt "text_id=23928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　感覚が狂っている。"
msgstr "  The ground distorted."

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:250:23929: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:250
msgctxt "text_id=23929 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　世界は崩れている。"
msgstr "  My senses went haywire."

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:256:23930: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:256
msgctxt "text_id=23930 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　わたしはきっと、何かを、間違えてしまっている。"
msgstr "  I must've done something wrong."

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:301:23931: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:301
msgctxt "text_id=23931 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　不意に、耳元で"
msgstr "  Suddenly, a voice whispers in my ear."

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:312:23932: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_WXYZ_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:312
msgctxt "text_id=23932 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "　　　　　「み"
msgstr "          \"Con-"

msgctxt "text_id=23933 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "な"
msgstr "gra-"

msgctxt "text_id=23934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ご"
msgstr "tu-"

msgctxt "text_id=23935 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ろ"
msgstr "lations"

msgctxt "text_id=23936 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "し、"
msgstr " on"

msgctxt "text_id=23937 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "お"
msgstr " kill-"

msgctxt "text_id=23938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "め"
msgstr "ing"

msgctxt "text_id=23939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "で"
msgstr " ev-"

msgctxt "text_id=23940 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "と"
msgstr "ery-"

msgctxt "text_id=23941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "う」"
msgstr "one.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:344:23942: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:344
msgctxt "text_id=23942 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一度も聞いたコトのない、世にも恐ろしい、"
msgstr "  It was a voice of terror that I'd never heard before,"

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:349:23943: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:349
msgctxt "text_id=23943 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　近しい他人の声を聞いた―――"
msgstr "  yet it sounded so familiar..."

#. Occurrence WIK_X_2:40:23944: scene=WIK_X_2
#: WIK_X_2:40
msgctxt "text_id=23944 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そいつがすべての元凶。"
msgstr "  Only one of them could have caused this all to happen."

#. Occurrence WIK_X_2:45:23945: scene=WIK_X_2
#: WIK_X_2:45
msgctxt "text_id=23945 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　プロイとやらを起動させられたのは誰だ、とわたしは思った。"
msgstr "  I considered who could have activated the Ploys."

#. Occurrence WIK_X_2:299:23946: scene=WIK_X_2
#: WIK_X_2:299
msgctxt "text_id=23946 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そうだ。"
msgstr "  Right."

#. Occurrence WIK_X_2:304:23947: scene=WIK_X_2
#: WIK_X_2:304
msgctxt "text_id=23947 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　つまり、人物Ａは、"
msgstr "  Our prime suspect was..."

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_Y:8:23948: scene=WIK_SELECT_Y
#: WIK_SELECT_Y:8
msgctxt "text_id=23948 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｙ～"
msgstr "-Decision Y-"

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_Z:7:23949: scene=WIK_SELECT_Z
#: WIK_SELECT_Z:7
msgctxt "text_id=23949 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その、もっとも分かりやすい根拠は？"
msgstr "  Was there a simpler explanation?"

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_Z:7:23950: scene=WIK_SELECT_Z
#: WIK_SELECT_Z:7
msgctxt "text_id=23950 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "～選択肢Ｚ～"
msgstr "-Decision Z-"

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:98:23951: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:98
msgctxt "text_id=23951 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「―――わたしだ」"
msgstr "\"...It's me.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:104:23952: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:104
msgctxt "text_id=23952 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そう。"
msgstr "  It could only be."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:109:23953: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:109
msgctxt "text_id=23953 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　この、自分の思った通りに事が運ぶ状況こそが、わたしがスイーツハーツである、何よりの証拠だった。"
msgstr "  The fact that everything had gone just the way I'd thought was proof above all that I was Sweets Hearts."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:150:23954: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:150
msgctxt "text_id=23954 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　スイーツハーツであるわたしは、都合の悪い事は思い出せない。"
msgstr "  And as Sweets Hearts, I couldn't remember anything that worked against me."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:155:23955: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:155
msgctxt "text_id=23955 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なので客観的に考えよう。"
msgstr "  I had to look at this objectively."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:160:23956: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:160
msgctxt "text_id=23956 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　パーティーの日、プロイキッシャーを起動させたのは誰なのか。"
msgstr "  Who activated the Ploy Kickshaw on the day of the party?"

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:180:23957: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:180
msgctxt "text_id=23957 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　答えは『誰もいない』だ。"
msgstr "  The answer was, \"no one.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:194:23958: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:194
msgctxt "text_id=23958 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　プロイが保管されていた部屋は、久遠寺さん本人が施錠している。"
msgstr "  Miss Kuonji personally locked the room were she stored her Ploys."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:199:23959: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:199
msgctxt "text_id=23959 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　ドアが壁になっている部屋に侵入できる者はいない。"
msgstr "  No one could possibly break inside."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:204:23960: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:204
msgctxt "text_id=23960 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　トリックの可能性が提示されていないのなら、そこに“なんとかして壁を開けた”なんて可能性は除外される。"
msgstr "  As long as there weren't any special tricks, we could eliminate that possibility entirely."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:209:23961: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:209
msgctxt "text_id=23961 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　それが推理の鉄則だ。"
msgstr "  It was only logical―"

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:229:23962: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:229
msgctxt "text_id=23962 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　故に、プロイを奪えるとしたら、それは<今|・><日|・><以|・><前|・>。"
msgstr "  Therefore, if someone took the Ploy, they had to have done it *before* today."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:234:23963: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:234
msgctxt "text_id=23963 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　単純に考えて、久遠寺さんが施錠する前日に入るしかないのである。"
msgstr "  They would have broken in before she locked the vault."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:239:23964: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:239
msgctxt "text_id=23964 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　パーティーの当日である三連休の二日目ではなく、"
msgstr "  Only someone who had accidentally come on the first day of the long weekend"

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:244:23965: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:244
msgctxt "text_id=23965 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　間違えて一日目にやってきてしまった人物にのみ、そのチャンスがあったのだ。"
msgstr "  would have had the opportunity."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:277:23966: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:277
msgctxt "text_id=23966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　では、どうしてその人物は間違えてやってきてしまったのか？"
msgstr "  So, why did they come on the first day by mistake?"

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:282:23967: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:282
msgctxt "text_id=23967 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　これも明白だ。招待状の内容が、そもそも間違えていた。"
msgstr "  Simple: the invitation itself was wrong."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:312:23968: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:312
msgctxt "text_id=23968 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "“連休のはじめに、誕生会を開きます”"
msgstr "\"A birthday party will be held at the start of the long weekend.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:317:23969: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:317
msgctxt "text_id=23969 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そんな間抜けなミスをした男と、"
msgstr "  The blockhead who wrote that on the invitations"

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:322:23970: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:322
msgctxt "text_id=23970 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　その男に招待状を送られたのは三人。"
msgstr "  sent them out to three people total."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:372:23971: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:372
msgctxt "text_id=23971 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　うちひとり、蒼崎橙子はあらかたの事情を看破していたかもしれない。けど、彼女が想像もしていなかったネタで笑わされ、リタイヤした。"
msgstr "  Of those people, Touko Aozaki probably had it all figured out. But, she laughed at something she wasn't expecting, so that took care of her."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:405:23972: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:405
msgctxt "text_id=23972 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　もうひとりは山城先生。"
msgstr "  Then there was Mr. Yamasiro."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:410:23973: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:410
msgctxt "text_id=23973 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山城先生はこう言っていた。"
msgstr "  He'd said..."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:415:23974: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:415
msgctxt "text_id=23974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "『今朝、招待状が届いた』と。"
msgstr "  ...that he'd gotten his invitation that morning."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:420:23975: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:420
msgctxt "text_id=23975 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　みんなの招待状はもっと前に届いていた。"
msgstr "  Everyone else had received theirs before that."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:425:23976: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:425
msgctxt "text_id=23976 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　なので、山城先生の招待状は郵便ではなく、昨日直接ポストに入れられた可能性が高い。"
msgstr "  It's highly likely it was delivered directly to his mailbox instead of being mailed."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:445:23977: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:445
msgctxt "text_id=23977 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　―――仮に、その時点で静希が“人物Ａ”の協力者になっていたのなら、招待状の内容は彼らにとって都合のいいものに改竄されていただろう。"
msgstr "  If Sizuki was working with the prime suspect, then they likely edited the invitation."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:450:23978: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:450
msgctxt "text_id=23978 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　一日目で共犯者になった静希は、二日目の朝、その日に山城先生を呼ぶ招待状を送った。彼が“間違えて人物Ａを一日目に呼んでしまった”事実を誤魔化す為に。"
msgstr "  Sizuki became an accomplice on the first day, and then invited Mr. Yamasiro on the morning of the second day. This was to hide the fact that the prime suspect was \"accidentally\" invited on the first day."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:455:23979: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:455
msgctxt "text_id=23979 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　山城先生は殺される為に呼び出されたのではなく、人物Ａのアリバイを偽証するために呼ばれたのだ。"
msgstr "  Mr. Yamasiro wasn't just invited to be killed, but to act as an alibi for the culprit."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:488:23980: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:488
msgctxt "text_id=23980 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして最後のひとり、わたしは―――"
msgstr "  Then, there was me."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:493:23981: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:493
msgctxt "text_id=23981 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　このパーティーを、連休の一日目だと思いこんでいた。"
msgstr "  I was sure the party would be on the first day of the long weekend."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:499:23982: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:499
msgctxt "text_id=23982 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　以上の事から、プロイを起動させる可能性があるのは、登場人物の中ではこのわたし、久万梨金鹿と静希草十郎のみ。"
msgstr "  Based on all this information, the only people who could have activated the Ploy were me and Sizuki."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:538:23983: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:538
msgctxt "text_id=23983 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　日付を間違えてやってきた久万梨金鹿を、静希草十郎がどのように持てなしたかは想像するしかない。"
msgstr "  I could only imagine the kind of hospitality he must have offered Kojika Kumari for suddenly showing up on the wrong day."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:552:23984: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:552
msgctxt "text_id=23984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　けど、自分の責任で無駄足を踏ませた同級生に、お菓子と紅茶を振る舞うのは、そう突飛な話ではないと思う。"
msgstr "  But, it wasn't unreasonable that he'd put out tea and snacks for a fellow schoolmate."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:557:23985: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:557
msgctxt "text_id=23985 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　問題は、そのお菓子を静希草十郎がどこから持ち出したのか、という事だ。"
msgstr "  The problem is, where did Sizuki obtain those snacks from?"

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:597:23986: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0000; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:597
msgctxt "text_id=23986 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あーあ。気付いちゃったかあ。"
msgstr "\"Ah, well. You figured it out, huh?"

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:603:23987: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0001; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:603
msgctxt "text_id=23987 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　もう少しであたしの勝ちだったのに。あの子も予想以上にうまくやっていたんだけどなー」"
msgstr "  I was so close to winning, too. This girl's smarter than I thought.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:613:23988: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:613
msgctxt "text_id=23988 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そして。"
msgstr "  Just then..."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:618:23989: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:618
msgctxt "text_id=23989 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　洋館からは、わたしを追いかけてきた、さっきまで静希だったわたしが現れた。"
msgstr "  From the mansion, another me appeared from the mansion-the one who had been Sizuki chasing me."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:755:23990: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:755
msgctxt "text_id=23990 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「アンタが、スイーツハーツ？」"
msgstr "\"Are you Sweets Hearts?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:760:23991: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:760
msgctxt "text_id=23991 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　膝をついた姿勢から立ち上がって、もうひとりのわたしと対峙する。"
msgstr "  I got up off my knees to face my other self."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:771:23992: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:771
msgctxt "text_id=23992 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　そいつはええ、とあっさり負けを認めた。"
msgstr "  She nodded yes, admitting defeat."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:798:23993: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0002; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:798
msgctxt "text_id=23993 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「そう言う貴女もスイーツハーツだけどね。"
msgstr "\"You're Sweets Hearts, too, though."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:810:23994: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0003; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:810
msgctxt "text_id=23994 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　あたしはカレに化けていた方で、貴女はカノジョに化けていた方。"
msgstr "  I was disguised as him; You were disguised as her."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:822:23995: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0004; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:822
msgctxt "text_id=23995 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　でも貴女は久万梨金鹿と完全に同じだから、スイーツハーツとしての記憶を持ってるのはあたしだけだけど」"
msgstr "  But you're exactly the same as Kojika Kumari, so I'm the only one with any memory of being Sweets Hearts.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:850:23996: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:850
msgctxt "text_id=23996 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「あっそ。じゃあ消えて。これでゲームクリアでしょ。もうじき完全に日が昇るわ」"
msgstr "\"Is that so? Well, it's time for us to go. Game over. The sun's almost up.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:894:23997: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0005; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:894
msgctxt "text_id=23997 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「いいの？　クリアしちゃって？"
msgstr "\"Are you sure you want the game to end?"

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:906:23998: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0006; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:906
msgctxt "text_id=23998 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　このままなら貴女の勝ちなのに。勝者の報酬は惜しくないの？」"
msgstr "  You're about to win. Don't you want your prize?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:939:23999: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:939
msgctxt "text_id=23999 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「……なにそれ。聞いてない。どういうこと？」"
msgstr "\"My what? I didn't know there was a prize involved.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:986:24000: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0007; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:986
msgctxt "text_id=24000 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「久万梨金鹿があたしを食べる時、なにを願って、なにを迷っていたかって話。"
msgstr "\"I'm talking about what Kojika Kumari wished for and was worried about when she ate me."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1008:24001: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0008; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1008
msgctxt "text_id=24001 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　終わりたくない。もっと今が、この半熟卵みたいな、曖昧な生活が続けばいいと思ったでしょう？」"
msgstr "  You don't want it to end. You wish this half-baked, uncertain life could go on forever, don't you?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1057:24002: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0009; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1057
msgctxt "text_id=24002 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「なんで高校生活は三年だけなのか。"
msgstr "\"'Why is high school only three years?'"

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1075:24003: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0010; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1075
msgctxt "text_id=24003 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　どうして自分はあんな無駄な時間を過ごしたのか。"
msgstr "  'Why did I waste so much time?'"

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1093:24004: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0011; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1093
msgctxt "text_id=24004 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　なんで素直になれなかったのか。"
msgstr "  'Why wasn't I honest about my feelings?'"

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1153:24005: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0012; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1153
msgctxt "text_id=24005 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　そういうの、"
msgstr "  All those things."

msgctxt "text_id=24006 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ぜーんぶひっくるめて叶えてあげるのがあたし、願掛け卵、思春期限定・女の子限定のプロイキッシャー・スイーツハーツなの。どう、納得いった？」"
msgstr " I can make all your woes go away. I'm Sweets Hearts, the Ploy Kickshaw of prayer for girls in the prime of their youth only.  Whaddya say?\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1240:24007: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1240
msgctxt "text_id=24007 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「納得なんていくワケないでしょ。能書きはいいし、何があったかなんて知りたくもないから。"
msgstr "\"Thanks, but no thanks. I don't care what you can do, and I don't care what happened."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1261:24008: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1261
msgctxt "text_id=24008 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　もうお喋りはたくさん。ノータイムでリセットよ。"
msgstr "  I'm done talking to you. Time's up."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1267:24009: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1267
msgctxt "text_id=24009 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "　アンタは、ここで」"
msgstr "  You're finished.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1362:24010: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0013; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1362
msgctxt "text_id=24010 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「え、ちょっ、だってあたしの使用条件は、片思―――」"
msgstr "\"W-wait! But I can only be used by someone who has unrequited―\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1367:24011: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1367
msgctxt "text_id=24011 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　っていうか、そもそも、"
msgstr "  At the end of the day..."

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1438:24012: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1438
msgctxt "text_id=24012 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「消えて。犯人は静希。使用者はわたし、久万梨金鹿よ」"
msgstr "\"Get lost. Sizuki is the killer! I'm the user, Kojika Kumari.\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1534:24013: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0014; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1534
msgctxt "text_id=24013 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "「えぇ、そんなぁー！？　女の子にあるまじきーー！？」"
msgstr "\"What? Seriously?! But that's so unmaidenly!\""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1566:24014: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1566
msgctxt "text_id=24014 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　槻司が死んでるのに、願掛けも何もないっての。"
msgstr "  There wasn't anything left to wish for, now that Tsukiji was dead."

msgctxt "text_id=24015 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "それは何か、不吉な兆しなのでは、と思った。"
msgstr "Might be an ill omen."

msgctxt "text_id=24016 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "鍵はいつも開けっ放しなのか、と思った。"
msgstr "Maybe it's always unlocked."

msgctxt "text_id=24017 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "これならひとりでも入れるな、と思った。"
msgstr "I could enter by myself."

msgctxt "text_id=24018 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "このまま居間に移動した方がいいと思った。"
msgstr "I should head to the drawing room."

msgctxt "text_id=24019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "その前に客室の様子を見た方がいいと思った。"
msgstr "I'll check out the guest room first."

msgctxt "text_id=24020 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "意味のない行動をしてみるのもいいと思った。"
msgstr "I'll do something random."

msgctxt "text_id=24021 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "何か不穏。洋館に戻るべきだと思った。"
msgstr "Something's wrong. I should go back to the mansion."

msgctxt "text_id=24022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "気になる。確かめてみるべきだと思った。"
msgstr "Curious. I should check it out."

msgctxt "text_id=24023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "このまま雨脚は強くなるな、と思った。"
msgstr "The rain's going to get worse."

msgctxt "text_id=24024 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "このまま雨は雹になるな、と思った。"
msgstr "The rain might turn to hail."

msgctxt "text_id=24025 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "このまま帰ってしまおうか、と思った。"
msgstr "I should just go home."

msgctxt "text_id=24026 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "数はあっているな、と思った。"
msgstr "The numbers add up."

msgctxt "text_id=24027 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "数を間違えているな、と思った。"
msgstr "The numbers are off."

msgctxt "text_id=24028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "……そういえば、まだ静希を見ていないな、と思った。"
msgstr "...I haven't seen Sizuki, come to think of it."

msgctxt "text_id=24029 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "これから陰惨な事件が始まるのだ、と思った。"
msgstr "Something horrible's about to happen."

msgctxt "text_id=24030 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "これからトンデモな事件が始まるのだ、と思った。"
msgstr "Something crazy's about to go down."

msgctxt "text_id=24031 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "槻司と組めて良かった、と思った。"
msgstr "I'm glad I was paired with Tsukiji."

msgctxt "text_id=24032 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "大雑把に言うとパンだ、と思った。"
msgstr "It was some kind of bread."

msgctxt "text_id=24033 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "現実的に小型爆薬だ、と思った。"
msgstr "Realistically, a small explosive."

msgctxt "text_id=24034 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "犬か何かに食いちぎられたのでは、と思った。"
msgstr "A dog or something chewed him up."

msgctxt "text_id=24035 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "土桔由里彦氏の死がネックだ、と思った。"
msgstr "I think we should focus on Tokitsu's death."

msgctxt "text_id=24036 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "たしかに一晩笑わないのなんて簡単、と思った。"
msgstr "It's easy enough to not laugh for one night."

msgctxt "text_id=24037 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "……そろそろひとり足りない事を指摘すべきだろうか、と思った。"
msgstr "...I should point out we're one person down."

msgctxt "text_id=24038 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "槻司の話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "Tsukiji's story doesn't add up."

msgctxt "text_id=24039 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "蒼崎の話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "Aozaki's story doesn't add up."

msgctxt "text_id=24040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ベオの話はむかつく、と思った。"
msgstr "Beo's annoying."

msgctxt "text_id=24041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "槻司と蒼崎の話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "Tsukiji and Aozaki's stories don't add up."

msgctxt "text_id=24042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "槻司とベオの話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "Tsukiji and Beo's stories don't add up."

msgctxt "text_id=24043 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "蒼崎とベオの話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "Aozaki and Beo's stories don't add up."

msgctxt "text_id=24044 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "静希の話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "Sizuki's story doesn't add up."

msgctxt "text_id=24045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "久遠寺さんの話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "Miss Kuonji's story doesn't add up."

msgctxt "text_id=24046 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "わたしの話は合っているだろうか、と不安に思った。"
msgstr "I don't think what I said adds up."

msgctxt "text_id=24047 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "静希と久遠寺さんの話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "Sizuki and Miss Kuonji's stories don't add up."

msgctxt "text_id=24048 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "静希とわたしの話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "I don't think what Sizuki and I said adds up."

msgctxt "text_id=24049 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "久遠寺さんとわたしの話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "I don't think what Miss Kuonji and I said adds up."

msgctxt "text_id=24050 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "詠梨神父の話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "Father Eiri's story doesn't add up."

msgctxt "text_id=24051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "シスターの話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "Sister Yuika's story doesn't add up."

msgctxt "text_id=24052 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "律架さんの話はおかしい、と思った。"
msgstr "Ritsuka's story doesn't add up."

msgctxt "text_id=24053 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "それぞれ客室で朝まで過ごすべきでは、と思った。"
msgstr "We should each stay in our rooms until morning."

msgctxt "text_id=24054 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "その前に、リデルのアリバイ検証もするべきだ、と思った。"
msgstr "We should check Riddell's alibi."

msgctxt "text_id=24055 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ちらっと廊下を盗み見たい、と思った。"
msgstr "I'll go peek into the hallway."

msgctxt "text_id=24056 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "そっとしておこう、と思った。"
msgstr "I think I'll just leave it alone."

msgctxt "text_id=24057 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "その意見に賛成するべきだ、と思った。"
msgstr "I agree."

msgctxt "text_id=24058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "それは危険だ、と思った。"
msgstr "Sounds dangerous."

msgctxt "text_id=24059 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "十三人目の存在がいるからだ、と思った。"
msgstr "Because there's a 13th person."

msgctxt "text_id=24060 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "電話線がなくなっていた時の、あの違和感について追求するべきだからだ、と思った。"
msgstr "We should focus on how the phone line was cut."

msgctxt "text_id=24061 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "……蒼崎をひとりにするのは危険だ、と思った。"
msgstr "It's dangerous for Aozaki to go alone."

msgctxt "text_id=24062 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "……ここで三人の帰りを待つべきだ、と思った。"
msgstr "It's best to wait for all three to return."

msgctxt "text_id=24063 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "すごい死亡フラグだ、と思った。"
msgstr "I don't see this ending well at all."

msgctxt "text_id=24064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "そういえばあの人も……、と思った。"
msgstr "Come to think of it, Beo..."

msgctxt "text_id=24065 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "あとは安心して眠れる、と思った。"
msgstr "I can rest easy now."

msgctxt "text_id=24066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "……本当にそうだろうか？　と思った。"
msgstr "I'm not sure about that."

msgctxt "text_id=24067 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "１４時～１６時の間？　と思った。"
msgstr "Between 2:00PM and 4:00PM?"

msgctxt "text_id=24068 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "１６時～１８時の間？　と思った。"
msgstr "Between 4:00PM and 6:00PM?"

msgctxt "text_id=24069 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "１８時～２０時の間？　と思った。"
msgstr "Between 6:00PM and 8:00PM?"

msgctxt "text_id=24070 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "２０時～２２時の間？　と思った。"
msgstr "Between 8:00PM and 10:00PM?"

msgctxt "text_id=24071 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "２２時～０時の間？　と思った。"
msgstr "Between 10:00PM and midnight?"

msgctxt "text_id=24072 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "か、鍵をかければ安全だし、そんなことされたら逆に眠れない！　と思った。"
msgstr "A-As long as I lock the door... but I won't be able to sleep!"

msgctxt "text_id=24073 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "そ、そういうコトなら、仕方がない、と思った。"
msgstr "No helping it, then."

msgctxt "text_id=24074 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "朝まで逃げるべきだ、と思った。"
msgstr "Should keep running until morning."

msgctxt "text_id=24075 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "犯人を推理すべきだ、と思った。"
msgstr "Should try to guess who the killer is."

